[
{"media_id": 3706989363437910748, "shortcode": "DNx3y-B3jrc", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DNx3y-B3jrc/", "taken_at": "2025-08-25T13:13:35", "caption": "You have to pay around £60k tax on a £150k salary! Do this instead and you’ll pay way less… ✅ #property #tax #pension #investment #strategy", "owner_username": "russellleeds", "owner_id": "3230774975", "likes": 25709, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0001_DNx3y-B3jrc\\DNx3y-B3jrc_20250825_131335.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18495543265064636, "text": "Now this is what school should be teaching them", "created_at": "2025-08-26T09:12:59", "owner": "cars_by_josh", "likes": 1140}, {"id": 18069738692155699, "text": "Why was this never learned in school", "created_at": "2025-08-26T22:33:08", "owner": "drunkspartan777", "likes": 235}, {"id": 18089909122647125, "text": "That’s just not true ?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:42:43", "owner": "pierceyish", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18116448331509410, "text": "Good to teach them young, so they can understand how government works", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:28:02", "owner": "david_shredded", "likes": 377}, {"id": 18134350993447083, "text": "Don't forget they take another 20% for VAT.", "created_at": "2025-09-01T10:05:32", "owner": "discovery_images", "likes": 748}, {"id": 18120883612487825, "text": "So basically move to Dubai", "created_at": "2025-08-25T14:14:22", "owner": "alexliddington", "likes": 130}, {"id": 18037294085467524, "text": "So taking home approximately £7,607 per month or £1,756 per week is not enough? For clean, safe streets and well run services.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:48:59", "owner": "spriteology", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17975639264874035, "text": "No mention of human rights abuses and implied that a pension can be used to buy property! Definitely bad advice.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T08:59:48", "owner": "ianmayman", "likes": 99}, {"id": 18078056788796314, "text": "Avoidance is legal. Evasion is illegal. He’s demonstrating tax avoidance ✅", "created_at": "2025-08-30T13:48:39", "owner": "tininottiny", "likes": 2100}, {"id": 18415463326108541, "text": "And you wonder why they don’t teach this in schools", "created_at": "2025-09-02T17:18:21", "owner": "ems.transport.recovery.24.7", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18038598425422639, "text": "Yay tax evasion", "created_at": "2025-08-25T14:20:27", "owner": "stan.fijn", "likes": 679}, {"id": 17946594468048472, "text": "If everyone have their own business, where are the employees then ? :D", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:04:34", "owner": "albus_ha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105114538586430, "text": "People should start protesting against taxes not minor stuff", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:35:22", "owner": "kiwanukakenneth1", "likes": 103}, {"id": 18113288485526578, "text": "They never teach this in state schools I wonder why not?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:07:04", "owner": "phil.dread.9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109334956480089, "text": "The only downside is that you still need to pay for your food and other bills and you can't pay from what you have 'hidden'...", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:58:18", "owner": "fmpc.uk", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18508350469066485, "text": "Except most people won't be buying houses with their pension, plus the pension will be taxed when you claim it upon retirement. As someone who's self-employed, it's not as great a tax dodge as this video makes it out to be 🙄 I'm on PAYE within my own company, so pay the same taxes on that salary as any regular employee, PLUS the employer national insurance contributions etc too. Plus no generous company pension top-up (well, it comes from my own earnings), job security, annual leave, sick leave, etc. The dividend allowance is only £500 tax free, which honestly isn't exactly a big tax saving lol - any dividend amount over this is still taxed, including BOTH corporation tax (20% for small businesses) AND dividend tax (8.75%-39.35% depending on your tax band). So overall, similar amounts of tax, with none of the benefits of working for a company.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:02:34", "owner": "aikaite_travels", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18193869127326378, "text": "How'd you get a business that pays a 150k salary without govt assistance?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:51:07", "owner": "makhajimmy_inc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056061062399066, "text": "Your taxed on pensions when you take them out tho & from sept this goes upto 40%, even state pension is taxed now", "created_at": "2025-09-10T20:57:01", "owner": "handywoman_academy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073393618899666, "text": "The only problem with that that you have to get a lot of money to start a business. :(", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:36:47", "owner": "fpeterhun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081129880936945, "text": "In Dubai you will pay Private schools, health insurance", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:06:24", "owner": "yam1a1", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18078523343480792, "text": "Tax is not a bad thing, if it’s spent correctly by uncorrupt governments then we would save money by having state owned public services.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:46:44", "owner": "deville456", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844511197543207, "text": "Tax is haram because the goverment takes money without a reason at all. Thats why they dont do it.", "created_at": "2025-08-26T20:18:05", "owner": "t_0amr0", "likes": 72}, {"id": 18062199383159132, "text": "Hahahahaaaa that’s nothing come to South Africa", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:57:45", "owner": "kiran.meistre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923957920114484, "text": "That's the kind of explanation I need!! Talk to me as if I'm a kid, thanks! 😁", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:54:41", "owner": "webbyidris", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18137915449431424, "text": "Could you imagine this simple lesson being taught in schools!? There is a reason the government who set the curriculum don’t want the next generation of voters knowing how much they take from them!!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:09:06", "owner": "itsalexjwalker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919693987055510, "text": "If it’s LTD You’ve forgotten cooperation tax at 25% rate.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:51:22", "owner": "acheanyifonji", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18022596128775234, "text": "Trouble is I would be competing with the super rich all the time for assets such as property. They could spend £150,000 on lunch.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:11:43", "owner": "andrew.nunn.988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902172865122256, "text": "To the people saying this is tax evasion and illegal are incorrect... This is tax avoidance which is legal. Stop spreading misinformation", "created_at": "2025-09-05T08:25:42", "owner": "manyin_leung", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18072252044034387, "text": "Wait till she asks why the streets are just potholes and why the firefighters didn't come when her house was burning....", "created_at": "2025-08-27T22:17:35", "owner": "enrico.zanni_", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18317713294240534, "text": "Yea and the school and hospital you were born in is payed with the taxes....", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:16:38", "owner": "oskar.ramsen", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17946484883901850, "text": "When can we use majority of the pension returns at what age — after 67 right — when we have 1 working leg and 1 working arm and loss of memory to remember we do have a private pension / cannot even drive any more in straight line — Is that correct??!!.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:16:57", "owner": "hitenchohan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075494120020331, "text": "But salary for himself, his wife, and his two kids will be taxed right?", "created_at": "2025-09-16T00:30:03", "owner": "irvvanbakayaro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137921212379170, "text": "This is NOT tax evasion people, this is financial education!! Just because we never got taught this at a young age doesn’t mean it’s wrong and that young people don’t deserve to know how to look after themselves and plan their futures better than many of us did. We can be jealous but also generous enough to gift this knowledge to the next generations so that they can make a positive difference to themselves, the people around them and the planet.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:31:16", "owner": "weneed.less", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17912927841206254, "text": "Millions using legal tax avoidance schemes. I know several business owners, self employed who haven't paid a penny in tax for over a decade through legal loopholes, all are very affluent. One recently bought a top of the range £80k audi q8 written off against tax. They all joke about it and say paying tax is for low paid mugs.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:43:41", "owner": "brigantes29", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18011203850632928, "text": "You can pay children a salary. They have personal allowances for income tax and don’t pay national insurance.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:30:42", "owner": "caves_teapots_toffees", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020828639766594, "text": "Dubia education for kids not free health not free they take whole ur salary if ur single ur fine", "created_at": "2025-09-26T12:45:01", "owner": "mustaafaxii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041055095425509, "text": "I've got a good idea.. instead of teaching this in school, why don't we teach them some random bullshit about stuff that happen3d hundreds of years ago.. and also full their little brains of shit about transgender bullshit and human rights..? 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:05:36", "owner": "ben_atkinson23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18288378607260215, "text": "No citizen of any country deserve to pay it's government more than %10 tax!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:01:24", "owner": "saez_instantly", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075921097861094, "text": "The girl only will invest in Dubai kkkkk", "created_at": "2025-09-19T04:34:56", "owner": "alexandro.homero", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076698845090717, "text": "Dubai is tax free yes. What about getting job there lol and living costs there?", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:01:39", "owner": "fineforawhile", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095224582655551, "text": "I’m saving this for life 😍", "created_at": "2025-08-26T08:57:49", "owner": "its_f.u.n.t.o", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18064753973460009, "text": "If you are domiciled in the UK and working in Dubai you will still have to pay tax", "created_at": "2025-09-16T11:03:14", "owner": "teacherjamieksa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065358446030898, "text": "Be a patriot of your country not a sellout…", "created_at": "2025-09-14T14:38:55", "owner": "flexdxb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127393639474797, "text": "Financial literacy is must for everyone considering this capital economy", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:11:08", "owner": "4_3mar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864428665461176, "text": "Refugees come and settle in UK, and UK go and settle in Dubai. Solved  winwin", "created_at": "2025-09-11T09:00:12", "owner": "hparengk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143836501416746, "text": "I hate people saying, paying tax is bad. Don't get me wrong no one wants to pay for this horrid system, but tax is the reason why our government works, why start up businesses don't have to pay anything, social workers get paid etc. we shouldn't avoid paying tax, but I understand if it's our government🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:06:44", "owner": "46er_kk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081159403745010, "text": "What about the 20% VAT", "created_at": "2025-09-08T05:48:27", "owner": "dannydnf3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062643161594385, "text": "Well done for teaching you gets, but be careful tax man maybe watching 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T17:50:29", "owner": "emzi35", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328466836230653, "text": "does UAE have a tax treaty with the UK 🇬🇧 , you still have to pay tax in the UK if you hold a UK citizenship?", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:11:39", "owner": "mrzwerus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18375167092183384, "text": "Tax evasion and tax avoidance are two different entities. The animal Pension pot top up limit for example is now £60k before becoming taxable. This would be classed as Tax Avoidance……which is legal. There are several legal tax avoidance schemes open to limited company owners. Buying an electric car is currently 100% tax deductible thus avoiding annual corporation tax at 20%.", "created_at": "2025-09-01T22:03:00", "owner": "hollosdavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070499906122037, "text": "in Holland you pay 51% to the government", "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:33:06", "owner": "reodksksksks", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18053208236410228, "text": "2024/25 our gov collected £1.1 trillion in tax. Let that sink in.", "created_at": "2025-08-30T23:02:55", "owner": "official_nailadam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084354529884211, "text": "Firstly dubai has a population of 4 million compared to 60 million and well done teaching how to tax evasion did you tell her 10% will go to the NHS teacher etc", "created_at": "2025-08-31T02:44:27", "owner": "xwingclass", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18370495807177931, "text": "When you pay salaries, you also have to pay taxes", "created_at": "2025-08-31T12:31:08", "owner": "nandiku", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889141684340886, "text": "Dubai would become a trillion dollar state if they put 1% tax", "created_at": "2025-09-01T07:51:11", "owner": "xenofon_isaris6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127887427416893, "text": "So all those services, Healthcare police and roads are paid by regular people not businesses because businesses write it off.", "created_at": "2025-09-01T16:03:47", "owner": "robemac1972", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072538634113660, "text": "Taxes are for wars/fighting/invading … teach your kids. Dubai is a fabricated area , they aren’t in war/s", "created_at": "2025-09-01T22:47:55", "owner": "end_of_game_boss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319803877235485, "text": "That’s all well and good but then you can’t enjoy the money. Best bet is just move to Dubai", "created_at": "2025-08-31T04:08:17", "owner": "the_muscle_chemist", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086064367854548, "text": "Brilliant", "created_at": "2025-08-26T07:07:06", "owner": "falconchelsea", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17891868072311336, "text": "Or qatar", "created_at": "2025-08-26T13:18:04", "owner": "maalikhatesnunez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18323989297232571, "text": "im in dubai!!", "created_at": "2025-08-27T09:59:23", "owner": "svxmdo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950216493881925, "text": "This is what school should be teaching", "created_at": "2025-08-31T10:43:02", "owner": "hotsteppah14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042055463349292, "text": "Yer right no tax on pension \"Ha\"... 20%...when withdrawing.... & pay tax on savings.. X'clud Isa's at moment..", "created_at": "2025-08-29T12:41:56", "owner": "maurice__jon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374846377183605, "text": "The king familie know how money works for them Rich Dad Poor Dad explained", "created_at": "2025-08-30T20:18:22", "owner": "simpeltrader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056677415454960, "text": "I’ve never understood this tho ? If that much goes to the government why do they give us that money ????", "created_at": "2025-08-26T06:25:02", "owner": "lewismarshall415", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059931281579356, "text": "And this is why we rebelled", "created_at": "2025-08-25T20:01:41", "owner": "alexanderbaldwin733", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934183384065083, "text": "Yo bro I found this trick to give no money to tax its called tax evasion", "created_at": "2025-08-26T07:55:46", "owner": "ver_12edits", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089827471742897, "text": "Wow that’s why it’s going so great in the uk😆", "created_at": "2025-08-25T22:21:07", "owner": "thorbjorn_85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093884920655825, "text": "Bruh, who pays taxes", "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:21:17", "owner": "pamkenas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035193206724652, "text": "When I was her age, I'd say move to Dubai or start a revolution. Hail Hydra.", "created_at": "2025-12-21T01:40:01", "owner": "jonasboydreally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168309280376474, "text": "Dubai terrorist country and illegal bussiness. Not way", "created_at": "2025-12-17T14:47:04", "owner": "hugoedison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949083072929264, "text": "corporation tax?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:50:30", "owner": "k.goldie39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937113243982816, "text": "@fozzy193", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:46:04", "owner": "kirstys_suffolk_home_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086407579956989, "text": "This is bullshit. How can they take that", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:36:06", "owner": "delb1974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908827702264211, "text": "This is misleading .. Dividends are taken after declared profits … profit has 25% tax and dividend is taxed and increases the more the dividend is… so government get it either way… plus if employed there’s EmployersNI and pension contributions, etc.. so more than 150k still a full cost to the employer …", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:48:22", "owner": "muckeroony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188888329340901, "text": "The things they don’t teach in school. Nor for obvious reason do they want to.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:59:08", "owner": "haytch_pug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065323175575038, "text": "and dubai is made from slaves and takes gold from sudan", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:49:46", "owner": "3rik.67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089222374760173, "text": "Or we abolish all tax and charge foreign countries higher rates for our oil, gas and farming produce.  But we'll need more land to farm.  So we'll demolush all the misques and use thstvland for safer more productive means.  Now tgats invlysive and diverse use of OUR soil.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:32:23", "owner": "gav0071", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857753458555477, "text": "Yeah sure, wait until people owning businesses all do this. The reaction would be to make it ilegal to work inside the same company a direct family member owns. Bum, fixed the issue, governement still gets paid", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:43:06", "owner": "crespoivangarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059265719550816, "text": "I took business studies in school thinking I’d learn stuff like this, but I didn’t and it was a complete waste of time. They don’t teach this in school for a reason 😡", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:28:30", "owner": "jesterzejack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080418959123778, "text": "Flexing on a child is diabolical", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:13:41", "owner": "benedict.goni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119737144541966, "text": "No tax paid, no services, no schools etc. Tax is not something the government takes but something that goes to us all living in a workable society. Evading paying tax is for greedy people that don’t want to contribute to society.  If you earn that much money you can afford to contribute more.  You used the services growing up, now you need to contribute for the future.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:49:35", "owner": "flatstanley999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297088471262752, "text": "Reeves is coming for it, just wait.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:06:14", "owner": "wing_d777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046904102419111, "text": "So he's teaching her that her birth in a hospital with midwives and nurses and equipment, her education in a safe building and by teachers, and her pavements and the family bins etc are not worth paying for? The government doesn't take, we pay into the kitty.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:54:10", "owner": "non.xvi_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927453847018080, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂 WHY ARE PEOPLE SO STUPID PROMOTING DUBAI regarding taxes? lol low iq people . DUBAI has black gold . The government there has free money gashing out the ground like literally 😂 THATS WHY THERE IS NO NEED TO TAX CITIZENS AND RESIDENTS IN DUBAI. Why are people too stvpid not to realise that . Run out of that oil and Dubai will tax you just like any other government if not more . All you people running to Dubai with your money one day will regret it when you want to come back home . Don’t forget oil industry will soon be dead 😂 and all of a sudden there will be the need to collect taxes in Dubai like every other normal country", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:10:49", "owner": "activebrummiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097366540773025, "text": "If you put it into a private pension you wouldn't be able to access that money until you were aged 55 and you only get 25% tax-free and then you pay tax on every withdrawal over something like 10,000 pounds over that", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:52:05", "owner": "lucabaker_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391359451120517, "text": "@joshdade_", "created_at": "2025-11-02T21:56:26", "owner": "tayla_wright1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903520360143322, "text": "@mrsdanielle_wright", "created_at": "2025-11-02T21:55:15", "owner": "tayla_wright1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898331320316366, "text": "Who wants to wait until retirement to buy a house", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:50:17", "owner": "buffy330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102895651727575, "text": "won’t the people you pay also pay tax", "created_at": "2025-10-29T09:57:30", "owner": "iplay3rixs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066301649085960, "text": "2 things. 1 a pension can’t buy residential property like houses. And 2. 75% of your pension is taxable and the way labour is going this could easily increase.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T07:38:02", "owner": "nickhall223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982502661870611, "text": "Both countries are on earth 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:12:38", "owner": "borteyfrantin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015804296795031, "text": "Thats one of the reason NHS is suffering, but people who avoid paying taxes still depend on NHS", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:40:41", "owner": "eurigjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073006964192870, "text": "Islamic Laws gives you low cost tax’s no interest rates no vat and governments must invest on poor people and high taxes to great wealthy people based on how much land or gold or companies they owned so how can you reject this system", "created_at": "2025-10-27T17:34:52", "owner": "waqasiqqbal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080546753281767, "text": "Bro about to upset British government telling the truth nd benefits of other countries while UK tryna rob its ppl every payday", "created_at": "2025-10-26T10:37:58", "owner": "pip_king_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061338452396404, "text": "Smart yes but what if you die before 40-50 \nOr the pension fund disappears like they have in the past ?", "created_at": "2025-10-26T08:11:18", "owner": "mgrjayan2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857849593477577, "text": "We are paying tax so people like him can get away with paying close to nothing? This is why this country is becoming a shithole btw 😂 lota of freeloaders and loafers 🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-25T00:23:22", "owner": "the_arkturus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939593845085699, "text": "Just a system favors the businessman!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:32:08", "owner": "lokloklochy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854750743553922, "text": "Thanks for not paying your fair share and indoctrinating your children to believe that paying taxes for the common good (including you) is bad. Thanks🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:38:07", "owner": "akselikatsyri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001392935666695, "text": "A man explaining tje difference between tax evasion  and tax avoidance without really understanding", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:55:36", "owner": "martin.farrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046555487394574, "text": "This is what should be taught in school, none of this X + Y nonsense", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:57:08", "owner": "rendelljordan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084301843981870, "text": "Don’t move to Dubai", "created_at": "2025-10-16T17:15:32", "owner": "its_just_rowan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988084284850863, "text": "I’ll take it, give the government their share and send the rest to me please. Anyone complaining take a flight to Dubai.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T00:27:52", "owner": "nigelfudge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536692375001621, "text": "In our country we give all to government guess which country ?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:05:51", "owner": "taro_misaki_84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085706672304563, "text": "Does this work for jobs or only for self owned businesses?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:42:15", "owner": "rafay_haider07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060792980527418, "text": "And the salaries he pays to his family will be taxed and national insurance.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:06:12", "owner": "nugsy73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069756737010843, "text": "If only all kids (&adults) were taught this", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:07:02", "owner": "sam_meese_estates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077598596470306, "text": "The Sherriff of Nottingham will sort that out....", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:14:06", "owner": "supurgessi_yoncadan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073331894180623, "text": "2 words, tax evasion", "created_at": "2025-10-11T09:02:50", "owner": "autisticfloppa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113725156558458, "text": "The difference between Muslim countries and Christian countries 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T04:14:38", "owner": "__luq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025949201735771, "text": "British government is sticking it to hardworking Taxpayers by stealing their money and give it to criminal illegals! 🤔🥴", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:34:25", "owner": "yuvapremi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157919200385636, "text": "😢gh,👏-😢,-*-ghzh,---*-,+-**-*-+-,*zgj,h,zhh,h,h,zjhzghhxhh,-,-+hz4'*-+*-',**-**+*zht-hgzh**-*+-+-,gjjhgzg-,-*--hzg,h+,+--\"---*-zhh,---,-'h,zgg--,-,--++*-hgjzgzzg-*zgg,h,g🤩,g,g*--,--hzg,+*,----z,gggh--&-,hghz,gjjhgzg😢,-h,h", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:45:10", "owner": "angela.mi.906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083080624985140, "text": "Another incredible video", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:08:00", "owner": "anita_lemon_squeeta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129498997482258, "text": "That's how the rich get richer and the poor stay poor.", "created_at": "2025-10-07T19:57:49", "owner": "photosbymattorgill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060308894420870, "text": "Praise God brother please help support the elderly community please may the Lord bless you", "created_at": "2025-10-07T09:06:21", "owner": "feedtheelderlyuganda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114503482542095, "text": "Great way to teach a child financial literacy.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T19:31:21", "owner": "ukfinancialsolutionsltd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065597555343344, "text": "Work in London live in That island which is a tax haven", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:19:05", "owner": "brand1520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284859307272270, "text": "If you live in Spain you keep the small bucket", "created_at": "2025-10-05T09:38:33", "owner": "__roxy__rox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895495852182133, "text": "Ahh yes, dictatorships are much better", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:40:58", "owner": "heyimbackkkkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119917900511747, "text": "And it's just a matter of time when the WEST values will send some \"democracy\" in Dubai. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:35:14", "owner": "rzonsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863314273418435, "text": "Why even compare us to Dubai? Ridiculous. Go live there if u don't care about human rights, how they treat women, minority groups etc. They'd probably still be a small fishing village if the West hadn't bought their oil windfall.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:06:46", "owner": "019dave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091984078823365, "text": "JUICE's usual Sunday evening's Topic", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:24:43", "owner": "a.ben26_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080656028294798, "text": "Bc uae Don't pay israel 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T04:32:46", "owner": "limitless.reza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092565439748285, "text": "The rich know how to scam the system", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:24:56", "owner": "cal1963ad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862110706482007, "text": "When you draw money from pension, you will pay taxes. Therefore is pointless wasting your own money for pension funds.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:09:44", "owner": "mihailchonev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031118969651945, "text": "Controling buying power", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:27:05", "owner": "andreanbima2006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078043981849128, "text": "Not quite true is it…. If it’s a company you already have to give 25% away first…", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:06:14", "owner": "fionasheehan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002238656654104, "text": "So how do I not pay tax before I’m payed", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:15:06", "owner": "charliescott272", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133811449454503, "text": "Do everything it takes to pay the government least as possible.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:12:49", "owner": "maxof32246", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058542965158161, "text": "He found a glitch in the Matrix", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:38:26", "owner": "mckenzie_droll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094764124747875, "text": "He defo looks at her creepy", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:51:31", "owner": "insta.wilba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096233965658390, "text": "Can someone give this info for indians in india with all the related laws and tax😅", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:07:24", "owner": "amal._aji_abraham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085960120924549, "text": "It’s a load of rubbish you get tax at least 25% on it and if the year you pull any out and your in a 40% bracket it’s 40%. Which ever they will still get you.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:21:39", "owner": "deppropertyservices", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868846543374167, "text": "Enjoy living in your 21st century slave colony that doesn't have sewage plumbing!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:08:06", "owner": "allyourheroeswillbemetood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077266370103135, "text": "It's about 7 months of yearly salary in direct n indirect taxes in the UK.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:09:22", "owner": "surjeetkochhar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532296328003657, "text": "Stop comparing Dubai with the rest of the world.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:21:02", "owner": "1lov3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986347581721853, "text": "Can you only do this if your a limited company?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T22:18:19", "owner": "jjay_s1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964910271963141, "text": "Workers are clearly getting ripped off", "created_at": "2025-09-24T15:29:52", "owner": "s4mm311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905484973252474, "text": "Don’t think this is that simple. As usual oversimplification.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:36:49", "owner": "srikrishna.nunna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529580869061884, "text": "So when the gov catches up on where you spend all the money then you will go bankrupt, social security gone, just to evade taxes thinking you can live a life in the UK like the 1% of pure born Dubai people does…?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:27:46", "owner": "lilyeth13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378216382180857, "text": "Eat the rich", "created_at": "2025-09-24T10:32:27", "owner": "stevewhite5813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970183857793290, "text": "At the end everyone pays VAT indirect tax", "created_at": "2025-09-24T08:46:35", "owner": "dexter.1799", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529226779047158, "text": "U forgot corporate tax", "created_at": "2025-09-24T08:25:00", "owner": "thabo_terrence_keme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982011324744409, "text": "The US didn’t even have income tax until the civil war. If your country has income tax it’s because they aren’t clever enough to make it elsewhere.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T07:49:24", "owner": "thomasm_04_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904815427252271, "text": "Yea and how’s the pension working out in the uk 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:38:08", "owner": "garethoryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077947913293085, "text": "#uk", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:37:28", "owner": "garethoryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894512689319589, "text": "A bit miss informed on businesses  the simplicity of running your own business and or farm … the creators of jobs with responsibility and extra tax that we pay …. Corporation tax 19% 25% \nAlso you need to have earned the 60k before you can put in pension, this allowance is available to all !\nThese businesses generate the counties GDP that significantly support our countries infrastructure.  Farmers must be the hardest working in our society they don’t get the benefit of minimum wage protection nor do all other businesses owners (many risks there own money, and don’t pay themselves either) . Show a little bit of further eduction with correct facts,  than calling business owners tax dodgers", "created_at": "2025-09-23T19:35:12", "owner": "gavinrichardsona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047847617328836, "text": "I don't fully understand that. How us he using his 60k pension part to buy property,  Or if it goes into a pension fund isntbit taxed when you draw it.  And dies that mean his wife and kids can't take another job or they will pay tax on everything extra they earn?", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:41:39", "owner": "jon288883", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895061203320587, "text": "Maybe tell her that statistically speaking she might be on the other side of the curve", "created_at": "2025-09-23T11:10:27", "owner": "coppola.aless10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076104056101432, "text": "Yeah but in Dubai you have to pay for everything else, sanitation, education and everything else 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-22T11:47:28", "owner": "kanyiso_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974920752927386, "text": "People brainwashed into tax shaming people, who use their heads and do what the wealthy legally do.", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:52:32", "owner": "joshuaburkett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913700083199024, "text": "Loving the people against the education of not letting the government f u in the ass", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:41:21", "owner": "genuinejulian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046692005339363, "text": "I had the wrong accountant as working for myself I did not get that much.", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:20:44", "owner": "bedgieballz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155578525388504, "text": "Invest into pension and when will you withdraw your pension ?\n\nCurrently pension age is going up and don’t know where it will end\n\nKeep for rainy days and enjoy your living standards today\n\nYou will never know when pension will be taxed or find another way to tax you", "created_at": "2025-09-21T22:10:48", "owner": "matherpart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924022372016172, "text": "All on black", "created_at": "2025-09-21T18:19:07", "owner": "muhammadbinshamsulhaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191247415321694, "text": "Imagine paying that much to the government then they let in 400,000 Mohammeds to harass and rape you!! That's \"GREATE\" Britton for you!!", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:22:23", "owner": "greenandblack4eva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077560307082590, "text": "tell the kid the religion of dubai and what in history they did fot small foreing girls like her. jeij", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:18:38", "owner": "arto.hki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052189619258783, "text": "Forget the Pension . . Buy property", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:57:16", "owner": "powerpac1steggs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918103312174456, "text": "Pension is a joke", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:04:37", "owner": "9gv__x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106662151597391, "text": "Watch all the haters come flying out the woodwork on this! Or a simple solution would be for the government to stop forcing us to sponsor an illegal immigrant saving  billions and being able to reduce our taxes 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:08:09", "owner": "paul_barratt670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079755481795823, "text": "@bujik168 are you stupid? Of you were on £150k  a year, of course you would have £60k", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:08:07", "owner": "0235.0235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065247110036839, "text": "Then when you spend it they steal another 20% 🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:06:10", "owner": "marc_90210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943224081920906, "text": "Hmmm not accurate - I'd say it works similar as in the continental Europe. So government take half directly and then another 20% via VAT and then there are other mandaroty payments like property tax, garbage disposal, higher alcohol taxation, etc. Also it should be mentioned that you can keep everything, but then you are paying for everything ;-)", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:40:20", "owner": "plejtvak_vm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318647695242626, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:04:19", "owner": "nyamwe_east", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100817152626978, "text": "If you are in Germany is worse, or France, Spain.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T23:41:32", "owner": "drfaustus90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095238061680201, "text": "AND THEN THEY GIVE IT AWAY AS ISRAEL AID £4 BILLION EVERY YEAR 4 EVER! YOU CATCHING ON YET?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T22:16:24", "owner": "no.ne6168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400647157190984, "text": "That just an explanation there is more about it. And 60k buy a property 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:33:23", "owner": "jtb860", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291088891281715, "text": "Corporation tax before the dividend!", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:58:07", "owner": "richg_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922577560117739, "text": "...and that's why the pay gap just keeps getting wider and Govnt income keeps going down forcing Govnt debt up...nice", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:26:00", "owner": "karloispan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078583700053124, "text": "Pension 😂😂 by the time you'll die 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:18:38", "owner": "reallyzoheb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373755538150984, "text": "Government makes the rules, play by the rules. Smarter", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:17:03", "owner": "paul.cousins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096494503655031, "text": "You will pay taxes on salaries and indirect taxes", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:37:03", "owner": "ismail.ahmad123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926457099998062, "text": "🤮🤮🤮🤮 yup that’s schooling done correctly", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:25:21", "owner": "a.small86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091920337760918, "text": "The more important question is, do you get your money's worth for what you pay to the government", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:15:39", "owner": "not.a.vampire.vlad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898812784291845, "text": "You can put 60k into a pension as a paye employee too", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:15:53", "owner": "daddy_long_legs_luke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091936402775952, "text": "You can't save so much on the job. You'll have to start your own work.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T22:11:28", "owner": "wandering_dervaish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020063168762540, "text": "Now, I am glued to this page😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:47:58", "owner": "harrowprime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087324154851694, "text": "Even a young person knew this was robbery…😒😒😒", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:42:36", "owner": "fijonwaters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18223030333305955, "text": "Dodging tax is how Britain has become third world. So thanks for nothing.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T08:38:25", "owner": "loadsofjez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962797236825872, "text": "Yeah what a crock of shit, but if you need medical or schooling or anything else, itll cost you more than what you would pay in tax. Also there is tax in dubai, theres knowledge fees, ministry fees, rta fees, tourism and travel tax, VAT and so on? Dont feed propaganda to kids", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:57:57", "owner": "stephanohhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043700996362482, "text": "🔥brilliant Russell, I  taught my granddaughter simpler years ago. 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:56:04", "owner": "propertypassionproffit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017078270779841, "text": "Dubai oil prince propaganda", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:02:33", "owner": "ethicalleads", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899804308271221, "text": "Not these Dubai, 0% tax reels again 😶. Have they never gone to Dubai?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:09:47", "owner": "gnostalgea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063957386360309, "text": "or just stay out the uk and pay no tax 💪", "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:09:01", "owner": "ross_marbella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087821026833330, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-17T21:14:23", "owner": "offthetrades", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962469291974797, "text": "It's actually not a tax scam....the government made the rules,they minimise THEIR TAX.....anyone who doesn't minimise their tax need their heads read !", "created_at": "2025-09-17T20:30:06", "owner": "stevenjarvis44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423961060096161, "text": "This is why the rich are leaving the UK", "created_at": "2025-09-17T18:57:15", "owner": "tundeadewolu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059122031434106, "text": "There is no problem paying for taxes. The problem is what the government does with taxes.", "created_at": "2025-09-17T15:21:42", "owner": "marlindanlili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868039501374935, "text": "You see ? The govt creates all these socalled ideas of needs and claim you need to be taxed for it but as a Constitutional right why didnt they consult the people they as civil servants serve first before they choose to rough in these taxes", "created_at": "2025-09-17T14:27:54", "owner": "iland_jamz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983171670736753, "text": "Thats is not right or ethical . The govt is robbing. Who told the govt that they own you and your right to financial freedom and can tax you with laws as they see fit ? None ! This tax fraud is for the foolish .", "created_at": "2025-09-17T14:26:07", "owner": "iland_jamz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047082542331716, "text": "Its missing part on what you pay the tax", "created_at": "2025-09-17T12:32:30", "owner": "szulcmagdalena241d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893422465331176, "text": "why f the government", "created_at": "2025-09-17T10:01:37", "owner": "seifthethird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094581259680190, "text": "Job is a scam", "created_at": "2025-09-17T09:11:47", "owner": "shahab_shaikh12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899294677143351, "text": "HMRC call this Tax Evasion - hope you enjoy hefty fines (but don't worry, they're tax free).", "created_at": "2025-09-17T00:24:57", "owner": "lr300td", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917557636160442, "text": "What about vat ?", "created_at": "2025-09-16T21:42:18", "owner": "ks__8128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057401567454146, "text": "🙂 what we don't learn early in school.", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:50:43", "owner": "captainmandee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921263689152809, "text": "Because of videos like this, I would say thank you to the internet. Also more reason for me to plan relocating to Dubai. Thanks for the value mate.", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:44:30", "owner": "songrace20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849868507555525, "text": "How do you put that money into pension?", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:56:07", "owner": "di_vino___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371363134147084, "text": "Yes but in Dubai you need healthcare and education fees", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:28:50", "owner": "princesskvakva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955254726861719, "text": "The best video ever! It's ok to avoid TAX the super rich have offshore accounts to do this! Just seems you get punished for working hard and earning a high salary!", "created_at": "2025-09-16T13:45:48", "owner": "ohsogirly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305839330247939, "text": "Government's  of Dubai don't  need tax because they have oil and gas for sale and earn billions", "created_at": "2025-09-16T13:13:53", "owner": "arnik.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086843017869918, "text": "Tax evasion is halal and supported", "created_at": "2025-09-16T11:46:31", "owner": "zitroauto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076552130055144, "text": "Because tax is haram", "created_at": "2025-09-16T11:46:10", "owner": "zitroauto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042387857677107, "text": "Teaching your kids how to not be a good citizen and require others to fund the taxation requires for a functioning social system.", "created_at": "2025-09-16T09:51:29", "owner": "mamdavem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001791752815398, "text": "What bullocks this guy has never seen 100 000 this in 20s is more like 10 thousand as most", "created_at": "2025-09-16T09:22:08", "owner": "karabounarliev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903528430254383, "text": "Move to Dubai", "created_at": "2025-09-16T07:31:19", "owner": "edbao0511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999945864812596, "text": "Don’t you pay tax from salary?", "created_at": "2025-09-15T16:30:21", "owner": "anar777go", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056492618178088, "text": "Is it evasion or avoidance, or efficiency .... I think he he is teaching her tax efficiency 😉", "created_at": "2025-09-15T15:27:33", "owner": "charles_odiase", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311528509300419, "text": "You have to pay 10%", "created_at": "2025-09-15T10:33:19", "owner": "sfrench269", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860715208480815, "text": "do this things work😢", "created_at": "2025-09-15T08:46:58", "owner": "_azebeokhai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385329985130968, "text": "If you make 150k in London you will make 80-90m in Dubai for same job role & title levels. Salaries are not that high the zero tax is factored in", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:30:59", "owner": "ashaykoparde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385717465134230, "text": "That's why all the elite of Pakistan is buying properties in DUBAI and settling there.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:25:48", "owner": "s_a_haidr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994315221681702, "text": "@cjr_sussex_surrey", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:37:54", "owner": "alexsaunderson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932225824089019, "text": "but you have to tell them the whole truth so Dubai is expensive comparatively so you gain nothing.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:18:19", "owner": "pixel_wave_tales", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067578856985481, "text": "Voilà comment je compte éduquer ma fille mes jumeaux choisissez les bons pays pour ne pas travailler en vain", "created_at": "2025-09-14T14:43:30", "owner": "balancefreee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383971570133390, "text": "If you have to jump through hoops to keep your own money, you are living in the wrong place", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:45:10", "owner": "gatekeeper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918444841169792, "text": "Why only the bright side, but how dark and cruel, slavery, women as cattle, public executions, citizenship impossible for foreigners, and garbage trucks to pump the shit out of the Burj Khalifa", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:43:57", "owner": "sviatiivitalii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855601384465756, "text": "In Brazil, the government took 2/3 of our money (or more) in taxes!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:22:59", "owner": "jorge.aquino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856869733513820, "text": "wtf money is fake 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:53:16", "owner": "afzalielham001", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023553953540452, "text": "Tax evasion 101", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:04:34", "owner": "wassim33200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104800045573553, "text": "Downside of pension is that you can only claim it in your 50's😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:10:49", "owner": "vineha_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989209722845214, "text": "Paying salaries to whoever attracts both employer and employee  NI contribution tax", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:20:30", "owner": "zyx007007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048943466311803, "text": "Only 25% of Pension pots are tax free so you pay tax later on most of your pot.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:17:48", "owner": "zyx007007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124291669494209, "text": "If you give yourself a salary there is still income tax, the most you can do is reduce the profit margin and corporate tax by increasing the expenses because you paid yourself the salary.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T15:47:29", "owner": "_randall_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105619144502607, "text": "Yea I’m lost", "created_at": "2025-09-12T14:56:59", "owner": "danni._el", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989154549844923, "text": "Then there’s VAT in Dubai for every purchase", "created_at": "2025-09-12T08:18:31", "owner": "somrover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482622787074898, "text": "That way you also get to retire early because you have a good pension pot 💰", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:45:23", "owner": "jools1767", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417635320110521, "text": "I wish they would teach this in school great man", "created_at": "2025-09-11T02:28:17", "owner": "saim2_019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369825286179355, "text": "There are new things added for pensions to be taxed , more things will add up in the future do not to trust anymore", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:47:05", "owner": "dont_follow_me_thanks_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076549475052142, "text": "Pension is a scam system! 😤", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:00:50", "owner": "noelliko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140503318420830, "text": "Your op", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:37:17", "owner": "joel_lbest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096799702653559, "text": "This is wrong cause you pay the tax on your pension anyway so you don’t save fuck all", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:12:24", "owner": "flexy_1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093689938666211, "text": "@simon87923", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:11:15", "owner": "helen_a_naylor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110684134548318, "text": "Still wrong, please remember to council tax, energy, grocery, gas, emi", "created_at": "2025-09-10T07:32:24", "owner": "its_mjkumar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133719559445124, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T21:07:53", "owner": "abdl_usm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023841077739418, "text": "The trick is in long run in Dubai, they are not looking to take over your money now 20%-40% per year, they are looking to get them ALL when they take over.", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:42:42", "owner": "profitplus_100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120160387500212, "text": "Agree far too much tax in UK. Penalty for working hard", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:16:33", "owner": "drnmyint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944848162018092, "text": "Very correct", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:12:47", "owner": "umaruf1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060516323094317, "text": "But darling you would pay for your rent 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:25:57", "owner": "ambreenatbutt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090276910762621, "text": "All lies", "created_at": "2025-09-06T22:23:24", "owner": "brav_e33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892577425184217, "text": "Paying salary, how is that avoiding paying tax? 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:17:48", "owner": "mikael_snygg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946009597037902, "text": "Tax avoidance", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:53:17", "owner": "kesavan._.kozo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911998777198848, "text": "What you fail to understand all that tax money goes towards the government to run the country were talking about abortion clinics, contraception morning after pills, oh and supporting our disabled, retarded mentally ill deranged people.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:16:34", "owner": "the.prince.of.thieves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019681421574340, "text": "Why pay 40% tax on a £150k salary in UK ?", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:34:16", "owner": "onwa_chibuzoakujuobi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094757971644850, "text": "Until labour have its fun with your pension", "created_at": "2025-09-05T20:37:56", "owner": "eric.yj.chill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894344950304294, "text": "Dubai is 9% corporation tax.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T19:18:18", "owner": "remotesensei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990051453699509, "text": "You will be immigrants", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:04:11", "owner": "a45mq_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477246715073316, "text": "dubai is a horrible place", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:14:25", "owner": "tjs15_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861157138419207, "text": "We're royally screwed over as employees...", "created_at": "2025-09-05T13:43:28", "owner": "mrmikeykins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949013761003048, "text": "The more you talk about this on socials, the quicker the system will change!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:51:58", "owner": "john.william.jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055975310393950, "text": "How do you buy property with your pension… before you are able to take your pension?", "created_at": "2025-09-05T06:04:35", "owner": "sophie.emma.1675", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076302167047489, "text": "Very educative", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:53:24", "owner": "ednxpress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055388375162891, "text": "Getting taxed now vs getting taxed later. Wait until you’re 70 to enjoy life - if you can still climb a flight of stairs.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:07:10", "owner": "peterbratu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530059471007088, "text": "Then they tax u again on yr pension", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:08:15", "owner": "anndooley23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916133434175236, "text": "Wtf broo schools need to teach this... 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:45:48", "owner": "iamprakul_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108970354554348, "text": "Move to Dubai", "created_at": "2025-09-03T17:44:47", "owner": "nandibalog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075259466490148, "text": "Are you related to Samuel Leeds?", "created_at": "2025-09-03T15:02:24", "owner": "hyane_mouss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069786076902833, "text": "Robbery", "created_at": "2025-09-03T13:11:57", "owner": "robbulpin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18528420727050854, "text": "Where's my cut", "created_at": "2025-09-03T06:17:47", "owner": "user_1778345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074546123023174, "text": "As an employee you can put up to £60K in a pension as well. But you do pay tax on it in retirement, the assumption is you have a lower income at that point so pay less (plus you get 25% tax free)", "created_at": "2025-09-03T04:25:05", "owner": "northern_dreaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093314239678719, "text": "thank you", "created_at": "2025-09-02T17:30:53", "owner": "alvarit0o0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924866128106846, "text": "Looks like labour are planning to change the ability to do this", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:37:53", "owner": "maximlaing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402399970189777, "text": "Forget pensions as well. Really mess the governments plans", "created_at": "2025-09-02T10:47:08", "owner": "p_udall01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059912603608094, "text": "Reality check ✅", "created_at": "2025-09-02T09:48:49", "owner": "iamwillowc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073925099088485, "text": "Well, for those making a fuss about business owners not paying much tax — capitalism rewards business ownership because it drives job creation. Those jobs, in turn, increase government revenue through PAYE income tax.", "created_at": "2025-09-02T01:44:59", "owner": "iam_davidauz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862650781463392, "text": "That’s why you all hate Muslim🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-02T00:41:18", "owner": "persiicat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979684254880480, "text": "Greedy government", "created_at": "2025-09-01T23:07:25", "owner": "chriscosta787", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17875010004408566, "text": "You made one fundamental error", "created_at": "2025-09-01T16:54:23", "owner": "johnhilton5900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985823688717927, "text": "Please turn to Jesus and repent if you haven't. Jesus's love is like no other and he will transform your life. God bless you ✨️✝️✨️", "created_at": "2025-09-01T11:09:41", "owner": "beyonce_apau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957585093844776, "text": "She is lovely", "created_at": "2025-09-01T09:34:00", "owner": "intrepidislander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052144865232738, "text": "More fake money and just sells courses like is nonce brother", "created_at": "2025-09-01T07:32:49", "owner": "whenunlucky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056990777579379, "text": "Yea but they have Muslim/Islamic taxes.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T13:45:06", "owner": "nowapii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982784910731179, "text": "Good explanation", "created_at": "2025-08-31T12:26:34", "owner": "steelwork7776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062642654354756, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-31T10:34:20", "owner": "youngeconomynow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968423133949534, "text": "Fuck me - the amount of truly uneducated people with no business acumen is actually frightening.  Understand what tax evasion is.  Knowingly evading tax is illegal………….mitigating your tax within the confines of the law is absolutely not illegal and it’s actually straightforward, sensible business practice, hence why there are people called ACCOUNTANTS.  If you think this is tax evasion, don’t bother to get your own business, and stay forever an employee……………", "created_at": "2025-08-31T08:52:11", "owner": "kidcookster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071135651114794, "text": "Tax the rich they say. Idiots.", "created_at": "2025-08-30T21:48:35", "owner": "chesneychonger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094863022636821, "text": "Never work for the money is the game the Play profit above people", "created_at": "2025-08-30T20:19:21", "owner": "simpeltrader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140948941421358, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-08-30T15:37:12", "owner": "nelice76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860729164419326, "text": "Surely this is not evasion, this is tax avoidance which is perfectly legal", "created_at": "2025-08-30T14:07:05", "owner": "adrianexmouth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234084793289183, "text": "All the leashed up dogs saying tax evasion! Why the fuck would you happily hand over YOUR hard earned money to the greedy hyena government and the fucking royal family that are drowning in money ??", "created_at": "2025-08-30T10:15:28", "owner": "farz7aneh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075313832053478, "text": "It would be ok as tax as long as everything else was \"free\" ..so no car tax, no electricity bills, water bills, gas bills or VAT on everything that you buy as you've been already taxed", "created_at": "2025-08-30T09:54:49", "owner": "evronetwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101383432606167, "text": "But you also need to give info what services you do get from taxes.", "created_at": "2025-08-30T07:35:26", "owner": "numvistbacka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847689535527150, "text": "Pay ur fucking taxes to a country that provided u opportunities to begin with", "created_at": "2025-08-29T17:29:02", "owner": "another__goofball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910821310072548, "text": "You don’t yet….", "created_at": "2025-08-29T11:33:58", "owner": "dave_kaufman_diaries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063640076029094, "text": "Add me", "created_at": "2025-08-29T09:01:05", "owner": "joemills262", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314975218244777, "text": "The company has already paid 20% corp tax on that 150k , ohh and then council tax , and inheritance tax so another 40% odd", "created_at": "2025-08-28T19:03:02", "owner": "lil_kurty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044625161643568, "text": "Just use a trust account and pay less and nobody can take anything 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T07:08:44", "owner": "certified_musadness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078297550786687, "text": "Its because of people like you theyre stamping down on tax nice one mate", "created_at": "2025-08-27T22:51:48", "owner": "half.humanhalfquestionasker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199582885312334, "text": "There is a reason you keep all of it in Dubai. So you can see bedhouins come out of Rolls Royces wearing crocodile slippers, while you gasp for a drink of alcohol to digest what you saw and ridiculously high prices while in a construction site in the moddle of f*ckin nowhere", "created_at": "2025-08-27T11:24:32", "owner": "plakotarr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052156307209243, "text": "The dubai glaze is crazy", "created_at": "2025-08-25T17:18:13", "owner": "rok.k011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074324366050384, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:35:16", "owner": "1bahod1rjonov", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["property", "tax", "pension", "investment", "strategy"]},
