 "I thought they Agartha'ed Nikki Bella 😭 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:57:38", "owner": "thighscrubber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922031578057315, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:54:48", "owner": "astonsmartini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863182282456118, "text": "Triple double through the head board smash", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:52:23", "owner": "aliefbaby_jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065687225170579, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:20:10", "owner": "kasrashojaei01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948465106061897, "text": "If I go to war ill make graffiti of you", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:53:26", "owner": "jaydenjackson55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535356556009103, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:36:57", "owner": "eduard_weinhardt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918954214072106, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:26:55", "owner": "seaniskingz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949108894060254, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:26:09", "owner": "soy.un.juan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050776040668497, "text": "I just folded like the cheapest origami", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:16:02", "owner": "brendanables_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144554944445747, "text": "Yeah I already know the football team knows what she looks like with the lights off", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:07:26", "owner": "chanyboo.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078658052515452, "text": "One of gods greatest gifts to man", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:40:18", "owner": "colby_bussell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960603966870451, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:19:07", "owner": "johnnmcginnis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081661928124337, "text": "Killer smile", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:05:21", "owner": "parthenopex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094463125699649, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:26:43", "owner": "elysium_314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547293013025866, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:44:59", "owner": "omarel_yamani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027068003578381, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:31:23", "owner": "the_king_cobra77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848120986608974, "text": "GOD DAMN DIBS", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:03:41", "owner": "dylan_list_1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986294547754764, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:00:14", "owner": "sallysplashzone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086345764995661, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:56:25", "owner": "stoopkid711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993386112893793, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:49:01", "owner": "jo_se_santos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089781268763144, "text": "Makin a sticker to go on my toolbox", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:45:15", "owner": "mphil_ltsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077840744230846, "text": "She has great genes", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:35:25", "owner": "newuse_r_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18554773111004155, "text": "Mommy", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:30:26", "owner": "senor_philswift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855396724528043, "text": "okay i’m transferring", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:10:12", "owner": "audrey.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029609108760112, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:58:48", "owner": "tonyygirii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060990524540775, "text": "yeah i plan on it", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:53:27", "owner": "grayson.barkley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184881337345673, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:53:26", "owner": "bray_newt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077315795232592, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:55:55", "owner": "cccdav_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081556742115131, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:22:05", "owner": "ulissescarvlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868721266480237, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:03:58", "owner": "mericyasinozen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002899493831775, "text": "Oh my lord 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:57:02", "owner": "jake_figueroa15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064969907625811, "text": "Ta linda ma’", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:32:47", "owner": "ramon.sc2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931567204136456, "text": "Wow, everyone got a reply except me?\nCool, I’ll just sit here like a decorative plant then 😐🌱", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:07:28", "owner": "voidborn19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876863770355222, "text": "Bros literally a child", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:43:55", "owner": "zmanbelmonte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082587194028444, "text": "(S)He told me don’t you ever come around here, don’t wanna see your face you better disappear", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:31:21", "owner": "archilla_999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086955958965483, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:38:45", "owner": "matthewconlon83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890387215381975, "text": "Ateee", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:00:41", "owner": "300sharkboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307699795248721, "text": "mami you FINEEEE", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:41:49", "owner": "__aiden.miller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091625725736386, "text": "*unzips pants and plops out tiny shrimp*", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:40:21", "owner": "pumpertondeleche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991562922887498, "text": "Only two days of nnn stay strong", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:06:30", "owner": "chill_malankane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857266672561403, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:10:50", "owner": "carter._iq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087092023959562, "text": "Why do women think it's acceptable to be chubby like this?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:06:45", "owner": "seanathancory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864485023529174, "text": "Meh I more a red type of guy", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:59:20", "owner": "armanijbrown4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063450032562641, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:51:30", "owner": "imtimmahler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079943450469882, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:47:19", "owner": "nzx10x01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965127822846505, "text": "golden", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:52:40", "owner": "weanutz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064321379162850, "text": "BULGE", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:28:09", "owner": "brandonbeams860", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156579547404574, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:36:39", "owner": "theostandridge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870313618398701, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:40:04", "owner": "tamashii_va", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082043672110623, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:08:21", "owner": "versatileg1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100051135827100, "text": "Might have become a UCLA fan", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:53:48", "owner": "jerrys.wrld05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902941108311765, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:42:20", "owner": "snesfan89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381059737148707, "text": "Ma god 🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:24:40", "owner": "luckyluiguis7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027829544569173, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:21:43", "owner": "giofannirahman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080623058126502, "text": "How can one be gayM", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:21:35", "owner": "diddycombe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902211550321480, "text": "She looks better then Sabrina carpenter 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:10:22", "owner": "hades_9809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070024238372810, "text": "God is good", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:25:39", "owner": "trevtrev9999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858675154556320, "text": "As a former track guy at UCLA, I have total respect for a woman on the Bruin squad. It’s no easy task and performance is everything, day in and day out. Kudos! Go Bruins!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:35:53", "owner": "carlos.xymartinez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190451038337309, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:30:20", "owner": "momocikadut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353741773166536, "text": "Damn Daniel", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:26:04", "owner": "gio_ortiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876710593354165, "text": "Ok i see you beautiful 💙🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:53:25", "owner": "giovanni11164", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145983520435108, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:22:33", "owner": "angelo_crown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968079597989355, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:17:43", "owner": "iiaudrzii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085634588048026, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:58:16", "owner": "eshfaquljohan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919183477070552, "text": "holy shit", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:46:29", "owner": "kjband.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958104324886402, "text": "gd", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:52:42", "owner": "mr.chrisaholmes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086448577823054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:28:41", "owner": "fvcknmadd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024757037591478, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:08:46", "owner": "_zhfrzkwn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087756935312955, "text": "🤤", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:26:06", "owner": "_manandmeat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876383233443306, "text": "Bruh ngl, this might be the best blondes I’ve ever seen.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:20:00", "owner": "bbarr.r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029688182765387, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:16:38", "owner": "_skinx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391531801176730, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:54:07", "owner": "adindankml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491445616078507, "text": "hmu", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:30:53", "owner": "joshmcqueen23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898475482343546, "text": "Whatever sport she does, I love that sport now 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:18:00", "owner": "eggssantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119834437550575, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:41:53", "owner": "annn.as_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078954851516055, "text": "omg", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:34:13", "owner": "aarna_pvtacc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099182482753588, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:28:57", "owner": "daios_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105259744724250, "text": "Baby, if you're seeing this, I liked it cuz of the Micheal Jacksons song", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:20:04", "owner": "jarlwest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063639200628274, "text": "Type of chick you see at the pool when you were five so you low-key suck your tummy in and flex your abs.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:10:19", "owner": "thecallumshaw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906898642270792, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:09:35", "owner": "pouya_shf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003325028824478, "text": "God damn", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:07:13", "owner": "desean9087", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848028310608225, "text": "Madison Beer's competition.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:59:52", "owner": "hashir_ali_shah_4064", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877403440346093, "text": "does the queen reply to everyone???", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:26:47", "owner": "t.schrand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874157281375603, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:15:44", "owner": "qiwylivi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427964302104579, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:55:50", "owner": "ben_kocsis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068819306099630, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:44:12", "owner": "chaslens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080863226323158, "text": "This blew the back off of my teenage boy head", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:31:29", "owner": "presidentj.osh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177590797363594, "text": "Im gay", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:18:57", "owner": "hdbfudndmlsj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104510242632044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:55:58", "owner": "9worg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086079178969105, "text": "This World is Healing. Id rather see this than what the algorithm wants me to see", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:47:01", "owner": "hibiki_irwin356", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954949105018685, "text": "Agartha, white monster, and her 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:41:44", "owner": "jam_ewo31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115735555574737, "text": "i’d crawl through 10000 miles of glass and barbed wire", "create