, could turn his back on both? Man was created by God in the first go. When God created woman, it took three tries before he got it right. Before she was “tame enough”, agreeable enough”, “submissive enough”, (or so it’s said). And even after all of that, all Eve had to do was give Adam a look, and that look was so powerful, Adam turned his back on the lord himself and ate from the Tree of Knowledge. It’s no wonder men are so terrified of women. Why we’ve spent our entire existence trying to control and tame them. Just a single look holds such dominion over us, the first of our kind turned his back on God under its hold. And if you ever wonder what kind of look Eve gave Adam, it’s the look in the first photo of this slide.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:17:23", "owner": "boston_baz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398325823125601, "text": "Sweetheart", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:10:47", "owner": "cee.29_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967344402987664, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:04:55", "owner": "lxies66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887407204389596, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:04:28", "owner": "haynkickboxxa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065625476418327, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:04:24", "owner": "anthony_melaragno", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849972073595917, "text": "Holy unknown slayer", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:03:01", "owner": "jacked_odenbach", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864656089436321, "text": "Oh you know u bad 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:56:00", "owner": "dhollo33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032612519724771, "text": "@ the photographer", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:53:37", "owner": "prxhb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964193847988495, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:53:12", "owner": "mikeav141", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319677403173308, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:43:10", "owner": "mortismanivela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073197824344211, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:42:12", "owner": "pedro_gnlez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 179