{"media_id": 3709810316021624242, "shortcode": "DN75NO2jG2y", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DN75NO2jG2y/", "taken_at": "2025-08-29T10:38:00", "caption": "Also Team Videos können wir 🤭🤝\n\n#jumpshotmarketing #marketing #videography #graphicdesign #meettheteam", "owner_username": "jumpshot.marketing", "owner_id": "53350042393", "likes": 144885, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0003_DN75NO2jG2y\\DN75NO2jG2y_20250829_103800.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18069844610182166, "text": "What’s wrong with Mikail? 😂 Why so serious bro", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:50:09", "owner": "samankinji", "likes": 880}, {"id": 18053598824255037, "text": "The coolest marketing team", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:57:18", "owner": "mancexplores", "likes": 849}, {"id": 17904921687279293, "text": "i mean i dont even know what company is this, but this is cool", "created_at": "2025-10-16T07:40:35", "owner": "shovian_", "likes": 60}, {"id": 18080513443941781, "text": "Fire the editor. Can't read the text. I hate myself for rewarding this mistake with engagement....Great job 😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:20:08", "owner": "ianbadenhorst", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18384316873132778, "text": "Daniela 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T23:55:38", "owner": "dimitri_ndjonyang", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18069290642268840, "text": "MIKAIL : Angle Protect The Hell", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:18:15", "owner": "wirdhhan_photographer", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18172920949342835, "text": "La social manager por Dios", "created_at": "2025-08-30T16:13:26", "owner": "hjulianrp", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18046580054386202, "text": "Podrían hacer tutorial jiji", "created_at": "2025-10-16T13:04:51", "owner": "javierasanhuezag", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902843491272452, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-20T05:11:09", "owner": "gswe_gmbh", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17853204915511309, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:28:41", "owner": "endlesspulp", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872514622425569, "text": "Hi Danielaaaa 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:48:21", "owner": "ttheo._ey", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18095388334600010, "text": "why every social media manager was 👩 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:08:55", "owner": "irust_13", "likes": 74}, {"id": 18544345567001575, "text": "@seosansmigraine à faire !!", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:08:19", "owner": "amandine_bart", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17902273590280674, "text": "Love it!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T14:43:24", "owner": "link2match", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060775100439942, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:39:36", "owner": "digiagency_net", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18197829115317045, "text": "@assis_mari02 olha aí pra mídia kk", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:22:46", "owner": "rayson.cruz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090621385684593, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:20:55", "owner": "travelislifeco", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18288339661263792, "text": "First one 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:30:45", "owner": "hishamallaoui", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085967725927850, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:20:42", "owner": "thetranslationpodcast", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052073561296169, "text": "I wanna join your team ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:09:41", "owner": "hassangfx2.0", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18086851624994994, "text": "What’s Azubi?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:10:12", "owner": "abdulla.akr", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18098703748666360, "text": "Im the only one in marketing department ☹️ i do content planning, social media, website handling/SEO , create marketing materials. \n\nand my job role is Marketing Asst. 🙂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:10:11", "owner": "aquariuuus__", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18068686442228058, "text": "I am editor", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:54:02", "owner": "quikredits", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18094057444688076, "text": "With daniela 🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:39:45", "owner": "haidarcoorg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096290086833827, "text": "Myslef 🫣😬", "crea