{"media_id": 3723303542388784064, "shortcode": "DOr1NhLCXvA", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOr1NhLCXvA/", "taken_at": "2025-09-17T01:28:12", "caption": "Go viral using these 3 proven hooks ⬇️\n\n1️⃣ Stitch Hook: Borrow momentum from a trending clip and add your unique take. It instantly taps into curiosity and context your audience already cares about.\n\n2️⃣ Shock Value Hook: Say something that makes people pause: a bold stat, a surprising truth, or a statement that feels almost controversial (but still true). The goal is to disrupt their scroll.\n\n3️⃣ Visual Hook: Let the first frame do the talking. A chase scene, a dramatic gesture, or even text that fills the screen can make people stop before they even hear a word.\n\nThe best Creators don’t just post content—they engineer attention. Master these 3 hooks and you’ll see the difference in your reach :)\n\n👉 For more growth strategies like this, follow @creatorstrategies \n\nFeatured Creators:\n@drtaniaelliott \n@boomzi \n@the_saltypineapple\n\n#contentcreator #socialmediatips #creatoreconomy #contentmarketing", "owner_username": "creatorstrategies", "owner_id": "72908272924", "likes": 21573, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0004_DOr1NhLCXvA\\DOr1NhLCXvA_20250917_012812.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17984690198863785, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-01T18:04:22", "owner": "russelgodfreydsouza", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063505031428633, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:57:58", "owner": "95krazy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084484483813685, "text": "Bro used all 3 of them", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:57:56", "owner": "_girishop_", "likes": 148}, {"id": 18302440498265457, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:22:29", "owner": "jimmy.in.china", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867739231403125, "text": "Where do you download these hooks to put on your videos?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:40:55", "owner": "fastighetsvardsyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062958827158421, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:13:48", "owner": "socialmediavirality", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846713110563379, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:51:12", "owner": "thesmallentrepeneur", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18102684130632043, "text": "First guy look familiar", "created_at": "2025-11-04T07:09:57", "owner": "mafi_leo_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18529642612044970, "text": "This is absolute fire🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-22T13:13:46", "owner": "whojeffincares", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18054639689289416, "text": "This is hilarious! Thanks for sharing 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:43:27", "owner": "uimedicalmarketing", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067439540214991, "text": "Check", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:51:03", "owner": "moaatitosherif", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17994000326891704, "text": "Very creative", "created_at": "2025-12-18T04:17:44", "owner": "webuildcourses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036257036733439, "text": "The algorithm wants us to use these and post 3 times a day no ones got time for that", "created_at": "2025-12-14T23:46:08", "owner": "jacobl1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152730502421034, "text": "how do they find these videos for the first video stitch idea", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:12:26", "owner": "hugsnodrugsrl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017740322620338, "text": "First one was so good", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:54:54", "owner": "fbkem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064957106563915, "text": "this the third time im seeing someone use the transtion method of a video..... but its not their video... can i watch the fu**ing original please?! FAAAAAH", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:37:22", "owner": "jaysxeast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079277717181781, "text": "good thing the girl doesn't have a penis", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:17:22", "owner": "thee_deveraux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400147216134369, "text": "Check out the caption?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:50:36", "owner": "in_finiite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092518415509688, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:38:15", "owner": "mysteriousaura9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067622444107980, "text": "Will be implementing this 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:36:25", "owner": "guesthaven__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085066769475033, "text": "😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:15:43", "owner": "real10babylinx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031736924743379, "text": "@brandingpilot.ai", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:18:49", "owner": "bananaboy1972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249022012288768, "text": "Prompt", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:15:51", "owner": "llwnrc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977871786953823, "text": "@thebranding.ai same 🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:13:38", "owner": "tam87to", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849207208563999, "text": "what about for longer clip? how to put the \"hook\" without getting too long/boring for the audience?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:05:40", "owner": "69.to.go", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870808681462690, "text": "So many types of hook to create curiosity.\nShock value is a good one my fav hbu", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:29:50", "owner": "itsdominicdigital", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903504688293975, "text": "Ans this is an hook hook", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:34:26", "owner": "darius.plk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875447392355878, "text": "Wäre so i finde that stuff?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:05:12", "owner": "toni22six", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191675017333973, "text": "Ouch", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:43:19", "owner": "222thz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976994631946276, "text": "The first one 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:49:30", "owner": "rosaria_kapya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102537985726805, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:14:30", "owner": "jayvux_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091986976889022, "text": "my friend erri hook @narayana_gupta_", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:40:55", "owner": "dil.barash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383246098181431, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:28:05", "owner": "primaclothing1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963000291868294, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:45:08", "owner": "artleadsdigitalagency", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100132339676977, "text": "Check", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:56:37", "owner": "ego_rayden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970852569805957, "text": "Can someone check bros balls", "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:25:08", "owner": "r1kaa.__ha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858516388476805, "text": "check", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:10:55", "owner": "tlsthefearless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002206325671370, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:22:32", "owner": "jimmy.in.china", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062567489565784, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:22:24", "owner": "jimmy.in.china", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986768310907324, "text": "Check", "created_at": "2025-10-28T17:56:25", "owner": "sebranibilal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990334965856121, "text": "Check", "created_at": "2025-10-27T18:46:07", "owner": "adt.amir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098715088732783, "text": "Check out", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:38:49", "owner": "jw_z7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061314233180505, "text": "@mirza.173", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:52:47", "owner": "harismekic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086720200764303, "text": "@mirza.173", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:52:37", "owner": "harismekic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898157707328314, "text": "Nice work. Thanx for sharing 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-26T05:29:47", "owner": "sisutrader08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846702547567539, "text": "check", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:37:55", "owner": "hamcostory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058893614633108, "text": "check", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:13:27", "owner": "freestyleconsulting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108854662587108, "text": "Hook", "created_at": "2025-10-21T12:22:11", "owner": "viciarc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079872809043404, "text": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DP_duOakr57/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:56:22", "owner": "train_nexus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092077744859363, "text": "Check", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:29:36", "owner": "qdropq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088026520904929, "text": "check", "created_at": "2025-10-18T04:54:16", "owner": "jozhingalla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067874498344714, "text": "check", "created_at": "2025-10-17T09:39:50", "owner": "ikydrums", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061038575387706, "text": "Check", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:25:11", "owner": "davv_rakoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926969119135513, "text": "Go search “guoshengdoh”, this guy is insane🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:38:12", "owner": "fpj.hip.jrmh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083510623946894, "text": "need concept", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:00:16", "owner": "dekh.ito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073854052935963, "text": "check", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:00:02", "owner": "dekh.ito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336192583229273, "text": "Check", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:05:01", "owner": "_nabeeeeeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046436645674191, "text": "Check", "created_at": "2025-10-08T06:35:58", "owner": "houssiinee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291254146281765, "text": "hook", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:46:19", "owner": "jonayed_xp_japan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021396626559913, "text": "Send me this post", "created_at": "2025-09-17T01:32:28", "owner": "california._icon._", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["contentcreator", "socialmediatips", "creatoreconomy", "contentmarketing"]},
{"media_id": 3759059030841944017, "shortcode": "DQq3EWvDufR", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQq3EWvDufR/", "taken_at": "2025-11-05T09:26:47", "caption": "We're building a railway that's fit for Britain's future - owned by the public, for the public.\n\nToday, we're introducing the Railways Bill into @ukhouseofcommons to set up Great British Railways and deliver a simpler, more reliable rail network.", "owner_username": "transportgovuk", "owner_id": "18964063694", "likes": 5285, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0005_DQq3EWvDufR\\DQq3EWvDufR_20251105_092647.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18242815114291824, "text": "Does this mean more affordable fares?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:49:40", "owner": "creeeper.aw.man", "likes": 207}, {"id": 18124549297503685, "text": "Gbr. Bit long winded. Make it BR.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:47:40", "owner": "montyweager", "likes": 467}, {"id": 18163499968376496, "text": "So back to the way it was 35 years ago then", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:17:34", "owner": "fizzytoucan", "likes": 91}, {"id": 18048210521403046, "text": "Starmer’s admin just made a video on a very popular issue and then missed the word “nationalisation” for the entire video.\n\nI am unimpressed", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:03:15", "owner": "harveydavethompson", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18096399415827711, "text": "How much did this advert cost? Very professionally done. Shame that wasn't spent on making more affordable fares though.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:53:55", "owner": "daniel01.w", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18046336331436112, "text": "Make it just BR and we got a deal", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:44:47", "owner": "toosplash29", "likes": 235}, {"id": 18005567447658874, "text": "Who writes this rubbish I travel on trains a lot mainly on lner. I've had journeys where I've had delays but in general they have been good. It's time to stop knocking things in this country and start supporting transportation, NHS, etc.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:18:55", "owner": "deltic235", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18087501848496752, "text": "Sort your ticket costs out and you may make something for everyone not just expensive commuter tickets for rich.  Germany has a gonanywhere any time ticket of €59 and subsidises there railway mile for mile the same as ours. That’s €59 to travel anywhere and it’s a bill you pay each month not each day or each trip.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:35:57", "owner": "dladers", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18073530227246969, "text": "We didn’t ask for this! It doesn’t phase us! We just want the damn tickets cheaper and make all stations step free access that’s it !", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:03:51", "owner": "mullanumbanine_064", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18352367722161439, "text": "Bring back our double arrows", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:14:04", "owner": "daegsenzo_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18163218457388877, "text": "So we're just renationalising railways?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:27:15", "owner": "caplonk_5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859156858539931, "text": "Last year my train was cancelled halfway so I couldn’t make the connection (and made a two hour detour). Neither LNER nor Thameslink took responsibility (and both blamed the other for the problem) and so I never got my delay repay back.", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:46:21", "owner": "johnzhiyuanliu1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17941070451066841, "text": "Privatisation was never private at all", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:41:31", "owner": "realrandomtoad", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18304047925264959, "text": "You say there’s an app and website. No there isn’t.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:28:28", "owner": "instagrampilot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291885835272239, "text": "@transportgovuk There should be a high speed rail from Paris via London, Heathrow, Birmingham and Manchester to Glasgow/Edinburgh. It would be one line connecting all major metropolitan areas in the UK and its largest airport to mainland Europe. It could be that simple and run at a high frequency on its own tracks like Shinkansen.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:28:21", "owner": "so.ein.bohei", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18063760736392064, "text": "Another website 🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:30:47", "owner": "bigcheese100", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18094032934865343, "text": "@transportgovuk who owns the trains and tracks?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:17:54", "owner": "belawal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044094359481813, "text": "Get rid of the ROSCOS first! They’re the biggest problem profiting billions which goes to shareholders outside the U.K.\nPart of the reason why train fares are so high as the TOCs profit margins are so low.\nGBR is all fine and dandy but unless the root problem is tackled nothing will change!", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:44:14", "owner": "nathan_trains", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17900834505165686, "text": "Rare UK W", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:33:07", "owner": "transitandbicyclingfan12.018am", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18162979645391713, "text": "Yeh just make it cheaper, that’s literally the only thing people want.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:40:25", "owner": "mrdancoleman", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18119706931481015, "text": "Just another extreme solution...", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:50:24", "owner": "dom_havel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18287827252274471, "text": "If the ROSCO's aren't also nationalised then we're all in the same boat still", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:11:12", "owner": "rhys.monochrome", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090191600308868, "text": "I have a feeling this is going to be pronounced, \"Great: British Rail.\"", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:06:42", "owner": "bristolwnbr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005967878810940, "text": "Your railways never work, never on time or just don’t show up", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:46:15", "owner": "liv.hz666", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064555025417635, "text": "Doesn’t matter how cheap or reliable they try and make it the train driver unions will go on strike sooner or later for a 20% pay rise!! Because it’s a tough job driving something that’s on rails!!", "created_at": "2025-11-06T20:56:53", "owner": "tallyhoblondie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121348024513673, "text": "Train fares need to change, no more dynamic pricing. My monthly season ticket is more than my mortgage (4-bed hse) for a 50 min journey into Paddington", "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:11:50", "owner": "lottielimejuice", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114610534563594, "text": "Please stop spending my taxes on political propaganda; announce your intentions in the proper place ie the Houses of Parliament and let the media report on it.  No more paid-for propaganda!  @10downingstreet @ukgovofficial @ukparliament @tahirali.mp #ukdemocracy", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:50:55", "owner": "man_b13_mk3", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18084477311079792, "text": "British railways part 2: Electric Boogaloo!", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:56:53", "owner": "train_man_dan", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17901344256335675, "text": "Give us British Rail back", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:53:09", "owner": "tj2infinity", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17952837399040235, "text": "Are the ticket prices gonna drop tho??? If not idfc", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:42:45", "owner": "amosss_leungg", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18068652401601145, "text": "I mean i'm not British but ok", "created_at": "2025-11-06T03:09:17", "owner": "mind.1621", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18185963785339393, "text": "Great English Railways. Your three non-equal partners in this union won't see much benefit, if any, and, as typically happens with Labour, the Devil will be in the detail.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:59:49", "owner": "nothingartyfarty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072032321594792, "text": "Yet Canadian owned Angel Trains, will continue making tens of billions out of our railways.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T03:51:49", "owner": "chrislondon2019", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18124942987559040, "text": "What about the hundreds of millions of profit that ROSCOs make? No? Didn't think so", "created_at": "2025-12-21T08:45:46", "owner": "apwattt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230934388305463, "text": "Nationalising is one thing, properly investing into it is another. If the government doesn’t do the necessary investments into the infrastructure, BR 2.0 will still suck", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:33:51", "owner": "itsalexcuriel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114919744515931, "text": "It should cost me Leeds to London £25 trains are fast have full 5G starlink on all of them and always on time :) you should also have UWB boxes in each carriage way and AI facial detection to detect and automate tickets. Yet our taxes do not get used :/", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:17:20", "owner": "khadaffij", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374404381154150, "text": "no more trenitalia uk", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:30:01", "owner": "nicoloorusco_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842464792655324, "text": "If that voice over isn't AI it was recorded to sound like it. Either way, it sucks. Nationalising rail is awesome however. Wish it was going further than this to be honest. Bring it all back in house. This just seems like a half measure.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:40:23", "owner": "leocookman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357332185163170, "text": "\"Our railways aren't work for passengers\"  you said all", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:53:18", "owner": "notsowhitecrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419410300117819, "text": "DB moment incoming?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:47:03", "owner": "naya.notnow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337209298237809, "text": "Creating global monopolist will not free up capacity on strained corridors nor will not miraculously upgrade faulty/dated infrastructure. So good luck with performance or fares improvements.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:53:50", "owner": "jay_not_son", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422412283117757, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:36:51", "owner": "mjp19_88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398085082134529, "text": "Good! @edwardjdavey @livuni @livunialumni @liverpoolguild @livunilibrary", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:41:25", "owner": "rorymeldrum2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846855985610013, "text": "@gabriel.schraiber", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:45:17", "owner": "sebarba.el.regreso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921129040209466, "text": "I’ll believe it when a one way ticket from London to Manchester doesn’t cost a staggering £90", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:09:48", "owner": "yairmillenbach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099955621667061, "text": "Oh Dr Beeching. What have you done, there use to be lots of trains until there was none", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:58:07", "owner": "linux_detected", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384936736177833, "text": "@deutschebahn 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:00:36", "owner": "hovi.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049601936385470, "text": "Great, well done!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:09:33", "owner": "jflemaydesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328722244209288, "text": "We've had problems on the exeter to London line for months now it's lost south west trains and renationalised it's even more shit than ever 3 carriages from exeter to Salisbury all full up overcrowding and this is what this bloody useless labour party thinks is good it's taken months to try to fix the track problem around crewekern and yeovil junction it might be ok by end of November..don't hold your breath.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:46:11", "owner": "sm4037191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090842681507382, "text": "Should have been done 25years ago, and don't forget the ROSCs.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:42:12", "owner": "captain_dermot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890725576372829, "text": "You need to bring the rolling stock back into public ownership this is the biggest cost on the railway unlike the wages that the Tories were blaming.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:20:54", "owner": "john.ogg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082834163472872, "text": "Dawg you tried this before British Rail was absolute dogshit 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:17:17", "owner": "sunsetrouterailfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124727362511887, "text": "I was sacked for being too ill after long COVID having worked all through COVID, does that mean I can have my job back?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:09:32", "owner": "happybadger_hamilton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348295417200316, "text": "Bring the price of a ticket down! I'm not flying to Spain i just want to get to Doncaster", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:21:34", "owner": "snakesandclouds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068014412100128, "text": "Make em cheaper fgs", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:04:49", "owner": "ubereats2511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066241424603124, "text": "Please fix Euston 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:59:42", "owner": "i_hate_euston_station", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086494486975960, "text": "Are you doing away with the rolling stock hire companies too? TWANGO's or ASBO's or whatever they're called?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:31:38", "owner": "realarvo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961329888861239, "text": "MAKE IT CHEAPER", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:26:55", "owner": "greenbrett1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020684210598083, "text": "Hopefully the cash we pay out for tickets doesn’t go into shareholders pockets. But back into upgrading the network . 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:55:36", "owner": "dave_elle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979496319927466, "text": "gonna buy back the trains though?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T11:47:22", "owner": "muhammad.a.a777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542397007038390, "text": "is that going to make it more affordable 👀👀", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:50:05", "owner": "roselikealice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029617616547474, "text": "BRITISH RAILWAYS 2??", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:32:39", "owner": "el_mati.ae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084434989970850, "text": "And what happens when they strike? Still got enough staff? 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:35:41", "owner": "cbtwizard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083624981091102, "text": "Here we go again, first the great train robbery (privatiastion) and now the antithesis!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:49:15", "owner": "jay.t1978", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845909017607769, "text": "@squashydisco sorry my Instagram is broken so this won't appear as a reply, but I think it could've been phrased better. When private companies own public transport, it allows the people who run those companies to make profit based decisions instead of people based decisions, making railways a more difficult experience for both passengers and workers and no responsibility is taken for the difficulties they face in the name of cutting costs and maximising revenue. That's how I see it personally, it's a problem with the owners of railway companies and they affect both the commuting passengers and the train workers who keep the system and country as a whole running.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:39:23", "owner": "bobby.on.bass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18558447982016338, "text": "GBR is cool. But INTERCITY is too inconic", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:39:15", "owner": "helimopp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912320584096047, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:22:21", "owner": "so.ein.bohei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009845945799642, "text": "Isn't GBR a rail haulage company?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:40:24", "owner": "archiewyer1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853992643568598, "text": "Gay Bar?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:35:05", "owner": "emu.1204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082185950041920, "text": "Are you going to own the trains in the future?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:04:01", "owner": "nathan._sim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098898028683839, "text": "This is great English railways. Wales and Scotland are currently doing their own thing snd apparwntly will continue to do so.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:32:32", "owner": "flykai_b1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866599945419087, "text": "Publicly owned? Doesn't that mean they have investors to keep happy? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:24:06", "owner": "gekke_gengis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064532651423572, "text": "well you’ve done a shit job so far", "created_at": "2025-11-10T11:10:55", "owner": "baileyy121_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513238186067312, "text": "no no no no no no no no no no, no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:45:00", "owner": "achtungpasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064721774388386, "text": "Well now your running SWR pity you cant get them to run full length trains. I see little chsnce of improvemdnt over next 30 years", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:59:08", "owner": "inked_gay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182512192350827, "text": "Expect more price increases like in the Netherlands from @ns_online : 2026 will hit passengers with a staggering 6.52% price increase 📈 it’s better to use the car whenever you can or domestic flights in the UK for long distance travel.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:42:12", "owner": "mpzalac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006261074655150, "text": "Take over Angel Trains!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:21:23", "owner": "habit611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420495121112328, "text": "Not at all! Another intermediary company taking profits and increasing fares", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:10:59", "owner": "moteipix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104878573724209, "text": "They can't use GBR as we at the Great Bush Railway claimed it first.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:28:44", "owner": "tom_3906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921155932188844, "text": "I HAVE PLAYED THESE GAMES BEFORE!!\nI SAID I PLAYED THESE GAMES BEFOREEEE!!\n(Renfe)", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:45:54", "owner": "fizzl_wizzler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862784602515909, "text": "Please add GTFS!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:43:36", "owner": "catenarymaps", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18386394238181010, "text": "Unless you half fairs, this serves almost no purpose", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:55:00", "owner": "_ellie.vine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012293960800877, "text": "Watch fares go up like they have on LNER, which has been publicly owned and run since 2018.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:44:13", "owner": "jon.barker.946", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543669889020055, "text": "Please get the people who did the new clock to sort out the branding. It's already a mishmash and those stickers on the trains look bad. There's a real opportunity here to ignite some national pride and address the feeling of national decline that's feeding Reform.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:14:06", "owner": "nckhnsn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047960462390136, "text": "Does this mean lower prices and more connectivity, say i wanted to go to nottingham from colchester direct or by avoiding london entirely would that be possible?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:18:39", "owner": "geometrix_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920708083190870, "text": "AI slop x", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:26:16", "owner": "barney_je", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085634060495527, "text": "Why's this got an AI voiceover?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:23:45", "owner": "stanley_olden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072965338994739, "text": "Why use an Ai voice over? Does your marketing budget not have £200 it would cost for a session?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:17:02", "owner": "heliumbaboon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117797422535954, "text": "MTRGA", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:57:54", "owner": "joey_nya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895308085203585, "text": "Why is this reminiscent of the watchdogs trailer", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:55:55", "owner": "joey_nya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141847417394116, "text": "Idk if anyone with actual ability to bring concerns to the decision makers reads these comments but if you want to fix our railways, you need to consider banning ROSCOs and own our rolling stock outright.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:34:16", "owner": "konkachu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045217736456316, "text": "The actual trains are still going to be owned by profit hungry leasing companies, negating a lot of the benefits of a publicly owned system. Also, freight, the most profitable part of the railway will remain in the private sector, which is honestly a massive oversight. If freight was brought into the public sector, the profits could be used to subsidise train tickets for passengers making the railway a lot cheaper for the general public. Let’s make a truly publicly owned railway network, not this pathetic attempt to make it look like the government actually care.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:17:41", "owner": "racingfranco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938301828965390, "text": "can’t wait to get stabbed on them 🤩", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:21:14", "owner": "yvasqz0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988004253856118, "text": "Big promises, let’s hope you deliver", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:11:01", "owner": "danspracklen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889867807240779, "text": "Briljant 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:32:23", "owner": "timhanssen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065174651119123, "text": "You need to role in the TOCs", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:32:21", "owner": "rsimpson1991", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3755115088211781735, "shortcode": "DQc2Ub7kqhn", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQc2Ub7kqhn/", "taken_at": "2025-10-30T22:50:23", "caption": "3rd years a charm🌟\n•\n•\n•\n•\n•\n#ucla #uclatrackandfield #year3 #uclaathletics #highjump #explorepage✨ #modeling #nil #LA #mediaday #track", "owner_username": "hannah.slover", "owner_id": "1823621851", "likes": -1, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0006_DQc2Ub7kqhn\\DQc2Ub7kqhn_20251030_225023_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0006_DQc2Ub7kqhn\\DQc2Ub7kqhn_20251030_225023_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0006_DQc2Ub7kqhn\\DQc2Ub7kqhn_20251030_225023_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0006_DQc2Ub7kqhn\\DQc2Ub7kqhn_20251030_225023_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0006_DQc2Ub7kqhn\\DQc2Ub7kqhn_20251030_225023_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0006_DQc2Ub7kqhn\\DQc2Ub7kqhn_20251030_225023_6.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17965169372989063, "text": "come home the kids (me) miss you", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:34:17", "owner": "katelynrosen_", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18536589634051147, "text": "hi gorgeous queen", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:50:34", "owner": "marina.k.jackson", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18069213890605099, "text": "i adore uuu", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:11:10", "owner": "lucy.campbell24", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18417160096115583, "text": "SO stunning Han!! Proud of you 🥰💙", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:31:31", "owner": "hanna.hoffman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904157548271998, "text": "gasping for air WOW", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:47:02", "owner": "daryahajiseyedjavadi", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18048168830663947, "text": "WOW.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:25:36", "owner": "aidensarin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18121764274518674, "text": "Wow ur so beautiful", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:50:51", "owner": "evarohrbach", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17920846800193124, "text": "SO GORGEOUS", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:43:39", "owner": "iz.larson", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863403634516804, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:21:14", "owner": "gregorio", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18302387770268492, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:45:11", "owner": "miaholdenn_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18522069514068077, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-31T19:35:17", "owner": "goodmorningucla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092540278893653, "text": "Hii baddie I miss you sm", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:23:35", "owner": "reagan.422", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096721708684054, "text": "BARBIEEE😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-31T20:23:32", "owner": "allychandler_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17987107388875930, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:29:28", "owner": "sajjadad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090175921914655, "text": "🥵🥵", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:32:34", "owner": "3li.p11", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074349866465065, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:38:50", "owner": "juliorizkita", "likes": 1915}, {"id": 17937975737965279, "text": "Ouuu😍", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:01:10", "owner": "joshwbailey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18298537675281042, "text": "I love you", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:35:03", "owner": "swmg_ong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092764558895240, "text": "Hi", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:38:19", "owner": "beener22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981527685765318, "text": "LG represent 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:32:12", "owner": "aydon.runs", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18048363125395478, "text": "Let your dreams be bigger than your fears, and your actions be stronger than your doubts. You are beautiful, your beauty comes from another world, the sublime shine of your eyes is reflected through your beautiful smile. Simply a Beautiful Angel😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:23:34", "owner": "navadiogo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944293359939500, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:44:29", "owner": "syd.johnson", "likes": 3313}, {"id": 17900450244322143, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:05:08", "owner": "_stereomantis", "likes": 888}, {"id": 17991735518853565, "text": "Since it's rare to see replies to comments on profiles like this, I decided to write a positive message in case someone reads it: To understand the things that truly matter, sometimes you need to walk slowly and slow down.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:44:14", "owner": "wellington921soares", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18317131342223449, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:45:26", "owner": "luketsiaras", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18540077050003323, "text": "its like looking at prime stephen curry", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:34:39", "owner": "jcutt525", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064161374382840, "text": "I’m following for the epic taste in music tbh", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:25:01", "owner": "he1himself", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086832994799255, "text": "Your place is in Paris !!", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:14:20", "owner": "aladiinjoudarii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18538686535058165, "text": "@a.qyl_ my fyp never failed me", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:29:09", "owner": "lelouchviiibritannia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084169274090712, "text": "What are the name of women of these types", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:14:07", "owner": "yakurmalah", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18076110370950379, "text": "Again the algorithm brings me here. Ps: you absolutely killing it", "created_at": "2025-11-15T05:04:38", "owner": "ivars0n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366314449083824, "text": "Thats quite some bruises on your knee, god bless this young woman speedy recovery", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:50:24", "owner": "mxax177", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105650500650744, "text": "@ivan_melgarr @pedri @pablogavi", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:27:15", "owner": "guillermoortiz_21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059611088196910, "text": "Literally so beautiful", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:04:07", "owner": "allybolden", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18140553130399202, "text": "Proud of you H! Keep doing great things", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:13:55", "owner": "anointed_in_ch