{"media_id": 3765461159500782460, "shortcode": "DRBmvlrkxt8", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRBmvlrkxt8/", "taken_at": "2025-11-14T05:26:34", "caption": "I played an investor game and actually crushed it 💸 \n\nYou swipe through real YC pitches, pick who to fund, and see if they made it. \n\nFeels like Shark Tank meets gaming 🦈🎮\n\n#startuptiktok #reactions #ycombinator #pitches", "owner_username": "moniify", "owner_id": "69723876741", "likes": 11223, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0007_DRBmvlrkxt8\\DRBmvlrkxt8_20251114_052634.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18096315316839219, "text": "Isn't ADDA like a big thing?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:55:52", "owner": "bjain.nd", "likes": 461}, {"id": 18494165803073201, "text": "Dude give them a chance 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:31:15", "owner": "goumidinabie", "likes": 3008}, {"id": 18064074041186232, "text": "Dislike button —>", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:28:36", "owner": "zeyadfayed14", "likes": 364}, {"id": 18432548338108626, "text": "Wts the game name", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:28:56", "owner": "girget__", "likes": 54}, {"id": 17970150611963775, "text": "Problem - Solution - Expectation - Product.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:11:43", "owner": "dayyan_theday", "likes": 211}, {"id": 18102194422665809, "text": "Well done 👏 they need to learn about elevator pitch like if you meet an investor in an elevator you got a few seconds to convince him to invest in your business", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:42:28", "owner": "maxturner_com", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18108527677529380, "text": "Hey thanks my game ycarena.com 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:16:38", "owner": "brycent", "likes": 80}, {"id": 18137292712462642, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:28:57", "owner": "youngstunner.algos", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18066624209614577, "text": "😂😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:41:36", "owner": "tishi.mov", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18111717484591820, "text": "@thesdgguy 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:40:01", "owner": "renganathanofficial", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18101098741690585, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:13:02", "owner": "whaleshark_2008", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17943419991073048, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:23:39", "owner": "arkan._.safi", "likes": 106}, {"id": 18103084939656085, "text": "What platform is this?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:08:23", "owner": "azat.yerzhan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073186952002629, "text": "Whatever the reply from Y Combinator,  please keep building 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-15T00:01:03", "owner": "muhammad.herdiansyah.paduppai", "likes": 170}, {"id": 18168729718379008, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:22:13", "owner": "gonza.vp._", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18195467125323006, "text": "Bro scrolling the dreams😂😢", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:46:01", "owner": "dsqrstudio", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18133838902488915, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:06:56", "owner": "lazycontentlab", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18089500987778124, "text": "Hes not rude, he is honest, elevator pitch is too long, just introduce yourself and sell your product.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:14:58", "owner": "mrcswzmn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933765796112057, "text": "Statistically speaking dude might just always call rejected and be right most of the time without making up fake rules for start ups 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:53:34", "owner": "david_zoolander", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18134709001482321, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:31:03", "owner": "thebillionairesculture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082163126279330, "text": "😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:57:13", "owner": "thoughtsofablackman_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18426022489114656, "text": "If you have decent traction, get to that info fast or use it as a hook", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:32:27", "owner": "sorhanft", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18111907219608815, "text": "I once was told that at YC most of the time the system sorta rigged😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:42:19", "owner": "catserah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960756783859734, "text": "😢😂😂oh now I know I’m already out😒", "created_at": "2025-11-14T21:53:20", "owner": "poptonydm", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17852174748579752, "text": "The indians didnt even get to state their names before you hoovered that \"reject your dreams\" button.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:29:28", "owner": "lordaronenglundh", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17976638396954505, "text": "What website or app do you use", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:49:14", "owner": "omani2002iq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060297524230047, "text": "Stabilization😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:10:27", "owner": "york.dmytro", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18038699591510100, "text": "Vibe 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:49:21", "owner": "147ammar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099979024735949, "text": "Give me website/game", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:29:37", "owner": "4stralchakra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084552746082297, "text": "Brutal hoahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:20:11", "owner": "emrelore_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972470154800964, "text": "Ycarena.com", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:45:39", "owner": "adamy3464", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18105007747572634, "text": "I hope all of these guys become more successful then you can ever wish for.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:18:11", "owner": "walid_nazir", "likes": 499}, {"id": 17870336562468725, "text": "You are rude af", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:17:25", "owner": "walid_nazir", "likes": 626}, {"id": 18112738870591547, "text": "you have likly 99% chance to gusse right.it's not magic!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:25:12", "owner": "sjhmi14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052655870668121, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-20T01:06:38", "owner": "bagekipo.v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083491402887044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:24:39", "owner": "m_junior_111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842783662651267, "text": "Who the f is that YC guy. Rude af. Hope no one picks up his call when he slips and falls in bathroom.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:19:07", "owner": "that.is.what.she.says", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029540342754405, "text": "Tbh worst investor i wouldn't ever pitch to you if you dont have the time to listen lol.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:09:08", "owner": "adish_chowdhury", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893440624234655, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:36:43", "owner": "abznasir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175320331366537, "text": "Baltimore mentioned", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:13:01", "owner": "benjinotafed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844983799610554, "text": "Link?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:28:45", "owner": "beachhomes.tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047043080464940, "text": "Man sybau", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:13:15", "owner": "abo_heijio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096795523839046, "text": "We are building trading team, we just need ambitious traders , quants, coding expertise, people who want to dominate on international level in this financial world , dm", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:03:04", "owner": "_yadav_rudra_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069314453614287, "text": "We manufacture all purpose cleaner in India @earthlycleanz recently started share your PoV on this", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:20:03", "owner": "doshisomya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063272675441430, "text": "Bro is \"Barbara\" of YC", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:34:15", "owner": "souviiiiiik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985214007921991, "text": "you don’t thing about your job unfortunately 👄", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:34:02", "owner": "saba.nikatchadze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074587112264490, "text": "Where to play this", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:31:04", "owner": "2xkh5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095904130686736, "text": "We’re building the first on demand boat ride app. Tap, Float, Go. Launching in Miami. Check us out -> @ridenava", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:30:44", "owner": "theoarranz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299828719256690, "text": "do you like to make thousand of dollars and stay at home,\ntired from online search for decent work, no worries ,\nwith real estate business you can just from flipping contract's\ndon't know how no, worries with 20$/month max dispo course\nyou would learn how to make contracts online and sell contracts to hedge funds to make profits\nhere is link https://tinyurl.com/m897dtru sign up today to begin your real estate journey today and profit from real estate market's!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:06:36", "owner": "friendrevv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907732969270300, "text": "The fact that his cursor is already on reject button before they even start is already tells everything", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:54:54", "owner": "saigakaxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103305337731176, "text": "Ur very fun at parties", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:11:45", "owner": "seeen.mp4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930115663012643, "text": "These guys must’ve never heard of elevated pitch ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:49:52", "owner": "thelinkgroupe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035018561522029, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:36:54", "owner": "radk98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086039701816060, "text": "Most of this accepted YC videos lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:07", "owner": "xzjordy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064257899176342, "text": "Bro, he pissed me", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:18:19", "owner": "lglgl1.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351939763167445, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:51:48", "owner": "othmantmoulik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864013015516464, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:31:07", "owner": "sir_stanley._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871218739465952, "text": "This looks like such a good app 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:06:21", "owner": "sakutradigital", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919686340189908, "text": "ADDA is a multi M$ company", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:27:34", "owner": "gtm_432", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070247765590624, "text": "how does an accepted one look like 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:45:40", "owner": "matthewgarcia4555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948261601061561, "text": "Which application is this ?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:31:19", "owner": "unboxkloud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083366555047214, "text": "So how do you win this", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:21:37", "owner": "ishanb3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073305329246373, "text": "And then you went back home with your money 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:33:05", "owner": "damidara01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079552859152348, "text": "If mine is on there I will sue. That's fucked up", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:33:01", "owner": "notaylacroft", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047971289689143, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂.. i gotta play this game", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:49:27", "owner": "olubayosam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975488643957432, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:09:04", "owner": "alhelali_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966238344996475, "text": "He’s looking for a product or pitcher? I just curious.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:44:25", "owner": "rey.zahari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986188626872336, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:34:11", "owner": "keshavregmii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873190879375821, "text": "Pitch swipe left and right", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:12:19", "owner": "_sameer_khatri__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073518152463059, "text": "How to do all that in under 1 minute?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:37:09", "owner": "dreamxcix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857969704551025, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:35:19", "owner": "deotii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119106442552144, "text": "its the vibe😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:10:40", "owner": "francisss.journey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082844483281207, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:54:05", "owner": "thisisdglove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316007152219874, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:35:36", "owner": "the_black_sunz", "like