t": "2025-12-18T16:25:33", "owner": "killerjack36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371133736088200, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:47:10", "owner": "ivys_classroom_dairy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352905961166888, "text": "😂😂不知道怎麼回應好了⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:27:31", "owner": "chiapinchung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917581276219623, "text": "Ok~", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:39:14", "owner": "inshilai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067002068390411, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T02:35:28", "owner": "rayjolinlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986458020916107, "text": "好漂亮的妈妈 尤其那一口牙齿", "created_at": "2025-12-14T10:20:54", "owner": "xiaoyueyang77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060966305265697, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:35:38", "owner": "java0215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081770366163338, "text": "but that is t ru e", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:28:19", "owner": "ang_lia5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069999329103591, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:18:29", "owner": "lwy_ladygirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114082642596296, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:11:46", "owner": "demi1984382019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044950853705566, "text": "這孩子以後一定是個大直男😆", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:42:49", "owner": "uni7393", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071491616367081, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:32:59", "owner": "smalcakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937987272985036, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:55:38", "owner": "tingmei_0401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353461474206622, "text": "真是貼心的孩子", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:41:48", "owner": "slightlyhandsome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064421042550817, "text": "😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:15:31", "owner": "ong.k.wai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943151518094289, "text": "冬天比較老夏天比較年輕", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:39:07", "owner": "p0958432132", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088470908310332, "text": "有安慰 但太多", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:59:51", "owner": "maplesyrup_0426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065403854163058, "text": "難怪會叫老二", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:34:28", "owner": "harima_mao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077085263232602, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:48:38", "owner": "celiacelia0612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853738978591224, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:58:38", "owner": "mmqllatotal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337349251232594, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:33:47", "owner": "peter26013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091984603920844, "text": "也沒說錯啦", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:33:51", "owner": "romanx_7651", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079435892145642, "text": "我也有😮", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:23:46", "owner": "dragon_________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078380128958013, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:38:18", "owner": "ahmin1230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542580046034579, "text": "@chloechu216", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:28:00", "owner": "yuen_w_pan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878718298434597, "text": "當有兒子時，類似的對話會是一種日常😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:23:58", "owner": "littleuniverses_ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900799873342950, "text": "媽媽：自己生的…自己生的…", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:17:17", "owner": "owen_lien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903578761325540, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:51:04", "owner": "puisze218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097558165838481, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:25:55", "owner": "oswin_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080913140131178, "text": "@joyuwu @luen10_21 @st214109 @red_all_red @nnamwa_jn @dofu802010 @aga_1129", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:42:57", "owner": "kkksssss3001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110148334611866, "text": "這孩子是懂安慰人的 效果先不管", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:26:33", "owner": "oldchiu802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842001985635513, "text": "他說的也沒錯啦", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:20:54", "owner": "kuncheng_0920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910160254256595, "text": "直男安慰人火力全開", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:43:54", "owner": "cashliu0216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085383245047939, "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:50:50", "owner": "danlaicc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542405524051166, "text": "外國版的小新吧😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:40:46", "owner": "feiviktor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074013653344475, "text": "媽媽為什麼要想這麼久？孩子的比喻沒錯啊😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:51:35", "owner": "ann7024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048823832693771, "text": "@amiu135_ 好萌哦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:26:54", "owner": "imnotzoeeeew_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876772627355419, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:18:11", "owner": "catlerbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179103997361600, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:10:29", "owner": "mayyangc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414296650136888, "text": "也許那代表他是雞老", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:07", "owner": "log0divby0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082780255887385, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:34", "owner": "chrisy_abc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086195143994196, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:11", "owner": "wmichaelhsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339263647227957, "text": "好可愛🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:10", "owner": "evelyn_chen0114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925926292171749, "text": "🤣🤣太好笑了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:31:43", "owner": "_____annele__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898457731342489, "text": "至少他不是已讀亂回", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:05:22", "owner": "shine_0625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102123244708983, "text": "That’s true🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:25:39", "owner": "kylieliu1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247243885293222, "text": "老媽表示不要拿吃的做比喻", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:11:01", "owner": "lai15.00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993805851893413, "text": "🤣🤣太可愛了！！", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:57:37", "owner": "freyafangwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063533465185372, "text": "🤣笑死了，小朋友说话就是直接，当真是童言无忌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:40:13", "owner": "lucidprardox5.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18488193838076382, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:43:27", "owner": "nameliang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901371358318778, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:07:30", "owner": "monjan0220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109628020539726, "text": "我怎麼一開始就預測到他會說什麼，小時候也覺得那些皺紋很有趣（？", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:54:29", "owner": "tsaodayo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991313526897432, "text": "老蛋", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:20:37", "owner": "lord_j14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031291868539987, "text": "長輩容貌焦慮就會很容易使小孩以後容貌焦慮，共勉之", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:38:02", "owner": "xiaxia0604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062259470406186, "text": "突然笑噴🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:25:23", "owner": "xu_yiqiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056251091317562, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:06:50", "owner": "kummingchang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068403389588747, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:40:55", "owner": "imfrancis2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185160970344284, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:50:26", "owner": "iris.w.520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986251113874819, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:19:12", "owner": "siuleesopo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099517342690459, "text": "媽媽當機了", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:09:30", "owner": "xiang_sam93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867774907414397, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:31:01", "owner": "caihaijie111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852125071589355, "text": "被蛋蛋安慰到了", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:46:12", "owner": "incubusjoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098465119753655, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:21:16", "owner": "zero_heart_one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066179081613301, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:55:03", "owner": "jennyh7687", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087698014789762, "text": "他是一個好孩子🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:54:47", "owner": "eggchan1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149968864426683, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:53:10", "owner": "polo85two", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415349647187284, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:50:15", "owner": "crystal_sakura_miki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095891623671533, "text": "是這樣沒錯，但不是這樣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:05:12", "owner": "666jo.seph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324161845245778, "text": "原來：「老二」的由來出處，在此皺紋。", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:48:43", "owner": "jihoioi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867800827416740, "text": "很會給情緒價值的孩子", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:33:59", "owner": "oliviaw7123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547253002029911, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:33:06", "owner": "cherryuouo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071300603069590, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:48:23", "owner": "duncan0315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065198411148151, "text": "都是寶貝", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:46:09", "owner": "hung_ding_stone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097308094833883, "text": "...................................", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:32:39", "owner": "chuehpishia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087899869949382, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:39:40", "owner": "rebornaccounting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083147519476844, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:05:50", "owner": "0800jenny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079416080332257, "text": "@paiyuhsin", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:52:08", "owner": "kevin_8161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086404669819182, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:55:24", "owner": "unallia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943497223079978, "text": "你這孩子真會安慰人🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:24:23", "owner": "laio_gai_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961512489859701, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:42:30", "owner": "mars.lai.56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104367043638233, "text": "👏👏👏😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:16:35", "owner": "shang__gnahs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891419896372899, "text": "已經能想像的到老公看到這影片時的笑聲了", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:26:05", "owner": "zeroora_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030058457757157, "text": "She’s twenty six btw", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:43:53", "owner": "wil_an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967977807974967, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:14:07", "owner": "duochen0210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048926477401585, "text": "這個沈默震耳欲聾", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:55:46", "owner": "x49636009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138077620462817, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂child", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:33:32", "owner": "chu20_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879709147326994, "text": "你的蛋是老蛋", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:18:55", "owner": "hsieh.jamie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071856098040731, "text": "😂😂真實了", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:13:40", "owner": "chacha._.bunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301649164251971, "text": "男生老得早", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:38:59", "owner": "chiehwei.1221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944537986082493, "text": "是這樣沒錯但不是這樣.jpg", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:10:07", "owner": "shiwei_0216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965372535997163, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:04:27", "owner": "sujorge497", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951489352022772, "text": "有道理🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:33:06", "owner": "ariel.hung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914419147236870, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:25:36", "owner": "euniceliu0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112169722596207, "text": "被擊敗了", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:22:45", "owner": "syh_rd168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086680306977990, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:47:26", "owner": "icu515510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983735220759154, "text": "哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:41:08", "owner": "twnices", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933885193108597, "text": "蠟筆小新美國版", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:52:45", "owner": "jfoto.ins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396134827131051, "text": "其實我覺得這弟弟超會給情緒價值了，他還小，詞彙跟認知有限，但我覺得長大後應該會是大暖男", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:44:47", "owner": "gildthelizy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093553477884154, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈～太好笑了！！！", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:35:59", "owner": "w.sherryyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078178535140362, "text": "記住了嗎媽媽們，當兒子說你不老的時候，不要拿皺紋來說事，不然他們會拿自己蛋蛋的皺紋跟妳比。", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:55:04", "owner": "ware_night.46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137012473462443, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:23:56", "owner": "loveronaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979536237779911, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂我的蛋蛋？？？？！🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:25:07", "owner": "polop.200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869510044395107, "text": "好好笑好喜歡", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:20:05", "owner": "yi.ning.tseng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111879889522234, "text": "@vanillabbwai", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:43:09", "owner": "evankam1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917691334226000, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:19:31", "owner": "chakyguam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083291132034471, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:56:38", "owner": "crazyjazz82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027838454758011, "text": "@aungdeyjr @yiiiiiziiiiiy @chihungchen8352", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:44:12", "owner": "daronn_nn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078554710926998, "text": "已讀亂答真英雄", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:13:52", "owner": "jason71828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061187135229950, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:46:23", "owner": "kenchen0627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173069854371715, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:06:45", "owner": "s.wang0628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047210738435707, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:00:26", "owner": "lihan998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077901661928543, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:48:26", "owner": "situfirefox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18563144362037292, "text": "@rockhousefarmsllc he does have a point.  Age is relative.  He is already old compared to a newborn.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:08:54", "owner": "athenasanctuary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365657767094008, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:09:42", "owner": "ugoyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878659384440776, "text": "好好笑哦😆 這樣以後我該如何跟我兒子解釋🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:50:29", "owner": "xuan_1_9_9_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083759522022419, "text": "笑死我了童言无忌", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:23:29", "owner": "wzc4_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387602470183450, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:17:46", "owner": "jac.vader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097446490750355, "text": "🤣🤣蛋的皺紋確實很難說清楚", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:49:07", "owner": "chang.shuhui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090794978306838, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:36:56", "owner": "ellywu888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086709034800798, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣體貼ˇ的孩子 話鋒一轉", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:35:09", "owner": "xz_29005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092178025730475, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:22:26", "owner": "weiwei.style", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072623867204853, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:02:30", "owner": "yewen889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210523894311053, "text": "@aso_hakima246", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:01:48", "owner": "aaa__ndy.1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853628914575870, "text": "但蛋蛋是隨溫度而眼角是隨年齡", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:30:06", "owner": "superyufun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368121652081883, "text": "嗯 你的臉開始出現蛋蛋感了🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:57:19", "owner": "lfabcd2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915073558230916, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:47:41", "owner": "tina_doctors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997363647696404, "text": "這個比喻在這個年紀，我很難反駁！", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:20:11", "owner": "pogichen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969028500979127, "text": "@samckwon 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:36:13", "owner": "greendejj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119131981543167, "text": "媽媽：這是我生的…我懷胎10個月生的…", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:19:32", "owner": "maji_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983567721929212, "text": "小新", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:29:53", "owner": "sadnessbears", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105620014723361, "text": "學到單字了☺️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:22:24", "owner": "toma0527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115103206562434, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:47:34", "owner": "junetang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051433241658231, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:18:06", "owner": "sharon_coz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034984628511671, "text": "切掉蛋蛋，就没有烦恼😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:14:26", "owner": "lucaschristblessus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004092692671269, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:13:42", "owner": "fan__1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927999493141158, "text": "@vincent_lo_kas", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:14:24", "owner": "mali_n_mali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297879940256029, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:12:14", "owner": "iam_awang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944680501073351, "text": "那是他他全身唯一有皺紋的地方啊！so sweet 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:59:26", "owner": "yingwenw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063722918168363, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:29:22", "owner": "dyg7xcrd2ikr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085556341997095, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:45:54", "owner": "julio15345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086820499944728, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:45:53", "owner": "julio15345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859272532544832, "text": "先揍爸爸", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:33:01", "owner": "bozhang.huang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084640421103467, "text": "至少這孩子嘗試了👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:18:54", "owner": "zooeysasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067793933439896, "text": "菊花算吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:14:57", "owner": "sactzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971269626876829, "text": "巴嘎wrinkles", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:38:06", "owner": "_.5.2.r_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103411459657689, "text": "Dickface", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:16:54", "owner": "tm.mannn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896232670199559, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:08:34", "owner": "verna74makeup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332309278208565, "text": "至少這孩子貼心地嘗試了。", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:46:19", "owner": "jimmyflyingchc44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126271321503850, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:39:13", "owner": "wxbystander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055155068646124, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:23:22", "owner": "hayun0807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191874244326567, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:32:22", "owner": "jianzhuanfu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155647123409179, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:12:27", "owner": "dai700688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986773335869866, "text": "dad joke", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:04:45", "owner": "jack502x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983954238917196, "text": "你蛋蛋出生的時侯就皺了，我.....never mind 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:38:32", "owner": "unsp.juliebrows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084585268832860, "text": "🤣🤣🤣，所以不能說皺紋就是老", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:30:33", "owner": "pc050760", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045942812443177, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:39:39", "owner": "white1225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991258821858529, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:07:28", "owner": "vip1230k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990008643887934, "text": "(性平會議和大遊行 啟動中\n(again", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:06:52", "owner": "yuhohh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068432843100360, "text": "是這樣沒錯但不是這樣😍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:39:43", "owner": "guanhuaxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868826401407617, "text": "Well…that makes sense😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:24:46", "owner": "vincemiko72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064720880533693, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:15:41", "owner": "hou_mika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944694868075123, "text": "是這樣但不是這樣的", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:48:48", "owner": "jasonjohnson42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385998532178729, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:01:21", "owner": "amy923831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068315708363518, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:16:18", "owner": "dora_01.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124801690504361, "text": "真的被笑死🤣媽媽怎麼可以忍住不笑🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:44:54", "owner": "a08267", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059673470554913, "text": "😂😂😂😂🙌👏🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:07:52", "owner": "shawn_nigel_min", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086802433790775, "text": "So sweet son", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:42:22", "owner": "sabrina8888tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985954107908696, "text": "He’s not wrong! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:58:00", "owner": "vikkiwaiki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884860552403408, "text": "未來會說「媽媽妳的蛋蛋長在臉上耶」", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:35:45", "owner": "b053280253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964586811845153, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:06:51", "owner": "alicechen66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118564579549235, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:10:48", "owner": "tony_woohaha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070913549460409, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:54:12", "owner": "j.c.ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080684098896855, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:53:02", "owner": "sun_cakes1118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104195956640874, "text": "他說的也沒有錯ㄚ🤣但就是⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:46:17", "owner": "wen_hsu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115435402495414, "text": "@tendie11261202", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:47:50", "owner": "bcctmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086139068008149, "text": "you said what 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:29:56", "owner": "easygoing613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063621452624664, "text": "這孩子研究過他淡淡的皺紋", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:43:31", "owner": "tony_2030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072815714191222, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:37:55", "owner": "fortuneowner_liz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074207302983462, "text": "@yuuki_coolguy_sam", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:45:41", "owner": "a991102567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063615113423151, "text": "@wenhuang0816  還好你們家的沒這麼誠實", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:24:22", "owner": "la15039", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094682185677155, "text": "@agnes22ong 你家直男给你的情绪满满😆", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:05:36", "owner": "rainbowbebe1220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858489409551212, "text": "😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:01:31", "owner": "pokm0527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088279837749899, "text": "核桃", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:33:28", "owner": "ractopamine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892021957367829, "text": "蛋蛋的哀傷", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:16:45", "owner": "vic199083", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898887793184224, "text": "是這樣，但不是這樣！🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:15:19", "owner": "ravencheng9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847170757604643, "text": "本來的感動瞬間化為烏有😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:05:22", "owner": "glennfromtaiwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087395390483721, "text": "@94yu2_ 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:12:55", "owner": "w.kuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987903228906719, "text": "是這樣沒錯⋯但也不是這樣⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:10:37", "owner": "csgogo90258", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002343287824107, "text": "已經是直男🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:03:54", "owner": "iamok0615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381752359150524, "text": "我也陷入了沉思", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:54:54", "owner": "mouse_9356109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020006648792381, "text": "一個是原本就是。一個是後來才來😂不一樣啦", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:24:58", "owner": "fush100301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852348139580838, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:11:19", "owner": "pp015046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029665106742466, "text": "她瞬間當機長達8秒 本來想反駁些什麼 但是最後還是決定不要開口好了", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:01:25", "owner": "68littlejohnny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077775416178805, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:53:26", "owner": "chenyuli1024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085503268957486, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:53:17", "owner": "ailsa1586", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094362082882431, "text": "是這樣但不是這樣😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:26:01", "owner": "520kiba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060474614215083, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:08:29", "owner": "kim_et", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872827162378065, "text": "眼睛旁是笑紋，所以表示很常笑😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:04:03", "owner": "europe_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539437780047423, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "creat