47", "owner": "_hannnnnn22_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384963787177664, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:22:42", "owner": "shiori_girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333747871227646, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:17:49", "owner": "nicolelee_ins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901946419161652, "text": "有安慰但不多", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:07:19", "owner": "betty_w.h.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953464260901925, "text": "怎麼會有小孩這麼聰明？", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:50:09", "owner": "nath0119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965124966841233, "text": "成功用蛋蛋打敗媽媽👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:30:05", "owner": "aainal888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050645534662152, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:17:59", "owner": "maiss_mom0318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535336798002762, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:13:30", "owner": "minchengmimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896158333345425, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:05:11", "owner": "eva_yyen2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049907618349433, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:29:35", "owner": "em.the.music.muse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083338708844052, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:25:31", "owner": "jing_value", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177932854364244, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:23:53", "owner": "jimmygopro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990594609730741, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:22:16", "owner": "wei_yin_cheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879263518425881, "text": "媽媽直接放棄爭執🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:19:02", "owner": "cang_0857", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848970484598834, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:08:13", "owner": "carolovecoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102314500737856, "text": "腦袋迅速想了一輪要回什麼，結果只能嘆氣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:00:37", "owner": "fei31407113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134065009476899, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:51:40", "owner": "leemin66666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083693854827754, "text": "😢🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:20:09", "owner": "tawiyq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949407114921352, "text": "頂級安慰，我就問是不是沒想自己老了有皺紋的事情了？", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:41:02", "owner": "elmotpy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422759956112391, "text": "年紀是誰，為什麼要上它", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:29:17", "owner": "linnn_316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084098741008416, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:21:37", "owner": "chen.alice.169067", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073365836221637, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:56:54", "owner": "johnlam.kt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106312717627384, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:55:54", "owner": "g_ritaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18200278516321893, "text": "好像無法反駁😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:55:52", "owner": "wadacmeow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103751677629619, "text": "Baby you win 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:54:25", "owner": "celestj1130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060738095552077, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:39:26", "owner": "heylydii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065109905618271, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:26:47", "owner": "elvapinyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100009444667756, "text": "？？？？？？？？？？？？🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:24:17", "owner": "guoge850503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862044424458185, "text": "本來想說些什麼但想想還是算了的表情", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:06:18", "owner": "oszdog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302783812249095, "text": "口水直接笑噴出來", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:02:12", "owner": "shiouu_0503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105401485712841, "text": "原本以為會是小暖男\n結果後來其實…是大直男🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:00:44", "owner": "mingte95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104924149650858, "text": "那個嘆氣.....哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:54:09", "owner": "laurara.lai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372881146154741, "text": "@ocfeng", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:51:46", "owner": "hooiyie_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070497509582286, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:41:25", "owner": "juneho0o0o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878709133329451, "text": "@funnywaiwaicom", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:38:30", "owner": "carlily_lily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120023791531965, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:21:14", "owner": "waynejer43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975125817952924, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:18:40", "owner": "casimuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920862439056686, "text": "瞬間笑噴", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:10:21", "owner": "chichi_shih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973841037951077, "text": "有人发现背景有音乐是what's going on吗", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:06:48", "owner": "shirosawa_san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028775573549316, "text": "想到了很久沒看到爸爸的皺紋", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:50:11", "owner": "mickworkmaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18227649301306211, "text": "@qwe530225", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:44:52", "owner": "ying._27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955853086011931, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣笑瘋", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:44:35", "owner": "joss_empress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850858432554803, "text": "那可能蛋蛋會比較老哦🤣皺紋比較多", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:39:10", "owner": "_meow_8719_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061171733446972, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:29:47", "owner": "emily0517tp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164519062377367, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:27:26", "owner": "ginni_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18561715051040635, "text": "沒事的！媽媽你只是蛋臉", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:20:16", "owner": "codecalsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863795725516423, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:17:13", "owner": "chi_amelia_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901145995315010, "text": "真的是好會安慰媽媽，下次別安慰了，但我喜歡😍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:11:32", "owner": "tgb304520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006949706810101, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:11:20", "owner": "rosslynn.leong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929088724016661, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:03:55", "owner": "teknodogg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126210538511997, "text": "😆", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:55:22", "owner": "xiufen859", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943922767074401, "text": "媽媽當機了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:54:45", "owner": "leo_980812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075504317184297, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:54:12", "owner": "32_cheng_han", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900654049299325, "text": "為啥剛好錄下來？", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:51:48", "owner": "justinhsu1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055270172318360, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:49:18", "owner": "azhi20522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046286096439721, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:46:07", "owner": "formyself.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056372105295685, "text": "I love him", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:45:58", "owner": "tchau125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084317783068832, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:43:16", "owner": "unj397155", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196568932325585, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:33:35", "owner": "samantha_ms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074977238519220, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:33:35", "owner": "ailing5072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968444601825159, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:33:30", "owner": "samantha_chen0210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930638689113686, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:33:22", "owner": "hansonqian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132509386477410, "text": "她兒子水瓶座喔", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:27:41", "owner": "cwh_213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084362519004927, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:11:32", "owner": "jane740613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971908359809722, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:06:22", "owner": "mmm___em", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062896460172171, "text": "媽媽跟我蛋蛋一樣重要～\n是這樣沒錯，但也不是這樣啊🤣🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:05:56", "owner": "yagami_lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046612292424316, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:03:40", "owner": "yo_xun3010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949163250925202, "text": "確實", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:57:27", "owner": "siangen0982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870980431462657, "text": "內心OS: TMD這兩種皺摺不一樣好嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:47:28", "owner": "hsinyaoyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072034556584345, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:44:39", "owner": "candy.wang.79230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422370454116856, "text": "美國小新😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:42:26", "owner": "chusmall0715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875199859443245, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂好會安慰媽媽", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:39:35", "owner": "veronica_peng3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058324616266819, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:34:53", "owner": "we_care_world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082693352044691, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:31:02", "owner": "linda611107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097633441795065, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:30:14", "owner": "17yun_ru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070362020588906, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:23:50", "owner": "cchen_0000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076167467224751, "text": "我去！！！！🤣,打死我都没想到是这样😂哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:19:00", "owner": "mmminatang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043756040692260, "text": "@z.j_11.11", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:11:58", "owner": "yainshin1107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977579058933232, "text": "是這樣但不是這樣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:08:50", "owner": "cchyyuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185062840345835, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:08:29", "owner": "brian0877", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914308936228631, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:07:28", "owner": "wyc_07.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060165008234964, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:07:08", "owner": "lin.yun.xi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875923324349417, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:06:16", "owner": "kim______kim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080026988132943, "text": "蠟筆小新🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:05:15", "owner": "guangting.zheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104418085565992, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:02:03", "owner": "fz308149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537883435036845, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:00:28", "owner": "amywu740", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861007561539583, "text": "這個真的無法反駁😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:59:58", "owner": "twister_7_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992846796852132, "text": "根本是蠟筆小新🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:58:15", "owner": "axue_0805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085700893823492, "text": "你猜到了過程，但是沒有猜到結局", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:57:10", "owner": "magneto520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847235824603006, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:48:56", "owner": "tinetineslife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048548192399589, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:42:34", "owner": "ivyivyivy_o7o3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911496565263170, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:41:10", "owner": "sy1._.via", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081602966163738, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:39:59", "owner": "abcabc_95279527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542281510036870, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:38:05", "owner": "mail.wendy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084562289066930, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:23:24", "owner": "hsin061945", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438060010101794, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:17:53", "owner": "chloe___lan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071923322023466, "text": "拿老娘的臉皮比蛋皮，你是皮在癢😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:16:51", "owner": "easonliu714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550426069031432, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:12:08", "owner": "y_c_l_0820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898729774336845, "text": "男仔有時會有金句出現🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:10:44", "owner": "simin.yo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545499730037571, "text": "还好不是像你蛋蛋那么皱 哭给你看哦", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:03:06", "owner": "6354xmx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081308081323124, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:00:45", "owner": "qmoa0615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539802502028133, "text": "他很努力了 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:56:41", "owner": "joeruirui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854476261569276, "text": "笑死", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:52:31", "owner": "avalin520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099654064776159, "text": "真的只能嘆氣欸 沒辦法再解釋下去了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:52:07", "owner": "cleo666666_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848791315566547, "text": "@wei77chen 寶貝你蛋蛋有皺紋嗎😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:51:38", "owner": "qinabb19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912857299096147, "text": "他只想安慰你啦！😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:51:29", "owner": "bobomew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540984199003520, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:48:07", "owner": "melodyluv1009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846630970584059, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:47:22", "owner": "circle_syfong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893580772226066, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:38:23", "owner": "dreamorixer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842001568622031, "text": "@malk2311 @eddielai_", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:37:28", "owner": "hsin_tu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077801399331060, "text": "這個有好笑 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:33:45", "owner": "annayang421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902450074302797, "text": "@a96145228", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:23:04", "owner": "ying_lin822", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101506276734571, "text": "Ball = 眼角", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:13:13", "owner": "kuanyt819", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430472797106157, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:13:02", "owner": "huanghaimau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155971894411465, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:12:49", "owner": "lovely.life_zy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049697318348285, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:59:04", "owner": "sttt_1105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093483955854927, "text": "有安慰@但不多😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:58:10", "owner": "mmgirl927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056963195642465, "text": "臉”蛋”", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:54:18", "owner": "rayyyyy0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097498174839530, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:39:34", "owner": "tinn3i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016954484791744, "text": "但是你的蛋會隨便外露給別人看到嗎😏\n媽媽的應變能力太慢也是老化問題🤷🏻‍♂️🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:28:58", "owner": "waiwai_war", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172183486373851, "text": "兒子：你個撚樣（婉轉）", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:19:15", "owner": "rainarrow41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940675816096007, "text": "被擊敗了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:18:31", "owner": "kingsze0718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943352461080974, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:13:27", "owner": "oscar_tsui1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057556322275694, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:04:04", "owner": "lovececi_lia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871033510462942, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:03:08", "owner": "weixunzhen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995215053845595, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:02:47", "owner": "lidisi22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060489515233057, "text": "🤣🤣🤣太可愛啊哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:01:32", "owner": "hepfz_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939828511085356, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣.但還是很貼心啦", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:57:59", "owner": "juliya601215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074555243195229, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:52:06", "owner": "lei_lei_liu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112179280599380, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:37:51", "owner": "mariposaj13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926758888179448, "text": "慘了，我也～", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:32:19", "owner": "motherfunker929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873763951448967, "text": "媽媽本來還想說點什麼....唉...算了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:32:19", "owner": "love1020day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982170471941037, "text": "所以你蛋蛋也很老了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:32:03", "owner": "pangyaklong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084216608490649, "text": "原來我的蛋皮一直是老的", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:19:46", "owner": "_omvajarsattvahum_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134236879476160, "text": "真的很天真ww", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:13:16", "owner": "nazilewis251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296459491279419, "text": "不然怎麼叫做（老來蛋）", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:07:48", "owner": "kuang.0124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101381476709229, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:05:18", "owner": "dorothyliu123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086466520997216, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:03:32", "owner": "qiujimmy7637", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061658561631890, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:57:16", "owner": "nana_a1211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177014548367900, "text": "很可愛呀🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:52:01", "owner": "jillmahone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542232388016152, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:51:26", "owner": "patty331011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854215189527682, "text": "我也沈默了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:50:08", "owner": "yaya_0530_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381393961194053, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:49:22", "owner": "srty7077", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080818898471985, "text": "😆😆😆😆😆", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:47:44", "owner": "jane888_li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089652079738410, "text": "還有那玩意的皮也有皺紋....", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:41:30", "owner": "itezaakuma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338437714226098, "text": "balls🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:20:51", "owner": "little.hos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110576854600934, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:20:48", "owner": "shi.b.zhong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101979982732949, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:04:49", "owner": "yyc_312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881233342421792, "text": "他都沒說錯", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:03:45", "owner": "starainbow1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064738748146677, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:03:27", "owner": "k.e.l.l.y_goh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930961768151949, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:46:27", "owner": "vinny3560", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060015803236402, "text": "那一瞬間，媽媽年紀又默默增加了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:30:56", "owner": "komawang_hun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975497619793311, "text": "亞洲家長就打下去了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:28:43", "owner": "chewei0518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072048551256125, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:23:14", "owner": "wanqinlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966378396991900, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:20:14", "owner": "rebecca98960", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925915399159864, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:20:02", "owner": "mjc771029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900473035317491, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:16:40", "owner": "i_mmagooo26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927474457118708, "text": "暖男一枚👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:16:19", "owner": "huanqingl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543740524028268, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:16:04", "owner": "jun19625364", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209197516312661, "text": "總之媽媽你就是不老，不要再辯駁 🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:10:24", "owner": "ykmaggie0989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087088921779014, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:03:58", "owner": "______1127_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163149325387873, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:56:12", "owner": "jeeprider99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111771847594012, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:50:07", "owner": "gina866266", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000590345835529, "text": "True🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:49:03", "owner": "sue.sue.2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859658203476570, "text": "提醒你還年輕😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:48:36", "owner": "dcseikodx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929873182113156, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:40:53", "owner": "chuchumi613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070697360056997, "text": "Wrinkles on my balls🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:32:28", "owner": "joannacty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082072187041508, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:12:49", "owner": "adonis.1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884399986284496, "text": "我想到 臉蛋 這個詞🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:09:43", "owner": "converter.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373365106157827, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:08:45", "owner": "candy520213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103435486578982, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:05:03", "owner": "gail_wujia88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146585257439215, "text": "皺紋又增加了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:50:53", "owner": "yao_guanliang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095096908892165, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:44:19", "owner": "ansisyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096967591834278, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:39:52", "owner": "yuenmeiwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080251601116245, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣小朋友就是這樣天真單純，直言直語😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:39:41", "owner": "cvi9835", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119647996551669, "text": "好險孩子沒說：你臉跟我的蛋蛋一樣有皺紋", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:30:29", "owner": "nn07211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083521337063513, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:25:51", "owner": "sammi720409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547134196036946, "text": "Wrinkle wrinkle on the balls🤪", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:22:55", "owner": "hsun0710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905298004272414, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:20:37", "owner": "unanana_0129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990977646895883, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂so cute❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:19:49", "owner": "tocrazyto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989335824857243, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:19:09", "owner": "venus.0127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930399379117877, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:15:08", "owner": "anqibbgie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395794333131238, "text": "@edwin_wcw", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:05:36", "owner": "so.amy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082890656108517, "text": "我還以為是什麼䁔心的故事🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:03:49", "owner": "figureshouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048372890403101, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:03:34", "owner": "waterylotus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946174903068038, "text": "兒子應該是水瓶座😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:00:21", "owner": "roym_hygge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063306140401115, "text": "我今年30歲，蛋蛋80歲", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:58:47", "owner": "v016800n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028854011759226, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:57:57", "owner": "kalaspy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113252740510341, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:57:46", "owner": "ru90380ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931858411125124, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:57:04", "owner": "czy_ap_1212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152583877412371, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:47:19", "owner": "monalinana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896038537202505, "text": "Wahahahahaha…太好笑了，但是小朋友講的也對啊🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:47:04", "owner": "tinatachin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060581393240778, "text": "思考了很久 還是不知道要怎麼回", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:40:54", "owner": "29hstagram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065859260109823, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:28:59", "owner": "zhiyuan311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114717802570879, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:28:35", "owner": "huangjuanjuanjojo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064114895564133, "text": "媽媽正在回想人生遇過的無數男人的蛋蛋", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:22:26", "owner": "kima_autos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081014129033874, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:20:26", "owner": "www66_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544860394001181, "text": "這個媽媽真沒幽默感", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:15:16", "owner": "yosiyasu9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961345743859011, "text": "爸爸的蛋蛋更多皺摺⋯⋯😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:14:50", "owner": "nowhy1103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030050006535298, "text": "他為什麼有注意到自己的...😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:07:36", "owner": "caimingxun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145188202435526, "text": "媽：l’m sorry", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:06:53", "owner": "yugo_luo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081652253103959, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:03:34", "owner": "hi_1149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952728040020497, "text": "He's right 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:02:49", "owner": "notyetdone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969063450978590, "text": "lol.  I have wrinkles just on different surfaces 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:01:45", "owner": "helloshallowcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062224445417839, "text": "@huihsuan102 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:56:06", "owner": "bowen1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050521178363117, "text": "@alicebhooo", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:52:13", "owner": "martinhyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386183359176020, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:44:37", "owner": "jiuj.iu97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165252763383484, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:43:30", "owner": "gracechien1218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881340469310401, "text": "在捷運上笑出來😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:43:08", "owner": "amisa.oct.26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097252168827537, "text": "是這樣但不是這樣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:42:03", "owner": "archduke1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139436158458370, "text": "My baby has no ankle", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:41:34", "owner": "jackytan_junteng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539436976060916, "text": "男孩不分國籍，我兒子也講過一模一樣的話😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:41:13", "owner": "jayjohn158", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918147895206448, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:40:54", "owner": "jerry0908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122219647519042, "text": "他的蛋蛋是老起來放…😆🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:40:38", "owner": "jasmine.c.w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068682560591319, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:39:20", "owner": "joanna0213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083376632058128, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:35:56", "owner": "must5277", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333434935231029, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:32:33", "owner": "why_periwinkle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064840973402366, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:22:17", "owner": "ya112599", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435567064108511, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:22:03", "owner": "anntang515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073589588205190, "text": "這小孩竟然將蛋蛋跟臉蛋比😂難怪媽媽無言", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:16:28", "owner": "sandychuee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987209883863313, "text": "就是結尾那個長嘆氣 加速老化現象😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:11:58", "owner": "ety61233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077676050516912, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:08:46", "owner": "jasonfqs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881325970310426, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:03:46", "owner": "moonfish7509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289565215278252, "text": "@jcochen", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:57:34", "owner": "ycs_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191899321336932, "text": "眼淚一秒收回去", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:46:33", "owner": "denniszuo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051006803361988, "text": "該說小孩反應很快？😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:41:40", "owner": "abc300452200267", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181563637345882, "text": "真的去扯蛋", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:31:23", "owner": "sambreg_tom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893727676220010, "text": "那下面是OG囉", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:26:28", "owner": "cliffstuff9016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133530859468175, "text": "有努力安慰，但是感受不是那麼一回事😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:25:38", "owner": "willy_wuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144452194439535, "text": "兒子好天真好可愛😍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:17:19", "owner": "mina.tseng.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075105551195604, "text": "@jackylam808 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:17:01", "owner": "meimeis808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051164666365279, "text": "所以冬天显老，夏天显年轻👀", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:13:15", "owner": "go.duck.777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068284421599920, "text": "👩🏻：想說點什麼 想想還是打住好了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:04:24", "owner": "hzh.miller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985904862752880, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:52:49", "owner": "szu_yu521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068559032604908, "text": "She is my friend wife right ? Seattle ?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:51:03", "owner": "rickytsangkh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891468697367422, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:44:55", "owner": "alex0726__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074672078464792, "text": "😂😂😂I'm old too", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:42:34", "owner": "nkfx2papa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024623966780333, "text": "😂也沒說錯", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:34:23", "owner": "wyciqy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105071323564434, "text": "@cufcufcuf2002", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:34:04", "owner": "beoh.17_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866325358493449, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:32:36", "owner": "anforhsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073128389350526, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:24:37", "owner": "_ro.si.ta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078861146276013, "text": "媽媽竟然沒笑出來🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:22:10", "owner": "seamaiden79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929080279151394, "text": "伊莉莎白歐森二十五歲就差不多長這樣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:19:39", "owner": "witnessjack_0828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940823524088427, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:18:55", "owner": "tengyucao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077375516468823, "text": "他說的有道理", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:17:48", "owner": "xie3369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099271039625843, "text": "臭小子 說你媽的臉 像你的蛋蛋 好樣的 哈哈！", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:17:26", "owner": "luigi.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333696883237916, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:12:15", "owner": "minki_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066202646616108, "text": "👏😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:01:22", "owner": "cindylala.chiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927095419158467, "text": "我現在也在被童言童語打敗的階段中🤣真是常常語出驚人嗄~~", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:00:31", "owner": "lau.111.ra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952055224043786, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:58:39", "owner": "josephinerosariolai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006619613655987, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:57:16", "owner": "kevinz_fl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961283436865386, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:55:37", "owner": "wooapplelai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904161091295570, "text": "睪丸是 皺褶", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:54:01", "owner": "mafaulker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013175051797895, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:48:56", "owner": "a0976292542", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845535634609604, "text": "Ok, Those are old balls", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:42:50", "owner": "rayin_rou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928997134153594, "text": "ㄡ", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:34:22", "owner": "yunny328", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106215454715590, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:33:37", "owner": "peipeiyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985541199865964, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:12:18", "owner": "qi_yi_li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045224951471009, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:05:56", "owner": "jessic.gu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109843288591421, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:01:25", "owner": "rainny413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062380118193631, "text": "\"You are not old, you just look like my balls\" 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:43:07", "owner": "jamesloh.works", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098847511779320, "text": "還以為是什麼很暖心的東西 結果最後後來這一齣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:23:26", "owner": "chakyin9898", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083451821044886, "text": "It’s true", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:21:13", "owner": "jjmsn_life_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935978790979747, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:17:40", "owner": "ez19941029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885971311401626, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:16:27", "owner": "dowa00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170734423330128, "text": "孩子妈想起了老公的猕猴桃", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:14:24", "owner": "timtimtiming_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048714047399365, "text": "小孩英文說的比你好🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:33:30", "owner": "bestbeautifullove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895071382356274, "text": "孩子很努力的在安慰媽媽", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:21:52", "owner": "trytoncrh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869210608398331, "text": "麻罵麻罵看我的豆皮壽司～", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:43:29", "owner": "badoldj1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080311340121498, "text": "可愛い🩷", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:35:14", "owner": "charade_mai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153077557418355, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:43:52", "owner": "kevin00538", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898272721340306, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:27:29", "owner": "titanwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957051402886599, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:27:03", "owner": "charlie_lin0323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071442890521879, "text": "我真的很好奇那些沈默裡的”腦音”在說啥😂😆", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:11:07", "owner": "zhu_johnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845443402609744, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:07:32", "owner": "stingersons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293623054278093, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:56:34", "owner": "stanleywhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005678357817492, "text": "蛋蛋有皺紋 是因為他的朋友叫老二", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:39:02", "owner": "_.william528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113433046579353, "text": "没想到小小年纪就一把年纪", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:23:03", "owner": "cikurakuhuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080827394321979, "text": "😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:17:14", "owner": "puli89228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537674152048058, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:58:43", "owner": "tamboboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939614232965328, "text": "😂😂媽媽跟蛋蛋一樣樣😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:37:35", "owner": "ack0110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902633809316765, "text": "這小孩的智慧太高了", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:30:21", "owner": "deanyuan5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089342008742264, "text": "@_yiannnnnnnn__ 我妹也知道你的很老", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:29:01", "owner": "joe_huang_0705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003931688818750, "text": "看來是爸爸的基因相當強😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:27:25", "owner": "kilang_830", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093232348891578, "text": "兒子是刺客職業嗎，爆擊挺高的", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:22:31", "owner": "jamessaid974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141372841453082, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:04:08", "owner": "mi_tsang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075912290210521, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:53:11", "owner": "yi_niu_li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966674781992342, "text": "我兒：「媽咪！我覺得我越來越長大像大人了！因為我的蛋蛋越來越黑，跟爸比越來越像了！」😐……", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:48:25", "owner": "abigail_nu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335670193232179, "text": "😂😂😂弟弟真智慧", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:44:23", "owner": "onlycug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087315134480971, "text": "@alexlee_tw", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:45:31", "owner": "shiuenen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933119341128731, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:32:47", "owner": "cok_dewi8000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094619320863055, "text": "孩子，你贏了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:20:43", "owner": "squidalice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085998356301754, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:17:16", "owner": "jack_fang1003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075772447979240, "text": "是這樣但不是這樣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:08:49", "owner": "42pasta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214286893308015, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:59:52", "owner": "kyra_chkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074765627225761, "text": "......🤔🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:52:48", "owner": "mjin_0514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085532261053942, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:23:18", "owner": "ivybb2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065128568455205, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:15:44", "owner": "andrew0590zd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989375931904876, "text": "老勒蛋", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:58:42", "owner": "love_nick9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050606939660310, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:04:48", "owner": "wurayray", "likes": 106}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3712979067671247279, "shortcode": "DOHJsozAXmv", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOHJsozAXmv/", "taken_at": "2025-09-02T19:33:58", "caption": "係英國返嚟香港的我\n\n#hongkong #uk #香港人", "owner_username": "cantoanton", "owner_id": "60197948348", "likes": 9657, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0011_DOHJsozAXmv\\DOHJsozAXmv_20250902_193358.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18525409108046020, "text": "buffet同放題有咩分別😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:24:44", "owner": "mckw_0228", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18058322195376581, "text": "我都比你帶壞咗 +4kg未落得返去", "created_at": "2025-09-02T21:52:54", "owner": "chunggerman", "likes": 83}, {"id": 18354974350090576, "text": "食咁少。。。", "created_at": "2025-09-05T13:41:21", "owner": "kc_gaming23", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18077948765003453, "text": "6KG咋⋯⋯唔夠勁", "created_at": "2025-09-05T19:49:33", "owner": "yana007forever", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027398219706826, "text": "要有😎🤙🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-03T07:45:58", "owner": "rgo_iitsyariz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18517496296052847, "text": "go on boss", "created_at": "2025-09-02T19:44:30", "owner": "_.elaine.chc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18134158249445920, "text": "I can’t wait to try next year ❤️🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-09-02T19:40:57", "owner": "bethanyyy_7777", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17973515741926927, "text": "有得食好搏命食😢😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:34:21", "owner": "maykolxie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064630172204263, "text": "Such a variety of delicious food xx", "created_at": "2025-09-02T19:40:45", "owner": "bethanyyy_7777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18395326411141859, "text": "@fuyurose", "created_at": "2025-09-05T03:52:21", "owner": "ns.dollhouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529613623034800, "text": "@chuizi552 @willzhao2 @9487_hsin_yu @magg1e_z 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-17T13:35:12", "owner": "kwan_kwaneric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072466028041418, "text": "@iwanttobeingoodluck 你請", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:31:42", "owner": "small_hin_ac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084682142060430, "text": "看著很有食慾哦", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:50:25", "owner": "miltonvoid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976821189785561, "text": "我絕對相信呢個係我🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:45:59", "owner": "eth.andance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959573829991441, "text": "表示暑假返咗香港之後都重咗6kg😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T15:15:49", "owner": "thesnappymonster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054547958644792, "text": "@mckw_0228 有，buffet自己拎，放題再落單", "created_at": "2025-10-29T15:11:37", "owner": "st39547", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325805014214397, "text": "Frrrr😢😭", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:54:05", "owner": "a_random_human_from_the_world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843463195593076, "text": "香港太多引誘，搵食太方便，易肥難瘦", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:08:17", "owner": "siusun23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089729050866783, "text": "結論，住喺英國有助減肥😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:50:08", "owner": "chanwanghei1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090158386642265, "text": "美食地獄返嚟美食天堂wor", "created_at": "2025-09-23T05:54:11", "owner": "light_ray_1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399032185188363, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:09:38", "owner": "lilian.chan.mingming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052128401638431, "text": "算少啦", "created_at": "2025-09-17T08:38:02", "owner": "241130x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040808390413568, "text": "真😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:49:18", "owner": "cxtrollydolly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082237261926211, "text": "呢啲片真係好好睇🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:23:40", "owner": "prettyger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857873119507212, "text": "6kg only?! I only had 1 buffet and gained 10kg 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:42:06", "owner": "alex_isnt_fat_lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070061732165963, "text": "Me too 8kg", "created_at": "2025-09-08T06:44:04", "owner": "ray_mok_foto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019622741754220, "text": "I confess - I love to eat 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:37:29", "owner": "simonationeffect", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035487437700705, "text": "Same, when I go back to hong kong from Germany, all day eating and eating comfort food to kill my homesickness", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:42:33", "owner": "peggywan428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094038760591660, "text": "You’re not alone😭", "created_at": "2025-09-05T03:25:56", "owner": "deonieeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187841614323525, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:54:51", "owner": "come.eat.with.meee", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["hongkong", "uk", "香港人"]},
{"media_id": 3756606637382700031, "shortcode": "DQiJdVWEgv_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQiJdVWEgv_/", "taken_at": "2025-11-02T00:14:44", "caption": "🔥 Follow 👉 @mathchillguy\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n#mathematics #mathsmemes #mathematicians", "owner_username": "mathchillguy", "owner_id": "1458981886", "likes": 36193, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0012_DQiJdVWEgv_\\DQiJdVWEgv__20251102_001444.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18085342276814374, "text": "Ma Tri Xie", "created_at": "2025-11-04T05:04:03", "owner": "j.astagina", "likes": 2923}, {"id": 18099391432708066, "text": "the matrices have to be the other way round istg", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:50:44", "owner": "samj_gray", "likes": 583}, {"id": 17863758591437226, "text": "Would probably be better to learn it this way lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:58:22", "owner": "irenuccia29", "likes": 59}, {"id": 17842932237612638, "text": "who can i even send this to", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:38:12", "owner": "itsyoboiollie", "likes": 103}, {"id": 17896976133342251, "text": "Its real and complex at the same time...but not imaginary", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:24:41", "owner": "_.radheyy.__", "likes": 405}, {"id": 18060391169219432, "text": "我們在有了gta6之前有了線性中文😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:54:28", "owner": "patrick_huang1807", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17931242220046159, "text": "Essa Matriz falou oque da minha mãe ?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:26:40", "owner": "j.s_al1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18197138191322991, "text": "哈哈哈 two in one", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:46:49", "owner": "tommyrkaid", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17900040474314016, "text": "Please tell me this is a joke", "created_at": "2025-11-04T17:27:36", "owner": "callmefireman", "likes": 199}, {"id": 18048011906409021, "text": "So… should I use the Confucian Elimination to factorize it ?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:29:28", "owner": "plaid_the_floof", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18109199155592116, "text": "@prakhar_2218 please solve", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:29:26", "owner": "__mivyansh__2305", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083333651082898, "text": "I'm actually interested with this image", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:49:45", "owner": "hmdialifi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867103084480460, "text": "yo, i read that as lin manuel miranda at first and i was ??", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:33:52", "owner": "mar.garine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076766759178099, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:33:38", "owner": "itsfromicarus", "likes": 88}, {"id": 17888321586253697, "text": "these are the traditional chinese elements, but I don't know what exactly the matrix is or how this works, can anyone explain it deeper?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:33:13", "owner": "david_the_tropical_ecologist", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18068526350110996, "text": "吓哭了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:43:59", "owner": "jitang888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863121208521086, "text": "Can Gauss Elimination be applied??? 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:52:56", "owner": "_yai.h1jm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18541035889063949, "text": "The worst part is these characters aren’t even numbers 1-9. Idk a lot of mandarin but I have no idea what they could possibly mean", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:58:50", "owner": "noah_petillo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18296763214287649, "text": "淦", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:54:07", "owner": "philips.jx", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18378158653194670, "text": "Please tho.", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:34:38", "owner": "buttlord2.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17889723801241338, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-04T15:02:04", "owner": "amiocat_thecommentor", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17895422973348111, "text": "Why", "created_at": "2025-11-04T07:31:32", "owner": "timothyprajogo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945411028064306, "text": "Ancient chinese had math texts describing one of the first versions of row reduction!", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:47:22", "owner": "agilebelatedcrescent41580", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18061468820168588, "text": "淼森焱垚鑫", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:55:51", "owner": "w45h_f15h", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17982339416767009, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:50:29", "owner": "forbidden_testicle", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102206419665200, "text": "My tired ass reading \"Thursday, Friday, Wednesday, Tuesday, Saturday\"", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:56:27", "owner": "shuvorner_zi_yashinto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18351276889161786, "text": "Deepseek be like", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:11:21", "owner": "jppedrom", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18543030166014530, "text": "Wrong, that product results in an integer. You should invert the order of the vector", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:05:03", "owner": "arnauab25_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027888482767457, "text": "So fking true", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:21:35", "owner": "leoooo_379", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118839976479182, "text": "淦！", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:16:13", "owner": "tale70537", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099923731685573, "text": "Tensorproduct jaaaa", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:36:39", "owner": "tetsuyaryota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142855078447512, "text": "watching this a day before my linear algebra exam. what a chinese time", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:33:42", "owner": "timeinanaheim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904848283144468, "text": "@khannh.vu tới đẳng cấp này chưa :)))", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:38:27", "owner": "my_tiny_day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852504916581417, "text": "Double 金 is frightening bro", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:21:14", "owner": "vainiusmlz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078926152897498, "text": "Me like : omg it's the trainstation person character ^^", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:54:27", "owner": "n__rs_n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099993196738972, "text": "Outer product enjoyers unite", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:04:58", "owner": "tian.charlie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965255904988993, "text": "@joselago._", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:19:18", "owner": "palaciosnd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086069104794854, "text": "sent this to every chinese person i know\n\nActually i lowkey dont know if 1 of them is chinese but fuck it", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:58:24", "owner": "catalyze__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087377504475849, "text": "淦", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:48:52", "owner": "_kuang.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928621585017461, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:58:36", "owner": "downupl1r1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048437246674315, "text": "elite球知识required🤓☝🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:13:55", "owner": "xggxjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163754617382141, "text": "《淡》", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:06:52", "owner": "ziyao_xu608", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062572601404172, "text": "Zhihu/weixin at 4am", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05:42:11", "owner": "chem.1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101500072726855, "text": "Is this DeepSeek?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:24:03", "owner": "everybodysenoch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098554978748680, "text": "{🔥🔥🔥🔥}×4", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:51:47", "owner": "ser.gpt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092378743872986, "text": "Help", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:29:41", "owner": "aleenayo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085091563802972, "text": "Chat is this real", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:20:57", "owner": "gloeyjoey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110227543582567, "text": "It's swapped 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:23:47", "owner": "nailtongamadec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862479922448213, "text": "Could be worse, could be non real non linear", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:03:08", "owner": "climent_1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147272755421785, "text": "🥀🥀🥀😭", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:04:57", "owner": "ramsesclementino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070078814581426, "text": "Just kill me instead", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:56:30", "owner": "rottenapple512", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["mathematics", "mathsmemes", "mathematicians"]},
{"media_id": 3759710071648290744, "shortcode": "DQtLGPvDge4", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQtLGPvDge4/", "taken_at": "2025-11-06T07:01:03", "caption": "#拜託快點推出\n\nProject Clean Take 利用 AI，拍好的影片也能「事後修正」發音、語意、雜訊、背景音……再也不用重拍！\n影像創作者的夢幻救星就快來了✨\n\n🔗 想看更多 Adobe 今年的 AI 驚人新技術？留言告訴我們！\n\n#AdobeMAX2025 #AdobeSneaks #projectcleantake #InCGMedia #數位創作 #CG #adobe #adobemax", "owner_username": "incgmedia", "owner_id": "4770261345", "likes": 13176, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0013_DQtLGPvDge4\\DQtLGPvDge4_20251106_070103.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18063451040419306, "text": "以後就算有影像有聲音也不知道事情是真是假了", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:35:53", "owner": "carl_fong", "likes": 1564}, {"id": 18384330973179629, "text": "創作者的救星，假新聞的利器\n賺錢的好發明，世界的亂源🤞", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:27:34", "owner": "jackthetube", "likes": 620}, {"id": 18087065728983816, "text": "🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:16:55", "owner": "cathyhuang39", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083957078480843, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:47:47", "owner": "exinang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117118246551357, "text": "雖然說只是個工具、只是個功能，但就是有極高的淪為犯罪的風險\n\n槍枝也是個保衛家園和人類安危的工具，可是也能當作犯罪的利器", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:11:19", "owner": "xh1user_taiwan", "likes": 355}, {"id": 17974774163957037, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:52:49", "owner": "drummerfreak7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104126428570338, "text": "以后记者写的新闻还能不能信啊？基本上可以伪造ei", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:34:19", "owner": "eugenepoon226", "likes": 85}, {"id": 18107933032613540, "text": "以後拍片的人永遠不會做好錄音前準備，反正怎樣也可以修；跟攝影師一樣，隨便拍就好反正可以修改；以後滿街都是一堆沒有花精精時間進修技術的懶人", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:06:31", "owner": "vevevera", "likes": 58}, {"id": 18044467709694494, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:23:39", "owner": "c.yen_wu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033424892732759, "text": "Pm", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:11:56", "owner": "_alson.61_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053501993648630, "text": "@mm.millmilk", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:43:18", "owner": "janlin325", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088185067945671, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:12:49", "owner": "junzhi1117", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093084889712030, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:58:55", "owner": "kurea9692", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104907874655100, "text": "需要", "created_at": "2025-11-12T16:03:35", "owner": "summer_rain_free", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18516791788071424, "text": "這太跨張", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:39:19", "owner": "seanyenn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072908192259448, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:01:08", "owner": "wendychen_1128", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18196443190323734, "text": "反正都是別人的科技 都要照別人說了算規則使用 台灣😂 永遠追不上", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:49:41", "owner": "the_atrillion", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094938565887023, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T23:23:34", "owner": "aki_mooon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900968080317673, "text": "那以後再沒有可信的影片了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:14:10", "owner": "jason_hohin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088344850980164, "text": "什麼軟件？", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:35:07", "owner": "nigel_kwok", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084478084952641, "text": "感覺@shasha77.daily 這種頻道會需要", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:10:39", "owner": "rayliao__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18326024842243730, "text": "歡迎來到已經冇辦法分真假的時代", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:45:56", "owner": "noklam0829", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18532687735029716, "text": "p m", "created_at": "2025-11-12T10:35:03", "owner": "alvinyongart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850959331592207, "text": "Pm", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:23:33", "owner": "kennngs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18544214680036824, "text": "Pm", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:07:17", "owner": "zy_chill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047358053406831, "text": "女人大叫令人不安，影響聽眾收聽", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:53:50", "owner": "mango_d_luffy", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18093944617874279, "text": "偽證利器（並不", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:08:52", "owner": "nerdyzoyee", "likes": 78}, {"id": 18078227135134326, "text": "所以以後所謂的有影片有真相就不可信了！😮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:01:13", "owner": "castlelincastle", "likes": 42}, {"id": 17868499344405482, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:26:56", "owner": "shing511", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18170296666373090, "text": "完蛋", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:42:30", "owner": "jimmy__0407", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984450846873262, "text": "難分真與舊 人臉多險詐", "created_at": "2025-11-12T10:54:04", "owner": "tyas_lyrics", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060251327627449, "text": "現在還可以勉強分辨ai影片，以後基本上分辨不出來", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:56:47", "owner": "heison_cheung0701", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18082052693470199, "text": "這種事對極權獨裁國家更有力", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:08:45", "owner": "mikeywu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109352980593568, "text": "假訊息要更氾濫了 \n再來就是像零日攻擊那樣竄改元首發言了", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:43:38", "owner": "wiklanw", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18068761832372602, "text": "好可怕😟", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:50:56", "owner": "joshkwok_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18545841178009537, "text": "太危險了，技術門檻太低，會導致很多罪案，以後所有影片和相片都會是罪惡溫床了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:00:16", "owner": "samsonlsc", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18091786939914790, "text": "是adobe的什麼？", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:54:53", "owner": "samuel_lin_1006", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930279247129807, "text": "中文也能嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:43:03", "owner": "huyaliu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17940917811092937, "text": "👏👏👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:19:57", "owner": "qaz789113", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114940498577437, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:36:46", "owner": "harry_0802", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027910634760546, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:56:29", "owner": "aster._.25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096544819793951, "text": "好好好，所以訂閱要多少錢？取消訂閱要多加多少錢？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:43:33", "owner": "os.t1n", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18375902023194170, "text": "我總感覺這些例子都是逆向工程 當自己用的時候完全達不到效果😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:54:47", "owner": "chinam.leung", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18111782995599429, "text": "是什么软体呀，adobe 什么", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:40:04", "owner": "camkiew", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18056230313307978, "text": "很讚", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:52:45", "owner": "eason719819", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900801082314648, "text": "雖然大家想的比較遠擔心資安\n我腦袋裡只發現：一鍵降噪😍", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:02:18", "owner": "dukesheng", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089112094922358, "text": "水喔…", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:46:20", "owner": "kurtlinmiru", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17889124905385062, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:59:02", "owner": "f83113", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970550370974535, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:56:25", "owner": "yeh_big_bear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084410203794627, "text": "This is bad. No one will trust videos anymore. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:35:14", "owner": "skybird21", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18041666561703316, "text": "要造謠更方便了", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:41:25", "owner": "hate20tw", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18295864879261859, "text": "失業神器", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:59:52", "owner": "laikit319", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883377145407305, "text": "請問他支援中文嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:43:08", "owner": "tinani99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083285723041199, "text": "說話那個我還相信，學習人聲並模擬。音軌那個應該僅限於前後頻率相同的素材，才能模擬前後的聲音。總之未來可以拿舊素材改，不用一直重拍真的方便很多", "created_at": "2025-11-11T03:26:10", "owner": "magicturtle0228", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079064822151315, "text": "世界即將大亂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:46:30", "owner": "cellar.u", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18181769485349642, "text": "Very interesting", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:45:51", "owner": "virginia.pak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892770139224536, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:33:27", "owner": "ahyuenah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17871737454459100, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:57:03", "owner": "yukiwingsum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107443405721169, "text": "👏👏🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:21:49", "owner": "kitsita107", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064866107402268, "text": "👏👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:57:22", "owner": "_angel_k_24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118139149541209, "text": "Adobe 的什么software?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:15:36", "owner": "alvinyongart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948579940025671, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:50:03", "owner": "marcelino_1127", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18189592621329051, "text": "想知", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:39:52", "owner": "alexlexyin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090212920930529, "text": "fucked up world", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:19:25", "owner": "ernie_yu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843788872601645, "text": "amazing!!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:01:36", "owner": "planslo.ly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090048022952118, "text": "@happykay2005", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:18:20", "owner": "rraritimm", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17992338665715569, "text": "這是哪一個軟體", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:01:41", "owner": "wbee791018", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858482284542009, "text": "@jerry1002629", "created_at": "2025-11-12T05:01:06", "owner": "jonathan_chen._.v", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071068568036541, "text": "Adobe能不能加一个好用的slate功能呀。Adobe的音话同步功能太难用了比达芬奇差远了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:16:32", "owner": "wang.shaoxuan", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17851384704579305, "text": "哇！有禁止柬埔寨使用adobe嗎？😮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:13:02", "owner": "cheng_neo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18374921095149357, "text": "哇操！錢拿去！快點出！", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:49:17", "owner": "tsaiyujue", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088504123945758, "text": "唇形看起來還是像fifth", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:44:47", "owner": "_cyliang", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18064630643381582, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:57:02", "owner": "chinglynn70", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537794764017592, "text": "絲絲", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:44:30", "owner": "nonoco0129", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096651781695616, "text": "正", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:16:54", "owner": "deviljames", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880805656308098, "text": "可轉不同人聲嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:23:55", "owner": "upmugcue", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057796400268174, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:59:45", "owner": "cfd.wiskey.girl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098523208776944, "text": "不是好事", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:08:53", "owner": "yougotmilk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18429544348106894, "text": "真的不知道真假", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:28:02", "owner": "boborobo0909", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17976334268931232, "text": "總統下命令只能親臨現場了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:30:37", "owner": "alan_blan_clan_dlan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082127723288547, "text": "？？？😮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:23:27", "owner": "chris.rainey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039349778503538, "text": "不是就打（口誤）就解決了哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:19:41", "owner": "kaize9487", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069258083375434, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:38:50", "owner": "casakit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050052134350284, "text": "廣東話支援嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:02:39", "owner": "sora.shiro.kurooo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18244907695294403, "text": "🤯", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:34:30", "owner": "mrray064", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108250270717724, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:32:20", "owner": "rlcw99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18141529876445828, "text": "製作假訊息越來越容易了，閱聽人根本無法辨別真假", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:49:11", "owner": "775jia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025305197577393, "text": "十年前早該推出了，簡應滿天下了，到現在才要弄", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:47:12", "owner": "martti_1658", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928091965115075, "text": "私", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:28:37", "owner": "kwanfaifai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081909326079992, "text": "接下來就是整個軟體整合到ai可用的程式庫  你甚至不用安裝雜七雜八的垃圾訂閱軟體", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:16:08", "owner": "theres2chinas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068077541080976, "text": "想了解", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:11:56", "owner": "yin0102", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087110474310593, "text": "該功能支援中文嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:01:45", "owner": "mrkc_kyle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078651251162379, "text": "工作又變多了", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:58:49", "owner": "tu.sean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875774722441063, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:43:00", "owner": "sensei.k3ik3i", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093100117682072, "text": "哇靠", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:46:23", "owner": "jykj58888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891683614361283, "text": "👏🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:29:41", "owner": "familyen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114347653561503, "text": "想了解", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:59:11", "owner": "timetime4325429", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968127879841101, "text": "Pm", "created_at": "2025-12-21T05:47:02", "owner": "jackychiu_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198249523324313, "text": "世界在走向混乱。我看到的是弊大于利。", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:51:43", "owner": "shumasa_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077338931241947, "text": "🙋", "created_at": "2025-12-15T01:58:00", "owner": "banbancat1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035518238523377, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:36:29", "owner": "we24200242", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211560943313427, "text": "I need it!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:55:50", "owner": "124_jade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928486840159160, "text": "這兩年adobe發表會都好變態啊", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:41:54", "owner": "aabbcc81502", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062676659200836, "text": "三立、東森摩拳擦掌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:59:05", "owner": "guan_powerlift59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902537617300789, "text": "比較希望adobe把每個月訂閱費用從上千變成幾百塊", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:47:29", "owner": "hakkaing01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973599348953739, "text": "壞人：感恩ADOBE", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:18:55", "owner": "tsungyuwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072879812207315, "text": "詐團：學到了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:55:41", "owner": "ig2336k5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107692819528522, "text": "造谣跑断腿 看来以后黑白更难分", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:08:58", "owner": "kafandstitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112394209575597, "text": "詐騙集團都高ㄔㄠˊ了....", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:59:15", "owner": "garou7535", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107524675545091, "text": "萬物皆可竄改", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:00:01", "owner": "cfd.wiskey.girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925770262156459, "text": "終於可以讓習近平說一些色色的話了🥵", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:04:32", "owner": "nima_wang_", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18145097155437529, "text": "Adobe is a horrible company, don’t use them if u done have to. I’ve have been using them for work, it’s such a monopoly. Service is horribly bad, so greedy and unethical.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:49:07", "owner": "jr.marshwiggle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399733726121191, "text": "Pm", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:27:44", "owner": "nothing_but_yanb_fans", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18174366286324083, "text": "Premiere!?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:10:34", "owner": "gigijames2047", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["拜託快點推出", "adobemax2025", "adobesneaks", "projectcleantake", "incgmedia", "數位創作", "cg", "adobe", "adobemax"]},
{"media_id": 3720989871298174653, "shortcode": "DOjnJLDjd69", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOjnJLDjd69/", "taken_at": "2025-09-13T20:49:54", "caption": "", "owner_username": "realzoena", "owner_id": "63529211649", "likes": 93169, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0014_DOjnJLDjd69\\DOjnJLDjd69_20250913_204954.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18129674848460148, "text": "What’s happening here?", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:48:58", "owner": "allrockcity", "likes": 8825}, {"id": 18100713817718096, "text": "Still non-consenual practice of BDSM in public space.", "created_at": "2025-09-22T11:51:42", "owner": "ietsgangsaandevreemd", "likes": 26384}, {"id": 18076612340021858, "text": "The problem here is that there’s no one with her. She could be assaulted and wouldn’t be able to defend herself whomever handcuffed her Really should be with her or have her them.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:38:54", "owner": "tru_armor", "likes": 3960}, {"id": 17927149046996805, "text": "?? Dafuq? Explain", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:06:47", "owner": "hw_do_u_like_ur_coffee", "likes": 139}, {"id": 18408021451115310, "text": "Trust me we need kink to function normally in this crazy world❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:05:38", "owner": "anke_luise", "likes": 931}, {"id": 18064127348597566, "text": "sis is so proud", "created_at": "2025-09-23T22:27:31", "owner": "digitalweb3guy", "likes": 893}, {"id": 18087088642698363, "text": "In public spaces your kink stuff needs to be so subtle only the people involved can notice. If it's obvious or overt you are including people who didn't consent in your play.", "created_at": "2025-09-22T20:24:32", "owner": "amotherbuckinggod", "likes": 21881}, {"id": 18079826984289705, "text": "Drive vehicle is well parked and secured", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:11:14", "owner": "yopilokas", "likes": 274}, {"id": 17915438283207343, "text": "She’s so cute wtf this is sweet", "created_at": "2025-10-26T19:23:41", "owner": "ezra_sayerr", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18070613912239967, "text": "Her smile and that choker on her neck say she's probably into it 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:56:22", "owner": "mirzasisic0001", "likes": 2431}, {"id": 17922917511187462, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:43:54", "owner": "jamalluddin_altaf", "likes": 650}, {"id": 18060890507097003, "text": "She’s a keeper 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:43:42", "owner": "vincent_tabbycat", "likes": 2529}, {"id": 17865765075496703, "text": "Alice Weidel", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:15:03", "owner": "sorynn4", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18065617808523445, "text": "That's called DBSM😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:40:57", "owner": "rukoenig", "likes": 131}, {"id": 18041202392406643, "text": "Omg … I can’t take you anywhere 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-16T13:55:17", "owner": "ray_nixtamal", "likes": 153}, {"id": 17923982433172468, "text": "Berlin*", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:33:12", "owner": "jaydvrden", "likes": 24}, {"id": 17887117122261733, "text": "Anything but going to therapy", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:06:59", "owner": "itooaminthiscommentsection", "likes": 316}, {"id": 18039123848690333, "text": "Warum denn? Da gibt es fesselnde Plätzchen 😍🔥😈", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:07:11", "owner": "jensdiegler", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17844882339620224, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:57:40", "owner": "tyneviskdoja", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17860896471491293, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:40:15", "owner": "chiliccoff", "likes": 827}, {"id": 17980836251922791, "text": "😍😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:14:01", "owner": "rolandrrsttt", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18085087177819218, "text": "Forcing others to witness and/or participate in your kink is sexual harrassment", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:44:07", "owner": "pantsthatshitdifferent", "likes": 107}, {"id": 18117260515483251, "text": "It’s Germany brother", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:29:19", "owner": "mason_hall2425", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095677993836142, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:05:36", "owner": "shakajee88", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18007882454814127, "text": "What's happening here? 🤯", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:32:16", "owner": "netimville", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18023835818716728, "text": "sie hat ihre db fahrkarte vergessen", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:43:41", "owner": "illustrativ.jpg", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18059804045230756, "text": "What's the matter? Police had to go get donuts?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:07:31", "owner": "catrina.jones13", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18538004968041756, "text": "Need her @…", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:50:45", "owner": "n.n.__77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969403074957414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:30:58", "owner": "_damn_d1", "likes": 63}, {"id": 18134501248422337, "text": "People need to call the police to \"save\" a woman and feign ignorance about any of that bdsm shit", "created_at": "2025-11-11T08:52:37", "owner": "_dream._.world_1", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17986197878744959, "text": "München hbf probably", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:53:25", "owner": "bushmanofkalahari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159965185380240, "text": "Why u don t go to see a therapist", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:22:34", "owner": "yayapaslesfraises", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18073352192256143, "text": "It is diffucult to take a nice photo in Europe without them!  Use AU to remove them from your photo!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:18:37", "owner": "thesociologist_pt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082654589105259, "text": "Another clown in Berlin . 🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:38:34", "owner": "itsmetsiam", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18313422694173213, "text": "Yeah maybe yall do deserve the migrants", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:22:39", "owner": "dabigmanc", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17855566254485859, "text": "AND THEN CAME THE DECLINE OF OUR CULTURE🙋‍♂️🙋‍♂️⚡️⚡️", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:53:59", "owner": "oblivion_guard_post", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17862606807517851, 