this", "created_at": "2025-08-19T07:10:33", "owner": "richierain", "likes": 21085}, {"id": 18196356406313046, "text": "this is theoretically one of the most optimal yet morally dubious  ways to pull girls", "created_at": "2025-08-13T12:31:00", "owner": "okaydario", "likes": 81501}, {"id": 18096095572638583, "text": "I can fix her ahh", "created_at": "2025-09-05T19:11:30", "owner": "oztracing", "likes": 3444}, {"id": 17887336350204169, "text": "Damn new method dropped, ima try this", "created_at": "2025-08-08T06:38:49", "owner": "haudi_mr_audi", "likes": 43123}, {"id": 17937126768057241, "text": "❌ Passport Bros\n✅ Bailbond Bros", "created_at": "2025-08-09T02:51:35", "owner": "3fishdrewfish", "likes": 101526}, {"id": 18012777140785392, "text": "I thought this was a joke Blud actually bailed her out ain’t no way 💀", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:45:25", "owner": "jayquanza", "likes": 37288}, {"id": 17968979438856907, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:45:43", "owner": "eduxrrr", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18001849781643773, "text": "Bro took “I can fix her” to the highest level", "created_at": "2025-08-24T23:25:55", "owner": "bassxsantana", "likes": 159}, {"id": 18151431103386035, "text": "Your Premature millionaire shirt 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:52:49", "owner": "nathankarhu", "likes": 109}, {"id": 17889346167300525, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-08T12:30:35", "owner": "samr0yce", "likes": 7397}, {"id": 18016954511774176, "text": "Bro bought a huzz pack for 30 gems", "created_at": "2025-09-19T20:00:32", "owner": "leoveronese", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18072600173133552, "text": "Like playing Russian roulette with a Glock", "created_at": "2025-09-12T19:46:40", "owner": "19_regan_94", "likes": 1406}, {"id": 18071390990093873, "text": "Bro def broke her in half that night", "created_at": "2025-08-09T00:38:47", "owner": "areatbd", "likes": 781}, {"id": 18074139191483175, "text": "irl blindboxes", "created_at": "2025-08-27T09:38:09", "owner": "hehuabuilds", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18135425587382332, "text": "Bro, I was literally gonna bail this one out myself 😭😭😩", "created_at": "2025-08-14T04:53:03", "owner": "strxtched_gsxr", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17955024198010132, "text": "“ dad how did you and mom meet “", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:19:54", "owner": "james_rileyrw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17956061321840951, "text": "Bro really fixed her", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:06:01", "owner": "meurdavidd", "likes": 74}, {"id": 17929824248980400, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:10:40", "owner": "sethamoto", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18542306218040833, "text": "This dude found love in the county lock up 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:51:51", "owner": "aaronjr_75", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18071917403020375, "text": "Real life \"Wade Wilson and Vanessa\"-ish style relationship. Lol", "created_at": "2025-08-09T08:17:39", "owner": "seektruthseekgod", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083909288061793, "text": "Rent a girlfriend", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:10:52", "owner": "knightchalk", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18199113211314809, "text": "This might be the new strat. Is this patched yet guys?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:14:21", "owner": "alvinlee3030", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083118587093163, "text": "Ts is literally a plot for a movie, but the inmate's past somehow comes into the story", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:21:52", "owner": "probably.rapha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046223219317110, "text": "“If loving you is a crime then I am guilty” ahh", "created_at": "2025-08-24T04:33:46", "owner": "osirisr1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18236823103293955, "text": "Noted", "created_at": "2025-09-01T15:04:06", "owner": "sliqqbaqq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18283562092282664, "text": "Bro wha----t...", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:32:28", "owner": "trunks_ow", "likes": 49}, {"id": 17892412632305716, "text": "This is real, and it would actually make a good movie…", "created_at": "2025-09-02T03:31:54", "owner": "meissinmonterroso", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865355968443831, "text": "That bro putting her back tho 😅", "created_at": "2025-08-24T21:17:15", "owner": "painpainting1812", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18113953159583320, "text": "So casualy he bought her", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:16:36", "owner": "gbr.luca05", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18062408162176211, "text": "\"play euro truck simulator twin\" wdf ts frying me 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:04:24", "owner": "husayra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18132273640409918, "text": "Good luck", "created_at": "2025-09-22T01:25:14", "owner": "mmitchl1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18122770240483462, "text": "Black pill is real", "created_at": "2025-08-19T21:44:32", "owner": "bobrc_fitness", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18329857741215757, "text": "She gonna steal his car after this", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:33:14", "owner": "your80827", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18090527851670582, "text": "Is this the method?", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:34:10", "owner": "picassahoe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17972510798786952, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:51:24", "owner": "cb_boxing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879352108261706, "text": "You two actually make a good couple, you guys should date", "created_at": "2025-08-13T09:06:35", "owner": "lmatthews7717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952870056858919, "text": "Am I the only one that can tell she’s only into girls?", "created_at": "2025-08-20T23:25:16", "owner": "javinerd", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17851068906541115, "text": "Day in age Pretty woman story.😂", "created_at": "2025-08-30T11:03:20", "owner": "johnrickc191", "likes": 79}, {"id": 17904114285141628, "text": "She has that prisoner walk and tone.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:56:38", "owner": "pictureswithsam", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17863653849516183, "text": "Bro is getting stabbed in his sleep", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:49:05", "owner": "jude.hendler", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859204591491735, "text": "Looks so scripted", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:22:09", "owner": "_mathi__._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18193966903319407, "text": "12 w