, "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153416857404823, "text": "The madlad actually did it", "created_at": "2025-10-07T23:40:57", "owner": "backlashburner", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043705277434559, "text": "Where were you when I was locked up??", "created_at": "2025-10-07T22:34:27", "owner": "missrobynbanks", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070640120519891, "text": "Why be a passport bro when you can be a parole bro??", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:26:50", "owner": "_robo_mark_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043857743413050, "text": "Look like siblings fr", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:47:20", "owner": "chase_smitty03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890143468220052, "text": "Is game really game?", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:50:05", "owner": "skrtpion", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108530578572088, "text": "The only bro to actually \"fix her\"", "created_at": "2025-10-07T09:52:18", "owner": "fatman.t20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075758552132425, "text": "@mugshawtys", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:15:18", "owner": "iconfinado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095154166705561, "text": "\"I can fix her\" final boss", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:32:01", "owner": "sk1bidihh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130386619422808, "text": "Ok so like a few weeks ago someone came into my job with her mug shot on their shirts turns out it was her bday and they were all meeting up a bar!", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:20:55", "owner": "amyxvxcarla", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18098082496710876, "text": "yall look alike", "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:44:11", "owner": "mayaav1la", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083908802499949, "text": "Still a better love story than twilight", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:55:48", "owner": "dabouz19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067626467346431, "text": "Bailed out means court date, he flew her out of states she’s on the run haha", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:53:01", "owner": "isaiahs210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048058298650524, "text": "Marry her 🗿", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:34:04", "owner": "branezabic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007251971803523, "text": "My friend found out there are accounts specifically for connecting people out here to ones in prison for relationships there were some baddies in there in the hour or so we went through the posts, lotta “I can fix her” comments too haha", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:55:22", "owner": "zach14_12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055928339222427, "text": "It would be class if they do actually become a long term couple 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T09:31:02", "owner": "k_mcdonald_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038348060701701, "text": "@chevrolet  my engine broke down", "created_at": "2025-10-06T05:59:17", "owner": "ayan0ffline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294984316266124, "text": "She has the personality of a package or ramen noodles with autism", "created_at": "2025-10-06T05:24:37", "owner": "mattwagnerlive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069909854258524, "text": "Bail out Valerie Tavares in New York", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:54:26", "owner": "two21am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360409201082821, "text": "Usual suspects", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:23:03", "owner": "nzp222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073234649163193, "text": "Is ts the new strat??? 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-06T00:37:12", "owner": "blaq_jack0907", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053141348272478, "text": "Yall got married ?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:45:00", "owner": "tattookartel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902230699270488, "text": "it looks like she was charge with possession of some sort of substance with intent to use, she wasn't like a murder or psycho", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:48:06", "owner": "esethlyine", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18006285851810300, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:27:30", "owner": "heyits._akshat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129052258467931, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:14:12", "owner": "briannac0sta", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17868509154450906, "text": "Dangerous gamble", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:12:51", "owner": "jett.ochel", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18136186354444079, "text": "What 