eone said she was in for stealing a car i see why bro linked with her without a car 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:47:35", "owner": "chefboi.jp", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18066646493202907, "text": "Until one murders your ass", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:51:38", "owner": "that_one_chopped_dude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895431100313367, "text": "Might have to try a rescue lol", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:04:11", "owner": "big.flint", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18383617246130122, "text": "When others are living your dream.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:14:49", "owner": "heathen769", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128040304474671, "text": "Wait he might be onto something", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:42:16", "owner": "fontinik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094698337683145, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:37:42", "owner": "bosslevelautoworks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043947683666900, "text": "Mail bride is over, bail bride is the new shit", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:22:35", "owner": "martinjohnbrabham", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17920626303175777, "text": "Bro bailed out a chick who got nailed on possession with intent to distribute 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:11:19", "owner": "joshua.sulentic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055996355219935, "text": "Bro took “I can fix her” literally", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:11:10", "owner": "deusvult1189", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094785157689350, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:02:56", "owner": "gsaintlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997491150685778, "text": "😭💀", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:11:56", "owner": "johnny.travers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059566235421704, "text": "HE FUCKING DID IT", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:09:37", "owner": "bedford_beyblade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097056226735712, "text": "This world is getting mad 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:38:54", "owner": "jorg3cast", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067855361011871, "text": "Amount of people who think this is real and don’t realize they know each other is hilarious. 😂 funny concept though and don’t hate that it’s staged.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:54:36", "owner": "weedie710", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18073407548145605, "text": "It's over w", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:32:02", "owner": "jujusmokes420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127421677481702, "text": "\"dad how did you meet mom? Well son....\"", "created_at": "2025-10-02T01:56:29", "owner": "stradas_xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093665905827208, "text": "I wish I could do this", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:55:36", "owner": "dshawn_bjj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066734450049359, "text": "Wait.. Ain't u guy the 2vs1", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:17:10", "owner": "laurine_99620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149786656404564, "text": "I broke your mom out of jail", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:39:51", "owner": "twisted_malice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935068357095539, "text": "Uh oh", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:31:29", "owner": "officialdregs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428027167101079, "text": "Did the baddie ever show up?💀", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:30:13", "owner": "cleatus822", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120988282447817, "text": "Bailing out a girl just to wear that weak ass shirt to meet her, work ethic all out of wack", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:11:13", "owner": "weenie_________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206420449308983, "text": "The jail house is always a great place to meet / start a healthy relationship", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:55:08", "owner": "benzi_box", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374118019151842, "text": "One guy said pay 2 win 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:52:22", "owner": "gunpowder___._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877605808312478, "text": "Its all good until she wants to go and get high.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:40:58", "owner": "bitedogs702", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085646764920182, "text": "What's the return policy?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:53:26", "owner": "eschauffler73", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17987147129722678, "text": "I need like a primer or a recap episode or someshit", "create