": 2}, {"id": 18205813051309406, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:22:13", "owner": "borderommaker", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17914147866197507, "text": "That’s hella unethical", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:42:20", "owner": "wolnickibartek", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18413507929115780, "text": "I did something something similar, now I’m a single dad of two boys lol", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:33:28", "owner": "theonecalledgod", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18524105083030235, "text": "I guess looks do matter", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:13:32", "owner": "snappedtierod", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117421765523148, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:21:22", "owner": "emmanueldtorno", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075003932279329, "text": "Simpstagram", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:55:04", "owner": "upsidedownpenguins42", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081457006977667, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:23:00", "owner": "904mrjoker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18530032387001518, "text": "Insane", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:01:48", "owner": "ethankerrphoto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057513806183079, "text": "distressed investing", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:35:53", "owner": "charliecai777", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18176614462348185, "text": "So fake", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:00:35", "owner": "deedsy_03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952488906888062, "text": "REF DO SOMETHING THIS IS PAY 2 WIN", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:13:46", "owner": "nobody_mp4.2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019703243585402, "text": "What was she in for, that’s the first question? Speeding, yeah fine (no pun intended), but stabbing someone then that not on point (pun intended)", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:36:11", "owner": "rickypowell604", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077472184995435, "text": "I think this is the ultimate form of pretty privilege im stoked for her but holy shit hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:06:27", "owner": "nlnwo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17877229122303968, "text": "Captain save a hoe irl 😂", "created_at": "202