rehouse of them 🚩", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:29:10", "owner": "anshu.man.bhardwaj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085084198894890, "text": "Guys wtf", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:48:31", "owner": "zozze63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958513278993672, "text": "What was she in jail for?", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:27:14", "owner": "l.kletke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921922318017922, "text": "Yall getting so creative now", "created_at": "2025-09-07T18:28:42", "owner": "ereyka.a", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17996148638821317, "text": "SIMP", "created_at": "2025-09-07T17:07:49", "owner": "jerem_np", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522327265001428, "text": "I saved her from a shelter", "created_at": "2025-09-07T16:18:14", "owner": "hectorglopez_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18111036862534221, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:39:27", "owner": "caleb.medel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078222143066497, "text": "“AND I DONT WANT THE WORLD TO SEE ME, CUZ I DONT THINK THAT THEYD UNDERSTAND!”", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:24:56", "owner": "homelesshank100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986011734707079, "text": "Bro did it.", "created_at": "2025-09-07T13:26:25", "owner": "jackatcx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059417747579368, "text": "all fun and games until youre the next reason she's going back to jail", "created_at": "2025-09-07T13:00:31", "owner": "keaknowzz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18041527403394812, "text": "If I did this I’d go to sleep one night then wake up tied up butt naked in the middle of the woods while she took my money and dogs", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:31:00", "owner": "cyborggallente", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18526124794050680, "text": "In this week's episode of \"Extreme Red Flag Blindness\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-07T06:20:27", "owner": "jem.jem.jem.jem", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18310091965174999, "text": "Bro went to the shelter💀", "created_at": "2025-09-07T05:56:36", "owner": "zac_foxwell07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893057392318863, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-07T04:16:16", "owner": "ankita__