 who need money and get them to do shit to him. (He gets their info because things like phone number and address's are public information sadly) so yeah there's people that work hard for the jail girls lmao!", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:32:23", "owner": "cheyssummer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18372610384195865, "text": "Living life on recruit difficulty 🤣!", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:03:34", "owner": "ss_mightydiamond", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077170484512279, "text": "Ay ladies, if he wanted to, he would 🤫", "created_at": "2025-09-06T10:37:18", "owner": "vantasticv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001533665649068, "text": "This is disgusting.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T10:18:13", "owner": "ali_efaf", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18095501773636919, "text": "Next minute she slits you're throat I you're sleep", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:56:56", "owner": "_0rder_up___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013103663781243, "text": "🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:51:23", "owner": "0venge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075182033061183, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:33:48", "owner": "zealousfights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184747606335620, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:05:06", "owner": "johngoesoutdoors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104135185574123, "text": "CRAZY💀", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:04:29", "owner": "harlfoxx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989821791838357, "text": "Wholesome", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:33:39", "owner": "solarcombustion", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103288984584619, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:32:33", "owner": "nick_berlint", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18152206099395340, "text": "The “I can fix her” final boss 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:51:34", "owner": "fireandashx", "likes": 124}, {"id": 18075353225020536, "text": "Is he still alive", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:54:30", "owner": "shaikhshaheb_xo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18322811125239404, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:46:13", "owner": "aka_julie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076361228072853, "t