": 18086255674880074, "text": "Bro indeed fixed her", "created_at": "2025-09-02T11:33:21", "owner": "wt_lima_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994983663821883, "text": "Bro, you don't have to play this game.", "created_at": "2025-09-02T11:23:18", "owner": "maheshsapre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091738936613666, "text": "😭 @sayyidakhlq", "created_at": "2025-09-02T10:16:21", "owner": "chaesaradli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18426354181097804, "text": "What did she do ?", "created_at": "2025-09-02T08:29:43", "owner": "hanss.3008", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17908193031211265, "text": "Ngl some time ago I stumbled upon am instagram page just for this.", "created_at": "2025-09-02T07:46:08", "owner": "senderekmichal", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18199820653312318, "text": "Perfect opportunity for a Lamar Jackson edit", "created_at": "2025-09-02T07:43:45", "owner": "romybek", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17999723336807192, "text": "THIS might be a method 😭unfortunately", "created_at": "2025-09-02T06:01:22", "owner": "ft.jodie", "likes": 80}, {"id": 18522118405058706, "text": "Waiting for the one baddie to be a trap💀😭", "created_at": "2025-09-02T04:30:30", "owner": "pmmurph18", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17854260309518934, "text": "I dont know how to process this...😂", "created_at": "2025-09-02T03:29:23", "owner": "joshua.r.cabrera", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940130769932111, "text": "“And that’s how I met your mother”💀😭", "created_at": "2025-09-02T03:15:24", "owner": "matblecher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075938192318747, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-02T02:37:52", "owner": "bnaandez.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074954231018194, "text": "Don’t be shy, would you go to jail for?", "created_at": "2025-09-02T02:20:26", "owner": "just_willliam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050274731275871, "text": "And she got treated better then most women out here haha 🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-02T01:14:33", "owner": "m00000r000000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054636566393603, "text": "Do they feel pressured to go on dates?", "created_at": "2025-09-01T