025-09-01T18:02:27", "owner": "butterz_the_magnificent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071309939165850, "text": "@jordyn_101_troutman", "created_at": "2025-09-01T18:00:52", "owner": "razorjonathon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864967309454327, "text": "Euro truck simulator 💀😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T17:26:45", "owner": "lukehutchinson_95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098565043623222, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-01T17:24:34", "owner": "fotisvassilopoulos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954761638005422, "text": "@veryscamlikely", "created_at": "2025-09-01T16:07:13", "owner": "gyoolio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040043432398327, "text": "The wildest way someone using free will 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-01T16:05:30", "owner": "ur_photo_is_no_good_but_i_stil", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17860550490471315, "text": "how i met your mother ah video", "created_at": "2025-09-01T15:40:36", "owner": "alechhh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087643132834336, "text": "I thought this was Zach or Cody", "created_at": "2025-09-01T15:35:30", "owner": "j_leon919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123056899434605, "text": "This a @veryscamlikely thing to do 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T14:47:50", "owner": "jay_wit_da_yola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075438815081032, "text": "What... What was she in jail for?", "created_at": "2025-09-01T14:23:11", "owner": "starxnova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876311248402716, "text": "A falsely  accused prisoner seeing this", "created_at": "2025-09-01T14:22:54", "owner": "rathore.rjt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077479616298220, "text": "“I can change her “ 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T13:52:42", "owner": "bozito_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18154517902381663, "text": "even Shakespeare couldn't write this", "created_at": "2025-09-01T10:28:01", "owner": "crocodiledaz", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18116353954510921, "text": "This is wild 🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-01T10:07:37", "owner": "diderkamal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420617950102352, "text": "Can somebody translate from us-slang-brainrot to English please?", "created_at": "2025-09-01T09:40:03", "owner": "samuel_llito", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18338356906202882, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-09-01T09:15:03", "owner": "jazzinoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139887382426426, "text": "@dontdoharam  get yourself a rescue man", "created_at": "2025-09-01T08:46:05", "owner": "_heathen.x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086446435878209, "text": "Bro gonna die someday😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T07:42:24", "owner": "onni_samu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912744745083492, "text": "Gambling would be better as you know you could win money back, this is more like a devestment", "created_at": "2025-09-01T05:36:48", "owner": "matthewdmerrill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355376464084813, "text": "Bro is living the dream", "created_at": "2025-09-01T05:08:38", "owner": "polar.4098", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104358319509248, "text": "Bail bond bros", "created_at": "2025-09-01T05:07:18", "owner": "loganmacinnis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872577679418170, "text": "high risk high reward 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-09-01T05:05:03", "owner": "vladpush1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078499540772177, "text": "This is such a wild form of reality show... Do more", "created_at": "2025-09-01T04:01:04", "owner": "huetopia.collective", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077133922969096, "text": "At this point, I am willing to do this for love", "created_at": "2025-09-01T02:41:58", "owner": "mr.weasel25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18147562330409406, "text": "If the spruce twins had a daughter together", "created_at": "2025-09-01T02:41:38", "owner": "sterlinguini_alfredo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045859727326097, "text": "dam🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-01T01:44:07", "owner": "wawa1989142", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966251367953431, "text": "What did she do 🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-01T01:13:07", "owner": "jeffrey_vargas_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074677118021901, "text": "We always say women are the problem, but really simps are the biggest problem. Just stroll through the comments and point and laugh.", "created_at": "2025-09-01T01:11:47", "owner": "parkscope25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862360711463838, "text": "Form of human trafficking yet the court systems do the same thing so 🤗🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-01T00:53:31", "owner": "zacknuckles", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057144473451940, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-01T00:48:39", "owner": "saltwardsrevenge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077185744977319, "text": "This is disgusting", "created_at": "2025-09-01T00:15:24", "owner": "bendejo420", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17918275731161719, "text": "You gotta hit after being release together 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-31T23:59:03", "owner": "malainfluenciaangel305", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948878974010428, "text": "\"Did bro crack\" is a disgusting phrase I actually have no idea why ppl talk like ts", "created_at": "2025-08-31T23:00:48", "owner": "baileys.c0met", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053500655550881, "text": "Ultra mega simping gold plus.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T22:41:26", "owner": "who_is_cedar_lamb", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18042572954357800, "text": "@alejandro_hernandez_carne the comments", "created_at": "2025-08-31T22:06:58", "owner": "pqrqz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866706703372322, "text": "Chat is this a new trend?", "created_at": "2025-08-31T21:44:28", "owner": "andimfajar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987622164845591, "text": "Damn so all i gotta do is bail someone out to get a girlfriend 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-31T21:34:53", "owner": "11th_gen_phil", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18421827088106551, "text": "this seems like a great idea until you wake up one day with a strangled dog and everything of value stolen", "created_at": "2025-08-31T21:11:27", "owner": "613.233_e", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18047244215636314, "text": "This man is on a mission. A not very honorable one but a mission never then less", "created_at": "2025-08-31T21:04:01", "owner": "angel_98361", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18091549864670946, "text": "undeniable W ngl", "created_at": "2025-08-31T20:50:24", "owner": "jxosh.m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876614902396946, "text": "ts killing me😭", "created_at": "2025-08-31T20:25:08", "owner": "freezyaire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143130376373996, "text": "What was she in for? Why is none of your motherfuckers asking the question", "created_at": "2025-08-31T20:23:10", "owner": "emirhan.mdzp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933700000082264, "text": "Bro is the GOAT", "created_at": "2025-08-31T20:13:41", "owner": "lkojvjekkkkk508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044615258654722, "text": "Genius", "created_at": "2025-08-31T20:00:15", "owner": "collin__keane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406926835118128, "text": "Bro actually did what we all say seeing mugshawtyz 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-31T19:59:59", "owner": "daveylarez24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341119846167165, "text": "This mf looks like Dexter", "created_at": "2025-08-31T19:51:38", "owner": "youngojsause", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919178104119071, "text": "Im mad jealous.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T19:49:44", "owner": "sunnydarkooo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18520505683047647, "text": "As a former CO for the love of god do not do this 👏", "created_at": "2025-08-31T18:47:30", "owner": "spicybardboi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18393744523189126, "text": "Did it work? Are they married??", "created_at": "2025-08-31T18:35:02", "owner": "mitchglisson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085833436888335, "text": "How’s it feel to live my dream", "created_at": "2025-08-31T18:25:25", "owner": "ihaines358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051561791550263, "text": "Wait what is going on ?", "created_at": "2025-08-31T18:11:32", "owner": "sahilpatanwala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061608632067314, "text": "Okay but like, did they end up together? Bro was right, they do look good together lol", "created_at": "2025-08-31T17:51:12", "owner": "bjensen1165", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039625436418672, "text": "The real \"I can fix her\" 💀", "created_at": "2025-08-31T17:46:39", "owner": "bryanssx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091916194708803, "text": "The layers to this 👌", "created_at": "2025-08-31T17:40:24", "owner": "jeffalderson86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924072322104018, "text": "@derek_ds5 tengo una idea", "created_at": "2025-08-31T17:38:51", "owner": "leninwachimingo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526174129007231, "text": "An interesting use of free will", "created_at": "2025-08-31T16:50:35", "owner": "altyartz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073751818877802, "text": "Is there a waiting list??", "created_at": "2025-08-31T16:47:36", "owner": "jorge_ofdosheen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067176730973971, "text": "I’m start putting parlays on this 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-31T16:24:26", "owner": "anunnaki_the_ruler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050967953553643, "text": "She talks like man boy voice", "created_at": "2025-08-31T15:30:03", "owner": "empty_beercan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096001750725012, "text": "Bro fear noathing lol ahhaahaha", "created_at": "2025-08-31T15:12:21", "owner": "valknut1922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051522047240384, "text": "Who said she a rescue 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-31T15:02:54", "owner": "thelight_victor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102607681521145, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-31T14:57:01", "owner": "nxrcoooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385856413127746, "text": "💀 👏 it’s true what they say, man women would never take jail time", "created_at": "2025-08-31T14:19:56", "owner": "6_s_dead_eyes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897939586146168, "text": "Bail out the teacher who boned her students", "created_at": "2025-08-31T13:47:42", "owner": "manlikehas_98", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17886724512224887, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-31T13:45:57", "owner": "iaverysimone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137305354381854, "text": "elite ball knowledge", "created_at": "2025-08-31T13:38:05", "owner": "xhuey.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071432168155762, "text": "Possession? Bro was jus trying to get hers. Good luck buddy", "created_at": "2025-08-31T13:30:21", "owner": "michaelordonez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852668281533208, "text": "Soooo, is she like a rescue dog..... A rescue female dog (bxxxx). Kidding aside, this is pretty wholesome, and she's cute.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T13:22:02", "owner": "dontlookinsideyourceiling", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143398204417203, "text": "How do we bail people out?", "created_at": "2025-08-31T12:19:21", "owner": "mhaziqansari", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998457354813497, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-31T12:15:29", "owner": "bijoy.m2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019575983685404, "text": "Okay but what did she do though", "created_at": "2025-08-31T11:33:33", "owner": "lincoln_littler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105321919565455, "text": "Can someone bail out my HS girlfriend, she’s only 20 years into a 40 year sentence for murder. 😭", "created_at": "2025-08-31T11:07:17", "owner": "paule915", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18090517813782744, "text": "This is a really funny bit ngl", "created_at": "2025-08-31T10:03:17", "owner": "mattrockj", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18070512050157836, "text": "Dude pulled a girl from prison", "created_at": "2025-08-31T09:53:55", "owner": "leobrux96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086068690678118, "text": "Society's awful lmao", "created_at": "2025-08-31T08:55:33", "owner": "matchaavocad0es", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17939757042058384, "text": "New gf strat just unlocked? Just bail em, wine em, dine em", "created_at": "2025-08-31T08:41:16", "owner": "xinitii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884070340241964, "text": "The neverest thing that never happened", "created_at": "2025-08-31T05:00:25", "owner": "taylor._.0_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076181776995661, "text": "this dude might be a genius", "created_at": "2025-08-31T04:41:50", "owner": "a_postmodern_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104901967504269, "text": "Rest in peace, bruv.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T04:17:42", "owner": "cancelled4words", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322607890239604, "text": "NO FUCKING WAY LETSSSS GO", "created_at": "2025-08-31T04:02:23", "owner": "signorellisimon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862220704405191, "text": "An influencer and a criminal? That's a match made in heaven.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T03:42:37", "owner": "charactersremix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099235960528647, "text": "So there’s people more retarded than me out there.  Nice. 🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-08-31T03:15:47", "owner": "christofer_cervantes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074345701842847, "text": "When the rest of us say “I can fix her” we’re joking bro", "created_at": "2025-08-31T02:08:04", "owner": "clappedmagic", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18124554025470846, "text": "That is the most baller \"I can fix her\" ever bro", "created_at": "2025-08-31T00:35:54", "owner": "jazzyhill1983", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18076686235822049, "text": "So what did she do lol", "created_at": "2025-08-31T00:33:55", "owner": "wattskade", "likes": 164}, {"id": 18136078852431411, "text": "Where’s the Lamar edit", "created_at": "2025-08-31T00:26:57", "owner": "soloman1704", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058304606600302, "text": "How is nobody bringing up how gross and predatory this is. Bailing women out of prison in hopes that they sleep with you?", "created_at": "2025-08-31T00:21:51", "owner": "kingrobin2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064278809008514, "text": "Is this a real thing?", "created_at": "2025-08-31T00:08:07", "owner": "artieatthebank4040", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124553857471739, "text": "@jmarty0331 saw you like this shits funny 😆", "created_at": "2025-08-30T23:27:06", "owner": "showroom_gloss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040525724666348, "text": "watch the eyes", "created_at": "2025-08-30T23:08:17", "owner": "nick_mcghee11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080571220745609, "text": "When simps get money😭", "created_at": "2025-08-30T22:40:07", "owner": "justnotherliamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057965831110987, "text": "What was she in for?", "created_at": "2025-08-30T22:19:03", "owner": "shad0wgh0ul5255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957963156842854, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-30T21:38:43", "owner": "t.j_scrotum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104596414569916, "text": "I’m sick of getting thoroughbreds. I want a rescue girlfriend.", "created_at": "2025-08-30T21:13:48", "owner": "ttennyson", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18381133435122684, "text": "😭🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:35:55", "owner": "jerca_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112309699465043, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:20:41", "owner": "jt_02004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074120966038036, "text": "This is fuckin outrageous!!! \n\nWhy didn’t I think of this??", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:20:22", "owner": "notfinite", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046951655642532, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:15:07", "owner": "vasper_12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073346249033713, "text": "What did she go in for", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:00:11", "owner": "justin_dtb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921850816131300, "text": "I rescue a dog from a shelter, i'm a hero, but when I do it with a woman, everyone loses their shit", "created_at": "2025-08-30T18:57:48", "owner": "waynejeffrie", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17920491054135472, "text": "Sooo there’s a chance you can get stabbed if she got charges likes that hahaha", "created_at": "2025-08-30T18:39:38", "owner": "cat_daddy14111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954073971861205, "text": "Red Flag: The Movie 🚩", "created_at": "2025-08-30T18:16:48", "owner": "junglist_lemieux", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17853875163528196, "text": "Atleast u know who to bail out most would just leave yo az", "created_at": "2025-08-30T17:52:07", "owner": "tell_nobody18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953549076859054, "text": "Whatever it takes capt america", "created_at": "2025-08-30T17:41:59", "owner": "ovenguak_egede", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093102040669468, "text": "You better crack spending onlyfans money on a girl", "created_at": "2025-08-30T17:36:56", "owner": "lowkeyoglo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108267529489142, "text": "Fueling the no accountability fire", "created_at": "2025-08-30T17:35:37", "owner": "vectra___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18150348532360825, "text": "And when you fall asleep, she takes everything. Was it worth it ?probably😂