on33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286654636255129, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:35:52", "owner": "beast_snagga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076706737787596, "text": "50$ says bro did not crack", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:35:42", "owner": "scuba_martin720", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18524195089050627, "text": "No way", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:33:58", "owner": "rileydachenhausen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402144736112306, "text": "Bet bro didn’t even get to hit", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:33:39", "owner": "yeeyeeassasian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071605115491116, "text": "You are more attractive then she. Pathetic buying out so basic bitch. You could even pick up better one", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:32:21", "owner": "user294238183", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134108458440118, "text": "“I can fix her” final boss", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:31:01", "owner": "mas3452001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349345750093187, "text": "If I’m still single when I’m 30 u will prob catch me doin sm like this", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:30:46", "owner": "dylan_aletich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078765532919953, "text": "After she kills you ill bail her out again 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:28:22", "owner": "zmk_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913950391171158, "text": "Bro acc managed to bail the most gorgeous mugshawty gyal 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:25:46", "owner": "ty.cwn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866952682427432, "text": "questionable methods, but they work I guess…", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:25:23", "owner": "3_sssgz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977869884744652, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:23:43", "owner": "jakeamongothers", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045129305317299, "text": "What did she do actually though?", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:23:38", "owner": "amirksj_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064981175238771, "text": "I can fix her final boss", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:19:04", "owner": "indridcol", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18050033642236304, "text": "Lol this is 100% a robbery set up and homies is press in the gas pedal", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:12:19", "owner": "denverjuggler", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18091804078582112, "text": "She look like faith orday", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:11:11", "owner": "officertenpenyx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954069273868256, "text": "Lol. All good til you wake up the next morning. Then you wake up to your phone and wallet missing. Along with your bank account totally drained. 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:06:12", "owner": "miked820ig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047164355636378, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:05:52", "owner": "rxllindice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956866689838402, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:03:56", "owner": "saisecluded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088326997686409, "text": "WHAT THE FUCKING PTW BULLSHIT...... FUCKKKKK", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:02:33", "owner": "cosmo.surviv.io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850819243520517, "text": "You know the dating market is f**kd when we have to bail out our dates 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:02:25", "owner": "dahbromo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18369235729198715, "text": "Ref do something😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:01:57", "owner": "ur.pretty.boi_acky", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17884219383350782, "text": "Corny fake", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:01:00", "owner": "lilprecum69", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074689633978955, "text": "@jaypickzem I know your doing this for entertainment purposes, but please don't do this in irl in your dating life. Ignoring the red flags and being a cuck dating her", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:57:36", "owner": "kevgil2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047285573633903, "text": "Well I know what I’m doing now", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:55:52", "owner": "senpia_ss_mob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104332960497339, "text": "The fact people are dumb enough to think this is real🤦🏼‍♂️ they both just happen to advertise the same dumb roulette game on Instagram? Idk what’s worse the fact that people are dumb enough to fall for this shit or the fact that people actually follow this dork and think he’s cool 😂 I guess with the right amount of cringe and purchased followers anyone can be insta famous these days", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:54:16", "owner": "zachxsparks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904745299091231, "text": "Brah brought her to the Venetian 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:52:59", "owner": "ken.navarro_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088838896688364, "text": "Ok but what did she do", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:51:03", "owner": "cincyspqr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116975038497521, "text": "I've dated crazier girls so it's not that bad idea", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:49:21", "owner": "st.diego14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093552151631471, "text": "Yt boys doing the most", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:45:57", "owner": "ramonxn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415308757105832, "text": "I have a dream", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:41:53", "owner": "darealyon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009275012789777, "text": "When she say “how can I ever repay u.” Darling there’s a way 😉😏", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:40:33", "owner": "azrael_divine_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018702710738643, "text": "REF", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:37:33", "owner": "petrone.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089532910702680, "text": "So his girlfriend got arrested.  Got it", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:36:33", "owner": "jmo_82184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170217994358704, "text": "We got GTA 6 before GTA 6", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:32:41", "owner": "sup.rico_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936624403052758, "text": "I used to have hoop dreams", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:32:15", "owner": "yekcimmoore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912586648179595, "text": "Usually skip this part", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:30:01", "owner": "yyzchino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052796510190925, "text": "Someone sent this me and said NO DONT TRY IT ! 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:28:57", "owner": "cham619", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990231303830748, "text": "No fkn way", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:25:39", "owner": "jdinthescat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067035566155530, "text": "If y’all are official, y’all are meant to be together. 🙌🏽🙌🏽", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:20:37", "owner": "problematicnoah2.0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18336208324203118, "text": "Hell nah 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:13:02", "owner": "ogueddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042586319335528, "text": "Too good", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:12:45", "owner": "joey69072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873972151393143, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:12:07", "owner": "tahj.mahall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049657577623339, "text": "i’ll bet gooners unironically do this and then they get killed for it", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:10:25", "owner": "gabe.fray", "likes": 9933}, {"id": 18072631493086886, "text": "Someone make a Lamar Jackson edit for the end", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:09:43", "owner": "tommy_muchwano_atl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061611089460127, "text": "New way of dating just dropped 🫳 🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:08:17", "owner": "hectropolis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060155417364232, "text": "No way man bailed her out 🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:07:44", "owner": "mkd_gigachad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522572677034087, "text": "TS SO FUNNY BRO 😭💀 I need this to be a tv show", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:05:39", "owner": "jaydga5_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064555024986505, "text": "Another trash couple who will have 4 kids to burden the rest of us🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:02:42", "owner": "bobski213", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["togi", "soosh", "casino", "slots"]},
{"media_id": 3747940235889175528, "shortcode": "DQDW8l_kWvo", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQDW8l_kWvo/", "taken_at": "2025-10-21T01:15:44", "caption": "psa to lock your doors 👀\n\n#college #dorm #dormlife #freshman #fyp", "owner_username": "lifeinmyers", "owner_id": "77134184309", "likes": 8479, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0018_DQDW8l_kWvo\\DQDW8l_kWvo_20251021_011544.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18065984888610393, "text": "need a room tour of the 9 person room bc HOW", "created_at": "2025-10-25T14:24:08", "owner": "sophiamcsmith", "likes": 1167}, {"id": 18198475195320946, "text": "I’m just imagining being in the room and seeing the door handle randomly jiggle", "created_at": "2025-10-25T19:17:52", "owner": "mirandashort", "likes": 613}, {"id": 18325224235209739, "text": "This girl doesn’t even live here…", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:04:19", "owner": "summerhobbs5", "likes": 245}, {"id": 18075805522918820, "text": "My friend left her door unlocked one year- she learned quickly- I went in and rearranged the entire room. Flipped the bed around. Turned pictures upside down. — set up a camera to record her walking in! It was HILARIOUS. She never left her door unlocked again :). I was so proud of that lesson I taught!", "created_at": "2025-10-24T10:59:16", "owner": "tabbiijae", "likes": 129}, {"id": 17902397682145917, "text": "3rd floor would NEVER leave their doors unlocked (I’m lying)", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:24:36", "owner": "kimbrooooo85", "likes": 502}, {"id": 18020864159777377, "text": "FOOFIE my beloved! ready to finish my life with the walter boys whenever you stop trying to open people's doors!!! @nona_32322", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:51:11", "owner": "annie.putzke", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18132302113479503, "text": "Y’all are lucky to be able to leave your doors unlocked—my dorm is keycard access so I have to take my whole lanyard with me every time I go down the hall to piss", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:06:21", "owner": "scr1pturience", "likes": 289}, {"id": 18116163049535464, "text": "At my university, all of our doors in our dorm are locked. They only way in is with your ID and key.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:05:38", "owner": "aero.mischa", "likes": 138}, {"id": 17899712127299617, "text": "So is no one else wandering why there are 9 people in one dorm?? lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T17:09:09", "owner": "christisdunn", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18051867041328903, "text": "wait i know her", "created_at": "2025-10-25T21:15:23", "owner": "annamci18", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18140982892450341, "text": "@nona_32322 great, now come to milly and check my door", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:46:10", "owner": "averyc_geary", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17939089554085151, "text": "Loving all the Halloween decor on the doors! I always tell parents on my website to add a few decor items when they send their Halloween care packages.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:38:36", "owner": "dormlifeonabudget", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17874530454434376, "text": "THATS MY DORM BRO", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:56:27", "owner": "sunubean", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18537449788004161, "text": "@nona_32322 pls don’t break into my house thanks", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:57:51", "owner": "ellet288", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18074636476937031, "text": "fi up to her typical antics glad to see nothing has changed", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:45:08", "owner": "iceyrosez", "likes": 44}, {"id": 18173812630371453, "text": "HELP I LOVE THIS @nona_32322", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:08:05", "owner": "anne.zainab", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099265018672566, "text": "omg she's so funny", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:01:49", "owner": "beebeeg", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18112803862562667, "text": "I don’t like being exposed like this", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:52:51", "owner": "isabella__karina", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18244079851292146, "text": "Fiona this is a very good reminder to lock your doors!", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:44:21", "owner": "uga.grayson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18123981151511263, "text": "Fi thank you for reminding me my apartment is currently unlocked", "created_at": "2025-10-21T03:20:49", "owner": "sc_saint90", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18044131574442942, "text": "@nona_32322 my goat👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:23:36", "owner": "_ari_johns_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17983049483912028, "text": "FIIIIII", "created_at": "2025-10-24T16:54:32", "owner": "gracikluge", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17848786593562829, "text": "@kate.shemm 276 stayed unlocked when we lived there 🤞", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:19:21", "owner": "allytrem", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055699382275730, "text": "i fear mine is almost always unlocked….(like it is in the video)😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:36:22", "owner": "a._.sres", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18009874388638266, "text": "My biggest pet peeve is busybody Karens.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:20:29", "owner": "lmins.ta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18142168054446638, "text": "Not the fart zone 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T22:14:43", "owner": "college.edc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082441313059376, "text": "I’m so glad my door was not featured", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:16:27", "owner": "braelynn.chevelle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001924049671250, "text": "Man my dorm room locked behind us the second the door was closed. Always had to have our keys on us even to go to the bathroom. I was terrified of being the one that got locked out and having to bother an TA to unlock it for me at 4 am.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T05:10:19", "owner": "anniewillow33", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067588349371938, "text": "Locked or locked in?🤯", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:39:14", "owner": "celina_naheed", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18076144834915948, "text": "FI AHHHH", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:17:06", "owner": "malin_mcafee", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18319860856171917, "text": "I always kept mine locked if I wasn’t there but always unlocked if I was there. \nThat could’ve been fun just to bee bop in with me staring at you. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:19:28", "owner": "madame.librarian20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151334110417667, "text": "When I was in college I had a single occupancy room, if I was in the room the door was open. I lived next to the RA- I would have other girls crash in my room if their dorm mates were sick.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T06:37:46", "owner": "stevi_gottlob", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18091088980920139, "text": "Okay but her smile is so pretty", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:23:49", "owner": "the_kingdoms_treasure", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872797228441175, "text": "We always left are door open yall are anti social 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-25T22:06:47", "owner": "thetruth42x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874162555355531, "text": "As a veteran RA, this is actually how you get the police called on you", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:33:00", "owner": "matilda.chowen", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18101312464736757, "text": "Not only was mine unlocked, but I left my dorm door open all of freshman year. I kept nothing anyone wanted to steal at school.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:39:52", "owner": "richiiieeee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18534479125031041, "text": "Don't you have to study for finals", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:10:40", "owner": "ig._saadi2.0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071464670029085, "text": "why don't you just always need a key to open them from the outside? especially in a dorm rather than a home, it's easy enough for management to have a general key to open if someone locks themselves out.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:48:06", "owner": "unterlassbar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922560352177533, "text": "YOU LOCK YOUR DORM. stuff will get stolen", "created_at": "2025-10-25T05:02:33", "owner": "connorray1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045094139437284, "text": "Ours auto locked", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:21:12", "owner": "larry.mciver", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088758955922890, "text": "Every time when I was in college, and I went to go home to visit parents and stuff like that, I would worry that I’d forgot to lock my car so before I left the parking lot, I would go back and check it again. Even to this day I still like to take a video with proof that the door is locked. This would be at the condo that I live at or even at my parents house if they’re not there.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T20:26:13", "owner": "michaelp6670", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098793676588344, "text": "fiona this is scaring me", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:56:09", "owner": "clackey11", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18140340181444847, "text": "I’m coming for ur door Fiona😻", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:26:46", "owner": "jkim0625", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18102060001724165, "text": "@nona_32322 what 😭 thank god I don’t live in Myers anymore", "created_at": "2025-10-22T01:32:35", "owner": "carter__doucette", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368404120159458, "text": "@nona_32322 🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:24:32", "owner": "katherinedent_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17929741907999103, "text": "I’m scared", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:50:10", "owner": "eva_cochrannn", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18045679394415217, "text": "doors may be locked or unlocked but fiona's locked in @nona_32322", "created_at": "2025-10-21T11:26:52", "owner": "junhui_park", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077312966152492, "text": "won’t catch me slackin", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:35:27", "owner": "kennedywiedower", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17922146634175926, "text": "this is so funny actually", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:43:07", "owner": "abigail_.wright", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18299254981271069, "text": "ummm fiona", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:15:29", "owner": "shivanishiv00", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053778140308970, "text": "Oh im scared", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:06:19", "owner": "emi1yyyyyyyyy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17953467126020664, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:30:00", "owner": "thyagarajan369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337085575235543, "text": "Honestly I would just get an apartment nearby.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:48", "owner": "pureskatefb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100776106615230, "text": "Haha these signs", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:27:01", "owner": "careertipsbyred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176086468367346, "text": "I think those are working on something more important like world peace? Nah! I think they were so stoned they just forgot to lock it!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:52:15", "owner": "thomas37685", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881967376419533, "text": "Remember coming back to your room and someone had written on your white board? Peak college.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:27:08", "owner": "sbg_2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104104609722437, "text": "Ours autolocks", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:02:56", "owner": "bb.cali.girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062233067179278, "text": "If you are in the room, leaving it unlocked is fine. If you are not, it is stupid", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:10:08", "owner": "micrognome87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990684393854284, "text": "wha- 9 people?!", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01:03:04", "owner": "thecooldoggo1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861771445531971, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T03:23:50", "owner": "burgersandfries.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085874584784452, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:07:35", "owner": "muzuleft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025777370759804, "text": "When I was on a floor with a bunch of creatives, we would leave our doors open to come and hang out w each other it was cute", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:35:25", "owner": "lolitslea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895160551346193, "text": "well when i lived in a dorm, our doors auto locked. you had to have a key. but also, the door knobs would just fall off. and you’d just have a hole for a bit. 💀💀😭 mine was just abt there. and i had a large crack at the bottom of my door on the side, i guess where it wasn’t sealed right. who knows. worst experience of my life, NEVER. again 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:05:37", "owner": "abbyelizabeth2445", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537970936036930, "text": "When I was in college I was def the one to leave my keys in the door then be tweaking not able to find my keys", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:53:53", "owner": "its_colleenhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880798522309349, "text": "Meh. Its up to the people in the dorm room. Safety is the enemy of freedom now a days.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:00:24", "owner": "tipmoose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535400077020801, "text": "I never locked my dorm lol", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:10:40", "owner": "oliviajbutler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012450974802910, "text": "All of our doors lock auto lock as soon as you open it", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:00:40", "owner": "sierralbee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182055388355728, "text": "She's somehow surprised when it's locked and when it's unlocked 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:26:13", "owner": "fusion138254", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081282785026812, "text": "Tip, don't announce your address on the internet.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T05:33:35", "owner": "dedoburrito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023907863780766, "text": "When I was in college, I would leave my keys in the lock outside my dorm.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:23:26", "owner": "hob.christina2785", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103049275643678, "text": "Ah, the days of being an RA. I gave everyone fair warning. Leave your door unlocked and I'll steal your beer. 😂 I never had to stock my fridge.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:47:39", "owner": "uncle_andy225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116286316543495, "text": "Do we have dorms/colleges in Adelaide no we don’t but did I watch the whole video anyway to see what would happen yes yes I did ahha 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:23:26", "owner": "rebecca_carmody13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059311223219227, "text": "In my residential halls all doors were always automatically locked. So... if you ever forgot your keys, you had to pay a fine to get it open. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:24:02", "owner": "sensei_mireles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879341767420204, "text": "Imagine having doors that don't lock automatically", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:21:17", "owner": "the_irishrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849647998585685, "text": "Luckily for us our doors automatically lock- our key is our id which is on our phones", "created_at": "2025-10-31T22:22:23", "owner": "ekf.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071044823208079, "text": "All I can think is that I hope she washes her hands several times. Like doctor scrub in clean.😆🤪dorms are such a germ cesspool...lol", "created_at": "2025-10-31T16:31:59", "owner": "katelane15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155713342402679, "text": "Unlocked doors in college rooms are like upside pineapples on cruise ships!😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:17:42", "owner": "macho4all", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541583977038286, "text": "My dorm door automatically locks behind me. Tf?", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:16:07", "owner": "chaossismajestic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118150501542803, "text": "All of the doors are locked in my colleges dorm. Only way to keep it open was prop it. Better not have forgotten your key if you left to do anything", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:20:13", "owner": "shumgartadam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086610068510181, "text": "Look your doors because there’s a crazy chick that’s wanders around trying all the doors", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:20:17", "owner": "paul.volkmann.16", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18179609524357267, "text": "damn this feel crazy lol our university dorm doors automatically lock behind us :p", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:38:40", "owner": "sir.goofygrace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123616798503042, "text": "Fiona is doing what any Fiona would do 😉", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:38:01", "owner": "jthkg1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978223827927620, "text": "When I was in college we left our doors wide open for the common area and just locked the bedroom doors.", "created_at": "2025-10-27T19:56:28", "owner": "edward45001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002117591821380, "text": "You're adorable. A perfect script if \"How I met your Mother\" were still running.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T20:00:06", "owner": "scottscouter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084584695996583, "text": "I only leave mine unlocked if I’m in the room (and awake)", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:12:35", "owner": "amohrman25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531206659035895, "text": "So many kids who have never had their bunks flipped.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T12:23:16", "owner": "jason_belliveau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095022856648116, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-26T03:33:37", "owner": "ottawadinburgh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065251703618689, "text": "invasion of privacy", "created_at": "2025-10-25T20:34:52", "owner": "lukefromny_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975955617928505, "text": "The locks on your doors work???", "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:49:15", "owner": "savannahlorenc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879251155413166, "text": "Is the bed ready for us?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:21:44", "owner": "reaganbetter_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040737395701139, "text": "Why do you care?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T04:26:57", "owner": "hansdramm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076890296146618, "text": "The fact that some of those doors where opened a cracked and a key left in the door is pretty scary. You never know what someone could do.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T02:56:51", "owner": "cjs30513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141900013431598, "text": "My university's doors locked automatically behind us.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T00:44:55", "owner": "mintyxx429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075825850919152, "text": "Mine was just a key and I only left it unlocked to take out the trash.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T18:23:58", "owner": "car_cat_kitty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966371616969188, "text": "That’s , scary", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:46:36", "owner": "againstalloddsashley1.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078663613886620, "text": "🔥🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:31:16", "owner": "ediburgde_writers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912725815213394, "text": "WTF", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:56:28", "owner": "sunubean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096220774753433, "text": "FIONA WTF", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:55:56", "owner": "sunubean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021044966778023, "text": "U weird asf", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:07:13", "owner": "ieatbricks13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17909659197251012, "text": "I’m right next to the trash room and laundry room so if I’m making a quick stop then I usually leave it unlocked but only bc my door is in eye sight", "created_at": "2025-10-22T00:43:39", "owner": "cat.chesh", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18315088123217143, "text": "So that's what u were doing thought someone went crazy", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:03:31", "owner": "jyc_sp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851031442534157, "text": "Im glad college hasn’t changed u that much (ur still a stalker)", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:48:36", "owner": "averyc_geary", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094521562805360, "text": "@nona_32322 this seems very stalkerish…", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:40:59", "owner": "aerawyn.a.t17", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["college", "dorm", "dormlife", "freshman", "fyp"]},
{"media_id": 3769255760128422773, "shortcode": "DRPFiS6DLN1", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRPFiS6DLN1/", "taken_at": "2025-11-19T11:05:23", "caption": "", "owner_username": "no.context.brits", "owner_id": "48908538551", "likes": 2242, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0019_DRPFiS6DLN1\\DRPFiS6DLN1_20251119_110523.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18159526600399866, "text": "My Husband spent nearly 2 hours on an ambulance waiting to go into QMC Paramedics were amazing unlike the staff once we got into the Hospital!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:48:52", "owner": "michelle_gowler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072232790058380, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:55:03", "owner": "jamespass47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979910943943273, "text": "My mate was treated for a stroke then spent the night in the ambulance as all the wards, beds and corridors were full. Whiston hospital 😖", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:48:12", "owner": "the_girl_with_green_fingers_", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18090799615926238, "text": "❤️🚓💙", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:46:10", "owner": "999.police.cars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111931660587366, "text": "There all left in corridors 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:34:54", "owner": "davidhughes7186", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17876948583349795, "text": "Lie", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:41:45", "owner": "davidmatthews943", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918318763217480, "text": "LMAO", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:48:11", "owner": "pilotgaz80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881507767421736, "text": "You sure about that 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:38:35", "owner": "dan.slatter", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17973253856951387, "text": "Not true 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:04:08", "owner": "lovelollylou", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18380398339197907, "text": "Not so sure that's the case any longer.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:59:23", "owner": "n26ten_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17854990443577019, "text": "Are you sure?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:17:18", "owner": "paulgh555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108838516612259, "text": "It's Panto Time 'oh yes they are'", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:47:03", "owner": "igl_7171", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394493548131017, "text": "It's in this vehicle, not on. Graffiti artists, what are they like?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:33:18", "owner": "mcmartface8", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18075891824191239, "text": "They kidding? We all know the NHS has been pushed to the brink & our patients are indeed left in ambulances outside A&E all night. Just some good old British Politics.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:08:52", "owner": "el.finners", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18185368099354110, "text": "If only it was true…😜", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:00:07", "owner": "gwphoto1066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848548552582046, "text": "Dont believe it", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:00:15", "owner": "jrbt1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903921769164175, "text": "But can you be really sure?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:07:37", "owner": "fred_scratchet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091942438934260, "text": "Better to have said “no patient carried in this ambulance will be bankrupted by cost of care “", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:12:06", "owner": "treacle_dinosaur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932818150000754, "text": "Yep, some slight truth in the humour.\nWon’t complain as I’ve only ever had excellent service when I’ve needed it.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:43:10", "owner": "chris_in_chessington_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866420131434728, "text": "There could be patients in the ambulance though the way the NHS has gone to the dogs", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:31:31", "owner": "christopher_thompson1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538311322016518, "text": "People aren’t considering that this message is meant for the paramedics to tell them not to do this. Which is even more alarming, when you think about it.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:45:56", "owner": "sanabuttniazi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18201438670319568, "text": "Except on days with a y in them? Based on current  A&E waiting times! 🙄🙄😠", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:10:11", "owner": "matt409157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992081952879596, "text": "Obviously it’s not from our local hospital. People regularly spend the night in ambulances", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:33:36", "owner": "hughmarcus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046811840446362, "text": "Theft deterrence", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:11:20", "owner": "jrhulettlandscapes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897487453203738, "text": "No organs*", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:35:31", "owner": "draconianreptilian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094850749694593, "text": "Used to be an ambulance, now they are extentions for A&E", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:24", "owner": "follow.dohboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946061394940223, "text": "*IN", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:51:21", "owner": "bendavy1976", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18028913564559456, "text": "Not true", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:46:32", "owner": "the_girl_with_green_fingers_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105108241634228, "text": "More lies", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:17:49", "owner": "froggysaint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120052129485358, "text": "Well they won't be  ambulances, and hospitals in heaven and no government and council.....", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:18:01", "owner": "ke.rri9083", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888041875390478, "text": "Would be funny but a bit too near the truth!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:20:23", "owner": "johnholmes1815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854405182529229, "text": "Fs 🤦‍♂️ just as I was about to…", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:15:38", "owner": "growlimitless_108", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157903099366175, "text": "IN, no patients left IN this vehicle, if you're putting them on the vehicle I don't wonder they need a hospital", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:09:43", "owner": "peter.king.927980", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990684387730371, "text": "Possibly untrue nowadays", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:26:33", "owner": "firkinbill", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18303770047265839, "text": "Init", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:34:24", "owner": "robertburns832", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3739330871645338255, "shortcode": "DPkxZ2uEnqP", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPkxZ2uEnqP/", "taken_at": "2025-10-09T04:11:31", "caption": "台中走在路上鞋底會卡彈\n-\n.\n.\n.\n#音樂 #西洋音樂 #音樂分享 #流行音樂 #饒舌 #樂團 #歌手 #短影片 #短片 #推薦音樂 #中英翻譯 #歌詞 #排行榜 #告示牌 #情歌 #好聽 #歌單 #日文歌 #好歌分享 #rap", "owner_username": "addictiveplaying.zz", "owner_id": "65644534082", "likes": 17967, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0020_DPkxZ2uEnqP\\DPkxZ2uEnqP_20251009_041131.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18078453133854236, "text": "台中日常還真的是這樣😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:26:55", "owner": "angels_.2010", "likes": 301}, {"id": 18534049411020969, "text": "求歌名", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:27:20", "owner": "thomas__4fatman", "likes": 63}, {"id": 18061207016424779, "text": "防彈玻璃是標配", "created_at": "2025-10-09T14:52:22", "owner": "cca_0222_", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18084612175991692, "text": "請問 領槍的號碼牌從這邊開始排嗎？😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:28:53", "owner": "dola1031", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069124997260325, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:46:26", "owner": "c_n_y_rx7_fd3s", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18043913615430831, "text": "我還真的有Glock（沒", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:11:38", "owner": "hank_liang.0523", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843963214606580, "text": "別說了自從我搬上台中，半夜或平常不是警車就是救護車還有一次半夜聽到槍聲的", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:43:52", "owner": "yukaioxo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536346868024634, "text": "在台中出門帶個戰術裝備很正常吧", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:13:26", "owner": "ykx._.1221", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073762916272793, "text": "克拉克之歌", "created_at": "2025-10-10T01:16:03", "owner": "hwang7618wtaps", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062256713624457, "text": "台中人槍是都不用錢的嗎 感覺人手一把", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:57:45", "owner": "roselun_12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18152735380400577, "text": "說什麼呢\n我們都是隨地拾起🫴路邊的子彈跟槍比路邊的零錢還要多", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:10:43", "owner": "ahlong_cosplay", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18081781177802148, "text": "台中9mm幼幼台-克拉克葛格、瞄準鏡姐姐", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:34:41", "owner": "caesar09999", "likes": 60}, {"id": 18091914097828674, "text": "台中新兒歌by 克拉克葛格", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:33:07", "owner": "caesar09999", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18022127423785457, "text": "我們一起去走台中市  如果走完鞋底沒有彈殼你裸奔台灣大道三段", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:45:30", "owner": "hajia_wei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084195230017816, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:04:40", "owner": "chillchill_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052555319659402, "text": "嶺東那邊常常開槍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:29:10", "owner": "rongez_lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080790104127098, "text": "這是真的 我現在鞋底卡了顆子彈拔不出來", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:23:09", "owner": "kuanhsuanchou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414671173143325, "text": "所以那邊也是按下F進入載具嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:13:15", "owner": "s.isng209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031593794749522, "text": "true", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:57:55", "owner": "eer11c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107771608716222, "text": "不要侮辱台中可以嗎？  什麼時後只拿手槍了 不帶把Ak47都怕被人打", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:09:33", "owner": "mbt_m1a2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058762976257112, "text": "還蠻好聽的😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:32:03", "owner": "wu_yi_man_526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003879992815361, "text": "台中晚上山上很多😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T06:58:35", "owner": "koom._.kome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120408679515595, "text": "Bro", "created_at": "2025-10-17T21:08:26", "owner": "sigmaboy64610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326495596240832, "text": "Ja morant be like", "created_at": "2025-10-16T16:21:43", "owner": "jyw_0418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077496158035100, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:14:55", "owner": "ever___changing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940617178073547, "text": "@et.han9036", "created_at": "2025-10-13T17:09:49", "owner": "abula10.26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101410453621103, "text": "my nigga 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:44:45", "owner": "777.7777vii", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["音樂", "西洋音樂", "音樂分享", "流行音樂", "饒舌", "樂團", "歌手", "短影片", "短片", "推薦音樂", "中英翻譯", "歌詞", "排行榜", "告示牌", "情歌", "好聽", "歌單", "日文歌", "好歌分享", "rap"]},
{"media_id": 3686372013728362800, "shortcode": "DMon9C0OHEw", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMon9C0OHEw/", "taken_at": "2025-07-28T02:30:15", "caption": "史蒂夫是有什麼問題啦🤨🤌🏻\n\ncredit: Me, You and Steve by Garfunkel and Oates\n\n#翻譯 #garfunkelandoates #yourfriendsteve #steve #memes #迷因 #迷因翻譯 #迷因歌曲 #歌詞翻譯 #英文翻譯 #funnyvideos #funny #好笑影片 #好笑 #有趣 #有趣影片", "owner_username": "renayu_3i3", "owner_id": "67312246722", "likes": 178013, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0021_DMon9C0OHEw\\DMon9C0OHEw_20250728_023015.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17872168533401999, "text": "她們是原唱嗎？ 還是最原始唱的另有其人啊？ 她們兩個很好笑誒", "created_at": "2025-07-28T14:09:01", "owner": "double_pthw", "likes": 8338}, {"id": 18086112490826321, "text": "好好笑 竟然是真實事件🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-28T04:18:20", "owner": "xinbt_0108", "likes": 15415}, {"id": 18032580170670679, "text": "她們都有出現在big bang theory裡！", "created_at": "2025-07-28T08:27:16", "owner": "hannnnahmiao", "likes": 2333}, {"id": 17871868671308847, "text": "學了新單字fellate (還以為是隱晦的詞彙，殊不知翻譯比原字還委婉😂）", "created_at": "2025-07-29T06:18:43", "owner": "jo30320", "likes": 2533}, {"id": 18041062463659980, "text": "他們會兩人是咬牙唱的耶🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-28T14:16:17", "owner": "fan_xuan_970927", "likes": 6509}, {"id": 18052480025161322, "text": "好愛“How's it going.”的尷尬語調😍", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:20:49", "owner": "amberrias_", "likes": 1572}, {"id": 18046226699277473, "text": "難怪覺得那麼眼熟 原來右邊是TBBT裡面超愛Sheldon的研究生", "created_at": "2025-07-28T14:42:51", "owner": "vickyywu__", "likes": 371}, {"id": 18064441007178008, "text": "Steve:是我先看到的！", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:53:52", "owner": "vo_l_l_ov", "likes": 567}, {"id": 18009727727783481, "text": "終於知道這首史蒂夫之歌的正確名稱了😂", "created_at": "2025-07-29T12:13:37", "owner": "aa59047799", "likes": 444}, {"id": 18084154078687389, "text": "某一任男友在因為彼此距離和時間的問題，我們很難得可以見上一面，結果每次約會都帶我去找他朋友😀😀😀然後他們在聊天我看起來像史蒂夫😍😍，到底誰才是史蒂夫！！！！！", "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:45:21", "owner": "penny_umi0", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18043924232641842, "text": "他到底是不是已經被史蒂夫掰彎😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T17:32:30", "owner": "avrilaven", "likes": 154}, {"id": 18186213031340506, "text": "讓raj 能和女生說話的人，還有讓Amy成功結婚的人🤤", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:50:11", "owner": "denkakeke", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18160995103371738, "text": "@pihi0701 怎麼都沒人留言說右邊的是演星期三的諮商師的", "created_at": "2025-08-06T17:59:23", "owner": "ty.annnx", "likes": 71}, {"id": 18469273273073363, "text": "靠北現在才知道歌詞這麼搞", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:44:25", "owner": "fkstmd", "likes": 1041}, {"id": 17893568925328910, "text": "這兩位是不是演員？左邊的很紅😍", "created_at": "2025-09-17T08:15:37", "owner": "vilian_ice", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18059056802392136, "text": "@squid_0207 為什麼要按讚", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:44:05", "owner": "_chen._73", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18491016496068480, "text": "說不定史蒂夫說要去妳男友才願意出門的", "created_at": "2025-08-07T09:32:08", "owner": "wasi7ru", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18306708223217548, "text": "男友可能想要「一夫一妻制」😂", "created_at": "2025-08-01T06:55:59", "owner": "cloud.shar", "likes": 276}, {"id": 18046561649273357, "text": "他是給吧", "created_at": "2025-07-28T07:07:23", "owner": "a_saltyfish_oui", "likes": 170}, {"id": 18280989670282454, "text": "fun fact: 這兩位都是the bigbang theory裡的常設角色，左邊那位飾演lucy，rajesh在漫展上碰到的女生，date了一陣子對陌生人有強烈的社交恐懼，右邊那位飾演仰慕Sheldon的天體物理學家，Ramona Nowitzki，後面親吻Sheldon促使他決定跟army求婚", "created_at": "2025-08-10T07:49:15", "owner": "rubio_raw", "likes": 137}, {"id": 17901897600313269, "text": "他們唱的咬牙切齒www", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:12:56", "owner": "0807._.fox", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18111675739533351, "text": "憑實力刷到原唱", "created_at": "2025-08-22T05:40:13", "owner": "mashulalala_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17944695020897201, "text": "@ck_thats_me wa yuanlai got full version one 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T12:37:28", "owner": "samuell_0628", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064426447965615, "text": "害沒辦法因為史蒂夫想要吃狗糧", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:22:30", "owner": "agoni_998_", "likes": 35}, {"id": 17937602343058978, "text": "今晚要不要刮毛好好笑", "created_at": "2025-07-28T06:45:26", "owner": "99happy.9", "likes": 506}, {"id": 18081228770110579, "text": "Steve ：明明是我先來的😔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:58:29", "owner": "mht.huang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106868779583906, "text": "damn這兩個演員都很有名欸原來這是她們樂團的歌🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:27:00", "owner": "imjustfluffyyy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074865761071974, "text": "竟然是原唱😍", "created_at": "2025-08-06T16:45:22", "owner": "rei_fukurou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18345376843201333, "text": "Btw, maybe more people online here love Steve story😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:58:00", "owner": "yserng99", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846072655537945, "text": "@ab__.2210 史蒂夫走了啦！", "created_at": "2025-07-31T16:00:36", "owner": "eelin.0203", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881056273244658, "text": "我不喜歡自己出現在這首音樂裡", "created_at": "2025-07-28T17:08:47", "owner": "alex_lin.1230", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18076907701749358, "text": "@juiiuoo1111 我是steve 你女友問你要花多少時間在我身上", "created_at": "2025-07-30T02:17:02", "owner": "andy920319_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17979888749928762, "text": "咬牙切齒的在唱www", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:16:50", "owner": "gen521326", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086315014906141, "text": "有沒有一種可能你才是Steve\n🤭🤭", "created_at": "2025-10-07T12:58:39", "owner": "zhuopinrui", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18076117114797912, "text": "所以故事是對象在約會的時候總是喜歡帶自己的兄弟嗎😂", "created_at": "2025-08-17T15:55:26", "owner": "violet_fdcia9826", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18047619311542313, "text": "Steve正在錄影", "created_at": "2025-07-29T07:16:56", "owner": "garry_0516", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18037838150495932, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:38:38", "owner": "i_love_mickey_0331", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967140270967982, "text": "壞事做盡史蒂夫", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:41:34", "owner": "kikior_pp3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18519511609025345, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-28T14:23:17", "owner": "chiangtw_", "likes": 56}, {"id": 17902057071282379, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-07T13:14:09", "owner": "mr._delirium", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921932644115842, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T11:49:17", "owner": "daniel_cember", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17977510307922407, "text": "@lsm0417  那天samatan說的Steve就是他", "created_at": "2025-10-07T08:02:41", "owner": "yymtyt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18383519659133417, "text": "她們好棒", "created_at": "2025-09-16T08:36:04", "owner": "linuschung0625", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18317026849208003, "text": "不想相信這已經是16年前的歌", "created_at": "2025-09-18T00:24:22", "owner": "maggiew.m.m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066028403270420, "text": "晦澀難懂，逐漸清晰，大徹大悟", "created_at": "2025-08-17T21:48:35", "owner": "bata._.0413", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901221268127592, "text": "可能史蒂夫是金主🤑", "created_at": "2025-09-01T01:39:24", "owner": "ksfm32", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070939718123196, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-16T14:01:43", "owner": "syut.cha_guy.fun", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17938893204058078, "text": "@178ootd", "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:34:59", "owner": "xxzongjiexx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087975739739515, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-05T14:28:51", "owner": "jinsh._.1024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869256637328793, "text": "經典一生推", "created_at": "2025-07-29T00:59:09", "owner": "lolipopipusavvvy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18053384516166600, "text": "@tmxlvmdla 😢", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:46:23", "owner": "eca_._l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393159763139191, "text": "原来她们唱的Steve就是Raj", "created_at": "2025-07-31T01:45:48", "owner": "raviolimsy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18162692755364265, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-03T03:00:33", "owner": "jimmywyt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055380203452855, "text": "Steve還在 但你已經離開了", "created_at": "2025-07-31T01:52:01", "owner": "nig_akkuma", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070781111090486, "text": "@andy._.0929", "created_at": "2025-08-01T04:31:45", "owner": "scr_noob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037051385404958, "text": "Steve is a great friend. Historians will say they were roommates...but we all know the truth don't we? .... Steve ❤️", "created_at": "2025-07-29T12:02:33", "owner": "_charlie_contino_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18340270186162832, "text": "其實很好聽😂", "created_at": "2025-07-31T07:59:02", "owner": "zhangmiqi56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071486423109600, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-31T11:02:16", "owner": "sushi0830", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17871992475307245, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-29T13:46:45", "owner": "maxhoyo10", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055812230376816, "text": "咬牙切齿不像假的", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:53:48", "owner": "wen__5211", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18070498732871764, "text": "@jiawei.0728 笑死steve原版诶", "created_at": "2025-07-29T18:18:42", "owner": "xiaowei0130", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856659181471281, "text": "@mimiballball Steve 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-29T14:42:01", "owner": "oh_my_god_401", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081065416722143, "text": "@s_cheng_yu", "created_at": "2025-07-29T15:57:36", "owner": "ohily_09_23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094042009724351, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-28T14:55:49", "owner": "__zoooe_682868__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18299275753219997, "text": "在唱史蒂夫的時候，是真的有咬牙切齒的小猙獰😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-28T05:32:44", "owner": "akmoc2000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967111470928754, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-29T00:34:40", "owner": "itsemmakawa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18312825154215986, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-29T04:49:10", "owner": "lonely_and_free", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865079860430190, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-07-28T14:35:54", "owner": "ms027851300", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877574941376492, "text": "@happyguitarrrr_xn 🤏🏼沒事我陪你", "created_at": "2025-07-28T16:00:36", "owner": "cms_0818", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954040039023969, "text": "金髮的是星期三第一季的心理醫生！", "created_at": "2025-12-21T08:45:44", "owner": "038_light", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058323575309859, "text": "欸不是所以她還幫史蒂夫一起吹喇？", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:12:07", "owner": "brison1028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857079571525865, "text": "通常滑到基本都是 Steve", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:09:14", "owner": "cloud___0215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411582397140925, "text": "所以原來是有兩個steve", "created_at": "2025-12-17T16:12:56", "owner": "ashy_yiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077597087336912, "text": "@zfdy._95  dudududu", "created_at": "2025-12-17T13:17:54", "owner": "tbf_1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194961760334572, "text": "@cheng_yu_yang_  steve", "created_at": "2025-12-17T13:17:27", "owner": "tbf_1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855995377581268, "text": "我也是拼實力刷到原唱的人了", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:44:34", "owner": "qup6yk6jo6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084997613037073, "text": "只有我覺得她們越唱越快嗎😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:24:49", "owner": "miaoxiaohei0311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433237807107879, "text": "Do 🥳do 🥳do 🥳do🥳 do 🥳do 🥳do 🥳Steve😡", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:43:40", "owner": "shuochen_guo23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001855505832105, "text": "哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:29:02", "owner": "kchihsheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100459717701129, "text": "她男友會不會雙性戀？", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:22:39", "owner": "willwang85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110106724541067, "text": "終於找到原唱了？", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:05:23", "owner": "huang.g.you.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076688161982493, "text": "@jiaguey2001", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:50:29", "owner": "benson.__.2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143124979443714, "text": "右边看着也同样眼熟…是不是也演过生活大爆炸啊…", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:04:58", "owner": "yuuor_ange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385055995194157, "text": "左边那位看着好眼熟 是演过生活大爆炸吗", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:04:18", "owner": "yuuor_ange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997494201854691, "text": "作為一個史蒂夫兄弟要哭時是我，要搬家是我，送醫院是我，我二十年前從國小到畢業都混在一起的還是我。所以我也好奇你是誰😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:17:35", "owner": "thomashua0408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054273179331700, "text": "左邊那位是女演員，有演過「宅男行不行」", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:29:55", "owner": "chu399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066475034125499, "text": "我覺得史蒂夫應該是暗戀她男朋友，才會一直出來當電燈泡吧", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:52:47", "owner": "hyde_1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061694540627409, "text": "沒想到這個故事完整版這麼鬧，Steve感覺是跟到天涯海角😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:55:45", "owner": "lilymoonpig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957463992888152, "text": "Plot twist: Steve was all an imaginary person in her head", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:05:46", "owner": "eddie0tic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074279318017884, "text": "Steve再次感受到了世界的惡意xD", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:02:38", "owner": "jung_jjai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113608870603307, "text": "這首歌太棒了", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:21:49", "owner": "timrobbinslu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543696574022905, "text": "那个金发女孩的样子很熟悉，感觉在哪视频上出现过", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:11:55", "owner": "hazel_nut0913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100970818684769, "text": "看來史蒂芬說不定才是正宮", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:07:40", "owner": "marucat2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105495046646594, "text": "做Steve無錯，係你搶走我兄弟😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:42:53", "owner": "isaacyiu_lkyss41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082691108088636, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:31:49", "owner": "evets_liao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879328336425867, "text": "史蒂夫才是真愛", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:58:59", "owner": "aturn0410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865924015503797, "text": "第一次知道原唱", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:17:59", "owner": "hermann_li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896575666201528, "text": "終於聽到原唱了", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:33:16", "owner": "stansouthparkids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409295665143934, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:11:11", "owner": "lalaline0314_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118701634547785, "text": "終於找到原版了🤓,@leejingjing2021 🤓", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:17:08", "owner": "g1090195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882511843410711, "text": "這樣看他們兩個很像偽人😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:50:07", "owner": "sea.usagi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085214477057188, "text": "前兩個音跑出來還以為豆豆先生要開門了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:34:31", "owner": "yaoting783", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067715009340474, "text": "Sorry but he is a good person😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:14:46", "owner": "tinayzu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936704172965383, "text": "哇喔～zoe 的頭貼～", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:36:09", "owner": "tropical0fish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080212115011244, "text": "哈哈在講我嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:49:24", "owner": "iou_8106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308849968221553, "text": "@stephen_sean._.14 有沒有聽到，滾開", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:16:52", "owner": "milly611._.116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066094418589325, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T08:11:02", "owner": "tag_yoir_bestie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082307872959087, "text": "Ramona Thornes and Raj’s girlfriend @eldritcheldrin", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:45:07", "owner": "ayaoriola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046410458655288, "text": "我史蒂夫我驕傲", "created_at": "2025-10-07T15:33:07", "owner": "shiroi_uwu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844815880573004, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:54:39", "owner": "kristinnnn4710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057282215397587, "text": "@kokorogaoreru", "created_at": "2025-09-20T05:14:43", "owner": "chen_891101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023765102544156, "text": "每一句Steve都咬牙發音😂", "created_at": "2025-09-18T00:51:50", "owner": "iris.xin.li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162144517335310, "text": "找我？", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:04:20", "owner": "steve__huang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006574436628613, "text": "@chak_heiii u know there’s a Steve 阻住我地相愛", "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:59:08", "owner": "wil._y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365035585149285, "text": "Steve成功掰彎了嗎😍", "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:31:16", "owner": "ttalgi_bl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296050072301788, "text": "我就是Steve", "created_at": "2025-08-28T08:17:18", "owner": "221.aiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083435920907777, "text": "學到了一個單字 fell什麼的", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:38:37", "owner": "eddie_is_on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061640453201456, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-19T08:20:46", "owner": "doublefish.0302", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17846764893528828, "text": "", "created_a