": "2025-08-02T19:09:50", "owner": "nine99ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413375455104928, "text": "Big bang theory", "created_at": "2025-08-02T09:33:37", "owner": "h.i_09.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18489340072069419, "text": "maybe you are just another person that he wants to include in his and steve's relationship", "created_at": "2025-08-02T07:22:10", "owner": "will799", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064941805971253, "text": "steve好慘😢", "created_at": "2025-08-02T02:26:38", "owner": "yhy.0410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933558466065525, "text": "@hahahahahahappy_ 好可憐一男的steve", "created_at": "2025-08-01T21:10:55", "owner": "maimidangkala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022324355721033, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-01T17:07:31", "owner": "terry14657", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521540740007295, "text": "@wilyspak", "created_at": "2025-08-01T11:07:08", "owner": "junkuizhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023754929520525, "text": "@72._kay 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-31T11:44:20", "owner": "r_rain1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891628942295957, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T05:53:57", "owner": "landiaqxing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022989503713408, "text": "史蒂夫還會睡公園", "created_at": "2025-07-29T16:12:33", "owner": "tianenlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871983742311478, "text": "唱歌的人是不是也有唱一首從後面來的歌啊🤔", "created_at": "2025-07-29T14:47:02", "owner": "anntheotter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074832394971854, "text": "是Raj的女友欸欸欸！", "created_at": "2025-07-29T09:01:23", "owner": "koorishin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059803892358857, "text": "許了一千個消失的願望", "created_at": "2025-07-29T08:50:25", "owner": "leavekk111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983581548849192, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-29T07:25:02", "owner": "leonardokmg", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18098037682608357, "text": "@jonathanmai_0113 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-28T17:00:41", "owner": "cathy__liou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927278746093183, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-28T14:32:39", "owner": "sjk._0312", "likes": 85}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["翻譯", "garfunkelandoates", "yourfriendsteve", "steve", "memes", "迷因", "迷因翻譯", "迷因歌曲", "歌詞翻譯", "英文翻譯", "funnyvideos", "funny", "好笑影片", "好笑", "有趣", "有趣影片"]},
{"media_id": 3751894336461040538, "shortcode": "DQRaAVHj2ua", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQRaAVHj2ua/", "taken_at": "2025-10-26T12:11:39", "caption": "这个前台小姐姐一看就知道是见识过大风大浪的人 #整蛊 #犯贱 #酒店 #夫妻日常", "owner_username": "tianmickytian", "owner_id": "69008922603", "likes": 73031, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0022_DQRaAVHj2ua\\DQRaAVHj2ua_20251026_121139.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17843271450602401, "text": "櫃檯的普通話很好聽", "created_at": "2025-10-26T13:15:23", "owner": "boyfeeling804", "likes": 2361}, {"id": 17937713345963549, "text": "前台：啊！先生咁上次同你一齊來登記的那位是你太太。", "created_at": "2025-10-27T09:24:12", "owner": "coratsung", "likes": 1957}, {"id": 18361584130092922, "text": "恭喜你們，成功讓一個可愛的櫃檯傻住了😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:02:04", "owner": "fivecolorman", "likes": 114}, {"id": 18114404716567619, "text": "好可愛欸", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:10:07", "owner": "ryan_licheng", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18087188482920759, "text": "試過同老公行商場，忽然之間佢問我~附近會唔會撞到熟人？我即刻幫佢接😂我話：你老婆今日唔係返工咩？我哋兩個喺架lift度，見到個lift門又開又關，但冇人出去😂😂😂個個喺度聽我哋講偷情對話。 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T13:00:48", "owner": "tammy0111", "likes": 1266}, {"id": 18057570644558378, "text": "老婆好靓啊，好似章若楠😍", "created_at": "2025-10-28T13:36:29", "owner": "florencetai1101", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18098029207689550, "text": "咁一個得喇， 前臺呢位小姐絕對係最佳員工😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:35:38", "owner": "hksdc2", "likes": 357}, {"id": 18091397737716366, "text": "不错学到了……每次要训练一下", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:10:48", "owner": "devilscott", "likes": 163}, {"id": 18188131042332502, "text": "本來就只要一個證件😮", "created_at": "2025-10-27T05:16:20", "owner": "aaron_ks_cheng", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18080663813018200, "text": "櫃檯意外吃瓜😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T02:50:36", "owner": "jasonvsjason", "likes": 621}, {"id": 17858716965536904, "text": "好正，妳老公很懂玩，平時已習慣開房😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T15:39:50", "owner": "waiwaiwwwai224", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17950525875029222, "text": "抖音 星星夫妇", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:36:49", "owner": "l__sx", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18158749876396345, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:37:52", "owner": "xhh_hui", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049410677354514, "text": "個前台 好靚 🔥🔥老婆都係🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:21:16", "owner": "o_ohogg", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18066456821591127, "text": "搭𨋢女朋友攬住我同我講，姐夫你唔好咁啦", "created_at": "2025-10-27T12:21:00", "owner": "failure_maker", "likes": 92}, {"id": 17916149211069948, "text": "證明男方經常被這位老婆…查佢手機記錄” 而發晦氣 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T05:11:22", "owner": "szeyuen817", "likes": 63}, {"id": 18071700653596685, "text": "其实咁老公先好 中意开玩笑😝 情绪拉满", "created_at": "2025-11-02T15:52:34", "owner": "linawong2777", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18070245959027681, "text": "有一個這樣玩得的老婆 真是三生有幸", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:32:20", "owner": "tylptl", "likes": 148}, {"id": 18044980412425969, "text": "正，呢個老公好好玩", "created_at": "2025-10-27T09:27:44", "owner": "wingsiusiu", "likes": 102}, {"id": 18417728509117532, "text": "這樣的老公應該處處都是歡樂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T08:01:32", "owner": "daniel_hp1237", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18024771434578760, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:13:14", "owner": "happy2shoot", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18058983818631534, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:44:58", "owner": "linden_way", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17855984697552202, "text": "一间真系有查房记录", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:21:22", "owner": "vwvista", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18051708947370517, "text": "你真係太搞笑", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:45:10", "owner": "wendy8lai", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17959711802859818, "text": "前台好配合啊😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:41:40", "owner": "midhill_kitty", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085036957797639, "text": "有開房紀錄可以查 😮", "created_at": "2025-10-27T02:33:50", "owner": "mingyi_sh", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18063541868156143, "text": "學會了，下次識反擊老婆", "created_at": "2025-11-10T21:37:19", "owner": "kil_ronald", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080629234874080, "text": "我以后也要这样😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:29:39", "owner": "anthonyjrtan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057066515257229, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:58:32", "owner": "anguschen177", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046331960679657, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T19:28:28", "owner": "iam_rryy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109945522595583, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T23:55:27", "owner": "carinalee1105", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18534996820029045, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:46:15", "owner": "h_a_r_r_y_1031", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18418033918118051, "text": "以為好好玩好好笑，櫃台答：係呀小姐，佢上次都係用個女仔登記嘅", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:24:08", "owner": "rayond19a", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048425936378601, "text": "有这样的老公应该跟欢乐", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:31:15", "owner": "sunlitvibe6", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18182150110344266, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T01:22:14", "owner": "vincci_ying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073074158217229, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:23:53", "owner": "lucaschristblessus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076306385324691, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T22:01:27", "owner": "ack0110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086132425972858, "text": "ID @xy614", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:12:33", "owner": "hhyckwcc_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18416034934112792, "text": "隔壁男的一听到大瓜立即开启装忙模式😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:02:51", "owner": "elfy1030", "likes": 154}, {"id": 17947482009048392, "text": "前台小姐姐有点漂亮诶～", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:57:13", "owner": "calvin_czj", "likes": 48}, {"id": 17892149073359923, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T15:09:32", "owner": "fortune_kc6868", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17846108664604660, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T22:16:04", "owner": "zhongshaolam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049324523676704, "text": "慣咗咁講", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:11:26", "owner": "hgjhbbggb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18316579702170822, "text": "全部人都知去美利開房😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:16:44", "owner": "jackytheworst", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17913228054091964, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:17:57", "owner": "suej0123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865589347482128, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T21:49:43", "owner": "chuckles_n_fun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17910391047252257, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T09:52:46", "owner": "julian.s.x.y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961704573995825, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T23:55:00", "owner": "adcd0606", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074787668466571, "text": "@zanhaimujidoua 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:40:53", "owner": "babababaraaaaaaaaaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18181473964351120, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T07:52:57", "owner": "lamb88b", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17909176914250659, "text": "😂😂😂bravo", "created_at": "2025-10-27T10:19:49", "owner": "ronaldwwh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069145754200496, "text": "櫃檯還配合😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:31:39", "owner": "mighty_fei", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18047189366417423, "text": "@ngai.lau 下次我演一下", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:36:38", "owner": "chinnuyoah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921559984177468, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:42:23", "owner": "leig_alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876941581425628, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T14:40:33", "owner": "stephaniehenderson682hup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024419267753932, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:15:16", "owner": "salidbawon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349381081167427, "text": "美利😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:05:03", "owner": "heidi._.haidi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857766145541004, "text": "櫃檯很漂亮", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:33:26", "owner": "fghj0629", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861147400520812, "text": "櫃檯 ： 欸太太跟上次不一樣？", "created_at": "2025-10-28T12:12:13", "owner": "camtel001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132049396471229, "text": "服務人員：沒問題，能快點結帳刷卡環節，誰都可以", "created_at": "2025-10-27T11:13:54", "owner": "craigjouuser08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067033070524424, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T02:49:54", "owner": "jackyjackykh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087480005045715, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-21T05:56:19", "owner": "fank1699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094730681506551, "text": "呢个姐姐账号几多", "created_at": "2025-12-20T08:39:07", "owner": "lamsundi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112382620719786, "text": "老婆咁靚都玩🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:32:44", "owner": "narcissusycc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918925951215802, "text": "女主的账号有吗？", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:54:21", "owner": "haogege1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051520619666601, "text": "谁有这对情侣的账号", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:06:55", "owner": "gaoboyang1204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107717224566593, "text": "真人真事 我老公孖生阿哥同我地咁岩同一個周未Road trip 訂左同一間酒店 事前唔知 係去到check in 個酒店職員瘋狂望佢 佢地個名差一個字咁香港人名係澳洲啲小town又難記到 佢最後忍唔住問我老公今朝係咪黎過😂 我呆左心諗下 跟住佢阿嫂咁岩出story 我先知佢地係度😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T08:44:56", "owner": "angiem1121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847615822618941, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T08:43:33", "owner": "mrkoala0103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922229521192857, "text": "这个视频原账号叫什么", "created_at": "2025-12-14T03:52:02", "owner": "chisunnna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857764903569248, "text": "“合法的合法的”😏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:54:58", "owner": "lance_pon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913008019253140, "text": "I fucking love this shit nicely done❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:26:15", "owner": "mauijay_808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066408131535551, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:41:18", "owner": "qbo8844", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941578047965616, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:52:06", "owner": "hung.wai.336", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052244159379649, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:12:25", "owner": "jeff_goh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058376621311300, "text": "老婆同老公喺商場玩成晚，見到都好好笑，玩玩玩唔好玩出火，今晚你就知🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:40:48", "owner": "jintaole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419972701188201, "text": "@mattisonholiday", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:13:14", "owner": "and_chunyeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067260599401127, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:09:36", "owner": "jack_830312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124262077521268, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:58:10", "owner": "eddy1148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923501569082465, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:56:54", "owner": "banihokkien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165669634376525, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:55:49", "owner": "andyliliandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095889712873023, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:54:14", "owner": "shinjirobert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047052926475596, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:17:30", "owner": "zoey.sssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294387133278668, "text": "仲未離婚？😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:50:22", "owner": "hahaseal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117882565560193, "text": "Five", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:12:14", "owner": "mscarene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853309192546879, "text": "抖音发完 tk 发", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:10:19", "owner": "yewenliye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122392681531445, "text": "She said this is my husband.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:47:55", "owner": "az_238523", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067994366427942, "text": "抖音叫什么名字", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:34:41", "owner": "chung2v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885791620286669, "text": "夫妻間的情趣，未必要花大錢，都能讓彼此更親密！很幽默的老公", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:58:49", "owner": "pelsan.su", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097386427893175, "text": "你老公怕大陸個老婆查開房記錄呀蠢🐷", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:01:50", "owner": "flower_prince520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091461650307044, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:31:59", "owner": "hanocz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142183714456432, "text": "哈哈哈 笑死🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:58:09", "owner": "jasonkee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933214204131023, "text": "He so terrible", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:34:42", "owner": "staceywong08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877557685441224, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:56:53", "owner": "msmeinsonnenschein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180050983363099, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:33:54", "owner": "kmleungart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033733820727199, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:23:43", "owner": "benlau321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065864150614081, "text": "前台最後話：唔緊要，其實潛台詞係：你放心，我哋唔會理😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:28:57", "owner": "kelvinckw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068050022624090, "text": "前台：呢d case日日都見，使乜大驚小怪😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:27:01", "owner": "kelvinckw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099422389773819, "text": "我也會這樣哈哈哈哈，路上突然叫男友姐夫", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:22:05", "owner": "jacqueline.0616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933515515111886, "text": "旁邊的前台先生 嘴角微微笑了🤭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:15:57", "owner": "jessicab1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088712554779755, "text": "有個咁鬼馬老公真係好開心呀！", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:19:56", "owner": "clmiss11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065695553147872, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:36:21", "owner": "jiangjiangd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091366375905287, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:07:01", "owner": "rbc622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054282524653270, "text": "求櫃檯姊姊ig", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:11:06", "owner": "ggininder.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152860846420147, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:40:09", "owner": "jovie160", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126976168519047, "text": "@wongcc1031 見到你😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:36:50", "owner": "henrylinghk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298593727283518, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:44:22", "owner": "hkinsingapore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321959191168650, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:07:17", "owner": "megamike_1223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087415564814538, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:45:13", "owner": "jessy.lee.92372", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982500729945265, "text": "好笑，睇左好幾次", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:12:43", "owner": "netnetlau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104041216675153, "text": "開房記錄怎麼查😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:50:45", "owner": "yes_call