"text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:20:55", "owner": "chanbowen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059369708242559, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T04:36:34", "owner": "haywood.hung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863657881433567, "text": "回鄉證？", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:38:51", "owner": "js_arter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045363359679672, "text": "好幸福的一对", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:15:38", "owner": "samm.mymy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089044861905615, "text": "請問係咪真係可以查到 對方 爆房 紀錄？", "created_at": "2025-11-04T07:32:56", "owner": "lohohun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539807407033479, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:16:01", "owner": "zeroong89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348681559161241, "text": "What happen?", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:33:22", "owner": "saturn2venus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077625311169176, "text": "抖音号是什么", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:27:58", "owner": "anton10ten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101622202660158, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:04:26", "owner": "rlam31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899848966317139, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:16:57", "owner": "faddy_llllkkkkkkkkkkkkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049462997348064, "text": "有日突然唔記得咗", "created_at": "2025-11-03T11:51:36", "owner": "melody_sanrio_love_you_too", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411122764141786, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:36:38", "owner": "samjohn.ckc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097881175705888, "text": "好大舊瓜😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:30:35", "owner": "yutolun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419787160113274, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:02:23", "owner": "ytyplay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046114262680163, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:53:58", "owner": "tw.henry.cc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949190701047025, "text": "有冇咁有趣既女仔", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:31:04", "owner": "yip44660", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924037183172452, "text": "@frantxcy", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:40:42", "owner": "bei_xbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184569142337374, "text": "哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:38:28", "owner": "klj68131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093087988871922, "text": "我學會了！😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:56:29", "owner": "lin_jiaweii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061120805630567, "text": "哈哈 可愛的一對", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:10:22", "owner": "yi.c._chou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427986592110960, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:29:58", "owner": "glenn16ang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953008117034484, "text": "I cannot stop watching it again and again... and still laughing super hard! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T21:50:14", "owner": "chuckles_n_fun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157176580360913, "text": "You guys are hilarious!!😂 You guys are super awesome!!", "created_at": "2025-11-01T21:47:10", "owner": "chuckles_n_fun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065159576455398, "text": "結果店員說先生你上次和xxx小姐還有一筆未結消費", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:55:36", "owner": "lunggor2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102909964654661, "text": "他老婆真的查過，也沒說錯", "created_at": "2025-11-01T13:44:24", "owner": "0_momo_momo_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082379321099355, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:33:44", "owner": "seanhahan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089451019910824, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:27:01", "owner": "chenxiaohua491", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063705668145062, "text": "低能扮幽默，搵過第個寫劇本啦", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:24:26", "owner": "fong.0116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927120202118443, "text": "竟然還有開房紀錄這種東西", "created_at": "2025-11-01T07:30:17", "owner": "sunnysky1215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165188860379332, "text": "😂喂呢個堅好笑", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:22:38", "owner": "panpanpanpan7341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056791964272431, "text": "😍😍😍😂😂😂😂😂\n老公是整人專家喔！", "created_at": "2025-10-31T07:52:23", "owner": "cch7955714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030160949733830, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:48:27", "owner": "kasko61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865744306419357, "text": "他应该常常这样做😂👍", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:43:29", "owne