{"media_id": 3763621634293370086, "shortcode": "DQ7Ee-VCAzm", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQ7Ee-VCAzm/", "taken_at": "2025-11-11T16:38:12", "caption": "follow @meurdavidd", "owner_username": "meurdavidd", "owner_id": "1277729459", "likes": 96147, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0023_DQ7Ee-VCAzm\\DQ7Ee-VCAzm_20251111_163812.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18094762918865405, "text": "You cut the part out where I said my type was my boyfriend 🥲🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:53:10", "owner": "laurennrussell._", "likes": 2136}, {"id": 18090358009902145, "text": "Bro kinda hit jackpot", "created_at": "2025-11-12T22:15:25", "owner": "sebastian_von_kingsley", "likes": 11870}, {"id": 18077653706172980, "text": "Future single mum", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:45:15", "owner": "lord_homzy__", "likes": 8272}, {"id": 18058642286265398, "text": "Weird questions that were totally out of place.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:18:26", "owner": "msmoveonup", "likes": 5392}, {"id": 18082258451075091, "text": "questions were a bit weird in this one :/", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:00:15", "owner": "ci4rao", "likes": 6882}, {"id": 17916586848218944, "text": "This was wildly inappropriate and such red flag questions to ask women who allowed you into their home.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:44:52", "owner": "coratexplorer", "likes": 590}, {"id": 18080437721137019, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:53:55", "owner": "sloweredfn2", "likes": 782}, {"id": 18065512007530315, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:48:00", "owner": "war_axe35", "likes": 4053}, {"id": 17868879600397380, "text": "Video became useless when she said black guys 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:18:08", "owner": "anghelache.s", "likes": 1223}, {"id": 18063619190148200, "text": "You’re not white or black so why ask these questions? Unfollowed now", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:52:01", "owner": "winter_bloom34", "likes": 342}, {"id": 18083037641041692, "text": "Why did you ask that, I'll unfollow now.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:23:13", "owner": "elizabethjewellerydesigner", "likes": 975}, {"id": 17904992721302596, "text": "They speak \"English\"❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:40:19", "owner": "tchoupi_will", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17897472792340332, "text": "House full of future single mums right there", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:30:48", "owner": "monke__0.0", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17937256737099706, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:15:50", "owner": "d2.mcr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18153635110421902, "text": "mudshark", "created_at": "2025-12-19T16:16:45", "owner": "jnhg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872761648372685, "text": "Strange one....showed your true colours there", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:26:29", "owner": "wilsonneil1888", "likes": 143}, {"id": 18066417764398770, "text": "Lucky man", "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:32:03", "owner": "tibi_tutti.fresh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092309575821935, "text": "Cooked generation", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:30:15", "owner": "s.mario.89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058453133279018, "text": "Future single moms who are looking for a faithful husband", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:10:31", "owner": "andmudrov", "likes": 35}, {"id": 17987998277874727, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T09:52:53", "owner": "salmanmansour7", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17981791568940346, "text": "Dat baddie omg", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:05:09", "owner": "1raul.sww", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18141284464393291, "text": "realising you can’t pop to tesco for a pint of milk anymore<", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:10:25", "owner": "elsahares", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18057258554638889, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:44:33", "owner": "sir00maha", "likes": 2520}, {"id": 17875001526378003, "text": "Ce noroc are românul", "created_at": "2025-12-14T19:50:30", "owner": "12.gerry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362323165088564, "text": "Hit the jackpot 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T08:01:14", "owner": "bfordtheo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099166972793473, "text": "3 for a 100 was brought that night", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:54:08", "owner": "youngcourts", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18092048270504257, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:33:03", "owner": "7nxat", "likes": 151}, {"id": 18111382207590775, "text": "“Do you like black or white guys” question as soon as you walked in the house was wild", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:10:06", "owner": "elltortel", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18067883384575110, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:06:15", "owner": "no_longer_posting_2323", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18066471140403425, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:40:03", "owner": "bryan214smile", "likes": 156}, {"id": 18097610632815462, "text": "Made laugh", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:06:58", "owner": "adrian.efta_7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087885547993665, "text": "Did I heard financially stabled?", "created_at": "2025-12-20T20:53:49", "owner": "ba.kryvec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424973200119691, "text": "I usually skip this part btw", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:14:55", "owner": "privv.0mar_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907943503128323, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:51:17", "owner": "omuletul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056558981288027, "text": "This is really weird. Going into a uni house of just girls and asking stranger questions.", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:41:11", "owner": "_georgoo_", "likes": 617}, {"id": 18106712245641127, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T00:05:49", "owner": "von_ryan24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18545291956053223, "text": "Foursome", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:35:56", "owner": "vihanrok", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056172890307395, "text": "And a weird advert at the end too 🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-13T05:16:29", "owner": "adam35j", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18076714409273409, "text": "What's with the obsession about girls' preferences? Liking black guys doesn't make someone promiscuous, it just means she's got good taste.", "created_at": "2025-11-12T21:16:33", "owner": "racine.mars", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17911634823266917, "text": "Ce face bro in Anglia", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:26:06", "owner": "rubenbujdei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888213829271648, "text": "Lost interest after she said black guys", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:46:39", "owner": "yian.nis777", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18340587472224165, "text": "Could u take me😁", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:42:47", "owner": "gab_df__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077877769900922, "text": "They are looking forward to a lift of being a ran through single mum to mutilple baby daddy's", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:28:05", "owner": "mrbud82", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18349711642166737, "text": "They are all for the streets", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:49:13", "owner": "dan121212213", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063117968561935, "text": "@jayden._.ne", "created_at": "2025-12-15T15:15:44", "owner": "joebark.ne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085479178823758, "text": "What’s that girls @ in the brown leggings please anyone??", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:13:27", "owner": "thatlowkeyguy25", "likes": 72}, {"id": 17942291601085813, "text": "Yo David where’s the @", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:07:23", "owner": "s1zz365", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092177113724687, "text": "Let him cook", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:40:39", "owner": "7teendemxns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941499417965889, "text": "My mans clutching the 1v3", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:44:21", "owner": "aggelos_fasoulis", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18056911022290880, "text": "That looks absolutely abysmal", "created_at": "2025-11-12T05:55:50", "owner": "thismum_lovesgolf", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17900792670305971, "text": "So white British girls like BBC....", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:10:42", "owner": "dimitri.scoarta95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144380629454058, "text": "Come to Peterborough to try Moroccan food", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:35:19", "owner": "youssefking2009", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076446407187251, "text": "Look at all the women in the comments getting mad and saying \"unfollowed\". Makes me laugh", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:42:03", "owner": "thejacobberry", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18100019371736042, "text": "£5 meal 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:30:30", "owner": "ivan_kuntae", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18023458205780154, "text": "That dinner was worth about 4.99…should’ve asked for a refund", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:07:32", "owner": "jake_elcapo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18027174926581393, "text": "This is my favourite video so far @ Meridavidd😂🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:10:50", "owner": "leon10094", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894997465220419, "text": "His name is Daiiiivi", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:46:39", "owner": "inshal_haider_3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915296260217853, "text": "Le faci un cui și futi toată seara", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:50:39", "owner": "madz.m8", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17853426897572265, "text": "Male Karen please", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:23:45", "owner": "lungoo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18417482215186971, "text": "All are OF creator", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:55:15", "owner": "aayussshi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074797904337443, "text": "Pleasant fun girls", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:44:54", "owner": "sonia_washpam", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18079658114170621, "text": "Christmas night would be a whole other thing dude, make sure to dont miss it", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:02:29", "owner": "yacine_sa__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064861259114293, "text": "Mud 🦈 .. she likes the dark side of the 🌚. Night Rider..😂😂 💯 👋🏾 Her Dad is siiick, if she has one..😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:57:57", "owner": "keemfromqueenz5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083593745092033, "text": "That meal was like tops £5,- massive profit!😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-12T22:54:33", "owner": "bartisito", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872919037375992, "text": "BCC lovers cave))", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:35:10", "owner": "halkern747", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846151471604806, "text": "Donnie Yen Jr is winning in these UK baddie streets.😊😊😁😁", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:15:30", "owner": "tahaline4400", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17982718862761727, "text": "Damn ok😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T06:21:35", "owner": "b.bonks.__", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17898302289184654, "text": "Okay so go into a house of uni age women as a grown ass man talking about boys are we a real human", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:05:01", "owner": "hibbert.rhys", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17986592816914379, "text": "Wtf is that question ? Some dudes only have bbc in their mind", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:55:58", "owner": "wooisash", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18302564491270660, "text": "AWHHHH", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:13:39", "owner": "justt.sxd1_2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18532926229012962, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:37:48", "owner": "baeaf6ix", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18099918451676892, "text": "That’s girls voice just reminds me of any uni student anywhere in the world ever", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:11:05", "owner": "tomfri2", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17927457660154903, "text": "Why’s everyone talking about “weird” questions? I think they are alright. They are all centered around dating thing, but nothing weird or inappropriate. These girls are not that good though: they drink and talk abt some weird preferences in partners", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:42:31", "owner": "nuvinix_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18115517503585727, "text": "As a black guy I’m here take me now 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:08:02", "owner": "king_comeback", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085935512058852, "text": "i love her akcent", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:18:06", "owner": "crk_brgd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17977499804938867, "text": "That British accent 🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:49:03", "owner": "rio_mix_1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17905402947292070, "text": "I liked this video when they all said “blackkkk” 😂😂😂😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:23:38", "owner": "michael_ngoo", "likes": 2}, {"i