{"media_id": 3763692905090330934, "shortcode": "DQ7UsGbkTE2", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQ7UsGbkTE2/", "taken_at": "2025-11-11T18:55:15", "caption": "Ep 1: the group project\n\nTag your group project members⬇️\n\n#studysupps #studying #study #groupproject #uni #unilife #brainfog #funnyskits", "owner_username": "studysupps", "owner_id": "68892950986", "likes": 212559, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0024_DQ7UsGbkTE2\\DQ7UsGbkTE2_20251111_185515.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17864549757501994, "text": "frogs are so cool", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:39:15", "owner": "kaylee_truong", "likes": 15242}, {"id": 18071367617198274, "text": "Is this The Office?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:56:35", "owner": "manga_vg_art", "likes": 750}, {"id": 18319506226173289, "text": "It’s always who is McKinsey, and why is McKinsey, but never how is McKinsey😢", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:16:01", "owner": "squirrel52.0", "likes": 5156}, {"id": 18047921741405363, "text": "WHEN is mckinsey", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:22:42", "owner": "abrahamvlra_", "likes": 4286}, {"id": 18093987754891694, "text": "kate's kinda chill tho", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:18:09", "owner": "epic.skyfly", "likes": 1503}, {"id": 18078928070153863, "text": "University - the place where everyone is smarter than you... Other than the 2 in your group", "created_at": "2025-11-13T01:37:29", "owner": "professor_procter", "likes": 17099}, {"id": 18102510874572885, "text": "Brain frog is real", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:12:15", "owner": "abood_yousuf", "likes": 104}, {"id": 18088325624313672, "text": "Brain fog it occurs when your brain is overwhelmed. You’re nervous system sets off your internal alarm clock as a flight or fight response on accident.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:53:56", "owner": "dekelly811", "likes": 72}, {"id": 18080521511040617, "text": "Girl in red is tolerable, but the corporate girl ir absolute hell", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:13:42", "owner": "thatpolloasao", "likes": 911}, {"id": 18422298382141280, "text": "The corporate girl played her part very well. I got super annoyed 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:46:50", "owner": "l.daihiep", "likes": 4659}, {"id": 18083789453088928, "text": "ts getting too local 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-12T16:21:55", "owner": "jasnoor_smh", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18084964673060303, "text": "Abdullah is such a random name for a character", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:42:18", "owner": "alecio.sr", "likes": 795}, {"id": 18297622039286871, "text": "Tbf the girl in the hoodie is kinda real tho. She didn't know what brainfog is and she searched for it. As for the other one....", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:15:06", "owner": "thirdacc_wazza", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18066046748579886, "text": "Nightmare blunt rotation 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:22:07", "owner": "peky._.pp", "likes": 5212}, {"id": 18097856179694517, "text": "I swear god I have those two girls in my group project now, we'll do it next Monday hope good luck for me guys!", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:10:32", "owner": "j.___mnijungkook997_._k", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18123474199513233, "text": "Bro's back is broken 🥀 công ty trách nhiệm một mình tao gánh một đàn báo", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:00:33", "owner": "vietan0456", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17952228594043960, "text": "It's always 'Who is mckinsey' and never 'How is mckinsey' 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:29:17", "owner": "yaraferas_", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17868062157473213, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:10:02", "owner": "whereismyf40", "likes": 1637}, {"id": 17847051966604008, "text": "peer evaluation gonna go crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:37:57", "owner": "studyfetch", "likes": 44}, {"id": 17986738811908718, "text": "Why the asian guy is named abdullah 🫥", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:14:36", "owner": "aymanassadi1", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17939036606966071, "text": "Of course she’s late", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:18:34", "owner": "kennedy.egg", "likes": 46}, {"id": 17890474782241568, "text": "Yep there is one person who do all the project work(me), one person who do nothing apart from hanging out, one person who tries to help but genuine a bit retrded, and one person who is applying to millions of jobs all semester long", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:19:56", "owner": "jasonc2122", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18063435086624376, "text": "im dead 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:56:18", "owner": "nahal_k29", "likes": 54}, {"id": 18083488793017615, "text": "At least you met them in person, our group project doesn't even go beyond the chat 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:57:49", "owner": "khadicha_bonu", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17847959229573203, "text": "the office if it was actually good", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:45:24", "owner": "amine_bouassida_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18058661702251890, "text": "At the end add \"everything done by me\" or write the professor they didn't do shit on that project", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:14:17", "owner": "shyyur1", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18366788563085313, "text": "Utm is that u", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:16:04", "owner": "bri.8_y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083967770087107, "text": "the 4th member who doesn’t show up until the presentation:", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:44:54", "owner": "coenzymes", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081008987028537, "text": "The tension between “i want to scream at them for their lack of contribution” and “we need to keep things professional & no drama” and “but this group report needs to be done”\n\nBreathe in…..breathe out…..", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:17:21", "owner": "lizlizzzz1111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847699597573744, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:00:55", "owner": "tiads0104", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18114911518516731, "text": "Genuine nightmare blunt rotation", "created_at": "2025-12-15T01:50:34", "owner": "cheyennelove09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109827568543966, "text": "This is why u gotta go to a selection school with only smart ppl", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:37:10", "owner": "lim_sijia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974644557973481, "text": "@sinar._.23 😅😅 literally our last research", "created_at": "2025-12-14T13:49:24", "owner": "itz_sannna1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071735864254565, "text": "That's why I hate group projects, 6 in a group , but im the only guy  actually doing things. Is it some \" individual group project \"???", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:58:46", "owner": "touming_1223", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058935026267810, "text": "Now everything is GPT.. Saw team members just use it for searching for info (spoiler, wrong info), sources (also fake), and also for ideas for a team project 🤦🏻‍♀️🤦🏻‍♀️🤦🏻‍♀️ Wanted to slap them..", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:22:34", "owner": "_sabinasea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111090790610891, "text": "LMAO IMMEDIATELY RECOGNIZED THIS AS UTM", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:28:46", "owner": "kiratmalhotraa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931054792015121, "text": "@thomas.hwthrn Hi Ana @lizou.ri sorry.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:14:56", "owner": "shii.thread", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052812731661660, "text": "@_gayathri.bm_ @toodles_111 @pianosenpai13 @shaana_abd 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:14:27", "owner": "achilles_alexios", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116593750491651, "text": "me leaning against a wall, trying to impress kate: i like frog too", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:20:14", "owner": "ambercat_shine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18182488957345837, "text": "If you guys like frogs… I have a small business selling frog stickers and stationaryyy✨✨🐸🐸", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:00:21", "owner": "simplyfroggieshop", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18427472644128451, "text": "i smell 12 episodes with a beach day, summer festival and school festival😁", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:13:07", "owner": "fayyadaayan13", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17905047333289880, "text": "You didn't have to be so real", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:35:17", "owner": "unnobatroo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105681460653568, "text": "at least they talk", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:09:48", "owner": "zylophonia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084872065956868, "text": "Saviour fr", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:51:02", "owner": "vicxtsai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082221098044885, "text": "Bro they showed up. Dream team right there", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:38:33", "owner": "_why_at_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18097751641701931, "text": "Girl why would we leverage low hanging fruit", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:26:45", "owner": "atlas__who", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17870708040466456, "text": "@ivyzxyxyxy 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:29:46", "owner": "npc__jordan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18547251121034935, "text": "THE ACCURACY", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:03:25", "owner": "avika.elya", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17998297442839523, "text": "we need more episodes", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:48:23", "owner": "amina.enkhjargal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061734599552319, "text": "when’s the next episode", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:50:47", "owner": "al1ruism", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17977823687954497, "text": "@marilu.asno u lived thru ts hell", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:38:28", "owner": "dziniccc_din", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076314323220538, "text": "ABGs 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:14:57", "owner": "kelvinerufus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059582843559793, "text": "Ok bu i see u GL of group project return of the GL @alexrg.16", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:50:01", "owner": "saranshnarayan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052816907335160, "text": "gawddamn i hate stupid ppl in a group project 😒", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:11:04", "owner": "kaylee_truong", "likes": 498}, {"id": 17975714609792157, "text": "No way bros name is Abdullah 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:08:24", "owner": "nobel.syn", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17879833560422454, "text": "Actually representation of group projects", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:05:51", "owner": "richardsonbrayden0", "likes": 1039}, {"id": 18350528830164830, "text": "“Who is gamora, why is gamora” ahhh😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-12T21:15:07", "owner": "david_cuevas._.s", "likes": 66}, {"id": 18324744832245630, "text": "Wait his name is abdullah 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:56:16", "owner": "b_bakouri_26", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18338147485229802, "text": "@sidddddddddddddddddddddddddd6 how u felt after I left for tennis during science fair 🤣 but I did my part", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:04:34", "owner": "changduo_sun", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17985257168864318, "text": "Kate and Abdullah are cool af tbh", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:55:47", "owner": "z_ra__main", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18541533790052443, "text": "Kate is so cute i love her", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:15:42", "owner": "ra3wr.y", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18082625408050380, "text": "Hey at least your's shows up, mine don't", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:21:37", "owner": "sensudar_", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18061415555632051, "text": "I really feel Abdullah", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:27:47", "owner": "sd11no", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18104330200630287, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:49:47", "owner": "brxndonlin", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17991857279886142, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:27:42", "owner": "mightbeion", "likes": 98}, {"id": 17927624799153422, "text": "Why abdullah kinda……!", "created_at": "2025-11-18T06:30:31", "owner": "not_yourshaharah", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063730379155335, "text": "How am I all three of them 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:38:03", "owner": "sanzana.tabassum", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17951494623046131, "text": "Drop em gang", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:30:30", "owner": "ryanli0713", "likes": 249}, {"id": 18314016631223754, "text": "مايا 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-14T08:58:56", "owner": "obi_samaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853974808529746, "text": "why are we acting like guys actually do work in group projects. every guy i’ve been in a group project with, college or HS never does anything 😭🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:07:38", "owner": "literalle_e", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17976357656949642, "text": "@sam.abdii @ballardraignar you guys completed your tasks yet ?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:00:45", "owner": "ihsan_imran", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049912613676295, "text": "This page is so cool(they paid me to say it)", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:15:28", "owner": "just.youfie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18538354732003767, "text": "We need this as a reality show « College Drama Diaries » 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:30:27", "owner": "e__ozgeee", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18068363744579297, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:16:49", "owner": "sinhapratyush__________7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048203240420971, "text": "quella su Facebook sei te @terry.xadd", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:27:00", "owner": "alert4ngel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17927544423139614, "text": "@castel.01 cahier de charge HHHHHHHHHHH", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:34:52", "owner": "esnuupiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080022239103310, "text": "Sorry i’m Abdullah ☠️", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:39:55", "owner": "senia.goro", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18071798582252482, "text": "Stop it I’m getting flashbacks. WAR PTSD. 😭😭😭😭😭 all those presentations I had to do myself", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:47:37", "owner": "ae_1020_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085306000816036, "text": "If I ever get buried I want it to be by my group mates so that they can let me down one last time", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:18:29", "owner": "crazyparth101", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18124353370442956, "text": "The guy lowey sounds like Pan", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:59:20", "owner": "leoliu1412", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086976304769162, "text": "The office ahh video", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:05:16", "owner": "angthebender", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17927312325152062, "text": "“Can we circle back?”", "created_at": "2025-11-14T03:59:27", "owner": "owen_rasta09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060973940557597, "text": "you guys are cooking", "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:27:13", "owner": "jibraank.to", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952171174031613, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-13T05:58:58", "owner": "itx._.maha18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101918791669238, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:05:36", "owner": "abdullah.milad.21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864260524438490, "text": "Can we get a tv series of these three", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:06:31", "owner": "brodyd4260", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861960091533396, "text": "Do more of these sir", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:29:27", "owner": "kiranespin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079208000141042, "text": "Im the guy oh no 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:59:53", "owner": "spacepoppycreates", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18394962667120302, "text": "Corporate girlie is gonna be a personality hire somewhere", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:20:47", "owner": "ire.abyssum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044605928470687, "text": "So who’s McKinsey", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:27:23", "owner": "yuwenfang__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17843905713611290, "text": "Sometimes people are just in it for the LinkedIn post", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:29:00", "owner": "ghufrans_diary", "likes": 80}, {"id": 18084591086508398, "text": "“Facebook” 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:53:48", "owner": "alan.insta.sun", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17906820585269254, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:38:37", "owner": "david_01.07", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17921558757050004, "text": "the rage bait worked 🐸", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:09:26", "owner": "kamran_aslami", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087833623997234, "text": "mn2271", "created_at": "2025-12-20T01:39:31", "owner": "itsc.rol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102042592774513, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T16:12:55", "owner": "sany_s.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869809774484354, "text": "This is a 4 person group btw, the 4th just didn’t even bother showing up after agreeing to", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:44:10", "owner": "robzeroed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092183692746165, "text": "\"Serious high achiever\" Nah sounds like the guy who wants to do a little more than the bare minimum.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:19:41", "owner": "alienatedpoet17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103500466736865, "text": "“I like frogs “", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:13:59", "owner": "enrique.builds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050732357408892, "text": "Why his name is Abdullah 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-17T20:23:25", "owner": "68bxa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908373409275028, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:20:45", "owner": "deap345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344028268226380, "text": "😂😂 crash out 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T15:21:05", "owner": "n.j.brian.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054707435672453, "text": "Pardon me how your name Abdullah?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:17:54", "owner": "myzmzmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107181511560872, "text": "modern version of hell is other people", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:33:51", "owner": "alonb999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088896199970804, "text": "No the member who didn’t do anything in my group project was Abdullah rn lol", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:10:51", "owner": "jlkor02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925723264177332, "text": "it really be like that fr", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:32:55", "owner": "kalebs.workbench", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310764742301685, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:19:16", "owner": "tristan_tt30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095435386876505, "text": "Wait #womeninmaledominatedfields I love this yes queens", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:03:32", "owner": "fizzi_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411580156190126, "text": "LMAOOO", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:14:55", "owner": "onlyonel1na", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857363647569140, "text": "At least you could bang them if you play it cool", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:46:46", "owner": "cockatyusha666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387594796180210, "text": "Abdullah?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:38:34", "owner": "thepirmatov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214567699309179, "text": "Terrible be sorry to say I one of girls in group project", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:42:17", "owner": "miss.bethhhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861534097478572, "text": "If the final grade is individual, you best believe I'm gonna master my part only 👌🫩", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:14:10", "owner": "clemn.sm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076231019223537, "text": "this is utm", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:06:12", "owner": "eurudiiusye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275970169303888, "text": "This is spelling lse", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:27:42", "owner": "lishan_is_rudder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119533270548978, "text": "I'm the guy", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:06:48", "owner": "_arina_.arina_.arina_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073061972366410, "text": "Bro", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:36:27", "owner": "tai_tai887", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048355049446558, "text": "It took me a minute to realize she meant McKinsey the firm not a person 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:16:33", "owner": "sobowale_michael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128046139504141, "text": "Is this \"No Exit\" by Jean-Paul Sartre?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:53:04", "owner": "tiud0r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544375084053690, "text": "He is me I am him ...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:13:34", "owner": "d.elle_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081173924143982, "text": "4th guy never showed up", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:57:24", "owner": "xeritya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080763899167618, "text": "This was my exact experience this semester 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:38:17", "owner": "xx_its_leila_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082572680125857, "text": "Ts harder than league", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:21:12", "owner": "dagadagi_kori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058476590290873, "text": "L", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:32:51", "owner": "kaioldigaccount", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060136364269153, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:50:21", "owner": "mr.sia10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057784163304456, "text": "I am the serious high achiever 😭 I would think the project is doomed if someone showed up late", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:51:28", "owner": "risha_tae_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079481920937017, "text": "بوية انت مصر تذكرني يالطليان اللي جانو وياية", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:27:43", "owner": "ma_sr19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114973543568826, "text": "I feel U mannnn 😢😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:19:58", "owner": "kenwit221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852085339554228, "text": "Literally happened this week. I'm just like that guy 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:17:50", "owner": "esilasaurus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086001404054406, "text": "@shayejia785 我猜你组员也差不多是这样。😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:29:24", "owner": "rockyiscooking_0602", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059931338265110, "text": "Justice for Abdullah", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:26:10", "owner": "saadunhinged", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411763831187368, "text": "Chatgbt brain frog", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:15:06", "owner": "rayanooway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099882064816521, "text": "Chatgbt drain frog", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:14:52", "owner": "rayanooway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086105057067734, "text": "Abdullah? Hm i dont see my people anywhere", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:06:30", "owner": "lo_be_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070468175064354, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:21:13", "owner": "failstun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161264749398304, "text": "acting is peakk", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:10:24", "owner": "meijixlotte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047016644453640, "text": "You can use the 1st girl as a study case of a brain fog", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:06:39", "owner": "rio_agustian_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068584880458564, "text": "So accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:55:24", "owner": "rikusan_des", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135399436479276, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:10:29", "owner": "tuntum.boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067274243116735, "text": "At least your group members showed up for the meeting😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:26:50", "owner": "lakeisha.iwajomo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867729676485032, "text": "You've done everything? Awesome, kay well, bye! This group project was great.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:26", "owner": "ads.andongni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063733457407239, "text": "That’s nothing. One of my group members joined our group at the start of the semester, and went MIA after the first meeting. Then 2 weeks before submission she casually mentioned that she’s dropping out.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:51:34", "owner": "asy._ruff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947358801935776, "text": "Where is mckenzie", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:22:57", "owner": "wcalenietoxit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869857771471462, "text": "Genuinely hate linkedin warriors", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:44", "owner": "captain.samosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932459053000504, "text": "I can be all three and switch every 5 minutes 😎", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:09:26", "owner": "dania.binsaif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070820990060947, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:20:48", "owner": "the_realest_tristan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011515370641238, "text": "I got a better question for you.....WHY MCKINSEY", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:31:15", "owner": "dbmejias_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033348899526603, "text": "Jackpot👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:01:06", "owner": "lycheeweii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189119872338241, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:11:34", "owner": "shima.dhq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983883042763309, "text": "بعد ما أقدم وياهم", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:30:23", "owner": "eng.fatim.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869959546394651, "text": "At least you got a cameraman in the group", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:57:36", "owner": "csh96m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088368541779375, "text": "frogs taste like chicken 😌😎", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:05:34", "owner": "dimuthucode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127806916503561, "text": "We are not LEVERAGING right now", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:53:17", "owner": "erin_tanyixuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059785073249490, "text": "This is UTM", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:43:35", "owner": "basement_boy__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064572620433541, "text": "Surprised they even got a study room! That’s the hardest part", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:55:45", "owner": "pippyedu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859221265485305, "text": "I'm just going to Kick them Legally", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:13:41", "owner": "fake_ahahah99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379550914147840, "text": "But they're bad bro n ur the only guy", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:52:38", "owner": "a2_aka21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987402819871461, "text": "An asian man with the name abdullah 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:07:36", "owner": "nomolaudj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096000313664964, "text": "Please next time add a trigger warning ⚠️\"group project\"", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:55:30", "owner": "meryeme.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118320610550116, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:28:31", "owner": "aynamek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164944156376117, "text": "so average group work", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:31:37", "owner": "day_light_fly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323034292300798, "text": "Idk why these girls agreed to film this vid.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:47:02", "owner": "ba8ella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860782600540609, "text": "Gamora ahh", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:45:48", "owner": "b_kesova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106522498650953, "text": "He's literally me", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:06:31", "owner": "therad.dude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117094564483537, "text": "It’s very real the 4th person is not even there", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:20:57", "owner": "thomas_cot2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113257123501620, "text": "AT LEAST!!!!!! They attend the meeting 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:18:22", "owner": "tingfu001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368811847083834, "text": "College/university group projects are basically irl the office episodes", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:53:02", "owner": "stock_cork69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101803684709394, "text": "at least they show up", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:41:49", "owner": "lucian_mocan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056972981295517, "text": "IMO team projects needs to be reduced to 5 maximum for all 4 years at uni.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:21:19", "owner": "_sabinasea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972480384953418, "text": "This is sooo incredibly local I know what building it was filmed in", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:16:00", "owner": "dani26_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080605262035962, "text": "bro acting looks a lill to real", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:30:17", "owner": "fruitcaketwink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074669954339981, "text": "Is this a modern interpretation of Jean-Paul Sarte's 'No Exit'?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:32:19", "owner": "tommy_silbershatz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080974070121955, "text": "That's me. (I'm all three of them)", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:57:10", "owner": "pwlsikora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896378671199540, "text": "I guess one boy didn't show up", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:21:46", "owner": "mindorashvililuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102525427736021, "text": "Abdullah? Didn't expect that.🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:59:22", "owner": "abdullah._usmani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085127650962761, "text": "What if I’m all three?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:48:46", "owner": "evgenqa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061073147231639, "text": "Every group project has 1 worker and 3 background characters 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:25:33", "owner": "oegexperttutorsapp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385191841182912, "text": "it's me I'm abdullah", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:50:33", "owner": "laibah.basham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931773109137280, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:48:41", "owner": "ethan.phil05_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884752912406982, "text": "I need this to be made as a tv show", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:43:42", "owner": "xxixiiyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945851388938501, "text": "What was this reel about again?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:11:11", "owner": "this_is_rup02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409107448143566, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:33:47", "owner": "k.b.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076073156240118, "text": "I am Abdullah", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:24:11", "owner": "mariam.elkhayat.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071261147052767, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:24:12", "owner": "cv4lip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111112426581209, "text": "In university everybody is smartest except you group mates", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:08:12", "owner": "o.islom01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089402978505092, "text": "i cant…", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:55:58", "owner": "andy_wzc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397022929132887, "text": "At least this group work doesn’t look like an engineering PBL.😢 Or you’ll have the clear vision of inferno.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:54:59", "owner": "perspective_ho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940952563085532, "text": "I've been there, buddy!", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:00:30", "owner": "iam.ayyoub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162837772379672, "text": "I got insanely lucky with my groups in my later years, early was bad later was god tier", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:37:46", "owner": "christor_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071619458035183, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:27:31", "owner": "adrielrsimon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854526916569969, "text": "Typical asian", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:01:31", "owner": "herman_melnyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857517160555482, "text": "It’s like Kazuma in konosuba, th helpless teammates", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:45:02", "owner": "cxiong16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158481157392277, "text": "Had to make a whole database by myself because my group mates had no idea what they were doing", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:24:05", "owner": "sebastian.cerna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047700773416725, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:52:51", "owner": "brandol_jc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008386799649861, "text": "@viraksak_heak", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:46:00", "owner": "kimchi_is_yellow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100346815690700, "text": "what kind of an abdullah u r", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:31:57", "owner": "whofeeddrogon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078292190132379, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:32:05", "owner": "gernotlepschy06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376018450156183, "text": "I'm Abdullah", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:53:19", "owner": "axviews_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943386991069188, "text": "10/10 production", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:23:54", "owner": "isar.co.uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063318827533305, "text": "The frog girl is soooo me coded 😍 😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:19:13", "owner": "jakshp1407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891589882366494, "text": "this is how every group project is. EVERY SINGLE ONE", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:08:28", "owner": "haaris_janjua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048610766674356, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:47:30", "owner": "liatibule", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104464018638018, "text": "WHY IS GAMORA", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:47:15", "owner": "dryersheets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932928469103090, "text": "At least he has subjects to study brain fog in", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:09:34", "owner": "mrheavenman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913678891237968, "text": "skill issue 🚨 cluely content copycat", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:02:47", "owner": "matecueva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292519912258230, "text": "this skit style reminds me sm of The Office", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:35:37", "owner": "thenamesjin_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112905868566840, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:18:14", "owner": "koma_rouge75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099299905780950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:55:38", "owner": "ucf_s24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998367492842589, "text": "I’ll do it all by myself and not give any credit 😂😂😂 no my time for people to waste it", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:08:06", "owner": "kly292", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054508448319800, "text": "Im everybody 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:40:54", "owner": "treasuree.af", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852523009580099, "text": "The Asian dudes name 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:23:16", "owner": "kevincdope92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096130171830299, "text": "The theme is way more than clear when he said “brain fog” for the first time", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:41:19", "owner": "nashavasilissa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929286754011960, "text": "Abdullah?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:22:10", "owner": "slaswik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988209792741028, "text": "Me rn", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:14:45", "owner": "mhd4km4l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065999318111905, "text": "Justice for Abdullah 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:54:36", "owner": "cloud.0110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072241460462955, "text": "Bro I'm Abdullah", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:06:41", "owner": "ssupzuha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084485917970842, "text": "How are you calling them worst😂. Here we do not even know the topic of project, just that one bookworm know, we just see our project in final day presentation😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:59:54", "owner": "trading6155", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519315547064414, "text": "Why is gamora", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:52:20", "owner": "strawberrybaap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105032224575904, "text": "Accurate 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T23:31:52", "owner": "khalilouesleti951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050291132354980, "text": "@danyalbalochhh @itx_muskan_here.23 us in FYP.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:40:01", "owner": "__noorfatimaah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016159895619221, "text": "@aurora_tarannum  @tasmimuhtazi  both of you", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:47:15", "owner": "riju_002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093600469862787, "text": "I’m always the serious high archiver 😓", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:21:28", "owner": "xx.insom_niac.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047610224411487, "text": "I seriously need Abdullah in my group 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-14T11:38:35", "owner": "alexchristiansen26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928934956117867, "text": "Это я каждый день в институте", "created_at": "2025-11-14T08:10:49", "owner": "anya.kharlanova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539495833054123, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T03:24:33", "owner": "piyush.glitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333263851229437, "text": "She's not a member, she's the test subject", "created_at": "2025-11-14T02:21:00", "owner": "iloveapfsdsrounds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091180733497056, "text": "😂😂😂😂 until Oxford , l hated group projects 😂😂.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:26:00", "owner": "cassy_word", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842592655617215, "text": "This guy lowkey sounds like Pan", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:59:44", "owner": "leoliu1412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540574990008540, "text": "I am sure I am the overachiever I see i am not better than anyone 😂😶‍🌫️", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:08:56", "owner": "just_a_dandelion___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074505524195028, "text": "Group project about... An oral presentation ? Weird.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:26:43", "owner": "b.massoteau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915022738213534, "text": "some girl McKinsey😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T05:40:53", "owner": "shemen_mkg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245463274295357, "text": "Reminds me of @cluely", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:58:09", "owner": "allhail_king_nana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878063827429847, "text": "This 100% Ana's gpa booster elective subject", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:23:05", "owner": "de_short_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901376968163689, "text": "dude i know McKinsey too i wouldnt talk to her if i had a gro