{"media_id": 3717512737011383671, "shortcode": "DOXQiNZjb13", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOXQiNZjb13/", "taken_at": "2025-09-09T01:41:21", "caption": "Do you think it’s a bit excessive? Lol😅\n\n👉🏾FOLLOW for more of the BEST work memes on Instagram! \n\n👉🏾SHARE with your corporate bestie who can relate!\n\n@imjustacorporategirl \n@imjustacorporategirl \n@imjustacorporategirl \n\n#viralmemesdaily #explorepage #dailymemes #viralreels #foryoupage #workwoes #backtoworkblues #topmemes #bestmemes #workmemes #moneyonline #corporatehumor #workhumor #corporatelife #corporatememes #fyp", "owner_username": "imjustacorporategirl", "owner_id": "72026585561", "likes": 132282, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0025_DOXQiNZjb13\\DOXQiNZjb13_20250909_014121.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17884057461397593, "text": "Every time I watch this video again it makes me angry, why they make fun of her?!", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:18:38", "owner": "marisabel_0607", "likes": 1637}, {"id": 18091592401690957, "text": "My kinda gal", "created_at": "2025-09-09T10:27:49", "owner": "markysahb999", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18156556798376042, "text": "This is all of us on the inside when we’re hangry. She just couldn’t contain the beast 😆", "created_at": "2025-09-09T12:19:54", "owner": "twiztedpeanuts", "likes": 1175}, {"id": 18088165831872529, "text": "I understand her. Her blood sugar has to be really low.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:30:32", "owner": "izla1708", "likes": 7305}, {"id": 17940403596058059, "text": "I feel this in my soul.. lol", "created_at": "2025-09-09T01:48:34", "owner": "christa1317", "likes": 561}, {"id": 18093171574683844, "text": "Hangry 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-09T05:47:22", "owner": "pickeringannika", "likes": 58}, {"id": 17977628249864376, "text": "Lol me when I was pregnant, worked 12 hours nursing and had soup for lunch and my husband made me ramen for tea. I was so upset I just needed heavy carbs and not more liquid 🤣 the most ungrateful I've ever been 😆", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:49:13", "owner": "kirstietaylor123", "likes": 121}, {"id": 17961002142004143, "text": "HER EYES 💀😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:15:31", "owner": "z_3nn1", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18049492817391619, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:55:44", "owner": "elisabeth.mch", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18014664815779395, "text": "Lmao I feel her when I was serving and getting off late looking at food all day and my ex boyfriend would complain about stopping by whatabuger I would be raging inside my head 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-09T19:10:22", "owner": "sammiebaby18", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18030331481739681, "text": "Those who are laughing probably never worked a day in their life", "created_at": "2025-11-01T13:05:18", "owner": "giuliavittoriagrosso", "likes": 216}, {"id": 18060038729602184, "text": "Valid crashout", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:09:47", "owner": "marie.qrie", "likes": 903}, {"id": 18058597751229953, "text": "i think she wants wingstop guys", "created_at": "2025-11-04T11:19:39", "owner": "rxphxmusic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18193236043334170, "text": "This isn’t funny. She hasn’t eaten all day, and her friends that were in the car were pranking her by going in drive-throughs, but not getting anything. From what I’ve experienced when my blood sugar is low she must be in really bad pain and doesn’t feel good at all. So I don’t see the point in laughing about it because it is not funny. She hasn’t eaten all day.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T01:06:35", "owner": "madmads923", "likes": 622}, {"id": 18069461810618506, "text": "One of the best metal vocal potential", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:19:29", "owner": "ash_rft", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083890277059206, "text": "I work 12 hours five days a week and some days I don’t have food but I’m not screaming at my family like that because there’s nothing left to scream no energy lol", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:18:26", "owner": "janshaheen3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084572041799758, "text": "@nandy.em 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:16:33", "owner": "aayyu2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880051234326469, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:03:13", "owner": "aloysobeck22", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083198827752091, "text": "Try do 15 hours 😂 I pretty sure she will become Michael Myers", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:25:39", "owner": "edwardaugustyn1991", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18062933828215704, "text": "@katie.cwn", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:01:15", "owner": "iamginger.k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085186226474693, "text": "🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️please get her wing stop now!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:02:37", "owner": "aloysobeck22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874755427354602, "text": "My mom when she's hangry", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:15:05", "owner": "jackson.da.boi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18029356766534588, "text": "Can you belt whip an adult?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:32:19", "owner": "hexagreen6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041038916680345, "text": "And sh finna wait for 45 minutes to get her food", "created_at": "2025-09-09T01:57:35", "owner": "renntech560_", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18174182992350982, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-09T17:07:10", "owner": "heatherraaaae", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17869597263460137, "text": "nothing's funny about this...", "created_at": "2025-10-26T07:25:41", "owner": "jowwaxx.x", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18067108271224118, "text": "So valid", "created_at": "2025-09-09T01:50:21", "owner": "yeah_ajakakahahqh", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18063511481628769, "text": "@hena_ann_paul 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:34:00", "owner": "kiri_arj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942858763073129, "text": "I GET IT GIRL", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:18:28", "owner": "kodyaskins4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052235099650557, "text": "she doesn’t deserve that", "created_at": "2025-10-26T03:09:05", "owner": "mashed_potato___________", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084220291777694, "text": "I guess she is hungry", "created_at": "2025-1