 "2025-12-20T07:41:16", "owner": "lesoftheolives", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029301989771351, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-20T02:20:22", "owner": "jerry.baldovi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548920297008817, "text": "Americký kurvy a nebo negri strilet vás vsechny", "created_at": "2025-12-20T00:03:24", "owner": "lenin_1312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340435291232555, "text": "Old and funny post, has a a version of this one with heavy metal on the background… 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:00:00", "owner": "timetolivethereal_housemasters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089817682791502, "text": "Slapped her still she is not hungry anymore 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:04:28", "owner": "exbmu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101358523704544, "text": "When I get hungry I am monster 👹 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T12:35:09", "owner": "gadiel77777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075988889251091, "text": "That needs a slap to the face", "created_at": "2025-12-19T12:05:44", "owner": "irungla10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303222163264041, "text": "Fkn retard…", "created_at": "2025-12-19T07:54:15", "owner": "martin.chale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034944476741996, "text": "Nah she has a valid point", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:10:50", "owner": "jjakert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919008631218443, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:28:59", "owner": "s801.071", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979913232947318, "text": "she's an adult, it's only her fault that she didn't eat.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:40:41", "owner": "ecker_cise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398099443121591, "text": "animal...", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:25:25", "owner": "logiana534", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048459458462030, "text": "Calm down", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:29:30", "owner": "blackvikngs88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890109934393000, "text": "@annevanmid", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:02:33", "owner": "cindydriessen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134163439470067, "text": "When the camera made her eyes red is when I laughed😂😂😂", "created_a