chuwawa belike:", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:02:13", "owner": "proudbisexual_4532", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084908584794669, "text": "My getting out of school:", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:30:03", "owner": "oliviadagati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092803072680691, "text": "Io quando voglio le ricche fries del MC", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:40:42", "owner": "rosati_sonia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067809836395858, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:29:41", "owner": "yonityehi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117218512532127, "text": "lol only work 10hrs then getting crazy", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:15:12", "owner": "calvin_hw682", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061801799414051, "text": "Bad friends is the only problem I see here. She's worked ten hours, starving, probably a bit burned out, and all they do is make fun of her and refuse her a takeaway? Drop those 💩 friends", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:59:39", "owner": "lea.flamant", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18070268480038809, "text": "She said calmly:", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:52:53", "owner": "sabrinasflower30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962893593998338, "text": "She was very patient. I would've killed them straight away 😌", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:50:30", "owner": "andreacarari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902543476287010, "text": "The eyes Chico they never lie", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:22:08", "owner": "cvmpivnu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851591689573926, "text": "Yeah 10 hours isn't nothing my mom has to work a full 24 hour shift", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:33:31", "owner": "christophermadera8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944179221938809, "text": "😂😂😂😂real intense huh😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:06:31", "owner": "shadowravi10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096379948740257, "text": "Must be a server", "created_at": "2025-10-30T04:20:16", "owner": "andrewtheezealot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902995588276592, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-29T23:05:57", "owner": "dd7_caxaser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056021846292133, "text": "The fuck out of my car.  Eat some roadkill.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T22:50:35", "owner": "staghandle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086825536757208, "text": "lmao", "created_at": "2025-10-29T22:32:31", "owner": "ky4nh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288745906279179, "text": "Glad she didn’t overdo her crashout", "created_at": "2025-10-29T22:09:29", "owner": "timely_eagle7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413390245116257, "text": "@gulzar_riaz 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T20:34:15", "owner": "uvaisul_karni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923185504038823, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-29T20:34:15", "owner": "maucia1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061399652166876, "text": "Valid Crashout", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:45:44", "owner": "jeff_chan9527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007350542807220, "text": "She is hangry", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:44:23", "owner": "locklined", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874298686439445, "text": "Someone made a metal version of this with drums😆😆", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:49:02", "owner": "mantask2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058367222544885, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:35:24", "owner": "jurges__official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074207581960845, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:17:01", "owner": "hofer3604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893999167347209, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:04:12", "owner": "honzakojzar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060593948564331, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T17:59:32", "owner": "blog_dreamsgreen_digitale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978412449935881, "text": "Damn i forgot this treasure", "created_at": "2025-10-29T17:43:11", "owner": "mirec_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298487635265937, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:11:14", "owner": "marki_mikus10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938037873962839, "text": "Why didn't she drop the N word😢🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:47:03", "owner": "aliveshitx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085369033951965, "text": "Lol I can eat nothing all day, sometimes I eat only yoghurt and work not going on a break and I don't complain xd but I understand", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:44:49", "owner": "morderczyniczasu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061587104631121, "text": "Meee 🙌😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:38:28", "owner": "jhones.jessica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179615824348036, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:38:49", "owner": "rjuchiha24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132907888465148, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:24:07", "owner": "cavaulina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327921151210479, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T10:49:07", "owner": "makenziejensen8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960391495004595, "text": "In Taiwan, the students always study 10 hours, so don’t shout", "created_at": "2025-10-29T10:32:53", "owner": "spland_0603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546001444033308, "text": "I feeeeeelll youuuuu😢😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T08:10:46", "owner": "catrieaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963286530997229, "text": "Ten try working twelve. You a lil girl", "created_at": "2025-10-29T05:36:55", "owner": "eezy_brzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865675825478252, "text": "We can see the demon is the one talking from the eyes😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:38:00", "owner": "_itsanggara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895889977342183, "text": "valid crashout", "created_at": "2025-10-29T02:37:42", "owner": "happy_smiley_faces_2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907230451254021, "text": "The people that are excusing this will think this is a valid crash out clearly are emotional manipulators, because this is 100% toxic", "created_at": "2025-10-29T02:10:17", "owner": "ned_nomadic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044366318450057, "text": "Get her something. Stop laughing! This isn't funny. She's breaking down", "created_at": "2025-10-28T23:35:42", "owner": "lydiasergeant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385724257182739, "text": "Just 10 hours 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:45:12", "owner": "jakub7870", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995860902840439, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:38:58", "owner": "tuff_k__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910113370249848, "text": "A elegant gal with the right priorities 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:00:33", "owner": "askokkio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359655625090370, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:15:12", "owner": "meldez_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425837539111223, "text": "See ? The importance of emergency snack 🍪 maybe its not enough but you ll survive in order to attempt the wingstop 😎", "created_at": "2025-10-28T17:58:41", "owner": "arthur_ipa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925157671151595, "text": "Why it's kinda hurts me!", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:34:26", "owner": "mochaa_0239", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073221659268066, "text": "Where is the metal version", "created_at": "2025-10-28T12:52:30", "owner": "viito__corleone._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18503562172069708, "text": "Shut up bitch", "created_at": "2025-10-28T11:52:56", "owner": "hmzz.knn9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897682492183104, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T10:58:02", "owner": "jarno_paret12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027656621737691, "text": "😂💀😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T07:49:43", "owner": "pimpfrog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981375573764807, "text": "Not funny", "created_at": "2025-10-28T07:38:06", "owner": "sonaakashbhil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535726531008494, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:20:53", "owner": "reemiks02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085038148952125, "text": "Where is my power metal track in the background?...try to don't cast aside the traditions 😢😢🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-28T03:27:56", "owner": "the_knight_apharam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897122530184468, "text": "Valid crashiut", "created_at": "2025-10-28T03:22:49", "owner": "upthedragons2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082679153068027, "text": "Aren't starving makes you weaker.....she look more energetic 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:48:39", "owner": "larry.liaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082742518992956, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:40:24", "owner": "mjtaviuni_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070596503256272, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:28:07", "owner": "imdavidmariov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544747546040277, "text": "She is really hangry", "created_at": "2025-10-27T19:49:40", "owner": "farma_n106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908319640255667, "text": "Aww", "created_at": "2025-10-27T18:38:59", "owner": "ashvik_rawal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972088728950165, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-27T18:29:41", "owner": "t0_0t4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986141421883510, "text": "I mean i feel her..", "created_at": "2025-10-27T18:26:19", "owner": "julliee_hr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062791361149930, "text": "ฉันหิว ฉันสามารถกินช้างได้ทั้งตัวเลยตอนนี้", "created_at": "2025-10-27T18:19:04", "owner": "opudepellegrin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535455991011049, "text": "That one homeless kid in the street", "created_at": "2025-10-27T17:44:20", "owner": "aiden21566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926129227148930, "text": "That’s a true mood when hungry honestly", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:05:20", "owner": "r_a_s_s_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902703298290459, "text": "Gak makan aja masi segitu powernya wkwkwk", "created_at": "2025-10-27T12:14:36", "owner": "sukasukasaya.001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123274543518305, "text": "Rick Ross is smiling rn 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T11:22:28", "owner": "lievinnewaura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844757398598147, "text": "If that me I just want Matcha 😮", "created_at": "2025-10-27T10:20:54", "owner": "nyl_1505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984538410879333, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-27T08:22:14", "owner": "he.reckless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18487303684073918, "text": "Relatable😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T05:32:31", "owner": "kame_7563", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028963220758022, "text": "Saw the red in her eyes", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:29:53", "owner": "polarjustice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990702816723576, "text": "I heard it with the remix 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T01:38:48", "owner": "waleedoka123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061286180406694, "text": "Get her Wingstop now, make sure it's  lot enough to ease her hangry", "created_at": "2025-10-27T00:10:46", "owner": "nicholas_911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381157705176623, "text": "Okay like that’s what man does everyday", "created_at": "2025-10-26T21:59:06", "owner": "hussa.in_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181812004342832, "text": "She not tired she have a lot of energy for scrimimg  hahahahah", "created_at": "2025-10-26T21:29:55", "owner": "zcx_lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360065668088836, "text": "That is valid", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:26:37", "owner": "the_demised", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075538958174650, "text": "I worked 12 hours 🫠", "created_at": "2025-10-26T15:46:23", "owner": "michal_yaakobov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102728503630892, "text": "Is that Sam Kinisons daughter?  Lol", "created_at": "2025-10-26T01:14:11", "owner": "steveleininger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070543217251489, "text": "😂😂😂😂 exactly like that", "created_at": "2025-10-25T23:01:57", "owner": "adi.efrat.brakha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077050865165962, "text": "The red in her eyes said everything", "created_at": "2025-10-25T20:51:54", "owner": "luna_galaxy_2525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096451780688112, "text": "Exorcist", "created_at": "2025-10-25T11:00:29", "owner": "retrohollywood._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977505192778340, "text": "Very emotionally intelligent", "created_at": "2025-10-25T08:20:53", "owner": "electronicgras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063399644132244, "text": "Gurl its only 10 hours", "created_at": "2025-10-25T06:03:19", "owner": "_adamantonio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858533473537948, "text": "Legit crash out", "created_at": "2025-10-25T04:22:13", "owner": "andrewwalker2464", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081409967012720, "text": "This ended there frendship", "created_at": "2025-10-25T03:45:17", "owner": "jimmyblack1479", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984595770870871, "text": "Next tine they'll keep a Snickers bar in the glove box. 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T23:52:11", "owner": "blade2k25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849448183547790, "text": "She’s not Survivor material .. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:46:24", "owner": "nikadone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074269268183345, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:25:12", "owner": "aurelien_sttp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082742635976762, "text": "They were constantly driving past places where they could eat after promising to go eat. So research before you judged.  Because it isnt hangry, it are toxic friends", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:45:15", "owner": "axellefeyen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047899970352430, "text": "Wife material 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:56:54", "owner": "stojanovic.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863094889500622, "text": "That was me yestrday 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:52:27", "owner": "a_telegdiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111517264569194, "text": "@nitharna_thiv", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:18:15", "owner": "thiviyan13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105229201624272, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:36:40", "owner": "torgefricke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914344078209294, "text": "I understand her. She‘s also a Taurus.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:05:41", "owner": "salvatore.mike_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204583063311637, "text": "Somebody's hangry", "created_at": "2025-10-24T09:22:27", "owner": "king_of_the_shadows_vt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894042037202554, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-24T07:18:09", "owner": "wileygonzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005812925656486, "text": "She ate my appetite 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T07:10:50", "owner": "p.paras.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885139804389737, "text": "Lol squid", "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:15:10", "owner": "epic_slayy26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850024573578518, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:38:52", "owner": "sakurayui1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954485109888860, "text": "😮😮😮😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T00:43:45", "owner": "waylong919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082139650956583, "text": "Isto sou eu qd acordo", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:25:04", "owner": "josebarrosdriver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901659934291387, "text": "She might be hungry", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:18:39", "owner": "onurcanc3tn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093392860872607, "text": "I would throw it out of my car", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:28:26", "owner": "francesbarry3612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047810852359439, "text": "@_hopedaviss us leaving the bar 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:19:36", "owner": "tallonrev555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897618178300045, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:19:45", "owner": "_itzrxyy99_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290907979275826, "text": "Thats me if I go hungry for more than 4 hours.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:09:54", "owner": "wajidnazir93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391033609125874, "text": "@febeeexo", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:36:49", "owner": "mike_bobik.mk4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081758809831749, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:32:20", "owner": "mrs_canderson1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046385597678870, "text": "Give her wingstop.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:13:02", "owner": "tristan_tazan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143054056431739, "text": "Ich 12 und ich bin Nicht so fet und aggressiv", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:04:28", "owner": "jellena_punk_rock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331263352226793, "text": "I literally feel that pain.. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:03:11", "owner": "ts197750", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059209004199429, "text": "Expected reaction 🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:01:28", "owner": "magentaautism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081286751047274, "text": "This human will forever live rent free in my head 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:36:54", "owner": "blakeeblakeesq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073730062953818, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:58:47", "owner": "royalte310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924664987154376, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:53:46", "owner": "fischerfritz_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855516301551046, "text": "Nurse ❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:33:48", "owner": "carinasilva78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043282895472266, "text": "@traceybeard35  you want churros 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:51:58", "owner": "rodneybeard9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085391965940181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:16:38", "owner": "pavel_blazinek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091440943687342, "text": "Poor of her", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:06:01", "owner": "feethough", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966818991973291, "text": "My sister when she wakes up", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:59:07", "owner": "soulberserker_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922979455035772, "text": "Don't mess with hangry just give her food 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:18:35", "owner": "blueberrygirly.anya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861177934448253, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:28:43", "owner": "nadia_goon_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508956292070508, "text": "You are not you when your Hungry.\nHave a @snickers", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:32:01", "owner": "marlon_vincent_marten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879292687310317, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:16:08", "owner": "laszlotuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899661331164424, "text": "Do u reckon shes hungry", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:05:03", "owner": "callummiller07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880901311407747, "text": "As someone who does 4, 11hr shifts in a row…… agreed", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:22:12", "owner": "maisyjoan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059090084551401, "text": "It has been a while since this Come out, i still feel bad for her", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:00:27", "owner": "soffan_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899734405165870, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:50:52", "owner": "ljubanlalic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974290629791121, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:16:47", "owner": "maximilian.benkert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898863268318597, "text": "Well she is right i agree with Her", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:28:37", "owner": "8324.bartek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140753269451910, "text": "10 hours only …", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:14:31", "owner": "ddddd.y.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084386839954034, "text": "\"CEO of hungry\" is always killing me😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:48:50", "owner": "yoji_h0126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099215128710060, "text": "That’s kinda excessive would have had me throwing hands like excuse me bitch don’t invalidate me like that!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:45:11", "owner": "serena_mcintyre95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087404581915429, "text": "What is she working", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:37:45", "owner": "bloodarrowhd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852581875561830, "text": "I mean i feel her.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:53:49", "owner": "hlias_mpougas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415402285115772, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:32:50", "owner": "monique.wakefield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079203548027342, "text": "her eyes are red at last🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:23:35", "owner": "cst.jossie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510502915068315, "text": "I work 10 hours being a delivery driver with no food until I get home at which point is around 12 hours of not eating anything and I never act this way. The most is being silent until my bf brings me food😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:43:14", "owner": "ann_27_lolipop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068401475360687, "text": "Someone please give her a lollipop 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:34:19", "owner": "ehasanhossen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078831283888751, "text": "She's Hangry", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:32:14", "owner": "poppejasmine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009004298638838, "text": "Avg day as a man. We eat during work or in Our pauses so its her fault", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:16:03", "owner": "sebastian_wiegand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305932672301586, "text": "Anyone wanna call the HR and report how starving a person for ten hours in inhumane?", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:35:43", "owner": "izzymoonbeam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109883362576030, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:34:49", "owner": "israelzenwirt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046341374673497, "text": "In Germany we say „ wir haben noch Brot zuhause „", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:21:48", "owner": "timon_mcfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079287338086188, "text": "I think that this was how the Snickers commercial got conceived", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:06:46", "owner": "valeriependelton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095241268774372, "text": "@leeanbibi חחחחחחחחחחחחחחח הנה את", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:45:31", "owner": "ofek__av", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072298943212754, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T12:47:32", "owner": "aii.0r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101437516712505, "text": "Same reaction after 12h 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T12:38:54", "owner": "niroxryze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023618279578980, "text": "I don't wanna laugh I know how that feels😢", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:37:29", "owner": "tawonzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857369503479767, "text": "QuickGive her a piece of lettuce before she blows up", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:54:57", "owner": "freddy20262", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912802783217442, "text": "Nothinggggggg!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-21T06:12:45", "owner": "mikefrm0925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080645417061609, "text": "Why did I hear her voice sound like a dog barking when she said \"nothing\"? 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:55:09", "owner": "tkkl_hydra_985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024117653571187, "text": "Girl just give her her wingstop", "created_at": "2025-10-20T21:32:29", "owner": "nevaehrosehigham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167269099327656, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:13:29", "owner": "rjbi.ker21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950818798043177, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:01:05", "owner": "ba_kolik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024281315575724, "text": "@kingkongsju", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:32:41", "owner": "helsehanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926095240139400, "text": "She would die starving in my car, yelling narcisistic bi*ch", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:40:04", "owner": "techa_hc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383060413178559, "text": "Ah yes, the flesh is craving something so unnecessary....😈", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:11:49", "owner": "1cor151kjb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064219352617076, "text": "literally", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:00:29", "owner": "6o6._.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083820455313130, "text": "For someone working for 10 hour she got a lot of energy huh😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:24:36", "owner": "blazingfate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074987240269845, "text": "@anna_maria_seth  אה,אז לי בעצם יש תגובות נורמטיביות", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:28:00", "owner": "anastacianetz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847645891583632, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:24:03", "owner": "bikers_john", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061110371403397, "text": "Good music", "created_at": "2025-10-20T12:15:51", "owner": "roysleepys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930293443106569, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T08:22:44", "owner": "aditmodesenyap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881910622288270, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T06:15:24", "owner": "damian_09110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069134987360561, "text": "Wkwkwk ga sadar kayak gtu, tpi pas udah makan langsung kalem", "created_at": "2025-10-19T23:52:49", "owner": "lian.sahara_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927027322135162, "text": "I ÆÆÆT NOTHINGGGGGGG👹", "created_at": "2025-10-19T17:35:25", "owner": "aaliacandice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055209884634914, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T16:19:58", "owner": "chrisinfalls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900321436295406, "text": "Pfft you're not you when you're hungry XDD", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:31:26", "owner": "harmonygalaxystar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287976895273680, "text": "the most reasonable crash out 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:51:19", "owner": "lostxtrace_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069108422346389, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:15:56", "owner": "ghine_mila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091867912889810, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:00:14", "owner": "your_dc_fashionista_mogul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137926414454899, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:34:53", "owner": "mireinadelaluna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107915860523716, "text": "Um...not funny at all bro", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:36:23", "owner": "yioli_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074838662141581, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T22:25:29", "owner": "meet_9100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161694370378339, "text": "Omg take a chill pill", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:41:18", "owner": "aet_ed83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924855877116474, "text": "Hot", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:40:24", "owner": "na_won_bin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933753262098419, "text": "Shit 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥 I'm on fire", "created_at": "2025-10-18T03:11:57", "owner": "rogue_nation_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157330477393482, "text": "Someone a sandwich", "created_at": "2025-10-18T03:11:41", "owner": "rogue_nation_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927770641112269, "text": "My Fridays:", "created_at": "2025-10-17T23:12:14", "owner": "maralcloudie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038433275687098, "text": "One girl worked 10 hrs for first time broke her completely😂 men do it on basis", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:14:18", "owner": "alex_sjhs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888135889240737, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T19:25:51", "owner": "richard_speed_31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021566375773614, "text": "I am here for it and i have also done it more than enough times 👏😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T14:30:02", "owner": "jessica.griffinxox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947068549028230, "text": "Understandable", "created_at": "2025-10-16T13:53:31", "owner": "yu__me__ko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100672531641513, "text": "I'm 12 hours can't scream like that😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T01:49:28", "owner": "ummiklsm27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044529392410283, "text": "Announcement kradiye?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T18:46:47", "owner": "madhur232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080222335837820, "text": "I understand her.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:03:48", "owner": "evamariammettelem1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861969592489898, "text": "@arrayaaah", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:26:58", "owner": "msn.sine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331581733230232, "text": "10 hours is good, experiment 14 hours", "created_at": "2025-10-05T03:28:00", "owner": "marcelop159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130315186478140, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T23:15:38", "owner": "jef_semam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856860451533610, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-04T19:24:43", "owner": "motta.fabio_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061852640599037, "text": "😂😂👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:47:56", "owner": "__seffa__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530717065028398, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:35:37", "owner": "doumyoui19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080116895059034, "text": "Senggol bacok klo ga makan seharian gara2 kerja", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:21:38", "owner": "zleepyyyhead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950009962033578, "text": "10hours work and no food ofc she pissoff", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:47:01", "owner": "ruee_bennn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092484469802710, "text": "I mean… im from Czech Republic’s usualy i work 12 hours and than have some snack 😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:42:02", "owner": "lexidraino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078966163998113, "text": "10 hours ain't shit", "created_at": "2025-10-03T23:02:39", "owner": "shawtylo01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949622107015440, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T18:27:50", "owner": "isaia_velas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069869939191360, "text": "I had one day where I worked from 11-9:30 but my co workers are amazing and I get break after five hours", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:04:31", "owner": "rocygonzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981975444752118, "text": "Me when I worked 12 hr shifts twice a week", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:45:27", "owner": "adventureswithsavvy_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323447485213441, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:58:48", "owner": "mahhamhmmd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080571598970299, "text": "Relatable 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:19:17", "owner": "hcrosier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058917317390455, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:21:15", "owner": "northking_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893031997337413, "text": "I need the metal version! That one is better", "created_at": "2025-09-22T03:18:35", "owner": "awfulwasteofspace8926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944481601025458, "text": "Relatable", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:19:03", "owner": "frankthetank491", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876027088309067, "text": "@wingstop  I found your new promo girl", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:20:12", "owner": "deanerrz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083002193506105, "text": "Hangry", "created_at": "2025-09-14T19:08:44", "owner": "lions1951southlondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163113457335973, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:46:53", "owner": "jackelinda1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325700923232484, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:46:41", "owner": "yitoke_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004312334809918, "text": "@jujuxmch 🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:34:48", "owner": "katiecollier22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075150661851901, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T02:18:30", "owner": "mfeeley16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078392191953299, "text": "How was apparatus doing? The transsexual demon.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T21:37:35", "owner": "redxenergyrebellion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339563650206793, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-09-12T16:08:43", "owner": "jillky50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051328376252519, "text": "Imagine pregnant valid reason to crashout😭", "created_at": "2025-09-12T13:18:24", "owner": "2x.eyelin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104004178604463, "text": "She became a sith mid rant her eyes turned red😂", "created_at": "2025-09-11T20:27:01", "owner": "creepersolger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081786514937418, "text": "i think she is hungry", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:29:14", "owner": "_mr.mesbha_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075803690059531, "text": "Must be a Taurus ♉️ 😂this is so meeeee 😭🤦‍♀️😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:43:44", "owner": "alexx.on.fleek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075955370103251, "text": "bruh….. ten hours is light work. i have slept longer then that", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:53:38", "owner": "shelbygeter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162578617334939, "text": "I’m with her lmao get her the wings!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:23:20", "owner": "realjcaban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18478931044072150, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T21:40:34", "owner": "dxnielleizm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072606419033522, "text": "A 10 hour shift or no food is crazy. This is a valid crash out.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:00:36", "owner": "justtrin3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17961500072979182, "text": "Definitely a Taurus", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:24:07", "owner": "01111111100000000000.zero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524644357056872, "text": "She's attending PTA meetings now", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:27:24", "owner": "fennell.carl.88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082294963901420, "text": "NOTHING😭", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:13:56", "owner": "eazyq_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183302482328715, "text": "100 💯 percent real", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:02:01", "owner": "rockinizzy52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971271123786611, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:14:36", "owner": "_navaja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014951825779001, "text": "Girl... u better leave that trash where it belongs.  I bet that's your car he is driving. Trust me, no dick is as good as peace of mind. Bye bye, little boy. Make him tuck and roll along with his bitch ass friends.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:01:36", "owner": "something_clever_82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171088078360577, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T04:58:21", "owner": "najiahfd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17997354923817286, "text": "The way her eyes turn red at the end. Diabolical", "created_at": "2025-09-09T16:03:02", "owner": "madrastra.malvada.molly", "likes": 2283}, {"id": 18009298499619795, "text": "How embarrassing. Damn you need to get the demons out. Not 😎at all. Not sure why society thinks it’s acceptable because it’s not.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:27:22", "owner": "girluenvy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977849709756603, "text": "Sh00t it!", "created_at": "2025-09-09T04:24:03", "owner": "__fukc__all__yall", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18526393747015081, "text": "Someone slap this bitch please", "created_at": "2025-09-09T04:02:19", "owner": "capital_g.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320627557208352, "text": "How do you laugh when someone is truly this mad? Don't you feel thats mentally sick to laugh at her? Im amazed at you and very disappointed at this generation", "created_at": "2025-09-09T02:31:02", "owner": "ava_the_healer", "likes": 11}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["viralmemesdaily", "explorepage", "dailymemes", "viralreels", "foryoupage", "workwoes", "backtoworkblues", "topmemes", "bestmemes", "workmemes", "moneyonline", "corporatehumor", "workhumor", "corporatelife", "corporatememes", "fyp"]},
{"media_id": 3686605997086942105, "shortcode": "DMpdJ8zMSOZ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMpdJ8zMSOZ/", "taken_at": "2025-07-28T10:15:00", "caption": "23 years old, no startup, no team, no product : just vibes and a PowerPoint telling tech CEOs how to grow faster and spend less 😮‍💨", "owner_username": "projetslingshot", "owner_id": "62008356678", "likes": 21883, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0026_DMpdJ8zMSOZ\\DMpdJ8zMSOZ_20250728_101500.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18046876835301146, "text": "McKinsey/BSG/Bain: Have you tried firing all the employees to save cost?", "created_at": "2025-08-08T17:01:32", "owner": "kimhegethorn", "likes": 3370}, {"id": 17875074948285617, "text": "Big 3 > big 4", "created_at": "2025-08-01T21:57:25", "owner": "amirowd", "likes": 403}, {"id": 18078944002907543, "text": "It’s so funny MBB people actually believe they are doing anything but providing cover for what that 50 year old CEO already wants to do", "created_at": "2025-07-31T15:28:32", "owner": "bigheadyakub", "likes": 1519}, {"id": 17862624402391226, "text": "Layoff is the suggestion right?😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T00:30:51", "owner": "ramadana.guna", "likes": 124}, {"id": 18068610905151674, "text": "“Do layoffs, cut the costs, increase revenue- yeah total consulting fees is $30M, thank you very much”", "created_at": "2025-08-17T16:25:37", "owner": "divmht", "likes": 660}, {"id": 18334336447207137, "text": "Consultant after suggesting their clients to fire 10k employees to cut cost 🤓🤓", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:08:14", "owner": "anchit_mishra00000", "likes": 112}, {"id": 18087950728833707, "text": "Big 4 🙋‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-30T18:18:21", "owner": "silverbeast_250", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17858616015416606, "text": "Cue the “cut costs, increase revenues”", "created_at": "2025-08-07T14:23:53", "owner": "marzio_moretti", "likes": 128}, {"id": 17857119414494590, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T09:34:34", "owner": "joeld2642", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18111197014542760, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:10:29", "owner": "pratik_bhange888_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103968361607800, "text": "Job at Renaissance Technologies 💀🌚", "created_at": "2025-09-17T18:09:54", "owner": "shindevishwajeet3112", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17877517650380677, "text": "Jobless guy me watching your rells daily 😢", "created_at": "2025-08-07T08:08:08", "owner": "forest_man_shanmukh", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18389867704132586, "text": "“Just tell them cut costs” Brutal big 3 pill 💔", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:26:35", "owner": "tkachenkoy7", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17935287231061879, "text": "Yeah, and I managed the big threes 💰", "created_at": "2025-08-09T01:19:18", "owner": "__willcullen", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18133355716454409, "text": "Process mining. Trust", "created_at": "2025-09-23T03:09:54", "owner": "chippres", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084596932783052, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-24T16:39:15", "owner": "timurahmadi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068805089471186, "text": "@cheeekuuu.hides.shit", "created_at": "2025-08-09T09:16:19", "owner": "anarispomo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064886636617627, "text": "What about Leyton?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:05:59", "owner": "ikhlas_khokhitta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877819930282416, "text": "@richiedhar", "created_at": "2025-09-03T11:21:49", "owner": "sma024____", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18235312819290426, "text": "Increase revenue, reduce costs", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:44:54", "owner": "mark_breitenbach1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959190073006819, "text": "Ah yes, FP&A", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:35:03", "owner": "johnny.ph_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122042731518906, "text": "Can smn explain?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:26:54", "owner": "marcos_ohanian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854707309504005, "text": "cuting costs : firing employees", "created_at": "2025-10-24T11:39:33", "owner": "y.oe29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861467389510443, "text": "McKinsey: 😎🍸💰 \nBSG/Bain: 😏✌🏻\nBig 4: 🙄😬", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:11:36", "owner": "architecoco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083310752313934, "text": "Banking is great to do for a few years. Then leave and NEVER look back. Thank me later", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:52:50", "owner": "canarywharfiancouk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072204101190711, "text": "I hate consulting", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:18:07", "owner": "harry_watson355", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130866226476234, "text": "Blackstone ♠️🦇", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:28:21", "owner": "calliax_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077239160044380, "text": "Yea but they larp a 40 page document to say that so it seems like they did something", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:32:39", "owner": "sandrobatinovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079205153050477, "text": "Copium", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:14:04", "owner": "axecanic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076579006856094, "text": "Big 3 are actual riyal shit!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:39:32", "owner": "babbu_bisleri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157240108379976, "text": "Negative se bach k", "created_at": "2025-09-06T10:50:40", "owner": "raghvendrasingh1542", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090775741683468, "text": "M & C", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:35:46", "owner": "inf.anu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197896231313890, "text": "Goldman sachs?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:34:05", "owner": "being.ali.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937965847053030, "text": "@pungolinii 250K né ?", "created_at": "2025-08-20T09:34:56", "owner": "joeld2642", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920566975137051, "text": "Mfs 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-16T06:52:28", "owner": "sam.iqbal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099460489595844, "text": "Consultant = biggest bullshit", "created_at": "2025-08-13T08:47:21", "owner": "ben_bak96", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18158211025375211, "text": "firing HR", "created_at": "2025-08-09T07:40:39", "owner": "deshjfvm", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18373679203182412, "text": "I literally lost my past job because of you motherfuckers", "created_at": "2025-08-08T23:52:23", "owner": "deonyx.52", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151325377381016, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-06T19:55:55", "owner": "krunal_gode", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17939405430021550, "text": "In banking & fonancial markets they usually do the same shits 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-01T15:13:58", "owner": "paulpelletier", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17899140048263170, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-31T20:18:11", "owner": "jo.sfs", "likes": 55}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3752889771216788353, "shortcode": "DQU8Vz-ktuB", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQU8Vz-ktuB/", "taken_at": "2025-10-27T21:11:32", "caption": "subtly flexing our lab setup 🙈\n\n#robotics #uw #robots #engineering #roboticscompetition #roboticsmemes #engineeringmemes #funny #trending #roboticsteam #explorepage", "owner_username": "uwadvancedrobotics", "owner_id": "7084885736", "likes": 27691, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0027_DQU8Vz-ktuB\\DQU8Vz-ktuB_20251027_211132.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18097239079749976, "text": "Why so many gay flags?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T02:06:36", "owner": "bigdawgn_", "likes": 637}, {"id": 18428999779102074, "text": "no aidens were hurt in the making of this reel (i think)", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:18:30", "owner": "divya_gatta", "likes": 2322}, {"id": 18099384631784950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:46:37", "owner": "blueprintjokerbalatro", "likes": 200}, {"id": 18028341716742579, "text": "i support womens rights and wrongs", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:17:20", "owner": "swara_seshadri", "likes": 5202}, {"id": 17891746218222015, "text": "i support women", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:14:47", "owner": "_sarhaw", "likes": 303}, {"id": 18138183340462323, "text": "w flags", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:52:48", "owner": "_kosuken", "likes": 615}, {"id": 18000189935824215, "text": "But aiden is cute. a hug wouldve been enough", "created_at": "2025-10-27T22:24:33", "owner": "nvl.studios", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18094410031828316, "text": "No price tag on Aiden because he's priceless 👍😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T02:39:14", "owner": "thesupersoto", "likes": 67}, {"id": 18061271270184334, "text": "the P1S is NOT worth 9k", "created_at": "2025-10-28T03:42:06", "owner": "nicomcc24", "likes": 304}, {"id": 18111774004608796, "text": "i looove the amt of pride flags <3", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:44:45", "owner": "aarav_s_boring_username", "likes": 62}, {"id": 17982134909867877, "text": "We love women in male dominated fields 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:14:46", "owner": "calvins_granddaughter", "likes": 421}, {"id": 17900930985325644, "text": "Whole lotta cornballs in the comments", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:23:14", "owner": "landonut55", "likes": 226}, {"id": 18119270839543169, "text": "Please tell Aiden he’s really cute and I want him to", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:53:31", "owner": "kit.dkat", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18274611661303702, "text": "Okay but why have we got the lipstick lesbian flag up and not the sunset one", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:21:25", "owner": "lumamoder", "likes": 62}, {"id": 17982915326906625, "text": "A P1S is NOT 9400$ dawg 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-28T00:14:21", "owner": "richaaaaaaddddddd", "likes": 198}, {"id": 18420050815114055, "text": "i saw that flag so no like", "created_at": "2025-10-31T14:51:51", "owner": "cikengoos", "likes": 208}, {"id": 18288407515278160, "text": "The printers are NOT $9400 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:09:26", "owner": "legostarwarsfan6", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18135173848481310, "text": "I saw that flag so like", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:01:10", "owner": "adadsdaddad", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18153301591414002, "text": "A well designed sentry should survive a punt from every team member\n\n(It’s how he test our bumper durability)", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:48:14", "owner": "feirasflyin", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18079228184127292, "text": "9,400$ for a p1s?!? where are you buying your printer from?😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:17:00", "owner": "jom_0226", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081811811062329, "text": "Aiden is expensive in our hearts 💔", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:44:07", "owner": "ruichu0708", "likes": 77}, {"id": 18072628963995749, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:21:05", "owner": "caminfullform", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18067762619612498, "text": "Why waste money on so much flags? Just put the 🇨🇵 flag. We'll know.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:46:09", "owner": "laith.s.m", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18029062340538185, "text": "Nuh Aiden is worth millions to me 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-28T00:21:18", "owner": "sleepyismylook", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18066213245147871, "text": "clock those flags🥹❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:38:34", "owner": "sillydemicracy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17926773414174195, "text": "Royal guard negates all damage", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:49:26", "owner": "johnf0rt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18363357112086430, "text": "Let it out queen", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:28:58", "owner": "kiri.nakagawa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18539806279053155, "text": "Aiden turned the other cheek. Thanks for being a good neighbor 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01:08:11", "owner": "suhy.unkim", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17842600776606180, "text": "Just wrap one corner of the shelf in a thick roll of foam", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:13:43", "owner": "syngrow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085777873996464, "text": "@aiden", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:12:43", "owner": "justin___hr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18148795495435339, "text": "Aiden's kinda into that iykwim", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:57:19", "owner": "thehuzzisheree", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18119834374532725, "text": "Bambu p1s is only $600", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:55:26", "owner": "hankedge07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982618023866084, "text": "The gay flags are environmental storytelling", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:36:25", "owner": "shadowedwish", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17862953283504084, "text": "hello p1s is 399 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:58:47", "owner": "timxuti", "likes": 96}, {"id": 18090651655931098, "text": "No like for flags", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:14:40", "owner": "simon_oleksin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17968653170823505, "text": "Jack freeman (those who know)", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:50:33", "owner": "jacobgold618", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117000040558982, "text": "Can’t forget our razer mice and keyboards", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:16:26", "owner": "_.skylin._", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079086947126940, "text": "Gotta protect the aidens out here", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:41:19", "owner": "aden_james17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863512831433824, "text": "I feel like my solar car team gonna attack me now...", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:02:53", "owner": "phipps_aiden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936399013102213, "text": "that p1s is not NEAR that much", "created_at": "2025-12-19T22:17:10", "owner": "slut4vanilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079965808947435, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:10:37", "owner": "musical.ash2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103978294664477, "text": "It's amazing. The only time fags have ever been funny is copying normal people, and they still manage to fuck it up", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:50:53", "owner": "spacebeleren4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060671060284705, "text": "O7 for the flags", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:57:11", "owner": "p.m.average.me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376784755158846, "text": "How did you spend 9.4k on a 500 dollar printer?", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:43:16", "owner": "shinythingiess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102952333736860, "text": "woah flags… cool…", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:52:09", "owner": "ellieishere128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981577557779470, "text": "I love the flags", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:25:43", "owner": "200ratsinatrenchcoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114842818517585, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:39:50", "owner": "yeshuahofmeister", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869828233496593, "text": "Im buying him for £5", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:16:16", "owner": "jeff_the_superjolly_land_shark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545880187057634, "text": "I want to work in this lab🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:39:13", "owner": "kzhzhba_poteryal_acc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869030005492091, "text": "Aiden cute, kiss not punch", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:33:32", "owner": "raecox0808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990338694874863, "text": "As a different Aidan, I fully support this course of action", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:21:16", "owner": "aidan_the_hacker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352218136206024, "text": "A p1s is $400 bro", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:55:46", "owner": "elwoodb25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929238718156542, "text": "Can i have Aiden", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:25:13", "owner": "kai.as.always", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082409477329293, "text": "Iron your flags", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:51:51", "owner": "diridam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992280072885350, "text": "not the lipstick lesbian flag...", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:40:03", "owner": "v.casey.reynolds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112552336610972, "text": "P1s isnt that expensive vro", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:33:33", "owner": "skameneoliver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052512704657280, "text": "The p1s is 400 dollars why u lie", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:13:30", "owner": "allicat232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056463398320249, "text": "Lesbian flag mentioned ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:02:35", "owner": "lyra_logic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154305343412326, "text": "??? A P1S isn’t 9 grand what the fuck lol. Mine was 1400?? You can get the base printer for less than 500 right now.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:48:16", "owner": "mystic12321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320926228168002, "text": "Peak flags, don't listen to cikengoos", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:37:53", "owner": "pfnove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064191251190493, "text": "Its always Aiden", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:35:27", "owner": "amyisek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087087887057264, "text": "Aiden has better headphones than u :/", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:29:58", "owner": "moistcologne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084968126089736, "text": "I support women’s right and lefts", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:23:55", "owner": "maximum.overload01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058388318301223, "text": "That is not how much a P1S printer costs 🤓☝️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:03:56", "owner": "stevinatorx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969514419975266, "text": "So aiden's free, right ?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:43:07", "owner": "takanobecca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086164328293089, "text": "Liking for the lesbian flag", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:27:38", "owner": "dandelion_jackalope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072759386598637, "text": "LEBANESE🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍🌈", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:13:30", "owner": "offensive_critic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869253391479652, "text": "I love the fag-flags", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:01:18", "owner": "s1mply.amy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075155507010110, "text": "Not the emotional support twink!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:42:38", "owner": "wheelindealin69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858100222503078, "text": "Can you deck Aiden again please?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:30:09", "owner": "marborf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121380043472469, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:39:37", "owner": "n.m.hunter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061647167539427, "text": "Gotta use your elbow", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:08:03", "owner": "the_raisin_cookie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085563443080850, "text": "Yay for all the flags", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:55:46", "owner": "m98.p1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066187472161589, "text": "I saw those flags so like", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:25:26", "owner": "elias_kom_sangedakru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068128193116590, "text": "AIDEN NOOOOOOO", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:11:01", "owner": "ari.riptide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085823860827753, "text": "a ps1 especially without an ams is $600 not $9k", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:08:43", "owner": "nate.i.think", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080697668177219, "text": "O hoped it be a good video but no is just feminists", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:42:57", "owner": "cutie_nigga_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868147198490965, "text": "Justice for Aiden, he is priceless leave him alone", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:01:32", "owner": "nathan_dorima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993205659852618, "text": "What did Aiden do? :(", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:20:50", "owner": "silvory259", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996828972845760, "text": "who hates aiden", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:41:54", "owner": "thia.irl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026051855770121, "text": "aidan uses the same model of headphones as me :3", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:20:20", "owner": "zoeyathena99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894896506225932, "text": "i support women", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:13:53", "owner": "fiishsii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986876892872947, "text": "Aiden: Jail", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:59:16", "owner": "vinthepro7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980578506932014, "text": "Aw cmon Aiden is worth something", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:23:40", "owner": "onyxbatter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088007092799344, "text": "Aiden is priceless", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:08:35", "owner": "numetal_guy97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874803481451766, "text": "p1s aint cost 9400", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:55:00", "owner": "clouded__quartz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854551087535131, "text": "Poor aiden", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:42:47", "owner": "zealouschoice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099694033808793, "text": "Crazy ass flags", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:27:28", "owner": "mapleyakii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096482845889507, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:51:48", "owner": "drunklonelypotato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894719419222208, "text": "AIDEN NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:27:52", "owner": "georgi0zhelev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029398163785090, "text": "Dropkick that twink 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:50:58", "owner": "thesinofenvy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064047980450863, "text": "When angy in lab, the intern is the one who caused the problem.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:20:32", "owner": "hinckleybenjamin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089465824767745, "text": "perfect 👍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:33:12", "owner": "simpsoliloque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385624576181670, "text": "P1s is like 600$", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:15:05", "owner": "garthamp3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885888538404643, "text": "Hey I went there to visit the place 6 months ago!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:22:45", "owner": "mj1g_santi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111314047592902, "text": "What about the organs?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:29:33", "owner": "the_dimentioneer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073632647018715, "text": "Nah, you gotta go through it, don’t stop", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:55:10", "owner": "kongar_lives", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936183427102084, "text": "P1S 🔥🔥 is 400 $", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:26:56", "owner": "dostavljac.novigrad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133184533469183, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:48:02", "owner": "thomasthtank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087901357980061, "text": "So to make stage combat work you wanna hide the strike in the camera angle and follow through. The target has to sell it…", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:28:40", "owner": "crosis101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928019839160356, "text": "MORE QUEER FLAGS IN RESEARCH LABS !!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:40:09", "owner": "chloe.isabella.13", "likes": 2126}, {"id": 18289377769275009, "text": "gawd dayum do y'all got 14 P1S' or what", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:05:16", "owner": "kachowoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060220058536208, "text": "i support womens wrongs", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:55:47", "owner": "legobionicle42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842887252615342, "text": "Our Doori 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:30:34", "owner": "herewego_robotics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928063570155057, "text": "The year I did robotics our budget was 100 bucks plus the starter kit....", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:00:43", "owner": "26shafel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077561635919621, "text": "A p1s is NOT even a tenth of that bro", "created_at": "2025-11-09T18:22:51", "owner": "nuggetnotn1gga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982497861763484, "text": "perfect 👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:08:25", "owner": "denizozii_rl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985717629747793, "text": "Ain’t no damn P1S or even 4 worth 9k 😭. Lost all credibility right there", "created_at": "2025-11-06T05:41:37", "owner": "nathanv_g", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882701653408056, "text": "8k markup on a P1S is nuts", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:51:01", "owner": "mr_zattack101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970045098970789, "text": "Wait how is the p1s like 10k", "created_at": "2025-11-03T01:24:42", "owner": "lktwoten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144356764388896, "text": "Should havd used double-knee drop like Robin", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:18:37", "owner": "warrenfernandes9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039415022707218, "text": "P1s costs like 600 euro", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:28:55", "owner": "serowa.kanapka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986925309897663, "text": "$9400? Try like $600\n\nI slap mine all the time when it makes a weird noise during maintenance\n\nIt’s important to assert dominance over the printer", "created_at": "2025-10-29T05:56:44", "owner": "nick.birnie", "likes": 469}, {"id": 17882555406285855, "text": "Bruh wtf is there so many gayslop that doesn't need to be there", "created_at": "2025-10-29T01:38:29", "owner": "blackiceop45", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059493842443300, "text": "Sometimes it’s just like that", "created_at": "2025-10-28T03:37:22", "owner": "daniellehates._.bananas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065570666098774, "text": "Yesss Aiden", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:09:50", "owner": "yo_shzer0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069555689599704, "text": "$9400 for a Bambu Lab? I know this video is for fun, but I got my P1P for like $600-$700. No way a P1S comes anywhere near $9400.", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:38:50", "owner": "rio_larsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884196196393662, "text": "noooo", "created_at": "2025-10-27T22:28:57", "owner": "aidans_x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911458096244880, "text": "I love beating men", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:43:27", "owner": "ruichu0708", "likes": 7}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["robotics", "uw", "robots", "engineering", "roboticscompetition", "roboticsmemes", "engineeringmemes", "funny", "trending", "roboticsteam", "explorepage"]},
{"media_id": 3676118204545531499, "shortcode": "DMEMge2SH5r", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMEMge2SH5r/", "taken_at": "2025-07-13T22:58:31", "caption": "these sf parties r soooo lit bro…\n#sf #startup #yc #waterloo #western", "owner_username": "derrick_hacks", "owner_id": "72355136343", "likes": 69332, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0028_DMEMge2SH5r\\DMEMge2SH5r_20250713_225831.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18056630597365505, "text": "Omg I saw you bro, you were so sad on the couch 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-14T05:35:51", "owner": "trywithbry", "likes": 3005}, {"id": 17953149533985414, "text": "😭😭 why did I see myself here", "created_at": "2025-07-14T05:31:44", "owner": "saraxxlg", "likes": 959}, {"id": 18099867367519457, "text": "Where can I be invited to these LinkedIn parties?", "created_at": "2025-07-15T03:53:01", "owner": "finaldestroyer1", "likes": 1570}, {"id": 18088497844667224, "text": "Bro why do you want her LinkedIn? You’re building B2B SaaS, check her github, ask her about Multi Tenant cloud architecture and OAuth2, etc!! 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-17T06:26:31", "owner": "thevyasamit", "likes": 77}, {"id": 18159550081335446, "text": "This is a VERY different SF than I've experienced 😂 (still funny tho)", "created_at": "2025-08-09T14:54:51", "owner": "citiesbydiana", "likes": 213}, {"id": 18045482909554925, "text": "Nice LinkedIn profile picture Derrick!", "created_at": "2025-07-13T23:14:09", "owner": "chaiyley", "likes": 98}, {"id": 18091075081638109, "text": "partying in the wrong places brother", "created_at": "2025-07-14T08:11:09", "owner": "sidsbestlifemoments", "likes": 306}, {"id": 18081109807871953, "text": "the ladies were really into your LinkedIn", "created_at": "2025-07-13T23:10:36", "owner": "ethan_r_ng", "likes": 10760}, {"id": 18045783953557615, "text": "oh hi @avelezarce", "created_at": "2025-07-17T03:09:53", "owner": "sasha.surk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900989884227803, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-15T03:03:00", "owner": "godly.kunal", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17961122012852149, "text": "linkedin hunter 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:32:17", "owner": "farhan.muhammadz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862092007546923, "text": "@sandyorteddy 瘋掉了真的", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:45:20", "owner": "juliayanggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042489212325281, "text": "sorry to buzzkill the party but like idk like this just feels so overdone whichever way u spin it: - if it's not a meme: cringe\n- if it is a meme: kind of unoriginally regurgitates the premise of a phenomenon that has existed so long ago an hbo comedy was made and ended almost a decade ago at this point. this like nihilist postmodern ironic humor is so exhausting and umimpressive bc it's like the safest kind of humor and its sheer unoriginality sorta reflects an attitude of approaching literally everything from a cushy bubble of comfort where you always maintain a radius of ironic distance from actually sincerely grappling with something real and new in this world", "created_at": "2025-07-25T22:56:01", "owner": "kaashmonee", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17957251421974958, "text": "i highkey be doing ts", "created_at": "2025-07-15T22:43:17", "owner": "catlodico__", "likes": 67}, {"id": 17903683128089080, "text": "I got a linkedin connection request while watching this 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-16T14:33:40", "owner": "hereforthevibes25", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17882669790274268, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:12:01", "owner": "bi.yotch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234284362294725, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-28T09:14:25", "owner": "aolin_xu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069037607086210, "text": "help i saw this being filmed 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-16T16:10:01", "owner": "michellee.wang", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18106151680567435, "text": "Guys let's connect on LinkedIn too 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:55:57", "owner": "scorpion_zulema", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863304358431785, "text": "AHAHAHAAHA", "created_at": "2025-07-17T16:49:20", "owner": "levsha_uzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915142726192769, "text": "Why am I smiling 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:49:50", "owner": "herb_sek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093164344653199, "text": "literally me in sg", "created_at": "2025-07-29T14:02:20", "owner": "xngocanhx", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17890330794300743, "text": "Dear connections today I achieved to touch grass and I thought it would be great to notify you", "created_at": "2025-08-12T19:10:16", "owner": "fazilgokceuygar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086227684685687, "text": "future of parties 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-15T10:33:05", "owner": "rajatsandeepsen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065686580189967, "text": "POV: a business student", "created_at": "2025-08-10T01:12:39", "owner": "yxjxxrx", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18123649396486474, "text": "@alisaraewu NO WAY AHAHAHAHAH", "created_at": "2025-08-16T00:17:49", "owner": "dbrockwell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18183402775323426, "text": "I'm also working on a vertical B2B SaaS… Babe-to-Babe as a Service. Can I get ur LinkedIn 👀", "created_at": "2025-08-02T00:09:46", "owner": "lifelenspov", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18078261227076519, "text": "Need to attend these LinkedIn parties", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:41:26", "owner": "oyemanto", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048612047204685, "text": "The only real way to 'connect'", "created_at": "2025-07-23T09:45:12", "owner": "uzi_ded", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094709182646534, "text": "Brooo, git when? LinkedIn is too middle class", "created_at": "2025-08-20T16:56:58", "owner": "_tushar_patel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891447673340550, "text": "@sid.righthere", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:00:14", "owner": "_.ant.ny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343766800165034, "text": "@jmpflores1 try it out", "created_at": "2025-10-13T03:01:56", "owner": "skandmaharjan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18287615845268083, "text": "Idea @kamoliddin_yaxshilikov", "created_at": "2025-07-15T22:27:25", "owner": "bbakhtiyorov___", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18057701294421867, "text": "why is everyone building a b2b saas", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:29:06", "owner": "fwsa.n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922702330130558, "text": "@pablo.ramost", "created_at": "2025-08-27T14:04:07", "owner": "cbregante_js", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015153656575170, "text": "hard", "created_at": "2025-07-15T08:53:19", "owner": "cluelysocial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18413160256110444, "text": "nice ball pit", "created_at": "2025-07-23T04:47:35", "owner": "etymologynerd", "likes": 325}, {"id": 18029111456695888, "text": "hahah great meeting you", "created_at": "2025-07-15T16:08:01", "owner": "rae122602", "likes": 183}, {"id": 17861266473459982, "text": "@aarush.vinay", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:47:15", "owner": "_not.ajay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982068714890634, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:14:48", "owner": "suvvio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876977032263938, "text": "Bruh", "created_at": "2025-07-18T21:00:15", "owner": "engineers_aboba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18418160686096640, "text": "Then you look him up, and realize his b2b saas is a bed and breakfast with sausage as a service", "created_at": "2025-08-11T19:54:58", "owner": "ballestratoad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088824388687683, "text": "Funny coincidence, we are also named Alissa 😅 and we are a vertical B2Both AI startup 💀\n\nLinkedIn on bio!", "created_at": "2025-08-07T17:05:58", "owner": "alissa.app", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063869989957923, "text": "no way was this the party at Mission Control", "created_at": "2025-07-16T03:31:33", "owner": "ayuushhhh_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912564604170265, "text": "western prepared u for this 🤔", "created_at": "2025-07-15T00:06:25", "owner": "anthnyung", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18049969622533620, "text": "Its that networking idea", "created_at": "2025-08-09T08:06:41", "owner": "m_febryadi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17845976577525742, "text": "photography skills unmatched WHOOOO", "created_at": "2025-07-13T23:21:02", "owner": "sallyyguann", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17984926025839339, "text": "@maybe_pravin @prathamesh.dhole.1", "created_at": "2025-08-08T06:33:13", "owner": "ashutosh.pandey_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109965700522596, "text": "I’ve actually done this so many times 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-21T06:02:56", "owner": "10figureslater", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18278695969282153, "text": "Dwaipaah", "created_at": "2025-07-16T08:23:48", "owner": "nkit__1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047105189246743, "text": "aura farming", "created_at": "2025-07-13T23:11:55", "owner": "felixjeong_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053051210608403, "text": "@al.ston  this u big dawg??", "created_at": "2025-07-14T18:32:32", "owner": "aiden.ar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075082759781864, "text": "only cluelys hinge premium can save people", "created_at": "2025-07-19T06:44:42", "owner": "thatssomethn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082566139803683, "text": "Iv already had enough of you on LinkedIn", "created_at": "2025-07-28T04:04:33", "owner": "fainet.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061568054259343, "text": "@niilufar1 🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-25T01:44:14", "owner": "akniyeet.s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977517798736923, "text": "I think i just met my twin😩 WASSUP @derrick_hacks", "created_at": "2025-07-15T15:36:36", "owner": "jjuullliiaallii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17885196984337585, "text": "Bro's spirit animal! 😌🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-07-18T14:29:44", "owner": "adityagupta.11", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085760884762225, "text": "@aitbaev_asik", "created_at": "2025-07-18T09:05:28", "owner": "_.azizk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119794150468783, "text": "If someone mentions LinkedIn on a party, you probably will have better fun at home", "created_at": "2025-07-16T20:49:54", "owner": "hezx13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091458205641118, "text": "@supera15 ive had this issue here", "created_at": "2025-07-18T01:05:16", "owner": "prophgurm12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074237354312705, "text": "startup networking 101!", "created_at": "2025-07-17T08:02:47", "owner": "_tanimpathan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074463395294177, "text": "@puneet.singh13", "created_at": "2025-07-15T15:19:17", "owner": "krish.mehta7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106205521540668, "text": "Hey SF startups, If you need low-cost workers from Pakistan to outsource some tasks. I am the person to reach out to.", "created_at": "2025-07-16T05:04:04", "owner": "moalidepar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17850407310506807, "text": "Lies, should be X", "created_at": "2025-07-16T01:32:18", "owner": "angelaellesun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067523396320914, "text": "No Linkedin Premium too. Let him cook 🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-15T21:30:00", "owner": "chaoarchive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064357028266508, "text": "Meanwhile soham cold emailing them😂", "created_at": "2025-07-15T17:51:36", "owner": "thevishnu23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038702810354503, "text": "Let him cook", "created_at": "2025-07-16T01:46:24", "owner": "agentkarter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963488955941589, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-13T23:31:05", "owner": "harryace_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053278631357182, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:25:12", "owner": "atlazaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900628540337359, "text": "Whats b2b saas", "created_at": "2025-12-15T11:44:43", "owner": "20rrp3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842387332647883, "text": "Linkedin party 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:38:13", "owner": "hapidzf21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005599904667955, "text": "I put a lot of effort on my LinkedIn as well ✨✨✨", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:54:06", "owner": "xnnaxtoys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903934510294694, "text": "It's better to get LinkedIn than instagram ngl❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:26:42", "owner": "saxipatellll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930741616125002, "text": "Keep it halal bra", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:31:34", "owner": "m7mdbakheet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080187134139979, "text": "Why i recognize on this? Hahhahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:11:19", "owner": "isa_salmoria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900087232337726, "text": "That's Lit bro", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:01:30", "owner": "ninjatofuture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430816639104808, "text": "Need to attend linkedin parties", "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:12:01", "owner": "priyanshu_gupta_2113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101459677709943, "text": ":)))", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:31:47", "owner": "eimliilyaiws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336046546234617, "text": "@derrick_hacks this is peak content but next big thing. Can l get your Penpal Card😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:14:26", "owner": "penpal.cards", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073527419351792, "text": "Definition of connected hahahaha cool", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:55:10", "owner": "topaanbgs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102276946580792, "text": "Great idea Let’s connect on linkedin 🥳", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:33:12", "owner": "sweettp0tat0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024729245771426, "text": "This would work on me", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:38:28", "owner": "anushka.nd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037054814709271, "text": "LinkedIn parties are on a whole different level", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:20:57", "owner": "jussitorresgonzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290178190258922, "text": "Rip: linkedeb", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:12:41", "owner": "davronbek.tech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033554750711027, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T16:32:52", "owner": "homewithalejandra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115220041532418, "text": "Connecting irl bro 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:36:45", "owner": "_kennntth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873961393429275, "text": "😂👏😍", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:36:01", "owner": "alzhaanka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910088590091868, "text": "*I'm *I *I", "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:58:40", "owner": "notxander.123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951129874040031, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:28:16", "owner": "thomascdawson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059387744426607, "text": "What is bro doing", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:44:44", "owner": "inom.careertips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082551523760862, "text": "\"you're not even the first one\" 🤣😭😭😭😭😭😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:53:03", "owner": "aadiisfuckinginsane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071914567913615, "text": "Crazy 😂 founder.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:48:32", "owner": "hedayaat12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530466652046682, "text": "Is mfckr flirting or raising capital?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T00:19:29", "owner": "lal0_mohedano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068067173245001, "text": "Job market is so bad that dating market is easier 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:06:50", "owner": "ozgurkrll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069679109232257, "text": "We're building a SaaS too 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-19T22:51:13", "owner": "jobfix.ai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951305709886317, "text": "Is this what we call Networking?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:16:09", "owner": "abdokujo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356220283087491, "text": "Cool can we moots on LinkedIn?", "created_at": "2025-09-15T10:49:11", "owner": "bulbanooss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855581164528522, "text": "Cornball", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:48:20", "owner": "hmcn3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108984229483437, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:27:54", "owner": "essie.bx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923987341120966, "text": "Who wants to connectttt", "created_at": "2025-09-10T00:16:08", "owner": "faso_365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945444163020320, "text": "id love to connect", "created_at": "2025-09-09T22:26:09", "owner": "harissaefulloh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022066289754048, "text": "lol", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:51:29", "owner": "bloodytings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525015751025904, "text": "Ya checks out bout right", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:21:54", "owner": "andrhlt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966489633951515, "text": "Lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T10:28:27", "owner": "codewithmercy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353492587089429, "text": "What event is that and which count