": 18018574364534177, "text": "Dead 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-18T05:13:24", "owner": "mohammadmussab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073166608973530, "text": "I’m from France and i’m also building two B2B AI SaaS, how to ve on those parties would love to meet same minded people, French people are stupud abd communist", "created_at": "2025-07-18T01:15:37", "owner": "amilkdg_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069303980034442, "text": "Is it AI-Powered though?", "created_at": "2025-07-17T22:23:41", "owner": "ali_fiaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986367408828557, "text": "Fuck them b2b saas's", "created_at": "2025-07-17T19:19:02", "owner": "sozo_bozo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050565359618742, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-17T14:25:57", "owner": "aaron.farrell1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058658177523070, "text": "Yeahhh", "created_at": "2025-07-17T06:45:54", "owner": "santoshh_nepali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064432790231476, "text": "😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-17T06:39:39", "owner": "befettle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915375037149300, "text": "Let's connect as well also working vertical idea", "created_at": "2025-07-17T06:32:06", "owner": "escapevoyager_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282955330254080, "text": "“I don’t care if ur boy or girl, beautiful or ugly. I just need a job” vibe in the party.", "created_at": "2025-07-17T06:25:03", "owner": "erichuanp824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890684884290138, "text": "Wheres my invite!", "created_at": "2025-07-16T23:25:36", "owner": "hi.its.kristina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060297359209490, "text": "Bro getting crushes off LinkedIn, work smart not hard 💀", "created_at": "2025-07-16T22:33:33", "owner": "syed_mamoon99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873485518390614, "text": "I want to join that party so bad. Guys let’s connect each other’s Linkedin", "created_at": "2025-07-16T19:24:23", "owner": "kropachev099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086279137781015, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2025-07-16T17:17:30", "owner": "raymondwu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520012123006385, "tex