ansoncyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909723277173933, "text": "linked in is always the move", "created_at": "2025-07-15T07:57:19", "owner": "nanoliter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914716867079658, "text": "No way bro @saraxxlg this randomly popped up", "created_at": "2025-07-15T04:30:15", "owner": "zaz_artz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118252594487415, "text": "crazyyy", "created_at": "2025-07-15T04:07:47", "owner": "kavyasolanke_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094533100618316, "text": "@m.park29", "created_at": "2025-07-15T01:22:51", "owner": "rob.rewey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093878818623124, "text": "Love it 😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-07-15T00:08:15", "owner": "the_corporate_cleaner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063783488469205, "text": "I can’t believe u rly got roy lee to comment💀", "created_at": "2025-07-14T21:12:47", "owner": "evelyn_jiay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043560659312233, "text": "Chat is this rizz?", "created_at": "2025-07-14T20:49:47", "owner": "alexosow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900522289227802, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T20:13:58", "owner": "joshroutley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936497533024571, "text": "who took those headshots i’m tryna get mine done 2", "created_at": "2025-07-13T23:20:35", "owner": "sallyyguann", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["sf", "startup", "yc", "waterloo", "western"]},
{"media_id": 3766034180664830754, "shortcode": "DRDpCJOgasi", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRDpCJOgasi/", "taken_at": "2025-11-15T00:24:59", "caption": "#collegecore #universitylife", "owner_username": "alex.doeslife", "owner_id": "78480232462", "likes": 313795, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0029_DRDpCJOgasi\\DRDpCJOgasi_20251115_002459.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18095739628827600, "text": "I don't think you need attendance in uni", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:56:25", "owner": "bluenavyhospital", "likes": 1543}, {"id": 18075931061236177, "text": "My professor speaks a different language but I force myself to show up", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:30:36", "owner": "chima.ogbonna03", "likes": 19893}, {"id": 18083687606282557, "text": "“I don’t have time to over that topic today but it will be in the exam, so make sure to read chapters 4-6 by tonight” 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:18:42", "owner": "suibian.le", "likes": 8504}, {"id": 17843648163616817, "text": "I tell myself... I'll skip this week and start attending next one... Then again... And again... And again...", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:15:28", "owner": "janciccdusan", "likes": 2474}, {"id": 18382707619196633, "text": "Uni experience is just teaching yourself and going to class to know what you should teach yourself 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:16:57", "owner": "ibrahim_is_the_king", "likes": 409}, {"id": 17902227738162964, "text": "Lectures are a type of daydreaming session", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:27:14", "owner": "betulisleer", "likes": 1200}, {"id": 18097617835753744, "text": "It's sooo true, I lost my interest for lectures rather I prefer studying at dorm or the library.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:43:30", "owner": "ismoilyusupovv", "likes": 293}, {"id": 18322696972168404, "text": "Anytime I feel like skipping I remember the tuition fees and drag myself to class 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:39:35", "owner": "ni_ni_noir", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18085008032044455, "text": "I don’t be eating in my class tho, I got manners", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:44:57", "owner": "asian_bryan_athlete_rapper_", "likes": 130}, {"id": 18147185674438910, "text": "I don’t like how accurate this is", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:21:21", "owner": "_jackrob15", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18247779922290965, "text": "U get there and then you realize why you don’t go there everyday", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:48:33", "owner": "admu12365", "likes": 58}, {"id": 18301853146269823, "text": "This Is the most accurate post i have ever seen in my entre life", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:51:28", "owner": "mau_schz.1", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18068894141102971, "text": "this definitely beck hall", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:49:10", "owner": "josiexelizabeth", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18080683412155052, "text": "Bruh I be going to a class and be studying for another subject instead and then cover up this current lecture in the next subject class.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:05:45", "owner": "sai_kri.123", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17930492673130654, "text": "Collage isn't noisy like highschool but I had to tolerate that so much the idea of leaving to learn was a massive chore.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:03:56", "owner": "rosesarepink210", "likes": 622}, {"id": 18061661954449313, "text": "I just listing and taking some notes but do everything in the library or at home", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:22:13", "owner": "luc_ille06", "likes": 183}, {"id": 18054291413652252, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:00:17", "owner": "zanvolt_", "likes": 599}, {"id": 17865985254436173, "text": "sometimes they make u talk to ur peers.. or group up. makes me wanna skip lowk.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:06:27", "owner": "kayla.flowerss", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18033420257733346, "text": "90% of classes are basically me attending to know what we are covering that day just for me to go home and YouTube it for practice and conceptual understanding", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:45:32", "owner": "heylookitsjay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982935948763614, "text": "or dont go?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:19:39", "owner": "yahya_m.f", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18432064588106547, "text": "I physically cannot listen to a person talk about theory for more than 30 minutes so i end up playing minecraft 🥀\nSo far passed all my classes btw", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:56:41", "owner": "laundarburvisugunsbumba", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090139525899212, "text": "I never skip a lecture because I barely do anything as is so the least I can do is attend the class", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:02:24", "owner": "gentleman._monster", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914257822090929, "text": "Wait sandwich might be the new meta", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:21:27", "owner": "lcelliott1448", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073219526585853, "text": "Literally just showing up so my professors feelings don’t get hurt", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:32:45", "owner": "melanie.blackhurst", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18104644099736977, "text": "Universal experience", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:46:10", "owner": "_mahnoor19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081603313893612, "text": "This but without mandatory attendace😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:30:00", "owner": "oliver.gadda", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18374964265154760, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:35:50", "owner": "mysteriiiiiousgriiiiip", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18064440416414320, "text": "realllllllll", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:33:59", "owner": "shanttg", "likes": 209}, {"id": 18185205688343503, "text": "I get attendance and just play balatro the whole class, then i go home and play more balatro", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:57:13", "owner": "predufipke", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18013293641801593, "text": "I know UCSDih when I see it", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:44:45", "owner": "dannyboi77777", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18083693966097452, "text": "@wth.ea", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:12:05", "owner": "jennymoonyy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094284091897027, "text": "Class is doom scrolling time", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:37:44", "owner": "fiona.rodrm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097995421701687, "text": "There’s no attendance in that lecture hall Bru come on", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:02:39", "owner": "anders.caleb", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18078144736943812, "text": "ain’t no way you took off the tomatoes and pickles", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:31:30", "owner": "snehadasanii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084951518317811, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:53:05", "owner": "klein_yuan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097503664827626, "text": "Could not be more accurate 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:02:48", "owner": "ja1d3n468", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351782107166572, "text": "I just skip the lecture and wake up to refresh the instapoll", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:32:10", "owner": "j3ff.lln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047771432412686, "text": "cuz the teacher doesn't even teach shit cough cough history cough cough", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:57:27", "owner": "daoist_seo", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18062527520199936, "text": "@quemqueamorem @rainer.mariia", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:45:01", "owner": "sousisuke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027205271758267, "text": "Iswrrr", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:03:32", "owner": "_rxndyy.y_", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18112080466523842, "text": "what is he eating 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:32:46", "owner": "dailytangover", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081776495513271, "text": "@paula.puddingxx @ma.urice3782", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:56:47", "owner": "nth.dvs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882275986411719, "text": "turbo can save u fr", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:49:28", "owner": "ch0w.mien", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18300031231259726, "text": "Exactly that is the whole problem", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:12:59", "owner": "natalia.nerchitecture", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034796246715199, "text": "Before..make notes for questions about the readings and lesson to get more reading material from prof...then study again after", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:01:17", "owner": "mikeywilliamh", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17942323752088662, "text": "@honghuang9940 big facts", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:36:46", "owner": "4es1r__0g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093777919845725, "text": "So real", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:34:22", "owner": "mani_the_madi", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18064216496528981, "text": "@lamtang.vu found you again", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:29:19", "owner": "avomilk_271", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076088399266719, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:37:01", "owner": "akdenizzyagmur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166585186377587, "text": "@with.nezrin sen", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:00:43", "owner": "nurmamedova_selbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512153158069721, "text": "Half half", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:25:24", "owner": "paulwitzke01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046187675680478, "text": "@hadaredri21 את", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:52:44", "owner": "saadon_ayala", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963484584990069, "text": "Literally me", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:22:54", "owner": "ryyp_rp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034813709721426, "text": "you mean studying....", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:05:38", "owner": "fxdeltax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032898725717522, "text": "Dude!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:08:08", "owner": "docadg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070747730092253, "text": "For med student we have to open YouTube and watch ninja nerds like what the fuck is wrong with our college", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:49:15", "owner": "dar._.wiinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908154871281615, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:20:19", "owner": "war.of.legends1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090441952779007, "text": "For sure", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:12:29", "owner": "nigeltiong0624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106694272633114, "text": "Yup college summed up fr", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:43:54", "owner": "danielle.alien_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118253203499916, "text": "That’s me in high school eating in every damn minute😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:30:40", "owner": "8eeq2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161567467394299, "text": "he gets it", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:26:57", "owner": "notes.by.nick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934026988139682, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T03:15:47", "owner": "studywithjessica1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098172526869962, "text": "I don’t even need the attendance, I just go", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:25:18", "owner": "_tahera_yasin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048325031460919, "text": "Needed 80% attendance for my visa btw", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:40:50", "owner": "shawarmainmymouth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899372917346824, "text": "I'm doing this rn", "created_at": "2025-12-15T10:10:57", "owner": "ambhasing9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929078683158792, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T23:41:29", "owner": "egl_35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113781358590213, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-12-14T18:22:52", "owner": "luna___0730", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552566467058394, "text": "No because why do I have to resort to teaching myself bro, I pay YOU to teach me brochaco 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:15:28", "owner": "akangj0ji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881360503428148, "text": "*International relations major", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:16:21", "owner": "angelos_balkn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958778532889415, "text": "I lowkey just sign the attendance sheet and dip without hesitation ✌️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:16:46", "owner": "weirdnugg_lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368551804092729, "text": "I just eat in class all day at this point", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:39:09", "owner": "piker.marie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303778954271078, "text": "Lectures are a try not to pass out challenge for me on the daily", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:34:02", "owner": "hannah.gurganus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330558622241001, "text": "are you playing kahoot", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:33:34", "owner": "solvely.ai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854540782587585, "text": "Watching your teachers during the day like you understand. Learn at home in the night with google and ai 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:14:22", "owner": "slihono_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901161289180455, "text": "frfr", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:14:29", "owner": "riccardo_avanzato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869109913487489, "text": "❤️‍🔥😡😡", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:18:51", "owner": "tor000020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065719289624767, "text": "Me sa ggsr", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:20:01", "owner": "hyxii_quiin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860819293553362, "text": "stopped showing up to class and got better grades bc these people cant teach for shit", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:12:51", "owner": "kyleevdv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542820334000886, "text": "Ong I just sit there and listen even tho I ain’t understanding shyt and then teach myself when exams are coming up", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:17:01", "owner": "arya__adam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338238730230898, "text": "@bogac.hanbora wtf re u talkin about", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:16:31", "owner": "ishaa.nzahir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897627940204243, "text": "When the attendance is worth 5-10% of your grade 😩evil ….", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:08:51", "owner": "nicolerotceh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865175776526969, "text": "I kind donthe same thing when I get home I had to teach myself lol I don’t know why", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:38:36", "owner": "bianca.notely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070800893374582, "text": "Kahoot testtt😑💔", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:44:28", "owner": "bmd2121_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885449920407549, "text": "REALEST", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:59:16", "owner": "malesigma146", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183617782355116, "text": "Not 3 of my classmates reposting this😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:02:27", "owner": "_mausoleum_do0r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337299796232607, "text": "🚶‍♂️👍 شسوي بعد", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:05:20", "owner": "v8h2_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849983866601464, "text": "I don't understand shi from lectures and when I selfstudy I understand things better but when I don't show up I feel like I'm missing important things", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:00:06", "owner": "hikmetzapkinus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119772931555940, "text": "I always do this too lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:19:54", "owner": "lifew.sadielady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889658311387969, "text": "Ya I give up bro", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:31:02", "owner": "misscupid_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871329298469676, "text": "Engineering moment", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:00:52", "owner": "theforceisback", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067463243621682, "text": "I pay attention and participate but still don’t get it so I re-teach it to myself 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:21:55", "owner": "ladybuggy11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043403567700301, "text": "yea", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:20:29", "owner": "isaiahh_jj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063551999541882, "text": "No learn 1 month before exam....", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:19:56", "owner": "__harsha__raj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965681971000389, "text": "I study at the lecture myself", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:00:36", "owner": "therealcimorexave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864842869519502, "text": "At least respect the place!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:11:45", "owner": "annatample25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984152181763017, "text": "for real💔", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:43:36", "owner": "frrranlish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073255847366507, "text": "We need 12/14 attendance to pass a class in my uni. So yeah lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:25:26", "owner": "qisthy.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084707405092042, "text": "Sounds like expensive highschool", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:59:07", "owner": "junebug243159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060044528641538, "text": "i don't care about the attendance bro i just show up so my mom doesnt slime me out for staying at home for like more than 2 days in a row 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:50:33", "owner": "aliisafraid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863668096536074, "text": "Basic college gameplay", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:10:17", "owner": "hrtsnam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172231489374705, "text": "My professor takes attendance for a big chunk of our overall grade", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:14:45", "owner": "ryancopeland04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988415658884326, "text": "Imagine having a class big enough to do this all of my classes are TINY", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:52:50", "owner": "salts5328", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063233996195759, "text": "basic knowledge", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:27:45", "owner": "nu.92002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980568225925774, "text": "Fr fr", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:18:21", "owner": "tttttrong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085662698045332, "text": "This is so me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:53:58", "owner": "rcm_lina_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986992614868531, "text": "university is a waste of time. i learn nothing useful 🫥", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:44:18", "owner": "arte_fby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890480953382641, "text": "Waste of time", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:31:53", "owner": "psstitsme__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305406538267721, "text": "Riyal", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:46:02", "owner": "ichirukiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330809224209263, "text": "Guilty of this unfortunately", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:40:00", "owner": "nenem_ddin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891822046244474, "text": "Is this York Hall 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:41:32", "owner": "_alex.haeundai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900074914338097, "text": "just to show up to the lectures that make little to no sense and then there’s that indian guy who can explain a whole semester to you in just 3 days", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:11:16", "owner": "roger_cassa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074491949243265, "text": "I hate that 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:39:57", "owner": "mlkibear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098605021772716, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:21:40", "owner": "tutorx.in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060635423541738, "text": "Jokes on you I don't even teach myself", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:05:44", "owner": "joshua.jang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118467148553835, "text": "th tao", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:08:21", "owner": "sebastionberyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096144952798415, "text": "Pretty much. Couldn’t understand 2 of my professors this semester. Literal gibberish", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:14:38", "owner": "tommy_flowers05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104701666659394, "text": "so real", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:38:07", "owner": "210np_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061705595200975, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:31:55", "owner": "heisayon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070775810345811, "text": "That's actually not a bad idea. Thanks for the advice.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:11:01", "owner": "nullusva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297854035260598, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:47", "owner": "selam_awit80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847411540610247, "text": "like do they expect me to pay full attention at 8 in the morning?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:29", "owner": "nob0dy__k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862417393460567, "text": "Wtf is that table", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:53:47", "owner": "q_21_q2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080733320122344, "text": "Not applicable to engineering or meds. Cause either you show up to class or not, youre gonna need a lot to study either way 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:47", "owner": "glowingboom5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073326038196817, "text": "My turbines class at erau… God", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:09:39", "owner": "roshandb_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095041636859100, "text": "Ong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:03:37", "owner": "joehari_49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549391435042911, "text": "Me right now", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:57:17", "owner": "ehd_anatole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094228396698354, "text": "Kahoot!!!!!🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:26:21", "owner": "naomipastorchong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078273479126843, "text": "LOL SO TRUE", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:18:01", "owner": "0.51502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902164486302374, "text": "real 😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:22:05", "owner": "doseofmado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956468554033536, "text": "Then why are you paying to go to college/uni?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:45:26", "owner": "matty.b333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107922274719109, "text": "My chem professor taking a whole day for vespr structures while I taught myself it with a single 10 min youtube video", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:19:32", "owner": "indoorpumpkin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064671944571382, "text": "@yetong_75", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:38:54", "owner": "elllooopig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179248213320205, "text": "//", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:03:37", "owner": "m_b_d_rouddine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892580368362196, "text": "Mabahith Ilahiyyat", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:35:22", "owner": "daniishmuqri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012763835804940, "text": "They don’t even take attendance for most classes. At least not for STEM, maybe for some culture classes", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:25:33", "owner": "bloodytings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298610485258480, "text": "Chat gpt and Indian guys on YouTube bouta carry my GPA", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:46:50", "owner": "wage_gap_gaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411612286184223, "text": "They always choose to cover the easiest questions from the book too. As if finding the volume of a cylinder will somehow help me find the volume of a rotated conical solid", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:12:31", "owner": "moblago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040378931504818, "text": "Lecturers so shit there is no choice but to teach yourself", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:55:14", "owner": "chess.game.guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157470721406067, "text": "I'm attending to class just to share goon material to the boys", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:48:18", "owner": "nafilrizq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071765366351298, "text": "College is the most useless shit ever", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:20", "owner": "nithish_saran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029055734757522, "text": "Fr🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:42:49", "owner": "a._rwa._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098445091817566, "text": "showing up to class to do other class's assignment", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:23:04", "owner": "revaldi_ariza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864527473524988, "text": "Kahoott", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:36:30", "owner": "otr._.d1ve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037991309718910, "text": "@_minkdesu riel", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:00:50", "owner": "duy_nguyennb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101389891606490, "text": "You tape the lecture and go listen at home", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:53:07", "owner": "missavibaybee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922118437190811, "text": "I got my professor chatgpt at home 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:48:55", "owner": "b.n_m0408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094424122851649, "text": "Naw the worst is the subject is hard in general but the teacher teachers it in there specific way and asks the questions in there own language", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:49:07", "owner": "tw_ig__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876973681440929, "text": "100% accurate or I study another course while in that lecture", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:07:15", "owner": "ess_is_blessed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961763841863020, "text": "Probably the most useless fuck ahh class that’s only available in person rather than being online just gets on my nerves.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:59:30", "owner": "nomad_vizo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201125275320264, "text": "We don't even have attendance but some (incl. Me still go 😂) (we end up just being on our phones and study later)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:13:25", "owner": "panskarpta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366556900092236, "text": "That’s me, especially when I have a lecture with the professor that’s my personal end boss. He has this horrible accent, mumbles and talks in a very quiet voice so you don’t understand a word of you don’t sit in the front row. Also he tends to speak a lot without saying a thing. I used to put in my AirPods, put my hair over my ears and watch something on Netflix during his lessons because frankly I wouldn’t miss anything anyways", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:39:53", "owner": "_astrid.l_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113107450591789, "text": "best strat", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:18:47", "owner": "evan_studies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995494914804047, "text": "exactly 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:51:21", "owner": "_anya.xyy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081620329892066, "text": "This is no lie", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:13:37", "owner": "stephenfromars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073668497012142, "text": "Frrr", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:41:52", "owner": "saradoegah.mamaladyboss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118724887531677, "text": "Bro discovers that uni is not high school", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:35:25", "owner": "fusinghorizons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383317207198415, "text": "Fr that😢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:47:20", "owner": "matisse_ro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094702750887128, "text": "@yakup.ux", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:33:13", "owner": "ferdy_west", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053968541331532, "text": "Just do online college at that point", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:31:25", "owner": "brandon_bruce__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929414005118902, "text": "same reason why i went to school this morning", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:27:57", "owner": "catherine_jieh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879487636329708, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:12:41", "owner": "umdjnvn7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905357527277360, "text": "That was me few years back lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:55:07", "owner": "anna_53155", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972169692970814, "text": "But why does it test like the best meal u have ever had 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:22:53", "owner": "rp_kaalid_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550259083050880, "text": "THIS-", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:37:32", "owner": "achvrra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153394447416475, "text": "So it is a worldwide problem 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:36:32", "owner": "yuliya.it", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076406492237469, "text": "Can’t relate still in high school core ✌🏼🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:30:20", "owner": "not._.mhsn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141200260456055, "text": "Reallllllll", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:45:59", "owner": "st4sia.stia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061092794228711, "text": "And to add salt to the injury it's followed up with tons of paperwork, you pay the tuition to teach yourself 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:56:21", "owner": "n3r0_4rt1g0lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113082349601307, "text": "Kahoot life", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:24:13", "owner": "khuja_drifter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104533699732758, "text": "Literally me", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:57:11", "owner": "sana_am113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940787629088471, "text": "I'm doing this rn", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:42:50", "owner": "pudra_sucuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064129775629820, "text": "Literally what my first semester here was like..", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:10:29", "owner": "urlocalstreethopper._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986768127867982, "text": "GLOBAL canon event", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:03:59", "owner": "matchaavocad0es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070811699369404, "text": "We had a situation in two different subjects that the things we learned never appeared on the exam and the teachers would just lowkey give us the answers for everyone to get a good grade", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:59:29", "owner": "xanderjml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916435327219135, "text": "I fw this heavy", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:00:14", "owner": "isaac_suttmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851794270591601, "text": "watching this video in the middle of class rn", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:23:39", "owner": "whosslang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040823561707688, "text": "What tf are office hours for?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:59:19", "owner": "sai_cep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082208939279641, "text": "Fax. Me getting a 96 on my free response exam after zoning out all class and not watching the lecture videos 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:19:30", "owner": "cjbriggsgsw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968899533967146, "text": "@llanxz_xnv banget", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:41:12", "owner": "amsal_lokananta13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061124252227321, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:10:52", "owner": "dominic.reed04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198771067324392, "text": "Fr man, these professors low-key useless", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:13:57", "owner": "_eviivanova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097157437849356, "text": "I go for the social interaction", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:27:23", "owner": "izzyy.frizzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983252085766155, "text": "Yuppp", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:26:13", "owner": "chovi4nn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985113219919744, "text": "Like, theres one 1.5 hours long class of each subject per week and one 1.5 hour long useless lecture. Thank God we have ChatGPT cuz without it I wouldnt understand shit, and Im not even dumb.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:25:00", "owner": "erik.gaal.2033", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101278300743057, "text": "College core: you go to class for clash royale then go home for clash royale", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:30:24", "owner": "david_yes25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545271475004873, "text": "Need Assignment Help?? DM us!!", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:16:42", "owner": "the_homework_guys_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087620209947577, "text": "I guess this is an international problem", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:56:20", "owner": "takistyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084890174001802, "text": "I dont listen just study in classroom bcs it is more efficient", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:04:38", "owner": "mk._wan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136359328467028, "text": "I pay so much money only for me to go teach myself while in highschool I paid way less and the teachers basically did everything, crazy😮‍💨😩😩", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:24:31", "owner": "tashjaner2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932068846122113, "text": "Your supposed to do all reading before the lecture. Go to lecture like it's review or an opportunity to ask questions about shit you didn't understand and then go home and do homework.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:36:21", "owner": "2oo6.baby", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18029114675561340, "text": "😂😂 teach my self is better than lecturer", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:31:17", "owner": "viii_hikal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105561979573979, "text": "York 2622?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:09:47", "owner": "slimey_tube_dude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070605587067969, "text": "I learned nothing in those lectures,  taught myself it all, Professor wouldn't even answer our emails, ignored a lot of us when we'd raise our hands for questions 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:05:42", "owner": "sagie_draws_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540514432020435, "text": "I was always working on the homework due for the next day in class cuz I already taught myself what we were about to learn in lecture", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:51:29", "owner": "dakotacardoza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908564101255689, "text": "we had half a lecture on a topic that we then had a quiz on", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:15:30", "owner": "canter1ter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022479386789056, "text": "Hybrid Classes are goated!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:38:42", "owner": "61d3on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107398120628598, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:41:42", "owner": "yeganeeniyaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039170480711555, "text": "I mean, that's how it works 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:41:41", "owner": "aqlanmalek_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100242412704332, "text": "Physics bro🤧", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:00:05", "owner": "pstarshere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158559529398281, "text": "Fr 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:36:49", "owner": "climbontoppeak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083757193853153, "text": "Plot twist, the most worthless subjects need almost 100% attendance", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:42:29", "owner": "vvsantander55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066347567384154, "text": "I go for the entertainment only honestly", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:09:50", "owner": "sigamma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057418430288182, "text": "Why is this so true 🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:08:39", "owner": "jordannjones1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956292181000935, "text": "Its bad when your professor doesnt speak English and so no matter how hard you pay attention you still have no idea what they're talking about", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:43:48", "owner": "homo_sapien_lemon_snake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019857437610979, "text": "They’ll literally just read, like one can’t read for themselves", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:14:04", "owner": "bufftodler1", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["collegecore", "universitylife"]},
{"media_id": 3714140057542915249, "shortcode": "DOLRrQ35PSx", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOLRrQ35PSx/", "taken_at": "2025-09-04T10:00:00", "caption": "🇮🇳💁💁‍♀️💁‍♂️🇮🇳\n#tokyosims #krilovee", "owner_username": "excusebob", "owner_id": "875521840", "likes": 45217, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0030_DOLRrQ35PSx\\DOLRrQ35PSx_20250904_100000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086882624504309, "text": "這樣貌，絕對高種姓", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:31:26", "owner": "lovaney0214", "likes": 3532}, {"id": 17997682241666006, "text": "兩個都高種姓？", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:50:13", "owner": "sae0007", "likes": 912}, {"id": 18526834507035315, "text": "一知印度就有點肚痛", "created_at": "2025-09-04T23:43:00", "owner": "goodcommunist", "likes": 2219}, {"id": 18001533443651486, "text": "我好像要这个女的ig 有人知道吗？", "created_at": "2025-09-12T16:15:08", "owner": "connor_jd99", "likes": 195}, {"id": 17936997681088577, "text": "去印度的第一天食物中毒一個禮拜", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:04:20", "owner": "ming_shen1031", "likes": 87}, {"id": 17963900315859111, "text": "不得不說這是我見過最漂亮的印度女生", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:31:02", "owner": "zzz87980", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17922243768119251, "text": "那個厭惡的表情真的是讓人😇", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:06:20", "owner": "yang_chef_._", "likes": 112}, {"id": 17990850323886933, "text": "高手過招…？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:55:04", "owner": "anchorage_2004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076962899284096, "text": "男的也會Indian", "created_at": "2025-09-20T22:57:15", "owner": "fatjimjim", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18034772141698159, "text": "好詐 xD  被騙說出意思ww", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:50:31", "owner": "stawn520520", "likes": 642}, {"id": 18051894368386357, "text": "高种姓不一定都是白的，我有个同学是棕色的，他也是高种姓😮", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:49:26", "owner": "h.ysfi_0157", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876552643321144, "text": "講話沒有搖頭不正宗印度人", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:50:38", "owner": "chiu_08.25", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18118901356529479, "text": "為啥我認識印度人都不長這樣？", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:22:01", "owner": "shao3365", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17963406243007980, "text": "高種姓印度人，他們的樣貌都是頂級出眾", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:46:35", "owner": "pika_chiu0404", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18087975382909709, "text": "輕度 中度 重度 印度", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:17:02", "owner": "cool_biker666", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18046654955479903, "text": "有没有加whats APP的？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:08:22", "owner": "yin_yue7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114792463583050, "text": "感覺至少是刹帝利🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:29:16", "owner": "zh_kane_0125", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18020677910789290, "text": "我獨自烙賽！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:03:12", "owner": "supangyou", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18001505786836023, "text": "Bro's rizz is unmatched", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:31:28", "owner": "orhokay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060981311240765, "text": "Marry me", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:22:40", "owner": "crocodilebootsowner", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069938330078418, "text": "哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:47:18", "owner": "chunchi1994", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912677974093450, "text": "肯定高種姓而且又白", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:49:19", "owner": "rwi_1027", "likes": 107}, {"id": 17990648672904937, "text": "太会撩妹了", "created_at": "2025-12-15T16:24:07", "owner": "superfish_balls", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106594906629473, "text": "good", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:04:49", "owner": "gaogui.10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105061390711674, "text": "兩個9成高種姓 看臉就知道", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:59:59", "owner": "weiwei___0818", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17913970374217628, "text": "看起來很乾淨", "created_at": "2025-10-27T10:43:46", "owner": "baka._.0111", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17890428231258892, "text": "天龍印度", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:05:16", "owner": "k19z.eth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076404460994868, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:49:01", "owner": "donald_527_", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18089266082297342, "text": "有人說過，\n一個印度人是盲盒\n一群印度人是恆河😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:23:47", "owner": "wusinchan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18150128623393728, "text": "各位啊 女生IG在這krilovee._", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:01:46", "owner": "excusebob", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17861688360526942, "text": "印度的雅利安高种姓吧", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:45:36", "owner": "jdbdjdbjsksbdbjsbwkq", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17860431051436686, "text": "做了多少次手術？", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:30:27", "owner": "hi_higi_hu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086759213001632, "text": "滴答鲁工噶猴打嘿", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:20:38", "owner": "p.e.k.k.a903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868252756495588, "text": "肚啦V 學廢了", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:13:44", "owner": "taiwan06903", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17931163980112016, "text": "fk india they r fking gross", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:03:15", "owner": "sheep_gonna_die", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245085061295131, "text": "感覺他們兩個可以一對都很帥都很漂亮❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:14:09", "owner": "waves44444444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844069930602042, "text": "啊k苦力猴呀猴奔", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:23:32", "owner": "ptc9927", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["tokyosims", "krilovee"]},
{"media_id": 3748991363443683726, "shortcode": "DQHF8g0EXGO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQHF8g0EXGO/", "taken_at": "2025-10-22T12:04:27", "caption": "Situationships explained by cats#fyp #situationships", "owner_username": "kittyt3rry", "owner_id": "8219326725", "likes": 68211, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0031_DQHF8g0EXGO\\DQHF8g0EXGO_20251022_120427.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18027568673550044, "text": "我有個朋友破防…算了找人弄你", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:20:01", "owner": "bruce_nan1127", "likes": 3341}, {"id": 18118949365535765, "text": "你覺得這則貼文有什麼問題？ \n□語言侮辱和人身攻擊 \n□暴力傾向 \n☑我不喜歡自己出現在文章上 \n□低俗 \n□引起不適 \n□其他問題", "created_at": "2025-10-28T02:36:51", "owner": "starghoul0404", "likes": 932}, {"id": 18157971895392227, "text": "有人跟你說你們只是situationship，就是快跑，不然就是一起享受", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:15:15", "owner": "zzz_08.31", "likes": 1231}, {"id": 18069087386597699, "text": "兄弟刪了吧，我朋友有點破防了，我是無所謂的，沒那麼容易的，不輕易破防的，但是我一個朋友可能有點汗流浹背了，他不太舒服想睡了，當然不是我哈，我一直都是行的，以一個旁觀者的心態看吧，也不至於破防吧，就是想照顧下我朋友的感受，他有點破防了，還是建議刪了吧，當然刪不刪隨你，我是沒感覺的。", "created_at": "2025-10-25T18:58:25", "owner": "ambe._05", "likes": 228}, {"id": 17869899600464972, "text": "希望每个在situationship里的人都有结束的勇气，不要再继续伤害自己了", "created_at": "2025-11-10T02:22:06", "owner": "tianxu_xing", "likes": 164}, {"id": 17898659691186158, "text": "真是服了，不喜欢这个ship 那就换一艘ship 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:14:42", "owner": "yumi_jiang_", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18122283106516369, "text": "就友達以上，戀人未滿", "created_at": "2025-10-26T06:17:03", "owner": "merelyfleshandblood", "likes": 122}, {"id": 17845189188586634, "text": "兄，予不以畏，但恐吾友視之覆哀啼，然弟無妨，笑之。故煩兄收上述所言。故交與所言相似，某無恙，視之無感。素友於旁，揮汗如雨，如有大疾，乃席地眠之，非吾所為，余視其大恐，故顧之，觀其如豎梯立於墻，敵破而入，望兄刪其言。予不以為然。其行在兄。吾為故交所不平也。", "created_at": "2025-10-31T11:37:51", "owner": "lil_timmysavage", "likes": 61}, {"id": 18089893414730493, "text": "可以刪掉這隻影片嗎？我擔心我朋友看到會破防", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:41:39", "owner": "rezimy_1813", "likes": 185}, {"id": 18091386679893290, "text": "跟我好像喔 聊的很開心 卻根本沒有任何關係 🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:26:24", "owner": "jason_00627", "likes": 331}, {"id": 17982252551942045, "text": "Situatioship跟曖昧的區別是什麼", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:56:27", "owner": "waita_043", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996412530699476, "text": "能删了吗？我兄弟他有点难受，有点想哭", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:47:41", "owner": "ms090115", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17952930863904276, "text": "人經歷過已經夠難了，不要讓貓貓經歷這些😢", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:25:02", "owner": "jeffrey_zuo", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18071085080260724, "text": "poor kitty…", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:46:32", "owner": "7.oast", "likes": 106}, {"id": 18069136139596123, "text": "所以说有被stationship的男的吗？还是说只有被situationship的女人", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:59:24", "owner": "chittyxiaoxiao", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18029165156533229, "text": "我朋友不喜歡這個影片可以麻煩刪掉嗎謝謝", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:27:23", "owner": "ji8knnn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17923425195053474, "text": "你打開留言是不是想看大型破防現場？", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:21:17", "owner": "wwwiiiccc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947643844060910, "text": "這𥚃很多人說他「朋友破防了」\n我就不掩飾了……\n我破防了！😢", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:22:09", "owner": "jcylo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18383946907144637, "text": "刪了吧 我沒錢找人弄你", "created_at": "2025-12-15T18:08:48", "owner": "c.s.t__03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160268359385492, "text": "你覺得這個貼文有什麼問題？\n□語言侮辱和人身攻擊\n□暴力傾向\n☑這我\n□低俗\n□引起不適\n□我的臉準備好了\n□其他問題", "created_at": "2025-11-01T17:25:07", "owner": "piggyhill_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18007792505803977, "text": "兄弟删了吧，我有個朋友...算了我找人弄你", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:13:46", "owner": "0219__.genos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915617452212950, "text": "以後上嚟玩9upper 抽到situationship 識點解釋了🎉", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:09:59", "owner": "partyroom_fable_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972073851962398, "text": "前段时间被困扰的不行 就觉得非他不可了 现在想通了很多 他确实很好 但是我也不差 不过这种情感上的消耗让我对任何ship都没冲动了🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:43:34", "owner": "kiki174234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104960776722376, "text": "@travpapisg10 我有个朋友破防了…", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:56:15", "owner": "yangzhou_4everyoung", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062067545625629, "text": "爱情没满友达之上", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:32:11", "owner": "jessytam007", "likes": 46}, {"id": 17866142346490739, "text": "一直發這種東西害人破防💀", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:52:23", "owner": "lucky_god_not_dog_9911", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071778370994581, "text": "hope everyone in a situationship (included me) managed to look after themselves…", "created_at": "2025-10-24T08:10:21", "owner": "mingg.jingg", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18075649438942161, "text": "Thanks bro😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:40:17", "owner": "whtthedogdoin5", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17989393652875355, "text": "@coxlcoy_leyi", "created_at": "2025-12-16T02:15:46", "owner": "meishidaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913540873231927, "text": "😢垃圾关系垃圾人", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:20:25", "owner": "kenzisx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17979934412919672, "text": "kitty needs justice", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:34:02", "owner": "ryfrie.d", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18136155607461758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:00:12", "owner": "silencieuse_8270", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18118857973547505, "text": "😕", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:34:37", "owner": "uya_kilinm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858057076477531, "text": "我哭了兄弟", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:46:06", "owner": "ivanyi.226", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17932399035103141, "text": "@ivan._.za", "created_at": "2025-10-27T07:05:14", "owner": "brianwky0218", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18131133172489856, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T23:06:51", "owner": "karola_chan1231", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987743649900247, "text": "wait…😢", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:22:39", "owner": "inxue9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063613376119573, "text": "@wakawakaaa____", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:35:32", "owner": "s000_tired", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052875068320338, "text": "@___0430__ 大寶二寶小寶", "created_at": "2025-10-24T17:03:45", "owner": "iam_feinida555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518908351066891, "text": "@parcoshear", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:45:30", "owner": "nathan_nn__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17910957366097692, "text": "主播啥时候开线下粉丝见面会 @_nagumo99 我和我朋友一起给你送点东西", "created_at": "2025-10-24T09:04:03", "owner": "zowdoq", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18138085333452216, "text": "破大防", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:13:44", "owner": "jim961229", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18133141813464492, "text": "@joseph.lo_3936", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:55:00", "owner": "gp_.0080", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854791360556435, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:25:55", "owner": "kyubi888_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18531759607052916, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:20:54", "owner": "natsuki_im", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081697601051901, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:19:13", "owner": "chenyumin94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949299186935271, "text": "超好笑更可悲的是對方知道還不點破的時候🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:12:15", "owner": "chill_way_1124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086273942015484, "text": "So it is fwb isn’t it? Why there is a new word now", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:03:01", "owner": "hogidogiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085220441022785, "text": "The timing of this is impeccable 💔", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:26:16", "owner": "ausiedundan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878297311356234, "text": "@stevegorrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr …", "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:59:12", "owner": "kaolmiengx0827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899070022350599, "text": "伙计们，我掉进陷阱了", "created_at": "2025-12-16T01:51:19", "owner": "jackie.koi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084413998869311, "text": "破防了😢", "created_at": "2025-12-16T01:21:02", "owner": "water4459", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082847240122618, "text": "我不找人弄你\n我親自上", "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:12:03", "owner": "shao_wei_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088588966807593, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-15T05:26:29", "owner": "alexzendergriffin676", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093220918910013, "text": "这集有点针对性了啊小猫什么意思💢", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:19:29", "owner": "edcasa3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089144797797101, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:43:02", "owner": "isthatupu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034093355722596, "text": "我找人弄你😢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:03:35", "owner": "shimmm_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185811682350504, "text": "把对方当作玩的很好的同性就好了。 朋友之间只是阶段性的陪伴。 不要总是想着谈恋爱 要不然折磨的是自己", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:03:24", "owner": "34.607972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549463684045594, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:53:27", "owner": "littlecsy54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092137603932621, "text": "一大早起来被创飞😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:23:12", "owner": "brelyn0119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397655233132374, "text": "幹", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:10:21", "owner": "yuxuan_dust", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943237885022885, "text": "這留言區含友量極高", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:10:26", "owner": "perionza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099852949701104, "text": "被评论区笑死", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:36:39", "owner": "greyyyy_0012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429459469108142, "text": "尬哩金婆 刪掉", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:58:35", "owner": "terrible_thing_likethis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084546623018203, "text": "?BRO stop talking about it. I BEG U", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:24:51", "owner": "pain_fetish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960017365008542, "text": "It’s not kitty it’s 舔狗 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:32:37", "owner": "daniel860815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868250011492592, "text": "🙂🔪", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:56:12", "owner": "sybamboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333934687237291, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:40:44", "owner": "wangxiran994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022405721788368, "text": "Kitty stopped texting kitty gj👏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:26:04", "owner": "didi950210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193243768333767, "text": "弄…", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:18:36", "owner": "zoey777659", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882651718311307, "text": "心理委員我不得勁🙁", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:26:12", "owner": "pylorsun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193880905334291, "text": "搞situationship的人都给我去死", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:35:26", "owner": "cwynness_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350363443200085, "text": "Can't just kitty want besties? Like nothing more than that , just a friendship", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:40:18", "owner": "yxlia92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078494977949009, "text": "👏❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:10:47", "owner": "xiiixiiiiiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987329082873004, "text": "从信息论的角度来解构的话，Signal_{received} = Signal_{true} + Noise_{ambiguity}​Signal_{true}：对方真实的意图（通常是“不够喜欢”或“不想负责”）。\n​Noise_{ambiguity}：对方释放的混淆信息（例如：“我也很想你”、“如果不...我们就在一起”）。\n​Situationship 中的人，大脑会充当一个过拟合Overfitting的解码器。你会试图从高噪声中提取出不存在的 Pattern（规律），把对方的无聊解读为深情，把对方的寂寞解读为需要。\n​从信息论角度看，熵（Entropy）极高。你永远无法通过当前状态 S_t 准确预测下一时刻的状态 S_{t+1}。我们定义追求者的reward function里包含了关系带来的好处，而被追求者的reward function里包含了关系的好处却不想承担responshbility的cost，而导致的reward hacking，从信息论角度的最优解就是构造一个step function来进行滤波，也就是摊牌，使得快速确认双方的reward function使得总体reward最大化", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:30:16", "owner": "felixwll1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083480581864970, "text": "SI-TUA-TION-🚢 😒🙄😮‍💨 yes. All ✅ the box", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:56:29", "owner": "lycialeecya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930031657150106, "text": "我要找人弄你🙃🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:18:02", "owner": "woodatou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066735386456728, "text": "😢😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:08:57", "owner": "momo.chaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024371774592111, "text": "翻个墙还给看破防了哈哈～", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:12:38", "owner": "untilwebleedatglance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316988950223946, "text": "wow so similar to my experience", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:52:01", "owner": "oliviachan818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084943934094952, "text": "可以，你这样发是吧，小心我找一车面包人弄你", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:21:12", "owner": "chuan.0430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996715725845875, "text": "备胎", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:00:31", "owner": "tkinsthetop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028006220752021, "text": "I m fishing，and you are the fish", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:33:16", "owner": "uan0728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992965590854965, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:46:11", "owner": "huaxu_bearing_ellie_xu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928512721017094, "text": "kitty stills yearns..", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:28:29", "owner": "eeeiscoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849160912565547, "text": "最後一句話破防", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:21:30", "owner": "siamike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083475797020675, "text": "A situationship is js a friend", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:50:23", "owner": "yuyu6w6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082576877028798, "text": "我貸款也要告你", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:21:22", "owner": "zz____y.ning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084708812060522, "text": "Poor kitty", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:40:21", "owner": "mllymilktea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430602991104770, "text": "@alfieeexd 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:11:12", "owner": "fushen_.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104491393658023, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T05:00:46", "owner": "u.lee_lty625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086237150332137, "text": "破防了喵😢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:48:48", "owner": "huiqi_wwwww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050741573346827, "text": "<2025最棒教科書系列>", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:43:55", "owner": "_taize.zs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903720313284138, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:09:25", "owner": "ruey_000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083744168094011, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:56:16", "owner": "link123123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913830985088961, "text": "刪掉吧🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:45:04", "owner": "hig682024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383078098181368, "text": "only toxic relationship worth staying", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:30:17", "owner": "bunnnnny____", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073399763213642, "text": "雙龍", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:48:59", "owner": "ted0_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294490324285486, "text": "破防咯", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:49:36", "owner": "jacklynns20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872591569449846, "text": "@lct.zzzzz", "created_at": "2025-11-05T04:39:46", "owner": "jian_c722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18216163759308690, "text": "Except they r just friends", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:41:53", "owner": "jane.c.y.w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088211653935344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-04T10:36:51", "owner": "dr._lu1205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076991923929361, "text": "祝對方永遠爛在這該死新鮮感裡吧", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:14:47", "owner": "zxj_luicd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066035126105125, "text": "@hahahau_8", "created_at": "2025-11-03T23:20:57", "owner": "seec302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111848848570208, "text": "Not true😱我太冤枉了 包大人😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:25:23", "owner": "aaronbigbig_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390162181130212, "text": "WAIT A FUCKING MINUTE.... THAT'S ME", "created_at": "2025-11-02T11:42:41", "owner": "rexchan_72780", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028373777739312, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:40:55", "owner": "mush_greyloz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947933946914714, "text": "所以就是一個舔狗+一個不想負責的？㊗️大家幸福", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:05:27", "owner": "l.x_a.i", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18325780528246701, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:19:12", "owner": "krikom00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928906270137042, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-01T23:02:58", "owner": "john_bai5959", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965738652986413, "text": "@toothless925", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:09:43", "owner": "yellowdream._.1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106114384621816, "text": "破大房😢", "created_at": "2025-11-01T14:15:31", "owner": "huangyongzhi21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913686664229244, "text": "kitty's fish pound", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:13:37", "owner": "xiang_p9260", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052182977333863, "text": "太准了吧😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:43:33", "owner": "damaozi_joanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163398169387723, "text": "：）？", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:29:49", "owner": "zjin428_adofai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899079871319993, "text": "我有一个朋友，真的", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:20:47", "owner": "ivano_nana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083328935299031, "text": "我有個朋友破...算了 我找人弄你", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:06:26", "owner": "agagu3737", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082497674050477, "text": "@svadilfari.loki 我有个朋友破防了……算了我捅飞你", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:56:54", "owner": "shazzy_ron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18171828481368997, "text": "我友破算找弄", "created_at": "2025-10-29T09:34:02", "owner": "deirdre.vie99", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17934225146984737, "text": "@peiitonng", "created_at": "2025-10-29T05:00:29", "owner": "mimi_meowmeow825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361644238089124, "text": "Is it possible that when life is full of uncertainty that we tend to make other things uncertain too... unconsciously", "created_at": "2025-10-29T00:14:09", "owner": "sylvia_0119_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986243061910217, "text": "大破防囉w", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:40:35", "owner": "yui__0423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860977576521047, "text": "@jess1ca416", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:24:46", "owner": "__peijun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925075438159189, "text": "刪掉", "created_at": "2025-10-28T11:17:00", "owner": "xxrlshlee2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924885403079460, "text": "Riel", "created_at": "2025-10-28T10:15:02", "owner": "soiee_ci_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028064108753831, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:08:18", "owner": "mickey_omg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875690563431332, "text": "Bruh", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:39:57", "owner": "cyiherng_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968167041976371, "text": "@ykxtks_ 水水", "created_at": "2025-10-27T10:18:11", "owner": "2m00y6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028616066543541, "text": "我現在找人去弄死你👍", "created_at": "2025-10-27T05:10:32", "owner": "grandpa_head", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18429531790097905, "text": "我不喜歡自己出現在這裏。", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:59:59", "owner": "just._a.dork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097945885683229, "text": "操你马已经被骗了太迟了", "created_at": "2025-10-26T02:39:35", "owner": "sn_rdeyes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371466658159553, "text": "我破防了，建議刪掉", "created_at": "2025-10-26T01:45:58", "owner": "31n31n_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083225093489608, "text": "弱😂", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:49:43", "owner": "keeeerrrchun_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929204533149201, "text": "@ii.oon_", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:26:18", "owner": "naweoo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929110804112648, "text": "Trash feeling", "created_at": "2025-10-25T03:29:16", "owner": "10dtsz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088521889915489, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-25T01:14:28", "owner": "jimmytsai1207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853099369561483, "text": "kinda confused 🌚 \nthen what about friendship?", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:02:26", "owner": "toothpaste_ff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897291268324638, "text": "🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-24T05:39:51", "owner": "wenqi.ng.625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18241180492295003, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T05:12:27", "owner": "yoomi1204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291576007260355, "text": "yeah", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:58:18", "owner": "ug.beluga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109475413589058, "text": "It is a fking trap", "created_at": "2025-10-23T22:32:33", "owner": "hsn_nigel.mu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959365029856104, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:42:20", "owner": "daveeecai", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["fyp", "situationships"]},
{"media_id": 3743730423542141202, "shortcode": "DP0ZvwuDVES", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DP0ZvwuDVES/", "taken_at": "2025-10-15T05:51:26", "caption": "Hi", "owner_username": "suzi___3231", "owner_id": "75483264775", "likes": 89897, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0032_DP0ZvwuDVES\\DP0ZvwuDVES_20251015_055126.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18531814786014493, "text": "Guys, I was on the first date and repeating 'here, have some wine' didn't work, am I doing something wrong?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:39:54", "owner": "tremor.a.m", "likes": 2755}, {"id": 18061113275158378, "text": "Sorry but asking if “we’re overreacting” is still dangerous.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:41:35", "owner": "monieblake", "likes": 4136}, {"id": 18022888223780278, "text": "“Go get me a beer”", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:46:17", "owner": "ywv", "likes": 4744}, {"id": 18084989338937577, "text": "I could live if they asked me what I’m so worked up about, I can see a world where that is asked with sincerity and an ear to listen with, but the second someone says to me „could we be overreacting?“ I’m going for the throat, let me show you how I am when I overreact", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:13:41", "owner": "natalieholmessss", "likes": 736}, {"id": 17842256379607743, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:30:02", "owner": "grieshmaa", "likes": 53}, {"id": 17857633770537259, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:43:57", "owner": "scanz77", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18094284484651732, "text": "how is “could we be overreacting“ safer???", "created_at": "2025-10-26T12:39:23", "owner": "ginevradostuni", "likes": 221}, {"id": 17987230178857087, "text": "I don’t drink alcohol, TRY AGAIN", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:57:54", "owner": "sailormea78", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112418548585270, "text": "If I asked you how I looked and you said \"here have some wine\" you'd be in pieces and in a suitcase before you could count to 3", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:13:30", "owner": "sa.lly1984", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18059605421529957, "text": "“Here’s my paycheck” 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:11:16", "owner": "lveha_", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18362486731082989, "text": "But... Where's the green? There is no green... There is no green!!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T07:08:43", "owner": "mahmoud_graiwatt", "likes": 57}, {"id": 18079527407319276, "text": "Seems legit", "created_at": "2025-10-26T17:21:32", "owner": "rj_0241_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085324367051659, "text": "My ex husband was ALWAYS in the dangerous zone, BUT my current husband is 5% in the safer zone, 85% in the safest zone and 10% in the ultra safe zone, there's times it won't even be wine, it can be a massage, having a conversation, playing a game together, or even him coming home early from work!!!!! He does so much, it puts him on a pedestal, but I hope I pass before he does, I don't want to be in a world without him", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:10:19", "owner": "left_eye_blind", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948813375914304, "text": "I’ve always loved you in that robe.😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:38:30", "owner": "yoopersnaggletooth", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18120862381525605, "text": "The True Ultra Safe is: Here is some Chocolate.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T17:30:55", "owner": "annalina0209", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082731556825246, "text": "“What are you so worked up about” and “are we overreacting” need to be switched (what are you so worked up about at least tries to address the cause of the issue and can imply that you want to fix it)", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:18:57", "owner": "bootdoesthings", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17919710688176800, "text": "“Go clean the dishes”", "created_at": "2025-10-17T08:11:56", "owner": "ftc.aiden", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18338148643203469, "text": "I live in Orange. I cross red when angry but yellow has never happened", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:35:15", "owner": "ramby3210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855735727544011, "text": "This chart is for Betas.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T23:46:09", "owner": "exchangeagramdan", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17934046697983210, "text": "What are you so worked up about? Here's my paycheck", "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:27:27", "owner": "momsboyfriendfromschool", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911430529231030, "text": "So, what are we supposed to do after we get our woman drunk?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T10:04:41", "owner": "johnnypmartin359", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18095650051768999, "text": "“there are a lot of apples left” is dangerous bro", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:28:58", "owner": "jurassic_cart", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17986758038903933, "text": "Can we get a safe / dangerous list females should speak to their male partners ?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:43:28", "owner": "theconfusedargonian", "likes": 87}, {"id": 17970930758954101, "text": "No marriage so I could buy more whiskey ❤️‍🩹🥃", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:30:28", "owner": "eyecantsea_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925763275168308, "text": "no the most dangerous is, \"would you mind driving me somewhere.\"", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:23:10", "owner": "myinstajczs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891509830224125, "text": "As the resident non expert, here's my take: \"what did you do all day today\" can be moved to safer given context and without the emphasis on \"do\". \"Could we be overreacting\" and \"you know, there are a lot of apples left\" should be moved down. \"Wow! Look at you\" should be reworded or moved down to safer", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:11:02", "owner": "jenielsen326", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18295728679250430, "text": "I’m sorry but asking where would you like to go for dinner can be just as dangerous", "created_at": "2025-10-25T22:58:08", "owner": "elishahalverson1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079946629858636, "text": "Safest is fine I fecking hate wine", "created_at": "2025-10-16T17:49:18", "owner": "valtat63", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18088279714900173, "text": "Dangerous section is being direct. If a woman can’t handle it, she’s too soft to be wife or mother material", "created_at": "2025-10-17T19:12:55", "owner": "lkenmaner", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17975410370948096, "text": "@rhoux_man is gay so he cant relate", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:26:38", "owner": "nivstzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955779498906103, "text": "Ngl actually I prefer to be asked \"what's for dinner\" so I can smash this damn cast iron skillet over his head. That's for dinner 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:56:15", "owner": "troox.ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295131334287578, "text": "Damn is this how I became an alcoholic 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:45:12", "owner": "lauraashby22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069843968067865, "text": "Only if your partner is an alcoholic I guess", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:15:08", "owner": "arska_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103912780632637, "text": "fck", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:21:14", "owner": "davjoh23naturbruk.nu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492399931072793, "text": "Dumbest crap I’ve ever seen", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:41:46", "owner": "northeasternelitek9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846127678584601, "text": "Dangerous is how I talk to my mom on a regular basis", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:23:42", "owner": "lubunnii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064469333128212, "text": "here have some wine", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:47:49", "owner": "logan_b6682", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405625873189213, "text": "here have some wine", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:47:45", "owner": "logan_b6682", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367765687095113, "text": "*a blunt", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:24:30", "owner": "grapeswish3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865662412497828, "text": "@sean.sutton.1650", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:19:51", "owner": "kirstykurly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969151521985793, "text": "Men will like this and still treat their partners like shit :) d!e yall :)", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:45:46", "owner": "australopithecus.defender", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895322242202842, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:30:57", "owner": "333llab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916827652071754, "text": "This chart is for men with no spine or sense of self-worth! 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:29:00", "owner": "minkeymoo1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044231219693200, "text": "\"im thinking of having another girl\"", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:54:39", "owner": "pelonchas_sniiiiifffff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434805511099774, "text": "Booze, money and male attention “cure” all women’s complaints.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:12:03", "owner": "cooleuropean1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072195638209163, "text": "Are WE overreacting nice touch", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:06:05", "owner": "cal_rothnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048043277682596, "text": "I usually just use my fists", "created_at": "2025-11-01T10:31:22", "owner": "kiikitten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376576927151228, "text": "i’m sorry but if my husband asks if we’re overreacting i am choke slamming that fool", "created_at": "2025-11-01T04:23:40", "owner": "briannahemwall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067441745576871, "text": "Funny how there's never classes on bow to treat a man, because no one cares how men are treated", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:48:25", "owner": "wildadragon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060644405568775, "text": "Chart to help woman dodge accountability", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:53:03", "owner": "faitle01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092747704876695, "text": "where would you like to go for dinner is def dangerous too", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:54:32", "owner": "3tyler3segg3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144042559442215, "text": "Here have some wine", "created_at": "2025-10-30T16:31:04", "owner": "pblibbinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418473145117565, "text": "\"you know, there are a lot of apples left\" that's even more dangerous than the dangerous one", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:56:44", "owner": "vanquish_marten.9643", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295293109258672, "text": "I don’t see can I suck your toes…", "created_at": "2025-10-29T06:10:28", "owner": "vintageblasian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062966762575669, "text": "Have some wine @sidney_steinberg", "created_at": "2025-10-29T00:42:48", "owner": "kate._.lifts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085158745806020, "text": "I’mma buy some wine I think", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:35:12", "owner": "rabbi_jacob_allali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538667167039117, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T13:31:59", "owner": "halls.karen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868242805464464, "text": "“i can’t just be friends w u”😒", "created_at": "2025-10-28T12:51:00", "owner": "andreea_dan7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879740170305237, "text": "Happy Wife Happy Life", "created_at": "2025-10-28T09:40:47", "owner": "nicki_jxson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037919192507845, "text": "Nope, they already have enough whine.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T17:29:48", "owner": "drakereed2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885766798260167, "text": "Avoiding the issue works lol", "created_at": "2025-10-26T17:06:42", "owner": "adam7627g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097812283744683, "text": "wine is shit", "created_at": "2025-10-26T12:29:01", "owner": "1bread1gambling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091516552866508, "text": "I can't have wine..I'm allergic to grapes", "created_at": "2025-10-26T04:39:55", "owner": "ig_nezzx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120185440518388, "text": "So simple really 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:12:34", "owner": "sts98gw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892773991348517, "text": "It only makes sense if you read it left to right", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:58:22", "owner": "uncle_daws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951822550041878, "text": "Ok cuck.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:24:46", "owner": "ralteqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842000044608263, "text": "This is like worse than the reddit chore chart lmfaoo… nation of cucks", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:22:59", "owner": "aidan_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877211632424059, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:54:45", "owner": "trumper678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946682052915465, "text": "What’s for dinner 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:22:19", "owner": "noah8579", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054584879288046, "text": "I don't think any of the \"safer\" expressions are much better.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:52:32", "owner": "bart.smith.9279", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069810164200721, "text": "@sohampalkrit @sarvesh_11_7", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:52:04", "owner": "soham_nashine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856117861542302, "text": "\"You know, there are a lot of apples left\" is crazy tho", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:05:28", "owner": "damiangentile666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116106508537525, "text": "That part!", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:59:56", "owner": "mlgrayson62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083023210966240, "text": "@clairestathamhumphreys  I’ll laminate a copy of this for Andy and Ross so there always ultra safe haha xx", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:23:19", "owner": "gemcx1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368509426158205, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:04:36", "owner": "christinemartin52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101097259654427, "text": "4 every time works for me😁🌺", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:56:50", "owner": "torywillson5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079814819018366, "text": "If you have a good girl, the dangerous ones become short cuts and she will be happy.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:02:31", "owner": "mikhael_oc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056692724241516, "text": "Perfect! 🤩", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:00:14", "owner": "deborah.farrell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853656286512660, "text": "SAFEST is safer than ULTRA SAFE 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:54:32", "owner": "jawhara.of.the.nile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186974611337782, "text": "Dangerous all the way!!", "created_at": "2025-10-21T05:38:58", "owner": "karimf2485", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285972856302660, "text": "can’t believe my ex said all the red stuff", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:16:45", "owner": "chocolat.wav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381117853198416, "text": "Wine IS cheaper", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:24:02", "owner": "waffles_on_toast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083234480057895, "text": "You shouldn't be scared to talk to your wife.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:58:10", "owner": "patricialy.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857757829538010, "text": "this sounds like the steps to r*p", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:33:35", "owner": "mr.getshi_done", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872740483440913, "text": "A man wrote ts, you can tell", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:52:22", "owner": "pigeon._.418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859798201519088, "text": "its so funny when u realize that the 'housewife/married woman obsessed with wine' stereotype is only a thing because these women r genuinely so miserable and overwhelmed they turn to literal alcoholism. theyre functional alcoholics. maybe lets not perpetuate that stereotype, which only harms these women more, snd actually offer help w things, give them alone time, for themselves, give them time to go to therapy, since they do SO much for us - doesnt matter if ur her husband, child, parent, etc., she spends her life caring for you, let her have HER life too", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:31:04", "owner": "electricmaxxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851111461570301, "text": "I would argue that the safer category is more dangerous than the dangerous category", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:27:50", "owner": "bertthepei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298488706248599, "text": "Replace all of this with a straight “fuck off” problem solved", "created_at": "2025-10-20T06:02:16", "owner": "scottyevo2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859844869527066, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T18:33:24", "owner": "wondergal2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859605262458428, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:02:29", "owner": "gabrielmedina1035", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382640398182532, "text": "can I get you a piece of chocolate with that is not safe why r u calling me fat", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:46:57", "owner": "greyson._.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084058000971086, "text": "It’s soooo simple!😏", "created_at": "2025-10-18T21:58:34", "owner": "arts_wen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001214933666384, "text": "so basically materialism and alcoholism. definitely not the women id date", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:24:50", "owner": "the__real_kullervo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084080707974990, "text": "Notice how all of the ultra safe responses are “here, have some wine” wonder why?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:13:44", "owner": "vib3insta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951784885010797, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:53:48", "owner": "dylan_73602", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17886819666372321, "text": "@elvis_bak", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:31:01", "owner": "nyxalle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109579333574564, "text": "ultra safe is not safe at all that’s just playing with fire, either she gonna be pissed you think she’s an alcoholic, assume you think she needs wine to feel calm or she actually is an alcoholic and won’t question the random offer 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:30:32", "owner": "jacqueline.n.w", "likes": 13}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3760676269370162135, "shortcode": "DQwmyRfDLvX", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQwmyRfDLvX/", "taken_at": "2025-11-07T14:59:28", "caption": "My happy place? are you coming???\n\ntake me to the mountains any day - please…\n\n#medicalstudent #mountains #wildcamping", "owner_username": "nehajournals_", "owner_id": "45061971182", "likes": 1278, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0033_DQwmyRfDLvX\\DQwmyRfDLvX_20251107_145928_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DQwmyRfDLvX\\DQwmyRfDLvX_20251107_145928_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DQwmyRfDLvX\\DQwmyRfDLvX_20251107_145928_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DQwmyRfDLvX\\DQwmyRfDLvX_20251107_145928_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DQwmyRfDLvX\\DQwmyRfDLvX_20251107_145928_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DQwmyRfDLvX\\DQwmyRfDLvX_20251107_145928_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DQwmyRfDLvX\\DQwmyRfDLvX_20251107_145928_7.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17943228453082026", "text": "Run to the mountains from placement, wild swim and camp, run back in the morning and start shift 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:40:22", "owner": "dan.cotton92", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17897158842343101", "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:02:57", "owner": "maliik_al_maliik", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18083585270065614", "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:55:11", "owner": "ottawadinburgh", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17916591402214152", "text": "Nature is for sure the best antidote 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:44:38", "owner": "a_fortunateman", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18026200979775650", "text": "Which country 😘🤝", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:17:56", "owner": "ramchandraopragada", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18044181566681718", "text": "I don't blame you. Sometimes I wish I could teleport to the middle of nowhere", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:30:17", "owner": "mangochutneyinapot", "likes": 5}, {"id": "17943726249067526", "text": "Why not ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:33:52", "owner": "pbown47", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17983911470872963", "text": "👀", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:40:23", "owner": "softflask", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17863089924514028", "text": "What’s one hike you wish you could do ?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T17:50:19", "owner": "celtic_focus", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["medicalstudent", "mountains", "wildcamping"]},
{"media_id": 3712861923722446493, "shortcode": "DOGvD9_jMad", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOGvD9_jMad/", "taken_at": "2025-09-02T15:42:45", "caption": "lol first day at Imperial\n\n#imperial #london #university", "owner_username": "saskialesterr", "owner_id": "707707417", "likes": 3319, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0034_DOGvD9_jMad\\DOGvD9_jMad_20250902_154245.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17847221460558445, "text": "Reading is better. 💋", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:29:39", "owner": "uor.confessions", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18091658536776680, "text": "It's good but not 2nd ranked. Harvard Yale Princeton Stanford MIT Oxford Cambridge Columbia UPenn. These are better then Imperial 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T05:55:41", "owner": "kaiser____01", "likes": 182}, {"id": 18091946710684785, "text": "Welcome! 🙌✨", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:22:26", "owner": "imperialbiz", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18049809401278559, "text": "❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-02T23:00:45", "owner": "jeanpier_k", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082910677910833, "text": "Congratulations on your enrollment to imperial 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-02T23:33:29", "owner": "abhi022bond", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17911909962232532, "text": "I love crying Americans in comment...whole Ivy league, MIT Stanford can't altogether surpass Oxford and Cambridge😂😂...cry harder kiddos...", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:38:24", "owner": "avcanic_preet", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18078284218792735, "text": "Number 1 University is either Oxford, Harvard, MIT, Yale, Stanford, Cambridge etc.", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:47:34", "owner": "foxytony", "likes": 536}, {"id": 18108828616558266, "text": "Sorry why is this girl flexing abt imperial college rheres like 7 ivy leagues plus stanford plus MIT and not to mention oxford and cambridge 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-03T00:56:42", "owner": "eclairchat", "likes": 304}, {"id": 18085123750842188, "text": "Very happy for her, well done, but just saying these rankings don't mean shit. All the top unis, Oxbridge, Imperial, Harvard, Yale, MIT, etc are excellent, just choose based on where you want to go for 3/4 years.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T14:43:10", "owner": "usman_lone6", "likes": 155}, {"id": 18059855438614431, "text": "Vamos! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:09:29", "owner": "rafael_sahagun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056122463150105, "text": "Eu assistindo isso obrigada a ser estudante clt, tenho nem dinheiro pras minhas contas quem dirá pra esse evento 😹😹😹", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:34:43", "owner": "dabreutrice", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17870219370351486, "text": "Any ivy league beats any european university and it's not even close.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T03:22:38", "owner": "galamango33", "likes": 113}, {"id": 17866587966459487, "text": "Slay queen 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-03T03:25:07", "owner": "arintheia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096333088575892, "text": "As someone that made it through Imperial, good luck surviving Imperial.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T06:25:48", "owner": "thomas.allenuk", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17896554207279294, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-02T15:47:42", "owner": "richmporemba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101384176608246, "text": "I’ve never heard of Imperial University before", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:56:56", "owner": "kestianors", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17888233881344399, "text": "Sorry it just makes top 5 in the UK…", "created_at": "2025-09-03T16:15:06", "owner": "bruno._.lucas", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18109447570551402, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-02T18:13:14", "owner": "davidfranciscobritoestevaes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054802016547705, "text": "HEAVILY depends for what course, imperial is only amazing at a few STEM degrees and nothing else", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:11:07", "owner": "hugooofca04", "likes": 88}, {"id": 17986200383708065, "text": "Lol what about MIT", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:21:56", "owner": "aash_ishhhh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166581451347666, "text": "For those fixated on rankings: the top 10 UK universities have collectively around 240 Nobel laureates, while the ivys without counting MIT and stanford stand at about 350\nThe achievements speak louder than any list(without even considering Fields medal winners)\nGetting into US schools isn’t just about high grades; you have to excel in everything, sports, research, leadership while UK admissions only focus on grades; producing one-dimensional students", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:50:12", "owner": "barisyilmazp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111887689549607, "text": "only people that care about rankings are people that don’t go to the actual top universities", "created_at": "2025-09-05T20:56:43", "owner": "arondesilvlong", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092596669892628, "text": "Who said that it was number 2 ?!?!", "created_at": "2025-10-29T01:06:36", "owner": "paquinsimon4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033901685651205, "text": "Who did this freaking rankings 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:46:33", "owner": "alexandre2r2m", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18050203145249004, "text": "TT gal really believed the Imperial propaganda….", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:18:31", "owner": "joshuatgtsai", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18529289494017316, "text": "Congratulations", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:03:45", "owner": "dyv_y", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17938937103089536, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:32:17", "owner": "ahhiyawa_linearb_etewokelewe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867508192396835, "text": "imperial lowkey bunzz", "created_at": "2025-10-25T22:46:26", "owner": "efegokturkm", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18086391551479706, "text": "That's Stanford", "created_at": "2025-10-29T20:53:17", "owner": "l1nk529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926589676106593, "text": "UCL ranked #1", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:39:07", "owner": "os_kahn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18003124328813296, "text": "Oxford and Cambridge are still better than Imperial college.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:22:15", "owner": "betaoption5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18012792302784458, "text": "Me when I am at a uni thats higher tham other uni in a imaginary ranking system just to have the same job at the end of it and pay more for it", "created_at": "2025-09-03T13:07:22", "owner": "wiszni.m", "likes": 108}, {"id": 17867326992439775, "text": "Dear Imperial Student,\n\nGO EXPLODE\n\n- Yours truly, a King’s Student", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:01:37", "owner": "aayanthapa80g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982194645928174, "text": "This is where all the oxbridge rejects go", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:08:25", "owner": "nakayamauzaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869583112490294, "text": "Lmaoooooooooooooooo", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:10:25", "owner": "akikosquid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185299984356089, "text": "Me my first day before the horrors of the DoC set in", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:25:54", "owner": "shivkumartejas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921094129199844, "text": "I’ve seen your LinkedIn, it’s not even one of the good masters 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:37:32", "owner": "username1034598", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012668846637371, "text": "I think they lied to you , when you see how easy you can enter in it from France school exchange it's definitely not the second one", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:59:56", "owner": "florentbrbt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948675724026954, "text": "what university is that?", "created_at": "2025-11-04T17:55:46", "owner": "humpty_dumpty_1736", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847062391572331, "text": "Making me wanna apply frl", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:28:15", "owner": "verballyconstipated", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031053014531174, "text": "🥳😎😎", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:44:40", "owner": "brym07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930709477104387, "text": "Your rent is high. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:21:37", "owner": "betaoption5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062153354157452, "text": "Not even the second in the uk 😭 I’ll never trust QS", "created_at": "2025-10-24T00:16:55", "owner": "0akes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294330223268815, "text": "prop top 40 but not second", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:13:55", "owner": "simon_s_sat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080464094314315, "text": "it's at best 4th in the UK not 2nd in the world", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:13:42", "owner": "simon_s_sat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072789920165241, "text": "It's good but not 2nd ranked", "created_at": "2025-09-25T05:54:38", "owner": "kaiser____01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064603745054486, "text": "❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-22T12:01:06", "owner": "emma_carleton_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047463989330254, "text": "congrats, loads of envy in the comments", "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:13:58", "owner": "4lbin_avci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530789365027066, "text": "https://www.topuniversities.com/qs-world-university-rankings", "created_at": "2025-09-09T13:01:09", "owner": "jack_3766", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069162625964150, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:05:49", "owner": "daddyxicon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925594626997673, "text": "What you studying @saskia_ls_", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:02:35", "owner": "bsunlifts1511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152677963389454, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:43:25", "owner": "fahaadh1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076814920984989, "text": "Congrats, 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T12:55:52", "owner": "ethanschulenburgcalvert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173206945355481, "text": "Beauty and brains! Congrats, that's awesome. 🎉", "created_at": "2025-09-03T05:30:11", "owner": "grande_americano_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988205721839194, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-02T23:07:41", "owner": "uggboyme", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061234016074641, "text": "Малышка красотка🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:57:42", "owner": "lopatenko23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037375031472493, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥😉❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:39:32", "owner": "wingboymartin", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["imperial", "london", "university"]},
{"media_id": 3731493418443508994, "shortcode": "DPI7X5oCI0C", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPI7X5oCI0C/", "taken_at": "2025-09-28T08:42:24", "caption": "Degree b Lai le 😂", "owner_username": "you_me_n_england_life", "owner_id": "49265116353", "likes": 345604, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0035_DPI7X5oCI0C\\DPI7X5oCI0C_20250928_084224.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18142175257429340, "text": "Somebody take that beer can away from him 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:15:50", "owner": "ianoseino", "likes": 74}, {"id": 18426160096101138, "text": "They took his clothes aswell 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:03:12", "owner": "chocymint", "likes": 30051}, {"id": 18071443619228050, "text": "They take his fitness as well 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:29:24", "owner": "nishathf_", "likes": 194}, {"id": 17884749135383453, "text": "The qualifications are NOT free, mate‼️", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:48:09", "owner": "seunbharbs", "likes": 496}, {"id": 18065757404359087, "text": "They took his shirt too 😮", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:52:22", "owner": "divahalima", "likes": 1319}, {"id": 18073441979279181, "text": "I thought they existed only in the USA", "created_at": "2025-10-02T03:33:17", "owner": "edbechrah", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18357595909090288, "text": "They take his brain as well 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:58:41", "owner": "demps_1", "likes": 17273}, {"id": 18077315249024208, "text": "Poor guy is being robbed badly, they have taken his clothes, his senses and God knows what else", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:50:23", "owner": "alina_fazi", "likes": 6738}, {"id": 17904768048123626, "text": "Imagine using AI on a video, then slinging it around like it’s the real deal. It’s funny, no doubt. Wild though.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:28:25", "owner": "dannydoesthemthings", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17995214642839138, "text": "He probably can't read nor write.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:25:45", "owner": "yusuph7395", "likes": 7535}, {"id": 17946492096028077, "text": "They taken his brain and clothes and qualifications !I feel his pain 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:29:53", "owner": "shazb1404", "likes": 52}, {"id": 18062118707379934, "text": "He’d make a great Trump supporter", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:53:53", "owner": "autopilot240", "likes": 10357}, {"id": 18067906922041436, "text": "that's AI created . Brits usually goes to school and goes to college as well. The only problem is they choose to stay or work in traditional jobs or family owned businesses. You are getting confused with Americans.", "created_at": "2025-10-08T22:43:50", "owner": "wandering_sneakerhead", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18102415027543212, "text": "At least they’ve not taken your can of beer 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:33:04", "owner": "joeklin", "likes": 4223}, {"id": 17858344791512169, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T21:09:42", "owner": "mr_aamir_jutt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18373854343198400, "text": "At least, they didn't take the can of beer. Praise God 🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-08T04:03:22", "owner": "fabulositee", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18087627715950265, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:46:28", "owner": "abz_uw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055247879558715, "text": "Wow that’s my point exactly. Stop with 🍺 start with📚. You will get a job too mate.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:23:22", "owner": "msmajeed82", "likes": 85}, {"id": 17887571007384162, "text": "And taking their clothes as well 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:50:52", "owner": "balwantdahien", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18425860669111417, "text": "It's scary that many of you can't see this is AI 👀", "created_at": "2025-10-25T17:35:14", "owner": "br.nordic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17975948165941903, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:22:34", "owner": "heeriyayyyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18430130803098161, "text": "It's AI however...", "created_at": "2025-10-26T00:43:16", "owner": "omairinsta", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18424482406103766, "text": "We going to take your jobs, houses, businesses, all your money, we going to rinse you all out, just the way you did in our countries, we are coming for you beer belly chav 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:45:15", "owner": "missyh2021", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17936748203962620, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:48:17", "owner": "simz_pearl", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18060599255143500, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T15:52:24", "owner": "cgdowner", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993684534693374, "text": "They didn't take you beer thankfully", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:50:05", "owner": "nenyemabelle", "likes": 42}, {"id": 17907863337251254, "text": "We speak English 😆", "created_at": "2025-10-11T08:37:29", "owner": "way2george", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952806736028238, "text": "They took everything from you and gave you a beer 🍻😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:42:10", "owner": "pharro__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137403247446416, "text": "🤣🤣🤣😢 😭 💔", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:09:44", "owner": "lafemme_ngozi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849624652566186, "text": "HE DOES HAVE ONE QUALIFICATION", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:20:52", "owner": "taffk51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082025729068046, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:05:46", "owner": "tafseerkazmi1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17974307234946468, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T05:18:27", "owner": "doubleman__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959299122877256, "text": "One thing I understand in this country is people believing whatever they hear from politicians and what they see on televisions without conducting a personal research whether those things are true or not", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:11:32", "owner": "mhiraculus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011357942619893, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:10:12", "owner": "krn__1123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954731398002171, "text": "My experience of many English men - sloppy dressers and poor manners.", "created_at": "2025-10-27T15:59:06", "owner": "louise.halperin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880364986408466, "text": "Bro did they take your clothes as well ?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:10:50", "owner": "rishi_cse", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081444916978063, "text": "The Brit is Ai", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:18:33", "owner": "jumpingjalapeno", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17918304207194821, "text": "If they took your qualification you can work as gym trainer😃", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:46:37", "owner": "dk_vachhani", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17855946867551504, "text": "Next we taking you wife's", "created_at": "2025-10-24T11:21:25", "owner": "clivehirasen", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864688423479874, "text": "🍺thank God, they didn't take the pub!", "created_at": "2025-10-24T18:00:20", "owner": "hello_love_of_mine", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063298682607276, "text": "This is epic one😆", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:24:07", "owner": "mirjan_077", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18125100955495168, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T09:45:09", "owner": "emy.bouf", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18289511041259957, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T14:26:20", "owner": "pilotmyasirm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18313801132220630, "text": "😂🍺at this point, he really needs Pres. Trump for a backup or perhaps be among Trumps cabinet 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:04:45", "owner": "gibrinesowah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849715816591714, "text": "AI", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:46:20", "owner": "workfamillia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947130475048828, "text": "They took his job n his teeth as well 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:43:50", "owner": "f.snaiki_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059517170553955, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T22:21:47", "owner": "mathetkuac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936227860093580, "text": "Did they dig him up? Or was he already dead?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:06:06", "owner": "maggiedanjoan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098757499674637, "text": "They ate all the qualifications along with the cats and the dogs 🐕 🍺😅", "created_at": "2025-10-29T15:31:03", "owner": "robin_farr5726", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902278156290482, "text": "They have taken all our clothes for jilabiya and abayas too.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:21:11", "owner": "lead.ers2016", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083957078304581, "text": "The second video (British guy) was made by AI", "created_at": "2025-10-08T21:19:41", "owner": "eileen.aylin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17878068045423550, "text": "What qualifications do illegal immigrants have?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T09:34:48", "owner": "arta__xvarenah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18103036849529556, "text": "Hehehhehehehe", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:55:06", "owner": "zee.7199", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17882487927402148, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T14:41:49", "owner": "baraya_2600", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862967968507949, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T12:28:35", "owner": "franklintorino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385923535181814, "text": "Does everyone here know that the video is AI-generated? I’m not defending the person in it because there are real people who talk like that. I’m just wondering if no one realizes it’s AI, or if you all know it’s AI and just find it funny?", "created_at": "2025-10-27T17:52:11", "owner": "ob1lv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046915934345270, "text": "And they are taking our drinking alcohol qualifications 🤣🤣🤣🤣🍺🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:50:15", "owner": "shingiadventures", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17991111353854173, "text": "Hire him as a flag 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:37:11", "owner": "ajayprasad6837", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052120016649762, "text": "He got his 🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-26T23:24:25", "owner": "petro_rock", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076527521143736, "text": "Qualified pinter", "created_at": "2025-10-26T22:28:18", "owner": "dbrownman2018", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113590807551336, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T20:59:41", "owner": "simplyjennart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328454890236944,