wner": "rusty_patina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954752505895574, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:42:20", "owner": "radhiaattou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041916644705087, "text": "At least you still have your beer, they didn't take it. #smiles....", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:34:15", "owner": "elekwafestus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900435166321358, "text": "@jas_stud 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T07:34:59", "owner": "ogeo97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945757527938204, "text": "🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:20:22", "owner": "camelbutt123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084510740074256, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:41:43", "owner": "aabahar88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985747416872666, "text": "Where’s me o level??", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:58:04", "owner": "tarqglenpet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075665668939659, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:22:30", "owner": "pymcheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887918908388997, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:08:57", "owner": "khaibershinwari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870170680464299, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:35:07", "owner": "samrat_p77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100623811677651, "text": "They need to take the can of Stella Artois off your hand too.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:19:38", "owner": "ncheenwabunnia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875381917355509, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:04:45", "owner": "mahdi.abdi.31586526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300924697253047, "text": "They paid hugely to aquire the qualifications so they might take the jobs", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:55:22", "owner": "jonathanosayi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110472286589695, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:11:53", "owner": "allinone_hairandbeauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991891674892853, "text": "Still deport them", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:05:12", "owner": "onlymikai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082196729014510, "text": "You really do, why don’t you go to schools in your homelands. It is their country their birthright not yours. The entitlement!", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:58:12", "owner": "dreams_allowed_destinations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992099712718478, "text": "He is certified pig", "created_at": "2025-11-10T21:35:20", "owner": "mike313syr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033507593726758, "text": "Oh Dear.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:38:37", "owner": "peter.summerfield.77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878748412327829, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂Mercyyyyyy", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:35:07", "owner": "jolynana2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920639806189550, "text": "Kung of benefit", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:19:42", "owner": "chukwuemeka_peters1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072369587201467, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:46:21", "owner": "mikebody_teamiron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370794922155803, "text": "East India company was smart and ruled us...now we are much.more smarter and  ruling over england 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:51:50", "owner": "ronyenigmatic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075675440227784, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:53:00", "owner": "attitude_by_nadre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18404943697188509, "text": "In his voice “ none they ‘ve taken all the qualifications as well !  M*gu", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:26:23", "owner": "dy10001d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164143018381891, "text": "So TRUE AND VALID POINT. The next time someone says that. I am going to ask them what jobs are they taking? What qualifications do you have? 😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-09T17:38:37", "owner": "realestaterehabfashion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852215101577455, "text": "Love this.🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-09T17:20:19", "owner": "aysha.saeedb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031282667740730, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:45:56", "owner": "naweedzazai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884867170393509, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:59:06", "owner": "andreia_barbu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062966600396430, "text": "Ai you stupid \"Ç U NT\