24, "text": "At least he doesn't go around stabbing innocent people walking thier dogs, you bunch of left wing cunts", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:53:43", "owner": "doveantony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068314436074845, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:28:16", "owner": "neda001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295811068266078, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:53:29", "owner": "sebastiaolarsonfernandes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045518951438124, "text": "Thanks God they left enough beer and fast food for you to feel your big belly", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:30:24", "owner": "ghazalmnhhhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861105889521084, "text": "Hand picked and misleading examples on both sides. We know that statistically Muslims aren’t taking or doing any jobs at all.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:01:14", "owner": "louiscarroll1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867873232394600, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:13:41", "owner": "elashkar.khaled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082209082956555, "text": "He is right - the demand for American colleges from expats has put the fees beyond such people", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:05:35", "owner": "pj240758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077667820887677, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:09:53", "owner": "anchor_vidya_official2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953615287013088, "text": "Obvious it is AI", "created_at": "2025-10-30T04:45:00", "owner": "m_maitha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865290550495977, "text": "They took your brains too? 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:34:25", "owner": "ngozimawa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093335221803116, "text": "Coke loaded", "created_at": "2025-10-29T21:55:47", "owner": "nahid4066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331235470227755, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:29:20", "owner": "jayrah_deen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096686695768962, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:34:56", "owner": "dan79986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085348222799138, "text": "Lodu prajati", "created_at": "2025-10-29