etc etc 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:21:56", "owner": "axe_lmtz01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081792878318285, "text": "You can’t teach stupid 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:14:48", "owner": "marco135791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310476094217332, "text": "Wait that's here too🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:13:59", "owner": "backbreak2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986478285860039, "text": "This is an insult to good sense. It is about millions of white men remaining  without jobs due to imigrants. And indeed, the qualifications can be stoled by supporting only the foreign people to study. This is perfectly possible in the “shadow grades” system from English universities", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:10:57", "owner": "maverick5256", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062684555617140, "text": "All he needs is a shirt not a job😅. Common sense was wrongly defined in the dictionary.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:52:48", "owner": "watchmore_talkless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359786557086600, "text": "If this was real, a person talking like this would have the St George’s Flag painted, not the Great Britain flag. But funny", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:44:02", "owner": "mafeo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060368801171895, "text": "Hahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:24:18", "owner": "irshad4ver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069208502258272, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:19:59", "owner": "chris_lartey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922655947155117, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:46:43", "owner": "sitoetatiana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061128479145562, "text": "Sorry ooo lazy man 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:38:32", "owner": "med_yinkus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866552368397383, "text": "Reform future MP. 😅", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:06:05", "owner": "waynewatson51", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882087160402319, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂🍺 he gat his beer", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:05:02", "owner": "kalifa_baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066517394059807, "text": "😄😄", "created_at": "2025-10-1