er": "yahwendyb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109441168586555, "text": "The immigrants took his brain cells too 🤣. This is what inbreeding does to people.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T22:06:57", "owner": "sabs516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370860121145484, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T22:00:15", "owner": "mygatos2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004545665814919, "text": "Pls come turn ur mic to india u will see people@like this in evey inch of corner😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:57:38", "owner": "ranvijay_m007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905039662266801, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:39:22", "owner": "isabel_fortes18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056917520634504, "text": "😂😂😂😵‍💫😵‍💫😵‍💫🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:33:44", "owner": "merlefrankfort", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045135224402642, "text": "😅🤣😅", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:32:43", "owner": "ndey_bhoyo1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103886734546047, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:14:09", "owner": "arneshg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908928310239124, "text": "She don't look like she just came from the 3rd world though", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:03:48", "owner": "zara.khan786_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067136669589353, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣 who can help us if the country is full of these idoits", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:53:38", "owner": "tonyclark0662", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946037206059564, "text": "It’s ai", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:37:20", "owner": "claratg3653", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536496763004838, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:13:59", "owner": "baben6559", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885191506379519, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:04:37", "owner": "luxaestheticstudio_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912702496208975, "text": "You cant fix stupid", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:00:10", "owner": "pats.y2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053944025268094, "text": "Hahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:10:32", "owner": "suestkitchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965827611825477, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:07:12", "owner": "malik_nommyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055723601564054, "text": "They're the drunken masters & that's their qualifications.. 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:06:05", "owner": "shoaib316cold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951296701020160, "text": "atleast he has bachelors in unemployment & excuses", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:01:48", "owner": "sn4n._.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180702052339515, "text": "But do they take your women's also", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:52:37", "owner": "gibril.turay.359", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082876888787749, "text": "Go ur home after u study no one want you in EUROPE!!", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:52:21", "owner": "billie8g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135130186456074, "text": "He doesn't know what is the meaning of qualifications.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:45:54", "owner": "ricky9588", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059862224628054, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:43:43", "owner": "queenromade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075751016149751, "text": "A typical Brexit and trump supporter 😜😜", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:22:47", "owner": "benjibongo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060507170150814, "text": "No Qualifications..\nNo sense..\nNo intelligence..\nNo shirt..\nSo what is he moaning about then?\nHe should be ashamed that international students have travelled to the United Kingdom to earn their degree 📜 and give back to the country by becoming Lawyers,Doctors,Teachers etc…", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:16:07", "owner": "daddy_moany_chronicles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071185334265514, "text": "Beer belly is his qualification", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:10:08", "owner": "carvellebee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991288614847183, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:09:57", "owner": "manuthesimba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096324481665924, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:04:41", "owner": "mic.ki.kirikiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077424947035730, "text": "😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:59:06", "owner": "rosycheeks3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894281623341406, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:57:39", "owner": "sayali_bora_dugad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061772288618707, "text": "Mate, keep that can of beer safe and guard it because they are coming for it next! 😱 🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:56:58", "owner": "matureblkmasseur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013827944792307, "text": "At least the didn't take his can on beer. Something to be grateful for. 🤣😂🤣😂🤣😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:55:15", "owner": "matureblkmasseur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068197127372936, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:51:17", "owner": "dee_.purkiss12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863769010480084, "text": "Mumu", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:50:40", "owner": "marriagecouncillor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032785163709521, "text": "We haven’t taken his beer 🍺 obviously. We are coming for that too 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:45:26", "owner": "greggpeters2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099162466578719, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:41:44", "owner": "wean.genie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979838844760825, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:29:11", "owner": "ganchevognyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082067260963091, "text": "Since Tony Blair was in power there has been in every council in the country a positive discrimination policy were by if a white British person and an immigrant go for a job it must go to the immigrant regardless of qualifications or experience and that is FACT", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:27:57", "owner": "only1mistaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120465049509308, "text": "Just like south Africans are saying same thing", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:25:40", "owner": "henrytabi22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052864922633258, "text": "There is just no cure for STUPIDITY", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:21:40", "owner": "sa.rah7148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042065303463284, "text": "Naaa that’s AI", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:13:36", "owner": "agyennyark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072798442958981, "text": "😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:41:00", "owner": "gurvinder.sandhu.5076", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071187620269612, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:39:51", "owner": "just_123yesno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18486911707075825, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:36:18", "owner": "regina_sukh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019777331777168, "text": "😳🙃💯🙏👏😂👍👌🫶🏾👑🙌🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:26:02", "owner": "street.mask", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007373738812490, "text": "Education in Western countries is not as heavily subsidized as it is in India. Students there often need a strong financial background to continue their education. As a result, only the wealthy and exceptionally talented individuals are able to pursue higher learning. In contrast, mediocre students in India can access a good education at a subsidized cost, leading many to believe that we are the only highly intelligent people in the world when they go abroad.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:34:22", "owner": "kanchankoner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198254554316685, "text": "What a Jackarse 😩😩😩😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:30:32", "owner": "brownin84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055610510542549, "text": "Is this AI?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:24:57", "owner": "waqarr154", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924676549141724, "text": "Please like a degree lands you a job these days", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:15:10", "owner": "certifiedjimenez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973581054945944, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:09:55", "owner": "anthonycarlgordon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884659717261121, "text": "I want see one Brit to go to a different country (no English speaking) - learn the language, study, live there, work, pay taxes, pay rent and all and make friends - I’ll wait …..", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:09:53", "owner": "eva_deva_boo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078529223090816, "text": "Without Pakistani, Indian, Bangladeshi, Chinese, Taiwan, Vietnam, South Korea, Japan, Cambodia, and Malaysia…. Western countries, US, European countries, can’t survive.. US Economy and UK will be on top.. they can’t fix their computers.. without the presence of Indian or Pakistani or Chinese..", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:09:36", "owner": "haquetalha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055893737535139, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:05:40", "owner": "veroncegmail.com6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976644537926697, "text": "What a satire .. not all poor can understand though !!", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:23:53", "owner": "_7_rapa_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295225186253077, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:12:02", "owner": "britocipriano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114999493530413, "text": "He has beer", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:11:58", "owner": "charlady.phillipsventures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069943169245979, "text": "Anger and blame are their qualifications", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:04:19", "owner": "nile_asante", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18131642863464306, "text": "We have the same in France 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:04:17", "owner": "mustaphapimousse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967672710812953, "text": "He should say England mata ki jai", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:59:39", "owner": "aamir_ritz2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055327481261991, "text": "😂🤣😂🤣😂🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:39:33", "owner": "mabez_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094304635811924, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:37:17", "owner": "georgia_funches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136222837458148, "text": "😜", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:25:48", "owner": "hywho8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901570372276470, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:25:19", "owner": "gdestincollection", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069238409337753, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:19:42", "owner": "vjesh16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512105458071456, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:18:0