m naked", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:41:23", "owner": "shaolina77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109252093581710, "text": "Thank god they have not taken your looks. Damn arse", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:41:19", "owner": "anisalorchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068115257048186, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:38:27", "owner": "ousman193627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060970397158501, "text": "His brain has been taken too!", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:35:29", "owner": "offsiderule12a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060808778528978, "text": "🤣🙌🤣Usual  calling us Usual suspects but it's them unqualified", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:32:25", "owner": "howardkurtis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18177628201349461, "text": "Dude got a point 😅", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:29:08", "owner": "brooklyn_queens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074916629126406, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:27:47", "owner": "nida_vaseem81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912989869085718, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:14:31", "owner": "greenfamnestle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080288855490176, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:12:00", "owner": "n.salar76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101279263729663, "text": "He has no money to take qualifications because girls took all jobs. Keep dirinking 🍺 bro!! Never mind...", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:10:25", "owner": "dayinin_biri_iste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121051975511199, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:56:14", "owner": "auntlillys_eats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071238263186960, "text": "Chill man chill 🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:55:52", "owner": "saba.saher.988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079049884843804, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:34:52", "owner": "natalee56288", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990455535853527, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:32:51", "owner": "gaetanepostol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067639508582851, "text": "At least they didn't take his beer", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:28:44", "owner":