, "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063861602096843, "text": "Ok taking jobs was ok, but why they look all qualifications, that’s so sad 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:47:09", "owner": "qudsiya.jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056510927215785, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:12:39", "owner": "manye_ayeley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855215467544889, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:55:10", "owner": "elinam_manile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029280035720811, "text": "They left him body paint 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:49:06", "owner": "citizenken61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108889771603143, "text": "That's a real problem 😂 Bro", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:41:59", "owner": "ernesto.arevalo.501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18241295323293675, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:24:11", "owner": "faimalierhema", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041946698463592, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:22:14", "owner": "oloristarlady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894330847342932, "text": "South Africa where are you? Xenophobia", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:49:57", "owner": "lillianagada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110127118580848, "text": "😂💀🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:46:15", "owner": "keno_stylez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911907823211903, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:43:42", "owner": "i.am.marqan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376866895149568, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:39:08", "owner": "elena_posso_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002782364818917, "text": "Poor guy, they took everything from him...well, not everything as he has his 🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:25:59", "owner": "the.nubianqueen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080566172050186, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:20:37", "owner": "a_dreamy_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374287606150086, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:19:21", "owner": "latoyacleghorn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345425878161718, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:16:31", "owner": "rene_is_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078381755118201, "text": "Charlie Kirk Hammet 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:14:29", "owner": "abhijitbach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991983231849247, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:05:54", "owner": "247sabr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943666899935912, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:50:31", "owner": "its_zendarg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964907346977011, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:37:27", "owner": "thassan244", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015050660787797, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:26:12", "owner": "yosra.ibrahim.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856807228537460, "text": "Also the clothes, all of his clothes were taken by immigrants!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:08:35", "owner": "alicja_baranowska123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087630881508059, "text": "Dum as hell", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:05:50", "owner": "greenidgejuanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987102222854780, "text": "Stupid immigrations making this guy stupid 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:01:42", "owner": "tsangkarjun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082453471951589, "text": "First, they blame Europe for their failures. Now is the time to blame legit immigrants. Never mind, there will come a time when there’s no one else left to blame.😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:49:57", "owner": "midehaastrup", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870206998373007, "text": "They took all the things including clothes", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:36:50", "owner": "syed.o.ahmed.92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909646792238947, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:27:56", "owner": "justanotheruser_npc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115868074472999, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:27:37", "owner": "mothi14358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090953713680625, "text": "You mean to tell me that those dumbos colonized some countries in Africa including Nigeria. Ahh 🤦🏻‍♂️🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:25:41", "owner": "kings__rubies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975237333943648, "text": "This is supposed to be cayman.. exact words spoken by caymanians", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:04:01", "owner": "mridontcare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090168598884547, "text": "They took all the qualifications and hand him beer", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:55:08", "owner": "royal2ip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044871761402215, "text": "😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:33:34", "owner": "husseini.ibn_auf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910653952093697, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:27:09", "owner": "cheriabolfathi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061153988630803, "text": "हर अंग्रेजी बोलने वाला योग्य नहीं होता भारत के उल्लूओ 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:19:55", "owner": "devpurushh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946224019046364, "text": "😂😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:17:48", "owner": "rosenlund2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532681096025883, "text": "Anyone heard of AI", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:08:35", "owner": "david_little22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094389712753571, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:04:17", "owner": "devi_wibisana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904319575271235, "text": "That,  surely, has to be a set up!🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:01:08", "owner": "eileen.nicholson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042619913438386, "text": "What qualifications do you have?\nWell, I don’t even qualify for Jobseekers Allowance, cos I’ve never worked a day in my life. 🍺😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:48:21", "owner": "spanishdncr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101435935565005, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:43:04", "owner": "stargirlsexysam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057552578202569, "text": "Dum fk", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:35:50", "owner": "yvonne_henry_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057675317565029, "text": "Aye think they have stole your brain mate 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:27:43", "owner": "caroline.m.butler.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083119672980235, "text": "Ignoramus 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:27:16", "owner": "changalanglove", "li