reat again", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:25:52", "owner": "james_anderson_197", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925785805113082, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:22:30", "owner": "annmnolan70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886775617374025, "text": "None they have taken all the qualifications as well- he is seriously that upset? How? Must we wonder", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:16:32", "owner": "deepa.gupta.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106862710598506, "text": "😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:02:57", "owner": "ada_f.d.v_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856578487479868, "text": "See the qualification on his hand 😂😂😂😂🍺🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:52:05", "owner": "official_ojeli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026401847735458, "text": "His qualification is gynecomastia 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:45:06", "owner": "jeanninemespitia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062632298105220, "text": "Including your clothes? Oh my🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:40:38", "owner": "azmanabb1585", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989709231853832, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:40:14", "owner": "ian.smejkal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077844047514160, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:32:26", "owner": "paul_ferret", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047239025365179, "text": "Clearly his qualification in his hand drinking 🍺, what a silly question", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:16:31", "owner": "zinanawras", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075478022124968, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:15:13", "owner": "sangeetagurung93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064256405092959, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:14:43", "owner": "vannessa8901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867265945459999, "text": "When they came to africa and take everything and our countries as well that’s how we felt or still feeling", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:03:27", "owner": "memory.banda.921677", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18161696089379626, "text": "😂🤣What job does he want that has been stolen?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:19:37", "owner": "lara_