0T21:28:55", "owner": "famous.mc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937860310087061, "text": "Selfish foreigners!!! Lol", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:25:41", "owner": "azupaul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027355718546235, "text": "always the toothless, living in council flats, no job, in Weatherspoons every day 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:16:08", "owner": "weckek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074014015908623, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:54:06", "owner": "mihaelaalina8998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286887097279048, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:49:44", "owner": "purehope27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122819446499568, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:48:22", "owner": "edwardbinton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093708421693817, "text": "Bro that’s AI😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:48:18", "owner": "mughal_574", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932798364982733, "text": "Oh dear, what a mess, will never work but happy to complain about people who want to come to the UK and actually pay into the system.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:46:05", "owner": "suthmke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063578357083961, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:32:21", "owner": "kynatrazaofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080275406079937, "text": "They forgot to take the flag color as well….🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:23:38", "owner": "ibn_abbas093", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851144542527303, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:21:35", "owner": "desi.bait", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014077982792530, "text": "...sounds right😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:14:53", "owner": "accharles2005mrs._jackson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371765959195084, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:07:03", "owner": "arlene.olivia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886382683366146, "text": "🤣😅😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:02:52", "owner": "viqtorlekranty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057877655570281, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:58:29", "owner": "elephants_mum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180674160593