y are not letting us study and work..", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:26:43", "owner": "sanmesh.parab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862616482495602, "text": "Rahul Gandhi ke fans India ke bahar bhi hai kya", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:24:59", "owner": "rachamadgu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945946089918417, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:23:05", "owner": "teamsimpson15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322819279209801, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:22:53", "owner": "muanpuiizaia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081030709990872, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:21:49", "owner": "etke.sz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097190668732937, "text": "Ha ha ha nice one!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:17:03", "owner": "georgestevede", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946137444915377, "text": "The thing is it's AI....but it's not far from reality 🤣🤣......a lot of British people are actually saying this. I don't mind them rallying for the country's migration issues...but at least do your research and join the rally for the right reasons! I have seen interviews of someone in the rally for the reason that he doesn't mind legal immigrants going through the right processing but doesn't agree with illegal immigrants getting in the country and getting free accommodations and all sorts while Britain has a high homeless rate. These kind of reasoning I can accept!  But the while \"taking our jobs but you don't even have you're own qualifications because you're too busy leeching off people's taxes and drinking pints in the pub....yeeeaahhh....it doesn't look good mate. 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:12:17", "owner": "gggizel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073866901936831, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:08:41", "owner": "deepesh_krishnakumar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067863521029275, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:06:41", "owner": "dararattwentyseven", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074132324173335, "text": "Bro hold your beer tight or they will take that too", "created_at":