rinking beer on a weekday 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T22:11:58", "owner": "maycheezy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086964424728817, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T22:08:17", "owner": "assetova_zhanerke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425148190109278, "text": "But they ain’t taking your beer I bet mate", "created_at": "2025-10-06T22:01:12", "owner": "martonmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909244804239767, "text": "It’s annoying how the internet never forgets. Poor man💔💔💔😀😀😀😀", "created_at": "2025-10-06T22:01:04", "owner": "ryn_winner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020426177775698, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:52:26", "owner": "jazz_richel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981541365756297, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:51:52", "owner": "jazz_richel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533476960047816, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:50:24", "owner": "vijay007jamesbond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859975819508963, "text": "Someone took your fucken brains. Long ago", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:50:08", "owner": "othonelizondo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980563557875186, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:49:15", "owner": "beauty.visions_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074124941272914, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:49:05", "owner": "ellandfishchips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407031436140699, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:42:53", "owner": "pintofdellibae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080318398833641, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:42:39", "owner": "chupsy001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521225860045568, "text": "@ngakalaj48", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:38:55", "owner": "am_lidya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929602786102109, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:37:49", "owner": "yasstinoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922431142197892, "text": "They took his bra and his brain", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:33:37", "owner": "lainytedted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097934290659665, "text": "The MAGA of the UK", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:30:46", "owner": "c