 "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285967780275470, "text": "Indians spreading everywhere in the world like a disease sometimesI feel like they don’t have a country 🦠😖", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:55:01", "owner": "ghadeer.q8yz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994747662843548, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:49:32", "owner": "jaroslav_pirkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986859327730691, "text": "Tit painting is not a job or a qualification!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:42:57", "owner": "auriadeliz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896954563308313, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:38:21", "owner": "anamrahimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090415186834552, "text": "🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:37:43", "owner": "emma_kaur1964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935348800095267, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:36:59", "owner": "kamal_singh720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952887744889151, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:33:30", "owner": "majyazd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968302182800474, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:32:04", "owner": "serifizzet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528753496035696, "text": "First give him a fu¢$ing bra😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:25:47", "owner": "sarfraz91222", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109278319505109, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:20:22", "owner": "ogee_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129839365474033, "text": "They are taking your beers too, mate", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:19:15", "owner": "peterboamanu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187643611334164, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:18:46", "owner": "himangi957", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094533952750369, "text": "Smile", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:17:13", "owner": "kehindekeniroja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845017348583528, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂🍺🍺🍺🍺😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:16:00", "owner": "londono12081", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872572531350414, "text": "It should be funny unless you think \"how then UK\" existing before those Muslim and blacks invasions", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:14:01", "owner": "fat_cat_2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069430043195624, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:13:28", "owner": "danielrb_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191681695324321, "text": "Yes the are", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:11:37", "owner": "dutchman6868", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987973734854126, "text": "They forgot to take his can of beer while their at it 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:11:34", "owner": "kokizag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092576182790650, "text": "Unfortunately this guy is being shown as if he is typical of brits, Brits are not racist they are sick of political correctness and spongers who the country cannot afford any more. If you’ve posted here, do you have a job that contributes to society and do you mix outside of your immediate circle of family and friends? Look around and prove me wrong, can you?", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:10:37", "owner": "dreslerdavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151275178408240, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:08:43", "owner": "ruland949", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024990845556200, "text": "😂😂😅😂😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:07:42", "owner": "amarie_thomas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079808714008442, "text": "Nobody can take his 🍺 way😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:07:34", "owner": "petrit.ko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18219900784314498, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:06:51", "owner": "_precious_mary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082664996479523, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:06:34", "owner": "petrit.ko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995114574829733, "text": "I’m taking that beer of him too", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:04:22", "owner": "mabla2303", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18078782699077300, "text": "😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:04:02", "owner": "blessings_42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040150520474924, "text": "Did they take your clothes! They left the beers for you!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:03:04", "owner": "punaotearohamonsall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889995526221203, "text": "Oh My Good Lord . Simone get me a whiskey 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:01:27", "owner": "funky_madam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049411937329485, "text": "Biggest joke of the year 👏😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:01:08", "owner": "haseebgondal786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054206369268877, "text": "You could not make this up", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:58:59", "owner": "ian_o312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081792970990963, "text": "😂 looks like they ve taken his clothes too 🙆🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:57:33", "owner": "riyadhingreja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968409732809377, "text": "Red Boobs 😂😂🤣🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:56:30", "owner": "jacquemartinue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869773231443908, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:56:20", "owner": "litsa.anastasiou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074837663167887, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:54:50", "owner": "khaistabae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066304376041033, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:53:16", "owner": "sohrabam1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035925479498600, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:48:51", "owner": "beluchafernandes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091533655637484, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:48:50", "owner": "dumlybazile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862010635491044, "text": "I don’t think any nobody has an issue with people intending to work contribute to society and pay tax. That needs to be recognised as truth rather than prejudice because in reality we’re get terrorists, rapists and drug dealers not than doctors.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:48:32", "owner": "dreslerdavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133321048456059, "text": "Love you Man 😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:46:26", "owner": "antoniocnpereira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053207222280121, "text": "What the ....we took the qualifications 🤣🤣🤣...bruh what did you drink 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:43:49", "owner": "moto____dock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180581663574