ated_at": "2025-10-06T07:18:40", "owner": "igifyougif", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065748836599579, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:16:01", "owner": "nnirmal97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036583208705580, "text": "As a Indian I would say stop immigrating ppl from India it would distort your country", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:14:06", "owner": "tahhazzib_80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529173247019238, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:10:47", "owner": "wariswaiting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080379253834447, "text": "Indian:-\"I need your clothes, your boots and your motorcycle\".... \"But you forgot to say please\" !!!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:10:07", "owner": "abhishridhar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180108154343995, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:08:43", "owner": "dhruvaswal.in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296089549250722, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:07:16", "owner": "carewabayomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090774406878722, "text": "🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:06:48", "owner": "sushmita_hali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970244706954595, "text": "Sadly this issue is complex. The hate and rhetoric is disgraceful. The poverty, lack of investment in left behind communities with multiple deprivations is also disgraceful. This is how the far right move in. Where is our Labour government- they are entrenching poverty further and are feeding hatred. They support genocide and are leading Farage and worse straight to parliament. Poverty is real, lack of educational attainment is real, poor housing, lack of employment it’s all real. Fight the hatred and fight poverty. I’m not condoning this man’s actions in any way I just feel we need everyone to have the opportunity to achieve. These are white left behind communities who have had nothing for decades and of course for the far right these people are prime targets to spread their own ideology, their own nazi agenda hidden in the guise of caring about poor white communities but like Trump we know this will not be the case. This is all about divide and rule rather than unite and fight! Peacefully I believe is the way.  Sending hope not hate 🕊️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:03:01", "owner": "rebecca.hadley1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091769071654243, "text": "Well he speak englisch!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:00:32", "owner": "oundtk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947917348043248, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:59:11", "owner": "sreejithrajendran04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082089826811037, "text": "😅🤣🤣 idiots", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:58:17", "owner": "zarajjoz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068793260021463, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:56:26", "owner": "ollyonuoha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080048597057894, "text": "😅😅😅😅😅😂😂😂😂🍺🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:54:55", "owner": "jeromedavis29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482924767074771, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:51:01", "owner": "skjoldis.dagslott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990956976844495, "text": "Give him back his qualifications! 😡", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:44:56", "owner": "nnnno_v_onnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988654719853194, "text": "😂😂😂that’s trump", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:44:48", "owner": "holly_hunter_123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048931904329902, "text": "Man with his beer 🍺 even thinks qualification is something you can lose versus have!! WOW 😮", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:43:13", "owner": "dashmanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528277555062799, "text": "They take everything!🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:35:27", "owner": "sienazin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865990906464864, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:33:28", "owner": "jayedwards2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060941156570720, "text": "It's AI", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:29:38", "owner": "roche_likes_a_scotch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946664071043225, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:29:34", "owner": "sarbjit_com.au", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872887882432536, "text": "🤣", "created_at"