  And the name of the president at the beginning of the book who meets a very interesting fate that triggers the next chapter of America as a dictatorship is named Donald Harrison.  As in Donald Trump and Kamala Harris the O.N. At the end of Harrison means Ordo novus = “an order that is new,” which puts emphasis on ordo (order) first, then qualifies it as “new.” Some people think it’s referring to a warning that this regime emerged out of a Trump/Harris presidential race that Trump wins which is why his first name is used in the first position and Harris’s last name is second.  But if you read the book it warns that he might not make it and with his fate sealed an order that is new will rise in his place run by a “hillbilly” President named Greeley.  Vance is a self proclaimed hillbilly that will usher in an order that is new in the form of Dark Enlightenment.  You have got to read this book.  Everything I described happens in the first two or three chapters.  Where it goes from there will blow your mind!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:27:24", "owner": "resistfascistrule", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026888363543103, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:24:38", "owner": "leyebea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945851134046897, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:23:58", "owner": "k_fadgeo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153712231398951, "text": "ये भारत में रह रहे लोगो का हाल है । रोना मचाये रहते है आरक्षण का", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:22:03", "owner": "rashmikasingh640", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055810454220858, "text": "MF", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:19:51", "owner": "juxx_vickey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994538985845235, "text": "Beer drinker!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:15:32", "owner": "mag1_bog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083836082310370, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:14:35", "owner": "allshadesoflena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082528172297484, "text": "Very soon they take the pub aswell 🤣 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:06:25", "owner": "sparkle_bonez"