: "mihaelafilipescu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877861948306752, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-05T03:00:58", "owner": "hanarayan16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18426739372096076, "text": "It's the fact that people don't know it's A.I", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:59:44", "owner": "elder_delight", "likes": 194}, {"id": 18332202028224544, "text": "He may be a rock, remember that is not india, if they get angry you get a bullet. You Can't show that casteist arrogance there, stay safe", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:58:02", "owner": "samudrala937", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526883434035399, "text": "No, he ate his for dinner.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:56:43", "owner": "mgris4_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856003870478872, "text": "Local governments have cut large amounts of funding to education at all levels, including elementary and high school levels, college and university. They have directed funds to private and rich schools to increase the division between the elites and everyone else and are bringing in more international  students  who are desperate enough to pay the ridiculous higher educational fees they place on them. This isn’t a joke, this is a serious problem that starts at the bottomed with our youth all to benefit the greedy and give our politicians better GDP figures for their bonuses.. I know in my part of the globe the universities are owned/controlled by the Zionists. Wake up people and don’t let depraves desperate international students intimidate you with their BS. I come from a line of immigrants myself and this ain’t about racism. This is about a broken unfair system controlled by greedy prejudiced wicked self serving individuals.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:54:26", "owner": "annaelm27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858344947516236, "text": "Where they sold beanhead!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:46:56", "owner": "sistrinn2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090703489799876, "text": "Beer peple😅", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:45:13", "owner": "rendell_ren_ren", "likes"