 to work and pay taxes to keep Britain economy running and today the same immigrants that rebuild Britain though Britain wealth foundation was built  on slave trade, global resources theft and the same immigrants that rebuild Britain after ww2, those immigrants are now what British people called invaders on their culture and values. What a shame. English is a Germanic language and was never indigenous to anywhere in Britain. The original owners of this UK are the Scottish, Irish and Welsh. English people themselves were a tribe from Saxon in germany who invaded England, killed indigenous people and stole the land and later the Vikings Called norsemen from all of Scandinavian countries especially Denmark who were violent species of humans just like their fellow criminals Saxons from Germany, those Norsemen invaded England, fought a bloody war with the Saxons and later made peace to rule England together this is the origin of English people in England which is the origin of the word ANGLO-SAXON. The anglos were Vikings from Denmark primarily and the Saxons were a tribe from germany because germany is just a country with different tribes of which one of those tribe were the saxons who later became what we know today as modern English people. . Even the British royal family original name was Saxe-Coburg-Gotha which is their German name because the British royal family are German by blood and they never denied their German heritage they only changed their name to Windsor during ww2 for fear of being attacked when all of Europe was against germany over Hitler atrocities. My advice to English people is that they should go do a DNA test and the result will show their ancestors were either Germans or Denmark or Norway that’s it", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:08:49", "owner": "bestfriendofbabiesandpuppies", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889835473222373, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:06:37", "owner": "djpanda664", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986379597894425, "text": "@yeah_