y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297159103269083, "text": "If this guy were American he’d throw in something about wanting to get rid of “D.E.I” and going back to “Meritocracy” without realizing the irony", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:40:03", "owner": "kitchenhobby101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531218161048531, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣they took all the classes, all the books, everything 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:39:19", "owner": "naushoun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083044150761815, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:37:17", "owner": "shubha.pillai.94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375249172196954, "text": "And who took his brain?? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:35:28", "owner": "vintage.dealers.etsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034169141703511, "text": "😂😂😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:34:15", "owner": "vintage.dealers.etsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295717972254829, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:33:44", "owner": "casanovaaarav4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947383147020257, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:32:07", "owner": "rooso_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078568883015727, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:31:52", "owner": "stevewealth001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536694343048543, "text": "😂😂😂😂🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:31:42", "owner": "nery.rodriguez.7169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077619232844048, "text": "They left the beer 🍺 that’s it", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:31:27", "owner": "gurpreetsingh_johar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058115816407696, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:27:52", "owner": "esuwemimo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876796141415237, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:26:04", "owner": "vanq_shelepko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089091538894438, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:25:37", "owner": "world____taman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076069864887296, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:24:58", "owner": "khangi_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849678793534782, "text": "🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:24:43", "owner"