d_at": "2025-10-04T13:33:05", "owner": "lilyya874", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858034672519038, "text": "Funny but the second clip is AI", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:32:30", "owner": "mjbass17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073587338134368, "text": "They took his brain and shirts well.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:31:43", "owner": "asim_mehmood1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026058758726690, "text": "What language is this guy speaking? 🍺 sorry, I'm from the UK and don't go out much.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:31:43", "owner": "maya462841", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062429600613196, "text": "🤣😅😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:28:20", "owner": "aydatamazight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087875266710015, "text": "They might have taken all the jobs, qualifications and even his bra, but atleast they didn't take away all his food, because he looks very plump 🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:27:54", "owner": "miss.aggie_comedyofficial1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089228320865034, "text": "They take his sense too", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:27:53", "owner": "firepepper1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065664242588737, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:27:40", "owner": "firepepper1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846344947578620, "text": "Funny.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:27:33", "owner": "todaysdealsuk1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069267131244372, "text": "The land he is staying on is his qualification! Respect the people who host you!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:26:02", "owner": "ray_barencci", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042127895422099, "text": "Brilliant", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:24:35", "owner": "party.mrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012730691792135, "text": "This is funny I could never get over it lol x", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:23:36", "owner": "beautylicioussham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910789069217416, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:23:12", "owner": "queenprice51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914994367194501, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:20:30", "owner": "pmlmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868370167454777, "text": "Classic reform voter", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:20:18", "owner": "bad.gandalf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989826822853409, "text": "His qualifications is I’m British, illiterate, Fat & fill my body with sugary soda drinks. He’s an idiot", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:20:07", "owner": "kingsody77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088765879853544, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:18:20", "owner": "steven.radin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911877835227095, "text": "They also took your senses.🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:14:59", "owner": "flowershannas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921494464165025, "text": "I am WHITE what else do u want.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:14:42", "owner": "rajashekarraghavan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065113898353878, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:13:40", "owner": "upupa_africana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875149243332715, "text": "Stop drinking🍺and go to gym and start educating yourself bro 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:13:07", "owner": "belkheir847", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140582566435899, "text": "That actually was a good response from his side", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:12:40", "owner": "ibad1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078711791088813, "text": "Comment Reserved", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:11:39", "owner": "sichulajohnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106616107581300, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:08:53", "owner": "kannappanagani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048767567648247, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:05:30", "owner": "kumanalaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340796440203367, "text": "He can hold a beer can.  Pathetic.  Please go away", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:04:50", "owner": "nick.abel9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965351601972269, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:03:57", "owner": "outdoors_with_rehna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917934145053752, "text": "\"They take our qualifications.\" *International students pay more than twice the fee they are supposed to pay. For bloody same positions!!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:00:15", "owner": "faeriethequeene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921184420038143, "text": "Stole his fitness as well. It's sad.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:58:52", "owner": "charles092018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037540664686987, "text": "^ most Brexit voters", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:58:21", "owner": "andreas_avgousti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308766286223097, "text": "Poor guy, they took his brain too", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:57:49", "owner": "iambarakat22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089188033892153, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:57:21", "owner": "nerdytrinitee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079165655013456, "text": "Andhbhakt in parallel world 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:56:13", "owner": "pro_theorist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068590324990724, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:53:34", "owner": "rebed407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879567784405608, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:47:49", "owner": "fitbyshelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181261822352266, "text": "At least give his clothes back .\nAt the end of the day, that’s his country 🇬🇧", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:46:44", "owner": "arif317865", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106243360590081, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:45:30", "owner": "sunny.mams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092739367753944, "text": "Put on a shirt, get to class, and then hit me with your best shots 🙌😂😂😂 leave the beer pong at home 🍺🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:45:13", "owner": "make_up_artist_avesta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901030468144505, "text": "☺️ best advertisment", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:45:05", "owner": "mr_kinkybunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059086469417763, "text": "And his living on benefits", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:43:37", "owner": "theresatheron3708", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057057449636127, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:43:03", "owner": "uc_success", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921429094177088, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:41:19", "owner": "toba_danny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924571456117874, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:37:18", "owner": "rosenewwoman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966415242971460, "text": "And you stole their biryani and jewels too 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:32:37", "owner": "claudia.mon.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099040723661328, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:30:41", "owner": "hh_hov21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089067514881971, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:30:30", "owner": "vita_elshekh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900885265279832, "text": "And his 'Common Sense' 😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:29:56", "owner": "carrikay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872350687348979, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:29:51", "owner": "christinaevers04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117475555518721, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:28:59", "owner": "millionaire_maxwell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096497008674467, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:28:25", "owner": "ilyas_fehe_gh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356930470084382, "text": "Really ?!!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:25:30", "owner": "shast1204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892616245203816, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:24:40", "owner": "dgooom8y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022975112756224, "text": "Same ones whose ancestors migrated to America. Lazy don’t want to work", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:23:41", "owner": "fbwpsu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867773878453496, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:23:20", "owner": "clez_chanel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861053416435916, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:21:49", "owner": "marceliuliannistor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063376475536382, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:21:44", "owner": "teesza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384721318133422, "text": "Give my man his qualification and t-shirt back u morons", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:21:41", "owner": "keenan.ly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021134390772644, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:20:46", "owner": "sahraouiamariame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427330765108094, "text": "He doesn’t need a job. He’s been living off the fat of the land all his life.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:20:39", "owner": "bobbimarx2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056146514554226, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:18:29", "owner": "denyse_bingham_williamson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066452471036728, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:14:03", "owner": "tarciamanuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846583129578276, "text": "Believe me, it's not about the jobs!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:13:58", "owner": "celia.grimaneza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932102769983146, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:12:52", "owner": "n0t_jerryyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072407900164045, "text": "😂🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:12:05", "owner": "zynabibro__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044038022653901, "text": "This Ai video guys you believe this😂 but in real life they are like that", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:11:24", "owner": "turgut.ertan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964602219988688, "text": "The US is deporting people en masse in the name of returning jobs to hard working Americans, but somehow unemployment is back up to pandemic levels, so where are all of the hard working Americans to fill these jobs that were supposedly stolen from them? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:11:01", "owner": "justinbwilliamsvo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985647276895196, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:09:40", "owner": "unseen_thrillers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186952537327867, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:09:07", "owner": "muskaan_0012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878568634427027, "text": "Hmm 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:08:13", "owner": "jossse_trejo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049703693331148, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:04:20", "owner": "seharkhan7777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087669478698672, "text": "His voice sounded like AI", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:03:17", "owner": "dr.mostafamaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204378910312860, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:01:57", "owner": "dave_challenger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081385753807140, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:01:35", "owner": "nnennaya2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898125874164770, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:01:17", "owner": "mairaj_faheem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093606103702320, "text": "Took his clothes but he can buy 🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:01:16", "owner": "sueduf24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091930558828079, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:00:30", "owner": "jacques.joseph.9889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035658578502102, "text": "Fckn cunts can’t afford neither do they have the intellect required for studying and getting those qualifications even when they have to pay 50% of what we pay as international students. FCKN CLOWNS", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:58:44", "owner": "neelsurjiani7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892471234200590, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:56:31", "owner": "iamlogicalthinker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057160514575960, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:56:22", "owner": "suitedservitude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057674348533141, "text": "Education isn’t for everyone as you can clearly see", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:55:40", "owner": "amiemaria35", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026567147534212, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:53:52", "owner": "ratul.hasan.397", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058409684399479, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:51:48", "owner": "pankan_d_panda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052356029292092, "text": "Funny bear 🐻", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:49:26", "owner": "aliahmad_rahmani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145911616422120, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:48:12", "owner": "edithabe2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146657707416211, "text": "He has big 