, "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:57:34", "owner": "anatolieviorel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077733566041677, "text": "Had to be a trump supporters brother 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:56:19", "owner": "joemercsdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060859691622142, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:53:39", "owner": "cookie__xx___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068144408257568, "text": "At least he's still had a beer. He should be happy foreigners are doing the job for them.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:52:13", "owner": "askidsmart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905075731123021, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:48:06", "owner": "kasim.aj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536089015026488, "text": "Some needs to steal his knife and fork😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:46:05", "owner": "tonychristian860", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985726341888842, "text": "The only thing stolen is the air he’s breathing", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:45:22", "owner": "tonychristian860", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070361639219027, "text": "The serious face it nxt level🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:41:21", "owner": "nomakajama", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867734218387074, "text": "😅👏😢", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:30:32", "owner": "paqriq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099880624568903, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:29:49", "owner": "rupalsoodan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948370165031532, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:28:45", "owner": "kadameneka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851483290558288, "text": "Damn right.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:28:05", "owner": "darrenpayne._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047869526339322, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:26:30", "owner": "tina_halder28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399543925137923, "text": "Took his jobs, his qualifications, his shirt, his muscles, his brains and left him with a beer can. These immigrants steal a lot.😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:25:09", "owner": "realotobi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055796390555737, "text": "That’s their country .. their rules .. Indians can’t even wipe their own backyard from dirt and they hate being Indian 😂😂 why don’t you go back where you come from and save your own country and learn some civil sense and manners .. Whereever you guys go , you ruin the society with your nonsense .. that’s not your problem if they are uneducated .. their country is way ahead that’s why you are desperate to get their county citizenship 🤡", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:21:13", "owner": "la_lunadel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527350351065269, "text": "This is an absurd parody of English folk.  However, to stereotype all English people like this is wrong.  There are genuine concerns about immigration.  If English people like this exist it's because of poverty.  You should not use this as humour you never know how you will be yourself.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:19:23", "owner": "bishoppriest77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920205289175936, "text": "😂😂😂🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:16:23", "owner": "roganovicmiodrag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904830652124100, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:16:13", "owner": "rai_mamata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093208204701258, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:14:11", "owner": "hamzadhouky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082553075064629, "text": "Indian lawyers , doctors where there prolly already !! And the prime minister is indian to.. yea they taking over allright 🤣😅🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:13:12", "owner": "sovranistanl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527688169041591, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:12:05", "owner": "goldencakesandevents", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086756179909424, "text": "Lol. They have taken the qualifications and gave U Beer 🍺to be managing 😂😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:07:51", "owner": "odogwubooboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090132340680848, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:07:23", "owner": "tighearnan_noonan_writer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022977170769457, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025