m other cultural backgrounds.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:21:53", "owner": "davidmarsden583", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908800828098394, "text": "They've taken his bra has well!😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:20:09", "owner": "helensanya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049483070657845, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:19:24", "owner": "monojit_chowdhury07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873685411427338, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:18:04", "owner": "latchanakevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979424322914888, "text": "I heard they came for his drink also 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:15:08", "owner": "dand_de", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042452555671346, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:09:27", "owner": "renukarachelvijay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076567412034289, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:09:07", "owner": "omidigold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18500800531070458, "text": "Brilliant 👍", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:08:40", "owner": "carolinehugo56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081824110781049, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:07:51", "owner": "krishna__heer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040265777465979, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:07:09", "owner": "carloti_dilopeze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994370061832375, "text": "Not possible...this must be Ai generated", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:06:59", "owner": "dumeraitnl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001031609815294, "text": "They took his bra as well🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:06:09", "owner": "rajat_ghanoot22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140251918434838, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:05:13", "owner": "oyekan134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18239770408293870, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:05:08", "owner": "rajeshthunoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883909114263735, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:02:45", "owner": "aimensaleemsani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080580640817168, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:02:38", "owner": "sonjalovesorig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854923669486320, "text": "Technically, he is right. They are going to their countries in the name of education and later stealing their jobs. I still support him.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:01:29", "owner": "micheal_thiraviaraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082306721493141, "text": "Priceless!!!🍺😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:01:20", "owner": "whispering_wools", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060119966623625, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:01:03", "owner": "aleksandraur_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526963807005084, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:00:52", "owner": "fanja.ratsivalaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046393550676896, "text": "They took his senses also", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:57:14", "owner": "butterfly_doll91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179030275346423, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:54:31", "owner": "dimchetanevski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043005674680761, "text": "But didn't take his nipples!😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:54:29", "owner": "sanandsaxena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925469677015997, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:54:22", "owner": "mtelevu_elias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108733951603507, "text": "But they couldn't take his moral yet 🍺😅🙌🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:53:50", "owner": "cadet_hafiz_027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981048696865888, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:53:22", "owner": "tna119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082867864782649, "text": "🍺🍺Damn at least he can have a Stella Artois though!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:53:10", "owner": "cr4ft24bility", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059583827618415, "text": "@shraddhakapoor 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:52:53", "owner": "bhaskarjha009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098443918647237, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:51:19", "owner": "kin_thetrainer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053145860279557, "text": "You are mocking him over his qualification, but his community created high salary jobs as well as quality instituions in his country....but y