achieve in your own country? :)", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:24:25", "owner": "j_ss_33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18314870287301170, "text": "Ha! Ha! Haa!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:21:08", "owner": "_petermartins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057412409406795, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:19:43", "owner": "marthxcp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190026583335114, "text": "He is right, even when he is 100% wrong 😑", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:19:00", "owner": "dunkelherz91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070171066994359, "text": "The left only his drink 🍹", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:18:42", "owner": "osha_whitelion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988674180890204, "text": "Thank goodness they left him some paint to cover the body 💅🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:18:36", "owner": "mir_nusrat_nisar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043115306413155, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:14:59", "owner": "conniekameraif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508851346070445, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣 and even our clothes too🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:13:28", "owner": "olufemiabisoye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987916086853037, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:12:56", "owner": "olufemiabisoye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922346182173112, "text": "Man fought so hard they couldn’t take his Can away 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:08:01", "owner": "bashpie_cubicle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118601755515235, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:05:47", "owner": "risje.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076913504113752, "text": "It's that kind of dumb the far right in every country in the world counts on to get elected😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:03:33", "owner": "kilani_abbas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071881964273051, "text": "Welcome to England 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:03:07", "owner": "oyeoyeoye502023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873070024428889, "text": "Maybe they taken off his clothes aswell", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:59:55", "owner": "azenith57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852234292511906, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:59:54", "owner": "splintertech77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978404970868865, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:54:37", "owner": "_the_wanderlustgirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025107983726252, "text": "Funny but looks like AI", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:54:21", "owner": "paul58743", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947097978914255, "text": "Indians fought for independence against the British for nine decades. Now the British are begging Indians for independence. Well done Indians.😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:51:30", "owner": "dcb_mendis123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146190997416760, "text": "Ignorant people 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:50:51", "owner": "afrimahmeti2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993684534693374, "text": "They didn't take you beer thankfully", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:50:05", "owner": "nenyemabelle", "likes": 42}, {"id": 17884749135383453, "text": "The qualifications are NOT free, mate‼️", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:48:09", "owner": "seunbharbs", "likes": 496}, {"id": 18310353262223627, "text": "Hurry up... There are only five qualifications left! 5...4..3..2..😂🤪", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:47:11", "owner": "ninapling", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082310311784014, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:47:10", "owner": "j_alex.louis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042891473676091, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:46:38", "owner": "jamesrodriguezzz007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534536575024043, "text": "Somebody Make one for americans too😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:42:13", "owner": "fiyahsydee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973462980945562, "text": "This is true.. Wife's a nurse, she wanted a job in the same hospital as her dad. Can't get the job due to migrants filling every job in said hospital. So ye you are taking the jobs", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:40:58", "owner": "____ka97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073449772929139, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:39:55", "owner": "chrissyuneze1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122154448494980, "text": "No use 😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:31:44", "owner": "jamilahnoor95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089251690681499, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:28:36", "owner": "casc__ada__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890230501355886, "text": "Wasn't that video AI? It's light on one side and dark on the other.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:23:06", "owner": "prossypriver", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983166468744952, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:21:42", "owner": "junhao_25valentine_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096871669679486, "text": "They took yr jocks as well 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:18:52", "owner": "cliffordmartin13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022412054765876, "text": "And the clothes too 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:16:56", "owner": "sanja_stankovicgc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540502189050548, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:15:10", "owner": "lo_dette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064033019589400, "text": "Sadly, they didn't take your stupidity.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:13:21", "owner": "liladepm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078707270045665, "text": "Ooops Soory Bawa 🥹🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:10:44", "owner": "ayanusmani195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141050857428405, "text": "🤣🤣 beer qualifications that's enough 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:10:32", "owner": "taiwocarolinehair247edinburgh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989585922846693, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:08:58", "owner": "sincerelykristie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968501427809302, "text": "Yhey need to remove ur azzes from Europe definitely", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:05:35", "owner": "xo.haddasah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898140478297948, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:05:19", "owner": "sandesh_shravan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295793896267238, "text": "Pretty..❣️", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:05:08", "owner": "aroojazim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935780068089773, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:02:21", "owner": "alinadumirai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983446896909756, "text": "It all sounds funny.... but... when you find out that most government or institutional bodies openly specify that preference will be given to ethnic communities, gay, etc.. ie if you're white male... don't apply.. then this isn't so funny", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:01:48", "owner": "stevewhigham", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17921019414173958, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:01:19", "owner": "premierhospitalitygroup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046018964347782, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:00:18", "owner": "babyfactoryng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896547385313309, "text": "Who knew England had trumpers", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:51:29", "owner": "calibimmer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097264405679866, "text": "British Andhbhakt 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:50:24", "owner": "bablu.bihari06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951666844010092, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:50:15", "owner": "mujh1446", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102311821623203, "text": "Whoaaaaa 🤣🤣🤣🤣 actually rubber johnnies could avoided so much….", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:49:57", "owner": "the_bulletguy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942739107934676, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:47:20", "owner": "brunnyharrington", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974906514931478, "text": "They have taken all his 🧠🧠🧠🧠🧠", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:46:33", "owner": "madambocc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116591152518771, "text": "@ingeengelbrecht 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:44:51", "owner": "riaanvanrooi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155003743400772, "text": "Rather than throwing a tantrum on ‘stealing jobs’, why dont you get qualifications and skills to get those jobs.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:41:36", "owner": "squeeps_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019250525591649, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:39:21", "owner": "smo061", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092464345697242, "text": "AI", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:37:40", "owner": "rebelvyas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967631403805352, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:35:25", "owner": "aka_____god", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059637698387688, "text": "Oh and they’re taking all his clothes as well 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:34:22", "owner": "chichi_ona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345607945162640, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:33:05", "owner": "wholisticlivingwithanu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18506847271064615, "text": "This probably AI, but some of those real people actually exist 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:26:49", "owner": "strah_ma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086126602934282, "text": "They’re taking our Jobs our education land, identity  but leaving us only free rations, free rent, free schools & unemployment benefits. We need dependency not dignity.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:25:52", "owner": "yazzer_aaga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084651140307042, "text": "They are world power & ruling the world", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:23:52", "owner": "chahal3218", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18533659669056969, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:16:22", "owner": "nourie_abedeen1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052778762283286, "text": "Bet he can’t even spell “QUALIFICATION” 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:16:14", "owner": "_t.a.j.i.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295692178249622, "text": "They took his brain 🧠 as well. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:16:07", "owner": "cubbert2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154089058392804, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:15:50", "owner": "tengku_nazaruddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900809155273912, "text": "He left his brain in his mums tummy", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:15:27", "owner": "um_ayman_deema", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368486515152749, "text": "😂🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:11:30", "owner": "__ink__nirvan__tattoo__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076751528102507, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:09:24", "owner": "hmza.2828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021244511771150, "text": "Its okay to support your country still", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:09:08", "owner": "yarenardccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061698770455877, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:05:43", "owner": "eyitemi_nurain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861932299484782, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:03:39", "owner": "ya_farida6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062365580379415, "text": "He should come to the US now. He’ll be a CEO in a week.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:59:48", "owner": "osawatomiebrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153965158399882, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:59:12", "owner": "king_zolly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002179016661499, "text": "😂😂😂😂😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:58:51", "owner": "setranajoyce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108932572565932, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:58:21", "owner": "karrz_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108660061506286, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:57:34", "owner": "sahiljangra6868", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895983133317487, "text": "He is American Bhakt 🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:56:15", "owner": "niraj_dhn73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895181530185899, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:53:05", "owner": "jo_b4u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988815675713012, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:52:51", "owner": "eim_yzalia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883974652259738, "text": "the schools are free for british people, you can study and get a degree or go to college. when the job is available you go to claim as the job is doesn’t fit your hours of sleep", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:52:03", "owner": "erion.prifti1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339130600201637, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:49:35", "owner": "khushdeep_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892153477343222, "text": "Bro lost his clothes to them as well🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:49:14", "owner": "hamzaibrahimmohamedd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917311957057775, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:48:57", "owner": "akshaymodi888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509702341064179, "text": "🍺we will take beer also sallla 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:48:38", "owner": "porchezian_ramachandran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068855012251428, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:48:32", "owner": "achumilongkumer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058891835437769, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:47:19", "owner": "ghj_badazz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136489162393752, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:45:48", "owner": "doctorfazna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432367354099847, "text": "Farage and Robinson stir up hatred and prey on  people's fears simply to gain votes and power. Farage is a man who's friends with Trump. He is funded and controlled by big business - power companies and private healthcare. He wants to sell off the NHS and cut all your  services.  He pretends to have an answer to immigration. He doesn't... because, as the Tories proved, there is NO easy answer. Millionaire toff doing the bidding of billionaire backers... who would benefit from the sell-offs. Don't be fooled by the conman that sold you Brexit and cost us BILLIONS. Don't be conned. LIKE TRUMP, FARAGE AND ROBINSON ARE SELF-INTERESTED CONMEN.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:44:30", "owner": "edalcrowe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088679587917869, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:43:42", "owner": "lltk.tunacelik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119093983508101, "text": "They left the 🍺with him only", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:40:17", "owner": "omair.g_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904407733255639, "text": "They left the 🍺with him only", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:40:15", "owner": "omair.g_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906852427251168, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:40:05", "owner": "seenivasan569", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988602621852471, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:39:42", "owner": "seenivasan569", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927134443111068, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:36:50", "ow