likes": 0}, {"id": 18078701528318640, "text": "Valiendo nada, como se ridiculizan....se reusan a aceptar la ineptitud....😂😂😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T20:00:10", "owner": "josebanda33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103241278538283, "text": "Big idiots 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T20:00:07", "owner": "savmom_team758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959876649990000, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:59:47", "owner": "baran_ahmadi.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048899801329815, "text": "He's so poor he has to paint on his clothes 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:59:29", "owner": "luarena_luli_hanley_makeup_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944762980048721, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:59:17", "owner": "sri_crazy007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091256926828339, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:58:44", "owner": "selfie.madness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015812492606534, "text": "I come from an underprivileged country/third wall where the government offers us nothing. Meanwhile, here in the UK there’s free education, free healthcare, support in every direction. And yet, the people I know—most of them foreigners—worked hard, studied here, paid their own way. The irony? Many British people take it all for granted, complain that “immigrants are taking their jobs,” when half of them wouldn’t even qualify for those jobs in the first place. 🤣😅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:58:16", "owner": "iamrubia38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359258989093703, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:57:23", "owner": "chrisvincent1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895666618319120, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:56:50", "owner": "omalichacustomcakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883916809265160, "text": "So Britain wasn’t an extremely educated country before an influx of terrible International people?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:56:16", "owner": "swerve_brillo_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104973271591931, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:54:11", "owner": "skvorovski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058964186565803, "text": "Yea its a silly thing to say... the prob eith Indian immigrants is half have dodgey/ scsmmywork visas", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:53:43", "owner": "ro.sinanz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158030944390492, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:53:05", "owner": "slkonfire_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074328143167041, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:52:23", "owner": "mimita_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914051113070969, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:52:16", "owner": "janbrenhaspereira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884133838383234, "text": "He is qualified for a beer drinking contest.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:52:13", "owner": "aymanelbast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076438612869309, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:49:57", "owner": "ladie_mc_1967", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073124584921815, "text": "Big dummy 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:49:55", "owner": "bamaworld3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042478094691830, "text": "😅😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:49:44", "owner": "pallavivaidya_limbachia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846698197576994, "text": "😅😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:49:01", "owner": "tabet_shadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963747744830892, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:48:49", "owner": "honeyjossy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090051607662382, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:47:49", "owner": "r.d_yomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914460091072411, "text": "@think.about.th1s", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:47:30", "owner": "mrsmatarr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136116664399489, "text": "We are taking the clothes too 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:47:19", "owner": "mafinie_heaven_kitchen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080951086956865, "text": "He has a qualification \nIts called drinking and watching football😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:46:50", "owner": "rafiaq45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889684246225469, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:45:12", "owner": "priscil