s ...they came Canada by fake documents", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:16:56", "owner": "earthly_urbans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121347433451819, "text": "She got the another person job in her position", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:16:01", "owner": "earthly_urbans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108471487512310, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:15:27", "owner": "xynthia_chelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998593101822528, "text": "Return this man’s job and qualifications ASAP 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:15:26", "owner": "niczkitchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069307877002519, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:14:21", "owner": "kawishalam670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088514857853227, "text": "Please they feel the schools and colleges to the max so the support staff are over stretched and therefore education systems are broken", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:09:45", "owner": "nishabeauty1969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072918211944845, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:08:32", "owner": "joyflowfull", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899403961279141, "text": "Deport him in his own country 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:06:53", "owner": "nishanmehraan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422782114107888, "text": "You got qualifications sitting on a barstool in a pub", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:06:34", "owner": "tomfranklin165", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052375046295440, "text": "So true..... Back to ampomaa", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:06:16", "owner": "paavovuoti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876853738417498, "text": "Well….. who’s gonna tell him?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:06:11", "owner": "me.he_me_he", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080549267295935, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:05:54", "owner": "tabrina30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847682416548530, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:03:42", "owner": "natashabehroozan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121556596500556, "text": "I am glad no one took his brain\n He can keep it😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:02:5