ombshell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985934532889601, "text": "All he has is the drinking beer qualification 😂😂🍺🍺🍺👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:49:36", "owner": "sir_jtothek_places", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862606255480321, "text": "Yes you are.  Explain to me how any of this doesn’t work exactly the same as the H1-B visa scam?  Why don’t you go back to India and be awesome there?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:48:38", "owner": "rickexaus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978987480766506, "text": "Does he have any teeth ??", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:48:26", "owner": "step_haniewal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310139701221687, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:47:16", "owner": "sir_jtothek_places", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059357318173547, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:46:41", "owner": "lianca562", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863475808416873, "text": "Take them all 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:46:40", "owner": "emperol_lolly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100482427653853, "text": "Well they haven’t taken his ti!s", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:46:19", "owner": "bysueplace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895301575315677, "text": "England me bhi Arakshan😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:45:27", "owner": "sanjay_patel22121986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029960201718420, "text": "What an idiot.😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:45:09", "owner": "38eddie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427797154106412, "text": "MBGA", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:44:35", "owner": "q.a.m.a.u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089047135871279, "text": "Americans can’t even afford to go to college … forget about stealing their jobs! 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:44:32", "owner": "heer_minnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945133071917730, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:44:17", "owner": "achelekatt1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113407582541437, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:43:30", "owner": "marielatescobar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203225116311835, "text": "The flag is looking directly into the camera", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:41:55", "owner": "mdebleen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18565210858032727, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:41:35", "owner": "divya_rawa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102769318558155, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:41:18", "owner": "jugnuz3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054215723257528, "text": "I saw red boobs for the first time😂😂😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:41:00", "owner": "dark.man757", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093715162686398, "text": "Did they also take his common sense?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:40:53", "owner": "queen_nandi_boutique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078242885512568, "text": "St George's dumbf*ks.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:40:35", "owner": "vivienneballico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145887796419341, "text": "😂🤣😅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:40:12", "owner": "muhammadarsyad1191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070822642973583, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:39:53", "owner": "isajurojas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896389285313854, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:35:56", "owner": "7k.ambika", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949286904901572, "text": "Being in the pub everyday is a job for him. They took everything off him even the clothes on his back and him no have no rass sense. Dumb ass  with the big union jack flag. Your job is to try and lose that damn big ass beer belly you have😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:34:26", "owner": "nicky_love78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286440022275371, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:34:23", "owner": "senpriya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151264048405388, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:33:47", "owner": "ukpebor_efe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138809692433469, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:32:48", "owner": "aniolde63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842798437591675, "text": "They don’t know how to speak, their own language,how will they take our jobs…", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:30:29", "owner": "antomar_berlin", "likes": 0}, 