while you were depending on government free benefits, moron😮😢", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:21:07", "owner": "inyangsonic198", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051814163308148, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:17:56", "owner": "adamu_baade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138011845450213, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:17:30", "owner": "mike.sport.freak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059859749384001, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:16:43", "owner": "srishteechaudhary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073298336133333, "text": "WELPPP.. HE CAN PAINT.. ON HIS BODY!!!! S$H#I!TT!!", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:16:38", "owner": "kamalaulvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900388165292280, "text": "Bloody immigrants coming over here and taking all our qualifications 😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:16:28", "owner": "clam1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864252580471068, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:13:05", "owner": "veroalva88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900886303280025, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:12:36", "owner": "diane_santangelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105258166587132, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:11:57", "owner": "ksing_h1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001954646660867, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:11:13", "owner": "smokyred72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897464896297631, "text": "🙈🙈🙈🙈🙈🙈", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:09:29", "owner": "norbertziegert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901000375148067, "text": "@tomcott5", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:09:02", "owner": "eilishcottart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078017011864892, "text": "The comments are Brilliant😅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:08:02", "owner": "rosecoubry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075078251116463, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:07:49", "owner": "kesim_srj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080019979815521, "text": "🤣🤣😅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:07:25", "owner": "tgi200420012019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921376009035310, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:07:22", "owner"