hey take the qualifications as well??Absurd😂😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:12:29", "owner": "mumjunes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070181213190056, "text": "Love the guys laughing!!", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:11:22", "owner": "sallyst60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297381019248597, "text": "We are resilient and we know what we want that’s why we successful every where we go.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:08:42", "owner": "samtaha5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144276976421196, "text": "Ai", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:08:30", "owner": "itz_kuldip09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037380128701808, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:08:16", "owner": "mariem_che", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082665562788731, "text": "This is not looking at things in the same level.\nThey are taking an uneducated unemployed on the dole Englishmen and then showing another non English person excelling?\nIt should be apples and apples.\nOr oranges and oranges.\nNot apples and oranges.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:07:40", "owner": "gun_musa_ali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043871399668720, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:07:21", "owner": "ayshtam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079392667833013, "text": "That’s how they blame us 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:06:03", "owner": "jannah_omar_zainal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069452264248151, "text": "😀😀😀😀", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:05:40", "owner": "shineandslaytogether", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942356260062796, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:05:17", "owner": "iamthatbj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099452053576918, "text": "Qualifications = 🍺 all day", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:04:57", "owner": "oussama.dz_vlogs", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18297150652264758, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:03:02", "owner": "tceee21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994676085836559, "text": "They took your dick as well", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:02:12", "owner": "dken273", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937816636095418, "text": "You don't need qualification", "crea