es": 0}, {"id": 18003272897656655, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:29:45", "owner": "riyadh.abdullah1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059530328628073, "text": "People need to understand the Brits could see the changes but when they spoke out they were criticised. They are not the brightest I admit. They don’t know the difference between the Asians, but they were learning. They called them racist and shut them up. Called them racist to bring in Islam illegals. Called them racist to put up palestine flag up. Called them racist while their kids were getting 🍇 by these Islam illegals. Called them racist till the synagogue issue in Manchester. The whole world is waking up and the come back is going to be crazy. You mocked the Brits and kept them low. We can see Europe crash in front of a very eyes. Enough is enough. Every thought the same with trump, trumps supporters weren’t smart but look at America now is getting better is healing. We hope the same for Europe and rest of uk. Vote reform and let’s clean this mess. Get Islam back to their Muslim countries. Send them back to their caves. 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:29:10", "owner": "tharan_0597", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530831647065434, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:28:44", "owner": "prince_attahboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064429208342177, "text": "What shoes is she wearing??? I love them!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:26:00", "owner": "samrahkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146249884414861, "text": "And shirts too 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:25:58", "owner": "ahmadwarraich1210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925819972137347, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:25:30", "owner": "samrahkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076512506109343, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:20:38", "owner": "peteraoun3333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135899863454265, "text": "Someone took his bra too", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:20:28", "owner": "sporexplorer97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 179950687768318