0}, {"id": 18004030160652498, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:38:41", "owner": "alphatocharlie7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302414341270451, "text": "@joerogan @marclamonthill @theovon @realcandaceowens @timjdillon @thejimmydoreshow @jimmydoretruth @theproblemdavesmith @wilfredburr @ninaturnerohio @joyannreid @angelayee @danbilzerian @jonstewart_official @theproblem", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:38:15", "owner": "yaseenameer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185878477336411, "text": "It's not nice making fun of this guy. He is expressing his frustration. He knows his reality.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:37:57", "owner": "rav.ising11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073453127127751, "text": "Just lazy and privileged Americans", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:37:33", "owner": "orlycardenez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093772567627514, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:37:21", "owner": "denis_boran_koci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895481185180362, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:36:46", "owner": "mat_janin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076946312279722, "text": "🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺😂at lease he still has his beer 🍺cheers 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:34:52", "owner": "sharonstclare", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063400781589727, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:34:47", "owner": "abbycampbelluva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923759113151078, "text": "@alenya80", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:33:45", "owner": "dengtoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059379092411620, "text": "😅😂😅😂🤣😅😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:32:09", "owner": "karema_williams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060924656437500, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:31:51", "owner": "jasbagha_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088954867881634, "text": "So dumbness is worldwide? Right? Not just the states", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:27:53", "owner": "themilitantjobjunkie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877763956309329, "text": "It’s the ‘can of beer’ for me Mr Stella😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:27:37", "owner": "obfolancy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080535517967424, "text": "at least they didn't take his beer...🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:26:40", "owner": "genti_shegani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844411867574184, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:25:34", "owner": "genti_shegani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910429309231456, "text": "I'll take your beer...and give you a shirt", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:24:53", "owner": "fourpackgarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067085543040920, "text": "At least leave him something", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:19:38", "owner": "belprestans_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985273353860241, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:18:50", "owner": "princethejerk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108499636572203, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:18:22", "owner": "imranshehla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984445554886087, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:18:01", "owner": "zacango", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077599453849975, "text": "You don't have qualifications and you complain about your job being taken?? Can you do the job?? Do you have the skills?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:17:25", "owner": "eruku_isaac_bethel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905069866124207, "text": "😅😅🤣🤣🤣🤣 we know who you are ,European white racist corruption poorly educated ,go learn to love", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:17:08", "owner": "lake6882", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950085985033424, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:15:31", "owner": "neenu_caprising", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078125734857654, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:14:56", "owner": "kiss_yomzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973447479935691, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂dumb as ours! 😂😂😂😂😃🤷🏻‍♀️😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:13:57", "owner": "staceyandrade72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853948933542941, "text": "Shouldn’t he have a bra on???", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:10:39", "owner": "vincent.decapite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060557024381280, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:09:56", "owner": "jocelyneharrisson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033653864705743, "text": "Looool.. the funniest part is when I hear immigrants put pressure on the NHS..\nWho is the NHS? The last I checked, you're seen by African GPs, Asian/African consultants, dentists, surgeons etc..\nNot one time have I accidentally bumped into... you know who!\nGet educated & quit drinking beer 🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:07:04", "owner": "lade_alexx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058606412168999, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:06:14", "owner": "jusie13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128181010474372, "text": "I hope this is a joke 4 real.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:05:59", "owner": "haroldcarter188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106784311576627, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 no comment necessarry", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:02:18", "owner": "riohelmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076908025876275, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:00:50", "owner": "mark_melb_2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972194727948691, "text": "Poor guy..all taken away but his fat belly ..kwasia!!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:59:32", "owner": "sahm_nt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034053428509917, "text": "Orueee…including your clothes aswell 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:58:13", "owner": "official_oseremen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074617907145163, "text": "Still holding stubby soon that will be taking as well", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:57:36", "owner": "flamemaster_kebabmachines", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863450977415555, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:57:06", "owner": "thisis_blade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529039864018204, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂 And his sense as well 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:55:27", "owner": "folake2040", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976456698771021, "text": "I thought that only happened with MAGAS…😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:53:30", "owner": "mesacval", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379513876183406, "text": "Well at least they didn't take his b00bs 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:50:53", "owner": "yennifer_952