easant_properties", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916822018193028, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:33:44", "owner": "david.fanfan21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067973084464322, "text": "Absolutely correct. All admission are taken by them then how will he get a degree?😂😮", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:33:32", "owner": "country_first_kkdi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116945953524309, "text": "They took his bra too 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:33:16", "owner": "quraysh_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068154194214538, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:33:11", "owner": "asefmohammad1968", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082936450764437, "text": "😂😂 ha ha ha I have no qualifications, they’re taking everything including the qualifications 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:33:08", "owner": "andechito483", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858314122458862, "text": "This is unbelievable 😳 👏 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:32:36", "owner": "lolly_2676", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892399423200551, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:32:35", "owner": "oluwatoyin936", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285397300286966, "text": "Don't worry you have the pub😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:31:45", "owner": "polo.kaur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975541902778888, "text": "White lie 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:30:54", "owner": "call_mzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080631986484718, "text": "Please have that man put a shirt on, his man boobs are an embarrassment", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:29:54", "owner": "franfox1951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046365467659623, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:29:36", "owner": "helen.abu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144441634425092, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:28:42", "owner": "kurdishlady01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062577233108404, "text": "The only thing they didn’t take was the Flag and Soda. He’s right", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:28:38", "owner": "ralphosky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366946495154532, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:28:28", "owner": "azgar718", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904768048123626, "text": "Imagine using AI on a video, then slinging it around like it’s the real deal. It’s funny, no doubt. Wild though.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:28:25", "owner": "dannydoesthemthings", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18058176182165152, "text": "😂😂😂😂👏👏👏🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:26:34", "owner": "alyahxa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035450429695973, "text": "He looks like he passed his art o level though!\nThey walk among us", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:25:15", "owner": "davegoldring_149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364101874154551, "text": "His big Bain in the beer tin 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:25:09", "owner": "mehmetkoksal486", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945040380925150, "text": "I guess all them chemicals from that paint are eating up his brain", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:24:13", "owner": "waltersandoval3440", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904157176127916, "text": "I’m sure this man was offer a beer to protest 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:15:14", "owner": "_lekzyofficial", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17906412405254884, "text": "This is MAGA all the way", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:14:04", "owner": "beardgame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856927291532625, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:12:30", "owner": "caveman_110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099262141712586, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:11:37", "owner": "v.bouldouyre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855449971539706, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:08:20", "owner": "zabelllucas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148937947416727, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:08:02", "owner": "mst.lynda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080845409303977, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:06:08", "owner": "shinyapple_401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095580133669282, "text": "It's mind-boggling how in every country I ever lived in, there are people bashing immigrants for \"stealing their jobs\", yet not a single person from that country wants to do those jobs, and if they do it, they're miserable the whole time, complaining about low wages and nasty to customers. For example in The Czech Republic we couldn't function without Vietnamese and their small shops that remain open during holidays, weekends, late nights, basically any time. They save our butts constantly and do it with a smile and politeness, unlike many “original Czech” clerks in Tesco or whatnot. They do not “take our jobs”, they created their own and we need them. Btw, I live in UK now and work as a live-in housekeeper. In 13 years here I haven't met a single UK person capable/willing to do what I do here. I cleaned in hotels, too, and guess what. Out of 30 hard working foreigners in the fanciest one there was ONE English girl and she didn't work nearly as hard as everyone else. It's not that English people weren't welcome there. They just don't want to do this job and everyone with a brain knows that. Oh and l'd LOVE to see this dude do the Life in UK test, oh that would be fun to watch. 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:01:22", "owner": "emthephoenix", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18343447249167445, "text": "It’s tragic that they don’t even get the irony. God save us!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:59:25", "owner": "deferwyatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922384147159298, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:58:02", "owner": "mo.chamma.125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111747763483001, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:57:48", "owner": "spottedbigfootuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078042707009711, "text": "This is unbelievable 🤣 he's very upset about it. 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 better they take him too.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:55:27", "owner": "annneenenne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904157191125541, "text": "Classic xenophobia it is", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:55:06", "owner": "actuallyitsshruv_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079474924997955, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:55:01", "owner": "rowenachien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903540412257146, "text": 