e in the gym.\n🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:33:48", "owner": "olaoluwa_jd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141109732429532, "text": "Took his bra too", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:33:44", "owner": "blake_exists", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079997182815496, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:32:38", "owner": "patrice_esella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360559060085861, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:32:18", "owner": "haboo555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081343774785251, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:32:14", "owner": "shashankjagtap3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128862160483167, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:29:27", "owner": "ndi_simpa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053726207258656, "text": "They taking it out of context. Remember years ago even too this day. Tradesman’s get laid off. Because a European guy will work for half the wage. Or a company wont get the work because the customer got a quote half price from some Europeans working cash in hand", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:28:52", "owner": "brownejames123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974871723933962, "text": "This is are country 🇬🇧💯✔️👍", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:28:48", "owner": "ruhel246", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324226942242253, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:27:51", "owner": "drpatz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862317964481018, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂💯💯💯🇬🇧🇬🇧🇬🇧🤙", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:27:14", "owner": "ruhel246", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110671090560293, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:26:21", "owner": "kala_deelight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058418516424119, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:26:00", "owner": "mirelamuharemovic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959916714995818, "text": "And she’s gorgeous too! 🤗👌", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:24:08", "owner": "stevehudspith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054934139629656, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️even the 🍻 Beers 🍺 🍺🍺🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:23:10", "owner": "nina.196022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084634858906516, "text": "The DALIT of BRITAIN 🇬🇧.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:21:42", "owner": "leilasapartment", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900846799146655, "text": "Also the brain 🧠", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:20:37", "owner": "selenelunagzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063724355099614, "text": "Well at least he has the Union Flag painted correctly on his chest. As for everything else well, what can I say🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:20:05", "owner": "phil.shirley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976264860926401, "text": "Being white 🤡🤡🤡🤡🤡", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:19:27", "owner": "fits.82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027998411723133, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:19:00", "owner": "luisanaleon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075234125152050, "text": "😢😢😂😮", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:17:38", "owner": "roopa_praveen06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323507998240859, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:17:24", "owner": "pedibeauty4you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057593054624708, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:17:24", "owner": "meyram77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092626600761157, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:17:02", "owner": "asddf.lkjhhg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852073966511345, "text": "Omg, these qualifications don't come cheap, as a parent whose son is about to start Uni", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:16:19", "owner": "shai.sta2240", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535972453034856, "text": "Var", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:15:52", "owner": "emiliovandermeyde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965019264965643, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:15:43", "owner": "mars_mercy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526774585013868, "text": "They haven't taken his beer", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:14:53", "owner": "witheringtonbarry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883598077260851, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:14:45", "owner": "salma_arian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075908795012696, "text": "Bro drink less Bier 🍺N read more books", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:14:23", "owner": 