asar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898022122298865, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:55:15", "owner": "__medin__ramani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056798213535785, "text": "Exactly😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:52:54", "owner": "godrulesentirely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18227010439305739, "text": "There brainless white people everywhere!  I thought we had them all in the US", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:51:39", "owner": "fribooger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073246642932149, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:49:19", "owner": "rehanag2201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179660326344527, "text": "Meanwhile they have 10 felonies 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:48:16", "owner": "safiatuseidu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18268999039303061, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:48:10", "owner": "e.perry.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886864906241162, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:47:59", "owner": "pranatimahapatra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18239970103288675, "text": "They left him with only shorts 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:45:46", "owner": "rajuach5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898115899293341, "text": "They took their fabric for British flag 🇬🇧 as well, so he need to painting the flag into his muffin top belly.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:41:00", "owner": "backyardscourt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328454890236944, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:40:50", "owner": "w.a.j.a.h.a.t_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295589479270503, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:39:28", "owner": "monne_heg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059515559408123, "text": "Surely no one is stupid enough to not know that this is AI", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:34:50", "owner": "dickerchris0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043771874397994, "text": "I can give him my certificate of participation 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:33:44", "owner": "sana.futi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894937777337111, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:30:45", "owner": "isameerirshad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965112774968522, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:29:39", "owner": "_s.ch9e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921632344031711, "text": "They stole from every continent and still in poverty", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:28:13", "owner": "rarara3532", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057669002535335, "text": "If we rounded up these low life’s and deported them we would be great . Reformers all as dumb as Farage knew they would be .", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:26:33", "owner": "wayne_spain_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873217918431019, "text": "But you r in his country not yours,stay in your own country", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:25:19", "owner": "sharib.alam.581", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074723912279144, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:24:33", "owner": "dumisanijones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888351751360626, "text": "Same human tendency to feel insecure here as well! Whether it is an Indian state domicile feeling about migrants who come to state to work may be a forced job transfer or a new opportunity altogether! Illtreatment or spreading fear is tactic used to remove all competition by all means but no efforts invested to earn it by education and genuine efforts or slogging once #%$!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:23:16", "owner": "nimeshbhodia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087398290724023, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:22:29", "owner": "drsairakapoor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073704209154256, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:22:26", "owner": "pabloalbertosaquicbono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916842772191724, "text": "Looks like he took all the kebabs, chow Mein, Currys and Burritos from them.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:21:04", "owner": "dermotbreen75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358889266083212, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:21:01", "owner": "aisling.ohanlon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052183853281076, "text": "Are sure you are drinking a beer. 🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:20:31", "owner": "claudesainturbain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1796021