0}, {"id": 17882348160391359, "text": "Imagine if a white person posted this mocking a Muslim person with a video created by AI? Would it not be seen as racism? Nobody would be stood outside a pub with a can of Stella and a British flag on their chest. This kind of post stirs up hate and division. Please be careful what you post and what you read. I hope this wasn't intentionally posted to be against white people but you should be embarrassed for misleading people with your post.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:34:13", "owner": "thomaswardleeds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108337096510844, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:34:01", "owner": "marquis613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061896377614288, "text": "😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:33:11", "owner": "lupy_mgy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059118245528246, "text": "And \"they\"  probably took all the brains aswell", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:33:03", "owner": "riadehenau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917816002177352, "text": "Lolz", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:32:02", "owner": "adahunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18479485525076111, "text": "But we couldn’t steal their laziness because we need to work and pay tax to survive", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:29:34", "owner": "wongicy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081608686987044, "text": "We pay a LOT OF MONEY and invest a lot of time to legitimately get the qualifications we don’t ’take it’.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:27:44", "owner": "shivangi_a_gandhi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18077051630019354, "text": "The last time it was checked, he could only memorize the multiplication up to the 5 times table 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:27:40", "owner": "ahmad_zaki_syafrizal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976988607924877, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:27:34", "owner": "cdarchieux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060936989124007, "text": "Your country colonized , robbed and slaved their countries for centuries , now lets see how it feels you mr qualuficatiins.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:2