kes": 0}, {"id": 18086973376723130, "text": "Took his bra too. He can always get a job supplying milk to newborn calfs with those udders", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:32:42", "owner": "zainab_gafur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892236829202261, "text": "😮😂😂😂😂😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:31:54", "owner": "cuba_mariana_maceo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079280974977948, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:31:02", "owner": "naeto_nwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345071065163556, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:30:42", "owner": "sandy.n.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975063288778886, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:30:07", "owner": "cuba_mariana_maceo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069128546224024, "text": "I don't think he knows what the word \"qualification\" means..", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:29:27", "owner": "deepuramachandradas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094278358780281, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:29:14", "owner": "lola_sh1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078657431099483, "text": "The two braincells in his skull are fighting for the 3rd place. His look when asked for qualifications 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:28:38", "owner": "hd_schfrs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109929244561182, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:25:43", "owner": "emad.zadeh.uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953411341015984, "text": "My God…", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:25:15", "owner": "shailendra.sapphire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030000485719429, "text": "I like the Union Jack on his chest.  Something else is going on but it can’t be blamed on immigrants.  It is hilarious 😆 though", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:22:00", "owner": "monie5090", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850398754527481, "text": "Never responsible never accountable", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:19:52", "owner": "jaysanstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082909162763486, "text": "It used to be Irish,  Scottish,  Welsh who were the problem in the 70s 80s now there is a new scapegoat 😂", "created_at": "202