😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:01:54", "owner": "b_l_a_c_k_2206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145907203424723, "text": "Well then go back home 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:00:37", "owner": "manipulator_of_manipulators", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064095713071717, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:59:15", "owner": "bijan.sobbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156878812379451, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:59:11", "owner": "rozzialdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323248588239699, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:56:59", "owner": "khan.aazim1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084616075916696, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:56:33", "owner": "mr_mista_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090422509789020, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:56:09", "owner": "this_is_moh_265", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281193133262894, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:53:09", "owner": "cmysusanty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931791603979668, "text": "What he all gets is the white skin and a beer", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:52:42", "owner": "whalesleep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056286137228547, "text": "India an we need u back in india come back india", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:50:43", "owner": "asit_85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042732230679854, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:50:32", "owner": "sudhir_taurean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079318868068968, "text": "Typical B", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:44:21", "owner": "anah.lissa55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531144628037346, "text": "NO PROPER EDUCATION EXCEPT BORN IN THAT COUNTRY.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:42:37", "owner": "vincentelangovan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308227087216998, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:42:03", "owner": "yungturuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038296355679068, "text": "🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:41:41", "owner": "markusbenk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095329168705275, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:40:48", "owner": "ashudoc1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538675804030751, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:39:49", "owner": "spookyp1e_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087320941700741, "text": "Qualifications Are Earned And Not Stolen!!!BODO!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:39:22", "owner": "peri_winkle77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325247569237810, "text": "We're doing a favour to your country without Indians you'd be down the drain 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:39:06", "owner": "_itsmike___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866547022462285, "text": "Bro seems they took all ur cloths as well😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:38:08", "owner": "im_niteshydv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849407815535444, "text": "They also took his common sense 🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:37:35", "owner": "sheilgumhotmail.co.uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069358157220538, "text": "The only thing they left was his beer", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:37:25", "owner": "jamalyusufi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412522969118726, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:37:03", "owner": "jamalyusufi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871316737437125, "text": "Silly Man These wonderful Graduates are contributing to the Country financially and intellectually Now get some clothes on Read a book 📕 and stop  drinking all that beer 🍺 It’s robbing the rest of your brain cells Sad", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:36:28", "owner": "elizabethconroy6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090541273872303, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:31:28", "owner": "lyfewithphini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999719349670068, "text": "Atleast they left his beer", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:30:11", "owner": "j_itsyourtime", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865452040395472, "text": "Literally snuck in and stole all the qualifications that he never had. What an imbecile", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:27:27", "owner": "teepeee1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047171402653163, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:25:17", "owner": "efuasezy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043722239673214, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:24:45"