ight .... be glad that they left your ignorance ...... 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:00:27", "owner": "katie_kudrete", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066743285594791, "text": "WHITE SUPREMACY", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:59:43", "owner": "aaron_paul34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025318838549984, "text": "British man at his finest….. all he’s good for is walking round with his beer gut hanging out drinking more beer and stopping for a kebab on the way home, looking for his intelligence …. Hilarious 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:59:02", "owner": "nicola.leigh.752", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17957530778862461, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:54:22", "owner": "kirnabrahmbhatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885538102371730, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:53:01", "owner": "iqwright53live.com9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042248729410362, "text": "That guy is a cow😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:52:37", "owner": "michael.ndungu.39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106964776510396, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:50:06", "owner": "flashindepan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285394087302790, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:49:08", "owner": "pudding4x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050802125306768, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:46:43", "owner": "amada.mac.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053420075253899, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:45:08", "owner": "mubeen.tahir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055177487214190, "text": "He drinks beer. A lot of it. Skillz!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:39:44", "owner": "johnwong4850", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869310346372969, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:34:39", "owner": "asidhearthsingh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914185876069620, "text": "Looks like somebody took your meds get back on your meds", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:34:26", "owner": "4768pennylans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081196303795888, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:34:24", "owner": "rule_no1_cardio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1