oliviasaenz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428757349098767, "text": "Yep! We have idiots too! 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:53:57", "owner": "gloriasouth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067162046029673, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:53:31", "owner": "sweet_attraction_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055829699242425, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:53:10", "owner": "anne.willlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077225774015365, "text": "Africans paid through their noses to study and qualify as professionals, yet some deem it fit to wallow in self-pity, saying “they took all their jobs”. I hope Africa becomes some days and the talents who travel far stay behind to develop their home countries.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:53:09", "owner": "plannerse1862", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18105799078523731, "text": "The average British police officer. And the reason I resigned from the force after 4 yrs. Piss heads and lager louts.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:52:15", "owner": "kaleem_sheikh123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386888449124259, "text": "His qualifications is in his hands...😂😂😂 Bloody alcoholic 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:51:46", "owner": "rumi_d_yogi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156824302384673, "text": "No words . He’s enough 🤡", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:51:32", "owner": "1monique13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020086091781935, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:50:53", "owner": "sophiamwagogo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074344346135546, "text": "The stupid is strong in him", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:50:47", "owner": "davkt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895388017183148, "text": "Idiots. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:50:22", "owner": "dkprojekt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073574450130999, "text": "And his brains too😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:49:50", "owner": "gardensofbee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18126201136488109, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:49:32", "owner": "urn13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067189064201477, "text": "No, I don’t care about his job, I’m g