reated_at": "2025-10-01T18:05:16", "owner": "bmaze49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889547125224123, "text": "Tommy Robinson is a wholly owned subsidiary of the Zionist forces, which are trying to create racial and religious wars in Europe and Britain on behalf of Israel.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:10:49", "owner": "thebash44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893645164339489, "text": "🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️ oh dear", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:40:49", "owner": "dr.ktorchia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900638020277230, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:11:17", "owner": "monadiggs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904761016124230, "text": "Because of mass immigration you need a degree just to work at McDonald's 30 years ago a high-school diploma got you any job that's what you dont get", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:06:46", "owner": "eastyorker19191991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910852543237328, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:03:11", "owner": "1leonzada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911473708208832, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:12:43", "owner": "sunny_magical_touch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915593671198258, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:13:07", "owner": "samya_hamdan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921510751160055, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:17:15", "owner": "ldaz6861", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924680587119867, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:03:28", "owner": "bilwaltredarslfd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925961206135298, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:24:03", "owner": "finomina_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948799197905356, "text": "Come on, man. You can’t expect someone without education, who’s been a ‘useful idiot’ and ideologically conditioned, to understand how their ignorance has been weaponized by those who believe it’s okay to manipulate uneducated people like that. It’s just sad.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:10:45", "owner": "jorgemario207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965641731974412, "text": "😂", "created_at": "