ner": "c_vaginnegh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389789611130922, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:07:29", "owner": "fo.nassou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408302836112387, "text": "🇮🇳 India Today (Republic of India, 1947–present)\n\t•\tLeadership & Politics:\n\t•\tWorld’s largest democracy with elections, multiple parties, and checks on power.\n\t•\tBut corruption, polarization, and bureaucracy are big issues.\n\t•\tReligious Freedom:\n\t•\tConstitution guarantees secularism, but in practice, religious tension and discrimination happen.\n\t•\tMinority groups, including Sikhs, sometimes feel neglected or targeted (e.g., 1984 anti-Sikh riots, farmers’ protests).\n\t•\tMilitary Power:\n\t•\tOne of the strongest militaries in the world, nuclear-armed, global influence.\n\t•\tJustice & Administration:\n\t•\tIndependent courts, but delays and corruption weaken justice.\n\t•\tDeath penalty exists.\n\t•\tEconomy:\n\t•\tIndia is a global economic power, 5th largest economy in the world.\n\t•\tBut inequality is high; farmers and workers struggle, while elites prosper.\n\t•\tStrengths:\n\t•\tStable institutions (parliament, judiciary, press—though not perfect).\n\t•\tGlobal presence in technology, science, space, and trade.\n\t•\tWeaknesses:\n\t•\tRising authoritarianism, communal divisions, and corruption.\n\t•\tFarmers’ distress and rural poverty echo some of the same struggles that existed 200 years ago.\n\n⸻\n\n⚖️ Which One Was Better?\n\t•\tFor Sikhs & Punjab → The Sikh Empire was far better. Sikhs were politically, socially, and culturally respected. The empire was tolerant, fair, and protective of Punjab’s identity.\n\t•\tFor All of India → Modern India is stronger in terms of global power, economy, science, and democracy. But it struggles with corruption, communal politics, and inequality.\n\nIf Maharaja Ranjit Singh’s model of secular, fair, strong, and farmer-centered rule had continued and expanded, India might have looked very different today—perhaps more united and less corrupt.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:58:36", "owner": "harwindernyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526408318047799, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:17:41", "owner": "musarratmirza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847918900570922, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:10:58", "owner": "imgokul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851001829558923, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:20:23", "owner": "debbiebanwo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857812705526200, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:59:19", "owner": "similewis12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869959705445193, "text": "They r only best at attacking Muslim countries and stealing their wealths", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:41:02", "owner": "fad_khan31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892701529343584, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:34:34", "owner": "81queenmother", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897919306167293, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:34:38", "owner": "singhserishka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901503985275682, "text": "Pls assess yourself first before you open your mouth Uncle 😬", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:25:42", "owner": "stunnertan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923214265154156, "text": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/public-access-to-chamundeshwari-temple-restricted-on-sept-1-in-view-of-presidents-visit/article69993018.ece", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:03:28", "owner": "khuzemablue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926814757134604, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:36:54", "owner": "hua_hua214_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935667391089168, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:17:34", "owner": "mayavichathan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945866803046050, "text": "And they left the beer cans 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:14:45", "owner": "sharminest.louis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947399725025013, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:40:45", "owner": "rubalpreetkaurrandhawa96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947870653045360, "text": "Go to Birmingham and Bradford then 😂😂😂", "crea