8659977544, "text": "That's proper English people don't have qualification on top they don't even know proper English what a shame do you know why ? It's their social services cos of which kids don't obey their parents but rest all other people does in England kids do all rubbish they have kids at 18 no marriage required on top due to social services and free govt money they are allowed to.So what jobs they get is shit cleaning.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:56:14", "owner": "greatest027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971728773790811, "text": "People spend thousands of pounds on college and university courses. They spend sleepless nights learning praying and working to succeed while spend days and nights in the pub…😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:23:58", "owner": "capoochcreationz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989111976712466, "text": "Britain ka chaddi", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:14:41", "owner": "sankho812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998671704820636, "text": "Whinging poms", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:24:54", "owner": "adishams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019610912775291, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:59:46", "owner": "veryseasonedovercomer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025620578534373, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:28:36", "owner": "hadiaformuli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041746115439644, "text": "😂😂😂😂yooo this is the most embarrassing thing I've seen on the Internet 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:21:44", "owner": "megane_hair_design", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042194975429871, "text": "Thank God they didn’t snatch his beer !! 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:58:57", "owner": "deepak92018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049169636653706, "text": "You do know it AI, thought you all would have known that with all those degrees 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:25:30", "owner": "rpf1889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060204008125509, "text": "I feel bad for that lad but how can any employer take him seriously when he project that kind of image...", "created_at":