t": "2025-10-01T07:16:54", "owner": "soros_lite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086896040494157, "text": "@europedefenders @ragingeuropeans 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 is that who you're fighting for", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:00:02", "owner": "umabdulla0974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088182661709661, "text": "These lot give the NF and BN piss a bad name 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:00:47", "owner": "fli9317", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091647457694150, "text": "West two different type of immigrants one qualified legal who obey rule and work in progress. Other is illegal Fanatic with religious agenda..who creat volience riots getting citizenship to..so address your problem clearly..", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:11:57", "owner": "nfnitesh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092597032694550, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:43:48", "owner": "rahadian_2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092617372691408, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:40:27", "owner": "onehtheblessed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093814558755106, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:09:56", "owner": "tom_ben03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098161369639732, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:51:15", "owner": "aparnamendies_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105628303592196, "text": "😂😂😂He did not say that! 😮 They just repeat things.  The White Male is the only group in the United Kingdom with no discrimination. White men do not face racial discrimination or gender discrimination so what is their excuse? What is the excuse for a fully able-bodied white male not having any qualifications or job?  The White male has the best form of white privilege so what is their excuse?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:34:41", "owner": "floras_divine_creations", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18116164273523173, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:24:42", "owner": "_rawbeing_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125107921489925, "text": "Terrible..", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:43:04", "owner": "nairtammy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159392995383825, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:22:37", "owner": "reginarajee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171033859319656, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:17:30", "owner": "s.yesmin010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320177761242061, "text": "There are qualified people but u choose someone from a bar,  is it a coincidence!?😮", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:56:48", "owner": "monmoni73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324219367212970, "text": "He's only left with the flag😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:19:13", "owner": "sammyplus", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18341687896205395, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:58:50", "owner": "satnaamkaur62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358654306086789, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:54:03", "owner": "fl_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365199361153081, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:30:40", "owner": "jacqueline_8502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392852794192495, "text": "lmao 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:32:28", "owner": "surajsharma5140", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403789837141936, "text": "He should ask HRH for Royalties", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:23:26", "owner": "neompartners", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480645526072223, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:43:22", "owner": "loualicia2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529274839036679, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:38:44", "owner": "ageless_glow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529831381000413, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:05:24", "owner": "pericansa0fficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535021168047402, "text": "No qualification.. No education...", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:09:41", "owner": "tom_ben03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843370534588780, "text": "And they took his brains as well", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:41:49", "owner": "cromana111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861689899496321, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:59:21", "owner": "13portfo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862027825427231, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:32:57", "owner": "drankitkinetix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869390317444199, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 he is qualified to feed his face with donuts.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:07:16", "owner": "ronnycushfilms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883215781390263, "text": "Average white British 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:22:13", "owner": "mr._.laugh._.a._.lot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883266922389659, "text": "We took his brain as well 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:15:33", "owner": "gcelest_canaleja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885443602372975, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:29:39", "owner": "fatima_rizzo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920151553173020, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:51:18", "owner": "laideyusuf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923931433118839, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:07:39", "owner": "rosyanne526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939222790077736, "text": "Well, in a way he is right. International students pay more tuition so greedy schools and colleges have been rejecting citizens and giving the seats to international students. They don’t realise that our taxes fund them and that’s why our tuition is less.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:14:13", "owner": "stephanie.dvi", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17943009875932849, "text": "😂😂😂😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:50:41", "owner": "harbans_singh_tamani", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969340263955657, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:14:06", "owner": "loveleengillanahadsjewellry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995745999688604, "text": "So dumb shit😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:54:53", "owner": "matanisali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016972331786169, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:01:26", "owner": "avtar_singh_dxb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023717624555880, "text": "Lol and he forgets that these immigrants often take up the jobs they themselves would turn their noses up at 🤣. Qualifications, eh? Why talk of qualifications when you obviously do not have what it takes intellectually to get into even a low-tier college? 😂 You got enough qualifications to pick potatoes, yet you don't want it and then throw shade on those who got the grit to do it? Madness 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:13:53", "owner": "jahmymp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034902596500982, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:17:29", "owner": "camy.muganga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039298565480467, "text": "Oversimplification of a bigger problem.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:25:01", "owner": "nandonorth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041671436443827, "text": "Who?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:11:28", "owner": "abidahellali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044422859378160, "text": "Sounds like an English maga. It's as empty and stodgy as its American cousins. Wherever they come from, xenophobic fascists gather...", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:53:11", "owner": "fredlam1972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053156939278588, "text": "He is qualified to wear a C cup bra.  Lmao. 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:58:13", "owner": "e.terriquez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053586863273176, "text": "À stupid suprematist man😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:58:52", "owner": "rouahsamir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057030752185843, "text": "“Meat Head”😮😢👏🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:48:13", "owner": "lesschled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057788474435176, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:07:20", "owner": "rosyanne526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057982331182360, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:17:00", "owner": "divina.fuentesss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059357771146483, "text": "UK 🇬🇧 looted wealth from india 🇮🇳 n made Britain . Now indians run their country n all they do is drink beer n watch football", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:17:27", "owner": "banrudro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062184476108069, "text": "ᴡʜᴀᴛ ᴀɴ ᴀʀsᴇ", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:57:45", "owner": "cliffordjmonteiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064549349575771, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:14:01", "owner": "clemkaris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065757404359087, "text": "They took his shirt too 😮", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:52:22", "owner": "divahalima", "likes": 1320}, {"id": 18066067814587812, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:09:41", "owner": "karen.besley.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066092669048702, "text": "None 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:34:53", "owner": "sevenmountain1307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068351942211913, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:32:03", "owner": "anup_d.nikkam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068704205245169, "text": "Lazy bones h🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:51:00", "owner": "laideyusuf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070276919189857, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:19:52", "owner": "murphy.sarahm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070384001333204, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂Love you my man . Cheers have another one on me 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:55:58", "owner": "gusagper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074663294113418, "text": "Compare college graduates between the ones studied in US from the beginning and the ones who came in middle saying they are skilled and can work for peanuts taking away natives job.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:27:59", "owner": "m_safety_queen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075055532329045, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:26:31", "owner": "shaher.aw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077914630851488, "text": "So British...", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:17:36", "owner": "booboo4384", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079217369050311, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:53:14", "owner": "eduardoalfredodamelio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079443191312926, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:32:23", "owner": "jansembsewjames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079506067998356, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:49:21", "owner": "pretty_danni_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079765774998580, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:06:28", "owner": "moona_siingh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080063843314104, "text": "And his brain too", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:22:19", "o