676, "text": "Same with Black peoples in the US", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:32:26", "owner": "editusername90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073931102275959, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:16:48", "owner": "priturii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075628217037129, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:16:19", "owner": "payalpat1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081058349286903, "text": "Wait a minute I have seen someone from India saying - Invaders stole all the knowledge from India, so it’s not the country it’s the stupid peoples in each countries.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:20:29", "owner": "_pooja__prakash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091238467806759, "text": "😂😂🤦🏻‍♀️😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:37:29", "owner": "tab33_m1rz4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091879819698033, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:55:12", "owner": "princess.dubai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093580258689683, "text": "America is his country . No matter if he don’t have any qualifications but still his origin is America.  Many poor illiterate slums are dying in India . Throwing their kids to dogs 🐕", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:31:25", "owner": "sarah_khan_4444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098952160726785, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:13:29", "owner": "sana.k.imran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100797691616069, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:31:43", "owner": "patrick.swizzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106957165585656, "text": "Just admit that u r a big dumb", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:34:07", "owner": "akunabyal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108977938566200, "text": "Only one isn't an example, we can show how many Indians living with only doll social benefits 😂😂😂- btw an English is in his own countries, but u r immigrants", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:29:30", "owner": "alanrojo2017", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128313295485911, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:47:23", "owner": "rabiya550", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140315452376380, "text": "He is right..they took all the brains away as well..😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:18:12", "owner": "tejalkhawse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157270504389495, "text": "😂😂😂👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:52:15", "owner": "orry9993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18239055457294973, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:54:18", "owner": "sagxr_41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282377950263190, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:15:16", "owner": "hiba_vaqar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288948103284634, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:45:29", "owner": "dassujita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325803613236344, "text": "But he is correct Islamic are taking their wealth which will effect their life status and education jobs and settler", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:37:12", "owner": "gus162024", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18373956103177451, "text": "😂😂😂non and stole your jobs 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:45:46", "owner": "sandra_tl1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378355333194401, "text": "Idiots ki kami nahi hai", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:58:29", "owner": "dr.juthikaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424188940099482, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:31:08", "owner": "fli9317", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18519507499005361, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:54:46", "owner": "harsweeti97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540259663030927, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:49:05", "owner": "abu_ayoub1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861869182427122, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T06:01:38", "owner": "dil_e_muztar777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892282027339402, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:47:21", "owner": "cute_kitties_mum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900524026147020, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T08:55:15", "owner": "sadooabbasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900827839273096, "text": "He’s right. They took all the seats at the university 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:26:05", "owner": "behmaha277", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911831473217103, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:16:23", "owner": "nazmanaz