{"media_id": 3764800097789054079, "shortcode": "DQ_Qb3_Eox_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQ_Qb3_Eox_/", "taken_at": "2025-11-13T07:34:38", "caption": "They lk had to introduce the one child policy to keep them from balling too hard\n\nXMandarinchinese.com\n\n#learnchinese #chineselanguage #language #mandarin #chineselesson\n#mandarinlesson #chinesewords #hsk #中文 #学中文 #汉语 #学汉语 #meme #chinesememe #memes #brainrot", "owner_username": "xmandarin_", "owner_id": "4501110535", "likes": 111860, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0036_DQ_Qb3_Eox_\\DQ_Qb3_Eox__20251113_073438.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18067864871601866, "text": "Type xi", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:39:45", "owner": "nxkhil", "likes": 9187}, {"id": 18085746337965408, "text": "supermodel ❌\nsuper idol ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:47:56", "owner": "mindy_wen", "likes": 6101}, {"id": 18191317318335675, "text": "我的中国宝贝在哪里", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:01:43", "owner": "sthuthipeter", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17925649404177503, "text": "what if i speak chinese and am performative", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:58:46", "owner": "kazapofficial", "likes": 231}, {"id": 18090908887927797, "text": "你好 🤫 🧏🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:42:27", "owner": "_p._.j", "likes": 235}, {"id": 17929386246168834, "text": "Explains why John Cena converted", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:55:37", "owner": "yo.its.kyle_", "likes": 1444}, {"id": 18085871389790884, "text": "So real, i said \"wo cao\" and they're coa'ing me", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:45:16", "owner": "heuvelheuvelt", "likes": 4008}, {"id": 17888129406389275, "text": "Mandarin propaganda", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:10:43", "owner": "movedhat", "likes": 862}, {"id": 17928609432139774, "text": "最中幻想", "created_at": "2025-11-14T08:29:13", "owner": "hddytm", "likes": 226}, {"id": 18093852778862729, "text": "我是你爸爸🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:28:35", "owner": "nafanyle", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057667022272482, "text": "我知道， 😎🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:04:01", "owner": "mr.dmittry", "likes": 207}, {"id": 17865017580510287, "text": "真没骗我？？", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:35:14", "owner": "amatsukami.0420", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068858111523939, "text": "這個不對，因為我說中文可是我又沒有女朋友", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:48:05", "owner": "chihuahuadumbstick", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17938991543964527, "text": "Yea yea go ahead and laugh. I’m building social credit", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:04:15", "owner": "dane.png", "likes": 85}, {"id": 18079497854329335, "text": "这是错别字😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:29:56", "owner": "alhamrizvii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954258127029276, "text": "你好，fine shyt", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:22:16", "owner": "eugene.lam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014317016631043, "text": "ni hao fine shyt", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:05:38", "owner": "raylilblue", "likes": 40}, {"id": 17982868394764721, "text": "Homies know them abgs before their abcs", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:05:26", "owner": "nolan4real", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18069156062606774, "text": "可是…并没有🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:15:22", "owner": "alexwu502", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18350156485200793, "text": "Xi-gma male 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-14T08:26:53", "owner": "pot.the.potato", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18108083626632582, "text": "tf", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:28:33", "owner": "redlight.o_0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060762650541957, "text": "ni hao ladies", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:32:29", "owner": "_aveski", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057113489330260, "text": "Chinese are making their own happiness 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:05:51", "owner": "abdiyevvvvvvvv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18195649522324695, "text": "I guarantee that's true. Even though I'm poor, ugly, and disabled, many women are interested in me. (I can say 早上好）", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:40:05", "owner": "henriquepaulo3", "likes": 485}, {"id": 17887525761389060, "text": "This explains why I’m single, I speak Chinese so fluently, people think I’m outta their league.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:10:29", "owner": "kevinzhang.exe", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17915655345226397, "text": "我知道", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:36:44", "owner": "rodney_rock_n_roll", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107357491565657, "text": "我说中文", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:54:31", "owner": "youqi_dai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065101490139070, "text": "speaks japanese 😷🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:23:57", "owner": "dynoxmusic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18129751924494519, "text": "I want to learn bing chi ling😢", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:49:28", "owner": "shaurya1082009", "likes": 145}, {"id": 17904987939292659, "text": "? This is not true", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:41:59", "owner": "jasn.li", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060117632539361, "text": "我可以说一点中文但是我没有女朋友。我想死了", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:03:19", "owner": "blunts.blunts549", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18065338886633524, "text": "？兄弟别骗自己了", "created_at": "2025-11-14T02:18:20", "owner": "derekw1d", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18011168708639482, "text": "哎呀妈", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:44:12", "owner": "charlieli01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074739299212909, "text": "@_vvi7_ @dollixu", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:54:07", "owner": "haoran_gu0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120404131549550, "text": "@me_e__eme see china superior 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:47:15", "owner": "thalasserydumbiriyani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992916366851993, "text": "Runs xmandarin insta page 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:06:04", "owner": "ivo_xd2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083614931476670, "text": "@calvinchan345 Chinese and you can’t speak Chinese smh", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:33:33", "owner": "jamie.b03", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104065357642991, "text": "Not true, never dated Chinese living here for 23 years speaking native Chinese 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:55:33", "owner": "humberto.jr0310", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072821813461299, "text": "Bro i dont run xmandarin page", "created_