{"media_id": 3702126186991657084, "shortcode": "DNgmCcBTyB8", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DNgmCcBTyB8/", "taken_at": "2025-08-18T20:11:09", "caption": "Every day, the safety of our children is paramount. As part of our commitment to ensuring their well-being, we launch this campaign to raise awareness about protecting children from strangers. It is our collective responsibility to educate and empower our young ones with the knowledge and tools they need to stay safe.\n\nKey Points:\n1. Recognize Safe Spaces: Teach children about safe places, like their homes, schools, and trusted community centers.\n2. Stranger Danger: Instill the importance of not talking to, accepting gifts from, or going anywhere with strangers.\n3. Emergency Contacts: Ensure kids know their emergency contacts, such as parents, guardians, and emergency services.\n4. Stay Together: Encourage children to stay in groups and never wander alone in public areas.\n5. Open Communication: Foster an environment where children feel comfortable discussing their experiences and concerns.\nTogether, we can create a safer world for our children.\n\n#pedpatrol #vitaly #predatorcaught #pdffile #tocatchapredstor #creepy.", "owner_username": "predcatchingcluub", "owner_id": "67828617886", "likes": 180563, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0037_DNgmCcBTyB8\\DNgmCcBTyB8_20250818_201109.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18039919106668950, "text": "The boy’s name is Bryan. He has a promising future ahead of him as a great hockey player, but now he can’t play the game because he was injured from getting too many high-fives.", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:55:57", "owner": "jiissooonn", "likes": 44864}, {"id": 18053489822294419, "text": "When I was 14 I was SA by a 19 year old girl and it left me traumatised because I finished in 30 seconds", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:08:02", "owner": "itsjusreal", "likes": 493}, {"id": 18525859099017129, "text": "One of the jealous classmate snitched on him 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:29:15", "owner": "legend_roman625", "likes": 34005}, {"id": 17873020893355399, "text": "Wtf is this comment section 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:05:06", "owner": "thibaud_schl", "likes": 6840}, {"id": 17904073779146068, "text": "I'm 16 and I'm telling you \"He's definitely not a victim.\". Free her. She's a nice lady", "created_at": "2025-11-12T02:53:21", "owner": "time.pass.joy", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18072469570980520, "text": "People saying he isn’t a victim are what’s wrong with society.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T04:13:22", "owner": "zrebert_417", "likes": 16274}, {"id": 18099149299526910, "text": "he aint a victim free her", "created_at": "2025-08-30T06:03:32", "owner": "chrisbodder", "likes": 1870}, {"id": 18040143533392261, "text": "The Boy who lived", "created_at": "2025-08-26T08:42:23", "owner": "arcanomics", "likes": 120}, {"id": 18093718747641304, "text": "Damn bro where were these teachers when I was in school", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:31:41", "owner": "robmaraioo", "likes": 57}, {"id": 18060113906426561, "text": "Gucci for some coochi", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:41:43", "owner": "saxonmckenzie", "likes": 1414}, {"id": 17935996137096277, "text": "Disgusting comments.  Paedophilia and grooming kids from a position of power is awful. If you can't see that,  you need some more awareness and think more deeply about morality.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T00:33:14", "owner": "jo3y_nobody", "likes": 2216}, {"id": 18240805429293896, "text": "This comment section is terrifying.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:00:20", "owner": "ironveil.project", "likes": 2231}, {"id": 18092338654861607, "text": "This why male sexual assault will never be taken serious guys come on 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T12:11:36", "owner": "pedropablo_paz", "likes": 10597}, {"id": 18088382180507077, "text": "Ask the kid if he felt victimized...lol", "created_at": "2025-11-13T01:49:55", "owner": "adaptivefisherman", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18080246456035073, "text": "Notice how the \"not a victim\" comments are made by fully grown men?? Scaryyyyy men need to be leashed to a trusted adult at all times for safety concerns.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T15:59:52", "owner": "m.e.g.roses", "likes": 199}, {"id": 18048567626392949, "text": "To all the people in the comments: imaging she were a male teacher and he was your daughter. Sme age same all, just the sexes swapped. Would you be reacting the same way?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:45:22", "owner": "thierryfaucillon", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17914403352216718, "text": "His male classmates snitched", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:18:08", "owner": "m4xxnousername.sa", "likes": 95}, {"id": 17860259406532212, "text": "That’s strange, for this he’s a child, all tho he looks like an adult and in my opinion more than grown up to make decisions, but when a real child less than 10 year old thinks he or she is born in the wrong body they can have transformation. Then it’s no problem that this child, who is a real child at that age, makes such an decision. Strange world this is becoming", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:10:38", "owner": "renzogarcet", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18359964088095523, "text": "Any man in this comment section saying that bro isn’t a victim is ok with touching kids.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:31:30", "owner": "frustratedmarsupial", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18027703718549314, "text": "Geeeez I didn’t have one those teachers 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:47:57", "owner": "__gui_trainer_br", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18096447913641727, "text": "My boy was getting Gucci and Coochie. Where were these teachers when I was in school?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:31:54", "owner": "the_kck", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17861793555519502, "text": "Victim?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:13:06", "owner": "halcon_xr10", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17872560351452805, "text": "I woulda stayed quiet bro told the wrong person or sum 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:35:40", "owner": "sethwillisonn", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18021576485597055, "text": "Free her up!", "created_at": "2025-11-04T22:56:01", "owner": "kfigs2x", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18488734255073924, "text": "shii I always wanted to be a victim💯", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:15:48", "owner": "filippofrnz", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17852542026577492, "text": "I was 10 she was 18.. she made me play with her cat.. when I grew up, I tried looking for her, couldn't find her.. it's sad..", "created_at": "2025-11-12T08:13:18", "owner": "channelising_homeostatis", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18093974557849399, "text": "Okay so really quickly I just want to point out how men are always complaining about how there’s double standards when it comes to sexual assault. LOOK AT THE MEN IN THESE COMMENTS! Saying that this boy isn’t a victim? You wish it would happen to you? He is a CHILD and she was his teacher. If the age wasn’t illegal the power dynamic is weird itself. If it was a little girl then what? :/ that boy should be protected the same.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:32:51", "owner": "virtuallymeowuw", "likes": 64}, {"id": 18158820280393531, "text": "This world we in is sick", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:13:58", "owner": "osama_obss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17957815440006952, "text": "There's no father in this world that wouldn't be low-key proud of his son in this situation.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:26:35", "owner": "h_nedd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024241484772256, "text": "If the teacher was male and the student was female, this comment section wouldn’t be this disgusting. He is a child. She is an adult. This is NEVER okay, what is wrong with y’all? 😐", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:01:45", "owner": "codybrown.sinfronteras", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18043938353444385, "text": "It’s gross behaviour for any adult? Idk why y’all saying he isn’t a victim. He is a CHILD.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:37:57", "owner": "sarah_nguyen_cbr", "likes": 3577}, {"id": 18119233447534951, "text": "I want to be a victim...😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:53:32", "owner": "fact.scan.hq", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18113135188603462, "text": "In most cases women child abusers/predators are not taken as seriously as men predators! This should stop! Sick perverts should  be treated equally by the law!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:01:52", "owner": "haroot_azarian", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18058958930096682, "text": "😎", "created_at": "2025-08-29T08:10:36", "owner": "leo.w78", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094220692889352, "text": "Haters snitched our homie. No way out he was going to say", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:41:52", "owner": "mandallahtz", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18538844479005650, "text": "These dudes be gay", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:46:56", "owner": "ashton_booln", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917436526195771, "text": "bro wat😭", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:20:53", "owner": "kennyswrld_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18049545053358030, "text": "Men in the comments proving \"Male lonliness epidemic\"", "created_at": "2025-11-12T16:25:18", "owner": "vxmpira_xv", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17875162536355751, "text": "My teacher was giving me d's and f's. This teacher was trying to get the D and F 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:10:47", "owner": "zpsychostephen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17849011221585293, "text": "I don’t care what people say, as a lad this is a dream come true. We are built differently and can’t be compared or have the same rules.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:38:21", "owner": "jude_gilbert_", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18083228062956088, "text": "But Diddy got 6 years", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:40:17", "owner": "emerssssson.21", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18432017608106932, "text": "I believe she's the victim here", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:29:45", "owner": "wnv.r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18158970313396612, "text": "Dude didn't knew how to shut up his mouth, and someone snitch on him .....😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:00:36", "owner": "alexandru.cris", "likes": 1}, {"id": 180910820