 he's a lucky son of a beach. If only Miss Dilan she's what I went to school for 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:58:28", "owner": "q_the_continuum_style", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087236464929611, "text": "Bro won the lottery🥀💀", "created_at": "2025-10-17T23:41:03", "owner": "dj_d.r.a.g.o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064696355142177, "text": "Men will cry in a female victims comments about how women do it too but then turn around and say he isnt a victim in his own video. . Its not all men ... ? Or is it predatory men are just the majority?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:49:42", "owner": "tatterpotpie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17898409302183949, "text": "Now imagine it was a male teacher and the student was your daughter not so funny now", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:10:17", "owner": "d_e_r_r_i_c_k_0824", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866742052421073, "text": "The comments by men and women as if a boy sexually assaulted is some sort of achievement . Don’t know how many of these ever realize the long term psychological impacts. A kid is a kid no matter if it’s a boy or a girl .", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:59:04", "owner": "jayabram590", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157419124392055, "text": "if i was him i promise u theres gonna be another victim of murder", "created_at": "2025-11-13T01:23:13", "owner": "kvyshia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046918193320480, "text": "Lucky guy", "created_at": "2025-08-31T06:31:05", "owner": "gangiskhanakacamo", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18338065696225098, "text": "Gucci belt and bro got to hit", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:01:18", "owner": "maximehunt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872896789442278, "text": "That's a win", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:43:44", "owner": "_stfusarim_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079087225974274, "text": "I tried to hit on my high school sub. She was blushing for a while but when I asked her to get drinks after school in front of the class she called my dad lmao", "created_at": "2025-09-25T22:35:04", "owner": "fiji_wataa", "likes": 3908}, {"id": 18089297269897969, "text": "Men in the comments minimizing this situation ofc ofc good to know that they not only do this to female victims but male as well 🤢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:21:33", "owner": "bezzbo", "likes": 345}, {"id": 18093991891895590, "text": "Free her", "created_at": "2025-11-12T02:51:50", "owner": "time.pass.joy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17984471954749673, "text": "What’s her @", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:00:21", "owner": "imjustbradd1", "likes": 75}, {"id": 17956382400002611, "text": "Guys lay off the porn it clearly is affecting your mindset if you think this is ok.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:12:46", "owner": "peytonisverystupid", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18158850589399793, "text": "I was born 20 years too early. My teachers did not look like that.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:24:17", "owner": "scouseinaz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874786162359205, "text": "She looks younger than the student", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:00:18", "owner": "maxpopopopopower", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090789334728908, "text": "I think we can just chalk this up to character development and give the kid all the high fives.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:13:16", "owner": "jacobgreschuk99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069011504360340, "text": "@leonclayton6 if this is the kind of things a “real man” says then I am happy to classify myself as a beta male", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:22:23", "owner": "frustratedmarsupial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18161021599394832, "text": "Busted", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:20:45", "owner": "sincol1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116174971576759, "text": "The only well paid teacher just so happens to be the one i wish i had been the victim of", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:36:11", "owner": "milligonewyld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918180895211190, "text": "Wish teachers cared about students this much when I was in school", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:19:19", "owner": "yourpapiboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095329393854623, "text": "@sanpreetsandhi  tell me where a woman does that here", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:40:10", "owner": "imsotired_letmerest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001771454829587, "text": "Pedophiles need to 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:45:49", "owner": "chihuahuas.rock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076969757187421, "text": "as a woman we dont claim her", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:44", "owner": "ninanizoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050919836357199, "text": "Bunch of chomos in the comment section.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:58:15", "owner": "nosuchluckpov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099521266766599, "text": "Will you have Ryan McGomery on as a guest, and help him to get on several podcasts to discuss all the ways pedos are working online\nhttps://x.com/ShawnRyan762/status/1991662363406221795?s=20", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:10:00", "owner": "wayne236890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073686950349085, "text": "He not a victim she was js buying bro a belt and ik he tappin dat", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:17:24", "owner": "lusxuferr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075816574953083, "text": "Men cry 'WOMEN DON'T CARE ABOUT MENS SA THO!' then sit there and say free her for rape only because shes attractive. You all suck.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:39:59", "owner": "w24_roadster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924829300178524, "text": "The dudes in these comments are f*cking vile. Yall need Jesus. Disgusting", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:47:42", "owner": "wowitz_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541410019005149, "text": "He got a Gucci belt and smashed his teacher. Luckiest kid in the world", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:56:13", "owner": "yungtao53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106062940725223, "text": "It's wild how different UK police are than ours. They tell you straight up don't say nothing lol cops here start asking questions immediately and read you your rights a hour later 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:49:33", "owner": "ss_marc__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315836401223908, "text": "“One of the hardest things I had to deal with in