e  to provide and protect like men...for him was the learning curve ...grow a pair u wook f*ckers 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:35:47", "owner": "n_d_f_m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096731524749422, "text": "@jakemarshall_1698 @klashgabos 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:32:31", "owner": "backroadbillionare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394808542132347, "text": "You save me in this situation am gonna fight you😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:49:10", "owner": "maxpeterson551", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079437140113799, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:43:41", "owner": "murtaz.0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981576993920211, "text": "All European and USA women's are a nasty bitch's and their men are fucking cuck 🤢🤮💩🖕🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:25:24", "owner": "masihmk00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907127257125468, "text": "13 should be the age of consent.", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:47:08", "owner": "prachipallo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903903907145864, "text": "Where were these teachers in my generation 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:30:53", "owner": "shaunadams5430", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18086552881952047, "text": "Im apart of the problem dreamed for this shit to happen to me, and regardless of that hes not a \"victim\" learn the definition.", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:28:03", "owner": "lekechris01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929092042128705, "text": "He seems safe to me🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T23:50:42", "owner": "cedriclguy310", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18008149559646281, "text": "What a creep. Evil", "created_at": "2025-11-06T23:40:36", "owner": "bebedehoux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057469673541506, "text": "The trauma 😓", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:57:32", "owner": "eze27__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072695882017257, "text": "All my teachers looked like Mary McLeod Bethune", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:55:48", "owner": "illmatic50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889536349367448, "text": "The cop saying she’s under arrest like she feels bad about it or something. Her sheepish voice with no authority.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:24:07", "owner": "girliepie33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084313367297738, "text": "Anyone who believes the child is a \"winner\" or that the woman should be set free are inherently disgusting. If a man does it it is a huge deal but a woman? Thats a double standard that is unlawfully just. That is a child at the end of the day. And a grown woman who is now a pedophile.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:30:58", "owner": "wild.yzf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065207411110963, "text": "When life gives you special lemons, you keep yo mouf shut", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:29:10", "owner": "ryt3.dj", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18102822277644253, "text": "Some of these comments are gross. A child is a child. It doesn't matter if they're male or female. If you're not making jokes when a man sexually takes advantage of a 15yo girl you can't then make them when a grown woman is doing it to a 15yo boy. You all are laughing off and minimizing predatory behavior and sexual assault. But if this were a man and a boy this entire comment section would be different. At the end of the day your ridiculous argument of \"well he wanted it\" is the same thing predators say about their female victims. You who are encouraging this only reveal your own sick, twisted, evil mentalities. This is EXACTLY why male victims of sexual assault don't come forward whether their predator was a woman or man because they will be judged as either \"ridiculous\" for complaining or \"weak\" for not being able to defend themselves. It's sick.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:03:52", "owner": "abshutt23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097321915808477, "text": "Not the mountain of pedophiles folding under 0 pressure in the comment.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T16:56:21", "owner": "rancid_corpse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001675037822481, "text": "Lucky boy", "created_at": "2025-11-06T16:34:19", "owner": "dannyo1980_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17951454671907911, "text": "We wish that happened to us 😭🤣🤣🤣🤣 getting a belt and 🐈. Top lad", "created_at": "2025-11-06T16:17:27", "owner": "sadry.fx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069631970601088, "text": "Poor kid properly doesn’t even realise what was happening till he’s older…", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:41:38", "owner": "baileylawry", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17991923564851683, "text": "Bro if anything she the victim bro was extorting the fuck out of her and giving her some dih in return like the other comment said please never save me if I’m in the same situation", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:35:04", "owner": "ooseryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079511434885219, "text": "To the people saying he's not a victim, I'm assuming you're fine with one of the boys being a teen dad? She became pregnant from one of the two boys she abused. Is it right for a 15 year old child to father another child?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:09:28", "owner": "shhhjenesuispasla", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18133479316463691, "text": "Hello? Where was this when I was in school (acting like I’m old “20”)", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:48:39", "owner": "thezyaron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034251272719059, "text": "Bro who tf snitched ok bro. Blud was living the lifeeeeee", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:19:18", "owner": "chillll.exe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17916141498211283, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:13:23", "owner": "c0zy_room_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18088310119939922, "text": "Damn... Now I miss my teacher too who did let me give her back shots every Friday", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:43:04", "owner": "kingt.oji", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18327832132240120, "text": "It’s probably 1 female SP for every 10,000 male SPs. Why are you posting this?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:38:43", "owner": "johnstephen007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303090901268528, "text": "Comment section is absolutely cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:33:19", "owner": "putradnyana_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18194630401325496, "text": "Did he have to give the Gucci belt back?!", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:32:10", "owner": "tuna.boyz_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17999788049684112, "text": "Providing a minor with anything of perceived value in exchange for sexual acts is child sexual exploitation and sex trafficking", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:14:24", "owner": "wzarddddd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066879020576975, "text": "He is a lucky ass boy. This page admin is some woke looser 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:58:24", "owner": "marcowongmonkeys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049333667370152, "text": "Id take this style of assault alllllllllll day", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:54:42", "owner": "timmeansbizniss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955451223889508, "text": "Did she get the credit back for the purchase of the belt? ….", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:14:42", "owner": "ollieroberts_fact", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082998569289710, "text": "The amount of virgin losers in this comment section is astounding. Its ok cause she's fit and he 'wanted' it? Seriously? Get a fucking grip.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:32:01", "owner": "beaudacious0_0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17892546804225895, "text": "3her man", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:30:15", "owner": "trapzortrapo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18161143099381205, "text": "Free her!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:58:26", "owner": "le_cockque", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18537116986036031, "text": "I wish I was him", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:57:43", "owner": "le_cockque", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900802138165508, "text": "Where were these teachers when I was young smh 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:04:29", "owner": "chris8278tian", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18022613270591425, "text": "Has anyone seen those feminist weirdos now? Didn't think so ... 👍😅💯", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:03:53", "owner": "dean408620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857876623541847, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:03:16", "owner": "a_chitron", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18116179567483673, "text": "Bro did it for a Gucci belt and played victim to 