en never shock us in the comments...the male loneliness epidemic isn't lonely enough....PED*PHILIA is wrong no matter if the victim is male or female....men just proving they don't see an issue with it..that's all😒😒😒😒😒😒😒", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:05:41", "owner": "gl_islife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18183224515354662, "text": "With this comment section we now men are more E X S driven.🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:20:06", "owner": "jolly_jellybean2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337959682235897, "text": "Where una for dey c this kin teachers sef???😢😢😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:47:52", "owner": "odiliabel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337163014233372, "text": "You dumbasses are the 13th reason and will never be able to provide for a woman. Beta freaks", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:29:05", "owner": "umbra_480p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323034841213710, "text": "Yo he got a Gucci belt AND got laid??? Where’s the victim??? 👀 I can’t find him.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:15:41", "owner": "_crazydiamond1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943406524070386, "text": "Victimize me next please", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:05:33", "owner": "amgsoprano", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084350122956805, "text": "What did she do wrong?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:13:07", "owner": "a2189826", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18407590273184873, "text": "Bros life was a real life 🌽-O lol", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:53:58", "owner": "ohshiznit_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016659980792464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:24:41", "owner": "sionography_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18314865655217280, "text": "Why this didn’t happened to me when I was in high school 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:17:55", "owner": "alvarado.jeyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077921504144350, "text": "What she did was wrong, she preyed on a child regardless if he was 2 or 15 she misused her position as a Teacher for her own satisfaction, and you can see her smirk as she pays for the belt - she lured him with gifts and abused him. She deserves to rot in Prison", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:12:31", "owner": "o_im.pepper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301150348267894, "text": "Why never me God whyyyyy‼️", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:57:01", "owner": "5derrick1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092586898846343, "text": "Death. End her.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:08:56", "owner": "xpetriex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106285201717507, "text": "She knew what she wanted, and got it!  Kid was a willing participant and couldn't say no!  I'm 99.9% sure, no kid that age would EVER say no to a hot older teacher!  If you would, you're gay af! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:07:20", "owner": "pool_plyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172611034367985, "text": "Why you played depressing background music in happy ending story?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T16:19:41", "owner": "wilfulfill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091727641844220, "text": "You could literally see her life crumble 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:21:37", "owner": "craigster86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886575232263735, "text": "The Comments from men are so sad… if you are a grown a** woman and you’re attracted to a little 15 year old, something is truly wrong with you.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:58:51", "owner": "yoadrianq", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18106726093618918, "text": "He looks very forced into accepting that gift 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:55:02", "owner": "nkxbolt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346731145202189, "text": "Only female student can be a victim, 😂 all boys used to dream of this situation when we're in school🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:49:02", "owner": "riak.maw", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17935053947981319, "text": "I'm not sure how but he has recently had perfect attendance and a A in her class", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:44:08", "owner": "black_jezzus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880367431310937, "text": "Bro was not a victim", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:30:23", "owner": "modest.bro", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18525900448064264, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:03:25", "owner": "c4m_0261", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18201775642319213, "text": "Love how the women in the comments are butt hurt, the teacher is hot, for most boys at that age it's a dream come true, we all had a teacher crush its a dream come true", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:14:25", "owner": "ace244577", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17976279626937695, "text": "What a lucky boy, any boys dream let's be honest", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:10:38", "owner": "ace244577", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18145777597430486, "text": "Why would you arrest this amazing teacher and woman 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:17:13", "owner": "juaan___90", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18383342275177527, "text": "Where were those teachers when I was in school.. Damme", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:05:00", "owner": "crist_offf", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18056792060280375, "text": "White people = pedophiles", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:57:51", "owner": "dani81lopez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110977567595050, "text": "No boy from 15 to 18, banging a hot teacher is victim. Its his faking dream...", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:52:31", "owner": "lavljizmaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045506357442597, "text": "I pray to be a victim of this type of predators 😩😩😩", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:16:55", "owner": "hbl_rkt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046800329409868, "text": "how young is the kid? is he circumcise yet?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:03:53", "owner": "memacommenter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054881837310713, "text": "Consent under the age of 18 isn’t real consent. There’s no excuse to grooming and pedophila.A male child is still a child.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:02:17", "owner": "suhikapalavaii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059865656226725, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:55:56", "owner": "rahuldhampur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055467176305392, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:51:48", "owner": "novoselov.aleksandr.sr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996351930840990, "text": "I wanted to be a victim