"bigggs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967506438823122, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:34:45", "owner": "lonely_sin666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065312291580391, "text": "Why couldn’t it be me", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:18:08", "owner": "brycebanx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937677856086185, "text": "Nice....", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:13:57", "owner": "foal24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131969935469764, "text": "Ew this comment section is f***ed. 🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:59:14", "owner": "kelleyehlen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987937392897862, "text": "Crazy to see this history. I grew up in Iran — our teachers were these hairy, bearded guys who only knew how to punish us. If I was in that situation back then, I’d probably beg not to be saved . The only place I could hang out with girls was the basement at my parents’ house, and only when they weren’t home. Wild how much the world’s changed since 1995 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:25:06", "owner": "imanius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071165048257675, "text": "I hate it so much that every few years there's a case where a grown woman (who's usually really pretty) has a fling with a teenager- aged 14-17, and everyone acts like she's a brutal rapist. The boy gets an erection, wants it, has fun, tells all his friends, but the woman gets punished as if she'd committed murder. Simply because she's a woman—but both of them WANT IT! If women who scream \"no\" are violated every day, even though they don't want it, then they guy gets three months' probation—if they even get punished at all.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:22:14", "owner": "donco81er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044593391693441, "text": "Imagine having to listen to these fuckin moron cops 😂 they can’t even speak proper they sound fuckdd", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:20:48", "owner": "jimbofuckinslice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075867551232231, "text": "Crime aside, how did that teacher afford Gucci and a flat? What district is she teaching in?", "created_at": "