ikes": 0}, {"id": 17898640644324060, "text": "\"If IT wAs a GiRl\"... damn st*u. He was NOT a girl. He was a boy, we all (unless you was a f*g) would've wanted to be with a teacher. We all had sexual thoughts with a teacher, with actresses, with adult sister's friends. Teenage girls, on the other hand,  are not emotionally and sexuaIly prone to this, and it could hurt them. That is why it is not the same.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:51:32", "owner": "elperdido.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951467596042175, "text": "Who snitching?", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:33:17", "owner": "too.spicy_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098866771742532, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:31:29", "owner": "jordancoulter7", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17932365078106357, "text": "If only i could have taken his pain 😢, i should have been the one to be scarified to that predator", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:27:33", "owner": "nothaxnat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922806667175126, "text": "I’d report and save you if you were in this situation @ksujiththomas", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:04:22", "owner": "_jerry_jose", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18373392442147851, "text": "Uhm he looked pretty happy 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:58:23", "owner": "jacques_matthee_bb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074727230521865, "text": "3333", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:55:50", "owner": "brodie.bw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090417358922759, "text": "Obviously a lot of people would have liked to be in that position at his age. And that mindset is exactly how he’s still a kid. To still wish that would have happened as an adult is when it gets weird. Some things u should just keep to yourself.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:49:47", "owner": "antman817042648", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107260237609043, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:48:16", "owner": "aboynamedgee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18162312034377357, "text": "I remembered one time being approached in a kinky way by 16 yrlds while I was 28. My luck was that they were ugly as