tim straight away so why not this young boy!!", "created_at": "2025-10-31T11:12:47", "owner": "ms_jada84", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985510242884454, "text": "Is she still in jail 😒 I need a LV belt 🫢", "created_at": "2025-10-31T11:09:07", "owner": "mr.himjayson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047086304682824, "text": "Noticing how the people in these comments who don't empathize with a child being groomed and sexually assaulted by someone who has power and influence over him are men.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T10:43:29", "owner": "plantmutual", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080148347103037, "text": "Why didn't I had a teacher like her 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-31T10:18:24", "owner": "benard_v12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17970933632798057, "text": "Women are the real predators", "created_at": "2025-10-31T10:13:50", "owner": "dyer_surf_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049502636659265, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-31T10:10:17", "owner": "tkordzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847460830593113, "text": "All the guys in the comments having a big mouth how cool it is for the dude, just to speak their outrage when the genders are reversed. Such double standards...", "created_at": "2025-10-31T09:10:17", "owner": "danielmuehlenberg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916553251069597, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-31T09:04:48", "owner": "et6donthavea9home", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075736883516681, "text": "The most polite arrest I have ever seen.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:48:06", "owner": "samitgambhir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133057921464499, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:28:02", "owner": "moondog_millionaire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053170460319825, "text": "Comment section should blow their brains out, i heard all this when i was a kid and it made me hate every single person who said \" lucky boy\" or \" wish it had been me \" truly desire for all of to put a shotgun in ur mouth and pull the trigger what a bunch of worthless no pussy getting degenerates", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:06:53", "o