ional, being a teacher and those boundaries should not be crossed..... He is a minor... That's someone's Son and the look on her face in the shop...... Is plain wrong x", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:21:14", "owner": "farrow_christy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062658740531519, "text": "Si me sucede algo asi...no me salven porfavor🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:05:13", "owner": "garrickfranz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846653938595827, "text": "GUCCI BELT AND 🐱", "created_at": "2025-10-31T04:55:51", "owner": "thebitchwhobrokemyheart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864329641489968, "text": "This is ridiculous", "created_at": "2025-10-31T04:55:30", "owner": "jasonstuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863416345506570, "text": "r", "created_at": "2025-10-31T04:41:30", "owner": "adriannaick19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158458318402810, "text": "AND buying him a Gucci belt 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-31T04:23:09", "owner": "enosoles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352094776165075, "text": "Wish it was me id never tell.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T04:10:40", "owner": "voltronlove1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18427922737129784, "text": "Chick's are bribing dudes with designer goods just to sleep with them? I would be happy with them just paying for their half of the meal...", "created_at": "2025-10-31T04:03:54", "owner": "rockandruthless.tyler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985276692910793, "text": "Change the music to some Elliot James  shit and it's a pretty cute video in the first half lol", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:59:41", "owner": "tegnus_em", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878634709419544, "text": "I wana be the victim Tf", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:46:00", "owner": "t3x3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992415954850307, "text": "Yeah this is why no one takes men’s sexual assault serious, everyone thinks it’s cool until it happens to their own children.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:44:28", "owner": "333crossing", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18055285448302859, "text": "This doesn’t count kids a playa,can’t arrest a woman for being shugaa momma that’s sexist. Rumor has it he got the substitute to buy him a Rolex after she was out of the picture.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:31:57", "owner": "michael_martin_foy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902666485282354, "text": "Maybe she just wanted to help him try on his new belt… oh wait 😮", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:28:14", "owner": "thehungrydominican", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104732938555863, "text": "All the men I know are saying he's lucky 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:09:54", "owner": "jayemarie80", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900493600162958, "text": "Dude is an idiot ngl", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:55:49", "owner": "musicforthe_villains", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003741878665336, "text": "Lucky bastard", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:46:26", "owner": "munkysnypa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055527443289458, "text": "Lucky bastard lol", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:25:40", "owner": "xwalkswithghostsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365797168082771, "text": "That’s it lonely, single.. all men. Time to hangout at the teachers parking lot😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:21:14", "owner": "mariophoto__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052441760333016, "text": "Bakit s pinas walang ganyan teacher pa nang aakit hahahah dto wala eh kung meron lng. Yan dto edi sana 10years old palang na susubo na ni mam", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:06:36", "owner": "kinghari06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395812831121692, "text": "how is he a minor though...all Whites are trash😂 so go ahead enjoy ur white trash democracy", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:56:05", "owner": "abhijitbach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024688460761757, "text": "Mate he’s a legend. Anyone that knew that this Happen would be happy for him. He obviously wanted this to happen. He’s a teenager.. we all wanted to get with a teachers if we could, especially if they were hot.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:46:04", "owner": "mrjenkinsbra", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18369784801154523, "text": "I wish I could be a victim. She is so beautiful", "created