er": "jbrucey_1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18085263544945198, "text": "How the fuq…where the fuq.. what the fuq.. just let me die now", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:43:40", "owner": "itsgettinharry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877252252331607, "text": "Y’all fucking suck. I wouldn’t say shit if was cracking one of my teachers", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:35:23", "owner": "double00_san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089187943731042, "text": "Damn it must SUCKKK to be the victim of a new Gucci belt and coochie 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:24:42", "owner": "turnisraeltoglass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336410077226191, "text": "WHY NOT ME", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:20:47", "owner": "jckk.hvn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062088089409241, "text": "It looks like he's in the right age 😁", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:07:17", "owner": "bluecollarcontrapelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056933138633877, "text": "ooo i see now", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:01:57", "owner": "kingjames___001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879972046412324, "text": "Search …\nHome » Sahih al-Bukhari » Wedlock, Marriage (Nikaah) - كتاب النكاح » Hadith 5134\nLanguage:  English  Urdu  اردو  Bangla  বাংলা\nكتاب النكاح67  Wedlock, Marriage (Nikaah)\n(40)Chapter: The marrying of a daughter by her father to a ruler(39)باب تَزْوِيجِ الأَبِ ابْنَتَهُ مِنَ الإِمَامِ\nSahih al-Bukhari 5134\nNarrated `Aisha:\nthat the Prophet (ﷺ) married her when she was six years old and he consummated his marriage when she was nine years old. Hisham said: I have been informed that `Aisha remained with the Prophet (ﷺ) for nine years (i.e. till his death).\nحَدَّثَنَا مُعَلَّى بْنُ أَسَدٍ، حَدَّثَنَا وُهَيْبٌ، عَنْ هِشَامِ بْنِ عُرْوَةَ، عَنْ أَبِيهِ، عَنْ عَائِشَةَ، أَنَّ النَّبِيَّ صلى الله عليه وسلم تَزَوَّجَهَا وَهْىَ بِنْتُ سِتِّ سِنِينَ، وَبَنَى بِهَا وَهْىَ بِنْتُ تِسْعِ سِنِينَ‏.‏ قَالَ هِشَامٌ وَأُنْبِئْتُ أَنَّهَا كَانَتْ عِنْدَهُ تِسْعَ سِنِينَ‏.‏\nReference : Sahih al-Bukhari 5134\nIn-book reference : Book 67, Hadith 70\nUSC-MSA web (English) reference : Vol. 7, Book 62, Hadith 65\n (deprecated numbering scheme)", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:00:57", "owner": "ijobbasavage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081776516474511, "text": "what did she do", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:00:05", "owner": "kingjames___001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983280153873409, "text": "@chrisbodder I have been bc it’s disgusting you’re the reason people get away with this shit… you don’t deserve good in your life if you think literal predators should get away with this", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:58:52", "owner": "gary_benedict_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094217788832546, "text": "There are some seriously disturbed men in here.... Good thing most of them got public profiles so the girls know which ones to avoid", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:57:52", "owner": "toriimonty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059620856213319, "text": "This comment section is wild AF to he honest 😅.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:56:15", "owner": "hallucination055", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18127539898495238, "text": "This clip shows that men and women are not equal to the eyes of the public and there's nothing wrong with that. Men don't feel sorry for the boy, but at the same time if it was a girl same men would bash the teacher, which is understandable. My point is Men and women are not equal", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:51:15", "owner": "shahab_mohseni143", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093770605880844, "text": "I wish my teachers were this awesome in school. 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:50:51", "owner": "sawtoothpaper_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076957909913008, "text": "The comment section is legit the reason why SA against males will never be taken seriously you guys are disgusting", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:46:39", "owner": "gary_benedict_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881688313405009, "text": "I wouldn’t wanna be saved if I was the boy", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:38:38", "owner": "alpha.mike7", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18098734759663953, "text": "Who’s the victim? Shit someone hit the jackpot", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:36:51", "owner": "dvine781", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18015246545796010, "text": "did he get to keep the belt", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:35:42", "owner": "ambershacker", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18143074255437514, "text": "Wow look at all the pedophiles in the comments 💀 Something deeply wrong here. Clearly the child was groomed, this needs to be taken seriously. Unless of course you think pedophilia is cool? Let us all know if your a pedo", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:35:26", "owner": "communitykino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084140888479018, "text": "He used that belt on her after 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:24:37", "owner": "gmo325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847958140565038, "text": "protect our lil boys from these creepy , twerkn we hate & don’t need a Man women ,  stay woke fellas 💯👑", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:23:10", "owner": "mizbulwitdadogs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114092773560397, "text": "Irrespective of how hot she is why would she want to fuck a boy. That's just perverted.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:22:27", "owner": "bear.hahn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100139800734882, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:13:00", "owner": "___scoats86", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988557114729402, "text": "Naw, you see, men will be fine, women need to be cherished and protected. Roles reveresed and it absolutely fucking wrong.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:11:17", "owner": "scholeyworks", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105824905549123, "text": "As a dad I would never want this kind of harm for my son. Jesus Put me in his place!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:06:42", "owner": "isaacg31", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18109967323597662, "text": "Dammit it should've been me", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:58:14", "owner": "bradleyholbrooks06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18333353068228057, "text": "Il pane a chi non ha i denti", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:43:14", "owner": "greidiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928999579110028, "text": "I went willingly sir……", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:37:31", "owner": "lancekohunui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083757911492192, "text": "victim?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:34:32", "owner": "stevnkz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078862391277297, "text": "How sad that some many guys thinking this is ok.  But if it happens to their daughters is not.  I was SA as a kid by a relative and til this day I’m not ok, a grown as man.  If I had the chance believe me I would cut her tits right off with a scalpel.  You don’t touch kids ever. You sick fucks here need to get your wieners cut off as well.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:32:45", "owner": "angel_one_of_a_kind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072395156518090, "text": "Sentence her to service the whole community then. I’m waiting.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:19:49", "owner": "litbritt72", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18382994734176470, "text": "I wish I was a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:16:49", "owner": "heavy_ahh_dih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906326233259321, "text": "A belt, a blow job and a bunk up..... What a harrowing experience for that young man.......", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:12:12", "owner": "matt.fern.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882845617287654, "text": "What? Gucci belt first and then some poom?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:03:27", "owner": "strikingtactics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065228858114657, "text": "So going by the comments boys and men should be glad they have peadophiles assaulting them but if the roles were reversed and it were a male teacher with a female student it would be sexual assault?....yea nah pedos make or female are attracted to children, grown ass men in here attracted to the fact a woman gets off on kids...yea that's not something any of you should be so proud to voice 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:01:21", "owner": "reaper_bubbles", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041311382704188, "text": "Oml bro we see the vlone hoodie ✌️", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:00:57", "owner": "zeebleglip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863223241432875, "text": "Someone needs to abuse me too 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:58:05", "owner": "ken_drick.1855", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857259439541959, "text": "This is a bloody joke. The guy is double the size of the teacher", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:54:38", "owner": "emrsdeaste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064198559621419, "text": "He is a grown man!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:54:23", "owner": "javokhirinatov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078480506155172, "text": "It’s crazy cuz this was 99% of teenage boys dreams ik it was mine.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:48:07", "owner": "ocularartsdevelopment", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052557545320976, "text": "She’s disgusting and deserves what shes going to get in prison from the mommas…if street justice doesn’t fuck her up beforehand….", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:47:37", "owner": "the.exposureproject", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382207057194029, "text": "An ADULT WOMAN is still an adult. A TEENAGER is still a CHILD. The WOMAN IS A PREDATOR. Anyone defending her is crazy. If that was a male teacher with a 15/16 year old girl yall would say a wood chipper or say you'd pull out a gun.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:43:55", "owner": "jess_burns9314", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18084160652068506, "text": "Wow what a p*ssy", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:39:38", "owner": "marshallmatrica", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907086952257786, "text": "Even if he liked it, it's a crime and she can't get away with it.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:38:32", "owner": "stoicve", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069576506585800, "text": "Stopped kid is living a dream!!! Every guy his age would do anything to be in he’s shoes", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:17:55", "owner": "rsfj415", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18139965508446458, "text": "YUUUUUUCK", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:13:07", "owner": "tiika.h", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877616740424044, "text": "it's nice to see equality is being implemented in the western; I won't say the same in Asia, In the Philippines only Male sex predators are getting punished the outrage is insane but when women does it it's just counselling 😒", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:08:33", "owner": "aktionpak77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116809750538147, "text": "These comments are horrifying", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:59:58", "owner": "tapioca._.bubbles", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025574312571091, "text": "The way she’s looking at him, it’s absolutely disgusting", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:37:56", "owner": "b.laura___", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18126175708498604, "text": "Bro get a belt then cry’s rape pussy af", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:35:16", "owner": "jiffreee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100049002734049, "text": "Men men men 🤦‍♂️🤣🤣🤣\n\n Your comments will make us think you never get assaulted", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:34:53", "owner": "____terry_____em", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077490260148642, "text": "Everyone's morals are showing.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:22:07", "owner": "jentyler", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18407281048188252, "text": "A lot of dudes here are a bunch of weirdos", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:19:45", "owner": "ace4dante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107962756612654, "text": "I wonder if the comments would be the same if the victim was a 15 year old girl", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:11:03", "owner": "wateneh_kamau", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073962880980885, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:09:40", "owner": "alexlush86", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18046686653664013, "text": "Lotta weird dudes on here. Flip the script and it’s a girl. Wouldn’t be funny huh?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:09:40", "owner": "rob_clark_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080637602037303, "text": "Lock her up and throw away the key", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:00:40", "owner": "its.sadiax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943826845069974, "text": "It should have been me 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:59:33", "owner": "abhir_aryan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18293860021259557, "text": "Go to hell your evil nonce", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:36:00"