. Bro knew what a Gucci belt was.. 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:10:38", "owner": "theblackmustardseedclan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076050389274898, "text": "Don’t seem likes he’s a victim je aint against his will", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:08:45", "owner": "damino2004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887585641381395, "text": "He's lucky as*hol*", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:08:11", "owner": "ibalocha_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015314705797442, "text": "I just love this comment section", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:06:29", "owner": "kanstantsin_karpovich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860562226458714, "text": "Always a white !!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:01:16", "owner": "priyam_rajawat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101168143732290, "text": "@onlrihannaforberr wasn't too hard when he was getting free stuff and bottoming out the lady.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:55:52", "owner": "krspykream_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168192292333080, "text": "If only... maybe I would've stayed in school. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:51:17", "owner": "anarchist1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090616357907001, "text": "i woulda", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:51:14", "owner": "_badlarry_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851147431576087, "text": "I don’t know what these teachers are thinking nowadays. It’s truly disgusting 🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:46:54", "owner": "freshteh_rohyeha", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080822507325178, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:40:33", "owner": "honeypackgeorge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089658538922681, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:32:30", "owner": "me.lol.no", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144899077434537, "text": "Yall rather push a trans agenda than have men being real men.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:31:32", "owner": "andres66489", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923282842176971, "text": "She’s hot. He’s not a victim. He a grown ass man. Look at him.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:31:01", "owner": "andres66489", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098238103706172, "text": "Wish I was her victim", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:26:52", "owner": "andres66489", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995904168848439, "text": "My teacher put my desk in the hallway", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:25:01", "owner": "ace16_29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898076677324780, "text": "Is the victim in the video orrr???", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:22:57", "owner": "_jaleell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163554253379966, "text": "This is why males don’t talk when something’s wrong! If this was a female y’all would’ve screamed on our ears now", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:18:20", "owner": "fundi_mlotshwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105572827719824, "text": "This is happening everywhere, not just here in the United States. I swear if that happened to any of my kids when they were in school, she would have two black eyes, and a fat lip", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:18:09", "owner": "melimel_37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902949634279840, "text": "Poor child 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:09:31", "owner": "ms_mitchygold", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080087585120924, "text": "I think he was a victim but also accomplice in the way that the first time he was the victim anything after that he had Stockholm if that makes sense", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:58:50", "owner": "bobodesall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868616311465540, "text": "Stfu with this nonsense. Any age guy who smashes is not being manipulated or raped. He's doing work like nature designed him to.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:55:40", "owner": "tomas_elnumerouno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101231854655694, "text": "Just keep your mouth shut 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:51:05", "owner": "filthyfishh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909382249252123, "text": "Comment section 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:45:07", "owner": "_shivamroy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348862291205948, "text": "I’ll keep my mouth shut, you don’t even have to buy me a Gucci belt 😜", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:19:29", "owner": "mrburnett", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055061639642131, "text": "This kid is going to be the most popular guy in school.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:19:23", "owner": "doktor_weed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100184869679880, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:59:32", "owner": "mm509inq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082104554054548, "text": "Wtf shit that never happens to me all my teachers were 70yrs old😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:58:08", "owner": "freddypikoso_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857040109487157, "text": "Take me back to high school please these teachers crazyyyy", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:57:34", "owner": "brody188", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903207565145976, "text": "So what is this innocent lady being falsely accused of?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:37:33", "owner": "good.guymario", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096493525789379, "text": "\"Hi I are 6 year old little boy AnD I  wiv alone and very very lonely again \" 😆😆😆😆😆 shid hopefully she replies guys!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:36:16", "owner": "blaq_elivis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990225714857288, "text": "It should have been me not him it's not fair", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:31:38", "owner": "rizwan_mbv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894519889204936, "text": "🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:31:32", "owner": "henrycavill__4ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062898224161829, "text": "Take that music off lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:31:21", "owner": "ray_nixtamal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131965051480809, "text": "And a Gucci belt ?! Some people get all the luck …….", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:31:11", "owner": "ray_nixtamal", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17985688031879707, "text": "Bro! Who tried to save him! Whoooo???? Gucci belt and flat later???? Chosen one fr!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:17:32", "owner": "prithvi.2509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949193956049584, "text": "Talk about Teacher,student, she's also super good-looking, bro really hit the lottery", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:02:16", "owner": "username0.000001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298614667255196, "text": "Bro got the childhood dream 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:57:46", "owner": "username0.000001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127452214496227, "text": "Never had teachers like that in my day… #gutted", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:52:59", "owner": "charlie_partis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942497767066550, "text": "What about police use their ressource to catch real criminals such as nigga rapist", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:45:40", "owner": "gaetanklbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086277038486339, "text": "Take meeee", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:45:03", "owner": "hamzza2502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117615169539442, "text": "The only being a victim every men want aye? 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:43:20", "owner": "hsadul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090407590916494, "text": "I would have banged a few of my teacher's", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:40:00", "owner": "drewcifer101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071207921018042, "text": "Absolutely ridiculous to arrest her!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:37:58", "owner": "v_beast81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102004393655295, "text": "Wtf lol", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:28:45", "owner": "neuro2slithery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125171725447320, "text": "Did he get to keep the belt atleast?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:23:23", "owner": "aaron.c.kellogg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111147448571027, "text": "Smfh boy fumbled one of his greatest blessings 😢😢🤦‍♂️🤦‍♂️🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:17:33", "owner": "sscaarrff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097006570759029, "text": "tf is a flat", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:16:02", "owner": "dennisonnchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079529299884062, "text": "That was my school boy fantasy. She chose the wrong young man.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:05:43", "owner": "fbvdiopyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095249959693391, "text": "The only crime is the Gucci belt...", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:03:52", "owner": "noobiebooh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051916949650226, "text": "Anyone know her @??", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:52:41", "owner": "louellabrk", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18042059078694968, "text": "These comment sad", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:49:53", "owner": "stephanidara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075493055133918, "text": "Ooof Sugar mommy 😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:40:53", "owner": "abandonedsoul77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408977287141698, "text": "Bro was winning in so many ways", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:40:46", "owner": "turabzaidi__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18098341129688324, "text": "Shit I’d let her do whatever she wanted, good time and I’d get a free A 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:38:06", "owner": "kensalaga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094835026831065, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:08:35", "owner": "anil.pani", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069251204584196, "text": "I wanna be the victim @eshilston", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:05:24", "owner": "daddy_cuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180815101357001, "text": "She’s hot!!!🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:47:41", "owner": "marmara_clinic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859583584534574, "text": "Maybe they were inlove", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:31:47", "owner": "therealmonicagh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020851286784803, "text": "What's the crime. Being the luckiest kid alive.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:28:51", "owner": "xscotttty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101344309640767, "text": "How sick are these comments? Are you disturbed, you pedophile, mentally ill bastards? I'm reporting you all.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:50:37", "owner": "melis_guerkan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966901530971875, "text": "No it her fault we all wanted that", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:43:02", "owner": "turtlenecklaggos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945963897930963, "text": "Where was she when I was still in school?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:41:39", "owner": "argon_828", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970257459957493, "text": "Why couldn’t it be me bro", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:34:03", "owner": "oscargonz_guts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18350113738167944, "text": "How tf are some men joking about this? A child was groomed and sexually abused..", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:19:56", "owner": "fatimaanadeemm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855652201555573, "text": "If that was my son she better pray the cops get to her before I do, cause she won’t be that pretty afterwards…", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:19:19", "owner": "draven_blackstone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988723653730272, "text": "i wish..", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:01:18", "owner": "dr.finity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096082459748280, "text": "This comment section is full of the nastiest, laziest, dumbest, weirdest, most depraved reddit and discord mods I've ever seen.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:55:39", "owner": "notdestroihooman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913644424228947, "text": "You pretty much have a full ride to college if u don’t say nun", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:55:19", "owner": "decayingtwice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915054679212565, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:40:30", "owner": "hloni_dotque888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084011588303620, "text": "Getting groomed for a belt is crazy", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:25:50", "owner": "____jjeenneefeerr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055911299291318, "text": "I want a belt 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:07:13", "owner": "bingy._.stingy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081798494022178, "text": "Poor sub lost his Mistress 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:04:53", "owner": "master.umer_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068735258521814, "text": "What?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:03:06", "owner": "mareolulo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080521505025323, "text": "Nobody was sexually Assaulted lol", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:59:28", "owner": "bradley.brandt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190891147327970, "text": "🧐🧐 how the fk did he fk up soooo badly", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:39:12", "owner": "big.steven.lees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064859438615591, "text": "death penalty 🫶🏽", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:36:37", "owner": "n.sea00", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17995685540841811, "text": "Look at the courtesy they give her with informing her she doesn’t need to say anything not to inflict more damage. Fuck her and her predatory ways, let her speak in front of body cam and make shit up. Let her dig a deeper hole for herself", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:31:04", "owner": "nyckasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071238566262443, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:25:42", "owner": "arjun_ari7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129287815495121, "text": "Even when they lie about their age you’re still an adult and should use  the head on your shoulders.. men are still held accountable for underage girls when they lie so this is no different..", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:24:43", "owner": "shy_t30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145331392426433, "text": "This is a CHILD. Anyone who is saying he is anything other than a victim needs therapy and maybe a jail sentence.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:53:12", "owner": "nofacelesswaist", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18033588869514964, "text": "It's not predatory if the prey is so willing.. like 90% of us are.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:43:41", "owner": "pereldaroquen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047788073392709, "text": "Well well well 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:32:44", "owner": "amjadkhanniazi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049203515655397, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:18:22", "owner": "championdi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17863173135502543, "text": "aight who snitched 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:13:22", "owner": "traxhigh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867172408470874, "text": "Bro was doin it the rightt way tho 😭💯", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:03:32", "owner": "pbratcher33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093869629831902, "text": "Yea its bad but like.... come onnnn😭🤧", "created_at": "2025-10-30T04:43:27", "owner": "mor0rless.alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101388385642970, "text": "Wish I had a teacher like that back in High School - Would be a Dream", "created_at": "2025-10-30T04:30:07", "owner": "aarongraysondorseth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061585202182214, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T04:12:06", "owner": "greff_helas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096547807774257, "text": "YOOOO WTF 🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-30T04:00:35", "owner": "angelicanevarez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894749269200351, "text": "Wait what?  Who complained?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:47:53", "owner": "teampagaling.boxing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060435698403903, "text": "Dude this is every boys dream to hook up with his hot teacher. Why is such a big crime. I remember all my friends trying to hook up with one of our teachers an EX Russian porn star lol. And our young hot science teacher that had an amazing backside. And she always wore the tightest pants to have all of us teens drool while she was writing on the chalkboard", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:46:38", "owner": "badboy_morales08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870575572452235, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:21:17", "owner": "liltodepressed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090460015911356, "text": "Shit get me a teacher like this", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:15:38", "owner": "wtf.ddaksh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937919451964713, "text": "Where was these teachers when I went to school fml I would ask for a PS5 at least", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:10:20", "owner": "eddie01090", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083084860993295, "text": "He ain’t a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:02:31", "owner": "badbendvr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18538247509002940, "text": "his dad probs snitched cause he was jealous 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:59:46", "owner": "ruatokit", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081215270044361, "text": "And the grooming gangs who are abusing young girls? Why is that being ignored?!!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:50:56", "owner": "selenapet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097811458753897, "text": "Free her fk free her now", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:30:34", "owner": "hope098