10148328581973, "text": "@through.gothic_eyes be interesting to see what the lad thinks about it", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:39:24", "owner": "elliotwilkes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362361367094306, "text": "The nerve on this teacher! Which school is this btw? I'm asking for my future son", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:24:31", "owner": "hmv__96", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17941036380075295, "text": "Why am I not surprised by the comments XD", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:22:22", "owner": "senin_myrza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898250293325429, "text": "Judge: Mr. victim share what you think of what happened that day.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:20:48", "owner": "adrien.aro", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18190560091333422, "text": "For her I’d be okay with being the victim 😭🤝", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:15:24", "owner": "hostile.donut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061651832175033, "text": "These dudes that are “victims” are pathetic as shit. All teachers would be safe with me.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:41:22", "owner": "tex_tht_travels", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084073798961802, "text": "Should have been me mxm", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:40:40", "owner": "hakim.tt._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095763295701860, "text": "He is such a “victim” got Gucci bought for him before he was driven around and plowed. They make movies abt that", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:37:15", "owner": "mick58o", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18097990624779284, "text": "Damn tap me in bronem", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:29:02", "owner": "leee.ohhh_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090296608898697, "text": "He's prolly down for that 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:51:54", "owner": "mob.fezco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944153842061959, "text": "Why can't this happen to me when I was in high school why why couldn't this happen to me when I was in high school why", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:40:14", "owner": "blackmeat4u2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106411219541706, "text": "Sad to see all the desperate Simps in the comments defend