733805, "text": "what kind of teacher can afford gucci?", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:53:00", "owner": "gr0liveira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054488174305893, "text": "Victim !!!!..... Really....", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:29:35", "owner": "ykr_frames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897556591181064, "text": "She was so happy when she bought the belt. That's love 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:06:41", "owner": "_lolli_dope_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18110562046502377, "text": "Nigga really bought a belt instead of NVIDIA Graphics Card ts pissing me off", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:01:50", "owner": "grown_child_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17864506548495142, "text": "I would of loved to have nailed my teacher when i was his age! Bro is a hero not victim 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:45:35", "owner": "da14ton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952376353041120, "text": "Amount of men unable to make the difference between reality and fantasy. 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:41:36", "owner": "herraloihtua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097658125741350, "text": "Put the putrid woman down like the animal she is 🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:39:01", "owner": "hentyreece", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076192175173785, "text": "Who’s gonna regret being the victim in tha case 🙂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:11:08", "owner": "aliooo_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870045685454792, "text": "Why wasn’t my teacher like this 😭😭😭. I mean I was homeschooled but still….Never once got a gucci belt from my mom 🤨", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:56:19", "owner": "daniel_lynchjr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929003647113344, "text": "Those safe spaces aren't always safe!", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:49:44", "owner": "tracesoftarina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081610682041846, "text": "Where the fuck was these teachers when I went school ffs 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:42:10", "owner": "peterwalker8386", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117500908533445, "text": "So just to be absolutely clear. British police will come arrest this woman but