03331094244, "text": "Definitely gay,  that's everyone's dream. If my son complains to me about that, I will kick him out of the house 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:50:22", "owner": "bogdanalexandru2391", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863850496491054, "text": "By the law, over 14 years is not crime. (Idk the age of the boy in the video btw)", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:45:42", "owner": "lucianonunes99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117474142539568, "text": "Why wasn’t I ever victimized by my hot teacher?", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:32:24", "owner": "elchinolatinoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903151444274550, "text": "@_nickangove24_ if a man did this with your daughter you'd be livid.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:30:09", "owner": "andwut_805", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001026734674121, "text": "I’m looking for a teacher my dm is open 🐱🥰", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:28:24", "owner": "jay_don44s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867852886466602, "text": "What sort of victim 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:23:46", "owner": "ikky_0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902880529143361, "text": "Poor bot 🥲🥲 (hell no)", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:17:08", "owner": "5an7_lau75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912745831216586, "text": "He ain't no victim", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:10:12", "owner": "pngbubbet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101177146641619, "text": "I don’t know how to think on this …. I don’t want a grown up woman to exploit my son but I had been fantasizing about being exploited by a Milf when I was 16 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:08:27", "owner": "gokturktopuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074134841244076, "text": "SMH should of got a ps5", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:03:18", "owner": "lentoh2.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041140886487515, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:01:00", "owner": "as18705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842182189607365, "text": "See how the comments turn on the guy, reverse it and see how they would absolutely destroy a man for buying gucci for a young girl. Wack society", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:59:31", "owner": "_jensdb_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099545713736863, "text": "“My steak is too juicy! My lobster is too buttery!”", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:56:29", "owner": "up.yours.man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055245380296426, "text": "No one else is concerned about the rise of female pedophiles in the last handful of years? Seems like the lax view point of sexualizing children by the lgbtq community and the forced acceptance of this community has made quite the wave for predators and pedophiles 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:51:09", "owner": "illusivelyexclusive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860025352459341, "text": "Every actual male teens dream is to be with a teacher usually uglier than her 😂😂. Dude lived every teenagers dream? And a Gucci belt?", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:49:01", "owner": "shmike25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363445237092518, "text": "Y can't people mind their own business ! Both are happy 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:47:01", "owner": "king_khan_lerealtor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105567286717787, "text": "Poor kid. Horrible 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:41:21", "owner": "jack_b_nimble.45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092689315874346, "text": "🤦🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:40:07", "owner": "kuttd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542298850000782, "text": "This should have been me 😑😭💔", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:38:06", "owner": "davidxx840", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003729908815579, "text": "Soft ahhh kids smfh", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:36:59", "owner": "tierrero_714", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095860966693915, "text": "Wtf are those comments bloody hell", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:36:56", "owner": "jaymnesie", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17894474835345045, "text": "Damn. She got 500-600 to blow on JUST ONE BELT 😭😭😭 must be nice.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:28:30", "owner": "dj_vargas89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937435951094522, "text": "‘Victim’? 💀 this is ridiculous, there are actual paedophilic predators out there but the police choose to go after a woman with a guy who can beard", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:23:46", "owner": "j2o_o2j", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18077403284132659, "text": "Lmfaooooo", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:22:58", "owner": "slpapi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064941113103648, "text": "Some bros are drowning while other bros are dying of thirst", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:16:40", "owner": "zander_radley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984512256910324, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:15:08", "owner": "cheezitthin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042966107467543, "text": "I want to be a Victim too", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:14:57", "owner": "kompaa_javivi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329965168239106, "text": "Yall saying he isn’t a victim cus he knew what he was getting into. Ofc he did, so do girls that go for older guys, still doesn’t change that it’s wrong and weird. Whether he knew or not. Reverse the roles and you’ll be asking for the guys name, address and social security number. It’s just as weird for a female doing this to a boy as it is for a male to be doing this to a girl. Just cus they’re different genders doesn’t mean either don’t know what they’re doing. Yes they’re children. Yes most of the time they definitely know what they’re doing. Any 13-15 year old boy OR girl more than likely understand what sex is and what they’re doing when getting into these situations and it’s on the adult to not entertain it or do anything with them because THEYRE A CHILD, so yes she is a pedo, yes she deserves the time and this is what happens. Don’t try put some double standards on it just cus u wanted to be in this situation as a kid fucking ur teacher. Cus the moment it’s a girl fucking her teacher it’s the end of the world so keep that same energy when the genders are reversed. Y’all just outing urselves as weirdos.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:00:43", "owner": "imureviltwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059467109198796, "text": "Bullshit, that one is not a kid, he knew what he was going into, the real predators are ruling your country, making laws and controlling the money. Those you don't expose nor punish.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:00:36", "owner": "nacho_sarmiento_1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082449776065765, "text": "Free her!!! He ain’t a victim he knows exactly what he did", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:57:43", "owner": "miss.acevedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110318377573065, "text": "It's crazy how the comments would be in a different universe if the genders were flipped", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:54:34", "owner": "toastystrudle", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18032717765724320, "text": "The dude is a legend with his school peers and coaches.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:50:43", "owner": "dradacu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859664452531334, "text": "If I ever needed proof that's I was not an attractive teen here it is ha", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:47:43", "owner": "mrfuzzywuzzywas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929937492996664, "text": "So he was comfortable with her buying him stuff but when it came to the goods, he’s a victim?!", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:34:27", "owner": "wyattwaynerisner", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071563757018151, "text": "Im sorry but doing this won't be a victim.💀🐱", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:33:15", "owner": "anchit_c", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048902549364477, "text": "I don't know why I'm feeling bad for the boy... Like he was having the best of his life", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:28:34", "owner": "zzainhsn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071006057005539, "text": "Bro was enjoying that shi😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:15:34", "owner": "vieiraandres917", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052099646647986, "text": "What's the age of consent, 18?", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:09:39", "owner": "ziggesigge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876885691333492, "text": "Hate old lady’s getting with young guys it’s well rude and disrespectful 😢😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T12:51:48", "owner": "brisbanes_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940834918094749,