e jealous 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:56:20", "owner": "isabelnadella", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18345376204163690, "text": "If it was a 15-year-old girl, people would react differently. But let’s be real, boys and girls aren’t the same. Do you know how much raging hormones a 15-year-old boy has? Most of them would jump at the chance to be with an attractive woman like Rebecca, especially if she’s buying him Gucci. What she did wasn’t right, but trust me, this boy isn’t a victim.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:55:24", "owner": "hussel_1st", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079857740105985, "text": "He’s not a victim ffs presents and 🐱what a lad", "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:53:00", "owner": "saulewens", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097690981682427, "text": "Brotha got good taste", "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:30:50", "owner": "johnni3_blaz3", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080883971059430, "text": "The comment section is fucking disturbing!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:28:38", "owner": "ludzellenberg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073821302179815, "text": "People who say he’s not a victim are weird. You think 16 year olds are old enough to consent? If it was a middle school girl and her teacher took her out to dinner first would you say it was a “date” or grooming?", "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:03:06", "owner": "crossfaded.mp3", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082904347959690, "text": "Bro he’s getting pussy and a Gucci belt, how tf is he a victim??", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:36:40", "owner": "luke.ortiz21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183003118341800, "text": "If I were him I’d swear it never happened", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:34:37", "owner": "spencer_swagner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311002366223074, "text": "🥷🏿 knew exactly what he was doing this is ridiculous", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:30:42", "owner": "fenrix15", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17871397794370583, "text": "WTF is the BS...get the fk out of here. He gave consent let it happen", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:27:37", "owner": "rtlm007", "like