ven worse because the authority dynamic", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:06:50", "owner": "eclectictwit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905781679256975, "text": "I understand the jokes from men, but we're watching evidence of a p3d0, so maybe show youre smart enough to know this isnt a good look. Especially in today's times, these kids aren't able to push through like back then so it'll impact most worse than others. Just kinda sad guys think like thaf cuz then that also excuses women from accountability", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:06:41", "owner": "respectfully.ignorant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025088984766595, "text": "Who the victim 🤦‍♂️wish it was me", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:02:09", "owner": "spliff_fflips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896347519339772, "text": "Bro’s in high school", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:55:21", "owner": "lovefamily11143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532331671002385, "text": "Bro not a victim😭", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:53:25", "owner": "knwn.cbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862316848506508, "text": "This comment section is absolutely disgusting", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:44:50", "owner": "luciaqnofhearts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990254154849478, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:38:36", "owner": "eat_a_fat_one_bish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052770443313323, "text": "Bros living", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:38:06", "owner": "ogrich105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903226069274050, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:33:09", "owner": "erlirrafmani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285334411274534, "text": "that guy is dum* asf", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:28:37", "owner": "gypsysaurus_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888671065242889, "text": "Bro just couldn't keep it to himself", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:23:13", "owner": "thanatoskingofdeath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156227839400567, "text": "Deffo a jealous class mate", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:01:55", "owner": "jadia_.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046412156416153, "text": "If a man ever says men are victi