d to anyone that we trust children to make life altering decisions to their body, but don't trust them when they decide they want to have sex?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:16:31", "owner": "jeffilson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982484247912078, "text": "🤦‍♂️🤦‍♂️🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:13:51", "owner": "ellzz0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093395860884113, "text": "These comments highlight the issue with men's sexual assault. If these genders were swapped you'd be calling the teacher all the names under the sun", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:12:24", "owner": "_nate_clarke_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089035147918575, "text": "Pucci and gucci!! Bro's a winner 🏆", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:10:38", "owner": "avi001.exe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985580349906920, "text": "Crazy how alot of you mafuckas switch up on roles.. either way this bitch couldn't get a of age guy..", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:10:25", "owner": "la_verdez71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966965541973066, "text": "@rohail07 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:06:19", "owner": "altamash2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904003498270376, "text": "Lucky lil shit....should of kept his gob shut. Living every lads dream 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:00:45", "owner": "pelldavid86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036057614509839, "text": "Break the punk rock B itch", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:53:22", "owner": "randybmendoza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906154576257374, "text": "“When women talk about being groomed as teenagers and how it negatively effected them”\nMen: yeah well it happens to boys too! \n“When it happens to boys”\nMen: He isn’t a victim he liked it😏\n🙃🙃", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:50:25", "owner": "jazminevalco", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18025386167563412, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:47:53", "owner": "ilqarasad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073776658946659, "text": "Why is it always female teachers doing weird shi like this more than male teachers? Weirdos", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:41:26", "owner": "d