ikekonyou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072848029977792, "text": "Should've been me", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:12:41", "owner": "anixhkhanna", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18004792088805629, "text": "Why society is mentally insane 101 complete collection right here in the comments section boys", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:01:04", "owner": "davey_sans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892547683357000, "text": "Where do we find this kind of teachers😭😭 why not me😭", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:54:19", "owner": "deadusernametaken", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18034417430709047, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:53:07", "owner": "pablotheplugbestfriend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073782542336748, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:39:10", "owner": "danny_boy902", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18139051375444665, "text": "Parental issues", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:34:49", "owner": "arshaque_aboo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842945647600146, "text": "He’s not a child. He’s a grown ass boy who unsurprisingly loves having sex with an insatiable cougar. How did judges keep a straight face with these cases?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:33:34", "owner": "anitasteward87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080413478088156, "text": "Such disgusting face expressions.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:27:22", "owner": "pqmebuscas_p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104864344625322, "text": "Thats not a kid.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:26:15", "owner": "johnarceepo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102664204648328, "text": "No one is confused by a teacher that can afford Gucci clothing? There’s more to the story 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:25:09", "owner": "crazyviking017", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080285423018322, "text": "Release her immediately. He's a legend", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:23:41", "owner": "mustardpat25", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059185415562298, "text": "Lil nigga don’t look like no victim ta me 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:20:18", "owner": "1ltez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100526014588764, "text": "Disgusting comment section", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:18:49", "owner": "_zuljalal", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18153878323405208, "text": "🐱 and Gucci", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:14:46", "owner": "omm0215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915532804209393, "text": "…", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:02:16", "owner": "dskrojo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532537042030280, "text": "Another case of the lobster being too buttery", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:53:00", "owner": "niallsmith_4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046350677391242, "text": "Very disgusting and it proves daily that all western women belong to the street and they're bitches", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:52:57", "owner": "esraamds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102902479632491, "text": "😂The issue is, we're tryna but both sex's in the same bracket. Like what happened here wouldn't exactly be welcomed if the roles were reversed. Men and women are not the same, as much as we strive for equality in that regard. Most young teens(male) dream of experiencing what this young man has, myself included. Even some girls feel the same way. But we should distinguish whether there's a level of duress. Boy seems comfortable as wrong as it is.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:51:36", "owner": "hikari.nanashi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977526063941096, "text": "Men who see sexual encounters with female teachers as “lucky” often feel little or no immediate distress because they’ve been conditioned to equate sex with status and validation. This belief can mask the power imbalance and suppress feelings of violation. While it may seem less damaging at first, research shows that unacknowledged abuse often leads to long-term emotional issues like guilt, confusion, depression, and relationship problems, once the person gains more maturity or perspective.\n\nThis could happen years after the incident. The harm isn’t necessarily less; it’s just buried, delayed, and socially reinforced.\n\nHe might have been \"lucky\" in the short term but when he realizes how little power and control he really has over his own body when the teacher was using it, it'll fuck his head up.\n\nSomeone will call me gay for pointing this out. It's called psychology.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:45:11", "owner": "alek_daniels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062569265149966, "text": "She may be putting her whole salary for a month or 2 to buy a Gucci belt for this lucky mf and some jealous mf ratted", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:39:39", "owner": "shaheer143rs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093429814835413, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:38:00", "owner": "williamxharris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287329255262892, "text": "That jealous madurfuker snitched 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:36:51", "owner": "shaheer143rs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143173765376409, "text": "Damn where were these teachers when I went to school?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:26:39", "owner": "ja_1pg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094036246875155, "text": "Oh the horror.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:22:26", "owner": "g_padre11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161668621349673, "text": "I would've kept my mouth closed 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:20:14", "owner": "gucci2timess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941206324070044, "text": "Damm", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:13:05", "owner": "sledgar.tha.illeagle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030168077530438, "text": "By the Way all the men responding are Conservatives that Love to talk to M*nors.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:03:34", "owner": "ghostshrine.chris", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18297984037267162, "text": "Please kidnap us @kevtomm", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:54:31", "owner": "abryanj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096358327793870, "text": "As a female I found her disturbing and disgusting but these men in the comments make it seem as if it was a fun thing to be done to a child!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:51:22", "owner": "ibtissam_eer_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18073827098265346, "text": "I don't see a victim here, I see a young lucky man", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:32:37", "owner": "mahmoudelirakivelardi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345070432205856, "text": "Some of these comments are spot on👏", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:31:59", "owner": "levi5ter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087885991915743, "text": "“Predator” 😂 gtfoh", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:30:12", "owner": "timekeeper_wayne", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072855533247349, "text": "No evidence why she is arrested? Thats only a video buying him a belt. No sexual abuse on video.🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:29:06", "owner": "nicoso992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167670583336366, "text": "Bro is a victor", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:25:28", "owner": "ben.farsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023038244781112, "text": "Usual suspects", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:24:23", "owner": "bcole59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976123371933375, "text": "@unmasking_toxicity bro ninakkonnm parayanille. You gender specific cree p", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:23:48", "owner": "bravo_echo_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917436526195771, "text": "bro wat😭", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:20:53", "owner": "kennyswrld_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084827116971522, "text": "Meanwhile, if she was an arab man, the police would have given her a pat on the back and arrested the victim.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:07:14", "owner": "bschlic1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075304804925973, "text": "All the men in the comments saying sexual assault and rape is fine 🤢🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:04:39", "owner": "fabiansversion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097538905689310, "text": "Teachers can’t afford that 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:02:09", "owner": "doohaa_1246", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18510199051066641, "text": "Overbragging probably", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:00:29", "owner": "saucybonkyboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540269626018408, "text": "I bet it was the employee that snitched 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:59:40", "owner": "found8waldo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076652390515068, "text": "notice the difference in comments ? imagi