ed_at": "2025-10-22T23:16:32", "owner": "capwillards", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074905970142621, "text": "Call me sick, but bro is living my fantasy I had throughout fuckin high school", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:16:11", "owner": "leig_alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005674958811698, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:11:58", "owner": "doom.guy.95", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981314520920088, "text": "Why didn’t this happen to me in school bro 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:09:50", "owner": "eddy4.200", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18423949117106728, "text": "Donny fuckin Berger", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:06:08", "owner": "sallenmatty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842603980602659, "text": "Idiotic case…", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:54:42", "owner": "michalgrabiarz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072292565221696, "text": "Soooooo 🤣💀", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:49:23", "owner": "kiidfreddo1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946423495052194, "text": "He's lucky 🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:38:38", "owner": "silver_2kk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035451146711420, "text": "Dude looks like hes 20 in this clip", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:38:35", "owner": "bradla2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048180494670919, "text": "Kids cannot consent, there are too many pedos getting comfortable in this comment section.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:29:51", "owner": "panic.at.his.disco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926576188138266, "text": "Sexual predator🤦‍♂️this dude is full grown man wtf", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:26:35", "owner": "jimhembree52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943745623074439, "text": "Man, how much are teachers getting paid over there? He got Gucci and coochie in a flat.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:46:43", "owner": "iamsilverbacksam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102188761727752, "text": "these sexual predators are what we need more😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:42:39", "owner": "dr.milad_ahmadi74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137887174454106, "text": "A GUCCI BELT???????", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:41:25", "owner": "mandelanotnelson", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024707228759844, "text": "At his age he is too young to consent because he doesnt know any better but can be tried as an adult for any other crime he may commit.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:39:59", "owner": "evoke_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975874299940852, "text": "Why this shit not happen to me", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:39:23", "owner": "koby1._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870536965378603, "text": "The comments are WILD. If it was reversed and someone's daughter, this comment section would be totally different. Young boys need protection from predators too- no matter what.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:37:49", "owner": "iseeuad", "likes": 180}, {"id": 18069877934343963, "text": "I guarantee you that the people supporting child rape in the comments are also the people who say the law doesn’t apply equally to men and women and complain about mental health issues for men and boys.\nYOU are literally the problem when you’re saying child abuse and grooming is fine as long as it’s a woman doing it.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:33:39", "owner": "spooklear.radiation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120529402514191, "text": "All the comments literally defending sexual activity with a child.\nYou all need putting on a list.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:29:21", "owner": "spooklear.radiation", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18090704281924564, "text": "Where was this when I was in highschool", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:28:55", "owner": "itsb_ryan.r", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18007484819803844, "text": "Bunch of pedo lovers in this chat 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:26:58", "owner": "toxin_av", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957815440006952, "text": "There's no father in this world that wouldn't be low-key proud of his son in this situation.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:26:35", "owner": "h_nedd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17904521979339409, "text": "In reality the issue is society itself. He clearly was bought into doing this for a damn designer belt