n ass men, men with marriage photos in thier pfp,  commenting about how jealous they are, fantasising  about how cool it is that a MINOR got raped.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:21:38", "owner": "moorishfig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425043094107302, "text": "Retarded", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:14:41", "owner": "means_of_momentum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929551978128194, "text": "I think it doesn’t work that way with grown a!? Man", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:14:03", "owner": "z3m_n0i53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885497317386924, "text": "Social media dividing us every second. Go outside, get off your phone", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:12:03", "owner": "streightfishin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058280984241458, "text": "PUTA", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:10:49", "owner": "samuelmedellin956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881962966402964, "text": "WHORE", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:10:46", "owner": "samuelmedellin956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081534323021099, "text": "she a cock sucker", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:10:37", "owner": "samuelmedellin956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180647833349266, "text": "yall creeps in the comments ong", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:10:20", "owner": "moorishfig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534885793003759, "text": "Omdsss the comments 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:06:09", "owner": "sherrifdeen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894139780202216, "text": "F that 💩I need a new Gucci belt too Becca ☺️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:05:42", "owner": "modellingbehaviour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090244912853777, "text": "HOLY SHIT SHE A 10, ID LET HER MOLEST ME ALL DAY", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:49:15", "owner": "nigawattt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042107435475604, "text": "Fuck they mean victim lmao", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:47:55", "owner": "sapsicle_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017286212789019, "text": "u lot say men’s problems aren’t taken seriously and now here are the men in the comments dismissing her disgusting behaviour 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19