": 17912663175217151, "text": "Hi I'd like to be a victim. I'm a size M. 34 waist.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:44:40", "owner": "vibekingr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982891743863983, "text": "Imagine being arrested for giving a boy his make a wish", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:42:32", "owner": "j_noz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160407871386770, "text": "Bros suffering from success 😔😔😔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:41:40", "owner": "pokershrooms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053744534310172, "text": "Where’s the women kicking off about how disgusting she is and how men need protecting against these monsters..", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:36:59", "owner": "kurteusmaximus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053987603309329, "text": "Damnit, where were all these sexed-up teachers when I was a kid? ………….. Nice 👌", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:29:55", "owner": "hampshire_simon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889528234363667, "text": "If men and boys don’t feel like victims, don’t victimize them. Unless it’s some creepy old guy.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:24:34", "owner": "cybildrah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18028702196755818, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:15:53", "owner": "liljhonnydoubleo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125519818499304, "text": "Imagine how gay you have to be to snitch. I would’ve taken that shit to the grave as a 14 year old 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:14:43", "owner": "mrocksyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057894599551346, "text": "bro is not a victim he literally knew what he was getting into #freeher", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:14:02", "owner": "fabbmartinezs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18313251904221775, "text": "They calling that 6ft behemoth \"a child\". I can't take the justice system seriously 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:11:39", "owner": "somehandsmike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026222489764150, "text": "Bunda becky", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:07:40", "owner": "walton__88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897457849322023, "text": "In July 2024, paedophile teacher Rebecca Joynes who groomed two teenage boys was sentenced to six and a half years in prison. \nWhile on bail for having sexual activity with a boy, known as Boy A, Joynes engaged in sexual activity with another boy, Boy B, and fell pregnant. \nNow, Boy B has said in his impact statement that he understands the “full extent of the abuse carried out on me” and was “coerced and controlled” when Joynes groomed him. \nNow, Boy B has said he has found it difficult to find support as a young male victim of grooming and sexual abuse, and that he feels had the victim been female and the perpetrator male, the crime would have been dealt with differently and more support would have been available.\nBoy B went on to say “Ultimately, I will forever be Rebecca’s victim and forever linked to her through our child.”\nRebecca Joynes and Boy B’s child was born in early 2024, however the baby was taken from her within 24 hours. Joynes now has limited contact with the child; Boy B said: “The most innocent victim is our child, and I’ve come to realise how important my role is in ensuring they are supported by love. I understand the difficulty and impact this will have on my child.”", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:59:31", "owner": "detailed_detailing_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18101444257641506, "text": "Bro clearly had haters cause WTF how you fumble the bag", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:58:53", "owner": "christianmartinez7429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113758762558335, "text": "Bro told that one hater who wanted it to be him and he felt salty so he exposed them🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:57:16", "owner": "onegee1996", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084320999071007, "text": "The comments liking this are disgusting", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:45:17", "owner": "eduardo.almeida98", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17883326535400567, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:43:35", "owner": "robertbuc_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18376531342179115, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:36:18", "owner": "aisforalxndr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096020653783275, "text": "Yo this dude ain’t a fuckin victim he a city boy", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:30:02", "owner": "rp01101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993875358846846, "text": "Yeah I’m sure he’s “devastated” as a “victim” I’m sure he’s screaming and fighting in vain with all the pain and displeasure when she’s boinking him.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:25:59", "owner": "givesyounguyens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102018289648827, "text": "Judging by the comments from the usual suspects, a lot of hard drives need checking !!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:23:12", "owner": "richyrichhh80", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17871621000444092, "text": "Do we have footage of the fellatio?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:21:29", "owner": "andrewtatesleftnut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937971582960204, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:21:09", "owner": "ryanjones2901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923299756173189, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:18:04", "owner": "sidali_photographer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083215645960097, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:17:12", "owner": "rextscitus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104145607625605, "text": "Your Honor, what 16 year old boy wouldn't hit it? Case dismissed!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:16:44", "owner": "idontlikemypictures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945688111059062, "text": "🤣🤣🤣the comments are epic 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:14:23", "owner": "dinshaw2.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051031820333310, "text": "The comments are dreadful and this is all kinds of wrong", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:08:18", "owner": "ethan_wyatt98", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17918604885056801, "text": "Lucky bastard", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:06:19", "owner": "dw_rvnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860420434524039, "text": "Maybe someone's get jealous😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:04:37", "owner": "jeblazedx_x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075997036909310, "text": "Police ruined it 💀😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:04:12", "owner": "jeblazedx_