"text": "He is not a child, someone is jealous", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:50:46", "owner": "cmau", "likes": 140}, {"id": 17964010901987061, "text": "My fellow \"men\" disappoint me in these scenarios. If it was a female student and a male teacher, everyone would be up in arms. But when its male student and female teacher, they cheer. I hope yall never have kids, for their sake.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:48:31", "owner": "punished_carson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086304859742096, "text": "I don't understand a thing here... Why in all the videos victim's face is shown and the culprit's face is blurred??", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:46:50", "owner": "the_mean_alpha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032024159715789, "text": "Yall saying whatever about him being a victim whether it was consensual or not SHES STILL A CHILD PREDATOR", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:37:53", "owner": "fishy.friday", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080289935117214, "text": "Its never a Latina or black women dang", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:34:01", "owner": "severe1738", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179528740350908, "text": "The one time a guy gets laid the society has a problem.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:27:02", "owner": "show_me_nath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388756069123783, "text": "victim of pleasure", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:17:46", "owner": "lazzooo_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922741900158437, "text": "She gets a pass", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:03:50", "owner": "zvonabager", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914753548209585, "text": "Bro fumbled the bag 🤦🏻‍♂️🤦🏻‍♂️🤦🏻‍♂️🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:01:23", "owner": "mynameisharllan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929621686000568, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:39:20", "owner": "albe.rtzito", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18126108871493792, "text": "Why couldn't  I be that guy dammmmmmm", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:38:17", "owner": "blac_khawk333", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074551238236061, "text": "If u a female  and u want  younger mans I'm 24 😂😂 come e pred