ll 13. It’s just a perspective thing at first glance for them seeing the case. Their reaction is to think when they where that kids age they would be so happy and be a school hero etc. of course when u think more deeply about it it does become clearer that this may have different dangers as it would if the genders reversed but there are still dangers of having a woman like this in our society that can look at a child and want to sleep with them. That’s just my view on it. I don’t think the dudes here are in favour of pedos. They just remember being a horny 13 year old and are looking through that lense.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:54:36", "owner": "jam_cam_fran", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974398665950073, "text": "Where were these teachers when I was in school?", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:53:44", "owner": "vale.ntine193", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082725817969132, "text": "he's not a victim but she's still a pedo", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:46:37", "owner": "mvrcx.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067633538411490, "text": "You guys are such losers for condoning this. This is a person in a position of authority over him - do not minimize sexual assault.  Yall gonna keep that same energy when some pervert does this to your daughter? I bet not.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:45:09", "owner": "john.arnold0409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053410595640064, "text": "She will be wishing she kept that belt money so she can buy some prison currency", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:44:26", "owner": "jam_cam_fran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062616734579767, "text": "This comment section... This wasn't the only one, she was a groomer and sexual predator, one of the boys are now a father as his 15~16...", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:42:17", "owner": "_spyryjyon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010115423637051, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:40:27", "owner": "paidshort", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924073537156618, "text": "This ain't a crime", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:36:37", "owner": "arvlnzz