ced herself on him. Even as a teenager, he could’ve tossed her off of himself. This was fully consensual. Back of the day, a kid like that would be getting high-fives from his buddies for pulling that. Now, in the name of a quality, I think she should be charged the same as a man since no one shows us any mercy on anything ever", "created_at": "2025-10-21T11:25:03", "owner": "geeebeee88", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18091125964856944, "text": "This is every straight guys fantasy. Release this woman.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T11:19:45", "owner": "stezbleu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983998635911372, "text": "That kid is lucky 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T11:05:05", "owner": "rezguy42", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18115419757553672, "text": "I would never be a victim to such crime.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:42:36", "owner": "iammtaalam", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18115063594557737, "text": "I didn't see any child.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:41:35", "owner": "jamiquest", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17935056399098276, "text": "*sigh* opens comment section", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:20:27", "owner": "abdullah.an01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18156510547396568, "text": "Not all women but always a woman, harassments , thank god 🙏🙏 he is safe from that demon woman", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:12:52", "owner": "jani_madu45", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046367402386950, "text": "White women not leaving behind white men in being paedos", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:10:05", "owner": "mmak_95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18413084797112952, "text": "Comments are disgusting.Men change your perception please.If that was your sister or daughter you’d be ready to end the guy.I feel sorry for your sons,you’ll teach your daughters about predators and how to protect themselves but neglect your sons.Shameful", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:09:46", "owner": "ronessi.est", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883984339273731, "text": "🤣 That dude will be trading on this for years 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:09:20", "owner": "richjwr