as a lucky, young man. He is not a victim. I prayed to God as a kid and one of my teachers would wanna fuck me. I would have done that every day and never said a word. You people act like these boys are victims the only ones who are possibly queer ones. The rest of them all the porn they watch is about older chicks, and these horny older teachers are giving them the gift that will never be repaid. They owe the whole rest of their lives to what those girls teach them.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:49:20", "owner": "bigd.stoltzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094902835637934, "text": "Bro def put in that work to get that reward", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:46:02", "owner": "lxv.ken", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18161803492388613, "text": "I don’t see him struggling, I wouldn’t either🤣 happy like a puppy", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:44:44", "owner": "juanieeeeee__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889129030365408, "text": "Bro needs to marry her", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:39:18", "owner": "john_roomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070210370029335, "text": "Such a delicious trap.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:29:15", "owner": "eltoreador2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909795775248009, "text": "She's good looking tho what's going on", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:24:57", "owner": "sargentslaughter2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095073622802061, "text": "I think this is wrong cause at 16 bro is so hormone filled he definitely thinks it’s a good thing and doesn’t know any bettter", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:23:29", "owner": "mwangsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027901727737454, "text": "Let the boy be happy 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:21:46", "owner": "i.freitas__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18335651485224541, "text": "Gucci and coochie…bro is verified", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:18:24", "owner": "made.man.mel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982263132872369, "text": "The world has turned upside down. Since when does a man report being abused by a woman? Does that boy have a 🍌or a 🐱 possy? 🤔", "created_at": "202