es male victims of grooming and (statutory) 🍇 seriously’ 😒", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:12:57", "owner": "xxnay__nayxx", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17863311345489294, "text": "Shes even lookin at him like a predator 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:10:30", "owner": "sofia.fi.x", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17966384663978582, "text": "Teachers can afford gucci belts?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:01:03", "owner": "matt.chewi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18111058207566843, "text": "Poor kid :(", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:59:58", "owner": "trinica_teskey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034905503706136, "text": "🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:59:31", "owner": "sam10grimshaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153545449403385, "text": "Bro got motion", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:56:51", "owner": "xrjoey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075411029515680, "text": "He musta started getting good grades out of no where", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:56:03", "owner": "scomontana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881917681287229, "text": "Fuck my life, I never had that kinda luck!!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:54:56", "owner": "bert.moreno.79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327023440215508, "text": "Victim ? Naaaahh", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:53:39", "owner": "npramuditha1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285964744272592, "text": "He was no victim, people found out coz he was bragging to his friends 🤣 he was loving that sugar momma", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:49:24", "owner": "gonham_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18296295151281955, "text": "I work in Dublin in a hostel, and once a group of Boys and Girls from Germany were enjoying a small season with us. And, a muslim man approached one of the Germany girls, she got scared. Her teacher beg to me to not do anything, to avoid problems. Okay, I gathered all the Boys and oriented them \"Boys, the first duty of a man is to protect a woman, as you guys have seen what happened today! Don’t let your female friends walking around alone, it’s not safe, unfortunately. It’s your mission, got it?\" And the Boys \"Yes Sir!\"", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:46:02", "owner": "heartoflore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074155481186885, "text": "Bro is not a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:41:05", "owner": "captain_red_rump", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18225489238306843, "text": "Bruh... where were those teachers in my era", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:40:38", "owner": "i_hav_negr0_fatigue", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18405909694143033, "text": "he looks older tho and wanted it so", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:36:02", "owner": "eliz.5880", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088589482920903, "text": "bro was not a victim 💔", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:34:58", "owner": "honneybunspt2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044615102444695, "text": "these comments prove that mens worst enemy are literally themselves and other men, and you preach about the \"male loneliness epidemic\" and wonder why youre so alone after making incel chud comments like these...", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:28:06", "owner": "hotpinkbrekkie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062975006136405, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:25:00", "owner": "maguire.cosens", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041869952471814, "text": "Where was these ppl at when I was a teen, wtf", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:17:30", "owner": "n0calleridstar69", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867050923398931, "text": "You all think its cool, till it happens to your 11 year old son or something", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:58:24", "owner": "dominic.a.smallwood", "likes": 91}, {"id": 18082879310067736, "text": "The lefty pigs normalizing this in the comments 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:54:41", "owner": "realfuentevilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842003215602228, "text": "The same guys that complain about people not taking men's mental health seriously are the same types to see this shit and be little the fact a kid was raped by making jokes or wishing they were him. Ask yourself if that was a man buying a young girl a purse before raping her would you have the same attitude, and if not why don't you care about what young men go through", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:50:31", "owner": "defiantlynottommy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983773281863894, "text": "She looks evil. What kind of a sane grown woman would be attracted to an under age boy? Thats gross.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:49:40", "owner": "undra_blr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921946585172471, "text": "i wish that was me in high school …..i tried so many teachers lol….these yns are some battyman", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:40:40", "owner": "fullydawk187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865097878472629, "text": "Gimme a break with this shit. If anything she's a victim of having shitty taste. That kid is a loser dork", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:38:46", "owner": "bcaso1976", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083962526478309, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:35:30", "owner": "lex_luther1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171988303369205, "text": "The comment section gives the whole \"male loneliness epidemic ain't big enough\" Thing a boost", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:34:49", "owner": "the_poetic_panda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114746923556269, "text": "Where the college teachers at", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:24:37", "owner": "jonathan42oo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392303416127228, "text": "Idk how to explain it, but it’s just not the same! 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:17:19", "owner": "jamel_ej25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177849424359822, "text": "These kids have it so easy 🐱& gucci ? My teachers had moustaches and cigarette throat", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:14:50", "owner": "bigggsy_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886775944381850, "text": "#FREETEACHER", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:13:48", "owner": "cristianmnl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053070377316398, "text": "Did he speak victemese? Who is the victim? Haah?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:10:10", "owner": "synth_vail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870826618448472, "text": "Mannnnn her husband is hatin 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:08:34", "owner": "i_am_st