o control your fuc**ing impulses! Hold back your pu**y/d1ck", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:22:22", "owner": "juniorguerrieri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061747592450902, "text": "This is bs", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:20:42", "owner": "rubendlc832020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084496537989022, "text": "Bro is lucky not a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:15:43", "owner": "jamesrodrigues8110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027404222741842, "text": "How old was he like 18?!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:14:47", "owner": "crows_arewatching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864526087481419, "text": "You know when drug dealers start getting flashy and people know something is up. This what happened to young boy over here.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:14:21", "owner": "defy_stkr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076501205141388, "text": "Say what???!? Why tf this shit never happen to me I promise I would shut tf up! 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:12:07", "owner": "ticboywoodzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071564144335203, "text": "Cool things like that never happen to me 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:11:27", "owner": "a_viera267", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083414395803587, "text": "That dude looked like a young man. Maybe according to the law, but biologically, 16 is not a child. She still a weird, perv for wanting to be with someone that young, but I don’t consider that a pedo.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:09:18", "owner": "alvarez_dan_80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929489578128880, "text": "He knows exactly wtf he was doing.......", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:59:47", "owner": "urfiinestt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359070193094871, "text": "yeah that nigga ain’t some “he’s just a mommy’s boy and he’s innocent” he knew what he was fuckin and doin", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:52:45", "owner": "1ghxul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970580760953939, "text": "Straight to the comments", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:49:24", "owner": "drudiggler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18177807784355811, "text": "Let him cook 🧑‍🍳 that’s not sexual harassment 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:45:19", "owner": "proper213_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922552528158440, "text": "He is still a kid. Let’s keep holding all adults accountable. 👍🏽", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:45:16", "owner": "dramaaaaloc4", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18073336123958622, "text": "He's old enough to understand. Shiiii", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:44:58", "owner": "xaffire500r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096658333775313, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:40:33", "owner": "drfausto1979", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108227215599721, "text": "Comments really just showing how botched we are", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:38:59", "owner": "ajsweeney14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963696397003340, "text": "If that’s the case, then the wife of the french president Macron should have been arrested long time ago", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:31:28", "owner": "hany_r123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985210764895987, "text": "This lil nigga beating his dick right now 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:29:06", "owner": "slumpedonact", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930443074124316, "text": "This is crazy to say she’s a pred. Shes 100% the prey. Dude is getting a Gucci belt and banging his teacher. She’s dumb enough to spend that money and let him smash. I hooked up with my smoking hot history teacher my senior year, Ms. Robert’s .. I promise you I wasn’t taken advantage of. I pursued that. lol get out of here with “pred” she’s the one being taken advantage of.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:27:36", "owner": "horriblekorbal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079912469037431, "text": "She will have to take up the Muslim religion and get acquitted", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:21:34", "owner": "tyson__129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076075424164836, "text": "I wish she was my teacher 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:20:43", "owner": "richhe_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054987476554129, "text": "@marthaguadamuzjul I’m not talking about this scenario, my comment was because you said a teenager should be with a girl around his age. So I questioned what rule is that since I have a difference of opinion with that.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:17:56", "owner": "_thelean.machine__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329794744238502, "text": "Bro aint a victim💀", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:17:15", "owner": "safwanx.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132511378419439, "text": "Trump gonna hire her.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:16:07", "owner": "twelveoldstyles867", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313156954222306, "text": "These men in the comments are the same one crying “men suffer too” the moment a woman holds them accountable for anything. Disgustting. Y’all need therapy", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:15:48", "owner": "coloringwithcloud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061577780426863, "text": "Damm these boys got them bitchs buying shit 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:10:43", "owner": "alcala_scal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978246756919870, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:10:33", "owner": "only_follow_dead_peope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006344978648729, "text": "😂😂😂 lucky mf 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:08:03", "owner": "salahsre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090993502860174, "text": "Why did all my teachers look like Mrs. Doubtfire and not like Ms. Jones? 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:06:56", "owner": "eg.8491", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197080741320221, "text": "To the men saying “it should’ve been me” please keep those thoughts to yourself. If you don’t, the world will continue to not take male victims seriously. Please, stop. If it didn’t happen to you, you have no idea how this affected his life.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:05:52", "owner": "perskripshun", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18103236184729505, "text": "They should get ash Trevino", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:02:36", "owner": "guzm4n92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122262937509025, "text": "That's just a young man securing the bag", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:01:49", "owner": "coconuki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077402315514299, "text": "Gay dude", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:57:31", "owner": "laurynas_u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057297599241677, "text": "Kids a legend got some cougar pussy and a Gucci belt!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:55:17", "owner": "zm__1801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066707438611845, "text": "I did not understand what was happened", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:52:50", "owner": "akk04321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076270976131082, "text": "How old is he?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:50:52", "owner": "rima_hafet17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937114897096282, "text": "Which safety children watching porngraph, dirty movies, parents leave them too dress up like harlots, boy saying am gal..U Need Right Judgement Accept Jesus Christ", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:48:44", "owner": "solomonkatamba1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065881145579977, "text": "Brother is NOT a victim, he won", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:39:49", "owner": "9ufe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083111581952494, "text": "What child!!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:38:29", "owner": "nasser_abdullatif_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109183345604723, "text": "we are a ridiculous society", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:37:46", "owner": "gabriel__friedel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18241495372292762, "text": "I feel like woman care more about male victims of rape then man themselves do", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:35:44", "owner": "ricraftz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136650769458880, "text": "Free her", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:34:54", "owner": "still_scoring_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105847576611424, "text": "Why I couldn’t have a teacher like this 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:28:43", "owner": "gritzcw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859917037531257, "text": "If you were the woman instead of the boy, what would you get from buying a child that isn’t yours a $500 Gucci belt? As soon as the kid went home after this, his mom knew something wasn’t right and called the police. So, you’re already on bail for assaulting this child, why would you do the same thing and meet up with *another* child. Why would you lie that you can’t get pregnant so you could get impregnated by that 15 yr old (you are OVER a DECADE older than him). You guys see this woman as a predator right? She was their teacher, she saw them eat their school lunches with the little carton of milk and then very obviously groomed them with things like a $500 Gucci belt before taking advantage. If you see her as a predator, which you should because she is, what would that make these boys?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:20:17", "owner": "tneilastsom", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18180737317351998, "text": "How do yall cry how no one cares about male rates of suicide when this is how yall treat assault.  So scary that some of yall think he is lucky. Shows how much of your brain really developed.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:19:19", "owner": "noinformation7031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082462777969482, "text": "How old was the guy 1st of all?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:15:00", "owner": "astr0t0t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862374349503317, "text": "if it was a girl a lot of women would be in the comments lying like they wouldn’t want to be dogged by an older man and spoiled 😂😂😂😂there is no double standard, girls are just as perverted as boys are. it’s just the societal image that they’re always innocent when that’s never the case.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:14:47", "owner": "3332fly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935960986094432, "text": "Maybe he was asking for it😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:11:30", "owner": "takeitfromunder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105210901627998, "text": "Bro is twice her size how is he a victim? 🐀", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:04:16", "owner": "notfitru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071128220262770, "text": "This is wrong but when a girl has a sugar daddy it’s not wrong?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:03:50", "owner": "that5series_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075747962329761, "text": "Why I never met a teacher like that in my life", "