hi 😭🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:56:30", "owner": "rohit__yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865664527472228, "text": "Mind you, its other men downplaying and overlooking sexual abuse yet again (to their own gender which is sad). I think the reason why you see women taking thid seriously is bcz we understand the serious nature of inequal power dynamics and how it prompts sexual and emotional abuse and manipulation. Unfortunately the male population has been so corrupted by p*rn and toxic masculinity to ever actually do anything about it", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:55:48", "owner": "arieola__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945164368057464, "text": "God, i am your son too", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:54:11", "owner": "nah_1849", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18432087343103535, "text": "If yoy are justifying this, you are a groomer and a disgusting human being. Keep her locked up.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:46:12", "owner": "ithacantraining", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057756434537897, "text": "😭😭😭because whyyy is her ass doing all of this", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:44:20", "owner": "happyaslife22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843430684598425, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:44:03", "owner": "pietra__preziosa_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109486339601876, "text": "Bro wdf why this didn't happen to me😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:40:24", "owner": "scrilla_kxng187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155207608402684, "text": "Bro was just loving his best life.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:40:18", "owner": "dre_az_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101535127636822, "text": "It's called grooming and yes he is a victim he is a teenager and should be with a girl around his age. Not that older women that is looking at him in a disgusting way.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:27:10", "owner": "marthaguadamuzjul", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18044380118690848, "text": "Until the Epstein list is telecast and who ever is in there is prosecuted, I don’t want to hear shit from any one, our kids only matter if the ones d