ths went by, then one day she turned up at my door crying. I sat her down and tried to ask what happened. She started telling me things about her marriage and personal stuff that I didn't want to be privy to. Suddenly she started to hug me and told me that she needed to be consoled, I became very uncomfortable and told her it was not appropriate. But she didn't listen to me and started to kiss me and touch my private areas. I was wearing shorts so she easily pulled those down and went down on me. When I tried to pull away she grabbed me by my sack and forced me not to resist. I know it sounds ridiculous but in the end she had her way with me and I feel ashamed and guilty that I may have given up too soon. At that moment using violence was the only way to stop her but I did not want to raise my hands on a woman and maybe that emboldened her to continue. 🤦🏻‍♂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:52:52", "owner": "vickydarung", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100262323646415, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:42:36", "owner": "stecoop27", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076846115278221, "text": "نفس طريقة الاعتقال في البلاد الاسلامية 🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:36:25", "owner": "hamodi4168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898298998312692, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:34:18", "owner": "_xerian_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070322915248437, "text": "I missed opportunities like black in school", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:20:45", "owner": "srtrade.e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067688843353842, "text": "I want to be next victim before graduation 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:13:41", "owner": "wildin.who", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18271947541304810, "text": "gucci belt easy sex and easy money? Fire.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:06:30", "owner": "riccardomateraa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962602668843301, "text": "Make me her victim 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:04:03", "owner": "extrdema", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922766809167553, "text": "Emm", "created_at": "2025-10-20T03:55:58", "owner": "k