ude as an unaware kid while they pleasure themselves. I went through all these scenarios, and putting this guy in the same category as what I went through is so fucking disrespectful to someone who actually experienced sexual assault multiple times. Honestly, anyone who is trying to say she's a sexual child predator needs to shut the fuck up. You clearly don't know what it's like to be sexually assaulted. You know fucking nothing if you're saying she's a child predator.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T03:01:14", "owner": "xdivingangel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904096624266666, "text": "That mf is taller than her. Child my ass", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:54:38", "owner": "bubblebutt73920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244483723295750, "text": "Dang teacher could've chose thousands of us single adult males yet she chose to f*ck her student 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:43:41", "owner": "ianxaerie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116121175537697, "text": "WHY COULDNT THAT HAVE BEEN ME 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:35:31", "owner": "lxer._.xavier", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057861596241599, "text": "NASTY!!! \nTeachers don’t make money how’s she affording this Gucci belt???", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:22:07", "owner": "alexislovesme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910022608247602, "text": "Men in the comments section are foolish for cheering this on and acting like its wrong for predators to not be held accountable.  Male or female. Its a crime and its evil", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:15:36", "owner": "prideaside11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069363980594579, "text": "I want that teacher right now😢", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:13:27", "owner": "ravii_kumarr98", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094643350796352, "text": "He is a victim, although this being a fantasy of many men, he still is a victim and she still is a pedo and pred", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:11:44", "owner": "kitchenwenchie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986112480889936, "text": "Like drake said my boy will probably do it for a Gucci belt