:53:14", "owner": "nate_in_realestate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098649250666994, "text": "Comments are wild.  As the father of two young boys I can tell you that there are in fact predators just like there are for young women.  Like seriously if you’re a 25 year old why tf you hollering at a 16 year old?  It’s gross", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:50:20", "owner": "chadconway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079567481049257, "text": "All predators male & FEMALE heads look better on a pike; sorry NO rehabilitation for them doesn’t work. ONCE A PREDATOR ALWAYS A PREDATOR 👍🏽💯⚖️🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:49:28", "owner": "penavelilla", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18037635071504987, "text": "He is not a victim let him hit", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:40:47", "owner": "topiaslindroos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095681758702074, "text": "One of the homies sold out cause he wasn't getting...😢", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:35:26", "owner": "de.one.and.only", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18091082053860864, "text": "the comment second is absolutely disgusting", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:32:10", "owner": "taha.hxshmi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17976059396932686, "text": "Man boys these days are lil bi***es I wish I could’ve cracked my teacher and had her buying me shit and giving me money that would’ve been our little secret and I would’ve graduated that class with honors😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:28:21", "owner": "d1.the1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082247008991648, "text": "He livin the dream", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:24:52", "owner": "ooorraaangggeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101070259645186, "text": "So we justifying a sexual predator because it's a female", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:22:16", "owner": "madisonheights", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18006599027646679, "text": "Woman talks about her sexual assault --> men: \"whAt AbOuT mAle ViCtimSSsS\" Someone advocating for male victims of sexual assault --> men: \"he's not a victim, bro's luckyyyy lolol\" THIS IS WHY WOMEN ARE SICK OF YOUS", "created