"text": "Nah. She’s a baddie🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:22:44", "owner": "divine_intervention99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044090351409765, "text": "Why was my teacher not like this", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:18:15", "owner": "bradgoodwin_capra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868982380460004, "text": "Man why didnt I get a fucking Gucci belt and a blowjob from my hot teacher damn", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:17:55", "owner": "jointrw2.0__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849400861578805, "text": "Wack af", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:13:27", "owner": "jeffspace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983310774909397, "text": "Damn thats bad whats her @ anyway", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:10:19", "owner": "usso.rhlm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856943020540756, "text": "The idea that a 14 year old boy can be a victim of this is as asinine as the idea that a 40 year old man dating an 17 year old is victimizing her. This culturally English purity spiraling in english speaking cultures is beyond stupid.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:08:39", "owner": "arndtyagunna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060150296424207, "text": "Victim? Naah bro is lucky", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:08:24", "owner": "r_ir31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867088900466726, "text": "Victim? Bruh played the game and won", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:00:41", "owner": "keachiescottalexander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045334133413916, "text": "Who snitched!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:00:25", "owner": "m00t00m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074312180327483, "text": "🐱ass kids this was every teenagers dream when I was in Highschool!", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:57:57", "owner": "simplysublimetx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097541791708148, "text": "Why did this not happen to me in school!! Lucky victim!!", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:56:15", "owner": "black_rabai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537846565063281, "text": "I pray my son doesn’t grow up with this mentality and knows what’s wrong is wrong.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:51:05", "owner": "_keiratrott", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18301119163264959, "text": "Wish my teacher did this to me", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:45:35", "owner": "doncity65", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17965933430826559, "text": "There’s a difference between being groomed and knowing exactly what’s going on if he can want a Gucci belt he knew what they was gonna do😂😂,he ain’t no victim", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:45:30", "owner": "4thebids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126723094494644, "text": "What is the world coming to when a boy can’t get a little grown 🐱every now and then", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:40:51", "owner": "tmtbside7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044262524446088, "text": "a haters analogy", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:34:33", "owner": "liljeffie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056244362554879, "text": "It looks cool but this is why people are so fucked up sexually and emotionally btw also porn is a cancer", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:33:55", "owner": "tanner_w27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872838535440404, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:28:20", "owner": "kefla23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060528965436574, "text": "Stranger danger is quite possibly the worst implementation of a policy ever all it did was freak people out when the danger 9/10 isn’t a stranger….. your most likely to be abused or unalived by someone you know ( yes random encounters happen but are rare ).", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:21:16", "owner": "rcs_cyle", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078883792888718, "text": "Who TF snitched on this man?! 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:21:10", "owner": "kennedy.trey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094575052650622, "text": "Meanwhile in Islam a male can do this to little girls and its fine.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:19:26", "owner": "ourlife_travels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095152120793636, "text": "😭😭😭i need that teacher", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:14:47", "owner": "firstclassacademy.ve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069971759018181, "text": "These lil rat ass niggas 🥴🥴🥴", "created_at": "2025-1