er he’s getting things bought for him… this is SA.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:40:08", "owner": "hjesus_marquez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179494348356855, "text": "Some died of thirst, while others drowned", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:33:50", "owner": "thefool_seq0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103234030714216, "text": "Bro didnt get pegged and got choked out by his gucci belt i think thats why he's mad AF", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:28:09", "owner": "barbier_julien_8930", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084621652999436, "text": "Where was these teachers when I was at school 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:25:13", "owner": "_ryanhayess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068768264585709, "text": "If you think this kid is \"lucky\" you will feel the same if this ever happens to your daughter", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:03:43", "owner": "shagger_neebs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181249210341412, "text": "Look at all gooners praising the rape just because he's a boy. Of course you would approve, the only contact you've ever had with women was in your fantasies, your brain is so addled by corn that you lack any empathy and you cannot differentiate between reality and fiction.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:00:20", "owner": "kuma_no_maiku", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080978888000436, "text": "Lucky", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:57:29", "owner": "briontop__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057601601238935, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:57:21", "owner": "darkfilemediatv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329154961234247, "text": "Would’ve been a dream come true 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:55:31", "owner": "_e_d_c_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882486973280197, "text": "I will write the same sommects i found here in man Predators videos", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:55:10", "owner": "fikarius7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055639532276265, "text": "No assault was done in this case", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:46:57", "owner": "jhonathan_partolin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18147834829423338, "text": "Comm