"jn.lx0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921608473171824, "text": "A coworker snitched on them.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:41:13", "owner": "corpsegrinder11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054492491290165, "text": "But I didn't see sex. I saw her buying a belt...", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:36:15", "owner": "therealmauriceatillman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088022773905969, "text": "Kid is living the dream.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:36:07", "owner": "dancatmtb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044579609689324, "text": "0", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:33:21", "owner": "rich_na_i_wan0421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060527405399971, "text": "She did nothing wrong", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:23:46", "owner": "_top1ofone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128950078479924, "text": "IT SHOULD HAVE BEEN ME", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:23:21", "owner": "coachmoscoso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072186647219755, "text": "This dumb bitch fucked a kid, got arrested, released on bail, fuck another kid, got pregnant, now has restraining orders against both boys. What the fuck is wrong with you people 😒", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:19:02", "owner": "vvaveshine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130834036473466, "text": "I know the comments will be...🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:18:04", "owner": "adnaf14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056205110631811, "text": "Shit that aint no victim!!! Never save a yping man from this situation 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:14:25", "owner": "snapps_west661", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079678387854305, "text": "That boy is not victime he used brain he got🐱 and gucci both and then get her to arrest smart kid", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:12:06", "owner": "sumesh_munda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064208684123674, "text": "Dayum were was she at when i was at school", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:07:55", "owner": "seanmac06_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158493751387972, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:05:27", "owner": "odaafahri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891049012223261, "text": "Bruh who snitched", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:04:57", "owner": "alexx_box_360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508208338069829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:00:29", "owner": "the_jdes_collection", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538741186038841, "text": "Some of these comments why is a boy not a victim but girls are? Normalize that boys can be victims too it's not a high five moment", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:45:42", "owner": "chelxo70srock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859799668457895, "text": "Free her", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:44:20", "owner": "norestilldeath", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18060912110429630, "text": "the same men not taking this seriously are the same ones who want to make it women’s problem to care abt men’s mental health", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:44:09", "owner": "iisisyelena", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897115510324067, "text": "Teacher is a criminal, but there's 90% chances this kid was having the time of his life and now will become depressed from the amount of people in his ear trying to make him feel bad about this. Because they get none and can't let a kid feel good about this, not on their watch! 🤡", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:41:56", "owner": "alexandreganhito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844570921582726, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:38:46", "owner": "complexroofingsolution", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861703120508745, "text": "People saying he is a victim regardless of his own opinion are not any better either. They use the law as excuse to portray their moral superiority. Teacher is a criminal, and the kid could have been having the time of his life, but dumb people like you will turn that into a nightmare, nagging him about how he's a victim and not a lucky dude. Getting a happy kid depressed just to flex moral superiority", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:37:27", "owner": "alexandreganhito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203935006311190, "text": "Is she British?!", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:35:43", "owner": "hassann.shehryar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851331838533930, "text": "She needs medication", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:34:41", "owner": "hassann.shehryar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116920072543245, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:26:07", "owner": "oso_de_negocios", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18532621012044578, "text": "TEACHERS PET👴🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:20:44", "owner": "smuzzgulp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053232716310565, "text": "What Victim ? That's a life long memory he'll laugh at", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:20:08", "owner": "mstr_robobot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860741956513958, "text": "For all the tw*ts saying free her you are mentally ill. If you don’t under stand what a nonse is, you are one. Vile.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:58:04", "owner": "rgch2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091312117684670, "text": "Where the fuck were these teachers when i was in high school?", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:51:44", "owner": "m.vizualz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18120646549512177, "text": "Bro got the Gucci & the Cucci 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:44:24", "owner": "jamesgrayny", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17920191747082015, "text": "He is not the victim here. He knew exactly what he was doing.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:38:41", "owner": "jbruni7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169479397369554, "text": "Whoopty dooo", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:30:36", "owner": "onely_tony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096414646762575, "text": "Yes, this is fucking rape. No he isn’t “lucky”, get help. People who think this is good or normal are a serious problem to society. Sex between an adult and a minor is ALWAYS a crime.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:18:56", "owner": "felipepalumbomed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029755637724873, "text": "I wanna be a victim too.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:18:16", "owner": "drwn.iiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103783405628644, "text": "Nigga got himself a gucci belt and some game? Teacher defo ovulating", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:11:56", "owner": "mirror_on.da_wallx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902321770148053, "text": "That’s a consenting young adult the fuck you talking bout children ?", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:02:07", "owner": "not.talley_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203655685311071, "text": "But when the roles are reversed yall would be jaw dropped. This world man it’s a sick joke", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:57:34", "owner": "tcaldax", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18225444895306599, "text": "Comments are vile, you always see “… until its the other way round” well its the other way round, why isnt is SA anymore??", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:55:25", "owner": "athena.moto125", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062270573142178, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:54:40", "owner": "spacecowboi9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206274640312805, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:52:02", "owner": "romeo.m4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18176983867359578, "text": "Sexual assault?? I’d give up my annual for a woman like to bling me out the fuck", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:45:02", "owner": "709jgp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982719096754754, "text": "Double standards exist for a reason.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:38:28", "owner": "_marcusbarksdale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896499175338161, "text": "English peepo be like, “I quiet don’t fancy this” lol", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:33:53", "owner": "misfit559", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080021138319132, "text": "Some kids have all the luck", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:19:21", "owner": "inertia.fish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898670641304647, "text": "This is retarded", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:17:26", "owner": "ios_pan_v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536472160043103, "text": "Everyone here needs their hard drives checked", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:16:03", "owner": "malltank30", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17911176372232434, "text": "People saying the kid isn't a victim need a hard drive check", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:06:05", "owner": "k.beanos1", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17987053760886682, "text": "Can I be a victim 👋", "created_at": "2025-10-18T2