: 17850392220571605, "text": "God I see what you have given to other…", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:43:44", "owner": "23.baby_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408582862141946, "text": "Why is the cop saying if you plead the 5th it can negatively affect you. That’s not how it works.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:41:42", "owner": "geearmour", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18377613019150015, "text": "my female teachers had more lip hair than my male teachers.lucky bastards", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:41:13", "owner": "chichischrist_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945300922062767, "text": "I want stuff too! 🙋‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:38:48", "owner": "dreamgirlsupreme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921151612176919, "text": "I dont get it. It should be lucky  right.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:32:53", "owner": "masams3k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927177370133821, "text": "Dam why couldn't i be a victimized like this", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:31:34", "owner": "m0z3r1lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990201999850320, "text": "Victim? 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:24:24", "owner": "robertosmfranco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062587217612507, "text": "He is a dumass🤦‍♂️ lost the best thing in his life", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:16:03", "owner": "v.trukoos.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192877471323683, "text": "Oh bunda becky lol", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:54:20", "owner": "ascendente_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095510983826712, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:51:18", "owner": "zoology_with_vic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083628637796424, "text": "I am man formerly a “kid” or “youth” however you want to label it. And I’m telling you, after 14 years, unless you’re being pinned down and forced, then you are consenting period \nThis does NOT apply to young girls. I find it disgusting when a 30 year old man can legally date an 18 year old girl. It different with girls. But as boys or men or whatever, we know what up after 14,15 max. I’m not saying she did right I’m just saying whatever