ext": "That male is not a victim. He could have done whatever he wanted to her at will", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:20:21", "owner": "timothyareeves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094453969863236, "text": "Guess I should have asked for more than a passing grade lol", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:18:06", "owner": "6spaulding_dropprz3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978270552925626, "text": "He's twice the size of her. Hardly being forced into going to shops shopping for gucci belts", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:15:47", "owner": "scottbelfast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043574666439249, "text": "Who's the victim?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:13:47", "owner": "andrell_monteiro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063496049528635, "text": "Who Is the victim? I see only a lucky guy 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:11:41", "owner": "karlux_999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063627530379380, "text": "Why are all these women fuckin kids?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:11:14", "owner": "avg_j03_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140168908444036, "text": "Where is the victim? Bro got a Gucci belt and got to smash a fine ahh teacher", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:11:03", "owner": "the_jet_set_life", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061530638148708, "text": "6 foot tal child 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:09:37", "owner": "mannsprinter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864306040480137, "text": "You cannot be serious... who’s gonna take these British pigs officers whatever you wanna call them serious. They are so soft out there and then you have this chick hooking a young man up ain’t nothing wrong with that.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:08:16", "owner": "josh_jay_boogs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941279107070623, "text": "No girlfriend got me shit like that 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:07:36", "owner": "pablowlouiewave", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143397355390406, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:58:08", "owner": "loadsmacker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021720995775467, "text": "People say are saying the “victim” mentality. Is absurd until it’s a female victim? This is due to the power dynamic. Regardless of his age. He is a male. And males are biologically superior to females. She may be older than him but she is not stronger than him. Which is why a lot of people are arguing he isn’t a victim. However, because of his naivety, one can argue he is. Although at any point in time if he refuses any sexual acts from the woman. There’s very little she can do to him physically to overpower him. He can just walk away. This is why often times this is seen as a “I wish I was that guy” “where were these teachers when I young” mentalities. Now if we were to flip the tables. The power dynamic changes. A grown man can in fact physically over power a woman regardless of whether she willingly accepts or refuses sexual acts. And that power dynamic is why people often see young women as the “victim” which is why men often get no mercy from the public.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:53:17", "owner": "mellow.pl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167851411373697, "text": "He’s definitely not a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:52:08", "owner": "leunytoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861692929506470, "text": "At this point these females teachers need to be studied", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:52:02", "owner": "the_gitchfitsfam2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081765932075136, "text": "What a non generous man for asking for a belt 😞", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:47:37", "owner": "prettyhugedihh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074207756171439, "text": "Erin called Ms sansour bby bc we thought she was going she checced him n the middle of class 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:46:57", "owner": "doggghousent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381946054177799, "text": "He ain’t no victim 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:44:55", "owner": "scotthoey1102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070773692586434, "text": "He fuccd the game up telling ole weak asss lil dude", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:44:39", "owner": "doggghousent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432199111111409, "t