16927, "text": "Coochie and gucci win win", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:56:16", "owner": "finessin_hearts", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082488629084989, "text": "I wish i had a teacher like her😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:45:53", "owner": "profgalloway97", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069520055255393, "text": "Damn, I grew up in the wrong neck of the woods. I think I've only had like one, mid teacher", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:45:31", "owner": "dudebro8292939", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17945815578054987, "text": "Men only see it as abuse if it’s a man and a boy. They don’t care about any other type.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:43:47", "owner": "jasmynrenapurnell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965812041826518, "text": "Dude is a Lil ponk", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:39:16", "owner": "dynoe84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986741652885724, "text": "Why are we defending predators?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:36:28", "owner": "essence_of_rahul", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18122901070507236, "text": "there are no female predators. Boys know how to defend themselves. Females are of the weaker sex anyways, so i dont see a problem here.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:36:25", "owner": "jayse0985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059906606405511, "text": "Ask the kid he say he had a great time 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:35:36", "owner": "_codyscrazyyy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990283872723556, "text": "Honestly I tried hitting on my teacher and failed 😞", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:35:22", "owner": "barrazamondo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075388868180006, "text": "Nah man, Hot older female and a boy is not much of a problem. Boys know what theybare getting themselves into. It's not the same case for older guy and below 18 year old girl, cuz young little girls cannot defend themselves. This guy in the vid is not a victim.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:34:29", "owner": "jayse0985", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954024217029639, "text": "That would’ve been a dream come true at that age", "created_at": "2025-1