nd it was outright abuse. Let’s be honest.....the boys were probably living what they saw as a dream. And to those saying, “If the genders were reversed…...I agree, it wouldn’t be the same. I say that with full responsibility as a man who’s been through that age.....it’s simply not the same situation....\nThis whole thing was probably pushed by the parents or influenced by the school.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:13:31", "owner": "rezam8720", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078016361122860, "text": "He lucky", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:13:30", "owner": "theonewhoknocks756799", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084191860950219, "text": "Where were these teachers when I was at school", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:07:23", "owner": "shaunsimpson32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852549499560478, "text": "As a mother of a teenage son, I would rip this pedophile apart with my hands. Disgusting", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:03:52", "owner": "the_girl_between_the_stars_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043431200452966, "text": "Most of the guys in the comments need to understand that it's wrong regardless if you think that you would be ok with it if you were him. She is a teacher and has over stepped her position of trust. He is also a child and legally (and morally wrong from my pointof view) seeing her buying him nice things is grooming. Protect all children 🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:02:16", "owner": "silknatasha", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18241156948291312, "text": "Dude was winning", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:57:34", "owner": "knotsaway5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083584262495527, "text": "Now days kids are dumb!", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:56:09", "owner": "1crdv9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071727047520916, "text": "That is where he wants to be", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:54:12", "owner": "kevv_themuse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082898719970019, "text": "She treating him financially and physically. Omg the horror…", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:52:52", "owner": "angel.dan.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17