hem anyway", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:28:55", "owner": "maintain_2025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143553070438909, "text": "Anyone do this to my boy. They'll be enjoying a free dive to the depths of the ocean.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:26:27", "owner": "don_karloss1177", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18140959972448595, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:25:01", "owner": "alex.gillette", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873459367348784, "text": "Female teachers in my day had hairy moles and stank of B O.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:24:37", "owner": "buddhamoons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079362779017947, "text": "2 things: 1. Men should be ashamed of their comments, reasons why men aren't respected anymore. 2. Change the gender in this scenario and see the magic 🪄✨", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:21:11", "owner": "dehradun.hunter", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17861584542507069, "text": "Send one to jupiter", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:19:36", "owner": "presidentof_jupiter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196110220316988, "text": "These comments are wild.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:15:48", "owner": "petrifier", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960668806002446, "text": "BRO IS LIVING THE DREAM 🐱", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:14:27", "owner": "dizzykyle_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842177302601103, "text": "Lucky little bas..., where were these teachers when I was in school damn it", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:09:40", "owner": "papi_chulo4791", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063927182377350, "text": "This was a teacher, schools are not a safe space. A child in the US is 37 times more likely to be abused by a teacher than a priest", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:08:11", "owner": "husky_seb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117385675539643, "text": "Everyone saying he’s not the victim should watch “a teacher” on Netflix. The last episode perfectly shows how something like this can mess you up even if you’re “willing”. It’s not okay. You can all pretend like being a pedo is okay for woman but it’s NOT. it’s gross.", "created_