rl you'd all be up in arms and banging his door down. This is absolutely different", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:52:26", "owner": "siboyjc", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18153825946397637, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:49:15", "owner": "maclellancj", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18404576818190515, "text": "Don’t ever interrupt man hood", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:46:52", "owner": "voxluugan214", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889301737361464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:46:36", "owner": "nuclear_lifts_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082690309985269, "text": "Just think this was your son , would you be high fiving him ? If yes, u r a pedophile too", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:43:43", "owner": "shandh1076", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972663090947438, "text": "He was not a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:42:42", "owner": "candlelife_510", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18489288286072843, "text": "Lucky little shit...", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:39:11", "owner": "happyoo53", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17898230379312567, "text": "Ur all freaks it’s sexual assault no matter the gender!! I pray none of you have children because you are showing that if you have a male child that is groomed by a woman you will not take it as seriously as you would if it was your daughter being groomed by a man", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:38:58", "owner": "poppymainbtw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17893410984204793, "text": "Lol he’s not a victim if she’s willing to going with him. Free bro ✌️✌️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:38:35", "owner": "charbeljr11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18533628094027874, "text": "Lol so not fair 😴", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:35:39", "owner": "_skuntlifeee_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17871008577446890, "text": "In men age doesn’t matter when dealing with women. Height does. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:34:31", "owner": "shar.p8204", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18391103062127170, "text": "If both of them agree with that. It should be no problem ahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:33:34", "owner