s": 1}, {"id": 18095099287757071, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:59:55", "owner": "juulianpena_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016485491792491, "text": "Where the hell were these teachers when I was at school 😝", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:57:19", "owner": "stu_a_60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875170942427894, "text": "I was a teen girl (14) together with an adult (42),, my father went to the police, the police didn’t do anything because it was my own choice.. of course knowing now, I know it was wrong.. but anyway the police didn’t do a thing. Perhaps because it was back in the days, nothing to compare with nowadays", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:56:27", "owner": "seasonweb.eu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953033101032385, "text": "I mean hear me out", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:55:50", "owner": "dke_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076849658153984, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:55:36", "owner": "ovaist123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893590210203393, "text": "Victim!?? lol", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:54:43", "owner": "scrizzlemayne", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068498552587005, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:54:33", "owner": "aziiiz_ma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026557436739070, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:54:14", "owner": "david_relaxedfit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065397458341806, "text": "Why can’t it ever be me bro", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:53:49", "owner": "animosity.himself", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043553228441392, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:52:36", "owner": "dr3w1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104460781720327, "text": "Gross", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:52:23", "owner": "totallynottory", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109335766571080, "text": "“We choose the bear “", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:52:18", "owner": "claweffects420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962316640002466, "text": "LMAOOOO", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:51:47", "owner": "vro.collin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186272176327837, "text": "can somone explain what’s happening ? i’m con