it.... what I'll find in the comment section😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:43:44", "owner": "blue_ice_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057886730227260, "text": "Doesnt matter, when i was 13 if a teacher gave me the opportunity i would have eaten her ass cookie monster style, i would have been no victim arrfhhhh yumvyumyum on that 🐱", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:43:33", "owner": "bagurvictor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045021155385586, "text": "🤢🤮🤮🤮🤮 what's wrong with people??? Teachers are supposed to be a good influence for kids... I hate our society.  Truly disgusting 😡", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:40:57", "owner": "whateverjustbarbie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148578445419768, "text": "Bro a lil fag for betraying her and she dumb for choosing a little dipshit", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:39:51", "owner": "tha1who_knockss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093757723832141, "text": "I was hit on by high school guys when I was a sub often & was literally asked out on a date. The buck stops with you, the adult. Gender does not matter & frankly their age does not matter (some were 18 & loved sharing that with me). No matter what, it is completely inappropriate to even entertain such conversations with a student.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:38:32", "owner": "amanda_amc12", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18057017366562636, "text": "A pedophile's a pedophile. No matter what they have between their legs. If ain't fucking an eighteen plus you'll sleep in concrete", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:37:56", "owner": "christopher_cz17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333365704234222, "text": "Wtfffffff he got some premium 🐱 and a Gucci belt?????????? Lucky brat 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:36:37", "owner": "griff_amg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960215763976707, "text": "Some mf ruined this man's whole day. He had a whole thing going for him", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:36:13", "owner": "galen907_photo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149999092412116, "text": "People out here saying he ain't a victim, well let's reverse the situation.. let's say it was a man with a school girl! Ye all would. Be hating so badly in that case no such thing as equality in a mind controlled matrix 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:35:28", "owner": "cal_g0ne.missin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079496659843821, "text": "Thats a Grown man", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:35:05", "owner": "_joserobles1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054324350296930, "text": "So in y’all’s opinion do you think it’s ok for a man to prey on a young girl if he buys her a gucci bag? Because that’s the entry y’all are giving", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:34:32", "owner": "cfl_5.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103488580618290, "text": "nah that’s p bro boutta rinse n repeat that play for the next 10years", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:34:20", "owner": "roostersofly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077934635145497, "text": "Also I love how men are always the first to bring up \"men can be raped/groomed too.\" And then when it happens they are the ones dismissing it and making fun. Y'all are lonely for a reason.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:33:56", "owner": "sophiegraceaxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069778289351734, "text": "Read their victim statements and let's see if y'all are still gonna make fun.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:32:47", "owner": "sophiegraceaxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110278819600366, "text": "How old was he v", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:32:24", "owner": "thelipstickgirly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131269351463843, "text": "How old is he?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:32:22", "owner": "highsolo3434", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057459632239107, "text": "I wish something like this happened to me the priest was no where near as hot as she is", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:32:04", "owner": "machughesinukraine", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18197125291318121, "text": "He doesn't seen so childish to me: he Is taller than the teacher and probably has a big 🥒 down there, ready to use and give pleasure. No offense detected.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:30:46", "owner": "costanzogravina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070818581254057, "text": "Wtf are these men saying 'he's no victim'? The female teachers was taking advantage of someone who is a minor. Society is so misogynistic that in this situation society thinks that boy knew what he was doing, but if it was a girl, she was being groomed.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:30:39", "owner": "martin_1140", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078546770026761, "text": "Women, if you know a man that says \"lucky guy, it should've been me.\", then he's a potential pedophile and a retard for sure. Keep yourself and your children away from these men. ✌🏾😎", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:28:28", "owner": "gino.the.charming.scoundrel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065559287589506, "text": "Why can’t this happen to me 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:26:44", "owner": "castrocleats13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096064441772300, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭 چرا ازینا برای ما نبود منو شکار کنه🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:26:24", "owner": "parrrrrshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991573143849824, "text": "Pedo race even yall white women does the same", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:25:47", "owner": "big_moneyzuwap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159005836385640, "text": "Pathetic . There is no victim here", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:25:42", "owner": "kuviboy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104686645537795, "text": "bro is NOT the victim. he got a free belt and buns, i’m the victim here", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:25:04", "owner": "sh1v_77", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18110839501579744, "text": "Yeah that is hardcore for her she’s the victim here", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:24:31", "owner": "collyerbenjamin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079007015015857, "text": "How tf can a teacher afford Gucci.  My wife is a teacher and makes nothing", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:23:46", "owner": "tsprites", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088481065895927, "text": "I feel bad for her", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:21:43", "owner": "patrick.inocillas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180237