n a little girl. She took full advantage of a child in her care.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:15:12", "owner": "aunt.sheryl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100186189726847, "text": "Lol said the wrong thing to the wrong person somewhere along the lines.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:14:28", "owner": "the0bakerman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428676772096185, "text": "I want to be victim too,", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:13:33", "owner": "muneeb672", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023540498775091, "text": "My teachers back in the day didnt look like that at all", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:13:31", "owner": "luiz_hgfilho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344724157200540, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:13:29", "owner": "saberbasre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994470918700252, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:12:46", "owner": "luiz_hgfilho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345802942207113, "text": "Bruh send her my way", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:09:24", "owner": "mixodupmike", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985961388899212, "text": "Leave her alone shes a saint", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:09:03", "owner": "blacboiflii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071121902464801, "text": "\"I WANT YOUR PURSE FIRST AND THEN YO ASS LAST\"- Ramirez", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:07:45", "owner": "scottprimiano", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076198964144614, "text": "Who what actually sickens me is that if this was a male teacher doing this to a female student there would be an absolute uproar but a woman doing it to a child is funny ? His a legend ? His this his that oh why couldn’t my teaches be like her like the f u c k that’s still a pedo regardless of gender you sick f u c k s", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:07:18", "owner": "thegingerbastard1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026484698733916, "text": "lol of course the cop helps her 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:07:13", "owner": "babytima561", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135158800462725, "text": "Half asleep when I saw this. The plot twist when I found out the woman was the predator 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:06:49", "owner": "dylan.penicillinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947892373046831, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:06:34", "owner": "_tkn7_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937455999960870, "text": "Where was these teachers when I was a young man jeez .when it comes to the other way around and I mean when they say a boy is being abused by the older female, its almost not fair ,its like entrapment on the boys behalf. It's every teens boy fantasy to score with a more mature woman like wtf .look at the movie from the 80s called weird science. The 2 need teens created a sexy teacher and she came to life .so it goes to show how the mind of a teen boy works and thinks .", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:06:24", "owner": "tommi6952", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915317155070583, "text": "Wish I was a victim of this back in the days😭🤣you people are idiots", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:04:12", "owner": "969kiraaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027776840538184, "text": "If he concented, he concented", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:02:58", "owner": "mohamed_ikbal_khan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092184361842552, "text": "Notice the common European family lineage with all the people supporting this", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:01:43", "owner": "nuttjuice101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061018214629778, "text": "Are you sure hes a \"victim\"???", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:59:39", "owner": "sorrowcreed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863474290490681, "text": "Niceeee", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:59:05", "owner": "tommytwopiece22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083953285808075, "text": "Why is not me 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:58:44", "owner": "lelebooy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866822473398056, "text": "The guy whose face was Blurred (for good reason) DOES NOT LOOK LIKE A KID!\nI’m sure, if there were anything sexual between those two IT MUST HAVE BEEN WITH CONSENT!\nTHE SO CALLER KID IS ALSO AS RESPONSIBLE AS THE TEACHER!!!\nTHAT SO CALLER KID TOOK ADVANTAGE OF THE TEACHER, MADE HER TO BUY EXPENSIVE GIFTS AND IN RETURN HAD PHYSICAL RELATIONSHIP TOO.\nHOW ON EARTH HE BECOMES THE VICTIM??????????", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:58:42", "owner": "roger_rahul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084067834950478, "text": "man yall really dgaf about boys being abused unless its a man doing it. Yall dont realize how shit like this warps their perspective on life forever. It will stunt their maturity. It will ruin their connections to future partners. It will charge them with lust for the rest of their lives, unsure of why they can never get this feeling back. Sure this might be exciting, feeling desired by an older woman, getting gifts, etc., too young to understand how a power dynamic like this works. All good until the shoe is in the other foot huh? Until this kid grows up into a man who does this to little girls, because its what he knows. Once he’s an adult he cant be the little kid in the partnership, so he’ll find one to carry out the fantasy. Victims of sexual assault turn into perpetrators of sexual assault because its how theyve been taught to partake in sexual relations. Once your body ties that release with these actions, and the events surrounding it, its hard to separate them. Thats why porn addiction is so real. Yall dont even understand what this does to young boys. Theyre victims now, but they wont be victims tomorrow. Theyll become predators. Not all, but this sexual immorality, unchecked, will breed more sexual immorality. Not to mention this unchecked lust in general is just bad for a developing mind in general.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:58:27", "owner": "albasancti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976998003776187, "text": "I wish I could crack my teacher and get a Gucci belt :( life’s not fair", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:56:31", "owner": "stjawnzbay", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18117151054539099, "text": "If I was 16 or 17 I wouldn't been gaaaame", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:54:45", "owner": "tys_to_heaven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1836582823015788