t back. She did the sign for sucking dick. Pushing her cheek with her tongue 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:30:41", "owner": "adventurousginge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908154919252674, "text": "Bro better sell that belt and pay that bail 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:28:47", "owner": "isaiah_davis559", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025479437753628, "text": "Where to be a victim ?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:26:25", "owner": "tranape_l_asiat", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18027015002744596, "text": "See no one cares when woman are ped0😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:26:19", "owner": "blahh000000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059801678563232, "text": "On a teacher salary?!? She definitely loved him", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:26:17", "owner": "dannyfromthe_6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17926233132111620, "text": "NIIIICE", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:24:59", "owner": "damd00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018454685788371, "text": "Bros she's fucking a child🤦‍♂️ what is wrong with you guys.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:22:37", "owner": "kevma_meme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429101557100143, "text": "A child ? Really? I wish I was lucky to have a “predator” like her when I was at school!😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:21:28", "owner": "alessandro_us", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071449001243375, "text": "Where was teachers like this when I was a kid", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:21:07", "owner": "daveeeeeed420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023768798572331, "text": "Poor men/male humans both in finance and intellectuality are saying the victim isn’t a victims because he got to fvçk, that’s how stupid they can get.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:20:43", "owner": "chizyokoye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985619508904839, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:20:19", "owner": "cristianofry", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18070649012220276, "text": "He finessed a Gucci belt out of her😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:19:37", "owner": "305protector", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18041534027694805, "text": "What a lucky guy 😂😂", "cre