xt": "Has to be one rule for all! Too many people saying he’s a legend and knew what was gonna happen. Yea he probably did but doesn’t mean it’s right for a woman who is trusted to look after and educate children has done this! Can’t want male teachers crucified and female teachers let off cos the boy “is lucky”", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:46:33", "owner": "ryanmalarkey", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18039655127695076, "text": "Disgusting comment section", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:46:29", "owner": "benjaminthompson1989", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17901910401276885, "text": "grooming is grooming, I think optically when it’s reversed like this it doesn’t “appear” as bad since women’s manipulation is in more of a submissive form. But the psychological effect is the same. A lot of the time young male victims end up believing they were madly in love, throwing away their future—while the culprits are only using them temporarily. I know people might think they want or wanted this but losing your childhood because of being groomed by an adult is not want anyone would actually want lol. At 15 you don’t think one night stand, you’re thinking rest of your life.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:45:35", "owner": "nitetimeee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867450574463753, "text": "What a lucky victim. Please pray that it happens to me.🙌🏿", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:42:26", "owner": "jonathanmanoj_music", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075800287918238, "text": "That nigga gay. Why tf would he snitch her out like that?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:40:52", "owner": "frankyloredo07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855833722544345, "text": "I see nothing wrong here", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:39:03", "owner": "patrickc2081", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058703696213561, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:38:47", "owner": "renegade_2002_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18078694622103739, "text": "Fck me and buy me a Gucci belt…we’re starting a gotdamn family. And that’s final", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:38:44", "owner": "relax_itslee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379093408147267, "text": "This nothing new it just doesn't get shamed as much as if roles were reversed.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:38:05", "owner": "shawnb8949", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078241810888233, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:38:03", "owner": "rdxtvsrd23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079509086120430, "text": "Its illegal but men and women are not the same.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:35:46", "owner": "cleanwelds_est", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095163364702634, "text": "leave em alone🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:35:00", "owner": "ch_haxn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115931281557487, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:34:39", "owner": "dat.mellow.fellow.alberto", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848345074579915, "text": "Sa is no the same as statutory rape, as if it needs to be spelt out statutory rape usually means consent was giving but the minor is legally to young to give consent. She is 💯 a pdfile but he gave her consent which is different from an assault. Doesn't make it better, but there is a legal difference. Law should be a mandatory  class in highschool. And this pdfile should be in jail.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:33:35", "owner": "ittiebittietitties", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862611826499794, "text": "@potatolookinhoe these comments are so weird", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:33:24", "owner": "riahhhhkay", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112693615496789, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:33:15", "owner": "normantrip8445", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073210322220161, "text": "🤬", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:32:21", "owner": "ipekaydinukl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852166072522915, "text": "I don’t think bro feels like a victim here 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:32:00", "owner": "jaypalacios__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091306054876704, "text": "Men prove everyday in the comments section why females are sick of them", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:29:40", "owner": "beckyalisajalen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17881818204402581, "text": "Well I'm actually disgusted by this comment section you guys need to actually get laid if your this desperate to get groomed and molested like y'all need to find god or something and I'm an atheist", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:29:38", "owner": "natiskeel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18226186921305851, "text": "This is what white women do! That’s why they say they choose the bear.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:28:52", "owner": "ran_out_of_clever_usernames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391391470124265, "text": "I want to be a victim 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:28:37", "owner": "curtiskennett", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090001762902240, "text": "I would beat anyone trying to do anything with MY child. You see the way she looks at him. Gross. He's a kid. Something is seriously wrong with her.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:28:27", "owner": "dcnrnbsn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080627036485946, "text": "Wish i was a victim ,, ya can’t even get that right lol", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:28:22", "owner": "nonstopalvaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095273476974319, "text": "You lil niggas soft af wtf. Got the kit and the kat . 🤣 what more ya want lol", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:27:40", "owner": "nonstopalvaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150869290408408, "text": "Ppl saying he isn't a victim, it doesn't matter she was older than him....PREDATOR BEHAVIOR", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:27:19", "owner": "p.d_moony", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087002231507811, "text": "How old is he??", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:25:58", "owner": "cmg6891", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108811006581778, "text": "O crime é que não foi comigo!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:23:38", "owner": "victorbarbosa.jp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084871702941379, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:23:26", "owner": "papandactilus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105448303611181, "text": "That is a 15 year old not a 12 year old boy .he knew exactly what  he was doing", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:22:56", "owner": "shawncole54321",