re having sex with her teacher?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:47:55", "owner": "heartlessbatman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296167354264014, "text": "I get this is every young man’s dream fr but if the shoe was on the other foot, a dude would not be getting praise. The double standard in the comment section is disgusting.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:47:33", "owner": "jacobj_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954156672888749, "text": "Haha don’t put crept music on thinking she’s a predator, how about you? Focus on the Muslim dream guns and all the rapes that are going on because of Islam", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:47:31", "owner": "traversea0801", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025937846563350, "text": "So many pedos down here", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:47:28", "owner": "alex.theinfidel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137985652454406, "text": "He’s #winning 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:46:35", "owner": "kaidenjunior1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899320951162153, "text": "Bro def bragging too much and someone else jealous and report it. 🤦‍♂️🤦‍♂️🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:46:32", "owner": "syncategorematically_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083655421791330, "text": "Ppl who made news just jealous 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:43:00", "owner": "nonvanichkul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046294160394613, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:41:39", "owner": "burdy84", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082906823490042, "text": "Would have been nice to habe such a teacher 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:39:08", "owner": "gotze_andreas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081699893006654, "text": "These comments 🤣🍿🥤", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:36:13", "owner": "adamedw4rds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345512329166621, "text": "Women in male spaces", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:35:29", "owner": "ajarisneverempty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906335392123199, "text": "Men saying he is not the victim are the same ones complaining why no one takes their struggles and male loneliness seriously, the irony", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:33:52", "owner": "reeereee773", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854059237555427, "text": "Watch all the men say that he's not a victim and then turn around and complain about no one taking make sa victims serious", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:29:13", "owner": "moonlight.artist10", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18039962516701642, "text": "This comment section is literally that one South Park episode. You are all retarded", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:28:24", "owner": "mrdko_pes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009752822797724, "text": "Damn, where were all these teachers when I was going to school? 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:26:50", "owner": "liwong21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926900992134635, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:26:26", "owner": "leanlarc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902157235143568, "text": "Yall tripping 🤦🏻‍♂️ I would’ve still been with her", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:24:38", "owner": "elvismoran.wav", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066472289371001, "text": "P3rv", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:23:56", "owner": "uhzibu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054515921297911, "text": "My negga man's getting the gifts on lock before dropping the cock. 👏 respect is due", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:23:50", "owner": "rico_insta1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130200478472916, "text": "If the genders had been reversed in this situation you can absolutely guarantee this comment section would have been a very, very different place.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:23:23", "owner": "andy_b909", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17847669084581606, "text": "Bro bagged a mommy 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:23:22", "owner": "rubobinn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17945573067049629, "text": "Coochie and Gucci? Sounds like a w", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:22:50", "owner": "el___sami", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099091153678574, "text": "Did for a Gucci belt didn’t drake write that?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:22:26", "owner": "brucevonemrys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950833683993597, "text": "What about the pakistani grooming gangs?????", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:22:19", "owner": "mglwrr86", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17949066150024210, "text": "The comment section is disgusting. If the gender was reversed I can guarantee they’d be different.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:20:57", "owner": "hannierosy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873187150356014, "text": "He ain’t no Victim he’s daft 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:20:57", "owner": "mrwalkanvibesanting", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047815841374064, "text": "How old was the kid?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:20:42", "owner": "c_lintongeorge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359533969088354, "text": "Lucky guy", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:19:24", "owner": "tyejjones", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897145672299875, "text": "“It’s clear from some of the public commentary when Joynes was convicted that there is still a lack of understanding when it comes to men and boys being the victims of sexual offences. They have had to read comments stating others are ‘jealous’ of them, and that they should be’ happy a young female teacher was interested in them’, and this rhetoric is very damaging and dangerous.\n“Women can still be paedophiles; this term is not reserved only for men. Men and boys can still be victims of sexual abuse. I would encourage anyone who wants to pass comment on this case really thinks before they speak, about the impact their words could have on not only those affected by this case, but others who are currently out there suffering”", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:18:56", "owner": "charluminati", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067038974052373, "text": "Bro used that spankbelt", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:18:38", "owner": "cat_turdcollector", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926877802136243, "text": "This lad is a hero", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:17:56", "owner": "harrybean180697", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100165309658414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:17:49", "owner": "domionico", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081875974953975, "text": "Yeah, right… 😂😂😂😂", "crea