907937, "text": "Bull shit", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:18:53", "owner": "puriya.ariyana.88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099753661647566, "text": "Sending a nonce to catch a nonce", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:18:08", "owner": "captincrunch5631", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367653481159829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:15:31", "owner": "baxter_cooke", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080437982511237, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:13:20", "owner": "silentbod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162118066375695, "text": "Ffs like, my teacher used to be very sexual towards me, she would sit on my lap when teaching language to give example of ‘on top of’ etc. never progressed to sex, but as a horny teenager it was fine by me. \n\nAlso used to flirt with the student teachers and reprographics teacher flat out. I kissed one of them when I was 15 on a night out when I was in my local pub, underage drinking. \nI knew what I was doing, and absolutely would have engaged in full on sex if I could of. \nThe weren’t predators, I never felt like I ‘had to’ to anything. I was young man coming of age that wanted his end away. Just like this lad! This lad was deffo bragging", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:09:13", "owner": "flashineire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269163211304549, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:08:34", "owner": "rescri_cm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090903544676356, "text": "Mommy", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:06:59", "owner": "74hm3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535940365038594, "text": "Bet not lock my ho up 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:06:38", "owner": "ballmunson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057704333406297, "text": "She had a relationship with two boys, both aged 15. One of them got the green eyes and snitched to his mum. If this had happened a few months later it would’ve been legal. She’s not a paedophile. This is a fifteen year olds dream. These boys need real fathers in their lives. That’s the real issue here. Women will manipulate men to get what they want and this is a psychological fact. This is a miscarriage of justice in my opinion. If these boys were pre pubescent it would be a different story. She’s not a criminal. She’s a horny teacher. 👩‍🏫", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:05:03", "owner": "morargilair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080086019041787, "text": "What's the story?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:02:40", "owner": "luisfcacio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18240805429293896, "text": "This comment section is terrifying.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:00:20", "owner": "ironveil.project", "likes": 2231}, {"id": 18061831406427014, "text": "I was tryna be that nga on highschool", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:59:24", "owner": "bsmfredopage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079535678020345, "text": "oh no my steak is too juicy and my lobster is too buttery", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:53:51", "owner": "sexmoneydrago", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17850271170571535, "text": "Why on earth would guy rat😂 he gave up his jackpot😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:52:53", "owner": "juandreferreira", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047142566367601, "text": "Winning", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:51:23", "owner": "tychobrahe300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021957848773563, "text": "It doesn’t matter if the boy even wanted to do it or not this is supposed to be a teacher someone who takes care of children not pray on them", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:50:56", "owner": "xxpombertxx", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18027297482725605, "text": "The thing is having sex with a beautiful girl is not punishment it's a reward.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:50:14", "owner": "fourlegs123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965463870975935, "text": "Some Die of thirst, while Some Drown 🧔🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:49:34", "owner": "imacrov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148946695416960, "text": "Lol. Hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:47:51", "owner": "tsjsvsyskabsgaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845178298591828, "text": "Bro is suffering from success", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:40:38", "owner": "the._.procrasti