: "I wish i was the guy 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:10:38", "owner": "bonabellana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075458438140560, "text": "The CHILD is bigger than her", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:09:18", "owner": "jameschips98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060802769389121, "text": "what the fuck is wrong with yall", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:09:00", "owner": "qreuriel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970922841951492, "text": "Absolutely nothing wrong with this", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:08:08", "owner": "jameschips98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021223961775323, "text": "Where was my predator in school 💔💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:04:47", "owner": "official_demogorgonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061214000614678, "text": "some die of thirst while others drown 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:03:43", "owner": "not4rya.fs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048006932352660, "text": "The comment section is kinda depressing", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:02:16", "owner": "gh0st_inthe_shell", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18375639451194052, "text": "You know she did break the law by sleeping with that boy. It’s good she’s goin to jail. lol but that boy ain’t no victim. He wanted that shit. Probably had it more than once too", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:02:10", "owner": "bodomfeeder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884846881261129, "text": "Bro is a hero to us all💀", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:57:42", "owner": "chrislaflame666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108352270588387, "text": "I guess some other student got his heart broken 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:55:07", "owner": "professor_moneymike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977383818776110, "text": "Its never fucking me bro never", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:51:11", "owner": "d3m0n5p4wn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18241060774289960, "text": "THING IS, IF YOU'RE OK WITH THIS ... YOU CAN NOT HAVE A PROBLEM WITH A GROWN MAN BEING WITH AN UNDERAGE GIRL AND YES THIS INCLUDES YOUR DAUGHTER OR IF YOU HAVE A DAUGHTER IN THE FUTURE. YOU CANT BE A HYPOCRITE 🤷🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:50:38", "owner": "d4ntha1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534086251020460, "text": "Hes one of the lucky ones.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:50:35", "owner": "joe.l.jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085976896939228, "text": "Child?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:45:22", "owner": "aez_io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008896358801127, "text": "That’s a sugar momma wtf", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:43:25", "owner": "project_sti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18534347929025429, "text": "Where were these kinds of teachers when I was in school?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:32:54", "owner": "cornelius.vigovskyy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18059692742445928, "text": "My teachers were almost 60 years old,  with a mustache and used to smoke a pack of cigarettes a day...😢", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:30:36", "owner": "hshneo", "likes": 82}, {"id": 18532715407036815, "text": "This is the only time I wish I was the fkng VICTIM", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:30:05", "owner": "mahmoud_elwawi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092151277835389, "text": "She was the victim in this case 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:29:36", "owner": "fotisvassilopoulos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057107954236974, "text": "Wtf he’s lucky asf 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:27:13", "owner": "edchevy5.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969381150800465, "text": "Someone snitched 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:24:34", "owner": "truemeaningg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17924983134175184, "text": "Release her, bro did not file a complaint...", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:22:50", "owner": "predefeine", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083514121760702, "text": "They still spoke after, and in her statement, she painted herself as a vulnerable. She deserved 3x the amount of prison.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:19:50", "owner": "night.rider_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080436203025832, "text": "All those who say bro is not a victim have double standards. If this was a girl everyone would’ve been in rage. A child is a child. Stop normalizing this.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:10:11", "owner": "enmajic", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985355238860444, "text": "Where do I volunteer?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:06:36", "owner": "mmanny.92", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18070911332250102, "text": "Wtf I thought the guy are the predator", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:03:35", "owner": "koi_221b", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083424781791038, "text": "All dudes his age dream of that", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:01:19", "owner": "carlos.armenta.2014", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053921996281362, "text": "keep it a buck with you, he is not a victim. This is like saying that a teenager who illegally gambled and won 10k suffered and is a victim. My nigga ain't a victim. Sure it is still fucked, but he is not a victim.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:00:55", "owner": "debbiedowned", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081441788095442, "text": "Victim 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:00:08", "owner": "fernando_otabil", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18107359441606563, "text": "I acknowledge he got to play out a school boy fantasy but ultimately she was in a position of trust and took advantage of- don’t work with teenage boys if you are going to look at them like that as it is exploitative- regardless of him knowing what he was doing she it was an abuse of power", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:58:31", "owner": "brazilnutt", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18108955996602070, "text": "All your captions are about strangers but she was not a stranger. Look at these comments, men don't even care about male victims or male mental health so why do men bring it up when female victims are being discussed", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:58:24", "owner": "ashley496804", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095326825700497, "text": "What is wrong with it? He not a child, he is a grown man! Who snitched on him?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:56:41", "owner": "briganteciro", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17902207431279427, "text": "Most victims aren’t in a store getting Gucci shit from the predator!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:56:33", "owner": "just_call_me_cheddar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922409161036660, "text": "Everyone supports because she's a girl", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:55:55", "owner": "isabelvalverdejll", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873358882437474, "text": "Yup expected cmnts frm so called “men” ..", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:52:17", "owner": "with.luv_kiko", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052214537317329, "text": "Where was my teacher like this", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:51:59", "owner": "noinvitenono", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17896782258326599, "text": "Should've been me", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:48:00", "owner": "cola.vina", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18078924161035140, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:47:31", "owner": "micho408rizo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047240108372237, "text": "All of us as men look at this and think “Where tf were these teachers when we were in school.” But in reality, she only likes you because you’re a kid. Once that realization settles in, it’s not funny anymore.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:46:51", "owner": "official2linemusic", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17893553070203050, "text": "Generational Fumble on his end", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:45:00", "owner": "wallie540", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912290527233542, "text": "Praying on children is wrong especially if you are working in schools", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:44:49", "owner": "james.kowalski2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097710289672447, "text": "Victim of what?????? A good time?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:44:08", "owner": "haafezsadi", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17877945858416685, "text": "how did they find out?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:43:30", "owner": "overw8_lover713", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070271963249379, "text": "She’s no predator she a G", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:42:45", "owner": "spoolturboram.805", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098680879732945, "text": "Id wham any mutt that would try this with my son.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:42:38", "owner": "renedawg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079889002864575, "text": "Bro's living dream life", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:41:13", "owner": "eudaemonicbliss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085228738741431, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:39:36", "owner": "mvg3npr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073861216955852, "text": "Where were these teachers when I went to school 🤬", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:37:53", "owner": "amelldjs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082103030478291, "text": "That mf is not a child and well aware of him getting some good 🐱. Overall dude you call a kid wins", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:35:49", "owner": "ethankamalov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848384254579276, "text": "Some envy ass mf snitch", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:35:18", "owner": "_cxmnh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052993430309433, "text": "Pussi and the gucci? In this economy? How that mf a victim? 😂👏", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:33:48", "owner": "el.carranza.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083248456799451, "text": "Where tf was these teachers at when I was younger. Was I just a ugly ass kid", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:32:49", "owner": "looneyminimotors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103537135614328, "text": "Oh no my steak is too juicy...", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:29:39", "owner": "jpedro__98", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866169694405849, "text": "Man what a soft foo", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:29:11", "owner": "goodluckboy1887", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041933582481426, "text": "🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:23:46", "owner": "rayly_alfonzo96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874758160429038, "text": "This is the only kind of victim I want to be", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:23:45", "owner": "de.vante1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17890882626220912, "text": "Smfh", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:20:32", "owner": "incognito_asmr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060082301437777, "text": "Bro was living the dreams 🐱and Gucci!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:19:36", "owner": "mrsrilankan", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18407809771138367, "text": "Y’all laughing but this is disturbing. But this disgusting pedo women sexually coerced two 15 yr old boys and became pregnant with the second boy. Talking to them thru Snapchat 🙄. He’s now forced feels guilt and depression  cause he doesn’t know his own child cause the baby was taken after she gave birth. Both are now 19 but it’s hitting them both hard as they’re understanding what happened to them and seeking help. Especially Boy B who became a father 🤦‍♂️ seek help, this is no joking matter at all. That lady only gotten 6 1/2 yrs, it’s a fucking joke🫩", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:16:16", "owner": "backupria21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101815228727591, "text": "Oh why i wasnt at his spot…", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:14:02", "owner": "antesphotography", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892215046346807, "text": "Bro climbed the ladder 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:13:53", "owner": "_thefanatic_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866426965466743, "text": "bro told on that smfh dummy 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:12:42", "owner": "rylpapiii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093322138834884, "text": "he got snitched because he bragged got his own stupid ahh caught", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:11:21", "owner": "zedzni", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069398144212135, "text": "Did bro ask for help??😭🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:10:49", "owner": "melqui_155", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18535767745014730, "text": "Teachers were never this cool in my day. And no he's not a victim stfu. It's every young man's dream come true.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:08:54", "owner": "doughs_bros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846303376567255, "text": "It's very strange that women that have crossed the line of grooming sometimes get some justice, but a falsely rape and they usually get let off or a minuscule jail term where a man would be given a much stronger punishment for a crime they didn't commit", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:05:57", "owner": "procrastin88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019813613782981, "text": "With his school bag on in the Gucci store 🤣🦮", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:04:39", "owner": "whatyouonfolkz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089202076927409, "text": "How do I become a victim like this", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:03:56", "owner": "nickaguilar323", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18003819317658304, "text": "Bro is not a victim. He is a lucky dude. I always wanted a teacher like this in school but unfortunately it did not happen. Let's not punish these teachers instead let's cherish them and protect them.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:03:06", "owner": "iamkrish113", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17967946877967109, "text": "My history teacher & art teacher liked me back in high-school  but I was too shy lacked experience. Trust me I wouldn't say a thing to my friends that time if I had smashed", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:02:14", "owner": "illswagga247", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081868127468271, "text": "The trial heard that Joynes was 28 when she had come out of a nine-year relationship and was \"flattered\" by the attention of teenage schoolboys. She gave Boy A all but one of the digits of her mobile phone number as a maths problem-solving exercise in which he had to work out the final digit.\nThey then connected on Snapchat and he sent her flirtatious texts, with the pair agreeing to meet in secret.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:01:51", "owner": "hexhammeren", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053048612536751, "text": "Youngest these days really know how to mess up a good thing 🤦🏿", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:00:59", "owner": "drewgeta27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068994029027971, "text": "Usual Victims smh 😅", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:59:45", "owner": "uncle_preme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043637612448624, "text": "Disgusting.... Lucky bast@rd 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:58:49", "owner": "illswagga247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350374579205875, "text": "Bro mad they locked up his bih", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:57:34", "owner": "uzojordan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966269154978055, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:56:37", "owner": "ripul_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024442826568503, "text": "Meetoo should be here", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:53:21", "owner": "xerocl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850219534570780, "text": "The kid is living his best life 🤣...release her", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:51:51", "owner": "mansom55", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855483571542221, "text": "Seriously, how desperate can you be to sleep with a kid. All you need to do is go to a bar or at the club and get someone 21 and up there. 🤦🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:46:44", "owner": "cherese2025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082768567981117, "text": "🙄 so? There is more serious problems in the world.. and these one are making drama for this🫩", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:46:21", "owner": "candy.lula", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062127446576633, "text": "Why this never happened to me when I was a kid?!😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:42:26", "owner": "vlees.mad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17896873575321637, "text": "Damn he ruined it by saying some shit. Could have been clapping for a good while🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:41:28", "owner": "_natedeezy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095535484690867, "text": "He’s not a victim, come on. Being drugged, tied, or forced is being a victim — not this. Look at him, “suffering.” My god, the “trauma.” This kind of narrative takes away from real victims, and it honestly pisses me off.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:38:46", "owner": "alvaro_antu", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18076858559515557, "text": "Ay who snitched 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:37:35", "owner": "kev_n_s", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081308054027407, "text": "Eww who wears Gucci anymore? It’s like the new Coach. Old news 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:36:42", "owner": "farewellalarms_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18154602442398627, "text": "Bros living my dream dam it.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:26:50", "owner": "i_liketurtles_6.7", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18137777368446891, "text": "Far from a victim, my boy is a hero", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:25:55", "owner": "itsnicktheo", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18167239414373227, "text": "Bro is not a victim!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:22:46", "owner": "omgjuanny", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18082840732992741, "text": "But I was told by feminists women were angels and men were bad.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:20:31", "owner": "karllee856", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422741965107855, "text": "🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:20:13", "owner": "mfjvasquez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910167136237193, "text": "This niggas are whack 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:19:24", "owner": "panamajohn09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976020939783159, "text": "fuckass comment section. you all need to stop thinking with your porn brains", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:19:00", "owner": "ryndraws_04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18294282103256162, "text": "For those who truly believe that that poor boy was not a victim, I want you to ask yourself “what if it was an older man and a young girl? Or an older man and a young boy?” Would you still feel the same way? Children can be taken advantage of regardless of gender. You need your hard drives checked if you think that boy is anything other than a victim.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:17:49", "owner": "katblike", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18082978411978968, "text": "Mbfn 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:15:48", "owner": "richnoquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951170167033968, "text": "Male can be a sexual victim only if his female offender is really ugly in his opinion. So that’s obviously not such a case", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:15:01", "owner": "just_voskr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072728951227086, "text": "If my son snitches like this I would become an alocholic and show him what real abuse is cuz aint no fucking way im letting that slide 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:13:35", "owner": "therealconquisherofficial", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18104302057545901, "text": "Wild to see how many people are okay with pedophilia. Imagine if the roles were reversed.", "c