, "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:34:47", "owner": "nathan.g625", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17888155437241158, "text": "It’s always some fucking monkey too these women have deep issues", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:33:55", "owner": "wanghaf147", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965741313829253, "text": "There's not a single teacher whose guts I was trying to stir up. They were all 600 pound bulldogs.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:32:49", "owner": "emerging_lobster", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17848864221578799, "text": "Not talking to strangers is not a good way to raise your kids..", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:31:39", "owner": "d3ano0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541671754036272, "text": "No crime, they had a deal", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:31:24", "owner": "marshallclark326", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17858896764530806, "text": "I mean he got what he wanted 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:31:17", "owner": "prettyadree", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104241871558698, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:31:07", "owner": "williampoohdiaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927478261111388, "text": "Lol, you love to blame others for your problems. Teach your kids better then, especially women, males know what they're doing, women not so much, obviously there's a much bigger power dynamic with men and girls.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:30:57", "owner": "tchris1985", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105832345607233, "text": "Shes hot she can diddle me all she wants", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:29:54", "owner": "h33rby", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086635243932681, "text": "Lucky bastard", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:29:08", "owner": "martinfloresgar91", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966285063969615, "text": "Some of you need some sense beaten into yall", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:27:43", "owner": "j.s.darwinist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106009510612757, "text": "Some die of thirst, others drown", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:27:15", "owner": "millyretail", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097302511666751, "text": "She is so creepy.", "create