025-10-17T00:15:01", "owner": "jonnynissim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058118846213923, "text": "I bet you he was the one hitting on her first. Then, F her really good and she fell in love on that “fck and not get caught aventure”… ☝️ So, later his parent find out and he play the victim.. Trust me on this one… My boy just got rid of his cat and clothes cus he couldn’t hold water in his mouth.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:14:24", "owner": "dionysrd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070548098518713, "text": "She was so excited", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:13:34", "owner": "cali13074", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065578904375250, "text": "Wish it was me", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:13:12", "owner": "crazy_funny_repost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154259833395857, "text": "He fucked up a good thing. Gotta brag to the boys. 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:13:11", "owner": "jj._.702", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092608468849393, "text": "😂 f the belt I'd have asked for ❄️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:12:53", "owner": "mazalito25", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861950416436926, "text": "Shoulda left wit da lettuce too", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:12:48", "owner": "melsavestheday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088449301902986, "text": "He was not a victim 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:11:20", "owner": "idc.kojisoloseazily", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18124990768500965, "text": "That ain’t no child", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:10:08", "owner": "carlitoselpibe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108658426600989, "text": "Damn. She can take me to her flat 😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:09:29", "owner": "deyv.andrade", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065078420103609, "text": "Oh come on.. stop with this shit. If it’s not at home and it’s not against his will, he ain’t a victim. He had the option and he chose well.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:08:58", "owner": "inoahsup", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17911192977235255, "text": "This is what your focused on instead of the blackmailing, and compromised leaders in the Epstein files?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:08:56", "owner": "cenruc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044519621406654, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:07:09", "owner": "zr1da", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047523752348520, "text": "Can I be her victim 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:03:16", "owner": "diazthedog97", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879289012411229, "text": "He’s absolutely a VICTIM. Say it louder for the idiots in the back!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:01:16", "owner": "thislife_onlyone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093201565873149, "text": "The only case l wanna be a victim of😭", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:01:01", "owner": "ju_do100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867196369465859, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:58:19", "owner": "martinlopez7811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060909512394008, "text": "I wish that was me", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:57:27", "owner": "ivanbericnino", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085526591499604, "text": "Damn....", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:56:19", "owner": "arthurscmdt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100579324634581, "text": "\"Men get graped too\" \"men's mental health matters\" crowd when a man is actually a victim for once:", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:55:33", "owner": "sparkyoshi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081961498839865, "text": "That’s my boy!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:55:11", "owner": "realhiroguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043639565446693, "text": "That guy ain't vulnerable. Also he doesn't look like a child", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:52:46", "owner": "emjae___23_____100000", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973026315793148, "text": "That's not a crime that's a come up", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:50:27", "owner": "capt0capt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17946274484915809, "text": "These kids be lame as fuck!! Like how??", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:47:00", "owner": "koffee229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081691877010196, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:45:58", "owner": "jhanwick_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938905114085678, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:45: