"owner": "gym.ratsnutrition", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17854687536501674, "text": "F off , no men will say she’s se*ual predator . Luck mf", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:26:10", "owner": "muthurajh_chelva", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095020804759402, "text": "Prob bought the vlone hoodie yoo", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:24:07", "owner": "anthony.p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149410648413174, "text": "cop has a very hard job of convincing himself and the woman it’s bad.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:23:19", "owner": "real_samden23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848787970546115, "text": "Sad how twisted people think this is a win for the teen involved right ? But this is the problem with educational institutions we need boys to be taught by men for a start, 🤷🏻‍♂️ but yeh women can be bigger creeps because to them they don't see the harm because of the way most people in the comments think", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:23:08", "owner": "arcadealchemist_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288698383272865, "text": "Nigga is living the good life", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:21:29", "owner": "hekeeponevolving_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975737070929424, "text": "She kinda thick....🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:21:14", "owner": "solcaron_7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039891014704031, "text": "Oh no, the air is too fresh, my food is too delicious", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:20:41", "owner": "roddzillaa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17899335864297272, "text": "God I wish that was me", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:20:28", "owner": "lucio.mkv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18401778190191500, "text": "He made her spend hard earned money on him and gave up her body and some how she is in the wrong", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:19:06", "owner": "reaper11189", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071151728241226, "text": "How is this a crime? Soft ah society 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:18:27", "owner": "maikol.ruiz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059453294557293, "text": "Repeat after me: Women who have sex with young boys are not predators.They are heroes", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:18:20", "owner": "wphcad2.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846931642583707, "text": "If I was young and she wanted it I'm there kids ain't stupid these days", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:13:43", "owner": "tajo419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864075799474366, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:13:37", "owner": "johnmc_616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981260349910540, "text": "Free Rebecca", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:12:32", "owner": "jevon1126", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18377929879179117, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:12:31", "owner": "leicester.scumbag", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052583279313442, "text": "Not all women but always a woman.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:11:27", "owner": "jeff_prenta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987611751728402, "text": "That boy realizes he likes 🍆 better than 🐱", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:10:57", "owner": "jayygee04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18180079093351106, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:09:28", "owner": "lapapabelica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050731736329500, "text": "He himself knows he is not a victim, he knows what time it is. Teacher is predator cuz she damn well knows what she is doing!!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:08:00", "owner": "jess.toledo26", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18129591130468151, "text": "All the dudes in the comments need to grow up from their teenage fantasies 🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:07:59", "owner": "brad.ley3547", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18099682228733894, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:06:45", "owner": "realhajiahmad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17901133707278643, "text": "It's funny to joke about but the bitch is a retarded loser", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:06:36", "owner": "pygmachia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330484717238835, "text": "Holding different standards for young girls and boys today shows we still suffer under a misogynistic society where both genders are harmed. There is no giant maturity gap between girls and boys in the same age that can conclude “they knew what they were doing” to be having an intimate relationship with someone that can easily abuse their authority in power dynamics. In fact, girls mature earlier than boys do but this whole defense doesn’t even hold up well because children in general mature at different rates. The idea that girls are powerless, defenseless and clueless about a hypothetical abuse that would happen to them is misogynistic and that expects the BOY to take the place of this intelligent, strong person who could never be the victim in any way because they have all the means to protect themselves.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:05:14", "owner": "obscene_scene", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18099646198636379, "text": "He's like 2 feet taller than her cmon now 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:03:50", "owner": "papa_smoosh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056278775244596, "text": "How did he ruin this again 🤦🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:01:11", "owner": "md_goose", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872540296440472, "text": "Not a victim, free her", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:01:01", "owner": "jmgr_33", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072303860238797, "text": "I wish", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:00:33", "owner": "s6donttrip", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870279079449581, "text": "Whether he's big enough or not, she abused her position as a teacher. Therefore, she has to be held accountable. We send our kids to school to be taught, not taken to hotel rooms.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:00:29", "owner": "dphantommuzic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18109051906576347, "text": "I feel like (god not all but if you get emotional about my comment you’re probably in the criteria) some men support all rape unless it’s man on man and even then there’s those that still fantasize about that. Seriously fucked up. But given how they’d say “she asked for it bro” I’m not surprised that the majority of comments are “bro wanted it” “he’s not a victim he got pussy” like that’s the mentality of a predator.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22: