kes": 2}, {"id": 17941968666074174, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂whaaaaaaaaaaaat", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:04:00", "owner": "txny94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071919395228013, "text": "@sashagrey", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:03:34", "owner": "mx.ugly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898531882299409, "text": "Is the victim in the room with us🤣?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:03:32", "owner": "liamjamesparker", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18190629703328133, "text": "Victim of a good time 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:00:06", "owner": "jackhnyc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091801012873971, "text": "Keep the same attitude when it's your underage daughter and a male adult. You all deserve to be thrown in the wood chipper.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:00:06", "owner": "mygoatsquirtzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172840252362123, "text": "HORRIBLE COMMENTS HES NOT LUCKY HES A VICTIM", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:55:31", "owner": "meshbesh20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101454187714374, "text": "Wow man I’d trade all the lucky shit that’s happened to me to go back and bang my middle school substitute Miss Perota 😂😭 thick ass Latina with a dump truck on her @cheefinthereefa", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:53:02", "owner": "soberllife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970250394958932, "text": "Even as a kid I would never want to ruin a woman’s life just because she was older than me and was attracted to me, if I wasn’t interested I would’ve just said naw I’m good, but if I’m gonna let you buy me designer belts and take me back to your crib then that means I’m down for whatever and what we do stays between us.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:51:33", "owner": "neez_flyinglow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18314960320168283, "text": "I want to be a victim!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:51:01", "owner": "djumel2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985075749871001, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:49:44", "owner": "theonlyljoner", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082235608823057, "text": "if the teacher was instead a male, and the child a female, would that change the way you guys are commenting?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:49:08", "owner": "merunfiltered", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18535717795029975, "text": "She wanted him to belt her on the arse with that high quality accessory.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:48:44", "owner": "necrogasm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087827929898722, "text": "The amount of people who are ok with PDFiles if the genders are reversed is honestly sickening", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:48:00", "owner": "scotty_nox", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062058563387414, "text": "I wish I had been “taken advantage of” by good looking teachers. Dumb as s kids (boys) snitching on that is crazy.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:47:12", "owner": "erika26869", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063033200579040, "text": "Stranger danger… sure but most predators are known and trusted people. So this teaching without the real one actually helps enable abusers", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:46:22", "owner": "melizee123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086783146938660, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:46:14", "owner": "robertotroshani", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18489092677076027, "text": "why that shit never happen here", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:45:36", "owner": "munnaaaaa.44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081265817091398, "text": "Bro wtf kind of shit is this never got lucky like this 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:45:12", "owner": "muro_e92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18315312409170641, "text": "Lucky Victim, Gucci + 🐱 = WINNING LOL", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:43:42", "owner": "mr.ed2329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060200228181228, "text": "Why was there no teachers around like this when i was growing up 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:43:25", "owner": "notshamx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842785240598507, "text": "Bro even gets a belt?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:35:38", "owner": "guiritt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104084221719116, "text": "Gucci and coochie", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:34:55", "owner": "_infinite_eclipse_", "lik