thing, I never felt like a victim. I’ve never been damaged it was fun.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:16:54", "owner": "habsalibaba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926491942114825, "text": "Lucky mf 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:16:30", "owner": "alex_vnt10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058533563544507, "text": "Homie was getting harassed by his parents “where you get the belt from where you get money to buy the belt” 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:11:22", "owner": "jovonamado", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18134052076413433, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:08:54", "owner": "mvinmeekvh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18412160266185408, "text": "where were this teachers when i was back in high school?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:08:26", "owner": "colombian.gguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071237390217046, "text": "These comments are the reason why male victims don’t speak out smh", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:06:40", "owner": "annessoul24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044077493430689, "text": "If that happened to me I would have held it down for her and not tell a soul 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:06:37", "owner": "oshane.perera", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18097424920604586, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:03:58", "owner": "serial.joe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17997756509687310, "text": "He knew exactly what was going on", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:59:49", "owner": "stuartcummings71", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18380941699194616, "text": "See fellas when a women is really in love with you, she will do anything for you, even buy you a gucci belt 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:57:51", "owner": "naeem_042", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082480220128581, "text": "Where were these teachers when I was in school! 🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:54:15", "owner": "pacci_lv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18137929561447599, "text": "Vic whattt..", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:53:47", "owner": "the_rookie11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045535739394944, "text": "I thought teachers didn't make a lot of money.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:53:32", "owner": "chi_townbrownie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096200290667484, "text": "Man wen I was in school all my teacher was old as dust 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:51:13", "owner": "sp_the_great813", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18040211063492441, "text": "If his parents give consent their shouldn't be an issue imo", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:49:16", "owner": "therealryanstafford", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18243366565294338, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:41:35", "owner": "_vishal_raghav007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863951419480515, "text": "All I got was detentions and that too from Miss Trunchbull lookalikes.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:39:19", "owner": "dynamicpropertymanagement", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983105826752215, "text": "After looking at the comments, too many sexually deprived men fantasizing about getting molested as a child", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:38:53", "owner": "negativauraa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881622364283317, "text": "She’s bad too 😭!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:37:41", "owner": "obii.obe", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17849686563574378, "text": "Why did I never have this kind of teacher?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:37:23", "owner": "falkhammermueller", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18077288393028646, "text": "Why would police even arrest teachers who fuck her male students? It is so obvious a guy is not a victim. Serious statement", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:35:19", "owner": "beckzzat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873273187356870, "text": "Bro got a Gucci belt and cheeks? He’s winning in life.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:34:04", "owner": "_this.guy.knows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048959873673812, "text": "Bro bragged too much forsure", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:33:02", "owner": "dzurovskibojan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085708897942439, "text": "I need a gucci belt", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:28:48", "owner": "whyamihere6183", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080251151085546, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:27:47", "owner": "nightuser19", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17982605906866220, "text": "Fuk sake where we these teachers when I was at school.  Just buy me some hot chips . Forget the Gucci belt", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:25:16", "owner": "jayxdee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059937770569262, "text": "I want to be a victim too😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:22:31", "owner": "_thehatefulseven_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314283052171429, "text": "men should change their mentality saying he is not a victim. guys are encouraging sexual assault on boys. imagine women even criticize a 40 years old man dating a 25 years old woman.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:22:03", "owner": "mont_tony00", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045227468402005, "text": "Im the victim cause where tf you find these ones at", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:21:56", "owner": "jahkachu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870697630448370, "text": "Sounds great.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:20:55", "owner": "bossconcepts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987553662887539, "text": "who keeps snitching bro🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:20:36", "owner": "tpstrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984035994746995, "text": "😐😐I am the victim for wanting this", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:20:21", "owner": "sobhan.salartalab2024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952696881892121, "text": "Bro either was gay or his boys were jealous", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:19:26", "owner": "lionsin90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001512857670289, "text": "It’s fake and I do not support this tbh because the world is lying to that young man and they won’t give a shit about him when he turns 18 in one more year or so anyways. Why go through all this extra stuff when he gonna get treated diff as a man later anyways and system will be against him instead of being with him soon", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:18:10", "owner": "jprince2189", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024347531773819, "text": "For those who say « he’s not the victim » you’re part of the problem", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:17:43", "owner": "w.ldg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080406641048861, "text": "I have loved to hit that teacher bro🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:12:23", "owner": "chris792759", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994738848698473, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:11:52", "owner": "human3khodaparast", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925056178137747, "text": "Women in male dominant fields and guys in female dominant fields \n\nA p3d0 and a gold digger", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:09:29", "owner": "imaginationinthedark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093933901642509, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:01:34", "owner": "khanq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165807598373443, "text": "What a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:01:15", "owner": "calnumber123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102845380711854, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:55:33", "owner": "dubs_goodblood", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18160820194391494, "text": "Bro got some Gucci and some coochie 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:55:03", "owner": "lluiss5.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850080919571174, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:53:53", "owner": "tnashhhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059845661170068, "text": "These so-called “predator catchers” often seem to have more psychological issues than the people they target. In many developed countries, the ages involved wouldn’t even classify the accused as predators. What we’re really seeing is a symptom of America’s prudishness and sexual anxiety—an obsession driven more by moral panic and envy than by genuine concern for public safety. Even when evidence contradicts these moral panics, as shown in the Rind et al. (1998) controversy, the urge for punishment and moral superiority still triumphs over rational thinking.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:49:22", "owner": "splitwin2023", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083874128492782, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:49:17", "owner": "hiks.online", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843534325596395, "text": "Yoooooooo damnnnnnn where the fuck was these teachers at when I was in school!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:47:00", "owner": "dat1_dudee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075778652126739, "text": "someone’s dream is someone’s reality", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:46:57", "owner": "fassihahmedfaiq", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18345977131164709, "text": "My teacher use to give me blowjobs, and it completely ruined my life. Sometimes i sit at night and think to myself is life worth living, i dont think ill ever get such amazing blowjobs again 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:44:07", "owner": "seventy7eight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929128360109588, "text": "This isn’t abuse this is premium membership 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:43:14", "owner": "__yes_imfunny__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17910929976090758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:41:41", "owner": "biggusdiickus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965341995986039, "text": "What a little snitch 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:39:52", "owner": "dyl.wil.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080944673063701, "text": "Where were those teachers when I was in school 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:39:19", "owner": "steeiey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072193330993642, "text": "What's a flat ??", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:35:54", "owner": "triniscntting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095085571817053, "text": "Let me be her victim 😂 Damn, she will give you 😺 and even the gift.  It's a win - win for him.  And when little girls in 14-15 sleep with adults and  give birth to a child, they are  blessed by people. Like wtf...", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:32:54", "owner": "b1ink191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085409143757234, "text": "That's a grown ass man sir😢", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:30:28", "owner": "the_fanarteest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944697130056090, "text": "Me next 🙋‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:29:24", "owner": "putinsiphone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061779014570434, "text": "People when they realize that victims can be willing😱😱😱 like bro that's a child y'all disgusting", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:28:17", "owner": "hannylikehoneyy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955592193992317, "text": "I wish this happened to me 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:25:54", "owner": "y2merlin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098801521670392, "text": "Can I be her victim please", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:25:11", "owner": "jacobson24000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097347124774001, "text": "Bro what 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:25:03", "owner": "mcar_daniel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901989967147958, "text": "Bro just stfu , you are no victim 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:24:47", "owner": "m_trabulo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887323522371210, "text": "How old is she?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:22:39", "owner": "notdyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983897280907405, "text": "What a victim, can I be one as well please?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:21:52", "owner": "_al3x.filip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863424448495535, "text": "Is there any vacancy of VICTIM available??", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:20:25", "owner": "syeddaniyalrazazaidi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851793157526353, "text": "Love how everyone in the comments is like \"that is not a child\", \"he is no victim\". Meanwhile, if a teacher did this to any of their daughters, rage would go wild out there. Crazy double standards. It's not about if he is ok with it, which he probably was. It's about the law, and she broke it. By you all logic, if a under age girl agrees to it, then it's fine to do it. 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:20:02", "owner": "x.miguel_andrade.x", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863262184494104, "text": "Hopefully is not all downhill for him from here on… that’s hard to beat as a teen boy. We had kings who were 13 years old. Teach boys to be men early on and raise your daughters to never be victims.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:19:56", "owner": "dayknight1908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061142555432677, "text": "That's not a funking child", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:17:52", "owner": "chilling_40s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059819879428659, "text": "Why why not me", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:13:12", "owner": "miguel_ferreira_7473", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18321468649213694, "text": "Bro cmon", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:12:03", "owner": "unrelatedjohnsmith", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094139284775571, "text": "M telling you he ain't victim sictim 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:10:21", "owner": "tan.ime897", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081823109304613, "text": "Imagine if it was the other way around and she gets all happy bc he buy her a LV bag....I wonder if she would be a victim too", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:09:34", "owner": "_sidib", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18182101378341912, "text": "Bro is a scum\nHe took the 🐱 and put her in jail.. he knew what he’s getting into.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:06:30", "owner": "extra_tp007", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17914528464196679, "text": "She ain’t half bad either, leave the lady be!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:02:36", "owner": "michaeldaly29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096396403747164, "text": "These new kids are gay asf how you gonna 🐀", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:52:06", "owner": "kingsa0101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115952716553240, "text": "He’s living his best life ffs", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:50:52", "owner": "laurelbay7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962220675842257, "text": "Hes a lucky kid", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:50:29", "owner": "bndzbbg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890604886225175, "text": "Where is the child ?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:44:37", "owner": "espazito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046366070671101, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:44:16", "owner": "w_atersheep", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18428182069102622, "text": "When there is no victim, there is no crime, yet somehow, a prosecution?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:42:30", "owner": "sveltdre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18532213498057961, "text": "Shoulda been m- I mean… shocking", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:40:12", "owner": "red_x_todd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17896951725336289, "t