er is she rich or something?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:09:29", "owner": "qanonymouse_1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000343175822129, "text": "I see this as an ultimate win", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:47:05", "owner": "rafa_nok", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023686514574188, "text": "Where were all these fucking teachers when I was a teenager man", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:12:50", "owner": "isaac_a_garcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024717371775114, "text": "That’s a dream a for teenage boy. For anyone saying that people don’t take male victims seriously , he’s about a foot taller than her and much stronger , he is not a victim , he’s an idiot who could t keep a secret.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:14:04", "owner": "kayuari2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026281637552742, "text": "I buy you gucci belt, just take me as your victim.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:43:31", "owner": "jeszeronesmark", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026339930554777, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:25:20", "owner": "an.veshak", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18046224878392798, "text": "All these dudes are fucked thinking it's ok to rape a boy but if it was there daughter and a teacher was buying  her stuff to smash  would they say it's cool😂 hopefully there daughter is getting smashed by a old teacher tricking on her 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:08:07", "owner": "jayvillain91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046327697383384, "text": "That’s a grown ass man😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:10:43", "owner": "rackianity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057283979226774, "text": "How come no hot teacher bought GTA v back then or sum 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:55:23", "owner": "brisan24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057727265208472, "text": "She buying gucci on a teacher salary??", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:13:57", "owner": "j.wade.jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058567844426684, "text": "Who else wants to give him a knuckle sandwich", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:49:00", "owner": "voltagehomeandlawn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18