ictim next?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:48:11", "owner": "skitzfoz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974728953946395, "text": "She was wanting that young meat 🥩.🐱", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:48:15", "owner": "paradiseneymar1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976628187780204, "text": "Smh where the fuck were these teachers when I was in school 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:16:56", "owner": "mr_el_jefe33788", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982937640750769, "text": "bro suffering from success", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:06:48", "owner": "vvhndrxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993106704846395, "text": "What a fu(;:;;:(( pu/-$ ahh ninja bro like for real lol🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:01:56", "owner": "xsuperoutlawx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039759554693812, "text": "Can she be prosecuted if the kid denies everything to protect her?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:37:53", "owner": "kaianttila", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048336191670334, "text": "Poor guy -____- 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:20:37", "owner": "n.n.__77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055852607246100, "text": "I was too ugly, apparently. 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:56:14", "owner": "eboun_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058019387204565, "text": "When I was in school, we got HILDA and GERTRUDE", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:08:49", "owner": "4toncookie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059915048395146, "text": "Lucky a$$ 🥷", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:19:40", "owner": "diego_el_maximo1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061953164434327, "text": "It's a kid you guys are disgusting.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T00:57:10", "owner": "xm177e2.92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068474360352855, "text": "If my teacher is like this then I'm not going to become a victim I'm enjoying every last a bit", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:55:57", "owner": "irei266", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068708825583346, "text": "Hes not a victim,  he is a little bitch", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:21:18", "owner": "drewski._2x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071485915995575, "text": "She's not a sex