hat will twist this to something else SHE IS STILL WRONG AS A TEACHER AND AS SOMEONE THAT IS TRUSTED With YOUNG ADULT \"teens\". ⚠️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:16:08", "owner": "semperintenebris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085849000937101, "text": "Wtf is wrong with these comments, that's a child, yk what I don't wanna hear no f*cking \"reverse the gender now\" sh*t, because y'all trash af, that's a child", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:52:09", "owner": "astronomyview", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087422482932265, "text": "And all my teachers gave me was detention 🤷‍♂️🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:43:24", "owner": "jordanlong92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090047284874327, "text": "Why our teachers never victimise us in our days😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:02:18", "owner": "mumbling_thought", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098840488658035, "text": "Who was the victim again?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T00:59:08", "owner": "peace_stalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099551101735110, "text": "When does the British ever care about stuff like that", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:31:31", "owner": "blink._dgb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100522483645091, "text": "WTF were these teachers back in my days?? 😩😭😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:22:06", "owner": "alexander_flores._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109541833516352, "text": "This is dumb as fuck 😂 what victim?!?!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:20:02", "owner": "brentklim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110359441574517, "text": "Is victim in this reel?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:45:43", "owner": "ark09_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112998886485417, "text": "Yo sign me up wtf😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:32:40", "owner": "adamtrebinskie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119950924514500, "text": "I was born way too early.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T00:56:31", "owner": "1mp3rial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124191337443176, "text": "Y’all are fcking stupid she SA’D a fckin kid and you’re worried about a Gucci belt you fckin idiots are sick and I hope all of you burn in 