it as the teacher buying the belt for assaulter and then she was gonna beat him with the same belt in her flat.......had to re read and was disappointed", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:58:08", "owner": "spicee.ice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929563921106323, "text": "Wish my school life had suchlike happen..", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:08:04", "owner": "scott.aspden.za", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931277245102088, "text": "Comment section disappointing", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:21:22", "owner": "meweezy_miran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932951179070786, "text": "Women assualting vs men assaulting 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:45:39", "owner": "clairesamores", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956575266871904, "text": "That looks like a 30 year old man wtf", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:02:00", "owner": "bibocribo87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964202727831195, "text": "Yn effer. Send her to africa and save some money", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:18:17", "owner": "haiwanhell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969143460953464, "text": "Lucky af", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:02:31", "owner": "hirst305", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983236770873403, "text": "He got a guy belt and ass the same day whats the problem@", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:53:11", "owner": "driplordissa_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987246414730511, "text": "Listen… usually I’m very against female predators. I think female pedos are a very real threat. But this kid is NOT a victim 😭 I wish someone would’ve victimized me buying me Gucci", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:44:35", "owner": "reenamontes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990663987851548, "text": "Victim?! I wanna be a \"victim\"", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:56:59", "owner": "auxenic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021528836777515, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:49:26", "owner": "stive_hc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022419140771691, "text": "What kind of teacher has money for a Gucci belt??💀💀", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:51:32", "owner": "nvaderr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025697705552043, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:22:09", "owner": "theeshort1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032126555719024, "text": "Horny males in comments assume that your teacher having a crush on you  is always a good thing. It depends! A woman can mentally torture a man, causing as much pain and suffering as physical torture. If not more. I don't know the story, but assuming that the boy is automatically happy with this is naive. He may have no option to exit these relationships, for example. He may like another girl, but the teacher would never let him go. Or she may intentionally get pregnant from him to bound him for life. Or maybe she is just crazy and mentally unstable, so he is afraid to stop this relationship.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:55:55", "owner": "volk_kuraga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056573774551647, "text": "I wish I had that teacher when I was growing up🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:25:07", "owner": "idk123458430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061451117153047, "text": "WE HAD TEACHERS GROWING UP BRO 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:24:22", "owner": "_bossman__98__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065563865102317, "text": "What did i do wrong god? 😢😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:09:01", "owner": "whodoitrust__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071056529520465, "text": "Bros is king in the group chat", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:52:51", "owner": "nickaparicio1999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072814897959181, "text": "Release that woman", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:05:26", "owner": "_jake_ech20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074413157165591, "text": "Ppl really think this is bad ??", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:21:03", "owner": "yniguez.99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074808244902641, "text": "🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:14:54", "owner": "mossymoss88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076882994106381, "text": "Very GOOD!!!! ARREST HER!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:04:59", "owner": "mostwanted_obi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077835263108240, "text": "Luckkyyyyy", "created_at": "2025-10-15T