reated_at": "2025-10-15T16:16:15", "owner": "adotbdot03", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047597981342403, "text": "How can you be so gay to let the police know i swear he failed in life already", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:15:24", "owner": "snelsnelweggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054450545271437, "text": "Usual suspect", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:11:31", "owner": "mrbellooooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058092782201906, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:02:10", "owner": "lin.robby", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060301826163403, "text": "Let's be real here, yes it's legally wrong. If I had a daughter would I be happy this happened to her? No. But if I had a son and this happened, and he was happy then fair play. Guaranteed the only trauma this lad received is backlash from the media. He's happy as fcuk", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:55:11", "owner": "4shm3x_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061851260146547, "text": "I want to be a victim 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:22:58", "owner": "gdelgado97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067818008057451, "text": "Victim??", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:56:43", "owner": "giacsmergs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069876872522168, "text": "Where is this kind of predators when we’re studying?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:09:02", "owner": "pangetxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070341215196657, "text": "He got a Gucci belt and some cucci cat?\nHis steaks too juicy and lobster too buttery", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:19:17", "owner": "slootslappa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074794982471568, "text": "Nobody snitched. His momma asked him where or how he got a Gucci belt 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:12:41", "owner": "pwaitforitt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074813633179961, "text": "GUCCI 🐱 and A+ …broski winning in life", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:58:41", "owner": "bgrf18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075971378277282, "text": "Ffs where were these teachers when I was at school", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:22:25", "owner": "jasonbrooks1280", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076862969155852, "text": "How old is he though?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:13:19", "owner": "justin_fitzzhughhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080619830286911, "text": "Some men are actually vile! The comments are sick 🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:10:43", "owner": "saskillajah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081087422099460, "text": "Disgusting comments here. She was in a position trust, groomed and sexually assaulted these boys, even having a child with one.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:19:04", "owner": "gothloretta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082848659487268, "text": "\"he's minor\", but he's male....we know exactly what we are doing", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:36:53", "owner": "weirdasspov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083262202789791, "text": "Where was this teacher when I was young?!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:28:35", "owner": "_thjesht.teo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083687362786680, "text": "Where were these predator female teachers when I was in school?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:49:48", "owner": "andyhu751", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085327409502300, "text": "That smile on her face said it all. He was bussing them guts", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:16:37", "owner": "lawson_esq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090090355883380, "text": "Sister saw the Gucci, then told mom, then mom tell asking where he got it from. Dad came in the living room, boy panicked and spilled the beans. So yes, The culprit was the older sister . Tq", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:10:23", "owner": "mln_3mn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090306109883603, "text": "Victim 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:28:46", "owner": "telodicelb", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093235405634590, "text": "question from my deepest heart, is there a registration form to be a victim?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:35:24", "owner": "weirdasspov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094888480747252, "text": "Brits and Aussies love making fun of Americans and their schools but y'all MAKE LOVE with ur students 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:51:28", "owner": "kadin_rubley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096797449776390, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:33:42", "owner": "rreinfacht", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097384867780686, "text": "I use to wish for this to happen to me when I was his age", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:30:19", "owner": "leealsafh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098544886679265, "text": "Spoilt", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:27:10", "owner": "the__admiral__durrant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100136209659997, "text": "bro got the gucci and the coochie", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:53:23", "owner": "kepeybara", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115559383553058, "text": "This doesnt feel like a sexual assault. She is a young and attractive Woman.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:47:14", "owner": "minchenxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119947582460642, "text": "I will never understand why teachers do ts, it's so incredibly absurd", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:11:45", "owner": "miguelangelloyd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138976117450575, "text": "Still with the Covid plexiglass", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:24:21", "owner": "camillodavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143126494391009, "text": "I’d love to be unsafe in this case", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:36:13", "owner": "realtomperkins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152064799366245, "text": "Did the boy complain", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:50:46", "owner": "sbd_interiordesigns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179749408351381, "text": "Release the Epstein files", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:50:42", "owner": "luka.ace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295671070281280, "text": "Where were the teachers like her when i was in high school", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:37:00", "owner": "fractured_arm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298063060249605, "text": "Bro never was and will never be", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:58:54", "owner": "mnlmrsinister", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310734259222086, "text": "I feel bad for bro, I wish I could have taken his place and endured what he went through instead. Over and over.", "created_at": "2025-1