"likes": 0}, {"id": 17904269601262149, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:34:18", "owner": "criss_12312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912483775217927, "text": "Lord, I see the blessings you do for others 🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:27:54", "owner": "uviermygod", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17920069515189724, "text": "Stop this sht , he ain't a victim. Fk thus age sht.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:39:51", "owner": "void.in.void", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954184482886612, "text": "Wait wait wait ….. let me tell you something 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:35:22", "owner": "thedisaster.artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997494618687354, "text": "I want to live that dream Mr. Pool", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:57:32", "owner": "sacg_3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013507559794993, "text": "Where’s this kind of female teacher when i’m in school. I’ll have good score, nice stuf & nice life.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:55:46", "owner": "josejaiyen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026781083752140, "text": "She’s a sex ed teacher", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:32:54", "owner": "raymundo_a_romero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043549064437961, "text": "Good grades, cookies, free shopping - the officer ruined this bros future investment 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:56:47", "owner": "fabfayz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045281915390183, "text": "Victim ??? 😭🤣🤣 bro suffering from success 😂😂run that belt up gang", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:27:50", "owner": "future_greatness_1995", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046057991374685, "text": "Ayo! Times are changing. Which school is this? 👀", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:22:20", "owner": "alejo.gp_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047808104370198, "text": "Why tf did he turn her in.... Got a fit teacher and a Gucci belt", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:43:23", "owner": "gregosss_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053015243312739, "text": "Lock her away for life! I hope that boy is ok.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:49:06", "owner": "angiefryer17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057749192208296, "text": "Not to excuse a grown adult doing shit with a highschooler, but Kid knew exactly what he was doing lol we’ve all been there as boys and we would’ve all been down for it. Hell the amount of girls that I knew who would only hook up with 20+ year olds in high school was astounding.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:17:02", "owner": "j_yunli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057758714204496, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:16:21", "owner": "fuzzyl00ser", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061697342152938, "text": "This girl will most likely be arrogant to guys her age approaching her 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:33:07", "owner": "wizie_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065299934604152, "text": "The lad was lucky tbf 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:54:55", "owner": "latino_lancs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067398044346566, "text": "“Victim”", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:12:03", "owner": "lauch_bd", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18069240326032258, "text": "TOMMY ROBINSON - she doesn’t look Muslim or brown to me. Where’s the outrage from your hooligans? Wait, I must have stolen their integrity as well as their jobs.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:07:07", "owner": "closed20122024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070270241462759, "text": "Women have sex with who they want, Men have sex with who they can. Let that sink in.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:44:09", "owner": "suffianhajikamaruddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070686086007818, "text": "The teenager's father might have snitched, he got jealous of his son", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:33:53", "owner": "aniki_bro", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071648003201476, "text": "Who snitched", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:56:05", "owner": "mat_teo226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072648035236665, "text": "Wait do you all really think having sex with a minor is a win?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:53:49", "owner": "mommybigheartr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072692597189958, "text": "I have never wanted to be a victim so bad until now", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:36:53", "owner": "austin_freni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073630030943180, "text": "Bros a hero 😂😂😂 not a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:35:34", "owner": "zacstudd", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18075554035932309, "text": "@thibaud_schl Tf is wrong with your hair?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:45:24", "owner": "i.m.f.i.n.e_0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076824454882137, "text": "He shouldn't of told anyone.  Next boys hatin", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:38:38", "owner": "w.aslam84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078342812079738, "text": "I need a belt too🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:38:57", "owner": "agm_4130219", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080524208100044, "text": "man listen it was 2 teachers I had i still wish shit like this had went down lol.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:35:54", "owner": "elfman_1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082576777961422, "text": "Stabbb her", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:56:50", "owner": "mz81mz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082723934075101, "text": "🤢", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:41:37", "owner": "sammy_bandz1187", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086121728308735, "text": "\"What about male victims\" - men under every stating statistics about violence against women - same ones commenting how he is lucky etc. here", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:47:39", "owner": "crniflomaster", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18089150383925332, "text": "IT SHOULDA BEEN ME ‼️", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:36:52", "owner": "chikilands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089825065868447, "text": "lmmfao a victim but was asking for things in return? thats a damn sugar baby 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:54:44", "owner": "eazykillz73ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098910922646952, "text": "Why does she look so surprised about it.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:58:22", "owner": "baoandthings", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18101227075639938, "text": "I would never have complained", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:03:27", "owner": "faz4m_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18102096079659670, "text": "What school ? I’ll send my lad there 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:41:12", "owner": "unknownsubstance10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110598529565943, "text": "Who snitched 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:42:00", "owner": "goldbergsam101", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18127159624489752, "text": "Nah ... Ain't no victim. I find it CUTE .... She's letting dude Bang her PLUS she spoils him with Gifts ? Win win fukn Win for Young Fella 👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:58:50", "owner": "someoneexampleyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136328962455703, "text": "The way 15 year old me would’ve cherished this relation 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:29:24", "owner": "easymoneysneijder", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18173366662362664, "text": "Ok they guy scores, gets a gucci belt and probably she will have to pay a fine. That bro doesnt control the world cause he doesnt want to!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:27:16", "owner": "alejandro.h.dorta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198644347316109, "text": "Dammmm cops cock blocked the poor boy 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:02:24", "owner": "kvs_prestige_valeting", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18266713036303188, "text": "I always see men, on posts about women and girls talking about sexual assault they've been through, doing their whole \"wHaT aBoUt MeN\" speech... This comment section just goes to show that it's men dismissing male victims, not us women. Why do you only care about male victims when you can use them to get one over on a woman's post about sexual assault? It's not us that's not taking male victims seriously. As a woman I find all pdfilia horrific, gender doesn't make a difference, a child is a child. She's the adult, she's the one in a place of power, she's the one who is supposed to be a safe space for her students, she's the one responsible for the grooming and inability to keep away from children. As an adult it's your responsibility to shut down any sort of sexual advancements from minors, whether that minor seems to want it or not. If, as an adult, you can't control yourself when it comes to a teen/child then YOU are the problem. This boy is a victim, whether he thinks so or not, and the person that reported her behaviour did the right thing. I hope she gets locked up, the same way I would hope a male predator would get locked up.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:57:33", "owner": "xtillyx", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18343361035166064, "text": "Crazy lol", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:37:49", "owner": "fernando_perez_gy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370738342145658, "text": "He just used her also to get a gucci belt 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:03:32", "owner": "cristinamrogstad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18389297059131257, "text": "The word predator gets thrown around too easy. More like a good girlfriend.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:54:27", "owner": "fatgabe10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403662802189327, "text": "Free her, she's a hero", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:55:33", "owner": "bluegargamel", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18528323587030669, "text": "Stop with these sexual predator among girl. The guy got lucky, only gay men says got they got assaulted in this situation", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:47:06", "owner": "whalerachaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848689186548380, "text": "Somebody was jealous and snitched on him, that's for sure", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:09:33", "owner": "rockycoronado6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17853219051557419, "text": "If that’s her, I’m happy with a pencil case - don’t need a Gucci belt.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:12:45", "owner": "steelmoon_watches", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17854719312551195, "text": "Is he under 18?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:31:41", "owner": "ikaliko808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864095428480487, "text": "I mean come on, man... where were these teachers back in my days?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:41:46", "owner": "kdtattooart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881902408400432, "text": "Protect our children from all these predatory women 😢🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:19:34", "owner": "temeculacigarenthusiasts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887918599242021, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:11:35", "owner": "shariqitis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888380662365451, "text": "Where's my sugar queen? hmmm for my tuition until got Ph.D.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:12:49", "owner": "eminent.in.shadows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897977029314630, "text": "Comments are gross. Do better", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:51:14", "owner": "mattrose00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907297672246793, "text": "Predator?  He seems fine with it.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:15:55", "owner": "jay.m.lucas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926712187115644, "text": "All the comments proof why men dint get taken seriously when sexually harassed. She slept with a damn child! If the roles were reversed no one would cheer on. Shame on you all.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:45:34", "owner": "h00ney_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927005200132032, "text": "Hi My names Bryan & that was best day of my life", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:34:41", "owner": "lockedxin_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936860326094139, "text": "Ol boy women don dey outdo men on this level", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:33:56", "owner": "_tayokarate22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963301833992894, "text": "He got the Gucci and the Coochie", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:25:51", "owner": "daveturner24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969312087808637, "text": "Can I be that victim?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:41:54", "owner": "parwindermeridien", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17969449688950210, "text": "He's a clever boy, she's a stupid ahh woman 👏😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:55:53", "owner": "saa4jj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976462524777778, "text": "Man got the succy and the Guccy 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:57:51", "owner": "liam_fletcher92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983657841747714, "text": "🤦🏾‍♂️🤦🏾‍♂️🤦🏾‍♂️bro", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:51:37", "owner": "uptownm3_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983957322898397, "text": "You see the double standard in the comments shits gross", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:19:55", "owner": "anthony_2000.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002747339662955, "text": "Bros are never victims 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:02:15", "owner": "iam_saintdaniels", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18004365968655970, "text": "I don't understand. She wanted an expensive belt. He bought it for her. She's standing there smiling. She went back to his place and made love. I mean this is opposite of how I do things. I make a woman buy me gifts first but still why is this our business?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:54:04", "owner": "brianj6532", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024275150568661, "text": "You know what… it’s not right…. Hear me out. My English teacher did the same thing to me… personally I loved it… BUT it wasn’t right… I never complained nor did I ever call the police. We had a good setup. My brother had the same thing with his science teacher. Many years later I told my mom… she was shocked.. I am her baby…. From her pov (parent) it’s really bad and I would be a victim… did I feel like a victim? Hell no! My English teacher was hot! 🔥 I never got a Gucci belt though…", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:36:02", "owner": "lucas_sinclair_official", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18028691165529493, "text": "Wish I had a teacher like that. I damn sure wouldn’t have 🐀", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:44:00", "owner": "tigerhoutx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054730862634662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:59:59", "owner": "nlowe_001", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18056488643560451, "text": "Comments section didn't disappoint 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:16:30", "owner": "tomclimbs83", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057917636403380, "text": "God has his favorites", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:26:11", "owner": "p.armas.pb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059111441185116, "text": "Where was this when I was in school", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:32:41", "owner": "luky_kidant", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059527235403325, "text": "These comments are horrible! My son is 13, I would go scorched earth if anyone tried to violate him!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:40:56", "owner": "drewjersey7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063989420384430, "text": "I wanna be a victim so bad🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:14:47", "owner": "0_rocky_kakl_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065962793367834, "text": "somebody had the audacity to call him a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:26:54", "owner": "sissified_army", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066270935609951, "text": "@fab1iii wir müssen uns umorientieren", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:15:51", "owner": "pavseinbruder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071310839223708, "text": "Set her free shes doing an amazing job!!! Shes done nothing wrong!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:51:22", "owner": "israel.garza.71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072381956337541, "text": "whats up with that? like seriously.. like its not hard for women to get laid. Has she ever been on a dating app? only explanation is that shes sick", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:07:46", "owner": "thebodybalder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075376493145729, "text": "If she was a Peaceful, case would've been dropped instantly. The Mayor doesn't like Islamophobia.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:03:26", "owner": "modernwarfare_33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076271510171222, "text": "She will get 30 days of community service. Roles were reversed the man would be stabbed to death in the penitentiary.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:46:57", "owner": "jacobdurant34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076485242127526, "text": "they won't go 50/50 with you though cause they just like power over people 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:47:00", "owner": "marvelous_god2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077881613171816, "text": "I was fucking around getting good grades instead. 😒 my teachers weren’t hot girls…", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:53:22", "owner": "cjeannn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078967460012563, "text": "Why bro why fk cunttt", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:18:28", "owner": "lindthaci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079260437042814, "text": "Bro living his best life and then someone snitched", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:19:13", "owner": "sslownsteadyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081109450977876, "text": "We all wish it was us at his age, but to see come true we can't do nothing but applaud", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:29:44", "owner": "nittyone1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087214012900160, "text": "When SNL script becomes reality 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:30:13", "owner": "rahulbardia14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094707250744751, "text": "These comments are sad. Don't expect men to open up about anything.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:16:46", "owner": "comedyfitnessxtra", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18096725683667414, "text": "All you dudes in there comments are why no one takes you seriously.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:30:19", "owner": "noquarter1718", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101890510652793, "text": "It's always ,,no one is taking male v!ct!ms seriously\" until it happens and suddenly it's not a problem", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:48:49", "owner": "hyejumuks", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109866457575275, "text": "Bro got free Gucci, then got free Coochie. Bro won life", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:23:32", "owner": "saadyaseen136", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124099312497048, "text": "That's every boys dream", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:15:22", "owner": "kim.jo199300", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18131036497471426, "text": "I want to be so lucky", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:52:00", "owner": "freebirds0117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139463896444247, "text": "I want to go school again 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:38:02", "owner": "kais.dxb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151245100409451, "text": "Any man saying free her fat L", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:26:44", "owner": "chefkman1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156264064395389, "text": "Come find me bae", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:03:02", "owner": "ericreyna1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18172499383365555, "text": "Im proud of bro 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:26:15", "owner": "