eelander", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073671775957119, "text": "😂😂 a P and cucci not part of victim hood in men world", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:49:07", "owner": "agafay_experiences", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074698541332014, "text": "Wait I just want to know who’s telling on the teachers. Damn how I wished when I was in highschool this happened to me. No joke my female gym teacher smashed a couple people in highschool n got suspended but she was bad af!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:32:28", "owner": "24hrsandcounting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075010169271558, "text": "What’s her @😭", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:38:03", "owner": "ro_skiiiii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075098660160854, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:42:36", "owner": "666_god_666_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075406918935859, "text": "Someone expose name of this idiot please", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:40:34", "owner": "chris.arab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077388593280609, "text": "He knew dam well what he was doing he is no victim. On the other hand SHE knew dam well what she was doing also which makes her a predator.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:12:47", "owner": "marsh1980", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079621895092058, "text": "I think some of these people on here need there hard drives and phones looked at … they are everywhere 🪢", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:08:18", "owner": "alans_photography_adventures", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18079642424011329, "text": "Damn that nigga got a gucci belt?!?! Smh these kids have it too good these days", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:23:12", "owner": "javicarrion15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080874959044137, "text": "Yeah I'm sure he's such a victim", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:00:29", "owner": "whitebread241609", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081462503284227, "text": "Bro played her good 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:19:06", "owner": "ajsiva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083603806985317, "text": "Notice they’re all males too? Lol", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:38:56", "owner": "ja