 "text": "Can she buy me a belt", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:33:16", "owner": "ben_parker1983", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18333665656231259, "text": "Who is the victim 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:38:05", "owner": "chris.arab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345191110203423, "text": "where is #tommyrobinson #nigelfarage at?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:32:43", "owner": "kk33mal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360291514095439, "text": "The only people who think he's a victim are women.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:59:58", "owner": "benacg89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364054357086048, "text": "Funny how if the roles were turned it would be a different story", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:58:18", "owner": "donald_galbraith", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18364520266155002, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:38:39", "owner": "casual__smarty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376694446176497, "text": "I missed the part where they had sex", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:06:36", "owner": "antisocialguy631", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491744551073373, "text": "Gucci belt she could of had me for a diesel one 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:11:52", "owner": "bigjohnghjjkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510807070071675, "text": "My girl will never give me a Gucci belt, and this dude getting it from the teacher. Welp.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:44:25", "owner": "andrermmariano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846171208567528, "text": "Can i be the \"victim\"?? I will sacrifice myself 😏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:38:35", "owner": "prideric2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848662579548616, "text": "The snitch needs to be found", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:10:27", "owner": "369dule369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861867004438264, "text": "I’m the victim for not having her as my teacher", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:08:19", "owner": "fknbandicoot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863092075488890, "text": "Where can I find this kind of predator?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:57:53", "owner": "edward._.elric16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885899359381257, "text": "Shes not arsed", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:53:28", "owner": "deanajade.williamson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916370899195626, "text": "Where were these hot freaky teachers when I was a high-schooler tf", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:24:44", "owner": "c.mullen009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916505608193478, "text": "Comments section did not disappoint😁", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:53:24", "owner": "not_garydoyle", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17920296024178162, "text": "He’s a legend 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:27:05", "owner": "mokefc20", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17921742810172425, "text": "This comment section is vile.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:56:03", "owner": "itsthat_d13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973593108944984, "text": "Gay af lol", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:48:28", "owner": "gabrielmo3991", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974124258946043, "text": "Bro is legend. Would of loved to with one of my teachers back in the day😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:43:48", "owner": "krissysmith11", "likes": 94}, {"id": 17974321976941002, "text": "Bro he had it good!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:35:55", "owner": "draculaswolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998952171826884, "text": "Bro needs to кцт the face of whoever snitched on him", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:55:53", "owner": "not_garydoyle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001800869663055, "text": "He finna spąňķ her when they get back to the crib", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:07:47", "owner": "bew_the_whole", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026496254539915, "text": "Free her", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:24:13", "owner": "emvy.collection2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035245787709878, "text": "Bro he got coochie and gucci I wouldn’t give af and she fine", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:53:07", "owner": "cor_gor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041146124691915, "text": "I'm betting a jealous \"friend\" report that or a jealous girl", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:51:52", "owner": "paco_d_guillen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046317425392564, "text": "Do your thing bro", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:03:33", "owner": "nacmillerz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056490182221097, "text": "at this point, he should return gucci.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:35:43", "owner": "zubair0ullah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057821132542750, "text": "I’d be damn proud of my son if he swung that.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:28:27", "owner": "vendmilieu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059510384181328, "text": "You must be an 11/10 lengest of leng to be securing a teacher never mind a good looking one. Bro has got generational aura", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:16:34", "owner": "zair69_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061578524618295, "text": "No man thinks this lad is a victim.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:12:56", "owner": "national_harrygraphic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061723082383278, "text": "Let the woman free", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:30:31", "owner": "elodkxxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067347068459947, "text": "Bro ain't victim!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:36:52", "owner": "masterstark_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067725707341372, "text": "Bro is gay", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:38:33", "owner": "robert_chirom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068129813205495, "text": "Why don’t you start hunting the organised gangs doing this aswell and expose them 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:22:52", "owner": "evolve_scaffolding_services", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071397395266471, "text": "Bro won jackpot and the second prize aswell 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:40:08", "owner": "l1nailsformby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072679417972462, "text": "Wow okay so caring for your students is now a crime all of us and I mean every single person here wishes they were in his place", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:47:46", "owner": "washing_pole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072801767224420, "text": "Victim?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:28:02", "owner": "sley_daniel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078515840104354, "text": "Should have been meeeeeeeeeee", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:08:16", "