ragingwest cmon bro", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:03:47", "owner": "samford_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046810559659770, "text": "Bro is exactly where he wanna be 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:44:20", "owner": "780boulderz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056815232622973, "text": "Bro played her.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:11:45", "owner": "chhandeuce4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057821132542750, "text": "I’d be damn proud of my son if he swung that.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:28:27", "owner": "vendmilieu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059211371181691, "text": "Bet he's an immigrant", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:40:04", "owner": "mike2142222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061286579416020, "text": "Lotta gay dudes in this thread calling him a victim.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:15:38", "owner": "cardboard_hussie_sports", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065734835366349, "text": "Thats love mannn", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:59:14", "owner": "rexmags", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067725707341372, "text": "Bro is gay", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:38:33", "owner": "robert_chirom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068129813205495, "text": "Why don’t you start hunting the organised gangs doing this aswell and expose them 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:22:52", "owner": "evolve_scaffolding_services", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071397395266471, "text": "Bro won jackpot and the second prize aswell 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:40:08", "owner": "l1nailsformby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071854898239940, "text": "I dunno how people look so shocked when they caught for a crime they knew they committed", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:16:53", "owner": "raychel_equine", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076877630135701, "text": "Sign me up!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:19:17", "owner": "chrisram.87", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078564058875715, "text": "For fuck sake people even consensual sex between an adult and a minor is a crime. Sure he probably enjoyed himself, thinking he was lucky etc. does make wha she did not illegal. She’s still going to be charged with the likes of statutory rape etc.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:46:59", "owner": "s14liam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080367665092588, "text": "I hate this generation of men, I hope that boy heals. And as for the teacher, woodchipper leg first, brazen bull then.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:19:34", "owner": "bowwow_modafaka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081639775822470, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:39:12", "owner": "farizzics", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082547506803802, "text": "He’s a victim?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:25:43", "owner": "greiii_area", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082845448969210, "text": "Be so fucking for real bro. I was ready to fuck my hot teachers when I was like 11. We need to lose this “equality” MYTH as a society", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:40:50", "owner": "hcimgobyking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083288413944454, "text": "You could of trained that boy and given him all the warnings, no way was he saying no 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:58:36", "owner": "craigdorey", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18083619512478834, "text": "My boi blue he up af 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:58:25", "owner": "khunai856", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090216658880620, "text": "Back in my day, our teachers were fragile looking old women.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:36:52", "owner": "kryzzbone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097095592737115, "text": "What a weirdo 🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:40:22", "owner": "mimidelgado101_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097147708735665, "text": "There was me thinking that being the victim of a sexual predator was a negative thing… as such I volunteer to become her next victim… and I also like Gucci", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:46:54", "owner": "mattmcbang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097184740665899, "text": "So he got 🐱 and a Gucci belt but still snitched?! Man didn’t know how good he had it", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:19:00", "owner": "m.b.buildersyorkltd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098963929649722, "text": "Nicee", "cre