then say this shit when a guy is a victim. Disgraceful.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:29:16", "owner": "a_boaty07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850093792559653, "text": "He looks in pain!😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:05:53", "owner": "dazmac1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851353291555246, "text": "Its weird that because its a female its acceptable. If it had been a male teacher with him, yall wouldnt be saying high fives all around. If this was a male teacher and a younger girl, this would also be view differently. Its kind of sick bro. Please don't normalize pdfs no matter the gender.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:13:03", "owner": "xkittyme0w", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17858221593513387, "text": "It should have been meeee", "created_at": "2025-09-25T19:21:47", "owner": "irondominus_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858899281509724, "text": "Man why I ain’t never ran into these teachers when I was in school", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:30:12", "owner": "1vallian", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17859407643505678, "text": "On behalf of all men who were once teen lads, he’s no victim 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:43:34", "owner": "charlie.jones95", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17861587224426810, "text": "“Victim” 🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:48:05", "owner": "jai.vander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871487425438142, "text": "Damm wtf lol 😂 I need a new engine for my Honda", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:20:21", "owner": "pagan_lui", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883113520263313, "text": "free shawty where were you when i needed you smh that kids a real snot rocket if you ask me", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:57:23", "owner": "roccotaco69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883197157265339, "text": "Oh god yes that poor boy. Sex from a hot teacher (like every kids dream) and free luxury goods. Dear God no", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:23:21", "owner": "the_silver_canadian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884194747379774, "text": "I’m gonna tell you right now, we don’t care.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:33:11", "owner": "dmo