pt with", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:09:39", "owner": "asamitchell1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036530159700887, "text": "Being a victim looking good as hell right now", "created_at": "2025-09-23T11:08:31", "owner": "writerrlr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043410470657517, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-23T22:47:25", "owner": "megan.turner11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044551418353642, "text": "Hahaha.  The kid having experience like no one else have .", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:04:26", "owner": "najwan_nazlan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049793114636729, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-23T13:42:01", "owner": "pt.nyc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050246723308785, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-23T22:47:55", "owner": "megan.turner11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058219895146909, "text": "i want too", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:58:26", "owner": "aviationbestphotos09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060699983454336, "text": "Dont be stupid... Getting groomed is nor \"lucky\"", "created_at": "2025-09-19T22:46:33", "owner": "true_tairu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062057276578310, "text": "These comments are so fucking disgusting, that boy is a CHILD", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:24:30", "owner": "mjprivate2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063216929457719, "text": "Ohh I need that kind of teacher. He is not a victim he is ma luck boy oooi 🤣😍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:50:41", "owner": "anonymous_sri_lanka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065948390037171, "text": "he definitely grew up with a single mother.", "created_at": "2025-09-22T12:44:32", "owner": "grantendriga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067551032266494, "text": "I bet it was kyle ✡️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T01:51:06", "owner": "t_ayya_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069299555253682, "text": "no children where harmed in the making of this vodeo", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:25:38", "owner": "richards22490", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072479021135289, "text": "Boys were 15 ,you dumb people who are not taking this seriously", "created_at": "2025-09-22T18:27:55", "owner": "some1.u.remember", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073198637515810, "text": "I don't think it should go unpunished and she definitely shouldn't be allowed to work around minors again but this just isn't the same as an actual child predator.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:41:48", "owner": "tr1n1ty.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073268786133357, "text": "Win win situation", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:49:51", "owner": "1shlies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076971668285556, "text": "She bought him a gucci belt and he’s a high schooler. He loved every minute of it, victim where", "created_at": "2025-09-21T15:00:58", "owner": "1drun.kman", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077273546015058, "text": "lucky him 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-22T05:28:50", "owner": "irza.kyleee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077937683053884, "text": "Female teachers are such predators, they shouldn’t be caregivers or teachers. Danger to our children. Very manipulative", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:44:29", "owner": "businessstrategistpro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078210733827424, "text": "That's sick. I would've been down to role play as a HS boy if she wanted", "created_at": "2025-09-22T16:07:32", "owner": "nike.theshoecompany", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079172129486029, "text": "bro yall buggin🤣🤣🤣id a bern down", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:30:32", "owner": "wawa1989142", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079369040056180, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:40:36", "owner": "peppqyak69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080260336979954, "text": "No doubt any man here posting congratulatory remarks, or cracking jokes, would be the first to respond violently were the victim a young girl. And I worry they would be the very same ones who, were the victim that young girl 30 years later coming forward, would shame her for not coming forward sooner, and delegitimize her experience (as they have this boys). It’s 2025 and a world of knowledge and resources is at your fingertips - there are absolutely zero excuses for your willful disregard for the safety of CHILDREN. I wouldn’t trust you with either of mine based on clear poor judgement alone.", "created_at": "2025-09-22T18:48:09", "owner": "iowangalnlp", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18081424933765872, "text": "Inside her mind... al problems..", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:22:58", "owner": "_fatale_sabato_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084992734911524, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:13:40", "owner": "mujtabah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085942780709606, "text": "Creep!", "created_at": "2025-09-23T12:41:53", "owner": "lmkay1991", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091375309698067, "text": "if it comes out that it was traumatizing for him then I'll believe him and he'll have my sympathy. until then all I can do is put myself in his position and when I was his age I'd 100% want this to happen. Really I'm just empathizing with him.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T18:21:13", "owner": "go_on_forever_33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091384363829953, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-23T18:43:34", "owner": "bkovacs23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091484158772020, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-23T22:46:34", "owner": "megan.turner11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098230300715901, "text": "How can this post list school as a safe space when she was his teacher?! 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-22T14:16:58", "owner": "kimberleyjessop", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103777930606997, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T04:58:49", "owner": "leprechuan__________", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18105695224605407, "text": "Poor kid must have nightmares about her 😂😂up", "created_at": "2025-09-22T15:00:52", "owner": "lamarcusohno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112430191477059, "text": "So he probably is gay that's the only thing that can explain this!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:06:26", "owner": "_rrrainella", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124164331490485, "text": "@martistic_stacruz check the comment hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-09-23T19:36:08", "owner": "rjstacruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124648081488804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-