ool. \n\nMy friend was taken advantage of when he was 14 by his teacher, who was in her early 20’s. He at the time thought the was the man. But now in his adult 20’s he realizes how much he was manipulated and how it affects the brain of a 14 year old. It leads to a lot of psychological issues, so ignore these manchilds in the comment section", "created_at": "2025-09-15T15:12:21", "owner": "kfdko_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893750743181735, "text": "You know what’s funny is how disgusting theses comments are all of u hyping it talking about he’s lucky and who snitched and why not me but im guessing since ur saying that ur okay with ur little daughter going out with a 49 year old teacher and buying her stuff and taking her back home right u bunch of weirdos", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:13:01", "owner": "alao_covers_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896806963290639, "text": "Filth in the comments laughing I hope this happens to your daughter and mother 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:09:25", "owner": "tachy0nic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906189919232219, "text": "Victim?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T19:58:35", "owner": "jackwindsor1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908220961217844, "text": "this is the type of shit we dream of happening when we were kids", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:38:21", "owner": "samdanielftw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17913038229197349, "text": "Take me", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:15:31", "owner": "gohomevic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916259800188797, "text": "Love seeing incels celebrating a crime. Desperate degenerates", "created_at": "2025-09-15T20:46:28", "owner": "ahmadhamoudi30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925977429998421, "text": "The only crime here is that I wasn't the victim 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:05:08", "owner": "dr.octopussssss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17934318368960713, "text": "Why in this world though does society only think predators are male ? Society needs to change its views", "created_at": "2025-09-14T19:47:08", "owner": "rugbymadman", "likes": 