2025-08-29T07:34:33", "owner": "kanishk_san", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18406310620119842, "text": "This btch ass gay mther fcker snitched", "created_at": "2025-08-29T07:14:29", "owner": "epim3no12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527796232025332, "text": "They're calling him a victim? 😂 Dude fumbled it bad", "created_at": "2025-08-29T03:55:27", "owner": "angelmungu1a", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849968314502897, "text": "FREE HER RN THAT IS SOME BULLSHIT", "created_at": "2025-08-29T00:04:12", "owner": "96shhhhhhh96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849974296504297, "text": "Who tf snitched her🤔", "created_at": "2025-08-29T02:16:39", "owner": "adithya_au22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853166500531444, "text": "Bro knew full well what he was doing but also she does Of teaches can't afford gucci", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:03:08", "owner": "trash_boat.556", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857626006491376, "text": "I want to be her victim please", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:10:36", "owner": "moothpeelo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866418457375347, "text": "Not even regular women treat you this way 😭👏💀", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:18:44", "owner": "skrtskrt14432", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17874600768310098, "text": "Would she buy me video games instead?", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:04:04", "owner": "herpuppy4ever", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887495584345858, "text": "Ok, so the kid is a 17 year old male with hormones exploding. If it was a kid, fine. But when I was 17 I was praying to get laid. It seems unfair, he becomes a legend and she gets her life ruined.", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:23:24", "owner": "tiagoluizd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892412728182533, "text": "The word victim here…is perturbed by the law imo.", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:30:26", "owner": "hearingjuan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894955036166673, "text": "White privilege pedophiles", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:51:20", "owner": "shxhin111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903441874243570, "text": "Who the hell is making theses laws ?! She just trynna teach some to a bro .. Free our teacher", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:58:58", "owner": "geez.2x", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17910974982069210, "text": "How you affording a Gucci belt as a teacher that’s one of my main questions", "created_at": "2025-08-29T02:07:22", "owner": "joshdiggett", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919418110139455, "text": "This whole comment section would be filled with blood thirsty killers if the genders were reversed", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:33:45", "owner": "an4tny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920285803148791, "text": "LORD I SEE WHAT UR DOING FOR OTHERS🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:44:49", "owner": "archangelstmichael", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17930304348086105, "text": "Smooth brained clowns acting like she did nothing wrong. When you have kids, come back here and let us know how you feel when your kids (which boldly have more than one functioning brain cell more than you do) have this happens to them. Who tf raised you? “Free her”? She’s in a position of authority and trust over a MINOR. Jesus Christ.", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:51:47", "owner": "ryan_mallett_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939223141059275, "text": "People always gotta mess up a good thing…", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:39:36", "owner": "dapperdan_duh93", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947862805011790, "text": "Bro got free 🐱, Gucci belt, good grade in her class, and she probably pays for everything when they go out too. And yall out here call him victim😭", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:56:17", "owner": "kekeweleexo", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17966615126956903, "text": "Where TF were these teachers when we were growing up", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:56:31", "owner": "chefdropkick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977066604869758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-29T00:54:28", "owner": "alij_05_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17978754245747765, "text": "2 months probation maxx", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:31:42", "owner": "etsjusa.maytrix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979209357888686, "text": "Who snitched..", "crea