omments saying \"free her\"but if it was the other way around it would be\"lock them up\"", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:30:51", "owner": "jknownrozz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064175171255081, "text": "I'll pray to be her prey 🙏😆", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:12:54", "owner": "sam_melvynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072770702031263, "text": "Men and women or different. She didn't hurt anyone's development !!!!", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:20:05", "owner": "namewasused", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073118393034461, "text": "Victim?😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:56:26", "owner": "rl1776007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074020070288349, "text": "VICTIM??? 💀", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:15:08", "owner": "space2026man", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077248723812086, "text": "Was she supposed to have Candy & a Van?", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:50:38", "owner": "thefreshestwater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077824126801328, "text": "He raw dogged that sweet ass", "created_at": "2025-08-29T00:53:37", "owner": "maff2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077964859989299, "text": "I came here for the comments... and... am not disappointed. Kid is 6foot and ready to play.  Let him on the field!", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:01:36", "owner": "ricardomarino80", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078327308064415, "text": "Victim?? 🤨", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:55:00", "owner": "arbaaz__kareem", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078827030296527, "text": "Never wanted to be a victim but there is always a first", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:46:49", "owner": "omaa_q6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080493874944984, "text": "where was this when I was younger !", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:42:18", "owner": "casper.773", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080642071935052, "text": "That’s not a child that’s a young man. No wonder these fkers never grow up", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:02:34", "owner": "elgatoroman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083645284850572, "text": "Is the victim in the room with us?", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:23:44", "owner": "causingy