en’t 85 when I was in school. It’s such an odd thing some random ppl made up at a random time in history because of some random incident. Now everything gets lumped in with each other because they’re too fucking dumb to separate it. A predator is not even close to the same thing as just fucking. She is not a predator. She wants to fuck like 100% of everyone else.", "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:19:33", "owner": "dxddyantt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058427549526512, "text": "We have to stop fucking pretending these dudes are victims. Like come on you think bruh is gonna remember this in 20 years as some traumatic experience? Fuck no it was the time of his life", "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:30:00", "owner": "jeff_berry_ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065009291258861, "text": "Victim?", "created_at": "2025-08-28T13:56:59", "owner": "2a.taco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065957504337159, "text": "Wish she was my teacher", "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:14:58", "owner": "paulc4386", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073613711022428, "text": "When I was a student the teacher use to buy a belt to hit me with it 💀", "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:55:05", "owner": "a.mjadabbass.i", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073933016485812, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:20:32", "owner": "m_rivas100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074437427064252, "text": "See the comments is why people can't take this kinda pedo seriously 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:52:57", "owner": "jovanarmando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074664023055978, "text": "real", "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:54:50", "owner": "jasonjaimes469", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076521727824066, "text": "Wish I was a victim 😔🥀", "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:13:41", "owner": "0xexdee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076945433486220, "text": "Ask the kid if he is a victim. If he says he's not, then he's not. He wasn't physically forced to do anything, nor is he afraid of her in any way shape or form. He can overpower her if he wanted to. This is not assault nor manipulation.", "create