ing he’s not a victim when he’s the one who called! He 100% is a victim of this no child should go through this! Men in these comments condoning SA is disturbing and it’s not rage bait or not too deep. This isn’t some trolls saying these things these are real commentary and how you actually feel so this is as deep because you all just allowing for it to happen again because others will see your comments and think it’s okay too!", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:57:24", "owner": "onlrihannaforberr", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18095152978641447, "text": "Need some new pants please😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:46:22", "owner": "8ashots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096683176625120, "text": "bless her heart", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:59:51", "owner": "noquarternic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098468266618379, "text": "Wait, he got a gift and a good night? 😢", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:51:43", "owner": "yindes3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108148945489051, "text": "The music LMAOOOO", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:22:08", "owner": "tan_man_dan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108182071559447, "text": "Smh", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:20:00", "owner": "isaiahzgotgame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165176236365531, "text": "Wild that dudes are okay with pedos as long as they're female..?!?!", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:31:08", "owner": "jordonwithano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167413288364429, "text": "He ain’t a victim what so ever", "created_at": "2025-08-28T03:19:40", "owner": "mikebrown5807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283410967261732, "text": "Some die of thirst while others drown", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:33:30", "owner": "c_u_at_the_lights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323107402232240, "text": "who snitched?", "created_at": "2025-08-28T03:11:06", "owner": "jakren_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18478326871073709, "text": "Vulnerable . Honestly  bro  enjoyed everything", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:48:35", "owner": "isagani_alonzo_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519511423013757, "text": "He’s definitely not a victim