wn man hitting on a 17yr old girl getting manipulated. Like it’s not the same. Bro was getting a Gucci belt and some from his teacher 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:29:05", "owner": "sea370z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916230370169727, "text": "Victimize me", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:04:02", "owner": "thepapergladiator", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921006619020455, "text": "I didn't understand anything. What happened?", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:20:25", "owner": "melillomello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928597341982269, "text": "Mane, wtf man.", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:01:27", "owner": "notorious_.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937702183061220, "text": "Poor girl", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:13:21", "owner": "skryjamartin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943354525032617, "text": "Free her wtf?", "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:39:56", "owner": "phat_nicker2308", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17944912029020185, "text": "Dud I wish I had teachers like this growing up fuck 😪", "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:12:13", "owner": "alberrtcastellanos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955767492992181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-27T22:33:58", "owner": "moch0loch0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966721197949729, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T00:28:00", "owner": "pinoptions", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975252984761525, "text": "Whats the age of consent there", "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:06:17", "owner": "kebhn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993445875681211, "text": "😐", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:09:57", "owner": "lantevision", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048645062289939, "text": "Where's the Trump reel?", "created_at": "2025-08-28T00:49:30", "owner": "sociablecapital", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052000655635318, "text": "He aint no victim he was living the dream", "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:12:02", "owner": "jb.bcklnd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054969086167964, "text": "freeeeeeee her", "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:25:03", "owner": "fbima.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059025785097154, "text": "99 percent of teen guys would want th