 "owner": "davee_avel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079508917752254, "text": "Was someone harm in this video 🐱😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T21:04:15", "owner": "_alannjuar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080052772936448, "text": "victim 😂😂\na woman for sure posted this", "created_at": "2025-08-26T18:21:06", "owner": "muchopotat0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081404011914343, "text": "And to think I actually paid cash for my Gucci belts smh", "created_at": "2025-08-26T16:25:58", "owner": "loadedlando", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086901337848479, "text": "Tf, he ain’t a victim.", "created_at": "2025-08-26T16:16:31", "owner": "sumedddddd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18090252310702337, "text": "Free her", "created_at": "2025-08-26T19:08:00", "owner": "l.jongs_101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094538383656932, "text": "Why i didnt have this when i was young", "created_at": "2025-08-26T20:40:45", "owner": "tonybone981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099883978719481, "text": "I need dis type of blessing Frfr 🤌🏾", "created_at": "2025-08-26T19:38:01", "owner": "__mmciise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103282459519753, "text": "Where were teachers like this when i was young?", "created_at": "2025-08-26T16:13:43", "owner": "hrudinko", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103362907573524, "text": "Why I couldn’t get a teacher like this 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-26T21:22:18", "owner": "1scammlikely", "likes": 67}, {"id": 18125682076423183, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-26T20:52:33", "owner": "rabbithole_619", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18126838258462430, "text": "Retards saying it’s still abuse are just socially and intellectually inept. He did not have to oblige and at 17 a minor can consent. Bunch of stupid fucks.", "created_at": "2025-08-26T16:36:47", "owner": "tonyassparker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154956805384463, "text": "The boy was under 18. That’s is a CHILD! She’s a predator! , Ain’t that what you b♊️✝️ches always say? Well good, keep that same energy in this reel.", "created_at": "2025-08-26T20:27:36", "owner": "pennyloaferstockton", "