ou people defending pedofiles are just wack man 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T02:52:56", "owner": "ronnie_thefuckn_donnie8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051273857561263, "text": "Bro got premium life and still fucked up 👏", "created_at": "2025-08-25T20:16:32", "owner": "ashishallthetime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053200913564070, "text": "What? He got a Gucci belt, some top, and probably lawsuit money? 😮", "created_at": "2025-08-25T21:27:37", "owner": "angus_wjg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053695085431149, "text": "Shit I had a teacher who was 38 but looked 25 and I was 15 I was happy and alive and treated well no abuse or grooming I knew very well what was going on what was happening and yeah don’t force bs or give me the imma victim card I chose that and these kids choose this and it’s sad he got a baddie n rat her out", "created_at": "2025-08-26T03:52:15", "owner": "88dohko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053913293572186, "text": "Type shit i prayed for and never got", "created_at": "2025-08-25T22:24:00", "owner": "chrxnus_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053963192535612, "text": "Aight who snitched", "created_at": "2025-08-25T21:12:29", "owner": "fxxad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058668467582198, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-08-25T22:28:25", "owner": "youknowsavo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063963491027993, "text": "Wish this happened to me when I was in high school", "created_at": "2025-08-26T04:16:53", "owner": "_lykz117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063963560261158, "text": "I thought we didn't pay teachers enough. Looks like this one is getting paid too much 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-25T21:24:20", "owner": "tg707sf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065501081249571, "text": "She is a victim", "created_at": "2025-08-26T00:46:03", "owner": "koda_g_wood", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069222178914262, "text": "I only had old lady's as teachers 🥴", "created_at": "2025-08-26T00:27:06", "owner": "delatorreg04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069610093936829, "text": "victim😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T04:49:22", "owner": "vi