9:44", "owner": "fromliberia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062484281353396, "text": "why my teachers aint make me a victim 🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-08-22T12:49:45", "owner": "wasianluvr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062903681033748, "text": "To everyone who don’t understand why it’s different for boy vs girls, (which it def is) firstly boys and girls are very different regardless of what you may think. 2nd with boys the girl may be older but no matter what he’s the one doing the fucking. There’s no way She can physically or emotionally force him to fuck her if he was against it. So any time you hear bout a boy and an older woman it’s implied he was totally in to it. Girls on the other hand…. It’s basically the exact opposite. It’s like up and down, there objectively the same, booth are just directions, but if a guy died shooting himself straight up somehow, you wouldn’t feel as bad a someone who fell of a cliff. Because you know the guy didn’t accidentally fall into the sky", "created_at": "2025-08-22T13:31:28", "owner": "johnalexander69996", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066133565246480, "text": "that nga roaming and buy gucci he aint no victim", "created_at": "2025-08-22T15:07:46", "owner": "gambit_242", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068833030913413, "text": "Lucky ducky", "created_at": "2025-08-22T12:02:34", "owner": "calcutta_taikhum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071523236279632, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T15:28:35", "owner": "joelpriceparker", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071578823513440, "text": "Don’t let your sons or nephews around these people in the comments cause they all gonna say he knew what he was doing. 😬 need Chris Hansen for y’all", "created_at": "2025-08-22T12:14:22", "owner": "mr_robmac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074549513511110, "text": "The whole head line is the name of this girl but if this was a man being caught every single man on planet earth or even among aliens would be targeted the whole social media tiktokers youtubers tweeters everyone", "created_at": "2025-08-22T12:16:26", "owner": "nawayd_ssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077350597801941, "text": "Someone snitched .. or bro is dumb AF", "created_at": "2025-08-22T14:25:10", "owner": "dentist_moe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077374096785666, "text": "Notice how all the men are supporting this", "created_at": "2025-08-22T14:48:16", "owner": "hanabi07255", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077449531788603, "text": "Daam pls bless me too", "created_at": "2025-08-22T13:22:54", "owner": "charli_1234577890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082738156856376, "text": "Bro got a Gucci belt and pussy and fuckee it up ffs 🤦🏾", "created_at": "2025-08-22T14:43:45", "owner": "l0ud_and_pr0ud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085006486803672, "text": "Isn't it funny how we judge each gender so differently. This young man is applauded by most on this comment section. Now imagine he is a girl and the teacher is a man, then somehow we imagine she has no control and he is a predator. What an odd way to think. I do still rate him for this", "created_at": "2025-08-22T12:17:48", "owner": "tprior90", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088583179749671, "text": "Can you give her my home address ?", "created_at": "2025-08-22T13:54:44", "owner": "_.karan_tandel._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088859131704291, "text": "Ohh no my lobster is too buttery", "created_at": "2025-08-22T10:53:40", "owner": "jjjorge_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089425849705141, "text": "I need this kind of teacher 😢", "created_at": "2025-08-22T11:04:20", "owner": "mukeshranjit1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090171085786785, "text": "I need her now please 😢", "created_at": "2025-08-22T14:44:12", "owner": "joshu_a82828", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099141556719482, "text": "Negga ain't no victim", "created_at": "2025-08-22T12:50:40", "owner": "ft.zawad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102876337587048, "text": "@bamdadddd", "created_at": "2025-08-22T11:06:16", "owner": "meradrad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104940304563651, "text": "Is the victim in the video?", "created_at": "2025-08-22T14:39:31", "owner": "kshitijmaurya.5