ad teacher like this, i would never let her get caught 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:05:42", "owner": "kn_yyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892817002294535, "text": "Abhorrent comments", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:38:33", "owner": "zach.rj05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894390958162931, "text": "I wish I had these problems", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:37:13", "owner": "leavesastheyfall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895416415279262, "text": "The shopkeeper who reported was jealous", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:59:39", "owner": "casegone169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931487206086182, "text": "Where were all these teachers when I was in school. \nDamn plus bonus gifts.", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:22:59", "owner": "shopping18222022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933028408074272, "text": "Coochie and gucci🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-22T04:06:41", "owner": "izu_machi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935245465079193, "text": "We may think this would have been amazing when we were kids. But it would have skewed our realities and expectations in relationships on the future.", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:15:12", "owner": "irbadboyz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17976755705873793, "text": "Double win", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:03:02", "owner": "darcyhyed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992516109824335, "text": "😂😂cops ruined the fun...", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:38:18", "owner": "mat_sarap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019598327558735, "text": "Why him...??? Why lord why am I being ignored😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:17:44", "owner": "brandonbabu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022748921729705, "text": "Where the fuck were these teachers at when i was in school?!", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:28:58", "owner": "s3abass3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038331557677538, "text": "got lucky asf", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:31:41", "owner": "mraffiqi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038456228436996, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:53:51", "owner": "parvez___mohammed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039540095401808, "text": "FREE REBECCA", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:19:05", "owner": "user2986700", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041151671660991, "text": "naa fk that victim", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:11:48", "owner": "grilledbbqtoaster_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041414837354935, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:02:49", "owner": "ja_ironwrkr_377", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041695778359677, "text": "Snitch. I would’ve never snitched. Why tf didn’t this happen to me.", "created_at": "2025-08-22T00:10:43", "owner": "xayacrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044975213326511, "text": "Why didn’t I have a teacher like that mannnnn", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:24:37", "owner": "userrr875432", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045672023645632, "text": "On a teacher's salary 👏", "created_at": "2025-08-21T22:55:36", "owner": "black_guy_27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046835111315748, "text": "He ain't no victim he put himself in that situation it's a win win either way", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:49:25", "owner": "d_e_c_a_de", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047710664288249, "text": "Bro lucky asl smh 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:46:02", "owner": "mrdouble_003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051013127235254, "text": "I had a teacher like that in high school was the best three years of my life back then 😍😍😍😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:51:31", "owner": "marktwo43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054254705175463, "text": "god damn it, why always not me 🗿", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:31:10", "owner": "ray.alexander12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054673718425534, "text": "Yup..he was \"forced\"", "created_at": "2025-08-22T00:33:49", "owner": "morganafbc", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057573242412396, "text": "Bruhh what , that kid needs to shut his mouth 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:11:30", "owner": "olay_yuhhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063643631255408, "text": "Sheeet an assistant teacher showed me n my boy her coochi in 8th grade ….i was NOT a victimm😂 #lethergo", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:22:34", "owner": "_mehko27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067782182227933, "text": "The fucked up part about all of this is that the females getting caught are legitimately attractive, since y’know all the “I’m gonna date a 6’0+, makes $500k/yr” mentality started spreading like cancer:", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:08:41", "owner": "__785978__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072497516025489, "text": "Free her", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:06:06", "owner": "24kf82", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073569290103445, "text": "These comments ain’t it. If the genders were reversed you’d all be flipping shit and calling for a public beheading. Money and looks will draw in KIDS REGARDLESS OF WHOS GOT WHAT BETWEEN THEIR LEGS! She’s no different from the creepy old man in the pub you all avoid, she’s even giving the same kind of looks at him. Just because all of you had fantasies about your teachers doesn’t mean you can excuse pedophilia and exploitation", "created_at": "2025-08-21T22:37:47", "owner": "elijah.parnell_spook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073877240078326, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:26:36", "owner": "akopositulay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074084738017681, "text": "Wish it were me bruhh 😂🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:47:34", "owner": "eduardo.x760", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075896575825826, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:43:13", "owner": "baked__poatato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076725385798180, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:28:09", "owner": "mohammed_sa999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076965391980647, "text": "@thelilkennedy hey Lil Whigga, wassup? Look what I found. Didn't even have to try hard neither. So what else is new? How's the job working out? You healthy? Falling in love yet? Hope you're doing good. Ttyl ❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:41:45", "owner": "doobs161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087933685768647, "text": "I wish i was the student 😍🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:41:41", "owner": "abofahuhailbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088755148691077, "text": "I wish happen to me 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-22T00:49:24", "owner": "hojatmirali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092133133672432, "text": "Wtf sign me up", "created_at": "2025-08-22T00:45:05", "owner": "uhhbeto_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095165242635881, "text": "Damn lucky guy", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:04:10", "owner": "jay.abaya.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097606681718949, "text": "“oh nooo my steak is juicy, \nand my lobster is too buttery”", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:16:09", "owner": "jeyms_matty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103478191512593, "text": "Why are these type of teachers get caught and no those fat typical annoying teaches 😂 let these kinda of teachers go and dont bother what they do. We love them 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-22T00:14:44", "owner": "mahfudzhrohaizak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108301906553914, "text": "Oh it’s a kid? Yeah before I never thought this was abuse. But after seeing Macron marry his teacher and never having his own kids that’s why I can no longer think so", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:56:12", "owner": "houyan_yousufurid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109871719548612, "text": "May this blessing meet my son and son sons", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:08:16", "owner": "wild_anlmal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118727206496434, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:31:56", "owner": "_parsa_m1k_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18132284269445905, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:45:42", "owner": "abofahuhailbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176699266337743, "text": "He knew what was going on. He wanted that belt and got some kitty 🐈", "created_at": "2025-08-22T00:10:52", "owner": "onzzway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192004420317912, "text": "Bro lame af 😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:34:08", "owner": "cherish724ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291922249250994, "text": "Victim 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:16:12", "owner": "__omid__mia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292567963268738, "text": "Lucky kid", "created_at": "2025-08-22T00:31:36", "owner": "_twm_84", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18311633506246575, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-08-22T01:05:43", "owner": "private_slutsky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324708574231385, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:41:30", "owner": "futsalshuffler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350212279088564, "text": "She is so pretty", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:09:08", "owner": "jitender_jolly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354482608082456, "text": "He isn't a victim.. he is a lucky bast**", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:43:54", "owner": "abofahuhailbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397837375184614, "text": "i would love to enroll", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:02:16", "owner": "h.0.0.0.k.l.a.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405709231112725, "text": "Guys living every man’s dream", "created_at": "2025-08-21T22:29:29", "owner": "johngossehamctoronto", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18526700536031141, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:26:21", "owner": "xuhayle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854840746509340, "text": "Disgusting , how are people so Lucky", "created_at": "2025-08-21T18:49:22", "owner": "yiao15", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17856952302487184, "text": "Y’all in these comments are the exact reason that male victims are never taken seriously… As a man I’d be lying if I said as kids we didn’t think about shit like this. I ain’t stupid. But when it actually happens it’s GRAPE. And y’all glorifying it because “the teacher is attractive” is not ok. What if a male teacher did this with one of his female students? Y’all would be outraged. Seek help dawg.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T19:59:38", "owner": "antonioo2372", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871989874410332, "text": "bro is not a victim. we need more women like this 🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-21T18:36:04", "owner": "jackrocket_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17874071340307815, "text": "Poor him lmao", "created_at": "2025-08-21T19:41:52", "owner": "papi_olas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17879199081388765, "text": "Some children are very lucky 🍀", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:26:55", "owner": "vancouver.education", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17888515248205328, "text": "Bro where were these teachers when I was in school fucking lucky kid", "created_at": "2025-08-21T21:47:43", "owner": "aurora_night98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914086696051572, "text": "Why are there so many paedos in the comments?!", "created_at": "2025-08-21T18:33:29", "owner": "metal.movies.monkeys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916617715154636, "text": "Snitches", "created_at": "2025-08-21T19:29:40", "owner": "j123aycub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921774277123318, "text": "Bruh you snitch on the dream", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:03:40", "owner": "kalolui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922263154133681, "text": "Who's the child here? Both looks young 🧐", "created_at": "2025-08-21T17:43:50", "owner": "muhammadazeem599", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940689948931778, "text": "Hear me out HE AINT A VICTIM I GET YOU CAN TRY SAY HES 15 YO HE KNEW WAG1 TRUST ME AT THAT AGE ALL U THINK ABOUT IS CERTAIN STUFF HIS MUM FOUND OUT AND HE PLAYED THE VICITM", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:31:54", "owner": "duncan247810", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958089957978766, "text": "My teachers used to look like Matilda principal. Smh", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:19:59", "owner": "edwardsnowden100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959651727986426, "text": "that yn happy ash😭", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:13:04", "owner": "mwanza.paul_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967124778793407, "text": "Terrible police officer, uses ‘obviously’ far too often in a situation where nothing would be obvious to somebody who had never been arrested before. These people should pass basic verbal English exams before being handed their best and cuffs and let loose on the public.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:05:07", "owner": "the_ad111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969782994947844, "text": "Where the women at in the comment section fn ghost town😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:40:57", "owner": "x1.topsecret", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17981829107731383, "text": "Who would even snitch on that", "created_at": "2025-08-21T17:49:12", "owner": "pwj2901", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984572091718314, "text": "😭 We could get Gucci out of them mine bought me an mcm", "created_at": "2025-08-21T22:25:17", "owner": "butterlokes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996532011810495, "text": "\"what about the male victims?\" The comments when it's a male victim", "created_at": "2025-08-21T18:34:37", "owner": "gracetrash__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18016270130583707, "text": "A minor is a minor u twats, reverse the roles.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T21:38:22", "owner": "the_reilly_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018935132759146, "text": "Lucky bastard , probably used it to spank her with 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T21:53:15", "owner": "escobar_600_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020319746750910, "text": "Me next pls", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:53:41", "owner": "kostovroberto", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18022751183720652, "text": "For all the women predator and pretty like her.  Please attack me , kidnap me , do whatever you want 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-21T21:57:48", "owner": "to0mmyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031081427501148, "text": "Lock her up. A pedophile is a pedophile regardless if it's a women. Absolutely no mercy. Get her away from minors ASAP.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T19:04:07", "owner": "heathervfeather", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038319146422093, "text": "She's a white women", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:28:10", "owner": "kuromi987650000", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053262530570017, "text": "I thought only men did that?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T19:59:15", "owner": "jd252000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053791625187638, "text": "U lot in the comments are the problem", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:06:42", "owner": "jared_r2k3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053963261439416, "text": "Bro got 🐱 and Gucci ? And he’s still a victim wtf is wrong with this world ?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T17:50:28", "owner": "im_araiz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18054820271452015, "text": "That boy is not a victim, release the poor women.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T18:41:40", "owner": "adbhu.ar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 1805977463