top making excuses because its an older woman and a boy. Abuse is abuse", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:48:34", "owner": "jahkada_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035542238480760, "text": "Bro got a Gucci belt and some cucci at the flatt", "created_at": "2025-08-21T15:29:41", "owner": "50000000cigarettes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039544091663628, "text": "Leave her alone", "created_at": "2025-08-21T15:01:02", "owner": "touseef_chaudhry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040825319373113, "text": "She fine", "created_at": "2025-08-21T16:00:50", "owner": "ddddraigan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042785630339693, "text": "It’s interesting how normalized and accepted is pedophile females, but as soon it is a male you would want death sentence, the hypocrisy is crazy here", "created_at": "2025-08-21T16:06:51", "owner": "jakub_skl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048752171274438, "text": "He ain’t no victim buddy was a sugar baby", "created_at": "2025-08-21T17:16:41", "owner": "the_pucker_man", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053732693432605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-21T16:19:22", "owner": "zongalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053919392552320, "text": "He doesn't seem all that hard done by", "created_at": "2025-08-21T15:17:05", "owner": "thatfreelanceradam.aa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056693426608625, "text": "bitch wouldnt have had to buy me shit. just let me hit and we good", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:58:32", "owner": "jordan.ainhim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059013998364936, "text": "Whennis it my turn to be a victim 💔", "created_at": "2025-08-21T16:27:56", "owner": "nuhuhstinky", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070784000120081, "text": "Poor kid! A free designer belt, truly tragic story! Reminds me of those 18 year kids who died in WW2!", "created_at": "2025-08-21T16:22:27", "owner": "jwallasch_fabrication", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071430302279337, "text": "He got a belt and got to smash?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T15:16:52", "owner": "isickening", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073218640849966, "text": "What about epstein files pedophiles", "created_at": "2025-08-21T15:29:56", "owner": "wangkb10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074017391093759, "text": "we need more teachers like this!", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:50:36", "owner": "alex.daly04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075992569816732, "text": "He a CHAMPION not a victim, if he were a female it’s a victim, common sense, boys are better at defending themselves and are more aware of what they get into compared to that of girls.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T16:12:55", "owner": "r1cc1071", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077294054307187, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:44:21", "owner": "m_yahya_heil.h_fan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078690637760127, "text": "Fucked up men complain about mens rights and shit but only women here are the sane ones calling out the pedo", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:23:26", "owner": "phishoilsupplement", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081572533910379, "text": "Bro’s never a victim LOL 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T15:08:56", "owner": "oba_823", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083256442715486, "text": "I can’t even get a text back yo 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T13:20:51", "owner": "bxxvm03", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085156006862316, "text": "i didnt have a teacher like that. Unfair.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:50:37", "owner": "emanpresto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094505518645843, "text": "Someone got envious and snitched 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T15:25:42", "owner": "dustin.montana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098189041721680, "text": "If he has problems being on that position then remove him I'd gladly step in", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:12:26", "owner": "_dea3th504_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098641003527603, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-21T13:38:45", "owner": "dripping_moist_memez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099685447607770, "text": "People defending pedophilia just because the perpetrador is a woman is disgusting. That woman is buying that kid with money", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:53:06", "owner": "damone8182", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104016