text": "should've been me", "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:14:02", "owner": "11milliondollars", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052008059216668, "text": "Bro is NOT a victim fr 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-21T07:08:39", "owner": "maximilianrehofficial", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052146062536752, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-21T06:23:13", "owner": "faithfull_ceo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053235146612253, "text": "Daem foo got a belt and some 🐱 what a lucky foo !", "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:42:44", "owner": "centralvalleyfoo", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18053968754167368, "text": "How much is her bail?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:00:56", "owner": "ng_fenix_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054301160170815, "text": "Damit! Where were these teachers when I was in middle school!?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:49:27", "owner": "ismealvin27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055709417437797, "text": "Thats part of health studies for practical assessments 😂. Whats the issue 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:21:56", "owner": "__sooky_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065483125985448, "text": "Heavy pedo vibes from her 🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:50:51", "owner": "kaec_papa97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067283531335179, "text": "Oh no, my lobster is too buttery and my steak is too juicy", "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:51:34", "owner": "dead_account4517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073610411037067, "text": "He will realise what he have lost when he grow up", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:17:42", "owner": "lawyershakil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074127847997195, "text": "Lots of people in this comments section need their hard drive checked.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:13:26", "owner": "lukesjourney1000", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076322365975702, "text": "I hate woman", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:46:08", "owner": "rhay.arellano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076510273814813, "text": "Lucky guy 😍", "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:46:01", "owner": "toxic_nabil94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076807427301374, "text": "he's no victim, she's no predator", "created_at": "2025-08-21T06:50:59", "owner": "engr_waqas_khan_yz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077729287964713, "text": "I wish I had teachers like that little kids now days", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:31:01", "owner": "ferdinandaguilar4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077820409781934, "text": "Stop snitchin on bro yall not coo", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:00:33", "owner": "varsante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084851785855266, "text": "Brooooooo wtfffffffffff where was she when I was in high school", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:24:13", "owner": "lbeatmywife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088311208784994, "text": "Dumbfuk studen, would have enjoyed for so long", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:14:10", "owner": "letmegainmybrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094887139711569, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:10:25", "owner": "snake6skin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108985285545754, "text": "Of course it’s a bunch of sick guys in the comments condoning this. It’s wild how many of you don’t see a problem with an adult grooming a minor. The news story also said that she ended up getting pregnant by one of the two students. Do you think that’s lucky?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:47:11", "owner": "josepho45", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114269536508641, "text": "Why are they always hot? Can they not find a man", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:03:53", "owner": "_phat_matt_collective", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138488419420178, "text": "How old is bro", "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:30:41", "owner": "caleb.s14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139536649422981, "text": "Ma steak too juicy , ma lobster too buttery", "created_at": "2025-08-21T07:11:47", "owner": "bigasdracoo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143307958409300, "text": "All of you are peds in this comment section.", "created_at": "2025-08-21T02:57:16", "owner": "armisinsane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150187204398941, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-21T07:15:08", "owner": "saikat.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167762554361848, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-2