got a Gucci belt and got to hit???", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:06:21", "owner": "fucking.dayvid", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18038789072419184, "text": "Someone snitched.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:02:03", "owner": "mickeyp1453", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047366648300679, "text": "Why those kid allway talk instead of just enjoying ?", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:27:06", "owner": "shinycolibris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051510713240512, "text": "I thought teachers were all broke and make no money and she’s buying him a gucci belt???", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:47:20", "owner": "ahappycowcanski", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054255815628867, "text": "Bro is a Snitch", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:03:37", "owner": "itsjaimeluna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055075466428960, "text": "Nice.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:40:43", "owner": "fortyonethirty_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055248284154139, "text": "Poor guy, I bet he needs therapy after this ...", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:35:43", "owner": "tiffanyxgentle89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055299629428655, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:25:03", "owner": "sam1rmoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058106141524913, "text": "These comments are just sick. Anyone praising this or wishing for it you’re seriously fucked up and shouldn’t be allowed to be around children. At the end of the day this is a CHILD! What the actual fuck is wrong with you people. So fucking sad.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:13:56", "owner": "callmecole666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067539008266117, "text": "Seriously how come none of this shit happened to me in school. My school should be punished for not having hot teachers like her", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:06:28", "owner": "timmaaaaayyyy01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068407790177415, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:55:13", "owner": "andy_fxdl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068967697923817, "text": "Where were these ho teachers back in the day at my school!!!!🤌🏻🤌🏻🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:54:11", "owner": "baba_yega79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075957796958189, "text": "Release the epstien files Peda Files ❗️❗️", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:16:39", "owner": "2025_gamer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081496282905954, "text": "Everyone in this comment section saying he’s lucky. I hope your son comes crying to you in this exact situation so you finally get it through your thick skulls", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:10:11", "owner": "noah.b108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083932498700164, "text": "Bro . The fuck happened when I was a kid . Teachers did take their fucking jobs serious . I am mad as fuck . For reals for reals .", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:14:06", "owner": "ilgladiator3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085144993873513, "text": "Parents are to blame. Kids a legend.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:50:38", "owner": "mrcwhite92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086579947825766, "text": "“Predator” hahahahhahhahahaahshs", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:44:04", "owner": "martin.gele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089497042690411, "text": "She fine ASF SND SHE PAYS 😮😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:39:38", "owner": "jojo_da_godson", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090941284673021, "text": "This is NOT equivalent to a teacher preying on underage girls! \nBoys ≠ Girls", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:46:52", "owner": "___zzahid__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108032080547877, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:01:26", "owner": "sageflamess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108573583546171, "text": "I want to go to school again 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:57:03", "owner": "manolo_lifeisgood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124548124463948, "text": "Lucky MF", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:44:13", "owner": "jarrarkhaled", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144691957413315, "text": "Such BS", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:19:30", "owner": "andy1972b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147612466396542, "text": "Obviously", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:28:07", "owner": "em_pt121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153499972382506, "text": "How young are we talking", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:43:26", "owner": "saladr505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160876822372600, "text": "WM make up 30% of US population, but commit 71% of SA in the US.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:08:14", "owner": "makeamericagayalready", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167077486363936, "text": "Put a couple of these teachers away for life or on death row. I bet it stops quick.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:58:19", "owner": "__kcrr__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304839097221139, "text": "I wish I was that kid! Man", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:56:13", "owner": "enevee_life_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323299774229615, "text": "Where were these teachers when I was a kid???? wtf", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:36:00", "owner": "liberatedlion88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18374685370178720, "text": "For a Gucci beltt bye", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:33:49", "owner": "vaehsstorii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18470352433073570, "text": "Not all women but always a woman", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:54:32", "owner": "miintys", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18500109307069125, "text": "“Victim”", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:54:28", "owner": "mwm44755", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516221665024095, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:24:44", "owner": "ashkan_shahniani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523655341023078, "text": "Can I be a victim too???? Please!!!!", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:32:39", "owner": "thebigroarr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523674820003805, "text": "@masscarrabs @likemike.59 niceeeeeee", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:20:20", "owner": "kevvvyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526491427026877, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:46:53", "owner": "danielsesam11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530649037057483, "text": "Sexual grooming.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T20:24:54", "owner": "markoherrer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846884374529235, "text": "Where was woman like this in my young days shhhiiiiiitt😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:20:30", "owner": "629.po", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847387210544474, "text": "NIGGA WTFFFFF WHY COULDNT TS HAPPEN TO ME???? Guccci belt? And some damn head after . She can take the gucci belt off my waist and slurp me up", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:48:45", "owner": "waponese", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854259043509039, "text": "buy me a belt too and u can have my body the whole day 😂😂😂 I will give u a massage when ur tired it’s a win win for both of us", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:54:35", "owner": "qtnoypi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854662996458436, "text": "I don’t defend her but in the student's shoes I would have felt like the chosen one🥲", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:23:12", "owner": "bergam._8", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17858487687427401, "text": "WHY CANT THIS HAPPEN TO ME😢", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:12:40", "owner": "anik_d_s_gamer_zw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871236496334477, "text": "Damn i wish she gave me the look", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:20:05", "owner": "mammadiefr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875894908398564, "text": "Quoi il a 17 ans 😂😂😂 ah c'est pas une victime je suis masculiniste et désolé sur ce coup-là je défendrai pas le mec 😂😂😂😂 mort de rire", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:43:13", "owner": "mehdi.h69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886111465344874, "text": "Jealous", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:26:16", "owner": "ronin_bil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889153366196076, "text": "I volunteer my self as tribute to you 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:13:15", "owner": "baby__ab_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17900126319256833, "text": "Yea he must be gayyyy😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:54:03", "owner": "soux09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906572899221040, "text": "I would have 100% banged my teacher in 9th grade if she let me. Not condoning anything im just saying...I would not have felt like a victim at all, cause she was smoking.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:02:26", "owner": "frankdee3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910186564072512, "text": "Oh no... Its a bright sunny day... ah problem", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:36:37", "owner": "mayankthaks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910500823194706, "text": "Sex and a belt? I don't see a victim", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:05:12", "owner": "liteshow714", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17916315468162993, "text": "bruh 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:07:54", "owner": "fundedarchive", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959293302977039, "text": "Where she works?", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:03:27", "owner": "d_realsparkamanii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960697365972298, "text": "As much as we wanted a hot older lady to buy us things and bang us when we were younger she gotta be held accountable because if it was a man he wouldnt survive the day. Not holding women accountable has pushed shame away and now we have weirdos and only fans women thinking what they do is important for society", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:28:58", "owner": "ochobinco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961316607960435, "text": "Some people ready to volunteer yo honour 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:01:56", "owner": "zeko.cene", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963999057808952, "text": "Free gucci belt and gets to smash and he somehow the victim?😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:31:04", "owner": "gojigayng7777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967537647790603, "text": "🥷 be gay", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:57:26", "owner": "levertisw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968320887942052, "text": "\"victim\"", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:43:49", "owner": "k.j_1103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970284873783674, "text": "Hell yeah 😎", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:13:37", "owner": "metusensei", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17993255165821466, "text": "Good things happen to the wrong people", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:08:15", "owner": "vikrant.sentis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019631339726257, "text": "And my teacher gave me detention😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:50:09", "owner": "toney_714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053009819529853, "text": "My question is how is a teachers wage paying for a Gucci belt", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:58:29", "owner": "stevie_mp215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 