s my portfolio: www.riyawatwe.com 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:10:17", "owner": "riyopipii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080019446326278, "text": "Haha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:40:12", "owner": "miworld1306", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18171840424329060, "text": "@peachxluvr transfer lele", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:44:27", "owner": "awwmyfrog", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18331971850210022, "text": "@_.p_r_a_d_y._", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:40:29", "owner": "sauravdeb_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18159782419393714, "text": "Where is the offer", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:46:32", "owner": "m9x0fficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18570526255032626, "text": "Completed PWC AC Lauchpad India and waiting for mail 😢.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:34:41", "owner": "anshuvairagade", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059077271556450, "text": "Send the joining letter now", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:08:54", "owner": "bhar.at_choudhary", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067696796096420, "text": "Now give me my offer letter 🙂🫴", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:45:52", "owner": "wandering_nobi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864958714455514, "text": "@juliicioso", "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:15:37", "owner": "_k.rivalsa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18148071640429262, "text": "hey", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:44:04", "owner": "kzshve", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17888064345262724, "text": "@anubhab_kundu", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:09:33", "owner": "parthiv_zzzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069881165593431, "text": "Maybe Maybe Maybe", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:00:34", "owner": "_upretpra", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17866117479487718, "text": "@ranbirchauhan_04", "created_at": "2025-11-12T05:23:35", "owner": "_na_m_an_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109941523608976, "text": "Contract please", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:59:54", "owner": "w.a.q.a.a.a.a.r", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17946401142077744, "text": "@brenwhox @ktenenh @blueberryy.blaze", "created_at": "2025-12-16T15:15:04", "owner": "jiggyywiggyyy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17853057300571074, "text": "Howwwwwwww😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:41:37", "owner": "bilalumer720", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17978091410939365, "text": "@louis_brigode is that a sign?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:47:24", "owner": "marialian_hv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093768361875990, "text": "How?😢", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:43:49", "owner": "heyy.kamaal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077004337963936, "text": "7ta ana b4iit 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:41:21", "owner": "moha.pvvv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099136270689731, "text": "Moi", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:05:18", "owner": "alishaaadas", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18540656506025787, "text": "Wait should I apply here?!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:51:00", "owner": "looneyttoons", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079092008159029, "text": "careers  pwc  email still didn’t reply", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:41:26", "owner": "r.d.b.rocks", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947423668058659, "text": "Thank you i am employed now yay!", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:47:09", "owner": "atharvasawant17_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054805451637910, "text": "oh stop we are so flattered 😚", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:24:21", "owner": "joinhandshake", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17889986184240513, "text": "I've applied for a software engineering position through workday and still haven't received any updates. Regards.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05:34:30", "owner": "_jain__saab__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059773196231834, "text": "So where do I apply. Analyst, developer,data engineer open to all .", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:58:05", "owner": "goel.me", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18188081650344343, "text": "@faldo_grs intern disini aja", "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:34:23", "owner": "nnadiahisnaini", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900755968299861, "text": "Who said I'm gonna join?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:03:24", "owner": "ro_prazzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084506363022444, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:06:43", "owner": "vamshi__1101", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948965253932959, "text": "insha'Allah", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:42:19", "owner": "m.saad_amin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843351088652303, "text": "@pwc_luxembourg where do I send my resume!!", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:48:55", "owner": "stackoverflowedlife", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061020413636231, "text": "how can?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:02:51", "owner": "pvt.life._of.jatin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047682062405979, "text": "How?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:52:47", "owner": "simrat_181", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17951608557025351, "text": "Do I get visa help as I am not from Luxembourg?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:12:30", "owner": "animated_life_05", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17904044667311707, "text": "Omg coming", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:43:47", "owner": "panfriedmommos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17869736886487880, "text": "Dm me then😋", "created_at": "2025-12-15T10:42:35", "owner": "aa_karo_aaaa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085352459050059, "text": "Where do I send resume", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:12:07", "owner": "avielleliora_valurea", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18327676153209177, "text": "I see the productivity of using Instagram now 😍 love u guyz where should I share my resume", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:28:00", "owner": "so_sammyyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971249274975952, "text": "Wow I must say it is very nice and attractive ...", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:10:33", "owner": "animated_life_05", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088753456789424, "text": "Aarha hoon", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:55:59", "owner": "anshulbadhan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17869621770393780, "text": "Oo my first love 💕", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:41:52", "owner": "alikhan_1887", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18398826769120169, "text": "Omw", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:38:10", "owner": "zenoweed", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17857933995486461, "text": "Can I apply? I have joined PwC India 2 months back in india", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:34:46", "owner": "aravkumarr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17874029409459143, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:47:05", "owner": "dmoha11", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17869455135480380, "text": "Need my resume?!", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:59:36", "owner": "applyfy_69", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17980825340928392, "text": "Thank you for your interest shown towards the role at PWC. We appreciate the time and effort you invested in applying for this position. After careful consideration, we have decided not to move forward with your application at this time. We received a significant number of applications from qualified candidates like yourself, making this selection process extremely difficult.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:18:23", "owner": "riyas_nasar", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17861047506478008, "text": "Please checkout my profile it has my linkedin link 🙌😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:47:20", "owner": "aadarsshhhh__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047579537405183, "text": "Intern? Employee!! 😚", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:55:14", "owner": "rbsiddhant", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17967773942825791, "text": "Anywhere where I can drop my resume ?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:58:55", "owner": "__.onlypakhi.__", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18085434533076361, "text": "So that's what you guys are upto after not giving my interview results and ignoring my calls 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:31:09", "owner": "notokayankita", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17929918512129107, "text": "can you ask pwc india to do this", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:49:40", "owner": "frizzbombshell", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17924223738035943, "text": "How can I apply to be your next intern? Please guide me.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:36:24", "owner": "gufran_ansari_01", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18301998316250311, "text": "Hmmm sure, intern like the lowest and least respect in the company. Also, earn less than the janitor or if nothing. So excited to be an intern at your company 👏😅", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:44:22", "owner": "kimmomile", "likes": 122}, {"id": 18382003573144131, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:56:32", "owner": "kousark_27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848768683562795, "text": "naah you don't pay enough.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:13:42", "owner": "hxrshilgupta", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17908343100268353, "text": "Anything for a software engineer", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:33:27", "owner": "iamhustler.z", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949946446051184, "text": "I'm in India 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:39:28", "owner": "unknown.suspicious.girl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17975563205790978, "text": "anything in motion designing?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:52:26", "owner": "saba_saifii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17888869962264262, "text": "Walk in interview?😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:27:01", "owner": "vandanaaaa_.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087350798480888, "text": "How about an employee instead?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:24:43", "owner": "aj_liber_amans", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936125274981564, "text": "@pratiksha0925", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:25:25", "owner": "noah.ipynb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066082784422352, "text": "Should I send my resume", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:01:10", "owner": "saty.ikp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18132630838469384, "text": "I'm glad to join you guys", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:31:39", "owner": "syedumerahmed_87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904116670142918, "text": "Where can I send my resume 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:48:56", "owner": "ig.amit_04", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060461501210012, "text": "😂 and then u don't hire.. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:36:22", "owner": "rani.k.921", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913958041087982, "text": "Never knew pwc was this cool!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:16:17", "owner": "rohratusharr", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18064621301413825, "text": "Is it open to foreign nationals", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:44:41", "owner": "ikiiguy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019326317610961, "text": "@mr.ayus_17 @_monster__cookie_", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:49:19", "owner": "___sakil___s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058210052553420, "text": "Do you guys do takeaways... Or dine ins with Resumes", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:19:51", "owner": "therealwrito", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17932102991998116, "text": "Would you make me an ai intern ,please ?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:23:42", "owner": "minaa_am7_junior", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985815579868828, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:17:39", "owner": "mono.vibes_09", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18552367564002396, "text": "@ruthikchitti", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:17:12", "owner": "balgam_trivikrama", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096301522766156, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-12T07:23:51", "owner": "xoq12233333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879771304425674, "text": "Indians are allowed??", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:36:06", "owner": "iamadi.05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878622205351785, "text": "How the way  working over there", "created_at": "2025-12-21T13:27:10", "owner": "andiwooow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031793570754568, "text": "Inviting me please", "created_at": "2025-12-21T13:26:10", "owner": "andiwooow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060682694285961, "text": "Is this wfh?", "created_at": "2025-12-21T12:42:37", "owner": "qureshi.academics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067123634159443, "text": "Interested", "created_at": "2025-12-21T10:44:05", "owner": "pawan_kushwaha6064", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092480749941902, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-12-21T06:56:57", "owner": "naaz_1025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076289816248338, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-12-21T06:44:01", "owner": "rags_preeti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061716044257412, "text": "Is there any any permanent position available Can we apply from India ?", "created_at": "2025-12-21T05:04:47", "owner": "memsree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951295417061760, "text": "Ok I will come after 3 years 😢 after completing my degree", "created_at": "2025-12-21T04:19:13", "owner": "shaiza193", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048095702480093, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-21T02:32:01", "owner": "n23_isma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094717810904322, "text": "Are you guys hiring international workers?", "created_at": "2025-12-21T00:27:38", "owner": "lasya.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089275192798261, "text": "Interested", "created_at": "2025-12-20T19:37:44", "owner": "_liy.112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075788903201624, "text": "Any software developer openings?", "created_at": "2025-12-20T19:08:05", "owner": "i_m_stunning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881562964332715, "text": "Thanks for inviting me 😉", "created_at": "2025-12-20T18:00:06", "owner": "devvvvvv.vvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932684386137306, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-20T16:25:41", "owner": "arhas.a.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949707153936124, "text": "Ok", "created_at": "2025-12-20T15:04:55", "owner": "oye_chaudhary_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943287883082221, "text": "\"Meri selection ho gyi \"", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:02:40", "owner": "atulshivaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997724637838612, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:53:31", "owner": "guy_from_kashmirr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288366391263531, "text": "Can anyone apply from abroad ?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:31:40", "owner": "abdullah.faisal._siddique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039247013508236, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:52:31", "owner": "luzral_xanadu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066082784422352, "text": "Should I send my resume", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:01:10", "owner": "saty.ikp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098108368761770, "text": "Hire me 🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:31:18", "owner": "iampritampyare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927048124169389, "text": "Should I send resume ?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:44:52", "owner": "rs0021.1200sr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420155503188246, "text": "Okay but where to apply ??", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:41:33", "owner": "kajalrai_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399169720121344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:28:26", "owner": "bougie_danforth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878183752432408, "text": "Ahem.... Agle saste mazdoor kaun... Tum 🫵", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:01:10", "owner": "09srb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084159419066559, "text": "Can i apply from india ??", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:36:27", "owner": "iamxohunt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538256623026433, "text": "@maanvi.sg", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:30:59", "owner": "who_tanay22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884456911407199, "text": "didnt know luxembourg was so big", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:18:03", "owner": "wmmggggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099989311706024, "text": "Pwc", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:27:55", "owner": "aritro7698", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099949111765889, "text": "OMG Can I have a chance to relocate and work there?? 😳😳", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:47:05", "owner": "_just.chhaya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085711213824609, "text": "Always wanted to work with PWC as a full time employee, having 7 years of experience, applied for numerous jobs in this company, but no luck.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:10:21", "owner": "dasng_suvo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401042077193887, "text": "Already worked for you 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:13:21", "owner": "mayyusical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875457478443256, "text": "Are  people from India eligible?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:12:33", "owner": "samhitha_ranganathan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144515464445926, "text": "Are you serious? You'll hire me, right? Don't play with my emotions 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:08:32", "owner": "sagedwithsid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081711668116793, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:44:25", "owner": "zenveushq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113205460571322, "text": "I know someone interested @_gilbetesta", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:22:51", "owner": "tthoonee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103049269675216, "text": "Interested", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:57:50", "owner": "thaditae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869621770393780, "text": "Oo my first love 💕", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:41:52", "owner": "alikhan_1887", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063486284540840, "text": "jirr, aamiin", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:41:42", "owner": "ultramen.ribut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896494078201101, "text": "Cute", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:36:00", "owner": "pooja_9999_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046818218447687, "text": "Just attended the interview with PwC India for intern role few hours back", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:33:29", "owner": "vikram_a_karthick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080861678117788, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:28:40", "owner": "shutup._10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886253110401902, "text": "How can I apply? Kindly guide me", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:15:34", "owner": "hudabiakhan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955433068020152, "text": "Do you accept international applications?😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:11:59", "owner": "areynaiduji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861738499536518, "text": "mauu", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:49:22", "owner": "cinnamorollcrumb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084392402016697, "text": "Yeyy", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:49:18", "owner": "cinnamorollcrumb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955265769896110, "text": "Is this my sign to check you out? Are you hiring law people? 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:47:39", "owner": "browhyffs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335418214238516, "text": "how", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:46:53", "owner": "junachelledacuyanurfuture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110399194591425, "text": "Do you have any virtual interships 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:04:58", "owner": "anyway.harshh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082790648035914, "text": "Do you have work opportunities in the sustainability development domain?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:26:26", "owner": "hajares129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929757715113269, "text": "Interested", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:01:15", "owner": "kriyaparekh_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909355603254869, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:59:18", "owner": "yogii_001234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044761289480757, "text": "Hey god, is this my sign to apply?👀", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:39:49", "owner": "harshrbhatiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153246511411878, "text": "Hey! can I be your intern 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:49:37", "owner": "azad__says", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897938476342579, "text": "Not the i**ern slurr", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:36:56", "owner": "haruu.spams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867122938493785, "text": "Me💐🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:13:42", "owner": "bythewaygulshuu___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019326317610961, "text": "@mr.ayus_17 @_monster__cookie_", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:49:19", "owner": "___sakil___s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044854400468618, "text": "Cute", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:17:54", "owner": "rapid_applyio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347406406202835, "text": "Aww😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:08:19", "owner": "soullnbetween", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067696796096420, "text": "Now give me my offer letter 🙂🫴", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:45:52", "owner": "wandering_nobi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17924793420170134, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:28:59", "owner": "adyalokavati1106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914589205234414, "text": "I want to work with you", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:49:50", "owner": "shubhamp2611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090558157931930, "text": "Okie give me details 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:38:37", "owner": "manpreetsingh.67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008858420649692, "text": "Thanks I'm already done ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:05:52", "owner": "growth_only__makes_me_happy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078355301149507, "text": "How can I apply 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:11:40", "owner": "malik.uree_360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078188527903384, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:00:52", "owner": "chettri__sc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082809062039443, "text": "how can i apply 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:23:58", "owner": "meerberlin01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165104809378123, "text": "Il suffit pas de liker hein @ahmed_yahya_letaief 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:51:33", "owner": "jiidhem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857605954501620, "text": "waiting!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:16:30", "owner": "luna_kindwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985032996874255, "text": "How can I apply for it?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:53:07", "owner": "kunal.j_3121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059095841268130, "text": "How to apply in PWC", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:54:57", "owner": "shavi.12st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091420549919083, "text": "Plz Let me know how to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:15:24", "owner": "manhar0420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890961538376509, "text": "aku juga mww😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:01:52", "owner": "zufarusys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090884230928630, "text": "Wow that's amazing", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:50:14", "owner": "its_puremagic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104725996644612, "text": "Well so thank you for this opportunity when is my joining date 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:42:46", "owner": "anju_.2413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085638730979794, "text": "Can i join 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:18:32", "owner": "weebo0601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087700643057185, "text": "If I apply will it work?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:09:51", "owner": "j00ngirlie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844680742613819, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:54:10", "owner": "sieera_151_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431214610099047, "text": "are you guys looking for a graphic design intern", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:52:00", "owner": "akhh4r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872918986452501, "text": "Not me thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:50:32", "owner": "gopo_so", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054225722645804, "text": "Woah, and after texting literal 1700 people on linkden I still can’t find one", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:47:13", "owner": "disha_bhandarii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118558588545767, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:40:39", "owner": "mohit_d_jadoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970960098814208, "text": "How can I apply for an internship from India.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:56:52", "owner": "ghanshyam_sen007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073610837253793, "text": "Thank you. Pl share the offer letter 🔥🔥. Ready to join", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:54:39", "owner": "justparamthings_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078155792465429, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:53:06", "owner": "oshithahirun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086794765812858, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:05:55", "owner": "x_akv_366_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953303665043531, "text": "My field isnt there😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:49:01", "owner": "zaneera_shafiq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932102991998116, "text": "Would you make me an ai intern ,please ?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:23:42", "owner": "minaa_am7_junior", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081921203032065, "text": "International intern ??", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:02:53", "owner": "yuyutsu_bamal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068781731580775, "text": "Can also a uni student be ur inters😍😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:50:02", "owner": "ifraa__hh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063635420171116, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:18:18", "owner": "cristinnaabigail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061699304560290, "text": "I blushed but I can't come🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:18:11", "owner": "khu.shaii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083703638488662, "text": "Awwwwwww", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:31:54", "owner": "being.ali.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031914959733980, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:55:20", "owner": "pvthbhaikyahua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324469762266096, "text": "Only to get rejected 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:45:36", "owner": "wai_yan_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846690073584202, "text": "No engineering internships?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:42:40", "owner": "bouch_bens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085352459050059, "text": "Where do I send resume", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:12:07", "owner": "avielleliora_valurea", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18008990264648530, "text": "How 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:27:26", "owner": "krishna_007x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090373975922430, "text": "Libk", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:06:29", "owner": "updatingmyhim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910701178251403, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:55:09", "owner": "pradyumnamegha999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071727341357544, "text": "If you looking for full stack developer you can contact me", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:32:04", "owner": "not_just_atul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942999013084072, "text": "Pwc was my dream company but then I joined electrical engineering 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:18:51", "owner": "super_nova_2k04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856783240559376, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:57:18", "owner": "mocnhi_amazing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543458887000649, "text": "Then why do you keep rejecting application 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:06:22", "owner": "basyaarsahil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302034889264721, "text": "Premium ways to purchase a slave", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:38:41", "owner": "yassine_ben_zekri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552367564002396, "text": "@ruthikchitti", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:17:12", "owner": "balgam_trivikrama", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117128032483260, "text": "I'mma send my resume in a box of pizza", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:10:16", "owner": "michaelhao01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123928945509050, "text": "☺😘", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:42:48", "owner": "i.anshikasaklani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947274526059541, "text": "Internship details", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:35:15", "owner": "karthik._.2005_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063377936183779, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:08:30", "owner": "salma.yehia.5220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069718682341732, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:47:39", "owner": "netclues_caribbean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074726141336793, "text": "Hire me", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:02:00", "owner": "programmerviva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908343100268353, "text": "Anything for a software engineer", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:33:27", "owner": "iamhustler.z", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101324104737050, "text": "How do I apply", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:15:30", "owner": "charlxx_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084665558003665, "text": "I wish i can work in pwc 😁", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:09:09", "owner": "andriaan.mf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536728384045554, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:05:14", "owner": "idc_rohan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063769319410547, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:21:26", "owner": "david_max2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867830845411575, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:13:02", "owner": "_nikitha_poonacha_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859829494477288, "text": "@pwc_india you guys when?🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:07:40", "owner": "nandiniityaagi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082372564866301, "text": "Consulting is dead", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:18:24", "owner": "aditya18.ap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879771304425674, "text": "Indians are allowed??", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:36:06", "owner": "iamadi.05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18135370795470162, "text": "I've applied for full time positions that I’d be a perfect fit for but never heard back 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:14:45", "owner": "ivy.inksomniac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092083255918220, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:08:34", "owner": "skusang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082466873511143, "text": "When do I start? 🤝🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:04:18", "owner": "tiadominicha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952897843042851, "text": "Stop being lazy and cheap and higher permanent staff", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:43:49", "owner": "zulqurnainjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926073751154252, "text": "Sooo wheres my offering letterr?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:09:11", "owner": "sshoffii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078536959914083, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:41:42", "owner": "aadrika.karn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199969702320026, "text": "Completed my internship hehehe... Now an apprentice 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:40:06", "owner": "_shubhaaaaaangi_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18085390478294562, "text": "I’m in medical. It would be nice", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:15:50", "owner": "eliset_xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142966081450263, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:56:38", "owner": "mandviji24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097652959765721, "text": "Do you take international applications?😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:03:31", "owner": "kyu.batau___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085097683996900, "text": "🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:52:30", "owner": "___amd97989798", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966846424002286, "text": "Only if PWC actually hired me through a reel! 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:44:06", "owner": "mr.milannn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846280849608143, "text": "Aww u think it's me 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:11:47", "owner": "itsmeshaonb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103383442660169, "text": "How can i attach my CV here😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:43:20", "owner": "rupali.asma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209995447309826, "text": "In Luxembourg?!? Sign me up, I have an internship to nail", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:16:22", "owner": "alwin._.antony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059715584235087, "text": "Now i suddenly feel interested 😋", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:43:32", "owner": "itz_imi15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947445490061402, "text": "Can I join😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:40:12", "owner": "zakihaykal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986987994886145, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:57:22", "owner": "_.thesassthings._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048297434401036, "text": "I was literally thinking about applying to pwc and here it is", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:48:12", "owner": "youuknowyouulovemee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059867549239303, "text": "I am good", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:14:21", "owner": "jishnu_guntur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893425024223677, "text": "@pwc_luxembourg Are you also in London?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:10:00", "owner": "nihan.n93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178078747361208, "text": "Excuseeeeessss", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:49:36", "owner": "htamisabj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028658162557245, "text": "Well tell me how I can join the jam??? 😌✌🏻✨", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:38:45", "owner": "his_jewel__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084598820476207, "text": "Seriously, I'm a software engineer...🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:11:14", "owner": "zzynaas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092008126730332, "text": "Are you fr", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:08:25", "owner": "d.souza_noel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894619585359255, "text": "Where is my offer Letter?@pwc_luxembourg", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:23:00", "owner": "_mannu1727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410451589186689, "text": "I'm 30 years would that be an issue, to be an intern there?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:11:28", "owner": "basith_ibnu_najeeb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047663369404981, "text": "Is it available remotely and any internships available on GO LANGUAGE", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:07:31", "owner": "sree_yansh_hatkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066429470530608, "text": "PwC india employees crying in the corner 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:27:25", "owner": "maitrasupra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088460371941342, "text": "This is so cringe.\nGlad all these CONsulting firms are downsizing and firing people.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:48:29", "owner": "swiftiesfortrump_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064135589406743, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:08:17", "owner": "raveenaspn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101695099663983, "text": "Nothing can be more inspiring for a student than having the chance to intern at PwC — and not just as a regular intern, but as an intern who earns a PPO. It’s every student’s dream, but I am not just like every student. I want to be the one who stands out as the best fit for an exciting role at your company.\nI would honestly like to earn, not just get, the opportunity to be a part of this organisation. Because if you receive something for free, you don’t truly value it — and I am definitely a person of values.\nI hope you will consider this, and even if you feel it may not work out, there are no hard feelings. I would still love the opportunity to learn from the best as my mentor.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:25:43", "owner": "anubhab._.das", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968984601971760, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:09:24", "owner": "mamba__pvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191243947336545, "text": "Full time job no ?La vibe 🤩😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:19:36", "owner": "bouslama_rahma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846944746582053, "text": "im from indonesia, and im the chosen one?😟", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:15:04", "owner": "saddieplaces", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540656506025787, "text": "Wait should I apply here?!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:51:00", "owner": "looneyttoons", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17995242434846547, "text": "Intern", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:46:21", "owner": "danny_arora_2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058947527259311, "text": "Oh yea? Stand upto ur words and gimme a internship", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:00:08", "owner": "supreeth_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096980248794476, "text": "Wish but live otherside of planet", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:32:19", "owner": "_jessie_gleaves_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985815579868828, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:17:39", "owner": "mono.vibes_09", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17858116656553013, "text": "amen 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:08:00", "owner": "oba_lolu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082589534026924, "text": "🖐️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:49:20", "owner": "manju7345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103422661629877, "text": "Thank you so much for the opportunity 😭. I'll join in soon. Regards :)", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:00:58", "owner": "gaurav._mittal_.9", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18079086041515310, "text": "W ragebait bro, these niggas will leave your application on \"pending\" forever", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:31:54", "owner": "omar_faramawy0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539346139007992, "text": "Can I??? 35 yrs old 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:20:12", "owner": "tiwiesy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071754899049065, "text": "But I need it in India 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:27:44", "owner": "sanskarbalbudhe13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134780353472414, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:47:39", "owner": "islamic_quotes145", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930950800133016, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:40:37", "owner": "priyanka_kundu777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009046394650281, "text": "Can I apply even though I m not in Luxembourg? 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:29:26", "owner": "saf.ben3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929001595015173, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:35:15", "owner": "94__muskan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954939055016539, "text": "On the way joining soon ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:49:22", "owner": "_himadri0128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887380969264002, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:28:50", "owner": "infinitywithribhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060461501210012, "text": "😂 and then u don't hire.. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:36:22", "owner": "rani.k.921", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289152970263640, "text": "First time I have seen a recruiter putting this much effort and welcoming with smile. I hope it's not AI😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:18:59", "owner": "glaciem_5x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925433347033249, "text": "Dream❤️… Not Immediately but definitely 💯", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:01:16", "owner": "swayam_belgaonkar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905894419292672, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:56:37", "owner": "jahshshb5492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413923849141053, "text": "Awww shucks 🤭", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:28:00", "owner": "iupcpdc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074617654995119, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:19:30", "owner": "krishtiiiiii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146275261379492, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:08:45", "owner": "yal10_ug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850651588591312, "text": "How to contact", "created_at": "2025-11-15T15:07:24", "owner": "_raiisa_777_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917566240070979, "text": "can i apply from Pakistan", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:48:54", "owner": "galacticv0id", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974904228960490, "text": "Package", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:36:32", "owner": "it_kidunia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103025785710174, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:30:50", "owner": "_spandu__12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395962537120730, "text": "umm... when is the interview scheduled??", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:00:39", "owner": "the.anarchist__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845709007593666, "text": "Bruh i am taking a dump", "created_at": "2025-11-15T08:53:36", "owner": "rank1gooner_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063808586133427, "text": "Is this a sign 😭?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T08:39:27", "owner": "rahafabiorm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914804995227864, "text": "Her * 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:38:01", "owner": "s.e.a.r.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056811443292562, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:01:32", "owner": "leena_suryawanshi08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319429648168289, "text": "Cutie pie where's my offer letter", "created_at": "2025-11-15T05:23:54", "owner": "ales.2454", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347725180203582, "text": "Hello 👋", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:59:16", "owner": "ranga_4311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497374489076001, "text": "Pwc mae apply karne ka karikram arambh kiya jaye", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:16:52", "owner": "debajyoti_banerjee007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329043097215879, "text": "Hey PwC Germany, tag yourself", "created_at": "2025-11-14T23:33:03", "owner": "georgienueberalles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084475628293936, "text": "Cute", "created_at": "2025-11-14T23:19:44", "owner": "sakshimalviya645", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070253540611657, "text": "I want to be part of your team🤩", "created_at": "2025-11-14T22:01:17", "owner": "vineetha_choyyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866154934499148, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:22:01", "owner": "johrabegamkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328391800209156, "text": "Yes please", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:31:03", "owner": "reuke.dinessh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067159967106228, "text": "One day bro one day✨️", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:18:52", "owner": "isthat.prashant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105529573641473, "text": "I'm also on the hunt for opportunities, and I'm really excited about working with companies like PWC. The people and culture here are going to be a huge benefit.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:48:41", "owner": "ai_laik_a_gona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077920522923229, "text": "When will I get my offer letter. Give it asap", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:43:22", "owner": "lifeof.sparsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349135672207757, "text": "Ughhhhh I wish. Running towards PwC careers nowwww!", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:36:41", "owner": "iqraayounas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932904175075137, "text": "can i join????", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:30:05", "owner": "karedoke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091422373898584, "text": "Let me know if you guys want me I can send my resume", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:47:12", "owner": "___aaaraah_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980361540942064, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:46:48", "owner": "rainakhan08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057026576265141, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:06:55", "owner": "its.sadeedakb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890397388239718, "text": "Gimme internship ... Im good at AIML 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:15:16", "owner": "rama_charan_2004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095744344669059, "text": "Thats really cool", "created_at": "2025-11-14T11:35:19", "owner": "anandu_s_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881389303304954, "text": "I completed +2 education can I become one of your employees ??", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:18:43", "owner": "_cursed_dream_x1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046911623434437, "text": "Interested", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:57:27", "owner": "supreme_lord_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003922589669874, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:18:26", "owner": "chiragk_7099", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010269062803465, "text": "Hire me", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:48:36", "owner": "abhi_s12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978381474931363, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:45:47", "owner": "f1_virals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907740931127587, "text": "How can i send u my resume??", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:13:21", "owner": "xo_.gurmeet", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17986969169745493, "text": "Pls let me know how to apply.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:10:04", "owner": "masha_wijesundara", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18145290091433425, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-11-14T05:41:16", "owner": "muslimmaster20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998536233832048, "text": "Why? For pilling up all the task to him ? For u to be leisure.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T05:28:37", "owner": "diaz_thug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050438594345032, "text": "I m interested", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:57:24", "owner": "insspireloop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022305374596479, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:43:03", "owner": "laelyofthevalley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911442763250730, "text": "How to apply?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T03:18:55", "owner": "srijon_banerjee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054805451637910, "text": "oh stop we are so flattered 😚", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:24:21", "owner": "joinhandshake", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044365565470688, "text": "PPO would have been nice tho😭", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:58:22", "owner": "sdtgs_18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935010976100119, "text": "I m ready just give 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:05:07", "owner": "mohit.777x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930477019132653, "text": "Don’t gets my hopes up if u ain’t gonna hire me I WILL SUE U FOR EMOTIONAL DAMAGE", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:45:23", "owner": "_sukh_ita_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148272514427134, "text": "Here you find multi-talented person with manual software testing, sales and chat support experience.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:40:52", "owner": "pankajkumar1577", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032235266526283, "text": "Are you hiring internship from UAE, Dubai?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:19:03", "owner": "justired.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327676153209177, "text": "I see the productivity of using Instagram now 😍 love u guyz where should I share my resume", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:28:00", "owner": "so_sammyyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064468157440683, "text": "???", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:14:52", "owner": "afshan_.hs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183714868342436, "text": "join karne se phle compony", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:00:07", "owner": "me_piyush344", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894749917359274, "text": "bhi join bhi kar lo sab hi ye karte hai", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:59:01", "owner": "me_piyush344", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984868530864528, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:37:18", "owner": "kavya_chelimilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989950989903310, "text": "Link please", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:14:41", "owner": "nishant_pratap_.pal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928788262118653, "text": "I am a data analyst in Nigeria, can I apply?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:12:31", "owner": "drdameey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992932029714687, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:47:19", "owner": "shankerlalweb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893071231223499, "text": "Where can I send my resume ?", 