s": 0}, {"id": 17975563205790978, "text": "anything in motion designing?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:52:26", "owner": "saba_saifii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17875380318354560, "text": "Pwc india with no freshers hiring 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:42:03", "owner": "sarcastikbrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100287730708298, "text": "For real? Yes please!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:36:02", "owner": "bgsrzky_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340154986225499, "text": "I am waiting for the opportunity 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:31:02", "owner": "candid__canopy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112986748575523, "text": "🙌🙌 I'm waiting for response", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:15:46", "owner": "sunnymishra0024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290401384277950, "text": "On god you guys rejected me", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:00:03", "owner": "narayan.is.a.god", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17999750093688212, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:33:31", "owner": "prashantverma98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059773196231834, "text": "So where do I apply. Analyst, developer,data engineer open to all .", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:58:05", "owner": "goel.me", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17899561845318005, "text": "Can I apply from Pakistan?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:44:51", "owner": "osama_ali_gujjar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881254681410746, "text": "🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:28:11", "owner": "ishuaib4u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892878379225570, "text": "Nice one PwC😭😭😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:27:17", "owner": "abhi_krupakar_1284", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18057683453269456, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:49:59", "owner": "nani_.04_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210067054312747, "text": "Hire? Pls?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:30:41", "owner": "sjroy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103204915729304, "text": "Can I apply from Nigeria?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:10:58", "owner": "sheisfonessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972985983958822, "text": "Cuuute... I will apply tomorrow", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:54:34", "owner": "juanitoconx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055300985315213, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:02:43", "owner": "vars.ha3647", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971867235796820, "text": "M ready please waiting", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:47:33", "owner": "sofiya_khanbts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861611920458988, "text": "See you guys ! :p", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:39:18", "owner": "heartysassy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020286518604628, "text": "Sybau man with these false promises. I get rejected the second I apply 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:10:05", "owner": "yasir.frames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931190518108304, "text": "Such good opportunity 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:06:21", "owner": "nidafatima1_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098145013692248, "text": "Really?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:15:03", "owner": "stoned_baller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085899184800121, "text": "Dur raho dur bikul dur", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:03:13", "owner": "_saxam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065898833428344, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:58:43", "owner": "its_verison_2.0_sss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060508220540871, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:30:59", "owner": "life_of.km", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872611354373685, "text": "Please hire me 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:37:10", "owner": "shikhat011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082082398861060, "text": "I need your support and mentorship please reply me 🙌😢🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:32:11", "owner": "vaibhav_maurya___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090609184737774, "text": "Please 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:31:24", "owner": "vaibhav_maurya___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094379479855262, "text": "But I'm from India 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:28:42", "owner": "jayati_upadhyay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064275080127876, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:22:00", "owner": "princ.esria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936700420068911, "text": "Thanks when am I getting my offer letter btw I’m writing this from India😏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:09:11", "owner": "nuoneinparticulareh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082477102859982, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:04:43", "owner": "acele_etmek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897383134342418, "text": "Sure sure just need a visa sponsorship", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:01:11", "owner": "_haris_toor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148661965427346, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:53:46", "owner": "feyavaz_741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351877084161043, "text": "❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:44:11", "owner": "jy10ti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850995412584971, "text": "Is it ?i been applying  for so long never  even got reply or selected for interview round so if  you posting things like this Atleast give some attention and time to cv and resume review team to go through it correctly", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:38:41", "owner": "kitty._.hwak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935601468984646, "text": "How can get this opportunity", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:34:15", "owner": "_tanzeemkhan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887215000264074, "text": "Pick me choose me 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:29:36", "owner": "yasmina_elkhazen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096090571842391, "text": "Take my CV", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:24:21", "owner": "1durlabh35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862308814515688, "text": "@pwc_india  looking forward if you guys have any internship opportunity in kolkata.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:21:25", "owner": "rrituraj5887", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952969978020830, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:18:33", "owner": "krishnaj_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860911060536398, "text": "How do I apply ?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:17:19", "owner": "woof_woof_woof_wooof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992785332719225, "text": "Wfh available", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:12:42", "owner": "i_am_preety_lil_princess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068134010610913, "text": "Cute", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:09:35", "owner"