"created_at": "2025-11-10T10:44:48", "owner": "dholiya_manalee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952892382902327, "text": "Me?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:38:30", "owner": "debugdaddy2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18570526255032626, "text": "Completed PWC AC Lauchpad India and waiting for mail 😢.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:34:41", "owner": "anshuvairagade", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17964445463989471, "text": "Let me know if you are looking for a fulltime", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:33:21", "owner": "nachi_kachoriya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080078537116688, "text": "Mee??", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:17:58", "owner": "pradipmuskan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923292787177053, "text": "@pwc_luxembourg , I am waiting for your DM", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:16:28", "owner": "kamalnarayanthakur1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083813510279448, "text": "@pwc_luxembourg What About Python Developer?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:03:54", "owner": "heisenberg_walter77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058041287271743, "text": "Applying!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:24:18", "owner": "selenophileszz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916506787216501, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:11:36", "owner": "aravindmuntimadugu.307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089811478920337, "text": "Hire me", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:11:07", "owner": "parigh_gupta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065989853581304, "text": "I hope they will never ignore me 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:10:20", "owner": "itxjwd_4742", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931378030110606, "text": "maybe this is my sign to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:55:07", "owner": "arey.reyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949075180028517, "text": "Yeah 400+ applies in LinkedIn still no one needs me 😢👏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:19:55", "owner": "__l_b__07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848768683562795, "text": "naah you don't pay enough.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:13:42", "owner": "hxrshilgupta", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18078040691165035, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:59:53", "owner": "aneesa_kalathil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083982709826796, "text": "I wish to apply for a PhD program at a university in Luxembourg. I have an IELTS score of 8.0 and would like to know the specific language requirements and admission process for international students, specifically regarding the application documents", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:48:12", "owner": "_ayub_shaikh_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875285659440888, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:44:50", "owner": "z.a.r.a.08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853057300571074, "text": "Howwwwwwww😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:41:37", "owner": "bilalumer720", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17924223738035943, "text": "How can I apply to be your next intern? Please guide me.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:36:24", "owner": "gufran_ansari_01", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18183942346344191, "text": "I'm waiting for offer letter😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:35:21", "owner": "tosif_swe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942624985004882, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:31:08", "owner": "its_all_about_pooja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173196937323389, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:27:48", "owner": "zara__khan_362", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022788950593474, "text": "For an internship 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:08:44", "owner": "src_af", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17967170879829059, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:05:30", "owner": "migratemanusa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117005035558445, "text": "Ok guyz, i accept it 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:56:55", "owner": "bubblyvaani", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046648367423932, "text": "so well", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:28:28", "owner": "theajay_sagar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112185283561948, "text": "Me me hire me I cant doing anything", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:57:16", "owner": "aang_doangg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926493646159583, "text": "I would like to join you guys 🫶", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:35:14", "owner": "sin.tree_num", "likes": 1