 17967773942825791, "text": "Anywhere where I can drop my resume ?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:58:55", "owner": "__.onlypakhi.__", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18094616275831484, "text": "@faizz._67", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:57:56", "owner": "no.100546", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104778508710805, "text": "Do you also provide consultancy for SAP S4hana consultancy in Luxembourg", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:47:37", "owner": "faizan3h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902680687295611, "text": "Can non eu citizens apply!@🙋🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:38:16", "owner": "passthe.ofnoreturn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845361742604810, "text": "I'm interested 😀", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:34:11", "owner": "dhrumil2074", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908607814256052, "text": "But how do I apply", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:24:58", "owner": "nithins4991", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18198378847319513, "text": "Really? I would love to join.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:20:42", "owner": "bushjam09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058210052553420, "text": "Do you guys do takeaways... Or dine ins with Resumes", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:19:51", "owner": "therealwrito", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062387468181399, "text": "Na i already work, not interested", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:17:53", "owner": "sreyash.reddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078289459918768, "text": "How can i join?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:36:23", "owner": "dhanvibhandary", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857970574547754, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:26:23", "owner": "khandait_sahil_.21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113708362563208, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:05:12", "owner": "anitha_yadav_38", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109941523608976, "text": "Contract please", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:59:54", "owner": "w.a.q.a.a.a.a.r", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17879792433422185, "text": "It's so good until you start to work inside", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:54:04", "owner": "yusuf.karatepe16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100927906674187, "text": "Li