", "owner": "re_ocea0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295255387281973, "text": "Ohhh i want it", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:07:27", "owner": "chocoester", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084539983817188, "text": "@prajakta_waghh would be the best candidate.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:51:26", "owner": "er.mansibhoge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869711884464703, "text": "Interested😍", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:48:47", "owner": "_vijay_sunar_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085005805967561, "text": "Alright alright", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:43:35", "owner": "rohan17th", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018892676790156, "text": "me🥺?!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:18:12", "owner": "therealchaswang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900651616309220, "text": "I would glad to", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:23:27", "owner": "fhirpratik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089773342734225, "text": "Come on!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:18:19", "owner": "shrirang.space", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948654714921952, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:04:41", "owner": "11crg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123462655517168, "text": "Are the positions open in India too?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:59:37", "owner": "stopitt_jerryy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949835134058910, "text": "Tmorrow I will came to your office thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:24:29", "owner": "karakoct21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896363071344472, "text": "Umm - so starting on Monday ?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:07:09", "owner": "hime_sama____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099136270689731, "text": "Moi", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:05:18", "owner": "alishaaadas", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18054356804646086, "text": "Yeahhhhhh", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:58:53", "owner": "confidenceremy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883618573287714, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:37:10", "owner": "_stella.s_pixel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113373640576016, "text": "And then you will just reject because I don’t speak French 😭 what’s even the point", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:21:57", "owner": "ketkihedau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905425198272671, "text": "Hiiii", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:18:55", "owner": "______jassi_______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984880812872512, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:16:30", "owner": "m.rim__72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064325156611451, "text": "So...um...when do I start?? 😚👉👈", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:12:51", "owner": "hawt.chai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869561146467589, "text": "Oh god no please", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:57:26", "owner": "chiamami_teo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551040250014044, "text": "please🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:56:19", "owner": "sheen_shazaib", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077178514908936, "text": "deepshekhar.dev", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:41:55", "owner": "_deep_3.0_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073610168466376, "text": "I'm interested how to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:40:58", "owner": "firoz_chauhan07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085592725810933, "text": "Uh thats so lit!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:39:07", "owner": "sam_16_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895169011346011, "text": "Dm is open!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:12:52", "owner": "aagaman_pokhreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065170682144570, "text": "not real", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:02:38", "owner": "_itsuren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922196236175090, "text": "Ameen,🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:57:32", "owner": "that__weirdoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093710638872402, "text": "How do i share my resume", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:43:08", "owner": "tejas14761", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083646833291300, "text": "@pwc_luxembourg I wish to be,but I think only ACCA affiliate is eligible, not finalist !?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:27:25", "owner": "azh_arjutt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843014575613248, "text": "Why not", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:26:55", "owner": "sam9_686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085039591989924, "text": "Omg i surrender", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:19:27", "owner": "nvm.diya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094664845872058, "text": "Hi I’m interested", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:18:38", "owner": "jenniexclusive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298575994270920, "text": "You guys rejected me 😞 saying that I am too young although I have FRM and 8 Coursera courses with projects", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:16:37", "owner": "rehaanshxikh1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065351966570059, "text": "Can I do it virtually please", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:13:40", "owner": "mahinn_shaikh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099690640763312, "text": "Only from Luxembourg they accept 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:59:41", "owner": "i_alyena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920504431191123, "text": "I am looking for an internship", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:51:26", "owner": "billalsalah5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083000632965225, "text": "I'm dying for thisss!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:51:14", "owner": "_nidhy__163", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104316418643004, "text": "HAH I WISH", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:49:49", "owner": "justlivinglife5150", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985092789872186, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:38:37", "owner": "jeremy_knb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052965572644295, "text": "🙂Ohhh fvckkk", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:37:15", "owner": "uffshaonaofc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938921938089140, "text": "From Luxembourg 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:25:09", "owner": "_lee._.s_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900141352316677, "text": "🏃‍♂️🏃‍♂️🏃‍♂️🏃‍♂️🏃‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:16:26", "owner": "ayush_____ruke_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087729013744155, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:10:58", "owner": "ghosh_koena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062625254175604, "text": "Guys have a look at my resume", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:10:15", "owner": "abhi022bond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042838817701989, "text": "I will come with this video, as evidence of the offer, you won't go back on your word, will you?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:09:22", "owner": "gkthelioness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098254198796903, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:03:30", "owner": "giriganesh016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875264791351020, "text": "Well after all rounds of interviews, you guys sent me a mail saying “Congratulations, you got selected”, and ghosted me for a week to tell me “This position got closed, so we will not be proceeding with your onboarding process”. So yeah I’m ok, but It just took me two more weeks to recover from that trauma🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:56:32", "owner": "felina_404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073441160206798, "text": "Finally!!!! Onboarding when??", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:52:50", "owner": "devesh.blends_app", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112691569571005, "text": "Chill guys , as I promised , I'll be there till January.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:47:48", "owner": "zean_jose", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047247251415609, "text": "@deloittelu", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:39:48", "owner": "lennoxchenx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942011605064811, "text": "well can i transfer from Pwc india to Luxembourg?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:38:32", "owner": "pranavskashyap", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18328432951241071, "text": "But I want a job not internship 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:31:52", "owner": "saheb.tayeb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093940843832146, "text": "Can I share my cv, I am from India 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:26:15", "owner": "varunkapoor_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079205582167092, "text": "You and who?!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:06:05", "owner": "dejii.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870548470459620, "text": "@gauravk_09", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:04:57", "owner": "_vedantg_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17939650707093457, "text": "Any remote?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:03:26", "owner": "rose__7489", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085429594971848, "text": "No pls", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:02:31", "owner": "grenadiere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026870825754227, "text": "U will never hire me", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:01:50", "owner": "_wild_sapphire_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928919662132742, "text": "Link is not working?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:00:29", "owner": "rose__7489", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087809708496825, "text": "Pls!!! Internship!!!! Dedo!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:59:30", "owner": "michuuu._me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047579537405183, "text": "Intern? Employee!! 😚", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:55:14", "owner": "rbsiddhant", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17905820481274142, "text": "Look at those smile looks like an so devilish 😁😊", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:49:29", "owner": "hams.ter2551", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174354322367266, "text": "Dm me 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:49:06", "owner": "_ayush_vora_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903879019142806, "text": "Waiting for job", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:48:16", "owner": "devasophia11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301608973251166, "text": "Aww. 🥹Don't hype my unemployed ass. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:44:24", "owner": "nobodywithadateofbirth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069974126345102, "text": "Me please", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:43:53", "owner": "__prime_mike_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036057833713757, "text": "I m interested", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:41:10", "owner": "omarsyed7860", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077571019907383, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:38:02", "owner": "itz_d.hannah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970124871971154, "text": "Well, may Ik the role and JD?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:32:25", "owner": "nandh_u95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056239925632133, "text": "Can I please", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:28:24", "owner": "sam_jaki__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000413123681006, "text": "Ues please hire me im in Hong Kong thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:23:41", "owner": "evitays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973087686950991, "text": "I am from india can i apply", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:21:02", "owner": "itz_vijaydaniel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842000008617556, "text": "Can I join you guys???????????????", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:17:36", "owner": "haai.chelloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492288817076457, "text": "Just today I have attended a meeting of PWC", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:12:54", "owner": "luffywillrare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906393106270739, "text": "Let's hire your team", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:11:48", "owner": "heisennberg_707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032752826744096, "text": "Pwc", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:09:47", "owner": "rockstar_abhi0205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185748880350629, "text": "Okay, I'm coming", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:07:01", "owner": "iamsaaheb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178626907362163, "text": "Wait, me? Really? But I'm a pharmacist🙈🤭", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:05:59", "owner": "allyna_sangi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853957942567277, "text": "I will go for Luxembourg 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:05:50", "owner": "monalisha__jena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867993316405704, "text": "Interested where to send resume 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:46:38", "owner": "bhuppender.singh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971733780958238, "text": "Is this a sign", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:43:02", "owner": "sabitasally12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082298569844609, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:37:35", "owner": "ineffable_sonder_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083715100967172, "text": "Cute😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:36:25", "owner": "the.archart", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18046787642409702, "text": "How can I send my resume", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:32:10", "owner": "shzmoonchild", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880687369307218, "text": "Yeah.... 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:27:31", "owner": "stop_.stalkiinng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891202543364572, "text": "Where to attach my resume 🤭🤭", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:20:00", "owner": "adi.ti_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535027138063458, "text": "EY🔥🙌>>>", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:18:17", "owner": "krtk_shrvstv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044945909693479, "text": "I will soo overwhelmed... Shall I send my resume ???", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:13:51", "owner": "aritrita_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851451343579437, "text": "Ohh I'm crying. It's so meaninfulll", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:56:09", "owner": "dapjeongneo_aysenur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18489306655075255, "text": "May I?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:50:52", "owner": "lollipop_holmes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138340558456922, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:50:00", "owner": "dome_shadowtales", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081179753081021, "text": "i want you too", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:48:47", "owner": "imsacakitritamaiacyn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077386186929122, "text": "How can I applyi", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:47:41", "owner": "chaos_me16", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18291482968272897, "text": "Happy to join man!!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:36:29", "owner": "laksh_mathur_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878468425428530, "text": "Waiting 🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:32:44", "owner": "muskan.gourr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980647905941731, "text": "Is there anyone opening vacancies from home?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:29:03", "owner": "nicheel4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037133552710579, "text": "Umm... thinking if I should submit my resume soon ☺️😌 Thankuu", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:27:04", "owner": "parasiteghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102521026726094, "text": "Where is my offer letter??? 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:26:32", "owner": "keshavivi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177547660317093, "text": "Yeah, I want to join as a member. Can you help me out with what I need to do?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:26:27", "owner": "fir.dhy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084664829317028, "text": "@tanishajaiin youve been promoted to intern", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:16:24", "owner": "sakshamxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095593045693713, "text": "Glad to accept the role, when do we start ?! 🤝🏼<⁠(⁠￣⁠︶⁠￣⁠)⁠>", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:09:00", "owner": "_mallikak_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095248987865962, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:07:05", "owner": "rrituraj5887", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004732706663058, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:06:15", "owner": "_chimdalu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948496224915305, "text": "Procedure?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:55:52", "owner": "himuskangupta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058052969251746, "text": "Ih lewat di akuuuu jgn²...... 😋", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:54:33", "owner": "hanawahyutriani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912028882249364, "text": "Send me the contract asap!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:53:26", "owner": "_9okhrel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048239441669688, "text": "Already applied @pwc_luxembourg . Help me with the visa.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:52:08", "owner": "gauravipandit12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082583746966555, "text": "Help me to join", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:43:53", "owner": "_ubitxh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093421072885993, "text": "Amen to that", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:43:42", "owner": "xaara_xafar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072320666601098, "text": "Can I really send my resume to u guys this seems so cool", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:41:27", "owner": "trailblazingsoul_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065425028569376, "text": "Can you hire me 🥺🎀✨🖐🏻??", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:38:31", "owner": "anu.zone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084399505997492, "text": "Send me the contract! Or do you want to have conversation over a chat?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:36:29", "owner": "_p_allav_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151124149418300, "text": "🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:35:02", "owner": "bint_e_ifteqar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903973789143143, "text": "I m interested", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:27:42", "owner": "omarsyed7860", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875332555440142, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:24:43", "owner": "whopoooov", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078995528276006, "text": "could you share me the link for internship ?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:23:23", "owner": "rohii.kandukurii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851532622579505, "text": "Rat race maxxing", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:22:48", "owner": "edmundalexander_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103817413642844, "text": "I m interested", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:10:04", "owner": "omarsyed7860", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925073464172282, "text": "Cute 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:09:22", "owner": "padawanprawapracy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045273821689663, "text": "I want internship", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:06:56", "owner": "__prajj.is.me", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942670498075008, "text": "So when can i join ? what's the role? And what's the stipend", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:06:32", "owner": "azzmuahhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396786640133154, "text": "Sure, pls yes", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:00:43", "owner": "iloveajvain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334988383231791, "text": "I am", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:58:02", "owner": "hariomtraders98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880579999307429, "text": "Waitinggggg", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:52:40", "owner": "_monisharoy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924436309170434, "text": "Now that's the right kind of marketing 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:51:39", "owner": "manifesting_my_lifee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862735777513370, "text": "our next slave*", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:51:35", "owner": "yanistzl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059467484564599, "text": "Aww... Thanks 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:50:44", "owner": "3character_2shoot_.jimmy.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085131673971610, "text": "😮🙌😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:50:22", "owner": "guzal_sattar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18152887297408559, "text": "Hey just wondering if you guys accept international applicants as well ?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:48:33", "owner": "_yy_bhupii_yy_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065610293123536, "text": "Yay unpaid labour", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:48:02", "owner": "hakimavech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847404871573193, "text": "I’m interested how can I apply?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:47:14", "owner": "anjalikondle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965011611989467, "text": "Do u provide summer internships for sophomore students", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:46:13", "owner": "pradyun_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111944359569464, "text": "Please please 🙌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:45:53", "owner": "rishisethiaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915442081213406, "text": "ur ATS sucks and even if u hire someone they get laid off in less than a year", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:45:05", "owner": "_arsenink_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050194496356397, "text": "Waiting for contract 🐸", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:44:40", "owner": "_sup_tiee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932324044107758, "text": "Send me your resume 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:39:29", "owner": "likkikkikki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175742053366444, "text": "How to apply", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:37:52", "owner": "_wingyme_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985438983910242, "text": "I'm seriously in need 🙂🙂🙂. As a fresher please if I can", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:35:16", "owner": "reading_is_feeding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092855194873050, "text": "Beautiful concept. I blushed. 😊😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:32:51", "owner": "sobanisresourcesltd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941790682004952, "text": "I'm interested. how I can join you.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:31:22", "owner": "mubeenmalik1308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983279271870024, "text": "Nah nah nah nopee", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:21:12", "owner": "bibimbapmandoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072208415587398, "text": "why is this on my tl..", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:21:10", "owner": "kelpln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945966345938209, "text": "How much you paying?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:21:08", "owner": "k.i.r.a__619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082073876097899, "text": "Are you giving visa sponsorship", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:10:12", "owner": "arushigupta_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145331338434035, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭 you want my resume???", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:00:18", "owner": "mahiiiiiiiii_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874589230359232, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:56:27", "owner": "___ras_hi__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338347675229434, "text": "Don't play with my emotion I am already ACCA affiliate", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:49:51", "owner": "love_in_nature_xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538210360031559, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:49:10", "owner": "alextarara", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059749811236928, "text": "Hire me 🙌🙌🙌😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:38:53", "owner": "rajputt.111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085470202821516, "text": "maybe this time I'll hear back", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:34:10", "owner": "rashi.abha.sharma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895436002342976, "text": "Love to work with your team😍but,my field is neuroscience, do u got any related internship?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:24:11", "owner": "sariiina_notash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876548296436140, "text": "better try to get the appointment before", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:07:56", "owner": "v_i_i_i_3_4_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084056263832978, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:07:38", "owner": "bhavyas_day", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868506433398885, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:55:52", "owner": "vida.de.tav.m", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077459089929150, "text": "How???", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:50:15", "owner": "ayeshaxmalikk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062904602434751, "text": "omg can i also apply ? I am from india though", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:27:54", "owner": "iamseeingthestars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068000465597191, "text": "Where is my offer letter, I am waiting 🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:26:18", "owner": "shivam_jha9163", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090929398730483, "text": "Unfortunately it's not you😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:17:44", "owner": "prosenjit8711", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17994180590844638, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:14:11", "owner": "aaradhy_vijaywat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925715596151478, "text": "😮really", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:09:03", "owner": "koustubha.srinivas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059232158197186, "text": "Omg me???? That’s way too kind🤭, but I’m all the way in Nigeria pookies 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:07:57", "owner": "efexdotz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537528226026080, "text": "Applied like 10 times and got rejected", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:05:24", "owner": "ankit._.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075630710273513, "text": "Oh yeah you forgot to mention it’s only for master students and that bachelors can just endlessly apply without any chance…", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:00:10", "owner": "camille._.grd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516113551066605, "text": "How do we apply??!!?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:57:08", "owner": "mong.00se", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853760437526591, "text": "Paid?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:55:02", "owner": "3sbl.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973336770955162, "text": "Bruh….😭🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:41:45", "owner": "imnabanita_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398826769120169, "text": "Omw", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:38:10", "owner": "zenoweed", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17895499977344026, "text": "I love it when big corporations start posting brainrot to attract young talents", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:31:11", "owner": "hey.subh.here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109580626613892, "text": "I dare you all to hire me😀", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:24:49", "owner": "shruusstii", "likes": 148}, {"id": 18380145790196903, "text": "Hope😭", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:17:19", "owner": "nishitaa.gautam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143213833446484, "text": "How can i join?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:10:52", "owner": "abhayy__999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047405906398700, "text": "I refreshed my email thrice... 🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-08T