", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944852959077754, "text": "Sorry, guys, I can’t.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:18:06", "owner": "davtian.annie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537558352047899, "text": "You guys keep lying 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:13:31", "owner": "keeratswaich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842624155614194, "text": "I am interested", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:32:38", "owner": "bhoomiipanchal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120220744467331, "text": "Meeee", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:32:33", "owner": "bhoomiipanchal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077209829328994, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:55:22", "owner": "tttt.aime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884185693280205, "text": "Please book my flight for tomorrow 🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:33:01", "owner": "taha_.ubaid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979167561775875, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:18:56", "owner": "akshkolli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929196748113979, "text": "Velen Danke @pwc_luxembourg 😮😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:53:14", "owner": "ughitsom", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18118012153534165, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:44:02", "owner": "deveshkaushal04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059718389225465, "text": "Omgggg, is this a sign😍😍 I gave interview and waiting for the results, pwc India", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:43:57", "owner": "_yourmoms.gf._", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18170553361369839, "text": "@shreyasdasgupta", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:37:53", "owner": "lukewarmtonic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18132630838469384, "text": "I'm glad to join you guys", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:31:39", "owner": "syedumerahmed_87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880680082306909, "text": "Waiting for the offerrrrrrr!! 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:27:18", "owner": "soumyadeep.saha09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074156360209679, "text": "I can attach my resume if you guys want 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:13:31", "owner": "harshan_a246", "likes": 2565}, {"id": 18066433895381299, "text": "Waiting for an intern offer for accountancy 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:48:07", "owner": "_cllu17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967718517979156, "text": "yes please, i am ready", "created_at": "2025-11-07T23:04:49", "owner": "yogitabag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299251570280285, "text": "The one and only attractive company „ooonly youuu“ 👆🏽✨🧡 @pwc_luxembourg", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:11:25", "owner": "kcbrahja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907244740127670, "text": "yes, but please don’t reject me! I wanna meet u!!", "created_at": "2025-11-07T21:44:19", "owner": "lorenzo.gianella", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920375935189453, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-07T21:29:51", "owner": "the_uday_777", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18095956147637905, "text": "Oh thank you convince me", "created_at": "2025-11-07T20:21:57", "owner": "psarvizu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042690347650831, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-07T19:03:01", "owner": "ricebroski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072762461017965, "text": "I’m waiting the internship contract 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:32:16", "owner": "bnaux_", "likes": 4513}, {"id": 18333773770235429, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:29:03", "owner": "brotherahad", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17946313778932179, "text": "So well done!", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:14:13", "owner": "neoskin_aesthetics", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17925050184030156, "text": "thanks! i felt seen 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:10:40", "owner": "whaaattttever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921194791050906, "text": "Hey interested but do u accept international students??", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:07:48", "owner": "diillekozturk", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18110840428588781, "text": "I need a referral", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:00:27", "owner": "ham_ham_zaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033862511710203, "text": "Hope i intern here🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:32:41", "owner": "draw_for_life6227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122910919459214, "text": "Okay challenge accepted !", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:14:14", "owner": "dafnacaspi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382063888147047, "text": "Amazing! I'm interested", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:00:26", "owner": "riona_gurjao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191672074336013, "text": "You guys take international students? 🤔😶‍🌫️🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:50:01", "owner": "ganurdd", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18080998045871028, "text": "11:11", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:20:47", "owner": "_tanaayyyy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062929136180920, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:31:08", "owner": "ti.lly8662", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948292056920863, "text": "So when can I join ? 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:46:33", "owner": "lilith_luna11", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18056094902296181, "text": "Is it a paid internship", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:28:57", "owner": "lorlah_moh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301998316250311, "text": "Hmmm sure, intern like the lowest and least respect in the company. Also, earn less than the janitor or if nothing. So excited to be an intern at your company 👏😅", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:44:22", "owner": "kimmomile", "likes": 122}, {"id": 18079011905164227, "text": "Im interested but how ?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T23:11:39", "owner": "lahcenaouina", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18122228968516485, "text": "Cutestttttt❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-06T22:15:04", "owner": "dhara_agath_", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18060075359215227, "text": "The transition 🤌🏼🤌🏼🤌🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:22:27", "owner": "its_so_so_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048910970386155, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:11:54", "owner": "sarahhedouin", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3639501556450101594, "shortcode": "DKCG2H3sIla", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DKCG2H3sIla/", "taken_at": "2025-05-24T10:28:29", "caption": "Consulting Industry explained 😳\n\nDo you want to work in Consulting? Sign up to laboro.co and apply to 1000 advisory firms in one click 🔗📌\n\n#finance #bain #bcg #mbb #deloitte #big4 #mckinsey #consulting #investmentbanking #jpmorgan #business #consultant #meme #businessschool", "owner_username": "interview_scouter", "owner_id": "65949595837", "likes": 33072, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0040_DKCG2H3sIla\\DKCG2H3sIla_20250524_102829.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18076119511892913, "text": "Consulting or advertising? 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-24T10:35:25", "owner": "kdekilo19", "likes": 457}, {"id": 18372583735125439, "text": "The EY push felt personal... 😂😂😂 I support it", "created_at": "2025-05-28T22:15:56", "owner": "ines_ao", "likes": 70}, {"id": 18026604713679173, "text": "Tata consultancy services", "created_at": "2025-05-25T16:24:47", "owner": "chakraborty_partha1992", "likes": 182}, {"id": 17943269691001368, "text": "Please make the insurance consultancy version!!😂", "created_at": "2025-05-24T14:26:10", "owner": "diastephy", "likes": 182}, {"id": 18041366288537063, "text": "Not a useful contribution from a single one of them", "created_at": "2025-05-28T21:30:51", "owner": "cwave_dave", "likes": 209}, {"id": 18011592305559502, "text": "Until the real OG shows up.🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-05-24T12:43:00", "owner": "ixshhhaaaaann", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18080965108693280, "text": "McKinsey just fired a lot of people", "created_at": "2025-05-31T12:20:01", "owner": "kclinussmith", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18065697320332932, "text": "@jonahkinsey @juan8rivera reality?", "created_at": "2025-08-05T02:42:22", "owner": "david.__.green", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301508209174287, "text": "Bro why do you hate deloitte?", "created_at": "2025-05-24T17:50:10", "owner": "polar_bear6666", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18085220284836147, "text": "Next stop inshahAllah🚩", "created_at": "2025-08-07T13:35:31", "owner": "its_haseeb_aca", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18333914023163225, "text": "Deloitte Forever!!! N°1", "created_at": "2025-05-25T06:12:17", "owner": "roberto.quarta", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17859906480431460, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T01:06:02", "owner": "mart_pt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085419583636986, "text": "Uhg please", "created_at": "2025-05-25T12:13:04", "owner": "kolikonda.sushmitha", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18507504370050242, "text": "Kinda funny why I find this so entertaining", "created_at": "2025-05-29T18:35:29", "owner": "hitsustan", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18370383745177838, "text": "love bcg", "created_at": "2025-07-27T02:56:53", "owner": "ghabras.kyro", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18086056756639736, "text": "Watching with pain as a consultant at Deloitte ☠️😢", "created_at": "2025-05-25T09:34:39", "owner": "one.above.all.1111", "likes": 128}, {"id": 17855156007455763, "text": "@karth1keya_varma", "created_at": "2025-06-19T05:57:23", "owner": "balavardhan_pothina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909451003114704, "text": "@__poojithhh__ HRC where ?", "created_at": "2025-05-24T11:09:32", "owner": "levi_arka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932118844046000, "text": "😂😂😂 the reality for MBAs looking to get into consulting - in I Banking these days, is GS still the rooster ? Or is JP now “the firm” to go?", "created_at": "2025-05-30T23:56:14", "owner": "raulcoral20", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092631112633670, "text": "EY ko do baar pel dia 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T18:50:25", "owner": "jaiswall_sagar", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18001877531785246, "text": "Where is JP?", "created_at": "2025-05-25T13:58:31", "owner": "92_bfo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995908728662866, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-06T03:59:30", "owner": "damn_shescool", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985596057751992, "text": "JPMorgan and Goldman Sachs where are you😂", "created_at": "2025-07-27T09:03:57", "owner": "regent3677", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052180445375773, "text": "TCS 🔥🤣NAAM SUNA HAI", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:29:48", "owner": "sringeri_shashank_3105", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18359672866196369, "text": "Bhai EY ki insult mat karo 😂 EY m hi hoon", "created_at": "2025-06-09T13:03:07", "owner": "sanskari_bacchaa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18148471003390561, "text": "@bengaleegoingplaces  Next which one?", "created_at": "2025-07-16T12:58:47", "owner": "roheramanish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096264199503914, "text": "No bdo?", "created_at": "2025-05-30T08:33:28", "owner": "juan.sin.tierraa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18034540982652651, "text": "Layoffs incoming 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-28T08:38:28", "owner": "thedeep.quote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076130467920640, "text": "kearney crying in the corner", "created_at": "2025-06-23T22:48:21", "owner": "rockh_31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071685578173311, "text": "Consultants get more credibility after years of experience in the field they are consulting in.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:30:25", "owner": "sem0mes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057110858224946, "text": "Where are  , Google, Amazon, Tesla and Trump", "created_at": "2025-06-06T10:21:46", "owner": "kiwiclaud", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073663726905357, "text": "@amishaa_sriv  lets cry in corner", "created_at": "2025-06-03T12:22:25", "owner": "meraki_2411", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104360518564493, "text": "Where’s IBM/Promontory???", "created_at": "2025-08-09T14:36:52", "owner": "minaandthesun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103398856523182, "text": "They can’t do a thing to BDO", "created_at": "2025-05-26T18:03:15", "owner": "bm384", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18043795085215384, "text": "I'm loving this series. It's not enough views this is amazing. 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-25T02:20:49", "owner": "mo.b_05", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18066547469463249, "text": "Consultants don’t have any useful advice", "created_at": "2025-09-19T05:30:55", "owner": "gibson_fowler", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17951212565863177, "text": "EY Parthenon enters the chat", "created_at": "2025-08-05T13:03:38", "owner": "_suryxhhhh._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087647053739598, "text": "In from EY, had a job interview at BCG. I asked the lady, what do you do all day with your clients (I'm from quant background) ? She told me we do audits and implement what we recommend regarding régulation (in banking). In cut short the interview. Most boring job I ever heard off", "created_at": "2025-07-27T10:20:50", "owner": "paulpelletier", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18396093751116592, "text": "Where's TCS?", "created_at": "2025-06-15T11:26:23", "owner": "ramsyndya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061843949273642, "text": "@g1_reddy028 @vishalv.reddy  mamul gha undadu", "created_at": "2025-06-18T15:50:35", "owner": "manojk_reddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899455639196849, "text": "Where's BDO lol", "created_at": "2025-05-24T13:32:40", "owner": "junxydh", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18049878650420376, "text": "Understand 3%", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:11:07", "owner": "sergio.glcs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978476127845122, "text": "@rishabh_khare_11 ek lappar mar diya 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-06T05:12:18", "owner": "imsohammalakar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18227895241291015, "text": "Forgot Palantir", "created_at": "2025-05-25T16:12:57", "owner": "moshewolberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852698215451787, "text": "Pleace do same thing for audit aspect?)", "created_at": "2025-05-25T12:09:43", "owner": "___ashurov05___", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051234338087557, "text": "Pwc😂", "created_at": "2025-05-24T10:39:36", "owner": "_chidambar_998_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18098592235697968, "text": "Reality is accenture consulting tops the list", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:28:14", "owner": "adarshanand_0001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078640382176449, "text": "Like deloitte isn’t ranked #1 gtfoh 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:05:44", "owner": "michaelaraujo2248", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085541932825842, "text": "Where's JPM and Goldman? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:37:30", "owner": "reginay_priv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084579692007574, "text": "Nah, Strategy& got this 🗿☕", "created_at": "2025-11-15T08:59:54", "owner": "songoku123xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938663914096880, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T05:12:26", "owner": "jonathan_okoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101669461734704, "text": "How come no kearney", "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:08:09", "owner": "f.cl_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105288259715925, "text": "Lol😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T18:38:12", "owner": "yo_han.00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850364593581987, "text": "bro EY can suukkk it😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T07:56:29", "owner": "lkaranmehtal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928881802114351, "text": "ChatGPT is coming, wait and see", "created_at": "2025-10-30T16:40:15", "owner": "trealdiallo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958314171863451, "text": "pernah lamar di BCG, dan dinotice sama HRD nya walau gagal masuk@ tp setidaknya bangga sih pernah kepanggil", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:48:24", "owner": "fransiscusxsinaga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081776918479166, "text": "mckinsey is ass", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:26:09", "owner": "vcibizov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18221615800305966, "text": "Accenture 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-16T05:49:56", "owner": "mohit__agnihotri__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076614311101431, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-15T10:53:05", "owner": "asilbek_saidmusayev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077047205075849, "text": "Bof… not really true most of cabinet in strategy are losing their lead due to their lack of knowledge in tech solutions", "created_at": "2025-09-11T19:49:16", "owner": "feres7304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287387773256809, "text": "More like this 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-02T21:34:47", "owner": "m_92_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030289694509616, "text": "Every consulting firm sucks 😅 their all noobs", "created_at": "2025-08-29T11:56:59", "owner": "information_discussion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994638645666307, "text": "They are all shit", "created_at": "2025-08-07T09:07:31", "owner": "sssmiles555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070328714078960, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T22:29:54", "owner": "avi.impuestos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913409395171574, "text": "@chrs.yang 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-03T03:16:27", "owner": "tikawngso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085658566629052, "text": "KPMG Almans", "created_at": "2025-08-02T07:04:40", "owner": "therealhaensonfire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060942959589420, "text": "Black Rock quietly watching 😮", "created_at": "2025-08-01T08:40:47", "owner": "akshay_markhedkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867203509425039, "text": "Hey slow down bro *I as accenture😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T16:50:11", "owner": "sayyhhnaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074911294953149, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-28T13:07:39", "owner": "prakashmahato812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907024762072200, "text": "There PPts are just pricey 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-16T16:40:26", "owner": "swastickchowdhury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076149638309975, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-13T06:25:19", "owner": "naitik24885", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072447016822442, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-13T03:22:24", "owner": "hhuman_singh123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069232388484088, "text": "We are all equally useless. Where's this ego coming from?", "created_at": "2025-07-03T23:17:27", "owner": "skylar_cgy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020471996713659, "text": "MBB🙌", "created_at": "2025-06-28T11:05:03", "owner": "anuj_maurya7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928627549077968, "text": "0% WLB", "created_at": "2025-06-27T18:19:03", "owner": "aakash_calm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899687251208399, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-26T02:04:08", "owner": "abhishek.tripathii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050813972621427, "text": "BAIN & company 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-12T19:38:27", "owner": "mr.bibushya_bain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067487264019629, "text": "MBB the king kong", "created_at": "2025-06-12T05:11:23", "owner": "sahilvishi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065695717892237, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-06-11T18:32:19", "owner": "c.a.wonder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073188310743813, "text": "No Aon?", "created_at": "2025-06-11T16:02:33", "owner": "blue_pirate_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851938870467561, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-11T03:52:32", "owner": "_.jeethan_dsouza_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114069001489666, "text": "McKinsey&Company🗿", "created_at": "2025-06-10T21:10:33", "owner": "brucewaynell", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18071159038787910, "text": "Song ?", "created_at": "2025-06-09T06:50:58", "owner": "dhruvaganapathy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092403436529209, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T12:17:49", "owner": "mean.farm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067523738087248, "text": "The big 4 are primarily accounting firms? That do work? Of course they put less importance on consulting vs entire consulting firms that do nothing but that.", "created_at": "2025-06-05T22:13:48", "owner": "arthur.redwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367095379183121, "text": "McKinsey 😏🤫", "created_at": "2025-06-05T21:55:29", "owner": "architecoco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062297608933550, "text": "😮😂", "created_at": "2025-06-04T05:03:03", "owner": "they_call_me_aanya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063887210111773, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-31T04:41:08", "owner": "iikyoshinthasari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011171372732324, "text": "Murzzzz @ecommurz", "created_at": "2025-05-30T04:39:26", "owner": "irsan56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068792921290499, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-30T00:48:37", "owner": "iamwhyam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18229611931290652, "text": "MBB over the Big 4", "created_at": "2025-05-29T13:09:47", "owner": "jeffmartonomilitia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18464072341073002, "text": "Whats wrong with accenture😢", "created_at": "2025-05-29T08:46:06", "owner": "iko.ruri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056045069018280, "text": "I need a big tech one!!!!", "created_at": "2025-05-28T22:46:09", "owner": "misskapone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163713121348926, "text": "They are all smoke salesman... Pure BS all of them", "created_at": "2025-05-28T22:09:00", "owner": "nico_posada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080967400749615, "text": "Come on, I didn’t know the circus had ranks", "created_at": "2025-05-28T19:42:19", "owner": "cristianocardarelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116206207479064, "text": "Knowing where to apply is step one but knowing how to stand out is where most candidates need support. That’s where @mbb_prep comes in.", "created_at": "2025-05-28T17:50:28", "owner": "ashwin_mbb_coach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354479476158284, "text": "Where’s bdo?", "created_at": "2025-05-28T10:24:19", "owner": "trinita_tan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092871790606526, "text": "Then it should just be ChatGPT pwning all of them at the end.", "created_at": "2025-05-28T09:30:37", "owner": "ahmiq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058055639233944, "text": "@_the_lion_hearted_harry_ 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-28T06:40:33", "owner": "crack._.guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061047887127938, "text": "@geetansh1908", "created_at": "2025-05-28T03:10:13", "owner": "i_amsrp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18459644770073492, "text": "@geetansh1908", "created_at": "2025-05-28T03:09:58", "owner": "i_amsrp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051501578093390, "text": "Capgemini??", "created_at": "2025-05-28T01:55:52", "owner": "adriantramirez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328047088165684, "text": "They got accenture too 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-05-27T19:21:35", "owner": "zarinawolfe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351266494153077, "text": "This is not how it works", "created_at": "2025-05-27T15:40:19", "owner": "read_write_execute", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938053509905984, "text": "The OGs vs New venture", "created_at": "2025-05-27T02:42:18", "owner": "kirakira95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061160375135711, "text": "Where is KF?", "created_at": "2025-05-27T01:47:45", "owner": "valance_ayan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 183245686302