"owner": "stax_the_great", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037815935711946, "text": "@benpagliar28", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:34:09", "owner": "daksh_1072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303440596249805, "text": "lmao yesterday in college workshop there were these students who were playing clash royal , poker,bgmi,and some random online mini games", "created_at": "2025-11-14T08:20:32", "owner": "kintamasilver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872181484452249, "text": "A particular friend of mine hmmmm.....", "created_at": "2025-11-14T05:16:43", "owner": "rafiaryasu4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881208685304835, "text": "For me, it’s Genshin Impact", "created_at": "2025-11-14T02:29:47", "owner": "chua_p_ness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027633794569785, "text": "@vishwajit_246", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01:30:18", "owner": "nisargjche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103978600648945, "text": "@rodion_krupin", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:32:27", "owner": "_brovilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118502242540978, "text": "Not me tho, I was watching yt like in the quarantine days", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:28:27", "owner": "avg_cosplayur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072505394014095, "text": "@saiesh_op", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:32:28", "owner": "mr_fernandez_029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068921822605655, "text": "@tanish_shettty", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:37:37", "owner": "elrizz_pvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080332640276031, "text": "How about Nasdaq chart?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:05:55", "owner": "plagu9rat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929745922131709, "text": "@lofi_vibe_fx", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:42:24", "owner": "sann_juu07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946183020935874, "text": "Freshmen trying not to hotbox the restroom with vape nades", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:23:03", "owner": "bankyy270", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894513565357957, "text": "Business students, specifically", "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:06:37", "owner": "nicholas.the.lamp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928256359138438, "text": "", "created_at"