{"media_id": 3656417113984450659, "shortcode": "DK-M_4ds8Bj", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DK-M_4ds8Bj/", "taken_at": "2025-06-16T18:39:54", "caption": "Which song should I strip the music from next? \n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\nNo beat. Just the sound of pretending everything’s fine\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\nFollow @just.listen.to.halal.music for more edits that feel too real.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\nHASHTAGS 👇\n#LifeGoesOn\n#OliverTree\n#NoMusicEdit\n#AcapellaOnly\n#EmotionalTracks\n#DarkPop\n#AltVibes\n#ViralSound\n#FYP\n#InstaMusic\n#justlisten\n🍉", "owner_username": "jlt7s", "owner_id": "71359772951", "likes": 448902, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0042_DK-M_4ds8Bj\\DK-M_4ds8Bj_20250616_183954.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18085835650710339, "text": "Babe, you're too controlling\nI'ma feed you to the wolves when you get nasty back at me\nBut baby, don't distract me\nI'm a goner, I lost her\nLike, why the hell you wanna play me that way?\nYou're bad, babe, you double-faced entendre\nLife goes on, and on, and on, and on, and on, and\nOn, and on, and on\nOn, and on, and on, and on, and on, and\nOn and on and on\nOn, and on, and on, and on, and on, and\nOn, and on, and on\nOn, and on, and on, and on, and on, and\nOn, and on, and on\nBabe, you best believe it, I'ma rip you up to pieces\nI'm a lover, not a fighter, but I'll light this place on fire\nI want it, I'm on it, but babe, at least, I'm honest\nI get tired of explaining\nAs these seasons keep on changing\nLife goes on, and on, and on, and on, and on, and\nOn, and on, and on (yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\nOn, and on, and on, and on, and on, and\nOn, and on, and on (yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\nOn, and on, and on, and on, and on, and\nOn, and on, and on (yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\nOn, and on, and on, and on, and on, and\nOn, and on, and on (yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\nWork all day, and then I wake up\nWork all day, and then I wake up\nWork all day, and then I wake up\nWork all day (yeah, yeah, yeah)\nWork all day, and then I wake up\nWork all day, and then I wake up\nWork all day, and then I wake up\nWork all day", "created_at": "2025-06-16T18:43:04", "owner": "jlt7s", "likes": 13931}, {"id": 18108472048585525, "text": "Un recuerdo será esta canción 🥹❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-10-17T23:23:17", "owner": "martinez_kevin_14", "likes": 79}, {"id": 18278563255260407, "text": "Nome do aplicativo - Moises", "created_at": "2025-06-22T10:38:12", "owner": "filipe_coutinho_", "likes": 245}, {"id": 18084444361704759, "text": "2021 tik tok trend", "created_at": "2025-06-17T10:13:30", "owner": "ecf1x", "likes": 7121}, {"id": 18050277788358876, "text": "App name?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:42:42", "owner": "_lux.core_01", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069403652315673, "text": "App name : mosies", "created_at": "2025-06-17T11:54:21", "owner": "abdu.ma1ikovich", "likes": 1102}, {"id": 18069099176054539, "text": "Onion 🧅 onion 🧅 onion 🧅 onion 🧅 onion 🧅 onion 🧅 on🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-17T17:45:51", "owner": "jonas_30418807", "likes": 5092}, {"id": 17902460520213076, "text": "Que nostalgia é essa?", "created_at": "2025-07-25T01:11:42", "owner": "luan206547", "likes": 135}, {"id": 17849957196513118, "text": "Before 👍after 👍", "created_at": "2025-07-21T13:01:17", "owner": "kit_dong.dh", "likes": 595}, {"id": 17922163439983900, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-16T23:52:13", "owner": "cenasblackwidow", "likes": 8622}, {"id": 18060912266029264, "text": "Es chema de Aida con pelo", "created_at": "2025-07-29T14:01:55", "owner": "darioflute", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039464585650369, "text": "Cómo para quitarle la música?", "created_at": "2025-06-21T15:26:38", "owner": "cristian981428", "likes": 361}, {"id": 18048012464565705, "text": "Só eu q achei legal sem o efeito sonoro?", "created_at": "2025-06-18T14:45:45", "owner": "kaue_portilho6", "likes": 2209}, {"id": 17964801107959111, "text": "Nombre de la aplicación?", "created_at": "2025-08-31T02:35:50", "owner": "danilo_pineda13"