 I wake up\nWork all day, and then I wake up\nWork all day", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:50:06", "owner": "_ysppvv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874509940325683, "text": "Ониониониони😢?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:23:52", "owner": "kamiwka_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082124420506783, "text": "Тинтититити гдее😭😭 наганга тинти", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:23:33", "owner": "kamiwka_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095438329668544, "text": "Moises 앱 아님?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:09:13", "owner": "gimmyeong40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056715800178360, "text": "App name", "created_at": "2025-09-21T00:48:27", "owner": "just_.fortunaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937628092074275, "text": "\"Year, year, year...\"", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:59:34", "owner": "willian_342_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104538532581357, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:14:33", "owner": "alicecastros16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054496328227427, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:56:53", "owner": "elmirr.7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039308927452970, "text": "إسمأغنيه؟", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:16:52", "owner": "kwi7a__100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976456959921332, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:13:56", "owner": "wsardor.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903159490254879, "text": "Hozigina tvda korudim shuni🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:51:45", "owner": "xaitboyev.boburjon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908343661227756, "text": "Let down", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:06:55", "owner": "cjt_1217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294684400270128, "text": "Still song was epic", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:18:55", "owner": "inos.manav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101878012534600, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:50:46", "owner": "n0rm3tov_007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851731993549665, "text": "De donde salieron tantos hongos nueva pandemia!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T05:09:54", "owner": "hernandezeduardooviedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084909367723998, "text": "Anxiety, please 🥺", "created_at": "2025-09-20T