{"media_id": 3647462131303618018, "shortcode": "DKeY3u8CpXi", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DKeY3u8CpXi/", "taken_at": "2025-06-04T10:03:27", "caption": "當年夜店的國歌啊！！！\n聽過的人站出來～～🍺🍾\n\n影片出處｜＠Youtube\nLow - Flo Rida\n\n［ 歌曲單字 ］\n✏️Shawty (n.)（俚語）辣妹、小妞\n✏️Fur (n.) 毛皮\n✏️Club (n.) 夜店、俱樂部\n✏️Hit the floor (phr. v.)開始跳舞\n✏️Apple Bottom Jeans (n.)服裝品牌名稱�補充：這一個由饒舌歌手 Nelly 創立的服裝品牌，以強調女性臀部曲線的牛仔褲而聞名。\n\n✅還想聽什麼呢？留言起來！\n\n#Winning+ #WinningPlus #線上國際語言學校 #英語學習基地 #激發你的英文超能力 #母語學習法 #線上英語 #英文學習 #low #florida", "owner_username": "winning.plus.tw", "owner_id": "38048553561", "likes": 51437, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0043_DKeY3u8CpXi\\DKeY3u8CpXi_20250604_100327.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17938182566898173, "text": "我的喪禮上一定要放這首", "created_at": "2025-06-04T12:31:17", "owner": "adawang410", "likes": 2064}, {"id": 18079259176865400, "text": "原來是She hit the floor啊\n\n我還沒看歌詞之前一直以為是She eats the bird", "created_at": "2025-06-05T11:15:52", "owner": "kailes.w1994", "likes": 889}, {"id": 17910049455037295, "text": "現在也還🙌🔥是夜店嗨歌啊😂", "created_at": "2025-06-04T10:52:51", "owner": "kamin929", "likes": 337}, {"id": 18040689347556714, "text": "這10幾年有了吧 還是一樣神", "created_at": "2025-06-04T14:43:50", "owner": "hiimweichen", "likes": 159}, {"id": 18353602048157688, "text": "現在聽還是很炸😍😍", "created_at": "2025-06-04T15:04:08", "owner": "tiffany_qwq", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071958163947509, "text": "太有感了，以後結婚進場歌😆", "created_at": "2025-06-24T18:46:51", "owner": "jet__lin", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18109066495506911, "text": "咦？原來歌詞長醬🤣🤣🤣🤣\n我只知道low low low low，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，現在都還是聽得到喔！！", "created_at": "2025-06-04T16:33:08", "owner": "nicolas_hakman", "likes": 87}, {"id": 18088161148741805, "text": "到底😂我媽煮飯都聽這首歌", "created_at": "2025-07-30T11:10:08", "owner": "lmfukinbad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069160760491707, "text": "現在聽還是很炸呀🙌", "created_at": "2025-06-05T18:15:40", "owner": "djnoodlestw", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17907881517157304, "text": "✏️Shawty (n.)（俚語）辣妹、小妞�✏️Fur (n.) 毛皮\n✏️Club (n.) 夜店、俱樂部\n✏️Hit the floor (phr. v.)開始跳舞\n✏️Apple Bottom Jeans (n.)服裝品牌名稱�補充：這一個由饒舌歌手 Nelly 創立的服裝品牌，以強調女性臀部曲線的牛仔褲而聞名。", "created_at": "2025-06-04T10:03:33", "owner": "winning.plus.tw", "likes": 80}, {"id": 17967416009768972, "text": "啊就舞力全開的主題曲", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:10:37", "owner": "sd970034", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17923489845087001, "text": "所以這群人的翻唱真的是照著歌詞轉換的🤣我以為是搞笑", "created_at": "2025-06-05T12:53:27", "owner": "wenyan7341", "likes": 33}, {"id": 17868861444310825, "text": "《霍金很喜歡這歌》", "created_at": "2025-06-23T17:09:43", "owner": "chiikawaaaaa0_0", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18143532004398843, "text": "小姐有蘋果底部牛仔褲", "created_at": "2025-06-20T05:08:25", "owner": "k41j4y", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973211217894017, "text": "這個翻譯挺……溫和？", "created_at": "2025-06-06T18:20:14", "owner": "hardware_tsai1997", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18032756666389557, "text": "@_power_duck 踩著毛毛靴", "created_at": "2025-06-05T18:14:19", "owner": "wcu.510", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18016632389735881, "text": "@dasianding0902 我的喪禮一定要有這首歌😂", "created_at": "2025-07-05T02:59:14", "owner": "victorhuang212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046411175405097, "text": "我要敬禮🫡🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-06-05T12:15:27", "owner": "weitin092078", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17942398406898553, "text": "歌名在哪", "created_at": "2025-07-18T05:21:13", "owner": "jackhan.11.04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089221828654597, "text": "從高三聽到三高😂🥹", "created_at": "2025-06-22T16:22:04", "owner": "jie_lili17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058041929239427, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-06T13:23:36", "owner": "mrlin_peter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18518273062051595, "text": "我又想玩qq飞车了", "created_at": "2025-07-15T06:15:30", "owner": "bichengszhao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917803129054514, "text": "@rachhh_l @chung__as", "created_at": "2025-10-11T04:56:55", "owner": "kwongtang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18292233880301479, "text": "Song name?", "created_at": "2025-07-05T15:11:06", "owner": "55502_george_5909.haha", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069737342082011, "text": "Flo Rida", "created_at": "2025-06-23T12:21:28", "owner": "asd55538", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18119286259475042, "text": "穿金色西裝是T-Pain喔", "created_at": "2025-06-30T23:23:54", "owner": "huangdada_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18090389581721600, "text": "发现好听的基本都是小黄歌😂", "created_at": "2025-06-05T09:43:49", "owner": "suzibaoyue", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17887148484300503, "text": "這首超讚", "created_at": "2025-07-16T08:28:42", "owner": "ktpss107025", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072368422936239, "text": "運動會跳這首😂", "created_at": "2025-06-22T04:29:55", "owner": "usanba0612", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100616413487984, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T13:17:32", "owner": "adria_nchok2180", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961863858975472, "text": "這首歌名字叫什麼？", "created_at": "2025-08-24T12:39:16", "owner": "ryan.121600", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988111833818443, "text": "歷久不衰", "created_at": "2025-06-26T12:45:50", "owner": "devilshalock", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065877050126715, "text": "+1", "created_at": "2025-07-02T19:21:07", "owner": "im_damnit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873975016363118, "text": "老歌了…", "created_at": "2025-06-15T13:10:33", "owner": "ladieslovelewis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17972273321779179, "text": "Jessica!!!😡", "created_at": "2025-09-02T10:46:46", "owner": "yeehohei", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023838539762207, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:19:58", "owner": "kuku16888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078626870124898, "text": "我之前都以為這影品第一句的那個歌詞在說 LeBron James", "created_at": "2025-11-15T05:48:45", "owner": "fel._.1218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078016525920219, "text": "@kay_chuu 當年🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:08:00", "owner": "wingsss_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516380926066031, "text": "這首不會退流行 現在聽還是很好聽❤️大愛", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:27:59", "owner": "joliefans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320885155215198, "text": "嘍起來。突然有個壞壞💡", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:15:59", "owner": "yojfaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061855154101090, "text": "而家間吾中都有聽🤭 因為跳popping 中意呢首歌", "created_at": "2025-09