{"media_id": 3651340680401883416, "shortcode": "DKsKwDRSZEY", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DKsKwDRSZEY/", "taken_at": "2025-06-09T18:30:25", "caption": "Part 1: The most iconic song during covid 19 \n\n#songs#iconic#covid19#fyp#viral", "owner_username": "tunecanvas0", "owner_id": "66558802918", "likes": 634426, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0044_DKsKwDRSZEY\\DKsKwDRSZEY_20250609_183025.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17863025058424453, "text": "😭Where is BTS in savage love", "created_at": "2025-06-30T05:30:46", "owner": "7bangtan.myworld", "likes": 789}, {"id": 18070349737885264, "text": "I remember savage love WITH BTS…", "created_at": "2025-08-09T00:00:38", "owner": "lolazy___", "likes": 1448}, {"id": 18025648865694650, "text": "SugarCrash was a different vibeee😭😭🤌", "created_at": "2025-06-18T17:52:23", "owner": "kaybee_291", "likes": 32546}, {"id": 18058222010221215, "text": "this did NOT need 2 parts", "created_at": "2025-06-10T06:18:12", "owner": "noanandonlydita", "likes": 59217}, {"id": 17843904747504822, "text": "wrap me was A KPOP SONG? 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-20T16:59:00", "owner": "_rubberduckyyy_", "likes": 1551}, {"id": 17894043018253482, "text": "I was swearing sugar crash was fire 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-18T01:17:03", "owner": "pregnantsubmissiveomegasoobin", "likes": 10030}, {"id": 17900322027090937, "text": "This feels so far away but so close🥲", "created_at": "2025-06-18T03:46:34", "owner": "reaganwhitmire1776", "likes": 4027}, {"id": 18033266261660684, "text": "playdate is genuinely so good", "created_at": "2025-06-18T11:05:12", "owner": "_srinjan06", "likes": 5466}, {"id": 18095514901731444, "text": "Okey pero savage love tambien es de bts...", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:20:45", "owner": "lupita.rodriguez.7528610", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17906675592062898, "text": "Play date 😭😭😭😩😩💕💕", "created_at": "2025-06-19T05:09:20", "owner": "_vinayak_shukla30", "likes": 5893}, {"id": 17980540418914620, "text": "SugarCrash! Is still in my playlist.....,,,", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:27:09", "owner": "happy_akshi1234", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100779280581352, "text": "Nostalgia 😭🤌🤌🤌", "created_at": "2025-07-26T18:01:01", "owner": "wingitwithkshitiz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18279123139257571, "text": "งื้ออคิดถึงอ่าาา", "created_at": "2025-06-20T02:13:41", "owner": "iamruby_eiei", "likes": 514}, {"id": 18079194736838919, "text": "Suger crushh yrr 👏🔥🔥🌹", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:56:45", "owner": "abhinavyogi22", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092518918769858, "text": "Sugar crush hits nostalgic😢", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:27:42", "owner": "false._.alarmed", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17910685296224258, "text": "Nostalgia ✨", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:45:22", "owner": "__faaaa___lk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865413643393623, "text": "Nostalgia 🥺", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:43:44", "owner": "vishvaprataap_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104464387494480, "text": "Nostalgic songs ❤️😭", "created_at": "2025-07-25T17:55:14", "owner": "yikees_s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082073551814215, "text": "I like the number nine😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:33:04", "owner": "khalifah.alfarisi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049207331632182, "text": "Play date 😭", "created_at": "2025-08-25T21:54:09", "owner": "jafethmy", "likes": 101}, {"id": 18078988943510967, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:20:00", "owner": "raissasenabat", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18405783379108048, "text": "Yeah these give me vibes😭", "created_at": "2025-07-09T06:58:22", "owner": "natasza_kazzz1601", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842904496597464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-13T17:55:17", "owner": "mounli8t", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079198282731618, "text": "Hearing this songs makes me feel so old", "created_at": "2025-07-26T15:26:51", "owner": "_pappynotpapi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080655028995691, "text": "Rockstar 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-13T08:03:30", "owner": "halycon_001", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17942262906046067, "text": "roblox edits went hard on ts 💔", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:10:31", "owner": "aldenalmeidaa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17879346714363618, "text": "\"I've never listened to K-pop\" are you sure?", "created_at": "2025-07-26T15:18:33", "owner": "_elena_lupo_", "likes": 495}, {"id": 18108145111583277, "text": "The old k pop wrap me ❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:45:09", "owner": "needs_asthetic", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067040687241734, "text": "I miss this era 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:10:05", "owner": "bawii455", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081454183795842, "text": "Savage love with bts", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:41:03", "owner": "piyushi_d_11", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17849081304457469, "text": "Still can't get over the fact Wrap me was Kpop", "created_at": "2025-06-18T04:02:16", "owner": "velumoblivii", "likes": 860}, {"id": 18116433292532026, "text": "2020/2022💔", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:07:31", "owner": "em.c_r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074282539913911, "text": "It was absolutely everywhere", "created_at": "2025-10-10T09:07:34", "owner": "sw3et._.p0tato", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077990684042748, "text": "Damn we had the worst music ever that Era", "created_at": "2025-10-05T00:20:34", "owner": "gustavkaufmann1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054433487260375, "text": "Do You get deja vu...ah...", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:25:04", "owner": "its_maria_143_1433", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023413793779451, "text": "Looks like labubu", "created_at": "2025-10-09T01:43:50", "owner": "figfuel_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933806146073981, "text": "sugarcrash😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-26T13:00:07", "owner": "freakingfairytale", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877533430308880, "text": "imma cry now", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:32:08", "owner": "morr.iganthom.as", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088040855499003, "text": "Corona🗣️ virus🗣️ dangerous🗣️ virus🗣️🦠", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:08:34", "owner": "lil_bs_04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066020003029394, "text": "The best shit from 2020..", "created_at": "2025-09-24T00:44:12", "owner": "zakrom08", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18021721520513067, "text": "Play date by Mel will always be iconic to me (if u hate Mel don’t waste ur time commenting on this plz)", "created_at": "2025-07-02T03:19:14", "owner": "theynicknamedme_thebolter", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17902249053255798, "text": "The gacha life videos on these 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:25:22", "owner": "_v.estige_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17860289454377484, "text": "Savage love - BTS 💜🪻", "created_at": "2025-06-20T14:16:29", "owner": "srija_das_879", "likes": 363}, {"id": 18104989189510837, "text": "Lets all of us be for real we were very cringe in that time and maybe in a few years maybe 2025 will be considered cringe too but you get it right?", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:33:25", "owner": "not.always.mean", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18059679284220197, "text": "we were literally dancing to savage love in 2022-", "created_at": "2025-06-19T04:45:47", "owner": "sophix_was_here", "likes": 480}, {"id": 18058564853252984, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-22T14:55:37", "owner": "aaryan__verse", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18324911461235997, "text": "Playdate was my everyday song", "created_at": "2025-09-22T17:53:59", "owner": "amant_47", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890576431342790, "text": "Play date 🎂💕🍰🧸", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:21:02", "owner": "iaagihtbp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18209765584307620, "text": "Bro brings me back to those days", "created_at": "2025-07-30T06:02:39", "owner": "cahobaonam", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18135687187439877, "text": "Sugarcrush 😭😭✨️🤏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:05:21", "owner": "shaza_arts19.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075999887086736, "text": "Hung inget covid tahun 2020 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:57:42", "owner": "windnkm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090009163695906, "text": "Play date is 💓💖", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:33:02", "owner": "sudhin._", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18111561055547729, "text": "Play date 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19