{"media_id": 3730306539690536665, "shortcode": "DPEtgipki7Z", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPEtgipki7Z/", "taken_at": "2025-09-26T17:20:29", "caption": "Gay\n.\n.\n.\n.\n#hridnic #playlsd #london_love", "owner_username": "hridnic", "owner_id": "66193143487", "likes": 247266, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0045_DPEtgipki7Z\\DPEtgipki7Z_20250926_172029.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18067531673211553, "text": "My song \"London Love\" is out now. Link in bio. Please give it a shot🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:16:21", "owner": "hridnic", "likes": 752}, {"id": 18399762346143906, "text": "I see \" Man \" is outside all of the circles", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:22:32", "owner": "youenn_le_gentil", "likes": 36245}, {"id": 17845987857617800, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:35:46", "owner": "sol_awe_che", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17971244795942069, "text": "What do you call that white space around the circles?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:25:59", "owner": "tannerwillmott", "likes": 1675}, {"id": 18091253935796109, "text": "gay here", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:30:52", "owner": "apex_skittles", "likes": 3559}, {"id": 17928686769109606, "text": "So I’m gay now? How am I supposed to kiss my homies without it being weird now", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:28:24", "owner": "h.pen___", "likes": 75}, {"id": 18058633688166501, "text": "Dumb af reporting for duty", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:17:43", "owner": "_busmate_", "likes": 1290}, {"id": 17884596159382585, "text": "i'm ready for a lavender marriage", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:09:07", "owner": "rihannanavy420blazeitup", "likes": 5710}, {"id": 18069912848195990, "text": "Where’s autistic?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:25:42", "owner": "thebach17", "likes": 3460}, {"id": 18083281439002852, "text": "Why is nerd the opposite of handsome?", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:18:05", "owner": "ashleighlitreal", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18103452148676005, "text": "Took my like back after noticing the Taylor Swift music on the reel", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:28:19", "owner": "kidnamedginger", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18081420037817273, "text": "As a gay man, yes we are perfect.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T07:07:00", "owner": "joel_someone", "likes": 89}, {"id": 18044210525466182, "text": "Why is nerd a bad thing?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:38:33", "owner": "dontugiveupnonono", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18110088061580904, "text": "Sad but usually true", "created_at": "2025-10-19T22:46:18", "owner": "sharonstone", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18042190685408866, "text": "This further proves that gay is such a high compliment!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:25:46", "owner": "elleleolikes", "likes": 1112}, {"id": 18153966364411049, "text": "Rumusan apa lagi ini😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:37:46", "owner": "squitink13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067474580014404, "text": "Okay fine I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:19:04", "owner": "cheesegrater_toiletpaper", "likes": 1401}, {"id": 18101515699628050, "text": "Humor so good", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:21:59", "owner": "_02.9y", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18359306425090987, "text": "all paths lead to gay yoai", "created_at": "2025-10-17T23:56:45", "owner": "dementia270", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18059361143275650, "text": "my girlfriend just called me gay", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:03:57", "owner": "landonboaz_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17843702154628987, "text": "@adhyuth__sj 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:49:51", "owner": "sheo.n7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948359464029057, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:25:13", "owner": "swastiiikz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18152624101398951, "text": "🤓", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:26:03", "owner": "pianoman382", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128836966444396, "text": "That is sooo true 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:29:08", "owner": "avangel1111", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18031003223754271, "text": "True", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:24:39", "owner": "ajaxtin", "