y_swerve", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18347033878160956, "text": "I hope I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-10-03T21:31:41", "owner": "szokekavinszkiadam", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18052761998304723, "text": "If he’s smart he won’t be gay 😐", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:07:58", "owner": "salim_tarikt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973804509926284, "text": "what if I’m dumb and gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:26:07", "owner": "giulgazza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059278121548560, "text": "guys im gay", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:09:29", "owner": "mstfkstff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928066573111100, "text": "guess i’m gay", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:24:48", "owner": "miatas_suck", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864333910484048, "text": "my man is gay??", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:38:14", "owner": "candelinaaaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906454726123310, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:39:18", "owner": "yin.mlbb_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961266036848451, "text": "I'm out of all those circles 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:47:33", "owner": "jermy_v26", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054700127292698, "text": "Can't get anymore accurate", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:44:20", "owner": "perry74218390", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961792359978694, "text": "Oh I am most certainly gay. Even my surroundings says it. I just can't believe it. 🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:02:29", "owner": "scurvus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072846637918775, "text": "Nigga why men outside the circle", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:10:26", "owner": "_hamza_laabidi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18000245798824255, "text": "I'm bi ... Does that count as gay too?...", "created_at": "2025-10-18T05:21:25", "owner": "ayush_.28.__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912545110231583, "text": "I dont Understand this", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:24:55", "owner": "rodrigo_10_03_05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966858663963048, "text": "I'm neither", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:15:53", "owner": "m.a.d.g.o.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925142827189462, "text": "Didn’t need the handsome to check all boxes", "created_at": "2025-12-21T00:47:45", "owner": "shirtsforecast_ckvn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935305258116964, "text": "This means iam gay?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:36:19", "owner": "aurakillerxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053679236364557, "text": "No issue with nerds", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:18:15", "owner": "phycopatchick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078545759219848, "text": "So all men are at least 10% gay", "created_at": "2025-12-18T06:05:08", "owner": "hueyy.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089801261498365, "text": "Not handsome, smart, nor nice but I am a dumb nerdy gay jerk", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:04:00", "owner": "gabxxvzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086851544047848, "text": "white = racist", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:19:37", "owner": "nasgor_trotoar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387770257146291, "text": "Nigga", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:21:49", "owner": "swaggy_swiggity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067904201418282, "text": "Nahh \nI disagree \nI'm only 4 of these things.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:18:27", "owner": "darkprince719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019219673619516, "text": "yes, I am smart and nice, and I am a fucking nerd", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:15:16", "owner": "meunomejose_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18555290449026785, "text": "Call me a jerk on how I jerk that shlong", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:23:03", "owner": "nigawattt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082857305032967, "text": "Not relatable 😔 as a man", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:33:59", "owner": "saamu_karot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075270221586106, "text": "Im offended🤯", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:49:13", "owner": "n.meyer.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091696808305518, "text": "Gays are not smart", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:36:51", "owner": "abiissr06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064308281566215, "text": "jewish propaganda", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:23:37", "owner": "jbg.kirill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121131490534558, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:14:10", "owner": "goldschild_88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327508081245349, "text": "I’m nice, not gay and don’t care for anime. So, yeah… shit 😒", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:45:01", "owner": "kwame_oluwasomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993874380890632, "text": "Appropriate to have a Taylor Swift song playing in the background.  This is certainly the perspective of her fan base.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:24:40", "owner": "jo.krueger12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000650699691716, "text": "Woman always go for smart and handsome 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:51:15", "owner": "mariocasneuf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870896185395438, "text": "It means I’m gay, but i am missing the part about being attracted to other men.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:51:53", "owner": "fabianomalard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093379366902401, "text": "Where's sigma?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:00:03", "owner": "akashbond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959867125002094, "text": "Now, solve for how many cats the woman that made this will die alone with…. 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:38:41", "owner": "mikejay126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089647276947983, "text": "Damn this means I'm super gay", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:24:07", "owner": "lucioladen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095614738850362, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:20:47", "owner": "defidaryus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932822422114190, "text": "Gay = Happy", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:54:41", "owner": "e.rex_sean777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319372564218466, "text": "Where is fat gay retard", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:14:16", "owner": "trundlethegreat2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968207142994400, "text": "At one point or another, I have been called every one of these adjectives.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:20:54", "owner": "williambernardbennett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328135780240844, "text": "Time to stop being nice rather be a jerk than gay", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:52:21", "owner": "hundredontens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211669516311825, "text": "Wheres dumb?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:03:44", "owner": "johnboy5.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176641306368330, "text": "TO TA LLY. How come?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:40:59", "owner": "luanmacielcarneiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333126937211714, "text": "Okay first of all, I am not gay.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:39:54", "owner": "d.irkat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928805512159541, "text": "nice? are we sure??", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:17:14", "owner": "evmsandev2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046514600467460, "text": "@_drewwiley", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:50:49", "owner": "hudsonjang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871212736469510, "text": "Where's playboy?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:48:57", "owner": "farh.xnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153569119411302, "text": "I’m extremely fucking straight", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:35:13", "owner": "fulan_tropo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846414607617149, "text": "🗿", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:48:22", "owner": "nzrdrlh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115870102572697, "text": "Gay❌ Racist✔️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:54:11", "owner": "shiro.kuma02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102437458684520, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:35:45", "owner": "jirka_693", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087227600293575, "text": "I'm all of em, but I'm not gay, i love femboys tho", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:10:15", "owner": "rullychristian20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084680600281692, "text": "Rare 2013 meme pull", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:27:33", "owner": "dre_from_le", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986821980866582, "text": "Where’s the “taken” section?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:42:00", "owner": "workdawgsinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106368370724189, "text": "Kiero un novio gei", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:00:30", "owner": "nicoleramirezm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541598956003662, "text": "Ugly ass dumb reporting 🤚🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:03:44", "owner": "theaman.pdf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082402361024962, "text": "It’s Hay not Gay.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:26:27", "owner": "woke_af_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020753945790025, "text": "I mean...I kinda love nerds", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:44:23", "owner": "polinalim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979083339947427, "text": "Should add one more besides gay, its Short, cz im short", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:36:23", "owner": "arcanechil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888339610393848, "text": "Im in the white area", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:26:28", "owner": "idol_joe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856099120523098, "text": "@hyelinee_26lh which part am I in?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:39:42", "owner": "zz_chongya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900733786340198, "text": "It's gay and racist 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:20:19", "owner": "the_nazi_cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010176917810038, "text": "So once you have all 3 you realize women are overated?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:39:02", "owner": "bigfatbeef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032904167730801, "text": "This is how I find out I’m either not handsome or I’m gay", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:14:38", "owner": "jayce4601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001756880830472, "text": "What if ur none of these", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:42:04", "owner": "nathan.gc.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343457839228647, "text": "that's why i like men", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:28:15", "owner": "eganxdd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946988772940666, "text": "ok", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:58:42", "owner": "savsexistence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497055760079020, "text": "Bruh 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:47:39", "owner": "pablothe1one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057062015641257, "text": "I declare myself as GAY--- but only to femboys", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:26:01", "owner": "aqil_dans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085966919286786, "text": "ladies call me gay", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:10:21", "owner": "arthur_da_casa71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969244650992304, "text": "this is why gay men are the best", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:48:31", "owner": "restarted_adi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106070929728065, "text": "Damn, guess I'll gay", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:42:44", "owner": "felixionfelecis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146712817441244, "text": "So I’m a 3rd derivative of position.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:24:10", "owner": "nithish_vs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079820876140192, "text": "Dhar Mann logic😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:50:10", "owner": "3bodithegoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546529735000584, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:36:08", "owner": "lonnlycheese5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889465243255109, "text": "Ya, he like a jerk, no doubt", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:14:29", "owner": "ice_shine_93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103541647735470, "text": "I like how the intersection opposite to a circle also has the opposite descriptive term in it.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:50:54", "owner": "chromattix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909358351258831, "text": "That’s literally just me tho", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:58:16", "owner": "joguleria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103767628591055, "text": "Racist? Autistic? Incel? Murderer? Like where are the real ones @ ?? 😕", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:49:42", "owner": "yelliabb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171783016331465, "text": "Just dumb...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:12:59", "owner": "azamuddin_azlan97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943511116080780, "text": "Jerk?🤷🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:35:25", "owner": "thelifeofchris06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083110775119447, "text": "sums it up", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:52:30", "owner": "jojitht", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086351504054079, "text": "Where is none of the above?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:54:19", "owner": "iman_mosleh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099723622774008, "text": "I actually am gay", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:56:35", "owner": "nathaniehammett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087201494297422, "text": "I actually am gay", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:47:59", "owner": "nathaniehammett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954655846013539, "text": "Bichka💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:19:06", "owner": "puri_sabzi_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123930673522069, "text": "My brader john is the outlier", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:49:19", "owner": "nangiudlehcar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033537701737915, "text": "goddammit im gay", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:20:18", "owner": "ashtoncreg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103902400638785, "text": "Definitely a jerk", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:28:11", "owner": "astayurei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879891622326226, "text": "There’s no work around", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:27:43", "owner": "xanderkaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433180549106929, "text": "He he, I’m a nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:34:14", "owner": "jojo_a_little_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086747725824939, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:37:44", "owner": "djreaperr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085908842060005, "text": "did you just call me gay???", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:09:00", "owner": "sch_levii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336363859229270, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:30:47", "owner": "luziliotti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969192642823028, "text": "One Venn to rule them all ….", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:37:04", "owner": "x5037444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211211227310939, "text": "For me it’s just gay, nice and smart💋💅", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:45:24", "owner": "rubydoobe.1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406557478137730, "text": "Me, platypus", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:21:11", "owner": "slowlybleedingblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971591085971868, "text": "handsome, smart, nice = abused", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:48:15", "owner": "the.alchemy.of.highest.version", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070837427524629, "text": "What about handsome and smart with a lil bit of nice and sometimes dumb 🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:26:38", "owner": "bigthug_h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009963791647122, "text": "Why Gay.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:07:49", "owner": "georgebrankov_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892108072362713, "text": "idk if nerds are actually nice tbh", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:01:47", "owner": "sloppy_twink_milk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859441552549921, "text": "Me and @_abdullah.513_ are GAY!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:54:56", "owner": "m.u.b.i.nn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044410937703462, "text": "Dude in the search tab, the preview just can see “Ni” instead Nice", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:50:08", "owner": "aggre115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862441447457910, "text": "какая пизда это написала?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:04:28", "owner": "peenka_coffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109614007607436, "text": "What if a guy is all the above?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:52:47", "owner": "miguel._.viegas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950822176046643, "text": "I love being a Jerk", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:20:19", "owner": "victormpro28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849177433566538, "text": "Unfair, I'm nice, dumb, and ugly", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:06:13", "owner": "michael.kreuter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876216754355105, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:44:19", "owner": "ijhhjmbvb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068498555599750, "text": "Somehow I'm all 4 middle ones. Depending on my mood", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:33:50", "owner": "tarikgp0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084562847068037, "text": "wrong. this diagram says i’m gay?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:43:52", "owner": "zanerjl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048835472397182, "text": "Ora capisco perché piaccio agli omosessuali", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:37:44", "owner": "gianmarco.greco29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901243288320509, "text": "I’m gay lol", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:03:54", "owner": "josuesurr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296548321281150, "text": "Tere Jaise Chhakko Ko Isiliye Maarte Hai Log....😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:49:09", "owner": "ttr_420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047363021422753, "text": "Yep, I'm Gay.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:29:41", "owner": "greetings.noah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850960255593033, "text": "Where's the retard?nd fighter cock?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:20:29", "owner": "clevan_officials", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925131895178039, "text": "😂👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:17:52", "owner": "fadilahhaidar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056686976645436, "text": "gay", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:43:25", "owner": "it_christn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096081970799866, "text": "My partner just called me gay because of this 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:31:56", "owner": "roo.rqr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015967925623158, "text": "Gay is basically all the 4 shared sections only", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:59:23", "owner": "kleczu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926956825159376, "text": "Gay mens aren't intelligent.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:24:03", "owner": "daniele_fiocco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105270445570748, "text": "so girlypop man is just the epitome of a man?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:50:54", "owner": "hakeemadli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923735614188018, "text": "As a guy who mildly hates women and is absolutely not an ally to women whatsoever, I completely agree with this take", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:07:22", "owner": "web_hacker11111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966839499993592, "text": "Of course", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:34:25", "owner": "patomagraner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317412997221370, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:34:34", "owner": "ethansmellie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315144499222168, "text": "You’re either gay or a dumb jerk nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:42:35", "owner": "antony.fsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093487543692444, "text": "the gay allegations on me finally making sense", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:19:11", "owner": "kcissok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069052496624746, "text": "Meanwhile I’m just hovering somewhere outside of this chart", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:42:48", "owner": "man_on_wheelz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870523108467810, "text": "Thank God I m just , nice and smart", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:40:05", "owner": "_ronnie_3.0_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056427815305544, "text": "tru btw", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:19:59", "owner": "a_r_x_a_n_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121226533463150, "text": "Btw, the venn diagram is not correct, look, there is no intersection of B and D", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:29:55", "owner": "sai.ram.sk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005532926820067, "text": "Im a nerd 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-18T06:37:19", "owner": "ykkr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095108962675485, "text": "I am suspected of being gay all the time wb that", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:55:07", "owner": "doncojuangco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299218333262231, "text": "im not qualified", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:01:09", "owner": "mbrad744", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963252873868260, "text": "Thank God I'm not handsome 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:00:12", "owner": "im_saif_siddique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904169740284364, "text": "Accurate 3 set venn diagram", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:50:58", "owner": "harsshiiiiiii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879320515328171, "text": "I guess im gay than...", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:36:31", "owner": "drug_steva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101028250740043, "text": "the conclusions are: just choose a rich one", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:06:19", "owner": "szporeeczka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18498320164075531, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:19:57", "owner": "tlr.soundcloud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084511553053486, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:36:40", "owner": "_sillyrabbit7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935842995978982, "text": "That's what I'm saying EVERYONE IS A LITTLE GAY🌚 they just deny it", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:20:19", "owner": "mag_owu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327093496246133, "text": "Im smart and nice but im not a nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:36:07", "owner": "mb_lian_pet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996213825839354, "text": "I’m a dumbass but I can tell you so much about one piece, and I’m uglier then sin this things dumb", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:41:51", "owner": "noyvernx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361469320093322, "text": "Jerk here", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:04:04", "owner": "the_ill_one_phenomenon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098301583702057, "text": "What if you’re not smart, handsome, or nice?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:33:44", "owner": "jackson_stanford07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061728911530618, "text": "What if someone is gay, ugly and dumb? 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:50:28", "owner": "cortis_sitroc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379316545146958, "text": "So basically, this post was made by a fridge", "created_at": "2025-11-15T15:30:34", "owner": "lolokovec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903463423299314, "text": "I’m gay and I’m a dumb nerdy jerk", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:48:35", "owner": "lipsyloopsybabes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991908882887371, "text": "WHY 😢😢😢@wanchi_sherissa @tiffany_0312_", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:51:42", "owner": "2002_janice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096541069834881, "text": "I hope These gay people burn in hell", "created_at": "2025-11-14T21:57:17", "owner": "china_clips123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921620773049607, "text": "this implies that nerds are ugly … only the incel ones are", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:52:22", "owner": "caroline.slmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078889403131521, "text": "Thank god i like girls <3", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:18:58", "owner": "mari.boooh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062890814174986, "text": "Need a women version", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:52:26", "owner": "no_user623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090185320924229, "text": "hi I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-11-14T05:51:58", "owner": "ghaniyyu__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019110050784409, "text": "Why is that describing me exactly", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:45:17", "owner": "tornberg.max", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881149837310382, "text": "No way that im ugly, dumb and maybe a bit nice sometimes 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:45:13", "owner": "silly_carrr1.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952567837023343, "text": "#proudnerd", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:22:24", "owner": "dh3uuvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931342953998832, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:36:44", "owner": "tannguye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059532968542666, "text": "Im not gay, ur gay!", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:34:23", "owner": "ixi150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305793439269455, "text": "Dang, I must be a racist according to this", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:08:39", "owner": "iamlegman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965419269997492, "text": "Grown ass man posted this btw", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:54:01", "owner": "bubbles_solos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121957519519562, "text": "Explain", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:39:30", "owner": "boondi.ke.ladduu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958776568020342, "text": "I'm kinda all of these tho", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:04:40", "owner": "mortifer._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857410723553210, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T07:59:25", "owner": "helpyouinyourlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921103819188360, "text": "anjer 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-12T02:00:03", "owner": "mahfuzh_yazid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059835860216194, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:11:17", "owner": "fgs_michael", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065816936452081, "text": "F Y", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:16:21", "owner": "femboytwistingmyniggaballsuck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853602262569790, "text": "How about neither of the main three 🫩✌️", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:41:51", "owner": "george.kirianov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102496219710392, "text": "Im GAY😩", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:42:20", "owner": "testiecalls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100953568662202, "text": "I knew I'm a nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-11T00:38:50", "owner": "trexlerr614", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902733376294982, "text": "Because they know what's up lol", "created_at": "2025-11-11T00:19:00", "owner": "_james.w._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096917893825516, "text": "Hello nice here", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:16:05", "owner": "keshife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317299936171665, "text": "How can a gay be handsome?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:35:53", "owner": "z.loqhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050167331361194, "text": "I am an exception ladies ❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:35:01", "owner": "oli.paulik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132472189485570, "text": "Thank, God, I'm a chimpanzee-looking man", "created_at": "2025-11-09T18:58:39", "owner": "langunno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863220463512836, "text": "I'm smart and handsome", "created_at": "2025-11-09T18:58:09", "owner": "w41lid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005307764813567, "text": "What for none??", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:51:10", "owner": "ellyte1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964485567995063, "text": "Sometimes a decent man needs to deal with some gay / bi allegations 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05:58:33", "owner": "trialman168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956769432886581, "text": "Dude I'm none of the mentioned", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:45:12", "owner": "ad8imo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063112976413017, "text": "So basically we got everything?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:55:15", "owner": "neurocrazyness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082164278079741, "text": "where's the mean part 😐", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:54:12", "owner": "solbirbeles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046546043429719, "text": "I didnt know i was gay but eh slaaaay", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:17:59", "owner": "ludwigdrezazadeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062879681163126, "text": "only 6 subdivisions procreate 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:37:34", "owner": "septimoandamio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880771018302502, "text": "a lot of gays aren’t nice tho", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:32:40", "owner": "raayyyoflight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045285422438286, "text": "I’ll take one large dumb one for all I care", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:52:48", "owner": "_corruptedmemory_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975187746791978, "text": "İm nerd and jerk how can thats possible 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:44:40", "owner": "p_rumet_heus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944888221066182, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:59:19", "owner": "solanch.92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067948502377200, "text": "why are they", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:33:06", "owner": "asmararizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865076509495148, "text": "accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-07T01:35:27", "owner": "jenna.jaff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111889837562975, "text": "Lord knows that’s a lie. Have you met a gay man lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:27:18", "owner": "notcuteboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110448667606337, "text": "Gay 🤝", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:11:12", "owner": "dark_prince25_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941953654079808, "text": "FR", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:51:46", "owner": "aamirr.iam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544181482004158, "text": "I’ll take smart nice nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:29:25", "owner": "yourtypeofleo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087461539970376, "text": "But im not gaaaaaay", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:25:55", "owner": "j_vid.rd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046911563404575, "text": "This is made by a women", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:29:13", "owner": "suryamahesh666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096536668691857, "text": "Where can I sign up for sexual orientation transition therapy?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:23:13", "owner": "rajyoda1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009633347643247, "text": "I'm not sure about that. Some gay people are quite wicked.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:21:44", "owner": "barbi_oliv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997120278693206, "text": "So basically, if a nerd is handsome it means he's gay", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:10:18", "owner": "noplertsumitkul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18301884478271709, "text": "i’m handsome smart and nice, and straight. the problem are these women", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:02:26", "owner": "k1ng.shxdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076990922136877, "text": "I'm handsome, I'm smart( people say it I'm thing I'm dumb and I'm nice to people , heh it is all thing at once idk how it works, bruh mine head hurts I'm don't Wanne be gay forever", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:09:42", "owner": "oskarkopec.prv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025830122741670, "text": "Find you got me", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:33:47", "owner": "amirali.19786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395939089124462, "text": "😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:29:29", "owner": "darumiftakhul_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882984364404569, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:12:23", "owner": "_id81_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861281449521713, "text": "Most nerds ik lowkey evil.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:08:31", "owner": "seribulucheryl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315079042173882, "text": "There is no smart gay person,cause if someone was smart, he wouldn't be gay", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:01:50", "owner": "a0k_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100932187726074, "text": "Conclusion , gays are dumb jerks", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:07:57", "owner": "zakariyapedersen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969687393811157, "text": "Then we have the handsome nice and smart ones that manage to be kinda dumb and incredibly gay but somehow he is your husband", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:23:07", "owner": "____.iza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096854671747799, "text": "Are Venn diagrams not taught in school anymore?😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-02T23:39:19", "owner": "ray_rayd017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054755198305306, "text": "I can't fit anywhere 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:56:08", "owner": "stealthystriker_149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080855191876202, "text": "The opposite of handsome is nerd?", "created_at": "2025-11-02T11:12:06", "owner": "pascal0811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537102415022909, "text": "😭😭😭😭🤏", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:17:41", "owner": "liaaao.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936599986097923, "text": "accurate i am a robot", "created_at": "2025-11-02T02:25:59", "owner": "chuck_struck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098116429775328, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:53:18", "owner": "jennybilounga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949316785025440, "text": "What a delusional assumption to have about gays being nice people...", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:07:43", "owner": "nikolaj.eleuterio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536039944042931, "text": "im into nerds👉👈", "created_at": "2025-11-01T17:22:50", "owner": "ocyeanic.minn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093916876876107, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:06:04", "owner": "lijah.harding206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086014117786466, "text": "😂why is it showing lavender and yellow to me 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T09:02:12", "owner": "being_ecstatic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101830351659127, "text": "Chat, I’m gay?", "created_at": "2025-11-01T00:34:46", "owner": "apollocrater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093894130879185, "text": "So you think Henry Cavill is gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-31T21:27:55", "owner": "indracatraarcipasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069336527365844, "text": "I fall under none of these categories, where’s the autistic, ugly, shy venn diagram?", "created_at": "2025-10-31T20:35:35", "owner": "naters_gona_nate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208376950312456, "text": "Not handsome, nice or smart... What am I? A Pokémon??", "created_at": "2025-10-31T17:17:17", "owner": "notsobalraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044355599700037, "text": "Opposite of smart is dumb, opposite of nice is jerk, but why is the opposite of handsome nerd? 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:54:13", "owner": "kevin__dragon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098113855703554, "text": "Add jacked to the equation you find racist", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:07:56", "owner": "youssef_guel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079532951121811, "text": "I'm aro ace so makes sense I'm in the gay category I guess", "created_at": "2025-10-30T01:21:05", "owner": "komukade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096358081816168, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:07:38", "owner": "canandmoregroup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085408628482116, "text": "Where's Misogynist?", "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:56:12", "owner": "teri_maka_haathi_ka_dabba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063018671572966, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T10:24:38", "owner": "mariahmae18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092488531884155, "text": "So the way to read this is Handsome+Smart= Jerk. Handsome+Nice= Dumb. Smart+Nice= Nerd.  Handsome+Smart+Nice= Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-29T09:25:02", "owner": "funnur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970742157807789, "text": "Yo soy Smart y Nice, así que toda mi tendencia física es volverme afeminado; si trato de verme mejor termino viéndome gay", "created_at": "2025-10-29T05:37:30", "owner": "enzaroc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060221792440433, "text": "But handsome right", "created_at": "2025-10-29T04:02:52", "owner": "danial.hailkal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171428617371457, "text": "Hehe I’ve got my Catholic man who is all three, do y’all need help? (Jk I can’t give advice I’ve got no clue how I got him except God)", "created_at": "2025-10-29T01:40:12", "owner": "julia.rosaleen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106708144622790, "text": "Amém", "created_at": "2025-10-29T00:12:57", "owner": "mbpascoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899524414305516, "text": "Chat am I gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T14:41:53", "owner": "rowanreid06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983632305913405, "text": "My bro is blue 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-28T11:05:55", "owner": "weeb_aadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025479122567338, "text": "I may not be nice however I am dumb", "created_at": "2025-10-28T05:21:59", "owner": "baby_fingerz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113213962501132, "text": "Y’all over estimate the gays wayyyyyyy too much", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:35:15", "owner": "andys009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330597292238097, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-10-27T15:50:15", "owner": "_tranmitam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047039732397654, "text": "SO TRUE", "created_at": "2025-10-27T12:17:06", "owner": "qqwai_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125508586500522, "text": "Notice how this post clearly says you all are gay at every point ?", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:45:01", "owner": "shikhar.rrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096020575622444, "text": "Women are just holes so", "created_at": "2025-10-27T02:45:48", "owner": "victor_rotciv_iv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083454457965823, "text": "What if I'm none of these things?😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:00:53", "owner": "zir.9978", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084015611057725, "text": "i’m not nice😭", "created_at": "2025-10-26T11:17:29", "owner": "masbamkit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128303698437234, "text": "İlovemydumbie", "created_at": "2025-10-25T22:06:49", "owner": "nisvindahouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864349801484496, "text": "Only this proves is men rather be gay than date women if they got everything ☠️", "created_at": "2025-10-25T12:55:40", "owner": "kartiksoni.412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912677776213769, "text": "ㅈㄴ 웃기네", "created_at": "2025-10-25T12:46:16", "owner": "sinbt0125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097795348688376, "text": "No way!", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:21:41", "owner": "i_m_ddp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083229790813410, "text": "@giulgazza ma lol", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:55:05", "owner": "james_blonde.inside", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083577814959664, "text": "Ok I need one gay💅", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:11:31", "owner": "rawinnipawinny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953418766004263, "text": "I'm bi tho", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:01:23", "owner": "tj.justtj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937785337094889, "text": "But I'm not gay😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:48:51", "owner": "shaoteng.hong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043443617465270, "text": "Nerd isn’t that bad. Don’t give up yet gentlewomen", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:39:19", "owner": "phanu_hongpradub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084001885991403, "text": "thank god im ugly!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:35:38", "owner": "suromidas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109521796598549, "text": "guess I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:34:35", "owner": "seanbryan01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081127820090491, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:27:24", "owner": "friedhuberstefan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082185430832677, "text": "Thank God for the nerds. 😌", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:07:23", "owner": "leaderbefree", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18347994160203574, "text": "Whovever created this falls under dumb", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:39:18", "owner": "kiranstark619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051384854334565, "text": "So that’s why everyone’s calling me gay all the time 😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:32:35", "owner": "youtweakintweakin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075951163920726, "text": "fr", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:53:04", "owner": "felesssta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864576079480702, "text": "Find the tallest building in your depraved countryside town and jump off of it", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:28:00", "owner": "kestionr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059674118184594, "text": "so, this just explaining my self??", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:15:13", "owner": "hollowbringer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995127228696583, "text": "Love my gay man apparently 👀😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:07:22", "owner": "skyegames07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536019586046410, "text": "Opposite of smart is dumb ✅, opposite of nice is jerk ✅, opposite of handsome is nerd ❓", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:47:37", "owner": "noobmasta5000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092725843881642, "text": "Just pick the nerd.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:16:24", "owner": "mysterious_random_guy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18159381604389269, "text": "fr😭", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:28:24", "owner": "nnnnijnyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076022216159277, "text": "Nerds ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:19:54", "owner": "heidi_k_and", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891275062225048, "text": "So “Men” are outside and none of those things. Thanks little lady!!", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:36:23", "owner": "shotsfired229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917990659187026, "text": "She regularly tells me I would be all of these but she liked this 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:05:34", "owner": "zweniboyy39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133542973466391, "text": "Nice!? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:45:14", "owner": "eezlao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082972580493695, "text": "nerd here. this is true ( 1 == 1 )", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:11:37", "owner": "mc3d.real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062118815575691, "text": "We never stood a chance.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:48:23", "owner": "superior.sayan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064205915115537, "text": "Hai bagwan ye kya duvitha ha 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:06:16", "owner": "itsfabia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083132170820794, "text": "this is the men’s version of the hot/crazy scale", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:58:53", "owner": "emilianovai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998142807825996, "text": "Actually this shit is very wrong 🤓", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:13:17", "owner": "st.d3v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872753281443614, "text": "all gay 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:07:41", "owner": "falsegode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911490070090811, "text": "I’m gay but I’m just nice", "created_at": "2025-10-21T11:39:35", "owner": "notnotyann_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086426083752794, "text": "Nice men didn't jerk it?", "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:53:42", "owner": "keby0__0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942770350073786, "text": "There aren't any dumb men. They're bred dehumanising women and acting in their best interest - always", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:54:13", "owner": "miss_doina_gherman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963271443840682, "text": "Someone comments \"where's racist\" 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:28:48", "owner": "manthan.moudgalya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084256117972025, "text"