"2025-10-17T01:36:55", "owner": "tiago.takao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986490504886786, "text": "Gotta tell my wife I'm Gay... Damn.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:54:30", "owner": "gventro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073210088228830, "text": "Sad reality", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:13:19", "owner": "rquesadaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060255059403224, "text": "I'd rather to be a jerk, thanks", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:56:06", "owner": "wil__alonso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055561811259499, "text": "I'm not gay Bro 🥀🥀🥀😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:31:51", "owner": "david_238kr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309002449217404, "text": "I am average intelligence and a solid 5.  And alcohol / take away sleep and I only have nice things to say mustache man and his homies", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:05:39", "owner": "joe.comstock.796", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160218694389826, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:03:35", "owner": "brownbiscotti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138996769449979, "text": "Gay 🤷🏾‍♂️ Smart, Nice, and Handsome. Although…I’d switch nice for “kind”", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:48:46", "owner": "magickharpnyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986449770867545, "text": "Am lowkey gay", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:32:56", "owner": "weiboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884901418266043, "text": "need id the best option", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:29:46", "owner": "wttrhhn.kra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878705002303566, "text": "im handsome?????", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:50:49", "owner": "sheeplol123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998669355832255, "text": "Make red bigger", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:24:12", "owner": "artsyneko123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881434378403049, "text": "🤓", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:13:14", "owner": "lllinyaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870452359448941, "text": "I'm men?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T16:57:39", "owner": "santczyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898063366312097, "text": "Always knew I was restarted", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:42:32", "owner"