 18076542092153500, "text": "Where can I find a dumb gay nerd who’s also het", "created_at": "2025-10-16T00:56:01", "owner": "coffinupcum2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089785471894861, "text": "Be Gay do Crime", "created_at": "2025-10-15T23:25:38", "owner": "decayed_hound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932512741129651, "text": "lieeeeee ;(", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:37:06", "owner": "mirandarart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926916055113491, "text": "Proudly nerdy", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:28:02", "owner": "luisosonim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965601417966643, "text": "Now I understand why people ask of I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-10-15T21:24:44", "owner": "khosinphasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095953900690697, "text": "Nerd 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:25:14", "owner": "yacarosario", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18374892199144924, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T19:38:23", "owner": "frederico_cunha_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115518742481601, "text": "Im nice", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:42:13", "owner": "lhamza.bourchidl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952254133033045, "text": "Red team ✊🏾", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:23:51", "owner": "fahulk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083138621480621, "text": "Riyal", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:39:28", "owner": "skyeeee.huh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083310485475553, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:23:38", "owner": "therealjqueezy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056805971237522, "text": "spoken like a true femcel", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:01:31", "owner": "dhgssnjjgcnkkok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047602592363227, "text": "So the gay couple who diddled then killed their  kids were nice handsom and smart,", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:23:05", "owner": "vantuylc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071584619260561, "text": "What about u@ly, dum..b,narcissist", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:11:22", "owner": "s_.arc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528582730006653, "text": "I’m smart/nice and dumb. So that’s wrong", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:37:31", "owner": "rodquezadaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154288063394759, "text": "So you are saying batkanis gay!! Such Stupidity", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:19:08", "owner": "adarsh_parasuram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079301948024909, "text": "I wish the gay men I knew were as handsome smart and nice as straight girls think they are", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:56:52", "owner": "zerakh10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880642909404863, "text": "I wish", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:33:05", "owner": "benjamin_kis.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009119669797485, "text": "I’m so fucking gay I guess", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:18:40", "owner": "saint.x.francis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975180495925901, "text": "THE ULTIMATE LIFE FORM", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:51:43", "owner": "diza_tak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077552531471957, "text": "Now that explains it", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:21:16", "owner": "valipta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125574064491847, "text": "I will have to forfeit being handsome or nice 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:02:06", "owner": "ashkan60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082694311951585, "text": "Gay men are all this except - Fit. An observation, most straight guys are ripped than gays", "created_at": "2025-10-15T02:45:38", "owner": "jancoutto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059129051162872, "text": "Glad im not handsome", "created_at": "2025-10-15T02:18:12", "owner": "farhan.mtd_12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057811607631789, "text": "WAIT! Am I gay???😮", "created_at": "2025-10-15T00:19:21", "owner": "harrison_and_blue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862644556497414, "text": "Straight and lonely", "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:22:35", "owner": "hall_of_unity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359032567093306, "text": "Where is princess?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T19:33:32", "owner": "_talesofsara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069752591212893, "text": "Nerd seems like the best choice...", "created_at": "2025-10-14T18:31:27", "owner": "evelyndeuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074556502933710, "text": "Smh.... if you're all three and not gay, you live in the middle of nowhere and no bitches can find you.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T18:22:30", "owner": "saathvik_thimmaiah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075264115923488, "text": "What a nice expression I usually don't like anything but this one hit very hard", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:44:49", "owner": "gylman_i4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997859325830015, "text": "Im an inch away then from becoming gay .", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:35:07", "owner": "boukhezzar_hamza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532936375035244, "text": "So true………", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:28:18", "owner": "guzelbsk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360793822085473, "text": "The BI circle is probably across all intersections and hetero’s have only one", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:07:58", "owner": "daan_schipper_010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079620641287181, "text": "Fuck.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:54:20", "owner": "ineedadrink_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973728789790353, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:43:48", "owner": "muadelwardy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862647418497719, "text": "Yeah I don't need this to tell me Im nerd I have already knew it before 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:18:49", "owner": "adam.lfc.911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087476536926468, "text": "Proud to be Gay then!", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:02:35", "owner": "zyadaatetematkar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879028651408503, "text": "@samanthia_mary", "created_at": "2025-10-14T15:18:48", "owner": "christophercastona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033842036707887, "text": "Vice versa diagram for women too", "created_at": "2025-10-14T15:04:01", "owner": "alop3zx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078886415018919, "text": "So I am confusion", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:45:21", "owner": "birisanirim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423035893110369, "text": "Sorry ladies I'm only in the outer edges :(", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:36:09", "owner": "chonkitty_doodles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107228362523850, "text": "I was wondering why I am always attracted to gay people", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:06:24", "owner": "rabia.arch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080921170996216, "text": "Out of context but not all nerds are nice", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:53:30", "owner": "ixa_prat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878593621312483, "text": "Is this like the female equivalent of the hot/chill girl being a trans woman?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:37:45", "owner": "hanzenfranzen406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060944222411746, "text": "Handsome + Smart + Nice = Gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:23:36", "owner": "vaneshsz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083167780986664, "text": "Maybe.. just maybe— I am a nerd? 🗣", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:10:01", "owner": "_zypherxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117906349520420, "text": "Just found out I’m gay 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:24:20", "owner": "allyenwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078778615878772, "text": "So women just like gay guys?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:07:12", "owner": "eyysarr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368812387155554, "text": "Made by a gay definitely 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:04:22", "owner": "dinesh_m217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144971683424625, "text": "Homiesexual here", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:34:47", "owner": "th3_dr1v3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405400681141936, "text": "\"the women will love this\" AHH post", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:07:09", "owner": "ruben.snchz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056632547235854, "text": "I’m either a nerd or dumb 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:53:03", "owner": "garys_lyfe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096099454739062, "text": "Nerd is a pretty good quality 😁", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:25:55", "owner": "matheus_oportugal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058047320532750, "text": "At least us gays are smart, nice and handsome", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:08:18", "owner": "ikeeholland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873202474350581, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:32:19", "owner": "antoniominjahdambuznas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078936566009767, "text": "So tragically true😭", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:24:05", "owner": "treehorse38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846348280583496, "text": "implying all gays are dumb nerdy jerks😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:22:34", "owner": "mango_eter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18180881599346838, "text": "Suppose I'm handsome smart AND nice, hah, suckers💅", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:03:08", "owner": "technomancer_lex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069432005205663, "text": "Makes me kinda gay", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:54:54", "owner": "itsalljokes000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089767192863654, "text": "How can someone be smart and dumb?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:26:57", "owner": "leo_mborges", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078907664472854, "text": "How does smart and handsome count as jerk sounds like people get jealous and make him a jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:21:48", "owner": "rodneyzomboni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161132209350035, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:17:35", "owner": "c3vsthworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387694480123968, "text": "I guess im a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:04:57", "owner": "mertduver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078655412044789, "text": "Now what if, and hear me out here. I’m smart, nice, and also dumb? What then", "created_at": "2025-10-13T21:59:34", "owner": "rjmalon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049706396643909, "text": "So you cant be handsome and nerd at the same time ? Ridiculous", "created_at": "2025-10-13T21:22:21", "owner": "norman_aboukouss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004188710811019, "text": "Man.. i think I'm a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:58:23", "owner": "evn.rb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045006839400340, "text": "Nerd here 🫡", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:28:17", "owner": "beratcanygz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050436986324863, "text": "Oh, fuck.😢", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:20:27", "owner": "dant_guil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054399701270955, "text": "Are you crazy?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:02:22", "owner": "mouloud.prinz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083782700303436, "text": "Why does the algorithm keep calling me a nerd? Like chill, I know already that I am one.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:24:55", "owner": "arjan_ghosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081021244995689, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:55:08", "owner": "solelegenda2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860991493509783, "text": "Hey not all man are nerd, duh", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:52:47", "owner": "ademserefoglu387", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104467237615504, "text": "Guess I'm none of those", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:45:56", "owner": "mateusrms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375463972148732, "text": "Me when misinformation", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:24:13", "owner": "vergilios_spatulas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075361436134298, "text": "🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-13T17:32:43", "owner": "pj_fetscher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178139356355173, "text": "All gay no matter what 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:48:35", "owner": "sly_1o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043710248437041, "text": "nice?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:31:33", "owner": "heycaiovictor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067489520599905, "text": "I must be lesbian gay", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:28:36", "owner": "rishhuh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937325754962661, "text": "When you’re outside all circles", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:10:17", "owner": "ffacure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179625754352230, "text": "Gays nice? Mhm. 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:49:05", "owner": "romain.risso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906621937254067, "text": "I like to think I'm nice and smart. Also my grandma tells me I'm handsome. So I'm I gay or are you saying my grandma is a liar???", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:45:13", "owner": "juusu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936216990964698, "text": "So is the goal to be gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:24:18", "owner": "thatoneguy2604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103138114712746, "text": "Are you calling me a jerk?? 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:27:44", "owner": "iammarcodorian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976343598927726, "text": "I'm a nerd at least", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:15:58", "owner": "kingjupiter06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078298691037650, "text": "Am I the best looking guy? No, but do I have a good head on my shoulders? No, but do I try to go out of my way to make others smile? Also no", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:12:09", "owner": "vighardr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914933161072000, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:48:28", "owner": "rick.goder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930071146103497, "text": "i wish i was gay", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:47:05", "owner": "douglado", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949285054043130, "text": "Handsome + smart troop---->", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:07:01", "owner": "spazevedo1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17953069677009812, "text": "totally hetero here", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:59:49", "owner": "enisdiyebiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076339592322381, "text": "So, just to be clear, gays are a blend of jerk, dumb and nerd?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:24:10", "owner": "_i_pinguini_radioattivi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084614071758424, "text": "Never seen a more accurate venn diagram", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:18:56", "owner": "_chandu.ke.chacha_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945989410046233, "text": "I do like a good venn diagram.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T10:09:13", "owner": "stefvinc80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043322051430700, "text": "Nerd would be the best option out of this😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:48:04", "owner": "third_daughter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862107349499084, "text": "AH", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:44:33", "owner": "immortal.hogg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366850132156190, "text": "Cope", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:40:33", "owner": "jeffcurrie00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093886219692002, "text": "Im somewhere in the white", "created_at": "2025-10-13T07:32:44", "owner": "kaps.2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130403068463717, "text": "i need the girl chart", "created_at": "2025-10-13T07:06:45", "owner": "wunderkinx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068166332207936, "text": "Smart+ handsome+ nice men can only be gay😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:59:48", "owner": "joganniya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104179018612205, "text": "Im just nice, I'm dumb ASF and chopped", "created_at": "2025-10-13T05:29:24", "owner": "hunterriess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041727086693639, "text": "I'm not gay😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T05:24:32", "owner": "faiz58204.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077747723513979, "text": "Where is racist?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T03:46:33", "owner": "oceanbrash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095204092769015, "text": "As a gay man, I see this as an ultimate win!", "created_at": "2025-10-13T02:42:04", "owner": "dererererererererek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144834397420606, "text": "LOL.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T02:39:54", "owner": "lmart16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18240540082288558, "text": "Gay people aren't smart nor nice", "created_at": "2025-10-12T23:56:46", "owner": "pretty_nice8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859134274455804, "text": "gay men r not nice theyre evil", "created_at": "2025-10-12T23:27:28", "owner": "jacktangent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272936488304205, "text": "Dumb 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-12T22:53:09", "owner": "binderr_dundat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072313672976693, "text": "You're either smart, nice or handsome. Other you're GAY.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:52:27", "owner": "frenziedfocalist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071820271976463, "text": "dumb bitch summer", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:54:34", "owner": "jamesklusener", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932970267982511, "text": "yup", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:54:13", "owner": "jamesklusener", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846430765562543, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:31:08", "owner": "zeirann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928512619112466, "text": "Nerd gang where you at ->", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:59:53", "owner": "vincent_d_workman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113406664555742, "text": "And somehow the nerds are always left out", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:38:24", "owner": "pacsoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105638749615054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:08:27", "owner": "dawi_d800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093642280768593, "text": "Lgbt brainwashing propaganda", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:08:13", "owner": "dawi_d800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356718052091841, "text": "I will have you know that I'm gay, and im not smart, handsome, or nice 😎", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:59:48", "owner": "thefoxjesus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965560437972940, "text": "Y I say don't knock a cute nerd.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:04:39", "owner": "hellsangel169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058247699194710, "text": "Missing a lot lol", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:50:27", "owner": "c.j_schulz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076379870324239, "text": "I'm none of those things except for gay", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:04:28", "owner": "ale.fsio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100853725574710, "text": "I am jerk dumb and not handsome", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:01:01", "owner": "danielkulec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852902146511331, "text": "if only 🥺", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:00:31", "owner": "cembalex.tmw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422677657129456, "text": "Glad to be a 🤓", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:23:01", "owner": "krish_patel0120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019923698596386, "text": "Q gays são esses ?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:39:54", "owner": "honeymoon23207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894201673344564, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:28:34", "owner": "rickchenchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118979878508769, "text": "Well Twinks certainly cannot be in that intersection the way they behave", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:17:38", "owner": "dan002996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081783418999790, "text": "Jerk 🤤", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:14:01", "owner": "pl_tore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082372904061342, "text": "Proud nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:21:56", "owner": "yonatan_poke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18179011426348938, "text": "Ji", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:17:16", "owner": "kamran_0.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078017738027923, "text": "Never thought I'm the gayest", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:15:36", "owner": "hs_marcell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107695708605878, "text": "I'm gay af", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:46:19", "owner": "von_wolfsthal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094769086704671, "text": "Im gay i guess @j_dee.bsst", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:27:33", "owner": "dieubalta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913742935208605, "text": "NERD!!!!!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:45:09", "owner": "alexii.icecream", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18003857600810399, "text": "Why is nerd the opposite of handsome?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:09:08", "owner": "bimbimaro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073165120958989, "text": "need racist", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:50:49", "owner": "pepe.the.julien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18240478975294140, "text": "I'm just dumb. Knew it", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:48:50", "owner": "alexander_wilmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071917700233821, "text": "I don't agree that gay men are jerk dumb and nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:20:15", "owner": "girondino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954326955882086, "text": "Thanks god to not make me nice person 🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:45:48", "owner": "priyopurwantor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118996831522690, "text": "I'm the white...", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:31:44", "owner": "iqbal.dnla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065691941602235, "text": "Noooo", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:52:57", "owner": "dodong_bulat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287625586273179, "text": "I like how dumb is the opposite of smart, jerk is the opposite of nice, and the opposite of handsome is.... nerd 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:34:58", "owner": "punk_and_pagod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878359324305245, "text": "Yay I’m nice", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:01:10", "owner": "jesse.fremont", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073039256135825, "text": "Nerd 😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-12T02:09:32", "owner": "weejean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974111199929849, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:48:25", "owner": "glowingbirdie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077343611027748, "text": "I think dumb should be bigger than nice.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:38:35", "owner": "amleclercq", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17892621075344299, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:09:23", "owner": "thechicagopro", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18102678940617000, "text": "My girlfriend said I'm guy. W", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:44:00", "owner": "adamhrwtz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18018154109601518, "text": "All roads lead to gay", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:38:59", "owner": "blossommmma", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18131681518482316, "text": "Love me a dumbass", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:07:47", "owner": "erin_mel91", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936921447960904, "text": "So that’s why people think I’m gay", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:59:16", "owner": "startainfection", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945944628925252, "text": "Despite this I'm still not gay...", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:41:18", "owner": "mikaround", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103377544722540, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:54:49", "owner": "thetigerlily25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977792073922889, "text": "So at the center of all men is a gay nerd?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:42:52", "owner": "nothomeless_on_instahoe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884527759263075, "text": "Guess I’m gay", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:20:24", "owner": "lukltz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17966693306964643, "text": "Who the fu** are you for making such crap?!!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:15:42", "owner": "maestro_marshmello", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976915215775716, "text": "Thank god im not handsome", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:00:16", "owner": "moi_oubliez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905503882123796, "text": "I’m not gay", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:02:32", "owner": "_lewis_alexander", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144070288425073, "text": "Thats not men thats me tho?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:54:39", "owner": "electioneeringg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18430739245108298, "text": "This would put me in the jerk category", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:53:51", "owner": "willevans_03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073419104177476, "text": "Okay guys, I’m coming out with some loads😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:21:48", "owner": "avalgu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072676444955846, "text": "Real af", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:12:16", "owner": "supslim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886032316378130, "text": "Be a jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:54:58", "owner": "iakshayhoskere", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536871280040488, "text": "Nerd is the best😔", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:06:55", "owner": "wimpii.spam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874630714427733, "text": "@mikhael_ze_b wow tu", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:41:55", "owner": "mi_ruri_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963861474833924, "text": "I am not gay", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:39:16", "owner": "littleosho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059997833407701, "text": "It's all opposites. Nice - jerk. Smart - dumb. Handsome - nerd.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:28:24", "owner": "greg_jonson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027102035539523, "text": "I was gay all this time? Oh man, my jokes wasn't jokes 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:12:42", "owner": "islammerabett", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138283585448035, "text": "They grabbed rainbow. It is agreeable", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:00:30", "owner": "lanca_lamika", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080728646317608, "text": "So true 😇🥳", "created_at": "2025-10-11T09:40:14", "owner": "isy_kili", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022151780586710, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-10-11T08:45:05", "owner": "babueeee3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113383540557131, "text": "My man is all of this and he is not gay - he is nerd for sure but very handsome nerd ❤️😇", "created_at": "2025-10-11T07:23:21", "owner": "riry.brasko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849341596570911, "text": "I'm outside the graph.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T06:45:02", "owner": "necroticspecter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075761540114962, "text": "Handsome and smart does not make a jerk, I'm not handsome but I have friends who are handsome and smart and are very nice too", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:20:09", "owner": "_.script97._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911450458231793, "text": "But I’m not gay though", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:16:55", "owner": "lukasboudreaux", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536588329041374, "text": "Why are we saying that like the peak of man is gay", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:09:37", "owner": "ashtonftl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104067334715270, "text": "What if ur only smart??", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:22:10", "owner": "acekicker56cc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001789916668515, "text": "ah yes, the non-man jerk dumb gay nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:14:59", "owner": "luk.eyboii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097834903676169, "text": "the fuck did you just call me", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:13:51", "owner": "luk.eyboii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18526593322007895, "text": "So that's why my girlfriend always calls me gay", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:59:02", "owner": "lmcclain.7567", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061813229111868, "text": "Gay or married", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:49:43", "owner": "manguy562", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895625716331046, "text": "Looove my nerdy guys 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:14:22", "owner": "angelique.desroches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875472781334635, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:49:06", "owner": "jenner_dm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325657510211170, "text": "Gay men are so sexy 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:06:01", "owner": "mccarthy6774", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048004727666938, "text": "@fueledbyramen217", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:51:14", "owner": "thelifeofpau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070382582245874, "text": "Where can I order a nerd😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:36:15", "owner": "begumyetiskin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089478331893451, "text": "Nah gáý people are hôřřible fúçķ them", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:53:14", "owner": "throwawayy012345678", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913183792211691, "text": "Clearly, I’m looking for a unicorn then 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:50:34", "owner": "sarahgabbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987554763855113, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:15:12", "owner": "cilhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066167051457719, "text": "Damn I’m gay af", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:14:24", "owner": "lluomo_nero_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960267495990580, "text": "Im nerd just verging on -but not quite- gay", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:06:31", "owner": "yoshiauditore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203510695311262, "text": "I call Jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:59:21", "owner": "tommy.trommald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090823237830813, "text": "Damn, guess I gotta come out the closet", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:54:00", "owner": "csjuego", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375261490179051, "text": "So a lonely, angry, homophobic, straight woman put this together ?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:42:01", "owner": "danzy89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419636272115578, "text": "Meanwhile gay men who hate women:", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:40:23", "owner": "reinholdsfurtheraheadupperlip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082171373314259, "text": "Science 👌", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:31:59", "owner": "the_gerschel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062333348618956, "text": "My choice in men.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:44:25", "owner": "nehas_nattering", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129249313484738, "text": "I’m gay", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:41:41", "owner": "rayrrader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913204870226976, "text": "What if I’m none", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:20:09", "owner": "pablo.fuckoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113524360536533, "text": "And that’s why im being gay❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:31:58", "owner": "bpcx69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046677071370503, "text": "As a gay person I wanna say this is not true lol", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:29:55", "owner": "mistakimushroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981858801755271, "text": "Jo i aint gay mother fucker", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:14:14", "owner": "romano_the__great", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314626588175666, "text": "Yasss", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:42:17", "owner": "s.chris_jooste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099148756648853, "text": "So nerd it is?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:31:11", "owner": "ris.quee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079414865050948, "text": "@devanshtripathii", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:15:23", "owner": "ayushhad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054015479270091, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:11:42", "owner": "el_thicc_bean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177637333357739, "text": "if only 💔", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:04:25", "owner": "brett_real_af", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001982486813257, "text": "So that's why everyone thinks I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:59:03", "owner": "somewhat.abroad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851127991527621, "text": "Istg", "created_at": "2025-10-10T16:49:49", "owner": "who.s_yul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161983957337943, "text": "Baby gays aren't nice", "created_at": "2025-10-10T16:41:07", "owner": "dorian_enoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093690667746394, "text": "This is so accurate", "created_at": "2025-10-10T16:10:45", "owner": "lorena.kaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296037358251786, "text": "No straight? 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T16:08:07", "owner": "itchi_kitchi_yaya_dada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019624184596525, "text": "If you’re gonna be dumb you better be strong 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:39:30", "owner": "feel.like.im.flying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173157898360059, "text": "Find your Ikigay 😬", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:35:48", "owner": "live.love.injoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121453021450829, "text": "Give me a nerd then", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:16:49", "owner": "baby_vayushka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067583525363783, "text": "We have a sweet spot at Nerd!!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T14:54:05", "owner": "casslabaraque42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843479953586371, "text": "Searching for my nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-10T14:37:26", "owner": "annou.fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053749790286453, "text": "Tf we are all gay no matter what ?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T14:19:30", "owner": "heera.mov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975594327925548, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:48:44", "owner": "harrisofhollywood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072583334180355, "text": "well, I'm definitely handsome. my mom told me.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:39:44", "owner": "honestdre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081727166488527, "text": "Ah yes I’m jerking it", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:11:18", "owner": "hoang_cui_dua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924729520152907, "text": "@m_arius99", "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:47:52", "owner": "joseluz99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900649927278923, "text": "This is true", "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:37:52", "owner": "pinki58nfit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964226739987898, "text": "suddenly it all makes sense💅🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:31:59", "owner": "da.v.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054882593629950, "text": "🤗🤗", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:59:25", "owner": "masonseesstars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109303084576135, "text": "Yo", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:54:57", "owner": "alechadd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016346147788658, "text": "I don‘t like that! So much stereotypes! I know many handsome gays that suck a lot (metaphorical)!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:25:31", "owner": "svancluca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061438493576968, "text": "Thanks already knew I was a nerd 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:21:35", "owner": "liveplaydie89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077646725157019, "text": "I'm not so smart", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:03:49", "owner": "xan.la996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073770742912014, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:47:55", "owner": "gilberd_d_k_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957524310862360, "text": "I love being a fagg😩😩😩😩😩", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:38:26", "owner": "succotrash_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065936837076990, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:37:59", "owner": "lordofwoeua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877406998421692, "text": "I'd like to see one on women... interesting vs beautiful vs smart... The middle overlap will be \"AI\"", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:13:59", "owner": "lhamborg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078221471027420, "text": "Overlapning surprisingly much with eating da poopoo...", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:11:21", "owner": "lhamborg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069645299212466, "text": "No racism and gaming. This is trash tier list.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T08:46:16", "owner": "rupesh_130107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027300350534958, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-10T08:05:35", "owner": "lucky_rfbl_college", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532554049028085, "text": "Being gay with homies >>>>>", "created_at": "2025-10-10T07:34:47", "owner": "ig.opello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994158159702886, "text": "LOVE me a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-10T07:08:05", "owner": "princesskeiserr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116904595532050, "text": "so this is why women marry rapists and murderers 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:53:24", "owner": "sissified_army", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356785486091231, "text": "Fuck, I guess that makes me handsome 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:06:12", "owner": "masters_in_disasters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097564930709853, "text": "I guess I’m gay 😂😂😂😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:04:39", "owner": "_optimus9_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108832501503998, "text": "I always wondered, why I often have crushes on gay guys. Now, I know! 😀", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:58:24", "owner": "marlenewankmueller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064191002600856, "text": "پس من نزدیک به گی شدن هستم...", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:53:56", "owner": "ahuramoradi.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066832280595579, "text": "Gay😔", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:35:39", "owner": "chackk.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080228213086885, "text": "If you go by opposite ends, you'll see that two of the three are actual opposites, but not \"handsome\" and \"nerd,\" so I feel like the internal logic isn't perfect. If you're smart and nice, it makes sense to say you're deficient in the third one (or gay, that's obviously the point of the graph), therefore you're ugly. I'm just saying I think that helps with the realism, I should know", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:29:30", "owner": "whydidimakethisaccount69420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295333744269095, "text": "Hey that's me in the middle, favorite color too :3", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:05:13", "owner": "_.yoswa._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061580420575358, "text": "Stay ugly gang 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:00:11", "owner": "dufero64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328942021214951, "text": "Skill issue honestly.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T04:11:28", "owner": "toddfount", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868579564386365, "text": "lol the middle could also be “friend zone”", "created_at": "2025-10-10T03:58:42", "owner": "rohandash", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921336553158486, "text": "There a lot of vapid mean f**s trust me.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T03:34:13", "owner": "awjeezrick5012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968393895958423, "text": "Sometimes I question if I’m any. But I know for sure I’m gay!!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T03:17:13", "owner": "bjornbrock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075549206145298, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T03:07:59", "owner": "p_c_b_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538278310031169, "text": "So a handsome nerd is 100% gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:42:16", "owner": "andershow03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121359286516698, "text": "que perfeccion", "created_at": "2025-10-10T01:07:16", "owner": "miguelvaccari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089580640681577, "text": "Me being everything but gay 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:35:22", "owner": "gilbert_cordova_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082500016782072, "text": "What if you are a dumb gay jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:31:19", "owner": "tallestryan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968721033808607, "text": "What if you are none of those things.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:26:54", "owner": "bash.wolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046830185355725, "text": "You think smart people are gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:26:04", "owner": "probstcalvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078025927860892, "text": "Is this true @withchrissy am I Gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:15:34", "owner": "ogorithm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107907376571591, "text": "So im gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:58:18", "owner": "itz_harout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982985898752054, "text": "Lol that's me 😂 gay but not gay 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:56:05", "owner": "prof.juliochiquetto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483428044075241, "text": "I fear I’m dumb", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:29:24", "owner": "babes_mattea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077675243028309, "text": "My baby is gay??? 😮😯", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:28:13", "owner": "livilrfe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082590022960135, "text": "I need to tell my wife I'm mmffff", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:24:25", "owner": "natosfera_94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116007436536791, "text": "Become a man then", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:44:56", "owner": "isaac_aren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061388219614194, "text": "Guess I'm dumb then", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:34:54", "owner": "angelo_crown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087676549861981, "text": "I guess im just nice 🫩", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:31:46", "owner": "someguynamedjonas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989958492719908, "text": "Mean ugly dumb ftw", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:03:05", "owner": "colepleshe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075007379127585, "text": "What about dumb and nice", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:44:46", "owner": "dx3_y6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286225909278247, "text": "Why you gotta be calling me a jerk tho?…", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:16:18", "owner": "bloopythestarman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084121516764120, "text": "Woohoo", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:10:16", "owner": "baristahona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346920517161037, "text": "What's wrong with a NICE SMART NERD? 😂🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:33:20", "owner": "baby_pluto_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532159831000630, "text": "Isso resume bem o mundo", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:26:00", "owner": "raulguerrak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026427200734181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:06:27", "owner": "jsfl_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072141812189345, "text": "🧐", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:04:50", "owner": "marmoriak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066488336460551, "text": "I mean...", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:01:16", "owner": "coollwhipp88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085635892740386, "text": "That’s why you gotta pick the nerds. You can dress them up and get a new haircut for them.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:53:39", "owner": "therealbrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960430389848363, "text": "Is there’s a lesbian one", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:52:30", "owner": "levileigey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078930977105391, "text": "Real (im a nerd)", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:49:49", "owner": "subway1003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985525578899738, "text": "so clearly a straight person made this", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:35:18", "owner": "drewoxenrider", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057954986533129, "text": "Women also same", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:32:28", "owner": "ranjanprasad727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104298892542560, "text": "Glad I’m not handsome 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:18:54", "owner": "bjdalbs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096481522739038, "text": "Thx for reminding me I'm a jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:58:19", "owner": "eitan_mayer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038090993494638, "text": "This is wrong I know for a fact that jerk and nerd can overlap", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:42:25", "owner": "galeheart2024", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17904329727257598, "text": "That’s why everyone calls me gay 😊", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:26:07", "owner": "uhhh_somebody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201650275314654, "text": "femcel ahh post", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:25:54", "owner": "abd_flwr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081572341802842, "text": "im not handsome, smart, or nice... but i surely im gay🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:07:43", "owner": "0ik4ke__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948918292023805, "text": "Nothing gayer than a group of straight men", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:03:27", "owner": "juancena_12th", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18378139651178042, "text": "But hear me out, ✨bisexual✨ men", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:23:54", "owner": "kelliroo90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872525416438597, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:22:48", "owner": "jonn_millz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314803555168210, "text": "When they have it all, they finally gain enlightenment and realize what they DONT need.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:16:35", "owner": "toano42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147631615372124, "text": "Aahhh that's why", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:11:32", "owner": "enes.dedecan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067058657356963, "text": "I'm neither of those so what am I ?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:45:12", "owner": "dysfunctional_mind_band", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046604735356276, "text": "Alr Alr Alr fine I’m gay", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:44:34", "owner": "jason.c.g__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135414721405248, "text": "It’s making sense now", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:37:00", "owner": "hoeezier_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066531725066218, "text": "Guess I’m gay now", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:00:20", "owner": "ittybittyglizzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390709315120659, "text": "2 genders", "created_at": "2025-10-09T15:56:14", "owner": "larry90876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067784891052760, "text": "Jerk🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-09T15:51:06", "owner": "a.mr.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099220315632239, "text": "God dammit", "created_at": "2025-10-09T15:30:34", "owner": "selfserveeverything", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890199874220983, "text": "I’ve been called all of these", "created_at": "2025-10-09T15:12:00", "owner": "markoxtony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047087399370396, "text": "Stop wasting time making things like this and just talk to girls", "created_at": "2025-10-09T14:38:50", "owner": "joshua_peck7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108608908573767, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-10-09T14:33:12", "owner": "shubhangijadhav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080930803826118, "text": "Add my circle “suicidal”", "created_at": "2025-10-09T14:33:10", "owner": "purplecatwithc4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073257866333147, "text": "Is it me? Am I the drama?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T13:53:19", "owner": "fersoberon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063423032104753, "text": "men here", "created_at": "2025-10-09T13:40:12", "owner": "aliziyadev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002824508814991, "text": "my husband isn't gay because I'm not a man (he doesn't mind the girldihh tho)", "created_at": "2025-10-09T13:37:38", "owner": "thederpydeed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536941264056838, "text": "Big three being smart, nice and handsome is crazy", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:58:52", "owner": "sunineshaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100105588645150, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:48:17", "owner": "emptyhassles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853650712551886, "text": "I’m not gay tho 🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:20:30", "owner": "mankind.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090024808865184, "text": "I'm in the white area", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:15:45", "owner": "hugo.vanwanghe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066489977368043, "text": "Neither of those but still gay🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:11:30", "owner": "lohan_heiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420906787111606, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:40:30", "owner": "_charles.courtois_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026804258745936, "text": "where's my dumb, ugly, twat section?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:24:15", "owner": "_finnbar_funbar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880640368402320, "text": "At some point men decide women ain't deserving them😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:09:19", "owner": "kashyaprauru", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025730237551973, "text": "Non sono gay", "created_at": "2025-10-09T10:53:48", "owner": "cartman_nello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141222502437200, "text": "Okay I admit I'm a jerk 👺", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:13:19", "owner": "pseudo_maverick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092909737828822, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:33:25", "owner": "rachaelmay_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025042946555574, "text": "I can confirm; I’m a Dumb Nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:59:07", "owner": "henry.asokan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295447195269084, "text": "I'm all because I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:51:08", "owner": "prism_97", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079942328002766, "text": "💩", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:40:03", "owner": "ozjohn.photo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378578290180405, "text": "Wait, how about the category of being plain dumb; ugly and dumb? 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:27:46", "owner": "kuangyu_liu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059129189194729, "text": "thank god none of us are ugly", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:30:27", "owner": "rizzless_bee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090496399879708, "text": "Are gays known to be nicer tho?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:18:29", "owner": "glutardvegan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525546151027133, "text": "Thats why being gay ist better 👌", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:16:56", "owner": "chrivid_x3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070472372190410, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:15:19", "owner": "randomshit_074", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044014550420985, "text": "Damn, gotta break the news to @emjojo", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:01:59", "owner": "thatjerkatwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412728448114696, "text": "Gay can also be pansexual which means no limits", "created_at": "2025-10-09T05:30:51", "owner": "jackbizga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054294821276280, "text": "Wanna be man now", "created_at": "2025-10-09T05:00:23", "owner": "mizukamnyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535706998041020, "text": "New I wasn’t good looking 🙄😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T04:25:32", "owner": "jamanos_is_real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531027739030342, "text": "What's in the middle of fat ugly and retarded", "created_at": "2025-10-09T04:09:14", "owner": "the_nfluence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024249272760030, "text": "fair", "created_at": "2025-10-09T03:45:51", "owner": "pugsmugsnotdrugs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18482709829075974, "text": "All this, but noone can call me ugly", "created_at": "2025-10-09T03:21:22", "owner": "its.nemo.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119540005460334, "text": "What if im neither of them?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T02:41:17", "owner": "joaquinalejandromoralese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068874137200317, "text": "All men are gay? Ok", "created_at": "2025-10-09T01:43:11", "owner": "andrew.sharky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095020099702450, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-09T01:29:31", "owner": "zain.man91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123862708501344, "text": "I'm gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T00:46:42", "owner": "davidjacobeder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876962959415213, "text": "Dawg, why am I getting this in the middle of facing gay allegations at school 😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-10-09T00:26:34", "owner": "ultimoml", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18534796651035802, "text": "Do women next", "created_at": "2025-10-09T00:10:25", "owner": "armanigayleja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534930046020243, "text": "What if he is just handsome, not smart, not nice?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T23:44:23", "owner": "priv.9657", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098215675733964, "text": "How nice to be labeled gay 🫶", "created_at": "2025-10-08T21:27:44", "owner": "maxlouiskr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030080639720506, "text": "If this real is legit then I guess I am gay 🤷", "created_at": "2025-10-08T21:23:14", "owner": "georgi.slavov_40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530277757039270, "text": "So I’m jerk, nerd, nice, and dumb. Isn’t that just called autistic", "created_at": "2025-10-08T21:09:41", "owner": "wesley.s2246", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099342310730795, "text": "This is why I married a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-08T21:09:40", "owner": "naynayslayz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126114073487711, "text": "Me gay", "created_at": "2025-10-08T21:07:21", "owner": "andrew_unfound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087073033725709, "text": "Nerds can be jerks too 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T19:27:20", "owner": "geraldinaur", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978488919916567, "text": "I don’t like how nerds are presented", "created_at": "2025-10-08T19:14:42", "owner": "dhakraphoenix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062633759618795, "text": "Nerd reporting for dookie", "created_at": "2025-10-08T18:08:57", "owner": "kendr1cklamat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056629409553680, "text": "❤️💙💛❤️💙💛", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:42:44", "owner": "beyza_karakuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902312227268646, "text": "Guess I'm a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:38:30", "owner": "sam_died", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081024716482876, "text": "This is for str8 girls only. If you are gay it works like this", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:33:32", "owner": "badger_mateo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922603297160119, "text": "what’s wrong with being a nerd???? 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:29:51", "owner": "clairebellelyy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022628723572612, "text": "So gay people are dumb nerd jerks?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:24:09", "owner": "sosia_do_davih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027422324535638, "text": "I choose the nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:19:23", "owner": "starseed__1111__broadcast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366286780157829, "text": "This means also that gays are jerk, dumb and nerd 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:06:28", "owner": "leo_guado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091520566837151, "text": "I am indeed gay", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:05:49", "owner": "dinizl.andre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851046625529299, "text": "I mean, I AM a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:03:39", "owner": "ganderlarry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877726342418163, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:52:34", "owner": "muctefe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117461707464583, "text": "Always a gay 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:35:45", "owner": "adrianfedere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880249813402255, "text": "So the famous \"ha gayy\" was actually an ultimate compliment? Also being called a jerk should be considered as one too?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:11:00", "owner": "ronipaavilainen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079624222856571, "text": "Well you can't have it both ways", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:09:30", "owner": "quen_in_in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072859970517049, "text": "Handsome and Smart generally follow a bell shaped curve", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:07:18", "owner": "chandrodayb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087989275918405, "text": "I am dumb gay jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:56:37", "owner": "samurai_jack1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849765112569597, "text": "this seems to be how the world sees it ...if he's dirty & barely value his image then ppl assume he's hetero", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:38:11", "owner": "ibtnn__ob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095219107681998, "text": "Guys I guess im gay.. homis?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:58:15", "owner": "aidstews", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313728736173998, "text": "não.", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:15:18", "owner": "juujeveryday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978421092765311, "text": "Ne kibar ne yakışıklı ne de zekiyim o yüzden erkek kısmındayım", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:04:16", "owner": "bekirtalhakizilkaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083826340763833, "text": "so accurate", "created_at": "2025-10-08T13:27:00", "owner": "_aryansrivastava", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891184954349357, "text": "Oh sono gay", "created_at": "2025-10-08T13:01:22", "owner": "camardazs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100275475645667, "text": "Misandrist hgs would love this", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:25:59", "owner": "_chhering__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863688418479138, "text": "This makes me hella gay", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:08:46", "owner": "pri.tarded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046677599351332, "text": "🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:21:38", "owner": "michael_mmcd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895955080182143, "text": "I'm gay ?... wow...", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:19:10", "owner": "ditfnaf_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861251473437162, "text": "That explains why my type are all gay", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:10:22", "owner": "_.wi.mi.ko._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881937793395109, "text": "We need a female venn diagram", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:01:45", "owner": "hanarilovesmile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170931754362519, "text": "What's the difference between nice and handsome ?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:23:57", "owner": "des.erwan_o_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079858370289664, "text": "This post is pretty pessimistic.", "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:22:59", "owner": "benjamin_roeser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110266084560253, "text": "Hmm, Dumb nerd jerk gay 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:21:59", "owner": "itz_juraj6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044809862400986, "text": "Ill be the jerk then", "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:10:03", "owner": "rowan2006.tch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192343984321676, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-08T08:36:33", "owner": "kaiser.sam98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042236162681915, "text": "🇺🇦🇺🇦🇺🇦", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:39:35", "owner": "mark_likhachov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085118861507140, "text": "Well, fuck you", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:22:00", "owner": "moysesauad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081616456946257, "text": "Means man is all of them", "created_at": "2025-10-08T06:23:27", "owner": "em_euphoria_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073754153326593, "text": "Proudly outta this diagram", "created_at": "2025-10-08T06:10:39", "owner": "vivaciouscupidd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003716288657132, "text": "so, gay is dumb, jerk, and nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-08T05:36:12", "owner": "nzuliann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090944863842348, "text": "Why are you doing this to me", "created_at": "2025-10-08T04:54:46", "owner": "acherkan_le_vrai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043806359682736, "text": "Smart, gay, jerk and nerd for me", "created_at": "2025-10-08T04:49:06", "owner": "monchiin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043375100425670, "text": "Whats wrong with nerds tho?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:59:31", "owner": "beeercat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058234052438026, "text": "Hahah damn!!! That's the ultimate burn on straight women. They so bad all the best men rather date men lol", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:14:36", "owner": "emmettvanhalm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091276132873595, "text": "And some men not even handsome, not smart, but also not nice. The audacity", "created_at": "2025-10-08T01:43:00", "owner": "9thsynapse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867163138462927, "text": "Agreed. A man is PROTECTIVE, VISIONARY, and COMMONSENSE. This is a false paradigm that just describes something that ultimately women don’t want.", "created_at": "2025-10-08T01:33:47", "owner": "nathanfinochio", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17960040309006743, "text": "That's why I like my nerdy boys", "created_at": "2025-10-08T01:15:47", "owner": "maria_signorelli_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082676671986198, "text": "Now when my gf says I'm gay I can just show her this", "created_at": "2025-10-08T01:13:05", "owner": "theguywhodrums", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036302066704285, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T00:49:59", "owner": "marnikeri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078447206032172, "text": "I have no clue where I fit in on this chart, all I know is that I am smart", "created_at": "2025-10-08T00:28:42", "owner": "frko.wulf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340283077202167, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-08T00:13:08", "owner": "ishyskwishy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022275620581896, "text": "I am a jerk, aren’t I", "created_at": "2025-10-07T23:59:29", "owner": "not_aaron31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945672027918327, "text": "Himbos rise up. Pure of heart. Broad of chest. Dumb of [Instagram censorship]", "created_at": "2025-10-07T23:32:43", "owner": "mighty.michael.condria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977115960923630, "text": "I'm one step from gay", "created_at": "2025-10-07T23:14:28", "owner": "jjakuba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925027612139362, "text": "I am dumb", "created_at": "2025-10-07T23:10:24", "owner": "skatewaymaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862791034482422, "text": "Nooo", "created_at": "2025-10-07T22:02:18", "owner": "grea.tmelvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849903025535084, "text": "Pretty much", "created_at": "2025-10-07T21:56:43", "owner": "josephmichaelbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955874344001296, "text": "Im dumb, but also ugly and an asshole. How does that work?", "created_at": "2025-10-07T20:36:46", "owner": "pirateboy47", "likes": 157}, {"id": 17859369225514834, "text": "Yall forgot, it’s “gay or mentally unstable”", "created_at": "2025-10-07T20:15:18", "owner": "abbyishereee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895873183180784, "text": "Nerd not being in the circle of handsome is a lie.", "created_at": "2025-10-07T19:19:37", "owner": "alanseb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098120344736542, "text": "All roads lead to gay", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:57:58", "owner": "wild.wes.james", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18363376357155221, "text": "Yknow, the problem is I’m going through myself and my friends and… yeah kinda 🤷. Don’t rly have a counterpoint.", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:30:39", "owner": "emixam_rampen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861165040437722, "text": "\"NERD\" is supposed to be \"UGLY\" if you're going to maintain the pattern. 👍", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:56:06", "owner": "erichansonartwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059168618410677, "text": "Stoopid", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:23:23", "owner": "rc_crusader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285708730275282, "text": "I’m okay being dumb, if that’s the price I have to pay", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:19:01", "owner": "el1salley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007199615815331, "text": "I need to get better looking so I can be gay", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:10:20", "owner": "theghostlyspyglass", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880816882284737, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T14:37:53", "owner": "tim_unger_real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928460409999715, "text": "Dumb and smart simultaneously", "created_at": "2025-10-07T14:14:41", "owner": "vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvuvvvvvvvvvg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884735839380478, "text": "Jerk is okay", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:59:34", "owner": "a.lin.8609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073931522139554, "text": "Now onto the female version", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:36:14", "owner": "canucallmeadam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900957262290525, "text": "So what's the problem with \"nerd\"? Anything more than just the word? If just the word, then there's really nothibg wrong with it, is there?", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:54:15", "owner": "sakkesakamoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117936421514200, "text": "So nerd it is 🙌❤️‍🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-07T09:42:59", "owner": "justwanttolivewhileimalive", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070307231219336, "text": "Gays are just a superior form of men 🤷🏽", "created_at": "2025-10-07T09:34:56", "owner": "roeegurarie2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960252459846953, "text": "Fucc you man, I'm not gay!", "created_at": "2025-10-07T08:16:42", "owner": "enbariz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053370857285307, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:02:33", "owner": "sugnoey.km", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059878313453496, "text": "gay are not smart", "created_at": "2025-10-07T05:56:57", "owner": "efeoral_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18090409390883095, "text": "Guess I’m gay", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:51:30", "owner": "hradbluffman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115836001530643, "text": "I might suck at sports but mom says I've hit the 'men trifecta'", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:37:23", "owner": "adambyronellis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881301274279464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:38:54", "owner": "gd_2k1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915113479067864, "text": "No way 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:24:38", "owner": "iburathaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082779938064235, "text": "This is how I have discovered I am a straight gay.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:33:08", "owner": "adamandhisworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040947341476999, "text": "Oh shit", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:45:08", "owner": "tap1blk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957500889862318, "text": "Gay>>", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:40:02", "owner": "paro._.x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950006688899113, "text": "Curioso, soy todas las del centro pero ninguna de afuera 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:34:32", "owner": "just.miguelangel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104690104615773, "text": "There are some very mean gays running around", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:27:07", "owner": "zeejaygee123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098467987662976, "text": "Oh damn ...", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:25:06", "owner": "derakonrad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102851155717861, "text": "Actually, in the middle it should say woman 😂, gays are even worst than straight men 😂😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:25:51", "owner": "jonathan.rose10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533072248034445, "text": "Relatable 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:51:05", "owner": "imfauwzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049842347648880, "text": "Proud to be a Nerd 🗿", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:41:05", "owner": "yoshi_strickn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943828192058128, "text": "im gay but no handsome", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:13:02", "owner": "qsart01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042255272438344, "text": "Joke's on you, I'm neither smart or handsome, just nice and a jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:52:36", "owner": "leo.ahonzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984602388906543, "text": "So what, are gay men always polite? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:30:49", "owner": "cinli.dede", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022330523565544, "text": "Gay nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:19:22", "owner": "imranethepunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993454632842226, "text": "But if you change the caption to \"Women\" you get canceled.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T09:05:36", "owner": "tobias.exe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971537850793334, "text": "Elliot in Bedazzled 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-06T05:01:53", "owner": "cielitolindisimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177587812343433, "text": "Am nerd. 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:20:18", "owner": "pyro6360", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904315150127216, "text": "Handsome + smart + nice = Racist/Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:51:23", "owner": "omdickyreal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18156140014385411, "text": "@ohyeahhuh2000 this is who you chose", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:19:33", "owner": "wesleylovesclimatechange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076843802119210, "text": "Is this true?", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:17:02", "owner": "thelastof_three", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080726920960617, "text": "Team NERD >>>>>>", "created_at": "2025-10-05T22:28:52", "owner": "farahft__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127989802469562, "text": "Gay here", "created_at": "2025-10-05T22:21:44", "owner": "ma3.l.esh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904968436266985, "text": "Wait", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:41:41", "owner": "kelifax.ns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091342042835210, "text": "I study with nerds everyday and trust me, they are not smart and nice, they are stinky and very unaware of how the world works.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:44:32", "owner": "ste_borra.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060224999159126, "text": "real", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:29:56", "owner": "disrespecter99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072106994332079, "text": "I might be gay", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:17:33", "owner": "analyticfanaticusa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889805890220957, "text": "Where's ugly?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:15:24", "owner": "justincsimmonsxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842370535594805, "text": "Whats the problem with a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:51:43", "owner": "alex_gervazova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295480774267895, "text": "People who think nerds aren’t handsome have obviously never heard of Henry Cavil", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:39:35", "owner": "tamahodgson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080894836977284, "text": "I’ll remember to buy some lube for when I go f*ck myself☹️", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:37:18", "owner": "tamahodgson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053684546263396, "text": "Isn't it a bit offensive towards straight men?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:03:29", "owner": "alessio.sugar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081727703005421, "text": "I'm just nice 👍🙂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:36:29", "owner": "jsumner21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100623442571851, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:54:41", "owner": "sober_hanri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062519324105955, "text": "No lies lmao", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:47:25", "owner": "rafikibeatxchangers", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028778030721002, "text": "Wouldn't be a smart choice to be gay", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:23:32", "owner": "yealo3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059455877414438, "text": "Fym I'm gae 🥀💔", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:16:26", "owner": "nihilist_human", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078844727048627, "text": "Add ugly too", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:01:49", "owner": "aditiwh0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080132866973391, "text": "And today we have learned that the opposite if handsome is nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:24:58", "owner": "akifotaci", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088080454710435, "text": "Are the nice gays in the room with us right now?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:19:33", "owner": "mysteriousglances", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106832269523927, "text": "If non of those", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:09:15", "owner": "captainmoayadgh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932285635099183, "text": "Iconic post obviously with a Taylor Swift song.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:46:11", "owner": "__adityeah__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940222411079660, "text": "Gays are the dumbest ppl", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:19:11", "owner": "mayyuriis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387917566130592, "text": "🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:09:41", "owner": "juliang013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848760436570787, "text": "😂👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:02:30", "owner": "rsr1803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113446036557077, "text": "Imagine the same with women. everyone would find that outrageous", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:49:51", "owner": "lorenzo_lollii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094043449769329, "text": "I’m not nice, I’m kind.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T07:31:29", "owner": "calvyngrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073681886469882, "text": "@_shxhxr__", "created_at": "2025-10-05T07:17:33", "owner": "lee_1__shaik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942425044057445, "text": "The accuracy", "created_at": "2025-10-05T05:26:11", "owner": "sunshine.0621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084704035737220, "text": "@_depresso_espresso._", "created_at": "2025-10-05T03:54:32", "owner": "lesbian._.protectorr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095750635682397, "text": "I’m not gay though", "created_at": "2025-10-05T03:41:49", "owner": "punmaster_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101809963556574, "text": "Ok fiiine I'll do it, where's the smart handsome man? 🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-05T03:21:24", "owner": "quinnalan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097379818678996, "text": "So I'm a nerd, nice", "created_at": "2025-10-05T03:01:11", "owner": "cai_the_knife_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933236131097516, "text": "I knew it… Men are just in the outskirts.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T03:00:01", "owner": "be.basstastic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068383067461243, "text": "Nerd is the best option here", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:43:17", "owner": "yaamflores", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18421098886105320, "text": "Actually autistic must be in the middle", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:10:10", "owner": "juandiegotoroegas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185651611334391, "text": "As a gay men, I don’t agree that gay men are all handsome, smart and nice. Actually, those are quite rare", "created_at": "2025-10-05T01:13:13", "owner": "bc_brandao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18358442650082414, "text": "Thank you 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-04T21:50:10", "owner": "joaofelipe_mta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080244062064894, "text": "handsome smart jerk is not bad btw", "created_at": "2025-10-04T21:25:10", "owner": "cheelgihon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949738665906205, "text": "i guess im gay", "created_at": "2025-10-04T21:01:52", "owner": "terrorblazer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424036531101639, "text": "@marianakaory", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:42:30", "owner": "jfernandesjr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023691221558091, "text": "Nerds are the best husbands!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:37:17", "owner": "anneraybon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18317453710244542, "text": "Very proud to be a nerd 🤓 @arx_chloe", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:36:05", "owner": "ewen__he", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065321900366899, "text": "Oh shit i'm gay, finally my dream comes true!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:33:42", "owner": "andrea_sime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889828408225617, "text": "Well, this offers me an explanation I guess 😅", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:05:07", "owner": "therealjfromuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931947630979928, "text": "@amirmohammad_rb jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-04T19:49:14", "owner": "matin.k79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082341523947306, "text": "@amirreza34549 jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-04T19:48:42", "owner": "matin.k79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525683965044728, "text": "When we're bi how it worck??", "created_at": "2025-10-04T19:15:53", "owner": "luccop06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972107391946382, "text": "happy to be in the gay spot without being gay 🥰", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:34:02", "owner": "frankkito.babe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077657981512777, "text": "I’ll settle for the nerds then?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:26:00", "owner": "wulfettenoire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048701870668498, "text": "Gays have everything and they choose share it with another guy", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:25:03", "owner": "oztr.kelif", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087775348872170, "text": "This is an odd way to find out i am gay. Don't tell my wife 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:04:57", "owner": "substandardphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968719041954859, "text": "Thank God I'm not handsome. I'm just a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:56:03", "owner": "ben10truther", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526568629015709, "text": "The don’t have… “way to old” there.. think 1/2 of gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:14:39", "owner": "craigabrown106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847776634544631, "text": "Wait a minute no way", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:00:56", "owner": "firat_bulut3012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056401217562212, "text": "I am dead center!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:14:42", "owner": "eddypham", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089153566874596, "text": "A nice smart handsome knows he outta league for all women collectively", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:10:06", "owner": "garamkhhoon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009360542799637, "text": "Hahahaha, I'm not handsome so I can't be gay, hahahah", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:02:29", "owner": "theinfernalfal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079730123510380, "text": "Henry cavill is not gay", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:31:37", "owner": "varkott", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078819485043527, "text": "I love the fact that if you are smart you are either a jerk to women, a nerd who is more interested in trains than women or straight up gay and not into women at all :)))", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:18:57", "owner": "dogankiransoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843932068589065, "text": "Damn that's why i have gay allegations", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:02:18", "owner": "lightbluemk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060272678141200, "text": "So, you saying 🧐 ??", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:44:28", "owner": "the_supreme_rizzler5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203671999312461, "text": "XDDD gay = jerk, idiot, handsome, bad person, no ambitions 🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:45:28", "owner": "instaszafa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098496421652110, "text": "Creepy", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:30:57", "owner": "allandan.gar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076715159041991, "text": "Guess I am dumb😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:12:43", "owner": "shandoukai_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866606212462290, "text": "Frl", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:35:57", "owner": "detroitgamezm8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019923728591479, "text": "You did not just give the most accurate description of men", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:41:13", "owner": "yevdokiyasverdlova", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082211827971324, "text": "I love nerds", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:38:25", "owner": "lel_val", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18385489033120657, "text": "This is what I see! Handsome men are not smart, nerdy or nice!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:22:43", "owner": "mcthil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364246243159540, "text": "I am Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:20:48", "owner": "mia_nburhan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892766485342579, "text": "I’m gay", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:10:49", "owner": "giacominopanevvino_official", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080336066075592, "text": "What if I am just nice", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:56:48", "owner": "beanbun18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858453625456384, "text": "Then I am “nerd”", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:50:56", "owner": "aethermeetsbagel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055699790224988, "text": "So the only option is nerds… sign me up!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:45:30", "owner": "miriam01miri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077587294864297, "text": "I'm all 3 and not gay. Your graph is wrong, I advise you to fix it. And if you don't...let just say, you will talk to larry", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:36:20", "owner": "rostikostikk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857209774532801, "text": "you should put gay/not a man btw", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:09:33", "owner": "pixiechar.lie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164549290374094, "text": "They be jealous of you cause they can't be you", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:05:56", "owner": "d33p.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984612171889674, "text": "Aaayooo bitch, I ain't gay", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:33:59", "owner": "om31_06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872138002355598, "text": "I’m not gay.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:51:58", "owner": "capitano_samet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118162804518838, "text": "Perspective", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:19:02", "owner": "_myself_anand._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894643225325822, "text": "Y'all acting as if this doesn't apply to women as well", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:18:00", "owner": "wilfred_hebron_moses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876580786419980, "text": "Where is the lie?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T03:53:48", "owner": "monikadc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084540445755541, "text": "I knew i was a nerd.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T03:49:59", "owner": "roden.tim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883851916263526, "text": "Still I can't find my type gay men 😭😭... I was born unfortunate 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T03:31:13", "owner": "aru_shh___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056631158624445, "text": "Am I gay… 😟", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:49:35", "owner": "bigbertcollege", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202275256313641, "text": "Sorry to flex, I got me one that’s all three and not gay, but I did have to wait for him to grow out of the “jerk” phase of his late 20’s 😂 20 years later, he’s a definite keeper 🩷🩷", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:43:28", "owner": "christiemcmahon56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861778507498142, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:43:26", "owner": "blahbybluebla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081126677490608, "text": "Then explain Henry Cavill.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:37:47", "owner": "rigitrite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046431497657087, "text": "Mine is a jerk.. he is not know to be a nice guy 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:30:10", "owner": "max.cat4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076400159107049, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:28:04", "owner": "earth2nacho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102904504627156, "text": "Im not gay", "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:11:29", "owner": "mr.scallywagjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033679109706167, "text": "What's wrong with nerds? I love nerds", "created_at": "2025-10-03T23:53:38", "owner": "jazdibar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090220249876063, "text": "I’m the white background", "created_at": "2025-10-03T23:23:31", "owner": "_gage.gardner_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025439990744199, "text": "So gays are handsome nerds?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:37:38", "owner": "mooeymctee", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17854339527492559, "text": "Smart gay? That exist?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:24:03", "owner": "filwaw7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18202036909313194, "text": "Yeah I need to work on my nerdiness before I can step into gay territory now 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:05:15", "owner": "thegreatloguwu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18388508788131815, "text": "I'm a jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-03T21:55:47", "owner": "akrammadx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120684238506935, "text": "The posts from the guy who really wants to have sex but is so ugly that he thinks taking pictures in the mirror makes him look \"good.\"", "created_at": "2025-10-03T21:22:43", "owner": "noct_leonhart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287578954278224, "text": "❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-10-03T20:45:08", "owner": "nayla.granelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909619459234026, "text": "Because gay men are everything 🔥🏳️‍🌈", "created_at": "2025-10-03T20:01:33", "owner": "jack.kasper", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18533684422035936, "text": "Jerk here", "created_at": "2025-10-03T20:01:22", "owner": "_arcxit", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859624567509328, "text": "Gay all the way.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:47:16", "owner": "wind_of_ice_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084462952738919, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:12:46", "owner": "alessandro_sfriso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059073896177881, "text": "Im not gay, I just like strong women who tell my what to do 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:47:24", "owner": "kazmotaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094082734782944, "text": "thank God! I am not handsome.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:43:27", "owner": "peanutcares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115078921536896, "text": "Always a jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:13:58", "owner": "ggxezee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889654282357760, "text": "Damn, I wish I was Gay. I mean in this instance.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:44:55", "owner": "bzc5882", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070420973195879, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:41:22", "owner": "jon.gulig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136181416399303, "text": "I didn’t know I was gay", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:21:19", "owner": "rayhanbrito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872807902346121, "text": "NOoooo 😭😭😭💀💔💔💔💀", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:01:41", "owner": "f.fallen.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108393424501489, "text": "I live in pure handsome tbh", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:35:40", "owner": "_rcstpigeon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094612009684276, "text": "Why can't I be nerd and handsome", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:21:17", "owner": "shahar.werbner", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915022699084507, "text": "The best definition i have ever seen", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:12:15", "owner": "aydemin_kedileri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075969065038201, "text": "Thank goodness I’m ugly", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:01:49", "owner": "squethanator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855245350540088, "text": "Rather to be dictator😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:54:19", "owner": "zorlu_serkan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073027456913404, "text": "Gays are the most toxic wth", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:53:45", "owner": "royda159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013738550794883, "text": "Damn, as a Nerd I'm pretty happy someone say I'm nice 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:49:08", "owner": "alexiel2077", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18422033503104633, "text": "@sayak_at_the", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:38:04", "owner": "mav_rishabh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896144581313706, "text": "Frrr...", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:32:37", "owner": "paridhi__2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982103271877653, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:17:33", "owner": "yamalgr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051611378308277, "text": "Not me just being nice 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T14:59:26", "owner": "dood_abood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327508876227644, "text": "Dumb ❌ poor ✅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T14:53:12", "owner": "karlmarxheinrich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283696528274785, "text": "I am the part thats white 🔥🙌😭", "created_at": "2025-10-03T14:05:59", "owner": "masarik_jozef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847802728575094, "text": "All I see is Men outside the diagram 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-10-03T14:04:35", "owner": "aditya__poddar10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050668226316316, "text": "Entonces si soy tonto feo y pesado soy hetero?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:56:19", "owner": "_camilol._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051022406303747, "text": "I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:24:25", "owner": "wujudaslisdm01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059862119386470, "text": "Ima gay", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:14:40", "owner": "incelanirudh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907934281247658, "text": "@mister_sakellaridis you’re perfect", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:11:13", "owner": "lou_daddy2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127924759473716, "text": "I... Im gay???", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:44:12", "owner": "typisch.mein.leben", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069795671184219, "text": "I hope i am a nerd because i am sure i am not handsome", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:02:33", "owner": "rub.en5814", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078454826020111, "text": "Yes I'm gay, very accurate", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:44:08", "owner": "ajs_black_cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089924470892553, "text": "😂😂😂so when you're gay you are perfect?? ? 😂😂😂😂 Let me laugh", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:42:28", "owner": "saggigo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006179720804765, "text": "I think I'm pretty much in the nerd category, although I can be an absolute idiot some times", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:53:03", "owner": "dragonboim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103804633612854, "text": "And they still don't have a clue.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:22:31", "owner": "smertabakasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294988231250290, "text": "Gay is not normal", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:54:18", "owner": "liubomyr_p15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884321587258946, "text": "Does this mean.. \"there's gay in every men\" ? I'm a data analyst", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:48:53", "owner": "tryingpeace", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074101835468749, "text": "What ever is that just don't be gay", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:17:54", "owner": "dirgantaraeldi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858368215454534, "text": "I hate how accurate this is", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:12:25", "owner": "laxmii_rannaa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096854209679985, "text": "I wish this was true", "created_at": "2025-10-03T08:00:24", "owner": "jacksonemerrill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044180381401794, "text": "So the real gay niggas pls stand up 🕺🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-03T07:17:09", "owner": "smokobig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18528678049023014, "text": "Dumb gang rise up", "created_at": "2025-10-03T07:13:29", "owner": "progrocklapdance", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863021599474639, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:48:04", "owner": "ivanot.ty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080501890952911, "text": "Awwww thankyou", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:12:50", "owner": "the_ramanuj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849255127569172, "text": "Just call me handsome nerd then", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:12:44", "owner": "berliner.luftpumpe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111025345493457, "text": "Handsome Jack", "created_at": "2025-10-03T05:56:55", "owner": "msavvi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954688576005996, "text": "Am smart, bur am not really nice to people and i dont think am handsome at all, so...", "created_at": "2025-10-03T05:29:10", "owner": "filete_fl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058672115571915, "text": "Im smart n jerk :( no hondsome", "created_at": "2025-10-03T05:15:54", "owner": "ulaspkr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080307577987787, "text": "I want to send this to him!", "created_at": "2025-10-03T05:15:19", "owner": "anndiazzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060423473629104, "text": "So if I’m only nice, I have to suffer nerd, dumb, and gay? Well I really won the lottery here 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-03T05:01:08", "owner": "uncle_daws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058317278175134, "text": "@peanytt kmu apa rap?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:49:22", "owner": "zuge_bros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880464694285629, "text": "oooooohhhhh so thats whyyyy i only get men messaging me😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:26:51", "owner": "dr.petrichev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975242472779004, "text": "I'm all of em. A modern Renaissance man.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:11:31", "owner": "brittonwfrost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531580111035219, "text": "Im sexist, homophobic, racist, misogynistic, islamphobic, christianphobic, nazi, white power, damn what else, idk, but yeah", "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:00:47", "owner": "ix7cq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106938241602781, "text": "Am I supposed to know where I fall on this?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T03:56:49", "owner": "davidgeorgejames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882780550390423, "text": "I'm just nice", "created_at": "2025-10-03T03:24:07", "owner": "alsoandres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325698538238558, "text": "this is extremely accurate", "created_at": "2025-10-03T03:23:27", "owner": "_emileebateman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074651726162925, "text": "I'm dumb but I'm not handsome nor nice", "created_at": "2025-10-03T02:43:35", "owner": "robosauriorex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070452953211697, "text": "Gay ❌ racist ✅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T02:28:42", "owner": "lil_shykh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117107194519671, "text": "Jerk/Nerd ✌🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-03T02:10:32", "owner": "dineshth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845070709581186, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:54:35", "owner": "willsznn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967934172954007, "text": "Good thing I'm not handsome", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:41:54", "owner": "evaristote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194976040317169, "text": "I guess I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:40:15", "owner": "j.del_sol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028573946722450, "text": "Lot of times the experiment relationship is jerk and dumb 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:06:38", "owner": "jadenphairwilliams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099336325630458, "text": "handsome is debatable on a certain people 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:03:21", "owner": "samlaxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326671339233380, "text": "This isn’t wrong 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:00:44", "owner": "christianstockman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077648963105550, "text": "If those are my only options, I'll take the nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:14:02", "owner": "bethanys_boardom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995096559837560, "text": "Diagram on how I just can’t win", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:12:03", "owner": "tali_kaja17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082569109943316, "text": "I’ll take the nerds", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:07:00", "owner": "abigailht_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075503966320090, "text": "So to not be gay you must be stupid ugly and son of bi**h! 😹", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:05:17", "owner": "amer.dzhavad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056707433568880, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:13:05", "owner": "_morkahn_", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18041895881452194, "text": "So what's why", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:41:13", "owner": "violet_spydr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844388722573993, "text": "Why am I just now finding out I’m gay??", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:40:19", "owner": "the_real_amadeus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322187686211987, "text": "Dump and gay are both the same thing", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:39:00", "owner": "machete_pues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103539493719141, "text": "Gay men are not nice", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:26:53", "owner": "astro.carolina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114116050528685, "text": "Yo quiero uno de esos. 🥺", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:02:49", "owner": "julio20axayacatl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18404007811190496, "text": "Give me a nerd any day!  They are the best", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:54:11", "owner": "westfallronda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980593650874258, "text": "im a dumb gay nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:43:44", "owner": "christiann3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055615085222710, "text": "Im not gay though", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:41:21", "owner": "raphaelmouny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994598235838437, "text": "Could be Bi too", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:41:21", "owner": "monkium", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072786538913012, "text": "Yes, unfortunately", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:40:47", "owner": "salvador.mirzakhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082012883310882, "text": "Im racist", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:31:25", "owner": "demir.dincay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089674156851674, "text": "Uhhh i fall in the autistic category 🙂👍", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:18:57", "owner": "idontconsentt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027787469527685, "text": "Chat am I gay", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:05:52", "owner": "fweaharyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995283864832433, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:47:30", "owner": "alexesponacasademunt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027139223740906, "text": "This is some boomer shit", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:47:20", "owner": "crispr__________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089804209864084, "text": "\"gay\" means \"low masculinity\" for little girls", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:46:53", "owner": "serhiusus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059144354616601, "text": "I am not a nerd", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:46:12", "owner": "caleblikesmetallica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111532921486574, "text": "Happy to see I'm a Jerk lol", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:31:19", "owner": "guy_blue43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964158930985648, "text": "Here I was thinking that the words handsome and gay were the antithesis of one another", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:29:40", "owner": "ansel_nollmeyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185302306336262, "text": "That's why everybody needs to be a lil gay", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:21:45", "owner": "colinwiddows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975736425778729, "text": "I'm not handsome, smart and nice all at once, so I a way, I'm gay in the grand scheme of things", "created_at": "2025-10-02T18:52:41", "owner": "suta_putra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065597702363599, "text": "thats the realest shit ive ever seen on this app", "created_at": "2025-10-02T18:48:46", "owner": "el_estrilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18506637418071324, "text": "What if you’re dumb chopped and mean asf", "created_at": "2025-10-02T18:39:57", "owner": "aslanlyu_mt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095342839665426, "text": "Henry Cavill", "created_at": "2025-10-02T18:33:03", "owner": "the_poteto_prince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081695491795324, "text": "Gay men are not nice what are you talking about", "created_at": "2025-10-02T18:00:41", "owner": "lydia_bell_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097811161659229, "text": "Yes, but I'm short.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:58:50", "owner": "ayoub77fouzari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892145350205973, "text": "Do women just hate straight men 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:53:28", "owner": "superdenver17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18168381454370973, "text": "I didn't know I was gay.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:33:44", "owner": "j_twice116", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18409397695119242, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:29:04", "owner": "thetruefaux", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072113809962823, "text": "Gay = happy 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:58:09", "owner": "ayrton_27_senna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068702360018022, "text": "explains why I like gay men", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:26:27", "owner": "aesl.uvr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126359527489096, "text": "That's so true", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:17:04", "owner": "tnyya.vsth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060065792617294, "text": "@mart1n_d are you gay?!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:53:12", "owner": "existentialice_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081621994790034, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:13:41", "owner": "batikankutluer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042185987425413, "text": "None of them lmao", "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:11:51", "owner": "amipsee.01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931402479987445, "text": "The handsome/nice/dumb combo is the best one, I’m tired of pretending it’s not. Himbos are my favorite", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:49:23", "owner": "megan.e.thompson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965221263817407, "text": "they have a bitch side more than gay", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:46:29", "owner": "4frhaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085362223930161, "text": "How can someone be smart and nerd at the same time 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:40:59", "owner": "gourang_22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925028443014325, "text": "Ofcourse gays are in the center of everything", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:35:29", "owner": "iradualin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058168616609472, "text": "so im in the white?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:29:10", "owner": "membraca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151771792395187, "text": "Apparently I’m gay", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:26:02", "owner": "joachimf1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18507599323067130, "text": "Most gays i know are stupid and irritating.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:20:54", "owner": "micheletoscan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951958300033054, "text": "Exactly", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:13:56", "owner": "9067__peanuts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178852549354263, "text": "@jessicamaygreen  @lornalogg  a fine science 🧪", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:37:12", "owner": "jtgibbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136582516446044, "text": "@nachiappan_angappan_", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:35:20", "owner": "iam_hvt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852692008554177, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:24:25", "owner": "lil_witch_2006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531620029039805, "text": "gay", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:20:42", "owner": "mickaella.mlhm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976727958770765, "text": "Luckly i got the outside circle", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:48:09", "owner": "veylisya_lou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001778399813384, "text": "Handsome smart nice nerd reporting for duty", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:19:08", "owner": "george.raul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065908922345385, "text": "Im a handsome nerd… help..", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:17:31", "owner": "omr_zx6r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043242617678721, "text": "Jerk and nice=gay?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:44:34", "owner": "astra_cyanpink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061020653111806, "text": "Ye I'm a dumb nerd jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:28:14", "owner": "nico_reitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097962691640173, "text": "Just say you don't like men at this point 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:20:06", "owner": "bm.7904814", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910243570234616, "text": "@valentin_egel why honey?😭", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:11:39", "owner": "severussnapereal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364710736156839, "text": "🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:54:29", "owner": "bpaulm1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908753845247734, "text": "😭😭😭 not fair", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:49:11", "owner": "regallumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895429729321066, "text": "Remove Gay with Racist and we deal", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:15:58", "owner": "keremozdemirmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064380398591840, "text": "All of men are red flag, just choose your favorite shade of red", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:50:07", "owner": "thtrthgs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078457955052390, "text": "i'm not gay dym", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:49:48", "owner": "garoldtheduck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076476173027555, "text": "@notmurshid you wanted me to tag you??", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:44:01", "owner": "risafaimtiyas_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044916971386774, "text": "@johnchackosebastian 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:36:31", "owner": "rujal_prajapati_9124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842646334588310, "text": "I want a boyfriend guys", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:01:43", "owner": "clan.po0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009500858632542, "text": "i’ve been called all of them", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:57:59", "owner": "khanny_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994386249693162, "text": "Men 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:50:45", "owner": "muflihhaziz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935506485964218, "text": "why my man are non of them . 🙃", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:18:24", "owner": "oct09th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895444024322879, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:58:03", "owner": "dddddarkmoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073316189329690, "text": "Niga", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:48:26", "owner": "osha_not", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942451041933712, "text": "So Gay men are Ideal?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:25:59", "owner": "innocentsoul106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978268671925747, "text": "nuh uh", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:04:49", "owner": "loocosmai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194079505320314, "text": "White men", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:51:37", "owner": "liam_olsen2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113244160546768, "text": "Hey that’s…..oh", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:39:09", "owner": "jasperfriendlybear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965116845971074, "text": "Lots of men are just jerks and dumb, not the other stuff", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:04:14", "owner": "thepepperdoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022393226758852, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-10-02T03:58:30", "owner": "reylopulalan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920723521173132, "text": "Swap from nerd to jerk depending on the mood", "created_at": "2025-10-02T03:37:11", "owner": "cafeconron.ron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978712413763965, "text": "So my ex was gay", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:33:25", "owner": "auvaman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295652413302051, "text": "Sí soy y ni modo", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:27:11", "owner": "mauricio.gmz.prz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865513411395572, "text": "What if ur none r u man?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:19:53", "owner": "ipmille_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040597778464910, "text": "I see this woman doesn't know how to use a radar chart, otherwise known as spider chart", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:52:29", "owner": "lil_memer_diego", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978367419766439, "text": "No dumb gay jerks? I feel like I run into a lot of them....", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:58:40", "owner": "mike.sanchez.12532364", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900696901275619, "text": "Soy gey", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:54:38", "owner": "escalamarfrito", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844344712573935, "text": "There are 3 traits that men possess, y’all need to pick 2. Good dick, good person, or got his act together. Pick 2. -Josh Johnson", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:55:01", "owner": "elfkingave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855275455538443, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:51:27", "owner": "djmflaxb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859470628509817, "text": "So technically a gay is a dumb nerd jerk", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:48:01", "owner": "tirsholl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058161563407812, "text": "Wow, what a way to learn that you are gay..", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:38:20", "owner": "sidvale_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097480177730723, "text": "Gurllllllll", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:31:41", "owner": "thekinshukzone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982086279911896, "text": "False", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:29:45", "owner": "nsintheor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965731524817532, "text": "That's absolutely right", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:14:35", "owner": "evlenrt_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903864592256544, "text": "Ig theyre talking about me", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:42:49", "owner": "_the_first_sunlight_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127634563483328, "text": "@albatross0312 handsome + smart + nice", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:35:26", "owner": "call.me.hnah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096666928669907, "text": "Gay = jerk + nerd + dumb ?🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:25:59", "owner": "oleg_cotic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984719997857302, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:12:42", "owner": "norberto_frerichs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482139691076670, "text": "So they all gay 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:09:51", "owner": "shaheeda2019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069067913248140, "text": "i am none of these", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:52:00", "owner": "potatoisustm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897550972298414, "text": "i fw dumb men so its fine", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:06:13", "owner": "dururuuuru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079983298990033, "text": "I'm smart , handsome but I'm a bad person,what am I?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:51:33", "owner": "anton.eig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848816803569143, "text": "если бы пересечение кругов было правдой", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:19:13", "owner": "molch.ph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114372529539876, "text": "Why is nerd the opposite of handsome 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:04:33", "owner": "pancake_lver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859511734508888, "text": "Old but gold", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:28:43", "owner": "abidin.dicle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956594736861450, "text": "gay propaganda", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:04:54", "owner": "thisisaarushh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073153940465870, "text": "wish that was true", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:33:30", "owner": "mamuangaroymak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891846781346439, "text": "I just learned that I'm not gay but a nerd, going back to default settings then 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:11:45", "owner": "jc_josephcailloux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854090140492217, "text": "thanks for calling me handsome smart and nice", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:01:03", "owner": "voodoo_065", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935964079084701, "text": "@shikharsalgarkar", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:00:42", "owner": "ddgop22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903893620257939, "text": "I’m a groyper not a fag", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:29:19", "owner": "ovoleno_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238167742293712, "text": "Gay propaganda", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:20:35", "owner": "iam_abdullahnoman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087569911920451, "text": "Gay———————————————————>", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:13:22", "owner": "pcyshilo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042090521426379, "text": "Dumb", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:43:16", "owner": "coldmintteaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064397474591538, "text": "Gay nerds? Where??", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:53:24", "owner": "rikardo.leitte", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949693320898905, "text": "i'll take nerd 1000 days an hour every single second of existence. worse fates than your dude being nice and smart.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:46:56", "owner": "real_jnledoux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949029873905886, "text": "Why are people acting like this doesn’t also apply to women and non binary people.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:16:14", "owner": "neck.sock", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902375005260849, "text": "Well that’s the truth", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:19:48", "owner": "scotland598", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063662087093190, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:05:41", "owner": "yahabibialby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965584680972056, "text": "Stupid chart. Venn would not like it. He was handsome, smart, and by all accounts nice.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:10:36", "owner": "rarelytherein404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911899219211534, "text": "Am I gay!?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T00:41:01", "owner": "stevan_molinar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184250452326889, "text": "My bf is gaaay?", "created_at": "2025-09-30T23:16:39", "owner": "nemoox34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102380338556857, "text": "Whenever someone calls me gay in the future I am going to take it as a compliment now…", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:33:38", "owner": "johannes_is_bulking", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858873082512899, "text": "Jerk + nerd + dumb = gay😭😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T20:57:26", "owner": "itzlucasboy1010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292226677281523, "text": "I'm not gay 😏 (joke)", "created_at": "2025-09-30T18:38:41", "owner": "alex_dujardin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873036919429112, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:40:54", "owner": "llamo_oliver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343341715201546, "text": "I'm only nice guy i guess 😭😭 would love to be nerd", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:01:47", "owner": "0xmertcan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085094998920572, "text": "I WOULD LOVE A NERD 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T15:25:11", "owner": "wt.alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900675577147662, "text": "Why cant nerds be handsome?", "created_at": "2025-09-30T15:20:16", "owner": "antoniomattia.imperatoriziaco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178844431354406, "text": "I’m the fn nerd at best", "created_at": "2025-09-29T19:08:00", "owner": "1988rocker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118253116506369, "text": "I’m the nerd 🤓", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:45:25", "owner": "blazemoreside", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093165073740513, "text": "As s gay man: where are these gays you're talking about? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:52:39", "owner": "cynicdreamer_1q87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115835446525525, "text": "I'm pretty sure there is another option besides gay. They call it just a friend", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:08:34", "owner": "leonardoaccorinte", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869123794377525, "text": "Who ever made this post is in the middle", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:49:47", "owner": "_.ktg11._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936205044962173, "text": "pride here @callmemadin_ @pnd.tr", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:07:20", "owner": "xxviivmmxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034812005686751, "text": "Not in Australia it’s the other way around, I wish they were gay herr", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:42:58", "owner": "zac_aendo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981326958864693, "text": "So I'm Gay?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:32:41", "owner": "ferdinan_ariel_sidauruk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079735691099247, "text": "so truuuuuuuuuuue", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:32:33", "owner": "projectbys_8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938981518078817, "text": "True", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:11:09", "owner": "thissdano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088253302680708, "text": "50 50 dumb gay", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:08:18", "owner": "matthew_deere", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041611490689836, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T08:44:43", "owner": "helloekarina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097364089632305, "text": "@campbelldoesmaths super handsome and nice", "created_at": "2025-09-29T08:39:22", "owner": "bailey_0_923", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080280592970771, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:53:49", "owner": "itsyour__deepu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079584716312604, "text": "D", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:37:54", "owner": "rfah_levi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098003650655233, "text": "give me hot nice and dumb i beg of u", "created_at": "2025-09-29T06:42:29", "owner": "adore.esme.now", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383931670126427, "text": "Guess i am the first straight gay", "created_at": "2025-09-29T05:36:56", "owner": "lethalcereal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068792606211558, "text": "Değilim gay değilim", "created_at": "2025-09-29T05:36:05", "owner": "emrhn3kv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045147731351311, "text": "I’m dumb", "created_at": "2025-09-29T05:06:20", "owner": "friendscallmeshiba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18159534445346999, "text": "Married in the middle 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:17:59", "owner": "tarik_karam_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880901191395646, "text": "U never seen any handsome nerd? Poor you 😏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:16:25", "owner": "samyangrosebuldak13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078970934053242, "text": "This is why himbos and nerds always top the charts huh", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:11:09", "owner": "riot.dog.onyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925244557137126, "text": "Gay people ARE NOT ANY OF THEM 3", "created_at": "2025-09-29T03:44:50", "owner": "iamoperator21o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092199259756926, "text": "Accurate", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:58:46", "owner": "rei.boss.mom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943327777048258, "text": "im okay with nerd", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:56:14", "owner": "ailurophilemylove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079331486490751, "text": "i think ill go with jerks", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:34:30", "owner": "nisaabasoglu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104841814611783, "text": "GIMME THE NERD !!!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:38:28", "owner": "naenaetabs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855666850476762, "text": "Damnit", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:12:20", "owner": "karink675", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078349168836641, "text": "gospel", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:03:11", "owner": "charrles_of_kent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066193025341299, "text": "Girls turn 18 and decide one of these three types", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:53:25", "owner": "aest.fit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089688928889021, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:08:07", "owner": "_sameergupta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091459030794472, "text": "@saikia_arpit 💋", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:29:16", "owner": "__sheekhaa__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325904290237271, "text": "Gay and unavailable tho", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:09:10", "owner": "nothingtoofear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175377529345508, "text": "Everyman is a bit of everything, and we keep loving them for that—just as they do for us. The rest can be kept outside. Life is a compromise, especially when you are in a couple, whether with a man, a woman, or someone who identifies as a goat.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:00:00", "owner": "emmanuelle.epl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080256323058508, "text": "So thats what girls mean when they say that they think im gay ✨", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:55:31", "owner": "_ahkha_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904286164121243, "text": "People often think I'm gay, nice compliment I guess", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:47:57", "owner": "steelwix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138660871442657, "text": "You just cant win", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:04:13", "owner": "abu_romi_alaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113624968532255, "text": "ok this explains why I like nerds 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:03:29", "owner": "chezishani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078730510834466, "text": "Im gay now apparently", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:01:55", "owner": "_tkm47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935587765083032, "text": "That's why bi men are special.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T18:44:36", "owner": "gustavo.suna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927291274129426, "text": "Nerd reporting for duty 🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-28T18:44:15", "owner": "legocolin1102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081668830965430, "text": "What's wrong with nerds? :(", "created_at": "2025-09-28T18:23:24", "owner": "ramfam.png", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045467942354359, "text": "اقتنعت", "created_at": "2025-09-28T18:21:10", "owner": "1heotp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139138228428230, "text": "Wait, what am I then?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T18:17:44", "owner": "leonardosibela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880657432394393, "text": "Nerd here", "created_at": "2025-09-28T18:10:19", "owner": "saman_spirited", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034450751501772, "text": "I guess I'm gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:57:40", "owner": "call.me.saamba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098174941730782, "text": "Ohhhh I get it now", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:08:09", "owner": "killapoptart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064519691342928, "text": "You forgot \"TAKEN\"", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:05:29", "owner": "liam.wie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077496464095411, "text": "Or trans ☺️☺️🥰🥰 lesbian 😝😝😈😈", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:02:15", "owner": "mylie_deacon_129", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985672707729085, "text": "It’s more complicated than this, but this still hits hard at the heart", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:47:48", "owner": "yinyangloki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081112849998340, "text": "Is this why everyone thinks I'm gay?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:28:35", "owner": "telecarlster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888995500358978, "text": "Thank god I’m not nice", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:23:31", "owner": "vlad.sedin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013324994613417, "text": "So gay people was dumb jerk nerd. Okay, I will remember!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:21:51", "owner": "tuthur5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991985589698682, "text": "What if I’m just nice and dumb", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:21:35", "owner": "christiantookthis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430462237097574, "text": "My husband is not so smart and gay but is also handsome and nice which is why he’s a dumb gay. I call him my golden retriever husband. No thoughts. Just happy.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:10:26", "owner": "justaboo456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082621919488995, "text": "I'm a jerker", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:43:50", "owner": "gurisunconsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066548111199122, "text": "This made me really sad", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:32:18", "owner": "myuberliciouslife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099386758575898, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:32:04", "owner": "maha.matin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088357681889310, "text": "🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:15:00", "owner": "bethnocle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094078738690404, "text": "seconded.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:04:23", "owner": "tupagalhaikyadiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060264074126481, "text": "All i got is Nice i think 😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:00:35", "owner": "radarinthai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521493340062873, "text": "Where's rich??", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:56:20", "owner": "repiapriliaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965324016969075, "text": "Gay guys are fucking stupid a lot of the time what", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:51:03", "owner": "imessiahcomplex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070994396218463, "text": "Phew at least I'm not handsome", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:49:59", "owner": "drichm2599", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152968963361130, "text": "It’s a vicious cycle but I can’t help but be butt hurt by it. 😉", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:44:01", "owner": "the_bearded_tactician", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056577914432686, "text": "Nerd is good i will stick with that", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:41:13", "owner": "rundfull", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079427723058073, "text": "I would choose nerd any day", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:23:40", "owner": "diya.sharma_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934155058098083, "text": "so am i gay?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:38:42", "owner": "darrennting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075871480870978, "text": "as a gay, thank you", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:33:21", "owner": "reza_notebook", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040808786439573, "text": "Nem os gays estão sendo bonitos, legais e inteligentes ao msm tempo", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:22:31", "owner": "aleks.fsiq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031017863713436, "text": "😭😭😭😭😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:19:30", "owner": "hannah_abdulhamid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073646132174207, "text": "whats wrong with nerds", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:00:48", "owner": "alp_kirte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108722848564175, "text": "Team nerd here ahaha", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:43:37", "owner": "weyoun16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074843459112051, "text": "The nerd one is not that bad...", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:38:44", "owner": "chiccen_tori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045443732346588, "text": "“Pretty, smart, nice girls are just Lezbo’s HA”", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:38:19", "owner": "thehappyjoelucky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049937957319203, "text": "So where am I?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:33:39", "owner": "paulusungirwalu7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992210409698629, "text": "Your telling me henry cavill is gay ?🤔😏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:33:28", "owner": "scorned_spirit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073765445320053, "text": "Hm I don't mind", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:24:31", "owner": "sama_goodman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017011805783360, "text": "Yes I'm gay for my girl I identify as a lesbian", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:16:26", "owner": "derbaji_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058660796539115, "text": "Time for coming out??😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:07:49", "owner": "sahil_prasad_0705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058865945426987, "text": "May be gays realised that women don't deserve perfect men", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:01:46", "owner": "val.valtron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944971324046088, "text": "Noooo... Where is Autism", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:52:35", "owner": "unknownjefy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078668722830630, "text": "Can i get smart, handsome, nerd, and nice", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:47:50", "owner": "may_lano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883374982260949, "text": "Best gays are biiii ppl (me hehe) :3", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:47:24", "owner": "_sri_k_2.71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941126587063256, "text": "I am not dumb???? I am autistic 😤😤😤", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:38:45", "owner": "erikkukukuku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064792640603585, "text": "Where’s broke?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:31:53", "owner": "jennydoncha", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18076992635475014, "text": "I am gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:29:42", "owner": "amen_the_iroon_moon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866079871462138, "text": "Thank god im neither smart nor good", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:20:33", "owner": "emiraslaner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845222089562380, "text": "im getting married and can assure you, men are not nice or smart but they’re handsome ig.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:17:03", "owner": "https.geazsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527798092042499, "text": "What’s the negativity in nerds?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:07:49", "owner": "greencasta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18317513263245256, "text": "If he's gay, it means he's dumb", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:01:20", "owner": "cnstllx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063418430347083, "text": "Ikigay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:57:46", "owner": "kalajengpink", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18070695382975115, "text": "\"Man\" is outside all circles", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:52:27", "owner": "dakshoutofcontext", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925367167116090, "text": "yeah, they're just \"gay\"😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:51:06", "owner": "ttalgiyogoteuu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18202020763311934, "text": "nerds are good bro", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:50:33", "owner": "t4ni.bjork", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18042632897400117, "text": "I need to become a jerk", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:49:17", "owner": "db153yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097161307654699, "text": "Gay is in the middle", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:34:12", "owner": "susana_7899", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913406818199014, "text": "😂😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:30:07", "owner": "smileyshreya_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042051905697197, "text": "Can confirm", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:28:43", "owner": "knktwink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087470731705770, "text": "@daspacematador I win. Jerk it is. Love life lately", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:23:51", "owner": "hadarontheradar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526178569022040, "text": "Oh shit didnt know i was gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:21:09", "owner": "matija.cujzek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978556317761503, "text": "Can confirm. My boyfriend is all 3 ans is indeed a lesbian", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:18:42", "owner": "call_me_nex_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058404887390890, "text": "🤨🤨🤨🤨", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:18:40", "owner": "raraasas_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311820976170777, "text": "Gotta try my luck with ladies now 😏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:18:11", "owner": "zyxwvuts_q_onmlkjihgfed_ba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083076652909411, "text": "Handsome dumb nice😁", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:15:02", "owner": "maximus_barinos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058033034168868, "text": "Do the math", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:13:15", "owner": "madeteryy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931565487980853, "text": "WHAAT?!😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:08:11", "owner": "kiramdanii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072942464137252, "text": "only the gays winning", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:07:56", "owner": "haifa_zeepriv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972292719944741, "text": "I guess am gay 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:07:15", "owner": "ri.g.oo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096838816588772, "text": "I guess I am Gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:05:02", "owner": "theycallomer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061255406113011, "text": "…..always😢", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:04:06", "owner": "heike.landsherr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063712571360667, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:03:10", "owner": "hsarawh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859175761507805, "text": "Cool, now i know that i am actually nice and pretending to be works, And that i am handsome. Cool", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:59:51", "owner": "instalex_64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068695859594629, "text": "Anything but red zone :)", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:59:36", "owner": "alifiansyah.id", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110842078553663, "text": "@astxy is it true??", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:54:54", "owner": "heemin__0819", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944578803924620, "text": "N. E. R. D", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:52:25", "owner": "janco1571", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966836202970771, "text": "@mauryarohan11", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:46:23", "owner": "_naynaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083461049297055, "text": "Damn I am gay 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:45:26", "owner": "jaiis60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910060480090320, "text": "I don’t know where they at tho", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:45:01", "owner": "sanzgreus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983307729905077, "text": "Luckily, I don't have any of the three.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:44:49", "owner": "aydnaltok", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091206595836715, "text": "Nerd", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:40:51", "owner": "chinnariaksharsai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064916384605164, "text": "Im taking the nerd home!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:35:28", "owner": "nzart_03", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991836930839787, "text": "Never seen something so accurate", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:34:37", "owner": "your_deewangi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058185254159432, "text": "I must not be handsome then 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:34:25", "owner": "matthewisanchez", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18098994250649720, "text": "😭😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:26:41", "owner": "sheyda.seyedin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040556459695193, "text": "Nerd supremacy", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:21:47", "owner": "creature._.from._.gublerland", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941741557059075, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:17:34", "owner": "petelawton0970", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17909406147235090, "text": "What if I’m a jerk but not smart of handsome? Am I a woman?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:10:43", "owner": "deedo550", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18145833664417041, "text": "Me is this guy… yes, im gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:08:22", "owner": "superdicasfree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075615806319885, "text": "Are you saying that nerd = not handsome = ugly ?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:07:13", "owner": "yaskazharfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872773819428847, "text": "Is this true I’m 9 yo and I’m scared 😳", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:54:28", "owner": "agbruuh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043240484666092, "text": "I dont wanna be gay tho", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:51:12", "owner": "iamerkutb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093906451702465, "text": "Nerds are hot", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:50:25", "owner": "codex_sunrise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061910204611869, "text": "Well well well I don't come in this vein diagram. I am ugly and dumb. I am not gay you can't hurt me with it", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:50:24", "owner": "519_pepe_gurung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041108711448844, "text": "When I suspect u as gay, please take it as compliment", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:44:39", "owner": "deviaridharma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894093832337524, "text": "duhh🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:41:42", "owner": "engineersuksess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886526743242519, "text": "I'm cool with being dumb", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:34:48", "owner": "gabe_tdm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166828354375244, "text": "Understood ,gay is jerk gay is dumb gay is nerd", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:31:11", "owner": "zhaokunbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072427901135359, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:23:19", "owner": "valiullovm1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121937635496334, "text": "Can we get something outside of the three categories?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:22:35", "owner": "loganpatrick050406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975735222926484, "text": "Tagging the most smartest handsome and nicest guy @thepiyushjoshi", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:21:26", "owner": "_aryan_0o7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857478007518274, "text": "the white outside: antiblack", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:17:50", "owner": "hndiksptra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068717906250239, "text": "I am all the of these things but never all three at the same timE", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:14:28", "owner": "youreternalbeing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040347728454202, "text": "Accurate af😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:13:14", "owner": "_heypragya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079942555980123, "text": "Well well I am a nerd again. I m proud", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:12:40", "owner": "beon2097", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095920354734500, "text": "Most of nerds are not nice💀", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:10:06", "owner": "o_.piccolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077259203080736, "text": "Nope I'm not ?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:09:29", "owner": "stuart.foley11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969848925951741, "text": "Nerds.😍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:08:54", "owner": "diesesarahda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529361662002796, "text": "Idk what to say on this post, just a word...... accurate", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:08:39", "owner": "zira_742", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844028221573681, "text": "So the Whitespace around the circle is Men?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:06:29", "owner": "sunnydagamer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080222521960166, "text": "Dumb >>>", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:06:11", "owner": "majapahi.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067004858194692, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:01:54", "owner": "deryaunalkose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077570783080136, "text": "Nice, gay, depending in the situation 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:58:41", "owner": "arff.na2308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986430864891362, "text": ":(", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:55:08", "owner": "s.rka__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070172606231855, "text": "Ahh I see. My husband is gay. Always had my suspicions", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:53:56", "owner": "aditee.kadam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979931685755606, "text": "Anyone from guwahati Assam?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:53:30", "owner": "shim7771685", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055029947537563, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:46:37", "owner": "kougananki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098976172567307, "text": "Oh,that's why my friend calls me gay.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:43:48", "owner": "thearyaanamiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908334346239591, "text": "Hey I AM NOT A JERK! (But I won't admit I am nice either)", "create