ikes": 0}, {"id": 18043888115384226, "text": "lavender marriage doesn't seem so bad afterall", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:54:22", "owner": "rahmandakaitt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118119112509463, "text": "I am definitely not a nice man", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:53:32", "owner": "vadim_fcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865150186396719, "text": "checks out, i’m a nerd", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:52:23", "owner": "chholeybhaturepaglu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085752472917764, "text": "I think I'm dumb", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:52:05", "owner": "ovnbun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091523242772142, "text": "parking my car in yellow", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:47:28", "owner": "rude_awakening.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058953887627010, "text": "😭🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:46:13", "owner": "_the.maurya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098705767566368, "text": "No place for ugly ?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:36:43", "owner": "chapri_bhai98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357294508080195, "text": "so you mean the ultimate sigma male are gay😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:32:49", "owner": "lingpan9999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868514380378258, "text": "The only green flag men these days are gay😭.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:32:37", "owner": "lil.moonxx_3435", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054565376543273, "text": "Nothing from any circle and intersection 🙂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:27:34", "owner": "kaustubh_nc19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099951040620821, "text": "Mai to lesbian hu", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:25:59", "owner": "h9rmnnprizzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062581439085963, "text": "I didn't know i like girls and still i am called gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:25:40", "owner": "_shree_ansh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075612454889471, "text": "Accurate unfortunately", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:23:28", "owner": "bunnymonnex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054635819232945, "text": "That's not how vemn diagrams work", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:22:57", "owner": "ramanuja_daasan_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18097615390729884, "text": "Victim mentality", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:20:57", "owner": "__.yoshioka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172046878362570, "text": "Trueee👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:15:31", "owner": "hyorabae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909561913230009, "text": "Apparently my husband is gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:08:24", "owner": "liv.dickson91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079899430956918, "text": "ok give m a dumb😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:04:50", "owner": "quy_anha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422588188128348, "text": "The way many gay men are actually just dumb gay jerks 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:01:24", "owner": "jonnyparable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329566534232993, "text": "Why i gotta be gay?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:56:34", "owner": "abustaif_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067297553259409, "text": "Where does Henry cavil fit in this brotha is a big nerd", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:55:21", "owner": "notsoslientman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079709584814879, "text": "Soo my husband is gay??😳", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:53:18", "owner": "diamon_ite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187967152325630, "text": "this is the most accurate thing i’ve ever seen", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:52:32", "owner": "safetyy.netttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238897417292834, "text": "Nice handsome get used so they are dumb or nice means dumb as long people can take benefits from you", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:51:10", "owner": "rishavaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135840490403431, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:46:24", "owner": "chlooecho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081798125305221, "text": "Sir I’m gay but I do not think I’m handsome 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:44:51", "owner": "jeells_teells", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980180346869011, "text": "What about a gay nerd who is a dumb jerk? …", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:43:51", "owner": "pain_with_a_taste_of_hope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093644410742887, "text": "SBNBM😔", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:37:58", "owner": "joshua_young040", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995602335686252, "text": "I love men", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:35:55", "owner": "leonardoolanciaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081192022957616, "text": "What's wrong with nerds? I love me a nerdy guy. They never run out of conversation topics, they can always make me laugh, they're sweet and loyal. Don't sleep on the nerds, for real.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:33:10", "owner": "baboone2011", "likes": 931}, {"id": 17844748713567582, "text": "Everything in between 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:32:18", "owner": "ronmee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924958861130868, "text": "Gay with ADHD 😆", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:30:02", "owner": "fyro16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985225602854820, "text": "I may not be any of those 3 but I promise you will have my heart :)", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:27:21", "owner": "malach1crocker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097019332730440, "text": "🫴", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:27:00", "owner": "rautsatyam952", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18409936738116845, "text": "Yesv", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:26:54", "owner": "micchin_sekkhi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18166435459370601, "text": "Me in San Francisco: can he please not be gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:25:46", "owner": "itskate.pm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058303955387566, "text": "WHY, OH WHY 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:23:05", "owner": "nkvenus_writer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096301798655520, "text": "🎯🤌🏿", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:22:09", "owner": "davidokikiamayojr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876516070413297, "text": "So according to this the ideal man as per woman doesn't even like women, noted.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:09:42", "owner": "aditya__.13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879168001402567, "text": "🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:08:43", "owner": "juraveragejoe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101364769618297, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:08:38", "owner": "x.vardhanx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080810413805101, "text": "See how women objectify men as gay when all requirements are met? And cry after choosing wrong men!. Not all women but always a woman.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:06:48", "owner": "aa_suiii_his.lo_ol.10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949530706019740, "text": "😌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:05:34", "owner": "branadane", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067164626349029, "text": "where's autistic", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:59:52", "owner": "3piecenuggethappymeal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916393066195094, "text": "Ooooo thats why my friend think i am gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:57:53", "owner": "ardacelalsimsek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095944267735198, "text": "Oh this how u guys finding ...., so I'm also straight gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:56:43", "owner": "ramesh.0_03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929826166100383, "text": "Idk I’ve met a lot of mean gay men. They just aren’t mean to your face", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:56:40", "owner": "nacho_in_a_pancho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960529623842358, "text": "aight here we go 🚶‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:52:10", "owner": "rashouuumon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18386331064135948, "text": "I'll take the nice one (that's me)", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:51:41", "owner": "x__ashley_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18404717614136764, "text": "So all men are...", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:46:41", "owner": "h.a.r.i_.hp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001922165657299, "text": "Hello fellow nerds ☝🏻🤓", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:36:14", "owner": "ems.robert", "likes": 219}, {"id": 18091776649692133, "text": "Men in thia era 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:29:06", "owner": "chussty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17934675011964473, "text": "NERDS FOREVER!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:28:02", "owner": "raptr_rah_rah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900552262147381, "text": "......how dare you", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:25:55", "owner": "thehomecookhomie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982035414911691, "text": "what if im not nice, not handsome, not smart?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:24:33", "owner": "rylix_04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949464169015285, "text": "Where’s racist?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:21:28", "owner": "turtle_skewers_", "likes": 8516}, {"id": 18176081764345851, "text": "Need a nerd🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:13:42", "owner": "palemoonlightvixen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18533077048062603, "text": "L", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:10:29", "owner": "skierzac", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983952777887263, "text": "It appears that you have a flawed concept of what a man is, maybe spend more time with your father?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:03:37", "owner": "commer_weedsons", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058380275430277, "text": "Nice guy is the only one which has 4 cons", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:52:54", "owner": "suraj_gad3kar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368043310151762, "text": "Ok….", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:51:03", "owner": "ibr_remote", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18363014218156920, "text": "Nice to know I’m atl half handsome (I’m bi)", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:42:40", "owner": "zedwiraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077604347081061, "text": "Thank god I aint handsome smart or nice", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:42:05", "owner": "yeet_0g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057392567441504, "text": "It's a good thing I'm none of these", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:40:25", "owner": "airheadluffyya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948428245042322, "text": "So did you just tell me all the guy is gay 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:36:09", "owner": "nurafa18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18329622997235082, "text": "Dumb = bhondu.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:32:59", "owner": "the_kingdoms_treasure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968346012956513, "text": "ugly, jerk, dumb is probably not a man but a damn ugli dawg (this is directed to that one animal who told its male friends to just get a lady pregnant to have her for yourself instead of giving a good advice to approach the fine lady)", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:3