nder marriage", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:52:10", "owner": "kumquat76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986225646895065, "text": "I'm not handsome", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:51:26", "owner": "leballsman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085580674918129, "text": "Smart and gay? Never", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:42:14", "owner": "adolf_jakson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078597500060997, "text": "@loooopppaa 제가좋아햇던 연예인들이 다 게이였던 이유...", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:40:45", "owner": "phoebe.soy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058255985160286, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:37:32", "owner": "vorpirs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292971277282216, "text": "what if im none", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:31:36", "owner": "benridenour_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097062574660622, "text": "I did not know if I’m a nerd or dumb", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:24:51", "owner": "abeljhart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041624408442413, "text": "Opposite of nice = jerk opposite of smart = dumb opposite of handsome=nerd?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:24:17", "owner": "ericmgrigsby", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884756074382658, "text": "Why is everyone gay?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:21:42", "owner": "neil.bru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018308021774989, "text": "Ngl handsome is so subjective i just want a smart/nice guy, thats enough to get me going", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:14:36", "owner": "jarvishutchinsonnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201085912311773, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:10:44", "owner": "arielroez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916796500056226, "text": "🏳️‍🌈", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:10:02", "owner": "lunacy._.garden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018824411592068, "text": "All dumb and g@y", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:09:44", "owner": "aandrewbartlett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934307908086416, "text": "Nerd here🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:06:31", "owner": "miranda_jmg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390602056121430, "text": "oh i'm gay", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:04:24", "owner": "conan_keeeee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084249868741619, "text": "Nice and handsome, but I'm lost after that..", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:00:18", "owner": "thebobodarling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098346115725556, "text": "I'm not Handsome, Smart or Nice.. just an ordinary Man..", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:57:06", "owner": "wickyw_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051612398647942, "text": "Where is racist?!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:55:48", "owner": "marketingmert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084073303907833, "text": "Why can’t a be a dumb gay jerk???", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:44:26", "owner": "tajames24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044836883372115, "text": "😂 so the perfect man doesn't want you!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:43:23", "owner": "snowblasted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044390363356762, "text": "Born to be gay, forced to be a jerk 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:42:34", "owner": "yourshinyboy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055534040631337, "text": "I guess im just nice... I think?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:41:51", "owner": "lauti.fernandez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044020751380499, "text": "Nerd here 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:41:16", "owner": "r_a_j_e_e_t_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867281380452119, "text": "Lmaooo I’m gay af then", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:37:05", "owner": "tsunyaami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922949842119707, "text": "The man matrix", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:32:36", "owner": "rainbowdog23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335441449201795, "text": "Emmm Cavil?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:31:15", "owner": "pablo_sougarret_palacios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087847774857322, "text": "Not handsome, not smart, not Nice. Im a Man", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:28:44", "owner": "eleonmmr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883319221264062, "text": "Nigga here", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:27:54", "owner": "ezequiel.lmm", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18111663850547258, "text": "What if I’m outside of all these circles", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:19:45", "owner": "mahoney_yu", "likes"