: "my bf is gay", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:12:05", "owner": "dlrchr", "likes": 143}, {"id": 18080251345956640, "text": "Yes we are", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:04:41", "owner": "true_manga_reader14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18185823940328650, "text": "So gay are epitome of men?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:55:59", "owner": "khush.29.04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289799620257056, "text": "Joke on you I'm bi", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:18:22", "owner": "zak0620k", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17946313797044618, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:50:00", "owner": "saifspoken", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18053248673253536, "text": "Im kinda a nerd but lowk kinda gay too 👉👈 Idk if im handsome.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:20:46", "owner": "arbiiigj", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18097571287639082, "text": "Nerd here", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:06:21", "owner": "sawant.animesh", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18068706731519860, "text": "My girl said im gay", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:06:12", "owner": "true.samuel", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18091253935796109, "text": "gay here", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:30:52", "owner": "apex_skittles", "likes": 3559}, {"id": 18062774858093201, "text": "I am @ag2002923", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:03:36", "owner": "octdaksh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18398059177139178, "text": "Guys, I’m coming out🤗", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:43:02", "owner": "albird.o", "likes": 195}, {"id": 18060900377575342, "text": "I'm definitely all of those things", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:16:11", "owner": "jede_flop", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18045313976357333, "text": "Certainly", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:57:14", "owner": "darkk_001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058633688166501, "text": "Dumb af reporting for duty", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:17:43", "owner": "_busmate_", "likes": 1290}, {"id": 17994263876731944, "text": "Im none of these execpt gay", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:52:46", "owner": "jew.anhilator.3000", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17971244795942069, "text": "What do you call that white space around the circles?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:25:59", "owner": "tannerwillmott", "likes": 1675}, {"id": 17975594366926824, "text": "I'm a dumb nerdy ugly and gay jerk", "created_at": "2025-09-27T01:56:23", "owner": "ag2002923", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18374080177146996, "text": "Nah they out of everything", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:36:24", "owner": "mr.rickfish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18267160387304490, "text": "Jerk here", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:18:27", "owner": "amg64575", "likes": 1243}, {"id": 18101504266624087, "text": "I dont fit into your box", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:36:30", "owner": "yournewstepdab", "likes": 8}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["hridnic", "playlsd", "london_love"]},
{"media_id": 3740539711832748255, "shortcode": "DPpEQy4CHDf", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPpEQy4CHDf/", "taken_at": "2025-10-10T20:12:20", "caption": "No one is saying no to that, this is a saxmike production #biologymemes #chemistrymemes", "owner_username": "ssaxmike", "owner_id": "71531631694", "likes": 397010, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0046_DPpEQy4CHDf\\DPpEQy4CHDf_20251010_201220.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18069305999245013, "text": "“0% absolute error, yes that’s right, we are just too precise “", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:16:00", "owner": "imf.rocketspace", "likes": 23404}, {"id": 18091133650885074, "text": "Dear my research supervisor I liked this post because it was funny and not at all relatable whatsoever", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:30:16", "owner": "_samcharlton_", "likes": 4990}, {"id": 18027576392754071, "text": "Then you have to graph it in excel and the teacher makes u redo ur experiment because its way off from where its supposed to be 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:49:35", "owner": "dark_dxgger", "likes": 2945}, {"id": 17959752074868269, "text": "Do you wanna just train the model twice and go home?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:18:40", "owner": "fru._fruuu", "likes": 6324}, {"id": 17948743098046327, "text": "The lion doesn't concern himself with the ethical principals of such called \"lab research\"", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:25:03", "owner": "osama.nbs", "likes": 27630}, {"id": 18043429541462700, "text": "Dear current employer, I am reflecting on the times in which I was in academia. I do not fake lab results at work. Thank you kindly HR.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T20:37:03", "owner": "williamfischer7", "likes": 419}, {"id": 18060693914527790, "text": "The lion copies other lions lab results and says i got the same results", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:30:37", "owner": "ctto_george", "likes": 119}, {"id": 18093634810744916, "text": "%100 accaptance 🙀 what a wonderful leader his country must improve too fast 🐱", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:25:14", "owner": "broken_bubble0", "likes": 74}, {"id": 18076198916320888, "text": "Me with my fellow cancer researchers", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:31:21", "owner": "caboose_flyer1280102938392", "likes": 1327}, {"id": 18081231575058202, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:10:33", "owner": "frostyms1468", "likes": 570}, {"id": 18028814249528579, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:37:57", "owner": "benhoxie_6", "likes": 964}, {"id": 17883925779281896, "text": "My lab partner and I literally did this yesterday in dissolved oxygen lab 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:28:51", "owner": "tshiminy_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17890982277348925, "text": "Dear my research supervisor I liked this post because it was funny and not at all relatable whatsoever.\nSincerely, Sydi.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T01:07:39", "owner": "siditawfiq", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18054507401307802, "text": "Love how my lab partner sent me this", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:09:12", "owner": "hahatanasha", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17982191348909914, "text": "Disclaimer: liked this reel because it was funny, not relatable. I do not take my results and all are 100% real. I found the post humorous, and also frightening, as it highlights how RAs may change lab results. But it also creates the question: why are they doing this? It’s it because they are overworked? This prompts further research. Please don’t fire me", "created_at": "2025-10-15T01:27:07", "owner": "tylarmacintyre", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18085673077746244, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:16:29", "owner": "krhikeman87", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18131102290481250, "text": "Guilty as charged, that was me 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:33:53", "owner": "ellie.krmi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061079885152633, "text": "Which series is the soundtrack from?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:05:38", "owner": "m.boltaboyev", "likes": 107}, {"id": 17938137858086329, "text": "@ro2se2005 احنا", "created_at": "2025-10-14T15:00:38", "owner": "r_0ay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090811456852993, "text": "To my academic advisor, I am liking this post because it’s relatable, not because it’s funny", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:00:00", "owner": "matthewharrison1510", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081951761080508, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T23:36:52", "owner": "daniyal_217", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18043825226415367, "text": "Can confirm this happened", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:23:07", "owner": "iamjasonwa", "likes": 153}, {"id": 18001161848820633, "text": "\"Wym -2200% error is not acceptable 😢\"", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:52:20", "owner": "freddmendd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17918565708190886, "text": "Titration karra tha dark blue ki jagah pink kaise hogya😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:03:11", "owner": "2phoneathar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17900300169308386, "text": "At some point I had an excel table that would sample points if a specific function with randomized relative error in a range included.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:15:09", "owner": "toybchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067656890084554, "text": "@ryee.offside ?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:48:56", "owner": "leiru.so", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887195878403674, "text": "@gai.a_ @sofiias.macchi @basilicoilico noi", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:30:01", "owner": "luca.pal05", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18170871019369468, "text": "I liked this post due to its funniness. It does not represent my views, past, present, or future research.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T21:28:12", "owner": "rafaelpetouris", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043786064436413, "text": "Not when you get g=-3879 m/s^2", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:16:40", "owner": "pj_rwt", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18167506966336773, "text": "Bro had to make sure", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:51:10", "owner": "tanqueguardia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965459076826170, "text": "\"proclaim the party anthem and leave the room\"", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:21:46", "owner": "lindsay_campher", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856097332540028, "text": "25381% error due to human error and environmental noise", "created_at": "2025-10-13T04:11:55", "owner": "shariik.gd", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071870533986961, "text": "No way, integrity is a core value of mine. I will never fail to uphold my identity as an honest, moral person.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T10:55:29", "owner": "darrellho_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17845777299596891, "text": "@radrai1385 anything but faking the titration 🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:07:29", "owner": "not85.om", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080058083163182, "text": "@hamz.aa9613 @m_d9008 bio type shit (but hamza always gets the trend reversed)", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:08:54", "owner": "omarsigmabond123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069895163585085, "text": "@anass_fae dosageeee😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:31:27", "owner": "amin.belghith", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080832791151542, "text": "To the PUB ‼️‼️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:28:03", "owner": "tom_ewart14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873242455355013, "text": "Everyone is chill until someone did it in their medical research", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:08:01", "owner": "raf1damri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100654765641546, "text": "The action of double clicking of a random ‘meme’ content does not correlate with the manner in which the subject conducts their manner in labs.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T02:07:40", "owner": "dhsusudtyzj", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056476256635361, "text": "But grades are more important than going home early😂😂 Rather spend extra half an hour to make sure nothing goes wrong than to go home early and realise you screwed up the results💀", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:32:01", "owner": "ehbroclub", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846490234591280, "text": "Doing two replicates instead of three 😐 ... (Just saying)", "created_at": "2025-10-24T00:00:13", "owner": "amine_elbouzidi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18486862540078187, "text": "Tried this today ➡️ Faked correct results➡️ Turns  out wrong buffer was provided ➡️ Got caught ➡️ Disqualified from the exam ➡️ Never again 🫠", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:37:10", "owner": "h0tshot_uwu_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17858963976527699, "text": "110% Yield, does that sound reasonable? Yep, sure does to me.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:55:08", "owner": "jamesmnguyen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895509190340198, "text": "110% reaction yield 🗿", "created_at": "2025-10-18T02:58:17", "owner": "pablo_ehm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092603914677141, "text": "There's always someone who says no so we have to stay", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:14:52", "owner": "sue_dough_nim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974515434949144, "text": "@lo.st_from_light", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:21", "owner": "oy_demand", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065938586084568, "text": "@amii.450", "created_at": "2025-10-20T08:51:55", "owner": "youyangqu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070224014196226, "text": "@ethanramchand", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:47:07", "owner": "gabrieljlmonteiro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100162156660489, "text": "I always thought it would be really funny if he waited for all of the others to make their decision and then show his", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:59:20", "owner": "wolfylotus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073707443468000, "text": "@iamnaitik_18 Beta aap smjh gye na kaise hota haii", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:12:54", "owner": "thisisnamanrai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074612771137408, "text": "@winny_rf @gabyy_sm_ @fck_isleo", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:31:16", "owner": "vittarioza", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080782114995286, "text": "@sarang.2004 @raj_patil5497 🤝🏻🤝🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:09:16", "owner": "chromo_som_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024239558758611, "text": "Is that the Brand of Sacrifice on the wall ???? 😲", "created_at": "2025-10-11T07:29:08", "owner": "kostas_louritis", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18011476856629691, "text": "wait I’m liking it cuz it’s funny not cuz it’s relatable (in case my school or supervisors see this)", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:20:23", "owner": "jamimevi", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18039412631700045, "text": "@life_is_sedd bara shikh kichu", "created_at": "2025-10-15T23:50:50", "owner": "assihazarpachasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893505874200486, "text": "@ghina_khazaal11 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:42:00", "owner": "reinafakherldeen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327372712237567, "text": "@a77medhamdy  مصيرك تعملها ف السكاشن 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:56:25", "owner": "ahmed_.sh0sha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178614898356816, "text": "@borademrel kardesimlen", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:31:08", "owner": "cantokaywastaken", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136262659459267, "text": "with enough technical knowledge, Microsoft Excel basic skills and questionable ethics, 5 hours lab procedure could be done in 1 hour 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:34:41", "owner": "johnklebsky", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17872202733440464, "text": "@jon.lackner", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:05:45", "owner": "davvy_ma", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057280355444958, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:38:52", "owner": "nuga_a.a", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18076941239514484, "text": "El israel truco @yo.vier", "created_at": "2025-10-14T18:00:44", "owner": "israel.gonzalezcruz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103121929619070, "text": "“do you wana just google what its supposed to be”", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:32:06", "owner": "b.hoff44", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17922104751035673, "text": "@deep.apeshit", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:01:43", "owner": "mnfr_01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090848674849075, "text": "In the grand scheme of things uni lab experiments don't matter . Just bs the report", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:34:58", "owner": "favogram__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18123821248498743, "text": "@mim_khe81 @mhdi__mir_ 😂آز هیدرولیک", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:30:35", "owner": "_alirezanazemi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047057885356713, "text": "Oh no, the Phenolphthalein color is too strong due to over titration, let add some water in to lighten the shade.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T10:26:17", "owner": "lamusaku0210", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120618226510512, "text": "@hhvaleriaa @juanita.urrea nosotras con los tiempos y la temperature", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:02:29", "owner": "catalinajaramillol", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878441125306565, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:48:31", "owner": "inastaleb.33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016392356791851, "text": "@h_63a_ منو هذا", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:50:56", "owner": "is.haider.akram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097863352601505, "text": "@andreva_09 tan real", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:54:36", "owner": "feiyangchen_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066761561366484, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:00:24", "owner": "kubumshel", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17906808336250236, "text": "@karrar.exe_ @hayder_azhar3 @aynaan_s @dhu_lama @the_sharifex", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:08:01", "owner": "axjjx5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18137235094453286, "text": "RFK Jr. finding the \"cause\" to autism", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:39:58", "owner": "kylobe", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18029676929723086, "text": "Some wannabe toppers won't let us do...😪", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:05:26", "owner": "masud_ur_rahman_18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069440345461203, "text": "In educational lab absolutely. Research hell no", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:57:03", "owner": "h_diesel_c", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074776658118935, "text": "My group of 3 voted 6 to 2 to fake results and go home early", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:45:10", "owner": "robot0552", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114984151548225, "text": "@tanushrees01", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:46:51", "owner": "username_roy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082867481311280, "text": "@likuan_chow @sanjeev_cr17 @edan_hw @kevin_ma294", "created_at": "2025-10-12T02:29:33", "owner": "_akshay_hermez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893621077343953, "text": "@khushi_tamrakar0", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:30:08", "owner": "minmaa.a", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081002143955502, "text": "@juju.exploits", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:32:16", "owner": "sadiqulamin.__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928933339109443, "text": "@_.harsh.___01", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:58:00", "owner": "arnav_madiwale", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059458571619476, "text": "@lewis__maddocks @luka_krauzig_", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:32:01", "owner": "nico.giangrande", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860370955509247, "text": "@dakshparekh27", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:02:04", "owner": "parth_kishan_26", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975614640947041, "text": "@franky26996 well in upcoming Friday", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:08:47", "owner": "abdulhamids_ucl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071241812465922, "text": "I should've done ts", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:50:30", "owner": "bpinney05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973947057947679, "text": "@priiitam_007 @_unfav.ramjan_ @_rajashree_ray Ghapla to hardware labs mei hua tha😁", "created_at": "2025-10-11T06:20:04", "owner": "theboy28wholived", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067271420366069, "text": "@greyling_charl", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:25:49", "owner": "jadennell72", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077344484117571, "text": "@meghnmistry", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:14:30", "owner": "krrishivv26", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897202348299514, "text": "@kingsukofficial , @krish41105 we faking andconstructing new  data at lab .", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:32:08", "owner": "shubhrangshu_das700", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078557015513501, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:49:54", "owner": "akm.6397", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18321389050246842, "text": "@julianbajkowski", "created_at": "2025-10-11T06:20:25", "owner": "boyansts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878805724353792, "text": "To my lovely supervisor: the reason i liked this post cuz i find it funny, istg 90% of the lab results in my report are real, we can talk abt the 10% later.", "created_at": "2025-12-20T23:07:52", "owner": "homaidhy.pdf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541087501021224, "text": "I wouldn't call it fake, but rather interpreting the possible outcome based on experience.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:51:03", "owner": "diegofeyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544440295030446, "text": "I can’t be caught liking this.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:58:44", "owner": "fayalyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065880929621676, "text": "Bro 20/100 is the same us 89/100 I can't see the different 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:58:11", "owner": "saadoss12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864710332438616, "text": "@soujoud_bahrouni", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:12:20", "owner": "hajerbrahim8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078938039173181, "text": "So true 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:13:41", "owner": "ax.elyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084871063823489, "text": "\"I actually strictly adhere to scientific ethics\" ☝️🤓", "created_at": "2025-11-12T16:08:29", "owner": "patt_y6967", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108310360718315, "text": "Us when the linear fit isn't linear", "created_at": "2025-11-12T07:35:07", "owner": "lynette.mrtn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873320044449039, "text": "First result: 0.25\nOk the rest are gonna be similar\n2- 0.22\n3- 0.27\n4- 0.23\n5- 0.28", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:10:15", "owner": "alijazayeri6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883413931284497, "text": "We also make the error 5% and less to not be so suspicious ✨", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:40:46", "owner": "alyeen.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922699465172849, "text": "I am not gonna like this post", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:49:01", "owner": "dark_nightt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088309349503166, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:51:51", "owner": "darya.a__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854959480561147, "text": "@iam.haze_yy 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:51:58", "owner": "dineo.jessica_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061488920560786, "text": "Dear buyer company , it is not a cast problem, it is because of your engineers calculated wrong. We are best casting company", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:39:01", "owner": "erkin.kcz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364252732095101, "text": "The lion fudges the numbers to lower the error rate and simplify calculations", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:01:52", "owner": "filipskumpija", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037441799710310, "text": "I had a 106% efficient amplifier once in high school", "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:15:56", "owner": "prokopec05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091167739713400, "text": "First i was fighting with my friends not to do that,but now ,whatever can make me go home early 😊", "created_at": "2025-11-04T16:21:38", "owner": "6s_tka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065627999579670, "text": "I am like this cause it is funny not because it is relatable", "created_at": "2025-11-01T22:51:44", "owner": "dest902royer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994360032704273, "text": "I like the human nature 😂 it’s so predictable", "created_at": "2025-11-01T11:25:43", "owner": "brave_boston", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073692587586136, "text": "Ive never seen that clip before, its lowkey scary", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:12:19", "owner": "manuel_gil_esteban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003083606670622, "text": "The lion doesn't concern himself with peer review", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:43:59", "owner": "nisargpradhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099026686748570, "text": "the lion does not concern himself with ethics", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:59:37", "owner": "ziindeed.wrld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018167531608294, "text": "for legal reasons laughing cuz its funny not cuz its relatable", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:34:36", "owner": "tonilober", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133275877465992, "text": "@sayanon__ 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:41:27", "owner": "metadamn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110691352503803, "text": "..........@aysraaaaa", "created_at": "2025-10-26T06:55:31", "owner": "sidikkjari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067123493366988, "text": "Peak democracy", "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:21:01", "owner": "hadii51515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078160765869491, "text": "@fabianrizkyyy", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:40:10", "owner": "sfikhsann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022935380584991, "text": "The 117% relative error was reduced to 17% under completely natural conditions.😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:42:19", "owner": "ozlemmv.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062896211133496, "text": "@lepoisson_alex", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:43:38", "owner": "alec_rb006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968534013813464, "text": "I can't be seen liking this", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:26:11", "owner": "alexandermakeykin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991750230850687, "text": "@paes.luke", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:56:32", "owner": "vaishsemnarayan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082714829064436, "text": "Why he even asking them", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:10:37", "owner": "justushessler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855924457550345, "text": "I'm a tattoo artist so I can like this without fear of any research supervisors💞💞", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:48:33", "owner": "ewoow_eewoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877100464326094, "text": "Happens every time 😹", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:22:54", "owner": "geestap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002105570824234, "text": "Did that for all of my years, never got caught 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:44:41", "owner": "3qc.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063722975618066, "text": "@lakribtoufik", "created_at": "2025-10-20T22:21:51", "owner": "mers_imad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110492275509164, "text": "Dear ai this is a joke only top scientists do this go after them not after the slaves of science", "created_at": "2025-10-20T12:17:34", "owner": "octaaquarimumidalunaali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873915514434178, "text": "Our class in phys labs😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T17:44:19", "owner": "feelslikerahim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151061845416831, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:48:02", "owner": "yossef.osama.75098", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065635163525699, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:06:34", "owner": "_16afa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077455520035394, "text": "Take a little walk to edge of town…", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:01:18", "owner": "cdaily303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846426370588674, "text": "@chie_hoang go home with RSD = 0% 🥸", "created_at": "2025-10-17T16:16:14", "owner": "hipp_noneem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077765449896822, "text": "Whoever is agains is dead + his family.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:30:41", "owner": "kjurilj7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079646684044862, "text": "💯💯😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:20:47", "owner": "paul_alkhoury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889062673364261, "text": "Highkey on this", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:39:31", "owner": "k3nju.dlm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088667779904468, "text": "Jesus loves you, turn to Him yall", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:17:45", "owner": "perrys_username", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060625580631126, "text": "Why they all acting like their lives depend on it?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:59:50", "owner": "rock.__.rock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093701122833576, "text": "Nobody's gonna replicate my results so it won't care", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:55:02", "owner": "geoloki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105292003619682, "text": "You added early thats an error", "created_at": "2025-10-16T17:34:05", "owner": "_mujtaba._.ahmed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089654147306103, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:16:31", "owner": "krhikeman87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918192034191721, "text": "When me, my bros and all girls in team agree with it… but here comes the gay one disagree tf???", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:52:16", "owner": "just_tive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083719747999055, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T05:31:34", "owner": "hichm_oo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090241585847969, "text": "I swear, did he look over his shoulder to “check“ that they agreed?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:32:24", "owner": "gabeflame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864460288413838, "text": "😭😭😭 so real", "created_at": "2025-10-15T21:29:36", "owner": "pierogi_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877233220421952, "text": "I loved basic chem labs were your error was like 67 percent or something", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:32:07", "owner": "superiorslush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421912642104746, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T19:14:41", "owner": "assem1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095223415773425, "text": "Fake all the stages and stole sb results", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:14:06", "owner": "hrz__pr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021194531771112, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:33:42", "owner": "__purnata__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902039374280072, "text": "@loubna__hammou 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:23:38", "owner": "medvibes02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078505313087345, "text": "ts can't be more fake than this holy", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:27:09", "owner": "mario.__149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057753707196805, "text": "@s.f.dehghani1999", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:03:18", "owner": "25th_hossein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109497142572714, "text": "happened today", "created_at": "2025-10-15T00:12:29", "owner": "c69h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863128825485634, "text": "Ku like karena relate bukan lucu", "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:08:58", "owner": "umarii098_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072544582980907, "text": "We didn’t even faked ours but we explained it so good that we had a good grade while having the worst pourcentage of error 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-14T19:20:50", "owner": "phasing_star", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069069566192956, "text": "The sources of error section of the lab report boutta go crazy", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:05:54", "owner": "jjk.x22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964005945833100, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:39:01", "owner": "sijm3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054025628300620, "text": "O sa fie plauzibile in raport dw🫶", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:35:58", "owner": "teodorateodora8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127858990434411, "text": "✅✅✅✅", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:31:45", "owner": "_ranmohd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152681482408595, "text": "@_dhn1702 vldc", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:20:32", "owner": "loo.m1n_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086403323496841, "text": "Guilty!", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:40:17", "owner": "noor.alfarsii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406619290139363, "text": "Should I let chatGPT solve it", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:47:27", "owner": "amigo_mo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889321891232061, "text": "@chakib__ry", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:12:47", "owner": "ikh_ilyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926398441117117, "text": "Please don't do this scientist. Don't prove MAGA people are right to question scientist.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:43:46", "owner": "bigskanky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845538517589038, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:51:05", "owner": "judge_holdemn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029264957527065, "text": "Im not using chat gpt for the assignment the entire class assignment:", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:15:59", "owner": "mohl0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096724657748296, "text": "@t__ttomato", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:41:18", "owner": "gabi.lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042382142437894, "text": "@farismuizzuddinfm @qo._.da", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:48:59", "owner": "syawal_ikramm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107984866584771, "text": "Dump data and call it a day :)", "created_at": "2025-10-13T08:14:10", "owner": "rmux0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866820190467204, "text": "HAHAHA kupal", "created_at": "2025-10-13T08:01:32", "owner": "botonesjames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081205114987571, "text": "Speed of light = 3×10¹⁴ km/s", "created_at": "2025-10-13T07:52:22", "owner": "mohamadaminghasemi2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203254648313858, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T04:12:21", "owner": "neda96rza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083949017313764, "text": "Relatable", "created_at": "2025-10-12T23:25:07", "owner": "omaramh2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207712003312288, "text": "@_sanjayyyyyy", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:36:37", "owner": "man_esh06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925374127148900, "text": "Soooooo fact🙂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:02:14", "owner": "rawan.k.com.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925982374153391, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:02:29", "owner": "ishak_a.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535750363008017, "text": "In then incoming 500 assignments for next week", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:08:12", "owner": "eng.mohamad.hasan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199213354316262, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:10:37", "owner": "222.568", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069187922008471, "text": "Never heard of GLP", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:07:36", "owner": "hardik_joshi_101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065140331604511, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:12:23", "owner": "majdutan_al", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078896866853828, "text": "@izzyjsharp  TS u?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:57:32", "owner": "carl_nisser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129204781476878, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:02:50", "owner": "3iimad.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103987534556658, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:51:51", "owner": "sorakbutr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075685718109101, "text": "True", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:49:10", "owner": "losts0ul_in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086391691900090, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:24:42", "owner": "chitra_cz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105248809614199, "text": "Percentage error 211.54%", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:07:18", "owner": "helzin333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140566849430128, "text": "@yarin__shik 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:25:15", "owner": "didi_mori_054", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069559172247567, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:54:56", "owner": "batool23195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341385898200441, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:51:44", "owner": "mimi_jeon_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057125555559686, "text": "@mxnveer._", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:44:36", "owner": "jeffreyisnotthatguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071087821999271, "text": "But the experiment is UV index… 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:58:20", "owner": "justjayden0109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094892581748146, "text": "Notice how there is no women in their parliament 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:43:46", "owner": "flowstate303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010087550632770, "text": "@iamkayane.kiss t3awen m3ana lah yrda elik", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:08:16", "owner": "mythical._.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078368930049196, "text": "Fuck", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:00:32", "owner": "_0_cha_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967049931971728, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:00:24", "owner": "s2ips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949562095031083, "text": "I thought this post was about doctors faking the labs to go home 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:20:44", "owner": "hatnaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018998993777742, "text": "Getting caught for being so perfect.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:11:15", "owner": "omar_hatem19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080858941967954, "text": "Frrr", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:28:41", "owner": "aaliya_.519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083325748792179, "text": "⁨اما طلع دولي الوضع 😂😂⁩", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:26:19", "owner": "al.al.1.9.9.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967326990812806, "text": "Lab instructors don't even fucking read them", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:05:04", "owner": "dhhfgdhshjdvdmaync", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989394108723081, "text": "\"yOu NeEd 3 ReSuLtS!\" No i need two the third one is the average of the two previous results", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:55:44", "owner": "kyle_11037", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527900698058246, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:37:13", "owner": "amir.b.mostaghimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056105927243040, "text": "The indian professor is not gonna leave you go home early young man. In fact you're gonna stay and extra hour or two because he once again didn't check if the experiment parameters were working before.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:33:13", "owner": "a3abo3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090788512676300, "text": "Physics/ chem", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:28:01", "owner": "kaynenigma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082769030494429, "text": "No relatório sempre dá certo", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:23:06", "owner": "oguilherme.kerber_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102492862623668, "text": "@othman0613", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:51:47", "owner": "bilal_3lawneh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108441841568932, "text": "What stupid Theater", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:46:56", "owner": "antoine_bugue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051192881311335, "text": "@hiran.t", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:17:29", "owner": "_aryanbansal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095088718612614, "text": "@ece_cengiz_", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:15:05", "owner": "nildathegodsfavchild", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045138857670279, "text": "@eng_raghad95", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:32:30", "owner": "epicadel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074877614469579, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:25:23", "owner": "nottaraneh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922156489175945, "text": "Chat gpt be like: do you want an estimated value?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:19:49", "owner": "pandicorns__r_real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063462623580605, "text": "Just run a simulation", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:05:14", "owner": "mo_reqasse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847352536579008, "text": "no", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:32:33", "owner": "_smoonlight987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082845191005173, "text": "These people SWEAR on their LIVES the pfizer vaxx is SAFE and EFFECTIVE now please sign this paper that says you cant sue me when the vaxx gives you turbocancer", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:57:41", "owner": "ivgo99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934137616097714, "text": "Relatable", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:41:34", "owner": "gustavobellini_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173344630319640, "text": "I heard he got 20 hole in ones last time he played golf", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:33:45", "owner": "bella_2_p_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996799497826530, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:29:37", "owner": "n.nazari_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030728207718690, "text": "Song?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:03:14", "owner": "g.mbn8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048208595672750, "text": "Music is amazing", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:54:16", "owner": "myelinsheathxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944139480932801, "text": "Dark", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:15:44", "owner": "3.o.s.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136151083454914, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:42:26", "owner": "gsf.hydra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060025565412402, "text": "Not the people I worked with. They were dumb (intellectually) and dumb (practically)", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:03:54", "owner": "as_sayf_al_muazzam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082266436806101, "text": "College 1st yr things... Cuz after 1st .. we learnt to skip the whole experiment..😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:57:52", "owner": "r_a_y_0906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937096656961326, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:51:07", "owner": "enkim_du", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921754249172553, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:56:47", "owner": "alfayyzah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087292483924280, "text": "That's is a real democracy 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:12:31", "owner": "abu1.yahya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178250560343907, "text": "average engine cadet with chemical tests", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:47:41", "owner": "antonis_manesis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073633388272314, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:05:13", "owner": "mohamad_doly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057687827570410, "text": "better than fake UN", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:58:31", "owner": "noman_habib2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18410281483115932, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:43:26", "owner": "chadr_04", "likes": 339}, {"id": 18098858260724848, "text": "My lab partner and I once had a whole session of just evil laughing with each other because we were faking some of the data and we thought we were so sneaky and slick for doing it cuz we knew the teacher wouldn't know", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:22:10", "owner": "tyberiustoaster7567", "likes": 3259}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["biologymemes", "chemistrymemes"]},
{"media_id": 3715682451285636194, "shortcode": "DOQwYC_CHRi", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOQwYC_CHRi/", "taken_at": "2025-09-06T13:05:11", "caption": "Welcome back to 2016\n\nFollow @iwantnostalgia_ For More!\n\n#nostalgia #nostalgiacore #nostalgic #remember #memories #goodolddays #fromthepast #familiar #childhood #throwback #90s #80s #2000s #vintage #retro #1980s #aesthetic #explore", "owner_username": "iwantnostalgia_", "owner_id": "2264594877", "likes": 1177060, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0048_DOQwYC_CHRi\\DOQwYC_CHRi_20250906_130511.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17922707055111538, "text": "why we throwing trump in like it was nostalgia 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:41:03", "owner": "ry_moore_56", "likes": 3352}, {"id": 17882020692385777, "text": "The world before Tiktok destroyed everything", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:52:56", "owner": "bertan02_", "likes": 53336}, {"id": 17985323855852842, "text": "World changed after 2019", "created_at": "2025-09-12T20:22:37", "owner": "_.adreamian", "likes": 6857}, {"id": 18041692886409433, "text": "2016 - 2018 is the best era", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:03:06", "owner": "syafiq.rf", "likes": 7267}, {"id": 17944843029064609, "text": "The good days I really miss fidget spinners", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:33:36", "owner": "spiderparker30", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18045699803652985, "text": "11 yrs ago btw", "created_at": "2025-09-12T15:42:10", "owner": "rares20w2", "likes": 6162}, {"id": 18298663936258107, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:44:43", "owner": "prash_120_210", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17890281762242512, "text": "Golden era 2013..2014...2015...2016...2017.2018.2019😢👏", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:01:40", "owner": "iha.trirat", "likes": 122}, {"id": 18293943766278697, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:11:31", "owner": "darkslauter06", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17892761526306105, "text": "Trump was not a good thing bro 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-13T12:51:58", "owner": "thomas_shermer4011", "likes": 3308}, {"id": 18087147166882301, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T02:47:30", "owner": "totallynotsenderlman", "likes": 10918}, {"id": 17856639429453077, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:37:28", "owner": "irzhax", "likes": 8333}, {"id": 18119540920513314, "text": "I miss everything in 2016, except Trump", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:39:17", "owner": "stuartselects_insta", "likes": 87}, {"id": 18083978069077722, "text": "Nostalgia for 2016 is like nostalgia for breakfast yesterday", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:33:12", "owner": "connorthescott", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092255530775833, "text": "You lost me at trump. Worst 2016 Edit💀🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-25T06:30:48", "owner": "ronnydabratt", "likes": 886}, {"id": 17980468241944094, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:56:02", "owner": "zaurez_hussain", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17975040125952779, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:12:30", "owner": "darkslauter06", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18101402497614235, "text": "Best year", "created_at": "2025-09-11T07:02:55", "owner": "hunterwhiz_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18050485439401327, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:22:14", "owner": "turnoil64", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056403719430311, "text": "Brother, trump being elected doesn’t fit in this list", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:56:32", "owner": "simi4.real", "likes": 12495}, {"id": 18067792628257956, "text": "It was already 4 showers ago 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-25T02:08:32", "owner": "andrew_yang_tennis", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18061449323097836, "text": "the new generation kids will never understand this", "created_at": "2025-09-19T16:38:11", "owner": "hafsa_na12", "likes": 5215}, {"id": 18092009185743350, "text": "Almost 10 years later clash royal is popular", "created_at": "2025-12-18T17:21:33", "owner": "hal_le102", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848645494548183, "text": "Wasn't too long ago tho", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:04:31", "owner": "discovering_minerals", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090388738694017, "text": "What happened", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:09:47", "owner": "thacrowdpleazer", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18065328428615873, "text": "Why are people nostalgic for Trump getting elected for the first time? 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:59:53", "owner": "gavinhein04", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18059561861449285, "text": "2016-2019 was so peak", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:48:56", "owner": "venumplane", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18088447447662385, "text": "Next year 2016 would be 10 years ago 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T11:08:47", "owner": "trophy.bwoy", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17902532256294932, "text": "Everything was looking good until Trump show up", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:27:49", "owner": "rzouga455", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18072820328516728, "text": "I do not miss this, personally 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-25T07:36:32", "owner": "xx.built4blame.xx", "likes": 57}, {"id": 18106272076653651, "text": "The good & the bad", "created_at": "2025-12-15T09:59:13", "owner": "xxmeowkittiixx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18395103043126864, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:39:47", "owner": "saba_jvaridze11", "likes": 51}, {"id": 17858010282552617, "text": "Definitely could have let out trump becoming president I only want to think of good memories from that yeah", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:34:34", "owner": "butterflycece05", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18078516301984445, "text": "\"Wish we could turn back time...\"", "created_at": "2025-12-20T16:04:39", "owner": "christian_161108", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094890997619903, "text": "Amazing 😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:06:46", "owner": "sarthaksachdevva", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18073019141516482, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T02:11:18", "owner": "gorestainn_", "likes": 1100}, {"id": 18040883642693606, "text": "What a jersey pull in the mannequin challenge clip dude has a mashahiro tanaka pinstripes", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:16:58", "owner": "nolan.car4", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081720466815914, "text": "And 2016 was 10 years ago in 2 months", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:30:09", "owner": "5o3jacob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039747761440855, "text": "Real.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:46:51", "owner": "ad2141985199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895674856306825, "text": "The simulation will reset itself, which I’m mostly ok with except for the company I kept", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:16:08", "owner": "thecheesepro", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18087529045807088, "text": "2016 for me was sh!t! 2015 and 2017 was peak!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:32:04", "owner": "matthiasmyllr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18388856287121901, "text": "Yeah and Trump ruin everything😔", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:40:29", "owner": "broo.jus", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17898899352147411, "text": "2001-2020 was just so peak  we need to bring back all of theses trends 🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:16:31", "owner": "daily_deciding_my_dogs_fate", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17919745635037836, "text": "2016 & 2019 were my 2 favorite years", "created_at": "2025-09-22T01:13:50", "owner": "mega_mastermind", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17856926472530431, "text": "The Iconic DanTDM Face 💔😭", "created_at": "2025-09-25T02:48:07", "owner": "fnaf_stuff_01", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17931669153132782, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:56:17", "owner": "starplatoe", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18068072291178906, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T12:54:00", "owner": "pmfilms.jpg", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18105629875649678, "text": "Even the song❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:07:41", "owner": "1arson__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322396396214134, "text": "I was 15 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-15T04:20:18", "owner": "i2cua", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17871221025378707, "text": "2016 is nostalgia already???", "created_at": "2025-10-29T17:58:54", "owner": "diego__goncalves__", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18051594515345771, "text": "Name of the song pls?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:52:05", "owner": "alexandrramesse", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18185281891334812, "text": "all good into i seen trump", "created_at": "2025-09-14T14:25:13", "owner": "h8tern3ne_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17896884348164620, "text": "Bro tried to sneak Trump 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:42:49", "owner": "r4verkittydog", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18051446666378581, "text": "Thanks I feel old now.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:57:24", "owner": "nightwing9708", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034071209722369, "text": "English or spanish", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:33:09", "owner": "dana_violatzi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105589744729409, "text": "I was in third class back then 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:12:49", "owner": "sxphie_xis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095838316849485, "text": "Peak civilization before it was slowly destroyed 👏🙌🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:17:01", "owner": "fuery.irl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18543817912049297, "text": "Bring back 2016", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:00:29", "owner": "jacemccollum19", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077634356066707, "text": "some of the best times in my life", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:08:42", "owner": "ari.sxf", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17963873357995481, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:00:34", "owner": "unknowndata.mp4", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18082546952281538, "text": "Dude none of this was good even back then, y'all need to stop pretending", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:48:01", "owner": "tommynestcepas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068161751243518, "text": "Rae sremmurd dropped black Beatles", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:10:32", "owner": "joel_yakob_999", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17950074557915460, "text": "Still playing pokemon go 😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:42:26", "owner": "j.a.c.k.y___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079782035061817, "text": "🔥🥀😢😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:17:59", "owner": "truman_rohrer", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18017315771775315, "text": "Taiwan😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T09:45:51", "owner": "kai.07__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18316387288216213, "text": "Also PewDiePie almost cancelled", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:18:03", "owner": "john_david9000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113479441504969, "text": "1 month for 2026 🥀💔", "created_at": "2025-11-12T07:06:40", "owner": "random_and_silly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077042216227041, "text": "Oh how I miss those days", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:14:53", "owner": "hazimeshiki_official", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18021150701602647, "text": "2016 🇺🇸 \"TRUMP\" \"TRUMP\" \"TRUMP\" 👍🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:35:31", "owner": "mike_mortuary", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17929499967077917, "text": "Cringe era", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:11:21", "owner": "endazer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069634676597889, "text": "fuc 2016", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:26:03", "owner": "xclilhv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18003466181650304, "text": "Those days ain't coming hack😔", "created_at": "2025-09-26T13:38:17", "owner": "zayan_shah234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979462632875294, "text": "And it all happened because of Trump...", "created_at": "2025-09-22T03:11:22", "owner": "yaya016910", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17915863101057000, "text": "Boy i miss that year 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-23T12:02:15", "owner": "spencergasperino", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18063184547106668, "text": "Nostalgia 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-08T13:58:41", "owner": "quitecraft", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17963684805002571, "text": "We come to far man 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:07:45", "owner": "chanduyv21408", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922902673175622, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T01:53:52", "owner": "jeong_121005", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060379928548864, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:35:51", "owner": "rizzedup_jom", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18106004986624114, "text": "I miss... This...", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:11:12", "owner": "whimsical_morute8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095178085814503, "text": "@nocopyrightsounds", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:30:55", "owner": "disturbing.projectttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150988591424842, "text": "It will be 10 years ago in 1 month🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:26:13", "owner": "mihir_vaghela10248", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092784112687072, "text": "😢😢😭", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:46:54", "owner": "alex_pak20", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17934193290106881, "text": "This song🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:10:57", "owner": "tehshyannyce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074883428042680, "text": "84 years ago btw 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-16T00:01:42", "owner": "sk3lan1mal", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17881940127409765, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:03:09", "owner": "heisenburgerlmao", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947084746016537, "text": "Tuffest year", "created_at": "2025-09-12T21:18:24", "owner": "aaruxhh.pvt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862877530417880, "text": "Kids today won’t know what WE grew up with", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:20:06", "owner": "someone1046729", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066751604030400, "text": "i was 6-7 years 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:19:40", "owner": "hyunji_nie._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088989661967384, "text": "😢 my favourite year of my life ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-20T06:26:46", "owner": "murphyidow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084347027104017, "text": "It’s weird how quickly things change now", "created_at": "2025-12-20T04:56:02", "owner": "josh_sells_roofs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495675748073747, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-20T01:19:28", "owner": "m00ha.mmed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890208373263477, "text": "I’m sorry but to someone from the 90’s, this is not a flex AT ALL😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:50:09", "owner": "ooolala421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012600533644404, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T17:08:57", "owner": "santiagolopez2130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903698458334818, "text": "The amount of people being nostlagic for 2016 is frying me 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:03:27", "owner": "mfnamedtony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079680119463389, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:28:24", "owner": "lil_ghost1015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066104099165179, "text": "😢👏", "created_at": "2025-12-17T20:22:48", "owner": "alexanderguerra365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113535487608701, "text": "Before covid and chaos. So sad.", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:43:37", "owner": "shellyschlegel82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874317544386357, "text": "Coulda left King Cheeto outta this 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T03:42:15", "owner": "the_az_beardedcook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901322623185855, "text": "This was not that long ago lol", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:23:33", "owner": "jomo6842", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049938962422481, "text": "How can we go back to when kids played outside im still a kid but not like the young ones who don’t go outside I’m 15 this should still be us", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:32:44", "owner": "gretchll_swimsbreastroke10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898697665201248, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:38:49", "owner": "jay_money_fresh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981595263931245, "text": "Creepy clown craze", "created_at": "2025-12-16T04:44:12", "owner": "fazegamergt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100793719817711, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:20:57", "owner": "miguelmtcartes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127081408512507, "text": "Rogue One, Kanan Jarrus goes blind Jasmine Tookes wears Bright Night Fantasy Bra at Victoria's Secret Fashion Show in Paris", "created_at": "2025-12-15T18:05:21", "owner": "jswanson8899", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065949608561948, "text": "This hurts...", "created_at": "2025-12-15T09:58:18", "owner": "xxmeowkittiixx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095333833846790, "text": "M", "created_at": "2025-12-14T23:21:30", "owner": "agondor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096890608867681, "text": "Nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-12-14T23:05:21", "owner": "mentoska_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062556566227543, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:44:15", "owner": "osman_72736", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998953149703956, "text": "Taking me back to my senior year. ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:02:21", "owner": "miamisports24_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087451312834723, "text": "Almost 10 years ago 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:00:18", "owner": "keel010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076396061248086, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:13:40", "owner": "mavrix09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065841929166767, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:01:30", "owner": "dwgdng_.12ce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089674366960281, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:59:20", "owner": "talon4ik555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066751283438682, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:39:28", "owner": "luke_nej2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933802344998655, "text": ":((", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:37:25", "owner": "neyyyyzurna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100653142699517, "text": "Love the trip down memory lane!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:08:41", "owner": "nakinamonique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046843463477490, "text": "Fidget spinners and the mannequin challenge were top tier idc idc idc 😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:19:57", "owner": "ladymonroe115__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864011158537053, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:39:26", "owner": "saving_the_game", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935009854112087, "text": "What's the name of this song?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:12:51", "owner": "arq_jonas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902317753322030, "text": "2016 was a legendary year for pop culture too. Rogue one, captain America civil war, stranger things season 1, battlefield 1, uncharted 4, dark souls 3.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:23:30", "owner": "general_grievouscis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087797033290489, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:33:11", "owner": "hardy._.editz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057366131639019, "text": "2016 was the end of my childhood", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:01:44", "owner": "matt.halter21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105409747636700, "text": "In 2026 2016 will be 10 years ago….", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:22:55", "owner": "emily.cornwall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034569836724771, "text": "In our class, we still do bottle flips", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:39:44", "owner": "mini.nooble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978165606950133, "text": "Fuimos tan felices....", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:53:05", "owner": "factos.mr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338352004233890, "text": "I still have a fidget spinner somewhere in this damn house", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:33:49", "owner": "kylercanter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868582729493761, "text": "Where's @talfishman", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:50:03", "owner": "jhaydon_.ruiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062486450544103, "text": "I remember andy’s coming", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:31:00", "owner": "eeminemx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380352298145702, "text": "Checked out at Trump like that wasn’t a good memory", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:20:06", "owner": "jaimiethecreator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332608504210992, "text": "The clown craze 🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:24:49", "owner": "euan_neon.21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109295905619748, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:59:09", "owner": "ausor1810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113453515594166, "text": "my dream was to participate in the Mannequin Challenge... I remember the one that was at the White House when Obama was still POTUS...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:58:59", "owner": "flower.youngvely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978977415943476, "text": "Fucking Trump… seriously?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:58:36", "owner": "some_little_prince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874699489375905, "text": "Can we make 2026 more like 2016 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:57:27", "owner": "hamda_buhmaiza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987062979913207, "text": "You haven't lived until you've made a snowball so massive that you can no longer move it.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:03:30", "owner": "iscanneri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126767752514113, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:13:17", "owner": "iswearhesweird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852854143548089, "text": "No Leicester city 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:43:19", "owner": "benthefireballelmo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058353185287422, "text": "Take me back 2014", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:33:15", "owner": "jeremiah031795", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906066445144957, "text": "before COVID 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:03:29", "owner": "4campos2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887140126400601, "text": "Focus on today guys", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:11:10", "owner": "dgilson101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954975040044719, "text": "Song name i forgot", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:14:26", "owner": "nxzz_currie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075317708248833, "text": "The best", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:34:02", "owner": "nell._m_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062693324207281, "text": "I miss my childhood, I was 9 years old at that time, sometimes it's not nice to be an adult", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:20:33", "owner": "kamukiraaja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058728230288394, "text": "Papp is the dumbest shit ever", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:47:33", "owner": "big_jerm21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882799183307968, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:20:04", "owner": "ms.exoticstarr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842440672635272, "text": "Dab was before 2016 like 2010-2014", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:02:50", "owner": "wse650q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118567048558964, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:53:47", "owner": "guy_el1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104924095729186, "text": "The vibes of this music...", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:07:57", "owner": "dario_koby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872051404465273, "text": "Trump being elected is that gif from Peter where they all put their hands together and Peter is like \"no no not you 🫳\"", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:32:25", "owner": "bakugami_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547242202000827, "text": "times when people were funnier and the world was easy to lean", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:35:51", "owner": "_fakeniina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081888587167856, "text": "Remember when Logan Paul filmed a dead person hanging from a tree? And people still support him, crazy", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:58:39", "owner": "aaaaaron17653", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919801780210887, "text": "Historical? NOTHING SPECIAL", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:40:52", "owner": "whiscaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065986091568836, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:11:10", "owner": "darkslauter06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064970828395167, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:10:29", "owner": "darkslauter06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891717187381957, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:10:03", "owner": "darkslauter06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355418635206941, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:09:33", "owner": "darkslauter06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341826961228445, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:09:17", "owner": "darkslauter06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844299016611824, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:09:08", "owner": "darkslauter06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375361471152544, "text": "I fucking hated 2016. 2026 will be way better", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:10:37", "owner": "loganmslaughter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106601995575978, "text": "Level 16 in clash royale + heroes now 😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:08:11", "owner": "ant.vsr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083364263103971, "text": "no way that’s almost 10 years ago", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:01:19", "owner": "benjamin_souza28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064841555415193, "text": "DANTDM MANNNNN😢❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:48:24", "owner": "ian_ssi.97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076801472265363, "text": "Either 67 or this", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:49:23", "owner": "nori_doorman002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174120463374921, "text": "I’m so old none of this means 💩 to me", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:04:04", "owner": "carlosmoreno5858", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099094081696109, "text": "Ppap", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:11:45", "owner": "urlrah.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843270178629004, "text": "Who invited Trump 🫩", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:31:44", "owner": "_ceoofthebikergang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087765340960641, "text": "AI go cray cray", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:05:39", "owner": "salemaillie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245573080289142, "text": "Musically😞", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:16:39", "owner": "sophiandiaye_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015812282628573, "text": "10 years in 30 days.....", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:41:01", "owner": "safieldain.ismail150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947553672934731, "text": "Bro almost everything that was in the video we have now too but only a bit different. The feel about past is caused by nostalgia and now we are older. 🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:06:48", "owner": "kubasoba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080883200332852, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:11:32", "owner": "eldridgemartin84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113640730588936, "text": "Trump wasn’t elected in no damn 2015 that shit happened 2020 /2021", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:29:10", "owner": "darennadesray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999014577839422, "text": "Peak word", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:10:32", "owner": "agent_mangox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207597604314663, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:08:51", "owner": "o.alinur30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182684785315373, "text": "Why is trump ther", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:04:35", "owner": "samuel_thmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934969405105173, "text": "Philippians 4:6 “Don’t worry about anything; instead, pray about everything. Tell God what you need, and thank him for all he has done", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:08:26", "owner": "iiam._stacyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249227479288540, "text": "This song😳", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:51:31", "owner": "pedro_popee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076136354223975, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:42:36", "owner": "ajbrodude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087138173315351, "text": "I remember in Hong Kong, there used to be Uncs cycling on the street with multiple phones playing Pokémon Go😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:49:55", "owner": "b3i0v3d_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053663171668692, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:31:50", "owner": "jojoshisnotcool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125446108509521, "text": "#everyoneletsmake2026thenew2016", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:15:14", "owner": "kanekics.ken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096928858661979, "text": "“Forget the former things;\n do not dwell on the past.\n19 See, I am doing a new thing!\n Now it springs up; do you not perceive it?\nI am making a way in the wilderness\n  and streams in the wasteland.\n20 The wild animals honor me,\n the jackals and the owls,\nbecause I provide water in the wilderness\n  and streams in the wasteland,\nto give drink to my people, my chosen,", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:42:39", "owner": "jadenn0o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842567341631129, "text": "Elite year", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:21:25", "owner": "adamcouser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926015254160038, "text": "And marshmello alone?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:47:31", "owner": "goat.gd2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386234683198060, "text": "@aidan.lego pure goosebumps", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:40:29", "owner": "henry.cookr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040345547718348, "text": "This is the worst edit ever", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:08:26", "owner": "konrad_thelad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298543381281856, "text": "Vine days", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:19:08", "owner": "jakob15847t73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972291438970169, "text": "That last one not it mate \nChief keef or Vine?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:38", "owner": "9tiago9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940760811961573, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:39", "owner": "propkiing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104819410644447, "text": "Go back to 2006 even better", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:05:24", "owner": "joe_unionmoney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378365836196279, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:08:25", "owner": "oceanwave05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027766448571800, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:08:01", "owner": "oceanwave05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908856304125396, "text": "The end of an era", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:07:49", "owner": "oceanwave05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128056924499016, "text": "I was 15 years old in 2016", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:49:58", "owner": "aaronchristoherbrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923128372082286, "text": "so glad that its been 10 years ago omg, but clash royal is clash royal", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:50:37", "owner": "capharnahomme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069671009604102, "text": "Name of this song", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:03:38", "owner": "chote_industries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844572562618380, "text": "The way I was smiling through it all until I saw trump and my face literally dropped", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:01:21", "owner": "its.elliott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853599463579671, "text": "song name plz", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:32:25", "owner": "sezz0311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061169945559598, "text": "Best year oat", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:22:10", "owner": "peter._.michel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397448854124860, "text": "None of these were remotely good except pap, the dab was dumb, Pokémon go was dumb, fidget spinners were meh, Trump sucks, bottle flipping was meh, DanTDM peak is meh, not like it’s worse than current trends but it wasn’t amazing.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:39:41", "owner": "triplecaesarpizzza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926634145171549, "text": "Dabbing is everywhere", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:33:36", "owner": "leohorton359", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864344071516721, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:02:38", "owner": "cobblestone_cobblestone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009392531811028, "text": "ＰＰＡＰってそんなすごかったんたんか😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:48:32", "owner": "naoki_nana7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894224425220467, "text": "How’s that nostalgic? Everything was already shit by 2011…nothing has ever been the same…", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:11:07", "owner": "alejandroinberlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899124751342312, "text": "This is horrible at least put Jeff Seid or sum", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:12:48", "owner": "camn_ptashnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971455881963386, "text": "Most of it it horrendous and I'm glad it disappeared", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:21:24", "owner": "pierrick.yahouedeou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861449182539203, "text": "Summer 2016 I was in the states. It was just like that + more. That time will be treasured forever💖", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:10:09", "owner": "katy.funkcake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133042363433488, "text": "Mannequin challenge and pokemon go are the only sane things from that time", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:47:20", "owner": "captain_yanzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977315007954667, "text": "Covid ruined everything", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:16:21", "owner": "ejminpanossian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193298962332255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:29:53", "owner": "ponchozap76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990483357884085, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:43:13", "owner": "arch_raspberry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107174005623972, "text": "Back when generation alpha wasn't even born yet", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:13:41", "owner": "stef_five_strings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049214120399671, "text": "“I love fidget spinners from my head to my toes”", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:40:30", "owner": "brooke.bt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095981041885614, "text": "Tbf the memes and everything better then but now everybody says random shit like 6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:22:05", "owner": "ollie_the_climber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078139091174475, "text": "Hot take : fidget spinners were pure brainrot, not any better than any skibidi or 67, I hated them and I still hate them now and I'll die on that hill. Also Logan Paul is a douchebag, he should have been jailed for years", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:07:36", "owner": "painkillerx12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979445349934074, "text": "Song name please", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:06:54", "owner": "lyana__blackgirl24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863379274519450, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:41:47", "owner": "basil.01_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18213693448313840, "text": "The swish", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:17:39", "owner": "wiebe.peters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540239836023433, "text": "Short form content ruined everything", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:53:36", "owner": "mishkanoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980416707933092, "text": "Is that Tete Brûlées he tried at the end?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:07:50", "owner": "skiesvert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078496157146291, "text": "This might be where it all went wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:51:26", "owner": "kornelparoczai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346932748200062, "text": "tiktok and the pandemic set us ahead 50 years😢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:27:59", "owner": "orifrazierr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933605356107404, "text": "💕💕Jesus loves you believe in the gospel of Jesus Christ and what he did on the cross. He is the only way to god there is know other way (John 14.6 ) he can heal your broken heart and revive your soul you just need to turn to him and turn away from sin you still have time about not a lot of It so live for Jesus now . It’s not to late if you start now , Jesus said no one knows the day of his return . If god can create the the heavens and the earth in a week . He can change you your heart in one night . Repent and believe that Jesus died for your sins on the cross . You will know longer be a slave to sin 💕💕", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:44:03", "owner": "faithandsoap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094015582892908, "text": "Sul serio vedere tutti sti trend e noi a ruota dietro. Un gregge di ritardati", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:22:10", "owner": "liberta_d_espressione", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073435508014379, "text": "The World wenn to shit after 2015", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:54:10", "owner": "d.rauch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888169888389486, "text": "The 2010s was decade that being corny was cool. As a teenager I never liked anything from the 2010s though if there’s one thing I’m glad is watching all of my favorite Youtubers like pewDiePie, filthy Frank and Brandon Rogers", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:49:02", "owner": "mozes2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900736060301520, "text": "2016 was kinda garbage💔💔💔 It all started when Bowie died", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:13:46", "owner": "cyantrubloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064084931434887, "text": "You had to be there, it wasn't all that great. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:14:04", "owner": "genedalefield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989269365902681, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:15:49", "owner": "alexpacheco3435", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953824884905174, "text": "Coc was release in 2012 when i build townhouse 14", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:36:06", "owner": "rio_richard88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062832287437179, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:03:11", "owner": "g_p_a._.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18559516216032683, "text": "And then when we get to 2040, it will be the same thing. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:44:37", "owner": "a_a_2024_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920011906197393, "text": "🖕🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:30:58", "owner": "cross_country_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081515825025623, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:46:13", "owner": "__zen__nin__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992114223722678, "text": "Community. It was all, community. That's what you miss", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:45:45", "owner": "_sidequestking_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950732980028081, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:00:19", "owner": "kameronscott33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917336485215853, "text": "Peak Millenial core", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:00:17", "owner": "forever_sleepingzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061188452207475, "text": "High key think I just got more retarded from 80% of what was just shown. “LeTs ShOw LoGaN pAuL bEFoRe GoOd DaY fAzE”", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:44:20", "owner": "itstrevsters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908927839121273, "text": "PEN PINEAPPLE APPLE PEN", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:47:00", "owner": "chrisasryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847704979605016, "text": "@dbrowne010", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:29:46", "owner": "elaine_browne_35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936155196981095, "text": "𝚆𝙰𝙽𝚃 𝚃𝙷𝙰𝚃 2014-2019 𝙴𝚁𝙰 𝙱𝙰𝙲𝙺 𝚂𝙾𝙾 𝙱𝙰𝙳...😭🙏🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:21:15", "owner": "x_unknown_3.3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080724092513742, "text": "America is great for a reason", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:13:30", "owner": "myrasainii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977352600939144, "text": "I’m glad somebody keeps a record of this because I forgot about much", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:36:43", "owner": "mintellectualphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864552703512973, "text": "Killer Clowns were EVERWHERE😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:37:00", "owner": "outofcontexthetalia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082725374108947, "text": "I was in fourth grade 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:36:19", "owner": "bluemeaniesrule60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547398283002364, "text": "You forgot Pokemon go!!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:06:21", "owner": "rgry1688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101405092663790, "text": "I miss 2016-2018 the world changed so much after covid-19 it was much better before 2019!", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:42:55", "owner": "ruby.windred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077872499179659, "text": "*2016 if you were autistic", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:04:02", "owner": "pedalin_monkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023702444716832, "text": "Such a nostalgic things 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:06:31", "owner": "aabid.mh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849148753598948, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:33:56", "owner": "stalin__obito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120218107537534, "text": "mannequin challenge>>>>", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:08:26", "owner": "_gnomone_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918781810067045, "text": "song name plis", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:35:51", "owner": "ssaniyyw_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866312140498115, "text": "I'm sure there are two factors that started the decline: covid and tiktok", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:43:10", "owner": "simo_vespe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913659211248595, "text": "The birth of modern Idiocracy.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:22:06", "owner": "thegreybarron45_47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097646353795110, "text": "I was five in 2016 and yet I remember all of this and still feel nostalgic 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:19:47", "owner": "greatestflyingrizzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024907178771729, "text": "Trump elected president was the beginning of the shit", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:49:30", "owner": "henleyy75515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319733242175699, "text": "Fidget spinners is 2017", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:48:47", "owner": "henleyy75515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852441781583168, "text": "2008-2013", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:45:02", "owner": "1.5_parkheights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368614639088003, "text": "What a stupid year based on trends", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:38:24", "owner": "nikolamilivojevic00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079963721327450, "text": "I was 18 years old in 2016", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:25:34", "owner": "h_parker_7916284", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077501534471551, "text": "Omg 2016 was peak", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:05:00", "owner": "fiesta_st806", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983409225759181, "text": "Can we bring back the mannequin challenge please", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:56:12", "owner": "xnothing_else_mattersx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929225212015718, "text": "I hate 2016", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:53:01", "owner": "t7t_mjhr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133213951479129, "text": "Me who still plays Pokémon go 😼", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:35:17", "owner": "rodrigo_miguel.17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077831069332508, "text": "Bro ends the video with some LGBT slop 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:36:11", "owner": "kalonreay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081462803032430, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:35:01", "owner": "timenarrowsreality321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081895964281761, "text": "No one was still watching tdm in 2016 dawg🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T06:16:45", "owner": "boof_monk3y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332610205230718, "text": "That’s when I left 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:48:54", "owner": "its.dolph24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019165061610329, "text": "guava juice/roi was my childhood 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:26:56", "owner": "mhuffmaster123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851650708544989, "text": "First half of 2016 was DEPRESSING\nSecond half I’d go back to", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:50:11", "owner": "eponymous.jayson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946670452059860, "text": "2016 was prime", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:14:51", "owner": "just_call_me_fex_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854051107575003, "text": "Broo😢", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:20:59", "owner": "m__a__n__b__o__y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953276409898159, "text": "No mams, enserio eso es nostalgia para ustedes? Tan re morros 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:20:19", "owner": "sparda316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064428515402096, "text": "The world before we didn’t care about the Politics n there were no zios", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:37:05", "owner": "9_11_2001_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058207589559566, "text": "Peak Era", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:14:30", "owner": "r3t4rd_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034600511718234, "text": "The best year", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:10:05", "owner": "k3kxz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877014355432667, "text": "we need to go back", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:41:42", "owner": "chad.schlueter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085039762961883, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:46:52", "owner": "alt1229_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921219097053587, "text": "Pokémon Go was crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:49:05", "owner": "matt.ice_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884088487284721, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:09:31", "owner": "otavin__0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953749768031452, "text": "I miss elementary school", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:51:49", "owner": "ahanabhansali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072404528338219, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:37:14", "owner": "l3m_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076376542971699, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:38:05", "owner": "skaseagorimou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497045740079085, "text": "Fernanfloo.....", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:21:23", "owner": "romanlclc_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069944510068576, "text": "Trump being president is insane", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:32:49", "owner": "itzoreoyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096071461833804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:39:09", "owner": "el_ap4che90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846869539581841, "text": "I wonder why the world has changed? (Labubus Dubai chocolate? Tiktok? Every single thing is an menace to society but no one is noticing that and it pisses my off why no one is doing anything)", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:51:09", "owner": "pineapple_in_bangchansburgah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099071182795753, "text": "Prime $uicideboy$ was 2016", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:37:45", "owner": "ryk.wetto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077796635169105, "text": "You can't forget CoryxKenshin", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:57:14", "owner": "pluvkazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101716759679133, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:30:00", "owner": "theactualyohann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103403833656904, "text": "Pineapple apple pen 😌😌", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:46:29", "owner": "satyam.761_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941991880077378, "text": "Harlem shake 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:06:00", "owner": "quizzzy25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083034701015334, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:46:32", "owner": "rayanrizkianugrah9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907890439128223, "text": "Tik tok destroyed them...", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:21:54", "owner": "pozzislav8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095928742837607, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:13:28", "owner": "daptocandy_yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414220783142299, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:10:02", "owner": "zidannemoraless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919102135196683, "text": "Those days were the best", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:57:36", "owner": "darrick81364", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973964607954283, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:01:55", "owner": "zetino10mateo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975937884792736, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:58:38", "owner": "elfrankenstyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893137159222945, "text": "怎麼沒有台灣人留言:P", "created_at": "2025-11-14T11:52:59", "owner": "dunno_qq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874231882361952, "text": "Did someone noticed the BMW🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-14T11:48:07", "owner": "gxdlfoeck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075339185250592, "text": "I really want to live the era...just before I grow too old to be reciting these to generations", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:51:01", "owner": "_fs._.kavvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059709803236991, "text": "2010 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:01:16", "owner": "mostafaatroshi99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377627950151309, "text": "U forgot the redbox prime", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:59:07", "owner": "kuchau666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093170203886121, "text": "My roblox avatar😢", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:57:48", "owner": "kuchau666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046750616429404, "text": "The beginning of the END.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:31:40", "owner": "mt.top_fitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085970965803815, "text": "Year", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:34:39", "owner": "butterflycece05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843896728613034, "text": "The red one has been chosen", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:10:00", "owner": "jacklovesallsorts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004095215669138, "text": "What is a sucky plastic year", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:45:32", "owner": "johnwesley4471", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864349231509783, "text": "I was only five but i remember everything to the last detail and i dont even know how❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-13T06:03:56", "owner": "patrikvyletal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064277795527336, "text": "Sis VS Bro did almost everything", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:57:00", "owner": "juvi0118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863855584514264, "text": "Where did our whimsy go", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:35:27", "owner": "blitz1blitzm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066669680375787, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:56:32", "owner": "niecy325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066485636095685, "text": "Are ya serious!!!! Try going back to the 80’s and 90’s than let’s talk!!", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:02:28", "owner": "joma_mvp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146087329429623, "text": "And this song... 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:54:19", "owner": "adam_rzodkiew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091923997900498, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:41:02", "owner": "megumi_fushiguro._.1027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093310762848651, "text": "Trump worst one yet( nothings worse then trump only bad thing", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:05:13", "owner": "mmk_kazi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18415961368116030, "text": "Who thought the fidget spinner would make you see more with extra eyes 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:04:16", "owner": "mmk_kazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951955449908357, "text": "The world before social media;", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:16:18", "owner": "sdk.z66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842175268618359, "text": "i used to flex that i can balance the fidget spinner on my nose 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:02:13", "owner": "ssl_9am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898784893341742, "text": "In 2016 American politics didn't matter to me because I was a child and lived in a different continent ... So how TF is it nostalgic?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T08:14:44", "owner": "evalcraft0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545830450061605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T05:38:53", "owner": "itsdylowin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332862496233667, "text": "one direction are taking a break...", "created_at": "2025-11-12T05:24:57", "owner": "xitenomzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940231956961550, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:00:25", "owner": "iha.trirat", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17924160033171411, "text": "Fucking Trump noooo dont be assholes eliminate now Game over your going too loose followers🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:34:33", "owner": "la_rissa1217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102556996636893, "text": "The video was great till it got to Trump...", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:24:32", "owner": "peter_louro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046242908428256, "text": "lagunya juga membawaku ke tahun tersebut🥺😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:35:56", "owner": "seken_akuneadira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101680900734989, "text": "Trump was never a highlight for the youth", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:14:05", "owner": "dominic_dom2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075550439334184, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:10:31", "owner": "alfian_frmnsyh14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376569841149618, "text": "Holy... Nearly 10 years ago. Fr", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:18:33", "owner": "syt_h_arin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895437013203963, "text": "@travis_chesson He got 40.2k likes on his comment sooo", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:52:54", "owner": "cruz_m0or3_619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074448311463888, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:16:21", "owner": "art03guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154316674408762, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:42:50", "owner": "jill_badut", "likes": 1}, {"id": 