for that dab", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:55:32", "owner": "stfuyouvirgintraitor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901627927316582, "text": "⭐⭐ 2015⭐⭐", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:25:41", "owner": "adrikusvonkopfe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119260738533453, "text": "2016 was one of them ones man😔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:35:00", "owner": "chills___06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095338444830679, "text": "The meme reset happened?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:22:35", "owner": "harelmame123123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028426982754655, "text": "Frrrrrr❤️🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:34:49", "owner": "anonymous.prick_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133166161485582, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:56:58", "owner": "isaacbeauchamps", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903612031147679, "text": "Best 20 years of my life.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:47:36", "owner": "knock.andrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897794476185704, "text": "I think there's someone hanging right there", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:57:21", "owner": "lv.tvx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048318959668508, "text": "It’s not too late to bring it back 😌", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:35:45", "owner": "yung._canidate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103015003636094, "text": "LeBron James and Tom Brady both led their teams to comebacks championships that year", "created_at": "2025-11-04T00:34:07", "owner": "mightyquinnh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18003483053819824, "text": "Dont feel any remorse but when see the 90s childhood video... damn i miss those days😢", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:32:34", "owner": "sparking_brains", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083345665971398, "text": "@stuartselects_insta I'm with u on that 👍🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:14:04", "owner": "jsanders706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861800176526574, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:33:59", "owner": "atrx_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057362870262968, "text": "moriré de nostalgia...", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:10:47", "owner": "kevin_f61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077873414