, "owner": "luqman_saeedd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043081151460054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-26T10:51:02", "owner": "tsu__12sr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888433423245379, "text": "Don'f forget Fernanfloo prime🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-25T22:09:16", "owner": "nizar13356io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077540119884361, "text": "wHAT SONG IS IN bACKGROUND??", "created_at": "2025-10-25T14:23:14", "owner": "amazing.spidermannnn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098716285679714, "text": "I didn't get emotional over this", "created_at": "2025-10-25T02:21:07", "owner": "marionettebonnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048007631372537, "text": "@wiiayra_ damn 9 F years 😂😮", "created_at": "2025-10-25T00:41:27", "owner": "elangsatria19k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061053038183003, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-24T17:27:56", "owner": "ryzshiftyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898351060316729, "text": "16-19🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:36:32", "owner": "___its_me_peter_parker___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030054566740576, "text": "@wiiayra_  kurang... Ada hal besar yg terjadi di 2016... Mas menemukan ayang 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T08:23:44", "owner": "elangsatria19k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965809185978420, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-24T07:18:46", "owner": "clipeditlab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054923816284315, "text": "God I feel old and I’m only 18 bout to turn 19 🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:03:52", "owner": "boredpotato446", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058589606536361, "text": "Fidget Spinners is 2017", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:15:34", "owner": "lennytc91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085367275993235, "text": "Donald Trump was a good president in 2016, now from now, im not sure what to say about his locking in shit", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:55:27", "owner": "swanfauntlol202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084537827503412, "text": "I Remember Nico Rosberg Won one & only F1 Title", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:29:59", "owner": "tecna.cosmixx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117011173479980, "text": "In 2016 there Are Basuri Horn Trend Or Very Known As Om Telolet Om Which Continue Run As Today Whiles Goverment Critizes", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:22:28", "owner": "tecna.cosmixx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020702333781174, "text": "god please bring me back", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:04:05", "owner": "skyrodaen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008319935804847, "text": "Oh man wow I wish I could go back 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:04:22", "owner": "powerplex60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097337602773457, "text": "So that's it? We cant go back?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:59:24", "owner": "red3x_mxnstrr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098785183670162, "text": "EDM was still dominating every chart, cars and mopeds were affordable and gas prices were fair, you could still have a full meal with less than 5€, people looked happier and didn’t mind to socialise, fashion was on another level and, most importantly, there was still big hope for the future, people would have laughed at you if you told them there would be a global pandemic and a massive recession in four years. God I wish I was 20 in 2016 instead of 2020🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:47:59", "owner": "albefaucci._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055461530256153, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:40:56", "owner": "fiwhs76", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18094023961765339, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:06:05", "owner": "pacho1581", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991279329712503, "text": "Pokemon go is still very much alive lol", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:02:14", "owner": "shyguy7535", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537052912035482, "text": "A world before trends became deadly", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:22:16", "owner": "buttsniffer3000_1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066997220074877, "text": "video❌\nSong✅", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:20:51", "owner": "niche_gong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052747487316441, "text": "Pokemon go was something 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:24:37", "owner": "jaqzonpatriq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852230098524881, "text": "Almost 10 years later", "created_at": "2025-10-20T22:54:20", "owner": "h.octavius", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922154203173383, "text": "time was experimented, we stayed in last good year 2019... everything from that moment is in another universe . Trust me ... They opened something underneeth ... that makes time goes wrong", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:31:46", "owner": "n.1k0l9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092862064858136, "text": "What a time to be alive. We didn’t know what we had till it was gone.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:47:13", "owner": "kingbandz270", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038881250687374, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:46:46", "owner": "cr7forever777777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854901013553726, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T09:15:16", "owner": "zhoroev_kk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540669283057928, "text": "This is when society peaked", "created_at": "2025-10-20T06:03:00", "owner": "wrench_and_weights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110599903574810, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T05:24:16", "owner": "sugacocox_x", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072856601333525, "text": "Remember kendamas", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:51:59", "owner": "marvinyanez818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084004048952004, "text": "Pov gen alpha:What is that", "created_at": "2025-10-20T00:16:30", "owner": "phili_ox9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094798318695277, "text": "This makes me not miss it…", "created_at": "2025-10-19T20:03:44", "owner": "zardakid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068843081251279, "text": "WE MAKING THE LIBERALS MAD WITH THIS ONE 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:33:48", "owner": "itzwitherfx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863583652496534, "text": "That’s crazy, this was like 9 or 10 years ago. Time flies man", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:17:43", "owner": "solosuperman24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17925735081115411, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😭😭❤️🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-18T22:21:55", "owner": "posted_glock", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18324039259209155, "text": "a era we all miss", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:54:37", "owner": "omar_berrian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934958302070827, "text": "For the english people the year 7s next year will be 2015-2016s 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-18T10:00:02", "owner": "swx.rz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984185922864335, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T05:50:07", "owner": "vera.paulode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909432622246511, "text": "Nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-10-18T05:47:22", "owner": "mighty.max.22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095532385773035, "text": "2016 was the best summer", "created_at": "2025-10-18T04:38:04", "owner": "alex.trujimx", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17986971245739120, "text": "Its almost 10 years ago……", "created_at": "2025-10-18T04:30:38", "owner": "revdrakw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18373902832195807, "text": "You had to ruin it by putting trump in 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-18T03:56:34", "owner": "amanuelbern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084049078781303, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T01:39:11", "owner": "jayfrm6ix0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047733026364390, "text": "Keep logan there", "created_at": "2025-10-17T21:37:45", "owner": "tobintonight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18488811271075092, "text": "@nintendo_jp can suck my cock because Asian idiot.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T20:21:45", "owner": "masked_injury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094456462769739, "text": "What about 2020-21 has it happan?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T19:41:07", "owner": "eldaradut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070763504216804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T16:55:40", "owner": "269_failed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18405067843136429, "text": "Bro snuck in trump", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:49:21", "owner": "timbob335", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079624049104067, "text": "Even the song sounds nostalgic 😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T08:56:38", "owner": "oceanzmint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107285206605743, "text": "2016-2018 was amezing af i miss those days 😭 watching minecraft videos \" noob vs pro vs god\"  playing coc, fifa 18 tricks , era of marshmallow, alen walker,", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:48:18", "owner": "khooni_sabjiwala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095551357701600, "text": "The other day I found out Logan Paul was 30 already I remembered him being 22", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:23:18", "owner": "scholarhayze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053849501300880, "text": "NCS,story mode games and vine compilations ahhh good days 🍃", "created_at": "2025-10-16T17:56:22", "owner": "atomicattul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039657446487596, "text": "Some mf wasnt even born yet 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T16:00:45", "owner": "jayce.eu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141690766433212, "text": "Why is Logan Paul lowkey popping off I  every single generation", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:18:21", "owner": "vhs.ventures_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994420716699855, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:56:42", "owner": "javo_meganight", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967035030971108, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:55:52", "owner": "javo_meganight", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877873000415955, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:55:19", "owner": "javo_meganight", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995844708692902, "text": "Who remembers when jack didn't do OF and just jumped off bridges", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:54:17", "owner": "javo_meganight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062702735111919, "text": "😔🥀kangen", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:22:01", "owner": "rskyibrhmm_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025545719749176, "text": "Vro missed the fire ball in clash royal😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T21:31:11", "owner": "exotic_butter660", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098114392678883, "text": "🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:15:26", "owner": "lubo.slavov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064083218103385, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:47:48", "owner": "aryan.exists_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17953672299010658, "text": "I was 15 at the time and omg it was the best", "created_at": "2025-10-15T16:54:16", "owner": "kid_lightning999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108592885518161, "text": "Song name❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:41:23", "owner": "dayani_sharmaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047056424368815, "text": "I was in my 2nd year of being in Korea 🇰🇷. On year 10 now haha", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:22:51", "owner": "layfield5283", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920059831192957, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:50:44", "owner": "astroakash29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058632830539720, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:26:12", "owner": "perez_nsanja.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18544996297022418, "text": "You woke something in me😭", "created_at": "2025-10-14T23:44:36", "owner": "holistic.haven5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847899496579727, "text": "The teenagers of 2016 were so much better than the ones we have now look more like teenagers and not overgrown 12 years and don’t even get me started on teen fashion these past 5 or 6 years", "created_at": "2025-10-14T23:41:39", "owner": "tr.ey1916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854491450552088, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T23:29:16", "owner": "cannotbefound19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157953940380554, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T23:28:37", "owner": "cannotbefound19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017336462606129, "text": "bro snuck trump in there💀😭🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:20:51", "owner": "dtb.mxrco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863333356498269, "text": "This is so peak", "created_at": "2025-10-14T15:20:07", "owner": "louie_srhoj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116101348532051, "text": "\"mannequin era\" IT WAS THE ANDYS COMING CHALLENGE", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:35:13", "owner": "rawringraves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926462653112476, "text": "Seeing a 2013 kid repost this make me feel old af.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:05:56", "owner": "azurukiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061803038573069, "text": "Take me back y’all 😭 I’m not ready for what’s next 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:21:52", "owner": "fatboyy4eva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081228452053762, "text": "I still fw fidget spinners and pokemon go, y'all can gth with ur skibidi labubus😼", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:11:47", "owner": "another_autistic_kid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531418945036582, "text": "The best trends!! 🔥🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:45:42", "owner": "juliansusko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085074229760531, "text": "2016 was such a good year", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:41:34", "owner": "vanassebrian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060789344398274, "text": "ain’t no way it’s almost been a decade", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:11:10", "owner": "mount_ev_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072281015229407, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:18:33", "owner": "fabiocristhofar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866455102397822, "text": "What about the best animated movie of 2016 known as Zootopia?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:11:08", "owner": "padawan532", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293073184273137, "text": "Captain America Civil War", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:19:54", "owner": "gmerboy492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082967749986279, "text": "Back when TikTok was called Musical.ly", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:08:24", "owner": "kaliltareks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964686939978717, "text": "I miss the simplicity of life", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:56:15", "owner": "josh_rackal.ig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922160491037118, "text": "Musicly", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:54:36", "owner": "kellen_bates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843042991594137, "text": "@include_blukid.h the real brainrot", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:04:23", "owner": "saharsh.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083477944769185, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:50:37", "owner": "mtj_19svg_88jj_24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047163659361084, "text": "Back then when there was no brain rot, no skipdsy toilet, no tung tung sahur no 67 and things was atualy funny and took skills to lurn, got good times😔😔", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:25:23", "owner": "kady_the_clown666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092598127829321, "text": "We don't future so we always found happiness in