:52", "owner": "salt_shakr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138059479445111, "text": "Shit was peak autism and it was so fun", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:01:14", "owner": "arashks_garage", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17887810047242659, "text": "Musical.ly and vine too", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:58:04", "owner": "sleepdisorder.exe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954970713878610, "text": "You can take trump out and add CoryxKenshin", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:56:36", "owner": "itryzboy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099595996635869, "text": "Help me help youuuu 🎵 now bet nb can tell me who sung that mann I miss the old days 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:20:46", "owner": "ebkobaby818", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072450931949570, "text": "All y’all stuck in the past", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:54:15", "owner": "raptibubti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957895653865495, "text": "tryna sneak trump in here😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:43:34", "owner": "ughjamarion_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18377199226198866, "text": "Samsung Galaxy Note 7 was 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:02:15", "owner": "kevin.guti7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18240680635295780, "text": "Why ppl act like 2016 was 40 years ago", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:56:28", "owner": "matfi_ej", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074059805516380, "text": "How was this almost 10 years ago😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:35:00", "owner": "urfavlenus_xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859515484530100, "text": "I saw a BMW.. On Pokemon Go clip", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:22:48", "owner": "_6th.dimension", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087236353904596, "text": "Everything but trump 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:00:46", "owner": "astupidusrname", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101676247629894, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:56:29", "owner": "xnshmaheshwari", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058501241568312, "text": "The song>>>", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:36:56", "owner": "ary.ann_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067820798055223, "text": "2013-18 era was so good never had a bad day", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:27:45", "owner": "exclusivelyjo___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859616146530193, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:16:59", "owner": "random_guy8010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109314850600965, "text": "Yoy can still see Mannequin challenge on the streets of major cities", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:54:05", "owner": "arjames26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111565849493800, "text": "I was 16😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:41:40", "owner": "noah_harbaugh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100775182650031, "text": "Why did you have to include Trump and ruin it? 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:35:58", "owner": "li.thium_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044801384436340, "text": "You guys were born too late 😢. Great year but this is straight degeneracy", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:30:38", "owner": "seekparadox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996153927836948, "text": "youtube rewind 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:09:22", "owner": "littlelaydie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896324974182183, "text": "bro tried to sneak in trump🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:50:53", "owner": "iurimoto.suriyashii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082161337999560, "text": "obj catch", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:47:04", "owner": "kyianbates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103030774616874, "text": "Happy these years were my childhood but I miss them fr", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:46:06", "owner": "pastelcukie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081529999819096, "text": "Is it bad I still dab", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:33:06", "owner": "skye_chann08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078706106107487, "text": "i still dab", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:31:26", "owner": "talvsm_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071385989217639, "text": "😭😭🔥🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:22:13", "owner": "jayashpathak_35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045467672394574, "text": "@maxoetke  @nikii.69", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:21:34", "owner": "levomns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116611288537610, "text": "Guava juice 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:21:08", "owner": "jp_toosturdy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099417697646725, "text": "The fact 2016 was almost 10 years ago really makes me realize how fast time really moves. In 2016 I was in middle school, now I’m 21 and working full time, for me it makes me appreciate those times as they were much better. If only we could have those times, but today.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:19:13", "owner": "aidan_haight04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937108375088017, "text": "Take me back there", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:19:13", "owner": "mika.poire123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878449042305207, "text": "trump supporter gotta go", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:09:33", "owner": "pty_sacred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063693062621541, "text": "don’t forget the killer clowns", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:54:35", "owner": "cn18xx_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937575217083741, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:26:49", "owner": "namann.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082198859067478, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:28:05", "owner": "threedaysgrace_fan109", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920169598179540, "text": "Guava Juice MENTIONED!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:17:01", "owner": "wanafif18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053654990640929, "text": "Trump 😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:16:22", "owner": "anime4life2073", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067674728363168, "text": "These were good times", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:10:16", "owner": "the_silvio_red", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941794648067905, "text": "\"that girl is a real crowd pleaser\"", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:46:32", "owner": "lmaarby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109009054571425, "text": "This forced me to follow u", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:40:02", "owner": "3xplicit_ved1xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100043365730783, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:54:36", "owner": "jordan_malaysias_kung_fu_panda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922845325160026, "text": "Love how short the trump clip was lmao", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:52:06", "owner": "justyourlocalcultist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917563339192369, "text": "damn...", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:22:29", "owner": "mijomorii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060297293173476, "text": "2014-2019 was the best era", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:14:33", "owner": "loukatouuu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053565413290796, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:10:46", "owner": "dumi_2008d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372961738145028, "text": "Covid 19 ruined everything", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:05:37", "owner": "3gaza.ts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060524843417534, "text": "Time when DUDE PERFECT was in trend😢", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:59:54", "owner": "always_noob2709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949275624907885, "text": "Almost a W edit 🤏🏽", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:15:44", "owner": "sex1cano3", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18531952687037245, "text": "Ai shi we runnin it back?? Who trynna go out and ride our hover boards?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:16:52", "owner": "905aiden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081369388950056, "text": "I wad 6 and and still got goosebumps 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:02:35", "owner": "urs._.rhesa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024255068562325, "text": "blud tryna sneak in trump", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:43:25", "owner": "d3ad4sleep", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061837697118534, "text": "dont forget prime roblox", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:15:14", "owner": "1.llll.1.lllll.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075031274129694, "text": "Lol 2016 has everything", "created_at": "2025-10-12T02:42:28", "owner": "wavie.sept1609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963484794977131, "text": "Pen pineapple apple pen 💔😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T02:12:54", "owner": "zlzk_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150120529406984, "text": "Xxxtentacion was alive ❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:56:44", "owner": "itz_abhey203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079962433997144, "text": "TikTok was the worlds destruction", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:55:51", "owner": "siahh_.2xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075615839163750, "text": "The best day 🥀 when u flex with a fidget spinner 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:52:31", "owner": "yrn_dcka.ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155494963402006, "text": "I still play clash and pokemon go", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:44:53", "owner": "foot_ballorlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117947593524085, "text": "Ur 2016 sucked dinky balls", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:18:59", "owner": "a.gunner55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178248880356235, "text": "Unliked so fast when Trump popped up 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:15:50", "owner": "satina1een", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18540505261014876, "text": "Trump one was the worst part", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:08:43", "owner": "hyujin04.3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155542597392931, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:44:29", "owner": "ava_java85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063080666570368, "text": "correction, THE DIAMOND MINECART! 🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:43:13", "owner": "hrtxaubrey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891021319358412, "text": "21 pilots", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:28:41", "owner": "agutsuma_vvk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871362271442034, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:25:31", "owner": "montesinos_john", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984695952903595, "text": "Where it all started…", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:04:19", "owner": "brovian15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429933754096983, "text": "Covid ruined everything", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:08:51", "owner": "kennedy_yennedy8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077245487512528, "text": "Trump 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:57:05", "owner": "zer0pika", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043247081408305, "text": "Trump was not a good thing", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:54:26", "owner": "nelly_multistan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098414383710337, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:46:08", "owner": "cam_t17_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920081356180174, "text": "Let it go bro damn🤦🏾‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:14:42", "owner": "kdnotshifty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167282209375413, "text": "I was 9 in 2016 and i loved my life and now im 18 and i hate my life..", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:20:12", "owner": "raclette_officiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182858401337157, "text": "I still do most of these things lol😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:01:34", "owner": "notme_12581", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087133804906226, "text": "good until trump was mentioned 🫩", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:54:29", "owner": "nyancatmeme.gif", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18070072664005889, "text": "youtube prime era 2016", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:54:17", "owner": "she7zan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976364088779906, "text": "Bring back mannequin challenge 💔", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:12:35", "owner": "bishimwhite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984927990899211, "text": "Half of these things are 2017 or 2015", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:25:55", "owner": "hazzcw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102874762615714, "text": "covid fucked everything up.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:13:10", "owner": "cryptxmnesia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043156967405586, "text": "Dan 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:34:33", "owner": "gnab_berry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393927964192911, "text": "that time was great until we are introduced to Valorant...", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:33:47", "owner": "ddraig_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530783734030962, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:12:12", "owner": "giockassum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529468333062596, "text": "You had me til you brought trump into this", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:08:51", "owner": "itz_crackhead_bulla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926872930136329, "text": "Pls 2017 _2018", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:37:55", "owner": "karlogoldencigarette", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873799357430358, "text": "I was there", "created_at": "2025-10-11T09:03:23", "owner": "iakovoss_1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982191231913335, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T08:32:20", "owner": "alexka091", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080061881054767, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T08:21:52", "owner": "jho_caesar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054499055255869, "text": "Where's slime?😭", "created_at": "2025-10-11T07:19:53", "owner": "____.janaeeee01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096696379674068, "text": "Had to hit a dab rq", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:25:09", "owner": "gabrielchasnlife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866296054393225, "text": "2015-2019...what a time to be alive bro 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-11T04:52:31", "owner": "co0ki3._m0nst3r", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18116182906471295, "text": "Most of these were 2017-2018", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:46:10", "owner": "greaseracer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081942488050701, "text": "We WILL doing this during the great meme reset", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:25:36", "owner": "waving_sand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058025639624982, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:22:31", "owner": "marcellhutajulu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043168046424013, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:03:09", "owner": "elieasante5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18017913929603884, "text": "2016 was a legendary year", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:02:42", "owner": "elieasante5", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18529917952038499, "text": "Good thing I've experienced this as a 2011 child", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:56:32", "owner": "inkwhitty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937010461091478, "text": "Oh my gosh, I remember the Dab and I remember fidget spinners and the bottle flip I still do it sometimes", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:07:59", "owner": "coopyr_dennis08311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083261602781880, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:13:33", "owner": "that.nigga.tevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935971060089753, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:13:12", "owner": "that.nigga.tevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899695147296182, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:12:49", "owner": "that.nigga.tevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096289687690251, "text": "and racism on YouTube, so, so much racism on YouTube", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:44:03", "owner": "cristianoatahualpa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076759247123550, "text": "guava juice❤️🌹", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:42:19", "owner": "itzkag3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18533914795030804, "text": "Trump?? You ruined the list", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:28:27", "owner": "magicbunnylover_140", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17862173895486943, "text": "Akkkkkk also when galaxy stuff took over everything and everyone was making DIY EOS crap. 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:51:47", "owner": "fatimazzz_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936640929961552, "text": "fidget spinners were 2017", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:43:48", "owner": "remy.portillo321", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097445626597286, "text": "Bottle Flip Challenge + Dab", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:14:23", "owner": "_e_cortes_7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093638926764544, "text": "We had no idea how good we had it back then", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:56:31", "owner": "cooliobrudda", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094114168693196, "text": "This is pre election, mabey trumps election was the pivotal point for the past 9 years", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:50:42", "owner": "_j.laka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114216676527087, "text": "Alot of my friends ain't make it outta this year😥🕊️", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:23:47", "owner": "ozepesopeso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932797333098773, "text": "The song 🙂‍↔️🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:20:28", "owner": "_.maaaaaaaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985980801897543, "text": "🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:17:26", "owner": "1gauravbhosale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847917802554049, "text": "Is this rage bait?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:53:35", "owner": "jaykessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059474633175610, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:34:01", "owner": "jaidifares", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886550893369271, "text": "bro this song.. 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:19:05", "owner": "s0.sxnsational", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928670778998567, "text": "Bro my cousin wasn't even born yet now he's going to school😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-10T16:55:25", "owner": "tramelroberts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928868631997926, "text": "New generation wouldn't understand🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:55:56", "owner": "4th_panzer_army", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421709050105998, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:53:56", "owner": "cxlin.stl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17916341637194826, "text": "2016 was a bad and sad year for me. Bud Spencer, Anton Yelchin, David Bowie, Muhammad Alì, Theresa Saldana, Doris Roberts, Gene Wilder, Prince and George Michael passed away. Christina Grimmie, one of my favourite singers, was murdered by Kevin James Loibl. I miss Christina so much. ❤", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:51:37", "owner": "davide.corso_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085052423497922, "text": "ppl love 2016 more than their families", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:45:08", "owner": "igotzeroaura", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17899019592296071, "text": "When you felt the real joy 😔😢", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:23:22", "owner": "smachart.10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017896205602595, "text": "Okay this is very nostalgic.. but I need to express the fact Kevin hart did not know what the hell he was doing. That was not a dab", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:02:23", "owner": "vaehsart5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855945148540987, "text": "Trumppp is on here because it ruined us totally", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:38:42", "owner": "chailautworld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090581665835905, "text": "vibrant times", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:19:46", "owner": "syaahrulandikaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897098890313445, "text": "2016 was different😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:07:56", "owner": "taki_hm7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044934299392410, "text": "I miss 2016 so much 😔💔", "created_at": "2025-10-10T09:22:09", "owner": "jana_avtr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065071910458469, "text": "怎麼會有台北😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-10T08:54:42", "owner": "im_zi_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921898999167789, "text": "Withing two months this will be 10 years ago 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-10T08:09:46", "owner": "yog.xox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059734136415881, "text": "Song name", "created_at": "2025-10-10T07:19:44", "owner": "emiraydinuzunali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100903444572896, "text": "Clash royale 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:51:04", "owner": "tasfin_ahmed_abir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090443095890582, "text": "Palestine", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:48:49", "owner": "ziedalshear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082262653808685, "text": "ahhh is so long", "created_at": "2025-10-10T04:51:50", "owner": "andre_rdn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050985782318466, "text": "NO AI 😩😩😩😩😩😩", "created_at": "2025-10-10T03:29:15", "owner": "ssxybvby", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846053074583026, "text": "had to unrepost ts… remake it wo trump", "created_at": "2025-10-10T03:21:32", "owner": "hearts4_amber", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17952088542009924, "text": "Crap year", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:53:10", "owner": "simba_813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856588207475855, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:48:39", "owner": "wadejrl094", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856378282478921, "text": "9 years....🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:09:37", "owner": "dragon_cold_nemesis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098113750670455, "text": "Take me back pleaseeee", "created_at": "2025-10-10T01:36:03", "owner": "ryaananthony__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081550960796862, "text": "Nah. I mostly remember the Pulse Nightclub shooting, Christina Grimmie's passing, etc. I guess the only thing I liked about that year in this video that I remember is PokemonGo", "created_at": "2025-10-10T01:08:22", "owner": "texaskira2006", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946905979023255, "text": "Let’s go back to", "created_at": "2025-10-10T01:05:27", "owner": "princ3ss_sw33tn3ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068798921585020, "text": "some of ts was stupid ngl", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:51:21", "owner": "npvalentine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989044467715385, "text": "time machine when?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:20:15", "owner": "ashie_washie1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374304505147037, "text": "Maybe 2020+ is Ai generated", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:12:42", "owner": "orange.ryan.eric", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986571744730614, "text": "My smile instantly left when I saw trump.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:52:49", "owner": "og_skyyy1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108146290596908, "text": "This song always gives me goosebumps", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:25:10", "owner": "obvcyphon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110895961496540, "text": "wasn’t fidget spinners 2017 though or am i going crazy cause they always the wrong year in these vids and nobody points it out", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:10:22", "owner": "icepenilecapricorn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073148932958976, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:45:42", "owner": "acext01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030823460719546, "text": "You lost me when i didn't see the splash and sum njgga Logan person whatever was dabbinh", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:25:39", "owner": "boi_with_cosworth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082139194960606, "text": "Hillary clinton killing off the dab will never not be funny. Like she dabbed and it was over 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:46:44", "owner": "soursneef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078879922859738, "text": "Gotta be the best year", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:38:18", "owner": "anthonygishere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037310834686837, "text": "Prime Pokémon go had society in an iron grip😭😭😭😭✌️✌️", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:35:09", "owner": "giftedhaterfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913458463209304, "text": "OK NOW WE HAVE TO MAKE 2026 LOOK LIKE 2016.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:30:57", "owner": "imlight_ok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863025214482156, "text": "Pokemon Go still peak", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:52:36", "owner": "kolaqvc_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085406798498938, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:28:32", "owner": "elia_minichilli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069217547255745, "text": "Hold up clas has been around allot longer then that. I've been playing it SINCE it got released. Fix yo timeframes", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:20:10", "owner": "us3r.6660", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936000033966110, "text": "Mean while in Middle East: 💣☣️", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:09:47", "owner": "bayad_ameen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059122970400735, "text": "We miss 2000 to 2016😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:09:14", "owner": "legendgam420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092607283789349, "text": "When we were cringe and not afraid to show it", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:06:45", "owner": "urbou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861521188433021, "text": "Best years of my life then the new generation took over are good times", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:57:33", "owner": "zone_attack_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014784881616506, "text": "WAIT.... Am I realy that old🥀💔💔", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:33:17", "owner": "n1k0_knvp1k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089558291508120, "text": "Dantdm never exited his prime, fight me.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:24:43", "owner": "frzbee_dingle_445", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064704323457664, "text": "Fidget spinners was 2017", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:09:44", "owner": "_bro.chado_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857799820532521, "text": "Guava juice 💔💔💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:04:15", "owner": "give_me_chocolatee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852036427559305, "text": "Greatest times of my life🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:34:15", "owner": "dbwrldz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139855018442361, "text": "ON & ON IS SUCH A GOOD SONG CHOICE FOR THIS OMG I MISS THIS", "created_at": "2025-10-09T15:09:47", "owner": "queena4809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058077629448479, "text": "THE GOLDEN ERA 2016-2018 TAKE ME BACK", "created_at": "2025-10-09T15:08:51", "owner": "queena4809", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18428887939097849, "text": "Yup, don't miss it at all. Best thing was mannequin challenge and Clash Royale then, I guess", "create