icreep", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093179158804757, "text": "Ts low-key made me tear up. I used to own a batarang fidget", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:01:16", "owner": "kreek.fanlovesforsaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107763931570427, "text": "This songggg", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:47:38", "owner": "mr.jump_outnblow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984918102873263, "text": "Background music😭😢 on&on", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:39:42", "owner": "w_s_h_matthew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045163322669168, "text": "Dan tdm never left his prime in my opinion", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:16:37", "owner": "alexanderthornton_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081588223982942, "text": "\"Bhai statue statue khelega?\" 🙃🙃", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:28:47", "owner": "_.zafree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090924685865329, "text": "On and on ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:46:57", "owner": "garvit_brahman_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081067253005370, "text": "remove trump...", "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:34:31", "owner": "ajsnowie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938629183077684, "text": "Bruh this shit can stay there and not come back😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:11:37", "owner": "andreucalaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077341049036306, "text": "I miss Vine", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:51:02", "owner": "otti.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056522420552099, "text": "Ronaldo Euro", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:28:26", "owner": "shuaeb.ashraf.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060987416147197, "text": "God I’m old", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:28:24", "owner": "theshinyj2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022700228780245, "text": "bro thought he could sneak trump in there", "created_at": "2025-10-08T05:49:11", "owner": "ooo_penguinz_ooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982839057881095, "text": "The world before trump was elected", "created_at": "2025-10-08T05:10:17", "owner": "its_ayymani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053557148278856, "text": "The song😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-08T05:02:33", "owner": "srijani_fs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901324402143507, "text": "Johan cruyff RIP 2016 🥀😢", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:53:57", "owner": "kamilov_akrombek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108304837604286, "text": "Blessed 7777777blessed", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:40:14", "owner": "ethan_somero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054816188250025, "text": "jaman jaya taik anjg misss", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:18:07", "owner": "r.taqii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081517645823155, "text": "When school was fun 😖😖", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:28:40", "owner": "stunna4edynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103013449720216, "text": "The World was peaceful during that era", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:08:45", "owner": "brocklesnarbsdk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060690125143485, "text": "TikTok made kids now dumb 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-08T01:43:14", "owner": "shchcxy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932273664983633, "text": "🤧❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-07T22:43:27", "owner": "aarybot9000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381350455176515, "text": "One of the few years in the last decade and a half or so for me that didn’t fully suck ass", "created_at": "2025-10-07T21:58:32", "owner": "chibear101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061607663578457, "text": "When true brain rot took over", "created_at": "2025-10-07T20:49:23", "owner": "mistadantastic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080911798973998, "text": "dantdm prime 😔😔", "created_at": "2025-10-07T20:13:44", "owner": "axyxn_r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093453796806699, "text": "Dab whas in 2017", "created_at": "2025-10-07T19:40:25", "owner": "rubenlovg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110567137560897, "text": "You forgot the \"DAAAAMN DANIEL!!\"", "created_at": "2025-10-07T19:34:20", "owner": "_e_cortes_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097618708737304, "text": "every generation says the same thing. 😅", "created_at": "2025-10-07T19:07:52", "owner": "karnige4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108707587601824, "text": "pissed cause for a decent bit of this time i wasnt allowed to be in yt so i missed like 2017-2019 dan, cory, and a couple others, feels like i got robbed", "created_at": "2025-10-07T19:04:39", "owner": "d1pns1p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082776349988299, "text": "Kendama", "created_at": "2025-10-07T18:19:38", "owner": "fiinsta_edy_rz15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057064538552673, "text": "One of my favorite years! 2016 was iconic 🥹😍", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:46:51", "owner": "chilltrailers.tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872534743355864, "text": "😃😃😃😃😃😃😃☹️😃😃", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:28:58", "owner": "landon_hibbert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858388399522348, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:19:33", "owner": "notmitch1803", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18166023331330927, "text": "Damn thats almost 10 years ago now 😬", "created_at": "2025-10-07T14:56:21", "owner": "thimal.ran", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104139421546992, "text": "5 minute crafts….", "created_at": "2025-10-07T13:13:06", "owner": "dante__awesome", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086977054914345, "text": "what i will ask you though is can you give me 1 more day.", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:06:45", "owner": "krishivslife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289610389287239, "text": "THE RED ONE HAS BEEN CHOSEN", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:02:07", "owner": "bemer.son", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105448771608589, "text": "Aye smile cz we did all that lol🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:58:42", "owner": "elwerkooficial_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016648910606147, "text": "@vari.03 @darshitsoni__16", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:30:02", "owner": "_kushsoni_03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042237782432291, "text": "Damn has it really been that long", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:27:54", "owner": "whois.chico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079036403092863, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-07T09:01:44", "owner": "hkwalker09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424379584110231, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-07T09:01:34", "owner": "hkwalker09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097696591677760, "text": "Oh to be a high schooler then😔", "created_at": "2025-10-07T07:24:47", "owner": "rc.ajj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178234537352077, "text": "New challenge: try to keep your hard on as long as possible. No touching! Just the thought to keep you hard", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:50:20", "owner": "jp.7oh7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069374423007881, "text": "Holy fuck we were retarded", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:48:59", "owner": "dr.egon_cholakian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536276710021924, "text": "I think my country was FARR behind 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:27:17", "owner": "masho_gulua_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865948321398900, "text": "Look at a good year ❤️🔥😭 i miss that ngl.", "created_at": "2025-10-07T05:02:41", "owner": "0310.jackie._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887794075365953, "text": "So basically everything goated happened in 2016", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:45:47", "owner": "hassanshahzadkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083597018503288, "text": "ts not nostalgic", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:39:04", "owner": "hikikomoriwife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071394704260941, "text": "this is a weak point in time. do better! go back to the 90s when most things were original not copied.", "created_at": "2025-10-07T01:44:24", "owner": "_gildaddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853422430552592, "text": "did you really have to ruin this nostalgic perfect reel with trump here..", "created_at": "2025-10-07T01:29:42", "owner": "_.milenka.privv._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078127286099344, "text": "I almost shed a tear watching this😢😔🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-07T01:01:17", "owner": "_t_omm_y_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090073957882674, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:59:24", "owner": "medieval_cat_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18180589708338972, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:05:36", "owner": "tr4_pz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081909059474469, "text": "Everything before Covid was lwky peak especially 2016-2019", "created_at": "2025-10-06T22:18:36", "owner": "luvvjoceyyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078522619860372, "text": "Remove trump and it’s sold", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:44:59", "owner": "clifftongooning24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18113535439481538, "text": "2016 - 2021 were the best. And I'm a Gen X", "created_at": "2025-10-06T20:34:25", "owner": "gorgonops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071530174967897, "text": "Best days", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:51:58", "owner": "betalpanchbingsati_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067621364462931, "text": "Bro instead of missing everything let's just bring it all back 👍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:22:43", "owner": "chainedupheart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071414372332354, "text": "2016 was 9 years ago😢", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:57:43", "owner": "jacob.aidan.smith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052791293302300, "text": "The DAP was my favourite", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:06:32", "owner": "iftekhar__hasan___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140557330431406, "text": "The PPAP was and still is the best", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:50:56", "owner": "nightoftheliving_bell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372964600150331, "text": "A decade ago 🥀😭", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:48:55", "owner": "xuzaki_rehab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922434589027793, "text": "2016 was a whole lot of cringey fun 💀🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:16:43", "owner": "seeasideofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094603999742324, "text": "Goaded", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:14:17", "owner": "itsyoboyykeith67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031063961708771, "text": "who is that tdm guy", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:06:41", "owner": "k_eybeets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964664385975881, "text": "Dengan sound Ncs 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:10:27", "owner": "iirzaaan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127931170468142, "text": "I love spinners❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:24:33", "owner": "jakub_cl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040788869467118, "text": "Id do anything to relive those years again", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:05:03", "owner": "j4y_the_king07", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18181448383339491, "text": "2018...😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:47:00", "owner": "sabri.ina_liaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864520375412483, "text": "Dabbing is permanently in my life idc who you are", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:38:58", "owner": "th9y.l0ve.p4yt0n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973883820929163, "text": "Life was with a special flavour …", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:56:49", "owner": "ashraaf.elhvvm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878016733302798, "text": "Pokemon go to the polls", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:50:23", "owner": "spacyqueso", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901176349143557, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:42:03", "owner": "moggingmaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144630052424969, "text": "I'll never forget when I was in 7th grade and my school's headmaster did the bottle flip challenge at assembly. He landed it first try and everyone went WILD.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:18:18", "owner": "therealjbas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077153225103076, "text": "Graduated high school this year", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:40:07", "owner": "hbkwayne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919471912178645, "text": "Yes we know all the crazy things started back then", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:31:44", "owner": "ata80s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968765067950143, "text": "Just take me back to 2002", "created_at": "2025-10-06T08:49:12", "owner": "allisoncathy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045711146380848, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T05:28:41", "owner": "zeeroo78p", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101411281720511, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T05:08:51", "owner": "_.yanndagostino._", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059226743628841, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T04:59:46", "owner": "michalsakac135", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18360125557085293, "text": "Don't forget when lebron owned curry", "created_at": "2025-10-06T04:46:28", "owner": "grandlethal24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18268097176304404, "text": "When everything was simple", "created_at": "2025-10-06T04:23:08", "owner": "joeyritzcracker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921303082039379, "text": "2016 was such a good year 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-06T04:20:52", "owner": "playmakajay3x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849781522535236, "text": "Prime trump", "created_at": "2025-10-06T04:04:28", "owner": "jaixden_the_joker9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122061022503531, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T03:41:40", "owner": "gxk_godzilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037757591686676, "text": "2016 will be 10 years ago next year....", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:40:42", "owner": "kween.anu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986022897904860, "text": "And the generational debt challenge 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:23:36", "owner": "seancann0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078025072859755, "text": "What is this rewind?", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:21:41", "owner": "shima.for.sure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113709388558644, "text": "Trump being elected was the beginning of the end.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:21:54", "owner": "tevvuno", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935347138095911, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T22:31:39", "owner": "str33t_spider101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068825285586868, "text": "Old is good", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:47:58", "owner": "pololu_naihe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114727393541153, "text": "When the shortest videos we would watch were 5 minutes", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:01:27", "owner": "prk_eq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982606863860771, "text": "Vanoss gaming and the crew peak time🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-05T19:21:32", "owner": "atl.ta.e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965235909973420, "text": "Peak life.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T19:17:44", "owner": "nevagaveasht_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095400613672919, "text": "We did not need to bring politics into this bro 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-05T19:15:38", "owner": "jgrace15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133140871413980, "text": "Enjoy the little things while you still can🥀😢😭😔", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:18:04", "owner": "joyboy1111112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099160366628728, "text": "i still dab idcc", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:11:15", "owner": "someunknownprettyybtc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084185068746450, "text": "2015-2018 were the prime years", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:54:44", "owner": "sanikabellare", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086296189913083, "text": "2017-2018 ish was the last good years of humanity", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:55:59", "owner": "falke.jensen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008982161796390, "text": "Telling my future kids this was WW3 😔🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:50:04", "owner": "b1gdr3amt3am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088063846723720, "text": "gotta put prime jack doherty on here 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:35:44", "owner": "_luv5anta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949608258905212, "text": "🚬🚬🚬 ahhhh… good times…", "created_at": "2025-10-05T14:59:41", "owner": "itsallastateofmind10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109815679568651, "text": "Great memories rivision", "created_at": "2025-10-05T14:36:23", "owner": "jsh_hiten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975125187926922, "text": "the dab was 2014 bro", "created_at": "2025-10-05T14:33:36", "owner": "imagine_itslil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952540483010394, "text": "Fidget spinners were a 2017 thing", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:30:36", "owner": "thefoursquarelegend", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18045818213676386, "text": "prime techno", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:27:43", "owner": "az_bs2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072591095231271, "text": "If Covid didn’t happen it still all be the same I bet", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:19:43", "owner": "zoellerbrady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857732596530795, "text": "2016 War On Drugs in the Philippines😎👍", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:19:24", "owner": "iamjoseph1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075334172133928, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:10:47", "owner": "natemorales0711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078438509104540, "text": "What a time to be alive", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:08:21", "owner": "rkenzo1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17875572921326128, "text": "All this was so cool back then 😭 I want it backk", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:06:11", "owner": "falakf_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132914413457329, "text": "🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:26:49", "owner": "ddnkg_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860066761506225, "text": "Pokemon had everyone touching grass", "created_at": "2025-10-05T09:10:02", "owner": "yujinvance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975056244783019, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T08:50:58", "owner": "mtb_ballsy_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17904433410128271, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T08:47:13", "owner": "kugi166", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081240160810502, "text": "😭 Fridget Spinner ka Nahi karna tha 😭 Please 😔 9999+ Types of it I remember", "created_at": "2025-10-05T08:39:39", "owner": "mustafa.mughal31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18326528185236371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T07:16:56", "owner": "szymanskys_music_93", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981154884914478, "text": "What with noob, pro, hacker, god?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T07:15:48", "owner": "szymanskys_music_93", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18172574644363566, "text": "@adam.blooms", "created_at": "2025-10-05T06:34:05", "owner": "ben._.chohra_2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848058637545538, "text": "guava juice😢", "created_at": "2025-10-05T06:28:42", "owner": "anthonygeeezzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075609521113656, "text": "Pasword nya dimenit berapa bang🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-05T06:08:08", "owner": "hey_wii15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940937143068005, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-05T05:53:48", "owner": "bilalnaek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249406879288003, "text": "the mannequin challenge ❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-10-05T04:55:25", "owner": "atx.jordan_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842212780595364, "text": "When life was good 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-05T04:10:29", "owner": "yefuune", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921410563150827, "text": "take me back to", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:52:09", "owner": "liv.madison.crawford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531612967027176, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T02:08:58", "owner": "real._.geh_gordon", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17940124286948202, "text": "Miss all a dt 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-05T01:54:27", "owner": "kev._.yg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910269829094698, "text": "Man when YouTube was what everyone was watchin, watchin them damn \"top 15 best fidget spinners\" and shi, i miss it all man", "created_at": "2025-10-05T01:29:15", "owner": "no0ne0f1nterest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926631403103035, "text": "Wait ppap was 2014", "created_at": "2025-10-05T00:53:30", "owner": "20j0rd4n07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096439624677422, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T00:04:22", "owner": "of_wain", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059435747575841, "text": "2016 was frl the best year", "created_at": "2025-10-04T23:52:34", "owner": "eptx_mari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027131444535894, "text": "Ain't nobody give a fuck ant Trump lmao", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:31:54", "owner": "lizzydarks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875571055423066, "text": "All the woke flakes upset about the Trump mention 😂 🤡", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:30:02", "owner": "jgarb12024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950128020900064, "text": "Most of ts sucked bro ain’t no way we’re nostalgiabaiting 2016 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:11:15", "owner": "alec_agil1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111904657495613, "text": "2016 was great being in high school. But honestly middle school was better going back to 2011 to 2013 for me. Feeling your first crush for the first time, learning a myriad of different emotions for the first time, homemade pizzas, holiday parties, sports, and recess. I always look back on how simply and fun life was. Now everything fist fucks you constantly and the dream of ome day being able to provide a perfect life for a family of your own is shattered.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:04:19", "owner": "ryguycoolbro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537570817003939, "text": "and the worst is trump", "created_at": "2025-10-04T21:43:43", "owner": "ryu.souta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921367552158835, "text": "I still have a fidget spinner 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:33:24", "owner": "xoxo._.christinaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091936732755573, "text": "I wonder what would the world look like without AI", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:23:49", "owner": "cheezballzzzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989752092707543, "text": "2014 was better", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:18:55", "owner": "abdelrahmanmoutaz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001756031819633, "text": "When life we knew it would be worse, I’d rather Hilary had won 💔", "created_at": "2025-10-04T19:06:37", "owner": "chrissyelloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926196817136877, "text": "I wish I were a teen living in this time, I was 8 I don't remember much 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:50:59", "owner": "tez_the_g_63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071306332976320, "text": "Almost 10 years ago….", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:03:41", "owner": "tyler_ellis395", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895168309325242, "text": "Before tiktok, fortnite, and brainrot genuinely started seeping it’s way into us.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:22:45", "owner": "ctdacc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984112188739865, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:05:27", "owner": "af_arrr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079902134005450, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:45:20", "owner": "_ot4vio_dv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003517706651392, "text": "Wheres hoverboards", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:39:29", "owner": "ok.triam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151884661366833, "text": "I wish we could show this generation how this felt, before trump and the overuse of electronics", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:39:24", "owner": "n0cturnel.sir3n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069733097240148, "text": "Why did you add trump dawg no one misses that 🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:55:59", "owner": "brdn239", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065199533368036, "text": "pokemon go scene was 5 mins away from my house gng", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:15:35", "owner": "_lesterboi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111370126494000, "text": "I was 5😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:12:33", "owner": "danielle_2029_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084171763942310, "text": "Covid really messed up the time and everything I feel like we’re in a dream and moving extremely fast right now", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:25:17", "owner": "thickhogrider", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021493331760899, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:19:23", "owner": "asianboi_sapin13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358100863086712, "text": "The worst thing is I was only seven so I never really realized how much I would miss those days until now😿😿😿😿😿", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:56:09", "owner": "backokhg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063402740584416, "text": "In 10 years people are going to make videos like this about brain rot.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T12:35:32", "owner": "fw._lucas0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086986330859250, "text": "Back when it wasn’t corny to dance", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:55:06", "owner": "designerjunkyjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138647206445859, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:29:23", "owner": "deejay_k_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073714075907643, "text": "This song 😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:51:07", "owner": "tesssaaa_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058216931181399, "text": "The song name plzzz???😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:49:56", "owner": "bluehaired_gir111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859739965508882, "text": "9 years ago 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:01:01", "owner": "im_is_a_human321", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909307330236394, "text": "The pokemon go made me lost in the wood for day, but i survived cuz there a rare Pokemon in the village so i go there without hesitati", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:13:45", "owner": "simonthepatrick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069269576237971, "text": "The song always reminds me of the Good old times. I want to go back😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:01:34", "owner": "salomebockayova", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17886998835243456, "text": "Seems like 2016 was when most of the dumb shit happened", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:30:31", "owner": "rickwithck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872206207437181, "text": "Peak of humanity", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:33:07", "owner": "kiddo._.shubh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884448067382587, "text": "I wish 2025 would be like 2016 I miss dantdm and all that so much", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:29:12", "owner": "nimmo.xyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074615924036476, "text": "Now🤳📱", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:18:17", "owner": "baohan02102012", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095096428666614, "text": "I wakt spinners", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:51:16", "owner": "charleseilish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085785037910841, "text": "Growtopia 🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:18:44", "owner": "lianhua_william", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073348231918752, "text": "Bottle flip is still famous in my class", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:49:02", "owner": "eee._.0210717", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067760810253311, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:17:39", "owner": "nkhl.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052197725300711, "text": "what about the colorful smoke?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T03:22:55", "owner": "vciaa_14", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18165775945332376, "text": "IVE BEEN SEARCHING FOR THIS SONG FOR THE PAST 3 YEARS WHATS IT CALLED BRO😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:58:40", "owner": "akhil.clouded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092394991829128, "text": "I still watch Dan tdm", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:49:13", "owner": "kimbercrosier.xo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992396364851842, "text": "And now we have a different type of dab", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:19:35", "owner": "dey.fw.k_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056603249627781, "text": "best year on my life 2019-2016", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:19:00", "owner": "gershenchevko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084369985909961, "text": "I feel old", "created_at": "2025-10-04T00:26:10", "owner": "jscharli890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030319322512127, "text": "Damn 😭🤍", "created_at": "2025-10-03T23:50:45", "owner": "s1nth_ef3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068045882255592, "text": "I am the comment 4000", "created_at": "2025-10-03T23:46:54", "owner": "naruto__kun999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077534015027560, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:48:23", "owner": "coryxthegoat385", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904367017127101, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:42:41", "owner": "evansdigregorio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528735724019004, "text": "Stop the AI memes and go back to all those vibes please.❤️🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-03T21:11:46", "owner": "moon._.fs1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943574377053211, "text": "🥹❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-03T20:42:27", "owner": "daimraza._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865858162466555, "text": "If you think Dan tdm’s prime was in 2016 you’re a bot", "created_at": "2025-10-03T20:16:17", "owner": "calebchildren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076808222091716, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:12:12", "owner": "jarad_pocock", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295628512270601, "text": "og guava juice", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:58:23", "owner": "purplegutzz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068874488206778, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:32:13", "owner": "thomas.the.traint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112802026551476, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:52:44", "owner": "_nuno_silva0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073504061150496, "text": "Ooh, the red one has been chosen 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:47:51", "owner": "sansingame", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035621336505978, "text": "stranger things release 😭😫", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:39:18", "owner": "diegoazuos26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126919372487314, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:07:10", "owner": "tae_j22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061436252120667, "text": "guys andy’s coming", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:51:07", "owner": "azthawed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097312630677012, "text": "so much nostalgia 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-03T14:09:46", "owner": "m.zayyan_raheel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973834524937519, "text": "Those days, I remember that feels like yesterday 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:28:51", "owner": "charlo4774", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298962226301915, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:26:14", "owner": "_sosaaadadonnyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064106090596200, "text": "Nearly a decade ago", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:37:08", "owner": "monolythical", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18373562974148884, "text": "Bring me back", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:15:17", "owner": "rnjsdydwns.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134072857458548, "text": "Don’t forget the warheads challenge in the era of challenges 😂🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:51:26", "owner": "adam_mouiakkine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068545103519292, "text": "@ayushpeter @steve___peters 😢❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:40:18", "owner": "_soham7_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18132912721456672, "text": "The song 🥹🗣️🔥‼️", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:03:48", "owner": "blvn.undead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914877682196033, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T07:51:46", "owner": "jaitra_cooks", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18532901785010424, "text": "This is a real era, not braintot or labubu", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:04:20", "owner": "lorenzo_varriale7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068233568252400, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-03T05:58:31", "owner": "gabriel.scht_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850511596560477, "text": "When the happiness is simply like that…", "created_at": "2025-10-03T05:19:34", "owner": "khrisna.gram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289483090286831, "text": "You guys were complaining about 2016 being a bad year y’all are going to the say the same shit about 2025", "created_at": "2025-10-03T03:58:24", "owner": "rightangletriangl3e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116767039466889, "text": "I was 8 years , now I'm 17 and going to be 18😢💔", "created_at": "2025-10-03T03:22:35", "owner": "kimjana25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068396855522118, "text": "😢😢😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-03T02:02:26", "owner": "robsonkevin084", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946438246025974, "text": "Bottle flips are still tuff", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:29:14", "owner": "tourejeffrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080875402970611, "text": "🥹🥹🥹🥹🥀🥀🥀🥀 I miss it so much I think of that year all the time 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:24:52", "owner": "alexandergreene761", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396553939136237, "text": "Musically>>>Tiktok", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:19:45", "owner": "_malsoaib06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927907927105025, "text": "If only I could be reborn 2010 again and go through this again kids these days need help", "created_at": "2025-10-02T23:45:16", "owner": "punkbeast6710", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18178159846344126, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T23:40:39", "owner": "beastlyofficial1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079737836290643, "text": "The sis vs bro", "created_at": "2025-10-02T23:02:10", "owner": "ur.winkz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052568333639591, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:18:11", "owner": "chris._02.27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965804388972840, "text": "the way most of this isnt even 2016 but 2017-2018", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:32:29", "owner": "whimiscalwaffles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861552379485887, "text": "2016 is the year ever. ＶＡＰＯＲＷＡＶＥ and future funk changed it so good. And maybe Milo too. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:32:03", "owner": "alchemist_knight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045329729367125, "text": "the song made me cry", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:44:35", "owner": "khodi.iir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848932723569963, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:27:03", "owner": "unequip_reference", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080972167956640, "text": "people still do the mannequin challenge", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:47:00", "owner": "ty.banga__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055797878242253, "text": "🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:23:31", "owner": "batmaaanx_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157887904391611, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:07:22", "owner": "darien_k4_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866946571461016, "text": "song name", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:30:00", "owner": "limhz_x1013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924558691117476, "text": "One year later the greatest Roblox game of all times released: Jailbreak Beta 🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:48:16", "owner": "cklein.vz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18182745229338383, "text": "Closer by the chainsmokers", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:55:09", "owner": "joshastings", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059915285430294, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:18:06", "owner": "jimmy.oc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18532305934003426, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:36:21", "owner": "nate.officialll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961233171841010, "text": "Teníamos el COVID más merecido de lo que pensaba... 🙄🤦🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:05:38", "owner": "trsstrsr92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065116172609752, "text": "“Anny’s coming” only OG’s would probably get that one. Anny’s coming and everyone would drop to the floor", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:40:31", "owner": "alijah.db", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093347509790658, "text": "Song name?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:25:36", "owner": "omerprime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971840694942694, "text": "The dab was so iconic😔", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:44:16", "owner": "93847_ac", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18056930258544206, "text": "That's all 2017 - 2018", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:39:20", "owner": "caesar.laag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114784510473038, "text": "The world was almost still decent go back to 2010", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:38:07", "owner": "im_.lucky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159789283378089, "text": "I think my 1st grade teacher has a photo of me doing the dab", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:32:11", "owner": "782.apex_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337579492204164, "text": "Don't forget Justin Bieber prime", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:11:31", "owner": "clumphus", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18068047166216282, "text": "one of these is not like the otherssssssss", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:02:21", "owner": "cryingmort", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921771271159070, "text": "Was chopped asf but at least it was peak happiness", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:59:08", "owner": "_battmannn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082032070788844, "text": "I’ll pass on 2016, this was the beginning of where we ended up today. Big pass", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:36:06", "owner": "markdes1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975314160920431, "text": "Freshman year for me best 4 years of school and literally in general before life got ruined", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:03:54", "owner": "strawberryyayo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895071532186641, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T03:55:34", "owner": "m4rc0_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027990158526664, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T03:52:23", "owner": "el.guero.hugo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296721022265433, "text": "I love", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:20:31", "owner": "_.cuteastrophe._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055553498225430, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:12:11", "owner": "bassma_pinqui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077718293077722, "text": "Would’ve given anything to be a teen during this era", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:53:24", "owner": "_wes_loves_god_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126384211488861, "text": "Back then when people were nicer 😔💔", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:37:55", "owner": "lowkeyjason_15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924002788118700, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:03:32", "owner": "ymdb_lavaboiledegg_koborez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17899048128287058, "text": "the late 2010s were just shitty and i was more than happy when covid began", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:24:21", "owner": "ginalauralex_airways", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068625848243820, "text": "Only legend knows Musical.ly", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:11:57", "owner": "setsu_yatogami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926378989130282, "text": "You lost me at trump", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:06:52", "owner": "alivetovibe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18134630116458400, "text": "Good old days 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:26:53", "owner": "muslimmamba2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18118697227510267, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:14:15", "owner": "amit_salap_7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058507394419416, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:52:11", "owner": "kiravex_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025599161535214, "text": "I hope y’all know this is p diddys prime and your favorite celebrities were getting cracked with baby oil and we didn’t find out until years later", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:17:32", "owner": "yvan_him", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079523087481596, "text": "World before Covid", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:52:39", "owner": "wstxx_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18115325215525106, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:06:57", "owner": "sunnehhhh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057356102627902, "text": "Lets bring it  back fr!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:38:56", "owner": "toxicgamerglich1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987456891721960, "text": "Imagine if you were dabbing with Kevin Hart in 2016", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:20:01", "owner": "sjb80085", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106489828572917, "text": "This shit meer aneesing me", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:08:12", "owner": "wajihbot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050754686657316, "text": "DanTDM era", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:57:52", "owner": "lunar_kj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18142200160425159, "text": "Everything except trump that stinky rotten orange", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:56:53", "owner": "a.n.7.s.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029022017520985, "text": "Anything to have this back 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:47:42", "owner": "sleepingwithsirensthehe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066266819355298, "text": "@guava 😢 gotta go back to watching gang", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:45:14", "owner": "rno._barry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858275188521405, "text": "And now the world and Teenagers are all cooked", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:36:02", "owner": "blyyboo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967600536806058, "text": "Where's skip challenge 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:09:50", "owner": "mcdonalds_douglas_md11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067349876202881, "text": "Fuck 2016", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:42:35", "owner": "sammister14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041738576446192, "text": "2016 was a good year", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:25:55", "owner": "shuriekkadar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062422727096739, "text": "I miss it", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:33:50", "owner": "not4damain._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914013871071059, "text": "You lost me at dantdm, was expecting cory", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:03:35", "owner": "ownerofstozz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928003920997053, "text": "Minecraft vs real life ah song🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:59:34", "owner": "inymnrenno", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961180236993660, "text": "El año del autismo", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:34:32", "owner": "luis_maryn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067598885206427, "text": "Dantdm 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:20:44", "owner": "shivanand.reddy19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971328456793303, "text": "Kally’s mashup 😔", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:16:47", "owner": "fodinhooo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036290501496361, "text": "Dude I was so young. I thought this kid invented dab because he fake dab high-fived me like 2 years before it became popular lol", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:10:23", "owner": "_asher.spencer_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18489411172079767, "text": "THE RED ONE HAS BEEN CHOSEN!!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:59:26", "owner": "audreyelzabeth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922648684152762, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:27:27", "owner": "rayyanzgg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077851997007946, "text": "Bring me back 2013 please , please time mechine 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:22:30", "owner": "thedazedshit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328041676229437, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:48:40", "owner": "cilliankeane30", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18365970670152168, "text": "Guava juice too in that fidget spinner clip holy", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:31:50", "owner": "nathan__seeley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051741041290261, "text": "ATP IM A OLD NIG", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:57:30", "owner": "justchuckyfr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293679040248781, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:20:44", "owner": "bogomil339", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911972152211258, "text": "The dark age of Mankind", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:07:32", "owner": "aangelo_caarciola", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120806260448253, "text": "Covid released a weird version of humans I guess😔", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:30:28", "owner": "zzazxy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18378653317178236, "text": "Golden era", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:10:29", "owner": "thatspiritualadvisor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065846150201427, "text": "Almost a decade and I still can’t do a bottle flip onto the cap", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:34:47", "owner": "pizzalover6580", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079087888838312, "text": "We should bring all these back ... except Trump but I guess that ship sailed", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:44:50", "owner": "fishyspino", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950147191010916, "text": "Bro dantdms face was so funny back then😭", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:23:02", "owner": "jhsjordan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18139990564431925, "text": "Trump was arguably the best thing", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:50:06", "owner": "kellypuckett_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855805696477317, "text": "Where's Alan walker 😿", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:47:43", "owner": "souj_found_socks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082101541938390, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:07:18", "owner": "dnijames25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081540817783962, "text": "Gen Zers who accused us of being too nostalgic started being so even before us 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T23:50:22", "owner": "fuzz_pictures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911669731212362, "text": "Don’t forget about Ghostbusters: Answer The Call", "c