e're all still doing the same things we've done for eternity...", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:50:05", "owner": "_moneytrees19_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959930670990904, "text": "Holy shit this is like everything", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:49:31", "owner": "_moneytrees19_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894913288184155, "text": "Whr's bum dikki dikki bum bum??", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:46:48", "owner": "chembuneedsabreak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040883006669564, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:08:47", "owner": "metond09091", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115231390525701, "text": "沒可能憑實力刷到北投公園跟266", "created_at": "2025-09-30T15:24:48", "owner": "cksc80up_ken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525342808032293, "text": "I was 13 years old", "created_at": "2025-09-30T15:17:58", "owner": "koolkiddre1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063095819611190, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:46:52", "owner": "theron_bp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072008252328746, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:40:46", "owner": "heisei_gojira_editz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034386962502768, "text": "Qrr ah s nga 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:18:53", "owner": "richgrands0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096114118731192, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:12:47", "owner": "pavelblazheski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869696104442366, "text": "This freaking song! 😭 I used to listen to NCS on repeat", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:04:52", "owner": "judahstar_dn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080988109810924, "text": "The best years ever", "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:58:55", "owner": "neverqu1t_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123717079494171, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T10:56:29", "owner": "guapo2slimey", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18376043311181577, "text": "Guava juice is abt to be a dad", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:41:40", "owner": "gh0s7._.boiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944714218060009, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:31:39", "owner": "i_really_want_a_snake_143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874824814331280, "text": ""