3:17:45", "owner": "eduardo_salvatierra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071234087234370, "text": "2017", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:15:01", "owner": "creator_g30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056982887431723, "text": "Dan is always in his prime fr", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:52:47", "owner": "kalibahh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108601531564899, "text": "I'm glad I wasn't born too early to be a teen there.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:00:18", "owner": "creb_guy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052508183540358, "text": "M", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:48:49", "owner": "rhka_ryu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877478071304432, "text": "The horror clown sightings! 🤡🎈 Literally the first thing that comes to mind when I think of 2016. This was such a random and weird phenomenon 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:09:45", "owner": "felixbdesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062569637091753, "text": "Que fireball horrível no clash kkkk", "created_at": "2025-09-29T23:57:31", "owner": "junhan.ai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942577000062114, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-29T23:12:08", "owner": "gabriel_xf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874902568423396, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:22:57", "owner": "kai_4200000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197873947316173, "text": "It ain’t like this now 😔🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:12:13", "owner": "traviesatosippy.kali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530506726008537, "text": "And people said back then it was worst year ever...", "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:08:22", "owner": "pulgoso2997", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959138109990573, "text": "Literally let me know when they build a time machine,2016-2019,best years of my life😭🥀❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:01:28", "owner": "1v._queen.liyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120880885511812, "text": "I don't cry b/c it's gone I cry because it happened", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:20:59", "owner": "madnessmax1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147175855417210, "text": "H3H3 prime", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:15:11", "owner": "jorgeb101", "likes": 0}