es": 1}, {"id": 17859378957502844, "text": "Fidget spinners and dabbing were more 2017 than 16", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:29:56", "owner": "rykav_productions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044076635661837, "text": "Miss 2016 man", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:35:56", "owner": "b_dawg__23_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083732488921016, "text": "Vines are better than TikToks.\nThat’s a hill I’ll forever die on.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:34:52", "owner": "eden_woof_woof", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863218732418455, "text": "When the bullshit trends started", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:34:26", "owner": "druemac_lsl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055145732445179, "text": "Dang dude, almost a decade later 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:30:35", "owner": "noahneedleman11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114132472471834, "text": "The last good year for me", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:23:28", "owner": "pierrick_ly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114109681550531, "text": "2015 and 16 were the worst years of my life (not political but just shitty life drama) so seeing people looking back on it fondly to me is like someone in Europe looking at 1944 with nostalgia saying \"we had it so good\" nah dude life is so much better now fuck 2016 if I could erase it from my memory I would.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:19:55", "owner": "vasilios_prokos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868919200449766, "text": "tolong pengen balik ke tahun itu🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:58:49", "owner": "vierrandlw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073183280518104, "text": "Absolutely Nostalnigga", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:17:07", "owner": "aldo_mewink_hd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990924864847471, "text": "I want 2010 back", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:09:27", "owner": "marian_craciun_005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105697714523956, "text": "The world before LITERALLY EVERYTHING started to become political. I miss those days.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:01:08", "owner": "jonathanosterman02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111363217487854, "text": "worst fireball over delete the game", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:51:14", "owner": "voidhallucin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063202589079287, "text": "2016 and up", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:44:05", "owner": "zombie_825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055250747540348, "text": "Not thats kinda when the world started going to shit", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:43:59", "owner": "zombie_825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100301875620722, "text": "Song?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:16:28", "owner": "rickywinzettel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291083758281789, "text": "10 years ago in 3 months is crazy 😔💔", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:29:12", "owner": "5_yoshy_16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178262002351490, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:22:55", "owner": "farhan_ahmed2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070931164948975, "text": "With this i can see how much stupids and dumbs we are...😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:51:10", "owner": "tiago_ferreira.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020465789773470, "text": "@phealey", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:31:53", "owner": "yeo_63_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080583496808054, "text": "Edm?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T05:30:55", "owner": "ade.wiraa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429387088097844, "text": "It was only like 3 years ago.......... Right?........right😢", "created_at": "2025-09-29T05:23:32", "owner": "mr.dinosaurrr", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075845437884740, "text": "2015-2019 was so goated", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:49:23", "owner": "jolly.nigga.freddy.fazbear", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17861644737491429, "text": "Azulek sur YouTube 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:39:46", "owner": "august_jdn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080663704959811, "text": "No way this was all in 2016 wtf where did the time go", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:23:10", "owner": "_youwasnevergang30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855700588474704, "text": "Liked unliked", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:17:49", "owner": "aogfz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527717023034407, "text": "The first time I ever got suspended was for bottle flipping 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:14:08", "owner": "gabe.scc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090697327662756, "text": "@yubitrippin", "created_at": "2025-09-29T03:19:28", "owner": "uzziception", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113217904526756, "text": "Yay", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:42:12", "owner": "chickenjockey86778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071119177955870, "text": "Best years was 2015-2019", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:17:06", "owner": "chaos_studios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070063360979230, "text": "Real though😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:14:12", "owner": "burris.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937587772074596, "text": "pause, what was PAPP?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:06:04", "owner": "official.ibbad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136192705447216, "text": "No trump eaten 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:59:17", "owner": "excalibur_1108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853271440500907, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:41:02", "owner": "jeremiehparnell_man_of_hour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169805596366885, "text": "Fr, when trump got elected I thought the world was going to end fr.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:10:55", "owner": "87twin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963970977974758, "text": "Bro", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:56:15", "owner": "toe_moncher6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003066167812568, "text": "Song?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:48:51", "owner": "christina._worlddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149184175413863, "text": "The start of all the brainrot shiii", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:47:04", "owner": "bryson_h0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901467475272563, "text": "Brexit", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:23:05", "owner": "callumwareing0151", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067066139027729, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:07:08", "owner": "dreamvilleray99_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330952390238503, "text": "Maybe TikTok do needa go💀💀💀this was prime time", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:02:34", "owner": "ciah.failz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894159283340017, "text": "You can just hear that", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:21:05", "owner": "tyalexanderbryant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935115244094069, "text": "the pandemia ,corona virus", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:14:13", "owner": "idanihell_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065885501076322, "text": "umur gua 6 tahun", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:50:00", "owner": "valzs_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067964249211517, "text": "Bro TikTok was around just not in the west 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:44:56", "owner": "eden__liu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986797620851676, "text": "I still play Pokémon go😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:38:08", "owner": "ilyvdeathh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093661150773854, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:32:12", "owner": "kade58628", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17892141894201458, "text": "2009 was the last good year.......", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:11:54", "owner": "jodyboy17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089239432854353, "text": "Early 2016 was amazing had an amazing New Year’s Eve that year but mid/spring was when it became the worst year of my life", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:10:01", "owner": "j_slick_805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041049161447280, "text": "Trump was elected president. Yeah 🔥💪🏼. What a time to be alive", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:09:48", "owner": "tasos_charitonos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055702046213849, "text": "Even tho I was like 5 I was a chronicly online 5 yo so I miss ts", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:22:09", "owner": "j.marie0606", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083389465746111, "text": "A truly retarded year", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:19:51", "owner": "valentinmitiu94", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18171331864364327, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:18:55", "owner": "thatgymrat26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095733109676462, "text": "If  only TikTok didn't exist I genuinely wish TikTok disappeared", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:48:45", "owner": "dbshinka_906", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18532664926058620, "text": "“Trump elected president” like it’s so,ethimg and he’s totally not a p3do or r@pist.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:40:39", "owner": "thealbinoclover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081604630786818, "text": "All the cucks can only focus on trump meanwhile Bro was the best this country had in a while and still is", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:26:50", "owner": "ghst9ine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019263485776447, "text": "The world before the gays ruined it", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:14:45", "owner": "mtthwalmaraz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912691528212034, "text": "Take me back", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:11:46", "owner": "my_eye_burns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923078023118797, "text": "It was such a waste of pice and stability, we could do more", "created_at": "2025-09-28T18:55:02", "owner": "denisyotsov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897723289298888, "text": "One sneak", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:33:00", "owner": "superdajoka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075785144277061, "text": "Do people not notice that Musicaly is literally TikTok just the new gene version", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:24:41", "owner": "godcified", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074482349129790, "text": "Oh God, that shit used to be fun", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:14:43", "owner": "king_the_drip_king_ksix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059803796618903, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:40:08", "owner": "wriyo_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17895091278181525, "text": "Juice wrld999", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:20:30", "owner": "kylerzehren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998132337672788, "text": "I may have been 8 years old in this year but it was peak! I actually had a fidget spinner, and went on a trip to Hawaii a year later 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:14:38", "owner": "the_big_j_2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067188884194466, "text": "Just a small reminder: The dab, was killed by @vonmiller in Super Bowl 50🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:56:11", "owner": "snottypippen89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859470814507393, "text": "Prime Fortnite also", "created_at": "2025-09-28T