iaatranaee.__ saying we was gone move to Africa cuz trump was elected🥹🥹😂", "created_at": "2025-09-26T22:25:54", "owner": "yaniiizwrld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090299236649605, "text": "What a degenerate time, huh?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T22:15:03", "owner": "octobers_cult", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072901148138360, "text": "People, JESUS ​​IS COMING BACK! And we need to repent of our sins and evil deeds.\n\nWe need to surrender our hearts and lives to Jesus and accept Him as our LORD and SAVIOR of our lives.\n\nJesus died on the cross to pay the penalty for our sins, so that we can live eternally in peace and joy in Heaven/Paradise!\n\nJust place your faith in Jesus, and let that faith transform you from the inside out and bear fruit!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T22:13:50", "owner": "lucas_.205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909844036220042, "text": "Lan clash of clans videolarındaki şarkı", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:34:18", "owner": "tugraberkturker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059462618625692, "text": "MANNEQUIN CHALLENGE BRUH 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:28:37", "owner": "garrett_wilson_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048803282640851, "text": "Pengen terulang lagi tapi gak seru jaman SMA", "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:29:20", "owner": "mtzlprtmahdsome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918419908178684, "text": "The bgm😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:14:03", "owner": "3bzci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181236580339384, "text": "I liked everything they pointed out in this video, EXCEPT Trump being elected president! 😡😤", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:59:11", "owner": "katie.magin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359405842082334, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:54:55", "owner": "cartoon2411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085694332724626, "text": "2016 best year of my life😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:45:41", "owner": "mylifeis_sofucked_up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072183803178138, "text": "2014-2018 was the best time period imo", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:43:15", "owner": "d4rkchimichang4", 