kes": 1}, {"id": 18075618485098643, "text": "Prime life before social media exploded", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:58:13", "owner": "yaso._ontop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112781368551892, "text": "Such a goated song 😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:45:03", "owner": "rishabdoesedits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082762091497232, "text": "Glad to say i do not miss thos era and will not miss the one we're in now🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:45:01", "owner": "puzzy_riot2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055741223629139, "text": "Jee advanced in that year☠️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:33:44", "owner": "sakethk_2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860217976435574, "text": "And Galaxy Note 7 realease in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:22:45", "owner": "devonchen8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845015878564112, "text": "Take me back pls", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:15:55", "owner": "agartha_mma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055990946538628, "text": "2016 + w music= nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:06:43", "owner": "duh.itx_shariq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906467632248577, "text": "clash Royal je furt nejhranější hra", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:43:12", "owner": "k.a.f.u.n.i.c.e.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897402646167596, "text": "Bring back the dab, fidget spinners and the mannequin challenge and I will be happy again", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:35:55", "owner": "peytonr189", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055464200531956, "text": "I used to sit and watch bottle flip videos for hours 😂 those time were golden", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:23:07", "owner": "u.r.l_.nully", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079089715991824, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:07:33", "owner": "paul.pagan.26000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107662987577869, "text": "And no wars😔😔😭😭😭😢😢🥀🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:28:59", "owner": "valio6505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992056893833887, "text": "Till 2015 was everything ok, after came the downfall.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:23:34", "owner": "romanm.93", "likes": 0}, {"id"