T21:44:42", "owner": "shaq_next_to_a_midget", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078157964064540, "text": "Damn just missed it", "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:32:03", "owner": "christian_yandel2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079518907961954, "text": "What about “donald trumps wig flew off”", "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:11:05", "owner": "hatedinct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039043472480449, "text": "September 08/2016 Funkytown joins the chat", "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:02:20", "owner": "rakr56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111240919551432, "text": "Feel like yesterday 2016 🥀 is the best year", "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:02:18", "owner": "zip.sky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536616610044098, "text": "Let's not forget the Andy's coming challenge", "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:00:53", "owner": "khrisartjourney2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854481025539586, "text": "All these anti Trump comments are making me laugh. Trump 2028", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:45:28", "owner": "justinlcoghla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385788049133885, "text": "life was fun cause nothing was considered \"cringe\" ...", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:41:02", "owner": "francy.romii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139607629429120, "text": "Man United - FA Cup 2016 Winners! 🏆", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:33:52", "owner": "n_rami_23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18148201348410330, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:31:17", "owner": "robert_jay_stuck__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060770810600350, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:19:17", "owner": "j.x.u.n0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17939619498069751, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-09-25T19:56:15", "owner": "2exclusive_teej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052745420642089, "text": "This song brings back some memories", "created_at": "2025-09-25T19:00:13", "owner": "landreboss10191", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18485435161072174, "text": "Was gonna like until I saw trump😂✌🏽", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:55:04", "owner": "iammarcus_2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087795889844435, "text": "Best year of my life",