": "2025-09-25T16:54:31", "owner": "he.whowalksbehindtherows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146247661412750, "text": "Happiness is temporary", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:50:55", "owner": "jam_strwberi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980965479918979, "text": "yeah ngl some garbage ass choices for this video 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:18:15", "owner": "bbc_overlordd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054730481533121, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:07:48", "owner": "joseluiswardlaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889702291350804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:49:10", "owner": "bryanbrayden30", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18533374426043804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:43:21", "owner": "maxyadig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102615886611593, "text": "I know thata guava", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:35:11", "owner": "blitzarigg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927445393110636, "text": "Shii use to be so simple back den 🤦🏾‍♂️😭💯", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:31:05", "owner": "2weeksgold1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927480507997979, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:28:27", "owner": "_illsacc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077503181051657, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:13:38", "owner": "1booperdooper1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854188366485937, "text": "Idk abt trump 😭 hes the reason everything got worse", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:42:58", "owner": "st1lld34d_.l4r4_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094734793758511, "text": "The best year ever 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:40:52", "owner": "maybe_its_caramelo_creme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355938550085854, "text": "Even though all the trends were incredibly cringy, it still felt more authentic than today. Post covid doesn't hit the same", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:40:32", "owner": "ellie.rrrree", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100385044721632, "text": "Dan tdm omfggg real Minecraft nikka", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:22:05", "owner": "margzonkourt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879896080396997, "text": "2016 was retarded", "created_at": "2025-09-25T