, "owner": "_yawnznnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853642231491871, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:14:46", "owner": "_.vish_.nu._360", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17871760089431618, "text": "I may crash out if someone associates 2016 with fidget spinners one more time", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:36:10", "owner": "_brandonr20_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138748810429162, "text": "clash is not nostalgia bro", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:32:29", "owner": "gianni.pagano2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945304846026601, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:01:17", "owner": "sharki.83", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905043157248018, "text": "Cringe af", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:30:47", "owner": "booyashan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958512918848766, "text": "You forgot the killer clown craze", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:21:56", "owner": "klwwrestling", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18156163585351795, "text": "good old day...", "created_at": "2025-09-24T10:52:06", "owner": "hj1f12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144029923421337, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:50:36", "owner": "meettt1__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18356587891084333, "text": "its was almost 10 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:37:03", "owner": "martaclobao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078547183959738, "text": "@princlym_", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:17:51", "owner": "dikkkaaaajowei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039170999466249, "text": "Tbh, it wasn't a good year.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:14:54", "owner": "awdiyeyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288898681262764, "text": "O mundo era mais feliz", "created_at": "2025-09-24T08:56:14", "owner": "gu_st4vorib3iro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083354473936538, "text": "kurang erpan", "created_at": "2025-09-24T08:44:34", "owner": "rhemonnotlemon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540334066020109, "text": "I remember when fidget spinners infected the companies and my dad would come home with 4 from his office", "created_at": "2025-09-24T08:17:54", "owner": "tar_fishi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036988184492147, "text": "I'm sorry but a lot of fresh popular childhood toys from 2013 to any current day stays in my possession (i.e. Yu-Gi-Oh, Pokemon cards, beyblades, Bakugan)", "created_at": "2025-09-24T08:15:57", "owner": "grimsleepernaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150704281404800, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T07:36:04", "owner": "imstagram_user_unavaileble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882156754389236, "text": "This songggggg😔", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:34:10", "owner": "stephanetotheworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082515199753012, "text": "One part of history I wish we could repeat😔", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:28:46", "owner": "simp4._unknown_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983787102736415, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:28:24", "owner": "madlapras3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985739196896650, "text": "Couple months from now it'll be 10 years ago 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:25:23", "owner": "mrtakethatrisk420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926662192109421, "text": "Hasan mustan gta 5 ekip🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:23:42", "owner": "chromynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174452332351953, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:09:24", "owner": "zsejmbes_utonallo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047521034645447, "text": "It was cringe, but it was a good cringe", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:02:13", "owner": "cj_markus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941838430058662, "text": "Tha... that is almost 10 years ago btw😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:08:17", "owner": "russia_schejbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072209165167591, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:04:01", "owner": "d0n_lorunz0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053374112559772, "text": "I remember it like it was yesterday.. can’t believe there are kids today who WISH they could’ve experienced this like we did 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:03:43", "owner": "pokeasi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871347934434600, "text": "2 bad news and all gold times🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:02:25", "owner": "greg.onio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182596105336527, "text": "Why they slip trump in like that🤨", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:01:52", "owner": "m.ark_49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073293179164832, "text": "Can we just create a fucking fuck time machine!?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:00:03", "owner": "ghost_daredevil_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052526945634376, "text": "Anyone remember the 2016 XXL Freshman Cypher?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T04:48:24", "owner": "ainttoomuch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277938460263767, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T04:42:31", "owner": "pavel.klasek_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157435747379304, "text": "DanTDM 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-24T04:04:41", "owner": "arfandzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077811764076951, "text": "Damn where Cory at", "created_at": "2025-09-24T03:13:55", "owner": "vonwya__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050925560279508, "text": "Dont forget about thr gratest Youtube War in history, a swedish man againts an india company", "created_at": "2025-09-24T03:13:52", "owner": "gbradff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418202731110670, "text": "Peak time 🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:34:09", "owner": "killthe_bigman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024198104743376, "text": "You forgot about Pewdiepie", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:25:24", "owner": "emman._luc17", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18076831033864990, "text": "I was 6", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:13:46", "owner": "aidensmallwood2010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912246010208677, "text": "At the time I hated all of it, now I wish I could go back and realize what great times they were.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:10:45", "owner": "rdw_portraits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920246377035813, "text": "Ah yes the year I graduated high-school.. Time flys..", "created_at": "2025-09-24T01:48:44", "owner": "miles_dragovitch_4200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060634748103368, "text": "Bro who TF is dantdf?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T01:24:01", "owner": "reymoon.gaeming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922550038141293, "text": "I always remember bottle flip challenge", "cr