nd lil demon third birthday", "created_at": "2025-09-22T12:12:09", "owner": "natsuki_subaru_fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080649970986663, "text": "Even 2016 music, nice touch", "created_at": "2025-09-22T12:11:47", "owner": "leteston3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867233734450594, "text": "Everything is good memories except trump", "created_at": "2025-09-22T12:04:28", "owner": "bklf_justin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17853633747541182, "text": "The only brainrot we need", "created_at": "2025-09-22T12:04:08", "owner": "woowie_owo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125019940484722, "text": "It was only 9 years ago 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-22T11:38:11", "owner": "mywifeishot69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142801699422269, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-22T11:21:44", "owner": "_mhdhaekal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852282241545074, "text": "Today : TikTok/brainrot/andrew Tate", "created_at": "2025-09-22T11:14:25", "owner": "shahardanweiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053366399246619, "text": "Waktu secepat itu 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:40:41", "owner": "ptzz_472", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090469669809796, "text": "Dantdm", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:32:40", "owner": "mysterious_baboon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947683810018898, "text": "超好笑寶可夢之亂在台灣", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:28:45", "owner": "lysjc_0510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315870769246159, "text": "Loh ternyata Fidget Spinner 2016??", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:27:41", "owner": "khoirulanam17_id", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876749893307913, "text": "Good old days", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:05:09", "owner": "bkl_exp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050564144295250, "text": "the peak of humanity", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:00:11", "owner": "sam.aintnomore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993048018837294, "text": "Seen my elders play Pokémon go, unfortunately I never got to ;(", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:54:42", "owner": "idevourf1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131710039454067, "text": "this makes me speechless😔", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:45:53", "owner": "cib.ee308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972866721941043, "text": "Peak life", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:33:21", "owner": "tom_cortin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057618227447811, "text": "When I saw trump. Oh-", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:28:22", "owner": "seraphims_catalog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999314064817798, "text": "谁恋？他们说菜就多恋❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:22:51", "owner": "lixiaojing178", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018515378777227, "text": "Bro I remember everyone fearing Trump when he got elected", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:14:57", "owner": "lv_otc_vl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860834413495763, "text": "now do 2020", "created_at": "2025-09-22T08:44:58", "owner": "hill_2303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987691395846639, "text": "bottle flip kid looks like the the charlie kirk murderer", "created_at": "2025-09-22T08:39:54", "owner": "shaun0neill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292653385249231, "text": "VanossGaming", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:43:58", "owner": "onlyfans._leo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080274982963529, "text": "Most of this PEAKED or STARTED in 2017 and a lot of extra stuff added to 2017 makes it a better year 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:42:34", "owner": "losbulls.drose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935126358961551, "text": "2016 to 2018 is the best now everything is ass", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:22:09", "owner": "tabithabird114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939517656942901, "text": "anying nostalgia banget, pagi masih cerah", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:06:26", "owner": "yoibyrjej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936689821077127, "text": "the dead body-", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:05:01", "owner": "avgsilver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147563539409047, "text": "crzy nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-09-22T05:29:16", "owner": "d1vy.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286800946287848, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-22T05:27:08", "owner": "ban_ymerej", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18134886448450503, "text": "Dude perfect era", "created_at": "2025-09-22T05:26:44", "owner": "ban_ymerej", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18415944898117052, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-22T05:08:15", "owner": "bigd66346", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311794513173252, "text": "“TiK tOk DeStRoYeD eVeRyThInG”.\nIt’s literally been around since 2015-16 😂 Y’all remember an app called “Musical.ly?” Same app, same developers, different name, different UI. 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-22T04:54:11", "owner": "ily.jye", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17871366636349710, "text": "Fidget spinner was 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-22T04:44:19", "owner": "vega_5.3_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934339738088781, "text": "World was already  in the shitter at this time, 2016 was the last good year……darkness from there on", "created_at": "2025-09-22T04:25:22", "owner": "marvomfshow_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966898362809272, "text": "Owwh I feel ancient 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-22T03:58:02", "owner": "pandhitapratama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112154668541284, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-22T03:38:27", "owner": "_jahteek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091666333785172, "text": "miss youuu musically😔", "created_at": "2025-09-22T02:54:11", "owner": "gstfebyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080244916987376, "text": "Crazy to think that’s almost 10 years ago🥲 I was only 11 at the time and times were just so easy", "created_at": "2025-09-22T02:44:40", "owner": "pattydaddy2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968919195955863, "text": "2016 was a hype year", "created_at": "2025-09-22T01:39:09", "owner": "dgenerationmemes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077692097069347, "text": "I REMEMBER PPAP😭", "created_at": "2025-09-22T01:33:45", "owner": "mayu_core4ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019066652777255, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-22T01:27:21", "owner": "912_d4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891113416342208, "text": "2010>>>2016", "created_at": "2025-09-22T00:56:35", "owner": "jano_lopez_cl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048118763328027, "text": "Dab is a L 🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-09-22T00:27:43", "owner": "frank_b1849", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105846997586949, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-21T23:37:09", "owner": "tr4pst4r2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055077632211401, "text": "Fidget was 2017 bruh", "created_at": "2025-09-21T23:26:11", "owner": "fuuudhel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516551119028400, "text": "Good ol' days😭", "created_at": "2025-09-21T23:20:02", "owner": "abdulbnasd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174753358353534, "text": "Maybe the reason these years were so fun was because trump was elected so the world felt more free", "created_at": "2025-09-21T23:17:23", "owner": "sixfeetunderbutonline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064295729458759, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T22:15:33", "owner": "dicksonma_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105168157573493, "text": "THE RED ONE HAS BEEN CHOSEN", "created_at": "2025-09-21T21:53:18", "owner": "silas_grubb_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998921724666907, "text": "🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-21T21:32:42", "owner": "whoknowsmc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126289957468083, "text": "life when tiktok was musically 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T20:46:11", "owner": "wikiiwimy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855072454474840, "text": "9 years .....", "created_at": "2025-09-21T20:42:18", "owner": "kd00dley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115682452513483, "text": "What happened before on the internet?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:58:11", "owner": "sessiz2sakin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064717067459014, "text": "Peak life", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:57:05", "owner": "feher_domonkos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380901979178152, "text": "\"penpineappleapplepen\" 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:55:24", "owner": "pro.fessionalgoodboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019730984581761, "text": "Sooooo I'm old", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:46:28", "owner": "x2ch1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853507504541655, "text": "Época em que os memes duravam o ano todo, hoje em dia só duram uma semana", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:26:22", "owner": "nklsrss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388645870192263, "text": "The things I would do man and the friendships I would mend and the people I would love to talk to one more time", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:25:57", "owner": "jt.beard15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917911927176399, "text": "Pen pineapple apple pen", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:22:39", "owner": "daltonhines_56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908759521090679, "text": "How did pen pineapple Apple pen make it on here 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-21T18:57:22", "owner": "qualityname_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084470602912405, "text": "Your not a real person if you DanTDM didn’t carry ur childhood", "created_at": "2025-09-21T18:27:58", "owner": "bloodonmywatch", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862544455416234, "text": "When getting 1mil vews was rare", "created_at": "2025-09-21T18:13:56", "owner": "adahd_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051204209285649, "text": "13 years ago. Flys really time.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T18:11:18", "owner": "stats4nerds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893759575331958, "text": "Clash royale is actually peaking lol", "created_at": "2025-09-21T18:04:29", "owner": "rxmarsh.res", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022490018750122, "text": "Best year", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:50:13", "owner": "yo_what_happen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178040092340735, "text": "I wonder how much ill see the world change before i pass", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:44:39", "owner": "plztouchmeimsick", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17890101261347323, "text": "(\"the good ol days\")", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:44:00", "owner": "plztouchmeimsick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295543768266227, "text": "Top 3 years oat", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:34:27", "owner": "pharmacophobia710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399414223136232, "text": "Spinners were released on 2017 and PPAP in 2013", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:31:38", "owner": "yorch_mv_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091955590699067, "text": "This is peak childhood", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:31:21", "owner": "wakeuppblat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054819539442132, "text": "Trump election not it", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:22:28", "owner": "allen_williams.k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930558750983103, "text": "before TikTok and Yt shorts prime life time fr🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:20:19", "owner": "the_real_mateo23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876601372305059, "text": "Why's my entire reel page filled with 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:13:17", "owner": "tsuhi_ma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157644715385468, "text": "W TRUMP🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:11:33", "owner": "joseph_e2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937421080075040, "text": "Don’t forget vanossgaming", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:50:00", "owner": "to_ulgy_4_u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162908431374302, "text": "Find the impostor", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:48:48", "owner": "ol_paolo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898710988298739, "text": "bro people was dying over pokemon go 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:42:06", "owner": "mirr5900th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095320237664475, "text": "This song was on every Pokémon video I was watching😂", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:40:54", "owner": "at3bon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077791943075871, "text": "I actually dont remember the mannequin challenge or PPAP", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:38:33", "owner": "plutonian_nights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328746529237581, "text": "I was 8 ..but I remember most of it 🙂‍↕️🤙", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:31:40", "owner": "ty6r___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844648759562350, "text": "Trump: “bing bing bong”", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:26:14", "owner": "1.onetakejay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903306985125034, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:25:10", "owner": "crimson.92206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092872519747179, "text": "Why am I shedding tears while watching this!?!?!? (Exlcuding the Trump part 🥹)", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:22:33", "owner": "_nzarzar_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055236704450288, "text": "I did not fw trump or clash", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:17:06", "owner": "1lul_bray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081470327509500, "text": "Marshmallow", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:12:32", "owner": "22ccoma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945528483977884, "text": "2016 one of the most cringe eras", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:03:54", "owner": "akucciyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078301613063072, "text": "trump being elected i don’t think fits in this😭", "created_at": "2025-09-21T15:28:46", "owner": "lewlewl3m0n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001314062811513, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T15:22:22", "owner": "_.slimnxtdoor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078979363981155, "text": "Dab is still alive and will never die", "created_at": "2025-09-21T15:09:41", "owner": "iammaxiee00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080065870804686, "text": "Right when Democrats went psycho and ruined America to \"get Trump\"", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:52:11", "owner": "landinggear750", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861124843481037, "text": "2017*", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:51:46", "owner": "vannyservin1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308581639247871, "text": "2016 was mid", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:24:34", "owner": "aristomdz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022631171769020, "text": "The world before TikTok and brainrots😔", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:19:44", "owner": "crashout_sce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18345354970164767, "text": "Time passes like nothing bro😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:10:35", "owner": "varsh_rathish07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056118431400573, "text": "2016 was the most goated year", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:47:48", "owner": "itzdubzofficial", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17854852836478687, "text": "Yea we def dodged a bullet known as Hillary Clinton that year. Oh the liberal tears were glorious", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:47:30", "owner": "pandaaheadcjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112718155534723, "text": "2012 ate 2019 era tudo muito bom", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:25:19", "owner": "guilhermemboficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084976735728945, "text": "this was world peace", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:01:56", "owner": "_tristinbranning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864687043466756, "text": "Young in the wrong time😔", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:49:49", "owner": "jwhitt218", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091153312772956, "text": "What does Kevin hart look exactly the same 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:38:04", "owner": "bigge_.thwgoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238399687293946, "text": "Falto la Eurocopa 2016 y la Copa América centenario", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:24:27", "owner": "gamerretro23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068932907191046, "text": "2016 prime Virat Kohli 🦾🦾🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:18:35", "owner": "jenishgotnorizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076161641028756, "text": "We really have grown old 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:17:50", "owner": "pavly_ezzatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884669161250392, "text": "Guava juice ❤️💘", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:54:53", "owner": "fw.rishxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968237154952097, "text": "miss", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:28:46", "owner": "hzllily", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18171521359362141, "text": "Almost a decade since then", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:24:39", "owner": "anvils_of_war", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991327872699322, "text": "I remember being in 3rd grade on the playground and 2 girls with high ponytails and big jojobows and coil bracelets came to me and asked \"who do y9u think should be president? The girl or the boy one\" lol I didn't know politics I said \"uhh the girl one\" I was so stupid lolll but funny memory", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:22:41", "owner": "zoeyrayne16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943322386026185, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:09:25", "owner": "rifkiaryaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987489252712931, "text": "Ngl great year", "created_at": "2025-09-21T10:50:13", "owner": "rhysbb14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356375110081708, "text": "2016 will be 10 years ago soin🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T10:48:19", "owner": "amaramari07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186012256329674, "text": "Lagu ini😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-21T10:31:31", "owner": "nailzzskie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974047323926333, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T10:21:06", "owner": "kermvn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086194048698130, "text": "Ice bucket challenge", "created_at": "2025-09-21T10:13:47", "owner": "banzuiinchobei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075590351040365, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:13:00", "owner": "gabriella_seoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846680299549018, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:12:38", "owner": "gabriella_seoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401732401137658, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:12:10", "owner": "gabriella_seoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097900678637279, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:11:30", "owner": "gabriella_seoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971668059948293, "text": "Good times", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:02:02", "owner": "_qiweiliang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194104495316178, "text": "yes in 3 months 10 years ago🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:54:47", "owner": "kajusa._.13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18538980967012665, "text": "this song too", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:43:45", "owner": "obsidique_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145377166412392, "text": "MA Gamerz Intro", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:43:37", "owner": "afaawww_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899831908147266, "text": "It's already a decade and we didn't realize how life goes fast....hope we have same life in future❤️‍🩹😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:33:31", "owner": "swiftx._.manoj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879396268286667, "text": "Peak year", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:22:03", "owner": "thragghimself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891452236200331, "text": "When life was perfect ❤️❤️❤️🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:58:10", "owner": "samandcolbylover170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876633748307034, "text": "2016=the Dab. .2025 mewing", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:47:29", "owner": "mauibra_andinputra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857953408513266, "text": "Me was here", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:37:47", "owner": "kuepeid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066408821365512, "text": "Nico Rosberg won the Formula 1 World Championship", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:33:07", "owner": "sonic12796979798", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079331488807902, "text": "We all had earth premium.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:28:01", "owner": "adibontop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860281594492391, "text": "What about denis daily prime", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:00:29", "owner": "iaintrjkan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150503650393549, "text": "Don't forget coryxkenshin too", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:59:42", "owner": "fxvour35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076862771083862, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:34:15", "owner": "rebel_calibers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021341699567444, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:32:47", "owner": "rebel_calibers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062013599086675, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:31:41", "owner": "rebel_calibers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883243789259097, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:31:29", "owner": "rebel_calibers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18237459370292085, "text": "Nothing about the pig 👑🕊", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:17:10", "owner": "nottt_st3f4n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098757382566547, "text": "Was that guava juice 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:16:40", "owner": "johndoom204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064407224372850, "text": "😭😭😭 take me back", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:14:41", "owner": "samiuli2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020112518771778, "text": "@zaini_042", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:58:38", "owner": "skizofrenik.mf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081368879505641, "text": "Trump being elected is NOT and will NEVER be nostalgic", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:46:17", "owner": "ethan_wichman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104411659582909, "text": "Bring back vine", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:44:07", "owner": "antixstock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067998968242861, "text": "I miss this 🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:36:37", "owner": "prodbymtr_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101365723552337, "text": "Don’t forget the git up", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:32:21", "owner": "jazzy0839", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341175277207194, "text": "Clash Royale mentioned🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:27:24", "owner": "hermss.5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851932753504572, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:23:14", "owner": "bad_god_lol", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079369909976111, "text": "Now people are just too sensitive 💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:21:43", "owner": "mys311._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071146810915186, "text": "2015-2018 was something else", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:15:35", "owner": "nicktheoklis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851158798552803, "text": "The song itself is iconic 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:11:10", "owner": "relizmo_editz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068728409243815, "text": "TikTok lowkey ruined the vibe of everything through quick dopamine hits and stuff, with covid adding up the fuel to the fire.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:04:49", "owner": "gishanfer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18110101480556495, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:04:45", "owner": "ii_e17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076338770115752, "text": "Still plays pokemon go 😂🙌uid-163848227193", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:03:00", "owner": "7_shades_ofsiddhu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18327866212224176, "text": "Dan tdm", "created_at": "2025-09-21T04:24:38", "owner": "sham_1986_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105361261597437, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T04:15:40", "owner": "joel_2002_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871631332429581, "text": "what a shitty year", "created_at": "2025-09-21T04:14:10", "owner": "solemon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924052477015609, "text": "You fell off on the back end but started off well atleast", "created_at": "2025-09-21T04:09:54", "owner": "1.3_quavo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022208894751536, "text": "Times were simpler", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:58:36", "owner": "thetradesofkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381747388178006, "text": "9 years ago btw🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:56:38", "owner": "chewyka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083284007493018, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:36:39", "owner": "sanz_editzzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030084905710156, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:32:56", "owner": "holasoyearc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091120471744536, "text": "Best year", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:31:18", "owner": "gabi.martx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078954050494807, "text": "2016 is in my top 3 worst years ever", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:18:48", "owner": "cosmic_level_stupid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044137541358030, "text": "Song name ?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:18:30", "owner": "meridias77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935969188066442, "text": "3-1 choke", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:13:31", "owner": "weston.smith44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054824195540558, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:05:05", "owner": "keandr_e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121312327496148, "text": "Last one🥹 💎👑", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:39:38", "owner": "aesthetic_muhd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077358800002149, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:38:40", "owner": "amsah_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851856922506390, "text": "I don’t mean to sound like a 🤓 but Fidget spinners was actually 2017, not 2016.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:02:19", "owner": "peterjames_188", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18059884793111971, "text": "what a time to be alive🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:44:42", "owner": "champagne.marques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921130489155960, "text": "in a few more months.. 2016 will be 10 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:38:55", "owner": "ritterkreuz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848607145561330, "text": "Adding trump ? You definitely wanted arguments..🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:37:09", "owner": "cashemere.dreamii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999290799664889, "text": "Who remember when before the name Tik Tok came the app was called music ly😭", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:19:20", "owner": "kelltoofficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076581419096460, "text": "We’re in a wild matrix where people think this was a good year.\nIt was likely the first full tard year", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:18:47", "owner": "oooface23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870168814439059, "text": "You forgot a certain gorilla..", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:18:23", "owner": "thisguyjimmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015322382604720, "text": "Why did DanTDM go bald 😢🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:12:23", "owner": "christian.t808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050880050288477, "text": "Let's not forget Space Jam 11s if you ain't have those you wasn't shit in school", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:00:06", "owner": "tonypatria7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066258380263148, "text": "I remember everything except Pokemon go", "created_at": "2025-09-21T00:58:39", "owner": "tonypatria7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106413757598579, "text": "Song name pls😔🤚", "created_at": "2025-09-21T00:55:59", "owner": "luvi.lenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073474724135846, "text": "Filthy frank", "created_at": "2025-09-21T00:13:11", "owner": "pizzaisforeverz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934573138089964, "text": "It all feels like it was yesterday 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:55:58", "owner": "huey.p.bailie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054775991561955, "text": "celeste was 6 years old during these times ....", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:54:09", "owner": "dieversgwapo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18502850311071665, "text": "The cringiest nostalgia lmao", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:30:37", "owner": "bebomoose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856686835521433, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:03:03", "owner": "1k.cinco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18235606477289827, "text": "Trump messed the list up", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:02:06", "owner": "prettylittlerere", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077101571047116, "text": "Only good thing on the list is clash royale", "created_at": "2025-09-20T22:56:48", "owner": "kinglewis_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061580414370247, "text": "I hated it 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-20T22:55:22", "owner": "kinglewis_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913287964207278, "text": "I remember this song but I forgot what's this name of this song", "created_at": "2025-09-20T22:39:31", "owner": "tom_smoke10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076649408093165, "text": "Peak 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T22:35:35", "owner": "herlan.prawidya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069659461963927, "text": "Ppap actually got a new version recently", "created_at": "2025-09-20T22:26:52", "owner": "stoopdman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056151728440772, "text": "Was happy until I saw trump", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:58:44", "owner": "cmplukan1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107838343566895, "text": "forgot the hoverboard", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:51:35", "owner": "_ducked0ff_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086481670896712, "text": "It's not so different from today.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:45:30", "owner": "luismhx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091508593756081, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:39:28", "owner": "noah10998", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973590402927749, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:36:09", "owner": "jxybethagoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137082754431247, "text": "Tbh o hated it", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:49:55", "owner": "alex_pendragon13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091491817693858, "text": "😃😃😃😃😃😃😦😃😃", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:26:06", "owner": "theyafraidofyou_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846608617545882, "text": "Before Ai 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:17:21", "owner": "mrdorky25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000816374657234, "text": "#bringback2016", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:15:40", "owner": "rauf_desu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978609054872699, "text": "Few more months and it'll be a decade 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-20T19:37:10", "owner": "a.r.ya03.de", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075418145107572, "text": "Oh yeah ts tuff", "created_at": "2025-09-20T19:30:08", "owner": "lamedubbz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035606186698451, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:41:43", "owner": "l__0__l_7355", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977275533762410, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:28:28", "owner": "sheluvsmj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076954196016005, "text": "The Cleveland Cavaliers championchip", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:21:31", "owner": "edrian456alonzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892718428328312, "text": "Harlem shake", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:47:21", "owner": "big_mcmenu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105139246585148, "text": "Everything on this list was perfect except trump", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:33:22", "owner": "john2xtimez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094360828678708, "text": "NCS, Alan walker, marshmellow , twenty one pilots & the chainsmokers 🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:28:33", "owner": "wanwan_tri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293173465248105, "text": "Pewsiepie prime", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:04:00", "owner": "bane.grkovic3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405386107114965, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:53:03", "owner": "luigi.maini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418813690128532, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:50:47", "owner": "laugewolkers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055786028405425, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:44:51", "owner": "kaiohenriqueguidade", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18041170892673806, "text": "This was an era ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:41:56", "owner": "j0ndzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091455256816526, "text": "We need those days back", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:30:17", "owner": "vaggos_tormpak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105983818605511, "text": "Jesus Christ loves you & died for your sins so u could have a chance to inherit eternal life btw✝️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:24:55", "owner": "leo_num1_fernandez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18168193555326314, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:22:16", "owner": "shiw_assup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846625186545843, "text": "\"i got fidget spinners from my head to my toes, i even got one right here on my nose, got one on my left, got one on m