ks", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:17:16", "owner": "mas.on082", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066981218252904, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:10:39", "owner": "tenna1997kromer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063320417601574, "text": "Inilah awal keseruan dunia🙌hhh😂😢😔dan hanya tinggal kenangan🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:02:15", "owner": "clamon99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144941308419786, "text": "nostalgia cringe\nsad cat dance\nthat ONE kiss me again vid", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:40:46", "owner": "sam_sleeps1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064197299366250, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:36:45", "owner": "ariftheclown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044265254370092, "text": "@nocopyrightsounds You made that era Golden", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:32:39", "owner": "lifeofhrz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076824341070675, "text": "Even the song..", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:26:44", "owner": "arya_dillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113196535527331, "text": "@officialsml_", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:05:17", "owner": "femboyticklerhiggernater67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064180193358477, "text": "2016 was the best year fr but y’all forgot the xxl freshman freestyle nothing could top 2016 freshman freestyle 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:51:23", "owner": "whotfis__sk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104687401603707, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:37:45", "owner": "el_horno_de_kazuha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095175220676521, "text": "We didn’t know what we had😔😢🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:31:16", "owner": "novembers_very_own_619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077365781053120, "text": "2016 was cringe, was like the beginning of the end honestly.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:29:17", "owner": "jacob_wickman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18305916562219174, "text": "pen pineapple apple pen💔💔", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:17:52", "owner": "dizzy_waz_heree", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087296380860712, "text": "My smile faded at trump", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:15:09", "owner": "apr3tty.weird_