g meninggal gara gara main pokemon go😔", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:50:13", "owner": "qrnnlvdd__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18480146107078283, "text": "I miss these times, as cringe as they were", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:31:05", "owner": "dumazz_green", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846839773568298, "text": "Coup 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:50:15", "owner": "panturkistunion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891040825203076, "text": "Peak of life right there", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:36:28", "owner": "bread25_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063949469342961, "text": "2016 was my Minecrafty years.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:34:28", "owner": "lacamendry64", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18525695377034723, "text": "Yeahh it's been long time", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:31:58", "owner": "afif_fnk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192714187319552, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:43:38", "owner": "szupi7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111852097557970, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:40:09", "owner": "ibrahimx010x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857861026513984, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:39:25", "owner": "brela_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965420742812808, "text": "The world before ig and tiktok destroyed it.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:21:19", "owner": "hadixleo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888439438222341, "text": "Harlem shake 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:10:32", "owner": "razan_chesta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18526331395018208, "text": "harlemshake?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:08:29", "owner": "vickramoscar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111970168537002, "text": "I don't understand why people stopped dabbing", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:51:51", "owner": "lalin.thawil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293231407271682, "text": "The floor is lava!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:41:18", "owner": "amin_fine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061974185609660, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:34:10", "owner": "faezanch_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071124074271929, "text": "i still have my fidget spinners😭