: "Still play clash Royale 🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-20T02:47:19", "owner": "francoisdavinci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054907346629551, "text": "I wonder if Harambe didn't died, would the world still feel like this?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T02:38:07", "owner": "superior.axel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876745969408700, "text": "Before bowo and the Sunday best transition", "created_at": "2025-09-20T02:13:10", "owner": "enthhahhlah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071512882934698, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T02:12:47", "owner": "chuys_nightmare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109544017487461, "text": "Almost a decade ago", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:52:26", "owner": "allangyms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851033131511967, "text": "When they used to ban fidget spinners and not phones 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:49:32", "owner": "vampirez_r_real", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980494212747461, "text": "pw nya menit berapa bang", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:48:43", "owner": "oobey__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091318837758964, "text": "Still Fuck Trump", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:40:29", "owner": "marezvince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850243621556212, "text": "This also your \"bad\" year to live? @kevinadisya", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:09:51", "owner": "joudymarsya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920491792156665, "text": "Now that I realize it, we where so easy to entertain back then water bottle flippin, fidget spinner’s, dabbing.. bro 😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:03:23", "owner": "finallyricchhh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945976651023392, "text": "I have go back to 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:51:47", "owner": "jhongarstv24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067061939339814, "text": "Minicraft 😢😔", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:49:15", "owner": "a_atqiya_f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306080143220618, "text": "What song?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:40:47", "owner": "kengk.newman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894270844326351, "text": "The memories…", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:26:34", "owner": "ryang