394972818, "text": "This is actually making me sad ngl…….kids nowadays will NEVER understand. They got this dumb “brain rot” shii", "created_at": "2025-09-19T03:40:48", "owner": "meezyjake510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082833953306795, "text": "lego junior😭", "created_at": "2025-09-19T03:19:40", "owner": "mijono_ab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099054430626412, "text": "I'll miss the old days 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-19T03:19:32", "owner": "knight_industries.2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100964041719045, "text": "Ngl I feel like south East Asia hasn't fully grown outta 2016 yet I still see some mfs doing the dab in the big 25📈📈📈📈", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:56:34", "owner": "xin2252008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040402265424815, "text": "Fidget spinners were weapons bro", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:51:31", "owner": "th3co0lk1d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111920176530932, "text": "2012🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:49:25", "owner": "aaron_mendoza_molina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064878512197296, "text": "2016-2019 is a golden era", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:10:52", "owner": "wisesa_smaradeni", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071208701225236, "text": "Ppap ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:07:38", "owner": "immatsuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972114768943633, "text": "Then bring the trends back", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:00:47", "owner": "alexis.cctx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17888276049224735, "text": "Damn time really does fly", "created_at": "2025-09-19T01:47:05", "owner": "manidkmmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310186027174745, "text": "This was tuff in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-19T01:45:56", "owner": "dtx_.juli4n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096810067732905, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T01:40:47", "owner": "leseouloneune_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106503535568774, "text": "Goated times man", "created_at": "2025-09-19T01:36:28", "owner": "swagtoku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065141015042077, "text": "😢😢😢😔😔😔😔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-09-19T00:59:04", "owner": "kingking13lil", "likes":