ikes": 0}, {"id": 18081229355302370, "text": "I generally think of the pandemic never happened life would be so much better", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:39:22", "owner": "fck.umean1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078095519066953, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:28:55", "owner": "denys_brsc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172429762358363, "text": "Anyone remember those Vines? 21? Crack kid? What are those? Lebron James?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:28:53", "owner": "maxburry96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101571748536023, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:23:24", "owner": "cakeythewolf1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069216529979905, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:22:37", "owner": "mel_lstroy9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078820885980265, "text": "I was in Syria I missed all the trends 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:20:35", "owner": "moody2official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057805874453222, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:04:25", "owner": "alijairon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930413673981709, "text": "I fr thought it said 2006 lol", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:43:07", "owner": "jose_27289", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070036838333301, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:27:32", "owner": "gs_rmdhn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066954920521747, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:03:26", "owner": "newbitslol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079514665800181, "text": "trump destroyed the video", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:01:24", "owner": "pol_10093", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077723144055586, "text": "Peek year for 2010 kids", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:00:07", "owner": "2muddy.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156461686375954, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:32:49", "owner": "sheeshh__jp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915105457195664, "text": "Mini militia>>>", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:32:36", "owner": "sheeshh__jp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850559158556334, "text": "❤‍🩹❤‍🩹❤‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:11:12", "owner": "_never2nothing_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994637064687114, "text": "😔🔥😭", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:52:21", "owner": "cr7_varxn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082703770936622, "text": "Summer 16 4L best year ever", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:44:40", "owner": "drofromthewestend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111855472542661, "text": "Was good till you threw trump in there 💀😭", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:35:00", "owner": "j__813", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17971223327944398, "text": "the best arc of all time", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:31:44", "owner": "farisferliawann", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151976710360827, "text": "nine years…", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:26:51", "owner": "chatu_00_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304765768220032, "text": "We were colorful then and the pandemic happened", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:18:10", "owner": "artgrimezs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374897320183529, "text": "türkish🥹🥹😢", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:54:04", "owner": "hamza.vlss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926432937997899, "text": "2026", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:47:10", "owner": "luke_sleepy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885311122367711, "text": "i still dab", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:45:18", "owner": "i_love_alina_so_much", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086628325867459, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:31:29", "owner": "im__sam22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057057065160285, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:22:45", "owner": "tugberkerseckin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112886197473878, "text": "4 months later, it will be 10 years ago!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:01:59", "owner": "the_hammer_enjoyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152002315402878, "text": "this song just stole my soul", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:50:13", "owner": "taysw0rld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063603218607779, "text": "Aw hell nah people are nostalgic for this dumb ass shit 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:48:48", "owner": "tophatcat999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871023148350179, "text": "For those with the niche memory the first 3 months of 2020 were goated, returned to the gym, was making cash and playing the first Warzone, it was great. And then rapidly was not.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:47:25", "owner": "thomaes_sollowae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526670857049377, "text": "@dhafinadiraaa old but gold", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:38:23", "owner": "sir.balee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096993835642330, "text": "Why PPAP look like @plaqueboymax", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:29:32", "owner": "cogslev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930523413983249, "text": "Best year🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:19:06", "owner": "trnl.viethoang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860754421483522, "text": "the song 🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:14:33", "owner": "cc.ianni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914725969083020, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:12:04", "owner": "_saadullaevich_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982893102817830, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:08:13", "owner": "bangezlan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916495906184766, "text": "jessnolimit era", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:02:15", "owner": "riann_permna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935932918089893, "text": "🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:14:03", "owner": "brannnofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155677159391800, "text": "I say that 2016-2019 was the best years for us", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:52:21", "owner": "808abrahammah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919454947035829, "text": "@duhhaleahh", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:45:43", "owner": "itsur_gurllexie47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051293981279796, "text": "remember minecraft monster school?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:30:15", "owner": "its_pw102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125738383474853, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:19:36", "owner": "eu_guihh__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068677064225843, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:06:42", "owner": "mehmetylcnd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170656666318651, "text": "The best year ever exist", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:28:46", "owner": "hanya.erwan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18357482581082979, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:17:22", "owner": "vipransh_0908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038755109476052, "text": "And the life of pablo🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:16:27", "owner": "seancombsforeverfan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17979881888880139, "text": "@ryanarmandoo", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:15:11", "owner": "annur_izzan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071248907165065, "text": "Sad…", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:06:09", "owner": "nottgpu_alu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000607556657755, "text": "And now we have labubu 😩", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:57:49", "owner": "resekartan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984128436731370, "text": "The dantdm one made my jaw lock up", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:49:59", "owner": "christianwalker1565", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972518868941594, "text": "This music 😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:34:57", "owner": "arturros2013", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17917465923177748, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:23:15", "owner": "apannn14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017714954775307, "text": "miss you  2016", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:16:19", "owner": "samueldmoraes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860324548496204, "text": "15july2016", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:04:01", "owner": "furkanep7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856060636519302, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:57:56", "owner": "anwi.nii44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156798541384891, "text": "we're so old 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:55:12", "owner": "borntobesxrn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890978905203758, "text": "I miss 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:47:04", "owner": "pizza4athaaaaaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939882379068082, "text": "One of the best sunmers OAT", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:27:09", "owner": "noah_mazzilli13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035330474490417, "text": "Who tf is dantdm 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:22:59", "owner": "ynzpo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893866441323948, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:16:20", "owner": "austinwhitney5257", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080915117507997, "text": "KEVIN HART BAHAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:12:28", "owner": "blackmf_keemdotq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073926185517091, "text": "9 years ago... 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:03:51", "owner": "19_.mart0._48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090600553747338, "text": "Semua kecuali trump", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:37:40", "owner": "itsapuppies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885346567363567, "text": "It brings back memories 🥀😔", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:28:17", "owner": "hunte_rl0l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071696216177231, "text": "Leave trump out of this", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:22:22", "owner": "blackpanther8986488", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319264138209311, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:10:56", "owner": "ezcarazaputra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080720245756393, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:54:39", "owner": "hamish.haywood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041397416419898, "text": "Ah the good old days!😢", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:54:00", "owner": "hamish.haywood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373822075195595, "text": "Fidget spinner is 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:44:09", "owner": "lor_i133", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080061796788010, "text": "Nostalgic 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:40:04", "owner": "_farzaann.exe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044275289353022, "text": "🇮🇶💔", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:34:09", "owner": "he_20120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082920412927473, "text": "Lots of those trends are from 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:32:01", "owner": "_vikycerna03_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322238728233761, "text": "noob wasted the fireball", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:06:21", "owner": "greatestsince99_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937429357074368, "text": "We were quite well until 2016.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T08:41:32", "owner": "brendantotanes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078169394074652, "text": "@here_is_the_full pleas 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-18T08:40:05", "owner": "rykhe666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155162755379761, "text": "What heavenly tune is blessing my ears", "created_at": "2025-09-18T08:37:44", "owner": "pradumna_biswas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090646327697607, "text": "One of the best year ever 🙌🏾😌", "created_at": "2025-09-18T07:37:54", "owner": "donny_koji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022997456549576, "text": "Döner damals noch 3-5€ 😢😔", "created_at": "2025-09-18T07:29:28", "owner": "gametimeandrevincent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876312709307900, "text": "Everything was better", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:45:36", "owner": "amirhosein_zeinali_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060838871614512, "text": "Real brainrot", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:43:40", "owner": "blue.cat.thomas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024018626543720, "text": "Omgg yesss", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:12:46", "owner": "captainrockpad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856236037520005, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:43:21", "owner": "crisfacho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965004939813815, "text": "Back when tiktok was actually app with normal content", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:34:17", "owner": "_kyl3.rrr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908194399234959, "text": "Can we erase the one after the Clash Royale release?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:32:29", "owner": "mekyi_is_bored", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097376500560038, "text": "g OLD era", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:32:00", "owner": "iepaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044255477343905, "text": "Trump being elected was the best! He showed us how much the media lied. I had no idea just how the Left controlled everything and how they were manipulating us to go against our best interests.\n➖\nUnfortunately, many are still not smart enough to figure this out yet 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:21:33", "owner": "djbenjaminbass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103763572598710, "text": "And ofcause…Pewdiepie❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:10:22", "owner": "_harrycheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325773112238304, "text": "🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:07:10", "owner": "kurtis_einfeld_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036046865699646, "text": "I forgot about Dan😢thx for the memory back🖤", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:46:17", "owner": "sleepyondat_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061815557347019, "text": "2016 was a vibe", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:44:05", "owner": "jr_white", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844508203574994, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:39:46", "owner": "uhhsaj", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18138910207436699, "text": "Before tik tok, reels, shorts...", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:28:24", "owner": "sidney_peault", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18400304512142603, "text": "nah i just want 2017-2019 tbh", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:10:53", "owner": "the.real.lilwheel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074793836037864, "text": "You forgot Xanax lots and lots of Xanax", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:06:16", "owner": "bacobjarrabtes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147631312406201, "text": "2016 was the peak of humanity", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:06:05", "owner": "weekly_myles", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078250777971445, "text": "Steph curry prime", "created_at": "2025-09-18T03:58:19", "owner": "gofw_drew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068416379223343, "text": "Pure nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-09-18T03:56:51", "owner": "stelios_k67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054096434208593, "text": "Matrik era ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-18T03:11:46", "owner": "haziqhamzah98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852473161544139, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T03:02:16", "owner": "tolamorasmus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080211313782561, "text": "perasaan baru kemrin 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-18T02:58:47", "owner": "maqqq__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138307027437694, "text": "the music is a vibe nel", "created_at": "2025-09-18T02:52:48", "owner": "stormspottervinceeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383441083133362, "text": "Q saudade 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-18T02:47:53", "owner": "rayellibrandao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18205414258309182, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T02:26:11", "owner": "axyd.aep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18478476601079216, "text": "DamTDM 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-18T02:17:22", "owner": "saiiim0786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071802959132858, "text": "fax", "created_at": "2025-09-18T02:12:56", "owner": "chaseclements978", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080485810785464, "text": "the closest we've ever been to world peace", "created_at": "2025-09-18T02:03:02", "owner": "nichocorado", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040231325446781, "text": "Wow nothing helpful came of 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-18T02:00:14", "owner": "ry_n_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289037155256861, "text": "That dantdm video specifically brought back some memories. I still remember it it feels like yesterday but all of a sudden its been almost a decade", "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:47:41", "owner": "blueshoes42s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926178262102470, "text": "Bottle flip still exist", "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:46:17", "owner": "_ultimatelifeform", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075668455841834, "text": "the best", "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:12:45", "owner": "jeffreyselvaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969174453951883, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:06:56", "owner": "plp_prr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043954730355741, "text": "I remember the killer clown thing going around too (though it could’ve been 2015), memories", "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:05:24", "owner": "thetrickycreeperboy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023190839549225, "text": "J7 Prime 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-18T00:12:35", "owner": "verx_pvt7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042612071386913, "text": "I was a senior in high school. Some good times", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:56:59", "owner": "17stokezac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105664798583374, "text": "Covid took this from us", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:56:07", "owner": "n3cr0m0rphlc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051270767277250, "text": "Aint gonna 2016 is kinda overrated sure its better than now but all those trends was actually kinda ass and i was pretty annoyed of those trends in that year🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:52:37", "owner": "the_eye_soul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363104158154716, "text": "Wow Trump as president; imagine that.", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:41:03", "owner": "samurai_cowboy2000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915987217082671, "text": "My life in Prime", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:14:56", "owner": "milan.ftna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093308347666716, "text": "I Had Prime living", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:14:36", "owner": "milan.ftna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041930636391524, "text": "THE RED ONE HAS BEEN CHOSEN!!🔴🔴", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:06:56", "owner": "that_place_in_florida", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084596923910398, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:03:48", "owner": "matheuslovemusics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076632143008246, "text": "we areee SOOOOO nostalgic 😭😭🫰🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-17T23:00:23", "owner": "_.xuxu_.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961249668975704, "text": "Anybody remember thise youtubers whose motto was share the love", "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:34:36", "owner": "extra_ordinary_ace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924657694134630, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:34:16", "owner": "hug0_ferreir0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066589940011673, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:15:49", "owner": "noah_underated", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353753449091835, "text": "Worst thing that happened in 2016... Angry Birds Go 2.0", "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:04:11", "owner": "sheepboythebfbfan030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076013591084109, "text": "2016-2020 was fire 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-17T21:56:37", "owner": "aco.jv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098984308627394, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T21:47:35", "owner": "darkincorperated", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083800741907605, "text": "Almost 10 years ago... damm", "created_at": "2025-09-17T21:42:17", "owner": "tekofrei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066111353214684, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T21:41:35", "owner": "disgraceful_madman", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18057829982614895, "text": "2016 had to of been the 