L THE BIG THING!", "created_at": "2025-09-17T05:10:10", "owner": "ace_mctroy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18182282023336525, "text": "The most peak year. All u need was just watched youtube and played minecraft after school", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:58:20", "owner": "royanrhdd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077660518988971, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:56:30", "owner": "risharishar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089067661835439, "text": "i miss ncs", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:52:17", "owner": "sofb3rry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977945955912391, "text": "9 years ago😭", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:27:04", "owner": "agungr1412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493626136066044, "text": "a year or a paradise 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:24:36", "owner": "aakarshutd01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070671452173847, "text": "3 a.m 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:20:13", "owner": "bbachirameeguruu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18369659014196070, "text": "And we had vines and musically instead of tiktok", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:17:55", "owner": "jxrxmy_nbg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090565621695128, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:12:53", "owner": "aident_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155050858387490, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:00:57", "owner": "flizooo86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177781642343231, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T03:55:58", "owner": "miadtninterludee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370911205198816, "text": "Almost a 2 digit years gone bye…", "created_at": "2025-09-17T03:44:25", "owner": "kenji.k.lor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021963125767663, "text": "Back when the world As Great Well not really but for me, Cause I Was a lil kid Low-key looking Back dabbling  was cringe But Still miss that Year 😪", "created_at": "2025-09-17T03:38:56", "owner": "n7ss1f1nn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937483222079797, "text": "Dan😢", "created_at": "2025-09-17T03:37:41", "owner": "_the.1.n.only_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980007003913719, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T03:15:26", "owner": "rhys0751", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059358131614913, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T03:11:27", "owner": "dirza_lino", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899514421268423, "text": "Pause... The mannequin challenge ain't a thing no more twin? 💀😭🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:58:53", "owner": "char_tha09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038362310466676, "text": "Our 90s", "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:56:16", "owner": "eldinerorapido_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868598299443141, "text": "The best years in my life", "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:47:12", "owner": "rizalj_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117530287509084, "text": "Pasti sudah pada tua tuh yg ada di vidio😔", "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:41:49", "owner": "me.zaidan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074456159113587, "text": "It’s was perfect until trump", "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:27:42", "owner": "cj_unknown1610", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090289630840649, "text": "Crazy to think the kids who were in the mannequin challenge are now middle aged and now have kids 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:24:43", "owner": "nickthenerd22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862930657470469, "text": "Clash Royale was released in 2014", "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:17:40", "owner": "itsmura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867924388443977, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:15:48", "owner": "drifty_117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050843846277266, "text": "Tf is Kevin doing man 🥀😭", "created_at": "2025-09-17T01:43:12", "owner": "itz.sushil.irl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861089458482084, "text": "🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-17T01:42:11", "owner": "bl4ck_gk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078572803999693, "text": "Clash royal lives on", "created_at": "2025-09-17T01:03:27", "owner": "leahlissyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527740111040435, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T00:50:18", "owner": "samm__y11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057213029148562, "text": "@just.faqihhh", "created_at": "2025-09-17T00:17:34", "owner": "mhamdfrdhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962803635823381, "text": "The song 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-17T00:04:33", "owner": "joel_yadah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086702464864391, "text": "Dantdm☹️", "created_at": "2025-09-17T00:03:04", "owner": "eyes4esme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094045117735981, "text": "i can’t believe it’s going to be 10 years in 3 months", "created_at": "2025-09-17T00:01:09", "owner": "below.archives", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076626728087959, "text": "What good old days my friend😔", "created_at": "2025-09-16T23:43:40", "owner": "cikeyproject", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073125215330050, "text": "Bro whatever happened to clash of clans", "created_at": "2025-09-16T23:34:02", "owner": "milk_and_grover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896524048163746, "text": "best summer ever", "created_at": "2025-09-16T23:30:20", "owner": "vasque_sq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980112699859589, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T23:15:48", "owner": "itsss.kn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095783287586378, "text": "Faze rug prime", "created_at": "2025-09-16T23:15:37", "owner": "han.zsuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063359390586768, "text": "@revynchi @andrewchrist03 @muhmd.arwin @jojoberybe @rsman_b08 @hxrixnto_sl", "created_at": "2025-09-16T23:05:53", "owner": "7uly_us", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971980377786207, "text": "2016 was best ❤️🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:56:04", "owner": "rohannnaldo_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985424586726374, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:40:41", "owner": "evlrta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078336682997544, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:36:39", "owner": "michaelm31111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18524670067017569, "text": "Ts was peak @carter4hd @tysonbueter", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:35:35", "owner": "michaelm31111", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866504209451317, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:29:36", "owner": "luiseduardo_2995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944053486028167, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:14:00", "owner": "that_boi_hector", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066215384014092, "text": "Saw a 2nd grader today with a full set a of nails that look to be 120 dollars", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:06:48", "owner": "kaianahefner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375511816198204, "text": "Guava juice is OG", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:05:05", "owner": "skylen4_yall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072937352335808, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:04:47", "owner": "skylen4_yall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973592064778522, "text": "Don't forget too CR7 eon UCL and Euro at the same time👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-16T21:34:59", "owner": "m.agriawan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996705837818720, "text": "Miss my nigga guava juice", "created_at": "2025-09-16T21:28:19", "owner": "kyums.dead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375619423183801, "text": "2016 was the best and worst year of my life, lost my dad that year when i was still in high school. But yes that whole year was otherwise fire 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-16T21:24:50", "owner": "rocket23__99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139447135382009, "text": "Last real year. Then ai and TikTok came and ruined everything 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-16T21:21:39", "owner": "yanick.cayouette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318524779215230, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T21:17:40", "owner": "lolobrue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18506085751066779, "text": "We took 2016 for granted bro🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-16T20:48:47", "owner": "2elusive._zirrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097187002643935, "text": "give me 2017 and 2018", "created_at": "2025-09-16T20:26:00", "owner": "ethanwitthavisuals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078610438804076, "text": "Seeing DanTDM back then just makes me tear up on how much he's been through since that time, and now seeing today he's a father of two kids + the millions of other people around the world. 🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-16T19:26:31", "owner": "brandon_j_santos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18183028981336090, "text": "Peak", "created_at": "2025-09-16T19:25:43", "owner": "_.soham10._", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062550170360429, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T19:20:23", "owner": "wortex_plus_fanta_crew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061577282378708, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T19:17:29", "owner": "_hanif.alfatih", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18342260635204586, "text": "Miss when life felt like this song.", "created_at": "2025-09-16T19:12:09", "owner": "jamescran_carphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065875694021031, "text": "I miss this", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:58:21", "owner": "ifonlyparmeetgotsomerizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941515107931359, "text": "In Germany „Danny Jesden“ was prime because of the fidget spinners 😂\nMy German guys knows 😂✌🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:42:40", "owner": "itzmauricee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056153366424772, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:39:00", "owner": "mihai_rvaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071148917169466, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:38:59", "owner": "mihai_rvaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100806745528125, "text": "Wassabi", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:29:51", "owner": "isqandar_313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054193394201972, "text": "Take me back 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:23:51", "owner": "uzairhussain.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071645678468243, "text": "The music😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:09:43", "owner": "maxiz_z17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114706837467320, "text": "That blonde guy in the Dab video is now a WWE Superstar (Parasite). Can you believe it? 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:07:26", "owner": "yyagiz.27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909489415210463, "text": "@_aris_666 @lvanderlyl @_gl__244 nesse tempo o sonho era ter canal no YouTube", "created_at": "2025-09-16T17:49:29", "owner": "exp3dr0_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110337016558722, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T17:23:51", "owner": "lugoshiiiiii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915372178056164, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T17:22:47", "owner": "_megat._a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902650213257369, "text": "When people were actually people", "created_at": "2025-09-16T17:07:17", "owner": "1an_0ndl0w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156702913386903, "text": "2016 itu 3 tahun yang lalu kan, ya kan?", "created_at": "2025-09-16T17:00:44", "owner": "victor_0101v", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062192492597256, "text": "The prime of every youtuber, there wasn't a single bad day", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:57:52", "owner": "iafernandess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059862107117171, "text": "Welcome to where ptsd began", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:53:22", "owner": "kittoxdex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373983031183658, "text": "Yg paling gw rindu cuma bagian bapak gw masih hidup", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:29:04", "owner": "ahmadnursyahs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078035396067391, "text": "Sa ressemble beaucoup  au prime de l'humanité", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:19:48", "owner": "eth4n_amns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069841376329403, "text": "TikTok done ruined attention spans and shit man", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:00:18", "owner": "bigboycurlyfry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079166779814821, "text": "Last good deep breath was 2016-18", "created_at": "2025-09-16T15:38:10", "owner": "enzopala.cios", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18527002339024933, "text": "9 years in a flash", "created_at": "2025-09-16T15:26:51", "owner": "sheepsteamfish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925412008133552, "text": "😭that Songgggggg", "created_at": "2025-09-16T15:25:26", "owner": "bishesh_xtha03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095864740656593, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T15:19:42", "owner": "omii.ii20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023806148543741, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T15:19:41", "owner": "omii.ii20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379872283176895, "text": "What’s the sounds track called?", "created_at": "2025-09-16T15:16:47", "owner": "andyma0316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107935621560837, "text": "The dab was 2015 not 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:57:04", "owner": "_.epohhcaz._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066333116014914, "text": "I remember I was 5 when pokemon go came out and me and my family would grind, it was so fun seeing the community walking around playing the game, this game made people go outside while now we just got bull shit ass games, I wish I can go back, pokemon go was truly one hell of a game to remember", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:56:19", "owner": "kingbrandess", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355510120081793, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:49:58", "owner": "iblamerhuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879089008395762, "text": "where's him", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:49:30", "owner": "iblamerhuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18239198584294847, "text": "Wake up it's 2026", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:48:04", "owner": "krishna_chavann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893493595328854, "text": "Dude perfect videos 😎", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:48:01", "owner": "riteshkumar2915", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071242501934485, "text": "Fuck ass year mannn😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:45:01", "owner": "alex_on_marz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075911618076233, "text": "😢😢❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:42:51", "owner": "maxen787", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052264844261108, "text": "This song is nostalgia 😔🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:36:43", "owner": "bella_theclown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849209818529475, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:29:39", "owner": "thesovietmanheresirw8e8e8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903593374256389, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:27:11", "owner": "itsyourvichuhere", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893758324331221, "text": "Mi mancano quei tempi 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:23:54", "owner": "giorgia_dalilaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922807621149885, "text": "nahh something feels odd when EvanTubeHD is not in the list", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:03:28", "owner": "superyuza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875874655409118, "text": "take me back bro💔", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:00:26", "owner": "elias_kom_sangedakru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091852870780295, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-16T13:44:47", "owner": "kingcelso17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986356599893856, "text": "