44048577, "text": "Hold me closeeeeee", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:34:44", "owner": "tray_done12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965903868796693, "text": "2015-16 feels unreal for a reason", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:25:49", "owner": "_terabyte.neo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087172846841634, "text": "Fidget spinners were in 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:03:04", "owner": "ezzeldinwael4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084837289729108, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T18:59:56", "owner": "jeramxhisdagoxt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994102083684714, "text": "I want to go back that time 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-15T18:47:58", "owner": "aeroblade107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074951099045776, "text": "Spinners 😭🤙🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-15T18:36:28", "owner": "kjs_kathliz_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986878191854510, "text": "This was our “80’s”", "created_at": "2025-09-15T18:28:13", "owner": "ijoljjbm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912242473196423, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T18:01:41", "owner": "corebuster_glutt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106962316565736, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T17:57:33", "owner": "_olecho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285504253279039, "text": "Die Zeit wo man sich noch selbst mit einfachen Sachen beschäftigt hat😢", "created_at": "2025-09-15T17:36:21", "owner": "vincent_ja06", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18325175506238926, "text": "ağlıyorum teşekkür ederim", "created_at": "2025-09-15T17:31:12", "owner": "sir_kaann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065510432038712, "text": "So, you're telling me it wasn't 4 years ago?", "created_at": "2025-09-15T16:58:23", "owner": "emirhan.agin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899013238272101, "text": "DANTDM was legit my favorite lol i would always watch him and trayaurus", "created_at": "2025-09-15T16:47:43", "owner": "ittybittyjelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040302617427731, "text": "retardation started 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-15T16:10:24", "owner": "foto.backlot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032669816507022, "text": "Holy almost 10 years ago...", "created_at": "2025-09-15T16:08:08", "owner": "itsjustmemehere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888086281221113, "text": "Video❌\nBGM✅", "created_at": "2025-09-15T15:41:55", "owner": "seantsai0108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865239712458148, "text": "The World stops at 2019. 2020-2025 feels too plain and wrong", "created_at": "2025-09-15T15:24:49", "owner": "syarif_spotter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18325059361239283, "text": "Truly the best year", "created_at": "2025-09-15T15:11:35", "owner": "camk11711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990369324845043, "text": "Okay 2016 was actually peak and the music too bro 🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-15T15:09:34", "owner": "marcus.mcguffin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078362710975665, "text": "life before instagram ❤️‍🩹🥀💔", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:55:28", "owner": "ibrhiimvls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068593640183799, "text": "dantdm hits hard 🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:50:44", "owner": "enurys_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980075256910310, "text": "2016 devon larrat got 2 hammers", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:45:07", "owner": "adulkerta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053395208627217, "text": "Guava juice", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:42:14", "owner": "krimeful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116458144511417, "text": "Being 12 then was peak life", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:41:29", "owner": "kingkyle611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077863397003740, "text": "Ngl. Im saying this for nostalgia and not in a political view. Times when Obama was President was the most goated time ever.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:39:38", "owner": "eshvar._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068431415331783, "text": "@ravnn.29", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:28:13", "owner": "ahhwynnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293237605266340, "text": "Shit seem like yesterday", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:19:48", "owner": "jay_stillsmokin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079165711789783, "text": "9 yrs already 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:13:12", "owner": "a_a_r_y_a_n_a_n_s_a_r_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354855283090200, 