4241090340684, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-15T06:14:55", "owner": "calvin.f53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386549260193126, "text": "Getting nostalgic over 2016 is crazy", "created_at": "2025-09-15T06:11:48", "owner": "frankmatthewsuk7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098850766720926, "text": "I think 2016 was sweet", "created_at": "2025-09-15T06:02:58", "owner": "konah_tuah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867596818445255, "text": "Prime Justin Bieber", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:49:57", "owner": "maximus_.06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105594376573546, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:42:40", "owner": "asep.sutrisno", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089863159753744, "text": "The broom challenge is what made the world get destroyed slowly", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:19:42", "owner": "amauris_g37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064440710594563, "text": "2016 hit different so unreal fr", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:12:20", "owner": "nishanthprabhuramm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105810112576288, "text": "0.37 showers ago 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:08:39", "owner": "bikelifenick7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093988690673550, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:03:40", "owner": "luvil_karate", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129487780463131, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:02:57", "owner": "luvil_karate", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879481633282116, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:02:44", "owner": "luvil_karate", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058498025386420, "text": "My kids was born at that day on summer 2016 he miss everything😭", "created_at": "2025-09-15T04:55:45", "owner": "i_am_not_purvik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322396396214134, "text": "I was 15 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-15T04:20:18", "owner": "i2cua", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17903266380254784, "text": "A decade ago ……. Oh my", "created_at": "2025-09-15T04:20:11", "owner": "moses_lim30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066850361002511, "text": "DanTDM existed like never before", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:54:15", "owner": "abhi_notfound.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094051015736263, "text": "Coming back from school and watching @jelly for hours", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:49:23", "owner": "_.sayoobi.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480771547078718, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:43:19", "owner": "kr_aley", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18070070591340140, "text": "This was it 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:24:08", "owner": "niggemeyerj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097009621568335, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:23:44", "owner": "ode_triarsana03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976203120919242, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:48:32", "owner": "jm8733boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396793435138868, "text": "The year I met the love of my life🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:31:31", "owner": "omgctj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419439700108333, "text": "Where is Filthy Frank? 🧐", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:25:35", "owner": "lsantander80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085809658870405, "text": "guava juice", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:24:04", "owner": "zacky777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025366136529715, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:21:06", "owner": "minorutouka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866683228448894, "text": "THE SONG", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:09:33", "owner": "thereallemeori", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085706815706481, "text": "Why this shi look like the 90s what are we doing ?", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:09:03", "owner": "nofakinthis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089472445834963, "text": "@charlie_typhoon @tommi.vicenti__", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:59:28", "owner": "danyy.cappiello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399547879137869, "text": "The year I couldn't escape god damn summer music when I was in Spain and the year that a racing game which killed the franchise for me", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:58:23", "owner": "xdmars21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075511082284244, "text": "And also where social distancing began before the Covid pandemic", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:52:54", "owner": "chris_in.24k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984053292893153, "text": "\"Carlos Brathwaite,Carlos Brathwaite, Remember The Name\"🔥,Hits hard in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:51:00", "owner": "justanormaltindat_t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18415907536128025, "text": "Bro, 2016 was actually the time to play alive. I remember playing Pokemon GO on my iPad while riding in my Mom or Dad's car, and sometimes I'd be like, \"Mom (or Dad)! Stop! I gotta catch this Pokemon!\"😂. I used to collect Fidget Spinners as well.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:41:02", "owner": "imjackofeverything", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089438308755637, "text": "Before pandemic.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:39:06", "owner": "stormyzedd7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067731794195879, "text": "2024 was this decade's 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:38:19", "owner": "culerxoib654789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174161287343951, "text": "The song 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:36:56", "owner": "chayan_.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063570083581620, "text": "Why did everyone forget about fidget spinners", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:32:36", "owner": "inevasked", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019121384582020, "text": "Imagine in the future insta reels become nostalgic", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:26:30", "owner": "williaml4694", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892172182340393, "text": "I can't believe it was almost 10 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:14:25", "owner": "rileyneimanis2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035904344687143, "text": "I wanna go back so bad 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-15T00:56:37", "owner": "lenarennaaaeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020724989567847, "text": "Dammmm DanTDM I forgot about him 😢 we getting 2025", "created_at": "2025-09-15T00:52:31", "owner": "adont_play5539", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108294160493759, "text": "Kevin heart look the same 🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-15T00:49:50", "owner": "justinkrick2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189363466326088, "text": "The dab was retarded. Bottle flip was less retarded. Figit spinners were stupid. I never saw the mannequin challenge. But DanTDM was a major highlight.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T00:04:41", "owner": "theb1gst4nk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054530795204461, "text": "I really wished I was in la during these times but I enjoyed it", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:57:58", "owner": "mrbeenondat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917450650081768, "text": "2016 is like a whole summer year 🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:44:19", "owner": "pubs_in_ur_cereal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068217746219295, "text": "50th anniversary of Ultraman and Ultraman Orb", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:27:05", "owner": "kaiju1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948257830034294, "text": "Dabbing was never cool", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:24:19", "owner": "jimmyburbz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525976186029332, "text": "I remember doing that mannequin challenge in my freshman home room 🙏🏾😂 shit was dn 10 years ago now", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:05:06", "owner": "dayonediscipline1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057185402153243, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:03:18", "owner": "qpxd1xq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863650486464145, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:03:17", "owner": "qpxd1xq", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070767964919736, "text": "2015-2019 best time in my life", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:56:22", "owner": "wu_morris", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18059862830378816, "text": "👀 2026?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:51:33", "owner": "__donnyrizzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041675468677782, "text": "It doesn’t even feel like it’s been 9 years", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:43:56", "owner": "matt_hew91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050845358271422, "text": "Most of these are cringe", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:43:32", "owner": "rbloxakhtar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905216488249514, "text": "password at minute 20:16", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:36:20", "owner": "axt.d2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084045343907235, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:34:38", "owner": "aguadepina4_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091161382767344, "text": "Anyone know the song name ?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:07:34", "owner": "bigjoker_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864345331460901, "text": "Vine...", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:45:04", "owner": "kis.valer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040969523414381, "text": "Te faltó el Minecraft bro", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:41:37", "owner": "vic.s.t.m.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056880794403966, "text": "Prime time😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:35:31", "owner": "the_real_excelsior_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069386249234373, "text": "2017", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:34:21", "owner": "chayote_0011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902066608254309, "text": "Ppap... wtf", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:29:49", "owner": "jascurdejan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150665902402019, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:21:02", "owner": "th3dza", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17958537935842632, "text": "One of the best years", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:08:45", "owner": "thugnasty115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077634356066707, "text": "some of the best times in my life", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:08:42", "owner": "ari.sxf", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18089790934829801, "text": "prime dude perfect bro....", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:02:17", "owner": "gideon_rosa04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990429567838524, "text": "Mannequin challenge🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:54:30", "owner": "sultan_shaikh_0712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362588539157022, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:48:26", "owner": "rheese_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966124179796826, "text": "😔😔😔😢😢😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:45:02", "owner": "karina6447873", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042198761666252, "text": "Don’t forget prime Stampy", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:43:34", "owner": "thetitansrundown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857596453508157, "text": "Maaaan 🥹 i miss 2016 also how can you forget chainsmokers hits…drakes hotline bling…weekends star boy….\nEverything was best in 2016 and i thought it was only me but most people i met they said 2016 was the best year and best summers of all time…everything changed after 2018", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:16:47", "owner": "ameer_1014", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18397489099187405, "text": "Bro these kids will never know😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:16:43", "owner": "tha1_nggafrm.co", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055846247176057, "text": "I wanna go back 🥀😔", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:16:24", "owner": "piggierider882345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895674856306825, "text": "The simulation will reset itself, which I’m mostly ok with except for the company I kept", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:16:08", "owner": "thecheesepro", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18052409930638145, "text": "😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:14:21", "owner": "notorious_one96", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18280259176279519, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:13:25", "owner": "frey.wade", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117874207502660, "text": "@genantsamere chaud", "created_at": "2025-09-14T19:36:28", "owner": "ve_ga946", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078625862507135, "text": "Harambe! 🦍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T19:31:00", "owner": "hashimpervase", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068544875187078, "text": "Vine era", "created_at": "2025-09-14T19:26:57", "owner": "mljthabeatmaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416168491108702, "text": "Ayo don't forget about the whole killer clown shenanigans", "created_at": "2025-09-14T19:26:42", "owner": "ray_raydagoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965593011797803, "text": "Literal brain rot", "created_at": "2025-09-14T18:49:00", "owner": "hallaslik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074837798101570, "text": "anyway, we were happy...", "created_at": "2025-09-14T18:48:40", "owner": "felii_potense", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17934430643960154, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T18:46:17", "owner": "ketchup_every_day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522353671015675, "text": "And the, like nahin karonge naa🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-14T18:26:16", "owner": "_lildidler_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067143919991540, "text": "Someo