l the world was and how much more people got along at the time", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:26:12", "owner": "10__andy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055678028621443, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:26:00", "owner": "auger_ethan_05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18480222055078428, "text": "Zoomers nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:18:20", "owner": "satsum0_tc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18174190153348310, "text": "50 years of Super Bowls", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:17:27", "owner": "5soviet_elite55", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18114980050520069, "text": "Best summer", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:10:50", "owner": "bunbo.19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901300285268034, "text": "Fidget spinners were 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:07:36", "owner": "nathaniel.aflalo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965723742801611, "text": "I still be tryna flip them bottles", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:59:54", "owner": "hnble.lector", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068633384187020, "text": "There’s a void inside me now", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:53:19", "owner": "flippy_ishappy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062247587458708, "text": "It's all fault of Covid-19 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:53:15", "owner": "sahil_gorule_47", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18039186287442666, "text": "2016 was just league of legends and weed", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:50:40", "owner": "loeak77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094499422733825, "text": "messyourself...", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:50:25", "owner": "mahiath.90", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067849799223980, "text": "Song: On & On - Cartoon (feat. Jéja, Daniel Levi) 🎶", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:45:44", "owner": "lui_jz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094863316676619, "text": "Almost 10 years ago😢", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:44:19", "owner": "jnkvcs.levy_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094120471678430, "text": "\"dont cry because its gone,smile because it happened\"", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:42:39", "owner": "______ego___", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054101588207178, "text": "Bring it back ple