esquícios da geração passada kkkk", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:01:30", "owner": "pabloandrade7374", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894147493317446, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:58:54", "owner": "i_goon_to_mazda_miata_mx5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041609198668430, "text": "u forgot ninja and fortnite", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:54:06", "owner": "saindeley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970609662949516, "text": "Fetö", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:50:53", "owner": "yigit_16sr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109406953489056, "text": "Absolutely loved 2016, I must have been on year 3 but still absolutely amazing, don't forget Stampy longlegs, I think that was his name, the Minecraft guy, absolutely great he was too.🙌🙌🙌🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:38:09", "owner": "casey_obee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929977566982279, "text": "Only 9 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:22:27", "owner": "aeshtetic.sam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922609972112182, "text": "Song name 🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:01:33", "owner": "f1_jielun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868584121442894, "text": "The greatest year of all time in the world", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:00:17", "owner": "milbeya", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17929924676984651, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:56:03", "owner": "alle_monta_10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537358939027664, "text": "Name of music", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:55:50", "owner": "taygreall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117155959507868, "text": "The best era fr😭🫶🏽", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:55:31", "owner": "pranjitdxmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076764328831137, "text": "Life when it was peak", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:49:32", "owner": "souleyzarr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050583059281982, "text": "OG of life", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:48:23", "owner": "lyj.0311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067334132186696, "text": "I still play Pokemon Go", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:47:30", "owner": "bxlwt12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965746947956965, "text": "Less socials media", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:46:36", "owner": "objectif_focus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080027762491379, "text": "Take me backkk😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:46:18", "owner": "fathima_12019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886240009361443, "text": "I'd do anything to go back :(", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:45:19", "owner": "cbrgasxv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917296870172655, "text": "Fidget, spinners were popular in 2017, not 2016. Whoever made this was probably 5.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:41:37", "owner": "shs7s5sfsg2gcv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079450084954439, "text": "So... It seems that everything went to shit around that time. So sad that \"culture\" for the generation that grew up during that year will mostly have memories of stupid internet challenges and trends. 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:30:39", "owner": "billyshears88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331910086237976, "text": "this song itself is 2016 in all it's essence", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:11:58", "owner": "_simply_vishal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027035711722689, "text": "AND COLLIN KEYY", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:09:53", "owner": "yasmine_spamzzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898633123276434, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:08:36", "owner": "dabeer._.ansari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947092987042673, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:02:41", "owner": "spide_y____", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18360574081155588, "text": "I was 6 but I remember ts shit", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:57:26", "owner": "mitsubishigenesis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945024964029039, "text": "The song 😭🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:53:01", "owner": "__.wasnt._.sanvi._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078185041817326, "text": "2016 nostalgia. One of the best years for me. But everyone knows that the best era is the 90'", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:41:22", "owner": "konstantinospathiakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087641752879244, "text": "Dantdm was always in his prime", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:35:50", "owner": "johnvvcx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971896497939624, "text": "I see the clip where it all went wrong---->", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:28:05", "owner": "io.clout", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058154627422982, "text": "Old OOF", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:17:29", "owner": "yihong_1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078473479819356, "text": "nostalgic😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:09:19", "owner": "acapnotselek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085715407850650, "text": "life before lgbtq came", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:05:15", "owner": "sushitherash", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063493604599315, "text": "Take me back to the night we met 😔😔😔😔😔😔😔😔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:57:14", "owner": "dat.gurl.dia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076197245043959, "text": "Killer clown era also", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:53:47", "owner": "zlxe.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065237759253588, "text": "And Euro2016", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:45:24", "owner": "flofficiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078431995969446, "text": "Why are you pretending fidget spinners wasn't 2017 lol", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:43:39", "owner": "car_t423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861858211415522, "text": "This was a decade ago in about 4 months", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:41:40", "owner": "professionalbassboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924880069104422, "text": "I had the best time of my life in 2016. Can I go back, please?😢", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:32:54", "owner": "_alessocosta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031531382705390, "text": "when the life was lifing", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:29:03", "owner": "saif_abukhsheim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078439978812771, "text": "Simpler times", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:18:50", "owner": "sattv1k", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069079573959350, "text": "Pokémon go hype was different", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:01:17", "owner": "its.juxtin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177030931341902, "text": "wait....fidget spinners r that old💀", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:59:59", "owner": "absurd.fool_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091380196763648, "text": "Fidget spinner was aura back then 🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:51:40", "owner": "ain__mohd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138645160436291, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:41:41", "owner": "s7_om7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340859386164409, "text": "Who tf is this DanTDM", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:38:03", "owner": "pedro.thiago.fma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084783499893497, "text": "Leafyishere prime too", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:21:08", "owner": "oniiii_chaaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525718156038238, "text": "You forgot about Jacksepticeye with the green hair and clowns sightings", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:20:02", "owner": "blue_dragon1130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083082568914604, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:19:25", "owner": "blue_dragon1130", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041404175403514, "text": "Neymar and cristiano prime 😭🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:07:53", "owner": "nabin_thakuri9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866220109387053, "text": "it’s so funny cuz i thought i was the only one", "created_at": "2025-09-14T04:59:24", "owner": "daniellrivera_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145603018412202, "text": "there way too many thing happen", "created_at": "2025-09-14T04:45:49", "owner": "s1nchan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867781648373675, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T04:37:29", "owner": "sushi_snatcher3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983175336902227, "text": "Nasi goreng purwokerto tengah", "created_at": "2025-09-14T04:36:04", "owner": "ic1zufxuxux1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087937210665642, "text": "When I came to the us to never go back shi been so fun here best year ever for everyone", "created_at": "2025-09-14T04:21:16", "owner": "dieggo.sa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902306422128320, "text": "Wasn't the mannequin challenge in 2013?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T03:52:44", "owner": "sshatmojo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098494969618227, "text": "I feel like i gained consciousness from that time like my life started from that time and before that i wasn’t even alive", "created_at": "2025-09-14T03:45:39", "owner": "mikenins_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086377609894792, "text": "Is it possible to bring all these back in 2026?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T03:37:07", "owner": "lena_oxton_tracer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153076360390534, "text": "@brian_bebo", "created_at": "2025-09-14T03:34:07", "owner": "felipe_obed22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071663111131318, "text": "@romangaleanox12 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-14T03:32:16", "owner": "ezee23_0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088927561835301, "text": "My mind: RIO 2016!!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T03:31:15", "owner": "rodrigorodriguesdelgado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103414126522912, "text": "😔😔🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T03:14:31", "owner": "its___me___youssef__1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076588586088979, "text": "So brainrot always has always been among us just in different formats…", "created_at": "2025-09-14T03:07:23", "owner": "logan_schaedel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001303049652045, "text": "Where is Euro 2016?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:39:02", "owner": "nakamura__shin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172558246359180, "text": "Was so lame", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:36:13", "owner": "nathaniehammett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152353918398798, "text": "This videos are always so cringe, like someone who didn't live that year made them", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:25:39", "owner": "gg_ggvw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065228132194074, "text": "Fifa Online 3 still exist, fidget spinner for phone case, Neymar still play for Barcelona...", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:18:23", "owner": "_razz16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395979292137584, "text": "สมัยอ้าย", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:03:52", "owner": "private.yoyniggass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102893113592280, "text": "Clash", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:57:02", "owner": "rand.all_xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952631736875150, "text": "Our high school lunch table would play bottle flip and if you lost you had to drop the bottle on your knuckles the height of how many lands it went up to. Core memory", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:55:29", "owner": "braden_rauco", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18397503616136435, "text": "can't believe it's been 30 years now since 2016 🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:47:14", "owner": "matthew._9945", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858586936500612, "text": "Didn’t clash come back to life in 2025 from all them edits", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:17:02", "owner": "w_vrgtag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067632950195720, "text": "There’s never going to be another summer 2016 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:10:55", "owner": "taaaaaaaavi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085586185722084, "text": "Last time Tennessee beat Georgia", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:07:15", "owner": "loganblevins_2401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073717496123751, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:54:06", "owner": "j.clo16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961996797983287, "text": "World changed bcs of : 🇨🇳 2019 tragedy", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:49:55", "owner": "_reap7._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372562693197139, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:44:03", "owner": "jvson.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074569753869143, "text": "THE RED ONE HAS BEEN CHOSEN‼️‼️🗣️🥹❤️‍🩹🌹🔋", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:42:07", "owner": "suprememassa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315904300241586, "text": "Prime earth🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:36:06", "owner": "tandagabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861919852413693, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:18:53", "owner": "ryan_franchitti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897622993278085, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:11:56", "owner": "vz_thauan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973280403925142, "text": "LMFAOOO that’s funny was just on clash Royale yesterday", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:07:28", "owner": "347stryk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091213654698510, "text": "Who tf is Dan", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:30:53", "owner": "snowlee.q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950966866033080, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:29:02", "owner": "manncrazyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105292420605904, "text": "I don't want to go to the hub to listen to Acid Bath tho.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:27:41", "owner": "kyler_rivera25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902891062123958, "text": "Fidget spanners", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:57:39", "owner": "samule_linkage", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17989387463847196, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:51:33", "owner": "bunnybear02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091485919751929, "text": "Simpler times", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:40:13", "owner": "rustythe10", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071643836146759, "text": "I don't think Trump being elected really brings up that positive nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:35:01", "owner": "janjohannbrot", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071619221144451, "text": "Summer 16 will fade into legend", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:16:57", "owner": "theycalledmelips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859196035497725, "text": "@doctorsax90 forse il “dimmi perché rido” più difficile di sempre", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:14:28", "owner": "nicola_wayne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110859553552994, "text": "Never do a challenge because its exhausting but i enjoy it can living in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:07:08", "owner": "madeee__.ee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101050936530764, "text": "9 years ago 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:52:33", "owner": "fawkumean200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976972884875516, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:45:02", "owner": "abdulaziz_adi95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980737080858144, "text": "Summer 2016 was peak", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:41:35", "owner": "eliav13044", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070833068169434, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:39:55", "owner": "lukamilosevic09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286930069281872, "text": "Ngl I never knew Kevin hart and Logan Paul met 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:36:25", "owner": "egpennydroppa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858423853501871, "text": "IDK why but i can make distinctions from the 80s and 90s, but from the 2000s i have a hard time separating the generations 2000s, 2010s, 2020s", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:30:36", "owner": "wizzelho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070733390514200, "text": "I graduated with that era in high school class of 2016🥲💖🫶🏽✨", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:29:24", "owner": "stefani.rosales_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090713968743007, "text": "It was almost 10 years ago now…But Damn thoose were really good times !", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:28:55", "owner": "benceinfiniti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908697442216122, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:26:04", "owner": "bamdotbeezy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058820588574300, "text": "Making me feel old😔", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:21:53", "owner": "ankle_bitter9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019828412567256, "text": "😭😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:13:03", "owner": "714_milo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919097392169295, "text": "Trump was the biggest downfall 🗑️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:02:09", "owner": "khizarjehangir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075410168011779, "text": "Harambe was still alive 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-13T20:52:03", "owner": "roon_shady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079532915296373, "text": "flip botol is timeless 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-13T20:48:19", "owner": "moko_rq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288954457255096, "text": "On and on is also peak 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-13T20:15:32", "owner": "journey.by.lens", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981322803902422, "text": "I miss it", "created_at": "2025-09-13T20:10:22", "owner": "shans.sxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057138869151046, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:59:08", "owner": "davi_biel012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521415700054986, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:58:05", "owner": "davi_biel012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057251831161958, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:50:24", "owner": "drxp3ie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934161748091323, "text": "Best year of my life 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:38:03", "owner": "prayag._267", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920121241150434, "text": "@ybrap ahhhhhh waktu itu.....", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:36:14", "owner": "b_bn0702__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991162281697528, "text": "Let's Revive them Movement", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:22:24", "owner": "og_anurag777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18236218948288665, "text": "Right after this this life soon got bad than covid that was the last of the good years oh fuxk Jake Paul and his stupid brother", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:21:43", "owner": "hozaydiesel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341868718166994, "text": "frfr", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:17:58", "owner": "alvintok._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993257742689858, "text": "summer 15 and summer 16 were such highs bro", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:15:05", "owner": "4evagrip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360561103159508, "text": "Pen pineapple apple pen🗣️🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:11:44", "owner": "pranjalsaxena099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059277701111822, "text": "Fidget spinners were actually 2017☝️🤓", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:03:02", "owner": "its.4lexii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951412350881185, "text": "Ahhh!!!! fidget spinner!!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:55:36", "owner": "aditya.inframe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202660570310425, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:51:32", "owner": "_official_elibee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983583063893836, "text": "We gotta bring these back next year", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:47:32", "owner": "masenknox808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063068549366043, "text": "Cuando México no era tan void👀🔥🔥🔥🔥♥️♥️♥️♥️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:43:45", "owner": "leo_xxj.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069034009964195, "text": "*and wen yb was blowing up* take me back😔😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:42:43", "owner": "vonripcailee_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18317930110240875, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:37:25", "owner": "guts_987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893545381181790, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:29:35", "owner": "asava234", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17927435160128557, "text": "Covid destroyed everything", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:20:33", "owner": "xzrpr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850335424553910, "text": "Life in 2016-2019 was peak", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:06:16", "owner": "_narwal___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102075370615343, "text": "Crazy how nostalgia sugar coats a year That people used to say was one of the worst years in history. I imagine that people in 10 years will be saying the same thing about 2025.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:55:53", "owner": "sweetigcreations", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056691842625203, "text": "😭🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:53:07", "owner": "gannipishiah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068416040266125, "text": "Today i go turn 18 and i feel old", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:49:51", "owner": "titoua_nnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086634376848110, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:45:58", "owner": "elijah_pod16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094198927678209, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:32:45", "owner": "m.ere.n.sa.lta.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107034397566687, "text": "2016 will be 10 years ago btw", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:32:40", "owner": "zaelshuntaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934192630088455, "text": "ive always said i hated 2016 but it truly was a good fuckin year", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:28:42", "owner": "forever5tar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292198162265103, "text": "It was cringe but we were happy", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:27:03", "owner": "calimanmartinez209", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861839083416797, "text": "Já tinha esquecido de ppap", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:19:42", "owner": "jose_rodrigo_olive", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057630473387215, "text": "That year I was 6 or 7", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:14:14", "owner": "eli_relitz14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075877802038366, "text": "Blud tryna sneak trump in fr", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:13:24", "owner": "andre_rangel12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105329620605408, "text": "AND THE SONG!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:10:40", "owner": "_opzain", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17896280154165740, "text": "That year was weak af idk why people hype it up I genuinely disliked 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:10:27", "owner": "soupraaaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959213448989522, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:05:16", "owner": "nitro_zeus1307", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085062745870073, "text": "Life is happier back then", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:57:13", "owner": "jeedaiismm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066507238991222, "text": "I still do the dab btw", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:52:14", "owner": "serj_burritos_h0t_cousin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054687020628131, "text": "Life before COVID was good (I know it's nostalgia but yeah)", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:49:29", "owner": "edymavile", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062402576346451, "text": "Now everyones so lame", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:37:21", "owner": "ch8podubs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082326451925714, "text": "I was 7 years old chat", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:36:18", "owner": "mygirlmypeace_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849939379554414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:36:06", "owner": "adam.elmernissi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885170731242024, "text": "爭鮮", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:24:29", "owner": "_xuzzill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111003949532446, "text": "I like that PPAP made it to this list 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:03:42", "owner": "lawson.j.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017179940774761, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:58:16", "owner": "aviel.mm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954836370859043, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:57:50", "owner": "killamytex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075034898019209, "text": "Acho que uma das melhores épocas....", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:51:30", "owner": "_anthony_araujo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077892506060806, "text": "2016 2017 chef kiss",