ose were the days 😭🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:26:04", "owner": "aaditya.kotian", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094140610709017, "text": "I just went through this channel in hope for more nostalgia but all I found is loads of ai bull shit.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:21:03", "owner": "mario_dohc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993650598836455, "text": "Before it all went wrong…", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:20:17", "owner": "asadeliskt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068797454182514, "text": "2016 was our 1980s", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:19:10", "owner": "marcz3lit0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053288546226233, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:09:54", "owner": "obb_xb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054205295542494, "text": "End of Uzbekistan in September 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:06:52", "owner": "ataboyevmiraziz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316400743246253, "text": "Get rid of DanTDM. Put prime XQC or something better", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:04:51", "owner": "ianober___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861805117413546, "text": "This background song is nostalgic on its own", "created_at": "2025-09-13T10:52:39", "owner": "omagashe96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321903916232339, "text": "Tellement nul 🤣\nVous vivez à travers les trends et memes tictoc mdrrr ?", "created_at": "2025-09-13T10:49:19", "owner": "vltn_vl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059067608605435, "text": "goat era", "created_at": "2025-09-13T10:40:43", "owner": "kvnsandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969617586791186, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T10:37:03", "owner": "fox_fishing_cz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981470481897312, "text": "Kia yad krwa dia yar 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T10:11:39", "owner": "alsohashir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042753218373250, "text": "NCS", "created_at": "2025-09-13T10:10:40", "owner": "kaique_kjtfaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923431039135140, "text": "In fact, we can go back to 2016 for a day as a whole world.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T10:03:47", "owner": "frline34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 182932627152