": 1}, {"id": 18176648518351949, "text": "well trump's too much and one thing's missing", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:43:24", "owner": "joelawrence2192025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336870727206675, "text": "this song too nostalgia man", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:40:26", "owner": "aaravthakur6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986389074714929, "text": "I was 14 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:38:09", "owner": "_fatalbullet_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071444636154517, "text": "2016 the best yesr in my life😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:29:54", "owner": "just_rhode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910395583201647, "text": "2016 prime life 😢❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:25:34", "owner": "mit_sigma_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023963225534376, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:25:10", "owner": "mit_sigma_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984808920891004, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:24:32", "owner": "mit_sigma_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078332677803238, "text": "And most importantly… popularmmos was still in his prime", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:19:26", "owner": "loganpurpleplant07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916409362170654, "text": "When everything went to sh*t", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:15:49", "owner": "stevestryker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337392139206484, "text": "Gay Generation Time", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:04:44", "owner": "veliayhatalp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857928772507567, "text": "one of the best year ever👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:56:07", "owner": "zamcl16_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079895965992302, "text": "Dantdm💙", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:54:37", "owner": "being_fahdkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856014598521727, "text": "Batman vs Superman, La luz entre los océanos, Hasta el último soldado, Buscando a Dory, Tren a Busán, Capitán América: Civil War, La 5ta ola, Avenida Cloverfield 10, Angry Birds, Dr. Strange, Deadpool, Emoji movie...", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:51:25", "owner": "unatremendairreverendamamada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056227274444091, "text": "simpler times before the woke mind virus", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:45:33", "owner": "trap_soul08", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18050067287271689, "text": "Soon it was 10 years ago😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:44:07", "owner": "csongradusz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017376728772407, "text": "Good old days", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:39:12", "owner": "k.dilshodovv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17851208856502814, "text": "can we please bring those back?;", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:37:59", "owner": "thimotee_fischetto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079753357780912, "text": "Yeah Um anyone remember all the videos saying 2016: Worst Year Ever and stuff like that?", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:34:00", "owner": "captain_zane_murcha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970347705929917, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:29:42", "owner": "prininwater", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086611453875793, "text": "And roblox was actually good back then with some of the best games being in their prime. Pokemon Brick Bronze has treated me well", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:22:32", "owner": "ragincman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117438037508793, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:19:53", "owner": "x_wuka_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003007442647715, "text": "I think the best year ever", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:19:46", "owner": "igorek_073", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075273878047127, "text": "Good times…", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:19:02", "owner": "luderallerechteste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896934229296244, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:19:00", "owner": "nest.van.zuid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081686177503978, "text": "World was better😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:03:25", "owner": "sebyy_gbr11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078759448987302, "text": "Mind u this all not in 2016 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:58:27", "owner": "chromesofhearts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056403719430311, "text": "Brother, trump being elected doesn’t fit in this list", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:56:32", "owner": "simi4.real", "likes": 12495}, {"id": 18053515736208092, "text": "2010s sucked, 2020s even worse : S", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:54:19", "owner": "jackniejacktak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069100277335921, "text": "in 2016 i was 3 years old but i was obsessed with spiners at 5 years old", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:48:38", "owner": "danil_efimov2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081006431307241, "text": "when everything was good 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:48:07", "owner": "21plankk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098018356648961, "text": "I wish the world could be paused on the days before 2019 to make sure everyone live in peace and happiness.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:41:02", "owner": "samisme2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396886366143087, "text": "damn its almost 10 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:36:57", "owner": "tgxrever1e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907918972225150, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:36:57", "owner": "nuc5352", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043457372361232, "text": "Next year 2016 is 10 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:36:13", "owner": "t.i.m.o_windi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060977432094278, "text": "10 years ago soon...", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:31:23", "owner": "mindni.off", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047921435317295, "text": "whered all our creativity go", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:31:09", "owner": "drybones376", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18524998747027649, "text": "This song is also feel like 2016 summer days", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:30:09", "owner": "bigboi.shoaib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043551824356821, "text": "Yall had until yall showed trump", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:26:52", "owner": "ngmdmoney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080709334822135, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:24:44", "owner": "achmadfirdias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074359624874091, "text": "Infokan para player Pokemon GO yg sekarang masih main🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:19:59", "owner": "zer0zer0ich1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956940381990368, 