fe before 2020 was best now👎", "created_at": "2025-09-12T10:08:10", "owner": "chingkhei_lov3__3111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944234947029372, "text": "almost 10 years ago 😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-09-12T10:01:14", "owner": "ejdis_sproch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524710339063566, "text": "My childhood", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:58:07", "owner": "wrti.jjk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535845952007054, "text": "Spinners🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:47:30", "owner": "radwan._.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091220356616460, "text": "ohhh yeahhhh", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:45:18", "owner": "sarvarbek_100_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013893800788896, "text": "Cringiness starting era🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:40:52", "owner": "nadeem_ibrahim_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087355348845817, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:40:13", "owner": "phukan_rudraksh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066347843254002, "text": "Don’t be sad it’s over be glad it happened 🙂", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:39:58", "owner": "l_a_m_i_n_e_f_o_f_a_n_a", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089782045769869, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:39:10", "owner": "daniel_dean_martine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914740081192456, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:32:10", "owner": "abee_al_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032601749503691, "text": "台灣耶", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:31:11", "owner": "ying._.louis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064131749363140, "text": "2010, 2016, 2018 was the best year....", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:24:26", "owner": "mas.aldo28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862703524468712, "text": "Peak childhood", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:14:32", "owner": "arnontthenics", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17961105188831162, "text": "Fidget spinners are nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:13:43", "owner": "aidenlyl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925796455105432, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T08:53:13", "owner": "cat_arab_nigga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053384867543323, "text": "Song ?", "created_at": "2025-09-12T08:5