"id": 18076451252105353, "text": "We were and still are all brainwashed😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:01:34", "owner": "i.a._38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902797876257200, "text": "โคตรคิดถึงงง", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:43:28", "owner": "p9e_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066400703337646, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:43:13", "owner": "adityaa._.012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419409289128521, "text": "seseru itu yaa", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:34:20", "owner": "yuugharta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091503076742388, "text": "Best summer ever", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:31:08", "owner": "rrrlilk3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040074527664122, "text": "Prime times", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:29:15", "owner": "guesta749", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099662311719873, "text": "DanTDM prime ❎ Fernanfloo ✅", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:12:37", "owner": "palitoman1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130312732460203, "text": "🙃", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:54:37", "owner": "tathallah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962469618971710, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:51:32", "owner": "ayoub_kh_2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859186444487793, "text": "Yeah 😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:41:18", "owner": "_drzymbd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309647272245876, "text": "Clash Royale prime", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:39:40", "owner": "mustx.68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056548274427244, "text": "You forgot Monster School bro", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:09:46", "owner": "undertaker_pi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057466316413826, "text": "No.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:08:36", "owner": "levyathan_ghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077162018054126, "text": "The internet was so goated", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:08:25", "owner": "vishalbhati0507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897643348280615, "text": "Ya no ocurren cosas así 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:07:20", "owner": "anndress_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353250553092793, "text": "Who tf is that last gay?", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:07:19", "owner": "avivmeshulam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856498717455218, "text": "Lol the last good year was trumps 1st term presidency man this feels almost poetic in a sense", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:05:53", "owner": "dannywildermuth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078445000997804, "text": "Take me backk😭", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:03:16", "owner": "tayzsheon", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18385551115127296, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:58:12", "owner": "r_uj_u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859159360491149, "text": "Believe me guys, its not 4 years ago. It was 9 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:56:49", "owner": "elf_blvckhawk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984908376895138, "text": "이거 노래 제목좀 ㅈㅂ", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:55:30", "owner": "juny.4s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970113039791027, "text": "The best summer I had in my life was in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:48:04", "owner": "al3xis_cord0v4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942703473918588, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:44:14", "owner": "mogazawee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958223400988020, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:37:24", "owner": "orod.gale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922916821113852, "text": "I do not miss this time. It’s not that much different from today.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:28:28", "owner": "__mbanks97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076368116001596, "text": "@notyouruncle imagine when we took the video for mannequin challenge in Mr.Taufiq lesson, the intire student's class follows this shit trend🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:16:35", "owner": "nfl.ammr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898899352147411, "text": "2001-2020 was just so peak  we need to bring back all of theses trends 🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:16:31", "owner": "daily_deciding_my_dogs_fate", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18078851611796225, "text": "It’s Pokémon Go for me💀", "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:05:55", "owner": "th4_re41_jc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087147166882301, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T02:47:30", "owner": "totallynotsenderlman", "likes": 10918}, {"id": 17869722813432511, "text": "Mannequin challenge was 2013 when we did it", "created_at": "2025-09-12T02:43:59", "owner": "jasmingrenade", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069148330951350, "text": "The song is enough 😌", "created_at": "2025-09-12T02:21:09", "owner": "_sumit.panwar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089224444804767, "text": "Nostalgia 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T02:09:36", "owner": "follkeezz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308677477172486, "text": "2nd 1/2 of 2016 for me ~ like September October of 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-12T02:06:43", "owner": "willismania", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040675010670280, "text": "i was realte until that tdm guy shit showed up, who tf is him", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:42:03", "owner": "jstky_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118825255453582, "text": "Fernanfloo,juegagerman,vegetta 777 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:36:39", "owner": "marianolea211", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18174274813356252, "text": "The song its self took me back 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:25:24", "owner": "_alison_paul_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093274117685598, "text": "RIO 2016 OLYMPIC GAMES 🇧🇷", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:17:34", "owner": "guillermoisaiasfleitas", "likes": 91}, {"id": 18119393815500386, "text": "RIO 2016 OLYMPIC GAMES 🙌🏻🙌🏻🙌🏻😎😎😎", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:15:31", "owner": "guillermoisaiasfleitas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103181083608423, "text": "Nostalgia 🖤", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:04:34", "owner": "the_onlydhruv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088527445828188, "text": "man rip fidget spinners 🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:54:41", "owner": "liam_normile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122111743492543, "text": "Few years ago, I thought only me felt 2015-2018 is golden time, now I just feel everybody lived the same life 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:52:23", "owner": "a.hu.tpe.89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923960056133792, "text": "Cristiano Ronaldo was in Real Madrid 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:43:26", "owner": "push.s4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035174837492798, "text": "I miss that time, It was the best year of my life 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:13:06", "owner": "luanzx_rk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039136349454464, "text": "Take me to back those days 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:05:17", "owner": "prince_baldwin_4", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18048052448648088, "text": "In a few months it will be 10 years ago🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:05:12", "owner": "for3v3r_d3ad666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073620766892984, "text": "Yall remember musically?!?!", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:00:42", "owner": "pootie__01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093579973665230, "text": "What's this song called", "created_at": "2025-09-11T23:36:10", "owner": "gman37320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078939628948817, "text": "Saudades, éramos felizes e não sabíamos", "created_at": "2025-09-11T23:11:20", "owner": "lucasdasil.ds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917203822243291, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T23:01:39", "owner": "d_moneyboy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126746911478866, "text": "Cap civil war and Batman v Superman came out", "created_at": "2025-09-11T23:01:12", "owner": "d_moneyboy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019262333576727, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:57:04", "owner": "petros_tsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180440026338850, "text": "Take me back 🙃🙂🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:50:39", "owner": "rizaldimaulan4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005924933798531, "text": "😢I miss those days when I was carefree in high school with all my friends every day", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:39:39", "owner": "_mikerbb001_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056216108167706, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:32:49", "owner": "bryer_mollink_movie_reviews", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862337977411845, "text": "Best year of my life so far and easily best of my childhood no trans plus bs no worries no stress with finding a job nothing", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:32:06", "owner": "drunser2023nphotogrophy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179063230337180, "text": "2016 was cool, but 2017 was the best year ever (for me personally)", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:26:48", "owner": "this_is_isaacg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089888266753210, "text": "Τhe Girl that you Like was 5 years old", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:09:19", "owner": "john_mparitakis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953714844868499, "text": "Bro take me back 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:06:58", "owner": "guyson.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094796308590683, "text": "When Justin Bieber was good", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:06:01", "owner": "nba_goatboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057834611133017, "text": "Who still plays pokemon go", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:01:51", "owner": "joshua642025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092553949612562, "text": "2016 was the best year and 2025 is the worst year i honestly wish next year in 2026 we just have it like back then again", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:59:07", "owner": "glitch_zero_soul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883073971367825, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:58:55", "owner": "ching_ting_cho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958119207845599, "text": "Omg what songs is", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:40:42", "owner": "coolkidlandon293793", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036780785686881, "text": "sis vs bro", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:40:05", "owner": "anasfathi2024", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18532959673059085, "text": "These were the good old days for people who grew up with an iphone in their hand😂 take me back to 06 or 96 shit was already garbage by twenty sixteen", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:29:22", "owner": "bigluke520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884952361243287, "text": "Bro no trump", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:21:09", "owner": "nino.b_22", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17889590136342189, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:08:19", "owner": "mustiqul_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071790659147499, "text": "Hope 2026 brings back the same feeling as 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-11T20:58:38", "owner": "syed_aliuddin06", "likes": 1}, {"i