antdm overrated asf", "created_at": "2025-09-11T19:20:14", "owner": "crosskillnisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904838386256075, "text": "Saudades daquilo que a gente viveu", "created_at": "2025-09-11T19:12:25", "owner": "gabrields2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073338140513885, "text": "Fidget spinners🥺", "created_at": "2025-09-11T19:09:03", "owner": "mohneesh_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076264718103516, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:58:38", "owner": "joseph_steve23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18265236835304490, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:57:03", "owner": "phenyx_46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051917861260181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:56:52", "owner": "joseph_steve23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079871540496801, "text": "Best years", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:50:57", "owner": "giskrev_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028262462511925, "text": "The time is passing too damn fast😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:50:15", "owner": "supremekai900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887693788223182, "text": "Come on guy, this was just like 2 years ago (denial)", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:43:36", "owner": "fa_garro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055871948176129, "text": "😔💔", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:43:04", "owner": "bv.yg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142168675421457, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:38:30", "owner": "its_me_tharun________7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133880029399895, "text": "Almost 10 years ago btw.", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:34:58", "owner": "whiteboyaidan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061937978361716, "text": "Estupidos", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:33:56", "owner": "androos_yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497520361068219, "text": "The floor is lava", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:27:26", "owner": "lil.bangsantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874239808420318, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:11:19", "owner": "itsokaymyman_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059185793605318, "text": "The worst year on earth.", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:05:42", "owner": "giannis_tsi4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071553257167738, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:55:26", "owner": "jap_nicolas_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981961407891611, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:51:46", "owner": "salsittoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355458622081299, "text": "Damn near 10 years ago damn I’m getting old", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:45:56", "owner": "donstaxkalot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154548364385669, "text": "A time when short content didn't exist", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:45:26", "owner": "agent_kd2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984282903853084, "text": "That was my last happy year🩸", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:42:36", "owner": "gp_psn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069541303964015, "text": "Literally the whole world was trying to be better except for some high seated people of some major countries", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:42:10", "owner": "talha_for_a_reason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378129364177884, "text": "The footage is soo \"2016\"...", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:38:25", "owner": "yash_kujo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063832277521585, "text": "Freshman Year Of College 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:35:22", "owner": "jaydelgado_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940880209049295, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:24:22", "owner": "matth_767", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949327590891867, "text": "dimana dunia belum terlalu di pengaruhi oleh zaman meskipun di luar sana sudah berkembang pesat", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:11:10", "owner": "mhmdlutfiakhtarr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096015127636773, "text": "2016 was ass!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:58:30", "owner": "jdec7591", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969689418792819, "text": "2010 🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:47:12", "owner": "kesavan.a.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046861697641165, "text": "I miss 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:40:12", "owner": "alxandere.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120378901501004, "text": "Best year of the internet", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:32:42", "owner": "lowprof1le", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133351402445091, "text": "Take me back.", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:13:33", "owner": "thecolebenefield23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090388738694017, "text": "What happened", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:09:47", "owner": "thacrowdpleazer", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17977431503867134, "text": "Suicide Squad❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:02:43", "owner": "albertadam1900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858659281497903, "text": "We all took 2016 for granted", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:56:43", "owner": "jas.hoopster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137090950438030, "text": "I was 16-17 & last year of high School 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:44:38", "owner": "looks_spicy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165742000363929, "text": "ucl 2016 @realmadrid vicktory 11 title", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:37:35", "owner": "priabaik406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937757605068673, "text": "when life was worth living", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:29:24", "owner": "a.ahad001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908798203215877, "text": "The darkest year of my life", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:27:14", "owner": "denistargos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893287462316553, "text": "Logo vai dar uma década 🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:19:08", "owner": "murylork", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18288159337282505, "text": "Trump got elected in 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:59:45", "owner": "federicodesalvia2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929648874981945, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:50:45", "owner": "eliav_greenblatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944126278028952, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:50:35", "owner": "eliav_greenblatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094301779657651, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:42:00", "owner": "y_san007", "likes": 1809}, {"id": 18481156180075430, "text": "Mannequin challenge ain't 2016. It's around 2013", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:31:17", "owner": "j.valenswoosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985546290723702, "text": "Song name", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:24:43", "owner": "mika89line_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087643894876471, "text": "@thnst95 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:24:40", "owner": "anggamaniezz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074431643020875, "text": "寶可夢那個在台灣哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:40:58", "owner": "wangkai_999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090161068740428, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:36:31", "owner": "davidreinhardt09", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075975479034193, "text": "U made the worst 2016 video", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:30:48", "owner": "jeremiahmay0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161445973372550, "text": "I aint this old", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:25:54", "owner": "excelsan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060101258106483, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:23:26", "owner": "adileterik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944927770022113, "text": "#rio2016", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:17:56", "owner": "asgard_f2p_ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068463824236451, "text": "One of the greatest years of my life!!!! I would do anything to go back to 2016!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:14:52", "owner": "erickrios5181", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18164846173371799, "text": "The good old Times", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:12:56", "owner": "ilovejdmcars000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992712849827778, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:08:11", "owner": "_berto003", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950084287010575, "text": "Ah moment", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:07:57", "owner": "joyyboyyeq_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898989730143881, "text": "Doom (2016) released", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:55:57", "owner": "dx2uwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068892055951063, "text": "Internet when it's prime", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:55:54", "owner": "aryasean_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071955230514162, "text": "missed up the old days", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:50:43", "owner": "dhaimoz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18323933461232599, "text": "if we could’ve got rid of the paul brothers it would’ve been nicer", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:36:41", "owner": "1844liam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080310358939962, "text": "☄️.... Well played!", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:35:12", "owner": "__.riques.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876569245405807, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:21:54", "owner": "abelvapiramdana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101131600612758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:17:17", "owner": "palis32", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076925311830441, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:03:45", "owner": "_paolodefazi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066481472523133, "text": "best year ever", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:03:09", "owner": "gogag.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078448069817345, "text": "no way all this happend in 2016🤯", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:01:43", "owner": "pm_schneider", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18037021313688687, "text": "Fu*k you🫠", "created_at": "2025-09-11T11:48:09", "owner": "milkovmma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026535881524306, "text": "Death is close time going so quick", "created_at": "2025-09-11T11:35:36", "owner": "spoko_7sw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072136313142985, "text": "All summed up in the 2016 YouTube rewind video, the best childhood internet generation could ever ask for😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T11:33:23", "owner": "shirkeromit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525401434061816, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T11:12:40", "owner": "_go.away_b4.ily_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942016492059813, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T10:48:59", "owner": "irvanboyz7535", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110232175550586, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T10:46:40", "owner": "tquuee", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18090646777795036, "text": "Vine", "created_at": "2025-09-11T10:14:37", "owner": "dannyboy.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055741772191471, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T10:03:33", "owner": "zaawaad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870683749431095, "text": "2016 reja arap lagi jaya jaya nya main game sambil tereak tereak kontol", "created_at": "2025-09-11T09:48:10", "owner": "barastruestories", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520742314020587, "text": "Prime King Kohli❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T09:44:52", "owner": "dheerrz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870785248428305, "text": "Don’t forget clown sightings", "created_at": "2025-09-11T09:27:31", "owner": "roryhinchliffe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383462731125632, "text": "Nico Rosberg World CHAMPION", "created_at": "2025-09-11T09:18:25", "owner": "mozoltamas26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328480057225490, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:52:19", "owner": "_ajiiiiiii___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070722163921891, "text": "Damn I miss the days", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:44:03", "owner": "ohger_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114829525509588, "text": "i was so alive back then", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:41:26", "owner": "syahrenassani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057692915613613, "text": "🤢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:38:47", "owner": "robertino_bombardino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898811722141869, "text": "Man, the search for Pokémon on PokemonGO was real en such a good feeling", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:37:22", "owner": "e36_e92_n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890175604343405, "text": "OK but how cringe was 2016?i cringe just by rememberin", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:23:09", "owner": "eve2cute4u", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954440439859805, "text": "Shin Godzilla was released in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:11:11", "owner": "itsx_destgojiyt_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037464848466721, "text": "whatever happened to time man", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:05:58", "owner": "starbockscoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060213749601008, "text": "tf is dantdm?", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:04:51", "owner": "sdillon5253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843401008574523, "text": "Charlie would be still alive", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:00:56", "owner": "peter_ste1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977721768876417, "text": "2019 was the last year of excitement and after that the world felt boring", "created_at": "2025-09-11T07:40:39", "owner": "antoniohal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890067433343730, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T07:16:02", "owner": "a10a1998a13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001313336813130, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T07:03:18", "owner": "pktk45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101402497614235, "text": "Best year", "created_at": "2025-09-11T07:02:55", "owner": "hunterwhiz_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18053375870551487, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:59:19", "owner": "kyu.nwrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883874425373178, "text": "I don't like this", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:52:46", "owner": "gangstagrrrl5124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041916224680458, "text": "😢🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:41:54", "owner": "_41_z4pa.ka_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089481307633710, "text": "Los spinners son de 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:37:52", "owner": "jerefer05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051211301251550, "text": "2020-2023 is timeskip for everyone", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:33:10", "owner": "d_ponyoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089019718633233, "text": "Pokemon go really made people travel the world", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:23:01", "owner": "da.curly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056462540154285, "text": "Gen Z invented all of this", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:22:30", "owner": "mrwalkerzzplayz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518119228011366, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:20:15", "owner": "_kay_909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060732218093125, "text": "The song 🎶🔥🔥🗣️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:14:57", "owner": "carcar06.12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021371816560162, "text": "The music was so fire during this year, literally everyone was dropping hot shit.", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:13:13", "owner": "jcolbee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000330866805742, "text": "I really wanna go back and enjoy all that all again", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:04:25", "owner": "whosssthunder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397538176185609, "text": "Bullshit", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:57:48", "owner": "14fou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131001643455619, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:44:37", "owner": "ahen1304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950832804886587, "text": "北投上榜了", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:35:03", "owner": "weicheng209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169032331362050, "text": "Agar.io", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:30:18", "owner": "february2k3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057217229148125, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:16:36", "owner": "sansfree_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918399160158653, "text": "Overrated, today's trend is the best", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:08:38", "owner": "rafisyahrir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909371980211040, "text": "miss ts shi", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:05:16", "owner": "g35.____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043448039359022, "text": "🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:04:09", "owner": "ipa22154", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922968595108301, "text": "😭😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:46:48", "owner": "_k4nkun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082668703737176, "text": "Best year in all over decades😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:41:05", "owner": "mandy_abdullah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074412326080288, "text": "Everybodys prime time, never know before", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:38:48", "owner": "dennisvfvb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985346262722083, "text": "Simpler times", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:33:37", "owner": "conman0309", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18504141766065902, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:22:02", "owner": "azat.s17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875726944310409, "text": "The time when Logan Paul vlogs and mo vlogs were peak", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:12:58", "owner": "proficient_maestro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051704489537836, "text": "When everything is okay..", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:12:55", "owner": "saturday.4pm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858626668500329, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:06:21", "owner": "knownastae2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049386818306771, "text": "2016 was prime", "created_at": "2025-09-11T03:55:58", "owner": "_tchoupii__", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18080813086766347, "text": "Fax", "created_at": "2025-09-11T03:52:17", "owner": "xjahmalg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524206471014373, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T03:05:03", "owner": "harunsu8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859414723493442, "text": "They forgot about @ayofvr and @teo reverse dance💯🔥!", "created_at": "2025-09-11T02:54:03", "owner": "vellgng_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072917438179865, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T02:45:08", "owner": "edgar.avellaneda.2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18564930022004705, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T02:42:51", "owner": "foxfromdaghetto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092589280776658, "text": "😩😩😩", "created_at": "2025-09-11T02:33:52", "owner": "morten7121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024336575719326, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T02:29:20", "owner": "enzosuicidelessons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072255626324655, "text": "Aku suka kejametan ini 🙌😢", "created_at": "2025-09-11T02:23:11", "owner": "wederopbloei_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862887577407923, "text": "Golden era", "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:56:39", "owner": "vini_santana_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047907077644012, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:54:34", "owner": "youngfather_11", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18425664394098972, "text": "That year i almost died, so for me it was bad year but ight. 2017 was the best year i had tho, so that one was better 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:47:36", "owner": "legendofcj15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278838766262938, "text": "2016 was the universal year of happiness", "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:40:06", "owner": "aditya.bengani07", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18085891411895710, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:31:46", "owner": "sonnymunoz31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055523156625731, "text": "Harlem shake more than anything", "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:28:39", "owner": "_rudeboyy.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055216985190592, "text": "Aint shi was going on in 2016 y’all reminiscing on nothing 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:14:41", "owner": "ghostunknown38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987028125849581, "text": "Bring me back", "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:09:25", "owner": "kimjoad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910365403226423, "text": "Most of this is 2017 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-11T00:41:53", "owner": "jtn739535", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987766551814725, "text": "one of the best years of all time !!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-11T00:29:08", "owner": "kking.quez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965668428950639, "text": "2012-2018 best music 2014-2019 best summers", "created_at": "2025-09-11T00:13:20", "owner": "armando._.xci", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17956346963852575, "text": "A simpler time anywhere from 2012-2016. I could say things and people wouldn't yell at me for being the whole rainbow phobic. A time when you could get away with yelling a slur over the Xbox mike", "created_at": "2025-09-11T00:10:52", "owner": "endersole123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940258363025833, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T00:02:43", "owner": "slammerssuperfan_8821_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951677785008728, "text": "Idk something just different rn", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:50:30", "owner": "abrarrdk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171631897314924, "text": "2026 shall be the new 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:40:08", "owner": "xavier66666666606", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856639429453077, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:37:28", "owner": "irzhax", "likes": 8333}, {"id": 17859087708433856, "text": "My Undertale Phase, and then Watching Game Theory FnAF Videos", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:37:00", "owner": "krymir411_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917537395174918, "text": "The summer of the Phenomenal A.J. Styles", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:34:34", "owner": "aydensthebest3511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063165536349026, "text": "2016 the best edm era 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:34:32", "owner": "fernando.frisko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137241829436841, "text": "just a reminder. in a little more than 4 months 2016 will be 10 years ago 😭😔", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:22:54", "owner": "999timooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074656816874458, "text": "In Germany we say to fidget Spinners: Beschweren kann man sich normalerweise ehr weniger ☠️", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:07:07", "owner": "janik_2073", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073969886035579, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:06:36", "owner": "telmo_a_m_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419364124106678, "text": "السنه الي اكتشفت انو اليوتيوب مو بس فيديوهات تفتيح بيض كندر", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:02:17", "owner": "lee_aya_676", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049181009301109, "text": "seseru itu ya", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:58:30", "owner": "farrellza_rdp", "likes": 2128}, {"id": 18042688403378284, "text": "لو رجعت لي ذيك الايام بنشهر بيومين من تحدي لو خيروك", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:27:54", "owner": "500ii1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893184871319970, "text": "ah that song too", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:23:07", "owner": "shemplovie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915337546192979, "text": "The last best year", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:04:14", "owner": "aubin_pm", "likes": 58}, {"id": 17893848003304113, "text": "Sound", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:03:21", "owner": "israel_98765", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353039758088782, "text": "No thanks, I'll take my PPAP and leave.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T21:58:48", "owner": "rydawg0116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863689045397906, "text": "Everyone was happy ❤️😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T21:32:07", "owner": "qasimqasmi56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001357481811588, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T21:23:54", "owner": "jack_wein8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076870712072342, "text": "Worst examples 🤣 it makes me feel like today is not that bad", "created_at": "2025-09-10T21:13:37", "owner": "theobechard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528433252026457, "text": "You forgot the swag and the icebucket challenge", "created_at": "2025-09-10T21:06:46", "owner": "prsambn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054324491193338, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T21:06:32", "owner": "usama_safaa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18525934093040456, "text": "And of course don’t forget about Leicester city where they won premier league in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-10T21:00:34", "owner": "ilhamhjzda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873600382422010, "text": "9 years😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T20:35:14", "owner": "byzicdevil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861615274414792, "text": "Damn.. in a few months this would be a decade ago.. man, I'm getting older.. this feels like 2 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-10T20:29:12", "owner": "bavannnn_raj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110799349538923, "text": "where is prime leo messi ?!?!", "created_at": "2025-09-10T20:14:08", "owner": "hsy_frkn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893162914321699, "text": "Unexpected underdog team Leicester city won 1st premier League title", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:43:40", "owner": "muhammadazlan19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069162910954507, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:40:47", "owner": "qadaruk84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524759482002644, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:40:19", "owner": "theodorhjalmarsson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965521710798605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:36:20", "owner": "krivanekjonas", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17849063136522654, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:34:30", "owner": "josh_cr1tikal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878449528287246, "text": "I didn't even have internet back then", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:31:04", "owner": "thxgt78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070984136178700, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:29:26", "owner": "alaninios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057720305614488, "text": "Clash of clans 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:19:54", "owner": "ruksamallick6", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18397819189143259, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:06:58", "owner": "eshni.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055652192625195, "text": "Guys. I can't deal with this nostalgia😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:02:47", "owner": "banzainikki98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876619201406131, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:45:46", "owner": "cabot_chips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077972602820898, "text": "I was 14", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:45:00", "owner": "actuallyadityakumar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958635315841226, "text": "And the Cubs won the World Series!", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:43:57", "owner": "cap.tain.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939598747063542, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:27:25", "owner": "mujiastutik81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526067140046294, "text": "When bitcoin was $50", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:15:20", "owner": "iikbm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040690523416349, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:14:47", "owner": "leodgp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049179539298328, "text": "Nerf guns video✨", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:04:36", "owner": "nova._.108", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081456113497303, "text": "Trump being elected president wasn’t the only bad thing that happened in 2016. Nintendo disappointed us again with Paper Mario: Color Splash on Wii U, SeaWorld ended the Orca Breeding Program making this the last generation of killer whales there, my work forced me to change facilities over some new unethical policy and nothing went right after that, drivers being chased by clowns in neighborhoods at night, Christina Grimmie shot and killed by an obsessed stalker during an after concert signing at a venue in Orlando, Pulse nightclub shooting the night after, and more…", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:03:21", "owner": "manadaloreprince89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059636138376405, "text": "El mejor año", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:02:12", "owner": "alangomezpineda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082632697906713, "text": "Why was this a good year? In 2035 people will be like remember 2025 that was the best year every people tend to forget things overtime and only remember highlighted events of that time so it appears to be a good memory or year but it’s really nothing different  this is called rosy retrospection", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:58:01", "owner": "iamjacob.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138600142387456, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:55:48", "owner": "md0w0", "likes": 146}, {"id": 18080187878508416, "text": "@wihan_blom", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:52:46", "owner": "adam.j.rogers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071758958121891, "text": "U forgot hoverboards, roblox, and the light up good shoes", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:45:33", "owner": "katie_g0603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113172970534084, "text": "Mannequin challenge was the coolest thing in 2016 in my opinion", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:45:19", "owner": "maddogsson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157046509391513, "text": "Blue whale 🌚", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:39:27", "owner": "sle3pycow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988991310839376, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T17:25:26", "owner": "axeflo_", "likes": 14328}, {"id": 17946853544897750, "text": "It's 2016 and I am enjoying minecraft with my brother . Ah peak", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:42:35", "owner": "alexplays__101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304158691220985, "text": "Peak years", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:37:46", "owner": "professortahmkench_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867200197377702, "text": "@chesterbe ......", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:34:44", "owner": "vala_lpachuau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110811823530879, "text": "I love 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:32:35", "owner": "vvvnxn_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855888520516742, "text": "U know what’s crazy the bottle flip collage started in 2011 it just took people forever to catch on 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:20:54", "owner": "beaterethecatalyst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074884454286407, "text": "One of my better summers", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:14:22", "owner": "austinmiley_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881715775264482, "text": "My butterfly era 🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:11:12", "owner": "taengkyu_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145346449412279, "text": "Damn all this stuff in one year I was in 6th grade great times 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:07:29", "owner": "s0ko_barz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17941569480063638, "text": "2016 was epic", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:04:56", "owner": "brianpeguerox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085977460804444, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:01:11", "owner": "il_b27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079027159985801, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:45:39", "owner": "lean.i30n", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18077037310827360, "text": "None of them were 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:45:19", "owner": "arashshagerdy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090915163765119, "text": "I miss 2016! Great year!", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:33:17", "owner": "cordeemack23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127381840460862, "text": "👏👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:28:25", "owner": "gamrakki_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090879955775172, "text": "2016/2017 was goated", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:28:21", "owner": "_ben711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038903357452202, "text": "And the absolut WORST year in terms of music", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:23:57", "owner": "wasser_flussigkeit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868596112440561, "text": "Childhood of 00's", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:17:41", "owner": "_adwinn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040932158662680, "text": "Golden Era😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:13:52", "owner": "alzerix_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062145089375474, "text": "Best moments in our life", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:13:50", "owner": "nafe.jul.39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079884355772521, "text": "Bro everything was at its peak even YouTubers 😔until ai came along and ruined everything 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:13:44", "owner": "yahwehisonlyway_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091535896771405, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:08:11", "owner": "monkey.d.jagger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021565430753551, "text": "Not a successfully flip the bottle and then dab 😭💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:55:48", "owner": "dercutemann420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075103969850945, "text": "😢🙌😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:48:54", "owner": "erikz.solyomvari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870160672355051, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:46:35", "owner": "kenny_yg_kemarin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859306450488707, "text": "That 135i was tuff", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:44:01", "owner": "dwc_visuals1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894177277314686, "text": "I was 10 🥀💔", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:41:42", "owner": "beam.hon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087081949863848, "text": "I miss 2018-2019", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:40:20", "owner": "thecharliedavids", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074129621514983, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:36:27", "owner": "stevenpinardo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078635302791364, "text": "I was 15 in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:30:21", "owner": "snakeyankee01_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021719390757090, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:28:34", "owner": "moh7med_ess7m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862280092469796, "text": "Back when summer was about connecting and memories not it's just fortune and fame", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:23:02", "owner": "502_ston3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870142336431564, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:08:12", "owner": "doddy7040", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905392432239100, "text": "2014 and 2016 were the best years of the 2010s", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:05:58", "owner": "doddy7040", "likes": 44}, {"id": 18304684507218428, "text": "Also the dab police, which didn’t last that long", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:05:57", "owner": "voquanghuy2711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068095370235433, "text": "Nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:01:43", "owner": "ab.durrahman.05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855362998521950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:58:18", "owner": "dgfd_0216", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18422824990109147, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:45:22", "owner": "xxninini__39396", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363592870156916, "text": "Why does this feel more older then 2000s", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:43:31", "owner": "john_stone_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408868954114228, "text": "Almost a decade ago… Thas crazy", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:42:55", "owner": "dcouevos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960281319985943, "text": "Bring it back bro😭", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:36:51", "owner": "jj_furletti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887667859224655, "text": "Life hasn’t felt the same after that 2016 summer", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:35:50", "owner": "carineddu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078659314984956, "text": "This name songs", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:35:32", "owner": "thismikey09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112312954542076, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:29:41", "owner": "dzakwan.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955002493005769, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:28:00", "owner": "d1_dec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859678441482954, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:24:59", "owner": "d1_dec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883095256368343, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:24:14", "owner": "d1_dec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029501804711320, "text": "Back then, Instagram videos were only 15 seconds long, and it was all about keeping it chill. no drama or politics 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:17:46", "owner": "nandangmoka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103739281601670, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:16:14", "owner": "d1_dec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925666374998229, "text": "Masa terindah dalam hidup ku ada di tahun 2015-2020 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:11:30", "owner": "edoartio.five", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077080498960082, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:09:42", "owner": "n1k0___123", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17958875039988828, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:45:28", "owner": "preradflorian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18317217445240357, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:34:35", "owner": "digraph6_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096759313573975, "text": "♡", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:15:24", "owner": "inda.__h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086958463861925, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:00:07", "owner": "gaadarem__", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18098829397622781, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:56:05", "owner": "bellinvs_02_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084685000716459, "text": "That was prime life", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:48:27", "owner": "jeffmccain30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178392772341165, "text": "Trump elected shouldn’t be included", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:23:09", "owner": "diddyandbuddy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973369419776119, "text": "Peak life", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:17:44", "owner": "joshjpope07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107545315497768, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:06:22", "owner": "iam_leonx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080360263942379, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:51:18", "owner": "kazmii.abdul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049474766558007, "text": "This year was goated", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:49:06", "owner": "1ts_ch0ppa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015484769599270, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:42:18", "owner": "abdiel_hanley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937282633064035, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:34:20", "owner": "mcgillivrayowen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931776607081556, "text": "🥶🥶🥶🥶", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:08:07", "owner": "kamsterek_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076884620489127, "text": "Also includes this song with all NCS songs 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:05:49", "owner": "tynnetity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933870361083607, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:05:40", "owner": "travis_chesson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042710033363121, "text": "lol is it weird that I don’t feel nostalgic at all, i barely give a damn", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:55:57", "owner": "michemakaya11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882020692385777, "text": "The world before Tiktok destroyed everything", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:52:56", "owner": "bertan02_", "likes": 53336}, {"id": 18091060660810399, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:33:45", "owner": "davidkim_55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055667636172378, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:30:28", "owner": "minicosboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885677749358403, "text": "Ncs music...❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:27:59", "owner": "manu_the_pilot16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086748652680575, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:22:54", "owner": "vitor_zillig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526565371042367, "text": "Omg dab is so 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:19:22", "owner": "king_magnusbay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053574995223774, "text": "2016 was humanity prime", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:12:24", "owner": "mainak_modak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851031187505064, "text": "look how chill and happy these times was . wow", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:10:34", "owner": "offdashelf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073733213032634, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T08:12:59", "owner": "zuhdanash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108735628490668, "text": "9 tahun lalu bro😮", "created_at": "2025-09-10T05:44:19", "owner": "nadnnaadd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125643235464247, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T05:40:29", "owner": "jacob_lebt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534800212019731, "text": "15-2016 😢star wars, batman v superman, tmnt 2, captain america civil war, x men apocalypse, zootopia, and angry birds", "created_at": "2025-09-10T05:25:18", "owner": "damahri2000", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17969184698954667, "text": "2016-2020 Humanity Peak", "created_at": "2025-09-10T05:24:38", "owner": "_patrizio01_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064581875048678, "text": "Me with bro @zo__gasss 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T04:47:25", "owner": "gonekatsu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075080668843994, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T04:36:38", "owner": "cakenakup_2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086058139803969, "text": "Peak human experience", "created_at": "2025-09-10T04:27:33", "owner": "takis_nitro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062793218343104, "text": "Clash of clans", "created_at": "2025-09-10T03:41:38", "owner": "v.vansh_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049272191305313, "text": "Trump being elected was the worst thing that happened in 2016 Fuck trump", "created_at": "2025-09-10T03:06:58", "owner": "jdafinest_offical", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090386488805845, "text": "can someone build a time machine 😩 after 2019 every year has been absolute shit", "created_at": "2025-09-09T23:59:09", "owner": "alexandradoesmakeup__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087946564857906, "text": "Fidget spinners and PPAP are 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-09T23:02:59", "owner": "andrewrc.18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099799027624632, "text": "Fidget spinners were pretty much 2017.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T21:37:01", "owner": "carolinafan1234", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18107670475563797, "text": "Palmen aus Plastik", "created_at": "2025-09-09T21:29:32", "owner": "renebleul", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18522198136014069, "text": "I was 11 years old that time ❤️ what a time to be", "created_at": "2025-09-09T20:19:18", "owner": "rysaasrahul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920129998154985, "text": "Nope still shitty", "created_at": "2025-09-09T19:47:36", "owner": "vulpes_vigor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986861262850140, "text": "This is when life went to sh!t and people became evil sickos.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T18:02:09", "owner": "shoffman2899", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418193902106294, "text": "Damn almost a decade. Time flies", "created_at": "2025-09-09T17:49:51", "owner": "gabrihdezcd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085378072861411, "text": "2016. It wasn’t the best year for me especially I hate middle school. And when Trump was elected as president, I was scared, even though he’s racist.\nI wish I can go back in 2016 so I can speak up so I can drop out of middle school and go to karate class instead.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T17:31:32", "owner": "luisalvarez7224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173386102356575, "text": "Hasta la musica es nostalgia", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:59:43", "owner": "batman0147", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863507062394148, "text": "Why start with a paul brother", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:04:09", "owner": "imamiopial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095625472633653, "text": "2016 was lit I can’t lie summers parties movies music cookouts night life 24 hour Walmarts man", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:17:17", "owner": "i_have_no_juice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927410665103499, "text": "What happened to these days everything just feels gloomy nowadays 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-08T04:52:27", "owner": "lava_boko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925071751108239, "text": "And Trump was better in 2016 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:04:47", "owner": "llllll_llllll_0_0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133518526451080, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:57:37", "owner": "ava_oreper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954136599865220, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:22:50", "owner": "mekhi.a", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18280620646277104, "text": "Everything was so good except that mfer becoming president but other than that everything else was good!!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T00:54:34", "owner": "kevospcebnd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066478547225600, "text": "This whole post was ruined by Trump being elected being included. Like regardless of political opinion or views, including politics in remembering childhood nostalgia is just weird.", "created_at": "2025-09-07T23:08:48", "owner": "just.a.fallen._.angel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035819696692358, "text": "Man 2015-16-17-18 were the best years to be online as a teen or a young adult also fidget spinners from what I remeber didn't blow up till spring 2017", "created_at": "2025-09-07T22:41:42", "owner": "grimwilly5506", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076904381074522, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:07:29", "owner": "emiliodanisi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094602469661868, "text": "Crazy this is gonna be 10 years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:05:38", "owner": "vatilano278", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103562752594899, "text": "Everyone hated 2016! Y’all are trippin", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:03:10", "owner": "joepomponio28", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071364200125080, "text": "Okay let’s not go away from shit that is actually nostalgic. 2016 is not nearly long ago enough for this page.", "created_at": "2025-09-07T17:47:07", "owner": "evanjk14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036629102677829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T17:26:50", "owner": "cch0000000p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18174693613347847, "text": "Jimmie Johnson won his 7th championship", "created_at": "2025-09-07T17:06:30", "owner": "thenascarrailfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193209916316545, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T16:47:02", "owner": "ayad_mustafa20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872790850329505, "text": "2016 was mid", "created_at": "2025-09-07T16:27:22", "owner": "masoon_mz3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940484337929555, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T13:53:42", "owner": "isaac_villegas23", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18520234171034591, "text": "2016-2018 best elementary school years of my life", "created_at": "2025-09-07T12:44:55", "owner": "newyork8980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363712936156258, "text": "Is @loganpaul", "created_at": "2025-09-07T12:16:56", "owner": "demetriusjclancy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528573763049098, "text": "Bro forgot cr7 prime", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:43:04", "owner": "_.sosa._02", "likes": 661}, {"id": 17847364554536292, "text": "@guava nostalgia 😢🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:24:45", "owner": "n4ss7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875005378408835, "text": "What is the name of this music?", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:21:05", "owner": "muradcelalzade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065951510249170, "text": "Sparta remixes", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:16:28", "owner": "marzipaan__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105087481576018, "text": "The dab emote craze in free fire🫠", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:14:54", "owner": "ti._.mmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421126828111321, "text": "Background music 😢🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:04:23", "owner": "shaik__subhan07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993051138829243, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:55:29", "owner": "photobyavichal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863031643465450, "text": "Dabbing became cringe the moment the Paul retards started doing it. That guy that ruins gifs by turning himself into the gif is the same as when the Paul brothers start doing something", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:53:51", "owner": "kyle.chilvers3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106209064560979, "text": "Harlem shake?", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:53:16", "owner": "khalfan.m.k.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529552432047650, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:33:00", "owner": "jamie_robins._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933343552085899, "text": "ahh good old days", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:23:45", "owner": "fachrizallkmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076609829291023, "text": "這是你在找的中文留言", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:20:36", "owner": "yoyo.yoyo.yo.yo", "likes": 410}, {"id": 17918510013037058, "text": "Thug life GTA V ahh vibes", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:17:08", "owner": "toro_1s1_orot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064666457249623, "text": "Smart scoter", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:15:35", "owner": "too_fy94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078165773058145, "text": "9 years ago 👽", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:09:09", "owner": "ch7kku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131996140452276, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:55:17", "owner": "you_name3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909069655213237, "text": "< 3 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:53:51", "owner": "bishop_disciples", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983568765894144, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:44:10", "owner": "engmin__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519270805019307, "text": "I Will do anything to go back in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:34:02", "owner": "dzulqarnain_aw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057777101383170, "text": "I honestly hated 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:28:31", "owner": "joe_fturner", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069092246153449, "text": "Bro if you were a teen in 2013-2017 and lived in LA and didn’t try to at least make content you failed in life all you had to do in LA is go outside and mfs would watch 🥀💀", "created_at": "2025-09-07T07:28:32", "owner": "amarion_fromthecity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034701539491067, "text": "It's already a decade and we didn't realize how life goes fast....hope we have same life in future❤️‍🩹😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-07T06:49:44", "owner": "itz_nizh", "likes": 299}, {"id": 17914696413055605, "text": "2016 there were people still alive during 2016? The world started in 2024", "created_at": "2025-09-07T06:42:18", "owner": "patrickreonisto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521705344049199, "text": "Being 11 would again would be nice.", "created_at": "2025-09-07T06:34:04", "owner": "port_m23", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17845497378545233, "text": "At least they showed the splash a tiny bit.", "created_at": "2025-09-07T06:33:40", "owner": "port_m23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074998720848926, "text": "Fidget spinners came out in 2017 not 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-07T05:58:12", "owner": "pariah_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068453605954479, "text": "I still do water flips", "created_at": "2025-09-07T05:35:59", "owner": "sd_odysseus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077505260484822, "text": "Beginning of the end", "created_at": "2025-09-07T04:37:04", "owner": "oskar.ac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537489970044853, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-07T04:09:28", "owner": "dr_sumitpatill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962119749827399, "text": "I miss these days so much 😢💔😭", "created_at": "2025-09-07T02:48:07", "owner": "hoshinojasonidol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981089742894856, "text": "Even in 2025 I sometimes dab…", "created_at": "2025-09-07T02:09:03", "owner": "anoverman2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069999107175818, "text": "I was 10", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:57:17", "owner": "rick_jr_newell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061825577603096, "text": "It was going good and then you fuckin ruined it with that one clip", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:10:29", "owner": "whereisrey__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093922486669308, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:03:39", "owner": "vedant_pvt0077", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072979513896441, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-07T00:57:20", "owner": "tyrone__mopar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062913344366214, "text": "I miss it", "created_at": "2025-09-07T00:46:39", "owner": "bowsette_the_charger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367166776150322, "text": "Tbh nostalgic is a lie like i was a teenager back then and not all the trends was as cool as it shown here. He realistic the apple pen, dab was gay", "created_at": "2025-09-07T00:42:21", "owner": "tiyung.17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909152179216035, "text": "2016 was trash, anything after 2012 went down hill", "created_at": "2025-09-06T23:40:01", "owner": "sjhollis24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940946398026168, "text": "So many people playing Pokémon GO lmao😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:12:51", "owner": "tanner.lepey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078447394789801, "text": "forgot abt dantdm", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:01:01", "owner": "neptunex8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402483925136205, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:41:36", "owner": "jr.shondarpowless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854685649523626, "text": "Don't forget the Gravity Falls cypher hunt!", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:17:47", "owner": "umsteadhenry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052720283233112, "text": "Miss it. Glad I lived through it.💪", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:13:17", "owner": "momo.jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083241454907613, "text": "Back in the day 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:12:20", "owner": "never_ex_ex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023043326547172, "text": "DanTDM is the greatest youtuber than fgteev, dang Matt Smith and hello neighbor games", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:04:19", "owner": "mr_dmhollywood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866114356447697, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-06T18:57:36", "owner": "sinaraki73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074728910091571, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-06T18:23:34", "owner": "ctrujillo_95", "likes": 241}, {"id": 17871084279425079, "text": "Our old days 🙂‍↕️😔", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:41:18", "owner": "sniper_vibexx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872701468331822, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:40:30", "owner": "sniper_vibexx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918900184145733, "text": "I was turning 21 this year", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:38:13", "owner": "king_los35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921456667141023, "text": "The ppap guy was funny ass fuck pineapple pen 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:27:47", "owner": "2faded_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915106303173019, "text": "Trump elected president 😮!Thats a “NO” memory or forgotten memory maybe😮!", "created_at": "2025-09-06T16:45:12", "owner": "georgescu_sorin.6", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18364679428158154, "text": "I would watch the figet spinner how it was sharp and the guy on there was bleeding bad 😢😢🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T16:08:37", "owner": "vidaurri_rocks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337585939203444, "text": "2016 😂 go back further, lmao who the hell feels nostalgic about 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-06T16:04:17", "owner": "lnsearchoflosttime", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17862790197467294, "text": "Bro ain’t no one here feeling nostalgic about trumpos first election.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:44:34", "owner": "propsonthemoon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100394953611617, "text": "Soon it will be a decade ago next year… and then the next decade will be 2017 😢😔", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:08:32", "owner": "_matthew_drawsss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18125040685481975, "text": "i would do anything to go back to 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:04:06", "owner": "ykwjoshhis103", "likes": 530}, {"id": 18090961309622356, "text": "In 2016 i was 40 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:58:01", "owner": "l.theque", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065594486014076, "text": "prime ZHouse if yk yk.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:40:46", "owner": "bcole30xs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852781918534866, "text": "Nothing special bout this year lmao", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:28:50", "owner": "subaruimprezawrx8719", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18077821934069332, "text": "I was only 11 I remember all that in elementary everyone would say Andy coming and we all would drop on the ground not move bc Toy Story reference but man times were golden back then miss the old memories", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:28:49", "owner": "its_jason_luis", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18286986529265510, "text": "i grew up on Jacksepticeye, not DanTDM lol", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:21:48", "owner": "bxcat524_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080489201494449, "text": "My senior year in HS. That was something", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:19:31", "owner": "cardiaccats24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060548474093388, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:11:00", "owner": "ruben__415", "likes": 770}, {"id": 17938955295063240, "text": "It was soo simple back then", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:57:07", "owner": "xl.bit_oo", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18089748169762080, "text": "Pokémon Go is still very much a thing 🤣 in fact there’s now level", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:48:45", "owner": "wesley_huntley_117", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18156649189377167, "text": "Trump was the only bad in here", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:39:36", "owner": "jordanmichael0220", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077541883951041, "text": "I wish I could just go back to 2016 to see my grandpa one more time", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:34:35", "owner": "bville_logan78", "likes": 1872}, {"id": 18100557397717839, "text": "Wow givin nothing", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:32:14", "owner": "bgrs84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036441293468488, "text": "I was 9 years old in 2016", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:32:02", "owner": "kevin_tiburcio035", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853604053478270, "text": "You forgot the clowns", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:17:33", "owner": "mrs.abi.mast", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104528146601056, "text": "I was 10 years old in 2016 I miss 2016 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:15:39", "owner": "kpop_stan_muliti_stan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067672999970718, "text": "I miss this I was 13 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:11:21", "owner": "robert_sharingan", "likes": 127}, {"id": 18112680940719996, "text": "The Downfall of the society…", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:10:42", "owner": "spencer.valter", "likes": 101}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["nostalgia", "nostalgiacore", "nostalgic", "remember", "memories", "goodolddays", "fromthepast", "familiar", "childhood", "throwback", "90s", "80s", "2000s", "vintage", "retro", "1980s", "aesthetic", "explore"]},
{"media_id": 3687483158852694604, "shortcode": "DMskmVWpnJM", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMskmVWpnJM/", "taken_at": "2025-07-29T15:20:43", "caption": "Me: I know Sabrina from On My Way-\n\n< Follow @imaginarymusic2002 for more >\n.\n#onmyway #sabrinacarpenter #nostalgia #songs #imaginarymusic2002", "owner_username": "imaginarymusic2002", "owner_id": "52174535662", "likes": 116044, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0049_DMskmVWpnJM\\DMskmVWpnJM_20250729_152043.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18074045009064276, "text": "This was Sabrina???? 😮", "created_at": "2025-07-29T15:33:26", "owner": "ester.ngondo", "likes": 4887}, {"id": 18170782129352920, "text": "Alan Walker era is one of the greatest era", "created_at": "2025-08-07T17:23:39", "owner": "shxilxesh", "likes": 9713}, {"id": 18342176167160861, "text": "This used to be my absolute favorite song", "created_at": "2025-09-11T05:38:49", "owner": "irene.ifszk", "likes": 1146}, {"id": 17866463676352893, "text": "Ik her from Girl Meets World, from 2014 💀", "created_at": "2025-07-29T23:20:28", "owner": "4k_connoiseur", "likes": 1441}, {"id": 18387890101193697, "text": "Nahhh, Girl Meets World---------------->", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:50:12", "owner": "helena.rmarques", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18047461889258922, "text": "OG PUBG players know this ❤️", "created_at": "2025-07-31T22:26:37", "owner": "royyamsaqib", "likes": 623}, {"id": 18290930056249673, "text": "THIS IS SABRINA'S SONG?????", "created_at": "2025-09-04T22:26:41", "owner": "sarpctsyl", "likes": 131}, {"id": 17867641518451761, "text": "2020 pubg memories", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:11:26", "owner": "brngns14", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17966363306949617, "text": "This Song by Alan Walker amk", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:54:45", "owner": "oguzstappenn", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17854496076484676, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-30T02:22:28", "owner": "nknarcissistic", "likes": 4796}, {"id": 18061490318612674, "text": "I knew her from this. This song is way better than her new songs", "created_at": "2025-10-09T04:52:48", "owner": "elia_hat543", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075963026305092, "text": "2020 PUBG 🥹", "created_at": "2025-07-29T15:28:11", "owner": "imad__kaci", "likes": 913}, {"id": 17913293733220482, "text": "Good old days PUBG Mobile theme song!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:47:38", "owner": "sh.g_120", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18036212201479938, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-03T09:48:40", "owner": "carly_riccio", "likes": 654}, {"id": 18106714411499272, "text": "Önceden en sevdiğim şarkıydı çok az kişi bilir bu şarkıyı.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T15:57:15", "owner": "elifsena040", "likes": 511}, {"id": 18324738031209648, "text": "Okay this was this song of Alan Walker but Sabrina was also the part of this 🙌🫶🏻 And of course we love both❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:15:16", "owner": "jaatnii_khushi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17942330367009495, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-29T20:20:37", "owner": "yash_malhotra.24", "likes": 402}, {"id": 17857644444541623, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:19:34", "owner": "syncxrely", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884253886243499, "text": "What's the song namee???", "created_at": "2025-09-03T09:47:17", "owner": "anniexowms._", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18110850916569871, "text": "Çok iyi şarkıdır mesela", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:25:46", "owner": "yaslicocuk_16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18365358676151040, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-27T05:12:52", "owner": "subhan_shaikh_9321", "likes": 458}, {"id": 17965800524985395, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T06:32:49", "owner": "michael.s.ong", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18083053417814345, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T09:04:34", "owner": "hanshul_gajbhiye7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073714928465671, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:22:42", "owner": "green_goalie", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18084247162956122, "text": "From girls meet worldddd🙂🙂🙂🙂🙂!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-19T03:01:22", "owner": "xnoorxneoushy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049212689662141, "text": "gacha kids all knew her from there", "created_at": "2025-10-18T22:58:41", "owner": "realsia_.m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18361905574081395, "text": "Best song", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:30:01", "owner": "elias31campbell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896595367184666, "text": "PUBG era", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:10:08", "owner": "sunaaaassh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993822063687517, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T20:18:35", "owner": "zumra_thn", "likes": 93}, {"id": 18086548829303116, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:29:07", "owner": "i._vans.10", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17898280986290342, "text": "OGs remember Thumbs", "created_at": "2025-09-27T02:09:42", "owner": "isabellaa.celis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044904422378600, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:37:05", "owner": "aishaxqw._", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17939989913938523, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T08:00:39", "owner": "golx._", "likes": 113}, {"id": 18063261647457866, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:47:34", "owner": "osrfl", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17842221618582503, "text": "THAT WAS HER??", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:45:19", "owner": "grillchipp", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18054280196646093, "text": "That's Ava max isn't it?", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:18:20", "owner": "archiewyer1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048619013363262, "text": "Bro start Erangel", "created_at": "2025-10-25T21:03:22", "owner": "amiirtvk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149365897419088, "text": "And she never made a single good song since working with Alan Walker", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:53:37", "owner": "cody_321apperley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18310288348217043, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:01:35", "owner": "negvxp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053418698542391, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:18:37", "owner": "dmlnxm", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18402839791139228, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:42:05", "owner": "big_man_kcal12", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18060307799615892, "text": "looking at me 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-20T02:40:42", "owner": "yk2544._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046276247665752, "text": "On My Way, Thumbs, Sue Me, Skin, Almost Love, Can't Blame A Girl For Trying, We'll Be The Stars, Eyes Wide Open ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:03:29", "owner": "mzw201015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950232211032728, "text": "I love you Pubg", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:59:08", "owner": "krisik_kelmi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075870551121862, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:35:27", "owner": "little.andre.sito", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18143389981410909, "text": "ahre, yo la conocía de thumbs", "created_at": "2025-09-01T02:06:53", "owner": "lxvibess__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18385295917131252, "text": "Peak gacha song", "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:38:22", "owner": "jeslyncchui_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18329381431231735, "text": "Su şarkı pubg geri gelirse yeniden başlarım oyuna", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:18:53", "owner": "suleymnll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985629507904298, "text": "And thumbs", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:47:38", "owner": "ipkglr_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061934003059795, "text": "Alan Walker 🐐❤", "created_at": "2025-09-10T06:27:45", "owner": "saif_akhtar26", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18073907741164938, "text": "Where are my OGs --->", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:30:38", "owner": "ezraellukman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984580521908811, "text": "Singular act 1-2>>>", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:50:46", "owner": "fraaa_ceccarelli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092177770789012, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:45:40", "owner": "tumancaev.sattyk", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18043757969394591, "text": "Pubg😢😭", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:17:18", "owner": "rana_yahya9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940624720051829, "text": "Free fire days", "created_at": "2025-08-19T13:08:20", "owner": "itz_me_goutham7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076920494083734, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:47:41", "owner": "saygi_berat0664", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062767355578264, "text": "I expected everything but not Sabrina was the one who made this PUBG masterpiece", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:40:14", "owner": "mh_nsr12", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18086344585723704, "text": "Alan walker 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:14:08", "owner": "coconutwoda96", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898695376296377, "text": "I dont even listen to sabrina but this song is fire", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:56:50", "owner": "miiiiq.09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18395698054189118, "text": "Sabrina sung and wrote that song? Dang!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:40:54", "owner": "syahiranqais", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930862213098354, "text": "Nah post malones first ever song puts her entire career in the dirt", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:59:13", "owner": "gabrielhnandez_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18044224643371526, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:04:01", "owner": "denizselvi30", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18093781762740701, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:26:13", "owner": "jannat._.khan8413", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947060152019639, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-09T12:51:19", "owner": "ghala_artist__", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18114403957524071, "text": "Miss this era😢", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:14:14", "owner": "khz.alif", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094935667708846, "text": "She has an insane glow up btw from on my way to espresso", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:17:26", "owner": "_wtf.av_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020428025571589, "text": "I know her from girl meets world", "created_at": "2025-09-15T20:24:56", "owner": "laalice345", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082798979312466, "text": "im that someone, sorry 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:42:23", "owner": "iibellazx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056358206179600, "text": "I know her from clouds...", "created_at": "2025-09-22T04:37:41", "owner": "randomhockeyguy_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066298733254691, "text": "Banger", "created_at": "2025-09-23T19:49:46",