ing the throne to another Queen", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:21:52", "owner": "diego_hernandez_solis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057037565623723, "text": "Thubmbs 💔", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:15:20", "owner": "tutubtwn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070633144926025, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:23:43", "owner": "melanyupi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082435774918652, "text": "I've known her since 2014.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:43:52", "owner": "enzomd11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954572724858982, "text": "yeah ts was car music in pubg mobile in 2019 or smth", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:40:44", "owner": "erkssz23", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18072041303146193, "text": "Essa era pedrada", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:29:21", "owner": "pedrogals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072631808090956, "text": "i know her since \"girl meeting world\"", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:44:54", "owner": "rana_frog_1611", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039712286432286, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:30:23", "owner": "zaraki_no1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985186434722255, "text": "DESDE THUMBS 🗣🗣🗣🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T20:37:05", "owner": "taliii_ana098", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863384125463008, "text": "Hepimiz bu şarkıyı sabrina olduğunu bilmeden dinliyorduk, şu anki kadar popüler değildi o zamanlar", "created_at": "2025-09-05T20:24:55", "owner": "yagmursengul_1907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887180110224370, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T18:09:44", "owner": "mr_lokslee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133662796453847, "text": "Know her from this song, one of my favorite songs ❤", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:41:58", "owner": "chadangkhoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081601375900891, "text": "ALAN WALKER ERA!!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:16:32", "owner": "thekentagd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842878879566739, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:59:41", "owner": "aruchie204", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18094580500725999, "text": "I knew this, never knew it was Sabrina", "created_at": "2025-09-05T13:3