"lanabreiss", "likes": 4291}, {"id": 17854262415582780, "text": "🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:59:47", "owner": "kavye_panchal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17933196045096640, "text": "👏love this  Good for you #Poland 🇵🇱🇺🇸", "created_at": "2025-09-25T00:51:23", "owner": "mariabartiromo", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18378540766180179, "text": "🇵🇱 long live Poland 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:59:11", "owner": "imjyotirmy", "likes": 152}, {"id": 18049278095638134, "text": "so proud of this man and country", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:08:40", "owner": "fitcarey11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100445485724259, "text": "Go Poland 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:36:43", "owner": "miataginge", "likes": 60}, {"id": 18097942510634778, "text": "Big win Poland! 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:29:31", "owner": "liu.spitzer", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18038954243689966, "text": "respect from 🇬🇪🇬🇪🇬🇪", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:03:44", "owner": "gurgenagg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17983828358864678, "text": "Proud of Poland and their leader💯🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:17:07", "owner": "mariska.botha.7564", "likes": 50}, {"id": 18088682281923559, "text": "He saved Poland!👏", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:20:01", "owner": "xml2624", "likes": 89}, {"id": 17905609386273035, "text": "Poland sounds like a good place to move rn", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:30:11", "owner": "margielabans", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18070864714915643, "text": "Polska ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:18:24", "owner": "kimdammer", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18021839090604068, "text": "Respect from italy 🇮🇹🤝🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:46:13", "owner": "nomecognome007", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18108588430722241, "text": "Well said mate !! I wish they could do that in Australia", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:30:24", "owner": "stewartjmurray069", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18134180653426105, "text": "He should be proud 👏 well done Poland 🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:25:13", "owner": "gulyagulnara9", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18222964741306252, "text": "Amin", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:11:06", "owner": "armz_in_flame", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537224422016472, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:50:18", "owner": "daving2211", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043641644390019, "text": "Salva Polska 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:18:33", "owner": "miles.christianus1", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18043462559405331, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:44:22", "owner": "sgk.65zo0", "likes": 1072}, {"id": 18020245445787031, "text": "Cancer free Poland 🇵🇱 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-08T06:13:52", "owner": "jaguriavdhesh", "likes": 536}, {"id": 18044944946668572, "text": "I’m going to move to Poland. If they accept me I’m not Muslim. I’m Italian. God bless him. They are absolutely 150% right", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:31:51", "owner": "riccardolore", "likes": 586}, {"id": 18099507868570121, "text": "The Poland is one real europian country right now in Eu. 🙌 Respect to Poland!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:27:35", "owner": "irakli_lomia_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17927102922036271, "text": "Poland 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-15T13:31:58", "owner": "amrit_bhullar.99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077836010159509, "text": "I wish Canada was more like Poland, things aren’t looking great here but it’s nice Polands doing well", "created_at": "2025-11-12T22:53:32", "owner": "gamer_pro097", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17850887418544604, "text": "Went to Poland for a week and felt safer than I felt in the uk (born here and lived here my whole life). Poland are doing it right and we should be taking notes", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:48:33", "owner": "callummcparland", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18091528805497482, "text": "I have a very peculiar skill set! My husband knows how to build homes! Poland, please may you take us please 😑", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:49:33", "owner": "clairebolger19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972391455799060, "text": "The example for the world. Go Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:40:12", "owner": "aarontallent", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17883065583381534, "text": "What a man.. Really, what a man. Poland, u are blessed to have a smart president with a backbone. Salute to you sir and bless Poland. 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:19:42", "owner": "reuelyap", "likes": 2837}, {"id": 18152855635416179, "text": "Cancer free poland.... awaiting India🇮🇳 to become cancer free", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:12:12", "owner": "sachinm214", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17973988841779231, "text": "More country s should be like poland!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:46:00", "owner": "chantaldillon22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928940314165635, "text": "Ask her ...why there's so much chaos in those countries who became generous and took refugees?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:46:20", "owner": "october_with_spring", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17853694104583972, "text": "Poland, Romania, Russia, so many countries over there just do it better than the west", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:59:16", "owner": "jbapratt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066413447577020, "text": "This is what every country should be doing", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:34:17", "owner": "harryrigles", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17842052079619772, "text": "Immigration is the root cause of all major problems current day", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:58:10", "owner": "attano_vor", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17971914563937639, "text": "Well done poland", "created_at": "2025-09-12T02:00:56", "owner": "akshat.tr7", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17874767253450409, "text": "Save??? Why polish ar everywhere?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:40:52", "owner": "ya_ssine_lucifer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919707082156053, "text": "The same thing with Czech republic, and i am so proud of it", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:11:04", "owner": "patricie.hova", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18159048010403816, "text": "💯❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:07:40", "owner": "kiunjurip2019", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860459656475469, "text": "Never gets Old - Na Zdrowie", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16: