ner": "robert.marin.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081494024177401, "text": "BBC racist clown.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:49:33", "owner": "georgeapiet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915478117095398, "text": "We need this type of guy in my country bharat,", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:56:01", "owner": "hemanthrathod59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543128833020801, "text": "Every country should bhi like Poland,", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:54:59", "owner": "hemanthrathod59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051047954418960, "text": "Why fucking muslim come to our country", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:44:07", "owner": "deepak.thakur__5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843731530654526, "text": "🇵🇱🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:36:02", "owner": "vicentinxz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907004272289186, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:18:49", "owner": "peterob_2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204080557320649, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T05:34:41", "owner": "bidy_uthalder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193343818336068, "text": "God bless you Poland 🇵🇱 😍\nYou are great 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:23:52", "owner": "free_moddy_girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356170756161791, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-17T15:02:35", "owner": "mr_huderi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016861778796487, "text": "Bravo👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-17T13:58:19", "owner": "avivshiri17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056570735649498, "text": "Mss toch maar verhuizen...", "created_at": "2025-12-17T09:27:34", "owner": "sp_ecialfoodies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869291167493143, "text": "Protect children ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:34:19", "owner": "cham.pagne1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067140392157797, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:22:51", "owner": "khokhar6240", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061513625632531, "text": "Mohamed falls profet he is in his tomb, Budha... All of tham thay die only Jessus win aggaist death and he didnt makes any war like Mohamed did he didt mary 9year old gir, he didt killed anyone of another faith another opinion... He speak about peace, love ge speak about forgivnes... As a Cristians I pray for all people of this WORLD and for all Muslim people qz you in your Quran speak and respect Jesus... He is Alfa and Omega.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:46:13", "owner": "jp_croco923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089018266801391, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:18:11", "owner": "abi.lxn__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030530147751916, "text": "Save your culture, its not the matter of policies, jobs, climate or any damn thing.\nIts the matter of your culture, your identity, your land, for ages man have fought for their land. Neanderthal, stone age, adivasis, any evolution of human history has always tried to preserve their land their rituals, their way of living life. What would be the whole purpose of human evolution if everyone of us have to bow down five times a day and follow the same things around the globe imagine a world like this it so sad, depressing . Human evolution has never been about doing same things. It always had various personalities various cultures thats the essence of Mankind even animals which habitat in different regions have differences in their lifestyle.\nBut these watermelons they want the whole world to be same. Save your culture, save your sovereignity, Save your land, Save your existence for your future generations so they what was their real existence, Just because your ancestors great great great great grandfather followed their ritual, their way of life, you are able to learn about it today, dont let your ancestors shame you.\nSave your land, Save your Identity, Save your existence.\nThis is not anymore about policies,jobs, etc.. it is only and only about your existence. They are after completely vandalising your Culture. Centuries old traditions and civilizations that your upcoming generations should know about. Save your existence and your future. WAKE UP.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:42:53", "owner": "ragsbags50", "likes": 0},