l done Poland. 👏🏿", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:40:56", "owner": "gilson_panciera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967135060003814, "text": "All the words the loony left uses. Racist, homophone, islamaphobe, Mysoginistic, toxic masculinity.  They've lost their meanings now, you've used them so much for all the wrong reasons. We don't take any notice anymore when you call us them", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:27:58", "owner": "paul843969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057209249310560, "text": "🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:23:50", "owner": "saichon_122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065636630621010, "text": "Yes they should be very proud 💯", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:55:26", "owner": "angie63hughes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089608504748745, "text": "🇵🇱💯👍", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:06:43", "owner": "amasha_kusal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099395035701084, "text": "❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:50:50", "owner": "abrahams0327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374545423159658, "text": "Well done Poland, I wish we was the same, I don’t feel safe xx", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:35:46", "owner": "alison1972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978632559947940, "text": "proud? VERY PROUD", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:28:13", "owner": "joel.lirocha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864887344530353, "text": "I'm SICK OF THESE FRIVOLOUS FOPPISHLY POMPOUS LIBERAL/LEFTIST TYPES & their retarded emotional blackmail. 💯", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:08:57", "owner": "non_modern_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950265375924601, "text": "Legend !!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:16:26", "owner": "pontusolsson88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083863495843040, "text": "Refugees my ass", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:06:58", "owner": "czech_whip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193718068329768, "text": "Respect for Poland 🇵🇱🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:59:56", "owner": "giuglan_stefan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086532892823167, "text": "They should be proud of it 💯 look at the rest of Europe and what immigration has done to it", "created_at":