 18095466091879527, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:37:09", "owner": "marek.u76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125750605515522, "text": "🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:47:57", "owner": "_gregyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067662497628101, "text": "And I stand so FIRMLY with my president of Poland. I was born there and I can see the difference between the USA and how Kamala allowed for ALL the illegals to come into this country compared to how my President in Poland has made it. We allowed the Ukraines to come into Poland and now half if not more of Poland is all Ukraines. Why? When Poland was in war and we needed help from the Ukraines they all turned their backs to us. But we are supposed to help them?? F$&K that!!! 🇵🇱💯❤️🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:05:36", "owner": "soulnghost3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062681861553457, "text": "The only one who made it right", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:52:23", "owner": "___seestern___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139390282455740, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:16:01", "owner": "labeautysalon010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095483098875537, "text": "How many Polish rats are in our country take em bk", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:46:24", "owner": "dezthered20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105174730650704, "text": "Hero respect from Ireland 🇮🇪 👏🏾 🙌🏽 🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:31:51", "owner": "doyle_25_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000082151839263, "text": "no f was given by this guy, and he is the person we need in this generation", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:22:18", "owner": "nonong1229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889764109385460, "text": "Brawo Polska 💪❤️ tak trzymać", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:11:48", "owner": "beckfreenisreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920017819212323, "text": "That’s how we need to be in USA", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:55:27", "owner": "montalvo.frankie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309545077270819, "text": "Poland the new safe haven", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:48:06", "