es needs to follow Poland 👏👏 well said. Why don't the reporter take one of the refugee in her home.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:35:32", "owner": "ray_parad0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103592791728711, "text": "One of the best European president.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:22:08", "owner": "a_s_k_avi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998045535697005, "text": "Poland took in over a million Ukrainians - mostly women and children.  Muslims and Africans don't deserve that", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:52", "owner": "twaj321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990977772889575, "text": "Good Job Poloand 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:45", "owner": "halanporai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083718509287385, "text": "🇵🇱🐐", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:17:35", "owner": "pelle240813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027606440566796, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:32:12", "owner": "maggieoliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061557953199947, "text": "Me to muslims- le re lund ke😂😂😂 teri aukat Poland me😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:55:31", "owner": "sudeshmahto_935", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028965719556199, "text": "Poland is doing very well! All Europe should do the same..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:14:42", "owner": "ioanniska1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148363342429392, "text": "He’s not racist. It’s not color, it’s culture. Some cultures have different values. Some cultures want peace, others want religious control", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:10:32", "owner": "timpitera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088868380749245, "text": "What a great man ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:46:22", "owner": "hay_dn17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131324674438993, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:04:00", "owner": "bruno.boas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086003332973273, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:23:20", "owner": "faath_imasanah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171268504335346, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱 respect", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:22:04", "owner": "prady__06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1791582775522653