", "owner": "jrguedes.pro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111401035603180, "text": "We don’t need those refugees", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:34:40", "owner": "photosaver82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919669339193788, "text": "Proud to be polish", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:56:57", "owner": "spturok", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103792915726288, "text": "I’m coming back to the homeland lol", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:56:37", "owner": "dondraper42021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083913746073354, "text": "😂😂😂😂💯🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:56:04", "owner": "dondraper42021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544188229058049, "text": "Poland hates us so much for no reason", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:37:51", "owner": "josphe999xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980517537773352, "text": "He saved roland 🇵🇱🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:34:09", "owner": "soundexp246", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18132962413473677, "text": "Why does no one understand that this is the way to treat a sickness  like the muslims and all of them idiots we don‘t need and destroy our culture", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:13:43", "owner": "sevenator_dom_aka_chef_dom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18394522360132542, "text": "We need him in Canada 🇨🇦!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:43:43", "owner": "frank____t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076294946227065, "text": "I stand with Poland. I wish America would get on board", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:30:08", "owner": "thisisabattleground", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858638518543011, "text": "Hah, gotcha!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:09:28", "owner": "manuel_marino_s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054356492646224, "text": "Be more like Poland and ask yourself the big question, why the Muslim countries doesn't take their brothers and sisters?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:47:18", "owner": "santabrauke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18432390691097502, "text": "@laringodrops  qualquer coisa a gente muda pra lá", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:46:04", "owner": "bianca_nefroped", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943035085078794, "text": "Respect ❤️❤️❤️poland❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:11:44", "owner": "prince88865darknes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015949457790017, "text": "No Muslim should live in Europe! Żaden muzułmanin nie powinien mieszkać w Europie!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:04:00", "owner": "george______73", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18297966874281069, "text": "Top man 💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:47:03", "owner": "chelsealazenby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096655015696146, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:37:17", "owner": "mr_suthar888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295424104262063, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:21:58", "owner": "jeni_bjmma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081694175117013, "text": "But yet half of the polish live elsewhere we have 600,000 polish in the uk", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:51:59", "owner": "222.blx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046881926427046, "text": "RESPECT FROM INDONESIA.. 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:20:15", "owner": "jabestmoon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17971000676974586, "text": "There are about 50 Muslim countries, so y don't they take own clan", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:27:24", "owner": "priyanka93saraf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056070749294997, "text": "Right decision taken at the right time.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:26:44", "owner": "priyanka93saraf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872665528452660, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏\nI wonder what her definition of refugee is.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:25:32", "owner": "wakabakari", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075077456225109, "text": "And Poland is becoming best country in Europe", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:38:08", "owner": "mathias.petersen7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074130998263995, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:22:58", "owner": "sheila_julio.bosslady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980627703926952, "text": "Man can u be the president of Portugal please?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:22:18", "owner": "simaogf06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890079655369816, "text": "난민이 문제가 아니라 불법으로 입국하는 게 문제인 것이다. 서구 유럽이 불법 이민자로 인하여 고통받고 있는 것이 그것을 증명하고 있다.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:52:18", "owner": "victoriumph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103554805640270, "text": "Free polanf", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:43:34", "owner": "delagarzajair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931819810135316, "text": "Respect for you sir 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:30:13", "owner": "excuseme_486", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916497157228786, "text": "Well done Poland. We should all follow suit 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:12:02", "owner": "harwood_79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085288486782540, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:57:50", "owner": "davide.pisi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100261156664660, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:44:47", "owner": "brandon_lane44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960476706861323, "text": "🇵🇱💯👍👏👏👏👏❤️❤️👏👏👏polen är det land som var klokast att inte ta in några flyktingar. 👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:34:48", "owner": "berntsson349", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543493561046216, "text": "Looks like I’m moving to poland", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:44:41", "owner": "ethan_seville621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142425577448042, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-11T08:11:55", "owner": "jan_willing._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112201237570598, "text": "🙌👏👍", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:47:10", "owner": "zbyneksirovy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076159393952832, "text": "👏👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:43:59", "owner": "neculaibea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182219935358496, "text": "Saved from cancer 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:19:13", "owner": "indian.x.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077421812173766, "text": "Funny she says and your proud of that...pretty sure whole world is proud of that", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:14:46", "owner": "chris.walski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084479465095390, "text": "Proud of poland", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:13:10", "owner": "chris.walski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014827592800310, "text": "🔥 FU K THOSE TERRORIST", "created_