h. I don’t blame them", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:00:58", "owner": "mirandalabeaut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123727546513522, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:40:04", "owner": "sally_whybrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085059461003662, "text": "Not racist!! He is protecting his people!!", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:12:31", "owner": "pimentel_lesley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898939135328912, "text": "👏👏👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:53:34", "owner": "richardau86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414047650190585, "text": "Quem me dera que Portugal fizesse o mesmo", "created_at": "2025-11-10T11:18:30", "owner": "_su1988_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909986551253218, "text": "Soon india will also follow 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:11:45", "owner": "mr.99_mithlesh_gunhawk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951813235023642, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:04:44", "owner": "vilmarimkeviciene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095537107831693, "text": "Go fuck you're self you stupid bitch", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:37:18", "owner": "p3stik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103147162728586, "text": "Get this a statue", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:28:44", "owner": "miguelpacheco1337", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074801960186620, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:21:34", "owner": "bling_bling_nail_designs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085702837790097, "text": "@narendramodi", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:51:28", "owner": "_yuva_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100809394737620, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:11:16", "owner": "sanchao___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394884454126624, "text": "Win for poland", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:14:36", "owner": "mynameis.mkb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092242030879752, "text": "every country should do this, islam will be the end of the world. people have to repent", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:46:38", "owner": "car_vulture", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990055029895817, "text": "🔥👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:16:36", "owner": "_bhushan.kakde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051810011338507, "text": "And then if a muslim country does it they will cry😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T03:19:30", "owner": "me7_edits", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866205952424764, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-10T03:10:34", "owner": "vinnisingh84478", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898844398328855, "text": "America 🇺🇸 needs to follow suit", "created_at": "2025-11-10T02:10:01", "owner": "isanava796", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842876836614593, "text": "🇵🇱💯 good", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:56:13", "owner": "ashmwwilks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873045088450288, "text": "Why do they have a problem with it? It’s literally his country She’s probably not even a Poland president and she’s complaining about it.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:22:12", "owner": "billykd57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945312643060551, "text": "🇵🇱💯❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:03:49", "owner": "cyrillesouque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077436326469993, "text": "👏💯", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:48:33", "owner": "ellac.adams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069363308362966, "text": "👏👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱💯💯👍", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:15:34", "owner": "kerr_janice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074861258335890, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:13:46", "owner": "shinggibanggippungppungbanggi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899275612324706, "text": "I wish my country was more like Poland.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:13:36", "owner": "chromaphorix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947064157054891, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:52:55", "owner": "peruviangirltnworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928718566147149, "text": "Exactly 💯", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:59:33", "owner": "exnavy78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193077013331443, "text": "W decision Poland 🇵🇱 👍", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:30:21", "owner": "alexx_boom7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143684932440180, "text": "\"aNd yOu aRe pRoUd oF tHaT?!\"", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:56:50", "owner": "danielgabeson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144028606437079, "text": "🇵🇱👏❤️😂💯", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:39:50", "owner": "liz_javier_711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393827989132704, "text": "This guy came to a UK-Neo Nazi March and falsely claimed 3 million attended but only 150k-200k attended - yes very honest guy, can be trusted 💯%", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:18:12", "owner": "alfie_bg_delboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084495032510953, "text": "60% of Polish migrate abroad to just survive, you should ask why - you can only become great if you respect the country’s and people who feed you and helping you - stop the hate\n\nAlso largest EU beneficiary country is Poland and NATO IS PAYING ITS DEFENCE", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:09:33", "owner": "alfie_bg_delboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986980164743066, "text": "She didn’t ask about Muslim so why’s it’s instantly in his head, also he claimed Poland is 💯% Christian very disturbing considering its dark past.  Considering the vast Polish economic migrants we have in the UK, it’s offensive - we are helping Poland to become better not go back to its past 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:05:01", "owner": "alfie_bg_delboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863844010508594, "text": "Good for you Poland maybe the rest of the world will wake up", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:48:49", "owner": "sonnyofhb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060825968530547, "text": "Good for you, Poland!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:46:52", "owner": "dinky42856", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048712559680012, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T18:38:47", "owner": "casillanoe19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101529778708914, "text": "Canada you need to watch this specially Mark Carney #MarkCarney!!!! Please!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T17:03:33", "owner": "rnzljim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379469998197677, "text": "Cyprus 🇨🇾 take a note.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:28:38", "owner": "jesus_love_of_my_life_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088920805822210, "text": "Its funny they say we're white nationalist while simultaneously forcibly imposing their religion on other people in other countries... the hypocrisy is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:11:47", "owner": "weskel902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024876146584476, "text": "The Man in his words ....🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:50:36", "owner": "dan___y3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946317172062706, "text": "He says 2 millions of Ukrainians!  they are definitely refugees! Then why the fuck is she asking about refugees and blaming him as a racist! 😂😂 . He is a patriotic politician 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:54:20", "owner": "micaiah_sharon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048851165667250, "text": "Power to the people 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:01:52", "owner": "tansykoha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109584565607407, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:27:33", "owner": "libermasya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078063470333663, "text": "🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:19:49", "owner": "snezanaxo600", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001912682677361, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:02:07", "owner": "i_am.jn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094092730881340, "text": "No Mohamed no troubles 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:51:58", "owner": "hollywoodstandard4sure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951922987040548, "text": "🙌🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:22:33", "owner": "cathryn.lloyd.52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085145089965084, "text": "But they aren’t suffering with stabbings, Grape cases or the worry of walking home in the dark🤷🏻‍♂️ I don’t think that’s racist you silly leftist cow I think that’s called putting your own people first… wtf is wrong with these deluded idiots pulling the racist card all the time I’m so fucking sick of it😂🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:18:46", "owner": "peppercornbandit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845176696607748, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:12:44", "owner": "keshav_sharma_tj__001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102806635676842, "text": "How wonderful to have a leader like that, Poland should be proud!!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:06:22", "owner": "suesnellgrove", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17854040670565813, "text": "Europe should do the same for safe Europe, déport them All before they destroy Europe", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:56:54", "owner": "_paulo_2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104270515640409, "text": "@coachjerrydude Jews push them onto us", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:16:56", "owner": "_juliee.nst_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093782245874374, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:58:24", "owner": "jaison_joshua_cbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244390282293124, "text": "Wow....so ao proud of Poland.....", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:20:28", "owner": "shikha_bhardwaj_gupta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060973571531284, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:16:26", "owner": "ravi_singhaswal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946539405932316, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05:19:29", "owner": "saraecheverriamendez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856970815552458, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T03:31:12", "owner": "donpatron_08_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409302472140670, "text": "Even muslim countries don’t take refugees so why is there a problem when a non Muslim country dont take them😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T03:21:23", "owner": "mr_davis_himself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882657442404350, "text": "He saved his country", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:53:12", "owner": "anne_aagu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073416986247832, "text": "GREAT YOU DID THE RIGHT THING POLAND!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:11:30", "owner": "grayheart92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887480170385361, "text": "They accept in alot of legal muslim immigrants and look? Safe country. France, Germany etc let in mass immigrants without passports, no way to identify them and alot of them were isis members. And look what happened their with all the church burnings and people being attacked etc", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:56:02", "owner": "wizard.of.psychosiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107414344591562, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱❤️💯", "created_at