-28T20:10:08", "owner": "tt821506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982874019874116, "text": "Don't get it wrong. He didn't say that Muslims are not welcome. He o ly said they don't need illegal ones and he is right. If you want to go to a country, go legally.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:21:04", "owner": "osondugodfrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925965226149806, "text": "Deport muslim or Allah।।।।।।।। Wake up world", "created_at": "2025-10-28T17:58:56", "owner": "ajayprajapat3802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085384007511688, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:59:48", "owner": "nickreynolds855", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070885934042090, "text": "This is a good man!!", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:33:43", "owner": "amorosotodd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082709315071575, "text": "🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-28T11:59:50", "owner": "a_run_in_lion_city", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412240654114084, "text": "CLOCKED IT 💯🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-28T11:05:06", "owner": "kirsdenny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094715824651689, "text": "My man", "created_at": "2025-10-28T10:34:49", "owner": "pasqualep_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977063145930439, "text": "Wow ! I love this guy and his honesty ! Greetings from Austria 🇦🇹 somebody we would definitely need over here as well", "created_at": "2025-10-28T08:34:19", "owner": "_prettylittlelashes0_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843517093602639, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-28T08:25:30", "owner": "drite.17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328067527208768, "text": "Well done Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:25:27", "owner": "niggiiswhite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865623865477054, "text": "She is so full of shit", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:01:01", "owner": "marionev8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084775282986576, "text": "Just kill all the Muslim if they want world peace", "created_at": "2025-10-28T05:56:37", "owner": "hhuy66288", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533250271058371, "text": "W Poland 🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-28T04:18:10", "owner": "_harsh_631", "likes": 0}, 