: 18085332871779392, "text": "King 👑 the world need to learn from you", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:01:59", "owner": "yossib120382", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016414760616391, "text": "Please come to Holland and save us to", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:45:56", "owner": "winniekuhlwilm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019317401604395, "text": "🇮🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:28:21", "owner": "kfir.tamir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065995976097197, "text": "💯❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:14:26", "owner": "sneeze_ice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054347516312412, "text": "I was there and its true🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-10-27T12:55:57", "owner": "zaiden.botha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059883764632754, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-27T11:17:38", "owner": "adarsh.ashoka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071531456585685, "text": "I'm Muslim I love Poland 🇵🇱🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-27T10:27:31", "owner": "mocchisayhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933849360980833, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-27T10:14:18", "owner": "travelmanpilot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105465547621485, "text": "👏👏🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-27T09:48:37", "owner": "libbyk849", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085392904967543, "text": "Respect from Ireland 🇮🇪👏", "created_at": "2025-10-27T09:30:16", "owner": "sutze84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059681414562319, "text": "Listen World, be like Poland!", "created_at": "2025-10-27T09:13:29", "owner": "kaore_tetahi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065469377379073, "text": "Crisp n Clear 👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-27T08:47:27", "owner": "soulofbanaras", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922009651168241, "text": "Poland model must adopt all Europe & all western country ...", "created_at": "2025-10-27T08:30:30", "owner": "ironakpatel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054305975317319, "text": "🇵🇱🇷🇴🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-27T08:20:39", "owner": "rares20w2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002796299665463, "text": "You got it right apart from the Ukraine people.... celebrating killing polish people... on the 26th of January I think