7992079195893858, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:47:57", "owner": "i_am_craig_from_southaftica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902746951143481, "text": "👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:37:50", "owner": "pranotisarang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051000650328874, "text": "Poland keep supporting this man on any cost 👍❤️this man save your country from being ruun ❤️ love from india 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:29:33", "owner": "sonal.iborde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966806244975677, "text": "Amen!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:28:42", "owner": "francis.hawk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054143672636765, "text": "Proper Stuff 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:10:00", "owner": "j_1nkz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18208266925310595, "text": "Very good poland . Oreslse ull be like canada and japan . Now these muslims are taking over them and that sucks", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:34:18", "owner": "ronnavicedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299668894252252, "text": "👏❤️🔥💯👍", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:15:30", "owner": "priyajoshi6285", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850955476574451, "text": "👊🏼well said,I'm proud of you", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:14:31", "owner": "robertorosso68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082119263008274, "text": "I love Poland 🇵🇱 ❤️America needs to do this God bless America 🇺🇸 and Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:58:38", "owner": "dontfeeded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422339998108616, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:56:30", "owner": "pegwmaggie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091952155686777, "text": "It’s what Poland wants. So shut up", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:27:35", "owner": "jingohervas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18485393473078032, "text": "Dominik Tarczyński 🇵🇱 🗿", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:59:30", "owner": "attilio_di_romavecchia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081903752489970, "text": "As Muslim huge respect to poland for not ruining their country 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:09:59", "owner": "_abd_bnch__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004167104675442, "text": "Brawo👏👏👏🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:45:37", "owner": "babsi.paola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061152551419258, "text": "And if you call it racist...than I'm  keep it simple send them all back. Support from the Netherlands 🇳🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:16:53", "owner": "daantje693", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405247315140377, "text": "Short answer...hell yes I'm proud of it🇵🇱💯👍🏽", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:14:44", "owner": "daantje693", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089206621907989, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:23:02", "owner": "dhiraj.pandey10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329212792226198, "text": "you haven't destroyed your country yet?? yOuRe RaCiSt", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:16:11", "owner": "hunter.scott.01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902597401147287, "text": "GOAT🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:28:41", "owner": "apophenian_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051782795321876, "text": "God bless Poland", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:22:23", "owner": "patrickleo446", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052512761648507, "text": "agree 🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:41:53", "owner": "mariolapazan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000274076819298, "text": "Poland is right!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:31:39", "owner": "bubulino_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024031277578755, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:26:31", "owner": "dora_puklavec_narancic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095662882774312, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:25:49", "owner": "0ldronin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983828358864678, "text": "Proud of Poland and their leader💯🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:17:07", "owner": "mariska.botha.7564", "likes": 50}, {"id": 17946457395050377, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱💯🇵🇱💯🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:03:13", "owner": "imredfitomarpro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930095572000638, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:43:44", "owner": "thawai_mi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127763617486518, "text": "“ And you are proud of that? “ He damn right should be ! Othe countries should