ed_at": "2025-10-22T18:16:09", "owner": "vasilios_prokos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064885499078731, "text": "0 muslims = Best country to live a peacefull life.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:01:38", "owner": "shen.kavee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074576308964223, "text": "🔥🔥President  of Poland 🇵🇱you earned my respect", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:08:23", "owner": "dr_jacob__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860323312521504, "text": "👏 a great leader 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:05:52", "owner": "bodie.55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140057509443074, "text": "I like this 👍💯", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:05:49", "owner": "michielll_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084511790298833, "text": "🇷🇺🇸🇰🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:02:54", "owner": "ja_som_0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534278563006908, "text": "✅✅✅🫡🤝🤝🙌🙌👏👏🇵🇱💯💯 Respect , this is what the entire world needs", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:41:18", "owner": "dubaicoachcleber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393766252125982, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:38:48", "owner": "p.s.kelowna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860550031522495, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱 good work poland", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:33:46", "owner": "baghelmaneesh15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118143652533375, "text": "Well said... ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:16:21", "owner": "statonedward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047281820355105, "text": "Poland bravoo🙌❤️👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:57:04", "owner": "ma_ko11111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109489645605165, "text": "Why cant them go to Muslim country?  Very simple", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:40:15", "owner": "amuruonyenaego_nteje", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143019580436428, "text": "They want to enforce the Sharia laws onto the non-Islamic countries. They’ve shown their true colours already and yet we still want to tolerate that here in the UK. Our government is cooked", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:15:12", "owner": "jroma.av", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862489318433506, "text": "Soo strong 🔥❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:09:37", "owner": "zajc_zajcew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145579180426539, "text": "My ancestors are from Poland, making me Polish, I have not visited although I would love too, but I stand with Poland! Doing the lords work! One of best all around countries! 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:55:51", "owner": "skiski123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294548542260378, "text": "Can we borrow this guy in a America please", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:34:19", "owner": "tonyvega920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065734595094315, "text": "Poland has an intact culture, safe streets, and prosperous economy. How ever did they do it with out foreigners that don’t speak the language? Multiculturalism is only demanded from white countries and it is a net negative to all societies.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:22:42", "owner": "thatboy73iv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961329564989911, "text": "Moving to Poland button -------------🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:14:20", "owner": "ididthis4", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073443782229500, "text": "let me in please", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:09:29", "owner": "mehra._.kia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073773823964989, "text": "Exactly", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:24:22", "owner": "paolaciardullomilani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069627242037182, "text": "💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:10:58", "owner": "tolyan1508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089623339848714, "text": "Cool 😎 Poland.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:10:55", "owner": "tolyan1508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064932020577317, "text": "She’s a bad journalist. She asked why he doesn’t take in refugees yet he already mentioned they took in Ukrainians. She obviously doesn’t know what a refugee is so shouldn’t really be asking any questions.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:08:26", "owner": "keafy2176", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026002787563108, "text": "💯 respect sir👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:00:55", "owner": "roshlife_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926252089175721, "text": "But your women and men out here in every other countries in Europe. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:31:20", "owner": "_trachyk90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856251964550453, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:30:30", "owner": "storeduart_carina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851087083534251, "text": "Dominik Tarczyński jak zawsze pozamiatał brawo! 🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:59:49", "owner": "ig.dzonyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077251115514485, "text": "Solidarity to Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:55:46", "owner": "sonutn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006804215650201, "text": "👏👏👏💯👍", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:50:49", "owner": "irenetemi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066630710342662, "text": "We need a leader like him👍🏻❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:38:17", "owner": "dreamer54680", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869023264460911, "text": "But nobody is talking about Polish people living on the Street in Holland and other countries.. they are kind of a problem…", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:14:44", "owner": "maliek_jaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865046416416522, "text": "God bless Poland and this guy. I wish we had the same in France.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:08:51", "owner": "afxnoguen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987163869734485, "text": "Respect from India 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:29:11", "owner": "shivoham9787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107835250606736, "text": "I need Poland!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:23:11", "owner": "faithmarchelle_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918828529057045, "text": "Manu, tu entends ce qu’il dit?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:23:00", "owner": "twentytwosevenxiv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874277368437884, "text": "Even in India  a law was passed a few years back to not let in Muslim refugees or migrants from  neighbouring countries. There were some corrupt so called liberals who marched on streets but thankfully it didn't work! There will always be people who can't see reason. Don't be that person.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:24:21", "owner": "tomorrow_is_new_day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319764493300729, "text": "Tell this corrupt woman pretending to be intellectual to go live in Afghanistan or Iran for a year and she'll know why they don't want Muslims even as refugees!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:22:07", "owner": "tomorrow_is_new_day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847340029588578, "text": "Tac … mentre in Italia votiamo persone che festeggiano nel carretto di carnevale … 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:47:40", "owner": "antonio_di_battista__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147755866424237, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱👏👏🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:01:06", "owner": "zacklaurinaitis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059309282565255, "text": "No Islam Terroristen", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:28:26", "owner": "braita88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060281165437800, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:37:58", "owner": "brunosgasques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074565850899478, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:25:51", "owner": "amon.serra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126918556435472, "text": "Be Like Poland! 🇵🇱❤️🇮🇹", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:48:11", "owner": "nik.z92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900936451281382, "text": "Bester mann", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:32:03", "owner": "flex_ibel94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056906573633310, "text": "Keep on keeping on brother💯❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:24:12", "owner": "exxiled1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073257700986258, "text": "Islam is a cancer", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:32:56", "owner": "maxstolyar1973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058275476541656, "text": "🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:59:45", "owner": "reber_burjus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945229818931737, "text": "🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:23:37", "owner": "cortez009_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059147462557289, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:37:54", "owner": "onyi_dc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093071137842531, "text": "👑🫡", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:15:47", "owner": "johnny_kreweta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1832299918324082