u think only Muslims are bad. In every Country, in every Religion have bad people. Being Bad is not belong to Religion.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:09:52", "owner": "mth_5r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105082021719864, "text": "Fuck the refugees, look at the UK right now, more crimes, more violence, more murders, more terrorism and more r@pes", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:51:59", "owner": "hnct27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869917231378478, "text": "🔥🔥👍", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:01:05", "owner": "umeshmishrajiindia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524762830057737, "text": "👍🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:46:32", "owner": "william7089309", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074057950944013, "text": "Shit ima need to move to Poland lol", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:35:30", "owner": "annelle_ayala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091128718841607, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:32:48", "owner": "ew.2672", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905792404124030, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:19:30", "owner": "scmishra2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901825756146234, "text": "The only thing the left can do is to outshame any person who openly stand against the Muslim and African invasion of Europe. I still need to see  that country who successfully has managed to integrate Muslims from the Middle East and Africa. It can’t be done simply by that cause, that they don’t come to be integrated and more important, they don’t want to be integrated. Europe has become so week. Our prisons in Denmark are overbooked by people from the Middle East and Africa. I wonder when our politicians wake up and acknowledge, that the disaster they continually contribute and approve to support, has caused Europe to be a place where crime and rape are taking over. Poland, you should be proud of yourself, for standing up against the insane and ridiculous left winged western world, that is destroying Europe.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:28:13", "owner": "rantzauphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310438675220867, "text": "Just be true Refugees become terrorist", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:24:56", "owner": "amasanmack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942881077068142, "text": "If you look at Mozambique, sudan and Nigeria, you will realize muslims is a threat🥺 Other religions see them as a threat because they really proof that", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:23:10", "owner": "ndiritu_robert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045324839418108, "text": "Mute all Muslims and depart then", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:30:54", "owner": "drewminous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097492705740515, "text": "Good Job Poland - fuck Islamcancer", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:30:47", "owner": "blacky8666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921626092169057, "text": "Congratulations you are now safe from Cancer", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:52:33", "owner": "raghavk619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973494432941930, "text": "This guy needs to educate all the Presidents to all countries. 🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:45:04", "owner": "jackmelch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536747011059173, "text": "GREAT LEADER!", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:34:25", "owner": "lde.carli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073218668189058, "text": "W POLAND", "created_at": "2025-10-13T21:15:35", "owner": "_gayest.gay.ever_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896709148322879, "text": "They are not refugees, they are time bombs which breads tiny time bombs in very short period.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:20:30", "owner": "gopalbhat16", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062704460131670, "text": "The world should deport all Muslims back to their Islamic countries unless they are willing to convert to Christianity.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:03:40", "owner": "pacz_38382024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531686305014097, "text": "Well done Poland", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:22:26", "owner": "alastairnelles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969798777953256, "text": "Good job Poland 🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:35:13", "owner": "miki.abramzon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097939759599666, "text": "❤️💯", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:10:39", "owner": "brado_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926241487011901, "text": "Protect this Man at all cost", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:36:15", "owner": "_iam_chinito", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079087436475832, "text": "They're not refugees! They're invaders.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:11:55", "owner": "lord__highlander", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090675448869657, "text": "Rispect ❤️ you save Poland 👍", "created_at": "2025-10-12T02:05:34", "owner": "sinhamanmohan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069671372252151, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:28:32", "owner": "lorin__tilipman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18264233920304873, "text": "World should follow poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:16:14", "owner": "nikbal101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031117877718820, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:04:57", "owner": "carolinaalarrosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066625394597275, "text": "Persevere!!!! You are saving your nation while any Other are being burnt....", "created_at": "2025-10-11T09:04:11", "owner": "ila_langia_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007347506802908, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:52:17", "owner": "nightowl8337", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18054823511633798, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:48:33", "owner": "nightowl8337", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069187316019977, "text": "He should be proud of that", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:42:13", "owner": "backinazmissingla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869943271446195, "text": "Im from Germany and Poland you have done it right! Great job neighbors", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:34:32", "owner": "rosasofialuisa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18390615064130846, "text": "Why you allow people to kick you  out of your country.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:24:13", "owner": "ohniix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083386409508555, "text": "Good job mr poland saver", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:06:03", "owner": "next_lvl_invest", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985480674855596, "text": "So proud of Poland! ❤️", "crea