text": "Love this! I wish UK was the same!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:35:18", "owner": "godataylor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069109181022748, "text": "@paramvirjolly absolutely correct!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:28:30", "owner": "bhatiapriya15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917539687056102, "text": "🇵🇱👍🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:26:35", "owner": "eliachristofel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068625536029328, "text": "For me as Muslims i agree with it cause i think immigration from middle east and Africa cause problems and issues but it wasn’t necessary to mention and accusing a whole religion over a ppl nobody represents islam  or any religions !!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:17:58", "owner": "aggameingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177508252351941, "text": "And for this lady to sit here and like she’s doing something special baby girl you’re not doing anything special because number one it wasn’t created for us to be taken in people just because they have a skin colour no it was never created like that not everyone is that stupid to be taking everyone not everyone is that stupid to be Ensuring that their country is destroyed and everything no it’s only European countries that we just accept anyone because the person who just come in through the border that’s the truth in reality when God gave us our own countries. Why did we even leave our countries to be going to random countries", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:04:22", "owner": "tomii_1500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192017215324924, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-10T04:57:19", "owner": "abricklife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084520672756384, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:59:27", "owner": "mr.tall__6.0ft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069256793249909, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:56:54", "owner": "a.k.a.s.h.hh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067430489585958, "text": "❤️❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:52:14", "owner": "apu_r_ba_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040440206682969, "text": "Leftists are crying watching this", "created_at": "2025-10-10T01:14:14", "owner": "mb_1.8_ax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892916215342762, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-10T01:00:26", "owner": "yashh.is.me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531706993022041, "text": "Bravo you have done a great job", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:36:18", "owner": "eldiwan.panca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986675037733455, "text": "🙌🇵🇱❤️ Really Proud moment for entire Poland…. 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:26:40", "owner": "life_of_vnk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972641982791012, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:16:26", "owner": "nick_burgin_writer_and_chef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915541177067302, "text": "Bravo!!!👏 The", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:08:01", "owner": "familiaharasymiw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053718671281368, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:22:27", "owner": "mantelissz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147725437417324, "text": "🙌💯", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:18:49", "owner": "sanskritibehera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983816703745025, "text": "☪️ With ✝️, Problems\n☪️ With ✡️, Problems \n☪️ With 🕉️, Problems \n☪️ With 🪯, Problems \n☪️ With ☪️, Problems\nWho is a BIG problem for the world 🌍?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:03:16", "owner": "ripalshivam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865156723470647, "text": "E assim a Polônia será a próxima potência da Europa!", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:06:07", "owner": "brunabar28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080850695069376, "text": "🇵🇱💯👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:02:37", "owner": "brunabar28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073608613933703, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:52:39", "owner": "gwendolynkay55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099722194658824, "text": "ادععععععم", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:10:55", "owner": "bero20.05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070201685260914, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:10:44", "owner": "daniela.matos.549", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104565373717478, "text": "🇵🇱👍🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:42:18", "owner": "atha.pn", "lik