516, "text": "Real leadership", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:52:27", "owner": "sir_patrickdavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880915564285706, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:30:38", "owner": "luca.bernaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002664014656873, "text": "protect this man !", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:55:57", "owner": "chesed.aline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110010508499101, "text": "Unlike here in Canada. I'm not against it, but the way they did it is destroying the country.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:20:20", "owner": "papa_swed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095054857748307, "text": "🇵🇱💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:20:08", "owner": "raphax_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078603010860920, "text": "Legend 🔥🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:06:32", "owner": "pepebike29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889567135360927, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-09T10:39:03", "owner": "tanmayyharitwal8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098790973731758, "text": "As it were true", "created_at": "2025-10-09T10:34:41", "owner": "_alexanderdegreat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065489429580466, "text": "He is right 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-09T10:21:17", "owner": "papiya__14700", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979635009764668, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-09T10:09:03", "owner": "tall.can.killer2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004264163813443, "text": "Poland is going on right path, they have rights to not allow to enter muslim refugees in their country, we support Poland 👍🔥❤️.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T10:03:31", "owner": "bhupesh24555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857643769533649, "text": "How many refugees she has in her home?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:49:34", "owner": "horriblestoryteller", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081622630986636, "text": "Muslim countries should also take refugees", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:43:54", "owner": "miss_lababe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936086040963279, "text": "🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:25:04", "owner": "abilityoflife10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965971077973058, "text": "@franklin_graham @jewishlifenow @jewishbreakingnews @jewish_voice @jewish_media", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:19:46", "owner": "infinitehesedwingmen777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092855020692192, "text": "@ianivon @vickylal577 @bennyjohnson @rossjohnstonn @markdriscoll", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:18:54", "owner": "infinitehesedwingmen777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121872187507819, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:18:11", "owner": "coldblooded_foryou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940576093079483, "text": "@matejovaanna @cafe.connect.hamilton @tiffany_blackwell_ @pastorpetrus @elijahchapman187", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:18:07", "owner": "infinitehesedwingmen777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208243471308810, "text": "They took in Ukrainian refugees. That’s normal. Ukraine is a neighboring country going through a war. Why won’t Egypt take refugees from Gaza?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:17:04", "owner": "bajw.oooz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529935229026470, "text": "@elonfromearth2 @presidentmnangagwa", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:14:59", "owner": "infinitehesedwingmen777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120426100509537, "text": "@b.netanyahu @emmanuelmacron @rishisunakmp @potus @realdonaldtrump @donaldjtrumpjr @erictrump @ivankatrump @flotus @melaniatrump @billmaher", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:11:29", "owner": "infinitehesedwingmen777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080021135289116, "text": "Ye fk muslims", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:05:10", "owner": "bajraktarovv.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007779926815777, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:04:22", "owner": "willz_710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062643455529778, "text": "🇸🇨🥰🇮🇱🥰🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:45:14", "owner": "waseemwasan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056136362208767, "text": "You go Poland if u have to be racist you go", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:31:35", "owner": "fil.artstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093034072773831, "text": "That is a man that loves his country, can’t say the same for our leaders", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:21:54", "owner": "xandrew._.tate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058474838631086, "text": "Respect from India 🇮🇳🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:06:32", "owner": "rishi_tisside", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082286155804058, "text": "Why not go to muslim countries where is ummah brotherhood", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:50:47", "owner": "sushanjit_thefreak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890526670353760, "text": "Good kept the devil out of Poland!  They were the first to be attacked in WW2 so NO MORE", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:25:02", "owner": "rhinestonebae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925729582014864, "text": "I wish all developed countries follow the same path there is no need to grant refuge to these third world a** holes just don't do it they create problem in their own country and then ask for asylum in developed countries like as if they were the reason for their self made nuisance. Why for what reason to turn these countries also like theirs? Tell them to improve their own country and leave their happily. They shit that they have created is not the problem of Europeans or any countries there asking for asylum in Suno need to grant them refuge if they belong to third world Muslim shitholes or from South Asia or Africa. Save ur country by your own. Have enough kids. Elect good leaders if they are greedy and destroying their country by allowing mass immigration and refugees for their own benefit just execute them. People are the power of their country it is for all Europeans, Americans, canadians australians everyone. Don't give these f****** idiots refuge in your country don't allow these immigrants for any purpose in your Nation. You are not the reason for their problems you don't need to be worthy for it. Become like Poland think of your people and your country or else you also be doomed like they did to Iran. Plz wake up don't let your country die. Long live Poland🇵🇱 from Israel 🇮🇱👍🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:07:24", "owner": "am_dizzy", "likes": 1},