7739547701, "text": "Is he proud of that course he fucking is UK should be the same", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:59:31", "owner": "decharrison369", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17887634289364289, "text": "🇻🇦🇻🇦🇻🇦", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:55:26", "owner": "matheus_campinho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092708449744849, "text": "We need him in canada and the US", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:46:59", "owner": "lilcsmoke357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856502215477318, "text": "Facts", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:46:39", "owner": "lilcsmoke357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060788639388806, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:36:04", "owner": "haendel.verissimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845578681565958, "text": "God bless Poland and their leader 💯❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:23:03", "owner": "matar.naguib", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083315411486621, "text": "Good on Poland 🇵🇱 that's what Great Britain 🇬🇧 should be like", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:55:22", "owner": "michellenewman2208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078014032846983, "text": "Respect 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:28:00", "owner": "meetsu03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323025106214164, "text": "They way it should be 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:27:10", "owner": "alex.lloyd21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858529018525449, "text": "He’s choosing to not let in illegal immigrants in for the safety of others and I don’t think that’s an issue whatsoever", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:09:30", "owner": "absilvers", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057708884403900, "text": "Netherlands should learn from poland", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:41:44", "owner": "briddlenettle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071269232246445, "text": "❤️❤️🔥👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:41:18", "owner": "kejtikate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068994188264551, "text": "Learn from him how to keep our own people from this insanity 🔥🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:17:29", "owner": "sibiljohnkuruvila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098819593568821, "text": "🔥🙌👏🇿🇦", "created_at": "2025-