d. Lucky polish to have good politicians", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:35:06", "owner": "raj_blocks_chennai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134883568454347, "text": "Wanna be our prime minister of Canada? We could use this man", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:28:39", "owner": "james_nagy1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982080519867497, "text": "Poland: ☪️ancer free country", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:16:35", "owner": "sandesh_p_p", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18387620923131977, "text": "Wish Greece was like Poland to", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:08:32", "owner": "naoum.ps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856591573536898, "text": "𝐃𝐎𝐍'𝐓 𝐀𝐅𝐑𝐀𝐈𝐃 𝐓𝐎 𝐒𝐀𝐘 𝐓𝐇𝐀𝐓 𝐘𝐎𝐔 𝐀𝐑𝐄 𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐈𝐒𝐓𝐒! 𝐘𝐎𝐔 𝐎𝐍𝐋𝐘 𝐂𝐀𝐑𝐄 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐂𝐔𝐋𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐄 𝐀𝐍𝐃 𝐏𝐄𝐀𝐂𝐄! 👍💯", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:52:19", "owner": "rubylovebabymochi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106328134525207, "text": "𝐁𝐑𝐀𝐕𝐎 𝐏𝐎𝐋𝐀𝐍𝐃🔥🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:51:04", "owner": "rubylovebabymochi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075352571135553, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:39:21", "owner": "vishskarma88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107880520574537, "text": "Isn’t this the same interviewer who got destroyed by Jordan Peterson?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:31:53", "owner": "zee.s101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119646289514038, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌 💯💯💯💯💯 I’m not from Poland ! But this guy i think do great job there !", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:31:11", "owner": "florin_toda_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078626255047225, "text": "Massive respect 🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:13:18", "owner": "i.surajsinghh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179893414339712, "text": "Europe needs more leaders like this bloody Islamist refugees should be sent to their fav place gaza 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:10:48", "owner": "amrit._.patra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063559901616656, "text": "Can I have this president in Aus?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:49:34", "owner": "vincent_chong23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095620429706604, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:18:57", "owner": "horizin_official", "li