rzo_whooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912087427220591, "text": "That's what happens when you are busy with birth control while muslims don't embrace such things. At the end of the day they're all eventually counted as people not as muslims", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:11:58", "owner": "martycolney", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18378540766180179, "text": "🇵🇱 long live Poland 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:59:11", "owner": "imjyotirmy", "likes": 152}, {"id": 17955206474877210, "text": "Do they accept Americans?", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:49:06", "owner": "keagan_wagner02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358083349091065, "text": "He's not racist for wanting to keep Islam from taking them over.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:42:06", "owner": "ladyjen47", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098620930578651, "text": "Bravooooo Poland is saved", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:00:34", "owner": "pinko_gang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949778983016592, "text": "Europe needs to increase its birth rate not through immigration, but by encouraging European people themselves to have more children🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:27:25", "owner": "aidanataniyeva", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17946529134026787, "text": "1 place for truoth", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:23:44", "owner": "kurlinkusmarius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015497276784176, "text": "Now that's what you call a leader", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:36:11", "owner": "luke.beckett2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038240060703842, "text": "It’s not racism, it’s protecting.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:09:31", "owner": "kianthelegend0102", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17918364273050101, "text": "They always use the racist card 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:46:27", "owner": "rasmussebastiaan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862751956482534, "text": "Κατάλαβες μωρη Καριόλα;", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:34:12", "owner": "mixalis.boydas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073928348137938, "text": "Legend 🙌 🇵🇱🫶", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:31:57", "owner": "never.caught", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18506976013065983, "text": "Kathy Newman can eat 💩 Poland based asf!👍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:30:50", "owner": "fury.jeff", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079239875078861, "text": "Poland implemented the correct immigration policy to protect is nation. If only we had followed the same blueprint our streets would be as safe as those in Poland🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:27:42", "owner": "markanthonynutter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18388061695131203, "text": "Poland Forever 🇵🇱🫡 This is the epitome of a legendary leader!!! England 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿 stands with Poland 🇵🇱 😎💪", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:56:40", "owner": "gentlemen_london_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17983704119745588, "text": "👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:38:21", "owner": "thavisup.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922988047151806, "text": "Dlaczego dla Wszystkich to takie dziwne że Polacy chcą się bić za Polskę ???? Dlaczego nie wierzycie że potrafimy obronić własny kraj przed imigrantami i chorą polityką EU …. Dlaczego wierzycie że Rosja chce z Polską walczyć ???? Piekło dzieje się w Ukrainie ( choć nie dla wszystkich obywateli 😏) … Rosja to atomowe mocarstwo … to miliony ludzi którzy też się boją wojny !!! To tysiące rodzin które opłakują swoich żołnierzy … dlaczego My Polacy pomagając Ukrainie mamy większy respekt do Rosjan ( większość !!!!) … zadajcie sobie pytanie ????", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:36:29", "owner": "kuba92270", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077989504842659, "text": "@flavio_fanc @lorenzo_ascia011 @gioele.marinetti", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:27:53", "owner": "cri_r_1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042654188442952, "text": "Poland is right ❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:17:14", "owner": "paulafn10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972877377790721, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:04:17", "owner": "lalit.biswas.56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100193899651134, "text": "He's racist!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:55:07", "owner": "drdoowittlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910386091231529, "text": "I wish germany would see it the same way, well done neighbour👍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:52:12", "owner": "juleka2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044456876676817, "text": "👍👍👍👍👍👍👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:50:17", "owner": "rambojames95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968515122950234, "text": "Strong 💪🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:42:38", "owner": "v.streha21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098290168730232, "text": "Fu*k Israel", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:30:29", "owner": "maddy_official6_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884736826385081, "text": "Respect", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:28:37", "owner": "inathan198", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909591526240669, "text": "🫡🫡🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:50:33", "owner": "jonathanadadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079300985080596, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:46:15", "owner": "dipsbhakat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998921982822700, "text": "Poland is the smartest one. They refuse the plaque and now they are saved.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:43:46", "owner": "naomi_septina", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070090733204656, "text": "Smart man 🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:43:06", "owner": "jarjarbinksbabiuch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843141481584208, "text": "We definitely hacw", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:28:07", "owner": "jackie.murphy.77398", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976516860931923, "text": "Yess poland keep going.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:22:57", "owner": "random_player34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090195466847976, "text": "🇵🇱💯🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:20:35", "owner": "edvin__tr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067643501244717, "text": "How every country should be", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:01:17", "owner": "shrowdedvoid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093821545773189, "text": "🇵🇱💯🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:40:13", "owner": "crazyforporsche_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890583595351003, "text": "Tell it how it is", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:39:22", "owner": "xx_rivas_syndicate_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188340586331666, "text": "💯", "c