"id": 17923835385119212, "text": "On jest faszystom", "created_at": "2025-10-06T08:21:35", "owner": "better_be_a_beauty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070406909187053, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️ mi hermoso país ! Estoy aquí de vacaciones, y es cierto, seguridad, en unos días vuelvo a España donde tengo una mezquita en mi edificio ! En fin", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:59:51", "owner": "karolinateresa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153399769363503, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:54:45", "owner": "yldo.mov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072538913184303, "text": "Such a sick ppl💀", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:47:38", "owner": "aws.bani_abdo2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972466476791443, "text": "What a G🔥💯", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:20:32", "owner": "j_k_t07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081374276480232, "text": "Be like Britain fuck other countries with Islam for your benefits.and ignor karma", "created_at": "2025-10-06T07:06:55", "owner": "0_amirhosain_abbasi_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086993332902540, "text": "Proper", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:55:57", "owner": "romanwhyte_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285776587272290, "text": "Poland is in safe hands. 👍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:50:49", "owner": "_its.bin.dyaa_", "likes": 33}, {"id": 17997873950681720, "text": "Need him in every non muslim country!!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:42:41", "owner": "hoba_world18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109558861571359, "text": "America listen up", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:41:45", "owner": "suleik_nuaman", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077399306471369, "text": "And yet they have millions of emigrants around the world", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:08:26", "owner": "ranveermrahar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925452622117581, "text": "This man should be employed in the UK. He is a true leader that actualy takes care of his country and citizens. Poland may be the only country whose government that actualy works in favor of the people and listens to them. We need more leaders like him in the world🇵🇱✝️", "created