it", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112980604543645, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-06T03:11:32", "owner": "_johnsjackson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079796003062544, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:40:40", "owner": "habla.carlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100678588626519, "text": "There’s a reason why immigrants move to such high countries. Maybe go fix your own government first before bringing your shit elsewhere", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:39:45", "owner": "bunny_babiess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127934656485925, "text": "🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:16:53", "owner": "kovalenk0_vitya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080567483074943, "text": "Nice move Poland", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:04:32", "owner": "antzdrei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150095680370358, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:55:05", "owner": "saints_heck_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127270054473891, "text": "love this man 👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱 he's not racist just doesn't want 🐀 in his country 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:23:36", "owner": "josephinehendren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007623575810073, "text": "🇵🇱💯👏", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:11:48", "owner": "lenabntl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895022107325235, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T00:46:51", "owner": "dennisgarciaguillen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139669435437128, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T00:29:47", "owner": "lampo_art_world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073782010918437, "text": "Should do the same in Canada! Too late now", "created_at": "2025-10-06T00:23:27", "owner": "ogravel87", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18529862266007911, "text": "Respect 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:30:23", "owner": "rachefdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100866700647454, "text": "Well said mate ✅", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:27:31", "owner": "deivid1oliveira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18485797690076177, "text": "ISLAM IS NOT A RACE. Why do people keep saying this shit", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:18:27", "owner": "jkjeep_girl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 181475893334110