, "owner": "kws2909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151022263410379, "text": "👍Respect for poland🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:42:22", "owner": "jxtin_46uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907761994249541, "text": "This is why Poland is safe.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:41:20", "owner": "craig_lacrosse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054668960646737, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:40:43", "owner": "pankokatya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968988747806480, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:28:29", "owner": "kingnahui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080937901822382, "text": "Save europe", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:26:50", "owner": "odinn_johanneson", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17953836719877728, "text": "🇵🇱🤜🤛🇨🇿 Tohle přemýšlení bychom potřebovali i u nás v Česku...", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:56:27", "owner": "zelko_r53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924885898148486, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:39:41", "owner": "dhruvtripathi2008", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113456791548537, "text": "They are refugees at first ...all of them ...they have muslim contries ...be refugees over there😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:22:06", "owner": "vidyutdeshmukh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056404421550582, "text": "There are around 2.3 billion Christians and about 2 billion Muslims in the world. Do you really think we can generalize and put everyone in the same box? What ignorance…!!!\n\nI honestly feel sorry for humanity, it’s just sad. \n\nHow many Christians have committed horrific crimes like pedophilia and others? \nImagine if someone said Christians were not allowed in a country, it would be outrageous. \n\nI’ve traveled to many Muslim countries and was always treated with kindness and respect. I only met wonderful people❤️ \n\nShame on this kind of speech!! it only serves to divide us and normalize hate. We should be uniting as a species, respecting each other’s differences. We are all brothers and sisters, sharing one planet and one brief lifetime in these bodies. Why waste that precious time on discrimination and hatred towards  each other ?!?!?!\n\nWake up, poor in spirit. Leave the mind and return to the heart❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:18:04", "owner": "joana_cambra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922731679156694, "text": "❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:50:33", "owner": "athena_g88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067938833257374, "text": "It is not safe", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:42:33", "owner": "ericartman9999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094755793739845, "text": "Uhm OK sure while Russia is litteraly attacking Poland because of the Ukrainians there", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:42:26", "owner": "ericartman9999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082406227783776, "text": "This fking English woman is insufferable. Tell her if she's so adamant to house some Muslim refugees in her own home for fks sake", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:31:08", "owner": "koreedaze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079545794044868, "text": "Love this", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:28:29", "owner": "yoshiskyblue7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842953600588160, "text": "This is what happens when Conservatives are in charge!!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:56:56", "owner": "lawrence.klein.739", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896986807301993, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:55:09", "owner": "_raphaelo_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102632551620420, "text": "Whoever bring Muslim to his country, gonna eat shit is life going down", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:48:10", "owner": "biton4786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286121680279641, "text": "I don't get what starmer finds so hard about this", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:43:07", "owner": "backwheeljamezey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18308276182219221, "text": "👍🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:36:41", "owner": "glaxsyy.__sid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040163837470663, "text": "Every indian dream PM 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:19:25", "owner": "hardychiku86", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057127955196538, "text": "Who wants to go to poland lol😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:10:12", "