2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057660146208942, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:29:16", "owner": "shibekbrat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028014341734032, "text": "🇲🇦🙂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:15:59", "owner": "sovnaz_1943", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104294671610692, "text": "If she’s referring to Arab refugees they have other Arab nations to go to, its not another country’s job to look after another country’s civilians because they failed to protect, support, & aid their own people.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:02:55", "owner": "borgora39", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18070918985231977, "text": "Hea so right though.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:56:20", "owner": "wkdarling_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861914641491146, "text": "Is that Poland or Germany?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:53:12", "owner": "kost.rou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176407372351436, "text": "Why don’t they take some of our homeless to Muslim countries", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:51:03", "owner": "dvanbreda13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419611876108389, "text": "Portugal should be like poland😔", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:47:27", "owner": "togui.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975379722938292, "text": "♥️🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏♥️", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:26:40", "owner": "hugo__andrade_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097298833709387, "text": "Polska górą 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:26:18", "owner": "00li_pv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139411555440357, "text": "💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:26:08", "owner": "a_man_khan3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883065607389821, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:26:08", "owner": "a_man_khan3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845453818580760, "text": "💯💯🇵🇱💯💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:26:07", "owner": "a_man_khan3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962884713995050, "text": "💯💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:26:05", "owner": "a_man_khan3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080682317056026, "text": "💯🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:26:04", "owner": "a_man_khan3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 178643236