": "Good to see America is starting to take the same approach.  Fucking sick of being invaded.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:38:15", "owner": "nealplaysdrums", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880647877285898, "text": "🇵🇱👍👍👍👍💯💯💯👏👏👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:17:18", "owner": "mtlcargeek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054131573268474, "text": "🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:15:57", "owner": "mr_kurugodu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059424089632177, "text": "Day 1 of randomly commenting everything so I can grow followers and talk with Emma Watson", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:07:58", "owner": "joyce.johnson01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992105178847195, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:07:37", "owner": "angelaortizn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103079941615671, "text": "Wait till you find out Christianity has one of the highest crime rates", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:04:25", "owner": "drawingenjoyer67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003755729805017, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱💯💯", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:03:26", "owner": "robinvrz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085834177732099, "text": "💯💯🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:01:38", "owner": "koshy_abraham_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055411964217837, "text": "Yeah we are selfish... and?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:57:50", "owner": "arthur.lobo.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079837394486064, "text": "Muslim countries like Saudi Arabia and Iran are so big. They should be the ones taking all these refugees.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:48:47", "owner": "herton_nva", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067746188342237, "text": "Maturity is when you realise he is right 🇵🇱 \nIts good to be racists if it is saving the nation", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:46:46", "owner": "joy_ghosh10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524759611012648, "text": "So proud of you sir.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:37:30", "owner": "black_year_my_country", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169103842365707, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:31:26", "owner": "santeclause1375", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1