n__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086626786931695, "text": "Of course. He has to be proud of not succumbing to the dirty woke tactic of cancellation by labeling.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:16:56", "owner": "joeltan28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089759347676300, "text": "RESPECT FROM ITALY 🇮🇹🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:46:40", "owner": "matteooturla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890163964349934, "text": "💯💯", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:45:50", "owner": "foodiee.boy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852340666556013, "text": "they shouldve rejected ukrainians too then it would be perfect", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:41:38", "owner": "vtkuba929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998184312676742, "text": "Proud of Poland! Unfortunately, in Romania, people are too \"mind open\" to see the future risks!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:35:13", "owner": "relluscurtu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079388243077685, "text": "Ukrainians are refugees too. They just happen not to be so african or muslim.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:24:49", "owner": "se.ma7761", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863034481476065, "text": "Welldone Poland stick to ur standards it's ur country and have the rite to decide what y want.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:24:46", "owner": "wezadewitt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860813530500013, "text": "Don't let these backward terrorist rapist god worshipers in your country", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:15:38", "owner": "alimong_anar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121552333501207, "text": "I love poland and its People 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:15:05", "owner": "tommiemartinsson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983596860857033, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱learn from poland", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:14:48", "owner": "alimong_anar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179046979349184, "text": "Respect from bharat 🗿🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:00:15", "owner": "sujal_soni_2610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852221440511524, "text": "A Government that listens to its people???? What's that???? Kier Starmer called His own people Naz1s, because (as We chanted proudly) Keir Starmers a W@nker!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:00:00", "owner": "normal.in.my.day", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862328005482021, "text": "Make this man president of the EU .🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:52:18", "owner": "autotechmerchtem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907773868246599, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:51:22", "owner": "hansdahlgren7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883290391386132, "text": "🔥🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:51:20", "owner": "hansdahlgren7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085231513937941, "text": "Make this man president of EU", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:39:01", "owner": "vik.gly_22", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863519740415958, "text": "Voglio vivere in Polonia 🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:37:48", "owner": "_mirco_2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063069773525232, "text": "Respect 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:36:15", "owner": "tanayapsugre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045951299350610, "text": "L poland", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:31:48", "owner": "th3_b0sni4n_d4ddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843166915590224, "text": "“AnD yOuR’e PrOuD oF tHaT?”\nYES 👍", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:30:55", "owner": "steve.cator94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065574392591595, "text": "🇵🇱💯❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:26:21", "owner": "ass_mylife_goes_on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024251513756988, "text": "Man of honor!", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:24:29", "owner": "jmoriaty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952180084013880, "text": "I would be proud if the entire Europe will be like this but it's good that even a few have waked up and try to save the christians", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:23:14", "owner": "whos_nicolae_frisca", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081362218799295, "text": "W Poland 🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:18:56", "owner": "arenking999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077900759104067, "text": "Some country destroy peace of poland . Beacaus they are jealous .", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:16:53", "owner": "kajalbarman5944", "l