efugees or immigrants from muslim country to expansion their land cos they know what the cost and consequences they're going through.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:46:38", "owner": "licasyaparamita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988484805851916, "text": "People should really be asking themselves why other Arab countries won’t take Palestinians", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:42:35", "owner": "outofcoffeeoutofmind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912171085214394, "text": "He should be fucking proud...The west doesn't have the balls to make big decisions. 🫡🇮🇳🧡🙇", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:31:52", "owner": "kalakarpaddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535485106015629, "text": "☪️ancer ☪️ommunity 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:25:44", "owner": "kamal_pbx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081253015987890, "text": "Poland sounds fucking awesome 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:33:24", "owner": "dylantom123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124389274494523, "text": "Poland should take Germany over 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:29:22", "owner": "koenigsliebchen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078581726090440, "text": "wie gut es sich anfühlen muss, einen staat zu haben der fürs volk ist.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:25:07", "owner": "michellefrlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999678243819814, "text": "Polish refugees were protected by maharaja of navanagar. Be safe dear always. Maharaja dint save children to be attacked by refugees today.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:12:16", "owner": "arpita.singh.16100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389212879123340, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:11:52", "owner": "khlortra.w1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961852674986269, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:08:36", "owner": "dramxib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972838929930261, "text": "Herooo💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:01:17", "owner": "bohemian_venom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878468497408786, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:47:10", "owner": "nordmarkmaria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096494179676169, "text": "More of this!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:45:31", "owner": "berwickrandalyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008927711799809, "text": "Proud of Poland but they have refugees", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:27:45", "owner": "leoncsv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18312605065173047, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:16:44", "owner": "shoorsaini_gurdan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991690497841863, "text": "Well done!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:41:26", "owner": "baaaaaar63829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083987215933111, "text": "🇵🇱❤️🙌👍💯 thats true!! Look how peaceful in poland.  There are only few terrorist might have gotten away  then created organized group.  Thats why few innocent arab muslim people . Affected to the crime created by few terrorists.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:34:57", "owner": "devtravels2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038710946484299, "text": "Great president", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:33:24", "owner": "sunithaanish9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033504542707645, "text": "Yes, he is proud 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:29:17", "owner": "prakashraghuvanshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178587664343376, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:23:43", "owner": "themystique10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030775805721479, "text": "Agreed button 🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:08:55", "owner": "arayakevin95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022642130755639, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:00:00", "owner": "_keshav_gour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860845303436525, "text": "Refugees are the meaning of illegal, when someone is not ready to have their own land why did they born, why should western nations takes muslim refugees when there are 50+ muslim nations why don't they go and die there, why they do need to western nations, shameless religion are like bed bugs if you leave one, it kills your own family peace because they grow in crores in a year", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:50:07", "owner": "madhu.m.s.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068569298005327, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-