es": 1}, {"id": 17930591061104166, "text": "👏 Stand Proud , let them call you a racist it is unavoidable if you are White. Big Balls in Poland", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:59:46", "owner": "woodslut1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862779838424440, "text": "Fuck yeah Poland keep it up", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:08:45", "owner": "sasquatch8668", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088173646684582, "text": "CANADA needs to listen and follow the path of POLAND. This is very true. You can enjoy the night life without any dangers! 💯", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:05:50", "owner": "_a.tags", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087094918849809, "text": "I can't stand this woman i vote to be more like Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:51:03", "owner": "wayneflinter123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942993469059784, "text": "🇵🇱❤️🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:46:07", "owner": "honza.mach11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937762834076122, "text": "Estou com os polacos e eles é que têm RAZÃO 👍👍👍👍 CHEGA DE MERDAS E VAMOS SER SINCEROS , ESSA MULHER INGLESA NAO DEVE TER FILHOS DE CERTEZA 👍💯👍💯 POR ISSO É QUE INGLATERRA ESTA COMO ESTA👍💯💯👍💯", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:13:35", "owner": "22jferreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861959371483996, "text": "They use these useful ldiots to insult and call people racists that don't want mass immigration", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:13:05", "owner": "stemmyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075935023887668, "text": "Well said!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:08:06", "owner": "mar.marvellous.creations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532199050054038, "text": "30 years ago half of Poland didn't have enough food on the table and now they asking to feed undocumented people. That is the most racist thing I have heard in my life.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:04:07", "owner": "aprilistirsvmille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042812423431443, "text": "👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:02:43", "owner": "selenaisabella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922408369159423, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20