": "suzy1911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922206661156275, "text": "Boo Hoo 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:31:30", "owner": "rimracer21", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18153852892393903, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:21:22", "owner": "mileniaanggrayni", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079758026077128, "text": "Turkey is transporter of refugees in to Europe 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:09:40", "owner": "vidhuran.men", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124260127495364, "text": "Respects from Turkey. Who thinks he is wrong can come to Turkey. Our borders open for all.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:54:35", "owner": "garuk_yildirim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076039216881104, "text": "Be like Poland", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:53:21", "owner": "klevans27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048465587330421, "text": "🔥🔥🔥💯💯", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:46:33", "owner": "cordex_edgar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126195094434412, "text": "Biswa sab inke jaise hi h👍💯", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:32:34", "owner": "atul.kansal.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989332572720019, "text": "Like yeah, just flood over here and set up your own country then, I guess. If you don’t like your own, you should just be able to get fully funded to move to a developed country and start living better than its own inhabitants?! Why should any be coming at all? If there’s so many it’s a full out war, you don’t evacuate everybody. Fight your war, whatever you got going on needs to get worked out, not spread around to more civilized places that have never seen anything like that. I think a bunch of real actual Canadians should claim refugee status back where we came from. Just take as much back from this land as we can and go back to Germany or Ireland or Norway. We should all be multimillionaire refugees trying to get someplace safe outside of Canada, with money and like-minded values to contribute when we get there.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:48:21", "owner": "brandingoeatyourbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058128074405717, "text": "He’s right, though! Don’t expect your problems to be my problems. Go off and figure it out. It’s not normal to be coming this far.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:38:25", "owner": "brandingoeatyourbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129797200473787, "text": "But they took in Ukrainian refugees so really they did take in refugees or does this not count because Ukrainians are white?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:10:33", "owner": "wolfgang_thecollector", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056300552222350, "text": "God bless Poland", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:05:36", "owner": "engrokoludo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029144510520534, "text": "Now you understand Israel?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:18:46", "owner": "offir.av", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076056253891727, "text": "Difference between refugees and illegals. Refugees are fleeing from a war torn country because they have to, whereas illegals wanna mooch off benefits and not contribute a single fucking thing", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:17:03", "owner": "peterandleestudios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875999920413377, "text": "Bravo !Will done!👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:13:38", "owner": "menkulasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867422566389568, "text": "That's why UK has most of the Polish people eh? Because the country is so good and protected. Polish governemnt helps no one not even on its own.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:50:53", "owner": "silhouettemermaid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083799724932390, "text": "🇵🇱🔥👍", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:46:53", "owner": "z0si4_s4m0si4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918629245187767, "text": "Smart,imagine not even one terrorist attack🇵🇱🙌🙌🔥👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:22:49", "owner": "f4ck_life.0783", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066382100054595, "text": "Well done 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:10:42", "owner": "pnwgold", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057502796538025, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:59:08", "owner": "i_m_skumar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059040728574843, "text": "👏👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:55:55", "owner": "saraybenamram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861449356487444, "text": "Shame on you interviewer...", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:53:57", "owner": "alexander_salim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913951819198373, "text": "Stop interfering other country's kitchen", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:53:32", "owner": "alexander_salim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842734009586139, "text": "Man... Poland sounds great 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:36:41", "owner": "mr_autoglass_pimp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535568629005756, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:00:07", "owner": "mirianstumpfboff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040961231451594, "text": "stoję z Polską", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:47:56", "owner": "trinniee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064980629597421, "text": "Australia needs this guy", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:45:51", "owner": "clintcutts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961396317839600, "text": "Poland is amazing! I’ve been to Gdynia, Gdansk and Warsaw and i can assure that there’s no other country like Poland. Nice people, nice places to go and very nice parties 😂 much love from Brazil 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:37:31", "owner": "nomadlifeigor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859921954506601, "text": "pack your bags, we’re LEGALLY moving to poland!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:20:22", "owner": "courts2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306916648216958, "text": "Respect from Romania 🇷🇴", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:13:54", "owner": "loby.sw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098390950732525, "text": "Polonia ya no quiere invasiones...", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:55:07", "owner": "carlosdanieltravieso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096622726661703, "text": "India is with 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:48:26", "owner": "mewithadhdandautism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073027223470068, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:30:54", "owner": "iamfarzanerezaaee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401237854190606, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:29:32", "owner": "juliafloridahome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928404118127764, "text": "❤️❤️👍👍", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:14:44", "owner": "harshalthakare88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070694591517753, "text": "Yeah, they are working, but for Poland it is not anough and today they are talking for all ukrainian - \"wypierdalay z polski\", that's mean - go to home. That is realyty. And it's wery bad situation.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:12:42", "owner": "romerovych", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090485434832551, "text": "Can I go to Poland serious question", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:02:53", "owner": "alex.morel.161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343493647160959, "text": "Very brave man bravo 👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:46:27", "owner": "ar_senio5251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886245769367007, "text": "and you can see the results of that, Poland is a safe and sound country.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:37:03", "owner": "ohlavracleirbag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096656062710523, "text": "This is why Poland is so safe🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:04:07", "owner": "bahniman_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081771914504377, "text": "and now the rest of Europe is suffering💯💯", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:38:36", "owner": "presidenniba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992869749702209, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:36:51", "owner": "_arkajit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139664551431626, "text": "🔥💯", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:27:34", "owner": "deanoazul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058632782162542, "text": "God bless Poland", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:14:23", "owner": "yuriy2359", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058614962575461, "text": "Jean Claude Juncker is a joke 😂 This guy has no balls.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:51:27", "owner": "jozekmu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099507868570121, "text": "The Poland is one real europian country right now in Eu. 🙌 Respect to Poland!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:27:35", "owner": "irakli_lomia_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18076785715863879, "text": "I stand with Poland . Other countries need to follow suit.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:10:44", "owner": "tara.goins.315", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17895299040326549, "text": "Esa gente no son refugiados están creando una ocupación 🤬🤬😡", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:47:00", "owner": "lmarin2707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043553891400937, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:46:22", "owner": "lmarin2707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400278895184880, "text": "olha a jornautista canhota nervosa, agressiva…", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:35:08", "owner": "tom_saboia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083481368298106, "text": "Poland has plenty of room because all their lot are still here in the U.K.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T07:31:19", "owner": "richtrett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080177501318800, "text": "É fácil chamar os outros de racistas .... quero ver é garantir que seu país esteja com a paz garantida para toda a população sendo da polonia ou imigrante", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:44:30", "owner": "marcellorodriguescruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923362537148678, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:31:19", "owner": "is_sh_zn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885173551376401, "text": "Proud of my country 🇵🇱🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:23:58", "owner": "emzzz.pl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083659537757514, "text": "They re not happy in they country and thats why they going to your country for make A muslim country in your land", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:02:37", "owner": "molux_alifuros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080709149484153, "text": "why he had obligation to receive refugees???", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:38:15", "owner": "blieveart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908791306236361, "text": "Don't tell muslims the terrorist 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:12:48", "owner": "i_m_bkv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073375976128065, "text": "💯💯👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:12:14", "owner": "avdhesh143sharma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201819625313382, "text": "Brawo!! I am SO damn proud of my fellow Pols! Tylko żeby tak dalej!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:13:00", "owner": "ideas_with_impact_podcast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186452638335116, "text": "Muy bien dicho.No te eches para atrás.Los africanos, musulmanes y homosexuales,quieren destruir, nuestra sociedad Cristiana.No lo permitiremos.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:18:54", "owner": "divaldez850", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068582048521285, "text": "We need to take a page from that book!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:11:31", "owner": "nicolaiquezada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18219429679307339, "text": "🇵🇱❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:02:40", "owner": "sydwieckowski_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073792082147338, "text": "Well said 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-01T00:58:46", "owner": "neha.dawda01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075904540886141, "text": "Please run in Australia ...years yea I know...get can't", "created_at": "2025-10-01T00:20:56", "owner": "goober339", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079972313509419, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-30T23:30:02", "owner": "georgiemc27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949572172032465, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T23:05:31", "owner": "despinatouloumidis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325994971234989, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:46:30", "owner": "k8andkids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077963392841804, "text": "👍👍👍👍👍 you are right..", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:41:29", "owner": "imade.muliana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924355234017909, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:35:48", "owner": "sabrina.m.y.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058474517173518, "text": "Now replace the lizard german cancler whit some Austrian painter whe need more politicks like this", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:30:51", "owner": "_dado__2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086520037910666, "text": "I'm proud of him!👍❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:30:30", "owner": "mayinnovember", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344198869160337, "text": "I agree with the dude he wants to protect his people he have all the rights to do that. I’m I the only one that thinks that he looks like heath ledger joker ?", "created_at": "2025-09-30T21:54:46", "owner": "alsalloomm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075738779120249, "text": "Wtf are you talking about? Who is refugee if not the Ukrainians running away from the real war. Not just seeing to suck the social system and get money for nothing", "created_at": "2025-09-30T21:52:42", "owner": "ohh_la_lala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158934370388790, "text": "Take notes Britain", "created_at": "2025-09-30T21:52:05", "owner": "nrohneerg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055664165221452, "text": "Grosse connasse pseudo journaliste.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T21:44:06", "owner": "liloudelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860708779438084, "text": "How is wanting your country to not change racist", "created_at": "2025-09-30T20:51:38", "owner": "gilbeeblig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087594268897207, "text": "🇵🇱💯🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-30T20:09:29", "owner": "sohamghosh70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866866906459899, "text": "I am form india but proud of poland ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-30T20:05:47", "owner": "bibhutibhusan_dash_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533172301043903, "text": "No muslim want to live in your shity poor country either dude", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:59:58", "owner": "gokdeniz_yavas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048278036653525, "text": "💯🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:57:00", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134210338458497, "text": "Poland is safe, i hope that is like that for ever…", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:45:13", "owner": "j.j_gng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054882221207417, "text": "That’s why nobody is having children raped or the countries history destroyed 👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:41:57", "owner": "matt2000doom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078965285080492, "text": "“Refugees” is the new word for foot soldiers…", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:18:25", "owner": "chepe40k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081022357800204, "text": "Hell yeah, I’d be proud of that!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:13:20", "owner": "trigger7mm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391428889120005, "text": "Estados unidos siempre tratando de imponer una imagen malvada de quienes hacen lo correcto.. ESTADOS UNIDOS, JUDIOS Y MUSILMANES, SON UN MALDITO CANCER.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:13:00", "owner": "francisco.riv.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187804840324134, "text": "Воспитание это не про них. Не сдавайте свою страну!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:02:09", "owner": "shadohanter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077780096291246, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏 parabéns Polônia salvem sua pátria o islamismo é um câncer 👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T18:54:43", "owner": "claudio.rodriguesgarcia.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080984572806526, "text": "🇵🇱 I liked Poland 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-30T18:46:24", "owner": "spthakur55", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17883640749266036, "text": "Good!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T18:13:53", "owner": "jenpowell3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528791596027367, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T18:05:49", "owner": "ckelley515033", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050333702645265, "text": "Well done", "created_at": "2025-09-30T18:02:13", "owner": "carmen2022mo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18396714022188228, "text": "Preach bro 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:49:37", "owner": "jayquellin13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055893722202037, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:45:37", "owner": "jamm_16_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935713123086645, "text": "We wish we could do the same in INDIA 🇮🇳, Proud of Poland🇵🇱👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:25:29", "owner": "gourab0706", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983910795888996, "text": "Lady stay at home", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:18:42", "owner": "zawlmugil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18358112518095843, "text": "Proud❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:17:14", "owner": "xy_plux_xy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842523286588073, "text": "👏👏❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:00:49", "owner": "ll_felcy_01_ll", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865779949462527, "text": "Poland is a ☪️ancer free country 🔥💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:41:06", "owner": "waffle4u_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044421746385547, "text": "👏 i oby tak pozostało", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:30:28", "owner": "fiddka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18359187280084478, "text": "❤️👏🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:24:01", "owner": "laura_samardzijova", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18320199442242140, "text": "Someone should ask the interviewer how the UK is doing as of today with illegal immigration and taking in all the refugees that they did", "created_at": "2025-09-30T15:45:26", "owner": "mr.a_capa_nun_e_bona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080202334819513, "text": "Thinking or vacationing anywhere, Poland should be your first choice.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T15:19:37", "owner": "pappywags_57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965376825978249, "text": "A fucking men - rest of Europe is a cot case", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:56:22", "owner": "jimmieciurlionis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960923994840780, "text": "The woman was talking about refugees and this other nigga was talking about immigrants 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:38:39", "owner": "meris.hyseni", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062703800088548, "text": "Let her take them home", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:36:41", "owner": "xavierillingworth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974586960927211, "text": "This is exactly how it should be. Refugees (vetted) or illegals should be sent back and enter our county the legal way. Their country would not allow us to enter or live in their county illegally, so why should they be allowed to. If the place they came from is not safe, they should be returned to a neutral county of same culture. They should never be allowed to change a county to the culture and country they were trying to flee from. Our government should protect us, as this man in protecting the people of Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:16:10", "owner": "isparkle4fl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090477811812255, "text": "Compare Poland to the rest of Europe", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:14:24", "owner": "keithrowe405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079323116057278, "text": "Um verdadeiro presidente meu respeito👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:54:35", "owner": "pmsousa002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064482446343248, "text": "Very good 👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:54:14", "owner": "vion__hindu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081262993985059, "text": "👏👏👏👍", "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:32:51", "owner": "catohelseth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389396272126341, "text": "quero ir pra Polônia", "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:27:18", "owner": "marcello.tonidandel.orciuoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861739471482561, "text": "Every country needs nationalism. And every person needs to stay in their country and fight the corruption within their country and stop running away from their countries f****** pansies", "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:05:45", "owner": "ghost_explorations89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980551473755517, "text": "I'm Canadian. Might have to move to Poland 🫡 They know what they're doing 😎", "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:05:15", "owner": "crklinck91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072509215923775, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:56:34", "owner": "dolly_bana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933814171007606, "text": "I pray Poland stands strong! ✝️", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:47:04", "owner": "randall.mando", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892043638340647, "text": "This refugees are so fanatic they should go to muslim countries.no bad feeling.Poland is right💯👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:45:36", "owner": "elenalaviniabres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942394192064595, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:40:15", "owner": "indrianidjota_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920448814160823, "text": "It’s always the white guys getting bullied by a white woman.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:32:36", "owner": "steezymcgreezy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17925787446110510, "text": "👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:21:58", "owner": "missbudgell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090089695845911, "text": "We Indians massively appreciate Poland 🇵🇱for this move, & bcz of their stern decision, their woman , children & even the men are safe.  Keep going Poland 👍.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:20:11", "owner": "anwita_16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884141953382719, "text": "Patriots* he missed Patriots", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:04:24", "owner": "keithscott679", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17972521544944804, "text": "Indian deserved this man's idea 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:01:30", "owner": "_the_ajith_17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892114594200489, "text": "Absolutely G", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:50:34", "owner": "jimmybarroww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847634026571571, "text": "Absolutely brilliant bloke, I wish he was here !!!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:48:18", "owner": "leeleelee656266", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900612049146512, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:48:03", "owner": "murzydavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925945954133491, "text": "SMART!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:48:01", "owner": "lorenzo.2881", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053036222268380, "text": "Anything is being racist nowadays. Even not accepting bombermen in my country is being racist", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:37:09", "owner": "noc.__13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937387777066032, "text": "👏👏👏🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:36:59", "owner": "daallia3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860695204437505, "text": "Protecting themselves from terrorism…", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:03:43", "owner": "paddy.9213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093793201702480, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:00:39", "owner": "jana_sarlay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18311668504170673, "text": "All those muslim illegal “asylum seeker” immigrants in Italy, Germany, UK, Sweden, Denmark, Finland, Norway, the Netherlands, France etc. have wreaked havoc in those countries. They mooch, mooch, mooch off the kindness and generosity of the host Christian  countries. And how do they repay the shelter that they have received?: 1) They demand MORE FREE benefits. 2) They disrespect the culture and customs of the host country. 3) They want to spread islam and control the government by demanding sharia law be established. 4) They do NOT WANT TO ASSIMILATE to the culture and customs of the host country they are in.\n5) They are all INGRATES!!! \nThey ALL need to be repatriated back or deported back to their hellhole countries or to muslim majority countries. It has been 10 years!! Their “asylum status” has expired!!! Time to 🥾🥾🥾🥾🥾🥾them ALL out!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T10:45:21", "owner": "hersheychaix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055817459631173, "text": "💯💯💯💯🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-30T10:14:10", "owner": "adrian._.shams", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985296669898245, "text": "❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:59:48", "owner": "xavabal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067762283252722, "text": "👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:58:59", "owner": "selma_gbg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963218499830300, "text": "I am Azerbaijani, but I respect the President of Poland, because this people will never assimilate, the Muslim religion does not want peace, I understand this perfectly!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:58:54", "owner": "joshgun.91", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18138433267442193, "text": "The real question is are ppl from other religions even safe in Muslim countries. They are forced to convert so why should we take them. U can see india is beyond cooked atp, after some time probably muslim ppl would become a majority. I fear that the most", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:44:36", "owner": "mahimaa8_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18125676061485726, "text": "💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:44:25", "owner": "truthnative", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17877421260308745, "text": "💯💯💯Respect", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:40:03", "owner": "rozzerprateek", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17925269511116140, "text": "+ rep 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:27:43", "owner": "elena.kriauciunaite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119943628505992, "text": "HE ANSWERED 2 millions FROM UKRAINE, but what she want to listen????? 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T09:10:10", "owner": "erikacrislima", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127908862479885, "text": "🔥🔥🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:57:02", "owner": "natalya.nazarova", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101011435557839, "text": "Amazing 🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:33:11", "owner": "lee_euroy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18532194904031443, "text": "He is 100% correct…Keep the troublemakers out!…", "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:26:40", "owner": "43ocd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18177325972343352, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:14:00", "owner": "idontloveyanymore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060497618384266, "text": "Well said shame uk doesn’t feel same way about the safety of us", "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:07:12", "owner": "marie.donnelly.94849", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041465537447912, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:57:52", "owner": "alesandri_ap", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053527778267127, "text": "Might move to Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:57:04", "owner": "pleasurepotz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17877412563311420, "text": "Poland - proud of you country...so many secular chutias in India", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:52:34", "owner": "niveshwithjitesh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101958295618394, "text": "Correct", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:46:24", "owner": "zincoxic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102824212536567, "text": "I wish Russian government was like Polish. Russia is recently inviting more and more immigrants from Middle Asia with their families.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:42:24", "owner": "rembrandao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016144682603201, "text": "Up Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:15:45", "owner": "xoxo.willene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042529112433989, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:06:22", "owner": "val.gnnkls", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035511221705493, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T06:27:09", "owner": "missstellinalaluna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18496760389069952, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T06:13:29", "owner": "shannelle_xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18380337478177405, "text": "god please save Poland🔥🔥Poland is the best💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T06:12:14", "owner": "dikkenson", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18149280178409592, "text": "🔥💯❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T06:07:06", "owner": "woetoer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105298939581117, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T05:40:12", "owner": "samanthamartin_88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086895052883719, "text": "Ehy muslim refusee only seek non islamic nation while they have 56 islamic nation to go ???", "created_at": "2025-09-30T05:24:29", "owner": "mishraji__ka__ldka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058811375618326, "text": "A leader with a spine. Well done sir.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T05:24:24", "owner": "samantha.vorster", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056368892193335, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-30T05:20:04", "owner": "jyoti.guggari", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950801287030776, "text": "Muslims They're not happy in Libya.\nThey're not happy in Morocco.\nThey're not happy in Iran.\nThey're not happy in Iraq..\nThey're not happy in Yemen.\nThey're not happy in Afghanistan.\nThey're not happy in Pakistan.\nThey're not happy in Syria.\nThey're not happy in Lebanon.\nSO, WHERE ARE THEY HAPPY?\nThey're happy in Australia.\nThey're happy in Canada..\nThey're happy in England.\nThey're happy in France.\nThey're happy in Italy.\nThey're happy in Germany ..\nThey're happy in Sweden..\nThey're happy in the USA.\nThey're happy in Norway..\nThey're happy in Holland.\nThey're happy in Denmark.\nBasically, they're happy in every country that is not Muslim and unhappy in every country that is! AND WHO DO THEY BLAME?\nNot Islam.\nNot their leadership.\nNot themselves.\nTHEY BLAME THE COUNTRIES THEY ARE HAPPY IN!\nAnd then they want to change those countries to be like the country they came from where they were unhappy!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T05:06:56", "owner": "paramvirjolly", "likes": 224}, {"id": 17887826901363506, "text": "👃🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-30T04:52:06", "owner": "memesredgy420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069654680194460, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T04:48:07", "owner": "mbishkov93", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987485652856273, "text": "Respect button for poland 🇵🇱 🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-30T04:23:36", "owner": "_anoj_king_killa", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17849604411561828, "text": "Stand firm", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:56:27", "owner": "time2_cook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059774906139775, "text": "Pergunta para essa repórter porque nenhum país árabe recebe os refugiados ????", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:46:00", "owner": "marcelo_558", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051706124292070, "text": "Be like Polish 🇵🇱👍👍👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:34:24", "owner": "mcnlhungdim", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17943635691026485, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:33:52", "owner": "de_alvarezz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947361166021921, "text": "What's with Media and their love for islam? If you love them so much go to the 56 islamic countries🤡☪️🐖", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:29:20", "owner": "kratos.777999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064354793077211, "text": "You didn't say it but he is VERY proud and you respect that. He truly cares about his family and his country 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:29:09", "owner": "santo_hernandez999", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17982844955911258, "text": "Respect ++💯", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:18:42", "owner": "user_undefined1234", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17877444951308187, "text": "Absolutely  correct  man 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:18:26", "owner": "user_undefined1234", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18421659886109967, "text": "Of course he’s proud of protecting his country - he should be. And not only that, Poland is helping out their neighbouring country.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:09:50", "owner": "alanbell170", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18371361715149168, "text": "🙌🇵🇱 so much respect from 🇨🇦", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:57:15", "owner": "natalieugarrison", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17934818178092838, "text": "This is a true leader, for the people. Elected by the people, to do this job. Something Americans can’t comprehend. We have Trump for 3.5 yrs, I pray he can clean it up and keep it clean for decades to come. Sadly, he has to waste time fighting the loonie left who can’t give their nasty agenda a break.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:50:55", "owner": "denisephotographyby", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18294951490265342, "text": "Be like Poland. Say no to Muslims and immigration.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:39:51", "owner": "billcorbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080044816980110, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:26:46", "owner": "fanolman.music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073336831932314, "text": "RESPECT!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:26:24", "owner": "hthrmrshll.33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067393562339590, "text": "I wish the united states was the same way!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:26:06", "owner": "hthrmrshll.33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116206033533532, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-30T02:25:37", "owner": "hthrmrshll.33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18386051275122915, "text": "I'm with Poland 🇵🇱 india will always support you and yes we're proud of your decisions", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:52:29", "owner": "kri10na", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861446149490773, "text": "I wish I was polish", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:36:54", "owner": "limacot14", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18106256578595892, "text": "There isn’t such a thing as legal or illegal Muslim. A Muslim is simply a Muslim. You want to know what you are dealing with ? Go and read Koran in whatever your language is. Don’t listen to any Mola or any Imam. Read and discover it yourself.", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:30:46", "owner": "sergesigarodi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075269816512783, "text": "Good job poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:23:16", "owner": "rabin2358", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18178316896347721, "text": "Cancer free world", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:50:12", "owner": "pinkrainbowmike", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18481003366075652, "text": "Very well said", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:49:01", "owner": "pinkrainbowmike", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043619075387899, "text": "😂 Kick off all poor polish immigrants from UK", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:40:08", "owner": "insi0123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076142833894588, "text": "Hero", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:32:09", "owner": "bat3980", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851819491555465, "text": "Moving to poland", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:22:27", "owner": "call_me_ant_323", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091734529830255, "text": "Respect from Brazil! 🇧🇷💪🏼🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:20:18", "owner": "alexwslopes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077996471044017, "text": "🔥👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:13:21", "owner": "akashirke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059949410126908, "text": "Nice prime minister!! I wanna one like him for my country", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:10:14", "owner": "felipenaltchadjian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086988082709608, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏💯💯💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-29T23:56:31", "owner": "southpacificsurfboards", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988469922707597, "text": "日本の政治家も同じ考えであってほしい🇯🇵", "created_at": "2025-09-29T23:44:59", "owner": "jossicathau", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081075521486203, "text": "Yup, be like Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T23:29:11", "owner": "russell_lovesclimbing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080589794312931, "text": "Everything country need to learn from Polish F the muslams", "created_at": "2025-09-29T23:03:45", "owner": "yedypr13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079891174952655, "text": "🇵🇱❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:53:30", "owner": "frans_prince42", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17892497955341252, "text": "Viva Poland 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:51:31", "owner": "marciabressanelli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854820772538890, "text": "👍👍👍🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💪💪💪", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:49:29", "owner": "40micmic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067954280194411, "text": "Always loved polish people so normal 🇵🇱👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:32:57", "owner": "pattinson_benny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970726995941869, "text": "Damn Poland is the place to be", "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:45:02", "owner": "james38253", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882186454392127, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:44:46", "owner": "paz_azulay_shish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946439959021155, "text": "Respect 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:44:03", "owner": "rahaf_issa_abdalhad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144061018424654, "text": "Someone really think that being called a racist in 2025 will ever scare or hurt anyone? 🙄", "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:22:37", "owner": "ottoman_memy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129343234463873, "text": "Love this!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:53:07", "owner": "p124576", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068230589214679, "text": "May I go? I’m half Polish and half Ukrainian!! ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:47:44", "owner": "mittnamnluli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089047276871983, "text": "Well well well 👃🇵🇱😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:46:36", "owner": "omie5o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106323367603626, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️❤️💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:35:20", "owner": "naiscikay26", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080194861807810, "text": "Good for him!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:33:16", "owner": "hannahowl1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031140170706772, "text": "Come mai i musulmani non vanno nelle regioni musulmane?? perché in Europa???? perché?? che  vadano nei loro paesi musulmani stop!!!no Europa!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:30:49", "owner": "dome.nico8889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041912096688550, "text": "Your people should be proud of you", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:30:35", "owner": "tejashnewar_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026106200532339, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:17:33", "owner": "stavroulagkika", "likes": 1}, {"id": 1808017696399317