 "created_at": "2025-09-29T19:03:52", "owner": "anand20555", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18041400584676838, "text": "🎤", "created_at": "2025-09-29T18:55:00", "owner": "preciouscis30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192898426323629, "text": "@realdonaldtrump @modithefilm2019", "created_at": "2025-09-29T18:44:56", "owner": "unknownn_source", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844892593568107, "text": "All countries should behave like this 👍and deport all Allah's prayers to his home 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-29T18:43:21", "owner": "unknownn_source", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853968223492331, "text": "Who is she reporter??", "created_at": "2025-09-29T18:06:34", "owner": "akshai17.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984541227734402, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T18:03:15", "owner": "andreabessab", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18185097208336589, "text": "💯 🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:53:16", "owner": "explorer_deb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083868316899285, "text": "All leaders. Listen to your citizens.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:53:13", "owner": "calhoon2024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107975482605838, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:39:01", "owner": "canadian_boy_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074433269277044, "text": "Ale pierdoli kocopoły", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:37:03", "owner": "tri.riri17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108162460569418, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:29:01", "owner": "natalia.spitova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034829453502132, "text": "Because many are not refugees.  They claim that to jump the line and many commit criminal acts", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:19:39", "owner": "donagca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095024287665138, "text": "Respect 🇵🇱👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:18:21", "owner": "dinanatalina82", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980630418874294, "text": "Every other nation should follow his lead.  Do not accept muslims and deport any and all muslims inside their borders", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:16:02", "owner": "coachwesleyhorne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975233049779007, "text": "I love this man💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:00:29", "owner": "far.ang1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022959797751134, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:56:29", "owner": "vivi_meow2402", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093817372773112, "text": "Smart Man!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:49:57", "owner": "sommom2011", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136357573444803, "text": "Who'd want to go?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:49:49", "owner": "sommom2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398913262140695, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:47:18", "owner": "aniket_x_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923990113119339, "text": "How many refugees have Saudi Arabia taken ?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:33:49", "owner": "overlordkingslayer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17986460054857058, "text": "Islam is not a race…", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:30:30", "owner": "firehousetheo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928594930107237, "text": "👏👏👏👏💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:30:16", "owner": "daliaperry54", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994914375688470, "text": "UK, France where r u???", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:29:30", "owner": "eva_novianty981", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042182726670810, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:27:44", "owner": "errrvincible", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080828743960106, "text": "Bravo poland 👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:25:10", "owner": "19captain66", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949346518014570, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:16:52", "owner": "celesdw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079970633004916, "text": "Bravo!!!!👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:14:46", "owner": "beckahcastro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097913218634795, "text": "He saved his country!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:13:47", "owner": "beckahcastro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020487962770491, "text": "Liking Poland more and more.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:11:14", "owner": "jouhanneus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862079956481088, "text": "If it against Muslim then he is not sounding racist to me...rather the host is sounding ridiculously ignorant of the fact that ALL of them are radical and can take her peace within seconds in the name of religion if got a chance once...😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:08:57", "owner": "sushil10x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113541205542894, "text": "Awesome", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:53:28", "owner": "____________t.d__________", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058829678451274, "text": "He's so right 👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:50:57", "owner": "alecastro_82", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17857738740515848, "text": "Poland🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:36:40", "owner": "robberta_lazarus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876278020414885, "text": "Be proud", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:36:17", "owner": "th3d4nkm4nnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870326155441551, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:30:47", "owner": "kroick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092048614827326, "text": "THAT is a real leader of HIS people. Its not hard to look at every other country and the current state they are in since opening their doors to islam. Recognizing a major threat is not being racist.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:21:28", "owner": "davidleee87", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18066535700584167, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:19:09", "owner": "nchin1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007488503633302, "text": "Wish we can stick to this too !!!! No Muslim’s !!!!! They way to take over", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:14:43", "owner": "w_michaels01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18222964741306252, "text": "Amin", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:11:06", "owner": "armz_in_flame", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989467083846583, "text": "I love this man", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:00:45", "owner": "e.r2202", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085148542909273, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:56:29", "owner": "littlepetunia77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979074672763310, "text": "This man is ancestor of Polish Szmalcownik!\nHis family sold Jews to Hitler and take over their belongings \nPolish  choose an Alfons on their representative", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:56:02", "owner": "kutyna4nogi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061853573607988, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:46:47", "owner": "c.salgueiro89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963733095972774, "text": "Parabéns, Polônia 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:27:23", "owner": "dayanamelquiades", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060021743413472, "text": "Mf’s questions him are D1 people pleasers", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:19:52", "owner": "nun_new4q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919364122168803, "text": "Islam is a religion, not a race…. The way the left gaslights is an absolute lie.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:05:05", "owner": "teddsterpinx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898801654301226, "text": "☪️aner free....🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:56:13", "owner": "jishon_jaison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535419802044906, "text": "Go Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:54:58", "owner": "k.char_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043225691658528, "text": "This is the damn right answer and why I will always support Poland no matter what. Finally people standing up and taking their countries back and not allowing people to just come in and take over. Enough already, they have many many countries they could have stayed in if they would just maybe act right and appreciate the freedom of living somewhere else not under oppression, maybe we would never have to have these conversations. Why should he be racist because he's trying to look after the well-being of not only his family in Poland but the other people in Poland. Good for him and more people should stand up beside him", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:51:24", "owner": "yochianaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850693552522945, "text": "They aren’t refugees 🖕🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:46:41", "owner": "scottanderson8891", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042144722423926, "text": "Dude you are crazy respect from Israel 🫡 🇮🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:42:58", "owner": "yakir.elmaliach8", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058678073148207, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:36:24", "owner": "myfordmaverick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18181647712338015, "text": "I’m moving to Poland lol", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:36:11", "owner": "jannetenino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883088206388434, "text": "Why are there lefty white idiots sticking up for the fake refugees 😂 they need deporting! Deport the news reader stupid cow", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:29:33", "owner": "andrewdavis294", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082833413303638, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:25:14", "owner": "i.am.eudaimonist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027541889724071, "text": "Poland suffered so much in the past. He is right!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:24:23", "owner": "joseferreira4456", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114295246541241, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:14:15", "owner": "frenzel.hamid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072673112162585, "text": "Respect 🇵🇱 and Muslims are cancer. 🇺🇸 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:10:09", "owner": "mohler6610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384822301120966, "text": "Love this guy 🇵🇱💪🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:59:41", "owner": "bastholmrasmus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093718615762748, "text": "Keyword, if they are illegal", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:54:27", "owner": "sir_gp_bragz_1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038902304693788, "text": "I have just come back from Poland after 15days and to be honest now I’m back in the uk I hate it here I want to go back to Poland it’s amazing there he’s right it was so safe I could go anywhere at any time and I didn’t feel one bit unsafe", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:34:31", "owner": "philboi30", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072146642232307, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:31:11", "owner": "peter.gema", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865447192465167, "text": "Italy take notes", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:16:49", "owner": "dre_def", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045961121655666, "text": "The interviewer should take in all the refugee then.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:16:21", "owner": "ms._jossy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17939622309075289, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:12:54", "owner": "pujakoiri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075170701894575, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:11:41", "owner": "cathedral212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112843807546937, "text": "Good for Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:02:36", "owner": "il.iya_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015154973787001, "text": "🙌🔥❤️Love this man. He is a true man", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:01:57", "owner": "nonchalance_77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070918736234108, "text": "👏👏👏heja Polen", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:43:56", "owner": "anngust64", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18376833400178867, "text": "Slay Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:43:47", "owner": "dankarvajal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543377509037896, "text": "Islam is not a race. There are Muslims in every race. I can understand culturally not wanting certain races in the country, but what does this have to do with being Muslim?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:35:04", "owner": "kevser_nohut", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064640042602371, "text": "So very proud of you", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:23:35", "owner": "ukholly_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084411355900693, "text": "It's nit racist ،they are proteceting of Muslim terrorism", "created_at": "2025-09-29T11:08:33", "owner": "jeniussos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931676241984545, "text": "God bless Poland ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:56:26", "owner": "philipshort60", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064582007074807, "text": "I am sure that he is really proud of himself by what he did. That journalist is 🤮", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:38:54", "owner": "kyawkyaw_t34_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083908682307877, "text": "Вы приняли Украину... Они мирно и тихо поднимают вам экономику... Но только вы их убиваете и избеваете каждый день! В интернете очень много видео! Вы не очень адекватные? Вы никогда не думали, что они