ted_at": "2025-09-29T04:38:44", "owner": "mendelskipriscilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054751703241611, "text": "Unfortunately that’s right! 80 percent of Muslims are not peaceful! At all!!!!! Especially Palestinians, Syrians, and Iraqi people! This is the truth", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:33:03", "owner": "noorausa_38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058060967399841, "text": "This is why Donald trump needs to adhere to this stance", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:31:20", "owner": "thirdtimesacharmkjeo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895017208324292, "text": "Way to go, Poland!! I think others should follow your lead! 💯👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:19:26", "owner": "mylove4hawaii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889126552349306, "text": "Why Saudi  not taking 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:19:03", "owner": "adi_pawar11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129347458480124, "text": "Polish politicians often use “safety” as a coded way of saying we kept Muslims out, so we’re safe. That isn’t an objective fact — it’s a political narrative. Poland does have lower violent crime than some Western European countries, but compared to the rest of the world it’s not especially safe, and crime stats are always more nuanced than soundbites. In reality, places like Dubai and the wider UAE rank among the safest globally, even though 80–90% of the population are immigrants and the majority are Muslim. Clearly, immigration does not automatically equal danger. Countries such as the UAE, Qatar, Singapore, and Canada show that you can have massive immigration — even majority-Muslim — and still remain extremely safe if you manage it with strong governance rather than fear-based politics. I used to have respect to Poland, but I lost it all now", "created_at": "2025-09-29T03:36:18", "owner": "naimozduman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064668596067614, "text": "Dear leader of Poland, please  continue to do what you do for your country!!! Do not give in to the liberal regime.  Do not ALLOW even 1 MUSLIM to enter.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T03:04:37", "owner": "21stcenturyethics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913417972084873, "text": "@markjcarney maybe you can learn something!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:55:55", "owner": "dj_killajewel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915502798195613, "text": "Grate man🇵🇱🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:54:19", "owner": "kalisto_op", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058961360617106, "text": "❤️🔥💯", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:50:05", "owner": "reel_vs_real_life_of_4923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290075866259592, "text": "Bro made the right choice 🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:49:48", "owner": "matthewalexanderfaulk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867189589387022, "text": "Followed and liked by randy orton ❤️❤️everyone knows the face of muslims 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:45:04", "owner": "rahulsharma1432z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131302348411280, "text": "Bravo!!!!! 💯 balls!!!! Call whatever names…. Poland sovereignty is important and the safety of their people first!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:42:13", "owner": "mrbl315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982109994748184, "text": "If only we could deport liberals, we might be more like this guy", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:39:49", "owner": "3puttbogeys_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106485862587454, "text": "Oh this is y that black guy probably kill that Ukraine girl", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:34:44", "owner": "kazzlique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068096549266950, "text": "Hats off Man👍", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:31:02", "owner": "hey_s_h_u_b_h_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895169053180732, "text": "Yes brother!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:26:17", "owner": "dogincage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130498822459197, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:23:45", "owner": "oroluisfernando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879388615404600, "text": "My friend you just asked for it", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:47:47", "owner": "dannydel_church_fitness_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920704600170944, "text": "He is  right 👍😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:44:56", "owner": "jannitagrace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905507269252654, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:41:37", "owner": "surfchanty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526538923003253, "text": "They dont gaf .THEY KEEPING THEIR PEACE", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:39:47", "owner": "xchainsaw_00x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289703497261768, "text": "America should be like this! Look out for our own!!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:33:40", "owner": "joey.8322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850620604522583, "text": "She's telling him that her perspective should be his obligation. He's flabbergasted that he's being shamed for not supporting a viewpoint he has no reason to conduct.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:31:07", "owner": "bry.agla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044614058372643, "text": "@now_thats_a_name_", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:28:06", "owner": "maplebacontoffeeapple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942653949932104, "text": "It's not about racism, it's about cultural values, Western values ​​that Muslim culture and religion don't respect, it's about the survival of Western culture and values ​​that must be protected and that socialist governments and those with a global agenda are destroying.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:23:37", "owner": "joe_rgj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072575680912009, "text": "I’m with Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-29T01:14:10", "owner": "kerrie30989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188162956325394, "text": "And your proud of that... yes why wouldnt anyone be?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:58:31", "owner": "bootes.void666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137138155449716, "text": "He is clear  on what to keep his country saved", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:51:28", "owner": "glagreis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068803409256739, "text": "👏👏👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:47:10", "owner": "jonlaquisan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077534462024780, "text": "Keep them out of EVERY country!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:33:25", "owner": "angelamusc90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1808093578