7730, "text": "👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:02:45", "owner": "nicolelacayo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045666188367624, "text": "We should have done the same", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:01:57", "owner": "123pajackson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138618949430819, "text": "Exatamente. Falou tudo certinho.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:01:54", "owner": "eduardo_duda_motta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045061475375956, "text": "I want a President like him in my country Costa Rica!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:00:06", "owner": "ricardomezamarroquin007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18290125294281161, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👍👍👍👍👏👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:52:46", "owner": "pedrosonic_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082248841988182, "text": "They aren't obligated to take ANYONE in, regardless of status. 🙄🙄🙄 It's their country, they can do what they want with their borders & society. I wish everyone understood that. NO country is obligated, or should feel,obligated to take ANYONE in. Period. The leaders job is to take care of their citizens FIRST & then IF they want to allow anyone else in they can.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:47:09", "owner": "kristyann1218", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17877358968308756, "text": "Right.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:39:07", "owner": "profodairsantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850775110527140, "text": "Muslims are refugees. They’re a cancer.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:36:09", "owner": "evetseflow1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339734689207609, "text": "Perfect! I would love to live in Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:32:31", "owner": "anaharumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097013413726073, "text": "I proud of Poland for not taking any!  We need to take their advice!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:24:09", "owner": "danaskyvara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078755444053141, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:21:46", "owner": "salmalekbich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863073931417462, "text": "Everyone here has clearly never met any true and practicing Muslim and have been heavily fed by hatred 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:04:14", "owner": "anas_askari2000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053395196261324, "text": "Respect from slovenia !💪😁🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:58:43", "owner": "miselvolf666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406168141186123, "text": "Shut her down!! He is the smartest in this conversation!!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:42:08", "owner": "happy_to_read_55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096079513668757, "text": "And we make jokes about pollocks being dumb when they are the the smartest", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:26:01", "owner": "jarrett.lynch.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868208869450195, "text": "I’d be proud to take no refugees that will change your country n drain it why u think they flee cuz there fucked n ruin there own country’s wake up ppl ffs", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:23:05", "owner": "katieyuley86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087846946855059, "text": "Good man.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:21:32", "owner": "katieyuley86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146494006413167, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:18:00", "owner": "vcarrie1120003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293775040250446, "text": "Is not too late , take them all back to there country", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:04:14", "owner": "bat.5023858", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109630876561158, "text": "❤️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:01:07", "owner": "egyvictor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18268626700304332, "text": "Supported fully", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:59:44", "owner": "wawaboss2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963596367972263, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:56:23", "owner": "nano_cortes23", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035557307499232, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:53:12", "owner": "ugurbayak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975318474937121, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:51:44", "owner": "jiayouwidjaja75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903162748267301, "text": "💯❤️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:50:29", "owner": "0210petinga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993773142692470, "text": "As an Italian based in UK since more than 7 years, I’m so proud of Poland. I saw how immigration is ruining Italy, and since I’m based here every time I go back I can tell is getting worse and worse. UK was already fucked up, and it’s still fucked up. Keep going Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:44:35", "owner": "legionovem_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097008799591652, "text": "based", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:43:24", "owner": "njz_ooak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072909680176727, "text": "Looks like after Israel ..Poland is the Only HOPE for the world ..", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:36:15", "owner": "saurabh_naturelover", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095412394732800, "text": "I was working a job a couple years ago and the guy that was installing the siding of the house was polish and he told me that polish welcome lots of different races except for muslims and he said “Mexicans? Welcome. Canadians? Welcome. Colombian? Welcome. Muslim? F you, f off” 😂 freaking legend that guy", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:29:16", "owner": "elpille_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406816018185343, "text": "Fuck Muslims and Islamic 🗑", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:25:20", "owner": "jusnguyen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088013545855096, "text": "Respect from Belgium! We took it way to far", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:23:49", "owner": "roy.vdp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860526565435219, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:21:59", "owner": "roberttwallker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386320381121177, "text": "Bravo Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:18:37", "owner": "rankine344", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058167323434920, "text": "Proud of him 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:15:35", "owner": "iviichka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063246371600203, "text": "A president with some spine!!! 💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:14:19", "owner": "shes_feyth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085814761910505, "text": "Why doesn't she ask Russia how many Muslim \"refugees\" they take in?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:11:19", "owner": "erickfariiia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916497940055784, "text": "I will never forget watching jordan Peterson doing an interview with this lady... to be honest I thought she would have resigned after that... but she's still asking ridiculous questions ....", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:52:29", "owner": "happybyrobyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074768819130766, "text": "💯 support", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:39:32", "owner": "max_nefarious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945465907027030, "text": "Well done", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:36:45", "owner": "therealonetman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114572539539558, "text": "Als je opkomt voor je waarden en normen voor je eigen land wordt je onmiddellijk bestempeld als racist….ongelofelijk…\nRespect voor Polen die opkomen voor hun eigen volk 🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:35:30", "owner": "eddyrybski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097949758725635, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:33:37", "owner": "cgbsilvestre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874675930329272, "text": "No racist . He is playing by the rules", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:32:04", "owner": "marcelodefuccio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081103397063534, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:31:07", "owner": "lexdanex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043263830417140, "text": "I’d rather be a racist AGAINST muslims and ILLIGALS. THEY DO NOT BELONG IN ANY CIVILIZED COUNTRY.\nThey are THE CANCER OF WORLD.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:30:05", "owner": "nsnmonica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077933896842712, "text": "Appreciation from India", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:28:29", "owner": "thrill_pool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919648432172532, "text": "Yess only country I would move to is Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:18:32", "owner": "smitsonell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293688442271323, "text": "🔥👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:17:21", "owner": "aakki977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965561847968926, "text":