at!\" I know they're not but \"Seperate the wheat from the chaff.\" We all know how that works in this context.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:06:27", "owner": "larryoverhouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021812957569307, "text": "Great man. Great leader. Bless you.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:01:16", "owner": "wisdom7030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182251126337351, "text": "Lo re banco. Cualquier religión que vaya contra la igualdad de género, debería ser ilegal, evolucionemos, por favor, ser tolerantes con todos no. Hay límites.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:46:15", "owner": "gimenezdra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054373238228592, "text": "The truth", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:45:11", "owner": "kammysbbq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126939982427949, "text": "Poland or Bust!!! 💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:44:19", "owner": "creativestate76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059873531124615, "text": "Ils ont tout compris", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:25:08", "owner": "jay.viau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063581588458324, "text": "🙌🙌🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:21:29", "owner": "glenevensen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080462146963641, "text": "Do you fancy whipping the UK into shape 🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:13:45", "owner": "emily_ce05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040455317465171, "text": "Least I know Poland is a cool place to visit still.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:07:19", "owner": "marmo360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877330195309139, "text": "This is the same bitch that made Jordan Peterson famous for lying about his words.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:06:48", "owner": "ko_on_the_go", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050546804300964, "text": "❤️🇵🇱❤️ Bravo Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:01:11", "owner": "antoniekangalov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311527003173720, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:00:37", "owner": "kristinaxoxox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079280684004549, "text": "Seems like common sense to me", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:59:23", "owner": "hervebonchance69", "lik