ade as news reader.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:27:14", "owner": "craig0512green", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079512863509408, "text": "👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:20:55", "owner": "vasuneet007goyal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036820742489276, "text": "He has a point 🫱🏽‍🫲🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:15:58", "owner": "john_loma_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293019784269640, "text": "Well done POLAND 🤍 ❤️ 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:00:05", "owner": "nathan_plant01432", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900379960142279, "text": "Why don’t these so called refugees go to other Muslim countries? These European countries are Christian countries and want to hold these beliefs and values among its people. Poland is doing the right thing for its people. Just look at what has happened to the western world. Muslims are attacking the citizens values and beliefs that could turn into a civil war.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:58:14", "owner": "walker_ynwa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17860456371436278, "text": "❤️🇵🇱🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:51:51", "owner": "rolandabrousseau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897693175166461, "text": "Don't let them in 💯💯💯👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:50:12", "owner": "thepdkeith02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865174003393301, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:41:19", "owner": "tanyalh13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860926102497677, "text": "Every country needs to get rid of the Muslim infestation. Send them home or 6 feet under.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:39:31", "owner": "arracerx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177020728357566, "text": "This lady is Zero knowledge... regarding results of Illegal immigrants...dnt even say they are refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:38:10", "owner": "tovi_styles_07", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073022180126744, "text": "👍💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:30:57", "owner": "just.jack007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174521287346435, "text": "God bless him !  No Muslims in any Catholic Christian countries - why are they leaving t