": 17865147204398853, "text": "Muslims are like parasite everywhere .m from northeast India and recently our government did the same, our govt had driven out thousands of illegal immigrants Also after chasing them out They were 2 3 buses full of Muslims trying to enter our state again without proper paperwork or documents and were caught and send back. They are a pain in the a** they rape beat the local people. They create only problem. Huge salute to this man 🔥❤️❤️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:55:35", "owner": "khiu_sumao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028176317721393, "text": "Bravo 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:51:59", "owner": "anthonyrt1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974274699930157, "text": "He is 💯% right", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:48:13", "owner": "hisulesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079266704476360, "text": "Stand on what you believe and don’t flinch 💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:36:47", "owner": "king.georgei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080895593311355, "text": "She should give harbor to isis terrorists in her home", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:33:17", "owner": "miss.anusual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386679424124102, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:29:10", "owner": "phillipcbabb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971333508931077, "text": "Love this man , respect for this true nationalist ❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:16:24", "owner": "anish_singh007_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18376563811196812, "text": "If this is Racist, Be Racist like Poland and be proud of it.👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:13:18", "owner": "param_9977", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17996061176827955, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:08:29", "owner": "lamb2coconut", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089342215872190, "text": "We need this guy in the UK!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:04:38", "owner": "mrs_cozens", "likes": 876}, {"id": 18063114614346564, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:02:21", "owner": "iam_sandesh__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062686940095021, "text": "Bet leftists have nothing good to say about him / this", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:49:22", "owner": "lennyt973", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946061368048074, "text": "The reporter should go hang with Sharia Muslims for a holiday", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:41:41", "owner": "joyleannestaff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180011254341817, "text": "Why refugees from Arab countries go to European countries why can't they go to Dubai, Bahrain or Abu Dhabi 🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:41:07", "owner": "mathiaslyamunda", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17919312813173789, "text": "Hat's Off to Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:25:31", "owner": "vijaykc007", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18377087524199145, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:20:43", "owner": "_.the_krixh._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938251525079764, "text": "🔥🙌👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:15:13", "owner": "anand_agarwal_1998", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918859981172071, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:08:11", "owner": "cultstarr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061896107454372, "text": "UK will be the first region to be done.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T05:01:16", "owner": "diroldan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961101900993555, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:47:48", "owner": "vitalredoxlife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944900235921023, "text": "MARD", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:47:25", "owner": "abotvf_rohan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056723060624864, "text": "❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:47:20", "owner": "candraeniii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317491513244291, "text": "👏👍🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:40:19", "owner": "izy1604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038850305481092, "text": "💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:39:42", "owner": "kumarsuraj8757_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093637063683144, "text": "They care for their people & their country 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:13:04", "owner": "styledby.joey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926749417107660, "text": "Proud on poland👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:11:23", "owner": "raj_official111.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170397826364530, "text": "🔥👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:10:29", "owner": "psycho_____ram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950009701034268, "text": "Superb 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:09:30", "owner": "the_subham_saswat_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097460869655889, "text": "Then !! I am racist too😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:05:53", "owner": "kishore_dey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061241612526528, "text": "Indeed", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:03:35", "owner": "lajin_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938199673073321, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏👏👏👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:03:31", "owner": "richard_zia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068347784224807, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:01:02", "owner": "shutterbug_tambe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996561297821917, "text": "🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:39:08", "owner": "godlike_jonny16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896300317313617, "text": "💯 Truth ☹️ actually the problem is what they are studying at childhood 🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:33:51", "owner": "anijith.mv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082673357508766, "text": "Much respect to you sir,you are a true leaderkeeping your people safe from these dangerous vile creatures.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:24:35", "owner": "iscariotjulius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054978029631600, "text": "👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:20:21", "owner": "gede_bagiada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027497468720292, "text": "The only smart politicians in the world are in Poland! Liberal idiots in the west are killing their own countries! Fuck liberals!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:19:52", "owner": "michael_luksic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088074682860406, "text": "Erase Palestine from the Earth!!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:11:59", "owner": "dradangodoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984377148887352, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:01:47", "owner": "beautyofmyplanet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054410303232664, "text": "People in their non-muslim countries need to demand that their government protects their culture and their country from Muslims.  They don’t come to assimilate and live peacefully, they come to invade and destroy.  Islam is a military movement not a religion of peace. Good for Poland. 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:58:08", "owner": "alba_asencio", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080516554809243, "text": "everyday poland is sounding more and more attractive to me, I long thought about moving to Germany after I got out of high-school, I could have become a full citizen and attended university, but I saw how Merkel was running the nation into the ground and how the government was blatantly ignoring the wishes of the people and changed my mind. Maybe it's time I start learning polish.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:56:07", "owner": "derekks87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054219956631918, "text": "So proud of Poland. Tell immigrants to go home!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:53:01", "owner": "sritchie1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159327052385519, "text": "Look at England and France.  They are being overruned by those mfs", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:50:00", "owner": "scbuff75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988498626712520, "text": "Way to go, Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:39:59", "owner": "jlsmith_pics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077020705843463, "text": "587-438-2129  wrightsea@hotmail.com", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:39:33", "owner": "energypresadogsofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043061585389730, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:23:00", "owner": "imdavidgeorge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101469940616483, "text": "Poland is so awesome", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:18:52", "owner": "tylerpenley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912096439208065, "text": "Great man 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:05:54", "owner": "oneneary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073724957126094, "text": "\"Because this is what my people are expecting from their government.\" 👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:00:28", "owner": "estevancito2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961526064992516, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:59:00", "owner": "estevancito2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106246009580191, "text": "We need clones of thos man running every country", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:45:48", "owner": "codyrico.1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081496102945290, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:45:37", "owner": "ronnyoriginal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097177876726030, "text": "He’s watching out for the true welfare of his people!! Good for you Poland!!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:39:22", "owner": "vickimc01", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072267625906371, "text": "Very good man", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:32:58", "owner": "rjforever893", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402873469139338, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:29:33", "owner": "himanshuvishwakarma577", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139880926389348, "text": "👍💯💯🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:28:35", "owner": "yelitzaesthergranado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328064767227257, "text": "Respect Poland 🔥🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:58:48", "owner": "uresh_nir", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900955501271161, "text": "Respect from India👍🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:42:02", "owner": "chakravarthy.nitin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18403778875191189, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:38:16", "owner": "frederic.cbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108508927563734, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:17:32", "owner": "vicferreirabarrios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880076767393465, "text": "Proud to be Polish ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:55:43", "owner": "k_maniuszko", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18118670539502264, "text": "We all shud be Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:43:44", "owner": "heyward5656", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074543384120265, "text": "Spot on! Call me what ever you want! I care about my Family and my Country and it will not be taken over by Radical Islamic Terrorists, illegal immigrants or any Radical group like Antifa. \"This We'll Defend\" (IYKYK)", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:41:50", "owner": "dick.via", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098361784566599, "text": "I lived in Poland in short time and polish people really save their country from muslims or indians. Good job 🇵🇱🇺🇦", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:41:18", "owner": "prokuda_andrew", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18074871134320107, "text": "Thanks each polish person which helps our country in difficult times 🇺🇦", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:40:02", "owner": "prokuda_andrew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081244978975647, "text": "👏👏👏Wow this man sounds lukewarm a true leader!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:28:14", "owner": "penny_thought_51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995563116685017, "text": "Yes be proud because America is being invaded right now and we are doing nothing so yes Poland be proud", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:26:50", "owner": "stephanie16233", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18311132767174764, "text": "@markjcarney", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:17:14", "owner": "way_stead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081151882940338, "text": "Yes, yes, yes...", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:08:16", "owner": "drjeanpereira", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322699435208369, "text": "Nah bruh, tell them Muslims to go finish what they started.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:44:54", "owner": "fragile_nails", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994611519837756, "text": "Be like Poland -------------------------->", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:40:22", "owner": "paratrooperofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096154081735568, "text": "You're wisely saving your country & you better keep it that way.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:22:46", "owner": "omidk232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923556586145788, "text": "This B thinks being called a racist means jack shit anymore", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:19:21", "owner": "aliciagreene624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054468983632459, "text": "They hv every fucking right to be proud!!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:54:05", "owner": "harish0522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095970733733203, "text": "Dude I'm proud of Poland and I'm fucking waiting to live a life there!! Nd whatever they hv achieved is great and if u talk humanity they have done right thing for their own ppl 😘😘😘😘", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:53:21", "owner": "harish0522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913737775068760, "text": "We need to do this in Australia", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:42:23", "owner": "kristy_souvatzis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943272058049679, "text": "Smart man", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:35:05", "owner": "rawan_qaqish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072655355146757, "text": "Love him", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:27:03", "owner": "stackmama3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068839190212938, "text": "Poland will save Europe and western civilization. Mark my word . God bless", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:26:02", "owner": "jivko_nedelchev", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883393759264052, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:20:16", "owner": "samlevteropullo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295113049264052, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:15:31", "owner": "chouhan1134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409910740115710, "text": "Congratulations to Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:10:30", "owner": "diannaa.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924196582078315, "text": "That is not racist. That is protect your country!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:09:44", "owner": "danteslondon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079717066997763, "text": "Poland be proud", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:56:32", "owner": "davearakis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078867959069879, "text": "Actually, its a responsibility of government to agree for what their people demand, so if the people in a country disagree to take refugees i think the government must to hear their own people first, idk its just my opinion", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:45:30", "owner": "ridwanizm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920668273037259, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:43:08", "owner": "sonechkanyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842286907586772, "text": "Exactly!! That’s what people don’t get it. He is right", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:42:04", "owner": "lalacasagrandehott", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092492905783299, "text": "#FreeEuropa", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:38:49", "owner": "alena.welserin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090962314834034, "text": "Proud racist button ————————>", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:37:09", "owner": "thepun1sh3r_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374379109178992, "text": "Listen closely. HE DOES NOT CARE ABOUT NAME CALLING. We have to stop caring what people think and say about us; we have to do what is right!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:34:07", "owner": "lucy_van_pe1t", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18080868110055866, "text": "This is why Poland is thriving and the UK is a shambles", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:31:38", "owner": "natbianca", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080197621797155, "text": "Poland took 2 million refugees. Ukrainian. So, white Christian refugess don't matter ?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:29:29", "owner": "julia.olsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105849790585848, "text": "Stick to your beliefs", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:28:39", "owner": "lyndale88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861020884493192, "text": "Smart man", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:24:14", "owner": "butterflygirl58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356901325094707, "text": "EXACTLY !!!! This is about the fact that they don’t assimilate- they invade. Look at London, France, Italy, Germany… it’s a shit show", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:24:01", "owner": "loanphrodite", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093170695740584, "text": "Say No to the Globalists", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:22:10", "owner": "adam_lenhardt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382636612135273, "text": "She is atheist libergay woke s☪️um", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:49:26", "owner": "leader__bangjo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973472310930098, "text": "Sempre lembrando que a Polônia foi o primeiro país invadido na segunda guerra, um país que tem uma história de destruição e que precisou de décadas para ser reconstruído.", "c