 "jishnubnambiar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113176282530107, "text": "Wish other country leaders cared about their own. Canada is going to shit.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:57:35", "owner": "carlinalucas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035620586495939, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:56:40", "owner": "anni_kasuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101158141616765, "text": "Don’t worry about Poland, interviewing lady.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:54:05", "owner": "simona.realty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027749231721275, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:52:45", "owner": "belezalatina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891088765345896, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:50:05", "owner": "nightfurym2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919998451168143, "text": "Legend xxx❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:44:00", "owner": "hairbystace2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098574199642463, "text": "מלך", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:22:25", "owner": "shir_liberman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072655046141473, "text": "🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:15:32", "owner": "alfekim.id", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066036995200137, "text": "Good. You just saved many life there💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:15:09", "owner": "alfekim.id", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019293482586964, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:02:49", "owner": "swolphanie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029620055510611, "text": "Islam as a cancer", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:58:00", "owner": "edmon_d72", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074102489134708, "text": "I mean isn't it weird when the men who claim \"refuge\" leave behind their wife and children..........", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:55:40", "owner": "azb4547", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084364043496644, "text": "respect", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:49:39", "owner": "sh_ri7696", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100589503624629, "text": "You are doing a great job. I wish they would it here. These are dissident not refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:49:28", "owner": "colleen248", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993103977837564, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:48:13", "owner": "sharon.121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089148541864445, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:37:45", "owner": "law_ra4ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072368368907166, "text": "Poland is a quite good role model in this matter. 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:34:31", "owner": "sanne_werweiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844652317567632, "text": "Heaven forbid governments act in the best interest of their native people. Job well done. 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:18:38", "owner": "kylejordans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046357061339099, "text": "That's how you run a government starmer. W⚓️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:17:02", "owner": "wibber230874", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18163413571374260, "text": "It’s never everyone but there’s a reason Islam teaches to move to places in droves where you’re not the majority become the majority and take over to make it like where you left! The cognitive dissonance it takes to live under Sharia hate it and move where there’s not sharia and then go “here should be like where I’ve left” then go back to where you’ve left. No? Then you moved there to live with the benefits of a nation with law built on Judeo-Christian principles while still claiming to want sharia. Illegal immigration is dangerous and allowing people with alterer motivates in droves to your nation is bad, the people who are good law abiding citizens regardless of race and religion ofc allow in but at the first threat of terrorism deport.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:15:12", "owner": "faithfirstfitnessgirlie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074833865116268, "text": "Keep it up Poland! You are saving your country!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:05:01", "owner": "lorendia57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044706383376012, "text": "they will destroy your country", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:44:22", "owner": "edliajammy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020928983753855, "text": "East Europe had the soviet lesson. West Europe did not.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:41:25", "owner": "henrik.somogyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283346773272978, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:31:42", "owner": "almalevin29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132609388456404, "text": "refugees from whom? from Muslims?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:27:12", "owner": "luizd91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069215933247311, "text": "If they were refugees then why doesn't other Muslim countries take them in 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:23:00", "owner": "robb_brill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386364124122231, "text": "Smart men👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:16:51", "owner": "shiran.mami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119947342520163, "text": "This is the reason why the world is where it is. Leftism is woke and they shove it down our throats, . This woman is outraged because Poland is not taking any refugees, she tried to shame him. Now, why does Poland have to take any refugees? Why does any country have to take any refugees particularly Muslims ? Who wrote the book saying that that’s what needs to happen? Good for Poland everyone should follow that example. Muslim countries are where they are because of their own doing, their own corruption and their own disgustingness. Why do they have to infest the world? Instead of being refugees why don’t they make their own countries a better place to be? Let me answer that, it is because they’re barbaric and they can’t and they don’t know how to live in peace.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:10:49", "owner": "smaugdawg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063923657589245, "text": "Poland is for Polish people peace and secure future. No failure no atrocities by invader criminals", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:08:07", "owner": "johba9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095452390670223, "text": "Liberal white women will end the world.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:03:32", "owner": "janeanddadinc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105107818598808, "text": "Poland is smart", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:59:06", "owner": "silenteagle16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156486649388719, "text": "Indian govt. Should learn and implement the ways to wipeout Rohingyas and Bangladeshi illegally migrants", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:23:08", "owner": "subash.sahoo18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057983759163894, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:21:13", "owner": "being.peter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949812718019757, "text": "Me too :) 🇵🇱 normal ppl live im poland👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:21:00", "owner": "mjzjohnsonn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18340871263207967, "text": "👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:17:46", "owner": "n_o_u_ra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157429759386353, "text": "Every country needs to follow this example.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:17:23", "owner": "logan.met10", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18111261544558634, "text": "Smart leader", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:11:20", "owner": "67gto_jay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042077333421015, "text": "Amen 🙏 a strong leader with commonsense, good values and morals. \nGod bless you 🙏 \nGod save us from the evil forces 🙏 \nwith love from Australia 🇦🇺", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:01:31", "owner": "_foundwhat_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18000277454663056, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:42:57", "owner": "mereed05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921486577156785, "text": "👏👏💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:37:29", "owner": "logan_taylor88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18367362796154831, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:22:40", "owner": "shnodilan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873078412427639, "text": "🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:21:16", "owner": "e1234545127582847298", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18097897180580314, "text": "Exactly you  b i t c h", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:08:30", "owner": "aquiles_78vzla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365311024156838, "text": "This is what America needs", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:00:00", "owner": "dustin.amos.756", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17857568223518691, "text": "Good job poland, wish Canada did the same", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:52:39", "owner": "thecrimsonlance", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055402298564620, "text": "Oh God I wish we have this kind of Leader❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:48:45", "owner": "grim_the_morning_star", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097779571648974, "text": "He has taken in many refugees from Ukraine! Smart man, smart country", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:36:38", "owner": "lisadavoren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18263866261303801, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:34:27", "owner": "samiajawab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526461031031590, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:31:00", "owner": "laurcavataio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963987588992755, "text": "Another slap on the face!!! Well done Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:17:12", "owner": "soraya.nbm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105420865588056, "text": "Respect from America🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:16:57", "owner": "edbugsy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18222779989305892, "text": "Be more like Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:12:39", "owner": "gir_nomames", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013478222790585, "text": "😎", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:11:09", "owner": "roberta_iara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154877482386593, "text": "Proud of you 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:02:58", "owner": "sageryadav7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106584136605978, "text": "He just told u he took 2 million refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:58:32", "owner": "robbert464670", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050673383303888, "text": "Smart leadership 🇵🇱👍 look at Europe being invaded by the Islam loosing their culture to the Islamist immigrants who are taking advantage of the democracy and freedom for their own interests and in a few years they will outnumber the Cristian’s and change forever Europe", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:58:28", "owner": "danakrespijewelry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076118054037348, "text": "Be proud.  Can't you see what's happening in other countries? What's wrong with her?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:47:54", "owner": "lizzie_lizzie7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874479046333858, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:45:17", "owner": "harshitparashar0001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065511416368369, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:43:59", "owner": "osher_noa_simhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107134786601007, "text": "Bravo!!!!❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:43:46", "owner": "___mermaid__princess___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074400083514358, "text": "Damb right!  I stand with Poland!!💯🇵🇱👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:40:15", "owner": "kathy.jodoin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18481771078073495, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:36:44", "owner": "cornelia_kraus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056662877182565, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:27:30", "owner": "_milja_r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845242762577680, "text": "🇵🇱💪🏻🇵🇱💪🏻🇵🇱💪🏻🇵🇱💪🏻🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:27:28", "owner": "01jp10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060490151122197, "text": "Refugees? That’s just the shiny new label slapped on illegal immigrants trampling into countries they don’t belong in! This man’s got massive 🏀🏀 for standing up and saying enough. It’s HIS country, his sacred home, and he decides who walks through those doors, not some global pity circus!!! Poland should be VERY PROUD to have a leader with the guts to protect his land while the rest of Europe plays doormat!!!! 💯💯💯💯💯💯🇵🇱❤️🇵🇱👏👏👏👏👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:27:23", "owner": "penelope_g_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286767676277062, "text": "Great policy 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:24:25", "owner": "its_mr_03_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070518194269312, "text": "Raise shield for the warrior", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:21:55", "owner": "slavik11351", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874998124327471, "text": "Wish Canada would take a break from it to be honest. At least 15 years to reset and focus on Canadians and put us first like this.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:17:03", "owner": "_vonetta_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081334012786523, "text": "Do what is best for your country. The UK are getting it hot hot right now for their open door policy.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:15:57", "owner": "stephnduka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857548459517046, "text": "Amen brother", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:11:06", "owner": "christu_sol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329643919231127, "text": "UK, France, Italy, Germany.. you should follow Polland, threat your country like that.. if you want to save & secure your country as a Christian country..country of Lord Jesus !", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:08:50", "owner": "gunturwiseso01", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072257146913165, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:00:52", "owner": "pourya__parvas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089272756878642, "text": "He spoke firm salute you sir...", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:53:18", "owner": "zhanjan_z08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081369439956685, "text": "Way to go Poland!👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:50:06", "owner": "patrickpjdoyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901504558270332, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:48:18", "owner": "miloudisra.pt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947582098020241, "text": "How do I become a Polish citizen?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:47:46", "owner": "deadmetalknot", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988678665706654, "text": "Yes good for you and your country 💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:46:00", "owner": "asdrubal.vargas.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178838500344362, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:42:56", "owner": "liam2324", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092879857741894, "text": "He took 2 million refugees from Ukraine? Listen to the man", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:41:08", "owner": "martin_s_harte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284688160278432, "text": "Ich liebe die Polen dafür 🇵🇱💯🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:36:17", "owner": "ringo_schmidt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904585321253407, "text": "WELL SAID. Bullying techniques of “and are you proud of this?” Don’t work on him. It’s such a low level manipulation, but he didn’t fall for it. THIS IS WHAT LEADERSHIP LOOKS LIKE. Protect your own citizens! UK, listen up.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:34:25", "owner": "oxi.t0cin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091349935697984, "text": "It's not racist ya dingus, islam isn't a race, it's a religion", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:30:19", "owner": "sternstronghand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050622296308968, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:26:22", "owner": "jorge_e_toro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162568828373157, "text": "🇵🇱so proud to be polish 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:11:22", "owner": "ivciakk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061931795086417, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:08:39", "owner": "nutsybeliciu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054254645541206, "text": "Agreed 💯❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:58:08", "owner": "sri_jana973", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17871702762351444, "text": "❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:57:39", "owner": "lydia__cook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871651984351831, "text": "Love this guy. I wish we had him in the UK.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:54:14", "owner": "mentlemum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089837962885601, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:52:03", "owner": "aleksrod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928143535104057, "text": "🇵🇱🧠✨👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽Certíssimo !!\nIsso é Um Presidente !!\nAprenda Macron🤢🤮", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:50:34", "owner": "gizzasantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113715142539099, "text": "He’s a real patriotic he loves his country respect from India Sir", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:38:33", "owner": "dipanwitaroykhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001539275812996, "text": "As an Indian I’m proud of Poland 🇵🇱 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:35:54", "owner": "raam.s_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002504987811677, "text": "He's not wrong.....", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:31:52", "owner": "christineannelitrenta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289074826256975, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:23:12", "owner": "susmitha_wanderer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081131314792699, "text": "That’s awesome for Poland president!!! He’s protecting his country. ❤️💪💪💪💪", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:23:07", "owner": "kev_khan_lay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289445149258219, "text": "👏👏👏👏💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:18:03", "owner": "shavitmichaeli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071702201518956, "text": "#ihatemuhammad 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:13:26", "owner": "kartikx_pal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894553567184815, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:13:00", "owner": "rajpoot.vj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104996218600047, "text": "We need a zillion of this man, Poland is a very lucky country ✨️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:08:26", "owner": "daninugent33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850503112522642, "text": "When other countries like India will wakeup", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:57:54", "owner": "amit1ada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071777647921279, "text": "This lady Running an agenda under the guise of racism", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:57:26", "owner": "amit1ada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144332818424246, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:53:44", "owner": "osirefaeli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384446752121571, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:53:09", "owner": "xxspeerxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377872021196357, "text": "now if you care about your country you're racist 🙌😂😂 lefties are ifiots", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:39:37", "owner": "inbaraninja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138832378432846, "text": "Too bad the USA doesn’t follow his ideas", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:34:34", "owner": "rogbizben1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991913070841634, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:31:40", "owner": "pablo_belaundee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924530512012088, "text": "Respect for this leader !", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:22:33", "owner": "liz_bar_david", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341213398206248, "text": "💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:19:17", "owner": "rojins_______mathew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925641934077374, "text": "Very TRUE. All countries should take lessons from him", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:18:20", "owner": "sophiekolkata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993843150834676, "text": "Fight the savage Muslims!\nWe love Israel 🇮🇱❤️🇮🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:17:03", "owner": "yacovorbach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942587617059764, "text": "I’m seriously considering emigrating to Poland! They prioritise their people and their culture before anything else 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:16:41", "owner": "aidytrueman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160067836344140, "text": "Respect from india", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:15:04", "owner": "kakashibhirajput", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064081889609858, "text": "I wish this guy would come and lead Australia. Instead of pathetic idiot we have", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:01:59", "owner": "warwickarmstrong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18293115154255556, "text": "I would move there if I knew for sure that Russia wasn’t about to invade them", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:53:11", "owner": "johnburns203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911801599210625, "text": "Be like 🇵🇱Poland 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:52:53", "owner": "elenavasilliou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918443092176858, "text": "Wow 🤩 amazing bravo 👍🏻 💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:50:20", "owner": "elenavasilliou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083171962822557, "text": "Bro is 100 right,, the whole community is danger to world", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:18:00", "owner": "lookng4me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941065642072180, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:17:49", "owner": "ale__andra.bruce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052413371265719, "text": "@r_t__s 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:15:16", "owner": "inert_inkspiller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080920450964420, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:09:46", "owner": "jonsson__89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055758719200223, "text": "Love from india because of one decision of gandhi and nehru we are stilling struggling because of this Cult muslim religion", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:09:15", "owner": "_vivek_130199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359285668083938, "text": "Never back down Poland. Don’t listen to the idiot liberals that try to gas light", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:53:36", "owner": "xxmechacyberxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038590391467578, "text": "🙌🙌🙌❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:50:53", "owner": "jordan_paps1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066713102190185, "text": "Respect from India", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:44:31", "owner": "rupanzel_0001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18510413002064729, "text": "🇵🇱 respect 💯🇵🇱🇵🇱 respect 💯💯💯💯💯 Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:43:15", "owner": "deneth_one", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17998923605827360, "text": "Europe is no longer in a position to take refugees, we are no longer rich like USA or China.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:27:41", "owner": "dan1bar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895881382303668, "text": "I agree. People of the country pays money for their country's development. It's their choice to take or not to take refugees. It's their choice. You can't force someone to do charity. If you the so called money and conscience, do it on your own. Why should someone be ashamed of not doing charity? It's their choice.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:25:30", "owner": "jibaneshwar_prusty", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18533045737037226, "text": "🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:22:04", "owner": "mominbargar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080985064769076, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:20:39", "owner": "chevchazy.miguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899313133275375, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:19:45", "owner": "shrutimenthe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973915890929948, "text": "👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:17:56", "owner": "debatoshray1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106105099599992, "text": "Respect from 🇹🇷", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:55:36", "owner": "nuit.silencieuse_94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040290773689740, "text": "Yes 👍", "created_at": "20