er": "ashmit330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113951296469067, "text": "So true. Other countrys should listen to him", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:57:50", "owner": "engbergjes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090969964642316, "text": "Videsh mein illegal aadami Nahin rahana chahie", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:47:48", "owner": "555shankarshah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911253076214938, "text": "You listening starmer ?…🛎️🔚…", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:47:44", "owner": "salk71_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040601855456917, "text": "Respect for the Poland government 🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:34:59", "owner": "radhikamishrra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938909974072941, "text": "He knew", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:26:49", "owner": "arash.ahmadi.9910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022388669768692, "text": "\"You can call me racist, but you can't call me wrong\"", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:13:06", "owner": "batman.and.beyond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070193222182090, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:08:52", "owner": "kerrie.schaefer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931411230984972, "text": "Well said.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:07:49", "owner": "valerio_taddei_76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077944001090517, "text": "Ik was er onlangs en ik voelde me veilig en ook in cz", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:05:35", "owner": "monique4566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053430995551317, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:05:33", "owner": "childrenovthecornsyrup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080513212987575, "text": "I'm soooo proud 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:03:16", "owner": "ola.tska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883473409383388, "text": "She hostess may take refugees to her residence if she likes.👍🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:02:35", "owner": "will.i.am.jackson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041362958437636, "text": "Good job Poland. I have a feeling America is about to do the right thing and remove the Muslims as well.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:02:01", "owner": "tdmyers85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079952341790140, "text": "Why is this so hard to understand? This is the job! Serve your people!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:00:36", "owner": "_csm_berlin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17949116489898814, "text": "Poland gets it! Too bad we in the 🇺🇸 didn’t think like this! Guess I might be moving to 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:51:41", "owner": "snow_flakemelter69", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063148718598335, "text": "Ye keep those mfs out", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:48:21", "owner": "erikz.7777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944779551915685, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:44:11", "owner": "parismariie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131511796461097, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:43:45", "owner": "isabellamarialopes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091992094702167, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:38:41", "owner": "ar_core_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046650131338353, "text": "Not even muslims ☪️ don't even allow 🕉️ allow Hindus to ur country they are dangerous for every nation", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:34:19", "owner": "alpha_male0571", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024176228551574, "text": "Waarom dan zoveel Polen in Nederland 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:31:51", "owner": "bodhi4589", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097828447730801, "text": "Smart man.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:30:00", "owner": "liat.davidyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056018099201146, "text": "Esse país deveria mandar na União Europeia inteira, o mundo e a liberdade que conhecemos não seria possível se os valentes guerreiros da cavalaria da Polônia não tivessem salvado a Europa e seus companheiro de outras nações europeia, se não fosse eles o mundo que conhecemos seria regido pelo islã, nem as mulheres teriam os direitos que tem hoje, os homossexuais iriam ser mortos, hoje o povo estuda tanto pra ser burro e ser a favor que quem quer aniquilar eles.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:24:13", "owner": "edwysantos7762", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045199247363114, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:18:33", "owner": "aaryallex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105779980526137, "text": "As is it should be.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:18:09", "owner": "rickymonn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090891346746426, "text": "✝️🇵🇱🗿🪽 Esse país salvou a Europa e deveria ser presidente da União Europeia inteira, países mulçumanos não aceitam refugiados 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:17:53", "owner": "edwysantos7762", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18177521677346625, "text": "🙌👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:16:43", "owner": "salleee23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046102718338397, "text": "Your people should be proud of you !! Well done", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:15:29", "owner": "chefabiovota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093972793665901, "text": "I met Dominick in London on the 13th and he was just the nicest guy you could ever meet! He loves his country and its people but moreover, is happy to stick his neck on the line to keep them protected. We need more like him all over the world!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:14:54", "owner": "dockyarddaz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18325922644234811, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:12:44", "owner": "lawanya_pandey_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359186086088866, "text": "🇵🇱 illegal immigrants 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:09:48", "owner": "suvratverma_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922306480119064, "text": "Yes! He should be very proud", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:00:43", "owner": "carmysecc_xoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059235146152215, "text": "💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:58:36", "owner": "burysekh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101962771622512, "text": "@officiallymaitlis You'd be dangerous if you had a brain.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:58:13", "owner": "tmason117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291699844251593, "text": "The world is finally waking up, how shocking! \"We have fallen asleep for a long time with lies spread on TV/media, turning those who really suffer into evildoers.\" A malicious Islamic program, a cancer of Islam so that we don't notice how it is taking over the world, and God forbid it will reach our doorstep! Dear Christians, Islamic terrorism is not ready for Christianity, for Jews, not for any other religion! The truth is that it wants everyone to be Muslim, in their book of faith called the \"Quran\", it is written to destroy everyone who does not believe - in Muhammad!! Do you understand what that means???!! We must not remain silent and support the destruction of the world, they do not see us as an existence, do not wait for a bad surprise! Remember the nonsense of \"liberating Palestine\", it was just word for word - liberating the world from all people who have a religion other than Islam. A much bigger story than we thought, not really against \"Zionists/Gaza\" and other inventions about babies\" etc. It was just a distraction from us! Their goal is to take over and conquer regions and countries, and turn you into Islam. All the lies and nonsense they publish to cover up their big and real plan! Be careful. Do not help destroy the world, do not destroy innocent people, do not support Hamas terrorism that will not have mercy on you and your family, it is not interested in the existence of all of us except Islam, warning ⚠️\n‎‏ ✝️ ‏✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️\n‏‎‏🇮🇱🇮🇱🇮🇱🇮🇱 🇱🇮🇱🇮🇱🇮 🇱🇮🇱🇺 🇫🇮🇫🇮🇫🇮🇫🇮🇺🇦 🇺🇦🇺🇦🇺🇦🇻🇪🇻🇪🇻🇪🇻🇪🇯🇵🇯🇵🇯🇵🇯🇵🇮🇷🇮🇷🇮🇷🇮🇷🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍🌈🌈🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇩🇪🇬🇷🇬🇷🇬🇷🇬🇷🇩🇪🇩🇪🇦🇷🇦🇷🇦🇷🇦🇷 🇮🇳🇮🇳🇮🇳🇮🇳🇬🇧🇬🇧🇬🇧🇬🇧🇨🇭🇨🇭🇨🇭🇨🇭🇳🇿 🇳🇿🇳🇿🇳🇿🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:57:59", "owner": "valeriavolkova1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068301917191058, "text": "Hey that's the lady that got destroyed by Jordan Peterson a few years ago", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:53:04", "owner": "cdm0920", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860134921500069, "text": "Share her address so we can send refugees to her", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:49:18", "owner": "tres_b_3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095963818675219, "text": "Jan III Sobiesky aprooved 🇵🇱 respect from Brasil", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:47:47", "owner": "jtnritter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913679686069544, "text": "There will be a day everyone say POLAND WAS CORRECT.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:42:55", "owner": "iamrufusrajan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951186474891909, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:42:10", "owner": "iamrufusrajan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935641350961687, "text": "Good man 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:41:07", "owner": "andywilson75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034758593704291, "text": "Well said 💯🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:34:55", "owner": "mariashar50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080814991952575, "text": "Can we already clone people?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:33:55", "owner": "korah_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857576323517838, "text": "👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:32:51", "owner": "sid.lotfi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085572157907781, "text": "🙌🙌🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:25:52", "owner": "kush_desai11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937027567089896, "text": "No he’s not racist he’s looking after his own people and his country bloody good for him shame our British prime minister couldn’t do the same our country the UK is well and truly fucked because of a very weak government 😩😩", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:24:08", "owner": "dowd4693", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050938262637272, "text": "God bless him!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:18:39", "owner": "mrs.dipasquale_12514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312055429175875, "text": "Don't blame them. All those middle eastern people are nothing but problems", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:17:59", "owner": "likelythatguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080694134496459, "text": "Good lad...speaks a lot of sense and he cares what his people want. Good for poland 👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:13:10", "owner": "thebookexchange1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091160743692609, "text": "Well done Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:06:08", "owner": "james.midgley.bozz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916444717056610, "text": "Well said 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:04:08", "owner": "jantte.davies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101391064556207, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:03:58", "owner": "chi_huahuamal2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969048039959550, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:03:14", "owner": "iamvijay.singh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018778892769169, "text": "👍👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:00:11", "owner": "aryan._.malviya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019807622751327, "text": "He have no lacks in his statements 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:59:31", "owner": "gastonalfonzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376279744178768, "text": "Exactly right, why should he take in refugees that he doesn't want? He is right that they have already taken over 2 million refugees, let other countries take the other refugees. Why dont the Muslim refugees go to other muslim countries? If they believe the same and follow the same religions then they would be safe there wouldn't they?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:55:22", "owner": "garryvidler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035952311699935, "text": "I call you a hero, putting your own country and it's people first 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:54:40", "owner": "gemmag1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356408254095629, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:50:23", "owner": "jacobbrachh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375395107151990, "text": "And now look at her own country and the mess they are in", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:36:55", "owner": "adamkilssart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418632118111928, "text": "🚩🚩🚩🚩🚩🚩. From. Hindus of.  India", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:32:43", "owner": "s.srinivasan66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864703474466494, "text": "Why can’t the rest of Europe and America take note from this", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:29:19", "owner": "ant_pala389", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157471888386285, "text": "Canada needs to learn this, and yesterday", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:26:40", "owner": "chrisdbrown75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059499560134723, "text": "Yes be proud Polen 💯 right 🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:20:51", "owner": "fatimaborg04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238102174291782, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:18:00", "owner": "cadenbird2007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099284056640196, "text": "UK is literally destroying themselvees", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:17:27", "owner": "roy.goorman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087348079708781, "text": "Bitches", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:15:41", "owner": "s.l.e.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067432361017004, "text": "The gold standard", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:13:40", "owner": "jeffpadesky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082220233749801, "text": "Yah bahut achcha Kiya Koi to safe rahega from virus 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:12:19", "owner": "thefireboltofalltime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100713112623998, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:12:18", "owner": "manuji28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078617495092038, "text": "Así es que se gobierna 👏🔥🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:11:25", "owner": "caisale1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877287661407832, "text": "Felicitări Poloniei!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:07:53", "owner": "ionutdanielpilan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890399278347959, "text": "My respects to Poland. You are doing everything right! My support from Canada. 🇨🇦🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:07:14", "owner": "tanialevin12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097891240632550, "text": "Amen 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:05:50", "owner": "jenwells5_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909158632229451, "text": "💯 👏 👍 👌 🙌 🙏 💞", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:04:17", "owner": "delle.333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079114396999203, "text": "Respect from 🇨🇿", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:59:35", "owner": "dani3l_private", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056989601631584, "text": "Yes he’s proud of not importing osama’s cousins 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:58:49", "owner": "boobzytheking2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402872395138526, "text": "Respect from India 🙌 You saved your country & your people 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:46:12", "owner": "mausam.parmar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977569671873809, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:40:44", "owner": "lukasneskudla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18412052278117352, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:39:00", "owner": "puslinchchic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088465858891365, "text": "🔥🔥🇵🇱💯❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:36:20", "owner": "urs_trulymahesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843870379572586, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:28:58", "owner": "rose.mirzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883702375380295, "text": "W Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:25:33", "owner": "deusvult1189", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929366281100745, "text": "Respect this man! They don’t want violence in their country - simple! My house my rules!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:21:34", "owner": "silkdiversity", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074638766028485, "text": "Unless I can go Saudi dressing like my normal self I don’t understand why Islam is anyone in the globe responisbilty", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:17:06", "owner": "sunqueen_1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987816651708603, "text": "Interesting how many people are fleeing Islamic countries however when they arrive to other countries they’re trying to make them Muslim, just like the country they’re fleeing from. I wonder if people has noticed that - it’s ridiculous", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:14:43", "owner": "mtz___isa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991301352845248, "text": "I can respect that", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:12:30", "owner": "veeolar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067145042202905, "text": "Yes 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:11:10", "owner": "nickyxmx44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059624891138128, "text": "🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:09:58", "owner": "nephilim.91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096673849711439, "text": "So proud of Poland! 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:08:33", "owner": "the_diy_swede", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295144876248359, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💯💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:07:26", "owner": "jen_jen1815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925629400120860, "text": "I’m moving to Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:07:21", "owner": "jen_jen1815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080155364064698, "text": "Why should another country be force to take refuge or be shamed if they don't. I hate that we do that here in America. He's right about evrything Poland is beautiful and safe", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:03:34", "owner": "emanuel370x", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18345605368163306, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:58:01", "owner": "samuel_r_maynard", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992072610702465, "text": "Not correct, not zero, they're lying. The number is very low but not 0", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:55:30", "owner": "ahmadalsharef994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080800771791292, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:51:15", "owner": "munstersfishing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083295275498612, "text": "Good job 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:47:57", "owner": "evita_.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907421656246746, "text": "Great Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:43:27", "owner": "mordavid411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068509871179186, "text": "he's right 💯🔥🔥🔥👍💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:43:25", "owner": "danielfreitas2124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865000228466432, "text": "I agree. Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:40:55", "owner": "fransiscuspasaribu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532525711039055, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:40:24", "owner": "austin_hiney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059537558527220, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🇵🇱👏💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:38:03", "owner": "hugo.roy.520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18506739400071680, "text": "Excellent Poland!!!. Keep moving ahead with your convictions 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:32:37", "owner": "leorobayoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862895533417357, "text": "A prime minister that loves his country 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:24:46", "owner": "unik.acreations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290609