{"id": 17915491398187039, "text": "🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:47:22", "owner": "__sher.in____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133778302460487, "text": "This guy loves hes own people our western leaders hate there people they only want to be politically correct", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:44:57", "owner": "christinescopasbeachgirl388", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900269080272048, "text": "I don't understand this that there are 57 muslim majority countries why don't they take shelter there and why why don't these countries call them  to take shelter in thier nation . Why they are fighting to get into a country where they don't want muslim refugees. Isn't it a personal matter of a country whom they want to give shelter and to whom they not. Why 🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:42:24", "owner": "pandey_uddhav_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099416074564854, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:34:26", "owner": "platinogram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176187814356074, "text": "Perfect 🇵🇱💯 respect from 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:23:37", "owner": "angelash_couple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343376236164833, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:08:02", "owner": "tmcullingham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345565039166141, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱👍be proud", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:06:07", "owner": "deannacook471", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981349881913636, "text": "So the Poland government actually listens to their people... wow, what a concept. Why didn't biden listen whe. He opened up the border & most were saying NO!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:58:48", "owner": "michele00072", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081134333506878, "text": "America should take notes", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:51:30", "owner": "rowdyrattail", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18166107229370618, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:50:48", "owner": "attackhunterse", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042834827402678, "text": "👏👍🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:45:09", "owner": "f.r.marisol", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102822010609971, "text": "À deux doigts de déménager en Pologne 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:39:40", "owner": "leo.beauger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058842983148857, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:35:29", "owner": "joy._here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068689103520303, "text": "I want to live there honestly", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:26:21", "owner": "alex_shading", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17890461936347964, "text": "Wooohhhooooo GO POLAND. 💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:20:25", "owner": "bravesagacious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097179700648966, "text": "They took Ukrainian refugees, is she racist? She’s conflating refugee with brown.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:15:13", "owner": "thefigure13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919707082156053, "text": "The same thing with Czech republic, and i am so proud of it", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:11:04", "owner": "patricie.hova", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18057345650180179, "text": "I was in bolt in poland. Driver was listening quran…", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:48:48", "owner": "iwtkmysm31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050229341639831, "text": "Standing ovation!!! 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:46:59", "owner": "visentin0775", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17944144659047388, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:45:06", "owner": "yannakissteven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389170189123431, "text": "Anyone and everyone is claiming refugee status these days. Fuck em.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:34:12", "owner": "swedish_chocolate10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070247293958216, "text": "He kindly slapped that reporter 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:24:14", "owner": "suman_x_vier", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087894220870105, "text": "People have the right to be”racist”", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:19:31", "owner": "chanasky67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948458802906255, "text": "Shame queer starmer doesn't follow this guy 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:16:34", "owner": "karl.colin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098638213569289, "text": "I support Poland love from🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:16:03", "owner": "rishabh10656", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973725954782119, "text": "Well done poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:04:22", "owner": "khuxhii_46", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127615978470570, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:00:08", "owner": "miss_daria__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090802753887876, "text": "Omg I love this guy, I agree exactly what he said, I want safe streets, my family and daughters safe, I want peace", "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:36:25", "owner": "max_lost_boy69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942009228936067, "text": "What a strong leader who actually loves his country!! Can’t believe he is being interviewed by one of the dumbest people I have heard speak!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:14:46", "owner": "michellene_kable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062363345376115, "text": "🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:08:40", "owner": "lukasz.935", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094380136707902, "text": "She is so worried. She can pick up some refugees and put them in their house.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:07:47", "owner": "league_of_mauri", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18530333956009760, "text": "Be LIKE 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💯🔥🔥👏👏🦾🦾🛡️⚔️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:04:57", "owner": "missbatistawolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055537433627445, "text": "🔥🔥🔥❤️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:04:15", "owner": "keerthikichus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960978090991932, "text": "Good man! That’s what Ireland needs a leader with back bone and not clowns that pander to media and propaganda! Stand up for the citizens of your country, the people that are the back bone of society and culture. The tax payers that shoulder the country. God bless you sir and I salute you 👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:01:13", "owner": "dermot_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059146271423177, "text": "👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:00:25", "owner": "sangzuali_tbc27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095115331733128, "text": "🇵🇱💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:59:03", "owner": "gaud_s_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136024606442888, "text": "Und so sollte es jedes Staatsoberhaupt machen. An erster Stelle steht das eigene Land und ihre Sicherheit.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:46:27", "owner": "19_mentalist_84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843693637581608, "text": "👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:45:13", "owner": "cind_ykorstanje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861142585497314, "text": "🙌💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:45:11", "owner": "cind_ykorstanje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064677959061305, "text": "Good for them !!👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:33:58", "owner": "leanekent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083418983306480, "text": "Brit here. I went to Poland (Krakow) for the first time earlier this year. Clean, safe, friendly, everything reasonably priced... There seemed to be a genuine sense of pride in where the people lived. By far my favourite place that I've visited. Whatever Poland is doing, they should keep doing it.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:23:00", "owner": "theharrywestgate", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099026221650018, "text": "💯👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:17:14", "owner": "abdul_khodir79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295117030266163, "text": "“And you’re proud of that?” HELL YEAH", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:15:38", "owner": "rtrltyvx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056978267530476, "text": "👍👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:06:00", "owner": "santoshji27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915123838194209, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:04:13", "owner": "sazzle271", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979617339911253, "text": "Yeay Poland 👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:53:21", "owner": "nining.spadola", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885797536363985, "text": "👍👍👍👍👍🇵🇱Poland 👍👍👍 so great 👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:46:27", "owner": "efren.castro.92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084612325733397, "text": "Shaabash ❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:38:20", "owner": "shethiamahek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066788075338312, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:34:59", "owner": "jinu_john_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072155728918292, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:33:14", "owner": "marshallvinding", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18073912415138011, "text": "Wish England followed this plan", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:32:50", "owner": "had_enough_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179195311344172, "text": "We will not go there as refugees.But we are coming to capture it 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:30:08", "owner": "md_tahmid_adit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948822010031112, "text": "Does she know anything about what Muslims believe?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:17:41", "owner": "erictheodoreburd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981785727909900, "text": "the Word need to learn from Poland🔥🔥🔥👏👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:11:09", "owner": "maheshkurude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967053870808445, "text": "Y'all invite them embrace them, in order to hating Asian and China. Don't forget that, it's only 5 years ago, y'all propaganda anti China and ban them, bullying kicked them, violence to them. yall prefer friendly to those terorists than to Asians. Now face your karma. Y'all love them terorists more than Asian and Chinese. 👍👍👍don't play victims. God bless ❤🇨🇳❤🇨🇳❤🇨🇳❤", "created_at": "2025-09-26T06:08:36", "owner": "fotolungolungo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963433821823537, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏💯💯💯🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👍👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:54:20", "owner": "faravasmenj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860985415484397, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:48:10", "owner": "daniel.abu.assali", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089882995827566, "text": "What? Whats wrong with one religion? Are you affraid of us?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:45:08", "owner": "killuadzoldix7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173759767359830, "text": "🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:41:54", "owner": "arvm9337", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074570303473975, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:36:04", "owner": "amuthadewi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 1807015