s": 1}, {"id": 18324761002234689, "text": "Strong work sir", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:37:11", "owner": "israelsolberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051282992634640, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:33:14", "owner": "mrwill_i_am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125746672485809, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:31:38", "owner": "vikas.kr.gupta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391475755125057, "text": "@bjp4india @narendramodi @myogi_adityanath this is what we  want in bharat", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:29:25", "owner": "i.amandube", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419760937108699, "text": "Respect from America 🇺🇸", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:24:41", "owner": "caviltanner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846588058572147, "text": "Terrorists are disguised at refugees. They will only bring their problems and tribalism. They don’t want to assimilate.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:24:02", "owner": "son.nydeleon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058769174388059, "text": "Hell yeah !", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:17:27", "owner": "tyojunior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18220423900306378, "text": "👏👏👏👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:15:42", "owner": "pattylt30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087640831804496, "text": "kitne bekar log hai , hindu muslim kr rhe hai BJP hogi poland me", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:10:32", "owner": "iam_abhi_saini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965128734991994, "text": "❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:10:02", "owner": "holmberg_jimmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907386520246752, "text": "Respect from 🇨🇦", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:07:04", "owner": "heylat19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050840897295030, "text": "👏👏👏👏🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:03:54", "owner": "rosalynpantoja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089780233883204, "text": "Bravo la Pologne 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:02:01", "owner": "eric83440", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528116872057939, "text": "🫡👍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:01:52", "owner": "t1000_jhon17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050355152644078, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:00:05", "owner": "isabelle_de_marchand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926003353131442, "text": "Solid reply. Solute to the Polish Government", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:57:43", "owner": "shepou_pao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879740179402568, "text": "I am supporting to Poland . Europe must be stop the illegal muslim attacks. They will opposite of your lifes and your histories. One day they won't want any churches , you can't work easily. But it is your punishment. The western countries always interrupt to Eastern world , Africa , middle east. So they are so poor . Wellcome to your new hell that created by you.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:54:48", "owner": "ketawnart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159406507377477, "text": "Damn straight", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:53:13", "owner": "cameron_petkau06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307882087300960, "text": "Damn 🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:51:24", "owner": "krishe_la", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067640891587328, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:39:03", "owner": "jaiin_riishabh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906569128247492, "text": "If you guys are afraid of a religion or a skin color well grow you a pair of testicles and stop listening to fascist dumb tv programs and social media accounts yall want « peace » but hate everyone that doesn’t look like you that’s how life works sorry", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:36:02", "owner": "lucas_bllo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045451133356465, "text": "Great mindset 👏 . He didn't allow that Islam viruses 👍 .it's more dengerous viruses then covied 19", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:35:26", "owner": "plm202444", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945320782027318, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:29:06", "owner": "joaovazuos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860697700494183, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:26:37", "owner": "art.mikyver.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979565616873665, "text": "On point!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:25:24", "owner": "maryleidysrodriguez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985912584855332, "text": "God bless Poland!🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:25:17", "owner": "melissakolarart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024844115537203, "text": "Can I move to Poland ?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:19:53", "owner": "michellecmcgrath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954044523991532, "text": "Fuck the EU leadership. They are NOT refugees!!! They are not asylum seekers. They are taking advantage of a woke in broken asylum and immigration system because they are all paid off by George Soros.. Poland is spot on and doing the right thing. The right thing by its citizens.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:16:37", "owner": "jason_karu34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937971712083747, "text": "Be selfish selfish when it comes country", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:12:39", "owner": "pavanaditya542", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108855445572990, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:09:14", "owner": "wambil_wolf1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096771820631830, "text": "Protect your people first then talk about racism, protecting your people first is the absolute priority", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:55:40", "owner": "chandyshot", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17945451846028258, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:48:48", "owner": "bernabe.hernandez1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044944946668572, "text": "I’m going to move to Poland. If they accept me I’m not Muslim. I’m Italian. God bless him. They are absolutely 150% right", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:31:51", "owner": "riccardolore", "likes": 586}, {"id": 17970311297948625, "text": "very correct decision ..", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:31:51", "owner": "valiantoffice", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18323432752242966, "text": "Israel should take every single refugee", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:31:09", "owner": "650_rob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074939018115916, "text": "Respect from The United States!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:24:15", "owner": "joaquin_sulleven24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085334104920924, "text": "Respect 👏", "create