ristian272024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908054998229949, "text": "Is Singapore the same*?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:33:39", "owner": "edwin90123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924413389014245, "text": "Well done", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:33:29", "owner": "edwin90123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079283510057166, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💯💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:30:41", "owner": "kush_unadkat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875886160412987, "text": "GOD FORBID a govt takes care of its own people before worrying about everyone else", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:25:51", "owner": "_lizziiiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956116818859753, "text": "Well done dude", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:25:29", "owner": "babipd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043099547397289, "text": "based", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:23:45", "owner": "carleemfleming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328045390237483, "text": "Don’t. Let. Up.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:22:56", "owner": "mrstevenzeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077683262094364, "text": "Sold Out Channel 4 disguised another BBC owned 💩", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:04:57", "owner": "oldskool_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062652512097329, "text": "They only allow Jews", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:02:54", "owner": "nerofrm6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984801825731013, "text": "Peace is no muslim at all.👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:00:27", "owner": "yin.yang_999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369085978195951, "text": "Wow the Brits need to take a leaf", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:59:52", "owner": "westwell.michelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531834598055311, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌poland💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:59:40", "owner": "ohanameansfamily_alohavoleybal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364886419158405, "text": "I wish the Uk 🇬🇧 is even better than Poland 🇵🇱 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:58:48", "owner": "mic_tizzle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18362399287153887, "text": "Poland have learnt from WW2 that foreign invaders who wish you harm will not be tolerated. They've lived through one invasion and for the Polish people that was enough.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:57:53", "owner": "davidbass72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846984388549152, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:56:47", "owner": "wish_one_knot_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073179281141259, "text": "It’s their country they can decide who they want.. you’re a bully.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:56:26", "owner": "aruba1522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185464333329163, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:50:41", "owner": "grosenwald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079603708802972, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:50:38", "owner": "grosenwald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537224422016472, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:50:18", "owner": "daving2211", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895003870314555, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌go for Poland!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:42:28", "owner": "gabblt25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083012471506978, "text": "Hope my country's government sees this and be ashamed of what they are doing", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:41:49", "owner": "jsph.yxzl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355303936091467, "text": "They took 2mil refugees - that’s the answer.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:40:58", "owner": "anamaria_lifestylecoach", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055259204536584, "text": "Poland has endured being taken over during the wars.  They won't let it happen again", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:36:34", "owner": "mattt.skyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407905768114194, "text": "India shoud learn from poland 🙏 respect poland from india 🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:36:29", "owner": "crick_verse_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078248006071355, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:35:46", "owner": "cest_steeve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012365882790885, "text": "Good decision 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:34:28", "owner": "sanjibbarman839", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877099210310699, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👍❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:32:13", "owner": "shiri_eyal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094029862706113, "text": "🇵🇱👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:31:49", "owner": "maria.7.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097705198642405, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:30:18", "owner": "in_fear_and_fate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898871500277417, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:29:53", "owner": "sle_blessed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069654883977770, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:27:26", "owner": "imthiagosousa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868483864447687, "text": "Yes Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:26:13", "owner": "owenhart1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018430289778597, "text": "I Agree with him. 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:20:36", "owner": "ninush75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844527736567883, "text": "💯🔥🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:20:04", "owner": "pelfortanie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028130819715944, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:19:22", "owner": "chiquiavellaneda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938136382075730, "text": "fuk yeah!!", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:06:26", "owner": "heatherbanks2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047886473324749, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:46:21", "owner": "_irina_eden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097145572579297, "text": "He is right. Every country has the power to decide who is and who is not welcome, including of course illegal immigrants and refugees. Rich muslim countries do the same. The difference is that the media don't interview their leaders. This is double standard. God bless Poland 🙏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:44:03", "owner": "danielfelipe1986", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846839545570759, "text": "Real nigga", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:43:49", "owner": "biggs_gianni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077926928045732, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:41:29", "owner": "sanatani2480", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125038867486114, "text": "Poland for the win!! 🇵🇱 🇵🇱 🇵🇱 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:39:30", "owner": "majohnsonofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915994294054868, "text": "You did the best. You can be sure that your country will survive👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:31:45", "owner": "s.khoobani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112433350545119, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:28:07", "owner": "niebergallmelanie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020949518572603, "text": "World leaders need to take lessons from this dude.  Imagine a gov that takes care of their citizens.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:21:13", "owner": "phatboyshadyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947236471021668, "text": "We need a leader like him here in Canada", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:17:30", "owner": "jaymccue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058531007620922, "text": "KING 👑", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:15:47", "owner": "stefzanini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100744474616506, "text": "Just compare security in Poland and the other western countries, even if your ideology is far left you cant deny the truth, its a fact. Now think about the reason of that…easy! The rest is political matters!", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:13:22", "owner": "asierballesterosgonzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052024316281150, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:03:37", "owner": "andre15474e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119609524506260, "text": "Illegal Muslim & refugees are the same. Not allowed", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:02:13", "owner": "ferger1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064271264592355, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:57:03", "owner": "fab_minty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077644091472173, "text": "It's like you're being kind to someone and you criticize other for not doing exactly like you did. That is not a very noble act, pointing out poland to be proud of not taking refugees just made others' help lost their value.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:56:52", "owner": "manorabbastiana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537170686021976, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:49:21", "owner": "manualfrancis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063049751580044, "text": "This woman gets right up my nose!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:47:58", "owner": "an.austrian.life", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085027906926429, "text": "Proud of you Poland 🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:47:12", "owner": "jhinga.fry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087385252803909, "text": "Super, fajnie. Szkoda tylko, że Ukraina w Polsce ma więcej benefitów niż sami Polacy.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:46:53", "owner": "aniawawrzi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072096421923043, "text": "Polska THE BEST ❤️❤️❤️🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:46:17", "owner": "jorytha_yungsmoke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868038676448525, "text": "Typical liberal tactic. She tried to gaslight him for not taking in refugees. Glad he remained confident in his response. He should have asked if she would feed and house said refugees. 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:35:14", "owner": "twoprimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059650100415919, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:33:57", "owner": "vinayraveendran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179006644355540, "text": "Wtf is he talking abt real Muslims are nt terrorists at all  it's ur propaganda u made .... that's bullshit 😏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:26:30", "owner": "khaoula_ajr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066664064013721, "text": "The entire Western Hemisphere needs to be like Poland! 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:24:33", "owner": "netizen_wmv8ogd.defblpt_znuy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079956518047159, "text": "Best President 🥳🥳🥳🥳", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:24:26", "owner": "l_o_v_e2027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068695736245036, "text": "Poland is based", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:17:55", "owner": "connor_brand00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100398685721152, "text": "Finally, a leader with a brain", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:16:42", "owner": "tonypezzello", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067068134247069, "text": "Fuck the Muslims", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:12:10", "owner": "wcked_smaht", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883157320261676, "text": "Refugees? Why can’t they stay in their own country and fight? Why do they go to other countries and spoil the country", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:10:54", "owner": "brimful_ofash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860173663500252, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:09:30", "owner": "jedibowling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075671678035908, "text": "Yaah the government listens to the citizens good for them", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:08:58", "owner": "selma._.imoughas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080441369296245, "text": "As a British person, why are British leaders, media etc so thick? It’s not hard to get your head round really is it 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:02:20", "owner": "dan_sullivan94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056149418531966, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🔥yes", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:00:04", "owner": "losmotix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190807681325927, "text": "Amazing leader❤️🇵🇱🇨🇿", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:58:55", "owner": "sdts_zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922902991148493, "text": "🙌👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:58:42", "owner": "angiesdoor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942847378051752, "text": "Wow I'm moving to Poland nowww🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:53:22", "owner": "its_bloody_jake", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062687045602230, "text": "Polish are proper people I'm thinking of moving there", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:49:04", "owner": "jj1236725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126330289470206, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:46:34", "owner": "adventuresofdomplusmom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079159202057991, "text": "Right on her face 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:46:02", "owner": "gary_allan190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091281241808588, "text": "Which Canada was like this we just let everyone in here whole country’s a mess", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:39:28", "owner": "jordanjohnbrydle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077590283096208, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:35:47", "owner": "mr_kryszak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104325400606919, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:33:43", "owner": "phephewah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979997274869636, "text": "None well done a man with a spine and care for his country and people . Eff the liberal west with their softly touch which breeds abuse of the system like a parasitic bacteria", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:28:49", "owner": "iiwii646", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079240193297033, "text": "Smart man!! Respect for standing up for your country/ people.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:24:46", "owner": "johnsteele109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358873618083754, "text": "THEY AREN'T REFUGEES!! THEY ARE INVADERS!!", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:23:13", "owner": "mlyssa716", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965572827982293, "text": "Gangsta ❤️🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:16:42", "owner": "edarrenjohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960223128995797, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:15:04", "owner": "nandinij508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097010656726403, "text": "He's not racist he's smart,you let one in,then they will flood in", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:14:50", "owner": "priscillamiranda3468", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983131692741032, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:14:11", "owner": "sundaemd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18345620353163720, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:14:02", "owner": "priscillamiranda3468", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530384362045932, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:13:42", "owner": "rubiambary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062105039093388, "text": "Bin there last week, the new president knows how it works ❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:13:37", "owner": "christiaan_splinter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337442332206421, "text": "Can somebody explain to me why all of the European countries obviously with the exception of Poland are so willing to take in the Muslim refugees? Whose idea was it? What is their motive? Did they consider the consequences? Have they reviewed the outcomes? Why does it continue if it's bad?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:11:25", "owner": "christopherkelly315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069085355271231, "text": "I think....I m going to move to Poland 🇵🇱❤️👏🏾 I salute u Poland 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:10:04", "owner": "elchileno76_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066428420199105, "text": "The world has to wake up! This guy is great 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:07:30", "owner": "kimkaufenberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942165862060881, "text": "W country", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:04:05", "owner": "viau_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126821200484881, "text": "Good for him ❤️ wish UK government was the same", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:48:45", "owner": "amy_christine_price", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358834282083427, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:47:52", "owner": "aloha_vibes_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065006294362395, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:42:54", "owner": "dtvar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967395744952429, "text": "Who is this grumpy lady?😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:41:06", "owner": "irnman88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523499164013111, "text": "Waaah kya baat hai, sabbash 💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:39:13", "owner": "arjun_rodey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879744412287365, "text": "Will be one of the last countries standing 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:38:44", "owner": "marshal_2104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029547929720698, "text": "He saved but what about US ? Other countries  they need to take important measures to stop immigration", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:37:58", "owner": "nandani_singh0951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093427483688172, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:33:22", "owner": "lou_v68", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109579300561531, "text": "Poland 🇵🇱💪🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:32:34", "owner": "andy03tx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900166027142313, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:31:14", "owner": "yulia_in_miami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087400723878866, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:30:48", "owner": "dias_agus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086280466907607, "text": "🔥", "created_