mart", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:40:47", "owner": "sculptures_by_anita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979462170911818, "text": "How many L's does this woman have to take?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:37:20", "owner": "bikemanveek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002429015809818, "text": "All countries should follow suit", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:32:49", "owner": "dawn_wilson2809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053409542630864, "text": "If only my country had leaders like this man", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:31:43", "owner": "ewanooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357933169081324, "text": "A quarter polish. Time to take a trip over there!", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:26:35", "owner": "tonyhodge95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18267395740304669, "text": "🇵🇱💯 - wish we had a leader like him in Australia", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:25:47", "owner": "vet179", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079484393056049, "text": "We need to this in Canada and the USA, the Islam religion is the most vile , disgusting violent religion EVER !!!!!. Go read about the Quran and try to convince me it's not the book of Satan 💯💯 I promise you wherever Muslims go , once they have the numbers they will fight to make any country fully Muslim , go ask Muslim extremists and they will say to kill all disbelievers and to make the country the major religion , as a Canadian I can speak about that not every brown person is Muslim , but we do have alot of Muslims and IMO they can all go the fuck back to Palestine or Iran or wherever the fuck else 💯💯💯😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:25:16", "owner": "justin_time1466", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104404738526116, "text": "🔥💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:24:16", "owner": "rajenharsh7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129737578465295, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:22:33", "owner": "jimmywinter7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105269983596275, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:11:14", "owner": "val.wattier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066960362255558, "text": "Refugees = illegal", "created_a