er": "linzeewoods", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171268153360410, "text": "Don’t let the insects drag you down. Way to be proud of your country. Stick to your guns.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T23:07:54", "owner": "mw_laudadio_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320068513210170, "text": "That’s how you run a country !!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T23:01:22", "owner": "______25jm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916915759177620, "text": "Be like Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:33:24", "owner": "bmunaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080988778786441, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:32:40", "owner": "theromeoohana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098546950711656, "text": "Your not  realy rasist! Go on Poland👍🔥✊️✊️✊️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:29:05", "owner": "janaswarovska", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079421188988646, "text": "Based. Take notes, western Europe.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:24:57", "owner": "adharoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131101945456893, "text": "Muslim refugees do not assimilate and they are not peaceful. It’s been proven in the uk and Germany. The people have had enough! I fully support Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:20:37", "owner": "dani_lynn1011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972851889946591, "text": "As it should be! Bravo to this president! All the people of Europe should learn from him. We, the people, demand it. We're fed up with this shit.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:17:42", "owner": "anabeldominguezespinosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911530549218696, "text": "God Bless Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:16:02", "owner": "stephanie_zeleniak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998854104669856, "text": "Poland making the last stand for Europe 🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:13:33", "owner": "dvdalba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078691241065596, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:13:02", "owner": "michaelsmith4872", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019196603589308, "text": "Think I'll immigrate to Poland👍😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:09:31", "owner": "susieconti07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842579548582363, "text": "Deport them☪️️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:08:01", "owner": "loay11.21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025311464735400, "text": "Nice. Very nice!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:06:35", "owner": "gviched", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857158972522164, "text": "Muslims problems are thier own. We don't need to take them in for that cancer to spread here", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:00:49", "owner": "erik.mckay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097560292650048, "text": "Well done Poland puts are traitorous Cowards to shame", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:57:14", "owner": "englishcrusader1945", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906776488238660, "text": "@bundeskanzler Respekt an diesen Mann! Hören Sie zu, Herr Merz!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:52:53", "owner": "manuela_2301_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971151453792721, "text": "Parabéns Polônia.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:52:35", "owner": "shigueh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085975516880546, "text": "I love Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:49:39", "owner": "bgall20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155649094387945, "text": "Respeto desde españa🇪🇦", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:48:37", "owner": "sexy_sallys_6ixty6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041616023688747, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:47:33", "owner": "jepsonaaron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168506683364295, "text": "Respect to Poland government 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:46:56", "owner": "mr_psyhcotropic_mad__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18503845105066091, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:45:59", "owner": "m.a.r.i.s.i.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865947352461271, "text": "They are all so stupid. They want freedom and free speech. Want immigrant. Islam takes over their country and sharia law will be handled. Gone their choises, gone their free speeches, gone everything they want now. How fk stupid. But it is an agenda to get the big opression thrue. World economic forum 2028. One world order so they can control everything. Its already in the bible it will happen. They do this on purpose people to get power and money", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:44:48", "owner": "larsgundelach_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097966567566365, "text": "Learn with Poland, be like Poland!!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:44:00", "owner": "rbntheone_n_only", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140144305426685, "text": "Amen to that", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:40:48", "owner": "cisco.fxpro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019343417783596, "text": "He’s just protecting his own country. I wish all European countries did the same!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:38:52", "owner": "normanyantonina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091240519808636, "text": "God bless Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:38:50", "owner": "john_zaia", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17984981123731689, "text": "Now thats what you call a government 💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:32:18", "owner": "elainecarey86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090077689746799, "text": "Yoo we gotta kick non arabs  from uae", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:23:16", "owner": "minouu4b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525711865031311, "text": "Well said sir!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:11:31", "owner": "dennisjamesr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083128259506079, "text": "Brilliant man!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:02:46", "owner": "mariebee2016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106620943604135, "text": "God I am so happy that Poland is still normal", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:02:24", "owner": "leviathan1645", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18285500656277477, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:00:12", "owner": "ju.les3817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991976868698772, "text": "👏👏👏👏🇵🇱good job", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:59:47", "owner": "yoa_639", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091509419483316, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:58:56", "owner": "andre10.86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143138653424939, "text": "Sounds like Poland is leading the way! 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:54:46", "owner": "davidantonio26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944198535923117, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:49:59", "owner": "il_marce_1977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022876871744481, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:46:17", "owner": "really_izabella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080227348798208, "text": "Good for Poland and good for their leadership", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:45:40", "owner": "nikkinbrad_williams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889113505224442, "text": "🙌💯 well done", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:45:23", "owner": "shannoncamplin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077514296010089, "text": "Браво и секоја чест за Полска, така се сака и се чува својата држава!  На госпоѓата плавуша ке дојде време кога ке и \"тропнат на врата\" тие \"бегалци муслимани\" само ке биде доцна А не и нејзините деца ако ги има, ако знае што е вредност фамилија, а за Полска чиста 10ка за политиката за својата држава! Прекрасна земја!🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:40:19", "owner": "zlatkosmilevski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021772481753599, "text": "Great job Poland. Poland and Japan are two countries who have been able to keep this cancer at bay. Also another question - why is it that everywhere when it comes to this cancer, reporters come out in support of them and start calling the guy in their front racist? Why so much sympathy for this cancer?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:37:19", "owner": "ashwini_mohapatra57", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17971885961933332, "text": "Holy Christ a government who works for the people of the country they represent. This is so refreshing and it gives me a sliver of hope. I know the Liberals in Canada will never work for the country, they've proven that for over a decade. They make the country work for them.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:28:23", "owner": "mohr9406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059880908581806, "text": "Amen!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:24:52", "owner": "_nurse.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923050114140832, "text": "The problem is the image of Muslims is not like you think please just check about Islam about coran we love peace help donation respect women freedom respect our god our prophet Mohamed صلى الله عليه و وسلم \n\n70% of Muslims are not doing Islam 100% \nThey ruined the image of our religious \nPlease read coran and you will understand what I’m talking about ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:23:45", "owner": "mounir.mld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913622152206502, "text": "Ejemplo ! 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:23:01", "owner": "valentindammer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056410856185623, "text": "É isso aí, tá muito certo🇵🇱💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:10:11", "owner": "andrea_b_teixeira", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18524533591053683, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:02:31", "owner": "doraa_shinn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960705846994066, "text": "Un gobernador que se preocupa por su país y sus ciudadanos. Preserva su cultura sus costumbres h su religión.  No chusma. No muslims.  Islam ☪️ancer", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:49:44", "owner": "chema6960", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082320445755039, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:43:00", "owner": "silvena.ivanovaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125728657468604, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:36:48", "owner": "bernardoxavierlima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962419926975573, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:31:29", "owner": "heyits.janet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044202191344641, "text": "Bravo", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:19:07", "owner": "ana_kasss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026092547529419, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:18:49", "owner": "ana_kasss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056977733165151, "text": "My question for that lady would be would you invite Muslim refugees to come live with her family and her daughters in the same house I know what the answer would be because if she did they'd all be raped by the end of the week", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:09:23", "owner": "doyle.sdm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105255094600321, "text": "just wait for the russians to arrive.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:06:08", "owner": "jtownpacks42069", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367598128146919, "text": "Let’s go Poland, I wish more counties had the same balls", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:02:38", "owner": "rene_z91", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057336611394687, "text": "👏👏👏👏🇵🇱👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:59:37", "owner": "mikee_xx79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020503514757034, "text": "invincible political mindset🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:58:18", "owner": "__dibyansh___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043319405665741, "text": "Some Ukrainian people if not all of them are Muslim I hope I am not wrong ..... but I did work with Ukrainian people and they said they were Muslim", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:57:47", "owner": "vladutu19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173887597357370, "text": "Well done", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:50:34", "owner": "j.eduardo_fitness_fx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843717583573114, "text": "YEAH I LIKE THIS GUY", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:50:34", "owner": "johngardiner8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857690371454167, "text": "Thumbs up 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:50:02", "owner": "kumoncavendish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376620043182693, "text": "Amen !", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:42:42", "owner": "girardi_tony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091329439793705, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:40:38", "owner": "smritiiks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045101906358892, "text": "Kutwijf", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:38:19", "owner": "gerbendebelder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891616006201422, "text": "Sorry but somewhere he talking true. 🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:37:49", "owner": "monik.rem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857001787518410, "text": "Thank you, Poland it is your country and you serve your people. You do not serve people who want to pass judgment for doing what the people want. Get over yourself stop calling everybody racist just because they protect their own people first that is a leader’s job.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:37:47", "owner": "sportsguru793", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063990089367268, "text": "Well done Poland 💯 🇵🇱 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:18:22", "owner": "keithwall259", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061665323100347, "text": "Amazing! Are you watching British Government?? Try some of this, show some fucking balls for once.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:08:06", "owner": "cercatrovaantiques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018939113777371, "text": "Ja pierdole 🙌🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:07:27", "owner": "mirko19eightyfour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174741178355439, "text": "Our goverment could take some lessons from Poland🇭🇷🤝🏻🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:03:02", "owner": "super.slavonac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042317150406061, "text": "If Poland accepted 2M Ukrainians, then doesn't that implies Poland accepted 2M refugees?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:59:35", "owner": "jin_oder_tonic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055137191208455, "text": "💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:57:27", "owner": "moghasushant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524640037015775, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:55:22", "owner": "marcelapfl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096436978736768, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:53:08", "owner": "genevieve.argi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078653534059345, "text": "True leader", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:50:18", "owner": "vkpanic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988426293891477, "text": "And now it’s top 10 economies, great job Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:48:23", "owner": "chereolga1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193449598320894, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️💯", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:46:23", "owner": "milishamilishka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050323679643162, "text": "Diversity creates diversion", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:43:59", "owner": "turnt_up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072063103931273, "text": "Top man 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:35:09", "owner": "jules5greaves", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979995882870468, "text": "Bravo 👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:33:29", "owner": "si_si_gh_fr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846941827549188, "text": "Nice respond, poland. Never let ur door to be opened for Islam, no matter what🇵🇱👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:32:19", "owner": "yl.flash", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974319288936298, "text": "We need him in Canada please", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:32:12", "owner": "mannor80", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17970838622791112, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:23:02", "owner": "jaychocanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991578573703667, "text": "🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:21:24", "owner": "mil.ego53", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054515312626986, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:16:27", "owner": "winhorn825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081927631755922, "text": "Well done Poland ,  none her businesses", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:15:13", "owner": "carolinetero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082887634941724, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:13:04", "owner": "davejohnbowen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097473892647402, "text": "Hey Lady, How many Refugees have you taken into your house?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:06:58", "owner": "596.peter", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18111439450545437, "text": "Браво👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:59:43", "owner": "victoriabm25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549371743032696, "text": "☪️ancer", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:52:14", "owner": "arq.flavio.alves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977775693763828, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:51:58", "owner": "arq.flavio.alves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041351315665790, "text": "If I were this man, i would be proud to be called a r4c1st!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:51:24", "owner": "leticia.garcia87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900548617145822, "text": "Man, we need more leaders like this guy.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:32:17", "owner": "specch79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091278223794378, "text": "Need him to run the U.S", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:26:08", "owner": "johnny.grant.94849", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883065583381534, "text": "What a man.. Really, what a man. Poland, u are blessed to have a smart president with a backbone. Salute to you sir and bless Poland. 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:19:42", "owner": "reuelyap", "likes": 2837}, {"id": 17860947198485342, "text": "Other countries should take note this man has the right approach looking after after his country and people", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:18:51", "owner": "padd.ym2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051377885289026, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:10:15", "owner": "rudr4251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934321890964578, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:10:15", "owner": "rudr4251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015105803789932, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:10:09", "owner": "rudr4251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084374410907850, "text": "POLAND STRONG! When the UK and the rest of Europe fall it will be Poland who cleans up the western world", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:02:16", "owner": "themoitessier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128481391468062, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:00:58", "owner": "kii.vhv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986205828852268, "text": "Well said", "created_at": "2025-09-24T15:49:25", "owner": "maxinebarkway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925192216109962, "text": "Good for Poland keep up the good work 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T15:19:07", "owner": "robert_weese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101270362556884, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T15:15:47", "owner": "kippage_bass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138218056437663, "text": "The guy should've asked why the UK left European Union 🇪🇺 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T15:10:57", "owner": "kosraos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944401935917432, "text": "Fun fact - this is the same feminist that had a debate with Jordan Peterson about the wage gap, thus I'm inferring that she is one of those who will get riled up about the pettiest of things if they oppose feminism even to the slightest degree. I always struggled to understood why Islamists aren't among those things..", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:51:23", "owner": "anartofdrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897866179285655, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:49:20", "owner": "suusmay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063776891077424, "text": "Notice he says countries WITHOUT muslims are safe?? Wake up Canada!!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:48:06", "owner": "brilliantlypure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313110322173967, "text": "Im moving to Poland when they start putting Sharia law into Canada…. Which is inevitable thanks to the Liberal government and every dumb Canadian that voted them in for over a decade. You were giving away your country so your grandchildren won’t have it.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:46:52", "owner": "brilliantlypure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074834038893622, "text": "Hevis absolutely right", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:46:47", "owner": "michaelzehava", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088782925891816, "text": "Sooo how would I go about moving there 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:45:16", "owner": "tattooedteddy93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185814625335391, "text": "Of course there proud, ask the polish people", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:30:31", "owner": "julired56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934553925964681, "text": "🔥❤️👊🏻👊🏻👊🏻❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:28:01", "owner": "precybheang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18529922995019990, "text": "This woman is an idiot", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:09:31", "owner": "dizzyizzyirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059784179381694, "text": "Hell yeah! Fuck those refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:09:08", "owner": "matttheallstar2325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843272149582790, "text": "Im not polish and don’t live in Poland, but I’m proud of Poland’s leadership", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:54:28", "owner": "beeabusybee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165837535369764, "text": "Gotcha!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:53:27", "owner": "dunkel.robin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916697509180605, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:53:02", "owner": "sofiaplatis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983518110896292, "text": "Proud of Poland 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:49:58", "owner": "d_l_steele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111523819544680, "text": "If Europe is facing chaos today, it has Angela Merkel to thank — her reckless political agenda and blind support for mass immigration from Muslim countries have fundamentally destabilized the continent", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:37:35", "owner": "viktoriiadavydova5921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950024458034725, "text": "Adamın dibi .", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:30:09", "owner": "ayhan.kafes.79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074821996894489, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:29:49", "owner": "aujla_gurdeepsingh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053898395239310, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:24:35", "owner": "ericpg_bjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055051178240416, "text": "GREAT JOB POLAND!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:24:08", "owner": "janelleycat", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18088728196847307, "text": "👍Respect from Bulgaria 🇧🇬!Bravo!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:21:32", "owner": "elza.vasileva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18222907603306155, "text": "Christ vs antichrist …. Islam is the antichrist", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:13:29", "owner": "erins_esoteric_essence2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049278095638134, "text": "so proud of this man and country", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:08:40", "owner": "fitcarey11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980116941873474, "text": "Be like Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:05:32", "owner": "jason_jeffrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319686604213218, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:53:00", "owner": "joy_abiakar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095438950664482, "text": "Love this !!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:49:57", "owner": "daddy_o_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062269202370220, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:37:54", "owner": "_lildimes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072012673922983, "text": "🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:30:22", "owner": "tny_strk42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020275988774582, "text": "God bless him for keeping a safe country 💯👍❤️🙌🔥👏 How’s your country? 😂😂😂😂 🗑️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:21:35", "owner": "beachdaze2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920529691038658, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:20:36", "owner": "shahriiaar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075398732119321, "text": "Wonder if I can move to the motherland", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:19:54", "owner": "nickturski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077144315010160, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:17:06", "owner": "im_gourav_dasgupta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103866964588836, "text": "A few years ago, I said this man was racist, but not anymore. Now he says he’s intelligent and smart, not racist—and he’s correct 💯.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:16:04", "owner": "dan_asmara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152072236394436, "text": "I need to move from London to Poland!🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:08:17", "owner": "leoschiavon92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078135050006593, "text": "So smart", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:05:01", "owner": "schmangler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902843683257341, "text": "Their government isn’t corrupt like the rest", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:04:59", "owner": "reider44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916257607197080, "text": "Damn Be Poland!!! 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:00:26", "owner": "dani71579", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360603646154874, "text": "This is a government that is working for its citizens", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:45:38", "owner": "dave_borland1948", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320044438242721, "text": "She had never learned anything from her interview with Jordan Peterson.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:38:27", "owner": "fit_body_con", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339590743200537, "text": "We must all emulate Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:37:06", "owner": "calliecat1214nyc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115315987521295, "text": "I wonder how many ILLEGALS this woman has financially suppor