 "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885837442364985, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:34:44", "owner": "karenrosefan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056947370388967, "text": "💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:26:34", "owner": "jrms2484", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934533087963554, "text": "God bless Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:25:28", "owner": "zimmykruspe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994776924831777, "text": "Awesome", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:15:34", "owner": "lee_anne_kryslin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861757891480749, "text": "👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:14:31", "owner": "grazie_az", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402369850141712, "text": "100% correct!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:12:11", "owner": "shawsy_scents", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860939674489172, "text": "But if Trump Do , he is the worst president Really", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:05:10", "owner": "nlopez_iri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083956169509413, "text": "LUCKY!!", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:02:56", "owner": "nandostrux", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876565954409197, "text": "Brawo 👏👏👏👏👏👏🔥❤️ exactly !!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:59:55", "owner": "kami_szymanska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059264195381962, "text": "Finally a European country that is not afraid of being called racist for protecting their people, the rest of the continent needs to learn from Poland 🇵🇱👏", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:52:01", "owner": "carolinarl11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097009501646125, "text": "I work with refugees here in America. They are disrespectful and disgusting.", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:51:22", "owner": "chris.walther.75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052588358268164, "text": "Good for you guys!", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:49:41", "owner": "chris.walther.75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891505132199870, "text": "You got it crazy lady", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:49:13", "owner": "francoah31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063859370077640, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:49:05", "owner": "busiax33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090049684834052, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:45:42", "owner": "simon.hughes31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544762693011882, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:43:18", "owner": "vonruckus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080496421945764, "text": "This man needs a medal for being awesome and full of common sense.  Countries taken muslim refugees are all in downfall.  UK, Ireland, America ( Michigan, Minnesota) are now being invaded by such. Muslims do not assimilate. They want invasion.", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:41:15", "owner": "denel_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082100506761845, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:37:31", "owner": "elu.addict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974833212924221, "text": "Great job", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:36:13", "owner": "superbtreecare7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864783994397333, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:32:09", "owner": "martina.jurzykowska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113695960530124, "text": "The rest of the UK neeeeeeeds to learn", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:26:47", "owner": "justin_pimentel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079787356791656, "text": "couldn't agree more🇵🇱🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:26:36", "owner": "khunovalatuhary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139924735429205, "text": "I might move to Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:14:55", "owner": "bigyodagreen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088355017849699, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:08:27", "owner": "malantharabibin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089515516660991, "text": "Respect from Finland 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:08:26", "owner": "samialeksi86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090243976871095, "text": "I think I wanna move to Poland never thought I think like that, but that sounds like a great place to live", "created_at": "2025-09-23T13:59:59", "owner": "roberttoub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039888557440724, "text": "Разложил норм 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-23T13:50:24", "owner": "driverdm1661", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305608156218724,