2025-09-23T08:09:34", "owner": "lukasan64", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18090867055796583, "text": "W Poland🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-23T07:36:01", "owner": "antipdf101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925408693109375, "text": "🇵🇱👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-23T07:05:05", "owner": "rahul_rathiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860753719484202, "text": "I love that guy. Really. He represents everything I support. He’s taking care of Poland, he shouldn’t take care of intern problems of other countries.", "created_at": "2025-09-23T07:02:17", "owner": "anabelcanetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181187569338298, "text": "Sure! Ukrainiennes that work and stealing a lot! Take care of your phones😂", "created_at": "2025-09-23T06:49:48", "owner": "eyonna_yonnu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167623006366303, "text": "Everyone thinks that if people/governments/countries are called racists, Zionists or whatever comes to mind, especially on the public network, then you need to understand very quickly where you are headed. Islam is taking over and exploiting you through democracy and you already feel it very well and good luck to you. And to all the gays and lesbians and the humane side who want peace in the world and accept the Islamist immigrant under the pretext of concern and equality...he does not come to acclimatize, he comes to change civilization and you already feel it very well in many places.", "created_at": "2025-09-23T06:47:29", "owner": "ofirshen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017686352676346, "text": "Well done. Huge respect for Poland.👍", "created_at": "2025-09-23T06:39:16", "owner": "jhonayahya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069185861223094, "text": "@rodolfo.yan.1", "created_at": "2025-09-23T06:17:38", "owner": "naiaraacgomes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079125748949681, "text": "The smartest government on earth", "created_at": "2025-09-23T05:58:34", "owner": "xxmaxy._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105762565600897, "text": "A man of common sense,💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-23T05:54:39", "owner": "paidokoukisantonis", "l