75629006024606, "text": "Genius", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:15:41", "owner": "sukittota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087535084872895, "text": "Proud of u poland...I wish every countries follows ur code", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:09:57", "owner": "manashhazarika7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878564254403357, "text": "Bravo 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:07:46", "owner": "travelrue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094025335666672, "text": "Respect for Poland..🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:50:36", "owner": "_spreading_smiles_aj_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882885778262351, "text": "Canadian here; THIS is what we need. We currently have muslims burning OUR Canadian flag in front of OUR parliament building chanting “death to Canada” 🤢 I am scared, horrified and extremely disappointed in the country I have been grown up in my entire lifetime. It has become unrecognizable. I will be joining you soon Poland 🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:48:26", "owner": "caanablisz_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981813762881547, "text": "So move to Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:46:31", "owner": "chad.rehmeyer.80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080676734304526, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:44:58", "owner": "merheiner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048704738320214, "text": "Not every country wants to be France, UK, or Belgium.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:25:23", "owner": "naturapathics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105650911583458, "text": "Hear hear", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:22:11", "owner": "elfheim93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078913621990811, "text": "#USA 🇺🇸 #ENGLAND 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿 #FRANCE 🇫🇷 #SPAIN 🇪🇸 #ITALY 🇮🇹 #EUROPE #MEXICO 🇲🇽 #CANADA 🇨🇦", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:15:11", "owner": "carlitosangel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046834556334731, "text": "Who is that stupid woke cunt", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:00:14", "owner": "marksfp77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097115824643955, "text": "Ja, Schatz, wirklich für eure Leute. Ein Hoch auf Polen. Man sollte euch als Exempel nehmen. Bro💙👏", "cr