and he’s spot on", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:19:19", "owner": "lovedalways70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893685136326342, "text": "I want to live in Polen 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:18:52", "owner": "slaytanicpatrick213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055495901545857, "text": "Don't blame him- illegal immigrants or refugee whatever they all became same eventually-out 100 , 5 or 10 live peacefully but other 90 will make chaos on the name of allah and quran and saria and all that Nonsense", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:18:13", "owner": "radhikaji_kh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090961117767417, "text": "That woman is so d*sgusting lefty....", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:10:45", "owner": "in_candescencia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926893444103516, "text": "Well done Poland।।।👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:04:19", "owner": "mahakalbhaktsumitmandal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057395537164324, "text": "What is this media?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:01:19", "owner": "genghis_khanempire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973753056926137, "text": "The fking media call him racist. CHARLIE KIRK WAS RIGHT THE SOCIETY MAKE THE RACISTS", "created_at": "2025-09-21T14:00:29", "owner": "genghis_khanempire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910362067228086, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:49:42", "owner": "harshvardhansharma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079077595989282, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:43:00", "owner": "sohilrajratan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073372055323988, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:42:09", "owner": "ivonnecella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033363572701869, "text": "👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️❤️🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:39:28", "owner": "marrichkka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880200256281847, "text": "Good Job Poland ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:34:17", "owner": "thick_asssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073353563213846, "text": "I wish my country would act like Poland does and not except any Muslims step it up America", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:26:08", "owner": "johnsonblake89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871142671355210, "text": "That's what a goverment should be worried about, it's own people!", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:22:52", "owner": "j.p_de_oliveira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427800382099491, "text": "Ireland take note", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:08:30", "owner": "donnasunderland_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970306044949692, "text": "More presidents like him", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:51:35", "owner": "vivoshi_vr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105432493584733, "text": "More man like that 💯🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:50:55", "owner": "cobra_leonard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071849585140214, "text": "❤️❤️💯", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:26:41", "owner": "kennethkcee9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291049261264678, "text": "Some European countries should follow his rule. Listen to your people. Illegals are not accepted", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:24:20", "owner": "smpa0824", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092045515702417, "text": "Poland leaders are awake. I hope the rest of europe will follow soon as well.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:22:20", "owner": "radekkrenek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18356155978083308, "text": "Her hair makes me want Ramen for some reason", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:21:39", "owner": "gamerzshadow17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073539614278024, "text": "Its a very Catholic country. They wont put up with all those carry on praying on the streets.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:02:21", "owner": "gracebarry6980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959648523844288, "text": "Sensible leader!", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:01:23", "owner": "gracebarry6980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108336868500330, "text": "Great Poland👏👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:52:41", "owner": "karamawad40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025543688742537, "text": "Great, I hope the other idiot European heads of state learn from you👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:51:22", "owner": "karamawad40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068525207210116, "text": "Poland🇵🇱💯", "created_