, "text": "Please come and rule india 🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:04:33", "owner": "kushal_at", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079857604949377, "text": "Didnt he say he took 2 million Ukrainians", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:02:59", "owner": "________joel_________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396350467136854, "text": "Tbh, I can’t blame him, Saudi hasn’t taken many either", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:56:23", "owner": "libertypicture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069154571227983, "text": "Well done !", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:53:26", "owner": "pascale.vleugels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023648399546208, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👍❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:50:30", "owner": "ruthisaac1115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117213040511966, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:48:48", "owner": "sahil_marshiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111235903533000, "text": "Seriously country should be like poland or else consequences wll be worst at the end!!.. 🙏🤞💯", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:46:40", "owner": "gg_grou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857671471514076, "text": "💯👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:45:23", "owner": "sk8aratas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093376219664375, "text": "Good country💯🇵🇱🇮🇹", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:43:13", "owner": "alex_emilio007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070062272272573, "text": "Yes!💯", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:35:00", "owner": "np57.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129702121463636, "text": "Well done Poland , shame England isn’t the same. !!!", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:22:21", "owner": "matt.w110879", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892845598337721, "text": "Good on this man. He's thinking about his people, his family and their safety 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:02:37", "owner": "_epsmalofou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964298085970679, "text": "Yesss", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:56:06", "owner": "kimmooney12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188607508325376, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:50:53", "owner": "sannidhi_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385849480123111, "text": "Die machen es richtig💯. Wir holen uns Gefahr ins eigene Land, füttern und Pampers sie. Frauen und Kinder können sich nicht mehr ohne Angst frei bewegen in vielen deutschen Städten", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:49:31", "owner": "alexmutterliebe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074743844038451, "text": "The trouble in the UK our PM only cares bout illegals immergrants not us British country we are having more stabbing grapeds ect ect", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:42:50", "owner": "jack.y5094", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190457812323647, "text": "Half of Poland are on UK he's not racist he's 💯% right", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:41:31", "owner": "jack.y5094", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964770876816764, "text": "Dominik is the men", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:30:43", "owner": "antoine_chaffard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079202590998265, "text": "W leader 🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:30:29", "owner": "joshludo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870456463439027, "text": "Well done Poland 🥂", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:27:14", "owner": "stuartpatrickhorton", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006420962684779, "text": "Kan deze man niet naar Nederland komen🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:20:55", "owner": "lisette_1985.nl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071536756898265, "text": "I'am from Belgium and we are invased bij the illegale Moslimpopulation !i'am a big fan of Dominik we need a man like him instate Madame Von der Leye!", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:07:04", "owner": "gypsi38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962390904978012, "text": "They’re not refugees, their economic migrants lady. Who are you kidding? What a stupid reporter", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:03:12", "owner": "aureliawilkinson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979397469875610, "text": "So because they don't let any illegal refugees in... it makes him racist? No, it makes him smart and a brilliant leader. The world's gone mad! Why would anyone want to accept anyone in anywhere when they're unknown?! In all aspects of life. You wouldn't.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:59:41", "owner": "tmcgowan_xox", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884610928365718, "text": "Refugee is leftist agenda.....every country should first care about their own legal citizens before accepting or accommodating refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:52:05", "owner": "mooh_sa_phir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387145399124119, "text": "Good guy", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:50:49", "owner": "johannesschwind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128112484467812, "text": "Cmon look at Englandistan or Spainistan or Germanistan 😂😂 what a looser leaders ... Leaders 😂😂 what a bullsh.it 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:48:41", "owner": "laci.l.pap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306332458223497, "text": "Dumb blonde vitch", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:42:56", "owner": "schnizel9000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053745845230563, "text": "Yeah look at America we fucked up bad and now no one wants to do anything about it cause you’ll be labeled a racist", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:39:56", "owner": "7b_rabbit4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040927547678142, "text": "If you're not for massive immigration and wokisme son you're racist and dangerous... World sees by some people: white/good : accept all muslim without watching. Black/evil: don't accept everybody in your country, you're a dangerous white supremacist racist.... World lost shades", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:28:44", "owner": "stevefrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361780720156069, "text": "Please we need sane policy in India 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:26:31", "owner": "arorameena1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101107414719743, "text": "Very very very very gooooddddd👍👍👍💯💯💯💯 don't allow those devils", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:25:24", "owner": "peter.mushi.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899111665274033, "text": "Wow, a politician that actually represents people's will, that's rare", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:23:07", "owner": "vladholtsev", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042914327382938, "text": "🙌🙌🙌❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:22:02", "owner": "alinka_rosegold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076285189862027, "text": "How many has Saudi Arabia taken? Let the UAE nation of Dubai take them in.  Build them their own island,  or let them stay in Dubai and see how fast it downgrades.  Poland thank you  for standing up for what the polish people voted for. Canada has lost its identity as have many countries that have taken them in", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:19:15", "owner": "nutso.666", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17859714165499233, "text": "🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:04:19", "owner": "_the_vickzzz_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848925604533914, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:59:19", "owner": "shruti_here_love", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18126254119482468, "text": "If Europe accept to receive muslims that means they are receiving this culture as well :  https://www.instagram.com/reel/DOuwwePkULM/?igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:43:27", "owner": "najazgheib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078449035950286, "text": "You will love to hear about the CM of Indian state Uttar Pradesh Yogi Adityanath 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:40:48", "owner": "ka1989rj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966835989958582, "text": "👏👏🔥🔥🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:28:58", "owner": "itzofficial_sid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063709154598626, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:21:04", "owner": "sandip.datta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067813004223183, "text": "❤️💯🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:17:38", "owner": "sterling_jagdeepdalal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065574692036704, "text": "Stand on business 🫶", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:10:45", "owner": "mzandrea101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089665642868931, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱great poland❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:05:05", "owner": "viploveverma111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044380520361880, "text": "OH HELL YEAH.", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:03:36", "owner": "robbyminton", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18098075509632416, "text": "Poland smart 👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:00:5