es": 0}, {"id": 18069035540214949, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:23:30", "owner": "snehasisdas313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105673603606755, "text": "Considering it’s history with the rest of the world, can you blame Poland for not wanting to take in people that follow a faith that doesn’t have the best track record?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:02:40", "owner": "christopher.shaw1388", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893903653184719, "text": "ZERO!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:36:19", "owner": "antnowakk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078012226838080, "text": "Bravo Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:32:57", "owner": "kazio63", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970239816948240, "text": "The man just said OVER 2 MILLION REFUGEES and zero ILLLEGAL IMMIGRANTS  good day miss", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:27:01", "owner": "zee666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020469446756526, "text": "Fantastic 👏👏👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:22:32", "owner": "n_coco68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851763136550123, "text": "Love this man's conviction", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:20:53", "owner": "00thevoid00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986474439721965, "text": "More countries need  to be like this", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:17:38", "owner": "crusinwithkeith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077021597293430, "text": "Kuch samje bhai terrorist attack kyu hote hain Hamare bharat , apply Polanad type model.💯", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:10:05", "owner": "gunjan_kr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131393410459748, "text": "Kpn nih indo", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:08:46", "owner": "wah_ui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857552395514773, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:04:28", "owner": "antoniusss10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310614259174009, "text": "Shut up troll! He’s doing that right thing!", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:49:33", "owner": "johngabranis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092148568702674, "text": "Poland a beautiful country....hood job", "created_at": "2025-09-21T01:41:23", "owner": "antonkurniawa