onal_trainer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083523529819982, "text": "Well done polish.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:30:00", "owner": "supera854", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330355411224057, "text": "Adoro este presente", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:28:51", "owner": "josegabrielcorreia1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091818313748660, "text": "Indian politicians need to learn from him that their country n people come first. Before their politics", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:20:15", "owner": "anuuuu_23_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079412054477084, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:07:12", "owner": "jkmathan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079245157805937, "text": "Polands priority is there country and people !!! 💯 with all Respect to Poland !", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:02:22", "owner": "khay_albro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329640607227986, "text": "How can you not love him.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:01:37", "owner": "thegoodgoracy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071404867935869, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:57:30", "owner": "footballfrenzy220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356505157080195, "text": "שאפו כל הכבוד הייתם חכמים ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:54:55", "owner": "myrym5031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055151630562073, "text": "Great job poland. Show these people to stop reproducing.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:52:47", "owner": "hugosenechal76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896994538167604, "text": "🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:47:37", "owner": "nettisplettis78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066875477010712, "text": "France, Italy, Canada, United Kingdom, USA, should learn from the president of poland, hat's off to the man with backbone ❤️🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:35:55", "owner": "amalxavierkainikatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18236995204294483, "text": "Good job Poland 🇵🇱👍. Never ever let your country become something like my country. Best support from Indonesia 🇮🇩.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:34:15", "owner": "perayogo_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071672137897328, "tex