e imigrants.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:17:39", "owner": "smaddeusart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037052018695871, "text": "Massive respect to you Poland 🫡. The UK should learn from you once Starmer is out.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:16:21", "owner": "brizzlewolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138692578428993, "text": "👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:09:38", "owner": "arshiya.zehtab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963349656970483, "text": "🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:05:49", "owner": "az_guti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055716377192651, "text": "🤮", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:04:10", "owner": "mas_agung_nbx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006282539801597, "text": "Well done sir💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:41:10", "owner": "jai_shree_ram_pankaj_p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047168591647250, "text": "🇵🇱 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:38:41", "owner": "imabhii007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954109299871866, "text": "🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:38:06", "owner": "keyur_jain05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910757272217354, "text": "Love it love Poland love it's people and love it's government keep up the good work fuck Islam", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:33:15", "owner": "coderedrummel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074314882879875, "text": "🙌❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:16:50", "owner": "omiie_mh09_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084369655897616, "text": "Well done Poland. It’s not racist. It’s how the world runs. When it’s Christianity and we wanna keep it that way in our own country right away we’re racist lol. But anyone else wants to keep things to their religion they’re not racist anymore it’s okay then. The world’s double standard is amazing.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:15:27", "owner": "_modest0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979449252880572, "text": "👏👏👏👏 way to go Poland !", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:12:18", "owner": "lolapalooza_and_furbabies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18240040372294630, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:51:17", "owner": "inish_gupta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076930166090065, "text": "Go Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:47:42", "owner": "marrsbarrs1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879319453402014, "text": "as someone living in a muslim country i totally agree with him.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:42:54", "owner": "acheron.aa", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18051929621560582, "text": "In cancer se duniya preshan hai bsdiwalo ser", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:31:53", "owner": "pandit_suraj007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079864487074139, "text": "He's trying to save his country from racists.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:19:01", "owner": "philbresser", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899352544272816, "text": "👏👏👏👏💯💯💯💯💯you are the best", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:18:49", "owner": "aesthetique_bliss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311318359172173, "text": "Good for him! GO POLAND! 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:13:03", "owner": "junemargaret7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322974364236782, "text": "Well done Poland 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:10:01", "owner": "canadiankx100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18184468204328775, "text": "Good. Its ok to be rasist if its about them. Because they will just come to ruin your country", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:55:21", "owner": "yunia_yuniarsi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926641230998367, "text": "👍👍👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:54:08", "owner": "yunia_yuniarsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075355256514217, "text": "Respect", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:47:28", "owner": "giuleo1998_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058836179419745, "text": "as a ukrainian thank u, so much. im sad ill never see my home country, but id be honored to see", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:45:11", "owner": "janell.em", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028849031721085, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:38:19", "owner": "stefan_cehlar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024051146751945, "text": "W Poland🇵🇱respect from Finland🇫🇮", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:33:19", "owner": "valtteri.flyfishing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090763969773578, "text": "All my Respect 🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:22:30", "owner": "urviikaushik_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18126735619464562, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:21:59", "owner": "seanwilliams1106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177445258342202, "text": "Im a muslim and i live in iran. Although i would say... KEEP MUSLIMS OUT man.they fucking ruin everything they touch", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:11:46", "owner": "major.h.f167", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020692442573879, "text": "Perfect decision 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:06:27", "owner": "iamjohnwick28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091785721701413, "text": "Perfect 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:05:15", "owner": "alexwerner_83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882619375259876, "text": "We have to move to Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:03:02", "owner": "_levystro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129061792461486, "text": "Awesome country.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T15:02:59", "owner": "harry656790", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046901156336474, "text": "There's no need to invite criminals into your home to prove you're not racist 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:58:49", "owner": "theweirdibi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074856968039579, "text": "Time to move to Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:48:56", "owner": "hudson.tina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068228168520345, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:28:19", "owner": "wendybeatwerton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862419856417395, "text": "Why is the lady trying to patronise him ?!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:08:18", "owner": "liftlaughlove.teena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080770010305172, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:56:38", "owner": "the_icy_queen_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077951464974868, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:52:39", "owner": "goce.stojcevski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082481269821917, "text": "@anjani_j_", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:47:53", "owner": "madhureshmahajan31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137964106431613, "text": "2 millions Ukrainians are refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:47:50", "owner": "chany.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978084891868544, "text": "Polish mentality is something that people like this blond dumb wont ever understand. No to terrorism, no to war. We had it enough in our past. Be like Poland, don’t give a f*ck, bro", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:47:14", "owner": "molendakvcper_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891645028340982, "text": "👏👏👏👏👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:44:09", "owner": "davidchaneli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077991847836639, "text": "👏🔥🔥🙌🙌💯👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:35:01", "owner": "_guru_mauli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980944173746931, "text": "I am shocked that she still has a job as journalist.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:23:31", "owner": "mv_scrapped", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087859648677188, "text": "☝️☦️☦️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:22:04", "owner": "soly.haddad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072959705155788, "text": "Well done and great job 👏 👌", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:16:19", "owner": "harishsidhu45", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18491101714075220, "text": "This is the best Decision taken 🫡☺️ This Was the decision that could be taken by whole Europe", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:15:06", "owner": "ankit.nagar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867120409448624, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:13:13", "owner": "99ankit_rajput", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128837959462842, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:11:25", "owner": "topofthelineinspections", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004926629804909, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👍SUPERB 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:00:06", "owner": "iris__guerra_1919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414091711115687, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:53:52", "owner": "nico_baiocchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908589727235154, "text": "Poland has a history about muslims. Polish King John III Sobieski saved Europe from further Ottoman conquest in 1683.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:49:01", "owner": "mariustroll", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078599909478074, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:41:10", "owner": "dennis_mennis_helmond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851083531554073, "text": "🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:33:19", "owner": "dawid_gaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238028611288595, "text": "I care about my family and country", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:33:04", "owner": "nikolas_ioannides", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105410806583846, "text": "Poles are all in England 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:24:33", "owner": "dannygraves990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867431233447197, "text": "Learn from Poland send Muslim refugees where they practice their own religion plenty of room for them in their Arab world. The Arab world is wealthy enough to house  them why do they want to be in the West and Europe when they don’t like our way of life. Not being nasty but if they assimilated it’s a different story", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:24:15", "owner": "mereilleec", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904217689252884, "text": "respect", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:22:56", "owner": "prasetyade_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074378264028250, "text": "Yeah hopefully trump will take a card from him and start deporting Muslims and anyone connected to Islam from America", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:20:07", "owner": "lumper83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058452431386871, "text": "@markjcarney you could learn a thing or two", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:58:48", "owner": "carlocarlesimo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18284151034273383, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:58:16", "owner": "carlocarlesimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061976174373282, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯💯💯💯💯💯🇵🇱💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:48:52", "owner": "dumont502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076698383077932, "text": "WHOA, an honest and patriotic national leader who ACTUALLY CARES about his people, has integrity and isn't an evil psychopath! That's actually shocking!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:44:42", "owner": "kevinmeisenbacher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075751934283619, "text": "Lets be more like Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:44:20", "owner": "hiramdavid_realtor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18131992384458395, "text": "🙌👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:32:08", "owner": "flaviojasonfig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359336872085851, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:28:13", "owner": "kpink4567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331504543232881, "text": "From a Brit well done Poland, a country actually doing it right 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:24:35", "owner": "xkira28_x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068525228518315, "text": "Bravo komšije", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:17:33", "owner": "darko._.curcic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923119219018180, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:12:06", "owner": "4two_fy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948106060009517, "text": "👏👏👏👏❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:06:26", "owner": "michael.zenou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126645760472392, "text": "Love it🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:59:20", "owner": "____mr.morningstar007___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080846890781067, "text": "I love his confidence", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:47:20", "owner": "_thegreatestcb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881274190390655, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:45:48", "owner": "mr.burns663", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104587498588798, "text": "Nice! MUSLIMS ARE CANCER", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:45:33", "owner": "fejemina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057930422150791, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:45:24", "owner": "yash_yt28", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085828273908156, "text": "👏👏👏👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:29:58", "owner": "gunkddkusuma", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17997669884820224, "text": "Poland setting the standards on government: for the people.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:28:47", "owner": "mrshades808", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860068630488554, "text": "He has a dog face, what do you expect??", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:22:55", "owner": "barrouh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18326358553235278, "text": "Well done Poland 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:20:40", "owner": "anindita_saha10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085762555693782, "text": "True 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:15:08", "owner": "dilan_rasika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860338615484633, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:14:26", "owner": "cmlovesmuse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079758394797051, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:10:21", "owner": "rudrani_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865371175462813, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:01:23", "owner": "h_a_ri______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922579321114627, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:01:11", "owner": "h_a_ri______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079418623957577, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:56:01", "owner": "greisexerlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007232351797200, "text": "Perdete esempio 🇵🇱 grande Polonia", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:51:20", "owner": "ed_edd_eddy_192", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909462406087628, "text": "❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:21:36", "owner": "thakurlokesh_1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992316534835884, "text": "Am an african n so proud of you Poland,  don't let those mutherfuckers destroy your country", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:21:14", "owner": "bmapuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060493247380009, "text": "Ama", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:20:28", "owner": "bmapuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919671538037235, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:13:14", "owner": "djohal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403519669136072, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:09:11", "owner": "hazonorel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082929556925040, "text": "amazing right", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:08:36", "owner": "komophe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853435636541726, "text": "🙌❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:08:05", "owner": "torinomaso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088235458887522, "text": "\"It's ironic that Europe, which once looted Africa, Asia, and the Americas through colonialism, now refuses to take in immigrants from those same regions.\"", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:05:50", "owner": "therakibulzain", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941254924004101, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:05:17", "owner": "eddiecgh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068672855270381, "text": "This kind of liberals are  the main reson of today's European condition Europe is struggling for their own land culture tradition language and most important thing is religion", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:04:01", "owner": "mustache_sanju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088826980665394, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:47:46", "owner": "jishnudevkv143", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094928650735244, "text": "Im moving to Poland🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:37:30", "owner": "jayla09111981", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18156087817388221, "text": "Please can we come and live there? 🙌🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:36:08", "owner": "pimms_o_clock_2025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861673702475192, "text": "Bravo Poland! 0 is the best for all the Europe!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:36:05", "owner": "minaciunterei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535488958059852, "text": "can we replace Brussels with Warsaw\n🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:27:11", "owner": "robin_waddy_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084075865929238, "text": "I really respect this man 🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:13:58", "owner": "anshika_aasiwal_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926701321121067, "text": "🇵🇱💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:01:43", "owner": "roxana_balu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993476055828334, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:57:54", "owner": "rai.mintoo2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075466778118414, "text": "1st someone slap her", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:57:09", "owner": "im___kalyann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061164755592707, "text": "@keirstarmer take note! You fold quicker than a 2000s flip phone.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:49:40", "owner": "ross._.rowlinson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961332180987811, "text": "very well done. not a single one deserves to enter. check what they have done in Sweden", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:38:58", "owner": "arsim5891", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092070406774933, "text": "That's a man who listens to his people and not being in politics for filling his pockets. Listen Belgium!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:27:48", "owner": "cindy_gsms", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902953753125067, "text": "Love this Man 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:27:27", "owner": "sehan_maduranga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981463983876580, "text": "Congress khan party ko Poland bulakar Jute maro 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:13:02", "owner": "ajay_rajput1137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060110405453422, "text": "This video is from years ago, Islam has grown in Poland since then", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:12:37", "owner": "nazeeba_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373099501183281, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:12:04", "owner": "ajay_rajput1137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052477901249779, "text": "#myogiadityanath", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:06:24", "owner": "sanatani_sagar_guptavanshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526736530013717, "text": "#amitshah", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:06:18", "owner": "sanatani_sagar_guptavanshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377726419177399, "text": "#narendarmodi", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:06:15", "owner": "sanatani_sagar_guptavanshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375582616196680, "text": "Italia impara sa questo eroe", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:05:35", "owner": "gionny_88_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100451446718897, "text": "This is a smart man", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:05:26", "owner": "elan_barash", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979150503755914, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:59:44", "owner": "thomas_guu06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117006823511882, "text": "Respect 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:59:16", "owner": "ankit_dore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982119396906840, "text": "Every country should follow Poland...NOW 👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:52:46", "owner": "duane_learhinan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18005354111802357, "text"