, "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104913487584602, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T16:42:30", "owner": "mirelaivosevic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909393400089149, "text": "Country first 🗿", "created_at": "2025-09-19T16:37:39", "owner": "_althaf97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113239447534096, "text": "в европе, только у правителей польши здравое мышление лол", "created_at": "2025-09-19T16:33:46", "owner": "_lustvamp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068885765239450, "text": "Way to go,", "created_at": "2025-09-19T16:14:23", "owner": "passerinolily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070058632944282, "text": "If you want to save your NATION resist islam ☪️... Resisting Muslim is equal to resisting satan the devil.... I love Poland❤️, in fact I'm going to Poland right mow", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:57:44", "owner": "sfamiquartz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066299426010096, "text": "@dominiktarczynski thank you so much for saving Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:50:29", "owner": "ryan.perez2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922196641115212, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:42:30", "owner": "danielleharrington01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033973205506405, "text": "And that's why in about 20 years Poland is going to be the only country in Europe that's still European and they will have Europeans flooding them because it's the only safe place", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:38:21", "owner": "i_cause_safetybriefs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095941846656823, "text": "Bro doubled down when she asked again", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:27:59", "owner": "breadley____6280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305751469217756, "text": "I love this!! 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:15:29", "owner": "michaelbrezzy16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064720034204220, "text": "💯👍👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:20", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094751236665132, "text": "👍🇵🇱👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:19", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289657609284470, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:18", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339621826166788, "text": "👍🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:16", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092664712774836, "text": "👍💯🇵🇱🇵🇱👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:15", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105458005576865, "text": "👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:12", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327900004231337, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:11", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082274197746572, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:10", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407514040118793, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:09", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075940139472086, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:08", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010431053753594, "text": "💯👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:07", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094207087707886, "text": "💯👍🇵🇱🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:06", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149903971403743, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:04", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876448627306512, "text": "💯👍👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:03", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384616321135788, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:13:02", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069079159965193, "text": "💯👍💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:59", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068981722976806, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:56", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040968620416952, "text": "💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:54", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096208402679052, "text": "💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:53", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854908627476767, "text": "💯💯👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:52", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058880558123911, "text": "💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:51", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362412163153248, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:50", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981520272858992, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:49", "owner": "sanatanyodha4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047801402330826, "text": "What a alpha leader", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:10:09", "owner": "ryan_11899", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153021883357793, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:53:56", "owner": "m_krishna_yadav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526963069048667, "text": "The only healthy European country", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:47:22", "owner": "azoulay_noam", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17900636151268037, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:44:42", "owner": "qualtrium", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012971693610374, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:40:26", "owner": "mariojacoppe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040929209436105, "text": "Song name?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:15:45", "owner": "davigvaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483989023072252, "text": "Every state can set whatever conditions it wants. The fact that there are people who can't face the truth that they did something wrong and therefore try to blame their problems on others is another matter. Every state governs itself, every state is sovereign. Eat what you have done...Germany, France, Britain, Denmark, Austria, Italy, Norway, Sweden, Spain, Portugal, Greece, Finland...", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:58:54", "owner": "ydannilov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965277039972036, "text": "Poland, here i go , legal of course", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:35:23", "owner": "maxmadok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063495107358358, "text": "💯🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:19:00", "owner": "arunkumar1vijayan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032724296703901, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:18:08", "owner": "76jco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044717405665952, "text": "I'm in Sweden for 7 months now and I am so shocked when I asked about why there isn't a Swedish flag waved in a highschool truck graduation and they told me it's because \"it's racist\" ....like how can it be racist when this is your own country. It's like Sweden adjusts and Swedes are now the minority. I wonder how it would be in the next 15-20 years. Sweden should learn from this😅", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:05:11", "owner": "chrlnvejante", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083497906914837, "text": "Brawo!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:45:25", "owner": "premdevayog", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087315529847668, "text": "refugees its the same of illegal muslins", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:42:18", "owner": "ths_matixs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065286827032541, "text": "The only European leader with a brain", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:40:07", "owner": "xvx.xv.x", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18049793138305768, "text": "I would like to have the same in my country 🇨🇵", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:14:16", "owner": "enzob__17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18317376520214582, "text": "Bros lowkey valid", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:14:03", "owner": "salimstibbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072406460132499, "text": "An example for the world", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:10:11", "owner": "michaeljadot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908342026231994, "text": "I’m proud of this man, and f*** this baby girl, she wanna destroy my country", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:54:31", "owner": "gracjan_jodlowski", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101919118715761, "text": "Thats not true guys i have been living in Poland for 6 months and believe me its not true.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:38:57", "owner": "gewrgiou_th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944172334026523, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:38:41", "owner": "sahiljangra6868", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849805024523080, "text": "Not wanting to be Bomb*arded and Disliking Ter*orism isn't RAC*ST👏🏻👏🏻🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:17:03", "owner": "gabrielle123670", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092123656765187, "text": "Respect from India 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:11:20", "owner": "rax_official00", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18155713597385184, "text": "💯🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:02:03", "owner": "suyash_kawankar_59", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089974726645735, "text": "No one thinks pollard is racist😭 we are all just jealous you have good leaders.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:58:30", "owner": "vra_mac", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089100553865371, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:46:47", "owner": "hegde1523", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18291511882250297, "text": "👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:12:53", "owner": "jek_s77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130117534460962, "text": "I mean how can he  after seeing what has happened in other countries. \nI", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:02:17", "owner": "mrleveau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882585007384234, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:42:55", "owner": "vitormoreira__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090286447768978, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:34:58", "owner": "mourovatykocour", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17972070089941256, "text": "☪️ancer free nation ❤️🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:40:54", "owner": "sujith.ssb", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063200315369894, "text": "Poland 🇵🇱 we respect you 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:25:53", "owner": "soul_rik_ftw2.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18191750941320267, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:21:35", "owner": "johnowen.good", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095276530670461, "text": "Everything should take example of Poland and stop letting bulks of immigrants in their country all they do is destroy it litter it and abuse it in every way Kmt", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:00:17", "owner": "foodie.nay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071466445911794, "text": "☪️ancer free 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:58:54", "owner": "mahin.hatake", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041854445399359, "text": "Well done Poland .. keep your co