16T06:18:56", "owner": "zypranto", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18157642966346979, "text": "Whole europe is proud! Go 🇵🇱💪", "created_at": "2025-09-16T06:16:18", "owner": "bigwatercarpadventures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388503805122803, "text": "Poland is a  Christian country and he listen to the voice of his people", "created_at": "2025-09-16T06:12:06", "owner": "1969yankee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925276807121148, "text": "🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-16T06:11:26", "owner": "1969yankee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107760115565818, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-16T06:05:08", "owner": "papsy18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969553170793124, "text": "Cant we just say \"Yes\" when they ask if we are racist. Just say \"Yes\".. Make rasism great again!", "created_at": "2025-09-16T05:57:58", "owner": "mariussolberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885482053242618, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏 he is totally right, he cares for his country, for his family 🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-16T05:56:38", "owner": "andreaalcantara9418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052289648545688, "text": "Nationalism is literally a biblically sound virtue. Don't let anyone tell you otherwise", "created_at": "2025-09-16T05:51:06", "owner": "jared.birmingham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358707328085500, "text": "I will tell all the countries and their respective governments protect your country from demography change and do not become a NGO for others for the sake of humanity there are 47 declared islamic states deport them there", "created_at": "2025-09-16T05:47:57", "owner": "supravo_biswas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105679195604452, "text": "🇵🇱 respect 💯💯 from India 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-09-16T05:45:23", "owner": "supravo_biswas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055579043569262, "text": "Dekho sab jage rss aur Bajrangdal wale nafrat faila re hai 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-16T05:39:22", "owner": "being_kanhaa9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 178794904