"👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:15:44", "owner": "annaakaz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957985360003089, "text": "Respect Poland ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:15:41", "owner": "ja.kingo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18325703632224179, "text": "We need this policy for India also.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:15:23", "owner": "deeps_duttabir", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079116448791339, "text": "Hats 🎩 off to this man 👍👏", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:09:51", "owner": "quasar2696", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893394286324560, "text": "Not racist! Poland is a CHRISTIAN NATION ✝️", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:07:44", "owner": "catholicprodigal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978662514868399, "text": "We need more of him button✅", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:07:30", "owner": "paatriik9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18192984277319026, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:07:22", "owner": "trajkovska__simona", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17963523041970074, "text": "Fuck this stupid cunt", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:05:08", "owner": "gastly.3v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039723896438356, "text": "This is what we need", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:03:53", "owner": "jake.koivula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180825865339580, "text": "DISGUSTING", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:03:12", "owner": "g_gerardgg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148728451369009, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:00:52", "owner": "grigorytikhnenko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858040222507451, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:58:08", "owner": "stef_ania_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894664060304064, "text": "@leonardo.loreti", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:52:06", "owner": "davidecicinelli42", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842954590572936, "text": "Im proud of my brother 🇸🇰🇨🇿❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:51:04", "owner": "vaannnnnannn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094930714660128, "text": "Well said and we’ll done 😃👍", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:48:54", "owner": "shellyy_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097842112727829, "text": "She didn’t even give a damn that Poles accepted 2 millions of my fellow Ukrainians, Polska górom 🇺🇦🤝🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:44:48", "owner": "_max_ambriz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096017923636145, "text": "Dan di negara si pewawancara itu sudah banyak masalah dengan para imigran😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:41:36", "owner": "trullyfedrik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922705552078884, "text": "Yes we are proud 🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:35:06", "owner": "joannewieckowska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522677128051574, "text": "Yes, some Poles sought refuge in Haiti when Napoleon sent them to the French colony of Saint-Domingue in 1802 to suppress the slave revolt. After discovering the truth about the rebellion, many Polish soldiers defected to join the Haitian side, becoming integral to the fight for Haitian independence. Following Haiti's victory and independence in 1804, the new Haitian government offered these Poles citizenship, and roughly 400-500 settled there permanently, primarily in the village of Cazale, forming the community of Polish Haitians.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:33:15", "owner": "no_iamdone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079991369476169, "text": "I like that “Nothing to do with racism when it comes to country’s security” Poland on point always", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:32:57", "owner": "muregojeremie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012534593785709, "text": "I care about my family and about my country. 🎤💧", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:32:06", "owner": "domlbaseball29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885259627242146, "text": "@dominiktarczynski you should have said that Poland is hosting 2 million refugees from Ukraine, but doesn't accept illegal immigrants. The difference between refugees and immigrants matters.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:31:51", "owner": "pikey_pictures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019587062775415, "text": "But they came to Haiti seeking refuge in the past . I guess history won’t repeat itself", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:31:25", "owner": "no_iamdone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864123997393305, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:29:28", "owner": "cko729", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18479778739077248, "text": "She’s tryna make him look bad, but just because there not Muslim doesn’t mean the aren’t refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:16:15", "owner": "toby_mobbs17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082704073932532, "text": "I respect him. He’s protecting Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:12:24", "owner": "kisskissrie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016331438782542, "text": "Why don't Muslims want to live in 57 muslim nations?", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:10:10", "owner": "hz.y_kk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928053928101431, "text": "He sees the problems in all the European countries so her is proud to standup for his own people", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:09:50", "owner": "globalmind_222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077945929825565, "text": "Boss🙌🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:08:08", "owner": "weldersofie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053884757197649, "text": "Che meraviglia di politico... Perché cristo non hai voluto che anche il resto dell'Europa ne avesse almeno un paio in ogni stato come esempio di logica obiettiva?", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:02:27", "owner": "arneseleonardo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18240120166294809, "text": "Poles are everywhere 😂😂😂.. faking gipsy", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:00:02", "owner": "nico.sivi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089215546810414, "text": "How many Muslims countries had taken muslim refugees??", "created_at": "2025-09-15T11:58:53", "owner": "meytalhasid", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18308920276172084, "text": "Wise man 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-15T11:50:39", "owner": "luis92_og", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069125672230852, "text": "In Poland you have to try everything for Integration living there. That's the point...", "created_at": "2025-09-15T11:46:49", "owner": "kacper_kd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146663242408056, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱 good decision something you have to be racist", "created_at": "2025-