": "paul_y_ratu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041148326680266, "text": "Well done,  you should be proud. Protect your own first.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T09:08:45", "owner": "joolsminxy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018210227774273, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-09-15T09:07:10", "owner": "turlakova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086928703854182, "text": "Muslim means terrorists. Not all muslims are bad but I guarantee that 90% of muslims support terrorism Jihad and all. So each and every country should take this type of initiative like Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T09:03:43", "owner": "manashdeka34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088099300888360, "text": "Le mec clairement dit :\n\n« Vous pouvez dire que je suis raciste, et tout pleins d’autres mots en .iste, j’en ai rien à faire, tout ce qui m’importe, c’est ma famille et mon pays ! »\n\nIl a tout compris, il y en a assez de vouloir se mêler du cul de Pierre, Paul et Mohamed.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T08:57:22", "owner": "val.lmx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059656280374586, "text": "She's asking about refugees, lol. She should ask herself how many refugees there are in Europe and how many are illegal immigrants. By the way, he answered her, because 2 million people from Ukraine are refugees, people fleeing war. What a stupid woman, she got herself into trouble because of her own words😂 anyway be like a Poland 🇵🇱 because this is such of clear example who doesn’t believe should visit Berlin, Paris ,London and go for a walk during the night if you survive then came to Poland and do the same you will see and feel the difference.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T08:57:16", "owner": "lukasdru88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104980840567264, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-15T08:52:48", "owner": "hugo.pinto04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987099303849393, "text": "Taaak 👍👏🙌🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-15T08:51:39", "owner": "aura_poleflexibility63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429155251102137, "text": "You lucky whit your government", "created_at": "2