upid b@tch", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:49:27", "owner": "nelson_lebrinhas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936687205079932, "text": "7 million refugees from Ukraine in Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:46:04", "owner": "svet.fatima1112", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17847237366561459, "text": "👍💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:46:02", "owner": "wirawan554", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059659349109399, "text": "Too bad most governments don't actually care about their own people.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:36:38", "owner": "magickandy_x", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18379683349134580, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱 we need to learn from them", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:36:09", "owner": "magickandy_x", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18050631653646726, "text": "Has a real one not racist", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:29:40", "owner": "sharkz365", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065184134033313, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:28:07", "owner": "lama.arafeh.jr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055753745432322, "text": "Ακριβώς!!!👍", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:26:25", "owner": "demetrakatsike", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081291755503786, "text": "But is there a problem with peace. Now. Woooow  Crazy chik", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:26:02", "owner": "sammusic036", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066949574211126, "text": "❤️❤️🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:24:36", "owner": "vishalthakur_8498", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078447845500440, "text": "My friend went to Poland, found a job and sends money back here to his family in Ukraine.🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👍 Way to go Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:23:01", "owner": "maximpetlura", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086271220861821, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:22:52", "owner": "sofiagioiaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918175327180324, "text": "Ovako se svoj narod brani,bravooooo", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:19:04", "owner": "nikolinatanjga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039874679450948, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:16:34", "owner": "danny.e7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 180722