er": "xer0514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000748706650985, "text": "Foi a melhor escolha de todos os tempos. \n\nO tempo inocentou ele e toda Polônia. \n\nQue sirva de exemplo para todo país que ama sua liberdade.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:54:40", "owner": "gunnareric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876016144312487, "text": "I just love this man for real he’s a hero 🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:51:45", "owner": "scott_.durk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848281927559486, "text": "Why doesn’t she go live in the country  the refugees come from since she so into refugees. I bet she won’t take her family and go.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:31:10", "owner": "wallywmanagement", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962061984978267, "text": "God bless", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:30:58", "owner": "e.b.a446", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115944055510991, "text": "Best leader 🇵🇱👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:28:28", "owner": "redbearrrrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527528773001454, "text": "Good shit.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:22:17", "owner": "adde_sthlm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923756503113206, "text": "He should be proud! 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:16:58", "owner": "hurrikayne2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025628798726237, "text": "And that is so well said !!\nA goverment that actually listen to the people who voted for them !!\nBravo !!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:05:52", "owner": "peter1970janssen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18343269826163165, "text": "Refugges my ass!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:58:37", "owner": "mariahelenafleischman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979047171910635, "text": "This is what the West needs 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:55:13", "owner": "el_peterete525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086422039862511, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:48:39", "owner": "frankrita1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086912026879277, "text": "Well done My country 🇵🇱👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:48:32", "owner": "jlxasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062286854366841, "text": "Be like Poland", "