here.  Because our government has given the green signal to report and arrest or shoot down any misbehaving Islam people.  They will consider them anti-government and will use martial law on any islam praying in public to provoke violence from innocent passerbys,  will use martial law on any islam declaring their religion as a law to follow, then they will be considered as an anti-government and attempted illegal activities to cause assault or other illegal intentions against innocent civilian too. 😂💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:06:46", "owner": "beamer2nd_acct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878169988401353, "text": "🇵🇱🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T22:04:29", "owner": "easyreadlegal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290300584251815, "text": "King", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:59:04", "owner": "vlatkovurmeski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068161919263312, "text": "I love this way,poland 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:58:59", "owner": "panda.2253855", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047400017320223, "text": "Can Christians preach openly in Poland 🇵🇱?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:53:03", "owner": "huntformeisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031070291709022, "text": "BE LIKE POLAND .....WE ALL HAVE TO BE LIKE 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:49:34", "owner": "marianastcv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040893950673334, "text": "👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:38:38", "owner": "lady.ladyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092337049785025, "text": "Australian government need to follow you mob of f..k witts", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:38:29", "owner": "spinamorrie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014795297786493, "text": "Why do liberals think that countries are obligated to take Muslim refugees? What for???? Countries need to realize what happens when they do that. Liberals love name calling, if you don't get manipulated by their agenda then they look for some of their favorite labels and call you that. It's insanity. Countries need to defend their countries from these people who are destructive. You call me racist, ok so what? What are you going to do? Call the police?? Why don't Muslims seek to be refugees in other Muslim countries?? They hate Christians and other religions but they only want to invade those countries 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:35:46", "owner": "chocharika", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096764584726556, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:33:42", "owner": "zorianapidhrushna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096426565725295, "text": "Support for poland 🇵🇱 from Georgia 🇬🇪 ☦️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:33:40", "owner": "anaaniuta87", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18064308356040550, "text": "Good job, Poland 👏❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:28:47", "owner": "vakili0117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864063892398060, "text": "Free Europe", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:24:09", "owner": "loli_shehaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888412183357868, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:22:00", "owner": "cristiankaligis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318175975212577, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:13:53", "owner": "lidiadominikaroszko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962828757972068, "text": "Well done Poland..to the rest of Europe. Drowned the Islamic Rats in the sea before they touch land...sink the boats.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:11:42", "owner": "just4kicks213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477098608078750, "text": "Can the polish government please take over Britain", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:04:54", "owner": "jimmyh46", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17919962859031348, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏 Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:04:17", "owner": "ghaenimirpourian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064496786362743, "text": "#BeLikePoland", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:59:42", "owner": "vickozlosilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061123787580606, "text": "Great job! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:58:50", "owner": "ayushdharr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024332636718784, "text": "What a man ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:56:03", "owner": "jaycee_65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983881263728671, "text": "100% 