 17842881651574081, "text": "Well done  Poland 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:33:42", "owner": "anastasiageorganti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109938673544188, "text": "Thats funny, even polish people are leaving poland, why should a refugee ?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:29:40", "owner": "senol_k61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924798064130885, "text": "💯❤️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:29:28", "owner": "change_ego_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867855922372132, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:28:59", "owner": "jctiuseco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061687886607900, "text": "I mean. YES.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:25:34", "owner": "evaser.malaga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909532801227835, "text": "Facts!!! Well done🇵🇱🇮🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:24:51", "owner": "maayan_b1985", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155571634378377, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:24:42", "owner": "jmn_bikes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983880792731452, "text": "👍 Family first", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:23:49", "owner": "antonio_jny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024732830533777, "text": "EXCELLENT and WELL-DONE", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:16:51", "owner": "mrinal.sarma14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867224266378959, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:15:43", "owner": "dspec607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533581576035473, "text": "Go to London. It's not British anymore", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:15:07", "owner": "mayaayam8800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061207397579362, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:14:28", "owner": "cvspx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922376245146199, "text": "Good for them", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:13:08", "owner": "mayaayam8800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985469910897746, "text": "How lucky polish people are", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:09:04", "owner": "_black0ut_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040390838689235, "text": "Greece should follow Poland's tracks well done Poland keep your country safe in the name of the lord 🙏☦️🇬🇷", "created_at": "2025-09-14T1