: "2025-09-14T12:27:33", "owner": "x_m.o.n.i.c.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521958553014752, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:27:27", "owner": "nikitabutrik", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896232655162632, "text": "Absolute respect, safest country in Europe just look at the UN stats, no rapes, no stabbings, no  people trafficking. Should 1000% be proud of that.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:25:02", "owner": "mikeowen92", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18262048966304896, "text": "Why does anyone would like to go Poland? Their people are immigrating to other counties to work? Seriously?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:23:56", "owner": "gixemsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899086315145416, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:22:19", "owner": "philophobic__14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039052856440905, "text": "Fair play to him💯🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:20:30", "owner": "jamster_34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855715279519899, "text": "🇵🇱💯🙌❤️ well done from Indonesian lives in US", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:15:59", "owner": "bersul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072949646149867, "text": "Respect for him 🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:12:16", "owner": "italoguthier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098022496716270, "text": "Help them but don't let them inn.. I'm Indian and we go to other nations with passports to do our job respect culture not like them who just want to turn every nation as a Islamic nation", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:10:32", "owner": "proudsanatani75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893242360186052, "text": "Bravo, Poland 🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:09:57", "owner": "rud_smart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866350339450957, "text": "2mn Ukrainians are better than 1 muslim!!! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:06:47", "owner": "karthik_an10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859752322489283, "text": "Good job 👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:04:31", "owner": "annimaprivat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052045223259640, "text": "👍👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:57:00", "owner": "perourek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088977634833787, "text": "America needs to be the same way", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:56:49", "owner": "lizzzard_3e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080059708784729, "text": "Should be proud, wish uk would", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:53:13", "owner": "adam_jewellerylane", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18374353396182029, "text": "Go poland", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:53:08", "owner": "hughsimoes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078757966802309, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:48:28", "owner": "sandeeppise_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019768628575737, "text": "Russian 🚀💣", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:47:53", "owner": "omar___sheikh1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173304997356925, "text": "Well done Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:45:01", "owner": "suzishafik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092117308777688, "text": "Well done Poland. Discernment", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:42:52", "owner": "cuppa_teas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037650434475252, "text": "Bravo 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:41:46", "owner": "primma_stylist_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063855092601978, "text": "@geertwilders", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:38:40", "owner": "ronald_saputra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093874060708503, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:34:21", "owner": "henrychawngthu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846579385564309, "text": "Bravo", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:33:34", "owner": "naslib_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020251163569893, "text": "Good job Poland 👍❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:32:21", "owner": "user_is_fereshte", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855933661525657, "text": "This man is doing his Job protecting his country.  What wrong is that ?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:30:06", "owner": "thomas.bopple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091291273703976, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:28:53", "owner": "i.ammaz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865541992456016, "text": "Woman in red had family members killed by refugees. This ages perfectly", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:27:46", "owner": "llewelyn_j_lilli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861820471418393, "text": "Proud to be half Polish 🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:22:03", "owner": "powerpuff_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017903147775132, "text": "Truth", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:16:46", "owner": "j160100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065861531260950, "text": "I once was proud but now I’m ashamed to be Canadian. the government has turned once a great nation into a breeding ground of refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:16:44", "owner": "kyle__mccabe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18502703944064192, "text": "Great Poland peoples we loves you Indian Christians 🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:16:04", "owner": "panjabi_bhaichara", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981225162884866, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:13:01", "owner": "sanchain_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150352396396671, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:10:05", "owner": "justus_thomas_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523611055006213, "text": "When I am looking for London,Paris nowdays...I am so glad that I am living in Poland🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:09:39", "owner": "musicraum_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106121725603548, "text": "Do you want your country safe?. Reject the immigrants that come from problematic country. Poland has do the right thing.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:09:17", "owner": "_alexanderyofin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891772405342427, "text": "I wish Britain had the same stand on refugees. Send them all back! Or at least build refugee camps to hold them in until they can be processed properly instead of housing them in 4 star hotels and letting them run riot and rape and beat innocent civilians at the expense of the British tax payers", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:06:06", "owner": "711njp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079416097979625, "text": "I'm so proud of the fact you dont take any illegal migrants and I'm not Polish 🇵🇱 Once we  vote for a Reform 🇬🇧 government in UK we will have a safe country for our families.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:03:59", "owner": "theselfmedman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079067630490945, "text": "Nice well done, Poland. 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:03:53", "owner": "rod_cosmoke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474659554076455, "text": "Fuck you Leftist bitch", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:03:46", "owner": "insta_viperbite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866604061448663, "text": "Poland 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:02:23", "owner": "nerinaruizok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922752103135936, "text": "Please I dont even younger anymore. Bust I still can have a kid, take me to Poland! And fuck off as Brazilians can say.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:58:52", "owner": "shi_rlac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025692440723792, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:57:52", "owner": "tim.sharif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058123409141999, "text": "W POLAND🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:56:26", "owner": "spyrosgermenis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091776106750311, "text": "Keep ☪️ out of our countries !", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:54:04", "owner": "kian_hughesy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125792386488644, "text": "I lived in poland with 3 different families for FREE after the war in Ukraine. When I moved to Canada. Hell God. So many Indians, Muslim and disgusting people being MF. Goverment did nothing to protect me, Police said if you are not killed or losed 30K$ CA. We dont give a shit. So, I Stay with Poland and with Ukraine. Unite is power, diversity chaos.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:52:32", "owner": "isaachladchuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921453838149459, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:51:08", "owner": "anuliumaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077230856082738, "text": "I am going to Poland...", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:50:58", "owner": "gianz3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076070360478487, "text": "Follow Poland ❤️🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:46:00", "owner": "paigeandersonnn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125259739468166, "text": "Love his confidence in what he says", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:44:35", "owner": "samj88xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865682803456326, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:38:51", "owner": "svabke_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324790597232992, "text": "He is correct", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:24:24", "owner": "luma.marina.9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090431413830825, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:23:46", "owner": "minitog.no", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077375071989921, "text": "Ay fuqing men. This is a true leader. Don't give a fuq about what it looks like. Says it how it is.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:22:37", "owner": "tom_connop94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149243020404468, "text": "They’re not falling for that again. Great start Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:22:23", "owner": "archangel.vega", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118551361507656, "text": "Be proud you polish ppl ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:21:45", "owner": "sahand_tvc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386545444192317, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:21:19", "owner": "sahand_tvc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062086778523533, "text": "If they throw you in a tank with a shark, will you get mad at the shark for attacking, or will you get mad at the one who threw you in?!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:20:50", "owner": "stph26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523132141016191, "text": "No abduls , no Mohammads , no problems !!!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:17:17", "owner": "avi.bbq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967016064953167, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:16:33", "owner": "berkay_sabuncu2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861459835472545, "text": "Far from truth. Many years Poland was most comfortable country for all migrants with some legal issues. Many instead of returning home ran to Poland for legalisation . They just were getting paper for stay instead of returning home after expired visas or residence in other countries", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:13:51", "owner": "aura_143_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087769735848622, "text": "Proud of Poland 🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:06:23", "owner": "rohit_bhojwani77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041527391391054, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T10:01:13", "owner": "tazifatiza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940199331937662, "text": "How his ppl act now present his words 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:59:11", "owner": "sofie.x47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079683044297669, "text": "🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:57:00", "owner": "shyjujohn_365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863365852405923, "text": "Good for Poland 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:52:19", "owner": "elektrasixx247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187150504324432, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:52:12", "owner": "majavip85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088287844833253, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:48:44", "owner": "sheltonfr__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103395127606792, "text": "SPREAD Islam EVERYWHERE", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:43:00", "owner": "gherbl25371", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053323280240576, "text": "Islam isn't a race lady 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:40:00", "owner": "aiden_arkham", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947892064012625, "text": "Hhmmmm did you go to art school my friend", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:38:04", "owner": "kalevi_juhani_sade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106319326566280, "text": "Mulllaaa rewww", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:37:53", "owner": "awaken_matrix03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089249971828666, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:37:10", "owner": "eccos_rose_tanja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107364730565835, "text": "respect from Hungary🇭🇺🤝🏻🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:32:34", "owner": "hubaupc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18527258359050200, "text": "We need people like this man i wish we had people like him in my country", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:32:18", "owner": "mahdi.grv1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354526261090978, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:30:12", "owner": "virtualontt", "likes": 