: 18077762030055277, "text": "💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:55:01", "owner": "ssha_maquillage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050166488648362, "text": "Simple peace matters🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:47:22", "owner": "mark_carlsberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090875023755357, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:43:17", "owner": "srdpty_ok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078482833983895, "text": "Hanno accolto e aiutato  due milioni di Ukraini ❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:40:13", "owner": "boninodesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078122386817380, "text": "Quand la France aura-t-elle un gouvernement comme la Pologne ?  Il a raison il est là pour protéger son peuple et non faire plaisir à une Europe qui prône n'importe quoi sans jamais assumer.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:37:18", "owner": "666daviddavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043858529343454, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:31:17", "owner": "nico362854", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523571077065522, "text": "Kurva takto to ma byt v celej Európe!!! 💪👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:29:34", "owner": "filipbizk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923349592016322, "text": "👏👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:29:26", "owner": "yosua.f.s_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524431858025483, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:29:16", "owner": "deividasteponavicius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965848011798713, "text": "Im a proud indian christian and i wanna go to poland😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:22:05", "owner": "itslushaa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17946268641023457, "text": "#be like Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:21:24", "owner": "fussypandabear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855760720528181, "text": "The only place in the world I've ever been assaulted while travelling is Gdansk 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:18:24", "owner": "drewbud315", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078501533297147, "text": "🙌❤️👏🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:18:18", "owner": "sandra_zt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857922811504751, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:16:51", "owner": "lnocentiva70_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979483221866074, "text": "Young women and children are safer because of that man in Poland. SUPPORT FROM AMERICA 🇵🇱🇺🇸", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:13:36", "owner": "cappyzoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854323882479610, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:12:54", "owner": "h_e_l_i_o_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989828922704254, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:09:47", "owner": "margo.gusarova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071708804123586, "text": "Yes I 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:08:31", "owner": "rh1no87_fitness_pt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896277064166459, "text": "As a Muslim I agree with him ..also Muslim will not accept Cristians in their country if they have the right to do so ofc", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:05:14", "owner": "zentamzgha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984950304895163, "text": "And this people , people like her pretend to be mad ?? Because someone like him refuses to take refugees?? For what?? To live like in France or Spain?? How many muslims have commited crimes in these countries??? And because he is trying to keep safe his family and his people he is racists?? I would love to be racist in that case", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:05:13", "owner": "dennisalbertoberroa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058123931124608, "text": "Yoo half europe is racist, be proud, or be like Germany or England", "created_at": "2025-09-14T08:00:58", "owner": "user496786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076272638086225, "text": "he cut her bullshiii out and answered the question live and direct hahaha😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:58:41", "owner": "wight_printz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101761387610391, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:58:18", "owner": "steelsharon49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151331680400914, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:57:52", "owner": "gospelaineh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369841471148769, "text": "Yes yes and yes 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:56:21", "owner": "beautifullycoloredhair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375774493181254, "text": "What a man 🙌 that’s a proper leader", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:55:07", "owner": "jamiemoore2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059096072611453, "text": "The problem in Europe is that if you don't give space to Muslims, you're a racist.... It's idiotic! It's not mandatory! No one can force us to limit our safety. We have clean and safe streets. Poland has never been a colonial country and has no moral obligation...", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:51:25", "owner": "ladesignq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919562521153014, "text": "La logique 🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:49:50", "owner": "canianvampire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039435065450680, "text": "👍🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:48:24", "owner": "eknockdiamond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041860385389476, "text": "Agreed", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:41:46", "owner": "_oxjj__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893215246186434, "text": "Solute to you my good sir 🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:40:10", "owner": "sva_auto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876096727310736, "text": "Can this guy run multiple countries at once PLEASE. 🇦🇺 needs you", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:36:01", "owner": "tonyfusti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058818053386308, "text": "Proud of these President, Europe nees more like that.👏🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:31:22", "owner": "mariamoncayo_17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040823366664232, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:27:27", "owner": "larsdrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077370301968585, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:23:04", "owner": "serega_saint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856759213455117, "text": "Proud of you Poland 👍❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:22:50", "owner": "reefbabe2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106660018577120, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:22:41", "owner": "darshil_1300", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18327004462238543, "text": "Fu....journalist", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:19:30", "owner": "manu.mor