": "No muslim No War 👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:19:27", "owner": "souravnath399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890616061202739, "text": "Most europeans think the same way and are proud of themselves! 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:18:27", "owner": "auriukaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077705099002745, "text": "👍👍👍👍💯💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:13:52", "owner": "kristaps_kalve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940651749935255, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:08:11", "owner": "veruska1355", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062204000522497, "text": "I would love to settle in Poland.❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:07:23", "owner": "daisy_raul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922709452111272, "text": "Good job !🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:03:08", "owner": "daisy_raul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078292228821649, "text": "I love you.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:02:28", "owner": "daisy_raul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981452445745336, "text": "VII. From a Desert Tribe to a Global Machinery of Conquest\n\nOrigins and Rise\n\t•\tIslam began in 7th-century Arabia with a small group of less than 50–100 followers, forming a tribal and militarized cult under Muhammad’s leadership.\n\t•\tRapid expansion through warfare, rape, slavery, and coercion took this tribal cult across:\n\t•\tPersia (651 CE)\n\t•\tEgypt (642 CE)\n\t•\tAfghanistan (652–870 CE)\n\t•\tIndia (starting with Sindh in 712 CE)\n\t•\tWhat started as a localized tribal ideology quickly became a global engine of conquest—not through spiritual elevation, but by systemic subjugation.\n\nWomen’s Suffering and Systemic Justification\n\t•\tOver 1 billion indigenous people across Asia and Africa lost their spiritual traditions.\n\t•\tHundreds of millions of women were raped, trafficked, married off as child brides, or turned into concubines—institutionalized in the Quran and Hadiths.\n\t•\tQur’an 33:50, 4:24, 23:5–6 permit sex with slaves.\n\t•\tSahih al-Bukhari and Sahih Muslim document child marriage, battlefield rape, and sex slavery.\n\t•\tFatwas and Fiqh manuals like Fatawa-i-Alamgiri compiled by Mughal Emperor Aurangzeb codified rape, conquest, and forced conversion as divine laws.\n\n⸻\n\nVIII. DNA: The Indisputable Evidence of Systemic Abuse\n\nGenetic Proof of Mass Rape and Lineage Replacement\n\t•\tStudies by Harvard, Stanford, and National Geographic show:\n\t•\tY-chromosomal DNA in regions like Pakistan, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan has near-total replacement by Arab, Turkic, and Persian male lineage.\n\t•\tMitochondrial DNA (maternal line) remains indigenous—proving mass-scale rape of native women by foreign Muslim men.\n\t•\tThis cannot be dismissed. This is genetic trauma encoded into populations—an undeniable historical and biological reality.\n\t•\tThe Arab slave trade and Islamic conquest routes directly correlate with Y-chromosome markers in East Africa, North India, Persia, and the Balkans", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:01:57", "owner": "giridharklp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903860824251379, "text": "VII. From a Desert Tribe to a Global Machinery of Conquest\n\nOrigins and Rise\n\t•\tIslam began in 7th-century Arabia with a small group of less than 50–100 followers, forming a tribal and militarized cult under Muhammad’s leadership.\n\t•\tRapid expansion through warfare, rape, slavery, and coercion took this tribal cult across:\n\t•\tPersia (651 CE)\n\t•\tEgypt (642 CE)\n\t•\tAfghanistan (652–870 CE)\n\t•\tIndia (starting with Sindh in 712 CE)\n\t•\tWhat started as a localized tribal ideology quickly became a global engine of conquest—not through spiritual elevation, but by systemic subjugation.\n\nWomen’s Suffering and Systemic Justification\n\t•\tOver 1 billion indigenous people across Asia and Africa lost their spiritual traditions.\n\t•\tHundreds of millions of women were raped, trafficked, married off as child brides, or turned into concubines—institutionalized in the Quran and Hadiths.\n\t•\tQur’an 33:50, 4:24, 23:5–6 permit sex with slaves.\n\t•\tSahih al-Bukhari and Sahih Muslim document child marriage, battlefield rape, and sex slavery.\n\t•\tFatwas and Fiqh manuals like Fatawa-i-Alamgiri compiled by Mughal Emperor Aurangzeb codified rape, conquest, and forced conversion as divine laws.\n\n⸻\n\nVIII. DNA: The Indisputable Evidence of Systemic Abuse\n\nGenetic Proof of Mass Rape and Lineage Replacement\n\t•\tStudies by Harvard, Stanford, and National Geographic show:\n\t•\tY-chromosomal DNA in regions like Pakistan, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan has near-total replacement by Arab, Turkic, and Persian male lineage.\n\t•\tMitochondrial DNA (maternal line) remains indigenous—proving mass-scale rape of native women by foreign Muslim men.\n\t•\tThis cannot be dismissed. This is genetic trauma encoded into populations—an undeniable historical and biological reality.\n\t•\tThe Arab slave trade and Islamic conquest routes directly correlate with Y-chromosome markers in East Africa, North India, Persia, and the Balkans🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:01:44", "owner": "giridharklp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857093317514482, "text": "Ukrainians r not onlg peaxceful😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:01:11", "owner": "cathrin_mallorquina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078296432303462, "text": "Poland be like top student while France can't even take notes😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:49:19", "owner": "ancient_greek6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055721909183981, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:48:18", "owner": "mahiii07777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059992841384414, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:46:59", "owner": "rustybohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954806727865380, "text": "People leaving their Muslim homelands while still practicing Islam as refugees is just a ploy to spread their poison globally. It's proven in their unwillingness to assimilate to the culture of their destination. They all need shipped back home.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:46:37", "owner": "gunshotgrab", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18416654728129948, "text": "In my lifetime I’ve seen Poland go from the butt of most jokes dealing with lack of intelligence, to possibly the smartest country in the world.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:46:25", "owner": "killaking47", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979591149911622, "text": "No Refugees existing", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:45:12", "owner": "kostas.lap", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893135623321657, "text": "Yeah and Poland is a peaceful place", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:45:11", "owner": "benzzzzilla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976448985763821, "text": "I love that,I love my family I care about my people", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:44:34", "owner": "ichydera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082921891904116, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:44:09", "owner": "yours.arnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941669707058999, "text": "Polska gurom", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:43:52", "owner": "999hemz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071897468168165, "text": "good. good good good good good. they'll never be like Canada 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:43:51", "owner": "areuregarded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074850623473720, "text": "It is said to see Brussels or Paris full of weird people who violate the love. We European people should be more attentive to what we get", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:43:34", "owner": "dianass_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092780149705680, "text": "Journalists just love labelling people and set them up. Well done Poland🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:39:44", "owner": "neochiu711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090394312758467, "text": "Need more people like this 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:34:19", "owner": "itskevo4real", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021508700560248, "text": "Last time Poland let people in the country was subjugated to the Nazi regime and war crimes", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:29:32", "owner": "patticuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871976440426014, "text": "You are a hero every European nations should act like him", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:29:22", "owner": "rakab186", "likes": 1}, {"