, "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859046989501087, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏good for Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:11:57", "owner": "erichmessar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962990967971194, "text": "Go Poland, teach the USA now!!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:11:48", "owner": "bulltravis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071104940325800, "text": "Se ela achou ruim, com certeza é algo muito bom", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:59:20", "owner": "geovane.cs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859413991484750, "text": "Bravo", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:58:33", "owner": "anton_ing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911746045198523, "text": "Why in the world will Poland take a refuge?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:51:21", "owner": "iamraajkanchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064530017250807, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:44:35", "owner": "wozniakm1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310174492173023, "text": "U got an attack from Ukraine", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:25:01", "owner": "gagan.issar80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051770888256526, "text": "Good job. God bless you.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:22:44", "owner": "daeijavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056796164157764, "text": "Now that’s a government! Putting his people and his country first 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:22:02", "owner": "daniellacolleena", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110696677546156, "text": "I tell everyone in America, just look at Poland. They're surprised when they learn that the crime rate is tremendously low. We need to be like Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:19:25", "owner": "theokayestpianist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904062844252789, "text": "God Bless", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:18:01", "owner": "finmccool248", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853235962488326, "text": "Yeah and keep it like that! It's about time to leave Holland.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:18:00", "owner": "tommy__ironside", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933538062963666, "text": "Bravo", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:14:18", "owner": "celinecauchon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966432111958813, "text": "Respect bro", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:13:47", "owner": "shubham_agrawal3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081476002756343, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:11:36", "owner": "herry_tan007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058880357603089, "text": "Don't won't them", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:07:46", "owner": "cjoconnor27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856654531454428, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:58:49", "owner": "iffi.lindholm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184592584330542, "text": "🤣😂 the way the newscaster asked about it as if it's any country's responsibility and obligations to help other countries' failure of governance.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:56:57", "owner": "stonepunisher", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18162118720373285, "text": "👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:51:39", "owner": "zoran.karalic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091611964701225, "text": "EUROPA..ITALIA! PRENDI ESEMPIO!", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:51:00", "owner": "valerio_di_mascio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942909927918626, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:45:04", "owner": "arekyaswemy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072150860132657, "text": "Well done Poland.👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏 If it's necessary leave the EU but never turn your back to your country. By now all European countries should be sure that Poland is right, and the EU is wrong.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:42:14", "owner": "gilson_poa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842063893580213, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:30:54", "owner": "logwlt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917602231175497, "text": "Bravo!!!! Love Poland government!!!!👏👏👏 they have put their pants with belt", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:24:53", "owner": "patriciacrodg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932654392093610, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:23:57", "owner": "raj7sam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924404983121345, "text": "Great job Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:18:05", "owner": "stephamanurse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18488032750078738, "text": "Lmao poland is considered based now all of a sudden. What the world has come to", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:15:02", "owner": "vickatilis_cam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005759684796944, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:10:03", "owner": "cokowha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091786465742368, "text": "Why any one will attack on poland ? All politics...yes he has point but ...long story", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:08:49", "owner": "shaba_ozutok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887272591354283, "text": "No terrorist attack 🔥👏💯🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:06:22", "owner": "cdnfernando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019131041772627, "text": "Good man 👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:05:19", "owner": "danny_zzr600_bt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524235196046085, "text": "Say he racist but I don’t see protest saying “we want them in” other countries mean while protest “we want them out”😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:04:30", "owner": "geibriel_s7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867292042378475, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:02:41", "owner": "victoriiaamayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056577665176224, "text": "The neighbors are doing it right 🫡🇩🇪", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:01:27", "owner": "letizia_mzl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097168153570485, "text": "A “religion” is not a race.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:00:42", "owner": "806_santa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059861645577184, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:57:43", "owner": "______de.bellis______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320441293212791, "text": "🇵🇱❤️😍😍😍😍💯💯👍👍💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:51:43", "owner": "kait916_66", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859407667484460, "text": "Go Poland, fuck UE🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:36:48", "owner": "psyko___2030", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18531773638045315, "text": "Poland has taken huge numbers of refugees from Ukraine.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:32:58", "owner": "rob4349", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074595281096281, "text": "W poland🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:30:02", "owner": "lennard_priv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077240840076506, "text": "Stay pay ur tax for Israel and Ukraine 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:26:42", "owner": "draconis_yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099162859628386, "text": "Muslim should stay in they’re place not in Europe where has nothing to do with they’re religion! Here or you are Catholic or Christian! And no, i am not racist, but they make a lot of attacks and many people dies because of them! So no more muslims in europe !", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:21:54", "owner": "laurentiu.szl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057853034138705, "text": "If you want to label us as racists that’s fine. We are intelligent enough to know it has nothing to do with race but everything to do with protecting our values. What don’t Muslim “refugees” go to Muslim countries? Why? Because they won’t accept them!!!!!! Islam is a faith based on the teachings of a cowardly pedophile! Why would we want to respect those values?", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:20:28", "owner": "alex72sk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028407005708345, "text": "Best gov ever!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:15:15", "owner": "ms.mutar.lah", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053791316532164, "text": "That's why Poland's crime rates are low , no terrorist attacks, guess why", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:15:02", "owner": "erolbarkin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981127059905896, "text": "He should be, look at the rest of the Western world.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:06:03", "owner": "complicatedlysimple232024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961056132987159, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:03:59", "owner": "custum222", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909882460086215, "text": "Being racist is a right 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:54:40", "owner": "rgdp_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065549567587239, "text": "She should be held to account as being a part of this disgusting regime. Shes been a mouthpiece for years. It shouldn't just be forgotten.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:35:53", "owner": "swings.fightube", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18061524173079017, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:31:41", "owner": "dominicbates69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072274271134136, "text": "👏👏👏👏💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:28:26", "owner": "nellybba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18528986188025895, "text": "Proud to be Polish. It’s hard to stand by the truths but our history has taught us to stand up for what is right. We are open and generous to people who will come with respect and openness to assimilation.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:23:55", "owner": "specialkww", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18324430522225516, "text": "You asked about Refugees and Poland 🇵🇱 took 2million Ukraine’s the reporter needs to get her facts right # Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:23:25", "owner": "markrichardlynch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070358090332574, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:22:06", "owner": "shanablob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055024436630771, "text": "Non è possibile convivenza e integrazione con questo trogloditi falsi bugiardi prevaricatori aguzzini pedofili", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:19:45", "owner": "eleo.bi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088811665802731, "text": "👌🏻 😉", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:19:36", "owner": "alyssonmariotto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050950445270225, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏qualcuno che ragiona c’è", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:17:58", "owner": "eleo.bi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921473860116365, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏 está muito certo,parabéns.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:16:13", "owner": "sandra_varela.1971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966115206809632, "text": "Less crime too for sure 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:15:52", "owner": "jenny_royoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037738121475436, "text": "I am in Norway  the working ones refugees from Muslim countries or Eastern Europeans but actually not working ones are  the refugees from Ukrain🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-13T22:12:11", "owner": "blixttoprak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040459397409755, "text": "This is because tho