r": "jlu0301", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18406781770114353, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:02:31", "owner": "jeanpierredeclerck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070992299138960, "text": "I think any country should have the right to deny entry to anyone they choose", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:00:46", "owner": "that_fucking_frank75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18150677044393630, "text": "Someone that cares. It’s their choice !! Don’t judge!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:59:08", "owner": "rosanna.grande2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18401884057191385, "text": "👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:57:55", "owner": "lenakosenkolena", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18288649159284154, "text": "Perfect 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:53:02", "owner": "alsmajorfitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303336790301544, "text": "Wish polish where easy to learn .... I would come .... Work there in Peace", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:52:04", "owner": "anslizyn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077583752319909, "text": "🇵🇱 proud of poland", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:49:33", "owner": "kevinmj_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947082816904273, "text": "top man", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:48:13", "owner": "brokenskater45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900125707268455, "text": "🇵🇱👏respect", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:47:40", "owner": "xersess69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858023284507195, "text": "I just feel it’s time to stop all importing and help them aboard to stay in their own counties and homes.  Not abandon the needs of true salvation to the poor and hungry!  Before they take over.\nAs we have seen how they have treated me and my son.\n@when both of us have never been racist!!! @We must never stop being kind because of their bad behaviour!!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:46:35", "owner": "mandytarrant", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053612048207423, "text": "This is a real king 🇮🇱🇮🇱🇮🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:45:56", "owner": "rachelnoy11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058640933609830, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-0