uslims spread in europe not for change their lifes but to change the europe itself spreading the word of their profet tô spreading islam there is a jihad going on in europe and europe is Blind to that", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:15:17", "owner": "duuhpetena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852496741541305, "text": "🇵🇱👍👍👏👏👏👏Great Poland!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:14:59", "owner": "peled_ohad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047329295322441, "text": "He should be running the EU parliament", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:12:38", "owner": "k1k1aragon7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873193360332179, "text": "Support from 🇧🇷💪 no câncer ❤🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:01:54", "owner": "eudes_trader1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915153778082683, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T13:57:52", "owner": "arri_gi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477030997078176, "text": "I’ve been living in Warsaw for the last nearly 5 years and seriously it’s so safe and nice… any time of the day you can come out and go literally everywhere … even at 1am or 2am or 3am in the morning….. Police are everywhere and they are serious….. And now look at London… Paris… Belgium… these countries are nearly gone… So sad to see what is happening in there 😥😥😥", "created_at": "2025-09-13T13:55:52", "owner": "kobizevs_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045029522660550, "text": "Voglio andare a vivere in Polonia", "created_at": "2025-09-13T13:52:09", "owner": "centuria_88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297543562265496, "text": "👏👏👏👏💯💯💯💯💯yes it’s better to be racist then being refugees later on in other countries of being murdered in his country !!!! Keep on this make your country clean and do not let criminals harm your community !!!! 💯💯💯💯 I agree", "created_at": "2025-09-13T13:51:28", "owner": "gisellaelhelou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882979978382076, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥good job poland 👍👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T13:51:14", "owner": "ronaldngongoloy88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068243746968875, "text": "Good", "created_at": "2025-09-13T10:08:06", "