23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100594540717888, "text": "Instead of saying bravo Poland and try to move to Poland make your country more safe like Poland 😁 he have right to do so and not take Muslim refugees  it's not racism it's taking care of others safety and don't be dumb we all know and see what is going on in other countries what other countries ALLOWED to happen", "created_at": "2025-09-13T09:00:46", "owner": "lulurowkey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072094697144077, "text": "As a Jew that his origins from Poland, even the with the history of what they have done to my family, I’m so proud of them for not letting this sickness get into their land\nI will never forgive them, but at least Poland proved that we can move forward, and that we have a common enemy that threats the whole globe\nMaybe this time they won’t blame the Jews, and start doing something about the real terrorizer of the world", "created_at": "2025-09-13T09:00:45", "owner": "the_nusi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080332648988866, "text": "Ask that dumpass woman in red, what dose she think about London, Germany, and Paris letting Muslims in. In paris muslims went to a Christian person on a wheelchair and stapped him in the neck for preaching about Jesus on tiktok. This man is the only one with brains in Europe.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:57:13", "owner": "bee_bee_joseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852464077539972, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:52:35", "owner": "labibi_lab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078155146961416, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:51:51", "owner": "alecs_day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055453025410141, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:50:20", "owner": "eunice9903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860152507483827, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:49:38", "owner": "wynneevangeline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070609264932058, "text": "👏👏👏❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:45:54", "owner": "riccardo__teixeira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906259963101147, "text": "I'm igbo but