", "owner": "h1t5h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054143303404667, "text": "Canada should learn from them bringing in refugees from false claims making temporary residents suffer made the country worst within 10 years….bringing hatred and famine in society….plummeting like a third world country….not fair!! Legal immigrants are suffering….citizens are suffering!!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:15:54", "owner": "bidaribritty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094868605663797, "text": "Proud to be Polish and like he said-I don't care what u lot thinking, its all jealousy that we keep our Country safe n traditions/culure that is our own!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:13:21", "owner": "dorota.careford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093956767709176, "text": "Good 👍 jab poland 🇵🇱 👏 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:10:52", "owner": "sa.njib1936", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056042225447449, "text": "Be like poland", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:10:48", "owner": "vaibhavrawalmusic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919831078118122, "text": "Yes bitch, that's right!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:10:35", "owner": "elainetsialafos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912580156067802, "text": "This man is smart 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:08:17", "owner": "susanjennings123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18417318910106264, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:03:52", "owner": "kevin.havlicek", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17855951130516275, "text": "Notice the difference between immigration and refugees lefties take note", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:02:34", "owner": "isaywhatbobbie", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18319460905234855, "text": "Ukranians work here aswell without problem.  The radiostation say that innigrant living here are intergrating so well.. yeah the Ukranians.  Not those that come here to seek fortune, to steal, to kill young women.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:02:05", "owner": "nickyvha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030514766709431, "text": "“I didn’t ask about illegal immigrants, I asked about refugees” They’re the same fucking thing. What are these people refugees from? Their countries are just shit, not warring or anything worthy of them being refugees. They’re just wanting a better life which everyone else in the goddamn world wants. Our countries homeless comes first, it’s not our job to import homeless from other countries for priority care.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:59:56", "owner": "jordan.c.mann", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991636881839601, "text": "you saved Poland 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:56:55", "owner": "catszone_moscow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859624657484139, "text": "I bardzo dobrze. W końcu coś mądrego powiedział.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:55:27", "owner": "_w33r0_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066491389999011, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:54:26", "owner": "do_rian8508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071871131150591, "text": "The reporter should be proud enough to take in those refugees into her own home, then..", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:51:33", "owner": "2015.04.03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855564772518366, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:51:31", "owner": "lexi24x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075697984843563, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:51:23", "owner": "brimfulofaashabarford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067641605239233, "text": "Your safety and country should be your priority and those who don't want your country to be safe shouldn't be let in period", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:45:15", "owner": "vicencoded", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918754639160420, "text": "🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:43:31", "owner": "dawid.bukiel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893798527303636, "text": "Very nice and very proud 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:38:49", "owner": "sagar7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086284618868294, "text": "good 👏👍", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:35:53", "owner": "chantelle.middleton.3760", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383952592133538, "text": "🇵🇱👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:35:52", "owner": "somalibohidar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305846287223504, "t