55", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18111204688545133, "text": "I love it ..... absolutely love it", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:05:28", "owner": "i__shubham2004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093237901708692, "text": "He should be proud well done not like the spineless British government", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:03:31", "owner": "dharding29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043660757668080, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👍👍👍👍💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:01:48", "owner": "huseyn05786", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095318335659343, "text": "W Poland, love from India 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:01:43", "owner": "phantom_rune", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18185426911334506, "text": "Kurwa tak !!!!!!!🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:01:30", "owner": "pawel_ceglarek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103338007595172, "text": "We are proud, kurwa 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-13T07:00:27", "owner": "a.kaminsky90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135531742447063, "text": "There are no muslim refugees  they want to destroy everything", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:58:08", "owner": "wildcardracing171", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962321928823562, "text": "He is 💯% true, BCS I lived in poland more than 7 yrs.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:57:39", "owner": "6nodo_123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914202433187848, "text": "I like that guy", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:51:44", "owner": "chance_quenneville39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293822842249753, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:48:12", "owner": "_shalu_paul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019717850574153, "text": "Salute u Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:45:56", "owner": "subiswas64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041658665389506, "text": "Poland genius 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:37:18", "owner": "oggrim112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031756424505485, "text": "Beautiful", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:36:43", "owner": "copious_lux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396266527185000, "text": "King", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:36:14", "owner": "justscreech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050591894637885, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:33:47", "owner": "daniel.fichet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065918564018643, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:33:12", "owner": "clari_courtney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066669320209544, "text": "Good job polish government", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:32:31", "owner": "neeraj0703", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893138743321498, "text": "What a disgusting world.. we sit behind our phones and decide for people’s life just like that: their Muslims they need to die? When not caring for humans life became such a proud action? \nDo you know how Muslim terrorists think ? You act like this people are chickens you can easily kill and not care about… you suppressed this Muslims countries for oil and their riches and now you stand in your safe houses saying we don’t want the rage? You stand there and say we don’t care about you , we don’t know what you believe in,what language you speak but we hate you! This rage makes terrorism… this hate builds a monster", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:29:07", "owner": "sarwitch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947261758012909, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:22:11", "owner": "karthikpillai4", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861834322416303, "text": "Wenn wir das in Deutschland sagen gibt das gleich nen aufstand😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:21:39", "owner": "alex.ander.rich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079547960507343, "text": "🇵🇱Good on Poland! 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:17:38", "owner": "sammyashellis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18237013390292808, "text": "Satrmer the prime mi ister of England has appointed a pakistani muslim as home minister.Six cities have pakistani muslims as Mayor now they are outnumbering christian in England and soon will capture England", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:17:11", "owner": "dinesh.bhargava3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086658985868555, "text": "❤️👍🙌🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:16:46", "owner": "fly_man_1222", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916120747050607, "text": "England os suffering lot due yo muslims france and germany and apain and america and canada all are suffering due to muslim and islamist .they are spreading riots and terrorism.Capturi g land of christians.if you want safe then stop visas and asylum to muslims", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:16:02", "owner": "dinesh.bhargava3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979292607870965, "text": "Thats  is why thy are safe country 🇵🇱 God job Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:15:40", "owner": "ninb_julian", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17873707446326931, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:15:33", "owner": "pan_bialy_czlowiek_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18175062217354858, "text": "I think poland is most sensible person.poland would be most happy country due to non muslim immigrants.Never allow muslims .don t allow visas asylum and shelter to muslims. Whole world like England America spain Swededn netherland and whole europe ahould listen to poland no muslims immigrant policy if they want yo be safe", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:14:58", "owner": "dinesh.bhargava3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107967226495530, "text": "@poland.pl we poud of you 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:14:31", "owner": "___d.k7____", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104002672597351, "text": "Good decision by poland", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:11:36", "owner": "mayank_5307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020411627566763, "text": "He has standards!! Something a lot of countries lack. 💯💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:11:19", "owner": "lizgonzalez_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859362664492908, "text": "*where do I file immigration papers??", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:07:55", "owner": "lame_dinosaur94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006961415632039, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥👏👏👏👏👏👏 @narendramodi", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:02:06", "owner": "6feet_kannadiga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090533068695028, "text": "@narendramodi @yatnal_warriors_ka28 @myogi_adityanath @bjp4india", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:00:49", "owner": "6feet_kannadiga", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060195704108120, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:58:43", "owner": "sabaa_4ever", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18154935757381219, "text": "Well said and well done 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:54:33", "owner": "dhruv_patel_1456", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023524994733737, "text": "🇵🇱❤️ Poland is safest country in the world", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:41:37", "owner": "sampath_kumar_j_m_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042052199385815, "text": "Wish India could be like that. Again..WISH.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:41:24", "owner": "biswasbideepta_07", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18292151611264407, "text": "They try to use the term \"racist\" to get them to comply. Hahaha Poland will not be manipulated. Not like slack UK which I am not proud to call it my country anymore... because it's not UK anymore", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:40:51", "owner": "k.w.consultingroom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893599102182770, "text": "God bless Poland 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:40:22", "owner": "mike115a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085060096807320, "text": "Well said. Well done Poland, I salute you 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:39:02", "owner": "k.w.consultingroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051573434260220, "text": "👏👏well done 👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:33:49", "owner": "alicjatopczewski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081289105935371, "text": "As an American, I never thought I’d say this, but I am jealous of Poland what a smart, smart, brilliant move. America has destroyed itself by letting immigrants in destroyed itself.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:32:21", "owner": "brody_gasper_m7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17896136580165676, "text": "Here in Ph, theyre forcing our government to allow them to have their own Sharia Law.", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:30:56", "owner": "lee_mik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325359535231493, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:29:29", "owner": "moein_nazari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097299208725819, "text": "I’m