avo👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T10:16:21", "owner": "nazare.oliveira09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946489072044594, "text": "It's not racist to be against Islam", "created_at": "2025-09-12T10:09:10", "owner": "arcticvikingtoke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076542620079619, "text": "🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-12T10:07:38", "owner": "christiaandenhaag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406444705115079, "text": "I agree", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:57:21", "owner": "kapustovatina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980351982879783, "text": "I am for the safety of my own family and country. If you call that racism , I have no problem, I'm all for racism then", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:57:04", "owner": "surongisrael", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18141882574421837, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:55:20", "owner": "_ar_o_m_a_l__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075217912859394, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️❤️👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:50:12", "owner": "dhvalpatel1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526455466007671, "text": "Standing up for what he believes in. People may or may not disagree but he’s doing what he believes and getting results at least", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:48:14", "owner": "simon_aspiringstrongman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086741962881964, "text": "WE LOVE THIS MAN!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:47:52", "owner": "east_coast_composites", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051803936544377, "text": "❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:40:46", "owner": "vee.masojidkova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919078663036911, "text": "Well done from Ireland 🇮🇪", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:38:50", "owner": "garbhan84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130853554458430, "text": "W Poland I hope to be there soon fuck starmers 3rd world shithole", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:36:32", "owner": "l.otterz094x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146179942407474, "text": "This man is a hero and needs to be protected at all costs", "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:36:11", "owner": "l.otterz094x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091803751689704, "text": "Wake up a