_at": "2025-09-12T06:52:51", "owner": "dion_dpp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079674853782538, "text": "This is not only what the guys from the government want, it is what the people, the polish population want.\nThats democracy, not racism or far right!", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:52:06", "owner": "chriss.schulter", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18527438818059368, "text": "Bang on chap. Total hero", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:47:27", "owner": "ericfrancis5023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174128269346712, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:45:42", "owner": "nipin_varma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413184373118557, "text": "Poland 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:43:03", "owner": "tapo4ku3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119123488500576, "text": "Good man", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:42:09", "owner": "lucia_kontopirakis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904706254251813, "text": "🇵🇱❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:40:40", "owner": "m4rs_bro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074258150103714, "text": "Irony is that most of refugees are Muslims and we constantly hear that the core Islamic countries are best , then why not live there rather than wander as refugees 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:39:44", "owner": "prithvigamer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867753736443501, "text": "Definitely 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:39:18", "owner": "princejanger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202543144310979, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:33:02", "owner": "shalinsalahudheen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898986322148190, "text": "Fuck Antifa BS", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:31:18", "owner": "seppi187_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055822253388325, "text": "Why is it rasistic to do this? Lock how the rest off Ueropa looks!", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:29:20", "owner": "nicklas_lindahl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088770901828917, "text": "🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:28:18", "owner": "nicklas_lindahl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048161054321837, "text": "Ora e tardi per Europa☝️", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:26:35", "owner": "marijafrodita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143877646413635, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:23:30", "owner": "ladyjoanne_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942705781053065, "text": "I look up to you. Other countries leaders are pussies", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:15:13", "owner": "pexxa_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861482836472806, "text": "Poland is incredibly safe! I had a stressful moment and needed to clear my head with a walk in the middle of the night, I think about 3am, and it was such a peaceful time. I felt completely safe - in fact, I kinda felt like I was doing something wrong by being out 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:09:18", "owner": "hotmesscarly", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18065987213021482, "text": "Good on Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:05:37", "owner": "colinrthomass", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18177422506339992, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:03:52", "owner": "genokrypto.sol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954118255006032, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:02:52", "owner": "ketanbisherwal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071589539131089, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👍🏻👌🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:58:46", "owner": "rahul.kulkarni9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846532144561535, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:56:20", "owner": "chanuth_randeniya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108279475496062, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:56:03", "owner": "thapa__pooja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846261307563122, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:47:38", "owner": "sarahs4011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090185596744685, "text": "Chad 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:47:28", "owner": "vinit.247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311390107243505, "text": "As thing that called Muslim l believe they did right thing👍", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:46:51", "owner": "franchesco.toti0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078347737954744, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:45:31", "owner": "gurreet_kur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367733266149145, "text": "Well said 👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱💯