157, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:46:39", "owner": "momocookin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082128835940520, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:28:59", "owner": "theudeshvlogs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943062549915200, "text": "This interviewer is the reason for the fall of Europe", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:28:36", "owner": "kc73holy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880181038389440, "text": "Ya and these are making a fuss in countries that took them in and in street interviews they say bout their population growing and taking over the world 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:22:21", "owner": "adrian.lim.k.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073016306138959, "text": "Soo proud of you 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:22:07", "owner": "er_amar18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075663929019998, "text": "Who gives a fuck about poland,they are porr as fuck they go to norway and work for 10 euros per hours and they do the same in germany and england,if you go to.poland you can fuck 5 girls with 60 euros and they still come up with this shit poland has 0 refugees,Poland is a poor country they dont have the economy like germany or england to take refugees so atop this bullshit woth poland they dont even like there own country", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:16:43", "owner": "adrian_i88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859072408437362, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:10:28", "owner": "krishna__janasainik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042518111666747, "text": "That gaslighting reporter knows nothing and very arrogant", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:58:11", "owner": "gioocastillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964770141950892, "text": "Yeah Poland should be proud", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:57:36", "owner": "gioocastillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079814485772492, "text": "Sounds like a country that remembers the 30s, and 40s and is doing everything to keep their citizens safe from outsiders.  That is smart of them to do. Why import a culture to the country that would destroy the Polish way of life? Should we go to the middle east, and throw down some Walmarts, and say no more Allah, no more goats, no more what you're used to? No, that is giving up too much. I don't expect anyone to ever do that for any reason.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:49:35", "owner": "cameroncorrosive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121393768442489, "text": "Be poland!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:45:14", "owner": "iammacmercado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092048803740258, "text": "Polonia terra di Dio!", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:43:02", "owner": "filippadaniele", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18174704212352818, "text": "RESPECT", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:41:31", "owner": "nerisebn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070260373931287, "text": "He got reason 👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:40:16", "owner": "linusultramindful", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137053009442237, "text": "Poland know how to survive 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:33:55", "owner": "divyanshu_1_1_0_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995262945827225, "text": "legend", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:29:26", "owner": "ijames009_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049157933289323, "text": "As a christian from Syria believe me this guy knows what he's doing 🇵🇱🔥👍", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:27:26", "owner": "baroncedar", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17965876940800733, "text": "How many has this lady opened her house to?", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:26:20", "owner": "lament_twh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080349703758645, "text": "The just thing to do would be to not accept not even one polish Citizen in the hypotetical case that there would be a war in Poland. But fourtunatly the world is not just, but moral and humanitarian.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T00:14:01", "owner": "___.marianareis.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041917517385556, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-11T23:38:06", "owner": "anton_shorninov_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091277455692571, "text": "Grate jobbb 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-11T23:10:56", "owner": "itsrup07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890449417