his refugees? They have the same culture and values and a lots of opportunities too. Get a life women!", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:02:45", "owner": "gabys2.r", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17911925730072018, "text": "Muslims to don’t assimilate…", "created_at": "2025-09-11T18:02:01", "owner": "tac.688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890343391199317, "text": "Liberals will lose themselves defending the rights of those who would take everything from them. Poland is showing the way—protect your land, your people, your culture, and your peace.", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:59:51", "owner": "ani_67706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144109687422687, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥💯", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:56:06", "owner": "shivangidubey315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962185398822907, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:53:04", "owner": "go.pinath2378", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843729754572114, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:51:44", "owner": "ov_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076287467086625, "text": "Divide and rule! People, you are being manipulated! The enemies are not migrants! The enemy is the murderer Putin with his army! Instead of uniting against the common real enemy, you are fighting with your neighbors 🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:48:04", "owner": "zhdanovska_anna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947048239031130, "text": "🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:44:24", "owner": "poliitra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000991259811307, "text": "💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:39:43", "owner": "litsa9426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050208818282619, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:27:24", "owner": "motaz305", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18418841404105369, "text": "We will stand together! Deus Vult!", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:25:25", "owner": "danyb7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867193846379068, "text": "Be like Poland !!", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:17:30", "owner": "mixeduptires", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972577014926859, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:16:45", "owner": "_omarc