nd!! Save ur country free from them", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:53:53", "owner": "iamlittecapibara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521319649031701, "text": "❤️👏💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:49:12", "owner": "sushant_tayade27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095350102578288, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:47:39", "owner": "nevnasty95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416390428109005, "text": "Muslim isn't a race soo its not racist", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:47:17", "owner": "todd_de_kort", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929527005986059, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:46:45", "owner": "saltoundina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363651142155170, "text": "Het kan dus wel @minpres", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:45:26", "owner": "krabbenbosch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311358022169885, "text": "She: asking about refugees, \nHe: talking about illegal immigration \nComments: he is smart 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:40:45", "owner": "pablo_zebari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060729518101482, "text": "Bravo!!!👍🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:40:24", "owner": "easy_rider794", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071604332324066, "text": "Perfect", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:40:19", "owner": "baby1_7280", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945899902041096, "text": "Very few are actually refugees", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:37:39", "owner": "hunterzdad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18173378269349590, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:37:28", "owner": "ichchha_fashion", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843588337571984, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️ Love Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:34:06", "owner": "parkerknightred_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025528880721208, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:30:14", "owner": "_akhil_kumar_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381121216135771, "text": "They are not refugees…. They were t forced to leave their countries!!! Why don’t they seek refuge in another Muslim country? Welldone Poland! May the rest of the world learn the same!", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:28:06", "owner": "_shelley_bean_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17936197719073017, "text": "Good for Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:26:28", "owner": "2024.newlmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918447652157637, "text": "That's how you save your country from cancer👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:25:39", "owner": "this_is_d_edakkana", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075970352085622, "text": "🇵🇱👌🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:24:02", "owner": "k.453.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921848389111861, "text": "So true👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:21:12", "owner": "paelzer_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075285871866185, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:20:46", "owner": "arbind_mm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927181048102208, "text": "Who speak about racist… is the first one Who are 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:19:54", "owner": "davide.0001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015715736595897, "text": "❤️🙌🇵🇱👏👍", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:16:00", "owner": "e_s_v_f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843760498562601, "text": "I’m moving to Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:15:29", "owner": "kitastrophy_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878777446394261, "text": "So proud of Polish Government 🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:13:56", "owner": "i.m.archit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882209254380306, "text": "🔥💯❤️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:13:01", "owner": "akash_unnikrishnapillai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089804311768592, "text": "☪️ancer community", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:12:32", "owner": "brown.skinboy0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949539198891982, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:11:34", "owner": "wojtas_przemyslaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973025967778094, "text": "You guys take Canadians refugees?", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:09:24", "owner": "mr.brown8012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869013256435096, "text": "A man", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:08:58", "owner": "_ms_math_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057358208162039, "text": "Are countries obligated to take in refugees?", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:07:09", "owner": "guernnica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081437543503398, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌 God bless you", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:06:55", "owner": "revelationofholyspirt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066215912219310, "text": "Love Poland, sounds like El Salvador 🇸🇻", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:05:25", "owner": "edcar11170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860125117479445, "text": "Wish Australia was the same", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:05:12", "owner": "claywestt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852199870540101, "text": "If racist means keeping your country safe then its a compliment and a lot more leaders should be racist", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:03:23", "owner": "charissastark_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522119563031152, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱 I can testify , it's very peaceful here", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:59:32", "owner": "david_mmasi09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949179366891849, "text": "Respect👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:58:42", "owner": "jagadeesh.srinivas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096280375660361, "text": "Proud of Poland 🇮🇩", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:57:21", "owner": "luizshiratori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975724161767984, "text": "👏👏👏👏 This man is 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:56:40", "owner": "luizshiratori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077828996059551, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:56:39", "owner": "kristinbutera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018003248775297, "text": "Yeah and F0CK all you white b*st@rd b*tch3s. First you rob and b*mb all the \"muslim countries\" and take all their recourses and then you complain when they have to flee from their lands and seek refuge from your f*ckass countries, after being ripped from their own cultures?? And then you have the nerve to question why some of them turn to violence? Great, I hope they b*mb many more of you f*ckt@rds then", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:55:27", "owner": "honeyhanjii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082471033911652, "text": "Poland’s biggest death count has come at the hands of fellow Europeans: Germany and Russia.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:54:00", "owner": "aryeah_irvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100046698619695, "text": "Muslims need to stay in Muslim countries.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:49:33", "owner": "lilmissdoneallwrong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073173028885224, "text": "Respect 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:45:39", "owner": "its__tushar__00_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896218561293837, "text": "Putin is coming 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:44:59", "owner": "ali_ahmedov777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885043666361406, "text": "The same of clown Giorgia 🤡🤡🤡", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:43:48", "owner": "alessandro87ssl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073671707031579, "text": "🙌🙌❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:41:58", "owner": "annapurna.aseem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520563196051075, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:41:24", "owner": "gianlu88lorenzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372200737197900, "text": "This is what I called prime minister 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:36:59", "owner": "mr.rutvik_2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046639448325251, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:34:28", "owner": "ryanxsimmons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282464392286816, "text": "👏👏🔥👏Portugal mete os olhos nisto", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:32:59", "owner": "andre.monteiro_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064997441032920, "text": "I wish we had a leader like him 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:31:21", "owner": "anastpant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070272715899413, "text": "Why can illegal immigrants just be called refugees and suddenly it's aloud BS well done Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:27:29", "owner": "peggconner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061567610594124, "text": "Every non muslim country should learn from this.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:27:18", "owner": "madhushreepal88", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075620717020318, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:23:04", "owner": "victoria_jane1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015587723785591, "text": "❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-10T1