by poland 🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:10:41", "owner": "keshavtomar_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024380555757900, "text": "Lets go!!!!! 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:09:55", "owner": "dericdarkink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172265857358007, "text": "Well, I'll put Poland in the top of my list vacation destinations", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:07:49", "owner": "madraprimana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166628308368122, "text": "The news tried making poland the villian and poland set an example of what a government should be", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:05:12", "owner": "flamingvolf94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043758746659249, "text": "Others should take exemple from poland on that point !", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:03:47", "owner": "meltdown_hardcore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070417603935916, "text": "❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:02:33", "owner": "aksaa_thomas_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998426082665994, "text": "Bravooooo👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:01:45", "owner": "autumn.inmyheart.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870302650350573, "text": "Who is she to tell is what to do! 🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:01:41", "owner": "ronney.mp3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389520715192096, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:58:35", "owner": "omneiboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066161789220775, "text": "Proud of you brothers! 🇭🇺🤝🏻🇵🇱❤", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:56:45", "owner": "bator.arnold8815", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114706636521012, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:53:51", "owner": "tareq_77799", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079486442485719, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:53:37", "owner": "_7z9d", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18353440288090495, "text": "World safest country 💖", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:52:11", "owner": "rask98765", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070682143908972, "text": "They might be called this and that...but what if they were right?", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:50:11", "owner": "mycki.kurosawa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110734462557014,