n bitch is this woman...bravo Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:15:44", "owner": "dobnikaljaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892037635334244, "text": "Sto pensando di trasferirmi in Polonia.....", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:08:43", "owner": "matildona70", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925649100998007, "text": "Nobody needs those terrorist, especially Muslims.  Most of the danger comes from Muslims from those countries. I have lot of Muslim friends but they are thinking same way. That’s why they are dangerous for all of us.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:07:25", "owner": "dr.iraklius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279914806285432, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:06:41", "owner": "gidibaba007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068622947179964, "text": "🇮🇳♥️", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:03:04", "owner": "theinsideinsight", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055899611544021, "text": "بهترین کار در برابر مسلمانانِ تروریست همینه👍", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:02:18", "owner": "chaarchoob4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125807377466877, "text": "Hero 👍👍👍👍👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:57:55", "owner": "sestmiha", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18356238550084002, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:55:04", "owner": "singh_pooja_3010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950126655889068, "text": "Poland hi jana pdega ab🤭", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:54:26", "owner": "astha_antas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088834639834501, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:53:49", "owner": "minellibarrow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019531454752648, "text": "👏👏t", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:51:47", "owner": "lmao_cxg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089929327801633, "text": "Tbh it’s actually wise decision. Imagine how many woman or kids being gangbang by illegally immigrants due to fckup beliefs.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:51:36", "owner": "tapalesgm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147559093411727, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:49:36", "owner": "bronxstump", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922438696112471, "text": "Turns out Poland was 