l became violence. So shut up KAREN. W Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:15:51", "owner": "raven_600rrr", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17897236047278650, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:15:41", "owner": "xyz12343361", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039133634680786, "text": "Any reporter can say anything another article or person so called said to try and make someone exposed on tv the man stood his ground this woman should invite the illegals to her house if she cares so deeply", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:13:28", "owner": "oskar.x.d.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101398852610530, "text": "He,s right, follow his example", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:10:07", "owner": "mustbemarta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18519386599011716, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:06:46", "owner": "wanderlust_diiip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935969419080663, "text": "@narendramodi @amitshahofficial @drs.jaishankar  सीखिए कुछ, हमने भी आपको किस लिए चुना, वो जानिए", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:02:54", "owner": "aadi__na_ant", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157940275383123, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:02:43", "owner": "giovanna_gee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17939211735063186, "text": "He's 💯 correct !!! Its a catholic country!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:01:49", "owner": "patrick_80lb", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18156778723383546, "text": "Proud of Poland 🇵🇱 have been there 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-10T08:58:27", "owner": "omkendre22304", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18128569885461242, "text": "Well done!", "created_at": "2025-09-10T08:39:41", "owner": "ashccalee", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17965784648798952, "text": "@big.chocky 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-10T08:38:26", "owner": "jacintaxyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071942834109870, "text": "@onenationoz we need to be more like Poland and the Australian people know you're the only party to do it for us 🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-10T08:37:43", "owner": "jacintaxyz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038617421460371, "text": "Good job i wish my country do the same thing", 