025-09-09T15:19:26", "owner": "more_of_me16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102825622522910, "text": "Should ask her would she feel safe to invite them into her home with her underage children, if the answer is no she wouldn't feel then why would you want to invite them into our country. Let's be like Poland but 1st we'd need to start deporting millions 1st", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:02:34", "owner": "bikerbirdy89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104355763602802, "text": "Proud of you ❤️💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-09T14:53:01", "owner": "sangeetarawat126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107126005564287, "text": "Go Poland I stand with you and I am Russian, sending love", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:19:20", "owner": "marinaoceanalife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122046352496302, "text": "56 muslim nation still muslim are refugees 🐷🙄🙄🙄🙄", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:27:49", "owner": "nationalist_mamta", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18134500603396019, "text": "@indians ❤️ @poland.pl 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:20:53", "owner": "raju_pahadi_1008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137385379442410, "text": "bothers in arms", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:24:23", "owner": "as1l3v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140442274425889, "text": "I can't stand that lady.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:23:29", "owner": "rob.falconer.7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18147062071405050, "text": "Im moving to Poland 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:21:45", "owner": "jessica136669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161467360374525, "text": "Zero=Hero🔥💯❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:50:17", "owner": "gimo1127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171033097361801, "text": "Nobody talks about hungary", "created_at": "2025-09-09T15:11:27", "owner": "marton.nagy.purpose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283649539260769, "text": "Unfortunately, cureent pro deutschlad government allow deutsch polizei to take illegals from deutschland and drive them trough our border leaving them in Poland. And our police are hitting polish, because we don't want illegals", "created_at": "2025-09-