91480283, "text": "Bharat (India ) 🇮🇳 also needs to apply this policy urgently immediately And this is the only solution.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T10:09:06", "owner": "shivanigupta.27", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17863098927464642, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:53:58", "owner": "adleyjoan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864137470459562, "text": "🔥👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:54:50", "owner": "chandureddy1056", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866035960451142, "text": "well if England continues down the path it’s on I’m moving to Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:47:28", "owner": "c._digxnce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866643259445060, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:46:58", "owner": "khotmilind3335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874653883412037, "text": "\"I Don't want ILLEGAL imigrants to come into our country in Thousands ILLEGALY\" \"Oh so you're rasist??\" bruh people.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:34:02", "owner": "utahraptor_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875634259306198, "text": "❤️🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T10:00:24", "owner": "prasadgtr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878242252397073, "text": "Great Job Sir 🇵🇱👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-09T10:04:38", "owner": "sumitdasbairagi.96", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17889986919206083, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-09T10:26:41", "owner": "jazguldakinova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893862715314956, "text": "So proud to be at least neighbor with Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:56:11", "owner": "vaclavlahucky", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17898119835274337, "text": "W Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:19:55", "owner": "jxshkettzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909284908210298, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:53:55", "owner": "adleyjoan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928113598132904, "text": "Polish is the rich, beautiful, peaceful country this time! Respect to this president 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:51:56", "owner": "minas_ac", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17941786659052187, "text": "Sigma 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:4