ext": "Refugees = Illegal Migrants", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:51:31", "owner": "hausbau_holste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318469147215562, "text": "I want that in Germany 😭 these leftist are getting more and more stupid", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:47:22", "owner": "mehr_6azu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405073678139709, "text": "This is Poland👍👏💪", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:20:43", "owner": "milan_petkovic0610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528867424020406, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:19:26", "owner": "nmy.fnando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531135406041776, "text": "Way to go Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-09T09:59:49", "owner": "delapiewoh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842066806577859, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👍👍👍👍💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:54:21", "owner": "viktorijajovanovska9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845656180548608, "text": "Good for Poland👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:42:20", "owner": "thompsontabitha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845667082547798, "text": "Its a Catholic country, let it be that way🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:14:59", "owner": "ron_ronnak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847779049557479, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:26:57", "owner": "prasad_solanki26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850926514505155, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:31:43", "owner": "meenu25rai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852802243538135, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:45:36", "owner": "_sumitsinha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881624452385498, "text": "he’s got a point. Poland has got a point. i as a ukrainian fully respect this. but from my point of view one thing that really makes me disappointed is that some Polish people are very nationalist and hypocritical because of that. this immigration policy where you can only get in the country LEGALLY is not genius but NORMAL. but i don’t know why are those very “liberal” countries decide that if you must respect all nations and shit, that means you must let illegals in, and on the other hand, why in the countries like poland who officially don’t discriminate any other nations people are so nationalistic", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:20:40", "owner": "mojiwhy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908012335234693, "text": "Sorry to say but every non Muslim country should not accept any Muslim refugee .", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:28:21", "owner": "_pankaj._singh._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908605495089669, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:55:58", "owner": "jokersixtyfour", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923214802111548, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:35:36", "owner": "samiyaraval", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923761738110939, "text": "Good work well done Poland 🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:24:56", "owner": "pauskardeeptesh800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925944169106431, "text": "🔥 Well done", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:20:52", "owner": "oshin.sharma.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950730505001225, "text": "Respect From India Man !! 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:29:09", "owner": "_p_a_ll_a_v_i_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957008305004638, "text": "So respect Poland and Polish government despite that i’am Russian.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:41:14", "owner": "c1ayman_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981359073884244, "text": "Bro see the future 😜😜😜😜", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:24:04", "owner": "khongjiartemis_1422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982320024854893, "text": "👑", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:17:49", "owner": "_s_u_r_a_j__r_o_s_h_a_n_a_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032262026708971, "text": "🇵🇱@poland.pl 🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:18:11", "owner": "bobin1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041176088389842, "text": "🙏👏👍", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:03:06", "owner": "nythan_gaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045945008334018, "text": "Every democratic country should take up this step👍", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:39:34", "owner": "_roshanwangkhem_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050544347544080, "text": "Sounds like she’s jealous her country is going to shit", "created