 "2025-09-08T23:55:48", "owner": "itzdhiren_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064934909462183, "text": "Democrats would love to ruin Poland also", "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:39:42", "owner": "who_me1977", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066010130199225, "text": "He took 2 million refugees . It’s hard to debate with special  ppl", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:55:05", "owner": "ajoropeza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067217987465672, "text": "Big respect from georgia❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:13:41", "owner": "anatorieli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067744382466585, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:13:42", "owner": "peterpfrang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069309839332219, "text": "Amen brother", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:48:53", "owner": "dirtydog72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069410444324549, "text": "10000000000%", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:49:37", "owner": "jojoboy2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070181810269563, "text": "Poland is the smartest country.", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:17:09", "owner": "conniewolfinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073301152869298, "text": "Paris and London should be used as examples of what happens to cities who indiscriminately take immigrants in every interview.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:28:25", "owner": "zayastm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073688672027197, "text": "@ryanmacwhu85", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:40:46", "owner": "lottie20133", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081736618821933, "text": "Who is this Bisch who is talking?!?!??!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:59:40", "owner": "mindaugasbudrikas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082584775930689, "text": "Ukrainian power in Poland🔥🇺🇦", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:49:59", "owner": "komnatasnov_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083169061723697, "text": "Well done, Poland. Bravery leaders with lion heart. God bless you, ✝️ 🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:35:19", "owner": "marial_anthony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086117410880891, "text": "I’m Ukrainian 🇺🇦, I’m working as a seaman, never been in Poland, and never ask for a help from other countries. I proud of Poland 🇵🇱. Thanks a lot that you let Ukrainians.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:52:15", "owner": "mr.gnln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090060277693037, "text": "A government that listens to its citizens. How nice, can we do the same.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:02:38", "owner": "elirfwilliams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095546800637620, "text": "Good luck Poland👏👏👏!!¡", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:58:48", "owner": "mindaugasbudrikas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100898164611827, "text": "She’s a fucking doylem her!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:19:33", "owner": "andrewblair21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106109233570946, "text": "Great job, Poland! 👏🏾", "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:54:30", "owner": "donnie.carloz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106518331566355, "text": "As Czechs, we should be like our Polish brothers 🇵🇱🤝🏻🇨🇿", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:03:44", "owner": "iam_michael_m99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110238085540417, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:09:15", "owner": "no_easywayout_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114165127518610, "text": "Respect for Poland💯👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T22:45:36", "owner": "the_houstonian01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18332043112229236, "text": "Excelent 👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:41:27", "owner": "luccaormonde", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18339250801206686, "text": "Absolutely right. 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:21:50", "owner": "gavinbald2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355923961085504, "text": "Im so happy for yall. You have a good leader.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:39:42", "owner": "maximus_dingus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370481377146942, "text": "Good job Poland!! No refugees in the world if your leader behave", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:39:50", "owner": "seulbi0018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374657737179055, "text": "🤮🤬🙋🤡", "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:02:40", "owner": "domotornorbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410188636112350, "text": "Respect Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:36:52", "owner": "catalinadrian7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419992141110400, "text": "Bravo 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:07:46", "owner": "timotiuz_adrian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526494019017460, "text": "Well done Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:34:08", "owner": "prityyyyypal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847360528558179, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏 definitely a good leader. The rest of the world needs to learn with him.💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T20:25:03", "owner": "anasofia598", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880066942387278, "text": "Bang on. Why is this difficult to understand. No country allowing mass immigration has become a better place.  Canada is unrecognizable and unbelievably unsafe. It's tragic", "created_at": "2025-09-08T20:48:06", "owner": "saltandpepperface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884736718244697, "text": "Be like Poland 🇵🇱 this is what I wish for all of you !!!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T21:01:29", "owner": "_de_a__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890186728203523, "text": "The answer is if you go to visit the factories in the UK, Germany or other countries you will see the result mate!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T21:57:26", "owner": "kayo.ran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896729971291532, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T20:50:28", "owner": "rhtdm5555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907174123229011, "text": "“Oh you are racist for not taking refugees of Islam”\nTake peaceful ukrainians 👍\nServe people and country 👍\nProtect people from terrorism potential 👍\nProtect man, woman and children from toxic idealism of raping and discrimination of sex/gender 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T21:30:25", "owner": "sokol.kozak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921550948078669, "text": "Poland, you are fantastic thinking of your own people🙏👌🏻 Sweden doesn’t give a shit about there own people who built the country. Now the government sell Sweden and there own people lite we are plaig", "created_at": "2025-09-08T20:50:49", "owner": "asajonsson72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936444442078004, "text": "We have to clean