wner": "anjusharma_510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939335722061818, "text": "Respect form 🇮🇳👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:54:25", "owner": "sakhare52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940252459053097, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T20:04:27", "owner": "tarun_channapla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944469088047666, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:00:56", "owner": "ab.thabz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944678182024331, "text": "Respect 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:57:45", "owner": "iextro69_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954517057005673, "text": "He is so right about that %100!!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:51:58", "owner": "__sema.exe__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972942489776468, "text": "Long live poland🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:46:44", "owner": "radhey0722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982676892853649, "text": "\"I don't care\" i like tha👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:15:13", "owner": "mysteriousheart5300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988043253848531, "text": "how many polands have the US taken? you feel proud your country is doing this but when you try to enter to another country you dont apply the same rules? nice", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:19:32", "owner": "kkrotosjm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990496014698794, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:45:34", "owner": "jay.dukatz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996270984820379, "text": "👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:44:51", "owner": "eddie_nejad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025018346526665, "text": "If you look at the numbers darker skin coloured people tend to turn to crime more often", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:47:46", "owner": "miniaturefigur3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025395476721415, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21:02", "owner": "amit_yadav12390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036740840693391, "text": "England need this", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:55:41", "owner": "annieerodgers", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037524929468871, "text": "Well Holland could learn from Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:37:39", "owner": "emmixmagic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042366608378437, "text": "When he says: “this is what our people are expecting from our government. That’s number 1”.🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T20:05:48", "owner": "helderpostigaingles", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044351543339298, "text": "@rayman_k", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:55:05", "owner": "klaassenjoe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054069515205041, "text": "👍👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21:01", "owner": "amit_yadav12390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056034764163073, "text": "Now all world ready to fight with allah ana sons bcoz that is cancer community💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:10:53", "owner": "shersinghchouhan477", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059058017608046, "text": "This guy has a guts and if you don't deal tough to them, those filth soon rape your identity, it's better to fight tough at front. Don't let them in.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:28:39", "owner": "rishank.la", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063196241359858, "text": "🔥🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:43:36", "owner": "valiant_varun09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063729413340383, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21:11", "owner": "amit_yadav12390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065754995462643, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👏👏👏👏 Islam destroy everything", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:51:48", "owner": "its_moche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065850368211372, "text": "Yes love it", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:44:27", "owner": "msaucedo8663", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074620136511192, "text": "♥️family first🫶", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:14:43", "owner": "kaikkos_samuli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075123875023756, "text": "👍👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21:00", "owner": "amit_yadav12390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077531783073153, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:53:21", "owner": "vikramsinghdafauti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077674709003568, "text": "@poland.pl prime minister is absolutely correct. Great response 🇵🇱 Love from India🇮🇳🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:01:33", "owner": "pj_isgreat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079662994947036, "text": "😊", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21:26", "owner": "ab_jsr_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083458478504637, "text": "“Our country is safe and our people voted for this”\n\n“but…but…muh RaCiSm”\n\nWe are watching people advocate for the destruction of human values for the sake of sounding “not racist”", "created_at": "2025-09-08T20:05:11", "owner": "spencerthewhitehurst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086470849869046, "text": "Keep strong Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:05:08", "owner": "guyver0001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090358252774395, "text": "👍👍👍respect button👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:03:29", "owner": "kumar_surya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090991882696951, "text": "Ohhhh there’s my ramen I thought it was in the microwave and I was so confused", "created_at": "2025-09-08T20:04:20", "owner": "boardsbythebay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093510595663345, "text": "But if the US tries to do the same shit we’re in the wrong?", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:18:10", "owner": "yxngplauge_g59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096066316712837, "text": "ذولاك الناس كرة عينكم و طاح حظكم اي والله", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:49:27", "owner": "abdulhadi.a.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102653959596246, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:35:10", "owner": "shwetatripathi06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110273953539628, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:36:55", "owner": "zeb577", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117912430505713, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21:08", "owner": "amit_yadav12390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124907266485795, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T18:53:09", "owner": "indernayak175", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134492605435248, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21:03", "owner": "amit_yadav12390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155097007382728, "text": "💯💯👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21:06", "owner": "amit_yadav12390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165109048369280, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:21: