d": 18103861894584293, "text": "I respect this man from 🇮🇳👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:45:52", "owner": "pritessa001", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103993348573197, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:09:59", "owner": "sunflowreck", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117260944504511, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:54:53", "owner": "rohit_meena_ji_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139281850426610, "text": "It’s hard to get into Poland even if you are legal. My dads the director in a company there and they didn’t wanna give him a visa 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:13:00", "owner": "today_of_ademi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18150143365398875, "text": "Those who let the terrorists let in their countries are now regretting their decisions and are suffering in their own countries", "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:21:48", "owner": "shwetagdelhi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18174952411345512, "text": "he is well known that if any single person come in his country then the cancer spread in the whole country ...", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:59:45", "owner": "shivendra5695", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18305084344221840, "text": "What does he mean zero?? She asked about refugees, not Muslims and Poland took a ton of refugees 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:11:59", "owner": "katestarh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18309822361168152, "text": "They're not refugees. They're invaders.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:44:40", "owner": "robertd8820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397156096187384, "text": "👏👏👏hell yeah 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:46:42", "owner": "nakhrewalinair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421865638101478, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:13:15", "owner": "art_amritangshu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846840514559383, "text": "Dumb bitch, how many dicks have you sucked? Let’s drop you off in a Muslim country big mouth. See how you do.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:42:22", "owner": "eddierothman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855121792517179, "text": "☪️ancer Free Country 🇵🇱💯", "created_at": "2