kes": 3}, {"id": 17983991015861844, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:25:20", "owner": "rohit25salvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002714510807115, "text": "Now whole Western Europe is suffering except Poland😅", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:28:02", "owner": "a_normal_teenager_boy_2006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012873659610060, "text": "🔥❤️❤️🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:43:24", "owner": "shivamdubey4823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018222980582968, "text": "Poland 💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:40:41", "owner": "shital_singh32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022977437741804, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:38:33", "owner": "robbie_boss13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025021544529704, "text": "What to say, we are failing as a nation. Bharat must learn this from Poland and take direct and strict action against those terrorist🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:34:55", "owner": "k_sutikshan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025100894528180, "text": "Good job Poland 🇵🇱👏👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:23:23", "owner": "macopinecarlutta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025846979735727, "text": "🙌🙌🙌👍👍👍👍👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:45:59", "owner": "rulezzz0r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027088946520511, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:08:10", "owner": "paddy_994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043760021361753, "text": "Muslims should be illegal immigrants everywhere", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:33:00", "owner": "j___g___dman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046749755329269, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:37:12", "owner": "theleralan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050849201647442, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️✝️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:32:34", "owner": "marek.maciejowski.perez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052575038239526, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:40:46", "owner": "madame_coco_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052631942553978, "text": "God bless you sir👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:39:39", "owner": "shiv__ansh_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055243061438896, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:51:48", "owner": "danario_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059263895608614, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:47:51", "owner": "kiran_p_thankachan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063877670523558, "text": "Jesus bless 🇵🇱☦️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:42:13", "owner": "joe.a_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065073722337396, "text": "I have the sudden desire to visit poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:00:16", "owner": "democracy_officer_wood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066306164002962, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:50:51", "owner": "crenta54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070342520131819, "text": "Yes I AM VERY PROUD OF HIM 👏🔥🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:46:38", "owner": "jacobsdavid910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070438993915603, "text": "The first time stunning and brave was actually warranted", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:45:32", "owner": "eric333666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070757399150883, "text": "Let good, working , families who will make life better for all into your country.  Keep criminals and those who will take advantage of taxpayer funded programs out!  I think we should get rid of native people who choose to be criminals or take advantage of their working, tax paying neighbors too!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:59:11", "owner": "xb_ranch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071218328327597, "text": "W poland", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:18:02", "owner": "criss.tea8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072122918124090, "text": "Llooo99", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:17:17", "owner": "itz_goswami_421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072948113155968, "text": "Good job @poland.pl", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:50:43", "owner": "the.guptaji9770", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074931229842706, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:11:18", "owner": "owner_of_kimen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074945729480829, "text": "Well said that man! Proper leader with a backbone ane a pair of bollocks. Unlike the wet wipes in charge of this shit hole!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:14:31", "owner": "jimmyt_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076048487097458, "text": "Look in England look all around Europe, where they lit all these immigrants and they’re taking over stores stealing. Send that where they came from. It’ll be cheaper. They don’t deserve to be in no country.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:53:55", "owner": "mikelj1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079900561772536, "text": "👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:39:45", "owner": "honorata_gitu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081478732902061, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:33:08", "owner": "soham_kolekar2006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082355591501339, "text": "There's a reason why its one of the safest places", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:35:31", "owner": "aminsomnii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089879023699363, "text": "Words of wisdom 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:07:00", "owner": "pep1632", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091740976737693, "text": "🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:09:41", "owner": "m_mila.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095008054708719, "text": "BE LIKE POLAND —>", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:25:06", "owner": "liamdavis481", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098598148716849, "text": "Clear n right 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:20:05", "owner": "ghanshamakm86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102899830611012, "text": "Smart country", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:26:05", "owner": "yazzlovestravels", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112095619549376, "text": "WOO", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:17:16", "owner": "itz_goswami_421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114053284522437, "text": "🇵🇱🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:43:29", "owner": "shivamdubey4823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118448191448387, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:06:14", "owner": "gasharma4064", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150824641393221, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:06:33", "owner": "ruhi.p.s.waghmare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169711213362582, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:43:48", "owner": "noamackmel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238076674290512, "text": "Yes he is proud of that. What's your problem??", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:02:40", "owner": "biph_d", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18284985814279107, "text": "Say it louder so the people in the back can hear!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:22:31", "owner": "naynayk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287708149259211, "text": "O999#9#9", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:17:16", "owner": "itz_goswami_421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325218016234715, "text": "🙌🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:34:04", "owner": "__bhattji___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338951476165098, "text": "Muslim didn’t do anything bad in any country, if their countries are destroyed it’s because of European and American countries. Also, whatever shits happened it’s most of them their own people not Muslims.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:30:19", "owner": "itx_mo47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376079848179807, "text": "Stick that in ye pipe and smoke it well done Poland 👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:38:23", "owner": "kennyrobinson360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496059568068040, "text": "Wir Polen sind topund Deutschland müsste es mit dieses Terroristen auch so handhaben.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:55:39", "owner": "dongo__brothers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842070004577481, "text": "No one can force a country to take immigrants and change themselves,when these idiots will understand? If you want and love them then take them all but don't force them onto us!!! That is the fastest way for EU collapse ( I personally hope sooner than later) cause we are like 40 ish countries and you can't make us think all like one. You just can't while also applying at the same time double or triple standard.So ye be more like Poland and Hungary.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:51:06", "owner": "nerynemephala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856160317514765, "text": "We desperately need that here in Canada", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:14:15", "owner": "tattoos_and_tequila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857381749508129, "text": "Every country should follow this", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:48:56", "owner": "nipinjain", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17869966917352775, "text": "🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:50:13", "owner": "opresq.andrei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874194508411782, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:45:16", "owner": "h__a__r___i___s__h__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876895948406714, "text": "🇵🇱🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:19:48", "owner": "blackmoonlilith92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881547118264053, "text": "Hell yeah! 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:49:39", "owner": "phoenix69phoenix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884769793243436, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:01:23", "owner": "b_nishaanth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892125499319272, "text": "I'm from Iran and I agree with him 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:01:59", "owner": "themsnp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893431720317210, "text": "RESPECT FOR POLAND", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:46:48", "owner": "diptanshu_dutta__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893944042314260, "text": "What a MAN!!👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:57:49", "owner": "nienaber.rudie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896948275290583, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:00:02", "owner": "aktywnapodroz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897600064277449, "text": "Life would be better in Poland without em question mark? 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:50:18", "owner": "ottavio_789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898662841271700, "text": "🇵🇱 I love you poland.. and am a fan of this guy in the video 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:48:29", "owner": "harish.roy29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920199811160157, "text": "He said what he said! 👏🇵🇱🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:26:57", "owner": "barbs_s__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925588111106146, "text": "I wish I lived in Poland 🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:12:48", "owner": "pennyvonnelux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934873906082011, "text": "Best country to live in 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:19:10", "owner": "rutvi_mashru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944362675028225, "text": "Proud of 🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:32:10", "owner": "kttttrhinduu_ojasvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944701177044641, "text": "Great 🙌👏Hope india learns lesson from him", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:44:40", "owner": "babz_rathod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961100859986147, "text": "🔥🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:54:10", "owner": "anshukumar938659", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961910712826858, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:10:32", "owner": "amychin222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964621245952953, "text": "Common Polish W", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:40:47", "owner": "dan1el_ivanov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969037038950543, "text": "Good on you. 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:42:10", "owner": "andrewh0101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970880109933071, "text": "👏👏👏🏼👏🏻👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:06:35", "owner": "dr.reza_deutschland_2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973902903919910, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:06:02", "owner": "martaes69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982101888737271, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:57:01", "owner": "i_a_m_yash16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010939826788699, "text": "If she's so great why don't she adopt all the rejected illegal immigrants. Salute to Poland 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:24:47", "owner": "nagaimofutoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017454707773606, "text": "Wowww...Finally some one has the guts to say these words..👏👏🙌🙌❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:17:17", "owner": "monty_chawla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026548544520856, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:11:56", "owner": "detergent_powder_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036998813694939, "text": "Refugees are elders, women and children…… refugees aren’t the people trying to make their way into every European country, aka undocumented young and middle aged men….. there’s not a single woman and children in sight. All men. And to say they’re trying to forcefully make their way into a country that explicitly DOES NOT want them, shows their true intentions.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:55:47", "owner": "rxxiex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038106878461761, "text": "We need more politicians like this", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:48:35", "owner": "w9arsenal", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18040197887691143, "text": "Traurig das klares Denken heutzutage so schwierig ist, so wie er denkt über das Thema sollte normal sein", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:48:12", "owner": "phipx420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049902215282172, "text": "🇵🇱👍💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:20:39", "owner": "brandonquekb902023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050902553537560, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:41:24", "owner": "arieterosso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053422079204994, "text": "Is not racism someone to protect its country.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:21:11", "owner": "katerina_parellis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057635105614907, "text": "..", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:44:41", "owner": "babz_rathod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059956772591766, "text": "World  should  learn from polland...because...it is a country that only  thinks about safety of their people...not about opinions  of others", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:00:14", "owner": "dronisolanki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061608806076394, "text": "If once you allow Muslim then after few years you became refugee  Poland।💯🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:05:16", "owner": "abhi_jha_darbhanga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065685236258348, "text": "saving your country isn’t racism", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:04:11", "owner": "cysr.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067502654335830, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:44:24", "owner": "shashikaa.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068542102961729, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌👏👏👏👏👍👍👍👍👍❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:16:08", "owner": "monty_chawla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070952351149356, "text": "She sounds ridiculous of course he is proud of Poland because they were the smartest country in the world!!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:06:44", "owner": "riegerlynne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072999335283422, "text": "Now send 🇺🇦back home !!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:03:06", "owner": "andre187__z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073535195037083, "text": "W Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:27:27", "owner": "tomas.mikel24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074752079034430, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:51:57", "owner": "kokanqueen10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075063955845230, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:08:04", "owner": "juandegrebber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076848236484445, "text": "Account based in Afghanistan 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:10:47", "owner": "xold.a_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078105601978818, "text": "Facts", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:20:32", "owner": "jakeyokhana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078186782480230, "text": "I actually agree 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:43:26", "owner": "whatisintheairthesedays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079146770506012, "text": "Canada should take notes we have more Indians here than white people😂 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:12:58", "owner": "krisjohnson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092163655689116, "text": "Ban Muslim save world..... Before it's too late....", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:11:48", "owner": "prawin_ambhore007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095978326629664, "text": "India should learn something from Poland🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:11:43", "owner": "angel_shreya_966", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096412348633825, "text": "Its incredible the narrative that the presenter is using. Looks like narrstive of brazilian media. They are full of shit and try to turn right at wrong. F#ck you GLOBO and communism.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:27:28", "owner": "sriagod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096756475647614, "text": "Canada needs to take notes", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:04:17", "owner": "zackscheifele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104659012588307, "text": "I mean if America started doing that we wouldn't have such a big problem in America.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:18:04", "owner": "makelsibley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155361280378171, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:35:04", "owner": "huan_yap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322268788236867, "text": "Respect 🙏🏻 🫡 Be like Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:46:01", "owner": "rohit_choudhary505", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18369236170197586, "text": "Goddammit I wish I was Polish.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:20:36", "owner": "wonderfulmrwolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477008191078451, "text": "\"And you are proud of that ?!\" - YEAH SHUT UP !!! 🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:47:31", "owner": "die.niccii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18517601956047937, "text": "Bro want 9'11 again but this time 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:41:18", "owner": "its.shzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525959329055102, "text": "The interviewer is a dragon. Poland does it the best of all European countries.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:00:54", "owner": "wattgroen_bv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850831843505481, "text": "Yeah but unfortunately they next to Russian invasion", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:16:30", "owner": "lazarenko.vladm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852773200485872, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T08:39:52", "owner": "vadd35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855103540521228, "text": "Bravo 💯🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:17:38", "owner": "subhodip_datta_333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855336583515407, "text": "Doing what the people want - memo to the left: that is democracy.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:08:19", "owner": "jamesj1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856614550509831, "text": "I m Indian 🇮🇳 but i support Poland policy’s 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:15:46", "owner": "harsh0007628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857677513444466, "text": "🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:58:55", "owner": "stafo777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858774325437426, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:43:37", "owner": "didigama97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859529197482981, "text": "Hail Poland 🔥🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T08:47:01", "owner": "siddharth17a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862075639412862, "text": "Australian here wanting to move to poland 😂 we are going down here too", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:35:52", "owner": "marshadams92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868841674439185, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:04:50", "owner": "comics_art.3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870051064348902, "text": "Based", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:39:42", "owner": "ondyy.x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899575717269713, "text": "Respect Poland 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:18:04", "owner": "jebemnatvojnazor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908740231210194, "text": "Mindset like that girl will destroy any developed country secularism is the most disastrous thing nowadays specially about muslims", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:15:16", "owner": "kirmad_2.0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920438095160663, "text": "Congratulations,  this is good decision 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:03:32", "owner": "valentinovpreslav", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923702098125762, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:37:06", "owner": "iranshahrglory", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941870941053310, "text": "Well done poland 🇵🇱🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T08:55:28", "owner": "luciobacenettiz011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942435585925316, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱 let's all learn from this I'm from the Netherlands and they fucked this country", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:27:26", "owner": "scottvanhooft", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968456901793240, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:04:23", "owner": "block89_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968618790794183, "text": "💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T08:40:10", "owner": "custom_made_______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979505118873162, "text": "👍🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:33:01", "owner": "_trippyeye_999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985623165851868, "text": "🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:52:50", "owner": "jan_me_jay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013697996784355, "text": "Shame on Indi