": "v.s.m.i5", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17965301984809310, "text": "Why does the reporter have sympathy for people with a jihadi mindset? No country should accept them, because wherever they go, they create chaos. Once they become large in number, they incite community riots. Western countries, it’s high time you take lessons from Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:38:40", "owner": "nikkynmdv", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17967945935948230, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:23:58", "owner": "shakeandbake9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982153899856173, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:36:04", "owner": "kirann_pawar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983792007894589, "text": "True words👍👍💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:58:19", "owner": "prasunmandal2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999132699661691, "text": "She can't comprehend someone being frank her", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:01:58", "owner": "lee828g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020081414566265, "text": "Great job poland ..... Always stays this same kind for your great existence", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:47:24", "owner": "alan.joseph.140", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033204761701567, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:05:21", "owner": "saei_fj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041402432400488, "text": "Muslims = terrorists if you dont believe google it what the muslims in Indonesia have done 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:06:01", "owner": "layvinarby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045023426674812, "text": "Polish refugees spread all around the world supporting anti-refugee government", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:32:01", "owner": "fatos.imeri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051581399638386, "text": "W POLANDDDD", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:07:15", "owner": "suwubawu18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051638081259120, "text": "He should be proud 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:56:23", "owner": "kaanalumkathalum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054149696450599, "text": "Good job 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:13:28", "owner": "souvikm2016", "likes": 0},