}, {"id": 18087464686864531, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:42:28", "owner": "bostonrobb31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089139244759769, "text": "🇵🇱👍 no ☪️ondom allow👍🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:37:56", "owner": "aakaxhds", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089738134750224, "text": "Virtual signalling at its finest “I’m better than you because I help others” and yet our island is now so overpopulated we can barely even book a doctor’s appointment. The system can’t cope with their lofty goals to show off. If you help someone, don’t brag about it.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:37:03", "owner": "raixan_js", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094823002728324, "text": "Respect Poland as a Indian", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:04:50", "owner": "cloudyyyyy624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098140321621149, "text": "I love this for Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:14:01", "owner": "whyyoum4d", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18103718353601710, "text": "BRILLIANT MOVE!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:56:40", "owner": "jacquierussell59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113671774522757, "text": "She asked about refugees, aren't the Ukraine people refugees.?", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:16:07", "owner": "darylstirrat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127348876468734, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:50:32", "owner": "avi.ortega", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155553238389864, "text": "I dont give a fuck about immigrants now next question 😂😂 Respect for Poland ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:28:25", "owner": "pap_patil_aagri_king", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18161840830373871, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:58:58", "owner": "fermellasp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190964059320362, "text": "Why is she so aggressive?", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:07:14", "owner": "jstnsebas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18192736297316619, "text": "👏👏🇵🇱😍❤️❤️ Respect Poland ❤️❤️ Love from India 😍❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:59:26", "owner": "mibheyaa_pl22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305881756220959, "text": "💯👍👍💯👍", "created_at": 