 in Czech rep. works in companies, no increase of criminality like muslim refugees in Germany and France.", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:39:33", "owner": "sajko1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081682351745006, "text": "This is the interview I was telling you about", "created_at": "2025-09-07T22:43:38", "owner": "patwolves1960", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081740986903427, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2025-09-07T22:22:09", "owner": "drizzos2628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082249114898128, "text": "and you seem proud to ask him questions designed to make him look bad", "created_at": "2025-09-08T00:53:39", "owner": "benjaminloving", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082516576926391, "text": "I love Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-07T23:37:55", "owner": "kennylitchy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082531183733695, "text": "👏👏👏 True leadership, doesn’t care about what others think but only for what is right.", "created_at": "2025-09-08T00:43:51", "owner": "mike_macri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087667000662728, "text": "He’s good. Take care of his family and people first .", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:17:55", "owner": "sockchengwee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087789880658107, "text": "Poland is smart", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:53:53", "owner": "maryanngeyer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088775677785168, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T00:13:43", "owner": "jdraze57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089039272833411, "text": "No country should accept Islam", "created_at": "2025-09-07T22:41:55", "owner": "anapaulasilva5348", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089066641829780, "text": "Proud from poland 🇵🇱 from Portugal", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:51:31", "owner": "miro.marques89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090930166692477, "text": "Well said.  I agree with you 100%", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:25:33", "owner": "hawa87619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091585546779081, "text": "Keep the Muslim out from Poland 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱Polska jest dla Polaków ❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-07T23:15:25", "owner": "misia1955", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1