79860102857677, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-07T19:35:17", "owner": "phelphellli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991431081833446, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:20:34", "owner": "jorge_freitas91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992882274837063, "text": "🔥🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:02:58", "owner": "amy_94.0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996430236823700, "text": "In 2024, Ukrainians contributed over 15.2 billion złoty to Poland’s budget, while social benefits for them — amounted to about 2.8 billion złoty. The net positive balance exceeded 12 billion złoty, and this is only the beginning.", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:38:32", "owner": "djonnizer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002380037803797, "text": "And he also says \"Not all muslims are t3rrorists but every t3rrorist is a muslim\" 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:52:30", "owner": "fallen_diaboli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020921717762246, "text": "Woman. Take at home as many muslims you want", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:48:17", "owner": "helblau67", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023637071737196, "text": "Dedicated to Mamta aunty 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:26:40", "owner": "porchezian_ramachandran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024102098740742, "text": "Go on ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:13:42", "owner": "nikki_07_07_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032637758502449, "text": "@stephenwrd78", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:14:20", "owner": "gracieh29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048935354641274, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:53:34", "owner": "anandkirtandas.vrindavan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052042541537553, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-07T20:09:36", "owner": "jaga.nayak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057286136150808, "text": "Respect for Poland!👏", "created_at": "2025-09-07T19:22:53", "owner": "kovacsnomy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062799239345828, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:03:11", "owner": "amy_94.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063170699361373, "text": "Go ❤️ Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21