hy Islamic country don't take them as refugees??", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:20:05", "owner": "craz_yyyy247", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898967269269354, "text": "💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:08:48", "owner": "despina_papalekakou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921688999016997, "text": "Respect to the only normaln politicer", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:18:01", "owner": "sk1uma", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957740166989289, "text": "She called them refugees 🤡🤡🤡", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:09:41", "owner": "texaner_jzx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961172571828005, "text": "Let Poland be our example, now more countries need to do what Poland does", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:24:47", "owner": "bryceb_in_ct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981346446889814, "text": "🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:19:20", "owner": "vava_kj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984010890896497, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:14:33", "owner": "iulian_verdes39", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991223235828326, "text": "زعيم", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:10:00", "owner": "dertyuipoijh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17997722054665688, "text": "When it comes to safety of country no refugee pls refugees always threat to countries specially from particular religion", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:40:11", "owner": "surya_colours_jk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016464071779646, "text": "🇵🇱strong! New European elite without muslims🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:23:19", "owner": "andrewmalkov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017494778756047, "text": "It's a shame that rest of europe is reeling under islamic invasion!", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:08:52", "owner": "nice20chap20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020626538765515, "text": "Only country I want to live now 🥹 I hope one day I can go", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:51:11", "owner": "no_more_snkrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024681650723034, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:35:41", "owner": "priyaprincess548", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036886325478614, "text": "Give this man some more me