ng.....his first priority should be his citizens", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:43:44", "owner": "chutz2earth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060194009457293, "text": "💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:42:35", "owner": "flamingo87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061154261367844, "text": "👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:32:06", "owner": "hbaertel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065133419022349, "text": "Hero 🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:13:53", "owner": "si_ranush_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066393470007859, "text": "Good👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:04:34", "owner": "will.insures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067102630986744, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏.👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:15:07", "owner": "davidfcb4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073033733320705, "text": "1000 dirty polish in uk 🇬🇧", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:25:18", "owner": "nav_ranu0915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075577286016577, "text": "Waooooo !! Proud of you Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:54:00", "owner": "turjasu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076080995089868, "text": "All muslim refugees are raping under 18 girls in Uk and France and foreign media is silent on this", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:49:41", "owner": "spiritual.wolf26", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077452250056255, "text": "Huge respect for this man", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:51:07", "owner": "stilianhr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078621488478779, "text": "👏👍🙌👍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:56:07", "owner": "vinxvonxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085131514848211, "text": "Somali gang members literally throwing grenades at each other in sweden", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:04:53", "owner": "monkeespankr45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085386211879283, "text": "Smart people", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:07:40", "owner": "27dkel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086042275860180, "text": "Why they are in uk go back to Poland and look own Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:24:36", "owner": "nav_ranu0915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086476414846255, "text": "Drunk beer throw cans in uk stree