rd working people are hard working and refuges are taking our all hotels, making a mess everywhere they go. They are not even trying to understand goverment or learn a rules of living in UK. Half of them not even trying to learn the language just populating to get more benefits from UK. It's just ridiculous", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:22:30", "owner": "aistedaisy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18108970927546890, "text": "Im Portuguese and I live in London… but I’m gonna tell, God Bless Poland and their people! 🇵🇱💯 Europe is dying  fuck ☪️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:34:46", "owner": "cs.tchimba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110433172480753, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:36:19", "owner": "beatka0589", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128974240460817, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:57:05", "owner": "gina_biolzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134339044450637, "text": "🇵🇱👍🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:57:55", "owner": "sulaiman_almisto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18235652110294918, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:33:07", "owner": "sadaf.sbr97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18237294673288539, "text": "World take notes 📝", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:16:12", "owner": "wolf9erine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285668110283920, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:12:25", "owner": "ateeq4314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295917940264058, "text": "Well done Poland!! 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:07:19", "owner": "efra_lamas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320096047211259, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🔥🔥🔥🔥👏👏👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥👏👏👏👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:55:26", "owner": "saktiadityo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359120617154399, "text": "Respect to Poland 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:23:44", "owner": "rohanbardeskar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18421594087099939, "text": "Meanwhile@in Romania we got imposed a puppet eith no brain and we “prepare” for our quota from@next year of illegals.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:02:02", "owner": "octtavyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 