to speak truth", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:50:06", "owner": "kulbhushan1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073790258027816, "text": "Remove muslims from this world everyone will be happy😎", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:08:01", "owner": "6ix_o45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076054223286441, "text": "Well, time is proving him right, because France and England are having a hard time dealing with Muslims.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:39:31", "owner": "jcruz_af", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077884720955247, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:53:12", "owner": "krugermaryq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081492065056687, "text": "Poland is becoming the other beautiful country of Europe even ahead of France.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:33:28", "owner": "fly_pcp", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18087145414876063, "text": "💪🏼💪🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:31:30", "owner": "andrew.peters.965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089520199691338, "text": "As a Indian i agree with him.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:28:31", "owner": "mahan_317", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093633868661330, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:02:27", "owner": "nsirsulla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094698616734092, "text": "💯👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:18:07", "owner": "_iamojasgupta_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095196244737095, "text": "Everyone...look at the comments and listen to your people!! ...", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:56:57", "owner": "cheryl20022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103382944599571, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:19:33", "owner": "cyberpsycho31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18174932890346674, "text": "God bless this man, and God bless Poland! 🇺🇸🤝🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:08:29", "owner": "krystalcrusader", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18286248871261038, "text": "Best country ever, ❤️ from italy", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:45:56", "owner": "igor_blooddrunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323014918227605, "text": "I feel bad for the Western countries how Islam is spreading there, and yet your governments continue to support it and invite more Muslims into your lands. Here in Islamic countries, we live under strict Islamic laws and often face persecution for our faith, but we still refuse to deny Christ. Meanwhile, in the West, many deny God, abandon the faith and values of their ancestors, and have become atheists while embracing other religions and beliefs. Do not forget your God.✝️☦️🪻", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:59:26", "owner": "atrishmasih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368606143197461, "text": "They’re not refugees, they’re invaders.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:48:14", "owner": "kenan.texier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383573380131833, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂 he is throwing truth on her face 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:56:54", "owner": "_vishalghonge219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18498009799067283, "text": "I It's RACIST I AM RACIST", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:47:55", "owner": "tukowskyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520821283044830, "text": "من زينها بولندا", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:28:08", "owner": "adventurer_jubail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522934546030903, "text": "Bharat ko bhi sikhna chahiye,bharat ke jitne gaddar muslim hai,sabko pakistan bhej dena chahiye", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:08:58", "owner": "rudranarayan_sj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525782152018065, "text": "Learn from Poland, in Italy we did what they didn’t and now look, these people can’t accept pur culture and ruin everything", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:26:12", "owner": "_manufabbri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18531293512006786, "text": "Im proud of poland 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:20:50", "owner": "rathore_abhimanyu29", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17845585329560777, "text": "Keep poland safe", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:49:29", "owner": "noldd_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854480944468412, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:38:50", "owner": "omaraguirre8774", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858999907494154, "text": "Shoot immigrants point blank", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:08:47", "owner": "bisalking2