"susieqt_santos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080687690479858, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:02:14", "owner": "tomaz933", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081427007505167, "text": "He's not racist, the UK needs to be like Poland and they are proud, the news now days brainwash people", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:46:22", "owner": "rdot16g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086218165885994, "text": "I am indian but love Poland ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:57:57", "owner": "vishal_singh7599", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087120655831723, "text": "Poland respect they know muslim are terrorist 🇵🇱🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:00:23", "owner": "psy.ritesh07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088217200841101, "text": "I wish my country's leaders were more like him. These days, both illegal workers and immigrants are getting the same rights as citizens, all just because politicians are trying to win votes from them.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:48:09", "owner": "mgs_serj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097522780727096, "text": "Yes Sr.!! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:19:49", "owner": "alfonso.cruz.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110086999550381, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:46:31", "owner": "oxilos80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124818208469902, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:02:59", "owner": "tsarevichjoel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18135640957453899, "text": "Make him European Union 🇪🇺 leader..Smart strategy 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:23:33", "owner": "manoj_khanal23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143534926415204, "text": "Agreed 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:04:14", "owner": "ffmitt12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148404865398854, "text": "💯💯💯💯💯💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:32:36", "owner": "deepakchauhan491", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154350766382808, "text": "Well done 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:22:28", "owner": "roking_bk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319013287209558, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:31:08", "owner": "razitapulavarty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322868017239393, "text": "Stay strong Poland don’t let the vermin in. And there are no refugees or asylum seekers. They are all lying. Keep them out and your country safe.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:58:31", "owner": "billsmith9597", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325473841239662, "text": "Australia need to be more like Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:49:33", "owner": "kye_wilsonn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18341507212167573, "text": "Spain should learn from Poland 💀🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:22:11", "owner": "madalin_vedat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341976295160081, "text": "What a g 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:59:04", "owner": "ali6a6a__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371554456197811, "text": "One of the few European leaders who is actually looking out for the good of HIS PEOPLE and not looking to import the entire third world", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:14:06", "owner": "brian.busch.580", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18383176975132207, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:20:58", "owner": "samk1326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409432840117839, "text": "GOD BLESS COMMON SENSE GOD BLESS POLSKA THE REAL EUROPE", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:56:20", "owner": "southeast.kiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858698296493602, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏💯💯💯💯🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱 muy bien Polonia!", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:22:46", "owner": "ginedger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859450222483664, "text": "Top man in England is secretly converted to ☪️ Islam, yet people are so blind to see that!!!😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:50:52", "owner": "oldisgold_._._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863209816398485, "text": "God bless Poland in the name of Jesus", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:06:09", "owner": "gopher_james", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867102604442535, "text": "A good listener would understand from the first thing he said. \"This is what our people want. This is why we are elected.\"", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:43:12", "owner": "mars_de_lamorona", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17871268665340795,