": "tashkaza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036304187478153, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:31:13", "owner": "yoyega68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039986786676646, "text": "Poland is goated👍🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-06T01:24:43", "owner": "brycespalding9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052602908222967, "text": "No muslim no problem 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:42:38", "owner": "seanpaulocarpintero77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057402986133418, "text": "Hero", "created_at": "2025-09-06T01:16:29", "owner": "berksglass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059172986106685, "text": "After Germany they learned 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:36:28", "owner": "its_always_wally", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062406659342804, "text": "I don't like to like come as an immigrant in a different country and try to bring on culture", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:43:08", "owner": "faststronghealthy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064690085352139, "text": "I back Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-06T01:43:46", "owner": "stevensuniverse89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065374820205849, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:26:34", "owner": "chapla.chris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069828715924349, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:40:38", "owner": "_.its.piyush._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070335919929377, "text": "This president is a real warrior 🇵🇱💯🙌 big respect", "created_at": "2025-09-06T01:48:38", "owner": "stefano.st01", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18073038395116946, "text": "I understand that places are not so great and I understand why a lot of people illegally immigrate. But there are reasons why there’s legalities behind entering any country in general. If every immigrant got in legally we would easily be able to detain anyone that got in illegally, which if everyone else got in legally, anyone illegally crossing would probably be an actual criminal who literally couldn’t legally get in. obviously it’s not that simple, there are lots of factors to that. But it would be great. I don’t think how the US is handling it is all that great, but unfortunately it’s a tough call that I think needs to be done, it’s hurting families and people that legitimately needed to flee. But you can’t blame the entire government for that, criminals are definitely a big factor in immigration. And criminals are definitely the reason we need to deport people, there’s a bit of collateral damage though. Bidens administration forced our hands by letting in sooo many illegal immigrants, even the democrats thought he was crazy! that’s why Kamala was elected to take over for his next term. I don’t know if this a legitimate fact, but I’m pretty sure Colombia released all of there prisoners into America when America had 40,000+ illegal immigrants entering in a day for a time. hopefully and possibly just click bait. Besides everything said. I love seeing different cultures, I love experiencing it. In a as non racist way I can say this, i kinda wish people stayed in there own country (i also wish that every country wasn’t war ridden and smothered by criminal gangs to bare in mind) But not as a “Stay out of my country way” but as in, your culture is over there ours is here. Let’s visit and tour around and stay for a while. But to engulf another culture to make yours is just as invasive as burning everything down and rebuilding. Or killing off a civilization to take over their homes and resources. It’s less brutal, in ways, although criminal migrants/refugees don’t help that. Wow… who let me type this long.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:15:39", "owner": "kbrassert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074574368046892, "text": "Islam is garbage 🗑", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:35:59", "owner": "walt_igginz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075049652081066, "text": "Wkwkwkwk lol", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:07:16", "owner": "lukmanhakim1061", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076061551970384, "text": "This man is a hero, make him the chairman for Europe and kick Ursula out", "created_at": "2025-09-06T01:18:00", "owner": "erickramer963", 