unakusantiago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025507844721500, "text": "I wish canada was like poland😮‍💨😮‍💨😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:37:44", "owner": "tylercoleowen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039208061690856, "text": "Time proved he is right", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:03:01", "owner": "rem_star92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039834266433750, "text": "That’s why my flag in online games is Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:04:56", "owner": "christianmcbane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041153975390033, "text": "But the most of refugee are economical ones , technically they are not refugee. It is called immigration", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:05:31", "owner": "hdedhehbh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048477119307956, "text": "Smart man.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:30:41", "owner": "nicco_denton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053180834208572, "text": "Good job sir...the muslim are terorist", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:17:17", "owner": "dave_march7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053709029530553, "text": "Love from Turkey", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:28:19", "owner": "sametk.21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055554104408452, "text": "Πολιτικός με μεγάλα αρχιδια!Μπράβο ρε μάγκα πολυ καλα τα λες!ΜΕΓΑΛΟ ΣΕΒΑΣΜΟ ΑΠΟ ΕΛΛΑΔΑ 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:23:21", "owner": "dimitris_rom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055709459426251, "text": "Smart Poland, not racist....smart", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:47:30", "owner": "shannamaribradford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059818286578085, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:06:46", "owner": "farfantjbczn1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062269742585451, "text": "Well done Poland.. I wish the uk was the same. Ridiculous the state of this country now 😒", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:24:28", "owner": "cyclesport_precision_fit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062319017368599, "text": "During World War II, around 1942, many Polish people came to Iran. After Germany and the Soviet Union invaded Poland, a lot of Poles were deported to labor camps in Siberia and Central Asia. Later, when they were released, about 120,000 Polish refugees – soldiers and civilians, including many women and children – arrived in Iran through the ports of Anzali and Khorramshahr.\n\nIranians welcomed them, and cities like Tehran, Ahvaz, and especially Isfahan hosted many of them. In fact, Isfahan became known as the “City of Polish Children” because thousands of Polish kids lived there.\n\nAfter the war, most of them moved on to other countries such as India, New Zealand, the UK, and the US, but a small number stayed in Iran, married Iranians, and became part of Iranian society.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:47:31", "owner": "pvrebwar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065086223217143, "text": "Fuck off…. Europe is falling down", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:49:10", "owner": "krigge69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066342419001902, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏💯👏🏿👏🏾👏🏾💯💯💯👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:42:56", "owner": "t3rr3m0to", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068769311233405, "text": "W poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:39:17", "owner": "zackattackisback151", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069709162924466, "text": "Your country should be very proud of that", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:29:35", "owner": "mike_hudson_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071004866173189, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:10:19", "owner": "jeffreyjones1040", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073670354020910, "text": "💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:27:13", "owner": "jennnx04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073681049026945, "text": "👏👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:02:38", "owner": "massimocereseto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075255104046449, "text": "America could learn a lot from Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:40:41", "owner": "wikimtb1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075340997031487, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:18:06", "owner": "edwardpiunno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076566967954437, "text": "They have come a long way since having screen doors on their submarines in the 70s.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:44:39", "owner": "big_johns_jumprope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086011318847152, "text": "I’d be proud too", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:57:25", "owner": "taylorsilor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091079938765439, "text": "Can’t even be mad at him he knows what he doing he listens to", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:42:49", "owner": "nick_cameron2005", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092437336615496, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:52:34", "owner": "bjp_3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093053050665967, "text": "This woman is offside, Poland is right.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:33:32", "owner": "djindjo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094091584735096, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:30:01", "owner": "mohitprashar321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104106955579147, "text": "Yeah zero is a good number. Wish the US could do this", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:36:36", "owner": "twoface220", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104291896595382, "text": "And all along we thought the Polish were dumb.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:05:02", "owner": "farmbuiltrodandcustom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105018244559553, "text": "Because you put another title over it doesn't mean it's going to change it", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:30:12", "owner": "gokuodd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105307447604560, "text": "YES", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:34:55", "owner": "scott.clark.984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109122694551472, "text": "When did worrying about being seen as racist become more important than the safety of your own citizens? We need to learn from Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:57:36", "owner": "theconservationistvr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110129677553086, "text": "Good job poland👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:14:48", "owner": "zendrix2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136928359429080, "text": "A true politician who cares for his country.  Top marks", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:41:16", "owner": "moderncrusader1096", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155321989385211, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:24:56