iens? Where are those questions ? I am in the US and cannot understand why some cities are even considering Sharia law. Where is the trans community with sharia law", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:59:19", "owner": "markpaul_lopez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063887519461490, "text": "He should be proud…he’s standing for his country and their policies…good for them!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:20:08", "owner": "acornhillantiques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065320049204030, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T18:12:18", "owner": "luminous_emperor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066892031245899, "text": "A leader with a spine...more leaders like this are needed!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:02:12", "owner": "scottiebs3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069965315125101, "text": "Very good 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:52:33", "owner": "mukesh_mane14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070013497914899, "text": "It’s not at all racist. Muslims are filled with hate, destroy their own countries, then try to infiltrate others. Good on him. 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:35:28", "owner": "shirkmedia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070456177923125, "text": "And The LIBERALS CAN SUCK MY .....😂😂😂👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T18:12:40", "owner": "rudyb2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073756709029147, "text": "Those \" non- racist\" women should all move to countries, where they will be the minority and where there is Sharia Law 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:53:36", "owner": "olijaeiou12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077166083056253, "text": "Total respect from Italy.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T18:16:49", "owner": "giuseppe_lopez90", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078066725294837, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:37:40", "owner": "disharojhe____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078111041049243, "text": "Well done poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:12:39", "owner": "ashwanth.p19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078356563803646, "text": "Listen Germany Listen. We are lost", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:17:01", "owner"