09-05T16:12:32", "owner": "mr_pezo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980059602909598, "text": "I’m learning polish and moving ( uno reverse )", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:16:14", "owner": "garethroot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985986609714174, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:04:34", "owner": "vinayak_bahuguna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988828494844480, "text": "Im Russian but this guy is my hero 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:11:05", "owner": "papagrant", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989792247821413, "text": "Trying to make him feel bad about a hardline position that is by all accounts in line with his country’s beliefs, while being from a country that has a identity and overwhelming crime crisis wrought by rampant immigration and unfettered flow of refugees is absurd.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:02:58", "owner": "sterkelandrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001777232805887, "text": "I am proud to be Polish", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:02:00", "owner": "grzesiekk86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016859447772942, "text": "Whole world should learn from Poland 🇵🇱💯👍❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:14:09", "owner": "jatav_gaurav", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039947234436261, "text": "Refugee is the democratic translation of illegal immigrant", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:16:05", "owner": "can_of_korn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042557303364394, "text": "Long live Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:01:15", "owner": "astronot_andy66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044570564663272, "text": "Well done !!!! You’re a hero!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:58:50", "owner": "soulexplorerkate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050860016252836, "text": "FREE PALESTINE \nFROM HAMAS TERRORISTS\nAND \nMU$LlM CHILDMOLESTING \nCULTURE..\n🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:04:50", "owner": "orlandoilges", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056792339632841, "text": "Be like Poland. 💪🏽", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:58:59", "owner": "kiemo_magas", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18056813714146588, "text": "I want to live in Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:03:30", "owner": "jenjenscuba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059515700592726, "text": "Right on buddy … let other countries label your country if they want …", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:59:02", "owner": "johnfromroxboro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065674988595195, "text": "People call USA racist but it’s only because we’re the country trying to actively host a melding pot of cultures while being inclusive to everyone, while also maintaining first-world security.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:10:47", "owner": "j0hn.k27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073000424029999, "text": "👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:17:23", "owner": "lennyhaditz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074505455284283, "text": "W politician", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:59:33", "owner": "emirozyurtxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077839030824914, "text": "I'm moving to Poland. In reality this is what every country should be doing. We elect these clowns who promise the world and just fuck you over more. I'm not racist but I don't want boats and boats of immigrants coming to my country and causing shit because let's be fair, they do. Why can't our government have a backbone and actually do what the country wants them to do.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:07:24", "owner": "gavinstill1878", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077859869059564, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:04:18", "owner": "tetty_jamie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078191572801921, "text": "Come to Canada.  Kick the scum Carney out", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:13:17", "owner": "clairmontronald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081529681938409, "text": "Be like bugs👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:01:39", "owner": "lorca_bastoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088765567647304, "text": "I talk to who to come ? Now", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:03:43", "owner": "kuzu24_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089896330744263, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:59:08", "owner": "__m__a__c__k__o__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092565703665241, "text": "Poland used brain 🔥", "created_at": "2025-