ht 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:43:45", "owner": "aressafedis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994592565829196, "text": "🇵🇱👍w", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:39:54", "owner": "lucifergt_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000244862815041, "text": "💯👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:46:39", "owner": "its_aakash_karn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017643290773260, "text": "I do anything just live u like u guys.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:43:14", "owner": "zztentzz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032941361702122, "text": "Why doesn’t he even come to Germany for a few years and clean up here. We would need such a politician… 🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:41:53", "owner": "dako.dmr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036695267477574, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:44:28", "owner": "jordanwillisfinance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037099532473161, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:39:13", "owner": "prettysloot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038647970442978, "text": "I want to come here", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:32:16", "owner": "hails_adelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039165737429925, "text": "My hero❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:42:31", "owner": "thunderdan10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045463148652937, "text": "👍💯🇵🇱👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:52:18", "owner": "janjagnjatovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050560166271058, "text": "And in Canada we have a complete shit show!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:33:25", "owner": "mike.wiebe.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052420118625557, "text": "👏👏👏👏easy as that", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:48:37", "owner": "luissilva5051", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057268505528195, "text": "I love this that’s the way we need to be", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:29:57", "owner": "nicholassmith7072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062560718354770, "text": "I love u! I wish I was Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:42:28", "owner": "zztentzz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063708287049745, "text": "That's why all israeli soldiers are polish 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:38:34", "owner": "rahim_tk16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065804819225218, "text": "fake datas", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:47:22", "owner": "nev_telenek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069201755226089, "text": "Here in Canada, we have gays, panhandlers, paki, muslim, Chinese, Afric, fake homeless people, we have ppl pretending to be women or guy. Trying steal money from u. The fucked part is that, Canada is helping them. Where us who work 40 hours in week, we get fucked up by 54% of taxes. Then our money goes to the panhandlers, and panhandlers give it to the drug dealers and there food stamps! If hard worker in Canada, Canada doesn’t support. Canada supports criminals.!!! Bums, panhandlers, paki. What shameful country.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:47:04", "owner": "zztentzz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070474367515398, "text": "Amen! If Muslims are going to have ties to all the terror and evil in the world, and if they are going to take refuge in a country but try to take it down from within, then they aren’t peaceful. It’s not your right to burn our flags and say death to America when we were the ones who tried to offer safety from oppression and harm. There have been historical accounts of Muslim being run out of countries because of their ins unity to work well with others. This man is a boss!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:34:25", "owner": "wittmanrjs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074502860015311, "text": "I really love this guy", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:53:03", "owner": "josepharun46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074771873089917, "text": "Clown🤡", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:49:04", "owner": "afjol_hussan08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075637571091863, "text": "Britain deserves his fate for being cowards snd weak. Well done Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:27:59", "owner": "eduardoxcm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076573193474244, "text": "I never see panhandler, I would never see paki. What beautiful u give u ppl.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:42:50", "owner": "zztentzz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078009238804884, "text": "Toto musime robit vsetci. Ak je niekto, kurva a vy buzeranti si tento vyraz uz kurva zapamatajte, NELEGALNY imigrant, ma byt poslany do pice z ktorej prisiel. Bodka, koniec a vy vitaci mate dostat po hube, svine", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:31:02", "owner": "pohodacik255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086770108878603, "text": "People try to put western values on others countries. it doesn’t always translate.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:42:02", "owner": "sonyskywalker77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088428490840986, "text": "Time to move to Poland button —>", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:40:33", "owner": "outdoorsman89", "likes": 5284}, {"id": 18088737073832158, "text": "So why aren't we poaching this guy and bring him to America to help us", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:44:36", "owner": "patchesandlucky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089650423700207, "text": "Well done poland!🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:37:37", "owner": "juancarlospedrozalopez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095078134656193, "text": "Good for them. Look at Ottawa Canada, the so called refugees ie Muslims are burning our flag and saying death to Canada and destorying property. All the Muslims that dont want to change and wants Canada to change should be packed up and sent back to where they came from. Take care of your own Country before taking care of another country", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:44:03", "owner": "brewernicholas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095947939640808, "text": "This Aged very well for Poland and their society", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:53:34", "owner": "pandajack89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097121230629591, "text": "Is not a must he must and no one can force him to", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:48:52", "owner": "benzino3783", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109821481541298, "text": "Please can this man run the UK aswell.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:42:33", "owner": "xistxx2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129395422456327, "text": "They dont have to take refugees like other countries...besides, Poland didn't start all those wars in middle east...so that so called 'refugee' problem cannot be put on Poland's shoulders...", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:42:13", "owner": "semihdellal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136657090429654, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱💯❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:27:40", "owner": "alextazi238", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138239617382018, "text": "I wish the United States was like this..!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:39:35", "owner": "gringogordo215", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18162761905372072, "text": "He is right. Poland took the right decision. That’s why Poland is a peaceful country. I wish Germany took the same decision, then we were a country without knife attacks and uproar riots and less rapists. Long live Poland.🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:28:49", "owner": "wagnerberenbostel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173232139345882, "text": "Man saved Poland 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:45:22", "owner": "ros9019", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18174491884346281, "text": "Thank you Sir 💯👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:29:32", "owner": "uchennaokaforchristian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174660712343853, "text": "The mans a Hero. The women's just looking to back him up. He just marched on with his point 😂👍👌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:48:59", "owner": "pfoxy73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289126447283931, "text": "I vote to have this guy run the planet 🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:41:09", "owner": "kingren1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305730697221398, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:48:29", "owner": "wcarlfdantasw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339176545203213, "text": "Really well done?  But they are millions out in the world taking over everything...so that is well done for you? Them taking over everything all around the world while not taking none in their country...wow", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:47:42", "owner": "bitterssweetpl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340469821163685, "text": "I wish u whare my president", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:47:58", "owner": "zztentzz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410255806117922, "text": "Adooooro🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:45:00", "owner": "raffapetra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424824484099983, "text": "👍🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:36:08", "owner": "spinfisher60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525635470026366, "text": "Thank u", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:41:26", "owner": "zztentzz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525716074021312, "text": "💯this is not racism!! Its their country they can do or rule how they like and i am they did good!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:38:09", "owner": "josie_t_chin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858651124496743, "text": "Whole Europe should learn from him 👌🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:21:05", "owner": "georgesorin22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858686374494518, "text": "🔥Truth", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:07:35", "owner": "_jincy_pinki_george_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883528897385580, "text": "UP WHIT 🇵🇱 PATRIOTS", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:14:30", "owner": "the.cloudsmaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885885286360677, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:25:21", "owner": "lawralx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893631055299789, "text": "Damn right keep them out, don't let them in", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:21:23", "owner": "dalemeese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895544650166916, "text": "Good man ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:13:54", "owner": "snowghost247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907214077091105, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:22:32", "owner": "orianielya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907972102089646, "text": "Shame on the woman ☕️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:25:48", "owner": "tinkccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911401171071013, "text": "Canadá is so far to that", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:25:16", "owner": "neejhal_andere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912617206194346, "text": "Why aren’t they going after Egypt?", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:06:13", "owner": "notzfast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913414153193740, "t