ikes": 0}, {"id": 18039564542426226, "text": "Religion, racism … know the fucking difference..", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:12:38", "owner": "dannymax04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041055323398438, "text": "OG", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:13:22", "owner": "rod.iba.pri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047215580321687, "text": "I am proud of him and Poland, good job!👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:18:15", "owner": "dubbyjohnsonlivestock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048845705299852, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:26:01", "owner": "j0smith13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054043334194945, "text": "Look at England and the Uk rn and say he’s wrong", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:07:12", "owner": "dead_topjet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055226915404194, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:15:44", "owner": "dibyajitbanerjee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057565514451940, "text": "Not hard to understand hor @marvindemartian", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:06:27", "owner": "weijieix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060274733457062, "text": "🙌🇵🇱👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:11:17", "owner": "rohitkumarmahato456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062737148054566, "text": "🙌👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:22:15", "owner": "dmwine02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067960108977440, "text": "👏🏻 thank you", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:18:20", "owner": "kathi_berg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073887254033669, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:06:16", "owner": "anu_anjni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076730380817298, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:25:22", "owner": "ellatino_kev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078065713789482, "text": "THEN CALL ME RACIST TOO. THEY DONT BELOMG IN CANADW", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:12:51", "owner": "floatinghorizonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078311572811053, "text": "A great government.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:22:54", "owner": "pedrodeoliveirar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079357456986775, "text": "That’s Right💯 Go Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:22:51", "owner": "aynkraven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081172315822375, "text": "good job", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:05:57", "owner": "naim0naim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081383110905856, "text": "Soon me and my family will go to Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:06:13", "owner": "martinsarkizyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084596389883614, "text": "👏🇵🇱👏👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:22:03", "owner": "bmwbanditka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088277560841009, "text": "He’s proud, he’s not razist, and stop calling those animals asylum seekers or refugees because they are not.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:10:15", "owner": "isasalacoach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091028122703635, "text": "Love Poland’s president I wish he could be our next president after Trump don’t get me wrong I love JD Vance but Polands president doesn’t tolerate any crap at all 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:06:00", "owner": "spinteach1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092281471736946, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:06:13", "owner": "zingspretzels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093692242675002, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:12:29", "owner": "ewie_f24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097018027725468, "text": "He’s right 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:18:52", "owner": "harveybranham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114223681518899, "text": "💯 👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:21:35", "owner": "miskella87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138038479429629, "text": "Man 💪", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:20:37", "owner": "chandansingh4801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143805859373549, "text": "I'm muslim Elhamdülillah but this man is 💯 right. Afghan, Iraq, Syria and so on sort of country's peoples are not and never going to adapt themselves to european life style neither to their culture. And it's never gonna work well. So at least he's keeping his homeland clean and safe. They've trashed their own country, think about what they could do to yours.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:09:03", "owner": "deranorskaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146044492409721, "text": "❤️🇵🇱 They will call you racist & every other name in the book. It's all fake outrage. They will never call you wrong though. Could care less about their stupid name calling", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:13:09", "owner": "investorpatrickbanc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173647348352000, "text": "👑", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:20:36", "owner": "vito.peckaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196570957315567, "text": "Can't complain mate, Poland got vision 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:11:29", "owner": "___.siva_prasad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286258561286076, "text": "🙌🙌 And that's that.. deal with it 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:16:50", "owner": "ratagonjack", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295646314266336, "text": "Never import a problems", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:17:44", "owner": "adhi_philip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325468708228657, "text": "Any topic that’s backed by that trash gull is the exact opposite of what needs to happen if society is going to move forward. \nMassive win for Poland 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:16:29", "owner": "justinwillis_shedhunter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328143118229732, "text": "Caring for their country is racism?😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:26:24", "owner": "lkdp712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329338408231081, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:10:42", "owner": "humanserum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340591633166339, "text": "Thank god for one smart brave politician don’t buckle to the evil that’s pushing this agenda!!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:22:31", "owner": "sammy1of5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517718254025589, "text": "God bless this guy", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:13:20", "owner": "cubaeneltop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530486422024428, "text": "That, \"I don't Care\" 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:22:04", "owner": "tirumudi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842429671574510, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:52:44", "owner": "samilalush11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850608508504541, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵