created_at": "2025-09-05T14:58:44", "owner": "sanatan_b_h_a_r_a_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970455963931860, "text": "💯🇵🇱❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:45:41", "owner": "schneiderwioletta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984086835850087, "text": "Her hair looks like a noodle pack", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:52:26", "owner": "oneballhall333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985937625712917, "text": "🙌💪🔥 Fck yeaah! 🇵🇱 👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:43:44", "owner": "meneu.1970", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989478348839790, "text": "👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:41:43", "owner": "macri_1962", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006838865631884, "text": "Yes !!!....he is very proud of it.. great job Sir!!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:49:57", "owner": "imyourboss1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022237688726190, "text": "God bless this person . Example for all politics in Europe.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:03:19", "owner": "martinsarkizyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025505843526009, "text": "A lot of polish people are coming to my country and a lot of them who are here for years refuse to learn our language. Yeah, great people 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:50:57", "owner": "richard.vanoudheusden", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038719448438320, "text": "Understood the assignment 🇵🇱on🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:56:36", "owner": "drewcopeland77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051008033269220, "text": "Illegals belong nowhere they need to go back to where they came from", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:41:50", "owner": "irondanh79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052229603234494, "text": "🙌🙌🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:42:56", "owner": "vegabethyname", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052629245233337, "text": "This man should be the leader of UE", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:43:34", "owner": "kadu_xavier", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052812257227417, "text": "Be like Poland. 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:55:49", "owner": "chrisrobinson407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056119724574673, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:45:43", "owner": "mrkviper22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056767073152825, "text": "Well spoken", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:53:51", "owner": "mc3k99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058914965576348, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:44:12", "owner": "nech_masaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060537806082143, "text": "Spot on👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:56:10", "owner": "lee.b82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065019602190787, "text": "👏👏👏💯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:37:25", "owner": "olgacarb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065527523017745, "text": "No because you know if you did that they would ✡️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:59:12", "owner": "bkgameingbk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068832298955607, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:54:51", "owner": "you_mokbel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075022981844904, "text": "Be like Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:39:29", "owner": "meyhm_rx2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076251992062416, "text": "🙌 AMEN", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:49:35", "owner": "rampadodavide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077270432049954, "text": "Class👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:42:34", "owner": "dannyp_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079697930314848, "text": "The man is doing what his ppl want 👍🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:03:30", "owner": "tweet0979", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082310843495035, "text": "Zero is a good number", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:48:39", "owner": "tomzom55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085705246850559, "text": "🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:00:39", "owner": "steff__224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087122581858457, "text": "👍👍💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:01:42", "owner": "l_monderr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090763918693014, "text": "Because they know they are a plague", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:45:11", "owner": "grizzlymike84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091011301738290, "text": "Sounds like heaven. Can I Come?", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:38:57", "owner": "uffdajoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091257895707433, "text": "Great job 🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:02:47", "owner": "remonrafat4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095729044645667, "text": "Why does any country have to take refugees ? It’s the same type of shit like if you would HAVE to take at least one to your home. I don’t have to and I don’t want to. Why should Poland take them if it doesn’t want it to happen ? Their home, their rules", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:57:39", "owner": "artjom.wagner_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096771403568436, "text": "Speaking facts", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:54:50", "owner": "apro_saiyan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112957312526389, "text": "Ok  but why polish people emigrate in usa ? Because they are white or what😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:54:35", "owner": "kled_h79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115525741513646, "text": "As a Turkish guy who lives in Poland, He is right. 💯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:55:02", "owner": "tekrardene93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124396741491774, "text": "❤️🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👏🔥🔥👍👍👍💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:55:06", "owner": "ba.ltazar9653", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124409974471794, "text": "Where are the Muslim countries in all of this?!?!?! Why aren’t they taking them?!?! Why is it that must if not all Muslims counties do not want them OR Muslims refuse to go there?!?!?!! They only want to go to non-Muslims countries why is that?!?!?! Once there now those countries are not good enough and want to change it to Shia law. Why would Poland be forced to take them?! Or shamed into taking them?! It’s insane.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:59:14", "owner": "hutrallycorp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145593166369951, "text": "Who’s going to tell her that it takes a racist to know a racist? 🤣🤣 what a way to call yourself out!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:43:06", "owner": "angrybeard89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173973007354957, "text": "👍❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:52:00", "owner": "buratino76", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18182797594335230, "text": "As someone who is born and so-called Muslim, you have done the best j