d": 18063272339201478, "text": "Let the Muslims move into the house of this J interviewer lady and see what happens to her", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:18:28", "owner": "nick.malanga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064414190349797, "text": "Poland 1 everyone else 0", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:17:06", "owner": "omerhezi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069012481944862, "text": "w poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:56:47", "owner": "zhuriks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069997969915685, "text": "Agreed", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:18:03", "owner": "abhinav_rawat0007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070695704150924, "text": "Be Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:19:09", "owner": "pjpavelic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072860305896398, "text": "How many refugees have Saudi Arabia, UAE, Kuwait taken? Zero. But they take white working people from Eastern Europe because they know the difference themselves.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:05:43", "owner": "username77007700", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074499868841331, "text": "That’s a mf man right there he don’t give a shit about nothing but his family and his country and same here brother", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:16:48", "owner": "rayadame91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074628470040130, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:11:17", "owner": "spandauer_bulldog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075453710315611, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:19:30", "owner": "mk_tallinn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076474805006618, "text": "Send all the Muslims to the news anchor house since she want the sand heat😎", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:30:44", "owner": "vmi.pl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076727626983408, "text": "Very proud", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:02:08", "owner": "terrybrown1976aust", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076942787483415, "text": "Call him a raciest but never a liar", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:11:30", "owner": "sxmm1_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078106544503804, "text": "Even ukrainians should not be let in", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:28:52", "owner": "emil_37426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078178264987305, "text": "As a Polish person, nice 😌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:01:35", "owner": "grac_maj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078263792483585, "text": "I hope that after all is saod and done we all look back and take note that the whole refugee was a planned act by elites to disrupt our countrirs and lives. When we do i hope we hunt down those responsible and put them to death. Greatest tradgedy of all time. May they all burn in hell", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:07:55", "owner": "rhino.6918451", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079409194760657, "text": "He should be proud...as should the  people of Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:31:40", "owner": "b_radcbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083152783919817, "text": "Those are my people so proud of them.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:21:28", "owner": "420_undead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085949038854148, "text": "How many bobr kurwa in Poland ?😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:02:41", "owner": "mr_smith8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086015116880172, "text": "Tell her to ask Muslim countries why they don't take those refuguess. ??", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:17:10", "owner": "shocker2for1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086228920867677, "text": "What have the Muslims done to you so you hate it that much? I'm Muslim from Morocco open to hear whatever you have to say 👇", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:01:20", "owner": "toorox._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088037374838401, "text": "He's not wrong 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:24:53", "owner": "surfdogzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091439722666902, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:05:04", "owner": "eytur220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094693045732260, "text": "Sabhi dukhi he bc ☪️ inse😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:26:25", "owner": "ra_thore8235", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100379824527175, "text": "This is how you deal with those midia morons.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:00:09", "owner": "beaga_alexandre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103906711595556, "text": "👍👍 love this man Smart", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:17:42", "owner": "lee12291992", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110221663479537, "text": "BARACK HUSSAIN OBAMA started all this mess!!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:28:15", "owner": "doubleoblanco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125718520479322, "text": "Giusto👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:23:12", "owner": "girardi.riccardo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157144861385538, "text": "They didn't take any refugees but deported many. Most Israelies came from Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:05:37", "owner": "shehabulredoy2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191376445320292, "text": "She’s unbearable, imagine getting hired to be a reporter just because your accidentally good at rage bait", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:23:01", "owner": "orlowski5878", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199670554314856, "text": "He not racist he is looking for what is best for his country. They learned the hard way way back", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:23:54", "owner": "antonio_terceros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282419572274845, "text": "Correct", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:32:24", "owner": "jana.zizkova8052", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316586623243485, "text": "I love this country🇵🇱❤️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:08:51", "owner": "eric.levesque.9081", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396739897140624, "text": "Ze is un Engelse denk ik ;zou Starmer of al die andere Premiers wel trots zijn met hun miljoenen asielzoekers ?", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:30:23", "owner": "freekk97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398504104139469, "text": "Bardzo dobrze 💪", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:30:10", "owner": "dani3l_bemwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425746384108344, "text": "Well done Poland 💯🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:27:00", "owner": "denise.madagascar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525651718026426, "text": "I was in Poland for 4 weeks and I would live there any day", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:21:10", "owner": "adrian_raddock", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845320093546741, "text": "Send then in western countries. First to USA", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:13:11", "owner": "bojankobal991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854628667520958, "text": "🦁", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:37:52", "owner": "timw.0106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862497217465994, "text": "Cancer community crying 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:49:54", "owner": "saurav155", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863258617399243, "text": "Poland is winning.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:16:38", "owner": "steveoh_itch2fish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874744486410587, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:39:44", "owner": "stratosnicolaides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881339776261689, "text": "based, let Japan and Europe do the same", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:27:01", "owner": "marky_rem", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891744460335985, "text": "Kudos Poland 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:49:01", "owner": "andy_anindita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892985290304015, "text": "Respect 😎", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:51:42", "owner": "senol08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921131038139944, "text": "As a muslim, i like that man.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:24:49", "owner": "aizrael_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921381736139028, "text": "No Muslims , no terrorists👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:31:10", "owner": "m.r_mirhosseini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922475725016644, "text": "Look at France, Germany and Italy… it turning into shit!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:43:37", "owner": "alpha_zero_tactical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937029658062597, "text": "Lol he’s lying, they took, 300k illegal just for a Money", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:42:36", "owner": "szymon.kucharczyk.9674", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942058120028115, "text": "He should be the president in germany!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:42:11", "owner": "er1c.ru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964444704955521, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:31:26", "owner": "joeleespamzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967210614956333, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:38:55", "owner": "wonderi