’s no difference between a refugee and an illegal. It’s the same here in Australia we get boatmen and illegals with fake identity. A huge percentage of the people who live here wish our corrupt government deals with them and deport them to their original country. We don’t want your race or your poxy beliefs or your drama from other issues.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:09:18", "owner": "highlymedicated82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077718556964916, "text": "Well done to Poland 👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:43:44", "owner": "martinlynch67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077928529815162, "text": "👏💪🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:29:12", "owner": "_erikk_kkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078682675984280, "text": "W mans", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:45:36", "owner": "chasebratcher08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081105202899729, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:05:41", "owner": "a.d.gobs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084635647715988, "text": "Слава Польщі!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:37:19", "owner": "oleksandr_molchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085070107894439, "text": "Get him for Britain", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:55:32", "owner": "pymramage4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092036818613686, "text": "What were your people doing during the world war?! They left. The question is Where did they go !!!???", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:02:07", "owner": "mohammadamin.hsnzd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095323387711704, "text": "Curly headed libtard dingbat", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:49:11", "owner": "endmout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095992915640694, "text": "👏👏 I stand with Polands decisions, I wouldn't take any Muslims either", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:34:15", "owner": "live4knot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097402501652756, "text": "of course he is proud.. deport all those radicals to their homeland.. let them taste their palestine and afghan they love so much.. let see how they gonna find work with good salary there..", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:52:33"