: "dorimefasalatidoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523318453040127, "text": "Wish the world would wake up and learn from Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:40:32", "owner": "vudzenberger_533", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843282760564172, "text": "this men need to ruel the world he its a legend", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:14:20", "owner": "mellvino_015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848245534529631, "text": "Er verdient Respekt. Gut gemacht Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:05:21", "owner": "kristina00stojanovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859001281483125, "text": "A government should work for the people not for the european commision 😂❤️ absolutely love poland and their policies. Cant cancel someone who doesnt care about cancel culture", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:22:47", "owner": "mprive__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868265572439613, "text": "Poland is going to be the last of the white race fs", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:48:09", "owner": "realmaggottz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875323204303730, "text": "Well done Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:20:46", "owner": "dianetrotterswain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887160349224278, "text": "Poland setting the example. Just hope the rest of Europe follows.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:05:55", "owner": "_p_r_e_s_t_o_r_o_n_i_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892391389317410, "text": "It’s so funny how often the good guy looks like the bad guy in this twisted world! Respect to Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:28:21", "owner": "chriso_mate321", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900598225265519, "text": "As a citizen from a country that allows thousands of illegal immigrants, poland is so smart and I hope my government has this mentality", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:34:28", "owner": "songukiller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906804316236441, "text": "🫡🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:20:21", "owner": "ehab_saad12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915187528053451, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:34:01", "owner": "gai_thao15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1794512496