ish has England and Sweden taken together? 🔥👏🇵🇱🇸🇪 🇬🇧", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:43:23", "owner": "ankarcronas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077719865503606, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:37:25", "owner": "jbt_6174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087467245835772, "text": "Love that he said this is what the people want and it confused the media 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:45:47", "owner": "karlos420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088114444828536, "text": "W Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:35:43", "owner": "the_final_finn_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089925220753571, "text": "Respect to Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:06:42", "owner": "murrayjamesharkness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090487156764423, "text": "A politician who actually cares about the people 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:20:38", "owner": "nickitran_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093337267679491, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:10:45", "owner": "rishvp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094199179736601, "text": "We all proud of Poland ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:51:38", "owner": "diogo.moutinho.barros94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095427262727658, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👏👏👏👏👏good job", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:10:30", "owner": "imeldahwilliams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097894087716293, "text": "he is right", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:54:51", "owner": "bulutoglu.rr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110091298533210, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:11:39", "owner": "duarttedu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111066751542746, "text": "Poland is right", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:23:36", "owner": "mgmgc3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114105925518665, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:46:42", "owner": "kaerle_andreas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120278044492455, "text": "Does india have any leader like him", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:19:54", "owner": "mrin._moy12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123597718488269, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:23:21", "owner": "hoodrich_billy_", "likes": 0}