:36", "owner": "craigheath01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126732850482038, "text": "W poland", "created_at": "2025-09-05T08:35:11", "owner": "thatyellowopc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18159581107340113, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T08:44:06", "owner": "patrycmarques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389688688127486, "text": "Great man", "created_at": "2025-09-05T08:25:55", "owner": "kenpainter1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422804437102651, "text": "Can I go to Poland please, I can’t stand I France with all shit that we have there", "created_at": "2025-09-05T08:26:38", "owner": "lukzer__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518316268043563, "text": "Is true", "created_at": "2025-09-05T08:50:44", "owner": "valerio_zeqollari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525377647033537, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T08:57:25", "owner": "pietro.foresti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856907530503242, "text": "Do you remember austrian painter ? 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:32:35", "owner": "_asif_khan13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858572629496706, "text": "totally agree", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:44:47", "owner": "anatoliy_for_tessi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861175363417157, "text": "Fact 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:02:29", "owner": "sholkypop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862641865405334, "text": "Well said man 🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:34:25", "owner": "c.j20420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882047698378628, "text": "Great Answer 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:46:17", "owner": "iamgeorge_eric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884494879244280, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T06:59:19", "owner": "nvart.mazakian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940438002932130, "text": "And this is the type of pm we need in the UK. Someone who cares about his people.", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:41:30", "owner": "cool_little_witch_shadow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945378739019905, "text": "That's a man who cares about his country, unlike the fucking Muppet we have @keirstarmer", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:30:01", "owner": "jxsh.291", "