the people want, not every country has to please everyone as long as they take care of their own 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:32:20", "owner": "jjjxckson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016195148782351, "text": "🇵🇱 god bless poland", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:14:46", "owner": "dwightbreezy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020563577743004, "text": "It is totally normal for European countries to receive refugees from other European countries, and Muslim refugees have no place in Europe, their place is in Muslim countries, why don't other Muslim countries help them? They are even closer geographically, they have the same education and religion, let them go there! Why should we Europeans receive them and help them?", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:52:35", "owner": "karinadonskaia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030892466705596, "text": "Poland charges Colombian with terrorism over arson attacks on behalf of Russia", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:57:13", "owner": "stickyxfinga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031073162710501, "text": "I shed a tear 🥲 i fkin love the florida of europe", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:49:05", "owner": "yeetus__mcfetus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031543076701833, "text": "Why can’t this guy be the pm of canada", "created_at": "2025-09-04T22:05:01", "owner": "eysuwkevduak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039724244436367, "text": "That’s how it should be in the UK simple", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:48:57", "owner": "rylee_platt1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040800455672244, "text": "Well done", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:12:09", "owner": "damiano_jx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042839399352554, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:27:18", "owner": "iau_urm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049876706279837, "text": "🙌🇵🇱👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:19:46", "owner": "28apil_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052505879216698, "text": "Poland should take control of EU because they have a better country than all of em", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:49:01", "owner": "shanelwillard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055487471427978, "text": "Keep it up", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:36:40", "owner": "terminellodennis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056433584395089, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:48:28", "owner": "mathewsalyssa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061650494587128, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:25:06", "owner": "ar_bel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066536908987656, "text": "Why polish people are over the world?Simple they racist just waite few yrs we see Poland like greece 2012", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:08:51", "owner": "rind_fejza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071720051140420, "text": "❤️🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:43:45", "owner": "lana.519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074161904025640, "text": "There are 53 Muslim countries why do they never go to other Muslim countries they always go to every other country that has different values than their own and don’t assimilate into society", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:09:15", "owner": "seth.sti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077000446821097, "text": "Poland saw what Muslim 'refugees' have done to the rest of Europe and chose the only logical solution. Keep them out. That reporter is part of the problem.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:55:41", "owner": "b_fan1313", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18077788108806103, "text": "I hate her", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:23:55", "owner": "langilleeric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079294021939403, "text": "I'm not Polish but even I am proud of them! 🇵🇱👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:23:23", "owner": "juniorguerrieri", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087905806840711, "text": "someone from this video e muistǎ", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:46:57", "owner": "kozmadness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088338145836410, "text": "Yeah man !", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:00:35", "owner": "jerem_az", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091524598674748, "text": "To have 0 refugees is something to be proud of", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:15:59", "owner": "groove_bcn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18100374856539859, "text": 