believing that he is in the wrong for not accommodating \"REFUGEES\" and therefore labelling him as a racist when he isn't! He is for his country of Poland and he is for the Polish people, he's seen what is happening to the rest of the world and I'm standing by my words when I say that He and President Trump are the only ones who seem to have their brains capable of functioning adequately in regards to volatile situation.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T22:08:12", "owner": "dramaticaussiemallyfloof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327171913228906, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:34:15", "owner": "definitely.not.isaac1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328568074228935, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:33:13", "owner": "mr_zipper2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384896776125576, "text": "🙌👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:09:00", "owner": "johann7109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395983336185594, "text": "👏👏👏🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:35:01", "owner": "shellymiguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534445783017971, "text": "🇵🇱🇵🇱🇵🇱100", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:57:24", "owner": "stoshwieck215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842070304574228, "text": "Way to go Poland!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:16:27", "owner": "sustainable_ohana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842710309571101, "text": "F accepting aulture", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:56:45", "owner": "victoryoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851728438539250, "text": "This guy got his priorities straight, unlike the rest of europe", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:24:49", "owner": "gewoontibo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872659663332718, "text": "Look everyone, a complete badass.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:03:39", "owner": "1957_panhead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878147077395411, "text": "Making Poland great!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:15:29", "owner": "mikealf420", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895006003297671, "text": "Well done 🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:06:03", "owner": "federico.merlo1977", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908308000213891, "te