 "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:20:46", "owner": "tacocat_2742", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119475604501300, "text": "🇵🇱👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:07:50", "owner": "oleeinar.skadberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120352648512460, "text": "This has aged so well", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:34:25", "owner": "l.f00007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122719168485302, "text": "As a mixed race man from England I love the polish they are hard workers and look after there own!!! Also good people!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T18:39:22", "owner": "louieskayak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122848315433584, "text": "Love how he has protected his people, his country and their culture ❤️. Canada is done", "created_at": "2025-09-04T18:15:57", "owner": "traceofbase0405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147587278395591, "text": "He listens to his people!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:30:51", "owner": "mamabaerbubbles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161508061328913, "text": "Hes absolutely right", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:15:16", "owner": "breeda.jackson.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176211424343998, "text": "Hero", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:09:32", "owner": "zoulfikar1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289766803248487, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:28:32", "owner": "the1anloufen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306409228218671, "text": "I agree with him. Bravo 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:32:13", "owner": "kimbentley2021", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18322792999230526, "text": "Immigration without integration creates borders within. How on earth is mixing an oppressive religion with modern day feminism going to ever work", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:31:54", "owner": "jennierosemolloy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18354121819095072, "text": "Hero", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:03:01", "owner": "leevong_pha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368473774194004, "text": "🇵🇱Poland government is smart they want their country to stay as it is !", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:21:30", "owner": "lorettaromano167", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18401553103138128, "text": "Well done Poland, Canada needs to follow this", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:06:59", "owner": "miketherealfontaine23", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18521195866011306, "text": "Magyarországon nincsen egy darab illegális migrans sem 😂 10 éve kerítést épített a magyar miniszterelnök. Ezért napi 1 millió euró büntetést fizettetnek velünk a náci Ursula, meg bandája.....😂", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:41:00", "owner": "robertcanlinch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881290576380136, "text": "Their country their choice", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:31:49", "owner": "pseudonym_hannah_copola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889598950205379, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:46:21", "owner": "jjh_995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889759498203650, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:09:21", "owner": "miguelamador.law", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893003692299623, "text": "Netanyahu is from Poland/ take him back too", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:48:04", "owner": "godiswatching_10fold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896134561294818, "text": "Good one 👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:44:05", "owner": "npmcaptain", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897625423270558, "text": "Listen 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:01:08", "owner": "greenkimberly306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903321748251029, "text": "If anybody could help me out with this question, I would greatly appreciate it.\nAnd this is strictly about religion, if you live in a country where a religion that you practice is the mass majority. Why do you want to come to another country and impose your religion", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:37:38", "owner": "sl3eptok3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906063331234362, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:59:35", "owner": "simon_boryczko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907225015232872, "text": "Europe needs to wake up n take an example from 🇵🇱 🇵🇱", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:45:16", "owner": "kash.bug", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916466950175270, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:28:30", "owner": "raymondmccardleandquba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929062104982745, "text": "Uk need take a leap outta his book", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:57:56", "owner": "stingy_900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932118595082439, "text": "Poland is rassist 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:05:59", "owner": "dj_charmaine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945290599044289, "text": "Other countries please listen to this", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:01:01", "owner": "bindu_paul159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946067041041251, "text": "Not racist,  Muslim is an ideology. It comes in all colors. It is incompatible with Polish culture", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:27:00", "owner": "lainebyrum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949052881001202, "text": "Do they take refugees from the United Kingdom? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:24:25", "owner": "j.whiteley0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964527750952726, "text": "👏👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:50:28", "owner": "connieg216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970764378934594, "text": "A government that listens to its people?  What a concept", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:30:28", "owner": "5975.alan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976040712763527, "text": "Smartest country in Europe", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:58:06", "owner": "minolta_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978663759752856, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:12:30", "owner": "susan.harrison.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979625475884423, "text": "About time some one showed the other countries how you should be", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:59:08", "owner": "jrcartawick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992897532827890, "text": "What a fu*king LEGEND🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:25:03", "owner": "zak_preel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994548081821833, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:04:55", "owner": "porkfatsamurai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018104894583770, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:03:50", "owner": "ivyzero6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039485081436422, "text": "Respect!👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:52:09", "owner": "cristianocesare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039633623431260, "text": "Smartest left leaning reporter", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:22:12", "owner": "ashton_is_typing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046815974320004, "text": "We need to be more like Poland in this regard", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:29:00", "owner": "spooledup_spyder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049900784285696, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:27:05", "owner": "felipe_rios01715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053060192208947, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:38:38", "owner": "burgesskent08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054695435439065, "text": "I’m moving to Poland ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:00:00", "owner": "lolomanaia_tuipulotu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060003932102393, "text": "Safe country!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:02:58", "owner": "pete0tten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070464878132788, "text": "I don’t know who this woman is, but she gets owned every time I’ve seen her", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:53:47", "owner": "brianlawart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073870327867255, "text": "As a Muslim I unfortunately don't blame him", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:48:01", "owner": "shaz73227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078200272985727, "text": "Lady, why you just don’t take them in your house to see how it feels like", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:10:42", "owner": "agapi2893", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081345371505852, "text": "And Poland looks like a f'ng boss country now!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:57:06", "owner": "jkellysheets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082519282924015, "text": "Poland is rassist country do not go there", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:05:47", "owner": "dj_charmaine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086179753874683, "text": "How dare you tell a president of a country that he must take and terrorist refugees!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:29:04", "owner": "fred_is_dead_123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086198212861625, "text": "Beautiful man", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:44:32", "owner": "i.rogg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087729547828363, "text": "England should listen close", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:15:19", "owner": "pgraham52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088686418825459, "text": "Be like Poland!! 🇵🇱🇵🇱 🇦🇺🇦🇺", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:24:06", "owner": "butto8004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088791730834432, "text": "Muslim câncer.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:54:35", "owner": "david_sam_s_775", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098228140627733, "text": "America should listen to", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:50:53", "owner": "connieg216", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101254120609103, "text": "Let me come back I know my family came from Gdansk if I spelled that right", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:52:40", "owner": "mbuckoiv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102705913594822, "text": "How many illegals has she taken in??", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:23:37", "owner": "eeeeeinb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104680075520138, "text": "Good job Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:07:59", "owner": "gruntlife05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104793736562175, "text": "Fuck yeah!!!👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:33:28", "owner": "whipplejosue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116537845504304, "text": "Right on stick to you grounds", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:27:38", "owner": "gymmama59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118590232496510, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:41:54", "owner": "maudy.veltenaar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154911265381117, "text": "W Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:41:06", "owner": "anarchyintheuk2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174900442347566, "text": "👍👍👌👌👊👊👊", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:44:40", "owner": "kash.bug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178258855338472, "text": "LEGEND", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:20:40", "owner": "beefys_abarth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278115667276777, "text": "Listen to this condescending evil bitch", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:58:52", "owner": "ireland9457", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283331614285488, "text": "Refuges are illegal if they don’t enter a country through port of entry and follow  the countries laws", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:26:31", "owner": "super_man_0988", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18326250058224724, "text": "Well done Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:26:42", "owner": "salunkesangram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417369703107753, "text": "Should make more of it around the world", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:23:32", "owner": "gymzz666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521149495012030, "text": "Smart guy", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:06:26", "owner": "raflizulfahmi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530235700027823, "text": "Well done sir,your the stuff that reak leaders look like", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:00:04", "owner": "ireland9457", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842741755566233, "text": "Even more of a Chad than what he thinks he is! 🗿🗿🗿", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:50:52", "owner": "stvprs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849729802512710, "text": "🙌hansup🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T09:45:20", "owner": "shadoray_da_hedgehog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857646082501171, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:49:23", "owner": "justice_and_patriotism_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859437478481827, "text": "I'm moving to Portland", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:48:32", "owner": "larosejoseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869713033348574, "text": "we all need to be like poland", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:14:32", "owner": "ms.fittr3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875535253406158, "text": "Stupid media ! That's a real leader 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:11:02", "owner": "jimbo5933", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892506115185438, "text": "thats right but they did the legal route not like the UK they are fleas comming to be treated like royalty and our stupid weak government do this and allow it i have loads of polish people round me they work very hard and cause no trouble these fleas comming in on boats nothing but trouble and they wont leave our kids alone dirty b@stards", "created_at": "2025-09-04T06:44:34", "owner": "jackie1959albert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912439390194964, "text": "This guy should be the president of every country in Europe, as well as Canada!!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T09:59:43", "owner": "chief_skata_officer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920182666116762, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:40:13", "owner": "vicky_oikonomou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920251978141097, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️😍😍😍😍😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-04T09:01:14", "owner": "roger.cole1967rc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923347993130688, "text": "Poland took in over 2 million Ukrainians. They are refugees! How many more are they expected to take? Muslim \"refugees\" need to go to Muslim countries and stay there.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:59:25", "owner": "bigdaddygroob", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948315592009885, "text": "Amen brother! We could all do with following Poland's lead on this! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:04:11", "owner": "gregzy23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957305937993391, "text": "👏👏🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T07:35:50", "owner": "4paco35g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965016978808662, "text": "The leader every country should have.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T09:39:01", "owner": "jim_ahlberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965654499955684, "text": "How many refugees have you taken into your home lady = none so pipe dwn", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:24:50", "owner": "kyles_1969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969601236949476, "text": "Poland 🇵🇱:\nTHE LAST TIME WE TOOK IN RELIGIOUS REFUGEES WE DIED IN THE MILLIONS", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:25:39", "owner": "goldtremella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972172857934388, "text": "These interviewers are all the same. It’s so obvious that they’re all serving the same master 👿 no matter which country they’re from.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:38:06", "owner": "missuzbigsthree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972881361938932, "text": "Poland is based. Let’s go", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:21:04", "owner": "benderjames844", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995538954677436, "text": "Hero", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:44:16", "owner": "willemhajoboomstra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013389470607073, "text": "Good for Poland 😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-04T07:50:33", "owner": "canyoudoanybetter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018986618757318, "text": "Yes.......brilliant nothing racist about wanting to keep your people safe. Come on, England 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿 🇬🇧 sort yourselves out ffs!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T07:53:12", "owner": "bofont117", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022613078541100, "text": "I'm moving to poland", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:21:03", "owner": "brandanliquorish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045485903651951, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:54:17", "owner": "sofia_kanter_atias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051287405542964, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T09:37:11", "owner": "reechaargyros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052322492565980, "text": "Poland leads the world to freedom of islam", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:34:22", "owner": "kaye.alefelder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052937930552464, "text": "Refugee = illegal invader", "created_at": "2025-09-04T09:47:38", "owner": "kevinshapouri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058777019374899, "text": "you dont fancy comming running theUK please actually begging now 👍👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-04T06:41:14", "owner": "jackie1959albert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060129725091760, "text": "Socially successful psychopaths in politics exploit fear, emotions, and mass media to manipulate people. Mass migration is often framed as a cultural or social threat to provoke panic. These leaders lack empathy and create division to gain power. Neuropsychology shows that during elections, rational brain regions are quiet while emotional centers dominate, making people follow these figures even against their own judgment.\nEvery society has psychopaths, but those in power can cause catastrophe. History shows that when psychopaths reach the levers of power, outcomes are disastrous. The solution is to prioritize rational thinking over emotions and reject inhumane political ideologies.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:33:37", "owner": "gnosis_sofia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060203966090386, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:40:09", "owner": "bogdan.imu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060266231456904, "text": "Sounds reasonable", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:43:07", "owner": "brinklowe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061492118600337, "text": "💯 proud why should there country deal with another country’s crap they don’t give two shits about us but always got there hands out time to wake up the world as a whole", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:22:45", "owner": "kyles_1969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066746603269965, "text": "She should work for CNN.. Where reporters go to die...........", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:01:57", "owner": "fromdirt2soil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067154591189387, "text": "Good for Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:49:45", "owner": "whereisgarry2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068772400955907, "text": "Fuck muslims", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:43:27", "owner": "niko_stepo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073648388038454, "text": "Yes, he's very proud.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:19:42", "owner": "kalbud_budsted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074698276860992, "text": "Hell yeah!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:18:32", "owner": "bigchuckd75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084142165715054, "text": "Why can't we do the same!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T07:09:34", "owner": "mitchellsmith797", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086712994871097, "text": "A goverment that listened to its people...thats a first.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T06:23:43", "owner": "stuart.payne.798", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087244258828524, "text": "Well, for starters, Muslim/Islam is not a race, so there’s that.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:47:50", "owner": "brad1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087767662658624, "text": "Muslim is not a RACE! It's a phucking ideology that pretends to be a religion.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:52:00", "owner": "bigdaddygroob", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090458