land, from NZ 🇳🇿", "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:17:44", "owner": "mjegram89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376431010177473, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:32:34", "owner": "croccosina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406938532116045, "text": "Stick that up your jumper host", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:27:38", "owner": "alfagtv62.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521204641023165, "text": "My first trip to Warsaw I was amazed at how clean and safe it was.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:04:34", "owner": "keliverstravels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524861338002716, "text": "Well said that man 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T06:14:55", "owner": "shabba_nelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850443577504772, "text": "please come to Canada ffs we need this guy", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:25:00", "owner": "ethanlabarre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859197217481634, "text": "Who is the useful idiot asking the questions?", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:31:04", "owner": "gjbees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866418430378322, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:13:06", "owner": "anna.laura.76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884347660240089, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T00:10:26", "owner": "thatguy6101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887921455346250, "text": "#EradicateEvilIslam", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:56:10", "owner": "reginaldregeti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891633826326751, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:23:39", "owner": "easymoneyyy96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891960931328533, "text": "Poland also helped the nazis round up jews. There's a lot of racism and intolerance there.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:29:03", "owner": "marcus_j_ranum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895335751161302, "text": "Leader", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:44:08", "owner": "jbisayes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897023533277597, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T00:13:11", "owner": "rosagomez9155", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898011037269968, "text": "This guy has it right!", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:43:22", "owner": "joannewerneke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906541891229902, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:53:46", "owner": "beekiter2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921688564078235, "text": "Bravo. ......A ty babo jak sie chcesz dupczyc z czarnymi  do won't do Afryki now ok 👌", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:05:15", "owner": "francko553", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960473397830456, "text": "That's awesome", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:38:23", "owner": "leroyvincentheft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964410960813712, "text": "This is how you love and protect your country 👏 Muslim refugees destroyed European culture,  security, safe and everything that Europe was before this allowed first by Merkel, then by Ursula", "created_at": "2025-09-04T02:54:19", "owner": "teastarinar", "likes": 142}, {"id": 17991266189692207, "text": "That man is a good leader💯", "created_at": "2025-09-04T00:51:31", "owner": "redd.freakin.roca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992837163831120, "text": "She acts so aghast like it's the worst thing in the world that Poland restricts immigration. That shows the extent of left-wing mind-poisoning.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T02:05:28", "owner": "jp_metzger1968", "likes": 282}, {"id": 18004694201798796, "text": "She is hypocrite！　He is real hero !!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T02:38:57", "owner": "yk531rumhime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018142622584770, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:00:22", "owner": "charitysettineri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021294614558548, "text": "Top politician.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:04:06", "owner": "cladi4c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032903807495485, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:30:57", "owner": "jasonbbelcher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037678574468640, "text": "He has a point on Poland. Now look at France, Germany and Britain. They have problems with jihadists.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:44:47", "owner": "boydston.alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039377354432756, "text": "Hero", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:58:05", "owner": "blagdensteve", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046493639330389, "text": "G 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:50:40", "owner": "protectiondogsglobal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051382664255191, "text": "Too bad it's too late for England, Italy, Germany and Australia America etc...", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:11:24", "owner": "h2olova4sure", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064202045362960, "text": "Well done, Poland. You are showing us how it’s done and we are learning 👏🏻 \n\nUK hates this vile woman.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:16:29", "owner": "teejaaypercival", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070168906917938, "text": "Real leadership", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:47:47", "owner": "anthonykelly1568", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070339553124139, "text": "None And don’t want to Clear?????", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:06:54", "owner": "romeothedoge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072710807107098, "text": "And to think they used to make pollock jokes ! That is a government that has their shit together. We need to allow not ONE MORE in the USA.  They are anything BUT PEACEFUL.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:46:36", "owner": "ronlauercowboy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073604588085557, "text": "When you have a pair and get elected to serve those who voted for you, not the cxnts who try to buy you.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:24:15", "owner": "tallpaulyxe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075526565063631, "text": "This woman supports a anyichrist terrorist organization that would kill her also because they want to rule the world", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:36:35", "owner": "kennethsurprise2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075720884292622, "text": "100%", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:34:42", "owner": "carolynspencerfitandhappy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076832441292962, "text": "Fcking Pom go home have a look at what has happened to the UK u dumb fcking bitch", "created_at": "2025-09-04T02:30:23", "owner": "mel64322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077120435297529, "text": "God bless Poland 🇵🇱 the smartest country on earth 🌍", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:01:49", "owner": "jimmycoleman455", "likes": 22486}, {"id": 18077150257971815, "text": "Awesome! 💪🏼", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:26:38", "owner": "vinnysguerra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077714956955994, "text": "God Bless Poland.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:04:48", "owner": "aggromonk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077852551955097, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:26:06", "owner": "maryottjohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078802286482659, "text": "This man Deserves Noble prize 🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:07:20", "owner": "ajayepunyabhumi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078996496784874, "text": "👏👏👏👏🙏🙏🙏un Président qui défend son pays 💪💪💪", "created_at": "2025-09-04T02:34:58", "owner": "candiard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086117896850373, "text": "Exactly what the rest of the world should have done", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:31:26", "owner": "mcooper0808", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090221503795756, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:11:04", "owner": "jeffbuchholz568", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096478321562028, "text": "Beautiful", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:44:34", "owner": "barry_1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107817166493824, "text": "i have lost respect for this woman.  zero respect for her she is just another demon", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:38:03", "owner": "reneehurley16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109635478546901, "text": "Don’t. Poland is wise.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:31:15", "owner": "dkelly0111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116234008506367, "text": "🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:37:54", "owner": "sjogrensandra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133942036446130, "text": "Talking about poles - recently some fans of Jagelonia went to the city of Tirana, Albania for the upcoming UEFA qualifiers match and behaved like absolute animals. They openly disrespected Albania's national symbols and figures and were seen shouting death chants. It was a disgrace - crowds full of drunken men and women acting like vandals with complete disregard any authority or citizen We'd expect that folks from a country who has suffered so much to be more humble and civilized, instead it was a bunch of gangbangers lining up to f the 💩 out of their beloved Natalia Starr", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:45:18", "owner": "ted.dy2793", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18135643528442720, "text": "Overthrow @ukgovofficial", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:33:39", "owner": "gustavoelpatron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136751644430984, "text": "That man is a good leader💯", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:05:36", "owner": "redd.freakin.roca", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18188422831322023, "text": "Congratulacion!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:44:07", "owner": "ramonbermudezmc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280782838275672, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:21:33", "owner": "dotcha308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288946609252370, "text": "Hell yeah", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:36:35", "owner": "luminouslinus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309906910168012, "text": "I would be ecstatic if Trump did that!", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:45:43", "owner": "papaw2003", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18323969449236579, "text": "Listen up rest of the world", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:31:35", "owner": "mdc19669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337631353160476, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:16:15", "owner": "marcobalouchi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18381706804130625, "text": "I lived there.  It's absolutely fantastic there.", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:52:20", "owner": "steven_undzilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425173075096819, "text": "Love this guy", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:22:21", "owner": "thegreengoalie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526494748023349, "text": "👏👏👏 Poland is goals", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:20:51", "owner": "miami.ivo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531934348036609, "text": "Aren’t you sick of the overplay of the word racist. He stands for his culture and his country and his people ! What’s wrong with that. It’s his and his countries prerogative . Goodness gracious", "created_at": "2025-09-04T03:09:14", "owner": "marthabooe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842476417571572, "text": "Absolutely right!  Way to go Poland!", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:20:35", "owner": "sharonfranklin1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849683419512606, "text": "I WHICH USA WOULD DEPORT ALL MUSLIMS.... THEY ARE SATANIC AND MURDERERS", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:42:30", "owner": "elsie1970_54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862455112405246, "text": "Very proud!!!!!❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:34:36", "owner": "beata.f2908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864221008452607, "text": "This guy gets it", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:55:38", "owner": "justinlforsythe12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877855840287212, "text": "Excellent 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:08:11", "owner": "rchichic", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17889507507340281, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T17:58:28", "owner": "katteia59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903956107251343, "text": "Top Mann, echter Politiker ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:37:31", "owner": "iolandaklemm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939545781938312, "text": "Outstanding", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:15:36", "owner": "beauchamp1305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943716370021640, "text": "We need this strength and conviction", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:01:37", "owner": "scot_nylonfan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964018542812702, "text": "Best guy in Europe and we have ah starmer", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:15:52", "owner": "flyn.n1800", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17971699226929280, "text": "Poland is awesome", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:50:13", "owner": "starstonesilvermoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971878458927802, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:54:05", "owner": "stayblind", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975026664767021, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:26:46", "owner": "luisagalveze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979545579745438, "text": "Poland should take all those zionist fuckers then we'll see how long those