"I guess Poland learned from taking in jews.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:40:19", "owner": "johngaines582", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061969115068584, "text": "I respect this man.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:05:11", "owner": "atari_plays_", "likes": 12731}, {"id": 18062959319203523, "text": "So that’s good.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:55:10", "owner": "cabasha42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066397670518072, "text": "Hopefully canada adopts this idea soon. Our country is a sell out, probably too late for us anyway.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:54:00", "owner": "collingardiner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071631206323284, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T17:58:50", "owner": "it220dream2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074106893037738, "text": "My man said zero fucks given👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:25:25", "owner": "pwenzel31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074210066326601, "text": "This is what your country looks like with a man in charge. 🥳🥳🥳🥳", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:09:32", "owner": "cordeira6070", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074352848095859, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:47:29", "owner": "dam.marlene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076643356817215, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:59:31", "owner": "vincebado", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077277368300782, "text": "Great job Poland!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:15:15", "owner": "lghinkle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078265963973741, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:54:23", "owner": "marcobalouchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078278690475849, "text": "🙌👏👏👏❤️👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:04:50", "owner": "genene.mc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078369023055478, "text": "Islam isn't a race...so what is she on about?", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:18:07", "owner": "superman2935", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082652428928675, "text": "It’s easy just copy-paste the man everywhere! 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:20:49", "owner": "ivchoom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083361226917850, "text": "Get him over to England, please 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T17:58:41", "owner": "homemead_construction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085677463874424, "text": "Dead right", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:04:14", "owner": "susanjudge10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086439241851565, "text": "Yes, keep this up. That’s what America needs to do. Take your stand. You’re doing great for your country.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:34:16", "owner": "renthouses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086699920845798, "text": "Nailed it!", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:32:13", "owner": "rodanaforian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088205869828170, "text": "Well done.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:58:37", "owner": "shedahab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089298145633192, "text": "Well done", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:19:55", "owner": "heatherjcurtis2000hcurtis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091381534685083, "text": "Smart!!!!! Too bad most are 🧠 dead 😵", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:20:13", "owner": "lust4luxurytours", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091581403690148, "text": "👏👏❤️👏❤️👏❤️👏❤️👏👏👏❤️👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:11:19", "owner": "mark.raborn.5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093620641671262, "text": "I wish whole Europe would act like Poland", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:42:51", "owner": "sokarma30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096027937656028, "text": "That “racist” title evasion will bring our world to crumbles. Kudos to the man", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:22:48", "owner": "santiagobaravalle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102294997593137, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:48:56", "owner": "marcobalouchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103342039606234, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:40:19", "owner": "jokelly895", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112452196535224, "text": "Imagine having a leader like this…", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:34:48", "owner": "leon_sampson_1984", "likes": 6}, {"id": 1813361457144