{"media_id": 3737348767726127878, "shortcode": "DPduucmD0sG", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPduucmD0sG/", "taken_at": "2025-10-06T10:34:58", "caption": "真的是太神奇的一次體驗了…\n-\nUC Training 推出專為戀愛新手、社交 I 人設計的實體講座，累積超過 5,000 名學員參與\n上過完整課程的學員更有 90% 一年內順利脫單！\n❤️限時Ｘ限量Ｘ實體講座！手刀卡位！\n\n#UCTraining #戀愛心法講座", "owner_username": "see_u_hong", "owner_id": "1552705911", "likes": 13632, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0051_DPduucmD0sG\\DPduucmD0sG_20251006_103458.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18159506704376048, "text": "了解更多：https://gdn.tw/see_u_hong/UCTraining", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:39:34", "owner": "seeuinhellyeah", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18060258449569584, "text": "妳直接當他女友不就好了？", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:55:06", "owner": "drgn.slyr", "likes": 94}, {"id": 18088693333856444, "text": "我看起來真的是認真的好學生，這一年我會努力的🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:49:58", "owner": "fuji_0926", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18538127644008411, "text": "這是傅肌的退役人生嗎？", "created_at": "2025-10-26T05:01:46", "owner": "n5a8wppr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18533473591024097, "text": "喬瑟夫節目有看到🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:16:56", "owner": "b0121095", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18127055371427930, "text": "思語是雙？", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:13:13", "owner": "ianchan_0986", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17975518934779368, "text": "所以那位Gay朋友（本人並沒有承認）的IG在哪裡？🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:40:14", "owner": "bear__prince", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18040850900466493, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:32:32", "owner": "uctraining.tw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18151093555408690, "text": "所以教主可以當我女朋友嗎？\n（第一句話就把天聊死代表🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:08:12", "owner": "ar_ching_0109", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094677142776160, "text": "各位哥布林們，族長跟各位報告，各位不要被女妖精的幻術給騙了，跟我回洞穴吧，今晚吃鴛鴦鍋，族長今天還給你們準備了A5和牛和哈根達斯", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:18:14", "owner": "7xphau", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18067028651589178, "text": "正妹就在旁邊  上完課旁邊學員沒有馬上搭訕嗎😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:45:22", "owner": "rayn05211986", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18342074143200947, "text": "喬：你有沒有想過你為什麼單身 因為大家都以為你是阿嘟啊", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:41:54", "owner": "lazy.rick", "likes": 36}, {"id": 17877990939308140, "text": "最後怎麼突然切換語言？？😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-07T12:39:09", "owner": "dannymeyer0115", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111588691551355, "text": "他之前是不是有上過藍狐獴😂很前期的影片", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:08:26", "owner": "aaronhsu629", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17894456280339086, "text": "思語是現場唯一交過女朋友的人，這句話感覺怪怪的，但是最後問老師的問題才是經典的瘋狂啊🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:47:10", "owner": "linglovelong", "likes": 279}, {"id": 17855000304492306, "text": "太神奇了 想了解更多這個講座的內容", "created_at": "2025-10-12T02:32:52", "owner": "emil03.27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081263108066263, "text": "第一長的帥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:35:52", "owner": "guan_hong1021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043415270693388, "text": "這麼有說服力嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:54:59", "owner": "red1973ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105380293608154, "text": "@raylee_0329 幫你報名", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:13:08", "owner": "weilin._.1216", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084905104903986, "text": "我先卡一個", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:07:35", "owner": "wesck91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970464279951958, "text": "🤔 難道妳不知道女生經期來，若和男生親密關係的安全措施做的很好很衛生，可以舒緩經期的疼痛痙攣問題？", "created_at": "2025-10-09T02:34:10", "owner": "mangoicesand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531159010034622, "text": "@blacktony0903 機會🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:37:48", "owner": "zhou_4136", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091506883798554, "text": "身體還好嗎 感覺有點過瘦", "created_at": "2025-10-07T15:27:40", "owner": "gurry0927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18487686094075312, "text": "還有就是。。。經期是問題嗎？🌚", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:24:41", "owner": "rykius_photoworks", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18295849978253595, "text": "交了女朋友便唱不了林俊傑, 不划算誒兄弟。快樂練成淚水才是勇敢，別被騙了！", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:40:12", "owner": "rykius_photoworks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077182082216999, "text": "我需要", "created_at": "2025-12-20T08:44:36", "owner": "jamesgjt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18336386401228787, "text": "人帥真好😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:37:27", "owner": "chen._.xinda2002", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004433177804630, "text": "都已經沒錢沒外表沒高興沒穿著沒談吐了，上課有啥用？", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:07:34", "owner": "william.chang.48", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059185946396815, "text": "思語太瘦了，跟以前麻姑師太時期比😢", "created_at": "2025-10-07T14:12:45", "owner": "syh6c1500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098051746727207, "text": "@zhangjiafu47", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:46:13", "owner": "lo_oo._.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085384001053256, "text": "所以…經期來了怎麼辦 老師到底有沒有說！！！？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:46:54", "owner": "mountein12345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076745495034825, "text": "經期來了就變經期是超人", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:14:50", "owner": "yunmiao7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858378574530750, "text": "確定他是想交女朋友⋯？", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:06:02", "owner": "akimoto_abc", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045355481666747, "text": "交不到女朋友，可以試試交男朋友啊😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:15:30", "owner": "e1992811", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905748979123196, "text": "UG Hank是蠻有一套方法，真的對於那些EQ不太會應對異性的倒是可以去上看看，也非紅藥丸、PUA課程。某層面偏向心理學。\n一次學費是終生適用、還會配合紳藍改造外表，曾去聽過試聽課。但我與我需要的需求並不相符。", "created_at": "2025-10-13T00:02:47", "owner": "ravin_331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054431468267117, "text": "這男的看來好眼熟🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:36:30", "owner": "chichungyu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17990911079850187, "text": "第二🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:37:10", "owner": "dw19663125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048243206338409, "text": "我是貓咪 喵", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:55:44", "owner": "wade__________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863768380418861, "text": "思語就是真性情👍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:11:59", "owner": "berganhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092787790799940, "text": "所以有聽到完=老師沒太帥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:40:17", "owner": "hiimzech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121688737504161, "text": "一言不合開撩老師*2", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:28:44", "owner": "sheep125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062275199120191, "text": "經期來了是三小😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:41:11", "owner": "marigold_0318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080860958509449, "text": "場面逐漸失控😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:31:20", "owner": "leo168leo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030217439713346, "text": "我也想知道經期來了要怎麼辦😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:15:13", "owner": "louis.wepier.ssr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862610185483404, "text": "找女朋友很難嗎😮", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:10:06", "owner": "79_23_12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083451094784762, "text": "笑死 我都在等後面的爆點？！！？？😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:25:52", "owner": "onitsuka1016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905346382255792, "text": "謝謝 我不想花錢當那10%", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:51:26", "owner": "_gn.24__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067296134257350, "text": "我有在喬瑟夫的頻道看過教主的朋友！！", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:38:00", "owner": "zombie001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876846478414437, "text": "思語 \n不要嚇到現場上課的學員🫣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:21:05", "owner": "georgechang13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076868840030604, "text": "老師太帥餒😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:38:23", "owner": "yurikoystk1005", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17906979741239146, "text": "喜歡你的問題🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:04:29", "owner": "edward780309", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093941797704697, "text": "我覺得我也要去上課", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:50:45", "owner": "eddielee_1121", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128555959472593, "text": "@fuji_0926  我一直以為你說母單是人設！", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:57:31", "owner": "good_boy_eno", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902984878272328, "text": "教主今天也很好看❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:03:27", "owner": "lydia__smiling", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18411293971115282, "text": "笑鼠給我講一半……沒事我已經有思語😍可以一起發瘋了", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:51:52", "owner": "reset_wini_05.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881145517288798, "text": "沒有找我上課😢", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:40:09", "owner": "jodeader", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18006915779802591, "text": "見到🔴就要沖😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:39:01", "owner": "ack0110", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077643731027575, "text": "🙌🙌🙌第一", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:36:26", "owner": "gary.1119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062772149106475, "text": "也想上課", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:21:16", "owner": "kushengkai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370600258153758, "text": "是uc", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:35:23", "owner": "reeves.charles1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115022782550691, "text": "有送女朋友嗎？", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:14:41", "owner": "aa.5506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936742246093483, "text": "上課有教怎麼追到女神嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:46:22", "owner": "roger_2244886", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029573138764965, "text": "我猜你朋友是交男朋友", "created_at": "2025-12-18T04:33:54", "owner": "tien_8820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080831575918752, "text": "感謝有妳\n我還可以參加嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:31:17", "owner": "qiuxingqi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321983047170799, "text": "@j6830.1", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:23:58", "owner": "g09558", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094923628895229, "text": "超沒意義的課\n瞭解更多 不用錢 我教你 \n私訊來 重點是自身有想做改變再來", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:12:25", "owner": "gtleft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060979715153024, "text": "他可以考慮一下男朋友的部分？", "created_at": "2025-10-20T09:54:00", "owner": "m15terf0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077955013890569, "text": "以前的人交朋友靠的是真誠跟緣份，現代人交朋友要搞技術搞花言巧語，那我還不如單身沒朋友比較自在", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:15:07", "owner": "gnp445", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945452013997443, "text": "我不信我朋友能脫單\n除非老闆配一個給他", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:40:33", "owner": "dunhillgg2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181524199339292, "text": "再湊3個就能組成經期4超人，還能當個經期隊長。", "created_at": "2025-10-11T07:06:50", "owner": "mingchi_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134769550409989, "text": "這是喬瑟夫gay達的那位嗎？", "created_at": "2025-10-10T03:12:07", "owner": "monk_11_20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885369496382683, "text": "居然有這種訓練，太晚發現了😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T05:48:03", "owner": "tony_li_hsuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968404329809789, "text": "@adelepeng", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:11:57", "owner": "m06handsome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856181740478979, "text": "是熊欸", "created_at": "2025-10-07T02:52:35", "owner": "yuuuuu7.13_2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18292908724271444, "text": "他的騷樣確定他要交女朋友嗎？", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:54:00", "owner": "john0936", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843177106583943, "text": "這是gay達嘛", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:21:32", "owner": "blulee_ad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998686968675040, "text": "思語夠瘋我完全可以但是她家有隻腿部肌肉發達的瘋狗我會怕🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:37:05", "owner": "knight33366", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18005056418646270, "text": "這不是喬瑟夫gay雷達企劃之前那個假gay嗎XDD", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:07:22", "owner": "sos3637665", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18376381294150323, "text": "熊男🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:49:08", "owner": "gs83831", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046837301361453, "text": "教主好瘋...更愛了😍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:43:46", "owner": "boonyasak_668", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["uctraining", "戀愛心法講座"]},
{"media_id": 3725718198579635146, "shortcode": "DO0aPY_jCPK", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DO0aPY_jCPK/", "taken_at": "2025-09-20T09:25:00", "caption": "POV: you’re single at university\n\n#vlog #uni #unilife #september #university #dayinthelife #student #backtoschool #firstyear #unistudent #universitystudent #universitylife #freshers #single #college #dating #fyp #uniaccommodation #collegelifestyle #universityaccommodation #universitylife #vlog #universityliving #movingout #september", "owner_username": "mel.goes.dancing", "owner_id": "41352688409", "likes": 53441, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0052_DO0aPY_jCPK\\DO0aPY_jCPK_20250920_092500.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086455657895387, "text": "You know what is hot, your campus, it is gorgeous, I love the red brick.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T00:06:00", "owner": "smashley_712", "likes": 466}, {"id": 17970080732793837, "text": "Honey.... You are at the wrong university then", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:44:11", "owner": "mercykyakse", "likes": 1750}, {"id": 18082111826498544, "text": "As a guy it's pretty bad for both sides, in my experience most guys come single and most girls already have a boyfriend which takes away that advantage of having more women than men in university", "created_at": "2025-09-23T12:27:29", "owner": "tiagoin25", "likes": 319}, {"id": 18294804721255438, "text": "As a dude the experience is the opposite. I just keep cursing myself for not worked on myself enough.", "created_at": "2025-09-23T08:12:07", "owner": "_r3be1_", "likes": 1447}, {"id": 18101196154529798, "text": "You need to go on the \"hot singles in your area\" websites", "created_at": "2025-09-23T11:33:18", "owner": "haddy_teh_hitman", "likes": 798}, {"id": 17952917940001608, "text": "What’s the point? It’s not like you’re going to ask them out!", "created_at": "2025-09-23T16:09:05", "owner": "polar._.bearrr", "likes": 197}, {"id": 18350616784206774, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:38:13", "owner": "life0fmaya007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917009695189685, "text": "90% of ppl at my uni are single (at least first years) but everyone is afraid to make a move", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:02:47", "owner": "klax_bel", "likes": 1625}, {"id": 18099304462662711, "text": "Uni of greenwich avery hill ??", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:24:17", "owner": "sami_khamis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17880370893283120, "text": "No my problem is there are loads of hot people and I'm still single 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:14:17", "owner": "mandrakeselixir", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18059683784233955, "text": "I'm 19 and have a full time Job. Kind of feeling like I'm missing out on the \"University experience\" but idk", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:44:05", "owner": "alexthewoo_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103565611646508, "text": "Keele?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:59:39", "owner": "tom_deeley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18319779373246274, "text": "I can't be at every uni at once 🙄", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:26:15", "owner": "5002_rednaxela", "likes": 70}, {"id": 18059537000220065, "text": "@mel.goes.dancing that looks just like their student accommodation", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:50:34", "owner": "sami_khamis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924508285012085, "text": "They’re here they just don’t want me lol", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:26:27", "owner": "smythsh01", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18098418433622398, "text": "if this is southampton, i was in that accom! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:02:22", "owner": "maddieh1004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065047436358484, "text": "You need to go outside lmao", "created_at": "2025-09-23T12:18:29", "owner": "thomaserwinwastaken", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18094800235766616, "text": "We're engineers, I don't think the people here even know what a 'relationship' is", "created_at": "2025-10-17T09:35:34", "owner": "fennec_teal", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18104679106658714, "text": "That Derby uni. I might even know the halls you're in.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T10:57:15", "owner": "harjkun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990162081894124, "text": "Is this Southampton?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:37:21", "owner": "melvin.kachere", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118338562481422, "text": "All the hot people are dating other hot people babe x", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:46:30", "owner": "millieethomas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995523447841623, "text": "You and me both", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:03:17", "owner": "bleumino1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074279147124710, "text": "Am js scared of talking to ppl idk", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:09:52", "owner": "rin.16_67", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075491548981810, "text": "People go to Uni & get in debt for this? 😭😭\n\nJust go ask your crush out dude", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:19:39", "owner": "hqsan_tem1z", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975294912791149, "text": "Do you go Uclan?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:11:25", "owner": "sarahkarim931", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877463704445563, "text": "@_ayushishah05_ isn't this our campus....", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:39:52", "owner": "ashaar.iq06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860613760540039, "text": "😮😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:21:09", "owner": "its_yuvi_7172", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090473290926496, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:41:23", "owner": "ukassignmentwritingservice", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083219099097523, "text": "big beggy of you", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:52:01", "owner": "jlivesrentfree", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849411373568356, "text": "Pac being famous.... wild", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:34:37", "owner": "minnsy74", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17894644485214032, "text": "Ahah i feel you", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:01:43", "owner": "ikkeeeurss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929398735149765, "text": "All the hot people must be somewhere cool...", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:20:59", "owner": "_breckmckye_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044841617365013, "text": "@imshreya_124 @sakshimaheshwari142", "created_at": "2025-09-23T06:52:25", "owner": "seerpearchaotic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18054276854335097, "text": "you’re with your looksmatch’s", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:51:23", "owner": "shortccp1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017210624795096, "text": "@bolderwood_baddies @livingstone_legends @76zoolane @toomanycooksinkitchener \n\nMany single men across these houses", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:54:48", "owner": "_party_intheusa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17878326990328785, "text": "@ea03123  why does this look like ours", "created_at": "2025-11-12T16:17:28", "owner": "x.rubyc.xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18162874501380190, "text": "You 👏 go 👏 to 👏 Uni 👏 to 👏 study 👏 and 👏 not 👏 date👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:18:09", "owner": "anonuser1223", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18117288322522438, "text": "We have no boys 😭 180 people attending my year and maybe like 5, but only 1 comes to classes 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:10:40", "owner": "konstantina17_", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18085110601740369, "text": "I ask this question everyday", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:01:25", "owner": "mikun.vii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18405541252188075, "text": "Oh no at my uni everyone is hot but no one wants me 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-27T17:20:18", "owner": "penelopececcato", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18393824986193660, "text": "Where’s the grass?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:46:37", "owner": "gigi.garcia00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091890508895706, "text": "Go to a better uni iq correlates with beauty", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:23:40", "owner": "metaz.69", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842233048609191, "text": "@_.sowmya22._ uuuu😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T22:42:44", "owner": "abhidhazen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852731380525258, "text": "Come on tour, we will change that 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-27T09:32:01", "owner": "uniwavesgetaways", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915993409195441, "text": "You're so hot, I'm getting Wi-Fi signal strength on my phone", "created_at": "2025-10-21T11:00:47", "owner": "faisal_junaidi_1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139156873446923, "text": "Unfortunately in my school all girls there look identical lol", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:21:19", "owner": "0_anya_morales_0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866522008395198, "text": "All of us are single here 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:49:56", "owner": "k.s_2080", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17898851799324436, "text": "@seerpearchaotic @shrutikaushik5618 i swear no  one", "created_at": "2025-10-24T12:12:59", "owner": "mainlyshreya.06", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080944286026552, "text": "I’m 40 and everyone is half my age!", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:51:27", "owner": "amanda.van.lynn_author", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095458513744342, "text": "They exist but they are just not the right people (behaviour)", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:39:47", "owner": "pati__mi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881033290284944, "text": "Remember, if there are no attractive singles at your university that means you're the attractive single🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:43:00", "owner": "blejdea._.alex", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18010955672623858, "text": "cant relate button >>>>>>", "created_at": "2025-09-23T23:42:17", "owner": "casparhul6", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17925014982118894, "text": "Harper ?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:30:20", "owner": "maxnazaruk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931302595101802, "text": "Accurate", "created_at": "2025-10-15T19:41:27", "owner": "manon.cccc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890722117221217, "text": "Maybe stop being a Hikkikomori for once 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:00:59", "owner": "xtakki27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17871610959443257, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:12:36", "owner": "kaitlyns_log", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023434112554770, "text": "Real tho!!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:02:04", "owner": "stephaniew1418", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18066921149363873, "text": "I was single in high school and i'm still single at university. I see no difference", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:52:50", "owner": "vicky_wisegirl._", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985115139905126, "text": "It's not only about looks right?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T07:04:47", "owner": "berrubaltali", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080468705002777, "text": "EXACTLY, like what the heck?!", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:55:32", "owner": "lili_mcanally", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071866129966835, "text": "Hey", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:22:24", "owner": "oliverhewittgeorge18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18203039242315586, "text": "@helio10l_88", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:54:41", "owner": "pangchicken", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18373725949146038, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:36:40", "owner": "wang34349", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842323297597072, "text": "Is this Loughborough or do so many student accoms look the same lol?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:48:57", "owner": "newagenewpage", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059291150409972, "text": "Its the opposite for me 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T15:28:38", "owner": "totallynotdougdimmadome47", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18050997236302613, "text": "That's a real issue fr", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:46:24", "owner": "eren.zkn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17968203557957375, "text": "just study, you will forget about that", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:29:24", "owner": "slimacekspekon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051779135289392, "text": "There a lot, but majority of ain’t worth catchin’", "created_at": "2025-09-29T03:06:05", "owner": "trzchry", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18088710433859460, "text": "Less dating, more studying", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:54:45", "owner": "tcw.ang", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079050734059629, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T01:01:47", "owner": "nurgrace_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078110687026013, "text": "jus go outside brah", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:26:50", "owner": "babymiele__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947957002020223, "text": "Knock knock 🚪 it’s me, your hot neighbor😆", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:40:15", "owner": "karo_vasko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087628240862083, "text": "Me on tinder", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:45:39", "owner": "isidorapoblete", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025169606739763, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:49:11", "owner": "_teeeeeeeeaa_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068769857338282, "text": "Wait why does that look like Southampton 🤣 Basic uni accommodation lol", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:18:28", "owner": "ais._.505", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17974963280924246, "text": "I fell attacked lol", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:44:05", "owner": "lucas_b2024", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18010419161797576, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:18:03", "owner": "kangproducergotinspiredagain25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957512941005220, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-27T04:58:50", "owner": "faith.becenti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854349280540115, "text": "Taken", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:39:34", "owner": "sopras_wi23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083887924917790, "text": "Be so fr 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:03:03", "owner": "ethanlarsen3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056697869181595, "text": "don't ever date someone from college specially if it's an engineering uni", "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:11:59", "owner": "charliegolfvictor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079356472950128, "text": "@betina_mfer", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:46:49", "owner": "kait_clark07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18398438992142869, "text": "@domin1ka_k18 🫠", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:13:14", "owner": "emka.kukielka", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078642665065312, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:12:59", "owner": "emka.kukielka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891927919344331, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T04:11:23", "owner": "i_s_promise", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108632782560181, "text": "Is this brunel ?", "created_at": "2025-09-22T18:05:01", "owner": "toota_shit_postin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091179497501053, "text": "skill issue", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:04:08", "owner": "become_.___monke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102088624683944, "text": "You can't expect a goldfish to climb a tree 😎, how could anyone be as hot as me", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:54:26", "owner": "just1n._._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083617457009055, "text": "is that Princess alice?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:37", "owner": "mattc.film2738", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105103483631890, "text": "My fyp is getting scarily local...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:34:59", "owner": "james_wiley.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420351691116449, "text": "Seeing my own uni accom is insane 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:54:35", "owner": "momolu2cozy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121530112515294, "text": "Hi, this is registered global writing agency known as Inkwell Insights. We help students in their assignments, essays, reports, dissertation, thesis, papers, coursework, exams&quizzes and all other. Get A+ WhatsApp: +923078281239", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:56:04", "owner": "onlineassignmentwriter019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058611425197556, "text": "Never thought there are hot dorks also", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:23:26", "owner": "pouria_ahsr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128861413488676, "text": "They everywhere wtf you mean", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:37:55", "owner": "joe9forever", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950438077020723, "text": "Me at heronbank", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:50:37", "owner": "anokhtiwana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943817668063232, "text": "I was in England for a while. I think my classmates including young people in my same age were both very very horny. Hot people, if you wanna meet some, you better go to have some social sport games. You will know them.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T23:37:16", "owner": "heyyouknowwhatis_amazing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056591570562394, "text": "I feel your pain... I experience the same sh*t. I've been alone for 6 years, I thought uni will change that. But guess what... it didn't. 😅😆😕", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:02:25", "owner": "kisslevente98", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075048164175836, "text": "Literally yesterday at boardgames club, I beat his ass in exploding kittens and when I poked fun at him he squared up to me, and he's really fucking tall so I was just looking up at him. Beforehand I had no interest, he's not even that hot, now I can't stop thinking about him", "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:20:08", "owner": "beanziebabyxx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076745567118503, "text": "Maybe I'm fucked beyond repair ✍️🏾 📝", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:17:44", "owner": "10rd_had3s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081474980494209, "text": "Which uni is this 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:35:54", "owner": "sukilev01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973304361945960, "text": "She may have chose the wrong university, it can't get any worse can it?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T23:44:36", "owner": "joshua.casbolt34", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074906957273801, "text": "@yemaahiii 😭😭😭 legit our conversation", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:40:04", "owner": "helihellyeah", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["vlog", "uni", "unilife", "september", "university", "dayinthelife", "student", "backtoschool", "firstyear", "unistudent", "universitystudent", "universitylife", "freshers", "single", "college", "dating", "fyp", "uniaccommodation", "collegelifestyle", "universityaccommodation", "universitylife", "vlog", "universityliving", "movingout", "september"]},
