{"media_id": 3660830785705594842, "shortcode": "DLN4jQky8_a", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DLN4jQky8_a/", "taken_at": "2025-06-22T20:48:58", "caption": "✋🔠 i made a scrappy and yet fun font editor ✨\npinch-rotate like a knob that switches modes:\n👌 index+thumb → pick the letter\n🤌 index+middle+thumb → warp its glyphs\n🖐️ all five → smooth the lines\n\nshoutout to @schultzschultzgrafik - the “pinch rotate switch modes” ui mechanism is inspired by their touchtype 👏\n\nalso another experiment of using @touchdesigner ‘s new op family pops to manipulate lines/curves ✨\n\n#touchdesigner #touchdesignerlearning #touchdesignercommunity #newmediaart #creativecoding #handtracking #fontdesign #typefacedesign #uidesign", "owner_username": "the.poet.engineer", "owner_id": "6264702178", "likes": 83594, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0054_DLN4jQky8_a\\DLN4jQky8_a_20250622_204858.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17983743539830094, "text": "can anybody tell me what branch of engineering is this ? i am fascinated about it, and want to learn it.", "created_at": "2025-06-23T14:36:27", "owner": "sagegreenscribe", "likes": 2844}, {"id": 17974134542886057, "text": "I’m so obsessed with your work", "created_at": "2025-06-22T21:47:34", "owner": "with.almnd", "likes": 997}, {"id": 17899928847096895, "text": "That sounds awesome! 🎨✨ Can't wait to see what cool fonts come out of it! 👏", "created_at": "2025-06-22T20:57:43", "owner": "the_isaiah_dupree", "likes": 101}, {"id": 18031440905654661, "text": "I saw the similar project of @schultzschultzgrafik . Is your code public? I would love to play with this one and add new features.", "created_at": "2025-06-23T15:17:43", "owner": "somahargitai", "likes": 83}, {"id": 17897211198232504, "text": "Last week I tried using media pipe to do this type of stuff, and today I was thinking about exactly what you're doing, but also a way we could add letters, set them right and keep going to form words etc. It made me want to try different type of control gestures! Your post reminded me of it so thank you!!", "created_at": "2025-06-22T21:05:39", "owner": "neurotypique", "likes": 523}, {"id": 18093395359535499, "text": "Very cool, is there a way to output the glyphs?", "created_at": "2025-06-26T17:27:07", "owner": "walter__oswald", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18062618843160233, "text": "Brilliant", "created_at": "2025-06-22T21:13:37", "owner": "liveup.media", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17974913099866313, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-23T10:18:21", "owner": "heshang_08", "likes": 647}, {"id": 17861301741517772, "text": "this is really cool but why would you make this 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:59:14", "owner": "theghostofjunia", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18072509870120991, "text": "Hey well i want the code i wanna play with it ❤️👏😢", "created_at": "2025-09-10T05:30:43", "owner": "always.agust", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18515333416052123, "text": "maybe touch designer ain't so bad", "created_at": "2025-06-23T22:05:29", "owner": "koczownikkk", "likes": 63}, {"id": 17865752487417353, "text": "U are the goat dude", "created_at": "2025-06-22T20:52:38", "owner": "ppurealchemy", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17932306482058675, "text": "This is next level, everything else you made is like a warmup 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-22T21:25:37", "owner": "cencyte", "likes": 133}, {"id": 18074418109901707, "text": "Oooooh this is like the schultzshultz one but with gestures so cooooollll", "created_at": "2025-06-23T02:18:21", "owner": "askbatguy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18378939214193577, "text": "Wild", "created_at": "2025-06-22T20:49:56", "owner": "iamfesq", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17907534492256940, "text": "이희태.?", "created_at": "2025-11-01T07:37:52", "owner": "0nxzuw", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18360948208152679, "text": "GitHub ?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T18:34:07", "owner": "sammaaaarrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040740332320319, "text": "I have an artistic crush 🙈", "created_at": "2025-06-23T14:12:54", "owner": "iamhimbaza", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18517548193010236, "text": "How you make this so smooth and sci-fi??", "created_at": "2025-06-22T22:08:52", "owner": "13_shwet_raj._", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18070948853305059, "text": "The children yearn for jet set radio", "created_at": "2025-06-23T03:44:33", "owner": "3xsanguin8", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18045485771274295, "text": "Could go adding about orientation identification and based on that the ability to select different font families from a prexisting list furthermore increasing the said capability", "created_at": "2025-07-13T20:12:31", "owner": "anantwhat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088826932765076, "text": "@arpit_2106_", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:36:01", "owner": "aa.di_18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128087173451664, "text": "Code or report GitHub can also work", "created_at": "2025-07-05T15:58:05", "owner": "akki_12_soni", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049474823432311, "text": "Your linkedin please", "created_at": "2025-06-24T07:41:40", "owner": "spill_the_tea_bangchan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115910341489241, "text": "Damnnn", "created_at": "2025-06-28T01:43:54", "owner": "free_watermark_rem0ver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093415171648774, "text": "My lapy will melt down tryna do dis 🥀🥀🥀💔💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-08-13T11:50:02", "owner": "sora.totsuki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946226520989924, "text": "Truly Unbelievable, more power to you 💪", "created_at": "2025-06-24T19:54:19", "owner": "lottiepro", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067675478287396, "text": "Are you a fucking wizard cus this is the closest I've seen to wizardry", "created_at": "2025-06-22T20:55:23", "owner": "zaggedout", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18169228639381301, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:24:39", "owner": "itz_nightdoom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103028308738870, "text": "Huge for glovers 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:34:34", "owner": "beastmodevega72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064008701390581, "text": "Creative coding is so cool 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:18:04", "owner": "c4rdfate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090421421497846, "text": "can i get the source code plsssssss......", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:47:33", "owner": "thejas_haridas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079379639182720, "text": "this some gay shit right here", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:51:28", "owner": "48_2f0391_0x7a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058692890309138, "text": "Where can I download this?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:29:43", "owner": "pedro.r.tavares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135133120485830, "text": "mute people pov:", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:44:33", "owner": "afucking_ape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075005003001558, "text": "🔥👏👏👏🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:35:48", "owner": "brianbossin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103899916639562, "text": "THATS FRICKIN AWESOME", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:37:32", "owner": "wyattolson253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851813167580601, "text": "I want to do the cool shit like this", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:08:32", "owner": "ctrl_zlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924526129037758, "text": "Nah bro genuinely what are they feeding you", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:37:31", "owner": "m4dscientist_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847318264595077, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:47:36", "owner": "apoetixart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848632129589701, "text": "이희태인줄", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:03:26", "owner": "h_seok0907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074491178226305, "text": "I also made something similar 😋", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:54:40", "owner": "chilldarsheel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093525925830161, "text": "Learning sign language with this? THOUGHTS THOUGHTS?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T09:38:00", "owner": "fhrer_johirnvel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042549671461786, "text": "🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:46:17", "owner": "noturavgsigma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188915500335426, "text": "이희태임?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:22:26", "owner": "damhwee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079114556018851, "text": "What do i have to learn to do this?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:56:18", "owner": "simpllynick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904188286127532, "text": "source code pls", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:11:46", "owner": "yadolfy1tler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945392224024131, "text": "That's superb! Can you please share the source code 🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T06:34:28", "owner": "krishna_086", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417564082128414, "text": "Ok. Amazing.", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:18:17", "owner": "c_lementines", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371817421194612, "text": "Plz source code", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:08:42", "owner": "v.k.agarwal1101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000992507815227, "text": "How do you give each font letter those points on them? How to know how many points is needed to make a letter? 🙂", "created_at": "2025-09-23T18:55:39", "owner": "arshad_ajmal_fx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998771523668785, "text": "whaaaaaat 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:02:23", "owner": "idk_lol7812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104330527593832, "text": "이희태가 개발도 하네 ㄷㄷ", "created_at": "2025-09-18T23:14:34", "owner": "kimhj0626_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878732632400211, "text": "Is the dark background intentional?with light originating from the direction so that it illuminates hands first? helps recognition", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:36:06", "owner": "heyaryansharma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419649430129571, "text": "good article 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-16T10:38:58", "owner": "kinkinnightning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062628101364665, "text": "Love it ugh", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:00:13", "owner": "hiro_bovin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087892432862813, "text": "Mind blown this is so coolll", "created_at": "2025-09-13T00:09:12", "owner": "kainat_afiya7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049339898302234, "text": "Привет 👋🏻 очень круто проект, я возможно видел вас в своих видениях, но ту героиню звали Лира 😮", "created_at": "2025-09-09T13:05:27", "owner": "astrolog_jyotish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890039731201534, "text": "Can you tell me the name of this?", "created_at": "2025-09-07T23:52:43", "owner": "dkwolf07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324687142209368, "text": "THIS IS SO COOL WTFFFFF ‼️⁉️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:19:05", "owner": "annihilateur2pingouin3200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854959351515586, "text": "Cool♥️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:35:02", "owner": "macszy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876060280404168, "text": "Damn, this is so impressive. I literally have no words to express this feeling 😍🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:03:01", "owner": "code2encoder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528151846034802, "text": "Whaaaat", "created_at": "2025-09-05T04:41:51", "owner": "westofwander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312297013300810, "text": "Great work!", "created_at": "2025-08-31T04:04:44", "owner": "aliendevuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109089988538816, "text": "Those Who knows the real capability of media pipe.", "created_at": "2025-08-30T22:15:33", "owner": "mvi__21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084327046895607, "text": "\"nunca vou usar geometria na minha vida\" tá aí o porquê se ruelas, o cálculo, a física computacional alinhada com a geometria analítica vai revolucionar tudo oque compreendemos sobre vida", "created_at": "2025-08-29T19:46:33", "owner": "isantmatos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066712072973956, "text": "is it deep learning? or generative?", "created_at": "2025-08-28T05:19:57", "owner": "farfettchhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059958494588530, "text": "HELLO??? why are you *so* cool??", "created_at": "2025-08-25T06:44:31", "owner": "samanthajyee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076332646817827, "text": "I want to implement this project in my research work and will extend this work , can you share a GitHub link ??", "created_at": "2025-08-24T05:49:54", "owner": "smitrpatel19.ai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084952930684625, "text": "this is so cool!", "created_at": "2025-08-22T20:25:34", "owner": "eric_l.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996321747821796, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-20T12:03:17", "owner": "chil