{"media_id": 3741270373371498270, "shortcode": "DPrqZUdgE8e", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPrqZUdgE8e/", "taken_at": "2025-10-11T20:28:13", "caption": "she was so confused🤣🤣\n\nwhat else did she miss?💬\n\n#hongkong #cantonese #hkmeme", "owner_username": "tinaormee", "owner_id": "62282014807", "likes": 21813, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0055_DPrqZUdgE8e\\DPrqZUdgE8e_20251011_202813.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17930391666101361, "text": "Don’t forget the scarf😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:25:15", "owner": "kooorla_0328", "likes": 264}, {"id": 17858933127522391, "text": "I feel likes it’s an universal moms dress code 😂 my Greek mother in law dresses like this too", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:57:33", "owner": "byha3el", "likes": 954}, {"id": 18186217252327780, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:45:03", "owner": "juliaxeats", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18067583684196637, "text": "This is my mum’s daily uniform 😂 right down to the phone case.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:05:18", "owner": "diamondcanopy", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18081916877486057, "text": "Yep, my mum too 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:43:32", "owner": "itskitlee", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18134428648482449, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:52:32", "owner": "dana.chereda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863005237484604, "text": "HK mums are single handedly keeping sketchers in biz", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:17:14", "owner": "saanstagram", "likes": 340}, {"id": 18111537280562207, "text": "Why are you filming my mum", "created_at": "2025-10-13T08:20:24", "owner": "claudia_chin", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18329749552233752, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:38:12", "owner": "stephanie.ugc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043248500422712, "text": "She must have a tiny bottle of water and scarf in handbags", "created_at": "2025-10-15T00:05:25", "owner": "connie_mortgage", "likes": 120}, {"id": 17868041355395047, "text": "That’s so true 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:50:52", "owner": "justinwongjw", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18080903903038934, "text": "靈魂係 S掛鉤！！", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:30:49", "owner": "723.owc", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17965871783824161, "text": "Hahaha true", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:18:36", "owner": "marinalailentz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18298073377264538, "text": "@haileytai_ i see your future and it is bright", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:59:54", "owner": "nellie.dougherty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180038644352205, "text": "😂😂😂 100% Korean mum’s same tho", "created_at": "2025-10-13T01:08:38", "owner": "kim.mj.chi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18360222901088506, "text": "i am a mom now, and i bought sketchers last month 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T01:29:39", "owner": "samantha_cheng0116", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062938547453813, "text": "Lmao that’s exactly my French mom 😂 I think this style is just universal", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:28:49", "owner": "math_gyd", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18084414541819255, "text": "I respect the drip", "created_at": "2025-10-27T07:30:38", "owner": "neestha._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18203940178315726, "text": "My mother in law didn't like it when I called her recycle bag a wat dat doi but not it's a form amount communication for us!", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:28:48", "owner": "ryanc_73", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17993910281838608, "text": "Also scarf and a small bottle with hot water", "created_at": "2025-10-14T19:06:04", "owner": "miss_laney81", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085371481752743, "text": "We are all the same when we get to that age 😝", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:27:42", "owner": "bonjour_brenda", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872713615445474, "text": "Excuse me I think you filmed MY MOM 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:15:43", "owner": "ima.momiji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090838498669041, "text": "😂 the hiking drip. The truth is that I couldn’t help myself but get in with them. Love my art’eryx jacket", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:37:47", "owner": "the_invisible_m4n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077529983031759, "text": "Omg!! This is my mom and she’s not HK, she’s Asian though 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:43:36", "owner": "missvivianyu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080447209843289, "text": "My Mum, too! And all purple!😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:55:43", "owner": "lazysyen", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17973345596792815, "text": "My husband calls the recycle bag 'Chicken bag'. That's bc everything I go to Ctown, I bring back a 🐔😆", "created_at": "2025-10-14T18:07:29", "owner": "ladym.888", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109241911510157, "text": "My mom’s exact look.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T01:46:35", "owner": "icecream345a", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17880632790408898, "text": "I don’t get the phone case at all", "created_at": "2025-10-21T05:44:01", "owner": "rc_rita.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130769410474359, "text": "@emilybbb8 it’s actually mum 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:40:38", "owner": "victoria.tsikchee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975938382931667, "text": "Exactly my Mum’s uniform", "created_at": "2025-10-13T08:21:11", "owner": "daluzb", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090990190807666, "text": "Are you sure she isn’t my Mama? 🫣🫨", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:17:26", "owner": "xo.simplyrose", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18080608319059325, "text": "And the scarf", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:34:50", "owner": "askthemagicconch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927290872132865, "text": "thats my mum 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T23:07:38", "owner": "pandaoneechan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060578900567218, "text": "Hard on the skechers 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T02:57:53", "owner": "msteebee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17990369219857491, "text": "Them phone cases be looking THICKKK too", "created_at": "2025-10-24T16:54:04", "owner": "chi.zyx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947218162028086, "text": "@sofia_ypy it’s @celia.chan_1234 lollll", "created_at": "2025-10-13T00:21:12", "owner": "si.dan_la", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924714946120018, "text": "Tempo tissues", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:01:20", "owner": "chloelaurencheung", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075901205140764, "text": "My mom’s uniform too. Except the color. She always wears black white blue and grey", "created_at": "2025-10-25T19:18:41", "owner": "theboringnoob", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18237811315290100, "text": "Meanwhile every po po is a pink puffer, curly hair, and that one pageboy hat that survived the 2000s😭😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:37:59", "owner": "tiffany.thom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864304357413548, "text": "Puffy jacket with 27-29C°??😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-13T08:04:35", "owner": "salene.seid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076205084173871, "text": "Minus the puffer and this is my mom's uniform 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:05:57", "owner": "granitaconpanna1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967675044968036, "text": "Ahahahahahahhahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:51:20", "owner": "pisteuotyche", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006370664646598, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:44:13", "owner": "chanmoyee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18329455006246068, "text": "That’s my grandma", "created_at": "2025-12-20T10:28:49", "owner": "tangpruuu_ie27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920452492069495, "text": "seeing the scarf... I thought this was my mom and I was confused... I didnt make this. and my brother didn't make this. So who was driving the car?!?!?!", "created_at": "2025-12-15T02:06:46", "owner": "sodypopbabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089911559486830, "text": "might be my mum. (im not from hong kong)", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:08:58", "owner": "222vl0dka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052712987669337, "text": "😂totally my mom too!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:31:10", "owner": "graceful_glowjourney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955208446046373, "text": "N the light weight nylon 😂scarf", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:32:51", "owner": "citeyourwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068940317580585, "text": "😂😍", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:12:04", "owner": "anggraini_shinta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000220085837551, "text": "Not my mum but definitely my grandma", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:34:05", "owner": "jam0_fn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945971113067450, "text": "Wait, that’s me!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:06:29", "owner": "lewangela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084296326852345, "text": "That’s my grandma 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:54:18", "owner": "codyyeungbk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953891611021531, "text": "I feel personally offended.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:31:13", "owner": "gigi_s_yiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952949419044722, "text": "My mil", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:50:59", "owner": "gilbertnyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856808947561396, "text": "Always wear jeans! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:28:32", "owner": "wing_sophie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374514106152708, "text": "Where’s the umbrella", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:42:21", "owner": "marlowandhishuman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105764215573912, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:56:13", "owner": "gobbleandsipuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064592390411136, "text": "Not my mom lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:32:02", "owner": "tessa.cheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963058641989956, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:29:10", "owner": "prabrisha.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086417323797058, "text": "Oh shit I’m a mom *panik*", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:58:50", "owner": "lokoboiowo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093816400874774, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:56:20", "owner": "haroldray1082018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000163880830725, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01:10:51", "owner": "wcl_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898830172338923, "text": "are u sure this isnt a video of my mom?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:39:42", "owner": "skykangaroo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046425194443839, "text": "Knly me grandmother does that😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:54:21", "owner": "aydenleung1025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085303436072585, "text": "Bro so is my my grandmom too young", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:54:06", "owner": "aydenleung1025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18228262501306673, "text": "My mom to a T😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:48:16", "owner": "betterforsea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290162785272404, "text": "At least not mine but lol", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:26:11", "owner": "miss_nellssiiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014351582799299, "text": "The scarf!!!!🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:07:16", "owner": "tszyin0128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964439020002521, "text": "Hot water bottle", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:49:27", "owner": "2611.kya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057379139230760, "text": "Hot water", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:49:20", "owner": "2611.kya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088895297492750, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T10:27:57", "owner": "winonski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374976658151631, "text": "also wear mask, sunglasses and hat", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:39:59", "owner": "ewaorie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531696274041442, "text": "It always has to be the one and only Skechers", "created_at": "2025-10-27T08:52:51", "owner": "stephenhoooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874015159354714, "text": "noo I think u forgot the phone strap (maybe?)", "created_at": "2025-10-26T11:49:29", "owner": "kwai1112.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869043349462537, "text": "That’s my grandma 😭 nai nai", "created_at": "2025-10-26T07:48:36", "owner": "ashl_ee145", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100580455591652, "text": "That's my grandma", "created_at": "2025-10-25T05:01:47", "owner": "s4m_1rah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105072418780279, "text": "💯 📠", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:26:25", "owner": "estherk_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043443947694111, "text": "And its like 20 degrees too", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:47:10", "owner": "i_changed_my_name_cuz_i_can", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857568667539411, "text": "The audio on this. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T11:22:19", "owner": "ajs_117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070474997207344, "text": "Fanny pack must be LeSportsac brand 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:59:37", "owner": "ichigoi102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981289641872961, "text": "Why is that recycling bag touching the floor", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:31:17", "owner": "thewok147", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025199558754914, "text": "and it’s also the most ugly flamboyant shopping bag ever known to mankind", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:37:37", "owner": "bleachedba6e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046334156666102, "text": "where’s the hat and umbrella", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:06:22", "owner": "michelfung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891614143350947, "text": "But skechers are so comfy 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T19:04:23", "owner": "miss_laney81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977726532923955, "text": "It’s 32 degrees in HK today, baffles me how Uniqlo has their jackets out already. Too hot !", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:52:02", "owner": "omakase_by_jeff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113180296485647, "text": "Banker", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:02:09", "owner": "ummmtang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060170192160285, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:27:51", "owner": "simply_thymejoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133836526456563, "text": "So comfy lol", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:35:27", "owner": "blairw1.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044531894432111, "text": "Ah 媽 is that you?!😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:00:24", "owner": "fsw_wilson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058474985187983, "text": "Screaming! 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:51:15", "owner": "kiannalucilla_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958714860990957, "text": "Unless we r living in different dimension, how ur mum manage to wear 羽絨 when it is 30°C outside. \nI’m impressed", "created_at": "2025-10-13T10:42:59", "owner": "ah.win28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911043796228098, "text": "Am ... Am I a HK mom?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T10:08:49", "owner": "chreeesc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097989502678853, "text": "@this_is_cecilia", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:41:59", "owner": "magsiewagsie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072490820225736, "text": "Nope. Not me.😬", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:14:54", "owner": "karinakswong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119045068515504, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:10:28", "owner": "patre_lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285919972272540, "text": "@leona_26.wtw accurate?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:40:53", "owner": "cunhallucas_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["hongkong", "cantonese", "hkmeme"]},
