{"media_id": 3729857719584129714, "shortcode": "DPDHdWWj4Ky", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPDHdWWj4Ky/", "taken_at": "2025-09-26T02:28:41", "caption": "What is it?\n\n#smallbusiness #ecofriendly #cleaning #aussie #sustainableliving #savetheplanet", "owner_username": "lucentglobe", "owner_id": "49992356679", "likes": 125339, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0057_DPDHdWWj4Ky\\DPDHdWWj4Ky_20250926_022841.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18053603948273787, "text": "2$ dollars a liter? That’s it?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:26:30", "owner": "olivier_gorski", "likes": 699}, {"id": 18202947025313940, "text": "PLEASE EXPAND OUTSIDE OF AUSTRALIA I BEGGG", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:39:24", "owner": "tribromooctaoxide", "likes": 6136}, {"id": 18079392443076343, "text": "Does it taste good?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:14:24", "owner": "sav1ourr", "likes": 1501}, {"id": 17862239976498276, "text": "I can’t lie this is good marketing", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:39:06", "owner": "glytch_404", "likes": 669}, {"id": 17903381073273570, "text": "My mum has horrific allergies that disable her. Since switching to these, she’s been able to comfortably wear her clothes without itching anymore", "created_at": "2025-10-27T04:21:56", "owner": "alexthelionn8", "likes": 97}, {"id": 18164540713330131, "text": "Zesty cherry😂", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:45:06", "owner": "sixtenj0nsson", "likes": 6452}, {"id": 18538101193029310, "text": "I have skin issues so would it be bad for my skin as in lots of chemicals?", "created_at": "2025-10-24T22:32:07", "owner": "itz.xottic", "likes": 73}, {"id": 17953370526043000, "text": "It's funny cause the same amount of laundry detergent in the uk same size ect only costs 9.50 on clubcard 11 pound without and its a 1836ml", "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:56:18", "owner": "le3xiiiee", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18242206024289644, "text": "Wow. 👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:25:54", "owner": "althuscuisot", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101227447683009, "text": "AND IT'S BETTER FOR THE ENVIRONMENT!!!!! 🤩🤩", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:37:30", "owner": "blythe_a960", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18108739303559424, "text": "Zesty cherry?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:08:26", "owner": "n3ls0n_jbr", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18113086648505537, "text": "Can u make a vanilla one??", "created_at": "2025-11-15T15:28:50", "owner": "eloa_lacerda_gomes", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18162052534338513, "text": "In bosnia u can get it for 5 dollars and it's 71 washes", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:25:03", "owner": "kapetan21211", "likes": 422}, {"id": 18069638792613794, "text": "Plss put it in Malaysia broo I need ittt", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:50:22", "owner": "syaxmizah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892811284224323, "text": "I see some people have used it.. cleaning wise is it good?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:28:50", "owner": "daviid_emmanuel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121656232478273, "text": "bro trust me get this is so much more convenient and not a mess like i’m 16 and ill pick it up at the store", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:16:07", "owner": "highwaysonathan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102102538736259, "text": "where are you getting 2$ gas at", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:53:49", "owner": "jerryberry20000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425778877117371, "text": "Im wondering that are they good for kids use laundry soap?? I need to know safely or not safely 🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:06:05", "owner": "senseinspir3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429686722106332, "text": "genius idea", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:05:51", "owner": "drzcul.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842494633626979, "text": "My mom has them 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:23:14", "owner": "lexie_greaves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069868811346693, "text": "YOU HAVE STRAWBERRY TOO??? OMG", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:53:11", "owner": "berry_clov3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083139008325715, "text": "Bet it’s good, I really want to buy it because it’s also mess free", "created_at": "2025-12-20T07:10:38", "owner": "pickle_with_ketchup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871894903469649, "text": "Too good to be true?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:48:20", "owner": "i_banged_you_mum_and_your_gran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519508759066195, "text": "Please we need to Expand to South East Aisa", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:02:28", "owner": "alonso______33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091172932642547, "text": "this is a great idea! i'm so happy someone finally did something, can i have a brownie recipe?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:01:15", "owner": "mysp011", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18383891020194643, "text": "Can I eat the laundry sheets?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:28:01", "owner": "watcher3669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948142350917319, "text": "Its 10.50 a litre", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:51:09", "owner": "kbrownie1097", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18311638183168215, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:45:25", "owner": "tricky_tris", "likes": 2881}, {"id": 18124337995516585, "text": "Sendin out to Slovakia?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:17:50", "owner": "cokoladovy_dezert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074345264255937, "text": "PLEASE EXPAND TO THE PHILIPPINES", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:46:45", "owner": "ruzz.gets.the.huzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053824151664877, "text": "am so interested in ts when i go back to Australia i will 100% buy ts", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:24:05", "owner": "michelle__oscar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948361608915231, "text": "I’m gonna eat it and there’s nothing you can do to stop me", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:02:52", "owner": "connor_h123454", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924043900150815, "text": "How’d $10.50 run into $21", "created_at": "2025-09-27T01:38:40", "owner": "matthew.dn_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18306309895264652, "text": "Hope you drop in the middle east❤️ ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:22:57", "owner": "adrenaline2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055310315661171, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-20T12:00:59", "owner": "zaidobrg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111357004610843, "text": "plz go to slovakia", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:43:14", "owner": "pro29436", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18107475229572404, "text": "I thought 20$ for 5L was expensive💀", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:41:48", "owner": "pure.darkness01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110296015612188, "text": "Let me buy 4", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:52:26", "owner": "1turbo_lolo6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147011545387470, "text": "is it edible?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:44:32", "owner": "pizzamaninohio_owo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066061922102975, "text": "Can 1 sheet take care of a large load? And if its a small load is the scent strong?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:39:46", "owner": "isabella_p0ll", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077468183156429, "text": "Mb but am I the only one that read that as $10.50/per L not $21/per L?? \n\nThe bottle is 4Ls so $42.", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:14:42", "owner": "copparobbo28", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18541595521054248, "text": "please come to indonesia 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:38:54", "owner": "corn_jello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051097721372103, "text": "What are you buying if it's $20 per litre", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:37:13", "owner": "vissy.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018940442789944, "text": "Please come to turkey", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:26:28", "owner": "catolika12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434975725098276, "text": "take it to shark tank it is truely genuis🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:26:24", "owner": "mohab_zhran__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069373931065221, "text": "Please come to Jamaica", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:00:20", "owner": "mr.james_fr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17902324140161305, "text": "Where are you getting fuel for only $2????", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:33:56", "owner": "opinionated.kiwi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897460825165948, "text": "This is actually amazing", "created_at": "2025-09-27T01:37:06", "owner": "peatherac", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112714318577581, "text": "We need this in Poland brother", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:14:49", "owner": "tytusgrom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123342574518322, "text": "It looks like gum I wanna eat it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:13:04", "owner": "emer23145", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023132759786247, "text": "Also, powder is cheaper than liquid so... use powder, its only $15", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:34:40", "owner": "opinionated.kiwi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369349492082779, "text": "Expand it to Thailand pls🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:40:15", "owner": "khummalala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067905002612737, "text": "In Greece  laundry detergent costs 6 € so around 6.50$", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:03:50", "owner": "xasapisorestis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030794729750846, "text": "Pls publish this in Morocco", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:16:43", "owner": "br0ski.cs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905037967144657, "text": "Does it leach microplastics into the water when it dissolves?, laundry sheets usually do", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:36:22", "owner": "sidrah_iman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313380679217770, "text": "Bro, that literally says $10.50 per litre", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:58:28", "owner": "dom.j26", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18073285013213983, "text": "Will it be available in South East Asia especially Borneo? Since in my region, it's rare to see a quality product that is not overpriced nor cliche", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:38:27", "owner": "syahdana175", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937714840065816, "text": "My mom has this but from another brand", "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:11:52", "owner": "jurre_slangen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089493838876311, "text": "Yes laundry detergent might be more expensive per litre, but you don’t use that full litre for one wash. For fuel you need multiple litres meaning each wash with a detergent is cheaper than fueling your car.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:50:23", "owner": "shemtroll", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852584437581972, "text": "It legit said $10.50 a litre.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:27:35", "owner": "noah.dowding1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067983779574000, "text": "My family uses this! It's awesome", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:05:29", "owner": "theniheldeal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17921895837051451, "text": "Do you have non scented ones too?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:20:47", "owner": "adrianaswiggins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547110424055955, "text": "Please expand outside Australia we need this in india", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:27:02", "owner": "yxsh_bxkshi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070490888343308, "text": "Where can I buy it?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:31:26", "owner": "eee_sau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076721852598396, "text": "Just looked at the website and it's $80 for 80 washes", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:56:32", "owner": "stierinstahater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074163308195480, "text": "PLEASE DO YOU SHIP TO NZ", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:31:44", "owner": "xx.beecat_.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081243050284198, "text": "We actually already use your soap in my household!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:56:31", "owner": "m_the_meatloaf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101872294652806, "text": "You know it’s quality when it comes from Australia", "created_at": "2025-10-24T16:32:50", "owner": "machine_check_exception", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18104619733650191, "text": "Worldwide shipping ?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:07:22", "owner": "bu7ejab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907634473128470, "text": "Do you ship to Europe ?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:36:33", "owner": "mathsfchs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871014796461192, "text": "Marketing at peak", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:58:21", "owner": "sahajjot.singh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057615404276447, "text": "10/10 convinced me", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:30:20", "owner": "schizophrayneic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978080184927922, "text": "I would want to eat that so bad😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:11:14", "owner": "mathiasmatejka_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076993964233752, "text": "Why not sell them in stores?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:40:57", "owner": "blkmars2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107160568623542, "text": "Is there a no fragrance option", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:40:02", "owner": "andiwithnoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071492654247706, "text": "I use something just like this but i can use this brand too seem good", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:43:01", "owner": "taee.2166", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866240569483947, "text": "Wow, I must try this. 💯", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:43:13", "owner": "nichmi_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076951675935929, "text": "Can I eat it though", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:03:59", "owner": "slixzyyyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094887469890372, "text": "OMO THATS ME OMGGG", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:33:51", "owner": "omo_san0482948", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075337622116652, "text": "do you guys use coconut?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:03:17", "owner": "nephrezoic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099277942685261, "text": "The price tag on the store bottle says 10.50 a litre how do you read that as 21", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:19:08", "owner": "mikaelamcgibbon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060128780208798, "text": "Is there a no fragrance option", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:12:06", "owner": "andiwithnoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167810386371042, "text": "Has anyone tried it? I just want to know if it's really this good", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:32:07", "owner": "mikulasvanas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988567023734328, "text": "Ship to Taiwan please 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:23:51", "owner": "itz_jerry1016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969146268985655, "text": "Come to thailand please", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:04:06", "owner": "s_jcoolguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075840190958586, "text": "Is it available for Eastern Europ and is it cheaper tho?🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:45:31", "owner": "plamiluvmetal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865145620490169, "text": "We do this but use sheets in our dishwasher", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:10:11", "owner": "theredbordoverthere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543078118023558, "text": "Where is cherry online?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:24:33", "owner": "heiditaree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861284257531294, "text": "Ive uses those before and they are great", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:32:13", "owner": "hmanthebell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084678082991961, "text": "1000000 zesty orange please", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:59:31", "owner": "ahbaarali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047794286397391, "text": "I want this", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:01:02", "owner": "foremasthumiliated", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104111770725343, "text": "Pls do outside of Australia:3", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:46:08", "owner": "godness__of_death", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071733932349001, "text": "Gng don't let me near that I'll think it's gum or sum", "created_at": "2025-10-28T17:25:53", "owner": "bradley.mp2", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18096139168764434, "text": "I sent this to my mum and we are using the rest of our detergent but already bought some. Also you guys should include how handy they are when you go camping or on holidays. Literally a life saver since we didnt need to buy detergent when we travelled!", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:40:33", "owner": "rosal_len", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18107720140632792, "text": "make it edible", "created_at": "2025-12-21T10:35:47", "owner": "evilnazivampire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075073388199991, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-19T20:09:40", "owner": "registerheath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973240536813362, "text": "@900.care", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:05:39", "owner": "lechinoirs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078001474932075, "text": "Has anyone tried this? Experience?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:31:45", "owner": "slowokom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914846116217958, "text": "2$???? In Reno we lying almost 5😭", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:50:03", "owner": "they_f.w_jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982736871760564, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:27:44", "owner": "steveman_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855576646558191, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:01:21", "owner": "pabloaxel_number1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062926052438726, "text": "here in europe costs about 4-5€", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:07:33", "owner": "mohammed.khzr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857073454552793, "text": "What cherry?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T21:38:14", "owner": "voltrexextra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930337936110052, "text": "It's 2 euro for. Liter where I live..", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:20:11", "owner": "marcus_feeney11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060563123208972, "text": "I'm interested in investing bro", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:09:35", "owner": "big_dawg_graysonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045947036437850, "text": "Are these at drakes or woolies?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T00:35:20", "owner": "rileyyyep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064427105623752, "text": "PLEASE SHIP TO NZ", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:09:10", "owner": "teata_og", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086125426760362, "text": "You guys are doing the world a favour❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:01:00", "owner": "prince.of.persia.2008", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106189309720610, "text": "Please come to India 😢 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-03T11:07:45", "owner": "smayan_baid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101635597654052, "text": "PLEASE EXPAND WORLDWIDE", "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:17:23", "owner": "whitebunnywb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053773499322500, "text": "Did you guys go on Shark Tanks? I'm sure you will get good approval", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:56:19", "owner": "nashriz_006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133949065474941, "text": "i love your accent", "created_at": "2025-11-03T04:24:16", "owner": "sjthomsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889468729242971, "text": "Met your supplier in guangzhou!", "created_at": "2025-11-02T23:34:52", "owner": "jetto2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365556121084467, "text": "am i the only one that saw a dogs jersey up the dogs", "created_at": "2025-11-02T19:35:36", "owner": "tarik_kalache", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045034508443675, "text": "Are they vegan ?", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:59:14", "owner": "stehtszumiefen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048601502658917, "text": "Bro just go to Germany the most expensive one in Dm is 11,95 € and the cheapest is 2,15€", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:21:20", "owner": "eleanore_el_dino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288235351285547, "text": "@mcx_bhagya bhoogya", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:40:15", "owner": "_neel_kelkar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888177322379754, "text": "We have been using these for a few months now", "created_at": "2025-11-01T22:04:28", "owner": "ben_anderson1450", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436881031097298, "text": "Where can I get it", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:36:57", "owner": "dwellerfree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300107323255767, "text": "it should be zesty, lime, and cherry crush 🤦🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-01T14:26:07", "owner": "luh_cay25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887628625390181, "text": "you need to ask shark for investment, this is good", "created_at": "2025-11-01T13:52:55", "owner": "gabbethegoblin13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061133393170142, "text": "Where in Australia?", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:41:18", "owner": "uso_ioane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392289940123958, "text": "will y'all be expanding to India?", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:40:16", "owner": "blue.screen.of.death_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068466335589832, "text": "At the start you could see on the label 10.50$.", "created_at": "2025-11-01T06:55:09", "owner": "justuskochs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546619051054083, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:49:57", "owner": "vyshalcobra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024757832770164, "text": "HELL YEAHHHH", "created_at": "2025-10-31T22:43:39", "owner": "iblamedyylann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075424153952489, "text": "Plz ship to india", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:12:18", "owner": "donkeyd.luffy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116598967557461, "text": "You need to meet the sharks your idea is Awesome", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:49:59", "owner": "rudraxd70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105275863651678, "text": "Where are yall getting your detergent cus mine cos 5 - 15 bucks", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:00:32", "owner": "spye_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541540282035200, "text": "Yooo this is the best ad i ever seen", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:47:19", "owner": "francesco_faccio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102880801715336, "text": "Its costs us 7 quid max", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:52:30", "owner": "richard201079", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843567970604610, "text": "Buying link please", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:16:10", "owner": "silent.1over", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121783666508461, "text": "please ship worldwide I beg of you", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:55:05", "owner": "schizoneon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18336622573224540, "text": "Are they vegan? And cruelty free?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:08:49", "owner": "enten_nudel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108580192589386, "text": "PLEASE EXPEND TO EUROPE!!", "created_at": "2025-10-29T10:38:32", "owner": "c_ines0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096192784750583, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-29T07:02:13", "owner": "dobigstudios", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070685738256475, "text": "What do you use to add the scents?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:55:43", "owner": "br00k_bay217", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17962997159845417, "text": "expand to mexico plsss", "created_at": "2025-10-28T00:14:25", "owner": "fucking._.sebas_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063775136617738, "text": "Nah in uk it about £2", "created_at": "2025-10-27T07:29:57", "owner": "erenyilds", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094389433801131, "text": "Has anyone tried it and how good is it?", "created_at": "2025-10-26T19:37:28", "owner": "ram.txt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922763626164950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-26T14:32:34", "owner": "bookwyrm_298", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068343146359163, "text": "@kydyuzhini", "created_at": "2025-10-26T08:42:25", "owner": "possessd_weirdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976954905937836, "text": "Does it like yk remove stains that hv been on ur tshirt for a long time", "created_at": "2025-10-26T02:37:48", "owner": "_.arcxivity._", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080849893852320, "text": "🔔🔔🔔🔔🔔🔔🔔🔔🔔", "created_at": "2025-10-26T01:13:46", "owner": "calegub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145075858386651, "text": "Hey what kind of store do U sell in in Aus? I live in Brisbane which stores have them?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T23:42:06", "owner": "grugdunkly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924192625159568, "text": "Where is this available?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T21:35:05", "owner": "ian.ban.2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915504700206994, "text": "This is amazing advertisement", "created_at": "2025-10-25T19:40:49", "owner": "christian219_og", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095873785782856, "text": "It’s not that much", "created_at": "2025-10-25T18:03:17", "owner": "freak_man236", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18412234180139012, "text": "Bigger", "created_at": "2025-10-25T13:22:08", "owner": "magiclasserre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862245931508413, "text": "🏳️‍🌈🍒", "created_at": "2025-10-25T12:38:15", "owner": "kak4_a20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110138023584306, "text": "Yeah but fuel tanks hold like 60-80 liters", "created_at": "2025-10-23T22:53:19", "owner": "hz1xkz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043421099441207, "text": "can i eat it.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:17:13", "owner": "filatofesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061622198161674, "text": "Germany Here, cleaning fluid costs 2,50€/l", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:59:48", "owner": "curlostudios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096567640690817, "text": "Now this is how to advertise", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:58:19", "owner": "sunny_ostric.bird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040456274694521, "text": "get lavender nd i’ll cop", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:07:45", "owner": "kvys_agenda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323298844209802, "text": "How do you get natural smell from strawberries when you have pick all those tiny seeds from the outside of the fruit? I have only heard of chemical derived scent or strawberries", "created_at": "2025-10-22T01:56:34", "owner": "sarahughes_77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065175551524897, "text": "Can i eat them", "created_at": "2025-10-22T01:26:02", "owner": "v0rtex1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917098660194084, "text": "its 10.50 per litre it says it on the label lmao😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:46:11", "owner": "rahulll.2807", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18056439251261364, "text": "Are these in Belgium? ☺️", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:25:54", "owner": "xxuwufemboyxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876614596332900, "text": "I’m gonna start chewing on my clothes if I get this 😛", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:05:44", "owner": "dznn0777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099014260669507, "text": "are they available in stores or just online? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:34:41", "owner": "fa1thfully.brxndon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298155910248543, "text": "How can I get it", "created_at": "2025-10-20T10:32:35", "owner": "ramz.one_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051667745324951, "text": "Is it sensitive skin safe? I break out in hives and rashes if I don’t use sensitive safe😅.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T21:34:43", "owner": "gren_eg_an_am", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080313772866239, "text": "Need it in Germany pls, Onlineshop would be great", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:19:15", "owner": "julien_der_echte_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896473465184910, "text": "Eyy expand it to indonesia mate😍👏 would love to try these", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:18:50", "owner": "darmet_kecepit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947344267044763, "text": "My mother brought some of thise", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:41:04", "owner": "nathanielbuttsworth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995382564836195, "text": "Bring this on shark tank", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:55:14", "owner": "nick.a200", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963197832992934, "text": "Is it sensitive skin friendly?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:22:04", "owner": "sophiamathisss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996681939831907, "text": "Ok are you a millionaire now?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T10:05:12", "owner": "poyraz_is_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169826599371511, "text": "this is so creative omg 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:28:32", "owner": "salacier_l", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075917656923786, "text": "Plz expand to europ. and do you also have some without any scent?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:20:29", "owner": "tilde_emilietoft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866912023397844, "text": "is it sensitive skin friendly?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:02:11", "owner": "c.cksucker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863463586488545, "text": "This is peak advertisement 🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-18T04:58:29", "owner": "iblame_ach1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154878289394315, "text": "peak ad 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-18T01:16:57", "owner": "theobokchoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312815404173104, "text": "Can I get it in Germany", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:32:06", "owner": "95.ahmedd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973434945940165, "text": "Please have unscented options!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:53:07", "owner": "justanafternoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060940517403876, "text": "That's cool", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:37:36", "owner": "blazzzer701", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18060113069451361, "text": "do yall ship to turkey", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:46:47", "owner": "feylesof.sid4r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166707952375462, "text": "hey man, the water isnt there for now reason. if you were to put simply concentrated detergent I dont think your clothes would fare too well. Infact, most liquid detergents are actually too concentrated, so you should only use (don't cite me on this) about a tablespoon per clean.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:45:08", "owner": "diduder256", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083846704786618, "text": "My mum got these recently and she actually loves them!", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:49:06", "owner": "maddieby04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055905371542055, "text": "No chemicals 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:49:04", "owner": "ratsoupe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980325879765456, "text": "Would you use more than one sheet if you were running a larger load?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:18:39", "owner": "blu3berry.muffinn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913821100212931, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:44:16", "owner": "letssgooguyss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094028755768381, "text": "NEEDDD", "created_at": "2025-10-13T04:33:58", "owner": "fifi_ranaway", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18291979207281147, "text": "Could you make one for hunters like a sentless one", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:55:49", "owner": "thomasleviwalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992064747887668, "text": "i hope you can ship this worldwide or possibly make a factory for this, maybe", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:22:53", "owner": "nonexisty_12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062638445121191, "text": "1 dollar for filling up a 30 liter tank in Iran btw", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:25:08", "owner": "isa_aliagavara7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346403833166234, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:32:57", "owner": "skicrim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921895699036473, "text": "Do you ship worldwide?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:42:26", "owner": "lordofthe2831s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18406432870189049, "text": "In hungary when", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:08:52", "owner": "barkanyipatrik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080433082829889, "text": "These wouldnt leave stains on white shirts?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:21:15", "owner": "pt.14oscar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071113871256460, "text": "Pleaseee grow your name in Malaysia and all of Asia! We need you!! @lucentglobe", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:44:16", "owner": "yunaanhyuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095233576616431, "text": "this is the only ad im willing to watch more than once", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:07:55", "owner": "suhnake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116760757540170, "text": "this is why i love aussies", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:28:54", "owner": "rayray071234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848348272546258, "text": "Strawberries and cream might have to get copped 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:11:05", "owner": "713.noahhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298463419267827, "text": "This is genius👏", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:33:26", "owner": "nick.searcy29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965384700823164, "text": "how many sheets do I put in", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:19:25", "owner": "deleted.user808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099375514646378, "text": "Next scent can be something fresh? Forest or ocean or something??", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:48:14", "owner": "collink1261", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949156132019763, "text": "This could eliminate both laundry detergent but also cologne", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:27:47", "owner": "johnmckinney3975", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322383724214512, "text": "Bro get on shark tank", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:27:22", "owner": "johnmckinney3975", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312176614220456, "text": "This is how you should advertise. I literally watched the entire thing and it was engaging.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:45:51", "owner": "abuleil1117", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110769784495426, "text": "I feel like adding a non scented one would be great", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:00:50", "owner": "kustiii23", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17961905924841086, "text": "Can you ship to turkey?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T08:53:52", "owner": "leah27381", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082097395944617, "text": "Can you sell it in Portugal too??", "created_at": "2025-10-11T07:17:42", "owner": "martim_carvalho.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328999420229649, "text": "I use these and they are amazing", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:21:48", "owner": "thomashardwick1807", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950090851033963, "text": "argentina", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:30:15", "owner": "astorbeluchii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939531019078944, "text": "PLEASE COME TO NZ 😣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:23:35", "owner": "rangatanga_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076564619135078, "text": "Yo could you do some flower based scents like lavender?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:36:10", "owner": "george213727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845432347584686, "text": "Does it smell good?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T14:20:03", "owner": "tj.oshy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090855709807664, "text": "That's the best thing technology is making nowdays, man, export this to Brazil 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-10T07:00:08", "owner": "_ab1ner_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989782518720310, "text": "does it kill bacteria?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:25:29", "owner": "i_stole_your_peepnis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18184675393329775, "text": "I wonder how much petrol you could extract from a liter of detergent 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:24:11", "owner": "infamous_prodmeister", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17878583715407894, "text": "as american we need this", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:49:14", "owner": "gassbassboosted", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17996364050837757, "text": "How much does one box come with", "created_at": "2025-10-09T13:29:42", "owner": "timothypie64", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18376993714198290, "text": "This is such a a good product", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:54:05", "owner": "issdatkamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030791969710484, "text": "Looks like a snack lol", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:53:56", "owner": "issdatkamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849940564535358, "text": "Great marketing 👌", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:28:02", "owner": "sehaj_the_sigma", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18053465546281148, "text": "this is great and all but.. what edge does it have over, say, powdered detergent? powder is way cheaper than liquid", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:25:00", "owner": "chii.gozie", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18054552848270302, "text": "Put it in stores andill huy", "created_at": "2025-10-09T02:55:24", "owner": "chiksav470", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072095752954666, "text": "Why is the cherry zesty", "created_at": "2025-10-08T21:49:43", "owner": "fxrces_and_a_h00die", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288034891285697, "text": "You have a good point saying it’s cheaper than fuel but you made a mistake. You said it’s $21 every litre but literally sign literally says $10.50 per litre", "created_at": "2025-10-08T20:56:16", "owner": "maxwell.peterman", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17872568040352461, "text": "COME TO THE UK PLEASE INFLATION IS KILLING US", "created_at": "2025-10-08T20:50:20", "owner": "7_immy_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847223437578613, "text": "I need this", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:22:53", "owner": "sum1zzch1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908889595101297, "text": "Your going to be a billionaire", "created_at": "2025-10-08T13:17:23", "owner": "cody_andrews_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872472691353865, "text": "That legit says 10$ a litre buddy", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:31:24", "owner": "lukereynold.s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085050353507593, "text": "What cherry???", "created_at": "2025-10-07T15:20:27", "owner": "blues_ig24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086661032498729, "text": "Omg, I want it here in Germany highkey", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:09:56", "owner": "tutel_w._gun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924236779151147, "text": "Can I have for free then I’ll be a loyal customer 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:54:48", "owner": "md2128.sj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986464530887627, "text": "How many clothes though", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:52:36", "owner": "lmg_userr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077623805020602, "text": "INDONESIA HOW TO ORDER", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:19:57", "owner": "oka_blazer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158050219380551, "text": "Well done mate... Now expand outside Aussie", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:46:28", "owner": "aarav_kalra345", "likes": 45}, {"id": 17977983917869227, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:46:53", "owner": "goaliejohn37", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18058491374184608, "text": "làm sao tôi có thể mua nó", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:33:52", "owner": "thanh111988888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089140405686822, "text": "I support this", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:31:24", "owner": "tropischgrondvisje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086869873917148, "text": "Do you ship to the USA?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:43:22", "owner": "ocean.noraa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854345947542850, "text": "I’m using this when I’m a adult", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:01:45", "owner": "strawberrien.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976098390926426, "text": "I like this but is there sheets with no smell?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:36:23", "owner": "ahm_ad.2.0.0.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344284198165334, "text": "Bros marketing skills are insane", "created_at": "2025-10-05T07:35:05", "owner": "asapyoung07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078215267287311, "text": "what about the black clothes or colored clothes washing together? will they mix colors?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T06:42:12", "owner": "nurefsan_fatma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521450332063967, "text": "GUYS BUY ZESTY CHERRY😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T01:17:37", "owner": "chillguy1718", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077422829113375, "text": "Can I eat it", "created_at": "2025-10-05T00:20:09", "owner": "scraf101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997818615835527, "text": "Wonderful idea. Do/will you have unscented variants?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:38:25", "owner": "dogevopatkany", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863145091479400, "text": "125 oz of tide for 15 bucks", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:05:38", "owner": "ronon.hartog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534618289014351, "text": "I highly recommend ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:22:36", "owner": "aigrampa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025882886549631, "text": "To people who’ve tried it, does it actually work?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:54:38", "owner": "drake_sorenson13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101290051619139, "text": "Hey, do you ship to Türkiye/Turkey? I'd love to buy these sheets.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:30:33", "owner": "seek3r777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100430827628351, "text": "In the uk it’s much cheaper to clean ur clothes", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:06:36", "owner": "brett_lane14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319021942209232, "text": "Please do Malaysia.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:00:07", "owner": "trialise._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963874776828352, "text": "How much laundry can I do with one sheet", "created_at": "2025-10-03T23:34:58", "owner": "jonah12f_yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093437602775028, "text": "I'm investing In this", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:36:23", "owner": "lummo14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076979246119391, "text": "Which Australian stores is this in, and which states/cities", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:34:24", "owner": "hassxxn.um3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127795951484103, "text": "Great presentation", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:21:02", "owner": "parkerdavis754", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094291303741336, "text": "Please make this available in Thailand i need it🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-03T08:27:27", "owner": "wooddy556", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127609105484601, "text": "@fatima_alkhuzaei", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:39:57", "owner": "3li.7sayen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054961826559085, "text": "I want this", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:05:37", "owner": "lensjsx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076579715174461, "text": "Can i buy online?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:23:00", "owner": "bussochreklambuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075103795888467, "text": "yeah, no. It cost 3,50$ for a regular bottle (a few litre) in Québec.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T02:44:03", "owner": "samuei_menard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081077507490015, "text": "Yours bulldogs supporter, I’m buying it", "created_at": "2025-10-02T23:55:11", "owner": "ava_.r09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288380620259645, "text": "It literally said 10 dollars per litre", "created_at": "2025-10-02T23:49:39", "owner": "max_nietrzeba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139473736445066, "text": "Bro is actually so good at advertising", "created_at": "2025-10-02T23:20:07", "owner": "eva_is_cute5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105428173590913, "text": "It’s still 30$", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:51:26", "owner": "jaidyn2719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068099651021260, "text": "Sounds good ngl", "created_at": "2025-10-02T18:39:43", "owner": "siddharth_anand0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068360681220534, "text": "Brother india is very big market and i love to be part of your team. Please let me know if you have any plan to start in world biggest mkt😍👏", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:46:49", "owner": "sky7.walker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134052319455237, "text": "Fuel per litre is litterly cheaper than buying water from the shops", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:30:48", "owner": "tyl3rr_08", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18284675653273570, "text": "Finally a startup not selling overpriced products thinking they’re gonna sell somethibg", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:38:06", "owner": "bahunleonard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367638133159326, "text": "Is this in New Zealand? My mum would love this", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:51:00", "owner": "flozwad2474", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061582259604819, "text": "what if i eat one", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:57:54", "owner": "spoonward211", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18147266899416936, "text": "mum has those", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:39:27", "owner": "angus_heron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483381820075149, "text": "It makes me want to eat it and idunno why..", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:13:52", "owner": "bbq_bacon_burgah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981526284912011, "text": "We got them!!! They work amazing", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:15:06", "owner": "gray_albers_478", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102359524619856, "text": "Take it to portugal pls, prices here are going 📈", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:32:52", "owner": "mendes.jvicente", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079670282003092, "text": "An actual good ad", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:11:40", "owner": "oakley.elb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059623295391916, "text": "I use this, it actually makes my rashes not as bad and I have MCAS (mast cell activation syndrome)", "created_at": "2025-09-30T23:37:38", "owner": "raven_claw0912", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079853993055084, "text": "Where do you live for it to be 42 or 21 dollors", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:07:33", "owner": "_______pho3nix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18205945150309277, "text": "@codystyler855 should of got some when you were at Cole’s", "created_at": "2025-09-30T10:41:12", "owner": "angelarussell799", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060192413576284, "text": "Vanilla scent please 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:56:45", "owner": "am4y_21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18158336992387944, "text": "Why not add a small amount of water", "created_at": "2025-09-29T23:35:51", "owner": "mr.jumannnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067950437258700, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:41:16", "owner": "v0jtass_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080999509795346, "text": "But… I don’t wanna have clothes that smell like fruits 🙁 Don’t you have a flower sent or sm?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:24:28", "owner": "cozza227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068528624247791, "text": "You ship to south Africa?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:16:26", "owner": "ewanvickers94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989212068843546, "text": "My washer is liquid onlyyy😢", "created_at": "2025-09-29T03:19:45", "owner": "yk_remii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914415388067560, "text": "i wish this got to me like three years later when i will actually have to do my own laundry 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:27:55", "owner": "jack_reardon1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904992280254410, "text": "I loveeee the idea but you may wanna change the packaging, it kinda looks like uhhhhh... no baby latex box", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:30:39", "owner": "isa.rovi08", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18095142607668706, "text": "Are they in store?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:13:50", "owner": "kingufjhf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138384058427797, "text": "So umm... Can I get this at a Walmart or a target or someplace?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:41:42", "owner": "torny507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354814015090067, "text": "Is it safe for eczema?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:30:06", "owner": "l.g_showpigs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079939120956269, "text": "I’ll give it a try", "created_at": "2025-09-28T17:17:37", "owner": "miniccu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053870084556902, "text": "Bro what that’s so expensive compared to here", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:45:16", "owner": "aviv.marciano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880381222398515, "text": "This is actually good", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:25:24", "owner": "nowhero.ike", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084975235732071, "text": "Is this available in Carrefour in the UAE?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T13:42:45", "owner": "f1fan_secret", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086042887929498, "text": "Pls bring to Indiaa!", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:23:59", "owner": "ryandj.18", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17981768141876050, "text": "If it's plant derived can I eat it?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:55:18", "owner": "thsngabd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027179237727061, "text": "In the Netherlands that 4 botels for €21", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:32:23", "owner": "kozlowski_krys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071673211944144, "text": "I can get a 4 litre laundry liquid for $18 and it’s 80 washes but you charging one pack of your laundry detergent sheets for $29.99", "created_at": "2025-09-28T08:36:45", "owner": "seth_fisho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907090624236092, "text": "It said 10.54 a litre😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:35:59", "owner": "jayz_4209", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056653877631786, "text": "You can get cheap detergent for like $2", "created_at": "2025-09-28T04:33:26", "owner": "kaj_allison_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080455099812353, "text": "I use powder", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:57:23", "owner": "real_clayton_playz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996537393681186, "text": "Just letting you know the price tag says 10.50 a Liter.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:30:50", "owner": "nwintle23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369081142147957, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:46:23", "owner": "maxx2solid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091973026762878, "text": "Do you ship to Australia?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:20:22", "owner": "lukascepanovic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945560245025096, "text": "2 dollars? HA. Try $4.49 a gallon.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:00:15", "owner": "carrera9042009", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064448360618837, "text": "knowing myself I would start eating it", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:53:03", "owner": "storiesforall123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071969233944919, "text": "Where do I buy this?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:46:35", "owner": "herbieloveiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948897066902283, "text": "2$ petrol??? In Ca its 5$😢", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:25:52", "owner": "mushy209r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523612702049911, "text": "But the blue color is there to keep ur clothes white", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:31:50", "owner": "btoy_boy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18113661919533316, "text": "2 DOLLARS FOR GAS?! WHERE DO YOU STAY LEMME LIVE THERE 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:13:57", "owner": "cruz.cntrol", "likes": 109}, {"id": 17953153412881285, "text": "$41?!!??!??! I pay $10 for a bottle of Purex that’s got 115 loads. No one is paying that much for detergent", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:09:40", "owner": "june_buggieboo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105500248596807, "text": "In japan its cheap like 7dollars", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:45:22", "owner": "nickomaster_daboos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066020723251647, "text": "Or u just go to Europe", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:29:46", "owner": "adamad737", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392158915133666, "text": "Thats a really good idea, reducing transportation emissions", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:04:52", "owner": "aminlwazzani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138655369433454, "text": "Thx for the help boys", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:43:39", "owner": "sebz867", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982396086746563, "text": "I use Xtra laundry detergent ots awesome it's 12$ for 260 loads at Walmart", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:23:53", "owner": "z_8z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985270956903190, "text": "So you just let us use are own water?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:16:06", "owner": "reels_reborn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093471124705584, "text": "Is there a non scent one?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:47:23", "owner": "wesley_foster42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041363627677334, "text": "Dog gas is 5 Dolores in California", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:44:01", "owner": "isaak_cereal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337759489206299, "text": "What’s the ingredients", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:24:20", "owner": "slothxbrbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025168883737330, "text": "At the local shop in Europe a laundry bottle is 4 or 3 Euros 😬", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:23:49", "owner": "stephen_veiron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860615611498375, "text": "I hope you succeed. This a dope business 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:17:12", "owner": "tejedaaiden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012627833616545, "text": "Go to shark tank", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:15:42", "owner": "remisivanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911068651227388, "text": "One gallon of gas in cali is almost 5 dollars", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:44:16", "owner": "pyro_reno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880486333401552, "text": "Please make drying sheets too🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:13:56", "owner": "blitzkriegracing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322458037210489, "text": "Sadly not in germany", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:56:06", "owner": "bigdaddybee01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372506203144082, "text": "That genuinely seems like a good detergent or what ever it called", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:50:01", "owner": "oldathanv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861525898480442, "text": "US available?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:48:21", "owner": "simjlim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972305664943903, "text": "\"no toxic chemicals\" but wearing gloves", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:27:03", "owner": "hamiaciok_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867396313452226, "text": "Damn this is smart as hell", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:22:00", "owner": "hugocarlqvist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925420375112284, "text": "Wow, so creative 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:14:04", "owner": "jermanchez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082826626745991, "text": "Don't sell out to black rock", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:12:57", "owner": "auto.uber.alles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152959282403627, "text": "Is there un scented?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:44:20", "owner": "flappy_sauce40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949108774041416, "text": "Start selling them in Walmart", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:43:05", "owner": "grady_parks444", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128800075465410, "text": "Is this on the us?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:35:16", "owner": "kanzlerkaleb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418844818128406, "text": "No it ain’t it is literally 10 to 13 dollars", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:26:53", "owner": "vinaehatt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17850045909529240, "text": "Only if I could get it in Pakistan 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:11:26", "owner": "cherry._.blossom.56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091552936827155, "text": "Crazy idea, buy nonliquid detergent", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:05:58", "owner": "peterbabish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087076849896749, "text": "Can I eat them", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:52:51", "owner": "eastonpomeroy77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087450391888331, "text": "Can I get theses in Canada", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:43:07", "owner": "jackdavids68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077228303083058, "text": "I have these!🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:29:41", "owner": "dinoxom", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17874573534333129, "text": "21$ ? Idk were your shopping at", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:15:09", "owner": "jo2hua_web", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056396825566914, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:14:21", "owner": "mat3ogm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045957239658513, "text": "Amazing idea ❤️🔥 Wish you guys the best of luck. Do you ship internationally", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:13:12", "owner": "nikoloztopuridze", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860582557499312, "text": "When is this coming to Europe! Here in Spain we need this", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:48:04", "owner": "miguelhernandezsantana23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136374976446657, "text": "Got a pack myself, Absolutely lovely! Clothes smell amazing too mess free and all.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:31:23", "owner": "adammack07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861606019481681, "text": "Bro, go to Costco. Laundry soap there is like 5 bucks😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:27:50", "owner": "xenoprog99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127155325470858, "text": "What about environment friendliness? Most detergents are really harmful to the environment and are non-biodegradable. What about your product? And if it's environment friendly, can you show us some proof?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:22:23", "owner": "lilbityash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079934056820726, "text": "is there an unscented one", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:16:17", "owner": "alex_wik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319485016211876, "text": "This looks tasty", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:10:43", "owner": "jus_a_rand0m_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028768949519333, "text": "wait so if a gallon is a little under 4 liters, that means a gallon of gas is like $7.50 where you are. what? the gas where i live is around $3 a gallon.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:03:35", "owner": "uncuredcement", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089418712879729, "text": "I kinda wanna eat the sheet now", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:01:46", "owner": "jose1811ph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128341906422841, "text": "Who uses 63l (the average car tank) per week of detergent?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:55:30", "owner": "freddie.toynton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845158543565194, "text": "fuel last me 3 days washing liquid last me 3 weeks", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:31:14", "owner": "ataliotisandrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000941549662981, "text": "We're i find this to buy", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:26:31", "owner": "galuda123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860319559436969, "text": "As someone with sensitive skin i dont try things like this last time i did i broke out in hives", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:59:02", "owner": "brownsugar_cattea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917008318190299, "text": "On the price tag was literally said 10.50$ per liter", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:54:17", "owner": "123wawawae12", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17904329142122639, "text": "Bro my grandma actually bought that for me and it works😭🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:50:24", "owner": "yoo_girl_niyaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860366743438458, "text": "It’s like 6-10 dollars in east Texas what the hell are yalls pricing", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:47:32", "owner": "tufavoritomexicano2.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058317224154678, "text": "Are you guys selling in europe?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:42:08", "owner": "feline_finest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889140028223827, "text": "@kydyuzhini", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:59:09", "owner": "saabirboor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527463043044634, "text": "The detergent bottle that you showed(the one where you said $21 per ltr in the supermarket), it's actually half of what you said 😂. $10.5 per ltr", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:49:54", "owner": "fatal_harmony", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18527757655037093, "text": "Amazing marketing", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:27:10", "owner": "autistic_kid_rapper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082638226948403, "text": "Is that without chemicals?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:40:47", "owner": "idocohen4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059125316615381, "text": "Can i eat it🤤", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:50:10", "owner": "erenadlibirsahis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551412805034796, "text": "Thats cool will you pls make an cheddar colored and smelling sheet so i can wash my clothes with cheddar 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:49:51", "owner": "jablecny_jezek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117707536507338, "text": "its 2 quid a litre at tesco mate", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:42:22", "owner": "alexdtcf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939541653948255, "text": "Hey! Just asking if you are planning on shipping them to the UK or internationally? It would literally save my mum so much! ❤️👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:04:52", "owner": "leah_rosemorg", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18063346673600727, "text": "In here it costs like 1$ lmao", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:46:46", "owner": "il.yss.psl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092897290762725, "text": "U coming to Portugal?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:44:35", "owner": "nanibot2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854326945540383, "text": "Okay hear me out are you using a whole litre of detergent at once no you use a little cup", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:37:33", "owner": "lemonpepsi47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171109516364486, "text": "Im gonna eat that", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:35:09", "owner": "sroedguld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524697961065496, "text": "Not in the Uk man", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:29:20", "owner": "ifanwatialosgi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026043161724380, "text": "My favourite chewing gum😋", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:28:37", "owner": "stolen_meme.s", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18178472302346273, "text": "Zesty?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:41:08", "owner": "seanmc2556", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18191768449321396, "text": "Heheh... I'm feeling like a zesty cherry right now...👅👅👅👅👅", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:31:50", "owner": "johnticklesack3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091836832773743, "text": "False advertising with the correct price in the video is crazy work", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:19:22", "owner": "lachy_m07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027752876526861, "text": "Ever heard of a washing powder?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:16:41", "owner": "soham_6612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106224826597600, "text": "You added the smells for money", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:16:10", "owner": "liams_arts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075236924150407, "text": "Do you ship to the UK?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:02:35", "owner": "sfxnz7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857282446521553, "text": "Zesty what?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:54:20", "owner": "db.nathaniel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903070687257858, "text": "Bro go to shark tank", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:52:52", "owner": "pratyush.parmar_2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960422292994958, "text": "Shipping to czech republic?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:42:06", "owner": "st.haas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906033214249974, "text": "That is an amazing marketing strategy I appreciate that", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:33:55", "owner": "semih.travels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960268251991521, "text": "i would lowkey order this but i dont live in usa", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:29:46", "owner": "luca_recalo_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133966894455552, "text": "Its 11$ for 4l", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:25:34", "owner": "zaouilhassan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357644389091721, "text": "Do you ship to europe?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:24:58", "owner": "linas.jaku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418405150104005, "text": "Will you guys ship to India ?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:19:26", "owner": "chill_guy_krm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18504530503070950, "text": "I might want to eat one of them", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:10:45", "owner": "tank.mt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913572550068897, "text": "Can I eat it", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:08:41", "owner": "james.hysek_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082196390494573, "text": "I buy a 10 l for 2 $ amd its really good", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:04:32", "owner": "snowy_khodor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151860949393401, "text": "In lime", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:52:59", "owner": "imal_egendthanos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083227513932686, "text": "Yo thx it helped", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:52:49", "owner": "imal_egendthanos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157887721391713, "text": "is there stocks?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:39:27", "owner": "n.l.isaac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993510312839947, "text": "can it be eaten?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:33:32", "owner": "radityapranawajati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074223476038315, "text": "Aussie innovation 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:31:26", "owner": "heath.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042308384421120, "text": "Bro how is 42$?? In Europe it's like 10-15€ and gas is like 1.80€ per liter atleast in my country", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:25:05", "owner": "theodosios_theo", "likes": 188}, {"id": 18146546158414556, "text": "So can it get rid of dirt and coffee stains?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:12:40", "owner": "rwar.rabar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050980841302511, "text": "Imagine 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T03:30:44", "owner": "fertovar1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068891759206884, "text": "Make a fresh pair of nike shoe scent and ill be a costumer", "created_at": "2025-09-27T03:26:34", "owner": "brownbesselman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093497251687625, "text": "Is this available in Asia?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T03:24:18", "owner": "itz_shaheem_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123971017436183, "text": "now THIS is good marketing", "created_at": "2025-09-27T03:23:27", "owner": "hayden_ch16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093468181705410, "text": "Take this to shark tank🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T03:15:42", "owner": "dithrasucks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079972201812751, "text": "Goated ahhh", "created_at": "2025-09-27T03:11:44", "owner": "ranchslaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116888995518784, "text": "You should make winter flavors", "created_at": "2025-09-27T02:51:35", "owner": "fl.etcher3547", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865773064461221, "text": "Only 2!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T02:41:51", "owner": "helium_headz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883729246383353, "text": "Amazing work", "created_at": "2025-09-27T02:40:40", "owner": "xl_rbt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917004190190125, "text": "Dawg it’s 42$ a month max", "created_at": "2025-09-27T01:23:31", "owner": "brodywoods71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101447179618268, "text": "But isn't the bottle for a bunch of uses?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T00:22:06", "owner": "alon401204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102111316536103, "text": "Can I eat it 👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T00:09:29", "owner": "hadley_woolner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076228057871033, "text": "They look so edible", "created_at": "2025-09-27T00:09:11", "owner": "bath.liam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039441818470931, "text": "Is there a reason why cleaning stuff is liquid and gets put in a certain place? If not then I might use the sheets", "created_at": "2025-09-26T23:54:47", "owner": "nytro_vending", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985007916900095, "text": "What a bout powder detergent, that’s what I use and it comes in a cardboard box", "created_at": "2025-09-26T23:34:38", "owner": "ronanlewis75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972907623928747, "text": "Waw", "created_at": "2025-09-26T23:17:31", "owner": "jjds36_yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006784004803545, "text": "$5 a gallon in Washington btw 😭✌️", "created_at": "2025-09-26T23:16:43", "owner": "keegan.hourihan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18175634731346654, "text": "i used them and there fantastic!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T23:02:11", "owner": "aquatapetae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903029992256366, "text": "This is such a smart idea goodluck guys 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-26T22:22:26", "owner": "seth_xavier_everett", "likes": 308}, {"id": 18049938086315580, "text": "its like 6 euros for 2.7 liters bro", "created_at": "2025-09-26T22:13:47", "owner": "frabakis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289490890259180, "text": "Huh", "created_at": "2025-09-26T22:11:19", "owner": "penguin_toreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081168736793324, "text": "Do u ship to saudi arabia?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:57:43", "owner": "deeznuts9914", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952139530013143, "text": "And since it's slab you can ship more in trucks than those bottles", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:56:43", "owner": "bungalowbuster730", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843869401581148, "text": "No, I don’t know we were getting two dollars per liter but that’s fucking awesome", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:49:21", "owner": "renodabs", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17963644907971755, "text": "This is a market gap, I love it", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:44:50", "owner": "bryanwiggins07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016306484780699, "text": "Bro it's like 15 bucks for a thing of Gain", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:40:55", "owner": "zawigga21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857216425519572, "text": "I pay 3$ per gallon which is like 3 liters also I use powdered which is like 3 bucks for a kilo you aussies are getting ripped off", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:37:22", "owner": "eazy_ftw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897348784165737, "text": "Ok u know what hell yeah", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:34:23", "owner": "ill_o.gee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915543091191606, "text": "@jeeves_ny", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:28:41", "owner": "colacolan09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18318581179210643, "text": "So you have a non bio for people who have sensitive skin eczema etc", "created_at": "2025-09-26T21:27:41", "owner": "the.prince.of.thieves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075555941111622, "text": "Can you make one for front load washers or can you use this on front load washed", "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:59:24", "owner": "graysonrysavy", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18111833011527733, "text": "Can we only receive them from your link or are they in stores?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:48:41", "owner": "fw_oldies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042386534414183, "text": "Yeah also washing wash ones don’t use that 1 liter in 1 go", "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:38:07", "owner": "trashyeditswithartem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063270089460429, "text": "Are you guys in South Africa?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:35:47", "owner": "hugoperkins_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082470199942504, "text": "Please tell me you ship to states", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:35:32", "owner": "m4rkkx", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18324987271239297, "text": "i love Business ideas Like these", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:32:27", "owner": "rudo_oduro", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18115431865521673, "text": "So... use gasoline to wash your clothes?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:48:13", "owner": "cadencesaintlouis", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18019272179588826, "text": "But what about the people that dont live USA, cus EU washing machines are horizontaly drum rotated. And what if i have auto-detergent/softer that only take liquid?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:06:26", "owner": "_honestly.patrik", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18021636956565563, "text": "Where do you ship?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:47:39", "owner": "kostantinosvourakis2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097426729640138, "text": "in the form of a shet🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:35:45", "owner": "ardei.upu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104301832592677, "text": "Still waiting for international shipping", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:55:06", "owner": "chosen_of_the_angel_saad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057750632167336, "text": "31 dolars is a lot bc it is 155lei the curency from my country and normal detergent will be like 30lei wich is the equivalant to 6 dolars", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:52:51", "owner": "dariu1796", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18045557738354394, "text": "Sell this in Kenya", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:16:24", "owner": "labanjohn573", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17888959110222130, "text": "Yes cheese🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:54:38", "owner": "xobotgucci6045", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060642626110194, "text": "You deliver to israel pear chance?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:53:52", "owner": "three_equalsign_less_thansign9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106153765597446, "text": "I love innovation", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:05:42", "owner": "samosa_kon", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18077973293512242, "text": "You do shipping mate?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:01:41", "owner": "dheevara0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041358479441659, "text": "where are u based? worldwide shipping?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:43:09", "owner": "rogue1.7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058524593420825, "text": "You better sell in Canada!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:11:07", "owner": "lachlan_holloway", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18362584396153902, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T13:52:16", "owner": "eduardofg._", "likes": 268}, {"id": 18097661689710694, "text": "How much", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:16:19", "owner": "a_cat12345", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860271712438777, "text": "Dam", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:46:15", "owner": "jonahs_just_a_happy_guy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084920389917153, "text": "We need it in italy", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:22:44", "owner": "sa_lvatore4033", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058883891158023, "text": "Please tell me you have a scentless one", "created_at": "2025-09-26T04:03:04", "owner": "thatonetallgaynerd", "likes": 9}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["smallbusiness", "ecofriendly", "cleaning", "aussie", "sustainableliving", "savetheplanet"]},
{"media_id": 3760148112720777431, "shortcode": "DQuuslRk9DX", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQuuslRk9DX/", "taken_at": "2025-11-06T21:30:07", "caption": "全球連鎖速食品牌 KFC 近日在英國 利物浦（Liverpool） 開設其首間飲品概念店 「KWENCH by KFC」，這是品牌 第一間以「飲品」做主角的概念店，特別把樓上打造成一個可以坐一坐、慢慢飲的飲品吧，主打 奶昔、冰咖啡以及水果氣泡飲，明顯是想走近 更重視「氛圍感」的年輕客群。\n\n新店位於 Lord Street，空間用了 粉霓虹、黑膠唱片細節 做氛圍，色調輕快，像是一間可以同朋友嘆住講心事、等班車、或者純粹坐下來休息一下的地方；樓下則保留傳統 KFC 菜單，包括經典 Zinger、Popcorn Chicken 及分享桶等熟悉選項。\n\n#飲品焦點\nKWENCH 的飲品強調 顏色亮、口感豐富、好影相：\n- Caramel Krunch Shake 焦糖奶昔\n- Chocolate Krunch Shake 朱古力奶昔\n- Coconut Mango Shake 椰子芒果奶昔（有假期感的那種）\n- Iced Koffee Krunch 系列冰咖啡（焦糖／摩卡／拿鐵）\n- Cherry Poppin’／Watermelon Poppin’ Refreshers 水果氣泡清爽飲\n\n杯子端上枱的那一刻，已經比飲之前先想影相。\n\n#不提供酒精飲品\n雖然叫「飲品吧」，但這裡 沒有酒精。\nKFC 說，目標不是做夜蒲場景，而是想做一個 可以停下來聊聊天、換一下心情、陪自己一下 的地方。\n\n麥當勞於美國推出飲品及小食為主的 CosMc’s 餐廳概念，試圖與 Starbucks 等爭奪飲品市場。但 CosMc’s 最終於 2025 年宣布全面關閉，反映此類模式要成功，仍需依賴品牌定位與實際需求。\n\n對於 KWENCH 是否能在 KFC 現有品牌形象中找到穩定定位，大家拭目以待。", "owner_username": "seedenjoy", "owner_id": "61724457040", "likes": 174, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0058_DQuuslRk9DX\\DQuuslRk9DX_20251106_213007.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["飲品焦點", "不提供酒精飲品"]},
