{"media_id": 3704240125005934836, "shortcode": "DNoGsSNujD0", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DNoGsSNujD0/", "taken_at": "2025-08-21T18:10:00", "caption": "💅 “I’m a Barbie girl, in the Barbie world…”\nReleased in April 1997, Aqua’s “Barbie Girl” became a global sensation with its bubblegum pop sound, cheeky lyrics, and unforgettable music video.\nThe song topped charts in over 10 countries and became a defining anthem of late ’90s Europop.\n\n📚 Fun fact: The song sparked a major lawsuit from Mattel, the makers of Barbie, who claimed it damaged the doll’s image. Aqua responded by calling the song a satirical social commentary—and the court agreed.\nDecades later, Mattel embraced the track, licensing it for the 2023 Barbie movie soundtrack.\n\n#Aqua #BarbieGirl #1997Pop #BubblegumPop #EuropopClassic #BarbieAnthem #MusicControversy #PopCultureHistory #LifeInPlastic #It’sFantastic", "owner_username": "unforgettableconcerts", "owner_id": "75042426078", "likes": 218471, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0061_DNoGsSNujD0\\DNoGsSNujD0_20250821_181000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18021633422549390, "text": "This might be the most lip synced thing I've ever seen", "created_at": "2025-08-25T01:45:11", "owner": "hail_to_the_kink", "likes": 8814}, {"id": 17899650762267526, "text": "Barbie want's to wear bra...😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:13:16", "owner": "an_inspired_motivator", "likes": 3897}, {"id": 18091871710664038, "text": "Shout out to the drummer. He just looks like he could really use it.", "created_at": "2025-08-25T01:54:59", "owner": "thekodibaker", "likes": 486}, {"id": 17866302243415539, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:09:51", "owner": "dhruv_rajput2026", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18301861288256448, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:10:44", "owner": "megadave09", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18425316739096979, "text": "Barbie plz wear a bra😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T17:16:57", "owner": "sorbonash_69", "likes": 681}, {"id": 17984548229909393, "text": "They so good they sound exactly like their album", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:35:34", "owner": "prdanpr82", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18002239631819161, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:39:58", "owner": "naren_dran559", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18080002870800069, "text": "cocaine is a hell of a cocaine", "created_at": "2025-09-23T23:30:47", "owner": "knux_creations", "likes": 189}, {"id": 17901735351335941, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:51:51", "owner": "narcissistash_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17971216142926541, "text": "I didn’t know Vin diesel could sing", "created_at": "2025-08-23T22:32:00", "owner": "series7whisperer", "likes": 821}, {"id": 17858147112569046, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T19:32:46", "owner": "__uchihan__eye__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18098457385639388, "text": "They was amazing in November 26,2023 ❤️concert was my first and AQUA killed it at the Fillmore in New Orleans", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:03:18", "owner": "kitten_c_2000", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18074806163228074, "text": "Best playback ever !", "created_at": "2025-10-27T09:46:14", "owner": "riiixgang42o", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18066826685357693, "text": "They was a one hit wonder never had another song 🎵 we would know", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:16:30", "owner": "walterm2023", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18092154256677366, "text": "Milli Vanilli would be proud", "created_at": "2025-08-26T18:51:51", "owner": "deniszikovic", "likes": 64}, {"id": 18044312969691905, "text": "I read online that this might be lipsynced. Who can tell me, i can’t see it…", "created_at": "2025-08-22T13:19:27", "owner": "bas.wijnsouw", "likes": 278}, {"id": 18327995698243751, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:54:50", "owner": "himanshu.bansal._", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18216041977308429, "text": "❤️❤️❤️😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:57:41", "owner": "ciceraguarda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001439420683296, "text": "", "created_at": 