hucked in the sea.", "created_at": "2025-10-07T14:31:57", "owner": "deac75", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18080720330008706, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:49:48", "owner": "alon__boy__321___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906924712094050, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-01T21:32:27", "owner": "cmac8419", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18063085766122182, "text": "@daim097 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:21:53", "owner": "itx__j_e_r_r_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081910066976581, "text": "put a bra on please .. theres kids", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:12:04", "owner": "mandoe619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920238637170153, "text": "Great jiggle physics", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:23:57", "owner": "crack_nasty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151651213407878, "text": "that year was awesome with no social media or any dramatic thingy😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T03:52:07", "owner": "gundamthords", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928426323998029, "text": "Just shut up and take the free advertisement Mattel 🤦🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:30:35", "owner": "the_mighty_illintention_band", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964416171829062, "text": "Its not lip syncing if its not in sync", "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:10:12", "owner": "montanacrystalminer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911583469233959, "text": "Ich Liebe dieses Lied 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:48:02", "owner": "marcelkoch805", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858417997524808, "text": "Cheers for the horror.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T20:26:52", "owner": "jamieno3lbruton", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892898908200839, "text": "It's because it was making fun of Barbie. It was a fantastic song 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:18:53", "owner": "burgessbrianw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18540837643049756, "text": "Who knew it would go so well with lady gagas poker face 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T08:39:37", "owner": "gamerdad2024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18383620252135214, "text": "We used to be a proper country", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:01:07", "owner": "anthonywk419", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093766753833838, "text": "I don’t remember that episode of breaking bad 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-08T04:27:09", "owner": "guillopineda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074284538277814, "text": "I bet they would be a billionaire or something by now lol it's like every kids anthem on fake phone", "created_at": "2025-10-09T04:22:10", "owner": "akkichuck", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929106688123366, "text": "I remember!", "created_at": "2025-10-09T00:45:32", "owner": "caseyjohnsonmusic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092983042662155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:39:10", "owner": "__med_amine__chentouf31", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18077820772845117, "text": "Das hat der Graf also vor Unheilig gemacht….", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:56:59", "owner": "don_lubinho", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17893627893320287, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:54:30", "owner": "meeple_bas", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18107165134602903, "text": "Unforgettable concert were they are obviously lip syncing", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:12:24", "owner": "brandoeli42", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17925360774061237, "text": "No… people chose to forget this.\n\nMany with therapy", "created_at": "2025-08-24T23:39:21", "owner": "rubyrockwellcomics", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18054703934551695, "text": "Why ain't they still doing music?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T06:47:07", "owner": "paulsp0p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870647068350274, "text": "I remember the good times when it was totally OK to just have some fun.😃", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:53:34", "owner": "frank_weyand", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18099092560615192, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-09T20:28:02", "owner": "huston_512", "likes": 58}, {"id": 17923136739129875, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T13:55:09", "owner": "sorfutar_azi", "likes": 87}, {"id": 18090259690771861, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:42:23", "owner": "mathis_ku08", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17861282220465263, "text": "Catchy beat, but the lyrics are kinky as hell.", "cre