 "2025-10-23T15:05:23", "owner": "lukeheath_sketchcard_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048445268360190, "text": "In my childhood AMBBAM BAADI LASKO BAADI... 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:44:41", "owner": "natheemnazar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068703812203491, "text": "Danes 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:45:56", "owner": "jajamonkeys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132553183474526, "text": "I think I its cool that the electronic dance \"raver\" girl look is kinda coming back in vogue. Aside from her hat she would totally fit in with 2025 fashion. Homeboy in back w/ his techno liberty spikes on the other hand..... woof", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:14:20", "owner": "professor_blamenify_galenstein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095834884691217, "text": "At the last see the back. Looks like she pooped😮😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:21:06", "owner": "faizan___butt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079790645107260, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:46:43", "owner": "1n5p3kt0r1n50mn14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092331343866898, "text": "What's wrong with her?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:41:09", "owner": "carriebythesea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910815481236060, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:05:47", "owner": "sad_dipankar7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074585969163785, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:05:37", "owner": "sad_dipankar7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061730147530206, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:05:20", "owner": "sad_dipankar7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534941779012662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:05:14", "owner": "sad_dipankar7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175702819347976, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:05:07", "owner": "sad_dipankar7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867244750397890, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:04:53", "owner": "sad_dipankar7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022845848771842, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:04:40", "owner": "sad_dipankar7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090910051861888, "text": "Life is your creation", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:12:23", "owner": "mr_ali_mureed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287190349263191, "text": "Def like the Free floating she got going on", "created_at": "2025-10-22T01:47:01", "owner": "mikecahill83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074590651952223, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T00:19:43", "owner": "dr.comedy_mr.tragedy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000826517818189, "text": "Loved this song", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:29:02", "owner": "hendry.duncan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533662948020873, "text": "I was mesmerized but it wasnt the song 😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:19:23", "owner": "fsanchez6293", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875136673430729, "text": "I'm a barbie girl 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:03:30", "owner": "king_of_epic_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177811843359224, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:34:40", "owner": "dharmendrasahu872", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926000410017243, "text": "❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:38:54", "owner": "m_dl_tuhin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094772536806576, "text": "What is the colour of the hat", "created_at": "2025-10-21T07:20:24", "owner": "private__captain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082065308076907, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:58:03", "owner": "novato___0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064644278120514, "text": "Play back... 🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-20T21:58:23", "owner": "ripclaw68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051968354330204, "text": "Not one song was sung that day", "created_at": "2025-10-20T21:47:16", "owner": "m.serpas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059284091450264, "text": "Is he wearing a icp shirt?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:58:41", "owner": "paul.bilotto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044498819404961, "text": "ഹംബമ്പാടി let’s go party.\n\nMalayalees comeon’daa", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:09:57", "owner": "ethereal_zest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073838708334857, "text": "Tits😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:15:00", "owner": "sunnyy_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946545300918864, "text": "Her boobies bouncing every where", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:56:31", "owner": "sn0wqueen143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424250668110377, "text": "Glad I grew up with this", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:12:43", "owner": "afadiln_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316147483170898, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:38:15", "owner": "ceonrpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069008909524236, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:42:48", "owner": "toko__69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315542086175748, "text": "this would f*ck in metalcore", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:51:28", "owner": "alexandrospolitis1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089240026908059, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:57:07", "owner": "_first.nation.sensation_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17976756725777776, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-18T21:05:56", "owner": "8s.m.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388391959125230, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:43:08", "owner": "savagewet_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065418596087047, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-18T18:14:42", "owner": "edm_aamir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028717946746335, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:16:34", "owner": "cameronmatthews1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321510754240176, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T16:02:37", "owner": "altaf.bro_________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390498688124815, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:38:25", "owner": "tequila_9911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911189296232523, "text": "Hab ihr arschwasser gesehen Button->", "created_at": "2025-10-18T06:57:25", "owner": "kallesahbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870081145451941, "text": "why is @philiphanselmo not letting us know about this?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T01:01:18", "owner": "kuyaleonard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296832103250943, "text": "SPEEEED", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:44:04", "owner": "kronos616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148375624414798, "text": "😍😢", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:10:12", "owner": "mansour__behdarvand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896112202324415, "text": "@unforgettableconcerts fun fact decades before 2023 they used it commercials..", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:41:44", "owner": "laf_steff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986869170856070, "text": "Le play-back de qualité", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:54:14", "owner": "tazphotos__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079584532852427, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:28:03", "owner": "pur_pitik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060800894170585, "text": "My childhood queen", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:33:04", "owner": "storiesofjune", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090824335869679, "text": "Physics was always there...", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:00:03", "owner": "rehman_z04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047981615354086, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:44:36", "owner": "bimmy420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966488421970772, "text": "Как мы говорим по русски the fanera", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:33:39", "owner": "i.v.kharkovskiy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943467823063784, "text": "I see Gwen Stefani moves", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:48:42", "owner": "songbirdkuku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143524750427209, "text": "It’s because decades later Mattel also used the Barbie brand for satirical social commentary. The Oscar nominations afterwards then continued the theme….", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:03:07", "owner": "mikehalladay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296862340252323, "text": "Is that the Australian breakdancer from the Olympics?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:14:04", "owner": "joe.arguijo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073404878469646, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:26:36", "owner": "gilangsaputra9932", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915075388084620, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-15T00:21:02", "owner": "rick.mendes.549", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901929547142137, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:15:15", "owner": "vojtech_bohac_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924490297116112, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:19:21", "owner": "railin_hernandez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132833830457429, "text": "Got some nice tits", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:50:32", "owner": "pnut3844", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083499584005762, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:30:47", "owner": "mr_aniket_11111111111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195143218321353, "text": "Even when you were drunk you needed to force yourself to sing along", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:41:54", "owner": "keystroke2807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533109697042691, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:26:17", "owner": "flyin_ryan_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534477418031935, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:24:42", "owner": "serbakovoleg722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068170406040713, "text": "The lip syncing in the 90’s was unbelievable 😅 what were we thinking?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:54:50", "owner": "apatheticgames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958252671862134, "text": "Can I just go back in time to when this song came out and stay there.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:13:26", "owner": "scottielip22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949684981014440, "text": "Ah yeah, back when so many televised \"concerts\" were lip synced...", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:10:01", "owner": "forgedsledge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114227665541899, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-11T04:50:50", "owner": "smile040376", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923077450038158, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:32:22", "owner": "pixel___alchemist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981297213916623, "text": "Unforgettable concerts?!?!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:50:29", "owner": "b99andla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877302349420559, "text": "That's some serious butt sweat coming through her pants, at least I hope it's just sweat", "created_at": "2025-10-10T16:38:09", "owner": "thomythology", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906045637258012, "text": "soo shit 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:30:01", "owner": "tomsonjaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076519403121011, "text": "Best song Denmark 🇩🇰 Ever made 💪", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:18:16", "owner": "jaanscily9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846186877581787, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:25:41", "owner": "kay_gi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890240098226117, "text": "Unforgettable only the moment you clearly saw that she was not wearing a brah", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:37:52", "owner": "xivcookiekitten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073329982901908, "text": "that's little me in the front row!", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:26:01", "owner": "titosgreens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329760199237617, "text": "Looked like she was powering down or got some wires crossed there for a second.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:24:37", "owner": "ky13newsome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026185037548450, "text": "That was a banger", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:04:07", "owner": "ryanjzim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304875523247475, "text": "❤️🙌🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:27:58", "owner": "ratrygg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925562419015224, "text": "Hood classic", "created_at": "2025-10-09T13:37:42", "owner": "ruthless.loc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078513020068307, "text": "The song is dogshit. Was then is now.", "created_at": "2025-10-07T07:45:30", "owner": "psychodelicskin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108906529577347, "text": "Hate it", "created_at": "2025-10-05T22:12:17", "owner": "jokey.hates.ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153601198396812, "text": "Lip syncing really ? Pathetic", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:03:53", "owner": "markystoys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080937191063258, "text": "Dat first wombo combo move with the snaps blinking and jumps 😂😂 she got the moves 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:21:48", "owner": "fegyo95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855203899485370, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:40:35", "owner": "maxmacgregor24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028485254526290, "text": "Niemals haben die so gesungen live", "created_at": "2025-10-05T06:16:33", "owner": "daschi881", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074286205926767, "text": "Blackback 100%", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:58:41", "owner": "danieljansenbekkensten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080286877824545, "text": "Someone who can give their opinion on my first release? 🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:51:24", "owner": "natsirt_music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402276115143574, "text": "Why did they lip sync it", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:45:19", "owner": "longalter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857244352530778, "text": "I remember when this song came out. It sucked then, it still sucks now lol", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:24:51", "owner": "funtucky_life", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18157463332388005, "text": "She was pretty monstrous.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:17:14", "owner": "sulawesionando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378212050196582, "text": "2021 one of the best shows I've ever seen", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:51:43", "owner": "notoriouslitt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363985657156322, "text": "scheisse", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:22:52", "owner": "mariokurtpammer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136681228445813, "text": "Dumme Generation Dumme Videos dummes gelaber", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:45:01", "owner": "butcherfinn13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057973160404212, "text": "Idc song was a banger. That whole album underrated pop art.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:32:16", "owner": "roccojg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423025300110370, "text": "Mattel Loved it", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:42:29", "owner": "nathanmitten1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062127551099825, "text": "I can sense the coke through space and time...", "created_at": "2025-09-29T18:09:27", "owner": "b.antimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020966945772171, "text": "That lip syncing is incredible skill haha", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:20:54", "owner": "stanky_beaver88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070775512963942, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:54:32", "owner": "0vf_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060869156113008, "text": "😂😂🫶🏽", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:29:51", "owner": "kalpana_00_arvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156876964380538, "text": "\"Aqua\". The 90s, maybe the best decade ever.", "created_at": "2