ha_ray @critical_role spooky", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:38:21", "owner": "ckwie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103836694608979, "text": "Why tf did they pretend to be a band", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:40:20", "owner": "2cheap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879497815393118, "text": "Wonder if it was playback 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:48:27", "owner": "thors84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058458173136607, "text": "@zwck_core_stf2", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:22:24", "owner": "tayrakolbel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876563185303967, "text": "Aqua 🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-19T06:09:51", "owner": "poeze_mie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294851155249351, "text": "What a banger", "created_at": "2025-09-19T03:13:01", "owner": "jgiovannichavez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893610922186018, "text": "The nips are free", "created_at": "2025-09-19T01:46:53", "owner": "bbq.fan77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102097429612625, "text": "Not only using the song for the movie, it's also been used in the commercials!", "created_at": "2025-09-19T01:04:57", "owner": "flexmentallo74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071403353325948, "text": "🧐I don’t think she was really singing.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:28:36", "owner": "christopherbrowhow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137252854436783, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:21:21", "owner": "rowarren_willets", "likes": 106}, {"id": 18081408418754602, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:41:42", "owner": "aayush_chawla__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947583727031919, "text": "And... its in the movie! 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:33:14", "owner": "legomuj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059196167626213, "text": "René Diff, altså ham fra Aquaaah, han er bare så skidesød.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:59:49", "owner": "abrandtmusic_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042418697392436, "text": "geboren um zu leben usw", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:21:04", "owner": "jawelo78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859055305500136, "text": "alter das ist doch unheilig", "created_at": "2025-09-18T