}, {"id": 18100451497716613, "text": "I miss this era 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-13T02:53:52", "owner": "she.wandersgt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416059309106527, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T02:15:22", "owner": "aidenmoore8045", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065408861260799, "text": "Trying to look all fresh and cool while singing that song 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T00:49:20", "owner": "xnecroking_of_painx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051928334254849, "text": "No way", "created_at": "2025-09-12T22:57:30", "owner": "motazalkhalaf22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019102835765076, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T22:19:06", "owner": "eugen_459", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078541469303973, "text": "Ha ha ha yeah 🕺🏽🕺🏽🕺🏽", "created_at": "2025-09-12T20:55:03", "owner": "justin_84_mo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111546463532429, "text": "Shortest concert in history.  They had one song. 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-12T20:54:44", "owner": "bufordt217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842068285579600, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T19:38:49", "owner": "rocenovic_andrija", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18052782152547549, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T16:31:21", "owner": "bogveradze_nikaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176414560342770, "text": "Powder was good that night", "created_at": "2025-09-12T15:06:31", "owner": "dirkkingston", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864258526462543, "text": "Even those drums were lip synching lolll", "created_at": "2025-09-12T14:21:35", "owner": "zvd.rom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075966761046803, "text": "She’s cute", "created_at": "2025-09-12T13:15:12", "owner": "nah.fr.fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065784914208889, "text": "Lip singing at it's finest", "created_at": "2025-09-12T11:05:20", "owner": "tahko_ffbc_prez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079960147945945, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T23:17:51", "owner": "douae._.2098", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082574029904500, "text": "Haha you laughed at me when I blared this song.  @reynolds.c95", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:58:26", "owner": "justfirethetimblitzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111197974538225, "text": "Lip syncing at its finest", "created_at": "2025-09-11T00:50:53", "owner": "vahnseru4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851073811544416, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-10T20:27:51", "owner": "dilshodxon_2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105695053568826, "text": "I and my friends as group performed on this song in school", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:39:37", "owner": "aganguly12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422416168099165, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:43:45", "owner": "benjaminwigell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483442876076137, "text": "Yay, i love JoySpeed!", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:20:44", "owner": "latterdirektoratet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085713784721457, "text": "Pre recorded lip syncing bullshit.. ya , great concert", "created_at": "2025-09-09T22:12:06", "owner": "jason.cowie.79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038390828463021, "text": "where are the phones? must be AI", "created_at": "2025-09-09T20:20:06", "owner": "zukpants13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17870147001352271, "text": "She’s geeked out of her mind", "created_at": "2025-09-09T18:47:04", "owner": "nstern7474", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353181715089911, "text": "So dm annoying, rushed to turn the radio off back then", "created_at": "2025-09-09T18:40:03", "owner": "nate.hurr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911281864200647, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-09T16:21:55", "owner": "hari.bury", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17893423320302727, "text": "Lets go party Barbie with some meth then I toss you to the homies", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:09:29", "owner": "doejoe2124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055117082624631, "text": "This song is hot garbage", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:34:05", "owner": "staypureforjesus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294235180269156, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:24:39", "owner": "horvath_agoston", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101786200613213, "text": "Yea they hated it because it’s blatant copyright infringement", "created_at": "2025-09-08T21:20:12", "owner": "yourteacher100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323226721238247, "text": "Lip sync from a terrible band", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:09:27", "owner": "smokeiam545", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073775204081924, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:48:09", "owner": "henry_v_2000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918424534039076, "text": "It’s kinda creepy", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:45:41", "owner": "oncloud_ix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371020720196609, "text": "Mannnnnn, the 90s were just too good.  We, who lived through the 90s, were so spoiled", "created_at": "2025-09-07T23:13:19", "owner": "ipickbadusernames", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074707651864870, "text": "It was…very cold in that venue 😳", "created_at": "2025-09-07T02:40:27", "owner": "some_midwest_dude", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920357752117167, "text": "My favourite actor tune has to be DOCTOR JONES, doctor jones, jones calling doctor jones, doctor jones. Doctor jones, get to not!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:16:20", "owner": "adhd_carp_freak_84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081663848507558, "text": "She was nice, a looker.. very tidy,", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:28:36", "owner": "brothertonglenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968899065956806, "text": "dance-pop group Aqua.🇳🇴🇩🇰, «Barbie Girl\" - «I'm a Barbie girl in a Barbie world - Life in plastic, it's fantastic».!👍😁", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:37:01", "owner": "steenlarsenole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370793470182631, "text": "Make Titties Great Again 🦅🦅🇺🇸", "created_at": "2025-09-04T06:36:41", "owner": "d.ourique", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17938798464062939, "text": "You need to do: Unwound playing \"Envelope\" in someone's living room. It's about the hardest shizz I've ever seen. The universe cracked.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:51:13", "owner": "ricardo_antonio_dominguez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942155248028104, "text": "Call an ambulance, I think they're having a seizure.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T12:42:09", "owner": "zuckerbergisacumdumpster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999658383657034, "text": "Everyone needs to put those hands down. Might accidently grab those bra less tits (serious, check the hand level)", "created_at": "2025-09-03T06:24:34", "owner": "covfefe_guy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077266891944945, "text": "Guess they got over in time for The Barbie Movie.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T04:16:31", "owner": "wordbuilder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085680208860120, "text": "I’m fine with it", "created_at": "2025-09-02T21:04:56", "owner": "gregmatej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352774972083192, "text": "Love seeing that wind up camera hahahaha 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-02T18:12:38", "owner": "tealosxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066215852225525, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:44:03", "owner": "rednosepiggy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096696481651390, "text": "And then mettle used it for the movie years later lol", "created_at": "2025-09-02T16:04:46", "owner": "rgv_communion_956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050964614537578, "text": "Did they not have bra's in the wardrobe?", "created_at": "2025-09-02T09:14:13", "owner": "wenniez21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949071703010593, "text": "That's fucking lipsyncing, dumbass", "created_at": "2025-09-02T08:54:42", "owner": "randpdx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070070183133574, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-02T02:09:28", "owner": "rumble_brigade", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18080722981903156, "text": "iconic", "created_at": "2025-09-01T22:00:51", "owner": "serjiojitser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858126733491259, "text": "La leggenda vuole che la cantante fosse andata in coma per una serata a base d'alcol e di sborra....poi non so come sia andata a finire dio spompo", "created_at": "2025-09-01T21:53:46", "owner": "luculucis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122442091485713, "text": "Why is everyone talking about it being lipsynced when all the fukboi hiphop youre listening too is literal fake souless trash", "created_at": "2025-09-01T18:52:45", "owner": "yarinktonmcgwimsbury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855458530514652, "text": "Iconic", "created_at": "2025-09-01T17:40:06", "owner": "marchelogamez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053693318560603, "text": "I didn’t realize how hot she was", "created_at": "2025-09-01T16:26:14", "owner": "bamcooktx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126013627464047, "text": "dont even sing for real loll", "created_at": "2025-09-01T15:50:34", "owner": "jeanfrancoisdutremble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913439479179724, "text": "That freaking voice", "created_at": "2025-09-01T14:08:28", "owner": "draggin2jh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941564361924666, "text": "Bring back lip syncing", "created_at": "2025-09-01T13:46:56", "owner": "mfl_jr_0727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059543894081498, "text": "🙄", "created_at": "2025-09-01T00:45:26", "owner": "dpriz87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928995651982630, "text": "Probably one of the stupidest songs in the history of music. And I’m including the entire catalog of Yoko Ono.", "created_at": "2025-09-01T00:32:36", "owner": "gee53742", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998042589659133, "text": "This was basically Top of the Pop American edition", "created_at": "2025-09-01T00:14:15", "owner": "noneofficialaz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079587460756645, "text": "This came out my first year at uni. We loved it 😂.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T16:01:54", "owner": "sian_carvill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069640813922482, "text": "Slipknot concerts are wild", "created_at": "2025-08-31T14:35:51", "owner": "i_guess_ill_go_zuck_myself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066099584211200, "text": "Not a single word was sung that day.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T13:26:39", "owner": "nunoyobisnis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857145949501374, "text": "Best thing about this video is the Mario lemieux jersey", "created_at": "2025-08-31T11:29:02", "owner": "chrishallam81", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057523853527377, "text": "@bonita_applebum93 @sandra_on_tour", "created_at": "2025-08-31T09:03:29", "owner": "akifnola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136674007430241, "text": "Literally nothing in that song justified her going so hard with the lipsync", "created_at": "2025-08-31T00:39:44", "owner": "eszterlivesandpaints", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015516350780977, "text": "ai tempi mi sembrava na 💩… poi sono arrivati ti pompi moderni eeeee voilá… diventata poesia 😅", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:38:30", "owner": "leo.bert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064166984252638, "text": "Even metalheads moshed to this 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-30T18:12:28", "owner": "caveman855", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980785701887418, "text": "She can lip sync all day if she gonna look that good.", "created_at": "2025-08-30T17:29:34", "owner": "scottievsg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069187847331634, "text": "She's hot ....but it isn't live . Full on lip synching", "created_at": "2025-08-30T17:19:17", "owner": "whitehouse.steve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077126188954049, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-30T16:32:53", "owner": "des_kassandrou_bujournalista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059811038081425, "text": "I was not happy with this song as well.", "created_at": "2025-08-30T16:20:33", "owner": "2des", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340206835165612, "text": "@annchristin_ebbing @isi_pugge @r.bruinenberg  Yes this is the real deal 🤛🏻", "created_at": "2025-08-30T15:53:44", "owner": "duikerdre", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18038131676459283, "text": "Unforgettable concert, impeccable playback and lip syncing!", "created_at": "2025-08-30T15:28:13", "owner": "un.impresssed", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18090197359688492, "text": "Dreck", "created_at": "2025-08-30T14:49:11", "owner": "pitzralf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199695475313133, "text": "This shit is embarrassing", "created_at": "2025-08-30T12:11:02", "owner": "steel_city_strangler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528462529062879, "text": "Anybody know what that hockey jersey is? The drummers got a Mario Lemieux jersey but that other one is... intriguing.", "created_at": "2025-08-30T11:10:11", "owner": "rory_allan_meditz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125670574467927, "text": "I hate this song so much 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-30T11:09:50", "owner": "zdenekzara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988839018702882, "text": "Pile of shite", "created_at": "2025-08-30T08:54:38", "owner": "plyplanet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279849376278550, "text": "She thinks she’s Gwen Stefani seeing ‘Just a Girl’ but she’s really whoever she is singing whatever that is. 😐", "created_at": "2025-08-30T07:54:48", "owner": "davidtdunlop", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051248534243031, "text": "Horrible lip sync", "created_at": "2025-08-30T07:02:41", "owner": "xcompanionx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971388129781361, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-30T06:36:10", "owner": "d3mon3y3s_505", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18358396483086120, "text": "🤮", "created_at": "2025-08-30T00:15:02", "owner": "marksand81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124466632473330, "text": "Is the drummer proto zoa from zenon ? Who knew he started as a drummer🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-29T23:09:04", "owner": "johnrhiger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076647779015845, "text": "Who???", "created_at": "2025-08-29T21:13:46", "owner": "la_famiglia_artuso", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18172603306356806, "text": "Love the drummer rockin the Lemieux jeresy", "created_at": "2025-08-29T19:39:56", "owner": "steffen.p.08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046994987644484, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-29T15:12:32", "owner": "d_g_p_83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139563784423435, "text": "Love that Lemieux jersey!", "created_at": "2025-08-29T13:57:57", "owner": "jimmy_hulse", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17990631554837396, "text": "Playback… 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-29T13:34:39", "owner": "vincentpeltieroff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291099520249693, "text": "Wait until Mattel hear from Nanowar of Steel 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-29T12:28:24", "owner": "mario.lanfranchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058978847097336, "text": "❄️👌", "created_at": "2025-08-29T08:53:34", "owner": "aaron415sf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056235218139194, "text": "Still can’t believe a song that almost got Barbie canceled ended up being her official anthem 😂🎶 Life in plastic really IS fantastic!", "created_at": "2025-08-29T07:19:55", "owner": "arturodrums.krk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117010312506911, "text": "And then begged her to use it in the new Barbie movie.", "created_at": "2025-08-29T03:04:04", "owner": "david_trebell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074810969008825, "text": "The Mario Lemieux jersey 🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:22:24", "owner": "c_cirillo_rn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053401070621168, "text": "The drummer wearing the Lemieux jersey is peak for me", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:11:01", "owner": "flightmighttonight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374133547176644, "text": "👌👌😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T21:58:00", "owner": "king_of_floridsdorf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524508745037629, "text": "Thank you, gravity.😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T20:04:40", "owner": "pbg_hh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897597937141930, "text": "Female singer has crazy face card", "created_at": "2025-08-28T18:45:28", "owner": "thanasis_drvn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312585229243857, "text": "This was already crap when it came out 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T16:19:11", "owner": "bomb903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109478764548651, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:59:15", "owner": "_xmacabrex_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082106350925120, "text": "I keep seeing people say lip syncing was the thing for totp but this performance isn't totp", "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:02:51", "owner": "16_bit_gamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060122852342960, "text": "If you ever felt useless, check the drummer at the back 😄", "created_at": "2025-08-28T08:44:47", "owner": "adyman13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303583822216404, "text": "No the world wasn’t fucking shite", "created_at": "2025-08-28T05:35:29", "owner": "303tb909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107585890555149, "text": "Front row dodging kicks: 🫷✊️🤛👊🙅‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-28T03:37:09", "owner": "feetured_you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020822663559947, "text": "They paid to hear the radio play their song", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:38:54", "owner": "tyler_gnosis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096818539714083, "text": "This live is so much better than how they tried to sell this 30 years ago.", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:07:28", "owner": "gueroayres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316956481215151, "text": "I would still like to see them", "created_at": "2025-08-28T00:10:04", "owner": "chrisdbyrd78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036296006476072, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-27T22:11:00", "owner": "centralvalleyvinylrecords", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17878527759391933, "text": "Jugalos was already a thing? 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T21:00:21", "owner": "stevebaumberger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951703881991439, "text": "how fucking embarassing. they must look back and think......why?..", "created_at": "2025-08-27T19:24:48", "owner": "r.rob.roberts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528049993002351, "text": "One of the dumbest songs ever written", "created_at": "2025-08-27T18:40:09", "owner": "westsidebobbyg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075969737005090, "text": "“Unforgettable concerts” — plays a lypsynced live performance of Barbie Girl.", "created_at": "2025-08-27T17:22:26", "owner": "jbake98144", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081736492911272, "text": "Take your bra off!", "created_at": "2025-08-27T16:14:18", "owner": "kennydemartini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075842156293584, "text": "Lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T15:38:04", "owner": "777iamgrantworthy777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529684837019291, "text": "no wonder he hated it, its a girl song.", "created_at": "2025-08-27T15:22:16", "owner": "_gungeligung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971106999922394, "text": "Wish version of Pitbull and Gwen Stefani", "created_at": "2025-08-27T15:18:09", "owner": "matt.pax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860952295413087, "text": "Shitty music and a shitty band", "created_at": "2025-08-27T13:20:13", "owner": "dustinrb1982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985137531707507, "text": "I imagined her to be a blonde, she probably is naturally", "created_at": "2025-08-27T12:12:27", "owner": "bitcoingator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076934408482164, "text": "Jeder der Gäste dürfte sein Leben lang nur noch dieses Lied hören.", "created_at": "2025-08-27T11:00:32", "owner": "denzelkowalski66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085121590676343, "text": "Concert...", "created_at": "2025-08-27T09:42:16", "owner": "the_retro_photographer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059818442093259, "text": "I fuckin hate the 90s Radio dance songs", "created_at": "2025-08-27T05:41:35", "owner": "stefet666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078702056494211, "text": "Isn't that Vanessa Bayer?😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T03:36:33", "owner": "huberbart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055414811153841, "text": "Strange how it sounds exactly like the album….", "created_at": "2025-08-26T22:56:02", "owner": "brooksanddumb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949830351882582, "text": "Sweet Jesus how we hated that song back in the days..... Now we laugh 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T21:46:27", "owner": "tor.skaare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051072014542098, "text": "Everything on top of the pops was lip synced. It wasn’t a secret. The guitars didn’t even have cables 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T15:27:26", "owner": "smcheart", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18076340327001492, "text": "Boobz 😮", "created_at": "2025-08-26T12:03:58", "owner": "joph_dfy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069184022164959, "text": "This is 100% forgettable.", "created_at": "2025-08-26T11:39:08", "owner": "jeeping_joseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071975287893601, "text": "Respect for the Lemieux jersey 🐧", "created_at": "2025-08-26T06:38:08", "owner": "cogitator_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966599508956881, "text": "Nicole Kidman?", "created_at": "2025-08-26T05:33:16", "owner": "hopslvr314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978465066904488, "text": "Great time to be alive.", "created_at": "2025-08-26T03:19:06", "owner": "royal_grizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075116153286369, "text": "Horrible song", "created_at": "2025-08-26T02:02:05", "owner": "kontrerasjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199363615312508, "text": "Not got at the lip sync.", "created_at": "2025-08-26T01:20:18", "owner": "destacados_uno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047028926315967, "text": "Sucked then, sucks now.", "created_at": "2025-08-25T23:57:59", "owner": "3bbeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090542167785025, "text": "Corney but it sells 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-25T22:58:57", "owner": "627_luka_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076042447950423, "text": "Big No to this crap", "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:54:56", "owner": "tumbledown91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094593268643932, "text": "@marta.err 1:1", "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:49:56", "owner": "krisiaczke_misiaczke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891982066182366, "text": "A great pop song, in a time before lip syncing was cool.", "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:46:22", "owner": "gavin.bamallm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111361351525112, "text": "Mattel US sued them, Mattel Europe promoted the song, go figure.", "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:43:35", "owner": "wersamurai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115862323507136, "text": "I have the volume turned off but who ever that girl is singing is putting  on a show. She definitely came to put on a show", "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:23:54", "owner": "jamalburgess77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108331420555135, "text": "Que de souvenirs", "created_at": "2025-08-25T13:16:31", "owner": "lulub_erlu67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882231055362827, "text": "when your drummer wears that jersey, you are beyond mere mortal criticism.", "created_at": "2025-08-25T12:09:21", "owner": "mastermind6000", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096910756719706, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-25T12:03:45", "owner": "beyond_the_black_horizon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17905562325096146, "text": "They hated it so much they used it in the movie.. 🤔", "created_at": "2025-08-25T08:55:23", "owner": "jett949", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18064219271261541, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-25T08:27:03", "owner": "manowarrior_ger", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17849608191541520, "text": "She was hot AF", "created_at": "2025-08-25T00:47:37", "owner": "mortgageservices678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073530944101432, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-08-24T22:26:33", "owner": "markusweberimmobilien.de", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094488718638887, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-24T20:04:05", "owner": "onni_koukkari_", "likes": 187}, {"id": 17862078720462011, "text": "Pretty sure that's @joshpatecfb", "created_at": "2025-08-24T19:35:47", "owner": "mlaw565", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102736849585762, "text": "Full Playback 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-24T18:47:08", "owner": "fernando.umpierrez.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103688077572228, "text": "Man that song sucked.", "created_at": "2025-08-24T13:20:38", "owner": "krycek_2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891081091327436, "text": "Cocain is a hell of a drug", "created_at": "2025-08-24T08:55:04", "owner": "watchtower177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113478544506926, "text": "Oof I remember when people use to rock that drummers hairstyle lol", "created_at": "2025-08-24T08:20:27", "owner": "anarcho_gato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880339321262211, "text": "I want that jersey.", "created_at": "2025-08-24T04:53:35", "owner": "nilbogdeadite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036134291475289, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-24T02:41:23", "owner": "josenaughty1969", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18159553654372941, "text": "I am old enough to remember Lynne and Tessa's lip sync version.", "created_at": "2025-08-24T01:45:06", "owner": "neilamstutz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928173591983111, "text": "Is she singing that?", "created_at": "2025-08-23T23:23:40", "owner": "zi0m99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085558315882927, "text": "I cant belive someone paid for this...🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-23T18:51:09", "owner": "mikalilleberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885387865350953, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-23T15:12:14", "owner": "nicolinadevine", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18519530668001439, "text": "Peak 90's", "created_at": "2025-08-23T08:45:54", "owner": "guerrilla_hoop", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17960337200986836, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-23T07:44:22", "owner": "preet.sagar_1k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054485570174991, "text": "🇩🇰🇩🇰🇩🇰", "created_at": "2025-08-23T07:10:22", "owner": "frk.susannes_side", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054903566408007, "text": "🤍", "created_at": "2025-08-23T05:39:25", "owner": "adeliger_hirschman", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17907625995212339, "text": "She was so fit", "created_at": "2025-08-22T20:00:20", "owner": "profmesser", "likes": 9}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["aqua", "barbiegirl", "1997pop", "bubblegumpop", "europopclassic", "barbieanthem", "musiccontroversy", "popculturehistory", "lifeinplastic", "it"]},
{"media_id": 3712859385799747017, "shortcode": "DOGufCXkaXJ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOGufCXkaXJ/", "taken_at": "2025-09-02T15:40:53", "caption": "JOIN US AND SEE US @ THE CLUB FAIR 😃\n\n#chineseclub #school #club #clubfair", "owner_username": "jenkschineseclub", "owner_id": "8568900266", "likes": 23797, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0062_DOGufCXkaXJ\\DOGufCXkaXJ_20250902_154053.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17910852987086650, "text": "Ok but where’s the Chinese", "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:51:40", "owner": "connorsaidhey", "likes": 5887}, {"id": 18115368250546811, "text": "Are the Chinese in the club with us ?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T13:37:24", "owner": "emsnotreal", "likes": 2964}, {"id": 18055588259628671, "text": "No it’s fine, I just didn’t think Chinese club would be white", "created_at": "2025-09-30T18:27:31", "owner": "ayo_boyo", "likes": 8444}, {"id": 18139491730436474, "text": "looking for the chinese in chinese club", "created_at": "2025-09-30T04:36:07", "owner": "maddierep", "likes": 5711}, {"id": 18067936019211078, "text": "Okay so….Maybe my small Chinese eyes aren’t working but where is the Chinese in the Chinese club", "created_at": "2025-10-02T03:23:05", "owner": "piercetheemma.0", "likes": 1939}, {"id": 18064394132607353, "text": "wow LOOK AT ALL THOSE CHINESE PEOPLE!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:57:01", "owner": "aeon.wye", "likes": 871}, {"id": 18118238908509370, "text": "Chinese club??? What for 😭😭😭 (I’m Chinese)", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:50:31", "owner": "aokos_room", "likes": 279}, {"id": 17928970620099276, "text": "Let’s go china 🇰🇷", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:12:42", "owner": "l0_0gn", "likes": 787}, {"id": 18138664258440290, "text": "i wanna go so badly", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:45:23", "owner": "leokitaenn", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18058357349119268, "text": "Yo this reel made me want to join chinese club", "created_at": "2025-09-02T22:56:40", "owner": "oliviajolie14", "likes": 531}, {"id": 18081498043944670, "text": "真的", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:45:50", "owner": "oliversfarthouse", "likes": 96}, {"id": 18028245251528053, "text": "Chat, it’s probably Chinese language, most likely mandarin", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:53:54", "owner": "the.mhadd", "likes": 588}, {"id": 17926671543129174, "text": "我可以有你的微信吗", "created_at": "2025-10-02T01:50:56", "owner": "char.siu.bao.bao", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092084329837618, "text": "as the former vp of a college chinese club i am pleasantly surprised to see chinese club content on my fyp", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:59:42", "owner": "allegivnt", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18099584431538323, "text": "Yeah I’m def poppin up to Chinese club", "created_at": "2025-09-02T20:57:22", "owner": "coleusmasterous", "likes": 321}, {"id": 18072673730469866, "text": "Yknow for Chinese club you'd expect to see a bit more of yellow", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:49:44", "owner": "yuanyuan_actual", "likes": 81}, {"id": 18061361837420293, "text": "i don’t like this comment section", "created_at": "2025-10-06T22:42:17", "owner": "peachyeinna", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18532598854053477, "text": "非常酷的视频", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:22:28", "owner": "hyrumswenson", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17850814575522705, "text": "你好", "created_at": "2025-09-30T03:07:36", "owner": "leesfrotho", "likes": 121}, {"id": 17903449005316724, "text": "Bold of you to assume they aren’t at a very Chinese time in their life", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:27:57", "owner": "woe.is.meow", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18022266254570312, "text": "我每天都會對習近平鹿管", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:25:40", "owner": "yuioper_is_epic", "likes": 222}, {"id": 18189850447325445, "text": "are the chinese people in the room with us?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:43:29", "owner": "chensteatime", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17851651602555292, "text": "y’all wasian or smth? 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:08:39", "owner": "notjamesqian", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17853889617544259, "text": "Yo where da chinese at?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:59:56", "owner": "everesttyf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17997480797826369, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:25:17", "owner": "kylefloraa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062189759571559, "text": "Lowk this club would be fire for @andre_triv what do you think @owen.lum ?", "created_at": "2025-10-26T07:50:04", "owner": "the_jangster72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986651640892443, "text": "不揪", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:42:41", "owner": "chenxu_0831", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984573210894927, "text": "where the chinese at tho? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:37:22", "owner": "manny.ming", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18430964965098110, "text": "I think I'm color blind", "created_at": "2025-11-04T22:16:29", "owner": "mr_jcampbell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18357944392084014, "text": "Xi is happy", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:21:57", "owner": "tuyhl", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18000725036819516, "text": "Why are there five Caucasian dudes in the Chinese club😭", "created_at": "2025-10-09T00:52:39", "owner": "fangbozhu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027218645773890, "text": "我破壞了一個狗狗的洞", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:11:04", "owner": "yeah._right7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18478819870079076, "text": "為什麼要這樣😨", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:01:17", "owner": "birdy_alley", "likes": 58}, {"id": 17849405100584345, "text": "Previous Chinese club was not diverse enough. New Chinese club more diverse.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T16:38:10", "owner": "xgon_givit2you", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981369660768063, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:39:20", "owner": "luohanfish", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061942043185941, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:01:49", "owner": "kev1n_feng", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18170034901367240, "text": "Their eyes are too big to be in that club, what’s going on", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:44:11", "owner": "03darren_", "likes": 528}, {"id": 17845573656584163, "text": "Dllm😊", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:00:18", "owner": "james_is_a_monke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080489468109151, "text": "chinese bully white club🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:06:10", "owner": "theres2chinas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137496037453800, "text": "Where the Chinese at", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:29:03", "owner": "nick.cyu", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18024857489573405, "text": "super difficult club🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:36:52", "owner": "jmkyleee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051918569293676, "text": "Something’s missing", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:59:25", "owner": "mateo.lloyd_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085025486485331, "text": "ni haoo fine shy-oh wait there are none here", "created_at": "2025-10-18T01:07:25", "owner": "konradhedges", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866415730461251, "text": "简直了", "created_at": "2025-09-29T04:38:10", "owner": "ramennoodless", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18094918429616408, "text": "on mondays they like to do orange chicken mondays and kung pao beef tuesdays", "created_at": "2025-10-07T15:59:28", "owner": "joowahn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18196567324315987, "text": "Can I join :000", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:11:34", "owner": "samuel.yzr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005935274802164, "text": "@imhot.88 哪里有中国人？？", "created_at": "2025-10-08T23:32:46", "owner": "isabella_thompson88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058560227156706, "text": "Let’s go China!!! 🇹🇼", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:37:53", "owner": "0829._.daniel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946537714023636, "text": "nihao fine shyt", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:27:56", "owner": "thevishcheung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079096742043157, "text": "they must be new members, they haven't become Chinese yet", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:20:44", "owner": "manoahzxl", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18312478213173363, "text": "China LETS GOOOOO 🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2025-10-06T05:21:19", "owner": "jry_2333", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17978648534768058, "text": "are the chinese in the club with us?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T03:05:33", "owner": "ben.jae.lee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963183255833615, "text": "They murdered him", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:54:37", "owner": "weatherman2025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060032624437686, "text": "Chinese club但是不招华人😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:04:58", "owner": "steveqi915", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18363702391157476, "text": "You don’t have to be Chinese to learn Chinese??? Why would people be upset at learning a language lol", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:36:50", "owner": "rooftop_asian", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18137439037398709, "text": "没有中国人教你们整活儿吗", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:38:19", "owner": "wiiaki7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893675929341330, "text": "Chigga", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:49:06", "owner": "duc.hieu_83", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082871518786557, "text": "konnichiwa yo", "created_at": "2025-10-06T03:37:11", "owner": "eyeballynn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067914329018070, "text": "为什么有没有中国人", "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:41:29", "owner": "abbynegley", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17894869230331189, "text": "Yalllll stopppppp 😂😂😂 these kids just wanna learn Chinese let emmmm", "created_at": "2025-10-05T22:07:29", "owner": "lil.scallion.pancake", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024989276536469, "text": "are yall feeling a little more chinese today", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:35:35", "owner": "janaemeilin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18327850675232444, "text": "99个未接来电", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:06:48", "owner": "jason_dunks055", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18003990422805149, "text": "Where all Chinese now 🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:51:06", "owner": "stdach445", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387310576134153, "text": "Chinese club but non of them speak mando...", "created_at": "2025-09-30T20:40:01", "owner": "marcus_16888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106972792583814, "text": "Theyve successfully colonized the Chinese club 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:53:14", "owner": "b_loofintuna", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17910723981219936, "text": "only one asian in the entire club", "created_at": "2025-10-02T18:20:19", "owner": "erenzcrazy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053653154254308, "text": "“We riding with mark cause mark riding with us”", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:29:14", "owner": "yea_drew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044674340386223, "text": "Can Chinese people go also", "created_at": "2025-10-03T05:28:15", "owner": "master.andrew0604", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18358344442089228, "text": "Chinese club does not have any Chinese members?...", "created_at": "2025-10-04T00:36:10", "owner": "hao.tan_1231", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089914114675519, "text": "中国人呢？？？", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:25:02", "owner": "frostedlogic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968181288806062, "text": "六七", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:50:32", "owner": "tok_.ki", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18031765874710240, "text": "太棒了", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:14:58", "owner": "650.astridddraooo", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17845474137565117, "text": "where is the chinese", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:47:24", "owner": "yh.ge", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18008392808684094, "text": "我碾过一个四口之家......😢", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:03:52", "owner": "newyorksuperrat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078662695993726, "text": "What do yall talk about", "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:10:52", "owner": "alicia.pain", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066421532350856, "text": "喔！！歡迎認識😍", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:54:32", "owner": "anna_212_918918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525341734001626, "text": "嘻嘻🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:57:00", "owner": "huoweiqi9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051982976558013, "text": "这啥啊，中文小组吗", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:43:10", "owner": "lucas_350c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965124504985612, "text": "面白い🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:39:41", "owner": "matsuri.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958191010002759, "text": "好的👌🏻我回来参加", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:26:50", "owner": "9usir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089202514886115, "text": "英文比較重要🙂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:56:22", "owner": "ljk_6969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18224193379306336, "text": "中文是你們觸及不道的領域", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:42:47", "owner": "ed_warrrrrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974676273780863, "text": "復興中華", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:20:40", "owner": "andurarumlilith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186508804331517, "text": "我会去的❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹放心", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:53:23", "owner": "angry.civilian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178950877346549, "text": "拉倒吧你", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:30:04", "owner": "yubo_not_the_app", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289614244253511, "text": "SURE THING ☺️👍", "created_at": "2025-09-02T20:43:13", "owner": "0ctober2004_pumkinspiceseason", "likes": 44}, {"id": 18124506214493484, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-02T08:11:47", "owner": "probro_tim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964680204824952, "text": "我中文很皓❤️不用去", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:03:27", "owner": "kirovistok", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063561620028974, "text": "😭😭 you guys are so creative!!", "created_at": "2025-09-02T19:58:05", "owner": "vunngg", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17883316524390328, "text": "They identify as chinese", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:41:11", "owner": "sidaanla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18191488720322692, "text": "你会说中文吗？", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:34:08", "owner": "musimix_pmd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055181936626314, "text": "So there is no Chinese in Chinese club 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:33:36", "owner": "lanegranky", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078111829991372, "text": "在那裡啊？", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:17:05", "owner": "ree.dreamii_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075562658275577, "text": "Ni hao", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:02:07", "owner": "marcohohoho1215", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17871940134355257, "text": "@_am_nahrt @h0ockikilig", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:45:40", "owner": "vhha1305", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18302942701260993, "text": "I support", "created_at": "2025-12-20T18:25:17", "owner": "beyoncesfather", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877224634449645, "text": "NI HAO FINE SHIT 🫰🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:22:44", "owner": "laoganmatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882202438327113, "text": "The Chinese are the friends we made along", "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:17:25", "owner": "zoengryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988903608750742, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:47:19", "owner": "janiczrn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381322141157831, "text": "Come to sydney, the chinese club is every club 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:47:35", "owner": "simonblazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108420292715690, "text": "Wait are you guys talking about normal club?", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:50:31", "owner": "danjokess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112355920611032, "text": "They not like us - Kendrick Lamar", "created_at": "2025-12-18T05:03:27", "owner": "rextse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384683830199679, "text": "Do you eat batsoup and gutter oil for authentic chinese experience?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T00:08:29", "owner": "mr.yeast069", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113618962592967, "text": "First AND second lunch? What?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:05:13", "owner": "y.zh_ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999125382839232, "text": "You met me at a very Chinese time in my life", "created_at": "2025-12-15T18:23:03", "owner": "diego_beitak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054320438671642, "text": "Can the Chinese join said Chinese club?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T05:21:43", "owner": "l8rslauren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964073052992329, "text": "it's actually a Chinese food club", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:31:03", "owner": "mdrideout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102104614836268, "text": "哈哈好的", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:28:04", "owner": "stevethach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340454062237800, "text": "Blink twice if the chinese is in the room with us", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:05:21", "owner": "notansonnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433431325105770, "text": "I just call it \"club\". Just a look into how Chinese I've become", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:47:07", "owner": "jacobpile22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886266055287467, "text": "Why is there unflavored chicken breast muncher’s in the video where the fuck is the people of the motherland?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:26:35", "owner": "grimmreaperty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995314656706676, "text": "Bunch of people hating on kids who are taking an interest in other countries are the same haters who watch Anime dubbed.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:38:09", "owner": "rikitoogawa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195980296333296, "text": "This is incredibly Rachel Berry coded. I support it", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:25:53", "owner": "laurz_jackson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980067012783905, "text": "Don’t come to school tomorrow", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:26:27", "owner": "vedderplet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097367125893343, "text": "nihaody 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:56:58", "owner": "higglefur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089467702772604, "text": "What", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:46:33", "owner": "victor_delrosario.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116659408579417, "text": "China number one 🇺🇸", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:38:18", "owner": "rep_entourage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091908041499702, "text": "This school definitely teaches the war of northern aggression", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:37:53", "owner": "eats_pandas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424587598117760, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:07:47", "owner": "myrt1e_turtle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902328535316763, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:05:09", "owner": "spe_henry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014540129801143, "text": "At this point, I just call it the “club”.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:29:13", "owner": "ethan.crane11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411189946190948, "text": "是的！！我爱中国，到处都是中国！", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:05:41", "owner": "iluvyoonchanyoung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060316190258980, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:04:43", "owner": "leoxu_sketch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296351923274107, "text": "I'm in such a Chinese phase of life that I just call it club", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:56:39", "owner": "brianswannn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086132813088983, "text": "Where have Chinese club?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:38:21", "owner": "ryan_06_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052434938356394, "text": "Do that hadilao dance", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:29:16", "owner": "vinhtoan.you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881573590424330, "text": "中国人在哪里？我只看到白人", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:16:54", "owner": "aidenwpurdy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987787488747611, "text": "Guys why would a Chinese person want to join that club", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:54:22", "owner": "williambailey_is_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002894336831818, "text": "why Chinese but not Vietnamese club 🥀🥀🥀awww", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:34:48", "owner": "_callmeray.ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901575967324636, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:58:19", "owner": "staticpant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072888188248494, "text": "so true", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:14:39", "owner": "chinese_xcx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949492305918251, "text": "歡迎來中華文化俱樂部～", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:59:36", "owner": "lan.yu8583", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859671142544131, "text": "Taiwanese here 大家好", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:25:57", "owner": "lift_1211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105886744651368, "text": "We Chiggermaxxing", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:16:38", "owner": "henhen.calico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095870674830151, "text": "我也想来", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:14:46", "owner": "russ79060", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069394757607891, "text": "So where exactly is this high school", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:11:04", "owner": "alanl.1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889439878379583, "text": "我也想来", "created_at": "2025-11-11T03:29:05", "owner": "movant_sss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431038762100020, "text": "this is the most whitest thing I have ever seen.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T00:40:25", "owner": "renowned_playa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105948022714957, "text": "Ni hao", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:43:44", "owner": "waverynigga478", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107991271527598, "text": "Secret ccp meeting at club fair during first and second lunch on Wednesday and Thursday (totally unrelated)", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:59:51", "owner": "tactical_possum1776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055890752302108, "text": "哦有人在学习中文吗，我可以帮你", "created_at": "2025-11-09T03:49:56", "owner": "nerdii115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304363828249001, "text": "Dllm is thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:41:45", "owner": "sophie._.0195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047579537675125, "text": "Dllm 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:41:37", "owner": "sophie._.0195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087775654754785, "text": "bro back in early 2000s I used to get picked on and beat for being Asian at my elementary and middle school. im glad we’re more accepted now.", "created_at": "2025-11-07T21:16:56", "owner": "50cao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992165616711959, "text": "So Chinese is the ceramic stuffs…\nOr Chinese “Chinese“\n!?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:11:30", "owner": "decadent_host", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317980630168468, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T22:38:50", "owner": "plusultra.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368698636159649, "text": "Sum ting wong in this club", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:15:06", "owner": "ljx_samuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919834024055448, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:13:38", "owner": "ljx_samuel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058815359216693, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:27:17", "owner": "qiuyuan9592024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910997329100980, "text": "Where the Chinese", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:16:53", "owner": "ashv0326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053258030325242, "text": "生鱼片是死鱼片 生前是死前", "created_at": "2025-10-31T07:39:42", "owner": "ansonwolf96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084882253805161, "text": "Looks like if I sign up I will be the only Chinese 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T22:06:02", "owner": "rockchen99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912743011235045, "text": "黑👻", "created_at": "2025-10-27T15:13:15", "owner": "kirayoshikagay69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046528016402752, "text": "Say it in mandarin or Cantonese", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:04:18", "owner": "heye.615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871024489449854, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-10-25T19:16:45", "owner": "ldc._.ldc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981229110764518, "text": "ni howdy", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:58:43", "owner": "joshi.toshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976087221936243, "text": "Getting Chin ease", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:00:11", "owner": "skiynot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088476187921660, "text": "I would go but at the same time i dont want to", "created_at": "2025-10-22T01:32:22", "owner": "big_vue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083889853977012, "text": "在哪兄弟🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:46:20", "owner": "lovebigcoollili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100759579658422, "text": "You no speak Chinese!", "created_at": "2025-10-21T06:40:48", "owner": "lord.d1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082537427286635, "text": "NO SAVEHIM HE DI NOTBING WRONGG NOOOO HELP HIM", "created_at": "2025-10-21T05:05:58", "owner": "offjayplays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953560914892095, "text": "相信我中文不好玩", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:10:20", "owner": "howardchan1103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018743378606052, "text": "U need a chinese for ur Club?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:29:33", "owner": "thatasian11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974241330946547, "text": "WHAT？", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:24:37", "owner": "yl._0711_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082321603981703, "text": "+1000000 social credit", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:00:33", "owner": "rssr2442", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052641131322117, "text": "中文？白人现在学会了中文？我操", "created_at": "2025-10-17T21:19:15", "owner": "j_yu77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044962772391803, "text": "請問怎麼報名？", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:37:58", "owner": "ping_lulululu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403416895189726, "text": "I'm Chinese and seeing white people doing this just fried me 😂💕🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T13:27:20", "owner": "queerismyjam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070266401264530, "text": "這是你要找的中文留言👌", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:52:54", "owner": "abbeychen.0207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095300146773603, "text": "Chinese club 🇬🇧🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:04:40", "owner": "lilliam.win", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108928375601844, "text": "Guys, I’m sure the club is based around the language, not being chinese", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:20:09", "owner": "rishis_573", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978872325921602, "text": "Not to be rude, but I am genuinely very confused and curious. I even viewed this profile and the comments, and it seems legit. Am I seeing things correctly? Am I dreaming? Is this real? Is this a joke? What’s happening? Can the author please explain?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:16:51", "owner": "g_wangopedia.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063887591591791, "text": "Holding up pieces of paper at Chinese club is slightly ironic", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:41:58", "owner": "19_joe_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890429620226664, "text": "Bro got Tiananmen'd", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:41:35", "owner": "19_joe_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856127566540071, "text": "他不值得这样对待😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:15:39", "owner": "1ychnng_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974728473931472, "text": "发生了什么事？", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:34:24", "owner": "rammsteinshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064379963098741, "text": "确实，别来。一群吃饱了撑着没事干的白左。", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:51:27", "owner": "ogga_420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891126988356990, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈很可爱的宣传", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:43:08", "owner": "enkashunn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070746224189698, "text": "Aw good for them. They’re interested in learning! Some absolute psychos in the comments.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:49:24", "owner": "demach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298186144265381, "text": "太棒了", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:48:21", "owner": "cly._1028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086391326497106, "text": "中國人變白了", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:32:26", "owner": "tehihihi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075608252163498, "text": "Where is this at? Is it in Australia?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T00:40:05", "owner": "big_teaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085052356750857, "text": "Chinese people read the red “don’t” so they didn’t 🙈🙉🙊💁‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-08T18:58:46", "owner": "shenshenkj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085524293508523, "text": "I think they took the Chinese outta of it may just be clubbing", "created_at": "2025-10-08T18:41:50", "owner": "__chengster__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962181930992184, "text": "Operated by white btw", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:53:48", "owner": "l1p61.02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058201796535804, "text": "Can I join?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:05:34", "owner": "hsiungyunko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107400550602236, "text": "同志们好? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:51:47", "owner": "sherrys.world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080763832972196, "text": "I would come 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-07T07:59:24", "owner": "how__when", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972773112792013, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-07T05:54:07", "owner": "manuelm1998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115216297473740, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T05:25:57", "owner": "bentley_truong26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984575835878966, "text": "RIP dont", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:45:58", "owner": "aloebrion.kom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343303420165308, "text": "Did they stuff the Chinese in the locker😂?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:48:46", "owner": "yilangdeng2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080540971815637, "text": "Why do we not have this club😠😠", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:48:36", "owner": "fj.1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936805242962027, "text": "So exciting!!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:57:44", "owner": "isley_batson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303903928218185, "text": "boutta hear the most whitewashed Chinese ever", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:29:18", "owner": "bumblbeesnflowers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029642396721294, "text": "chinese club being white is killing me", "created_at": "2025-10-05T19:39:36", "owner": "ellieng3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072874954940929, "text": "Ill be there!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:40:57", "owner": "qiu.qiu.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057551024447230, "text": "This ad was Tough, ppl are tripping in the comment section , it’s a mf school club anyone can join and everyone should be welcomed.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:50:01", "owner": "kevtran8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420620062129572, "text": "為什麼", "created_at": "2025-10-05T14:59:34", "owner": "dai_suki17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852426583512262, "text": "做得好", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:26:18", "owner": "titlis_joe_happy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041446958459489, "text": "Hmm right bellow this video is the Japanese club", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:47:09", "owner": "whatacatchkonny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088758055870479, "text": "Mind if we speak a little bit of Chinese on Friday?💔🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:10:26", "owner": "wilson12_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895458457336606, "text": "牛逼", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:07:53", "owner": "avaj1214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895568347181051, "text": "Teach Chinese for free!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:32:02", "owner": "judy_aespa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081704887815262, "text": "加油你們可以的👍", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:25:57", "owner": "dawn._.yawn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068855783267943, "text": "Cantonese club 在那裡？", "created_at": "2025-10-05T08:50:18", "owner": "0304_harley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941205310074600, "text": "summoned all the chinese peoplw", "created_at": "2025-10-05T07:55:05", "owner": "i4n.wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983739189900191, "text": "This reminds me of fresh off the boat", "created_at": "2025-10-05T05:06:40", "owner": "adventurous__adventures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177022930351750, "text": "搿个Chinese Club 哪能呒没中国人？", "created_at": "2025-10-05T04:32:11", "owner": "zichenwangmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064251296604466, "text": "bro i swear half the things youd be talking about is mandarin and panda express", "created_at": "2025-10-05T00:56:26", "owner": "pr0_testant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963160002976374, "text": "Where’s the Chinese? 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T23:03:25", "owner": "oscar.l22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325665178239490, "text": "Are people genuinely ignorant… it’s obviously a club to LEARN CHINESEE", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:52:08", "owner": "gauwbstauav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899654830293884, "text": "You’re USA Jenk high school?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T22:19:19", "owner": "melbourne_wangmaobang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085564634305515, "text": "why did they have to beat him😭", "created_at": "2025-10-04T21:33:23", "owner": "abexthewaterbottle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887535127365951, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-04T21:30:52", "owner": "caihongtang114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062745044103202, "text": "Feeling real Chinese lately", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:25:09", "owner": "jon.wan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885020377380054, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:00:33", "owner": "mr.lin3823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947968672023223, "text": "加油中文社", "created_at": "2025-10-04T00:57:30", "owner": "yiqing.lei05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114982189539171, "text": "好厉害👏", "created_at": "2025-10-03T23:46:40", "owner": "swaggyq2k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174662650360475, "text": "Does trump know you guys are doing this?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:49:51", "owner": "nilsirrah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914181001073116, "text": "吓？點解全部都係鬼佬", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:30:12", "owner": "https.st4rdrpz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112259503489120, "text": "六百六十六你们的中国人在哪里（大佐音）", "created_at": "2025-10-03T21:26:05", "owner": "ydakuan09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080252422823997, "text": "背後必有高人指點", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:26:23", "owner": "su3ao6fu06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053324639271728, "text": "早安", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:58:38", "owner": "momo._.ouo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076946084030362, "text": "Hello! we’d love to take your group to China! Give us a message so we can figure out a way", "created_at": "2025-10-03T08:20:18", "owner": "_beyondclassrooms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843297628582009, "text": "Wow I love this community", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:06:26", "owner": "kaynenigma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944071696054756, "text": "Where is this located?", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:04:06", "owner": "mistaluman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983004594912617, "text": "Why is it Chinese club and there is no Chinese kid??? Only white kids whaaaaaaaaat", "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:50:50", "owner": "ethan_dallaglio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080356819822396, "text": "Anyone need a c word pass?", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:49:23", "owner": "basedche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113448985540500, "text": "I wanna come", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:42:48", "owner": "jigglyjon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074070710142716, "text": "I've found this reel at a very Chinese time of my life.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:41:16", "owner": "wooch2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904734475122280, "text": "Ok, see you then", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:53:55", "owner": "squeakinc.games", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341459812204858, "text": "ni hao fine shyt", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:43:41", "owner": "blublubblubk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070997132233709, "text": "Delay no more! Join us NOW!", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:15:15", "owner": "yang.deway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865525156394870, "text": "China maxxing", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:13:03", "owner": "markappliar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953227003041528, "text": "The first rule of Chinese club.", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:25:50", "owner": "themarknewman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965294724968729, "text": "this is the reverse of US Math Olympiad Team😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:59:41", "owner": "faldo.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285796180277716, "text": "wheres the chinese 🫩 /j", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:29:49", "owner": "nahjay0509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960306468847428, "text": "Least obviously government funded group", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:40:36", "owner": "jatinsharma.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062733974609710, "text": "I’m a fan. Love from Singapore", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:57:41", "owner": "ycashzhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066863111348804, "text": "我可以加入嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:56:54", "owner": "justarandomgameboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877684642306823, "text": "0.5/7 Chinese", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:56:22", "owner": "pat07_os", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864024829488053, "text": "Silence the public 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:12:52", "owner": "ak_blessing1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900925561273527, "text": "Dude💀there are also no other than yellow guy in english clubs in china💀", "created_at": "2025-10-02T07:12:35", "owner": "popotan315_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18504674980070317, "text": "Oklahoma 有很多中国人", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:28:24", "owner": "happy_capppy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074701550129199, "text": "They had the one Chinese guy on the sidelines bruh 😭✌🏾", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:04:38", "owner": "sincerely.suqar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078646046042565, "text": "Not a single Chinese person in the Chinese club.....who will teach them dllm🥺", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:23:48", "owner": "dimi3936", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860953501498059, "text": "As an Asian community representative, I approve of this message. 👍", "created_at": "2025-10-02T03:47:13", "owner": "lets_laugh2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948453160030278, "text": "六七 六七 六七 六七", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:41:41", "owner": "min_.0629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081991918777206, "text": "六", "created_at": "2025-10-02T00:41:28", "owner": "min_.0629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066771827350486, "text": "ccp propaganda", "created_at": "2025-10-01T22:35:03", "owner": "metal.leaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 178693169494