100104063, "text": "wait…", "created_at": "2025-09-30T20:17:02", "owner": "shwimp_fwied_why", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861708298487603, "text": "这都不是我学校但我可能来吗", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:44:52", "owner": "jiehoooouang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055417664544347, "text": "Kk I’ll be there", "created_at": "2025-09-30T15:39:18", "owner": "ernestcdc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069388622219828, "text": "Not one of yall knows what Lao gan ma is", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:31:34", "owner": "toastedtoest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911872543211092, "text": "anything for the ecs 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:29:08", "owner": "ethan.yao13579", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18171095659317813, "text": "Is this… Jenks, Oklahoma? 😮", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:32:58", "owner": "martincye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025209764740874, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-09-02T21:32:59", "owner": "rice_destroyer1289", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17985432878718157, "text": "Yeah I’ll show up", "created_at": "2025-09-02T20:37:52", "owner": "ashtonstaxaphone", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["chineseclub", "school", "club", "clubfair"]},
{"media_id": 3683862865731737491, "shortcode": "DMftcIpMVeT", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMftcIpMVeT/", "taken_at": "2025-07-24T15:26:15", "caption": "ladies , gents and they/them’s this is who i’m LIVING WITHHHH!!🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯 #singer #singing #feed #avamax #avamaxedits #avamaxvideo #trending #funny #psycho", "owner_username": "issacfrank_", "owner_id": "28497556", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0063_DMftcIpMVeT\\DMftcIpMVeT_20250724_152615.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18542639902035959, "text": "MY SONG BLUEPRINT IS OUT ON ALL STREAMING PLATFORMS!! - link in bio 🩶💙", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:16:35", "owner": "issacfrank_", "likes": 243}, {"id": 18094181173637597, "text": "What this song", "created_at": "2025-08-14T02:15:47", "owner": "redxdalanie", "likes": 205}, {"id": 18108922738550299, "text": "that voice", "created_at": "2025-07-26T04:51:32", "owner": "ryanjoshuaatal", "likes": 26956}, {"id": 18057479036378627, "text": "karaoke with him must be fun", "created_at": "2025-08-15T13:43:43", "owner": "tashnym", "likes": 8512}, {"id": 18074321635832306, "text": "bros nailed it better than original song", "created_at": "2025-08-14T19:27:18", "owner": "just.dokter", "likes": 18274}, {"id": 18188612026319324, "text": "“we ran outta milk”\n…. girl eat it dry 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:23:56", "owner": "mxwcario", "likes": 2704}, {"id": 17862682878395024, "text": "Ur voice is so beautiful (Pause) + water and cereal is diabolical", "created_at": "2025-08-30T09:14:32", "owner": "bluedorearin173", "likes": 176}, {"id": 18100757290720342, "text": "bro's voice so good nobody care about the cereal with water", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:40:34", "owner": "petraa_0812", "likes": 1893}, {"id": 18382391209132963, "text": "I love the original song but I would love to hear this guy sing the entire song", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:36:55", "owner": "ash_marquez18", "likes": 25}, {"id": 180761195391640