10-04T22:19:15", "owner": "global_defence_force", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330586969224371, "text": "im stealing this man's throat while he sleeps", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:21:53", "owner": "altarf_tegmine", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18107402260605011, "text": "Very good intonation", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:33:22", "owner": "rebirth.appassionato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861324697486088, "text": "Go audition for the voice bro", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:56:50", "owner": "piarxiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046226264652391, "text": "Give me ur vocal chords", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:18:33", "owner": "redactedseed_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052888355555783, "text": "물씨리얼 맛있는데", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:35:20", "owner": "icare4ustillandiwill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178004359343423, "text": "She eats the cereal with water cuz her dad never came back eith the milk", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:05:05", "owner": "emilmecu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982104612859851, "text": "This gets on my nerves.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:59:55", "owner": "leap.motion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285666913273586, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:42:31", "owner": "la_fougere_qui_pousse", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865544461463194, "text": "Y does the British in singers voices vanish when they start singing", "created_at": "2025-09-25T07:13:46", "owner": "jrmoppler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844871590562313, "text": "Put her in federal prison", "created_at": "2025-09-24T01:22:57", "owner": "kyriethegoat29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867418366449828, "text": "Psycho😂", "created_at": "2025-09-22T14:32:03", "owner": "alip_alyp", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091023637826842, "text": "Nah atp bro do a whole cover holy fkn smokes 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:02:10", "owner": "rentleee", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18097052944653898, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:48:22", "owner": "fox_wild09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897708151279047, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:43:15", "owner": "arfaa_the_sauce_boss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17921228586156035, "text": "Voice so good no one cares about the vegetables on the floor", "created_at": "2025-09-16T20:30:55", "owner": "eating_dwayne_johnsons_feet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061938284524782, "text": "His voice tho", "created_at": "2025-09-16T12:18:55", "owner": "_.zefan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079634728953216, "text": "Straight to jail", "created_at": "2025-09-16T08:35:15", "owner": "jgburroughs26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945220534042013, "text": "Why did he hit that so well?", "created_at": "2025-09-16T06:36:10", "owner": "unidentifed_human", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060332807104729, "text": "Alright brosky when are you gonna drop the album", "created_at": "2025-09-16T03:02:46", "owner": "christianh1109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061988018607906, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-16T02:14:58", "owner": "mailogamv3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156501145379019, "text": "No milk = no cereal", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:46:17", "owner": "4dam.sa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154741084381170, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:18:29", "owner": "ayuseor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902956522123538, "text": "just water is crazy work", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:11:43", "owner": "gd.o02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100228903527970, "text": "141% accuracy", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:49:40", "owner": "maahish_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521065954041075, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:20:49", "owner": "avery_exotixbandz24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18285388228276651, "text": "Bro washing your cereals is one thing, but eating it with water? Nahh", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:29:23", "owner": "life.of.an.aloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078600034996099, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T04:24:59", "owner": "mpregstagram", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17965800032803952, "text": "Wtfff", "created_at": "2025-09-12T21:57:20", "owner": "sstorm__artt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009352772620294, "text": "cereal with watter", "created_at": "2025-09-12T21:23:46", "owner": "jvzinn17k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095336863659972, "text": "Damn his voice is deadass sick asf", "created_at": "2025-09-12T18:34:24", "owner": "lubie.pierogiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100531792528025, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T15:30:35", "owner": "c_yeeet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072862814515590, "text": "“Hey who should be our lead singer?” Guy in the chainsmokers:", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:30:15", "owner": "oliver67852", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923291218111613, "text": "i thought only i knew this song", "created_at": "2025-09-10T20:17:09", "owner": "ghadi_hamdan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114880780518033, "text": "If theres no milk dont eat the cereal twin💔", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:21:05", "owner": "therealtogore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17871384417426256, "text": "You think she’s psycho? One time on my residential trip, my social anxiety made me so nervous to get milk because I didn’t see it when I got my cereal so I used diluted cordial with it instead 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:17:18", "owner": "ky_or_kai_hh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877310071404517, "text": "I thought it was the original song", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:20:46", "owner": "miss_crazeebunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979151880864932, "text": "And that cucumber with a condom?", "created_at": "2025-09-10T06:30:36", "owner": "ne_o_dimm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18500822395066436, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T04:16:38", "owner": "jussomedude2006", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923130412129641, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-10T01:30:18", "owner": "stevechris879", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18070938586918452, "text": "vegan", "created_at": "2025-09-10T00:43:09", "owner": "andoki_doku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305550811223422, "text": "SONG COVER WHEN", "created_at": "2025-09-10T00:18:34", "owner": "ashamongthestars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873487513327751, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-09T23:08:24", "owner": "sir_sgandurra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306252703223628, "text": "Eats cereal with water, scrapes entire spoon with her teeth, can't trust this lady", "created_at": "2025-09-09T19:59:45", "owner": "big_hoss_1984", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061389431368538, "text": "So no one gonna talk about her??", "created_at": "2025-09-09T19:58:12", "owner": "sk4nd0r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321674782300848, "text": "🙌 impressive", "created_at": "2025-09-09T18:27:28", "owner": "monger1671", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048195995309925, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-09T17:25:36", "owner": "dydyreas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075415151510687, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:14:38", "owner": "johnfart67", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18373778602178897, "text": "Make a cover pls", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:19:26", "owner": "crimsenic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17849334576552940, "text": "Peak voice", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:50:24", "owner": "alexplays__101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100090822530560, "text": "How can u be more ghetto than the ghetto", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:59:03", "owner": "spi.ritzz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17845513065548794, "text": "지금 시발 시리얼을 물에 처타먹는겨!!!!!!이건 화형이오!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:44:36", "owner": "dnhdaa10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986225460849887, "text": "Falsetto was TOUGH 😩😩✋", "created_at": "2025-09-06T23:31:08", "owner": "dajedy__13", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17981595803884356, "text": "This account is all about no milk and repetitive singing.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T23:17:57", "owner": "tonyyiiy_666", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17902258944122817, "text": "has bro been smoking weed?!", "created_at": "2025-09-05T20:44:49", "owner": "madoka_pinky", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089940307786264, "text": "Her dad never came back with the milk", "created_at": "2025-09-05T20:43:56", "owner": "spanu_stefan12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875375317308541, "text": "This guy singing cured my hearing after listening to THAT guy who sings \"you can ask the flowers i SEEF FOR HAAAAAAAAAORURRRS\"", "created_at": "2025-09-05T18:26:01", "owner": "charly_weeber", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076060799487997, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T03:22:27", "owner": "andrsmob", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18137503129429095, "text": "Oh lawd that pitch control ✋😭🤚", "created_at": "2025-09-05T01:49:17", "owner": "jry_crs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062248106594592, "text": "Section 8 special", "created_at": "2025-09-04T18:43:53", "owner": "humbleyute_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017964263578348, "text": "Sorry for having vocal cords bro 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-04T18:32:38", "owner": "xdlakshya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520263013026592, "text": "Bro hit those high notes real good", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:27:24", "owner": "gozayan67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079860839507545, "text": "🔥🔥voice hot", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:03:51", "owner": "taylormandy92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048375977312830, "text": "its better with water (i have phobia from milk)", "created_at": "2025-09-03T18:13:55", "owner": "nouf305305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848210239552828, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-03T12:01:38", "owner": "mark018773", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18167198350366354, "text": "wym i ate like that too", "created_at": "2025-09-03T11:22:54", "owner": "tan_natchapon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075166820044609, "text": "Hear me out voice ngl", "created_at": "2025-09-02T15:46:26", "owner": "divya_luvspineappleonpizza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889640899202817, "text": "ate and left absolutely NO evidence behind 🥀💔", "created_at": "2025-09-02T14:54:03", "owner": "arthurtheanteater", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076836247988451, "text": "Bro nailed it", "created_at": "2025-09-02T04:01:25", "owner": "akuabdilah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073855061032104, "text": "101% accuracy", "created_at": "2025-08-31T15:49:52", "owner": "a1rfloe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18038636837673469, "text": "Maybe swap her out for a new one this one’s clearly defective", "created_at": "2025-08-31T01:29:40", "owner": "wildcruiser8852", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904066639238151, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-30T15:21:01", "owner": "mhmd_sbeity911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103992022601897, "text": "hitting dem notes tho wtf", "created_at": "2025-08-30T12:01:00", "owner": "ailumidah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984391941851993, "text": "Under reaction I would have flipped out if I saw such a monstrosity", "created_at": "2025-08-30T08:46:40", "owner": "mvpliam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103574716601861, "text": "Shi high key better than the original", "created_at": "2025-08-30T08:09:53", "owner": "siegfried_balicas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964405653951070, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-29T22:49:19", "owner": "x0xo.brielle", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18508029766067462, "text": "need this on spotify", "created_at": "2025-08-29T15:44:12", "owner": "simzcel", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18170535412356937, "text": "Too much melodyne man.. you realise you can make it sound natural as well as correcting the pitch??", "created_at": "2025-08-29T10:21:48", "owner": "naemythe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860520748416411, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-29T02:15:25", "owner": "drakehein45", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18075707159068698, "text": "Judging by her reaction he probably does this all the time", "created_at": "2025-08-28T05:03:42", "owner": "fatneekj", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17857876221482956, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-27T13:02:30", "owner": "zooman559", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17995208915675929, "text": "Her father never came back with the milk", "created_at": "2025-08-27T11:41:59", "owner": "mistlove__breathing", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17999395187807244, "text": "Alguna vez pensaste en ir a “The Voice”?", "created_at": "2025-08-27T08:08:41", "owner": "quecitron", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094677436725445, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-27T05:57:58", "owner": "javgonzales26", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18177692461339494, "text": "why is she wearing outside clothes and a cap", "created_at": "2025-08-26T20:37:45", "owner": "sourch3ryy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17960053253966708, "text": "Wearing father pants button ➡️", "created_at": "2025-08-26T20:10:04", "owner": "wtf_ojo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057655826378886, "text": "You def can Shazam this", "created_at": "2025-08-26T18:59:39", "owner": "bhastien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037816517446418, "text": "Song is Sweet but Psycho", "created_at": "2025-08-26T15:18:38", "owner": "arc_chicken17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078854207492336, "text": "And people say run! dont walk away", "created_at": "2025-08-26T12:29:51", "owner": "lunastic_23_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043429328339392, "text": "Bro hit every notes", "created_at": "2025-08-26T05:53:05", "owner": "nordof_tihoni", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083506606857244, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-26T05:32:13", "owner": "mouatz_seb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050323862551511, "text": "Is no one is gonna talk about the vegetables on the floor", "created_at": "2025-08-26T05:15:11", "owner": "_starboy_860", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17860289523416708, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-08-26T05:02:42", "owner": "desw1red", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087318178828880, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-26T03:13:02", "owner": "shawneesmithfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308509219168360, "text": "Am proud of my fellow PSYCHO", "created_at": "2025-08-25T22:25:39", "owner": "ravanche_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092047480675690, "text": "If this was a vine your voice would be def remixed on those gacha sing battles", "created_at": "2025-08-25T22:05:38", "owner": "tornnzz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18519924226014283, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-25T21:14:21", "owner": "captainjames_j", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18405957742112351, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-25T20:00:37", "owner": "alf_foggin94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516256030010196, "text": "YOU DON'T USE WATER WITH YOUR CEREAL IF YOU RAN OUT OF MILK WHAT ARE YOU MENTEL", "created_at": "2025-08-25T17:45:13", "owner": "barny_simp.450", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979769190892690, "text": "Water and Cereal 🥣 🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-08-25T15:39:46", 